export default {"format":"cadcraft-help","version":1,"app":"bimcraft","name":"BimCraft","common":"basics","sections":{"start":"Getting started","tasks":"Walkthroughs","switching":"Coming from other software","reference":"Reference","trouble":"Troubleshooting and limits"},"variants":{"os":{"mac":"Mac","windows":"Windows","linux":"Linux"},"browser":{"chromium":"Chrome or Edge","brave":"Brave","firefox":"Firefox","safari":"Safari"},"shell":{"web":"In the browser","desktop":"Desktop app"},"net":{"online":"Online","offline":"Offline"},"input":{"mouse":"Mouse","touch":"Touch"}},"topics":[{"slug":"whats-new","scope":"bimcraft","title":"What's new in 0.10","summary":"Rooms, room separators, areas and shafts, curtain systems, model groups, work planes, model lines and text, elevations, walls that stay joined, level of development, project stages, schedules and quantities, model checks, and plans from PDFs and scans.","section":"start","order":5,"keywords":["whats new","what's new","0.10","release notes","changelog","changes","version","new features","room","rooms","room separator","room tag","area","area boundary","gross building area","rentable area","shaft","vertical opening","wall opening","curtain system","curtain wall","curtain grid","mullion","model group","work plane","reference plane","model line","model text","elevation","tile views","walls","joins","disallow join","attach top","attach base","wall profile","lean","lod","level of development","ifc class","classification","uniformat","omniclass","uniclass","starter types","swap type","milestone check","project stages","massing options","submission set","revisions","close-out","field-verified","as-built ifc","schedules","totals","xlsx","google sheets","csv","finish schedules","gross and net","measurement method","bricks","blocks","mortar","model checks","missing tags","unnamed rooms","clash","lod 350","pdf to model","scan","presentation pack","render presets","default policies","pro layouts","trackpad","swipe","tour"],"headings":[{"id":"new","text":"New","level":2},{"id":"rooms-areas-and-openings","text":"Rooms, areas and openings","level":3},{"id":"more-building-tools-on-the-ribbon","text":"More building tools on the ribbon","level":3},{"id":"walls-stay-joined-and-square","text":"Walls stay joined and square","level":3},{"id":"level-of-development","text":"Level of development","level":3},{"id":"project-stages","text":"Project stages","level":3},{"id":"schedules-and-quantities","text":"Schedules and quantities","level":3},{"id":"checks-plans-and-presentation","text":"Checks, plans and presentation","level":3},{"id":"fixed","text":"Fixed","level":2},{"id":"in-every-app","text":"In every app","level":2},{"id":"said-plainly","text":"Said plainly","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThis is what changed in BimCraft 0.10, compared with 0.9. The big parts are rooms and areas, more building tools on the ribbon, level of development and project stages.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"new\"\u003ENew\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"rooms-areas-and-openings\"\u003ERooms, areas and openings\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EA Room tool with room separators.\u003C/strong\u003E Pick a room to name and number it and read its area, perimeter and volume; a room separator divides two rooms that have no wall between them. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/rooms-and-separators\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/rooms-and-separators\"\u003ERooms and room separators\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERoom and area tags\u003C/strong\u003E with the number, name and area. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/room-and-area-tags\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/room-and-area-tags\"\u003ERoom and area tags\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAreas and area boundaries\u003C/strong\u003E for gross building area and rentable area. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/areas-and-area-boundaries\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/areas-and-area-boundaries\"\u003EAreas and area boundaries\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EShafts and vertical openings\u003C/strong\u003E, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWall Opening\u003C/span\u003E. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/shafts-and-vertical-openings\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/shafts-and-vertical-openings\"\u003EShafts and openings through floors\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"more-building-tools-on-the-ribbon\"\u003EMore building tools on the ribbon\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECurtain systems:\u003C/strong\u003E draw one, set its grid and its mullions, or lay one on a face. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/curtain-systems\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/curtain-systems\"\u003ECurtain systems\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EModel groups.\u003C/strong\u003E See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/model-groups\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/model-groups\"\u003EModel groups\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWork planes and reference planes.\u003C/strong\u003E See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/work-plane\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/work-plane\"\u003EThe work plane\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EModel lines and model text.\u003C/strong\u003E See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/model-lines-and-text\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/model-lines-and-text\"\u003EModel lines and model text\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EElevation\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E places a marker and makes its view, and \u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETile Views\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E shows plan and 3D side by side. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/place-an-elevation\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/place-an-elevation\"\u003EPlace an elevation and open its view\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"walls-stay-joined-and-square\"\u003EWalls stay joined and square\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMoving, resizing or changing the type of a wall carries the walls joined to it, including a wall that ends on another&#039;s side. Disallow join frees one end.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWall shape: attach the top or base to a roof or slab, edit the profile, or lean a wall.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"level-of-development\"\u003ELevel of development\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAn LOD tag, an IFC class and classification fields (Uniformat, OmniClass, Uniclass) on every element, generic starter types at LOD 100 to 200, swap type without redrawing, level of detail shown apart from level of development, and a milestone check per element. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/level-of-development\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/level-of-development\"\u003ELevel of development\u003C/a\u003E and \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/classification\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/classification\"\u003EClassification codes\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"project-stages\"\u003EProject stages\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESite survey, building lines and massing options (stage 2), cost quantities (stage 3), a submission set with revisions against what was submitted (stage 4), working drawings and schedules (stage 5), and a close-out package with elements marked field-verified and an as-built IFC (stage 7). See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/project-stages\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/project-stages\"\u003EProject stages\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/massing-options\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/massing-options\"\u003EMassing options\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/issues-and-revisions\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/issues-and-revisions\"\u003EIssues, revisions and the drawing changelog\u003C/a\u003E and \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/verification\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/verification\"\u003EMark elements as checked or field-verified\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"schedules-and-quantities\"\u003ESchedules and quantities\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESchedules grouped by type with totals, exported as a spreadsheet workbook (.xlsx), to Google Sheets and as CSV. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/schedule-layouts\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/schedule-layouts\"\u003ELay out, save and export a schedule\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFinish schedules by room, wall and zone. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/room-finishes\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/room-finishes\"\u003ERoom finishes and finish schedules\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGross and net with openings deducted once, a measurement method per project, and bricks, blocks and mortar counted from the wall type. Types have real layer thicknesses.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"checks-plans-and-presentation\"\u003EChecks, plans and presentation\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EModel checks:\u003C/strong\u003E missing tags, unnamed rooms, elements below the stage&#039;s LOD, and LOD 350 clash checks between disciplines. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/audit-the-model\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/audit-the-model\"\u003EAudit the model\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPlans from PDFs and scans\u003C/strong\u003E become a starting model, marked unverified.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPresentation packs\u003C/strong\u003E with an option comparison table (area and cost). See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/client-pack-and-stage-report\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/client-pack-and-stage-report\"\u003EClient packs, stage reports and comparing options\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERender presets\u003C/strong\u003E (Exterior, Interior and more).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDefault Policies add-on\u003C/strong\u003E (off by default): the first wall type and starter LOD for new projects, set once by an office. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/default-policies\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/default-policies\"\u003EDefault Policies\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fixed\"\u003EFixed\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe Move tool, and changing the type of several walls at once, left joined walls behind.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA section that cut a wall opened an empty panel; a section sheet through joined walls printed &quot;Envelope fallback&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe Walls by type schedule could not be put on a sheet. The drawing set&#039;s title block named the file, not the project, and ignored a plan&#039;s own scale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E22 Draw-bar tools had no command (Grid, Column, Ramp, Trim, Pipe, Duct and others). Enter and Backspace did not reach the older sketch tools in the ribbon layouts.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe discipline clash check reported a roof resting on its walls as clashes.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Cannot access &#039;models&#039; before initialization&quot; on opening, and &quot;No IFC model is open with id null&quot; with no model open.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA Type option with no floor areas got a floor space of 0 m2. Grass broke through driveways and walks in the sample house.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"in-every-app\"\u003EIn every app\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDocking tool groups.\u003C/strong\u003E In a layout with a ribbon, tool rows or a toolbox, a group of tools can be docked as a palette beside the drawing. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/dock-tool-groups\" data-topic=\"basics/dock-tool-groups\"\u003EDock a group of tools\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFour Pro layouts\u003C/strong\u003E (Ribbon, Workbench, Review, Studio) in an optional Pro skin, in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EA two-finger trackpad swipe pans\u003C/strong\u003E the plan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETour tips\u003C/strong\u003E have one \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENext\u003C/span\u003E button; the X closes the tour.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"said-plainly\"\u003ESaid plainly\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERooms and areas are straight-sided, and a room&#039;s volume is its area times the level height.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA curtain system has one panel type and one profile, no doors or vents, and does not follow a level moved later. Only IFC4 was tested.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe stage-to-LOD table, the measurement methods and the 1000 mm lintel width are our starting values, labelled so; no quantity surveyor has reviewed them.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERoom names from a plan need a PDF text layer; scanned plans are not read (no OCR). The as-built IFC has not been opened in another program.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDocking tool groups has not been tried on two monitors.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe new tools were checked by automated tests in a browser, not yet by a person on a real project.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELanguages beyond English are machine drafts, and some words new in 0.10 are still English only.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFor the version before this one, see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/whats-new-0-9\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/whats-new-0-9\"\u003EWhat&#039;s new in 0.9\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"This is what changed in BimCraft 0.10, compared with 0.9. The big parts are rooms and areas, more building tools on the ribbon, level of development and project stages. New Rooms, areas and openings A Room tool with room separators. Pick a room to name and number it and read its area, perimeter and volume; a room separator divides two rooms that have no wall between them. See Rooms and room separators. Room and area tags with the number, name and area. See Room and area tags. Areas and area boundaries for gross building area and rentable area. See Areas and area boundaries. Shafts and vertical openings, and Wall Opening. See Shafts and openings through floors. More building tools on the ribbon Curtain systems: draw one, set its grid and its mullions, or lay one on a face. See Curtain systems. Model groups. See Model groups. Work planes and reference planes. See The work plane. Model lines and model text. See Model lines and model text. Elevation places a marker and makes its view, and Tile Views shows plan and 3D side by side. See Place an elevation and open its view. Walls stay joined and square Moving, resizing or changing the type of a wall carries the walls joined to it, including a wall that ends on another's side. Disallow join frees one end. Wall shape: attach the top or base to a roof or slab, edit the profile, or lean a wall. Level of development An LOD tag, an IFC class and classification fields (Uniformat, OmniClass, Uniclass) on every element, generic starter types at LOD 100 to 200, swap type without redrawing, level of detail shown apart from level of development, and a milestone check per element. See Level of development and Classification codes. Project stages Site survey, building lines and massing options (stage 2), cost quantities (stage 3), a submission set with revisions against what was submitted (stage 4), working drawings and schedules (stage 5), and a close-out package with elements marked field-verified and an as-built IFC (stage 7). See Project stages, Massing options, Issues, revisions and the drawing changelog and Mark elements as checked or field-verified. Schedules and quantities Schedules grouped by type with totals, exported as a spreadsheet workbook (.xlsx), to Google Sheets and as CSV. See Lay out, save and export a schedule. Finish schedules by room, wall and zone. See Room finishes and finish schedules. Gross and net with openings deducted once, a measurement method per project, and bricks, blocks and mortar counted from the wall type. Types have real layer thicknesses. Checks, plans and presentation Model checks: missing tags, unnamed rooms, elements below the stage's LOD, and LOD 350 clash checks between disciplines. See Audit the model. Plans from PDFs and scans become a starting model, marked unverified. Presentation packs with an option comparison table (area and cost). See Client packs, stage reports and comparing options. Render presets (Exterior, Interior and more). Default Policies add-on (off by default): the first wall type and starter LOD for new projects, set once by an office. See Default Policies. Fixed The Move tool, and changing the type of several walls at once, left joined walls behind. A section that cut a wall opened an empty panel; a section sheet through joined walls printed \"Envelope fallback\". The Walls by type schedule could not be put on a sheet. The drawing set's title block named the file, not the project, and ignored a plan's own scale. 22 Draw-bar tools had no command (Grid, Column, Ramp, Trim, Pipe, Duct and others). Enter and Backspace did not reach the older sketch tools in the ribbon layouts. The discipline clash check reported a roof resting on its walls as clashes. \"Cannot access 'models' before initialization\" on opening, and \"No IFC model is open with id null\" with no model open. A Type option with no floor areas got a floor space of 0 m2. Grass broke through driveways and walks in the sample house. In every app Docking tool groups. In a layout with a ribbon, tool rows or a toolbox, a group of tools can be docked as a palette beside the drawing. See Dock a group of tools. Four Pro layouts (Ribbon, Workbench, Review, Studio) in an optional Pro skin, in Settings › Global › Layout. A two-finger trackpad swipe pans the plan. Tour tips have one Next button; the X closes the tour. Said plainly Rooms and areas are straight-sided, and a room's volume is its area times the level height. A curtain system has one panel type and one profile, no doors or vents, and does not follow a level moved later. Only IFC4 was tested. The stage-to-LOD table, the measurement methods and the 1000 mm lintel width are our starting values, labelled so; no quantity surveyor has reviewed them. Room names from a plan need a PDF text layer; scanned plans are not read (no OCR). The as-built IFC has not been opened in another program. Docking tool groups has not been tried on two monitors. The new tools were checked by automated tests in a browser, not yet by a person on a real project. Languages beyond English are machine drafts, and some words new in 0.10 are still English only. For the version before this one, see What's new in 0.9.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"whats-new-0-9","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Okusha ku-0.9 (ngaphambili)","summary":"Izimo zezindonga, ukuhlukanisa, ukuhlukanisa ngokuphambene, ukweluleka nokukhiya egridini, amazinga angaphansi komhlaba, izilinganiso zegridi nokulinganisa epulanini, imibono ephindiwe enezitayela zokusebenza netheyibhu yamapeni, Bika njenge, ukukhipha i-Collada ne-Google Earth, Scan to BIM, ukuhlaziya komoya nokuzamazama, nama-add-on okuprinta nge-resin.","section":"start","order":6,"keywords":["okusha 0.9","ukukhishwa kwangaphambili","okusha","0.9","amanothi okukhishwa","izimo zezindonga","irektangele","ipholigoni","arc","khetha imigqa","landela umkhawulo","ukuhlukanisa","hlanganisa","ibhokisi lokweluleka","linganisa futhi ukhiye","hlukanisa udonga","igebe","hlanganisa kabusha","khiya egridini","khula kusukela","linganisa kusukela","engeza izinga ngaphansi","isisekelo","umyalo wezinga","izilinganiso zegridi","linganisa epulanini","isitayela sokusebenza","ikhophi lendawo","umbono oxhunyiwe","itheyibhu yamapeni","phrinta njengoba kubonakala","bika njenge","thayipha isikali","ngenisa i-svg","beka epulanini","beka emodelini","collada","dae","kmz","google earth","scan to bim","umthwalo womoya","ukuzamazama","finite element","iphaneli lamadokhumenti","ukuprinta nge-resin","okusha","izinguquko","0.8","0.8.1","inguqulo","izici ezintsha","ukuhlaziya","abantu","imigqa","umsindo","ukuzwakala","ukugeleza kwamanzi","umoya","ukuzamazama komhlaba","ingozi","umjikelezo wokuphila","ids","amathegi","amashejuli","hambisa","linganisa","sabalalisa","isithombe","ingemuva","skena ukuya kwizindonga","isayithi ku-civilcraft","imiklamo yamaphaneli","ukwakha","isikhala elingaphezulu","ukuhlukanisa","vrf","ukufakwa kwamapayipi","ubude bethreyi","ukukhanya","ukuqina","qhathanisa i-scan","epsg","ukuhlelwa kwemephu","amadokhumenti","isifaniso","ikhabhoni","izindleko","injini yokurenda","vula ku-","usd","glb","unreal","hlehlisa","okwengeziwe","pcf","izimpawu","izitshalo","landela","amapeni","ribhoni","isiphequluli sephrojekthi","ukwakheka"],"headings":[{"id":"okusha","text":"Okusha","level":2},{"id":"izindonga","text":"Izindonga","level":3},{"id":"amazinga-amagridi-nokulinganisa","text":"Amazinga, amagridi nokulinganisa","level":3},{"id":"imibono-amashidi-nokuprinta","text":"Imibono, amashidi nokuprinta","level":3},{"id":"umtapo-ukubeka","text":"Umtapo: ukubeka","level":3},{"id":"amafayela-nabasizi","text":"Amafayela nabasizi","level":3},{"id":"ukuhlaziya","text":"Ukuhlaziya","level":3},{"id":"ama-add-on-nemidwebo","text":"Ama-add-on nemidwebo","level":3},{"id":"ku-yo-yonke-i-app","text":"Ku-yo yonke i-app","level":2},{"id":"okulungisiwe","text":"Okulungisiwe","level":2},{"id":"imikhawulo-eyiqiniso","text":"Imikhawulo eyiqiniso","level":2},{"id":"ngaphambili-0-8-no-0-8-1","text":"Ngaphambili: 0.8 no-0.8.1","level":2},{"id":"okusha-2","text":"Okusha","level":3},{"id":"kulungisiwe-ku-0-8-1","text":"Kulungisiwe ku-0.8.1","level":3},{"id":"akusakwenziwa-kule-nguqulo","text":"Akusakwenziwa kule nguqulo","level":3}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ELokhu yikho okushintshe ku-BimCraft 0.9, kuqhathaniswa ne-0.8.1. Izindikimba ezimbili ezinkulu yithuluzi lodonga langempela nemibono eziziphatha ngendlela abantu abavela kuzinhlelo ezinkulu ze-BIM abayilindele. Ezinye zifika ngakho: ukukhipha i-Collada, abasizi abangabeka izinsiza zikagesi, Scan to BIM, nokusebenza komoya, ukuzamazama nezakhi ze-finite-element kuthebhu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuhlaziya\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okusha\"\u003EOkusha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"izindonga\"\u003EIzindonga\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDweba izimo ezigcwele.\u003C/strong\u003E Ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDweba\u003C/span\u003E, vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzimo\u003C/span\u003E (noma khetha isimo ohlwini lwezimo kumugqa wedonga) ukuze uthole irektangele, irektangele egqunyiwe, ipholigoni elinezinhlangothi ezi-3 kuya kwezi-64, i-arc ngesikhungo, i-arc ethintayo, izindonga ezikhethwe emigqeni, noma izindonga ezizungeze indawo evaliwe ocindezela phakathi kwayo. Irektangele inezindonga ezine namakhona amane ahlanganisiwe kanye nesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/wall-tools\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/wall-tools\"\u003EIzimo zezindonga, ukuhlukanisa, ukweluleka nokukhiya\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBeka ngaphambi kokudweba, shintsha ngemva.\u003C/strong\u003E Umugqa wedonga unezinketho ezithi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuhlukana\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlanganisa\u003C/span\u003E (khipha ukukhetha ukuze udwebe izindonga ezimi ngokwazo). Ngemva kwalokho sebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuhlukana\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkweluleka ngebhokisi\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinganisa futhi ukhiye\u003C/span\u003E kumadonga adwetshiwe. Udonga oluhanjisiwe noma oluweluleke luhlala lunawo amasango, amawindi nezilinganiso zawo. Yonke iresiphi iyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESika izindonga.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlukanisa\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIgebe\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzimpelo ezikhululekile\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa ingxenye\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlanganisa kabusha\u003C/span\u003E zisika udonga ngokuchofoza noma lapho olunye udonga lulisika khona. Ukusika esangweni kuyenqatshwa. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/wall-tools\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/wall-tools\"\u003EIzimo zezindonga, ukuhlukanisa, ukweluleka nokukhiya\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKhiya izindonga emigqeni yegridi.\u003C/strong\u003E Khetha udonga oluhambisana nomugqa wegridi bese uthika \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhiya egridini\u003C/span\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzici\u003C/span\u003E. Ngethuluzi legridi livuliwe, thayipha ibanga ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa ngo\u003C/span\u003E komugqa okhethiwe, bese izindonga ezikhiyiwe zilandela ngesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmuthi udonga olulodwa.\u003C/strong\u003E Ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzici\u003C/span\u003E zodonga olulodwa ungaxhumanisa phezulu kwalo noma phansi kwalo kuphahla, iphansi noma ulingqo, uhlele umugqa wokuphakama kwalo, uwuthambekise, noma usike ukuvulwa kodonga ngaphandle kwesango noma iwindi. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/wall-shape\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/wall-shape\"\u003EImo yodonga\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUbude buchaza ukuthi yiliphi icala elihlala.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhula kusukela\u003C/span\u003E ichaza ukuthi ukuqala, isiphetho noma isikhungo kuyahlala lapho ushintsha ubude.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUbude nezilinganiso zephlani ziyavumelana.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinganisa kusukela\u003C/span\u003E (umugqa wesikhungo, ubuso bangaphakathi noma ubuso bangaphandle) iqhuba kokubili inkambu yobude nezilinganiso zodonga epulanini. Iqala emugqeni wesikhungo, ngakho izilinganiso zodonga epulanini manje zifunda umugqa wesikhungo lapho zazifunda ubuso bangaphandle ngaphambili. Yishintshe ku-Umugqa wodonga, ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzici\u003C/span\u003E noma ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBimCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzindonga\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"amazinga-amagridi-nokulinganisa\"\u003EAmazinga, amagridi nokulinganisa\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEngeza izinga ngaphansi.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza izinga ngaphansi\u003C/span\u003E kuphaneli le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmazinga\u003C/span\u003E yengeza izinga ngaphansi kolisezansi, lide njengalo, ngokukhwezwa okungeyona into engeyinhle (Level -1, Level -2). Akukho okunye okunyakazayo. Manje \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza amazinga…\u003C/span\u003E yamukela ubude obungelona eyinhle. Ukuthayipha LEVEL, LEVELS, STOREY noma STOREYS emugqeni womyalo kuvula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza amazinga…\u003C/span\u003E, futhi kukhona inkinobho ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmazinga\u003C/span\u003E emenyini nasemathebhini e-ribbon. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/site-building-and-levels\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/site-building-and-levels\"\u003EIzindawo, izakhiwo namazinga\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzilinganiso zegridi epulanini.\u003C/strong\u003E Ngethuluzi le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIgridi\u003C/span\u003E livuliwe, thika \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilinganiso\u003C/span\u003E ukuze udwebe ibanga phakathi kwemigqa eseduze kanye nosayizi ojwayelekile ngaphandle kwamabhamuza kuwo wonke epulani lenhla ngayinye. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/grid-dimensions\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/grid-dimensions\"\u003ELinganisa igridi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELinganisa epulanini.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinganisa\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDweba\u003C/span\u003E inikeza ibanga nomehluko we-X ne-Y phakathi kwezinkinobho ezimbili. Akukho okulondolozwayo emodelini. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/measure-on-the-plan\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/measure-on-the-plan\"\u003ELinganisa epulanini\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EShintsha amakholomu amaningi ngesikhathi esisodwa.\u003C/strong\u003E Khetha amakholomu kanye nodonga, bese uhlu lubonisa uhlobo ngalunye nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGcina lezi kuphela\u003C/span\u003E. Inkinobho eyodwa igcina amakholomu futhi ikhombise izinkambu azo ezabelanayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIyunithi eyodwa yokubonisa yonke indawo.\u003C/strong\u003E Izixhumanisi, izilinganiso, izigaba, izikali zamashidi, izinkinga nezikhwama zethebhu yefreyimu zilandela iyunithi oyikhethayo. Ukuphuma kugcina i-SI.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"imibono-amashidi-nokuprinta\"\u003EImibono, amashidi nokuprinta\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsitayela sokusebenza.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBimCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsitayela sokusebenza\u003C/span\u003E sikhetha phakathi kokuthi umbono ngamunye unezinkomentari namathebhu wamapeni awowodwa, noma ayabelana ngawo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/working-style\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/working-style\"\u003EIsitayela sokusebenza, imibono ephindiwe, amapeni ephepheni, Bika njenge nezikhwama\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPhinda umbono.\u003C/strong\u003E Amaplani, amaplani esiling, ama-callout, izinhlangothi nezigaba zingaphindwa njenge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIkhophi lalo\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIxhunyiwe\u003C/span\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYenza ikhophi lalo\u003C/span\u003E yenza owexhunyiwe abe ngowakhe. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/working-style\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/working-style\"\u003EIsitayela sokusebenza, imibono ephindiwe, amapeni ephepheni, Bika njenge nezikhwama\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPhrinta njengoba kubonakala, noma ngethebhu yamapeni.\u003C/strong\u003E Ukwehliswa kwamapeni kugcinwa ku-IFC nombono, futhi amashidi nama-PDF adweba njengoba isikrini senza. Lesi sihloko siphinde sihlanganise namathebhu wamapeni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBika njenge.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBika njenge\u003C/span\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzici\u003C/span\u003E ibhala isilabhu esidwetshwe njengomgwaqo, udonga njengephaneli noma uphahla njengerempu kwi-IFC njengesigaba osikhethayo, bese lokho ​​kubalwa ngalendlela ezishejuleni, kuzibalo, ku-Find, ku-Color by nasezinkingeni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHlela ezinhlangothini nasezigabeni.\u003C/strong\u003E Dweba futhi uhambise izindonga, izimbobo, amazinga, izilinganiso namanothi ngqo ezinhlangothini nasezigabeni, ngosayizi bamashidi wakho nemigqa yokuqopha yakho. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/edit-in-elevations\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/edit-in-elevations\"\u003EHlela ezinhlangothini nasezigabeni\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmashidi.\u003C/strong\u003E Yonke ishidi lingaba ngobude noma ngobubanzi. Ibhokisi elithi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThayipha isikali\u003C/span\u003E lihlala ngasecaleni kolwazi lwezikali kwi-view ngayinye ebekiwe (1:64, 2:1, 1/4&quot; = 1&#039;). Ungadonsa umdwebo obekiwe noma usunduze ngamakhiye osebe, futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmafomethi…\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgenisa i-SVG…\u003C/span\u003E iguqula iyunithi yakho yeshidi ibe yigama lokuqopha elinezinkambu ezithayiphwe ngeshidi ngalinye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzikweletu zethala ezisheethini.\u003C/strong\u003E Isethi yemidwebo enezinto ze-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmtapo\u003C/span\u003E ithola ishejuli yezikweletu zomtapo oyingenisa kunoma iyiphi ishidi. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/library-credits\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/library-credits\"\u003EIzikweletu zomtapo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"umtapo-ukubeka\"\u003EUmtapo: ukubeka\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkubeka kulandela umbono.\u003C/strong\u003E Embonweni wephlani, i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmtapo\u003C/span\u003E ikhombisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBeka epulanini\u003C/span\u003E; ku-3D ikhombisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBeka emodelini\u003C/span\u003E; ku-Split ikhombisa inkinobho ehlukanisiwe enesenzo esiyinhloko ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBeka epulanini\u003C/span\u003E. Zombili izindlela zibhala into efanayo ye-IFC. Ungadonsa ikhadi lomtapo uliphonsele epulanini noma embonweni we-3D; ngepeni noma ngomunwe, cindezela ubambe, bese udonsa. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/place-from-library\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/place-from-library\"\u003EBeka into evela emtapweni\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"amafayela-nabasizi\"\u003EAmafayela nabasizi\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECollada ne-Google Earth.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECollada\u003C/span\u003E ethuluzini le-toolbar (imenyu yefayela ezitayelweni zemenyu) ibhala i-.dae, noma i-.kmz ebekwe lapho imodeli ikhona emephini. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/collada\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/collada\"\u003EKhipha imodeli njenge-Collada noma ye-Google Earth\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAbasizi bangabeka izinsiza zikagesi.\u003C/strong\u003E Umsizi wakho oxhunyiwe unamathuluzi amasha okungeza, ukuhlu, ukushintsha nokususa izinsiza nokusetha izibani. Abasizi bahlala bevaliwe kuze kuvulwe kuzilungiselelo ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/assistants\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/assistants\"\u003EVumela umsizi we-AI asebenze nemodeli yakho\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EScan to BIM (i-add-on).\u003C/strong\u003E Ivaliwe ngokuzenzakalelayo futhi idinga i-add-on ye-Point clouds. Iphakamisa amafulowa, izindonga, iminyango namawindi ekuskenweni kanye nokuphambuka okulinganiswe kokukodwa; ukwamukela kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ukuhlaziya\"\u003EUkuhlaziya\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIdatha yomoya nokuzamazama yesayithi.\u003C/strong\u003E Ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuhlaziya\u003C/span\u003E: imithwalo yomoya ngokwe-ASCE 7-10 noma 7-16 yesakhiwo esiqinile esivaliwe, nenani lamandla kuwo wonke ungqimba njengamacala emithwalo, kanye nokuthola idatha yesayithi yokuzamazama nge-USGS nesipekthra sokuklama.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkulandelela kwesakhiwo nezakhi ze-finite.\u003C/strong\u003E Ukuhlolwa kwekhonkrithi ngokwe-ACI 318-19, izinkosi ezilinganayo zokuzamazama ngokwe-ASCE 7-22, ukuthuthuka kwezitezi, amafulowa nezindonga njengamapuleti, nokuhlanganiswa kwemithwalo ngokwe-ASCE 7 ne-EN 1990. Injini yethu yakhe ye-finite-element yenza ama-shell, ama-tetrahedron nokuhlaziya kwemodi. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/concrete-and-seismic\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/concrete-and-seismic\"\u003EHlola izakhi zekhonkrithi futhi wenze imithwalo yokuzamazama\u003C/a\u003E no-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/frame-analysis\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/frame-analysis\"\u003EUkuhlaziya kohlaka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ama-add-on-nemidwebo\"\u003EAma-add-on nemidwebo\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkukhanyisa kwangaphakathi (i-add-on).\u003C/strong\u003E Ibeka izinsiza zokukhanya futhi ibhala i-lux njengezinombolo kwipulani yezinga ngalinye, ngokuhlolwa kokukhanya okuqhoshayo nombiko ophrintekayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIphaneli lamadokhumenti.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfayela\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmadokhumenti…\u003C/span\u003E linokuthatha nokubuyisa ngefayela lokukhiya, izinhlamvu zokubuyekeza, izimo zokukhishwa nomlando.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzifunda nensimbi.\u003C/strong\u003E Amaphakheji emidwebo nemithetho yokwakha yaseNingizimu Afrika kwi-add-on ye-Regulations, kanye nosayizi bensimbi be-UK abangu-976 kwithebhu eyabelanayo yezigaba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAma-add-on wokuprinta nge-resin ngaphandle kwentengo.\u003C/strong\u003E I-slicer, izinsekelo namaraft, ukuhlolwa kokuvezwa, nezinhlobo zamafayela i-GOO, SL1, Chitubox ne-Anycubic, zonke zivaliwe ngokuzenzakalelayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-yo-yonke-i-app\"\u003EKu-yo yonke i-app\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuhambisa phezu kwenkinobho noma ulawulo kubonisa i-tooltip ye-Bootstrap.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIndawo yokuqala yethiphu esikhaleni sokudweba esingenalutho inenkinobho yokuvala; i-BimCraft ikhumbula ukuthi yavalwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIthebhu yephaneli engeke ilingane ngayo manje iyaskrola esikhundleni sokusikwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELapho kuvulwe idokhumenti, ithebhu yesiphequluli ifunda &quot;&lt;document&gt; - BimCraft | CadCraft&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikelele\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkwakheka\u003C/span\u003E ukwakheka kuyi-drop-down yezinketho ezimbili zemigqa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUhlu lwezilimi ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E lunikeza izilimi eziningi kunakwi-0.8; ezingeyona isiNgisi ziyizinhlelo zomshini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulungisiwe\"\u003EOkulungisiwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkudonsa kusebenza ezitebhisini,\u003C/strong\u003E nasemagudwini, izinqubo, izindiza zophahla, izinsiza ezimi ngokwazo, izithombe nezindlela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkudonsa udonga akusaguqulisi igumbi.\u003C/strong\u003E Isibambi esiphakathi sihambisa udonga uzibambe njengesikwele futhi amakhona alo aguqukela phansi kwezindonga ezihlanganisiwe. Bamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze uthole ukuhamba okukhululekile kwakudala; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYenza isikwele\u003C/span\u003E ibuyisela ama-90 amadigri.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkushintsha ukuqina noma uhlobo esiqeshini esihlanganisiwe\u003C/strong\u003E manje kugcina ikhona elivaliwe ku-L, ku-T, esiqeshini sezindonga ezintathu nasecaleni kodonga oluthambekile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuhambisa noma ukukopisha iqembu lamagumbi\u003C/strong\u003E kugcina izindonga ezihlanganisiwe ngaphandle kwequmbu zihlanganisiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuphinda kwenza kugcina ukuziphatha kwezilinganiso zodonga.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkukhetha udonga nge-Draw ivaliwe\u003C/strong\u003E akusabangeli iphutha ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzici\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkurenda kubuyela ku-WebGL\u003C/strong\u003E lapho i-GPU ingakwazi ukuqala, esikhundleni sokumisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuhlola kwe-EnergyPlus\u003C/strong\u003E kungavulwa futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIdokhumenti ivula njengenkulumo-ngxoxo ephakathi.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, u-X noma ukuchofoza ekhasini elifiphele kuyivala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinkinobho ze-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIpulani\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESplit\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E zibonakala\u003C/strong\u003E uma imodeli ivuliwe, hhayi kuphela ngemva kokuthi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDweba\u003C/span\u003E ivulwe kanye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imikhawulo-eyiqiniso\"\u003EImikhawulo eyiqiniso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkukho okuphrintiwe ku-hardware yangempela. Ama-supports e-resin mashha futhi awaqinisekisiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImiphumela yomoya, yokuzamazama, yekhonkrithi nye-finite-element ngumsizi wokuhlola kumhlahlandlela wenjiniyela, ihlolwe ngezibalo ezivaliwe, hhayi ngesakhiwo sangempela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuskena kuya ku-BIM kuhlolwe kwisakhiwo esiyisimo, hhayi ku-scan yangempela, futhi kutholakala amagumbi azungeze ama-angles kuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-Collada ayikaze ivulwe ku-Blender noma ku-Google Earth lapha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsilinganiso sokukhanya sihlolwe ngomugqa wethu, hhayi ngezinye izinhlelo zokukhanya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinombolo zaseNingizimu Afrika azihlolwanga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzitayela zokuhlanganisa izindonga (butt, mitre, square off) nokubaluleka kwamaleyili akwakhiwe; amakhona yenziwa enziwa ngama-mitre.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzilimi ezingesona isiNgisi ziyizinhlelo zomshini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKonke okunye kukuthi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EOkungakakhiwa\u003C/a\u003E. Izinguquko zangaphambili zisemanothini e-0.8 nowe-0.8.1 angaphansi kwalelikhasi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ngaphambili-0-8-no-0-8-1\"\u003ENgaphambili: 0.8 no-0.8.1\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELokhu yikho okushintshe ku-BimCraft 0.8 (2026-11-01) ne-0.8.1 (2026-11-02), kuqhathaniswa ne-0.7. Manje i-BimCraft ingaphendula imibuzo ngesakhiwo futhi iyihlole, ngabantu, umsindo, amanzi, umoya nokuzamazama, futhi iyidwebe ngamathuluzi amaningi; i-0.8.1 ibukeka njengokulungiswa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"okusha-2\"\u003EOkusha\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHlola isakhiwo\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAbantu esakhiweni.\u003C/strong\u003E Isigaba se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAbantu esakhiweni\u003C/span\u003E sepaneli elingakwesobunxele sihamba nokuhlehla ngesikhathi sokuphuma noma ukufika kwansuku zonke ngamagumbi, iminyango nezitebhisi zakho. Ubona izindlela lapho isakhiwo sincipha, ukuhamba okude kakhulu ukuya ekuphumeni kusuka kugumbi ngalinye nokuthi isiphi sokugcina sithatha isikhathi esingakanani. Thika \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVala\u003C/span\u003E ku-door ukubona ukuthi yini eshintsha, bese uthika \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa abantu kumbono we-3D\u003C/span\u003E ukubukela abahambi. Imiphumela ifika ku-Izinkinga. Kuyimodeli yokubhekisa ngokubanzi yezinqumo zokuklama, hhayi isitifiketi sokuphepha komlilo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/people-in-the-building\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/people-in-the-building\"\u003EHambisa abantu esakhiweni\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuzwakala kwegumbi, nokulizwa.\u003C/strong\u003E Isigaba se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuzwakala kwegumbi\u003C/span\u003E sinikeza isikhathi sokuhlanganisa kugumbi ngalinye ngebhendi ye-octave (Sabine no-Eyring) kusuka kusayizi walo nezinhlobo zokuqeda oziqokile, futhi ngenhloso yakho yakho ithi ukumuncwa okwanele ukuze kuhlangabezane nayo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYidlale kuleligumbi\u003C/span\u003E idlala izwi, ukushaya izandla, izinothi ezikhishwe noma ifayela lomsindo lakho ngomthelela wokuphendula okubalwe ngegumbi. Izinombolo zokumuncwa ziwukuchaza kwendabuko okushicilelwe kwe-typical values ukuze ushintshe. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/room-acoustics\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/room-acoustics\"\u003EUkuzwakala kwegumbi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkudlala ukugeleza kwamanzi, umoya nokuzamazama.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkudlala kwengozi\u003C/span\u003E idlala amanzi akhuphuka ngamagumbi, ingcindezi yomoya ezitezini ngayinye nokuzamazama okushukumisa izitezi, phezu kwepulani noma kwenkulumo ngesilayidi sesikhathi. Amamodeli alula nokuqagela kwawo kuphaneli; hhayi ukuhlola kwekhodi. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/hazard-playback\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/hazard-playback\"\u003EDlala ukugeleza kwamanzi, umoya noma ukuzamazama\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOkuyogcina kuguga kumashumi amahlanu eminyaka.\u003C/strong\u003E I-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmbono wempilo yonke\u003C/span\u003E idwesela amawindi, iminyango, ukuqedwa nophahla, ngokuphila kwenkonzo ngayinye, iminyaka lapho zishintshwa khona, futhi uma uthayipha inani ngeyunithi, inani ngonyaka nenani lamanje. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza uhlelo (CSV)\u003C/span\u003E ilibhala. Izikhathi zenkonzo ziyizinombolo zokuhlela. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/life-cycle-view\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/life-cycle-view\"\u003EBona okuguga eminyakeni engamashumi amahlanu\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzikhathi zekhonkrithi nezokuzamazama.\u003C/strong\u003E Izigaba ze-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzakhi zekhonkrithi\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImithwalo yokuzamazama\u003C/span\u003E zethebhu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuhlaziya\u003C/span\u003E zihlola izinsika nezingqi zekhonkrithi ngokwe-ACI 318-19 zenze amandla ancintisana ngokwe-ASCE 7-22 emasongweni eqinile, nokuthuthuka kwezitezi. Okwenziwa injiniyela ukuhlola. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/concrete-and-seismic\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/concrete-and-seismic\"\u003EHlola izakhi zekhonkrithi futhi wenze imithwalo yokuzamazama\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHlola nokubika\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHlola nge-IDS.\u003C/strong\u003E Layisha ifayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.ids\u003C/code\u003E umklienti akunike lona bese ubona zonke izakhi ezingahlangabezani nalo ku-Izinkinga, ngaphambi kokulethela i-IFC. Vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlola nge-IDS\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuhlola imodeli\u003C/span\u003E. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/check-against-ids\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/check-against-ids\"\u003EHlola imodeli ngokwe-IDS yeklayenti\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmathegi namashejuli.\u003C/strong\u003E Chaza amathegi akho, uwabeke ezakhi eziningi ngesikhathi esisodwa futhi wenze amashejuli amakholomu, izihlungi namaqembu awafunda; amathegi agcinwa ku-IFC. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/tags-and-schedules\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/tags-and-schedules\"\u003EAmathegi namashejuli\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmadokhumenti emodelini.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmadokhumenti kusuka kumodeli\u003C/span\u003E igcwalisa ithemplethi yezinkomba kusuka ku-IFC evulekile bese iyigcina njenge-PDF, idokhumenti ye-Word noma i-Markdown. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/documents-from-the-model\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/documents-from-the-model\"\u003EAmadokhumenti kusuka kumodeli\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQhathanisa i-scan nemodeli.\u003C/strong\u003E Ngepoyinti lefu elivulekile, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQhathanisa\u003C/span\u003E ihlola ngalinye isakhi njengesakhiwe, esakhiwe ngokuphelele, esingekho noma esingafinyelelwe, futhi ikhombisa amaphesenti akhiwe. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/compare-scan-with-model\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/compare-scan-with-model\"\u003EQhathanisa i-scan nemodeli\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIkhabhoni nezindleko.\u003C/strong\u003E I-Carbon pane ifaka ikhabhoni eyenziwe ngokusebenzisa itheyibhu yezinto ongayihlela, ne-Cost pane isakaza izintengo ngesheduli ye-4D. Izinto ezikhona nge-BimCraft zijwayelekile futhi zimakwe njengezingahlolwanga. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/embodied-carbon-and-5d-cost\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/embodied-carbon-and-5d-cost\"\u003EIkhabhoni eyenziwe nezindleko\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENoma iyiphi iprojekshini yemephu.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinganisa\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlelo lwezixhumanisi…\u003C/span\u003E lamukela inombolo ye-EPSG, izone ye-UTM, igama noma inchazelo yakho yeprojekshini. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/georeference-any-projection\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/georeference-any-projection\"\u003EUkuthuthukisa ngeprojekshini yanoma iyiphi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDweba futhi uhlele\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHambisa, Linganisa nokusabalalisa.\u003C/strong\u003E Ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYakha\u003C/span\u003E; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift M\"\u003E⇧M\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+M\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iqala ukuHambisa (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ngokwayo isengu-Linganisa). Ukuhambisa kukopisha njengoba uhamba ngo-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, isinyathelo ngasinye siyisinyathelo sokuhlehlisa esisodwa, futhi sihamba ku-Live TeamWork session. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/move-align-distribute\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/move-align-distribute\"\u003EHambisa, kopisha, linganisa nosabalalise\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzithombe ngaphansi kwepulani.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYakha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsithombe\u003C/span\u003E kubeka i-PNG, i-JPEG noma i-WebP ngaphansi kwepulani lezinga noma endizeni ethi phezulu. Setha isikali ngamaphoyinti amabili, bese uyahamba, uyajikisa, uyafiphaza futhi uyakhiya. Indawo ekopishwe ku-MarkupCraft iyanamathiselwa ngesikali sesheethi yayo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/pictures-as-backgrounds\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/pictures-as-backgrounds\"\u003EBeka isithombe ngaphansi kwepulani\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzindonga kusuka ku-scan.\u003C/strong\u003E Ngescan evuliwe, izindonga, iminyango namagumbi kuza njengezincomo ogcina noma ozinqaba ngalinye, esinyathelweni esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Kutholakala kuphela izindonga ezingqondene kuzo zombili izinqondo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/scan-to-walls\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/scan-to-walls\"\u003EGuqula i-scan ibe yizindonga\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELandela, amapeni nesitebhisi sokudweba.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELandela\u003C/span\u003E ikhombisa elinye izinga ngokudashiwe ngaphansi kwepulani, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmapeni\u003C/span\u003E inika izindonga, iminyango namawindi ubukhulu bomugqa bawo kubuso obubodwa, futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDweba isitebhisi\u003C/span\u003E iguqula umugqa wokuhamba ube yisitebhisi. Ifayela le-Wavefront OBJ liyavuleka. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/trace-pens-stairs-obj\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/trace-pens-stairs-obj\"\u003ELandela izinga, amapeni nesitebhisi ngomdwebo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzakhiwo ezizungeze ikheli.\u003C/strong\u003E Izakhiwo nesakhiwo esatholwa yi-CivilCraft&#039;s Address to site ziza njengezincomo; uthika ezifuna ukungeza. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/site-from-civilcraft\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/site-from-civilcraft\"\u003EQala ngesayithi le-CivilCraft\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImidwebo yamaphaneli.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYakha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImiklamo yamaphaneli\u003C/span\u003E yakha izindonga, amafulowa nophahla ngamapulangwe noma ngensimbi eyizinhlamvu ezincane, futhi igcina uhlu lokusika njenge-CSV nemidwebo yokwakha njenge-PDF. Izinani zokuqala, hhayi idizayini yesakhiwo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/panel-drawings\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/panel-drawings\"\u003EImiklamo yamaphaneli\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIphalethi yezimpawu nezitshalo.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYakha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIphalethi yezimpawu\u003C/span\u003E ithola izimpawu zikagesi nezepayipi ngegama; umthombo we-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzitshalo\u003C/span\u003E wathi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmtapo\u003C/span\u003E uhlu lezitshalo ezingaba ngu-400 ezinezimpawu zepulani. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/symbol-palette\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/symbol-palette\"\u003EIphalethi yezimpawu\u003C/a\u003E no-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/plant-list\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/plant-list\"\u003EBeka isitshalo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzipayipi, imifudlana namandla\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuhlukanisa, VRF nezigcamu zokupholisa.\u003C/strong\u003E Iyunithi zangaphakathi nangaphandle nezixhumi zazo, nemigqa esayizwa ngokusuka etafuleni lezibonelo ezijwayelekile ezingashintshwa. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/split-vrf-fan-coils\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/split-vrf-fan-coils\"\u003EUkuhlukanisa, VRF nezigcamu zokupholisa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzibalo.\u003C/strong\u003E Ipane lezibalo lihlola usayizi wamapayipi okuhlinzeka nomoya nokuncipha kwengcindezi, liqondise amakhebula ngamathreyi nezigebe, futhi likhombise ukugcwala kwawo, futhi linikeze ukukhanya kusuka ku-IES noma ku-EULUMDAT. Okuzenzakalelayo kubhalwe ngamagama; thayipha amanani ekhodi yakho. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/mep-calculations\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/mep-calculations\"\u003EIzibalo zamapayipi, imifudlana, amakhebula nokukhanya\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmafayela e-PCF.\u003C/strong\u003E Ithuluzi lepayipi i-\u003Cstrong\u003EKhipha i-PCF\u003C/strong\u003E libhala imigqa yezinhlelo ze-pipe-stress nezohlelo ze-isometric, nofayela lwe-PCF oluphindwa lufundwe lidweba ipayipi lalo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/piping-pcf\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/piping-pcf\"\u003EAmafayela esakhiwo sepayipi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmaphaneli elanga.\u003C/strong\u003E Hlanganisa izinkundla zophahla noma zomhlaba, zifiphaze emthunzini wemodeli, linganisa amandla onyaka, hlola izintambo futhi wenze idatha yomugqa owodwa wedayagremu. Imojuli yokuqala namalahlekelo okujwayelekile. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/solar-pv\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/solar-pv\"\u003EAmaphaneli elanga\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIfayela le-EnergyPlus.\u003C/strong\u003E Ipane le-Check with EnergyPlus libhala imodeli njenge-IDF ukuze isebenze ku-EnergyPlus yakho. Ukuyisebenzisa ku-browser kudinga ibhilidi oyibambayo wena futhi uthayipha ikheli layo; i-BimCraft ayiyinaki. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/check-with-energyplus\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/check-with-energyplus\"\u003EHlola ukushisa nokupholisa nge-EnergyPlus\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzithombe namafayela\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKhetha injini yokurenda.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda\u003C/span\u003E inokukhetha kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInjini\u003C/span\u003E. Izinjini zethu ezimbili ezakhelwe ngaphakathi (Fast ne-Path tracer) zihlala njengokuzenzakalela. \u003Cstrong\u003EVula ku-\u003C/strong\u003E ilondoloza isimo njenge-USD noma i-glTF, nefolda yephrojekthi ye-Unreal njenge-.zip; ku-CadCraft Studio i-add-on ingangeza injini. I-plug-in ye-Unreal evula iphrojekthi ayikakhishwa. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render-engines\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render-engines\"\u003EKhetha uhlelo olwenza isithombe\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuhlehlisa kwe-Studio.\u003C/strong\u003E Ngaphakathi kwe-CadCraft Studio, i-BimCraft itshela i-Studio ngesinyathelo ngasinye esiqediwe ukuze i-Studio ikwazi ukuhlehlisa isinyathelo sakho sokugcina kunoma iyiphi iwindi osetshenziswe kuwo ekugcineni. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/undo-across-apps\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/undo-across-apps\"\u003EHlehlisa kuma-app\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAma-add-on kufayela lakho.\u003C/strong\u003E I-IFC iqopha ukuthi yimaphi ama-add-on abhale kuwo, futhi inikeza lawo owawasilele lapho uyivula. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/add-ons-in-your-file\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/add-ons-in-your-file\"\u003EAma-add-on kufayela lakho\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKu-yo yonke i-app\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXhuma i-AI yakho.\u003C/strong\u003E Umsizi wakho ongowakho ungasebenzisa i-BimCraft ngokuxhumana kwe-Studio aphendule imibuzo ngemodeli, njengokuthi yimaphi amagumbi angaphansi kwesifunda esinikeziwe. I-Studio ayinayo i-AI yayo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/assistants\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/assistants\"\u003EVumela umsizi we-AI asebenze nemodeli yakho\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmathuluzi ethuluzi.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikelele\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImigqa yebha yamathuluzi\u003C/span\u003E inikeza Wrap, imigqa engu-2 noma umugqa ongu-1; i-Wrap ihlala ingokuzenzakalela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinsiza zokufaka.\u003C/strong\u003E Ukukhetha kwepulaneti lokuthinta, ipeni, imouse ye-3D, ukulawula nama-MIDI kwabelwana ngakho ngama-app onke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinkinga kanye ne-Live.\u003C/strong\u003E Ipaneli lezexwayiso nezeshishi ze-Live zisebenza njengakuqala, ngezinhlolo ezintsha ngenhla zidla ku-Izinkinga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzilimi.\u003C/strong\u003E Izilimi ezingama-54, ezilishumi zazo zintsha. Ezingeyona isiNgisi ziyizinhlelo zomshini ezingakafundwa umuntu wendabuko; izihloko zosizo ziningi ngesiNgisi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"kulungisiwe-ku-0-8-1\"\u003EKulungisiwe ku-0.8.1\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkwakheka kwe-ribbon + kwesiphequluli sephrojekthi.\u003C/strong\u003E Insert › Import CAD, Insert › Image noma Manage › Project Units bekuthi &quot;Akukakhiwa ku-BimCraft&quot;. Manje i-Image ivula ithuluzi lePicture, i-Import CAD ivula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYakha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKusuka emdwebeni…\u003C/span\u003E (DWG, DXF, PDF noma skena), futhi i-Project Units ivula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikelele\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmayunithi\u003C/span\u003E. I-Move ne-Align zisebenzisa amathuluzi okuhamba nokulinganisa, i-Level ivula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza amazinga…\u003C/span\u003E, i-Phases ivula isigaba sezigaba zokuvuselela futhi i-Materials ivula umtapo wezinto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsigaba se-DWG classes.\u003C/strong\u003E Sasifundwa njengohlobo olungalungile; kulungisiwe ku-BimCraft nakwezinye ama-app afunda i-DWG.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUlimi ngesikhathi sokusebenza.\u003C/strong\u003E I-Studio namaphakheji amapakethe ingashintsha ulimi ngaphandle kokuqala kabusha. Lokhu akuhlolwanga kuzo zonke izinkundla; sitshele uma ulimi lungashintshi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuhlanganiswa kwe-Archicad.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Ccode\u003Earchicad_bundle.py\u003C/code\u003E, inkomba ehlukile yokulanda, manje ithola indlela ye-Archicad, ibheka ifolda isikhathi esingafika ku-20 imizuzwana futhi iyazama futhi eduze kwe-bundle.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"akusakwenziwa-kule-nguqulo\"\u003EAkusakwenziwa kule nguqulo\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinsiza zokuphepha nokuklama.\u003C/strong\u003E Abantu esakhiweni abanakho umkhawulo wokuhamba ukusuka kwikhodi yokwakha (uthayipha umkhawulo), futhi akukaqinisekiswa ngesandla epulanini langempela. Izinombolo zokuzwakala, zokuphila kwenkonzo nezingozi ziyizinombolo zokuhlela, hhayi ukuhlolwa kwekhodi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuguquka kwesimo sezulu nokuhlolwa kwe-EnergyPlus.\u003C/strong\u003E Akukho ukuguquka kwesimo sezulu okwakhelwe ngaphakathi: ungalayisha ifayela lesimo ukuze uhlole ukugeleza kwamanzi. Ukuhlolwa kwe-EnergyPlus ku-browser akuyona ingxenye yalokhu kukhishwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkwakheka kwe-ribbon.\u003C/strong\u003E I-Material Takeoff ihlala &quot;Ayakhiwe&quot; ngoba i-BimCraft ayinalo uhlu lwamanani ezinto, futhi amanye amathuluzi angu-54 e-ribbon ahlaziywa ngombala awanalo ithuluzi le-BimCraft emuva kwawo okwamanje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkusayina nezinhlelo.\u003C/strong\u003E Abafakeli be-Windows nama-.dmg e-macOS awasayinwe, ngakho i-SmartScreen ikhombisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUlwazi olwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYenza noma kunjalo\u003C/span\u003E, futhi i-macOS idinga ukuchofoza ngesokudla bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula\u003C/span\u003E. Ukwakha kwe-iPad ne-iPhone akuzange kwakhiwe kabusha ku-0.8.1.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzivivinyo zamakhasi wangempela.\u003C/strong\u003E Ezinye izivivinyo zakudala ze-browser ye-BimCraft ziyahluleka ezivivinyweni zethu zekhasi, njengoba zazihluleka ngaphambi kwe-0.8.1.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKonke okunye kukuthi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EOkungakakhiwa\u003C/a\u003E. Izinguquko zangaphambili zisemanothini e-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/whats-new-0-7\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/whats-new-0-7\"\u003E0.7\u003C/a\u003E nalapha.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Lokhu yikho okushintshe ku-BimCraft 0.9, kuqhathaniswa ne-0.8.1. Izindikimba ezimbili ezinkulu yithuluzi lodonga langempela nemibono eziziphatha ngendlela abantu abavela kuzinhlelo ezinkulu ze-BIM abayilindele. Ezinye zifika ngakho: ukukhipha i-Collada, abasizi abangabeka izinsiza zikagesi, Scan to BIM, nokusebenza komoya, ukuzamazama nezakhi ze-finite-element kuthebhu ye-Ukuhlaziya. Okusha Izindonga Dweba izimo ezigcwele. Ku-Dweba, vula Izimo (noma khetha isimo ohlwini lwezimo kumugqa wedonga) ukuze uthole irektangele, irektangele egqunyiwe, ipholigoni elinezinhlangothi ezi-3 kuya kwezi-64, i-arc ngesikhungo, i-arc ethintayo, izindonga ezikhethwe emigqeni, noma izindonga ezizungeze indawo evaliwe ocindezela phakathi kwayo. Irektangele inezindonga ezine namakhona amane ahlanganisiwe kanye nesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Bona Izimo zezindonga, ukuhlukanisa, ukweluleka nokukhiya. Beka ngaphambi kokudweba, shintsha ngemva. Umugqa wedonga unezinketho ezithi Ukuhlukana no-Hlanganisa (khipha ukukhetha ukuze udwebe izindonga ezimi ngokwazo). Ngemva kwalokho sebenzisa Ukuhlukana, Ukweluleka ngebhokisi no-Linganisa futhi ukhiye kumadonga adwetshiwe. Udonga oluhanjisiwe noma oluweluleke luhlala lunawo amasango, amawindi nezilinganiso zawo. Yonke iresiphi iyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Sika izindonga. Hlukanisa, Igebe, Izimpelo ezikhululekile, Susa ingxenye no-Hlanganisa kabusha zisika udonga ngokuchofoza noma lapho olunye udonga lulisika khona. Ukusika esangweni kuyenqatshwa. Bona Izimo zezindonga, ukuhlukanisa, ukweluleka nokukhiya. Khiya izindonga emigqeni yegridi. Khetha udonga oluhambisana nomugqa wegridi bese uthika Khiya egridini ku-Izici. Ngethuluzi legridi livuliwe, thayipha ibanga ku-Hambisa ngo komugqa okhethiwe, bese izindonga ezikhiyiwe zilandela ngesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Umuthi udonga olulodwa. Ku-Izici zodonga olulodwa ungaxhumanisa phezulu kwalo noma phansi kwalo kuphahla, iphansi noma ulingqo, uhlele umugqa wokuphakama kwalo, uwuthambekise, noma usike ukuvulwa kodonga ngaphandle kwesango noma iwindi. Bona Imo yodonga. Ubude buchaza ukuthi yiliphi icala elihlala. Khula kusukela ichaza ukuthi ukuqala, isiphetho noma isikhungo kuyahlala lapho ushintsha ubude. Ubude nezilinganiso zephlani ziyavumelana. Linganisa kusukela (umugqa wesikhungo, ubuso bangaphakathi noma ubuso bangaphandle) iqhuba kokubili inkambu yobude nezilinganiso zodonga epulanini. Iqala emugqeni wesikhungo, ngakho izilinganiso zodonga epulanini manje zifunda umugqa wesikhungo lapho zazifunda ubuso bangaphandle ngaphambili. Yishintshe ku-Umugqa wodonga, ku-Izici noma ku-Izilungiselelo › BimCraft › Izindonga. Amazinga, amagridi nokulinganisa Engeza izinga ngaphansi. Engeza izinga ngaphansi kuphaneli le-Amazinga yengeza izinga ngaphansi kolisezansi, lide njengalo, ngokukhwezwa okungeyona into engeyinhle (Level -1, Level -2). Akukho okunye okunyakazayo. Manje Engeza amazinga… yamukela ubude obungelona eyinhle. Ukuthayipha LEVEL, LEVELS, STOREY noma STOREYS emugqeni womyalo kuvula Engeza amazinga…, futhi kukhona inkinobho ye-Amazinga emenyini nasemathebhini e-ribbon. Bona Izindawo, izakhiwo namazinga. Izilinganiso zegridi epulanini. Ngethuluzi le-Igridi livuliwe, thika Izilinganiso ukuze udwebe ibanga phakathi kwemigqa eseduze kanye nosayizi ojwayelekile ngaphandle kwamabhamuza kuwo wonke epulani lenhla ngayinye. Bona Linganisa igridi. Linganisa epulanini. Linganisa eqenjini le-Dweba inikeza ibanga nomehluko we-X ne-Y phakathi kwezinkinobho ezimbili. Akukho okulondolozwayo emodelini. Bona Linganisa epulanini. Shintsha amakholomu amaningi ngesikhathi esisodwa. Khetha amakholomu kanye nodonga, bese uhlu lubonisa uhlobo ngalunye nge-Gcina lezi kuphela. Inkinobho eyodwa igcina amakholomu futhi ikhombise izinkambu azo ezabelanayo. Iyunithi eyodwa yokubonisa yonke indawo. Izixhumanisi, izilinganiso, izigaba, izikali zamashidi, izinkinga nezikhwama zethebhu yefreyimu zilandela iyunithi oyikhethayo. Ukuphuma kugcina i-SI. Imibono, amashidi nokuprinta Isitayela sokusebenza. Izilungiselelo › BimCraft › Isitayela sokusebenza sikhetha phakathi kokuthi umbono ngamunye unezinkomentari namathebhu wamapeni awowodwa, noma ayabelana ngawo. Bona Isitayela sokusebenza, imibono ephindiwe, amapeni ephepheni, Bika njenge nezikhwama. Phinda umbono. Amaplani, amaplani esiling, ama-callout, izinhlangothi nezigaba zingaphindwa njenge-Ikhophi lalo noma Ixhunyiwe; Yenza ikhophi lalo yenza owexhunyiwe abe ngowakhe. Bona Isitayela sokusebenza, imibono ephindiwe, amapeni ephepheni, Bika njenge nezikhwama. Phrinta njengoba kubonakala, noma ngethebhu yamapeni. Ukwehliswa kwamapeni kugcinwa ku-IFC nombono, futhi amashidi nama-PDF adweba njengoba isikrini senza. Lesi sihloko siphinde sihlanganise namathebhu wamapeni. Bika njenge. Bika njenge ku-Izici ibhala isilabhu esidwetshwe njengomgwaqo, udonga njengephaneli noma uphahla njengerempu kwi-IFC njengesigaba osikhethayo, bese lokho ​​kubalwa ngalendlela ezishejuleni, kuzibalo, ku-Find, ku-Color by nasezinkingeni. Hlela ezinhlangothini nasezigabeni. Dweba futhi uhambise izindonga, izimbobo, amazinga, izilinganiso namanothi ngqo ezinhlangothini nasezigabeni, ngosayizi bamashidi wakho nemigqa yokuqopha yakho. Bona Hlela ezinhlangothini nasezigabeni. Amashidi. Yonke ishidi lingaba ngobude noma ngobubanzi. Ibhokisi elithi Thayipha isikali lihlala ngasecaleni kolwazi lwezikali kwi-view ngayinye ebekiwe (1:64, 2:1, 1/4\" = 1'). Ungadonsa umdwebo obekiwe noma usunduze ngamakhiye osebe, futhi Amafomethi… › Ngenisa i-SVG… iguqula iyunithi yakho yeshidi ibe yigama lokuqopha elinezinkambu ezithayiphwe ngeshidi ngalinye. Izikweletu zethala ezisheethini. Isethi yemidwebo enezinto ze-Umtapo ithola ishejuli yezikweletu zomtapo oyingenisa kunoma iyiphi ishidi. Bona Izikweletu zomtapo. Umtapo: ukubeka Ukubeka kulandela umbono. Embonweni wephlani, i-Umtapo ikhombisa Beka epulanini; ku-3D ikhombisa Beka emodelini; ku-Split ikhombisa inkinobho ehlukanisiwe enesenzo esiyinhloko ethi Beka epulanini. Zombili izindlela zibhala into efanayo ye-IFC. Ungadonsa ikhadi lomtapo uliphonsele epulanini noma embonweni we-3D; ngepeni noma ngomunwe, cindezela ubambe, bese udonsa. Bona Beka into evela emtapweni. Amafayela nabasizi Collada ne-Google Earth. Collada ethuluzini le-toolbar (imenyu yefayela ezitayelweni zemenyu) ibhala i-.dae, noma i-.kmz ebekwe lapho imodeli ikhona emephini. Bona Khipha imodeli njenge-Collada noma ye-Google Earth. Abasizi bangabeka izinsiza zikagesi. Umsizi wakho oxhunyiwe unamathuluzi amasha okungeza, ukuhlu, ukushintsha nokususa izinsiza nokusetha izibani. Abasizi bahlala bevaliwe kuze kuvulwe kuzilungiselelo ku-Izilungiselelo. Bona Vumela umsizi we-AI asebenze nemodeli yakho. Scan to BIM (i-add-on). Ivaliwe ngokuzenzakalelayo futhi idinga i-add-on ye-Point clouds. Iphakamisa amafulowa, izindonga, iminyango namawindi ekuskenweni kanye nokuphambuka okulinganiswe kokukodwa; ukwamukela kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Ukuhlaziya Idatha yomoya nokuzamazama yesayithi. Ku-Ukuhlaziya: imithwalo yomoya ngokwe-ASCE 7-10 noma 7-16 yesakhiwo esiqinile esivaliwe, nenani lamandla kuwo wonke ungqimba njengamacala emithwalo, kanye nokuthola idatha yesayithi yokuzamazama nge-USGS nesipekthra sokuklama. Ukulandelela kwesakhiwo nezakhi ze-finite. Ukuhlolwa kwekhonkrithi ngokwe-ACI 318-19, izinkosi ezilinganayo zokuzamazama ngokwe-ASCE 7-22, ukuthuthuka kwezitezi, amafulowa nezindonga njengamapuleti, nokuhlanganiswa kwemithwalo ngokwe-ASCE 7 ne-EN 1990. Injini yethu yakhe ye-finite-element yenza ama-shell, ama-tetrahedron nokuhlaziya kwemodi. Bona Hlola izakhi zekhonkrithi futhi wenze imithwalo yokuzamazama no-Ukuhlaziya kohlaka. Ama-add-on nemidwebo Ukukhanyisa kwangaphakathi (i-add-on). Ibeka izinsiza zokukhanya futhi ibhala i-lux njengezinombolo kwipulani yezinga ngalinye, ngokuhlolwa kokukhanya okuqhoshayo nombiko ophrintekayo. Iphaneli lamadokhumenti. Ifayela › Amadokhumenti… linokuthatha nokubuyisa ngefayela lokukhiya, izinhlamvu zokubuyekeza, izimo zokukhishwa nomlando. Izifunda nensimbi. Amaphakheji emidwebo nemithetho yokwakha yaseNingizimu Afrika kwi-add-on ye-Regulations, kanye nosayizi bensimbi be-UK abangu-976 kwithebhu eyabelanayo yezigaba. Ama-add-on wokuprinta nge-resin ngaphandle kwentengo. I-slicer, izinsekelo namaraft, ukuhlolwa kokuvezwa, nezinhlobo zamafayela i-GOO, SL1, Chitubox ne-Anycubic, zonke zivaliwe ngokuzenzakalelayo. Ku-yo yonke i-app Ukuhambisa phezu kwenkinobho noma ulawulo kubonisa i-tooltip ye-Bootstrap. Indawo yokuqala yethiphu esikhaleni sokudweba esingenalutho inenkinobho yokuvala; i-BimCraft ikhumbula ukuthi yavalwa. Ithebhu yephaneli engeke ilingane ngayo manje iyaskrola esikhundleni sokusikwa. Lapho kuvulwe idokhumenti, ithebhu yesiphequluli ifunda \"\u003Cdocument\u003E - BimCraft | CadCraft\". Ku-Izilungiselelo › Jikelele › Ukwakheka ukwakheka kuyi-drop-down yezinketho ezimbili zemigqa. Uhlu lwezilimi ku-Izilungiselelo lunikeza izilimi eziningi kunakwi-0.8; ezingeyona isiNgisi ziyizinhlelo zomshini. Okulungisiwe Ukudonsa kusebenza ezitebhisini, nasemagudwini, izinqubo, izindiza zophahla, izinsiza ezimi ngokwazo, izithombe nezindlela. Ukudonsa udonga akusaguqulisi igumbi. Isibambi esiphakathi sihambisa udonga uzibambe njengesikwele futhi amakhona alo aguqukela phansi kwezindonga ezihlanganisiwe. Bamba Ctrl ukuze uthole ukuhamba okukhululekile kwakudala; Yenza isikwele ibuyisela ama-90 amadigri. Ukushintsha ukuqina noma uhlobo esiqeshini esihlanganisiwe manje kugcina ikhona elivaliwe ku-L, ku-T, esiqeshini sezindonga ezintathu nasecaleni kodonga oluthambekile. Ukuhambisa noma ukukopisha iqembu lamagumbi kugcina izindonga ezihlanganisiwe ngaphandle kwequmbu zihlanganisiwe. Ukuphinda kwenza kugcina ukuziphatha kwezilinganiso zodonga. Ukukhetha udonga nge-Draw ivaliwe akusabangeli iphutha ku-Izici. Ukurenda kubuyela ku-WebGL lapho i-GPU ingakwazi ukuqala, esikhundleni sokumisa. Ukuhlola kwe-EnergyPlus kungavulwa futhi. Idokhumenti ivula njengenkulumo-ngxoxo ephakathi. Esc, u-X noma ukuchofoza ekhasini elifiphele kuyivala. Izinkinobho ze-Ipulani, Split ne-3D zibonakala uma imodeli ivuliwe, hhayi kuphela ngemva kokuthi Dweba ivulwe kanye. Imikhawulo eyiqiniso Akukho okuphrintiwe ku-hardware yangempela. Ama-supports e-resin mashha futhi awaqinisekisiwe. Imiphumela yomoya, yokuzamazama, yekhonkrithi nye-finite-element ngumsizi wokuhlola kumhlahlandlela wenjiniyela, ihlolwe ngezibalo ezivaliwe, hhayi ngesakhiwo sangempela. Ukuskena kuya ku-BIM kuhlolwe kwisakhiwo esiyisimo, hhayi ku-scan yangempela, futhi kutholakala amagumbi azungeze ama-angles kuphela. I-Collada ayikaze ivulwe ku-Blender noma ku-Google Earth lapha. Isilinganiso sokukhanya sihlolwe ngomugqa wethu, hhayi ngezinye izinhlelo zokukhanya. Izinombolo zaseNingizimu Afrika azihlolwanga. Izitayela zokuhlanganisa izindonga (butt, mitre, square off) nokubaluleka kwamaleyili akwakhiwe; amakhona yenziwa enziwa ngama-mitre. Izilimi ezingesona isiNgisi ziyizinhlelo zomshini. Konke okunye kukuthi Okungakakhiwa. Izinguquko zangaphambili zisemanothini e-0.8 nowe-0.8.1 angaphansi kwalelikhasi. Ngaphambili: 0.8 no-0.8.1 Lokhu yikho okushintshe ku-BimCraft 0.8 (2026-11-01) ne-0.8.1 (2026-11-02), kuqhathaniswa ne-0.7. Manje i-BimCraft ingaphendula imibuzo ngesakhiwo futhi iyihlole, ngabantu, umsindo, amanzi, umoya nokuzamazama, futhi iyidwebe ngamathuluzi amaningi; i-0.8.1 ibukeka njengokulungiswa. Okusha Hlola isakhiwo Abantu esakhiweni. Isigaba se-Abantu esakhiweni sepaneli elingakwesobunxele sihamba nokuhlehla ngesikhathi sokuphuma noma ukufika kwansuku zonke ngamagumbi, iminyango nezitebhisi zakho. Ubona izindlela lapho isakhiwo sincipha, ukuhamba okude kakhulu ukuya ekuphumeni kusuka kugumbi ngalinye nokuthi isiphi sokugcina sithatha isikhathi esingakanani. Thika Vala ku-door ukubona ukuthi yini eshintsha, bese uthika Bonisa abantu kumbono we-3D ukubukela abahambi. Imiphumela ifika ku-Izinkinga. Kuyimodeli yokubhekisa ngokubanzi yezinqumo zokuklama, hhayi isitifiketi sokuphepha komlilo. Bona Hambisa abantu esakhiweni. Ukuzwakala kwegumbi, nokulizwa. Isigaba se-Ukuzwakala kwegumbi sinikeza isikhathi sokuhlanganisa kugumbi ngalinye ngebhendi ye-octave (Sabine no-Eyring) kusuka kusayizi walo nezinhlobo zokuqeda oziqokile, futhi ngenhloso yakho yakho ithi ukumuncwa okwanele ukuze kuhlangabezane nayo. Yidlale kuleligumbi idlala izwi, ukushaya izandla, izinothi ezikhishwe noma ifayela lomsindo lakho ngomthelela wokuphendula okubalwe ngegumbi. Izinombolo zokumuncwa ziwukuchaza kwendabuko okushicilelwe kwe-typical values ukuze ushintshe. Bona Ukuzwakala kwegumbi. Ukudlala ukugeleza kwamanzi, umoya nokuzamazama. Ukudlala kwengozi idlala amanzi akhuphuka ngamagumbi, ingcindezi yomoya ezitezini ngayinye nokuzamazama okushukumisa izitezi, phezu kwepulani noma kwenkulumo ngesilayidi sesikhathi. Amamodeli alula nokuqagela kwawo kuphaneli; hhayi ukuhlola kwekhodi. Bona Dlala ukugeleza kwamanzi, umoya noma ukuzamazama. Okuyogcina kuguga kumashumi amahlanu eminyaka. I-Umbono wempilo yonke idwesela amawindi, iminyango, ukuqedwa nophahla, ngokuphila kwenkonzo ngayinye, iminyaka lapho zishintshwa khona, futhi uma uthayipha inani ngeyunithi, inani ngonyaka nenani lamanje. Londoloza uhlelo (CSV) ilibhala. Izikhathi zenkonzo ziyizinombolo zokuhlela. Bona Bona okuguga eminyakeni engamashumi amahlanu. Izikhathi zekhonkrithi nezokuzamazama. Izigaba ze-Izakhi zekhonkrithi ne-Imithwalo yokuzamazama zethebhu ye-Ukuhlaziya zihlola izinsika nezingqi zekhonkrithi ngokwe-ACI 318-19 zenze amandla ancintisana ngokwe-ASCE 7-22 emasongweni eqinile, nokuthuthuka kwezitezi. Okwenziwa injiniyela ukuhlola. Bona Hlola izakhi zekhonkrithi futhi wenze imithwalo yokuzamazama. Hlola nokubika Hlola nge-IDS. Layisha ifayela le-.ids umklienti akunike lona bese ubona zonke izakhi ezingahlangabezani nalo ku-Izinkinga, ngaphambi kokulethela i-IFC. Vula Hlola nge-IDS ngaphansi kwe-Ukuhlola imodeli. Bona Hlola imodeli ngokwe-IDS yeklayenti. Amathegi namashejuli. Chaza amathegi akho, uwabeke ezakhi eziningi ngesikhathi esisodwa futhi wenze amashejuli amakholomu, izihlungi namaqembu awafunda; amathegi agcinwa ku-IFC. Bona Amathegi namashejuli. Amadokhumenti emodelini. Amadokhumenti kusuka kumodeli igcwalisa ithemplethi yezinkomba kusuka ku-IFC evulekile bese iyigcina njenge-PDF, idokhumenti ye-Word noma i-Markdown. Bona Amadokhumenti kusuka kumodeli. Qhathanisa i-scan nemodeli. Ngepoyinti lefu elivulekile, Qhathanisa ihlola ngalinye isakhi njengesakhiwe, esakhiwe ngokuphelele, esingekho noma esingafinyelelwe, futhi ikhombisa amaphesenti akhiwe. Bona Qhathanisa i-scan nemodeli. Ikhabhoni nezindleko. I-Carbon pane ifaka ikhabhoni eyenziwe ngokusebenzisa itheyibhu yezinto ongayihlela, ne-Cost pane isakaza izintengo ngesheduli ye-4D. Izinto ezikhona nge-BimCraft zijwayelekile futhi zimakwe njengezingahlolwanga. Bona Ikhabhoni eyenziwe nezindleko. Noma iyiphi iprojekshini yemephu. Linganisa › Uhlelo lwezixhumanisi… lamukela inombolo ye-EPSG, izone ye-UTM, igama noma inchazelo yakho yeprojekshini. Bona Ukuthuthukisa ngeprojekshini yanoma iyiphi. Dweba futhi uhlele Hambisa, Linganisa nokusabalalisa. Ngaphansi kwe-Yakha; Shift+M iqala ukuHambisa (M ngokwayo isengu-Linganisa). Ukuhambisa kukopisha njengoba uhamba ngo-C, isinyathelo ngasinye siyisinyathelo sokuhlehlisa esisodwa, futhi sihamba ku-Live TeamWork session. Bona Hambisa, kopisha, linganisa nosabalalise. Izithombe ngaphansi kwepulani. Yakha › Isithombe kubeka i-PNG, i-JPEG noma i-WebP ngaphansi kwepulani lezinga noma endizeni ethi phezulu. Setha isikali ngamaphoyinti amabili, bese uyahamba, uyajikisa, uyafiphaza futhi uyakhiya. Indawo ekopishwe ku-MarkupCraft iyanamathiselwa ngesikali sesheethi yayo. Bona Beka isithombe ngaphansi kwepulani. Izindonga kusuka ku-scan. Ngescan evuliwe, izindonga, iminyango namagumbi kuza njengezincomo ogcina noma ozinqaba ngalinye, esinyathelweni esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Kutholakala kuphela izindonga ezingqondene kuzo zombili izinqondo. Bona Guqula i-scan ibe yizindonga. Landela, amapeni nesitebhisi sokudweba. Landela ikhombisa elinye izinga ngokudashiwe ngaphansi kwepulani, Amapeni inika izindonga, iminyango namawindi ubukhulu bomugqa bawo kubuso obubodwa, futhi Dweba isitebhisi iguqula umugqa wokuhamba ube yisitebhisi. Ifayela le-Wavefront OBJ liyavuleka. Bona Landela izinga, amapeni nesitebhisi ngomdwebo. Izakhiwo ezizungeze ikheli. Izakhiwo nesakhiwo esatholwa yi-CivilCraft's Address to site ziza njengezincomo; uthika ezifuna ukungeza. Bona Qala ngesayithi le-CivilCraft. Imidwebo yamaphaneli. Yakha › Imiklamo yamaphaneli yakha izindonga, amafulowa nophahla ngamapulangwe noma ngensimbi eyizinhlamvu ezincane, futhi igcina uhlu lokusika njenge-CSV nemidwebo yokwakha njenge-PDF. Izinani zokuqala, hhayi idizayini yesakhiwo. Bona Imiklamo yamaphaneli. Iphalethi yezimpawu nezitshalo. Yakha › Iphalethi yezimpawu ithola izimpawu zikagesi nezepayipi ngegama; umthombo we-Izitshalo wathi Umtapo uhlu lezitshalo ezingaba ngu-400 ezinezimpawu zepulani. Bona Iphalethi yezimpawu no-Beka isitshalo. Izipayipi, imifudlana namandla Ukuhlukanisa, VRF nezigcamu zokupholisa. Iyunithi zangaphakathi nangaphandle nezixhumi zazo, nemigqa esayizwa ngokusuka etafuleni lezibonelo ezijwayelekile ezingashintshwa. Bona Ukuhlukanisa, VRF nezigcamu zokupholisa. Izibalo. Ipane lezibalo lihlola usayizi wamapayipi okuhlinzeka nomoya nokuncipha kwengcindezi, liqondise amakhebula ngamathreyi nezigebe, futhi likhombise ukugcwala kwawo, futhi linikeze ukukhanya kusuka ku-IES noma ku-EULUMDAT. Okuzenzakalelayo kubhalwe ngamagama; thayipha amanani ekhodi yakho. Bona Izibalo zamapayipi, imifudlana, amakhebula nokukhanya. Amafayela e-PCF. Ithuluzi lepayipi i-Khipha i-PCF libhala imigqa yezinhlelo ze-pipe-stress nezohlelo ze-isometric, nofayela lwe-PCF oluphindwa lufundwe lidweba ipayipi lalo. Bona Amafayela esakhiwo sepayipi. Amaphaneli elanga. Hlanganisa izinkundla zophahla noma zomhlaba, zifiphaze emthunzini wemodeli, linganisa amandla onyaka, hlola izintambo futhi wenze idatha yomugqa owodwa wedayagremu. Imojuli yokuqala namalahlekelo okujwayelekile. Bona Amaphaneli elanga. Ifayela le-EnergyPlus. Ipane le-Check with EnergyPlus libhala imodeli njenge-IDF ukuze isebenze ku-EnergyPlus yakho. Ukuyisebenzisa ku-browser kudinga ibhilidi oyibambayo wena futhi uthayipha ikheli layo; i-BimCraft ayiyinaki. Bona Hlola ukushisa nokupholisa nge-EnergyPlus. Izithombe namafayela Khetha injini yokurenda. Renda inokukhetha kwe-Injini. Izinjini zethu ezimbili ezakhelwe ngaphakathi (Fast ne-Path tracer) zihlala njengokuzenzakalela. Vula ku- ilondoloza isimo njenge-USD noma i-glTF, nefolda yephrojekthi ye-Unreal njenge-.zip; ku-CadCraft Studio i-add-on ingangeza injini. I-plug-in ye-Unreal evula iphrojekthi ayikakhishwa. Bona Khetha uhlelo olwenza isithombe. Ukuhlehlisa kwe-Studio. Ngaphakathi kwe-CadCraft Studio, i-BimCraft itshela i-Studio ngesinyathelo ngasinye esiqediwe ukuze i-Studio ikwazi ukuhlehlisa isinyathelo sakho sokugcina kunoma iyiphi iwindi osetshenziswe kuwo ekugcineni. Bona Hlehlisa kuma-app. Ama-add-on kufayela lakho. I-IFC iqopha ukuthi yimaphi ama-add-on abhale kuwo, futhi inikeza lawo owawasilele lapho uyivula. Bona Ama-add-on kufayela lakho. Ku-yo yonke i-app Xhuma i-AI yakho. Umsizi wakho ongowakho ungasebenzisa i-BimCraft ngokuxhumana kwe-Studio aphendule imibuzo ngemodeli, njengokuthi yimaphi amagumbi angaphansi kwesifunda esinikeziwe. I-Studio ayinayo i-AI yayo. Bona Vumela umsizi we-AI asebenze nemodeli yakho. Amathuluzi ethuluzi. Izilungiselelo › Jikelele › Imigqa yebha yamathuluzi inikeza Wrap, imigqa engu-2 noma umugqa ongu-1; i-Wrap ihlala ingokuzenzakalela. Izinsiza zokufaka. Ukukhetha kwepulaneti lokuthinta, ipeni, imouse ye-3D, ukulawula nama-MIDI kwabelwana ngakho ngama-app onke. Izinkinga kanye ne-Live. Ipaneli lezexwayiso nezeshishi ze-Live zisebenza njengakuqala, ngezinhlolo ezintsha ngenhla zidla ku-Izinkinga. Izilimi. Izilimi ezingama-54, ezilishumi zazo zintsha. Ezingeyona isiNgisi ziyizinhlelo zomshini ezingakafundwa umuntu wendabuko; izihloko zosizo ziningi ngesiNgisi. Kulungisiwe ku-0.8.1 Ukwakheka kwe-ribbon + kwesiphequluli sephrojekthi. Insert › Import CAD, Insert › Image noma Manage › Project Units bekuthi \"Akukakhiwa ku-BimCraft\". Manje i-Image ivula ithuluzi lePicture, i-Import CAD ivula Yakha › Kusuka emdwebeni… (DWG, DXF, PDF noma skena), futhi i-Project Units ivula Izilungiselelo › Jikelele › Amayunithi. I-Move ne-Align zisebenzisa amathuluzi okuhamba nokulinganisa, i-Level ivula Engeza amazinga…, i-Phases ivula isigaba sezigaba zokuvuselela futhi i-Materials ivula umtapo wezinto. Isigaba se-DWG classes. Sasifundwa njengohlobo olungalungile; kulungisiwe ku-BimCraft nakwezinye ama-app afunda i-DWG. Ulimi ngesikhathi sokusebenza. I-Studio namaphakheji amapakethe ingashintsha ulimi ngaphandle kokuqala kabusha. Lokhu akuhlolwanga kuzo zonke izinkundla; sitshele uma ulimi lungashintshi. Ukuhlanganiswa kwe-Archicad. archicad_bundle.py, inkomba ehlukile yokulanda, manje ithola indlela ye-Archicad, ibheka ifolda isikhathi esingafika ku-20 imizuzwana futhi iyazama futhi eduze kwe-bundle. Akusakwenziwa kule nguqulo Izinsiza zokuphepha nokuklama. Abantu esakhiweni abanakho umkhawulo wokuhamba ukusuka kwikhodi yokwakha (uthayipha umkhawulo), futhi akukaqinisekiswa ngesandla epulanini langempela. Izinombolo zokuzwakala, zokuphila kwenkonzo nezingozi ziyizinombolo zokuhlela, hhayi ukuhlolwa kwekhodi. Ukuguquka kwesimo sezulu nokuhlolwa kwe-EnergyPlus. Akukho ukuguquka kwesimo sezulu okwakhelwe ngaphakathi: ungalayisha ifayela lesimo ukuze uhlole ukugeleza kwamanzi. Ukuhlolwa kwe-EnergyPlus ku-browser akuyona ingxenye yalokhu kukhishwa. Ukwakheka kwe-ribbon. I-Material Takeoff ihlala \"Ayakhiwe\" ngoba i-BimCraft ayinalo uhlu lwamanani ezinto, futhi amanye amathuluzi angu-54 e-ribbon ahlaziywa ngombala awanalo ithuluzi le-BimCraft emuva kwawo okwamanje. Ukusayina nezinhlelo. Abafakeli be-Windows nama-.dmg e-macOS awasayinwe, ngakho i-SmartScreen ikhombisa Ulwazi olwengeziwe, bese Yenza noma kunjalo, futhi i-macOS idinga ukuchofoza ngesokudla bese Vula. Ukwakha kwe-iPad ne-iPhone akuzange kwakhiwe kabusha ku-0.8.1. Izivivinyo zamakhasi wangempela. Ezinye izivivinyo zakudala ze-browser ye-BimCraft ziyahluleka ezivivinyweni zethu zekhasi, njengoba zazihluleka ngaphambi kwe-0.8.1. Konke okunye kukuthi Okungakakhiwa. Izinguquko zangaphambili zisemanothini e-0.7 nalapha.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"whats-new-0-7","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Okusha ku-0.7 (kwangaphambili)","summary":"I-BimCraft yengeza izindonga ezidlula kwezitezi eziningi, Copy this level, izindonga kusuka kuma-PDF nakumaskeni, izakhiwo zakho zodonga, imindeni eminingi, izinsiza ze-MEP nezixhumanisi, amasethi okushaya, izimbobo kanye nezinkanyezi zamapayipi, amadokhumenti wempahla, i-COBie nezifundo zezinzwa, isibhakabhaka, ilanga, ukukhanya kwemini ngegridi nezidingo zokushisa nokupholisa, ukuhlanganisa iskena, ukubuka okuphilayo nokulandelela indlela ngekhadi lezithombe, i-STEP ne-USD, izinhlobo zempahla yomtapo, nokunye okuningi kubasizi be-AI.","section":"start","order":7,"keywords":["okusha ku-0.7","ukukhishwa kwangaphambili","amanothi okukhishwa","ushintsho","ukushintsha","0.7","inguqulo","izici ezintsha","izindonga ezidlula izitezi","copy this level","pdf","iskena","landela","izindonga kusuka kumapulani","izakhiwo zodonga","izendlalelo","ingaphakathi","imembrane","izilinganiso zokubhekisela","umtapo wezinto","izinkambu zokubonisa","indlela yokubuka","ukwakha","izinsika","imindeni","amapharamitha","isimbonakalo sepulani","izinhlanzi","ukuphindaphinda","izinga lemininingwane","imindeni ehlanganisiwe","usayizi we-csv","ngento ngayinye","izinsiza","izixhumanisi","ukuxhumana","ukuhlanzwa","izimbobo","izinkanyezi","izinkanyezi zesteel","ushiye umdwebo wamapayipi","izinkanyezi zamapayipi","documents","cobie","izinzwa","mqtt","ukudlula kwedatha ephilayo","isibonakalo sokuhlola","igesi yelanga","igridi yemini","ukushisa","ukupholisa","imithwalo","u-value","ukuhlanganisa iskena","icp","e57","ukubuka okuphilayo","ukulandelela indlela","webgpu","ukuhlaziya","isibhakabhaka esiyiphysical","ukuxuba ukukhanya","umugqa wokubonisa","umshini wakho","step","usb","isikhwama seprojekthi","ukwakha ubukhulu","izinhlobo","abasizi","add-on api","isitshalo","electrical","ukuhlola kwedizayini"],"headings":[{"id":"okusha","text":"Okusha","level":2},{"id":"akha-isakhiwo","text":"Akha isakhiwo","level":3},{"id":"imindeni","text":"Imindeni","level":3},{"id":"amapulazi-izinkanyezi-nezinsiza","text":"Amapulazi, izinkanyezi nezinsiza","level":3},{"id":"ukuphatha-isakhiwo","text":"Ukuphatha isakhiwo","level":3},{"id":"ukukhanya-kwemini-namandla","text":"Ukukhanya kwemini namandla","level":3},{"id":"iskena","text":"Iskena","level":3},{"id":"izithombe-nombono-ophilayo","text":"Izithombe nombono ophilayo","level":3},{"id":"amafayela-nezinye-izinhlelo","text":"Amafayela nezinye izinhlelo","level":3},{"id":"abasizi-be-ai-nezengeziwe","text":"Abasizi be-AI nezengeziwe","level":3},{"id":"kushintshiwe","text":"Kushintshiwe","level":2},{"id":"kulungisiwe","text":"Kulungisiwe","level":2},{"id":"kuzo-zonke-izinhlelo","text":"Kuzo zonke izinhlelo","level":2},{"id":"akusakho-kule-nguqulo-okwamanje","text":"Akusakho kule nguqulo okwamanje","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ELokhu yikho okushintshile ku-BimCraft 0.7, kuqhathaniswa ne-0.6. Uhlu luhlelwe ngezindawo, okubaluleke kakhulu phezulu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okusha\"\u003EOkusha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"akha-isakhiwo\"\u003EAkha isakhiwo\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzindonga ezidlula kwezitezi eziningi.\u003C/strong\u003E Uhlu lwobude lwethuluzi le-Wall lunikeza \u003Cstrong\u003EUp to\u003C/strong\u003E noma yisiphi isitezi esiphezulu, njengoba i-Properties yenza kudonga oluyikhethile. Amapulani ezitezi eziphakathi ibonisa udonga okhanyayo, amagumbi lapho avala khona, futhi izinmnyango nezifasiteli zingafakwa kuwo kusuka kuleyo mapulani; i-\u003Cstrong\u003ERuns through\u003C/strong\u003E ku-Properties iqamba izitezi edlula kuzo. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/change-a-wall-or-door#change-a-wall\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/change-a-wall-or-door\" data-hash=\"change-a-wall\"\u003EShintsha udonga, umnyango noma ifasitela\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECopy this level.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy this level…\u003C/span\u003E ePhaneli Yezitezi idweba futhi izindonga zesitezi, nezinmnyango nezifasiteli zalo, nezindawo nezilingo zalo esitezini esinye noma esisha phezulu, kwisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa; amagumbi avela ngokwawo. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/draw-walls#levels\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/draw-walls\" data-hash=\"levels\"\u003EDraw walls\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzindonga kusuka kwi-PDF noma kwiskena.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuild\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom a drawing…\u003C/span\u003E manje ithatha i-PDF (umsebenzi wemigqa noma iskena ngaphakathi kuyo) noma ipulani eskeniwe (PNG, JPEG, TIFF, amakhasi amaningi): ikhasi ngalinye libe yizindonga, izinmnyango, amafasitela namagumbi esitezi, nekhasi lihlala ngaphansi kwepulani yalo. Ukulandela akusebenzisi unethiwekhi noma imodeli eqeqeshiwe, futhi umphumela ungokwemigqa yakho: hlola isitezi ngasinye ngekhasi lakhe. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/walls-from-plans\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/walls-from-plans\"\u003EIzindonga kusuka kumasethi wamapulani\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzakhiwo zakho zodonga.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWall assemblies…\u003C/span\u003E yakha uhlobo lodonga ngesendlalelo ngesendlalelo, ngengaphakathi, ingaphakathi lomoya nemembrane, nombono onezilinganiso; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaterial library…\u003C/span\u003E igcina izinto zephrojekthi ku-IFC; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAnnotate\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReference dimension\u003C/span\u003E ilinganisa kubuso nasemigqeni yengaphakathi bese ilandela izindonga uma zishintsha. Ngomnikela womphakathi, u-Doc (drsurfbum). Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/wall-assemblies\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/wall-assemblies\"\u003EIzakhiwo zodonga nezilinganiso zokubhekisela\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinkambu zokubonisa nezilawuli zombono.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnits\u003C/span\u003E ethulini lokusebenza ibonisa ubude ngamafiti namainshi, amainshi, amafiti ayinhlamvu, amamilimitha, amasentimitha noma amamitha, ezilinganisweni, ezinhlwini, ezindaweni, ezilinganisweni nasezigatshaneni. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlan\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESplit\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E zisethulini lokusebenza, ihlukaniso lingadonswa (noma lihanjiswe ngekhibhodi), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShaded\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdges\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWireframe\u003C/span\u003E zisecaleni kwekhyubu yombono, futhi ukuthambeka kophahla, i-fascia kanye ne-soffit kushintsha uphahla olukhethiwe ngokushesha. Ngomnikela womphakathi, u-Joel (yisraelk). Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/draw-walls#levels\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/draw-walls\" data-hash=\"levels\"\u003EDraw walls\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinsika ezinezikhala.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFraming\u003C/span\u003E ingabeka ama-joists aqinisiwe (ahlelweni) kanye nezinkuni ezisawiwe, ikhethe uhlu olucwebe kakhulu nokujula okufinyelela ibanga, i-16&quot; noma i-24&quot; ngokuphakathi, endleleni noma yiyiphi; zingena ku-IFC nohlu lokusika. Isincomo esivela kwithebhula elishicilelwe somkhiqizi, hhayi ubunjiniyela. Futhi ngoJoel. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/framing\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/framing\"\u003EFraming walls, floors and roofs\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinsiza ezengeziwe zikagesi.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EElectrical\u003C/span\u003E yengeza amasokhethi edatha, eselula nevidiyo-iudiyo, iswishi yokukhetha, isikhathimeli, ithemostethi, izikhulumi zentuthu nokushisa, isiteshi sokuma, isiren, ifeni, imitha yamandla kanye nepanel encane, ngayinye ingumkhakha wayo we-IFC. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/electrical-plan\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/electrical-plan\"\u003EThe electrical plan\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"imindeni\"\u003EImindeni\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImindeni yenza okuningi.\u003C/strong\u003E Amapharamitha angaba izinombolo eziphelele, umbhalo, impahla, ipeni noma ukugcwalisa; umndeni ungadweba isimbonakalo sawo sepulani, uphindaphinde isinqo, uphawule izingxenye zemininingwane emincane, uphathe imindeni yakho (umlenze etafuleni), futhi ube nezinhlamvu ozidonsayo, nakwinto ebekwe epulanini. Usayizi uvela kwithebhula le-CSV, namapharamitha amaphawulwe ngokuthi \u003Cstrong\u003EPer element\u003C/strong\u003E avumela izinmnyango ezimbili zosayizi ofanayo ukuthi zihluke. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/family-editor#plan-symbol\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/family-editor\" data-hash=\"plan-symbol\"\u003EEdit a family\u003C/a\u003E kanye \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/families#sizes-from-a-table\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/families\" data-hash=\"sizes-from-a-table\"\u003EFamilies and their sizes\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"amapulazi-izinkanyezi-nezinsiza\"\u003EAmapulazi, izinkanyezi nezinsiza\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinsiza ezinezixhumanisi.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuild\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEquipment\u003C/span\u003E ibeka i-air handler jikelele, ifeni yomugqa, ipompo, i-boiler, isishisi samanzi, iyunithi yokugcina, i-diffuser, igrille noma ithangi, ilinganiswe ngamanani owathayiphayo, nezixhumanisi zayo zepayipi nomoya njengezixhunyo. Ngayinye igcinwa njengomkhakha wayo we-IFC nezixhunyo ze-IFC. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/mep-equipment\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/mep-equipment\"\u003EMEP equipment with ports\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImigqa exhunyiwe.\u003C/strong\u003E Ipayipi noma umoya oqalwa kuxhunyo uthatha usayizi nohlelo lwalo futhi uhlale uxhunyiwe kuwo: hambisa ipompo bese ipayipi lalo liyalandela. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck connections\u003C/span\u003E ibala izixhunyo ezivulekile, iziphetho ezikhululekile, ukungafani kosayizi nohlelo, nemigqa engenalutho engenayo ukunikezwa. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/mep-connections\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/mep-connections\"\u003EConnect pipes and ducts to equipment\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmapayipi nemimoya ngokumelene nesakhiwo.\u003C/strong\u003E I-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClash check\u003C/span\u003E inamasethi alungiselelwe kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPipes and ducts × structure\u003C/span\u003E ngokuchofoza kunye; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck clearances\u003C/span\u003E isebenzisa ukugoqwa kwemigqa ngayinye kanye negebe owalithayiphayo; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpenings needed\u003C/span\u003E ibala lapho imigqa edlula ezindongeni nezilele, njengeCSV nezinkinga ze-BCF. Akukho okusikwayo. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/mep-against-structure\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/mep-against-structure\"\u003ECheck pipes and ducts against the structure\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinkanyezi zamapayipi ensimbi.\u003C/strong\u003E Umugqa wensimbi usikwa ube yizinkanyezi ezinenombolo ngobude obude kakhulu kanye ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EField weld\u003C/span\u003E ozibekayo; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpool sheets (PDF)\u003C/span\u003E inikeza ikhasi ngalinye lenkanyezi ngombono wayo we-isometric, izinde zokusika, izinto ezixhumayo, ukuwelda nobuhlu bempahla, futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDuct cut list\u003C/span\u003E ibala izingcezu zomoya ezigqamile. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/pipe-spools\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/pipe-spools\"\u003ESteel pipe spools and spool sheets\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELezi yizinsiza zokudweba nokuhlela, zilinganiswe ngunjiniyela: azikho izindlela zokugeleza, izingcindezi noma ukulinganisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ukuphatha-isakhiwo\"\u003EUkuphatha isakhiwo\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmadokhumenti ngempahla ngayinye.\u003C/strong\u003E Ithebhu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAssets\u003C/span\u003E ixhumanisa imanuwali, izaziso zomshwalense, izithombe nemidwebo nempahla ngegama lefayela eliseduze ne-IFC noma ikheli lewebhu; kuphela ixhumo olungena ku-IFC. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/assets-and-maintenance#documents\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/assets-and-maintenance\" data-hash=\"documents\"\u003EDocuments\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIspredishithi ye-COBie.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave as COBie (.xlsx)\u003C/span\u003E ibhala incwadi yokudlulisa yomsebenzi ye-COBie 2.4, futhi incwadi ye-COBie efundwa ngokubuyela ibala konke ukushintsha ngaphambi kwesinyathelo esisodwa se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EApply\u003C/span\u003E. Ayikaze idlule kumhloli we-COBie okwamanje. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/assets-and-maintenance#cobie-spreadsheet\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/assets-and-maintenance\" data-hash=\"cobie-spreadsheet\"\u003ECOBie spreadsheet\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzifundo zezinzwa nokudlula kwedatha ephilayo.\u003C/strong\u003E Vula i-CSV yezifundo, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EConnect\u003C/span\u003E ngqo kusiphequluli kumabhrokha wakho we-MQTT noma ikheli lesistimu yakho yesakhiwo esiphendulayo: ipaseli ngayinye ibonisa isifundo sayo sakamuva nechati, ikhanyiswe emodelini, futhi iphawulwa uma ingaphandle kwemikhawulo elondolozwe ku-IFC. Izifundo zihlala ethebhini; amaphasiwedi awagcinwa lutho. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/assets-and-maintenance#sensor-readings\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/assets-and-maintenance\" data-hash=\"sensor-readings\"\u003ESensor readings\u003C/a\u003E kanye \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/assets-and-maintenance#live-readings\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/assets-and-maintenance\" data-hash=\"live-readings\"\u003ELive readings\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ukukhanya-kwemini-namandla\"\u003EUkukhanya kwemini namandla\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsibhakabhaka nelanga ezindizeni ngayinye.\u003C/strong\u003E Ithebhu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDaylight\u003C/span\u003E inika ifasitela ngalinye isibhakabhaka sawo esiphezulu nento yokuvimbela, ilandela ilanga phakathi kosuku nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESun through the windows on a date\u003C/span\u003E, futhi isebenzise i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDaylight factor on a grid\u003C/span\u003E kuwo wonke igumbi, idwetshwe epulanini layo. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/daylight-factor#vertical-sky-component-of-each-window\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/daylight-factor\" data-hash=\"vertical-sky-component-of-each-window\"\u003EVertical sky component of each window\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzidingo zokushisa nokupholisa.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHeating and cooling loads\u003C/span\u003E ibala ukulahleka kokushisa kwegumbi ngalinye, ukushisa kwalo ngonyaka kusuka ezinsukwini zedigri, nokupholisa kwalo okuphezulu, kusuka kokubopha emodelini nakwi-U-value yento ngayinye; i-U-value oyithayiphayo lapho ibhalwa ku-IFC. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/heating-and-cooling-loads\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/heating-and-cooling-loads\"\u003EEstimate heating and cooling loads\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKokubili kuyizinsiza zokuklama ngezindlela ezishicilelwe, hhayi izibalo zokuhambisana, futhi yonke ipaneli iyasho lokho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"iskena\"\u003EIskena\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHlanganisa amaskena amaningi.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERegister scans…\u003C/span\u003E (esiqaleni kwephaneli, noma ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow\u003C/span\u003E) ibeka amaskena esakhiweni esisodwa ngamaphuzu ahlanganisiwe akhethiwe noma ngamasethi athayiphiwe, ilungise ngeICP ukusuka phuzu kuye phuzu bese ukusuka phuzu kuya endizeni, ilondoloze ukuhlanganiswa njengefayela elincane leprojekthi, futhi ibhale ifu elihlanganisiwe njengefayela elilodwa le-LAS noma i-E57. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/register-scans\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/register-scans\"\u003ERegister several scans into one\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"izithombe-nombono-ophilayo\"\u003EIzithombe nombono ophilayo\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmbono ophilayo.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive view\u003C/span\u003E ethulini lokusebenza ibonisa imodeli ngendlela yesikhathi sangempela eduze kombono we-3D, ilandele wona nazo zonke izinguquko, ne-Walk, isikhathi sosuku nenyanga; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive view in a new window\u003C/span\u003E iyibeka esikrinini sesibili. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/live-view\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/live-view\"\u003EThe live view\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkulandelela indlela ngekhadi lezithombe.\u003C/strong\u003E Ngo-WebGPU, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERender\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHigh quality (path traced)\u003C/span\u003E isebenzisa umlandelelo we-CadCraft ekhadini lezithombe, ingamisa futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EResume\u003C/span\u003E, futhi inciphisa umsindo ekugcineni; ngaphandle kwe-WebGPU isebenzisa umlandelelo we-WebGL njengakuqala. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render#high-quality\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render\" data-hash=\"high-quality\"\u003EHigh quality\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOkwengeziwe kwengxoxo yokuRenda\u003C/strong\u003E (ekhadini lezithombe, ngakho idinga i-WebGPU): isibhakabhaka esiphysical nezithombe zesibhakabhaka, amaprofayili okukhanya e-IES, ikhamera nge-f-stop, ukujula kwenkundla, ukubona okubili, ukulinganisa umbala, izinkulungwane ezingu-360° ezibonakalayo, ibanga lokukhanya lesithombe esiqediwe, ukuxuba ukukhanya, izakhi zokurenda ngemva kokurenda, ukuqhuma, intuthu nama-caustics, ukugcina njenge-PNG enebhithi eyi-16, EXR noma ifayela lokurenda, nohlu lokurenda. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render#skies-and-light-profiles-on-the-graphics-card\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render\" data-hash=\"skies-and-light-profiles-on-the-graphics-card\"\u003ESkies and light profiles on the graphics card\u003C/a\u003E kanye \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render#the-render-queue\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render\" data-hash=\"the-render-queue\"\u003EThe render queue\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmshini wakho.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBimCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERendering\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYour machine\u003C/span\u003E ibonisa amagrafikhi, amakhodi eprosesa nenkumbulo esiphequluli sivumela uhlelo ukuthi lukusebenzise, nezinga lapho ukurenda kuqala khona. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/your-machine\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/your-machine\"\u003EWhat your machine renders with\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"amafayela-nezinye-izinhlelo\"\u003EAmafayela nezinye izinhlelo\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmafayela e-STEP ayavuleka.\u003C/strong\u003E Ifayela \u003Ccode\u003E.step\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E.stp\u003C/code\u003E lengxenye, lesisetshenziswa noma lomhlinzeki (AP203, AP214, AP242) livula njengemodeli encane ye-IFC, ngamunye umzimba oyinto oyihlola, ohlolwayo, olinganiswayo nolondolozwayo njenge-IFC. Imibala namagama ezingxenye zesakhiwo awakafundwa okwamanje. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/files#what-it-opens\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/files\" data-hash=\"what-it-opens\"\u003EFiles BimCraft opens and saves\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuthumela kwe-USD.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUSD\u003C/span\u003E ethulini lokusebenza ibhala imodeli evuliwe njenge-\u003Ccode\u003E.usda\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.usdc\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E.usdz\u003C/code\u003E, ihlelwe ngendawo, isakhiwo, isitezi nendawo yokusebenza, nayo yonke into ine-IFC class, i-GlobalId nezakhiwo. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/usd\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/usd\"\u003EExport the model as USD\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmthamo weCivilCraft.\u003C/strong\u003E Umthamo wesakhiwo ovela kumbono wesayithi we-CivilCraft ubonisa izinombolo zokufunda kuma-Properties, futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDevelop this mass\u003C/span\u003E yakha izindonga zazo zonke izitezi nofudu kusuka kuwo kwisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/develop-a-mass\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/develop-a-mass\"\u003EDevelop a building mass from a site study\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinto zomtapo ezinezinhlobo.\u003C/strong\u003E Into eza ngezinhlobo eziningi inokukhetha kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVariant\u003C/span\u003E kuthebhu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELibrary\u003C/span\u003E; into ebekiwe igcina uhlobo lwayo ku-IFC, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESwap item…\u003C/span\u003E iqamba ezinye izinhlobo, nokukhopisha nokubuyekeza kuyagcina. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/library-variants\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/library-variants\"\u003EPlace and swap a library item that has variants\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmaphakheji wephrojekthi esikhwameni.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen a folder\u003C/span\u003E ibala amafayela \u003Ccode\u003E.ccbundle.zip\u003C/code\u003E ngaphansi kuka-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProject bundles\u003C/span\u003E, futhi isakhiwo ngasinye ephakheji sinakho \u003Cstrong\u003EOpen in …\u003C/strong\u003E: i-PDF iya ku-MarkupCraft, i-DWG iya ku-CadCraft, ethebhini elisha. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/open-project-bundle#open-a-layout\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/open-project-bundle\" data-hash=\"open-a-layout\"\u003EOpen a layout\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"abasizi-be-ai-nezengeziwe\"\u003EAbasizi be-AI nezengeziwe\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOkwengeziwe kubasizi be-AI.\u003C/strong\u003E Umsizi manje angathola amagama ezinto nokusetha izakhiwo, ahambise futhi asuse izinto, ashintshe izindonga, iminyango namafasitela, akhiphe i-USD, arende isithombe noma asebenzise uhlu lokurenda; ngayinye iyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/assistants\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/assistants\"\u003ELet an AI assistant work with your model\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzengezo zingakha emodelini.\u003C/strong\u003E I-add-on API 1.1 ivumela isengezo ukwenza ushintsho emodelini njengesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa (lihamba ku-Live TeamWork), ukufunda imodeli, nokufunda imigqa yamapayipi nomoya, izixhunyo, izinsiza kanye nezinkanyezi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsengezo se-Plant\u003C/strong\u003E (sivaliwe kuze kube yilapho usivula ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd-ons\u003C/span\u003E): izici zamapayipi ezihlolwa ngemigqa, imidwebo ye-isometric yomugqa njenge-SVG ne-DXF nohlu lwezinto, izinsiza zokucubungula ezijwayelekile ezinezinzipho ezibekwe emodelini, umelalumanzi phakathi kwezixhunyo ezimbili, kanye nokuhlolwa kokuhlelwa kwendawo. Isiza sokudweba, hhayi ukugunyazwa kwezinjiniyela; amazwi aso ngesiNgisi kuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kushintshiwe\"\u003EKushintshiwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIndlu yokuqala kwilaputhobhu.\u003C/strong\u003E Esikrinini esincane njengesilaputhobhu i-BimCraft iqala ngepulani kuphela, ibha yokudweba iba iphaneli emincane enepulani elingene eduze kwayo, ipulani nombono we-3D kuyabuya lapho umdwebo uphuma kuwo, umbono we-3D wakha indlu yonke ephaneli emincane, futhi izinmnyango namafasitela kukhethwa ngaphambi kwemigqa yesilinganiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkugcina isithombe.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cstrong\u003ESave PNG\u003C/strong\u003E ekhadini lezithombe manje ngu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave\u003C/span\u003E, nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave as\u003C/span\u003E eduze kwayo kwezinye izinhlobo. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render#save-the-picture\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render\" data-hash=\"save-the-picture\"\u003ESave the picture\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIthebhu yokuhlaziya\u003C/strong\u003E inebhulokhi ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDesign checks\u003C/span\u003E: yenza izinhlanganisela zemithwalo ye-ASCE 7 noma i-EN 1990 ngamacala akho futhi ihlola ngayinye yesakhiwo sensimbi esigqwayiwe (i-W, S, IPE, HEA noma HEB ngegama lephrofayili nosayizi) ngokwe-AISC 360 noma i-EN 1993-1-1, ibonise ukuthi yisiphi isabelo sokukhawuleza esisetshenzisiwe. Isisekelo kuze kube yilapho unjiniyela ebhekisisa; izakhiwo ezibotshiwe nezinye izigaba zithi &quot;not checked&quot;. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/frame-analysis#design-checks\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/frame-analysis\" data-hash=\"design-checks\"\u003EDesign checks\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kulungisiwe\"\u003EKulungisiwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuphinda ukwenza ngemva kwesinyathelo esidale usayizi omusha womndeni kwehluleka (&quot;no size&quot;). Yonke isinyathelo manje senza i-IFC GlobalIds efanayo uma kuphinda kwenziwe, ngakho ukuphinda kusebenza kumindeni nakokunye konke ukushintsha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELapho abantu ababili belondoloza umndeni ofanayo (esikhathini se-Live TeamWork noma ngamawindi amabili), ukugcinwa kwesibili kwashintsha okokuqala ngokuthula. Manje kuyenqaba bese kuchaza ukuthi ungabona kanjani ushintsho lwabo bese wenze olwakho kabusha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImodeli ngamafiti esizwe sase-US yayifundwa njengo-0.3048 m ngefiti esikhundleni se-0.3048006096 m, okwakunyakazisa zonke ama-IFC anendawo emhlabeni ngamafiti esizwe sase-US ebhaleni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmhleli womndeni: ukuvala akusayikhipha ukugxila kwekhibhodi ekhasini, i-Save yakhe isalokhu ibonakala ku-foni, nezinkambu zakhe azisenzi ifoni ilingane.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kuzo-zonke-izinhlelo\"\u003EKuzo zonke izinhlelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinkomba zobukhulu.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnits\u003C/span\u003E inohlu olulodwa lobude, indawo, ivolumu, i-engeli nokuthambeka, ngosayizi abaqondile ezichazweni zamayunithi (ifiti lesizwe sase-US liyiyunithi yalo). Vala amayunithi ongawasebenzisi awaphume ohlwini, futhi uphawule elilodwa usebenzisa okusha okuqala kulo. Ifayela ligcina iyunithi yalo njalo. Ku-BimCraft uhlu lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnits\u003C/span\u003E ethulini lokusebenza ilandela amaswishi, isiqalo sisetha amayunithi okubonisa kuze kube yilapho ukhetha ngokuthi ethulini (ukukhetha kwakho kwangaphambili kuyagcinwa), futhi amabhokisi obude wamathuluzi okudweba amukela ukuthi yiyiphi iyunithi, njengo-\u003Ccode\u003E3.5 m\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E10 US ft\u003C/code\u003E. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/unit-lists\" data-topic=\"basics/unit-lists\"\u003EUnits, typed values and the unit lists\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkwakheka okujulile nezimpaneli ezizihlelayo.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout density\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECompact\u003C/span\u003E ilungisa okwengeziwe esikrinini (izikrini zokuthinta nofoni zigcina izinkinobho zazo ezinkulu). Ngayinye iphaneli yecala inebha yesihloko elincane: yidonsele ukuze uyifake noma uyihlukanise, uyilahlele ebhareni lephaneli yomunye ukuze yabelane ngefreyimu njengamathebhu, uyiphinde ukuze ihambe ilale ngasemaphethweni, noma uyifihle bese uyibuyisela emaphethweni. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels#make-the-layout-denser\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\" data-hash=\"make-the-layout-denser\"\u003EArrange the panels\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmabhokisi ayahamba.\u003C/strong\u003E Donsa ibhokisi ngebha yalo yesihloko ukuze ulisuse endleleni yomdwebo; liyabuya lapho wawuliyeka khona. Chofoza kabili ibha yesihloko ukuze ulibeke phakathi futhi. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels#move-a-dialog\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\" data-hash=\"move-a-dialog\"\u003EMove a dialog\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzindlela zabasizi be-AI.\u003C/strong\u003E Izicelo eziyishumi ezisebenzayo zomsizi wakho (hlela umdwebo, hlela isethi, hlola imidwebo, buza imodeli imibuzo, bala izinto ngokuphelele, zama inguqulo yengxenye…), ngayinye nezithuluzi ezibiza nemvume edingayo, futhi ngayinye iphindwa yizivivinyo zethu. Izinhlelo azinayo i-AI. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/assistants-recipes\" data-topic=\"basics/assistants-recipes\"\u003ERecipes for AI assistants\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzilimi.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cstrong\u003EPortuguês (Portugal)\u003C/strong\u003E kusha ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELanguage\u003C/span\u003E. Yona, \u003Cstrong\u003EPortuguês (Brasil)\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EEspañol (México)\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003EBahasa Indonesia\u003C/strong\u003E manje zinawo wonke amagama ezinhlelo, njengemisebenzi engakabhekwa umuntu wendabuko. Izihloko zosizo zisesiNgisi, kanye nezinye ezisesiSpanish.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio\u003C/strong\u003E isho ukuthi kungani ukuhlolwa kwesibuyekezo kwehlulekile (akukho fayela lesistimu yakho okwamanje, akukho inethiwekhi, isiginesha embi) esikhundleni se-&quot;Done&quot; nje, futhi iyeka ukubuyisa ikhadi le-What&#039;s new oliliwe uze kube khona inguqulo entsha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akusakho-kule-nguqulo-okwamanje\"\u003EAkusakho kule nguqulo okwamanje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E0.7 ayisayinwanga ngekhodi.\u003C/strong\u003E Ukusayina, kanye nephakheji le-Microsoft Store, kwadlulela ku-0.8 ngoba ukugunyazwa kwesitifiketi akukafiki. Hlola i-SHA-256 eseceleni kwefayela ngalinye ku-getcadcraft.com/download. Ku-Windows, uma i-SmartScreen imisa isifakeli, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore info\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERun anyway\u003C/span\u003E. Ku-Mac, okokuqala, chofoza ngokudla i-CadCraft Studio bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen\u003C/span\u003E. I-CadCraft Studio ayikakabi esitolo sezinhlelo, futhi akukakhiwa ukuthi ngokwakhiwa kwe-iPad noma i-iPhone.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmalisti wama-engeli nokuthambeka ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnits\u003C/span\u003E ayagcinwa, kodwa akukho bhokisi elilifundayo okwamanje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkulandelela indlela ekhadini lezithombe, izengezo ze-Render dialog kanye nohlu lokurenda kudinga i-WebGPU (ngaphandle kwayo, ikhwalithi ephezulu isebenzisa umlandelelo we-WebGL); umbono ophilayo usebenzisa i-WebGPU lapho isiphequluli sayo, kwesingenayo i-WebGL 2. Ziye zahlolwa lapha kuphela kumsizi wegrafikhi wesofthiwe, hhayi okwamanje kumakhadi egrafikhi angempela. Umbono ophilayo awunayo ukusakaza noma ukwabelana ku-BimCraft (ye-ModelCraft inakho).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkurenda uhambo olurekhodiwe njengevidiyo akwakhiwe ku-BimCraft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinhlolo zoyilo: i-I-shape ngegama layo le-IFC lephrofayili elingeyona usayizi we-W, S, IPE, HEA noma HEB (noma usayizi wayo uhluke kuwo) ithathwa njengewelded futhi ibuyela &quot;not checked&quot;, njengamathubhu, ama-angles, amachanneli, izingxenye ezincane kakhulu nokujikeka. Akukho unjiniyela owazihlolisisa okwamanje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinto ezidwetshiwe azikwazi ukukopishwa zodwa, zijikelezwe, zibhalwe ngasese noma zihlelwe ngamakhophi, futhi akukho udonga oluhlukanisiwe, ithuluzi lombhalo noma udonga lwekhethini. (Isitezi sonke singakopishwa.) Udonga oludlula udonga oluvela kwesitezi esiphansi esitezini esiphezulu alufakwa emzimbeni we-3D walowo wudonga, futhi izinkundla zikhombisa izimbobo zesitezi esiphezulu ngaphansi kwesitezi sodonga lwazo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImindeni: umtapo wemindeni ohlelwe phakathi kwamaprojekthi awukakwakhiwa. Imindeni nezitezi ezikopishiwe azikaze zivulwe ezinhlelweni zeBIM ezinye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMEP: izinsiza zijwayelekile (azikho idatha yabakhiqizi); amatee nezinciphisi ezinkanyezini zensimbi zijwayelekile, azivela etafuleni le-ASME B16.9; izixhumi zempahla yomtapo ezibekwe ngethebhu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELibrary\u003C/span\u003E azibhalwa ku-IFC; akukho okuhlolwe unjiniyela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsengezo se-Plant asikwazi okwamanje ukudweba umugqa oqondisiwe emodelini, ukubalela izinkanyezi kumidwebo yazo ye-isometric, noma ukuhlola ukuhlelwa kwezinsiza ezibekwe kumtapo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzitshalo zomtapo wezitshalo we-CivilCraft azikwazi ukubekwa ethebhini le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELibrary\u003C/span\u003E le-BimCraft okwamanje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmandla: akukho ukulinganisa ngamahora, akukho indlela ye-ISO 52016-1 neyamafayela ezulu. Amasethi: akukho ukuphila kwedijithali okugcina izifundo noma okuthumela izexwayiso lapho i-BimCraft ivaliwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuhlanganiswa kweskena kuhlolwe kumaskena okuhlola, akuhlolwanga kusethi yangempela yeskena lenhlangano; amafayela e-E57 avula kuze kube ngamapointi ayizigidi eziyisi-6 kanye no-512 MB.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmaphakheji wephrojekthi avulwa ku-BimCraft kuphela (ezinye izinhlelo zithatha isakhiwo nge-\u003Cstrong\u003EOpen in …\u003C/strong\u003E), futhi amaphakheji nekhithi yezinhlelo ezimbili ziye zahlolwa ngezinhlelo ezilingisa, hhayi okwamanje ne-Archicad noma i-Revit ngokwazo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKonke okunye kukuthi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EOkungakakhiwa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Lokhu yikho okushintshile ku-BimCraft 0.7, kuqhathaniswa ne-0.6. Uhlu luhlelwe ngezindawo, okubaluleke kakhulu phezulu. Okusha Akha isakhiwo Izindonga ezidlula kwezitezi eziningi. Uhlu lwobude lwethuluzi le-Wall lunikeza Up to noma yisiphi isitezi esiphezulu, njengoba i-Properties yenza kudonga oluyikhethile. Amapulani ezitezi eziphakathi ibonisa udonga okhanyayo, amagumbi lapho avala khona, futhi izinmnyango nezifasiteli zingafakwa kuwo kusuka kuleyo mapulani; i-Runs through ku-Properties iqamba izitezi edlula kuzo. Bheka Shintsha udonga, umnyango noma ifasitela. Copy this level. Copy this level… ePhaneli Yezitezi idweba futhi izindonga zesitezi, nezinmnyango nezifasiteli zalo, nezindawo nezilingo zalo esitezini esinye noma esisha phezulu, kwisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa; amagumbi avela ngokwawo. Bheka Draw walls. Izindonga kusuka kwi-PDF noma kwiskena. Build › From a drawing… manje ithatha i-PDF (umsebenzi wemigqa noma iskena ngaphakathi kuyo) noma ipulani eskeniwe (PNG, JPEG, TIFF, amakhasi amaningi): ikhasi ngalinye libe yizindonga, izinmnyango, amafasitela namagumbi esitezi, nekhasi lihlala ngaphansi kwepulani yalo. Ukulandela akusebenzisi unethiwekhi noma imodeli eqeqeshiwe, futhi umphumela ungokwemigqa yakho: hlola isitezi ngasinye ngekhasi lakhe. Bheka Izindonga kusuka kumasethi wamapulani. Izakhiwo zakho zodonga. Wall assemblies… yakha uhlobo lodonga ngesendlalelo ngesendlalelo, ngengaphakathi, ingaphakathi lomoya nemembrane, nombono onezilinganiso; Material library… igcina izinto zephrojekthi ku-IFC; Annotate › Reference dimension ilinganisa kubuso nasemigqeni yengaphakathi bese ilandela izindonga uma zishintsha. Ngomnikela womphakathi, u-Doc (drsurfbum). Bheka Izakhiwo zodonga nezilinganiso zokubhekisela. Izinkambu zokubonisa nezilawuli zombono. Units ethulini lokusebenza ibonisa ubude ngamafiti namainshi, amainshi, amafiti ayinhlamvu, amamilimitha, amasentimitha noma amamitha, ezilinganisweni, ezinhlwini, ezindaweni, ezilinganisweni nasezigatshaneni. Plan, Split kanye 3D zisethulini lokusebenza, ihlukaniso lingadonswa (noma lihanjiswe ngekhibhodi), Shaded, Edges kanye Wireframe zisecaleni kwekhyubu yombono, futhi ukuthambeka kophahla, i-fascia kanye ne-soffit kushintsha uphahla olukhethiwe ngokushesha. Ngomnikela womphakathi, u-Joel (yisraelk). Bheka Draw walls. Izinsika ezinezikhala. Framing ingabeka ama-joists aqinisiwe (ahlelweni) kanye nezinkuni ezisawiwe, ikhethe uhlu olucwebe kakhulu nokujula okufinyelela ibanga, i-16\" noma i-24\" ngokuphakathi, endleleni noma yiyiphi; zingena ku-IFC nohlu lokusika. Isincomo esivela kwithebhula elishicilelwe somkhiqizi, hhayi ubunjiniyela. Futhi ngoJoel. Bheka Framing walls, floors and roofs. Izinsiza ezengeziwe zikagesi. Electrical yengeza amasokhethi edatha, eselula nevidiyo-iudiyo, iswishi yokukhetha, isikhathimeli, ithemostethi, izikhulumi zentuthu nokushisa, isiteshi sokuma, isiren, ifeni, imitha yamandla kanye nepanel encane, ngayinye ingumkhakha wayo we-IFC. Bheka The electrical plan. Imindeni Imindeni yenza okuningi. Amapharamitha angaba izinombolo eziphelele, umbhalo, impahla, ipeni noma ukugcwalisa; umndeni ungadweba isimbonakalo sawo sepulani, uphindaphinde isinqo, uphawule izingxenye zemininingwane emincane, uphathe imindeni yakho (umlenze etafuleni), futhi ube nezinhlamvu ozidonsayo, nakwinto ebekwe epulanini. Usayizi uvela kwithebhula le-CSV, namapharamitha amaphawulwe ngokuthi Per element avumela izinmnyango ezimbili zosayizi ofanayo ukuthi zihluke. Bheka Edit a family kanye Families and their sizes. Amapulazi, izinkanyezi nezinsiza Izinsiza ezinezixhumanisi. Build › Equipment ibeka i-air handler jikelele, ifeni yomugqa, ipompo, i-boiler, isishisi samanzi, iyunithi yokugcina, i-diffuser, igrille noma ithangi, ilinganiswe ngamanani owathayiphayo, nezixhumanisi zayo zepayipi nomoya njengezixhunyo. Ngayinye igcinwa njengomkhakha wayo we-IFC nezixhunyo ze-IFC. Bheka MEP equipment with ports. Imigqa exhunyiwe. Ipayipi noma umoya oqalwa kuxhunyo uthatha usayizi nohlelo lwalo futhi uhlale uxhunyiwe kuwo: hambisa ipompo bese ipayipi lalo liyalandela. Check connections ibala izixhunyo ezivulekile, iziphetho ezikhululekile, ukungafani kosayizi nohlelo, nemigqa engenalutho engenayo ukunikezwa. Bheka Connect pipes and ducts to equipment. Amapayipi nemimoya ngokumelene nesakhiwo. I-Clash check inamasethi alungiselelwe kanye Pipes and ducts × structure ngokuchofoza kunye; Check clearances isebenzisa ukugoqwa kwemigqa ngayinye kanye negebe owalithayiphayo; Openings needed ibala lapho imigqa edlula ezindongeni nezilele, njengeCSV nezinkinga ze-BCF. Akukho okusikwayo. Bheka Check pipes and ducts against the structure. Izinkanyezi zamapayipi ensimbi. Umugqa wensimbi usikwa ube yizinkanyezi ezinenombolo ngobude obude kakhulu kanye ku-Field weld ozibekayo; Spool sheets (PDF) inikeza ikhasi ngalinye lenkanyezi ngombono wayo we-isometric, izinde zokusika, izinto ezixhumayo, ukuwelda nobuhlu bempahla, futhi Duct cut list ibala izingcezu zomoya ezigqamile. Bheka Steel pipe spools and spool sheets. Lezi yizinsiza zokudweba nokuhlela, zilinganiswe ngunjiniyela: azikho izindlela zokugeleza, izingcindezi noma ukulinganisa. Ukuphatha isakhiwo Amadokhumenti ngempahla ngayinye. Ithebhu ye-Assets ixhumanisa imanuwali, izaziso zomshwalense, izithombe nemidwebo nempahla ngegama lefayela eliseduze ne-IFC noma ikheli lewebhu; kuphela ixhumo olungena ku-IFC. Bheka Documents. Ispredishithi ye-COBie. Save as COBie (.xlsx) ibhala incwadi yokudlulisa yomsebenzi ye-COBie 2.4, futhi incwadi ye-COBie efundwa ngokubuyela ibala konke ukushintsha ngaphambi kwesinyathelo esisodwa se-Apply. Ayikaze idlule kumhloli we-COBie okwamanje. Bheka COBie spreadsheet. Izifundo zezinzwa nokudlula kwedatha ephilayo. Vula i-CSV yezifundo, noma Connect ngqo kusiphequluli kumabhrokha wakho we-MQTT noma ikheli lesistimu yakho yesakhiwo esiphendulayo: ipaseli ngayinye ibonisa isifundo sayo sakamuva nechati, ikhanyiswe emodelini, futhi iphawulwa uma ingaphandle kwemikhawulo elondolozwe ku-IFC. Izifundo zihlala ethebhini; amaphasiwedi awagcinwa lutho. Bheka Sensor readings kanye Live readings. Ukukhanya kwemini namandla Isibhakabhaka nelanga ezindizeni ngayinye. Ithebhu ye-Daylight inika ifasitela ngalinye isibhakabhaka sawo esiphezulu nento yokuvimbela, ilandela ilanga phakathi kosuku nge-Sun through the windows on a date, futhi isebenzise i-Daylight factor on a grid kuwo wonke igumbi, idwetshwe epulanini layo. Bheka Vertical sky component of each window. Izidingo zokushisa nokupholisa. Heating and cooling loads ibala ukulahleka kokushisa kwegumbi ngalinye, ukushisa kwalo ngonyaka kusuka ezinsukwini zedigri, nokupholisa kwalo okuphezulu, kusuka kokubopha emodelini nakwi-U-value yento ngayinye; i-U-value oyithayiphayo lapho ibhalwa ku-IFC. Bheka Estimate heating and cooling loads. Kokubili kuyizinsiza zokuklama ngezindlela ezishicilelwe, hhayi izibalo zokuhambisana, futhi yonke ipaneli iyasho lokho. Iskena Hlanganisa amaskena amaningi. Register scans… (esiqaleni kwephaneli, noma ku-Show) ibeka amaskena esakhiweni esisodwa ngamaphuzu ahlanganisiwe akhethiwe noma ngamasethi athayiphiwe, ilungise ngeICP ukusuka phuzu kuye phuzu bese ukusuka phuzu kuya endizeni, ilondoloze ukuhlanganiswa njengefayela elincane leprojekthi, futhi ibhale ifu elihlanganisiwe njengefayela elilodwa le-LAS noma i-E57. Bheka Register several scans into one. Izithombe nombono ophilayo Umbono ophilayo. Live view ethulini lokusebenza ibonisa imodeli ngendlela yesikhathi sangempela eduze kombono we-3D, ilandele wona nazo zonke izinguquko, ne-Walk, isikhathi sosuku nenyanga; Live view in a new window iyibeka esikrinini sesibili. Bheka The live view. Ukulandelela indlela ngekhadi lezithombe. Ngo-WebGPU, Render › High quality (path traced) isebenzisa umlandelelo we-CadCraft ekhadini lezithombe, ingamisa futhi Resume, futhi inciphisa umsindo ekugcineni; ngaphandle kwe-WebGPU isebenzisa umlandelelo we-WebGL njengakuqala. Bheka High quality. Okwengeziwe kwengxoxo yokuRenda (ekhadini lezithombe, ngakho idinga i-WebGPU): isibhakabhaka esiphysical nezithombe zesibhakabhaka, amaprofayili okukhanya e-IES, ikhamera nge-f-stop, ukujula kwenkundla, ukubona okubili, ukulinganisa umbala, izinkulungwane ezingu-360° ezibonakalayo, ibanga lokukhanya lesithombe esiqediwe, ukuxuba ukukhanya, izakhi zokurenda ngemva kokurenda, ukuqhuma, intuthu nama-caustics, ukugcina njenge-PNG enebhithi eyi-16, EXR noma ifayela lokurenda, nohlu lokurenda. Bheka Skies and light profiles on the graphics card kanye The render queue. Umshini wakho. Settings › BimCraft › Rendering › Your machine ibonisa amagrafikhi, amakhodi eprosesa nenkumbulo esiphequluli sivumela uhlelo ukuthi lukusebenzise, nezinga lapho ukurenda kuqala khona. Bheka What your machine renders with. Amafayela nezinye izinhlelo Amafayela e-STEP ayavuleka. Ifayela .step noma .stp lengxenye, lesisetshenziswa noma lomhlinzeki (AP203, AP214, AP242) livula njengemodeli encane ye-IFC, ngamunye umzimba oyinto oyihlola, ohlolwayo, olinganiswayo nolondolozwayo njenge-IFC. Imibala namagama ezingxenye zesakhiwo awakafundwa okwamanje. Bheka Files BimCraft opens and saves. Ukuthumela kwe-USD. USD ethulini lokusebenza ibhala imodeli evuliwe njenge-.usda, .usdc noma .usdz, ihlelwe ngendawo, isakhiwo, isitezi nendawo yokusebenza, nayo yonke into ine-IFC class, i-GlobalId nezakhiwo. Bheka Export the model as USD. Umthamo weCivilCraft. Umthamo wesakhiwo ovela kumbono wesayithi we-CivilCraft ubonisa izinombolo zokufunda kuma-Properties, futhi Develop this mass yakha izindonga zazo zonke izitezi nofudu kusuka kuwo kwisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Bheka Develop a building mass from a site study. Izinto zomtapo ezinezinhlobo. Into eza ngezinhlobo eziningi inokukhetha kwe-Variant kuthebhu ye-Library; into ebekiwe igcina uhlobo lwayo ku-IFC, Swap item… iqamba ezinye izinhlobo, nokukhopisha nokubuyekeza kuyagcina. Bheka Place and swap a library item that has variants. Amaphakheji wephrojekthi esikhwameni. Open a folder ibala amafayela .ccbundle.zip ngaphansi kuka-Project bundles, futhi isakhiwo ngasinye ephakheji sinakho Open in …: i-PDF iya ku-MarkupCraft, i-DWG iya ku-CadCraft, ethebhini elisha. Bheka Open a layout. Abasizi be-AI nezengeziwe Okwengeziwe kubasizi be-AI. Umsizi manje angathola amagama ezinto nokusetha izakhiwo, ahambise futhi asuse izinto, ashintshe izindonga, iminyango namafasitela, akhiphe i-USD, arende isithombe noma asebenzise uhlu lokurenda; ngayinye iyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Bheka Let an AI assistant work with your model. Izengezo zingakha emodelini. I-add-on API 1.1 ivumela isengezo ukwenza ushintsho emodelini njengesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa (lihamba ku-Live TeamWork), ukufunda imodeli, nokufunda imigqa yamapayipi nomoya, izixhunyo, izinsiza kanye nezinkanyezi. Isengezo se-Plant (sivaliwe kuze kube yilapho usivula ku-Settings › General › Add-ons): izici zamapayipi ezihlolwa ngemigqa, imidwebo ye-isometric yomugqa njenge-SVG ne-DXF nohlu lwezinto, izinsiza zokucubungula ezijwayelekile ezinezinzipho ezibekwe emodelini, umelalumanzi phakathi kwezixhunyo ezimbili, kanye nokuhlolwa kokuhlelwa kwendawo. Isiza sokudweba, hhayi ukugunyazwa kwezinjiniyela; amazwi aso ngesiNgisi kuphela. Kushintshiwe Indlu yokuqala kwilaputhobhu. Esikrinini esincane njengesilaputhobhu i-BimCraft iqala ngepulani kuphela, ibha yokudweba iba iphaneli emincane enepulani elingene eduze kwayo, ipulani nombono we-3D kuyabuya lapho umdwebo uphuma kuwo, umbono we-3D wakha indlu yonke ephaneli emincane, futhi izinmnyango namafasitela kukhethwa ngaphambi kwemigqa yesilinganiso. Ukugcina isithombe. Save PNG ekhadini lezithombe manje ngu-Save, nge-Save as eduze kwayo kwezinye izinhlobo. Bheka Save the picture. Ithebhu yokuhlaziya inebhulokhi ye-Design checks: yenza izinhlanganisela zemithwalo ye-ASCE 7 noma i-EN 1990 ngamacala akho futhi ihlola ngayinye yesakhiwo sensimbi esigqwayiwe (i-W, S, IPE, HEA noma HEB ngegama lephrofayili nosayizi) ngokwe-AISC 360 noma i-EN 1993-1-1, ibonise ukuthi yisiphi isabelo sokukhawuleza esisetshenzisiwe. Isisekelo kuze kube yilapho unjiniyela ebhekisisa; izakhiwo ezibotshiwe nezinye izigaba zithi \"not checked\". Bheka Design checks. Kulungisiwe Ukuphinda ukwenza ngemva kwesinyathelo esidale usayizi omusha womndeni kwehluleka (\"no size\"). Yonke isinyathelo manje senza i-IFC GlobalIds efanayo uma kuphinda kwenziwe, ngakho ukuphinda kusebenza kumindeni nakokunye konke ukushintsha. Lapho abantu ababili belondoloza umndeni ofanayo (esikhathini se-Live TeamWork noma ngamawindi amabili), ukugcinwa kwesibili kwashintsha okokuqala ngokuthula. Manje kuyenqaba bese kuchaza ukuthi ungabona kanjani ushintsho lwabo bese wenze olwakho kabusha. Imodeli ngamafiti esizwe sase-US yayifundwa njengo-0.3048 m ngefiti esikhundleni se-0.3048006096 m, okwakunyakazisa zonke ama-IFC anendawo emhlabeni ngamafiti esizwe sase-US ebhaleni. Umhleli womndeni: ukuvala akusayikhipha ukugxila kwekhibhodi ekhasini, i-Save yakhe isalokhu ibonakala ku-foni, nezinkambu zakhe azisenzi ifoni ilingane. Kuzo zonke izinhlelo Izinkomba zobukhulu. Settings › General › Units inohlu olulodwa lobude, indawo, ivolumu, i-engeli nokuthambeka, ngosayizi abaqondile ezichazweni zamayunithi (ifiti lesizwe sase-US liyiyunithi yalo). Vala amayunithi ongawasebenzisi awaphume ohlwini, futhi uphawule elilodwa usebenzisa okusha okuqala kulo. Ifayela ligcina iyunithi yalo njalo. Ku-BimCraft uhlu lwe-Units ethulini lokusebenza ilandela amaswishi, isiqalo sisetha amayunithi okubonisa kuze kube yilapho ukhetha ngokuthi ethulini (ukukhetha kwakho kwangaphambili kuyagcinwa), futhi amabhokisi obude wamathuluzi okudweba amukela ukuthi yiyiphi iyunithi, njengo-3.5 m noma 10 US ft. Bheka Units, typed values and the unit lists. Ukwakheka okujulile nezimpaneli ezizihlelayo. Settings › General › Layout density › Compact ilungisa okwengeziwe esikrinini (izikrini zokuthinta nofoni zigcina izinkinobho zazo ezinkulu). Ngayinye iphaneli yecala inebha yesihloko elincane: yidonsele ukuze uyifake noma uyihlukanise, uyilahlele ebhareni lephaneli yomunye ukuze yabelane ngefreyimu njengamathebhu, uyiphinde ukuze ihambe ilale ngasemaphethweni, noma uyifihle bese uyibuyisela emaphethweni. Bheka Arrange the panels. Amabhokisi ayahamba. Donsa ibhokisi ngebha yalo yesihloko ukuze ulisuse endleleni yomdwebo; liyabuya lapho wawuliyeka khona. Chofoza kabili ibha yesihloko ukuze ulibeke phakathi futhi. Bheka Move a dialog. Izindlela zabasizi be-AI. Izicelo eziyishumi ezisebenzayo zomsizi wakho (hlela umdwebo, hlela isethi, hlola imidwebo, buza imodeli imibuzo, bala izinto ngokuphelele, zama inguqulo yengxenye…), ngayinye nezithuluzi ezibiza nemvume edingayo, futhi ngayinye iphindwa yizivivinyo zethu. Izinhlelo azinayo i-AI. Bheka Recipes for AI assistants. Izilimi. Português (Portugal) kusha ku-Settings › General › Language. Yona, Português (Brasil), Español (México) kanye Bahasa Indonesia manje zinawo wonke amagama ezinhlelo, njengemisebenzi engakabhekwa umuntu wendabuko. Izihloko zosizo zisesiNgisi, kanye nezinye ezisesiSpanish. CadCraft Studio isho ukuthi kungani ukuhlolwa kwesibuyekezo kwehlulekile (akukho fayela lesistimu yakho okwamanje, akukho inethiwekhi, isiginesha embi) esikhundleni se-\"Done\" nje, futhi iyeka ukubuyisa ikhadi le-What's new oliliwe uze kube khona inguqulo entsha. Akusakho kule nguqulo okwamanje 0.7 ayisayinwanga ngekhodi. Ukusayina, kanye nephakheji le-Microsoft Store, kwadlulela ku-0.8 ngoba ukugunyazwa kwesitifiketi akukafiki. Hlola i-SHA-256 eseceleni kwefayela ngalinye ku-getcadcraft.com/download. Ku-Windows, uma i-SmartScreen imisa isifakeli, khetha More info, bese Run anyway. Ku-Mac, okokuqala, chofoza ngokudla i-CadCraft Studio bese ukhetha Open. I-CadCraft Studio ayikakabi esitolo sezinhlelo, futhi akukakhiwa ukuthi ngokwakhiwa kwe-iPad noma i-iPhone. Amalisti wama-engeli nokuthambeka ku-Units ayagcinwa, kodwa akukho bhokisi elilifundayo okwamanje. Ukulandelela indlela ekhadini lezithombe, izengezo ze-Render dialog kanye nohlu lokurenda kudinga i-WebGPU (ngaphandle kwayo, ikhwalithi ephezulu isebenzisa umlandelelo we-WebGL); umbono ophilayo usebenzisa i-WebGPU lapho isiphequluli sayo, kwesingenayo i-WebGL 2. Ziye zahlolwa lapha kuphela kumsizi wegrafikhi wesofthiwe, hhayi okwamanje kumakhadi egrafikhi angempela. Umbono ophilayo awunayo ukusakaza noma ukwabelana ku-BimCraft (ye-ModelCraft inakho). Ukurenda uhambo olurekhodiwe njengevidiyo akwakhiwe ku-BimCraft. Izinhlolo zoyilo: i-I-shape ngegama layo le-IFC lephrofayili elingeyona usayizi we-W, S, IPE, HEA noma HEB (noma usayizi wayo uhluke kuwo) ithathwa njengewelded futhi ibuyela \"not checked\", njengamathubhu, ama-angles, amachanneli, izingxenye ezincane kakhulu nokujikeka. Akukho unjiniyela owazihlolisisa okwamanje. Izinto ezidwetshiwe azikwazi ukukopishwa zodwa, zijikelezwe, zibhalwe ngasese noma zihlelwe ngamakhophi, futhi akukho udonga oluhlukanisiwe, ithuluzi lombhalo noma udonga lwekhethini. (Isitezi sonke singakopishwa.) Udonga oludlula udonga oluvela kwesitezi esiphansi esitezini esiphezulu alufakwa emzimbeni we-3D walowo wudonga, futhi izinkundla zikhombisa izimbobo zesitezi esiphezulu ngaphansi kwesitezi sodonga lwazo. Imindeni: umtapo wemindeni ohlelwe phakathi kwamaprojekthi awukakwakhiwa. Imindeni nezitezi ezikopishiwe azikaze zivulwe ezinhlelweni zeBIM ezinye. MEP: izinsiza zijwayelekile (azikho idatha yabakhiqizi); amatee nezinciphisi ezinkanyezini zensimbi zijwayelekile, azivela etafuleni le-ASME B16.9; izixhumi zempahla yomtapo ezibekwe ngethebhu ye-Library azibhalwa ku-IFC; akukho okuhlolwe unjiniyela. Isengezo se-Plant asikwazi okwamanje ukudweba umugqa oqondisiwe emodelini, ukubalela izinkanyezi kumidwebo yazo ye-isometric, noma ukuhlola ukuhlelwa kwezinsiza ezibekwe kumtapo. Izitshalo zomtapo wezitshalo we-CivilCraft azikwazi ukubekwa ethebhini le-Library le-BimCraft okwamanje. Amandla: akukho ukulinganisa ngamahora, akukho indlela ye-ISO 52016-1 neyamafayela ezulu. Amasethi: akukho ukuphila kwedijithali okugcina izifundo noma okuthumela izexwayiso lapho i-BimCraft ivaliwe. Ukuhlanganiswa kweskena kuhlolwe kumaskena okuhlola, akuhlolwanga kusethi yangempela yeskena lenhlangano; amafayela e-E57 avula kuze kube ngamapointi ayizigidi eziyisi-6 kanye no-512 MB. Amaphakheji wephrojekthi avulwa ku-BimCraft kuphela (ezinye izinhlelo zithatha isakhiwo nge-Open in …), futhi amaphakheji nekhithi yezinhlelo ezimbili ziye zahlolwa ngezinhlelo ezilingisa, hhayi okwamanje ne-Archicad noma i-Revit ngokwazo. Konke okunye kukuthi Okungakakhiwa.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"getting-started","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Ukuqala ne-BimCraft","summary":"Okwenziwa yi-BimCraft njengamanje, ukuvula imodeli yakho yokuqala, ukuyibuka nge-3D, ukushintsha inani elilodwa nokugcina ikhophi.","section":"start","order":10,"keywords":["qala","ukuqala","vula","ifc","rvt","dwg","ukuqala okusheshayo","isingeniso","umbukeli","bim"],"headings":[{"id":"vula-i-bimcraft","text":"Vula i-BimCraft","level":2},{"id":"vula-imodeli-yakho-yokuqala","text":"Vula imodeli yakho yokuqala","level":2},{"id":"buka-ozungezile","text":"Buka ozungezile","level":2},{"id":"yenza-into-eyodwa-eyisisekelo-lungisa-ithegi","text":"Yenza into eyodwa eyisisekelo: lungisa ithegi","level":2},{"id":"londoloza-ikhophi","text":"Londoloza ikhophi","level":2},{"id":"lapho-ongaya-khona-okulandelayo","text":"Lapho ongaya khona okulandelayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EI-BimCraft iyisicelo semodeli yesakhiwo somndeni we-CadCraft. Kulokhu kwakhiwo \u003Cstrong\u003Eiyavula, ifunde futhi ihlole\u003C/strong\u003E amafayela wesakhiwo, futhi \u003Cstrong\u003Eihlele idatha kumamodeli e-IFC\u003C/strong\u003E. Ayidwebi noma imodelise izinto ezintsha okwamanje. Cabanga ngayo njengombukisi nomhloli wemodeli, osebenza nokulungisa amagama, amathegi nezinani zezici kufayela le-IFC.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkuvulayo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIfayela\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkuthola\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIFC (\u003Ccode\u003E.ifc\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImodeli ephelele ku-3D: ukuzungeza, izitezi, izici zezinto, nokuhlelwa kwamagama nezinani zezici\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmafayela ephrojekthi nomndeni (\u003Ccode\u003E.rvt\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.rfa\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.rte\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.rft\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkhadi lefayela: ukukhishwa okwalondolozwa kuso, ulwazi lwephrojekthi, isithombe sokubuka namafayela axhunyiwe. Akukho 3D.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDWG ne-DXF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmdwebo ku-2D: indawo yemodeli nalo lonke ishidi, izingqimba, imidwebo exhunyiwe,ombono wokuphrinta, nohlu lwezinsiza lwemidwebo yokudla egcwele amathegi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfolda yephrojekthi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmbiko wawo wonke amamodeli efolda: okusekelwe, izixhumanisi, amakhophi alimele, nesiphakamiso sefayela okufanele uqale ngalo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKonke kwenzeka kwisiphequluli sakho, ekhompyutheni yakho. \u003Cstrong\u003EAkukho okulayishwa.\u003C/strong\u003E Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/files\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/files\"\u003EAmafayela avulwa futhi agcinwa yi-BimCraft\u003C/a\u003E ukuze uthole imininingwane.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vula-i-bimcraft\"\u003EVula i-BimCraft\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula i-BimCraft kusiphequluli samanje. I-Chrome, i-Edge, i-Firefox ne-Safari zonke ziyasebenza; \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/platforms\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/platforms\"\u003EIzisekeli, amadivayisi nenkumbulo\u003C/a\u003E ibala umehluko.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELinda isikrini esingenalutho esithi &quot;Vula imodeli yesakhiwo.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-BimCraft isebenza kusiphequluli, nasedeskithophu ngaphakathi kwe-CadCraft Studio, kanye nezinye izinhlelo. Ukulondoloza ku-cloud akukatholakali okwamanje: uvula amafayela ekhompyutheni yakho bese ubuyisela amakhophi kuyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vula-imodeli-yakho-yokuqala\"\u003EVula imodeli yakho yokuqala\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIndlela esheshayo yokubona ukuthi i-BimCraft yenzani ifayela le-IFC.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha ifayela\u003C/span\u003E maphakathi nesikrini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha ifayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.ifc\u003C/code\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hp\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:mac\" title=\"Mac\"\u003EFinder\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:windows\" title=\"Windows\"\u003EFile Explorer\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:linux\" title=\"Linux\"\u003Eisiphathi sefayela sakho\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E bese uqinisekisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELinda umugqa wesimo ongaphansi kwesikrini uthi &quot;Iqalisa injini ye-IFC…&quot;, bese &quot;Yakha ijiyomethri&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUzobona imodeli ku-3D maphakathi, ipaneli ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfayela\u003C/span\u003E nohlu lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzitezi\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesokunxele, kanye nepaneli ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzici\u003C/span\u003E engenalutho ngakwesokudla. Umugqa wesimo uphela ngo-&quot;Vuliwe&quot; nenani lezinto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUngaphinda uhudulele ifayela usuka ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hp\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:mac\" title=\"Mac\"\u003EFinder\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:windows\" title=\"Windows\"\u003EFile Explorer\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:linux\" title=\"Linux\"\u003Eisiphathi sefayela sakho\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E uliyise ngqo ekhasini. Isikrini sithi &quot;Lahla ukuze uvule&quot; ngenkathi uhudula.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"net:offline\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EOffline\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInjini ye-IFC ilayisha kusuka esayithini ngokuqala lapho uvula imodeli ye-IFC koqala, ngaphandle uma i-BimCraft yalondolozwa ukuze isetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi. Imidwebo ye-DWG ne-DXF, amafayela ephrojekthi namafolda akudingi okwengeziwe: abafundi bawo bayingxenye yohlelo. Uma inkinobho yebha yohlelo ithi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIlungele ukusetshenziswa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E, konke kuvuleka ngaphandle. Uma kungenjalo, amamodeli e-IFC ngeke avuleke uze uxhume kabusha, ngaphandle uma kade ekhishwe kuleyo thebhu. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/online-offline\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/online-offline\"\u003EKu-inthanethi nangaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"net:online\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EOnline\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUyaya endaweni engenaxhumano? Chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E ebhareni lohlelo bese ulinda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIlungele ukusetshenziswa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E. Ikhophi elilondoloziwe (cishe 11 MB) lifaka injini ye-IFC. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EUkusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"buka-ozungezile\"\u003EBuka ozungezile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:mouse\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMouse\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHudula ngenkinobho yesokunxele yemouse ukuze uzungeze imodeli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESkrola ivili ukuze usondeze.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHudula ngenkinobho yesokudla yemouse ukuze ushelelise. Ku-trackpad ye-Mac, bamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uhudule kunalokho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELwanele\u003C/span\u003E ukuze ubuyele ekubukeni imodeli yonke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHudula ngomunwe owodwa ukuze uzungeze.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHlanganisa iminwe emibili ukuze usondeze, bese uhambisa iminwe emibili ndawonye ukuze ushelelise.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThepha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELwanele\u003C/span\u003E ukuze ubuyele ekubukeni imodeli yonke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yenza-into-eyodwa-eyisisekelo-lungisa-ithegi\"\u003EYenza into eyodwa eyisisekelo: lungisa ithegi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza udonga, umnyango noma noma yiyiphi into emodelini. Iba luhlaza okwesibhakabhaka, nezici zayo zivela ngakwesokudla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKupaneli ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzici\u003C/span\u003E, chofoza inani eliseduze kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EIthegi\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBhala ithegi elisha bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBheka isigaba se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinguquko\u003C/span\u003E esivulekile ngakwesokunxele: inguquko yakho ibhalwe nenani elidala nelisha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"londoloza-ikhophi\"\u003ELondoloza ikhophi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGcina njenge-IFC\u003C/span\u003E esigabeni se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinguquko\u003C/span\u003E, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThola ifayela elisha kufolda yakho yokulanda. Libizwa ngegama lokuqala kwengezwe &quot; (edited)&quot;, isibonelo \u003Ccode\u003EClinic (edited).ifc\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIfayela lakho lokuqala alisoze lishintshwe. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/edit-ifc-properties\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/edit-ifc-properties\"\u003EShintsha izici ze-IFC ulondoloze ikhophi eshintshiwe\u003C/a\u003E ichaza ukuhlela ngokugcwele.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lapho-ongaya-khona-okulandelayo\"\u003ELapho ongaya khona okulandelayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/workspace\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/workspace\"\u003EIsikrini se-BimCraft\u003C/a\u003E: zonke izipaneli ngamagama azo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/coming-from\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/coming-from\"\u003EUkuza kusuka kwezinye izinhlelo ze-BIM nezokudweba\u003C/a\u003E: okuzwakala kwehluke uma ujwayele i-Revit.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/open-project-folder\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/open-project-folder\"\u003EVula ifolda yephrojekthi yonke\u003C/a\u003E: nikeza i-BimCraft ifolda yephrojekthi bese uyivumela ihlele amafayela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/view-dwg\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/view-dwg\"\u003EBuka umdwebo we-DWG noma DXF\u003C/a\u003E: amashidi, izingqimba nombono wokuphrinta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"I-BimCraft iyisicelo semodeli yesakhiwo somndeni we-CadCraft. Kulokhu kwakhiwo iyavula, ifunde futhi ihlole amafayela wesakhiwo, futhi ihlele idatha kumamodeli e-IFC. Ayidwebi noma imodelise izinto ezintsha okwamanje. Cabanga ngayo njengombukisi nomhloli wemodeli, osebenza nokulungisa amagama, amathegi nezinani zezici kufayela le-IFC. Okuvulayo: Ifayela Okuthola IFC (.ifc) Imodeli ephelele ku-3D: ukuzungeza, izitezi, izici zezinto, nokuhlelwa kwamagama nezinani zezici Amafayela ephrojekthi nomndeni (.rvt, .rfa, .rte, .rft) Ikhadi lefayela: ukukhishwa okwalondolozwa kuso, ulwazi lwephrojekthi, isithombe sokubuka namafayela axhunyiwe. Akukho 3D. DWG ne-DXF Umdwebo ku-2D: indawo yemodeli nalo lonke ishidi, izingqimba, imidwebo exhunyiwe,ombono wokuphrinta, nohlu lwezinsiza lwemidwebo yokudla egcwele amathegi Ifolda yephrojekthi Umbiko wawo wonke amamodeli efolda: okusekelwe, izixhumanisi, amakhophi alimele, nesiphakamiso sefayela okufanele uqale ngalo Konke kwenzeka kwisiphequluli sakho, ekhompyutheni yakho. Akukho okulayishwa. Bona Amafayela avulwa futhi agcinwa yi-BimCraft ukuze uthole imininingwane. Vula i-BimCraft Vula i-BimCraft kusiphequluli samanje. I-Chrome, i-Edge, i-Firefox ne-Safari zonke ziyasebenza; Izisekeli, amadivayisi nenkumbulo ibala umehluko. Linda isikrini esingenalutho esithi \"Vula imodeli yesakhiwo.\" I-BimCraft isebenza kusiphequluli, nasedeskithophu ngaphakathi kwe-CadCraft Studio, kanye nezinye izinhlelo. Ukulondoloza ku-cloud akukatholakali okwamanje: uvula amafayela ekhompyutheni yakho bese ubuyisela amakhophi kuyo. Vula imodeli yakho yokuqala Indlela esheshayo yokubona ukuthi i-BimCraft yenzani ifayela le-IFC. Chofoza Khetha ifayela maphakathi nesikrini. Khetha ifayela le-.ifc ku-Finder / File Explorer / isiphathi sefayela sakho bese uqinisekisa. Linda umugqa wesimo ongaphansi kwesikrini uthi \"Iqalisa injini ye-IFC…\", bese \"Yakha ijiyomethri\". Uzobona imodeli ku-3D maphakathi, ipaneli ethi Ifayela nohlu lwe-Izitezi ngakwesokunxele, kanye nepaneli ethi Izici engenalutho ngakwesokudla. Umugqa wesimo uphela ngo-\"Vuliwe\" nenani lezinto. Ungaphinda uhudulele ifayela usuka ku-Finder / File Explorer / isiphathi sefayela sakho uliyise ngqo ekhasini. Isikrini sithi \"Lahla ukuze uvule\" ngenkathi uhudula. Injini ye-IFC ilayisha kusuka esayithini ngokuqala lapho uvula imodeli ye-IFC koqala, ngaphandle uma i-BimCraft yalondolozwa ukuze isetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi. Imidwebo ye-DWG ne-DXF, amafayela ephrojekthi namafolda akudingi okwengeziwe: abafundi bawo bayingxenye yohlelo. Uma inkinobho yebha yohlelo ithi Ilungele ukusetshenziswa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi, konke kuvuleka ngaphandle. Uma kungenjalo, amamodeli e-IFC ngeke avuleke uze uxhume kabusha, ngaphandle uma kade ekhishwe kuleyo thebhu. Bona Ku-inthanethi nangaphandle kwe-inthanethi. Uyaya endaweni engenaxhumano? Chofoza Londoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi ebhareni lohlelo bese ulinda Ilungele ukusetshenziswa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi. Ikhophi elilondoloziwe (cishe 11 MB) lifaka injini ye-IFC. Bona Ukusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi. Buka ozungezile Hudula ngenkinobho yesokunxele yemouse ukuze uzungeze imodeli. Skrola ivili ukuze usondeze. Hudula ngenkinobho yesokudla yemouse ukuze ushelelise. Ku-trackpad ye-Mac, bamba Shift uhudule kunalokho. Cindezela F noma chofoza Lwanele ukuze ubuyele ekubukeni imodeli yonke. Hudula ngomunwe owodwa ukuze uzungeze. Hlanganisa iminwe emibili ukuze usondeze, bese uhambisa iminwe emibili ndawonye ukuze ushelelise. Thepha Lwanele ukuze ubuyele ekubukeni imodeli yonke. Yenza into eyodwa eyisisekelo: lungisa ithegi Chofoza udonga, umnyango noma noma yiyiphi into emodelini. Iba luhlaza okwesibhakabhaka, nezici zayo zivela ngakwesokudla. Kupaneli ethi Izici, chofoza inani eliseduze kwe-Ithegi. Bhala ithegi elisha bese ucindezela Enter. Bheka isigaba se-Izinguquko esivulekile ngakwesokunxele: inguquko yakho ibhalwe nenani elidala nelisha. Londoloza ikhophi Chofoza Gcina njenge-IFC esigabeni se-Izinguquko, noma cindezela Ctrl+S. Thola ifayela elisha kufolda yakho yokulanda. Libizwa ngegama lokuqala kwengezwe \" (edited)\", isibonelo Clinic (edited).ifc. Ifayela lakho lokuqala alisoze lishintshwe. Shintsha izici ze-IFC ulondoloze ikhophi eshintshiwe ichaza ukuhlela ngokugcwele. Lapho ongaya khona okulandelayo Isikrini se-BimCraft: zonke izipaneli ngamagama azo. Ukuza kusuka kwezinye izinhlelo ze-BIM nezokudweba: okuzwakala kwehluke uma ujwayele i-Revit. Vula ifolda yephrojekthi yonke: nikeza i-BimCraft ifolda yephrojekthi bese uyivumela ihlele amafayela. Buka umdwebo we-DWG noma DXF: amashidi, izingqimba nombono wokuphrinta.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"start-a-new-building","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Qala isakhiwo esisha","summary":"Yenza imodeli yesakhiwo esingenalutho ngamazinga awo, dweba izindonga zayo, faka izinto ezivela emtapweni, bese uyigcina njenge-IFC.","section":"start","order":15,"keywords":["entsha","isakhiwo esisha","esingenalutho","qala kusukela ekuqaleni","isifanekiso","amazinga","izitezi","amaphansi","dala","imodeli"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukwazi","text":"Okufanele ukwazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQala imodeli yesakhiwo kusukela ekuqaleni esikhundleni sokuvula enye. I-BimCraft yenza imodeli ye-IFC engenalutho enephrojekthi, isayithi, isakhiwo namazinga walo. Ungabeka izinsiza nezinto zasendlini kumazinga usuka emtapweni bese uyigcina njengefayela le-IFC.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzindonga zingadwetshwa manje: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/draw-walls\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/draw-walls\"\u003EDweba izindonga\u003C/a\u003E. Izimnyango, amawindi, amaphansi nophahla kusakhiwa ngokulandelayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsakhiwo esisha\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EVula ifayela noma ifolda\u003C/strong\u003E, noma ekhasini lokuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBhala \u003Cstrong\u003EIgama lesakhiwo\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha ukuthi sinamazinga angaki nge-\u003Cstrong\u003EAmazinga\u003C/strong\u003E (1 kuya ku-200).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBhala \u003Cstrong\u003EUkuphakama kwezinga\u003C/strong\u003E, kusukela phansi kuya phansi: isibonelo \u003Ccode\u003E10&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E10&#039;6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E3000 mm\u003C/code\u003E. Inani elingenayo iyunithi libe yizinyawo e-US, kwezinye izindawo libe ngamamilimitha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDala\u003C/span\u003E. Amazinga ayakhiwa ngokulandelana kusukela ku-0, ngalinye liphakeme ngokuphakama kwezinga kulelo elingaphambilini, futhi abizwa ngokuthi Izinga 1, Izinga 2 njalo njalo. Abonakala emthini wemodeli, nomdwebo wezinga 1 uvula ngasembonweni we-3D nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDweba\u003C/span\u003E ivuliwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDweba izindonga: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/draw-walls\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/draw-walls\"\u003EDweba izindonga\u003C/a\u003E. Qamba kabusha amazinga noma shintsha ukuphakama kwawo kupaneli ethi \u003Cstrong\u003EAmazinga\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaka izinto: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/place-from-library\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/place-from-library\"\u003EBeka izinsiza nezinto zasendlini emtapweni\u003C/a\u003E. Ibha yokubeka ihlu lonke amazinga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGcina njenge-IFC\u003C/span\u003E. Ifayela libizwa ngegama lesakhiwo, isibonelo \u003Ccode\u003ESmith&#039;s house.ifc\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukwazi\"\u003EOkufanele ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImodeli igcinwa ngamamilimitha, njenge-IFC4. Ezinye izinhlelo ze-BIM ziyayivula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzitezi\u003C/strong\u003E ngakwesokunxele zidwala kuphela amazinga anokuthile kuwo; umthi wemodeli uwadwala wonke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKuze kube yilapho ulondoloza, isakhiwo esisha sibalwa njengomsebenzi ongakalondolozwa. I-BimCraft iyabuza ngaphambi kokuvula enye ifayela noma ukuphuma, futhi igcina ikhophi kulesi siphequluli uma ithebhu ivalwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Qala imodeli yesakhiwo kusukela ekuqaleni esikhundleni sokuvula enye. I-BimCraft yenza imodeli ye-IFC engenalutho enephrojekthi, isayithi, isakhiwo namazinga walo. Ungabeka izinsiza nezinto zasendlini kumazinga usuka emtapweni bese uyigcina njengefayela le-IFC. Izindonga zingadwetshwa manje: bona Dweba izindonga. Izimnyango, amawindi, amaphansi nophahla kusakhiwa ngokulandelayo. Izinyathelo Chofoza Isakhiwo esisha ngaphansi kwe-Vula ifayela noma ifolda, noma ekhasini lokuqala. Bhala Igama lesakhiwo. Khetha ukuthi sinamazinga angaki nge-Amazinga (1 kuya ku-200). Bhala Ukuphakama kwezinga, kusukela phansi kuya phansi: isibonelo 10'-0\", 10'6\" noma 3000 mm. Inani elingenayo iyunithi libe yizinyawo e-US, kwezinye izindawo libe ngamamilimitha. Chofoza Dala. Amazinga ayakhiwa ngokulandelana kusukela ku-0, ngalinye liphakeme ngokuphakama kwezinga kulelo elingaphambilini, futhi abizwa ngokuthi Izinga 1, Izinga 2 njalo njalo. Abonakala emthini wemodeli, nomdwebo wezinga 1 uvula ngasembonweni we-3D nge-Dweba ivuliwe. Dweba izindonga: bona Dweba izindonga. Qamba kabusha amazinga noma shintsha ukuphakama kwawo kupaneli ethi Amazinga. Faka izinto: bona Beka izinsiza nezinto zasendlini emtapweni. Ibha yokubeka ihlu lonke amazinga. Chofoza Gcina njenge-IFC. Ifayela libizwa ngegama lesakhiwo, isibonelo Smith's house.ifc. Okufanele ukwazi Imodeli igcinwa ngamamilimitha, njenge-IFC4. Ezinye izinhlelo ze-BIM ziyayivula. Izitezi ngakwesokunxele zidwala kuphela amazinga anokuthile kuwo; umthi wemodeli uwadwala wonke. Kuze kube yilapho ulondoloza, isakhiwo esisha sibalwa njengomsebenzi ongakalondolozwa. I-BimCraft iyabuza ngaphambi kokuvula enye ifayela noma ukuphuma, futhi igcina ikhophi kulesi siphequluli uma ithebhu ivalwa.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"workspace","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Isikrini se-BimCraft","summary":"Ukuhamba kuyo yonke ibha, ipaneli nenkinobho, ngamagama azo ekuskrini, nokuthi isikrini sishintsha kanjani ngohlobo ngalunye lwefayela.","section":"start","order":20,"keywords":["isikrini","ukuma","izipaneli","ithuluzi","ukusebenzisana","ui","uhambo","ipaneli yezici","isiphequluli","ibha yohlelo"],"headings":[{"id":"ibha-yohlelo","text":"Ibha yohlelo","level":2},{"id":"ipaneli-yangakwesokunxele","text":"Ipaneli yangakwesokunxele","level":2},{"id":"isiteji","text":"Isiteji","level":2},{"id":"ipaneli-yezici","text":"Ipaneli yezici","level":2},{"id":"esikrinini-esincane","text":"Esikrinini esincane","level":2},{"id":"izimo-zesikrini","text":"Izimo zesikrini","level":2},{"id":"okuhlobene","text":"Okuhlobene","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIsikrini se-BimCraft sinebha phezulu nezindawo ezintathu ngaphansi kwayo: ipaneli ngakwesokunxele, isiteji maphakathi nepaneli ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzici\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesokudla. Okubonakala kuyo ngayinye kuncike kulokho ovule: imodeli ye-IFC, ifayela lephrojekthi noma lomndeni, umdwebo noma ifolda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ibha-yohlelo\"\u003EIbha yohlelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIbha encane phezulu iyeyesayithi ye-CadCraft, hhayi ye-BimCraft ngokwayo. Kusukela kwesokunxele kuya kwesokudla:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUphawu lwe-CadCraft: iya ekhasini lokuqala le-CadCraft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIgama lohlelo nemenyu yenguqulo. Ku-build yasesikhungweni ikhombisa ukuthi yi-build yini oyisebenzisayo futhi ikuvumela ukushintsha ibe inguqulo ekhishiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMayelana ne-BimCraft\u003C/span\u003E: ikhasi lohlelo kusayithi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E: izilungiselelo ze-BimCraft nezabelwa zonke izinhlelo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/settings\"\u003EIzilungiselelo ze-BimCraft\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsikrini esigcwele\u003C/span\u003E: ishintsha izimo zesikrini. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/workspace#screen-modes\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/workspace\" data-hash=\"screen-modes\"\u003EIzimo zesikrini\u003C/a\u003E ngezansi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIphepha\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImodeli\u003C/span\u003E: izindikimba ezikhanyayo nezimnyama. Umbono we-3D namadwebo we-2D alandela indikimba oyikhethile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ipaneli-yangakwesokunxele\"\u003EIpaneli yangakwesokunxele\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIpaneli yangakwesokunxele ihlala iqala nge-\u003Cstrong\u003EVula ifayela noma ifolda\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIndawo yokuwisa, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha ifayela, noma lahla ifayela noma ifolda lapha\u003C/span\u003E. Chofoza ukuze ukhethe ifayela elilodwa, noma lahla ifolda noma ifayela phezu kwayo (noma kunoma yiluphi uhlangothi lwekhasi).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula ifolda\u003C/span\u003E: khetha ifolda yephrojekthi yonke. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/open-project-folder\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/open-project-folder\"\u003EVula ifolda yephrojekthi yonke\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmafolda akamuva\u003C/span\u003E: ivela ku-Chrome ne-Edge ngemuva kokuvula ifolda ngesikhethi sefolda noma ngokulahla. Chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula futhi\u003C/span\u003E negama lefolda ukuze uyivule futhi, noma × encane ukuze uyikhohlwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgaphansi kwayo, izigaba zivela njengoba zisebenza:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsigaba\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ELapho sibonakala\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkukuso\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinguquko\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImodeli ye-IFC ivuliwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinguquko zakho ezingakalondolozwa, eziqala ezintsha, nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlehlisa\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGcina njenge-IFC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfayela\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImodeli noma ikhadi lefayela livuliwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzici zefayela: usayizi, ischema noma ukukhishwa, iphrojekthi, umlobi, inani lezinto\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmdwebo\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-DWG noma i-DXF ivuliwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfomethi, amayunithi, inani lezinto nezingqimba, amashidi, amadwebo axhunyiwe, izinsiza\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfolda\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfolda ivuliwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInani lamafayela namamodeli, usayizi, izinkinga ezitholakele\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuyela kwifolda\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUvule ifayela kusuka efolda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbuyela embikweni wefolda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzingqimba\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmdwebo uvuliwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbhokisi lokukhetha ngalinye lengqimba, nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKonke kuvuliwe\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKonke kuvaliwe\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzitezi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImodeli ye-IFC ivuliwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbhokisi lokukhetha ngalinye lesitezi, eliphezulu kuqala\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinto\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImodeli ye-IFC ivuliwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInani lezinto zohlobo ngalunye emodelini (ezingu-30 ezivame kakhulu)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isiteji\"\u003EIsiteji\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMaphakathi nesikrini kubonisa ifayela ovulile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOkungenalutho\u003C/strong\u003E: &quot;Vula imodeli yesakhiwo.&quot; nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha ifayela\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula ifolda\u003C/span\u003E, nencazelo emfushane yefomethi ngayinye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImodeli ye-IFC\u003C/strong\u003E: umbono we-3D nebha yamathuluzi phezulu kwawo, ngamaqembu aqanjiwe, afana nawesicelo sokudweba se-CadCraft, isithonjana sethuluzi ngasinye phezulu kwegama lalo: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubuka\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELwanele\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhezulu\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhambili\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlangothi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImiphetho\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzindawo\u003C/span\u003E); \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlela\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlehlisa\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhinda wenze\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKopisha\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENamathisela\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkuningi\u003C/span\u003E, bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/copy-paste\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/copy-paste\"\u003EKopisha, namathisela nephinda izinto zomtapo\u003C/a\u003E); \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImodeli\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmayunithi\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDweba\u003C/span\u003E); \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmtapo\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmtapo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinsiza\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzibuyekezo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzikweletu\u003C/span\u003E); \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuyekeza\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsigaba\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHamba\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinganisa\u003C/span\u003E; bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/section-plane\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/section-plane\"\u003ESika imodeli ye-IFC ngendiza yesigaba\u003C/a\u003E); kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkukhiphayo\u003C/span\u003E (ukurenda, umbono ophilayo, i-VR, ukuthumela, ukupenda nemibono elondoloziwe). Uma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDweba\u003C/span\u003E ivuliwe, ibha yokudweba ngaphansi kwayo inombala ofanayo: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubuka\u003C/span\u003E (izinga kanye nohlobo lweplani), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDweba\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlela\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmtapo\u003C/span\u003E. Ikhyubhu lokubuka lihlala ekhoneni elingakwesokudla ngezansi. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/open-ifc-model\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/open-ifc-model\"\u003EVula imodeli ye-IFC ubuke ngo-3D\u003C/a\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkujwayelekile\u003C/span\u003E ikhetha ukuthi izithonjana, amalebula noma kokubili kulezi zinkinobho, ibonise noma ifihle amagama amaqembu, futhi chofoza ngesokudla ebhareni lamathuluzi ukuhlela amathuluzi namaqembu alo. Esikrinini esincane ibha yamathuluzi ilahla amagama angaphansi kwezithonjana zayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIfayela lephrojekthi noma lomndeni\u003C/strong\u003E: ikhadi lefayela, nesithombe sokubuka, ulwazi lwephrojekthi namafayela axhunyiwe. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/read-rvt-file\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/read-rvt-file\"\u003EFunda ifayela lephrojekthi noma lomndeni\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDWG noma DXF\u003C/strong\u003E: umugqa wamathebhu (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImodeli\u003C/span\u003E, bese kunye ngeshidi ngalinye, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinsiza\u003C/span\u003E uma umdwebo unezinsiza ezinamathegi, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELwanele\u003C/span\u003E kanye ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubuka kokuphrinta\u003C/span\u003E), umdwebo, nezixhumanisi ze-X ne-Y ezibonakalayo ekhoneni. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/view-dwg\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/view-dwg\"\u003EBuka umdwebo we-DWG noma DXF\u003C/a\u003E ne-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/dwg-in-3d\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/dwg-in-3d\"\u003EBona umdwebo we-DWG noma DXF ku-3D\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIfolda\u003C/strong\u003E: umbiko wefolda, nebhokisi ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQala lapha\u003C/span\u003E namathebhu wamamodeli, izixhumanisi, amamodeli e-IFC nemidwebo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/open-project-folder\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/open-project-folder\"\u003EVula ifolda yephrojekthi yonke\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmugqa wesimo ongaphansi kwesiteji ukutshela ukuthi i-BimCraft yenzani (&quot;Ifunda imodeli…&quot;, &quot;Yakha ijiyomethri: izinto ezingu-1200 kwezingu-5400&quot;) nokuthi yini eyahluleka, ebomvu, uma kukhona okuhlulekile. Imiyalezo yempumelelo inyamalala ngemva kwemizuzwana embalwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ipaneli-yezici\"\u003EIpaneli yezici\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIpaneli yangakwesokudla ibonisa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgemodeli ye-IFC: into owe-chofoze, negama, uhlobo, ithegi, i-GlobalId kanye nalo lonke isethi yezici. Izinani ongazishintsha zibonakala njengezinkinobho. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/properties-panel\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/properties-panel\"\u003EIzinkundla zepaneli yezici\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgomdwebo: ukuthi ungahamba kanjani, imidwebo nezithombe ezixhunyiwe nokuthi zatholakala yini ngayinye, nohlu lwalokho okuthi \u003Cstrong\u003EAkukadwetshwa okwamanje\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgekhadi lefayela noma ifolda: inothi elifushane ngalokho okufanele ukuvule okulandelayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"esikrinini-esincane\"\u003EEsikrinini esincane\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma iwindi lincane kunesikrini selaptop, i-BimCraft ihlela izindawo zayo phezu kwazo: isiteji phezulu, bese izipaneli ngaphansi. Skrola ikhasi ukuze ufinyelele izipaneli. Kufoni zakha ikholomu eyodwa; kuthebulethi, ezimbili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izimo-zesikrini\"\u003EIzimo zesikrini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInkinobho ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsikrini esigcwele\u003C/span\u003E ebhareni lohlelo, noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kuzo zonke izinhlelo, ishintsha phakathi kwezimo ezintathu:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEjwayelekile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsikrini esigcwele, namabha asabonakala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsikrini esigcwele nebha yohlelo ifihliwe. Hambisa isikhombi uye emaphethelweni aphezulu, noma thepha lapho, ukuze uyibuyisele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukubuyela kwejwayelekile. Izisiphequluli ezingasekeli isikrini esigcwele (njengakwi-iPhone) zishintsha phakathi kwejwayelekile namabha afihliwe kuphela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuhlobene\"\u003EOkuhlobene\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/keyboard\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/keyboard\"\u003EOkhiye nemouse\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/files\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/files\"\u003EAmafayela avulwa futhi agcinwa yi-BimCraft\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Isikrini se-BimCraft sinebha phezulu nezindawo ezintathu ngaphansi kwayo: ipaneli ngakwesokunxele, isiteji maphakathi nepaneli ethi Izici ngakwesokudla. Okubonakala kuyo ngayinye kuncike kulokho ovule: imodeli ye-IFC, ifayela lephrojekthi noma lomndeni, umdwebo noma ifolda. Ibha yohlelo Ibha encane phezulu iyeyesayithi ye-CadCraft, hhayi ye-BimCraft ngokwayo. Kusukela kwesokunxele kuya kwesokudla: Uphawu lwe-CadCraft: iya ekhasini lokuqala le-CadCraft. Igama lohlelo nemenyu yenguqulo. Ku-build yasesikhungweni ikhombisa ukuthi yi-build yini oyisebenzisayo futhi ikuvumela ukushintsha ibe inguqulo ekhishiwe. Mayelana ne-BimCraft: ikhasi lohlelo kusayithi. Izilungiselelo: izilungiselelo ze-BimCraft nezabelwa zonke izinhlelo. Bona Izilungiselelo ze-BimCraft. Isikrini esigcwele: ishintsha izimo zesikrini. Bona Izimo zesikrini ngezansi. Iphepha ne-Imodeli: izindikimba ezikhanyayo nezimnyama. Umbono we-3D namadwebo we-2D alandela indikimba oyikhethile. Ipaneli yangakwesokunxele Ipaneli yangakwesokunxele ihlala iqala nge-Vula ifayela noma ifolda: Indawo yokuwisa, Khetha ifayela, noma lahla ifayela noma ifolda lapha. Chofoza ukuze ukhethe ifayela elilodwa, noma lahla ifolda noma ifayela phezu kwayo (noma kunoma yiluphi uhlangothi lwekhasi). Vula ifolda: khetha ifolda yephrojekthi yonke. Bona Vula ifolda yephrojekthi yonke. Amafolda akamuva: ivela ku-Chrome ne-Edge ngemuva kokuvula ifolda ngesikhethi sefolda noma ngokulahla. Chofoza Vula futhi negama lefolda ukuze uyivule futhi, noma × encane ukuze uyikhohlwe. Ngaphansi kwayo, izigaba zivela njengoba zisebenza: Isigaba Lapho sibonakala Okukuso Izinguquko Imodeli ye-IFC ivuliwe Izinguquko zakho ezingakalondolozwa, eziqala ezintsha, nge-Hlehlisa ne-Gcina njenge-IFC Ifayela Imodeli noma ikhadi lefayela livuliwe Izici zefayela: usayizi, ischema noma ukukhishwa, iphrojekthi, umlobi, inani lezinto Umdwebo I-DWG noma i-DXF ivuliwe Ifomethi, amayunithi, inani lezinto nezingqimba, amashidi, amadwebo axhunyiwe, izinsiza Ifolda Ifolda ivuliwe Inani lamafayela namamodeli, usayizi, izinkinga ezitholakele Buyela kwifolda Uvule ifayela kusuka efolda Ibuyela embikweni wefolda Izingqimba Umdwebo uvuliwe Ibhokisi lokukhetha ngalinye lengqimba, nge-Konke kuvuliwe ne-Konke kuvaliwe Izitezi Imodeli ye-IFC ivuliwe Ibhokisi lokukhetha ngalinye lesitezi, eliphezulu kuqala Izinto Imodeli ye-IFC ivuliwe Inani lezinto zohlobo ngalunye emodelini (ezingu-30 ezivame kakhulu) Isiteji Maphakathi nesikrini kubonisa ifayela ovulile. Okungenalutho: \"Vula imodeli yesakhiwo.\" nge-Khetha ifayela ne-Vula ifolda, nencazelo emfushane yefomethi ngayinye. Imodeli ye-IFC: umbono we-3D nebha yamathuluzi phezulu kwawo, ngamaqembu aqanjiwe, afana nawesicelo sokudweba se-CadCraft, isithonjana sethuluzi ngasinye phezulu kwegama lalo: Ukubuka (Lwanele, Phezulu, Phambili, Uhlangothi, Imiphetho, Izindawo); Hlela (Hlehlisa, Phinda wenze, Kopisha, Namathisela kanye Okuningi, bheka Kopisha, namathisela nephinda izinto zomtapo); Imodeli (Amayunithi ne-Dweba); Umtapo (Umtapo, Izinsiza, Izibuyekezo, Izikweletu); Buyekeza (Bonisa, Isigaba, Hamba, Linganisa; bona Sika imodeli ye-IFC ngendiza yesigaba); kanye Okukhiphayo (ukurenda, umbono ophilayo, i-VR, ukuthumela, ukupenda nemibono elondoloziwe). Uma Dweba ivuliwe, ibha yokudweba ngaphansi kwayo inombala ofanayo: Ukubuka (izinga kanye nohlobo lweplani), Dweba, Hlela kanye Umtapo. Ikhyubhu lokubuka lihlala ekhoneni elingakwesokudla ngezansi. Bona Vula imodeli ye-IFC ubuke ngo-3D. Izilungiselelo, Okujwayelekile ikhetha ukuthi izithonjana, amalebula noma kokubili kulezi zinkinobho, ibonise noma ifihle amagama amaqembu, futhi chofoza ngesokudla ebhareni lamathuluzi ukuhlela amathuluzi namaqembu alo. Esikrinini esincane ibha yamathuluzi ilahla amagama angaphansi kwezithonjana zayo. Ifayela lephrojekthi noma lomndeni: ikhadi lefayela, nesithombe sokubuka, ulwazi lwephrojekthi namafayela axhunyiwe. Bona Funda ifayela lephrojekthi noma lomndeni. DWG noma DXF: umugqa wamathebhu (Imodeli, bese kunye ngeshidi ngalinye, bese Izinsiza uma umdwebo unezinsiza ezinamathegi, 3D, Lwanele kanye ne-Ukubuka kokuphrinta), umdwebo, nezixhumanisi ze-X ne-Y ezibonakalayo ekhoneni. Bona Buka umdwebo we-DWG noma DXF ne-Bona umdwebo we-DWG noma DXF ku-3D. Ifolda: umbiko wefolda, nebhokisi ethi Qala lapha namathebhu wamamodeli, izixhumanisi, amamodeli e-IFC nemidwebo. Bona Vula ifolda yephrojekthi yonke. Umugqa wesimo ongaphansi kwesiteji ukutshela ukuthi i-BimCraft yenzani (\"Ifunda imodeli…\", \"Yakha ijiyomethri: izinto ezingu-1200 kwezingu-5400\") nokuthi yini eyahluleka, ebomvu, uma kukhona okuhlulekile. Imiyalezo yempumelelo inyamalala ngemva kwemizuzwana embalwa. Ipaneli yezici Ipaneli yangakwesokudla ibonisa: Ngemodeli ye-IFC: into owe-chofoze, negama, uhlobo, ithegi, i-GlobalId kanye nalo lonke isethi yezici. Izinani ongazishintsha zibonakala njengezinkinobho. Bona Izinkundla zepaneli yezici. Ngomdwebo: ukuthi ungahamba kanjani, imidwebo nezithombe ezixhunyiwe nokuthi zatholakala yini ngayinye, nohlu lwalokho okuthi Akukadwetshwa okwamanje. Ngekhadi lefayela noma ifolda: inothi elifushane ngalokho okufanele ukuvule okulandelayo. Esikrinini esincane Uma iwindi lincane kunesikrini selaptop, i-BimCraft ihlela izindawo zayo phezu kwazo: isiteji phezulu, bese izipaneli ngaphansi. Skrola ikhasi ukuze ufinyelele izipaneli. Kufoni zakha ikholomu eyodwa; kuthebulethi, ezimbili. Izimo zesikrini Inkinobho ethi Isikrini esigcwele ebhareni lohlelo, noma Ctrl+Shift+F kuzo zonke izinhlelo, ishintsha phakathi kwezimo ezintathu: Ejwayelekile. Isikrini esigcwele, namabha asabonakala. Isikrini esigcwele nebha yohlelo ifihliwe. Hambisa isikhombi uye emaphethelweni aphezulu, noma thepha lapho, ukuze uyibuyisele. Cindezela Esc ukubuyela kwejwayelekile. Izisiphequluli ezingasekeli isikrini esigcwele (njengakwi-iPhone) zishintsha phakathi kwejwayelekile namabha afihliwe kuphela. Okuhlobene Okhiye nemouse Amafayela avulwa futhi agcinwa yi-BimCraft","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"coordinates","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Amakhoordinethi ku-BimCraft","summary":"Lapho usebenza khona: indawo yesikhombi kuplani nakumbono we-3D, izinga ohlelweni lwalo, umsuka wephrojekthi kanye nephoyinti lokuhlola lesiza.","section":"start","order":22,"keywords":["amakhoordinethi","ngiphi","isikhundla","isikhombi","ukufunda","x y z","izinga","isitezi","umsuka wephrojekthi","umsuka","indawo yesisekelo","iphoyinti lokuhlola","isiza","amakhoordinethi emephu","empumalanga","enyakatho","ukubhalisa ngendawo","amayunithi","indawo"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"lapho-izinombolo-zibonakala","text":"Lapho izinombolo zibonakala","level":2},{"id":"amamakha-amabili","text":"Amamakha amabili","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukubone","text":"Okufanele ukubone","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkwazi ngokushesha lapho usemodelini: izinga olidweba kulo, ukuthi isikhombi sikude kangakanani emsukeni wephrojekthi, nokuthi iphoyinti lokuhlola lesiza lilaphi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lapho-izinombolo-zibonakala\"\u003ELapho izinombolo zibonakala\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPhezu kwombono we-3D\u003C/strong\u003E (ngaphansi kwesokudla, eduze kwekhyubhu lokubuka): hambisa isikhombi phezu kwemodeli. Ibhokisi likhombisa izinga iphoyinti elisulapha kulo nokuthi liphakeme kangakanani phezu kwe-floor yalelo zinga, bese kuba \u003Cstrong\u003EX, Y no-Z\u003C/strong\u003E. Phezu kwendawo engenalutho ifunda iphoyinti ku-floor yezinga eliphansi kakhulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKu-plani\u003C/strong\u003E (ngaphansi kwesokudla, uma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDweba\u003C/span\u003E ivuliwe): izinga eliboniswa yiplani nokuphakama kwe-floor yalo, nka \u003Cstrong\u003EX\u003C/strong\u003E no-\u003Cstrong\u003EY\u003C/strong\u003E wesikhombi uma sisePlani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma ifayela linokuguqulwa kwemephu (lalithunyelwe namakhoordinethi emephu), zombili amabhokisi engeza \u003Cstrong\u003Eempumalanga nasenyakatho\u003C/strong\u003E kugridi yemephu, ngakwi-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmayunithi\u003C/span\u003E oyikhethile (ngayo yonke imvamisa ibhalwe eduze kwawo; izinyawo nezintshi zibonakala njengezinyawo zedesimali). Umdwebo (DWG noma DXF) ugcina amayunithi wawo: ifunda ikhombisa amagama awo, futhi ayiguqulwa ngakunye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZonke ama-X, Y no-Z zilinganiswa kusukela \u003Cstrong\u003Eemsukeni wephrojekthi\u003C/strong\u003E, ngokwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmayunithi\u003C/span\u003E akhethwe ebhareni lamathuluzi (izinyawo nezintshi, izintshi, izinyawo zedesimali, amamilimitha, amasentimitha noma amamitha). Y ehlelekile ibheka enyakatho yemodeli, engahlali ibe yinyakatho yeqiniso. Empumalanga nasenyakatho zemephu zilandela ukukhetha okufanayo (izinyawo nezintshi zibonakala njengezinyawo zedesimali); uma iyunithi yesistimu yemephu ingafani nelo oyikhethile, ibhalwa ngaphakathi kwamabhulaketi ngemuva kwezinombolo, isibonelo \u003Cem\u003E(US survey feet)\u003C/em\u003E, ukuze umsinyi abone ukuthi isistimu uqobo ibhalwe ngani.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amamakha-amabili\"\u003EAmamakha amabili\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmsuka wephrojekthi\u003C/strong\u003E (isiyingi esibomvu esinesiphambano): iphoyinti 0, 0, 0 lapho zonke izikhombisi zemodeli zilinganiswa khona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIphoyinti lokuhlola\u003C/strong\u003E (isiyingi eluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka esinonxantathu): iphoyinti lesiza elinikezwa ububanzi, ubude nokuphakama kwalo, noma amakhoordinethi emephu. Ku-3D, ligxile kulo ukuze ufunde ukuthi lilaphi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma isayithi lisemsukeni wephrojekthi, njengesakhiwo esisha esidwetshwe lapha, kukhona okukodwa okubonisa kokubili. Chofoza inkinobho yesiphambano kunoma yiliphi ibhokisi ukuze ufihle noma ubonise amamakha; i-BimCraft ikhumbula ukukhetha kwakho kulesi siphequluli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukubone\"\u003EOkufanele ukubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinombolo ziyashintsha njengoba isikhombi sihamba, nebhokisi leplani liqamba izinga oliklame ohlwini lwezinga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmamakha ahlala endaweni lapho uzungeza, uhambisa nosondeza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze ufunde ububanzi nobude befoyinti, sebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinganisa\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo\u003C/span\u003E: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/measure\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/measure\"\u003ELinganisa izibalo, izindawo zobuso nezindawo ku-3D\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEsikrinini sokuthinta ibhokisi le-3D alibonisi lutho uze usebenzise imouse noma ipeni: umunwe uhambisa umbono.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Ukwazi ngokushesha lapho usemodelini: izinga olidweba kulo, ukuthi isikhombi sikude kangakanani emsukeni wephrojekthi, nokuthi iphoyinti lokuhlola lesiza lilaphi. Lapho izinombolo zibonakala Phezu kwombono we-3D (ngaphansi kwesokudla, eduze kwekhyubhu lokubuka): hambisa isikhombi phezu kwemodeli. Ibhokisi likhombisa izinga iphoyinti elisulapha kulo nokuthi liphakeme kangakanani phezu kwe-floor yalelo zinga, bese kuba X, Y no-Z. Phezu kwendawo engenalutho ifunda iphoyinti ku-floor yezinga eliphansi kakhulu. Ku-plani (ngaphansi kwesokudla, uma Dweba ivuliwe): izinga eliboniswa yiplani nokuphakama kwe-floor yalo, nka X no-Y wesikhombi uma sisePlani. Uma ifayela linokuguqulwa kwemephu (lalithunyelwe namakhoordinethi emephu), zombili amabhokisi engeza empumalanga nasenyakatho kugridi yemephu, ngakwi-Amayunithi oyikhethile (ngayo yonke imvamisa ibhalwe eduze kwawo; izinyawo nezintshi zibonakala njengezinyawo zedesimali). Umdwebo (DWG noma DXF) ugcina amayunithi wawo: ifunda ikhombisa amagama awo, futhi ayiguqulwa ngakunye. Zonke ama-X, Y no-Z zilinganiswa kusukela emsukeni wephrojekthi, ngokwe-Amayunithi akhethwe ebhareni lamathuluzi (izinyawo nezintshi, izintshi, izinyawo zedesimali, amamilimitha, amasentimitha noma amamitha). Y ehlelekile ibheka enyakatho yemodeli, engahlali ibe yinyakatho yeqiniso. Empumalanga nasenyakatho zemephu zilandela ukukhetha okufanayo (izinyawo nezintshi zibonakala njengezinyawo zedesimali); uma iyunithi yesistimu yemephu ingafani nelo oyikhethile, ibhalwa ngaphakathi kwamabhulaketi ngemuva kwezinombolo, isibonelo (US survey feet), ukuze umsinyi abone ukuthi isistimu uqobo ibhalwe ngani. Amamakha amabili Umsuka wephrojekthi (isiyingi esibomvu esinesiphambano): iphoyinti 0, 0, 0 lapho zonke izikhombisi zemodeli zilinganiswa khona. Iphoyinti lokuhlola (isiyingi eluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka esinonxantathu): iphoyinti lesiza elinikezwa ububanzi, ubude nokuphakama kwalo, noma amakhoordinethi emephu. Ku-3D, ligxile kulo ukuze ufunde ukuthi lilaphi. Uma isayithi lisemsukeni wephrojekthi, njengesakhiwo esisha esidwetshwe lapha, kukhona okukodwa okubonisa kokubili. Chofoza inkinobho yesiphambano kunoma yiliphi ibhokisi ukuze ufihle noma ubonise amamakha; i-BimCraft ikhumbula ukukhetha kwakho kulesi siphequluli. Okufanele ukubone Izinombolo ziyashintsha njengoba isikhombi sihamba, nebhokisi leplani liqamba izinga oliklame ohlwini lwezinga. Amamakha ahlala endaweni lapho uzungeza, uhambisa nosondeza. Ukuze ufunde ububanzi nobude befoyinti, sebenzisa Linganisa › Indawo: bona Linganisa izibalo, izindawo zobuso nezindawo ku-3D. Esikrinini sokuthinta ibhokisi le-3D alibonisi lutho uze usebenzise imouse noma ipeni: umunwe uhambisa umbono.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"files","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Amafayela avulwa futhi agcinwa yi-BimCraft","summary":"Yonke ifomethi evulwa yi-BimCraft, okugcinayo, lapho amafayela alondolozwa khona, nokushintsha phakathi kwamabrawuza nalapho ungaxhunyiwe.","section":"start","order":30,"keywords":["amafomethi","vula","gcina","thumela","landa","ifc","rvt","rfa","rte","rft","dwg","dxf","step","stp","csv","layisha","ubumfihlo","usayizi wefayela"],"headings":[{"id":"okuvulayo","text":"Okuvulayo","level":2},{"id":"akuvulwa","text":"Akuvulwa","level":3},{"id":"okulondolozayo","text":"Okulondolozayo","level":2},{"id":"ukulondoloza-okwesibili","text":"Ukulondoloza okwesibili","level":2},{"id":"amafayela-amakhulu-nenkumbulo","text":"Amafayela amakhulu nenkumbulo","level":2},{"id":"ku-inthanethi-nangaphandle-kwe-inthanethi","text":"Ku-inthanethi nangaphandle kwe-inthanethi","level":2},{"id":"ukulondoloza-ku-cloud","text":"Ukulondoloza ku-cloud","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EI-BimCraft ifunda amafayela ekhompyutheni yakho, ethebhini lesiphequluli. \u003Cstrong\u003EAkukho okulayishwa\u003C/strong\u003E ku-CadCraft noma kunoma ubani omunye. Lapho ulondoloza, i-BimCraft inikeza isiphequluli ifayela elisha ukuze lilandwe; ayisoze ibhale phezu kwefayela owalivula.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuvulayo\"\u003EOkuvulayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIfomethi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIzandiso\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkuthola\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIFC\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.ifc\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImodeli ku-3D, izitezi, inani lezinto nezici zento ngayinye. Amagama, amathegi kanye nezinani zezici ezisodwa zingashintshwa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmafayela ephrojekthi nomndeni\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.rvt\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.rfa\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.rte\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.rft\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkhadi lefayela: ukukhishwa, ukwakhiwa, ukusebenzisana ngokwabelana, ulwazi lwephrojekthi, amapharamitha omndeni, amafayela axhunyiwe nesithombe sokubuka. Akukho 3D.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDWG\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.dwg\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmdwebo ku-2D: indawo yemodeli, lonke ishidi, izingqimba, imidwebo exhunyiwe, izithombe nombono wokuphrinta. Indawo yemodeli nayo ku-3D. Amafomethi kusuka ku-AutoCAD 2000 kuya ku-2018 yiwo ahlolwe.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDXF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.dxf\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkufanayo ne-DWG.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESTEP\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.step\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.stp\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIngxenye, isiqephu sezinsiza noma imodeli yomhlinzeki (AP203, AP214, AP242) ku-3D: isolidi ngasinye siba yinto eyodwa (building element proxy) emodelini omncane we-IFC esiteziwini esisodwa, ifundwa njengamatriyangula ngosayizi wayo wangempela, isakhiwo esinazo zonke izingxenye lapho ifayela zibeka khona. Isebenza njenganoma yiliphi i-IFC kusukela lapho: izici, izigaba, ukukala, gcina njenge-IFC. Imibala nomuthi wesakhiwo akufundwa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmapoyinti ephoyinti\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.las\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.laz\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.e57\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.ply\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.pcd\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.ptx\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.pts\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.xyz\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsikena ku-3D, eduze kwemodeli noma sodwa: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/point-clouds\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/point-clouds\"\u003EBonisa i-point cloud eduze kwemodeli\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbhanoli yephrojekthi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.ccbundle.zip\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImodeli nemibono yayo, izakhiwo namaqembu ezici: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/open-project-bundle\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/open-project-bundle\"\u003EVula ibhanoli yephrojekthi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfolda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Enoma yiluphi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmbiko wawo wonke amamodeli, imidwebo namabhanoli aphakathi kwayo. Noma yiliphi i-IFC, imodeli, umdwebo noma ibhanoli embikweni ivulwa ngokuchofoza kanye.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/file-formats\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/file-formats\"\u003EOkufundwa yi-BimCraft kusuka kwifomethi ngayinye\u003C/a\u003E kuchaza kabanzi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-BimCraft ikhetha ukuthi yini ifayela ngokubheka ama-byte okuqala walo kanye negama lalo, ngakho ifayela lephrojekthi elinesandiso esingavamile livula njengekhadi lefayela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"akuvulwa\"\u003EAkuvulwa\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.ifczip\u003C/code\u003E ne \u003Ccode\u003E.ifcxml\u003C/code\u003E: I-BimCraft ithi &quot;.ifczip akusasekelwa okwamanje. Gcina noma uthumele imodeli njengefayela elilula le-.ifc.&quot; Khipha i-\u003Ccode\u003E.ifczip\u003C/code\u003E (iqukethe \u003Ccode\u003E.ifc\u003C/code\u003E elula) noma uthumele kabusha njenge-IFC elula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImidwebo ye-DGN ibhalwe embikweni wefolda kodwa ayivuleki.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-PDF, izithombe namafayela ehhovisi akuvuleki ngokwawo. Izithombe zisetshenziswa njengezithombe ngaphakathi kwe-DWG, futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkwakhiwa\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKusuka emdwebeni…\u003C/span\u003E iguqula amakhasi e-PDF noma i-scan ibe izindonga: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/walls-from-plans\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/walls-from-plans\"\u003EIzindonga kusuka kusethi yamaplani\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulondolozayo\"\u003EOkulondolozayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUchofoza\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUthola\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKuphi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGcina njenge-IFC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfayela elisha le-IFC elinezinguquko zakho, eligcinwe njenge-&quot;\u003Cem\u003Eoriginal name\u003C/em\u003E (edited).ifc&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfolda yokulanda yesiphequluli sakho\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELanda i-CSV\u003C/span\u003E ohlwini lwezinsiza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-CSV yezinto esizindeni, egcinwe njenge-&quot;\u003Cem\u003Edrawing name\u003C/em\u003E equipment.csv&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfolda yokulanda yesiphequluli sakho\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEzinye izinto zilondolozwa lapho zenziwa, ngamunye esihlokweni sawo: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUSD\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/usd\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/usd\"\u003EThumela imodeli njenge-USD\u003C/a\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECollada\u003C/span\u003E (.dae kanye ne-.kmz ye-Google Earth: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/collada\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/collada\"\u003EThumela imodeli njenge-Collada noma ye-Google Earth\u003C/a\u003E), i-.glb \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuze kurendrelwe\u003C/span\u003E, izithombe ezirenderiwe, amashidi namaplani njenge-PDF, izinhlelo nezinhlu njenge-CSV, izinkinga ze-BCF, isipredishithi se-COBie, amafayela omndeni, nezikena ezibhalisiwe njenge-LAS noma i-E57. I-BimCraft ayilondolozi i-DWG, i-DXF noma amafayela ephrojekthi, futhi ayisoze ishintshe amafayela owavulayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChrome ne-Edge zilondoloza okulandwayo efolda elisethwe kuzilungiselelo zazo, ngokuvamile i-Downloads. Ukuze ubuzwe lapho kulondolozwa ngayinye, vula &quot;Ask where to save each file before downloading&quot; ezilungisweni zokulanda zesiphequluli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:firefox\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EFirefox\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-Firefox ilondoloza ku-Downloads ngaphandle uma uyisethe ukuthi &quot;Always ask you where to save files&quot; ezilungisweni zayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ESafari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-Safari ilondoloza ku-Downloads ngaphandle uma ukhetha enye ifolda ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003ESafari &gt; Settings &gt; General &gt; File download location\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukulondoloza-okwesibili\"\u003EUkulondoloza okwesibili\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkulondoloza ngakunye kulanda imodeli yonke \u003Cstrong\u003Enazo zonke izinguquko ukusukela lapho uyivula\u003C/strong\u003E, hhayi izinguquko ezenziwe ngemva kokulondolozwa kwangaphambilini kuphela. Uhlu lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinguquko\u003C/span\u003E luqala lube lungenalutho ngemva kokulondoloza ngakunye, ngakho awukwazi ukuhlehlisa ngaphambi kokulondolozwa. Ukuqala kabusha kusukela kumsuka, vula kabusha leyo fayela yokuqala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amafayela-amakhulu-nenkumbulo\"\u003EAmafayela amakhulu nenkumbulo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIFC\u003C/strong\u003E ifundwa iphela enkumbulweni yethebhu, futhi ijiyomethri ye-3D ithatha inkumbulo eyengeziwe. Imodeli yamamegabhayithi ambalwa ingaba kakhulu kulaptop. Ngaphezu kwamatriyangula ayizigidi ezingu-1.5, imiphetho iyavalwa ukuze kongiwe inkumbulo (imiphetho ivaliwe kumamodeli amakhulu kakhulu).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmafayela ephrojekthi\u003C/strong\u003E awafundwa ngokuphelele. I-BimCraft ifunda kuphela izingxenye ezincane ezidingekayo, cishe ama-KB angu-40 kuya ku-100 nakuba ifayela likhulu kangakanani, ngakho imodeli eyinhloko engu-500 MB esendaweni yenethiwekhi ivula ngokushesha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDWG ne-DXF\u003C/strong\u003E zifundwa ngokuphelele. Umdwebo omkhulu kakhulu ubonisa: &quot;Lo mdwebo mkhulu kakhulu; kukhonjiswa ingxenye yawo kuphela.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmafolda\u003C/strong\u003E kuze kube ngamafayela angu-20,000 avulwa. Kufundwa kuphela amakhilobhayithi ambalwa ekhadi ngalinye lemodeli adingayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/platforms\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/platforms\"\u003EIzisekeli, amadivayisi nenkumbulo\u003C/a\u003E ukuze uthole okwengeziwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-inthanethi-nangaphandle-kwe-inthanethi\"\u003EKu-inthanethi nangaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuvula amafayela akudingi i-inthanethi ngaso sonke isikhathi. Umfundi owodwa ulayisha kusuka esayithini ngokuqala lapho ukudinga: injini ye-IFC, ngokuqala lapho uvula imodeli ye-IFC koqala (&quot;Iqalisa injini ye-IFC…&quot;). Abafundi be-DWG ne-DXF yingxenye yohlelo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"net:offline\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EOffline\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAwuxhunyiwe. Uma inkinobho yebha yohlelo ithi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIlungele ukusetshenziswa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E, yonke ifomethi ivuleka njengejwayelekile. Uma kungenjalo, imodeli ye-IFC ayikwazi ukuvuleka ngaphandle uma kade ivulwe kuleyo thebhu: xhuma kaqala. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/online-offline\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/online-offline\"\u003EKu-inthanethi nangaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze usebenzise i-BimCraft ngaphandle kokuxhumeka, chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E ebhareni lohlelo ngenkathi uxhumekile bese ulinda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIlungele ukusetshenziswa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E. Ikhophi elilondoloziwe lingu-cishe 33 MB; lifaka injini ye-IFC, ngakho namamodeli e-IFC avuleka ngaphandle. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EUkusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/a\u003E kuchaza amakhophi alondoloziwe ngokujwayelekile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukulondoloza-ku-cloud\"\u003EUkulondoloza ku-cloud\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkulondoloza ku-cloud akukatholakali okwamanje. Londoloza amakhophi wakho ahleliwe ekhompyutheni yakho noma kuseva yefayela yehhovisi lakho, njengoba ungenza nakunoma yifayela elinye. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/your-files\" data-topic=\"basics/your-files\"\u003EAmafayela akho\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"I-BimCraft ifunda amafayela ekhompyutheni yakho, ethebhini lesiphequluli. Akukho okulayishwa ku-CadCraft noma kunoma ubani omunye. Lapho ulondoloza, i-BimCraft inikeza isiphequluli ifayela elisha ukuze lilandwe; ayisoze ibhale phezu kwefayela owalivula. Okuvulayo Ifomethi Izandiso Okuthola IFC .ifc Imodeli ku-3D, izitezi, inani lezinto nezici zento ngayinye. Amagama, amathegi kanye nezinani zezici ezisodwa zingashintshwa. Amafayela ephrojekthi nomndeni .rvt .rfa .rte .rft Ikhadi lefayela: ukukhishwa, ukwakhiwa, ukusebenzisana ngokwabelana, ulwazi lwephrojekthi, amapharamitha omndeni, amafayela axhunyiwe nesithombe sokubuka. Akukho 3D. DWG .dwg Umdwebo ku-2D: indawo yemodeli, lonke ishidi, izingqimba, imidwebo exhunyiwe, izithombe nombono wokuphrinta. Indawo yemodeli nayo ku-3D. Amafomethi kusuka ku-AutoCAD 2000 kuya ku-2018 yiwo ahlolwe. DXF .dxf Okufanayo ne-DWG. STEP .step .stp Ingxenye, isiqephu sezinsiza noma imodeli yomhlinzeki (AP203, AP214, AP242) ku-3D: isolidi ngasinye siba yinto eyodwa (building element proxy) emodelini omncane we-IFC esiteziwini esisodwa, ifundwa njengamatriyangula ngosayizi wayo wangempela, isakhiwo esinazo zonke izingxenye lapho ifayela zibeka khona. Isebenza njenganoma yiliphi i-IFC kusukela lapho: izici, izigaba, ukukala, gcina njenge-IFC. Imibala nomuthi wesakhiwo akufundwa. Amapoyinti ephoyinti .las .laz .e57 .ply .pcd .ptx .pts .xyz Isikena ku-3D, eduze kwemodeli noma sodwa: bona Bonisa i-point cloud eduze kwemodeli. Ibhanoli yephrojekthi .ccbundle.zip Imodeli nemibono yayo, izakhiwo namaqembu ezici: bona Vula ibhanoli yephrojekthi. Ifolda noma yiluphi Umbiko wawo wonke amamodeli, imidwebo namabhanoli aphakathi kwayo. Noma yiliphi i-IFC, imodeli, umdwebo noma ibhanoli embikweni ivulwa ngokuchofoza kanye. Okufundwa yi-BimCraft kusuka kwifomethi ngayinye kuchaza kabanzi. I-BimCraft ikhetha ukuthi yini ifayela ngokubheka ama-byte okuqala walo kanye negama lalo, ngakho ifayela lephrojekthi elinesandiso esingavamile livula njengekhadi lefayela. Akuvulwa .ifczip ne .ifcxml: I-BimCraft ithi \".ifczip akusasekelwa okwamanje. Gcina noma uthumele imodeli njengefayela elilula le-.ifc.\" Khipha i-.ifczip (iqukethe .ifc elula) noma uthumele kabusha njenge-IFC elula. Imidwebo ye-DGN ibhalwe embikweni wefolda kodwa ayivuleki. I-PDF, izithombe namafayela ehhovisi akuvuleki ngokwawo. Izithombe zisetshenziswa njengezithombe ngaphakathi kwe-DWG, futhi Ukwakhiwa › Kusuka emdwebeni… iguqula amakhasi e-PDF noma i-scan ibe izindonga: bona Izindonga kusuka kusethi yamaplani. Okulondolozayo Uchofoza Uthola Kuphi Gcina njenge-IFC Ifayela elisha le-IFC elinezinguquko zakho, eligcinwe njenge-\"original name (edited).ifc\" Ifolda yokulanda yesiphequluli sakho Landa i-CSV ohlwini lwezinsiza I-CSV yezinto esizindeni, egcinwe njenge-\"drawing name equipment.csv\" Ifolda yokulanda yesiphequluli sakho Ezinye izinto zilondolozwa lapho zenziwa, ngamunye esihlokweni sawo: USD (Thumela imodeli njenge-USD), Collada (.dae kanye ne-.kmz ye-Google Earth: Thumela imodeli njenge-Collada noma ye-Google Earth), i-.glb Ukuze kurendrelwe, izithombe ezirenderiwe, amashidi namaplani njenge-PDF, izinhlelo nezinhlu njenge-CSV, izinkinga ze-BCF, isipredishithi se-COBie, amafayela omndeni, nezikena ezibhalisiwe njenge-LAS noma i-E57. I-BimCraft ayilondolozi i-DWG, i-DXF noma amafayela ephrojekthi, futhi ayisoze ishintshe amafayela owavulayo. Chrome ne-Edge zilondoloza okulandwayo efolda elisethwe kuzilungiselelo zazo, ngokuvamile i-Downloads. Ukuze ubuzwe lapho kulondolozwa ngayinye, vula \"Ask where to save each file before downloading\" ezilungisweni zokulanda zesiphequluli. I-Firefox ilondoloza ku-Downloads ngaphandle uma uyisethe ukuthi \"Always ask you where to save files\" ezilungisweni zayo. I-Safari ilondoloza ku-Downloads ngaphandle uma ukhetha enye ifolda ngaphansi kwe-Safari \u003E Settings \u003E General \u003E File download location. Ukulondoloza okwesibili Ukulondoloza ngakunye kulanda imodeli yonke nazo zonke izinguquko ukusukela lapho uyivula, hhayi izinguquko ezenziwe ngemva kokulondolozwa kwangaphambilini kuphela. Uhlu lwe-Izinguquko luqala lube lungenalutho ngemva kokulondoloza ngakunye, ngakho awukwazi ukuhlehlisa ngaphambi kokulondolozwa. Ukuqala kabusha kusukela kumsuka, vula kabusha leyo fayela yokuqala. Amafayela amakhulu nenkumbulo IFC ifundwa iphela enkumbulweni yethebhu, futhi ijiyomethri ye-3D ithatha inkumbulo eyengeziwe. Imodeli yamamegabhayithi ambalwa ingaba kakhulu kulaptop. Ngaphezu kwamatriyangula ayizigidi ezingu-1.5, imiphetho iyavalwa ukuze kongiwe inkumbulo (imiphetho ivaliwe kumamodeli amakhulu kakhulu). Amafayela ephrojekthi awafundwa ngokuphelele. I-BimCraft ifunda kuphela izingxenye ezincane ezidingekayo, cishe ama-KB angu-40 kuya ku-100 nakuba ifayela likhulu kangakanani, ngakho imodeli eyinhloko engu-500 MB esendaweni yenethiwekhi ivula ngokushesha. DWG ne-DXF zifundwa ngokuphelele. Umdwebo omkhulu kakhulu ubonisa: \"Lo mdwebo mkhulu kakhulu; kukhonjiswa ingxenye yawo kuphela.\" Amafolda kuze kube ngamafayela angu-20,000 avulwa. Kufundwa kuphela amakhilobhayithi ambalwa ekhadi ngalinye lemodeli adingayo. Bona Izisekeli, amadivayisi nenkumbulo ukuze uthole okwengeziwe. Ku-inthanethi nangaphandle kwe-inthanethi Ukuvula amafayela akudingi i-inthanethi ngaso sonke isikhathi. Umfundi owodwa ulayisha kusuka esayithini ngokuqala lapho ukudinga: injini ye-IFC, ngokuqala lapho uvula imodeli ye-IFC koqala (\"Iqalisa injini ye-IFC…\"). Abafundi be-DWG ne-DXF yingxenye yohlelo. Awuxhunyiwe. Uma inkinobho yebha yohlelo ithi Ilungele ukusetshenziswa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi, yonke ifomethi ivuleka njengejwayelekile. Uma kungenjalo, imodeli ye-IFC ayikwazi ukuvuleka ngaphandle uma kade ivulwe kuleyo thebhu: xhuma kaqala. Bona Ku-inthanethi nangaphandle kwe-inthanethi. Ukuze usebenzise i-BimCraft ngaphandle kokuxhumeka, chofoza Londoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi ebhareni lohlelo ngenkathi uxhumekile bese ulinda Ilungele ukusetshenziswa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi. Ikhophi elilondoloziwe lingu-cishe 33 MB; lifaka injini ye-IFC, ngakho namamodeli e-IFC avuleka ngaphandle. Ukusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi kuchaza amakhophi alondoloziwe ngokujwayelekile. Ukulondoloza ku-cloud Ukulondoloza ku-cloud akukatholakali okwamanje. Londoloza amakhophi wakho ahleliwe ekhompyutheni yakho noma kuseva yefayela yehhovisi lakho, njengoba ungenza nakunoma yifayela elinye. Bona Amafayela akho.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"open-ifc-model","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Vula imodeli ye-IFC bese ubuka nge-3D","summary":"Vula ifayela le-IFC, zungeza, shelelisa futhi usondeze, usebenzise {{ui:Lwanele}}, {{ui:Phezulu}}, {{ui:Phambili}} no-{{ui:Uhlangothi}} ukuze uthole indlela.","section":"tasks","order":10,"keywords":["ifc","3d","zungeza","shelelisa","sondeza","lwanele","ukubuka phezulu","ukubuka phambili","ukubuka ohlangothini","hamba","i-viewcube","ikhamera"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukubone","text":"Okufanele ukubone","level":2},{"id":"ukuhamba","text":"Ukuhamba","level":2},{"id":"eshadiwe-nemiphetho-noma-uhlaka-lwemigqa","text":"Eshadiwe, nemiphetho noma uhlaka lwemigqa","level":2},{"id":"amaphutha-ajwayelekile","text":"Amaphutha ajwayelekile","level":2},{"id":"okulandelayo","text":"Okulandelayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula imodeli ye-IFC, uhambe kuyo nge-3D bese ufinyelela izinhlobo zokubuka ezijwayelekile. Cishe imizuzu emihlanu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUdinga ifayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.ifc\u003C/code\u003E. Iningi lezinhlelo ze-BIM liyakhipha elilodwa; ku-Revit kungu-\u003Cstrong\u003EFile &gt; Export &gt; IFC\u003C/strong\u003E. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/rvt-to-ifc\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/rvt-to-ifc\"\u003EThola ifayela lephrojekthi libe ku-3D nge-IFC\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha ifayela\u003C/span\u003E (noma indawo yokuwisa engenhla kwesobunxele).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha ifayela lakho le-\u003Ccode\u003E.ifc\u003C/code\u003E bese uqinisekisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELinda umugqa wesimo uqede. Ubonisa &quot;Iqalisa injini ye-IFC…&quot; okokuqala, bese &quot;Ifunda imodeli…&quot; no-&quot;Yakha ijometri: … kwezingu-… zezinto&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBheka imodeli: ivulwa ngombono wamaqhwa amathathu, ilingane nesikrini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhezulu\u003C/span\u003E ethuluzini phezu komodeli ukuze ubheke phansi ngqo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhambili\u003C/span\u003E ukubheka phambili, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlangothi\u003C/span\u003E ukubheka ohlangothini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELwanele\u003C/span\u003E, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ukuze ubuyele ekubukeni kwamaqhwa amathathu kwimodeli yonke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukubone\"\u003EOkufanele ukubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImodeli phakathi, nemigqa emnyama emincane ukuze kubonakale njengomdwebo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIpaneli ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfayela\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesobunxele: igama lefayela, usayizi, uhlelo lwe-IFC (njengesibonelo IFC2X3 noma IFC4), igama lephrojekthi, isigaba, uhlelo olukhishwe kulo, umbhali, usuku lokukhishwa, nenani lezinto nonxantathu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinkomba ze-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzitezi\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinto\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmugqa wesimo: &quot;Ivulwe \u003Cem\u003Eigama lefayela\u003C/em\u003E: \u003Cem\u003En\u003C/em\u003E izinto ngo-\u003Cem\u003Es\u003C/em\u003E s&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuhamba\"\u003EUkuhamba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:mouse\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMouse\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E| Ukuzungeza | Hudula ngenkinobho yokhiye wokunxele | | Shelelisa | Hudula ngenkinobho yokhiye wokudla, noma bamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) bese uhudula ngokhiye wokunxele | | Sondeza | Skrola ngevili, noma hudula ngenkinobho ephakathi | | Bona konke | Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELwanele\u003C/span\u003E |\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac;input:mouse\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac, Mouse\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-trackpad: hudula ngomunwe owodwa ucindezelwe ukuze uzungeze; bamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bese uhudula ukuze ushelelise; skrolela ngeminwe emibili noma ukhuhlise ukusondeza. Ukuchofoza ngeminwe emibili kuyisichofozo sokudla, futhi ungahudula nakho ukuze ushelelise, kodwa \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E nokuhudula kulula kakhulu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E| Ukuzungeza | Hudula ngomunwe owodwa | | Sondeza | Khuhlisa ngeminwe emibili | | Shelelisa | Hambisa iminwe emibili ndawonye | | Bona konke | Thepha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELwanele\u003C/span\u003E |\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuzungeza kuhlala kuzungeza indawo ephakathi kwemodeli. Ukushelelisa kuyishintsha leyo ndawo, ngakho ngemva kokushelelisa isikhathi eside ukuzungeza kungase kuzwakale kungalingani: chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELwanele\u003C/span\u003E ukuyisetha kabusha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"eshadiwe-nemiphetho-noma-uhlaka-lwemigqa\"\u003EEshadiwe, nemiphetho noma uhlaka lwemigqa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinkinobho ezintathu ezincane ngaphezu kwesikhwama sombono zikhetha indlela imodeli edwetshwa ngayo: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkushadiwe\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkushadiwe nemiphetho\u003C/span\u003E (okuzenzakalelayo) no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlaka lwemigqa\u003C/span\u003E. Zikwa imiyalo nazo (kumenyu yombono nasohlwini lokwenza ngokwakho), ngakho zingaba nezikhiye zazo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIpulani\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlukanisa\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E zisethulalini \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubuka\u003C/span\u003E sethuluzi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amaphutha-ajwayelekile\"\u003EAmaphutha ajwayelekile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkulindela imibono enamagama.\u003C/strong\u003E I-BimCraft inemibono emine esetshiwe (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELwanele\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhezulu\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhambili\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlangothi\u003C/span\u003E), ikhyubhu yombono ekhoneni eliphansi kwesokudla nokuzungeza okukhululekile. Ayigcini imibono.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkufuna amapulani nezigaba.\u003C/strong\u003E Akukho mapulani angu-2D noma amabhokisi esigaba kulolu hlelo. Sika imodeli ngendiza eyodwa ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsigaba\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/section-plane\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/section-plane\"\u003ESika imodeli ye-IFC ngendiza yesigaba\u003C/a\u003E), noma vala izitezi: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/storeys-and-spaces\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/storeys-and-spaces\"\u003EBonisa nofihle izitezi, izindawo nemiphetho\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuvula ifayela lephrojekthi ulindele i-3D.\u003C/strong\u003E Ifayela lephrojekthi livula njengekhadi lefayela. Khipha i-IFC kuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuvula i-\u003Ccode\u003E.ifczip\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/strong\u003E Hlobosha, noma khipha \u003Ccode\u003E.ifc\u003C/code\u003E ngokuvamile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImodeli enkulu yenza ithebhu ibe nzima noma iwe.\u003C/strong\u003E Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/platforms\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/platforms\"\u003EIziphequluli, amadivayisi nenkumbulo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulandelayo\"\u003EOkulandelayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/inspect-element\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/inspect-element\"\u003EKhetha into bese ufunda izici zayo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Vula imodeli ye-IFC, uhambe kuyo nge-3D bese ufinyelela izinhlobo zokubuka ezijwayelekile. Cishe imizuzu emihlanu. Udinga ifayela le-.ifc. Iningi lezinhlelo ze-BIM liyakhipha elilodwa; ku-Revit kungu-File \u003E Export \u003E IFC. Bheka Thola ifayela lephrojekthi libe ku-3D nge-IFC. Izinyathelo Chofoza Khetha ifayela (noma indawo yokuwisa engenhla kwesobunxele). Khetha ifayela lakho le-.ifc bese uqinisekisa. Linda umugqa wesimo uqede. Ubonisa \"Iqalisa injini ye-IFC…\" okokuqala, bese \"Ifunda imodeli…\" no-\"Yakha ijometri: … kwezingu-… zezinto\". Bheka imodeli: ivulwa ngombono wamaqhwa amathathu, ilingane nesikrini. Chofoza Phezulu ethuluzini phezu komodeli ukuze ubheke phansi ngqo. Chofoza Phambili ukubheka phambili, bese Uhlangothi ukubheka ohlangothini. Chofoza Lwanele, noma cindezela F, ukuze ubuyele ekubukeni kwamaqhwa amathathu kwimodeli yonke. Okufanele ukubone Imodeli phakathi, nemigqa emnyama emincane ukuze kubonakale njengomdwebo. Ipaneli ye-Ifayela ngakwesobunxele: igama lefayela, usayizi, uhlelo lwe-IFC (njengesibonelo IFC2X3 noma IFC4), igama lephrojekthi, isigaba, uhlelo olukhishwe kulo, umbhali, usuku lokukhishwa, nenani lezinto nonxantathu. Izinkomba ze-Izitezi ne-Izinto ngaphansi kwayo. Umugqa wesimo: \"Ivulwe igama lefayela: n izinto ngo-s s\". Ukuhamba | Ukuzungeza | Hudula ngenkinobho yokhiye wokunxele | | Shelelisa | Hudula ngenkinobho yokhiye wokudla, noma bamba Shift (noma Ctrl) bese uhudula ngokhiye wokunxele | | Sondeza | Skrola ngevili, noma hudula ngenkinobho ephakathi | | Bona konke | Cindezela F noma chofoza Lwanele | Ku-trackpad: hudula ngomunwe owodwa ucindezelwe ukuze uzungeze; bamba Shift noma Ctrl bese uhudula ukuze ushelelise; skrolela ngeminwe emibili noma ukhuhlise ukusondeza. Ukuchofoza ngeminwe emibili kuyisichofozo sokudla, futhi ungahudula nakho ukuze ushelelise, kodwa Shift nokuhudula kulula kakhulu. | Ukuzungeza | Hudula ngomunwe owodwa | | Sondeza | Khuhlisa ngeminwe emibili | | Shelelisa | Hambisa iminwe emibili ndawonye | | Bona konke | Thepha Lwanele | Ukuzungeza kuhlala kuzungeza indawo ephakathi kwemodeli. Ukushelelisa kuyishintsha leyo ndawo, ngakho ngemva kokushelelisa isikhathi eside ukuzungeza kungase kuzwakale kungalingani: chofoza Lwanele ukuyisetha kabusha. Eshadiwe, nemiphetho noma uhlaka lwemigqa Izinkinobho ezintathu ezincane ngaphezu kwesikhwama sombono zikhetha indlela imodeli edwetshwa ngayo: Okushadiwe, Okushadiwe nemiphetho (okuzenzakalelayo) no-Uhlaka lwemigqa. Zikwa imiyalo nazo (kumenyu yombono nasohlwini lokwenza ngokwakho), ngakho zingaba nezikhiye zazo. Ipulani, Hlukanisa no-3D zisethulalini Ukubuka sethuluzi. Amaphutha ajwayelekile Ukulindela imibono enamagama. I-BimCraft inemibono emine esetshiwe (Lwanele, Phezulu, Phambili, Uhlangothi), ikhyubhu yombono ekhoneni eliphansi kwesokudla nokuzungeza okukhululekile. Ayigcini imibono. Ukufuna amapulani nezigaba. Akukho mapulani angu-2D noma amabhokisi esigaba kulolu hlelo. Sika imodeli ngendiza eyodwa ye-Isigaba (Sika imodeli ye-IFC ngendiza yesigaba), noma vala izitezi: Bonisa nofihle izitezi, izindawo nemiphetho. Ukuvula ifayela lephrojekthi ulindele i-3D. Ifayela lephrojekthi livula njengekhadi lefayela. Khipha i-IFC kuqala. Ukuvula i-.ifczip. Hlobosha, noma khipha .ifc ngokuvamile. Imodeli enkulu yenza ithebhu ibe nzima noma iwe. Bheka Iziphequluli, amadivayisi nenkumbulo. Okulandelayo Khetha into bese ufunda izici zayo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"default-policies","scope":"bimcraft","title":"\"Izinqubomgomo zokuzenzakalela: setha okuqala ngakho isakhiwo esisha\"","summary":"Tshela kanye ukuthi yiluphi uhlobo lodonga, amazinga, ishidi lokuqala, amathegi e-LOD, amayunithi nethuluzi isakhiwo esisha okuqala ngalo, kokubili kumaphrojekthi e-metric nowe-imperial, bese wabelana ngezinqubomgomo ehhovisi njengefayela elincane.","section":"tasks","order":16,"keywords":["okuzenzakalelayo","izinqubomgomo zokuzenzakalela","inqubomgomo","izinqubomgomo zehhovisi","izindinganiso zehhovisi","ithempulethi","isakhiwo esisha","uhlobo lokuqala lodonga","metric","ukwakha ngamabhulokhi","LOD","izinga lokuthuthukiswa","ishidi lokuqala","iphepha","isikali","amazinga","ukuphakama kwesitezi","amagama ezitezi","ithuluzi lodonga","iyunithi","ukwabelana","ukuthumela","ukungenisa","json"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"izinqubomgomo","text":"Izinqubomgomo","level":2},{"id":"ukuhlelwa-kohlu-umgomo-wehhovisi","text":"Ukuhlelwa kohlu: umgomo wehhovisi","level":2},{"id":"yabelana-ngazo-ehhovisi","text":"Yabelana ngazo ehhovisi","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukwazi","text":"Okufanele ukwazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETshela i-BimCraft ukuthi yini isakhiwo esisha okufanele siqale ngayo, ukuze akekho ehhovisi oyodinga ukushintsha izinto ezifanayo njalo. Lesi yi-add-on: ivaliwe size usivule, futhi inqubomgomo ongayisethi ishiya izinga le-BimCraft njengoba linjalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELezi zinqubomgomo zokuzenzakalela zezakhiwo \u003Cstrong\u003Eezisha\u003C/strong\u003E nezinto \u003Cstrong\u003Eezisha\u003C/strong\u003E. Iphrojekthi osuke uyiqalile ayishintshwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula Izilungiselelo, uye ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwengeziwe\u003C/span\u003E bese uvula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinqubomgomo zokuzenzakalela\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-Izilungiselelo, vula ithebhu ye-\u003Cstrong\u003EBimCraft\u003C/strong\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinqubomgomo zokuzenzakalela\u003C/span\u003E ohlwini oluseceleni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESetha izinqubomgomo ofuna. Ngayinye iqala ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EeyeBimCraft\u003C/strong\u003E, nalokho okukuphakathi kwamabhulaketi. Inqubomgomo enebhokisi elithi \u003Cstrong\u003EMetric\u003C/strong\u003E nelithi \u003Cstrong\u003EImperial\u003C/strong\u003E ithatha inani elilodwa ngohlobo ngalunye lweprojekthi; gcwalisa ezidingekayo kuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAyikho inkinobho yokugcina: ushintsho ngalunye lugcinwa njengoba ulenza. Inani elingasetshenziswa liyenqatshwa ngamazwi futhi elidala lihlala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECofa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsakhiwo esisha\u003C/span\u003E. Ifomu igcwaliswa ngezinqubomgomo zakho, futhi ngayinye inqubomgomo oyisethile ithi \u003Cstrong\u003Ekusuka kuzinqubomgomo zakho zokuzenzakalela\u003C/strong\u003E eduze kwayo. Ungazishintsha noma yiziphi ngaphambi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDala\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinqubomgomo\"\u003EIzinqubomgomo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIyunithi yesakhiwo esisha\u003C/strong\u003E: iyunithi ishintshela kulokhu lapho ucofa u-Dala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInani lezitezi\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EAmagama ezitezi\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003EUkuphakama kwesitezi\u003C/strong\u003E. Egameni, \u003Ccode\u003E{n}\u003C/code\u003E ibala 1, 2, 3; \u003Ccode\u003E{n0}\u003C/code\u003E ibala 0, 1, 2; \u003Ccode\u003E{nn}\u003C/code\u003E no-\u003Ccode\u003E{nn0}\u003C/code\u003E benza okufanayo ngezinombolo ezimbili. Ngakho \u003Ccode\u003EIsitezi {nn0}\u003C/code\u003E sinikeza Isitezi 00, Isitezi 01, Isitezi 02.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUhlobo lokuqala lodonga\u003C/strong\u003E: okudwetshwa yithuluzi lodonga kuqala. Ihhovisi le-metric lingaqala nge-Exterior masonry 300 mm, kanti amaphrojekthi e-imperial agcine i-Exterior 2×6.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIthegi le-LOD kuzinhlobo zodonga zokuqala\u003C/strong\u003E: izinga lokuthuthukiswa (LOD 100 kuya ku-500) uhlobo lwezakhiwo lwesishiyagalolunye olubonisa noma yikuphi lapho uhlobo lubhalwe khona. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/wall-assemblies\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/wall-assemblies\"\u003EAkha izinhlanganisela zodonga\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELOD yohlobo lodonga olusha olwenziwe\u003C/strong\u003E: ithegi uhlobo olusha oluqala ngalo kumhleli wohlobo. Ungayishintsha lapho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIshidi lokuqala\u003C/strong\u003E: iphepha lalo, isikali, inombolo yeshidi negama (sebenzisa \u003Ccode\u003E{level}\u003C/code\u003E ukuthola igama lesitezi esiphansi kakhulu), noma akukho shidi lokuqala ngokuphelele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUsayizi wezichasiso ephepheni\u003C/strong\u003E (Izilungiselelo › Global › Izinqubomgomo zokuzenzakalela): ukuphakama kwehhovisi, ngamamillimitha njengoba kushicilelwe, kwamanothi, umbhalo wesilinganiso, amathegi, amagama amagumbi, izinhlamvu zamabhamuza egridi, amagama emibono nombhalo wohlu. Isakhiwo esisha siyawathatha ngoku-Dala futhi siwagcina efayelini yaso. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/annotation-sizes\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/annotation-sizes\"\u003EDweba ngosayizi ogcwele, uchaze ngesikali\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIthuluzi elisebenzayo ngemva kuka-Dala\u003C/strong\u003E: Khetha, njengoba i-BimCraft ikwenza yodwa, noma Udonga, ukuze ukucofa okubili kokuqala kupulani kudwebe udonga ngokuqondile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuhlelwa-kohlu-umgomo-wehhovisi\"\u003EUkuhlelwa kohlu: umgomo wehhovisi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzilungiselelo › Global › Izinqubomgomo zokuzenzakalela\u003C/strong\u003E, ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuhlelwa kohlu (umgomo wehhovisi)\u003C/strong\u003E, setha ukuthi yonke uhlu luhlelwa kanjani, ukuthi luneziqephu nesamba yini, isihloko sawo nokuthi amakholomu anezinhloko zethe kanjani. Yonke uhlu olungachazi lwayo luyawuthatha, noma ngubani ohlela. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/schedule-layouts\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/schedule-layouts\"\u003EHlela, gcina futhi uthumele uhlu\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yabelana-ngazo-ehhovisi\"\u003EYabelana ngazo ehhovisi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-Izilungiselelo, vula ithebhu ye-\u003Cstrong\u003EGlobal\u003C/strong\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinqubomgomo zokuzenzakalela\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBhala \u003Cstrong\u003EIgama lehhovisi\u003C/strong\u003E uma uthanda. Libhalwa efayeleni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECofa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGcina efayeleni\u003C/span\u003E. Uthola ifayela elincane elibiza ngokuthi \u003Ccode\u003E.ccdefaults.json\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKwenye ikhompyutha, vula i-add-on, vula indawo efanayo bese ucofa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayisha kusuka efayeleni\u003C/span\u003E. Izinqubomgomo zefayela ziyathatha indawo yezalapho kulelo khompyutha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthebhu ye-Global nayo inohlelo lwamayunithi weprojekthi emisha, olusebenza kuzo zonke izinhlelo ezinalo i-add-on, kanye ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESetha kabusha zonke izinqubomgomo\u003C/span\u003E. I-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESetha kabusha kuzenzakalelo lwe-BimCraft\u003C/span\u003E kuthebhu ye-BimCraft isula ezeBimCraft kuphela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukwazi\"\u003EOkufanele ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIfayela liyi-JSON evulekile, elula: uhlu lwamagama enqubomgomo namanani. Inqubomgomo ifayela elayichaza engaziwa yile nguqulo ishiywa ngaphandle futhi ichazwe emyalezweni; ezinye zona ziyalayisha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinqubomgomo zigcinwa kulesi siphequluli, kuzo zonke izinhlelo ze-CadCraft kuleli khompyutha. Azigcinwa efayeleni lesakhiwo, futhi azihlanganiswa phakathi kwamakhompyutha: sebenzisa ifayela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIthegi le-LOD kuhlobo lokuqala livela kunqubomgomo yalelikhompyutha. Uhlobo oyenzayo njengekhophi lokuqala lithwala ithegi layo efayeleni lesakhiwo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-BimCraft ayinayo i-precision setting, ngakho akukho inqubomgomo yokunemba lapha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsakhiwo esiqalwe kusuka kwethempulethi sithatha izitezi nezishidi zethempulethi. Inqubomgomo yohlobo lodonga neyeyunithi isasebenza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVala i-add-on bese konke kubuyela kokuzenzakalelayo kwe-BimCraft. Izinqubomgomo zakho ziyagcinwa uyivula futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Tshela i-BimCraft ukuthi yini isakhiwo esisha okufanele siqale ngayo, ukuze akekho ehhovisi oyodinga ukushintsha izinto ezifanayo njalo. Lesi yi-add-on: ivaliwe size usivule, futhi inqubomgomo ongayisethi ishiya izinga le-BimCraft njengoba linjalo. Lezi zinqubomgomo zokuzenzakalela zezakhiwo ezisha nezinto ezisha. Iphrojekthi osuke uyiqalile ayishintshwa. Izinyathelo Vula Izilungiselelo, uye ku-Okwengeziwe bese uvula Izinqubomgomo zokuzenzakalela. Ku-Izilungiselelo, vula ithebhu ye-BimCraft bese ukhetha Izinqubomgomo zokuzenzakalela ohlwini oluseceleni. Setha izinqubomgomo ofuna. Ngayinye iqala ku-eyeBimCraft, nalokho okukuphakathi kwamabhulaketi. Inqubomgomo enebhokisi elithi Metric nelithi Imperial ithatha inani elilodwa ngohlobo ngalunye lweprojekthi; gcwalisa ezidingekayo kuphela. Ayikho inkinobho yokugcina: ushintsho ngalunye lugcinwa njengoba ulenza. Inani elingasetshenziswa liyenqatshwa ngamazwi futhi elidala lihlala. Cofa Isakhiwo esisha. Ifomu igcwaliswa ngezinqubomgomo zakho, futhi ngayinye inqubomgomo oyisethile ithi kusuka kuzinqubomgomo zakho zokuzenzakalela eduze kwayo. Ungazishintsha noma yiziphi ngaphambi kwe-Dala. Izinqubomgomo Iyunithi yesakhiwo esisha: iyunithi ishintshela kulokhu lapho ucofa u-Dala. Inani lezitezi, Amagama ezitezi kanye Ukuphakama kwesitezi. Egameni, {n} ibala 1, 2, 3; {n0} ibala 0, 1, 2; {nn} no-{nn0} benza okufanayo ngezinombolo ezimbili. Ngakho Isitezi {nn0} sinikeza Isitezi 00, Isitezi 01, Isitezi 02. Uhlobo lokuqala lodonga: okudwetshwa yithuluzi lodonga kuqala. Ihhovisi le-metric lingaqala nge-Exterior masonry 300 mm, kanti amaphrojekthi e-imperial agcine i-Exterior 2×6. Ithegi le-LOD kuzinhlobo zodonga zokuqala: izinga lokuthuthukiswa (LOD 100 kuya ku-500) uhlobo lwezakhiwo lwesishiyagalolunye olubonisa noma yikuphi lapho uhlobo lubhalwe khona. Bona Akha izinhlanganisela zodonga. LOD yohlobo lodonga olusha olwenziwe: ithegi uhlobo olusha oluqala ngalo kumhleli wohlobo. Ungayishintsha lapho. Ishidi lokuqala: iphepha lalo, isikali, inombolo yeshidi negama (sebenzisa {level} ukuthola igama lesitezi esiphansi kakhulu), noma akukho shidi lokuqala ngokuphelele. Usayizi wezichasiso ephepheni (Izilungiselelo › Global › Izinqubomgomo zokuzenzakalela): ukuphakama kwehhovisi, ngamamillimitha njengoba kushicilelwe, kwamanothi, umbhalo wesilinganiso, amathegi, amagama amagumbi, izinhlamvu zamabhamuza egridi, amagama emibono nombhalo wohlu. Isakhiwo esisha siyawathatha ngoku-Dala futhi siwagcina efayelini yaso. Bona Dweba ngosayizi ogcwele, uchaze ngesikali. Ithuluzi elisebenzayo ngemva kuka-Dala: Khetha, njengoba i-BimCraft ikwenza yodwa, noma Udonga, ukuze ukucofa okubili kokuqala kupulani kudwebe udonga ngokuqondile. Ukuhlelwa kohlu: umgomo wehhovisi Ku-Izilungiselelo › Global › Izinqubomgomo zokuzenzakalela, ngaphansi kwe-Ukuhlelwa kohlu (umgomo wehhovisi), setha ukuthi yonke uhlu luhlelwa kanjani, ukuthi luneziqephu nesamba yini, isihloko sawo nokuthi amakholomu anezinhloko zethe kanjani. Yonke uhlu olungachazi lwayo luyawuthatha, noma ngubani ohlela. Bona Hlela, gcina futhi uthumele uhlu. Yabelana ngazo ehhovisi Ku-Izilungiselelo, vula ithebhu ye-Global bese ukhetha Izinqubomgomo zokuzenzakalela. Bhala Igama lehhovisi uma uthanda. Libhalwa efayeleni. Cofa Gcina efayeleni. Uthola ifayela elincane elibiza ngokuthi .ccdefaults.json. Kwenye ikhompyutha, vula i-add-on, vula indawo efanayo bese ucofa Layisha kusuka efayeleni. Izinqubomgomo zefayela ziyathatha indawo yezalapho kulelo khompyutha. Ithebhu ye-Global nayo inohlelo lwamayunithi weprojekthi emisha, olusebenza kuzo zonke izinhlelo ezinalo i-add-on, kanye ne-Setha kabusha zonke izinqubomgomo. I-Setha kabusha kuzenzakalelo lwe-BimCraft kuthebhu ye-BimCraft isula ezeBimCraft kuphela. Okufanele ukwazi Ifayela liyi-JSON evulekile, elula: uhlu lwamagama enqubomgomo namanani. Inqubomgomo ifayela elayichaza engaziwa yile nguqulo ishiywa ngaphandle futhi ichazwe emyalezweni; ezinye zona ziyalayisha. Izinqubomgomo zigcinwa kulesi siphequluli, kuzo zonke izinhlelo ze-CadCraft kuleli khompyutha. Azigcinwa efayeleni lesakhiwo, futhi azihlanganiswa phakathi kwamakhompyutha: sebenzisa ifayela. Ithegi le-LOD kuhlobo lokuqala livela kunqubomgomo yalelikhompyutha. Uhlobo oyenzayo njengekhophi lokuqala lithwala ithegi layo efayeleni lesakhiwo. I-BimCraft ayinayo i-precision setting, ngakho akukho inqubomgomo yokunemba lapha. Isakhiwo esiqalwe kusuka kwethempulethi sithatha izitezi nezishidi zethempulethi. Inqubomgomo yohlobo lodonga neyeyunithi isasebenza. Vala i-add-on bese konke kubuyela kokuzenzakalelayo kwe-BimCraft. Izinqubomgomo zakho ziyagcinwa uyivula futhi.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"draw-walls","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Dweba izindonga","summary":"Dweba izindonga epulanini lezinga ngokuchofoza amakhona abo noma ngokuthayipha amabanga; amakhona ajoyina ngokwawo, izindonga zigcinwa njenge-IFC.","section":"tasks","order":16,"keywords":["ejikiyo","umnsalo","umugqa wendawo","ukulinganisa","udonga","izindonga","dweba","ipulani","ipulani yesakhiwo","igumbi","ikhona","joyina","uhlobo lodonga","2x6","2x4","cmu","ukhonkolo","ukuphakama","izinga","amazinga","isitezi","ubude obuthayipha","ortho","ukunamathela"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"vula-ipulani","text":"Vula ipulani","level":2},{"id":"dweba-igumbi","text":"Dweba igumbi","level":2},{"id":"khetha-isithombe-sokudweba","text":"Khetha isithombe sokudweba","level":2},{"id":"umugqa-wendawo","text":"Umugqa wendawo","level":2},{"id":"dweba-udonga-oluqhathaniswe","text":"Dweba udonga oluqhathaniswe","level":2},{"id":"thayipha-ubude-esikhundleni-sokuchofoza","text":"Thayipha ubude esikhundleni sokuchofoza","level":2},{"id":"izinamathisi","text":"Izinamathisi","level":2},{"id":"shintsha-hlehlisa-susa","text":"Shintsha, hlehlisa, susa","level":2},{"id":"amazinga","text":"Amazinga","level":2},{"id":"gcina","text":"Gcina","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukwazi","text":"Okufanele ukwazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDweba izindonga zesakhiwo epulanini lalo lezinga ngalinye. Chofoza lapho udonga luqala khona, bese uchofoza ikhona ngalinye; BimCraft ijoyina amakhona ngokwayo, inikeze udonga ngalunye izingqimba zalo (ukugqoka, ukumboza, izinsika, udonga lwebhodi …) futhi ilikhuphule kuze kufike esitezini esingaphezulu. Ukubuka kwe-3D kubonisa izindonga njengoba udweba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vula-ipulani\"\u003EVula ipulani\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQala isakhiwo esisha (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/start-a-new-building\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/start-a-new-building\"\u003EQala isakhiwo esisha\u003C/a\u003E) noma vula imodeli ye-IFC.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw\u003C/span\u003E kwithuluzi. Isakhiwo esisha sivulwa sesivulekile ngokwaso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIpulani yezinga ibonakala ngakwesokunxele, nokubuka kwe-3D ngakwesokudla. Khetha izinga ohlwini oluphezulu kwipulani, noma ngenkinobho eyindilinga eseceleni kwalo kuphaneli \u003Cstrong\u003EAmazinga\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlan\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESplit\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E ngamathuluzi aseqenjini \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView\u003C/span\u003E ethulusini (imiyalo PLAN, SPLIT nezinkinobho zisasebenza njengakuqala). Sebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlan\u003C/span\u003E ukubona ipulani yodwa, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESplit\u003C/span\u003E ukubona kokubili, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E ukuvala ipulani. Uma iwindi linqunyiwe (noma usayizi wesixhumanisi mkhulu), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESplit\u003C/span\u003E ibeka ipulani phezulu kokubuka kwe-3D esikhundleni sokuba eceleni kwakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIpulani inquma izinga ngo-4&#039;-0&quot; (1200 mm) ngaphezulu kwesakhiwo salo, njengoba kwenziwa ipulani yokwakha. Skrola ukuze usondeze; hudula ngokuchofoza inkinobho ephakathi noma yesokudla (noma ubambe \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uhudule) ukuze ushelelise; uma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E ivulekile, ukuhudula okujwayelekile nakho kuyashelelisa. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ngesikhombi phezu kwepulani kuyayilinganisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dweba-igumbi\"\u003EDweba igumbi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWall\u003C/span\u003E (noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha uhlobo lodonga ohlwini lokuqala, isibonelo \u003Cstrong\u003EExterior 2×6\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003EInterior 2×4\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha ukuphakama kwalo: \u003Cstrong\u003EKuze kube esitezini esingaphezulu\u003C/strong\u003E (udonga luyalandela uma leso sitezi sinyakaza), \u003Cstrong\u003EKuze kube\u003C/strong\u003E izinga eliphakeme kakhulu ngodonga oludlula ezingqimbeni eziningi (indawo yokwehla, igumbi elinobude obuphindwe kabili, igable ephakeme), noma \u003Cstrong\u003EUkuphakama okumisiwe\u003C/strong\u003E bese uthayipha kona. Udonga olunjalo luyingxenye yesitezi owadwebe kuso; amapulani ezinga adlula kuwo awubonisa ngokukhanya okuncane, amagumbi lapho avalelana nawo, futhi ungachofoza izimnyango namawindi ngawo kulawo mapulani (umnyango umi phezu kwephansi lalelo zinga). Ukuze uhambise noma ushintshe ushebe walo udonga ngokwalo, iya esitezini oqala kulo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza lapho udonga lokuqala luqala khona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ikhona ngalinye. Ukuchofoza ngakunye kwenza udonga; udonga olulandelayo luqala lapho owedlule ephela khona. Ubude nokuguquka kwe-engeli kubonakala eduze kwesikhombi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza iphoyinti lokuqala futhi ukuvala igumbi. Umugqa wesimo utshela ukuthi igumbi linezindonga ezingaki, futhi ngemodi yomugqa wephakathi, udonga ngalunye luthola ungqimba lwalo lwangaphandle ngaphandle kwegumbi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (noma chofoza ngesokudla, noma chofoza kabili) ukuze umise ngaphandle kokuvala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmakhona ajoyina ngokwawo: izindonga ezimbili zihlangana ngomthamo we-mitre, udonga oluphela kolunye lumi ngobuso balo (i-T), nezindonga ezintathu noma ngaphezulu endaweni eyodwa zabelana ngekhona. Izindonga ezidlula ngaphakathi kwezinye ziyashiywa njengoba zinjalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIgumbi lonke ngasikhathi sinye: vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShapes\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uthole irektangela, irektangela ejikiyo, ipholigoni, imijikelezo, izindonga emigqeni ekhethiwe noma emkhawulweni ojikijelwe (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/wall-tools\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/wall-tools\"\u003EIzimo zodonga, ukuhlukanisa, ukubeka phezu, ukweluleka nokukhiya\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khetha-isithombe-sokudweba\"\u003EKhetha isithombe sokudweba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003ECenterline\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EInside face\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003EOutside face\u003C/strong\u003E ngaphambi kokuchofoza kokuqala. Uma kukhethwe ubuso, ukuchofoza kwakho nobude othayipha kuchaza lobo buso; BimCraft ishintsha umugqa wephakathi wodonga ngesigamu sobukhulu obuphelele futhi ijoyina amakhona alandelanayo. Khetha \u003Cstrong\u003EOutside on left\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003EOutside on right\u003C/strong\u003E ngokuhambisana nendlela odweba ngayo. Ukuze uhlaka oluvaliwe udwetshwe ngokuphambene nokushintsha kwewashi, ingaphandle lisesokudla; ngokushintsha kwewashi, lisekhohlo. Ngo-\u003Cstrong\u003EInside face\u003C/strong\u003E umzimba wodonga uya ohlangothini lwangaphandle lomugqa wakho; nge-\u003Cstrong\u003EOutside face\u003C/strong\u003E, ngakolunye uhlangothi. Ukudweba ngobuso kugcina uhlangothi lwangaphandle oluzikhethele uma uvala umjikelezo. Emugqeni wephakathi, izindonga ezingavali igumbi zithatha uhlangothi lwangaphandle olukhethiwe; ukuvala igumbi kubeka wonke udonga ngaphandle kwegumbi ngokwawo, noma udwebe ngayiphi indlela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkushintsha uhlobo lodonga, isithombe noma uhlangothi lwangaphandle kuqeda ucingo lwamanje. Eduze kwekhona elibuyela emuva, ama-mitre amade amiswa ngokushiya izimbobo ezisikwe ngesikwele.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgenkathi udweba, iphoyinti eliphelayo endaweni engenalutho lingalinganiswa ngokuthi lilingane ngokuvundlile noma ngokuthi lilingane nesiphetho sodonga noma nekhona langaphambili. Umugqa onamachashaza uxhumanisa leliphoyinti nesikhombi esinamathelisiwe. Shift igcina indlela yokudweba ilingana; ukulinganisa kuyeka ngaleyo ndlela. Amaphoyinti aseduze, izimaphakathi nezinqamuleli zezindonga zithatha ukubaluleka kunokulinganisa okukude.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"umugqa-wendawo\"\u003EUmugqa wendawo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma \u003Cstrong\u003EReference\u003C/strong\u003E isethelwe ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EOutside face\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003EInside face\u003C/strong\u003E, udonga ugcina lobo buso njengomugqa wendawo walo. Kamuva, uma udonga lunqenqema noma uhlangothi lwalo lwangaphandle luphenduliwe, lobo buso luhlala lapho bukhona futhi udonga lukhula noma luphenduke ngalo. Udonga oluqondile oluhlangana nalo ekhoneni luyalandela, ngakho ikhona liyavaleka. Ungashintsha umugqa wendawo kamuva ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EProperties\u003C/strong\u003E: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/change-a-wall-or-door\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/change-a-wall-or-door\"\u003EShintsha udonga, umnyango noma iwindi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dweba-udonga-oluqhathaniswe\"\u003EDweba udonga oluqhathaniswe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWall\u003C/span\u003E, bese ukhetha \u003Cstrong\u003ECurved\u003C/strong\u003E ohlwini \u003Cstrong\u003EShape\u003C/strong\u003E somugqa wezinketho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza lapho udonga luqala khona, bese lapho luphela khona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza iphoyinti emjikelezweni walo. Noma thayipha ukuphakama kwejika bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUchungechunge luqhubeka emagameni alo udonga. Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze uliqede.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUdonga oluqhathaniswe lujoyina izindonga ezikuphelo zalo (amakhona nokujoyina okuyi-T kuyasebenza), lenza amagumbi, futhi lubambe izimnyango namawindi eduze komjikelezo walo. Ayisekho ngokuqondile, ilingana nodonga emaphakathini ayo, futhi ibanga layo lilinganiswa emjikelezweni. Udonga lungaphenduka okungenani amakota amathathu omjikelezo. Lulingana neziphetho zalo nephakathi lomjikelezo wayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkungakakhiwa ngodonga oluqhathaniswe: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETrim / extend\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECorner\u003C/span\u003E, ukwakha ifreyimu, izilinganiso zepulani ezizenzakalelayo nokulinganisa emjikelezweni. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EOkungakakhiwa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"thayipha-ubude-esikhundleni-sokuchofoza\"\u003EThayipha ubude esikhundleni sokuchofoza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgemva kokuchofoza kokuqala, thayipha bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EThayipha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIdweba\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E3810\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eudonga olunobude obufanayo, ngendlela isikhombi esiyibonisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot;&lt;90\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eobude obufanayo, ngale ngu-engeli (amadigri, kuya ngakwesobunxele ngokushintsha kwewashi kusuka kwesokudla)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E@3000,0\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekuleliphoyinti elikude kangaka nelokugcina, ngokuqondile nangaphezulu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1200,3400\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekuleliphoyinti epulanini\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuthayipha inombolo ngenkathi ithuluzi lika-Wall livulekile kuya ngqo ebhokisini le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELength\u003C/span\u003E. Ngamafithi namainshi, inombolo engenalutho iyinshi; ngamamilimitha iyamamilimitha. Ungaphawula noma yiyiphi iyunithi: \u003Ccode\u003E3.5 m\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E10 ft\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinamathisi\"\u003EIzinamathisi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIziphetho zodonga, amakhona ezinhlangothi zalo nezimaphakathi zodonga ziyanamathela lapho isikhombi sisondele kuzo (isikwele, unxantathu).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsikhombi siyanamathela komugqa wephakathi wodonga noma kunoma yiluphi uhlangothi (isiphambano).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKusukela kwiphoyinti lokugcina, indlela ibamba njalo ngama-15° uma iseduze; bamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze ibambe ku-0°, 90°, 180° noma 270°.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzindlela ezikhululekile zizungeza ubude ku-1/2&quot; (noma ku-10 mm).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shintsha-hlehlisa-susa\"\u003EShintsha, hlehlisa, susa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUdonga ngalunye lulinyathelo elilodwa ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinguquko\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E buyisela izindonga emuva bese ziphinde ziyabuyela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E ivulekile, chofoza udonga epulanini ukuze ukhethe; ukubuka kwe-3D no-\u003Cstrong\u003EProperties\u003C/strong\u003E kulandela. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E isusa izindonga ezikhethiwe, bese izindonga abazijoyine zihlanzwa futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amazinga\"\u003EAmazinga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIpaneli ye-\u003Cstrong\u003EAmazinga\u003C/strong\u003E ibala onke amazinga kanye nokuphakama kwawo nobude bawo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThayipha igama elisha, ukuphakama noma ubude bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Ukushintsha ukuphakama (noma ubude) kwezinga kuhambisa amazinga aphezulu ngalo mbala, nezindonga ezikhuphuka kuze kufike ezingeni ziyalandela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a level on top\u003C/span\u003E yengeza izinga phezu kwelisezingeni eliphezulu, elifana nalo ngobude.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a level below\u003C/span\u003E yengeza izinga ngaphansi kwelisezingeni eliphansi (iseli), elifana nalo ngobude: ukuphakama kwalo kuba negative uma izinga eliphansi lisesingeni le-0, futhi awekho amanye amazinga ahamba. Undo iyasisusa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy this level…\u003C/span\u003E idweba kabusha okusesingeni olibukayo ezingeni elinye, noma esingeni elisha phezulu: izindonga zalo nezimnyango namawindi azo, amaphansi nezingqimba (hhayi okhuni). Izindonga ezikhuphuka kuze kufike esingeni elingaphezulu ziyakhuphuka kuze kufike esingeni elingaphezulu kwelisha; amagumbi avela ngokwawo. Eyodwa i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E iyabuyisela konke emuva. Uma elinye izinga selinezindonga, ikhophi iyengezwa kuzo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnits\u003C/span\u003E ethulusini ikhetha iyunithi (amafithi namainshi, amainshi, amafithi ayizinkomba, amamilimitha, amasentimitha noma amamitha) kukho konke ithuluzi lokudweba elikubonisayo nalifunda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gcina\"\u003EGcina\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave as IFC\u003C/span\u003E. Udonga ngalunye lutholakala njenge-IFC wall ngomugqa wawo wephakathi, ukwakheka kwawo okujoyiniwe, uhlobo lwawo nezingqimba zawo, \u003Ccode\u003EPset_WallCommon\u003C/code\u003E nezilinganiso eziyisisekelo (ubude, ukuphakama, izindawo nevolumu), ukuze ezinye izinhlelo ze-BIM zivule futhi zihlele.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukwazi\"\u003EOkufanele ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzindonga zidwetshwa emugqeni wazo wephakathi. Ukuqina kuvela ohlotsheni lodonga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIpulani ibonisa izindonga ezidwetshwe lapha zigcwele, nakho konke okunye (izinto zethala, amamodeli avela kwezinye izinhlelo) kunqunywe indiza efanayo, nalokho okusezansi kokusikwa kubonakala ngemigqa emincane.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzindonga ezenziwe ezinye izinhlelo zibonakala epulanini kodwa azikwazi ukushintshwa ngalawa mathuluzi okwamanje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Dweba izindonga zesakhiwo epulanini lalo lezinga ngalinye. Chofoza lapho udonga luqala khona, bese uchofoza ikhona ngalinye; BimCraft ijoyina amakhona ngokwayo, inikeze udonga ngalunye izingqimba zalo (ukugqoka, ukumboza, izinsika, udonga lwebhodi …) futhi ilikhuphule kuze kufike esitezini esingaphezulu. Ukubuka kwe-3D kubonisa izindonga njengoba udweba. Vula ipulani Qala isakhiwo esisha (Qala isakhiwo esisha) noma vula imodeli ye-IFC. Chofoza Draw kwithuluzi. Isakhiwo esisha sivulwa sesivulekile ngokwaso. Ipulani yezinga ibonakala ngakwesokunxele, nokubuka kwe-3D ngakwesokudla. Khetha izinga ohlwini oluphezulu kwipulani, noma ngenkinobho eyindilinga eseceleni kwalo kuphaneli Amazinga. Plan, Split no-3D ngamathuluzi aseqenjini View ethulusini (imiyalo PLAN, SPLIT nezinkinobho zisasebenza njengakuqala). Sebenzisa Plan ukubona ipulani yodwa, Split ukubona kokubili, 3D ukuvala ipulani. Uma iwindi linqunyiwe (noma usayizi wesixhumanisi mkhulu), Split ibeka ipulani phezulu kokubuka kwe-3D esikhundleni sokuba eceleni kwakho. Ipulani inquma izinga ngo-4'-0\" (1200 mm) ngaphezulu kwesakhiwo salo, njengoba kwenziwa ipulani yokwakha. Skrola ukuze usondeze; hudula ngokuchofoza inkinobho ephakathi noma yesokudla (noma ubambe Space uhudule) ukuze ushelelise; uma Select ivulekile, ukuhudula okujwayelekile nakho kuyashelelisa. F ngesikhombi phezu kwepulani kuyayilinganisa. Dweba igumbi Chofoza Wall (noma cindezela W). Khetha uhlobo lodonga ohlwini lokuqala, isibonelo Exterior 2×6 noma Interior 2×4. Khetha ukuphakama kwalo: Kuze kube esitezini esingaphezulu (udonga luyalandela uma leso sitezi sinyakaza), Kuze kube izinga eliphakeme kakhulu ngodonga oludlula ezingqimbeni eziningi (indawo yokwehla, igumbi elinobude obuphindwe kabili, igable ephakeme), noma Ukuphakama okumisiwe bese uthayipha kona. Udonga olunjalo luyingxenye yesitezi owadwebe kuso; amapulani ezinga adlula kuwo awubonisa ngokukhanya okuncane, amagumbi lapho avalelana nawo, futhi ungachofoza izimnyango namawindi ngawo kulawo mapulani (umnyango umi phezu kwephansi lalelo zinga). Ukuze uhambise noma ushintshe ushebe walo udonga ngokwalo, iya esitezini oqala kulo. Chofoza lapho udonga lokuqala luqala khona. Chofoza ikhona ngalinye. Ukuchofoza ngakunye kwenza udonga; udonga olulandelayo luqala lapho owedlule ephela khona. Ubude nokuguquka kwe-engeli kubonakala eduze kwesikhombi. Chofoza iphoyinti lokuqala futhi ukuvala igumbi. Umugqa wesimo utshela ukuthi igumbi linezindonga ezingaki, futhi ngemodi yomugqa wephakathi, udonga ngalunye luthola ungqimba lwalo lwangaphandle ngaphandle kwegumbi. Cindezela Esc (noma chofoza ngesokudla, noma chofoza kabili) ukuze umise ngaphandle kokuvala. Amakhona ajoyina ngokwawo: izindonga ezimbili zihlangana ngomthamo we-mitre, udonga oluphela kolunye lumi ngobuso balo (i-T), nezindonga ezintathu noma ngaphezulu endaweni eyodwa zabelana ngekhona. Izindonga ezidlula ngaphakathi kwezinye ziyashiywa njengoba zinjalo. Igumbi lonke ngasikhathi sinye: vula Shapes ukuze uthole irektangela, irektangela ejikiyo, ipholigoni, imijikelezo, izindonga emigqeni ekhethiwe noma emkhawulweni ojikijelwe (bona Izimo zodonga, ukuhlukanisa, ukubeka phezu, ukweluleka nokukhiya). Khetha isithombe sokudweba Khetha Centerline, Inside face noma Outside face ngaphambi kokuchofoza kokuqala. Uma kukhethwe ubuso, ukuchofoza kwakho nobude othayipha kuchaza lobo buso; BimCraft ishintsha umugqa wephakathi wodonga ngesigamu sobukhulu obuphelele futhi ijoyina amakhona alandelanayo. Khetha Outside on left noma Outside on right ngokuhambisana nendlela odweba ngayo. Ukuze uhlaka oluvaliwe udwetshwe ngokuphambene nokushintsha kwewashi, ingaphandle lisesokudla; ngokushintsha kwewashi, lisekhohlo. Ngo-Inside face umzimba wodonga uya ohlangothini lwangaphandle lomugqa wakho; nge-Outside face, ngakolunye uhlangothi. Ukudweba ngobuso kugcina uhlangothi lwangaphandle oluzikhethele uma uvala umjikelezo. Emugqeni wephakathi, izindonga ezingavali igumbi zithatha uhlangothi lwangaphandle olukhethiwe; ukuvala igumbi kubeka wonke udonga ngaphandle kwegumbi ngokwawo, noma udwebe ngayiphi indlela. Ukushintsha uhlobo lodonga, isithombe noma uhlangothi lwangaphandle kuqeda ucingo lwamanje. Eduze kwekhona elibuyela emuva, ama-mitre amade amiswa ngokushiya izimbobo ezisikwe ngesikwele. Ngenkathi udweba, iphoyinti eliphelayo endaweni engenalutho lingalinganiswa ngokuthi lilingane ngokuvundlile noma ngokuthi lilingane nesiphetho sodonga noma nekhona langaphambili. Umugqa onamachashaza uxhumanisa leliphoyinti nesikhombi esinamathelisiwe. Shift igcina indlela yokudweba ilingana; ukulinganisa kuyeka ngaleyo ndlela. Amaphoyinti aseduze, izimaphakathi nezinqamuleli zezindonga zithatha ukubaluleka kunokulinganisa okukude. Umugqa wendawo Uma Reference isethelwe ku-Outside face noma Inside face, udonga ugcina lobo buso njengomugqa wendawo walo. Kamuva, uma udonga lunqenqema noma uhlangothi lwalo lwangaphandle luphenduliwe, lobo buso luhlala lapho bukhona futhi udonga lukhula noma luphenduke ngalo. Udonga oluqondile oluhlangana nalo ekhoneni luyalandela, ngakho ikhona liyavaleka. Ungashintsha umugqa wendawo kamuva ku-Properties: bona Shintsha udonga, umnyango noma iwindi. Dweba udonga oluqhathaniswe Chofoza Wall, bese ukhetha Curved ohlwini Shape somugqa wezinketho. Chofoza lapho udonga luqala khona, bese lapho luphela khona. Chofoza iphoyinti emjikelezweni walo. Noma thayipha ukuphakama kwejika bese ucindezela Enter. Uchungechunge luqhubeka emagameni alo udonga. Cindezela Esc ukuze uliqede. Udonga oluqhathaniswe lujoyina izindonga ezikuphelo zalo (amakhona nokujoyina okuyi-T kuyasebenza), lenza amagumbi, futhi lubambe izimnyango namawindi eduze komjikelezo walo. Ayisekho ngokuqondile, ilingana nodonga emaphakathini ayo, futhi ibanga layo lilinganiswa emjikelezweni. Udonga lungaphenduka okungenani amakota amathathu omjikelezo. Lulingana neziphetho zalo nephakathi lomjikelezo wayo. Okungakakhiwa ngodonga oluqhathaniswe: Trim / extend no-Corner, ukwakha ifreyimu, izilinganiso zepulani ezizenzakalelayo nokulinganisa emjikelezweni. Bona Okungakakhiwa. Thayipha ubude esikhundleni sokuchofoza Ngemva kokuchofoza kokuqala, thayipha bese ucindezela Enter: Thayipha Idweba 12'6\" noma 3810 udonga olunobude obufanayo, ngendlela isikhombi esiyibonisa 12'6\"\u003C90 obude obufanayo, ngale ngu-engeli (amadigri, kuya ngakwesobunxele ngokushintsha kwewashi kusuka kwesokudla) @3000,0 kuleliphoyinti elikude kangaka nelokugcina, ngokuqondile nangaphezulu 1200,3400 kuleliphoyinti epulanini Ukuthayipha inombolo ngenkathi ithuluzi lika-Wall livulekile kuya ngqo ebhokisini le-Length. Ngamafithi namainshi, inombolo engenalutho iyinshi; ngamamilimitha iyamamilimitha. Ungaphawula noma yiyiphi iyunithi: 3.5 m, 10 ft, 6 1/2\". Izinamathisi Iziphetho zodonga, amakhona ezinhlangothi zalo nezimaphakathi zodonga ziyanamathela lapho isikhombi sisondele kuzo (isikwele, unxantathu). Isikhombi siyanamathela komugqa wephakathi wodonga noma kunoma yiluphi uhlangothi (isiphambano). Kusukela kwiphoyinti lokugcina, indlela ibamba njalo ngama-15° uma iseduze; bamba Shift ukuze ibambe ku-0°, 90°, 180° noma 270°. Izindlela ezikhululekile zizungeza ubude ku-1/2\" (noma ku-10 mm). Shintsha, hlehlisa, susa Udonga ngalunye lulinyathelo elilodwa ku-Izinguquko: Undo no-Redo buyisela izindonga emuva bese ziphinde ziyabuyela. Uma Select ivulekile, chofoza udonga epulanini ukuze ukhethe; ukubuka kwe-3D no-Properties kulandela. Delete isusa izindonga ezikhethiwe, bese izindonga abazijoyine zihlanzwa futhi. Amazinga Ipaneli ye-Amazinga ibala onke amazinga kanye nokuphakama kwawo nobude bawo. Thayipha igama elisha, ukuphakama noma ubude bese ucindezela Enter. Ukushintsha ukuphakama (noma ubude) kwezinga kuhambisa amazinga aphezulu ngalo mbala, nezindonga ezikhuphuka kuze kufike ezingeni ziyalandela. Add a level on top yengeza izinga phezu kwelisezingeni eliphezulu, elifana nalo ngobude. Add a level below yengeza izinga ngaphansi kwelisezingeni eliphansi (iseli), elifana nalo ngobude: ukuphakama kwalo kuba negative uma izinga eliphansi lisesingeni le-0, futhi awekho amanye amazinga ahamba. Undo iyasisusa. Copy this level… idweba kabusha okusesingeni olibukayo ezingeni elinye, noma esingeni elisha phezulu: izindonga zalo nezimnyango namawindi azo, amaphansi nezingqimba (hhayi okhuni). Izindonga ezikhuphuka kuze kufike esingeni elingaphezulu ziyakhuphuka kuze kufike esingeni elingaphezulu kwelisha; amagumbi avela ngokwawo. Eyodwa i-Undo iyabuyisela konke emuva. Uma elinye izinga selinezindonga, ikhophi iyengezwa kuzo. Units ethulusini ikhetha iyunithi (amafithi namainshi, amainshi, amafithi ayizinkomba, amamilimitha, amasentimitha noma amamitha) kukho konke ithuluzi lokudweba elikubonisayo nalifunda. Gcina Chofoza Save as IFC. Udonga ngalunye lutholakala njenge-IFC wall ngomugqa wawo wephakathi, ukwakheka kwawo okujoyiniwe, uhlobo lwawo nezingqimba zawo, Pset_WallCommon nezilinganiso eziyisisekelo (ubude, ukuphakama, izindawo nevolumu), ukuze ezinye izinhlelo ze-BIM zivule futhi zihlele. Okufanele ukwazi Izindonga zidwetshwa emugqeni wazo wephakathi. Ukuqina kuvela ohlotsheni lodonga. Ipulani ibonisa izindonga ezidwetshwe lapha zigcwele, nakho konke okunye (izinto zethala, amamodeli avela kwezinye izinhlelo) kunqunywe indiza efanayo, nalokho okusezansi kokusikwa kubonakala ngemigqa emincane. Izindonga ezenziwe ezinye izinhlelo zibonakala epulanini kodwa azikwazi ukushintshwa ngalawa mathuluzi okwamanje.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"doors-and-windows","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Iminyango namafasiteli","summary":"Beka iminyango namafasiteli ezindongeni ozidwebile: phonsa udonga, bona ukuvuleka nezikhala kumakhoni, cofa; ukuvuleka kwodonga kuzisika yodwa.","section":"tasks","order":17,"keywords":["umnyango","iminyango","iwindi","amawindi","ukuvuleka","ukuvuleka kwesango","isikhwama","isandla","phendula","umnyango wokudonsa","umnyango ongenayo ukhanda","umnyango wegalaji","iminyango emibili","ifasiteli lokuvula","ifasiteli elisongwayo","ifasiteli elihlala lingavulwa","ifasiteli elidonsekayo","isihlaziyo","ikhala","ibhodi","umnyango wokuhlala","iminyango yesiFulentshi","umnyango wesibaya","izinhlangothi zomnyango","ifasiteli eliphezulu"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"beka-umnyango","text":"Beka umnyango","level":2},{"id":"beka-ifasiteli","text":"Beka ifasiteli","level":2},{"id":"hambisa-phendula-susa","text":"Hambisa, phendula, susa","level":2},{"id":"okwenqatshiwe","text":"Okwenqatshiwe","level":2},{"id":"okulondolozwayo","text":"Okulondolozwayo","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukwazi","text":"Okufanele ukwazi","level":2},{"id":"ifasiteli-lokuphuma-kwesisekelo-kanye-nomgodi","text":"Ifasiteli lokuphuma kwesisekelo kanye nomgodi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBeka iminyango namafasiteli ezindongeni ozidwebile (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/draw-walls\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/draw-walls\"\u003EDweba izindonga\u003C/a\u003E). Phonsa udonga bese umnyango noma ifasiteli kukhombisa lapho kungahle kuhlale khona, lapho kuvuleka khona nokuthi kukhashelwe kangakanani kuwo wonke amakhoni. Cofa, bese ukuvuleka kusika kuzo udonga kwipulani nakwi-3D.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beka-umnyango\"\u003EBeka umnyango\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDweba\u003C/span\u003E svuliwe, cofa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmnyango\u003C/span\u003E (noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha uhlobo: \u003Cstrong\u003ESingle swing door\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EDouble swing door\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ESliding door\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EPocket door\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EGarage door\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EBifold closet door\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EFrench doors\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EBarn door (on the wall)\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003EEntry door with sidelites\u003C/strong\u003E. Usayizi wawo ojwayelekile ugcwalisa \u003Cstrong\u003EW\u003C/strong\u003E no-\u003Cstrong\u003EH\u003C/strong\u003E; khetha esinye kuhlu lwezinhlobo eduze kwawo, noma uthayipha omunye, umzekelo \u003Ccode\u003E2&#039;-8&quot;\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E800\u003C/code\u003E. Uhlu lunikeza nemindeni yeminyango yalo modeli (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/families\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/families\"\u003EImindeni nezinhlobo zayo\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPhonsa udonga. Isimo sommnyango silandela iphoyinti ngomugqa wodonga, nebanga kusuka kwelinye lamaphethelo alobo buso libonakala kupulani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmnyango uvulwa ngohlangothi lodonga iphoyinti elikulo. Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"H\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (noma cofa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhendula\u003C/span\u003E) ukuze ubeke amakhanda ekugcineni kwelinye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECofa. Umnyango ubekiwe kanti ithuluzi lihlala livuliwe okulandelayo. Phonsa phakathi kodonga umnyango uzizungeze.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze ubeke ngebanga elinembile, phonsa udonga eduze nekhona olilinganisa kulo, uthayiphe ibanga (umzekelo \u003Ccode\u003E2&#039;\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E600\u003C/code\u003E) bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Ibanga liphuma endaweni eseduze yobuso bodonga kuya emphethelweni womnyango.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beka-ifasiteli\"\u003EBeka ifasiteli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECofa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIwindi\u003C/span\u003E (noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"N\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha uhlobo: \u003Cstrong\u003EFixed window\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ESingle hung window\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EDouble hung window\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ECasement window\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ESliding window\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EAwning\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EPicture window\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003ETransom\u003C/strong\u003E, kanye ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EW\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EH\u003C/strong\u003E kanye ne-\u003Cstrong\u003ESill\u003C/strong\u003E (ukuphakama kwaphansi kwefasiteli ngaphezu kwefloor).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPhonsa udonga bese ucofa, noma uthayiphe ibanga bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E njengamaminyango. Ifasiteli lihlala ngaphandle kodonga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hambisa-phendula-susa\"\u003EHambisa, phendula, susa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha\u003C/span\u003E svuliwe, hudula umnyango noma ifasiteli ngodonga lwalo. Hudula kudonga olunye ukuze uwuhambise lapho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E isusa iminyango namafasiteli akhethiwe; udonga luyavaleka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuhambisa noma ukususa udonga kuhambisa noma kususe okusemkhatsini walo. Uma ukuqala kodonga kuhamba ngomugqa walo, iminyango namafasiteli ayo kugcina indawo yawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlehlisa\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhinda wenze\u003C/span\u003E bathatha ngayinye ukubeka, ukuhamba noma ukususa emuva nasembhalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okwenqatshiwe\"\u003EOkwenqatshiwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkulingani kulowo donga.\u003C/strong\u003E Umnyango noma ifasiteli kubanzi kunodonga, noma kuzophuma ekugcineni kwalo. Zama ububanzi obuncane noma udonga olude.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIphakeme kunodonga.\u003C/strong\u003E I-sill nobude kudlula phezulu kodonga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulondolozwayo\"\u003EOkulondolozwayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmnyango noma ifasiteli ngalinye liyi-IFC door noma window enosayizi wayo, ukusebenza kwayo (umzekelo single swing left), uhlobo lwosayizi wayo (uhlobo olulodwa ngosayizi ngamunye womndeni wawo), \u003Ccode\u003EPset_DoorCommon\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003EPset_WindowCommon\u003C/code\u003E nezinani zesisekelo, ugcwalisa ukuvuleka kwe-IFC kodonga lwalo. Indawo yesisekelo nevolumu yodonga kuyishiya ukuvuleka. Ezinye izinhlelo ze-BIM ziyivula njengomnyango odongeni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukwazi\"\u003EOkufanele ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIpulani ibonisa iminyango ivulekile ngama-90° nendlela yokuvula kwayo, iminyango esongwayo njengamaphaneli amabili, iminyango edonsekayo ingena odongeni, iminyango yegalaji njengomugqa wedashi phezulu, namafasiteli nemigqa yawo yefreyimu nengilazi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUbubanzi bungububanzi bonke befreyimu; ilimu lomnyango liyababanzi obuyisishiyagalombili kubhedu ngalinye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkukopisha iminyango namafasiteli adwetshwe akuqedile; beka elinye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ifasiteli-lokuphuma-kwesisekelo-kanye-nomgodi\"\u003EIfasiteli lokuphuma kwesisekelo kanye nomgodi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EBasement egress with well\u003C/strong\u003E ohlwini lwezinhlobo zamafasiteli. Iqala njenge-casement engu-36 × 48 inch enesill engu-36 inch ngaphezu kwezinga. Umgodi usecaleni langaphandle kodonga, nobubanzi bokucacile obungaphansi kwe-48 inch, ukuphuma kwe-36 inch, nesisekelo esingu-6 inch ngaphansi kwe-sill. Ubonakala njengemigqa emincane ku-plan nanjengezinhlangothi ezintathu ezivulekile phezulu ku-3D. Umgodi uyingxenye ye-IFC body yefasiteli, ngakho ukugcina, ukuhambisa, ukushintsha usayizi noma ukususa ifasiteli kuyawuhambisa nawo. Ukushintsha usayizi kugcina okungenani i-6 inch ecaleni kwe-jamb ngayinye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELezi yizinombolo zokwakha ezizenzakalelayo, hhayi ukuqinisekiswa kokuthobela ukuphuma kwesisekelo. Hlola ngokwahlukana ukuvuleka okuchazwe ngumkhiqizi, izimo zendawo, ukuphansi komhlabathi, ukudonswa kwamanzi nanoma yiliphi iladi elidingekayo. Ukujula nobude womgodi kuyizilinganiso ezisetshenziswe ngaphambili; azilandeli ubuso bomhlaba.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Beka iminyango namafasiteli ezindongeni ozidwebile (Dweba izindonga). Phonsa udonga bese umnyango noma ifasiteli kukhombisa lapho kungahle kuhlale khona, lapho kuvuleka khona nokuthi kukhashelwe kangakanani kuwo wonke amakhoni. Cofa, bese ukuvuleka kusika kuzo udonga kwipulani nakwi-3D. Beka umnyango Ngo-Dweba svuliwe, cofa Umnyango (noma cindezela D). Khetha uhlobo: Single swing door, Double swing door, Sliding door, Pocket door, Garage door, Bifold closet door, French doors, Barn door (on the wall) noma Entry door with sidelites. Usayizi wawo ojwayelekile ugcwalisa W no-H; khetha esinye kuhlu lwezinhlobo eduze kwawo, noma uthayipha omunye, umzekelo 2'-8\" noma 800. Uhlu lunikeza nemindeni yeminyango yalo modeli (bona Imindeni nezinhlobo zayo). Phonsa udonga. Isimo sommnyango silandela iphoyinti ngomugqa wodonga, nebanga kusuka kwelinye lamaphethelo alobo buso libonakala kupulani. Umnyango uvulwa ngohlangothi lodonga iphoyinti elikulo. Cindezela H (noma cofa Phendula) ukuze ubeke amakhanda ekugcineni kwelinye. Cofa. Umnyango ubekiwe kanti ithuluzi lihlala livuliwe okulandelayo. Phonsa phakathi kodonga umnyango uzizungeze. Ukuze ubeke ngebanga elinembile, phonsa udonga eduze nekhona olilinganisa kulo, uthayiphe ibanga (umzekelo 2' noma 600) bese ucindezela Enter. Ibanga liphuma endaweni eseduze yobuso bodonga kuya emphethelweni womnyango. Beka ifasiteli Cofa Iwindi (noma cindezela N). Khetha uhlobo: Fixed window, Single hung window, Double hung window, Casement window, Sliding window, Awning, Picture window noma Transom, kanye ne-W, H kanye ne-Sill (ukuphakama kwaphansi kwefasiteli ngaphezu kwefloor). Phonsa udonga bese ucofa, noma uthayiphe ibanga bese ucindezela Enter njengamaminyango. Ifasiteli lihlala ngaphandle kodonga. Hambisa, phendula, susa Ngo-Khetha svuliwe, hudula umnyango noma ifasiteli ngodonga lwalo. Hudula kudonga olunye ukuze uwuhambise lapho. Delete isusa iminyango namafasiteli akhethiwe; udonga luyavaleka. Ukuhambisa noma ukususa udonga kuhambisa noma kususe okusemkhatsini walo. Uma ukuqala kodonga kuhamba ngomugqa walo, iminyango namafasiteli ayo kugcina indawo yawo. Hlehlisa no-Phinda wenze bathatha ngayinye ukubeka, ukuhamba noma ukususa emuva nasembhalo. Okwenqatshiwe Akulingani kulowo donga. Umnyango noma ifasiteli kubanzi kunodonga, noma kuzophuma ekugcineni kwalo. Zama ububanzi obuncane noma udonga olude. Iphakeme kunodonga. I-sill nobude kudlula phezulu kodonga. Okulondolozwayo Umnyango noma ifasiteli ngalinye liyi-IFC door noma window enosayizi wayo, ukusebenza kwayo (umzekelo single swing left), uhlobo lwosayizi wayo (uhlobo olulodwa ngosayizi ngamunye womndeni wawo), Pset_DoorCommon noma Pset_WindowCommon nezinani zesisekelo, ugcwalisa ukuvuleka kwe-IFC kodonga lwalo. Indawo yesisekelo nevolumu yodonga kuyishiya ukuvuleka. Ezinye izinhlelo ze-BIM ziyivula njengomnyango odongeni. Okufanele ukwazi Ipulani ibonisa iminyango ivulekile ngama-90° nendlela yokuvula kwayo, iminyango esongwayo njengamaphaneli amabili, iminyango edonsekayo ingena odongeni, iminyango yegalaji njengomugqa wedashi phezulu, namafasiteli nemigqa yawo yefreyimu nengilazi. Ububanzi bungububanzi bonke befreyimu; ilimu lomnyango liyababanzi obuyisishiyagalombili kubhedu ngalinye. Ukukopisha iminyango namafasiteli adwetshwe akuqedile; beka elinye. Ifasiteli lokuphuma kwesisekelo kanye nomgodi Khetha Basement egress with well ohlwini lwezinhlobo zamafasiteli. Iqala njenge-casement engu-36 × 48 inch enesill engu-36 inch ngaphezu kwezinga. Umgodi usecaleni langaphandle kodonga, nobubanzi bokucacile obungaphansi kwe-48 inch, ukuphuma kwe-36 inch, nesisekelo esingu-6 inch ngaphansi kwe-sill. Ubonakala njengemigqa emincane ku-plan nanjengezinhlangothi ezintathu ezivulekile phezulu ku-3D. Umgodi uyingxenye ye-IFC body yefasiteli, ngakho ukugcina, ukuhambisa, ukushintsha usayizi noma ukususa ifasiteli kuyawuhambisa nawo. Ukushintsha usayizi kugcina okungenani i-6 inch ecaleni kwe-jamb ngayinye. Lezi yizinombolo zokwakha ezizenzakalelayo, hhayi ukuqinisekiswa kokuthobela ukuphuma kwesisekelo. Hlola ngokwahlukana ukuvuleka okuchazwe ngumkhiqizi, izimo zendawo, ukuphansi komhlabathi, ukudonswa kwamanzi nanoma yiliphi iladi elidingekayo. Ukujula nobude womgodi kuyizilinganiso ezisetshenziswe ngaphambili; azilandeli ubuso bomhlaba.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"wall-tools","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Imumo yodonga, ukuhlukanisa, ukuhlukanisa ngaphandle, ukweluleka nokukhulula","summary":"Dweba izindonga njengesikwele, ipholigoni, ingxenye yesiyingi, emigqeni etholakalayo noma ezungeze umphetho; zihlukanise, zisuse ingxenye, zihlukanise ngaphandle, zelule ngebhokisi, zihlanganise bese uzikhiya ndawonye, nesilinganiso noma nomugqa wegridi. Konke ukushintsha kugcina izindonga zixhumene futhi kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa.","section":"tasks","order":17,"keywords":["shintsha uhlobo","shintsha uhlobo","ukubuyisa","kwashintsha ini","lod","izinga lokuthuthukiswa","uhlobo lokuhlanganisa","mitre","miter","butt","square off","ukuhlangana kwezindonga","okulandelayo","kudlula","vimba ukuhlangana","vumela ukuhlangana","ukubaluleka kwezendlalelo","ingaphakathi","ukubaluleka","ukuhlangana","isikwele","isikwele esijikelezayo","ipholigoni","ngaphakathi","ngaphandle","ingxenye yesiyingi","ithanjiswa","ukubhala","umugqa ophakathi","imigqa ekhethiwe","thebhu","ukulandela","umphetho","umpheki","ukuhlukanisa","hlukanisa ngegebe","igebe","susa ingxenye","hlanganisa kabusha","ukuhlukanisa","ikhophi","elula ibhokisi","umncele","ukuhlanganisa","ukuvala","ukukhiya","ukukhiya kwegridi","isilinganiso sokukhiya","ukuhlaziya","ukuhlehlisa","ukuma","usondo","ukuhamba kwegridi","ukugcwala","bamba ubukhulu","akuxhumanga","ukuma ngaphandle","ukuqala ngaphezu","ukulinganisa kusukela","umugqa wengaphakathi","ubuso bangaphakathi","ubuso bangaphandle","ukuhlukanisa ukuxhumana","i-alt"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"dweba-isikwele-ipholigoni-noma-ingxenye-yesiyingi","text":"Dweba isikwele, ipholigoni noma ingxenye yesiyingi","level":2},{"id":"izindonga-emigqeni-osunayo","text":"Izindonga emigqeni osunayo","level":2},{"id":"setha-ngaphambi-kokudweba-ukuhlukanisa-nokuhlanganisa","text":"Setha ngaphambi kokudweba: ukuhlukanisa nokuhlanganisa","level":2},{"id":"hlukanisa-susa-ingxenye-hlanganisa-kabusha","text":"Hlukanisa, susa ingxenye, hlanganisa kabusha","level":2},{"id":"uhlobo-lokuhlangana-disallow-join-ukubaluleka-kwezendlalelo","text":"Uhlobo lokuhlangana, Disallow join, ukubaluleka kwezendlalelo","level":2},{"id":"shintsha-uhlobo-lwezindonga-eziningi","text":"Shintsha uhlobo lwezindonga eziningi","level":2},{"id":"ukuhlukanisa-ngaphandle-kanye-nokweluleka-ngebhokisi","text":"Ukuhlukanisa ngaphandle kanye nokweluleka ngebhokisi","level":2},{"id":"hlela-ibanga-bese-uyikhiya","text":"Hlela ibanga bese uyikhiya","level":2},{"id":"hlanganisa-futhi-ukhiye","text":"Hlanganisa futhi ukhiye","level":2},{"id":"khiya-izindonga-emigqeni-yegridi","text":"Khiya izindonga emigqeni yegridi","level":2},{"id":"ubude-iyiphi-inhlangothi-emile-nokukalwa","text":"Ubude: iyiphi inhlangothi emile, nokukalwa","level":2},{"id":"okuhle-ukukwazi","text":"Okuhle ukukwazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYenza futhi ushintshe izindonga ngezindlela zethuluzi lodonga. Ngayinye iphela ngendlela efanayo nokudweba udonga ngamakhona awo: amakhona ahlanganisa ngokwawo, ukuxhumana kugcinwa kufayela, nakho konke ukushintsha kuyisinyathelo esisodwa ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EChanges\u003C/strong\u003E esiqhubeka sihlehlisa nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E. Izindonga zigcina ubuqu bazo: udonga owuhlukanisile, owuhlukanise ngaphandle noma owulelule usalo lowo owuqala, nezimnyango, amawindi nezilinganiso zawo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dweba-isikwele-ipholigoni-noma-ingxenye-yesiyingi\"\u003EDweba isikwele, ipholigoni noma ingxenye yesiyingi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw\u003C/span\u003E ovulekile, vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShapes\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini le-Draw (noma khetha umumo ohlwini lwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EShape\u003C/strong\u003E emugqeni wodonga). Umugqa wodonga ubonisa uhlobo lodonga, ireferensi yokudweba, uhlangothi lwangaphandle nophezulu, njengakwethuluzi le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWall\u003C/span\u003E. Bese uchofoza, noma uthayiphe amaphuzu (x,y · @dx,dy · @length&lt;angle · ubude ngaphansi kwesikhombi):\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERectangle\u003C/strong\u003E: amakhona amabili aphambene. Izindonga ezine, amakhona amane okuhlangana, isinyathelo esisodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERotated rectangle\u003C/strong\u003E: lapho uhlangothi lokuqala luqala khona nalapho luphela khona (lokho kusetha ukujikeka kwalo nobude), bese uchofoza ngesithathu ukuze uthole olunye uhlangothi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPolygon\u003C/strong\u003E: isikhungo, bese ikhona (\u003Cstrong\u003EInscribed\u003C/strong\u003E) noma uhhafu wohlangothi (\u003Cstrong\u003ECircumscribed\u003C/strong\u003E). Setha \u003Cstrong\u003ESides\u003C/strong\u003E (3 kuya ku-64) kuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EArc, centre\u003C/strong\u003E: isikhungo, isiqalo (lokho kusetha ukuma), isiphetho. \u003Cstrong\u003EWay round\u003C/strong\u003E: indlela emfushane, ngokuphambene nokuqondile noma ngokuqondile. Ukujikeka okungaphezu kwezingxenye ezintathu zesiyingi kudwetshwa njengezindonga ezimbili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETangent arc\u003C/strong\u003E: chofoza isiphetho sodonga, bese lapho isiyingi siphela khona. Isiyingi siphuma ekuphetheni kodonga ngendlela yodonga ngokwalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmumo ovalekile uthola ukuphuma kwawo ngaphandle. Uma udwetshwe ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EOutside face\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003EInside face\u003C/strong\u003E, ubuso okuchofozwa kuwo yibona obuhlala bunjalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izindonga-emigqeni-osunayo\"\u003EIzindonga emigqeni osunayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPick lines\u003C/strong\u003E: chofoza umugqa bese udonga luyawuhlala kuwo. Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (noma bamba i-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ngenkathi uchofoza) ukuze uthathe ukulandelana konke kwemigqa exhunyiwe ngokuphela. Imigqa yale mbono imigqa yokudweba, ireferensi ye-trace kanye nemigqa yegridi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETrace outline\u003C/strong\u003E: chofoza phakathi endaweni evaliwe yimigqa leyo noma izindonga. Izindonga zizungeza indawo encane kakhulu ezungeze lokhu okuchofozwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"setha-ngaphambi-kokudweba-ukuhlukanisa-nokuhlanganisa\"\u003ESetha ngaphambi kokudweba: ukuhlukanisa nokuhlanganisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmugqa wodonga unezinkambu ezimbili ezengeziwe, zisetshenziswa ithuluzi le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWall\u003C/span\u003E nemumo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOffset\u003C/strong\u003E: izindonga zidwetshwa kukhashane kuleyo ngxenye emugqeni ochofozayo: + ngakwesobunxele salo, − ngakwesokudla, obukwa ngendlela oyidweba ngayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJoin\u003C/strong\u003E: yiqede ukuze udwebe izindonga ezizimele. Iziphetho zazo zithola \u003Cstrong\u003EDisallow join\u003C/strong\u003E zihlale zikhululekile naphi lapho zihamba khona (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/change-a-wall-or-door\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/change-a-wall-or-door\"\u003EShintsha udonga\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlukanisa-susa-ingxenye-hlanganisa-kabusha\"\u003EHlukanisa, susa ingxenye, hlanganisa kabusha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalls\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini le-Edit.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESplit\u003C/strong\u003E: chofoza udonga lapho kufanele kusikwe khona, noma thayipha ibanga kusukela esiqalweni salo. Eduze kodonga olwelula kulo, ukusika kuyabambelela lapho bahlangana khona. Izingxenye ezimbili zinohlobo olufanayo futhi zihlala zixhumene ngokulandelana. I-\u003Cstrong\u003EGap\u003C/strong\u003E ishiya igebe lobude obukhethiwe elimaphakathi nokusika. \u003Cstrong\u003EFree ends\u003C/strong\u003E ikhipha iziphetho zokusika i-Disallow join esikhundleni salokho (Izilungiselelo › BimCraft › Izindonga › \u003Cstrong\u003EWhen a wall is split\u003C/strong\u003E ikhomba ukuthi yiyiphi ephawulwe ekuqaleni). Umnyango noma iwindi lihamba nengxenye elimi kuyo; ukusika kulo kuyenqatshelwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDelete segment\u003C/strong\u003E: chofoza lapho ingxenye iqala khona nalapho iphela khona. Umnyango kuyo uhamba nayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERejoin\u003C/strong\u003E: chofoza izingxenye ezimbili zodonga oyedwa (ngomugqa ofanayo, uhlobo olufanayo). Zingaba udonga oyedwa futhi, owokuqala ochofoze, nezimnyango zazo zombili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uhlobo-lokuhlangana-disallow-join-ukubaluleka-kwezendlalelo\"\u003EUhlobo lokuhlangana, Disallow join, ukubaluleka kwezendlalelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalls\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini le-Edit.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJoin style\u003C/strong\u003E: chofoza ikhona lapho izindonga ezimbili ezigudlekile zihlangana khona. Ngayinye ukuchofoza kudlulela kolandelayo: \u003Cstrong\u003EMitre\u003C/strong\u003E (zombili iziphetho zisikwa emugqeni osuka kwikhona elingaphakathi kuya kwelingaphandle, okuqala ngakho konke ikhona), \u003Cstrong\u003EButt\u003C/strong\u003E (udonga olulodwa ludlula kubuso bangaphandle bomunye, oluma ngaseceleni lawo) kanye \u003Cstrong\u003ESquare off\u003C/strong\u003E (njenge-butt, nodonga oludlulayo luphela ngokuqondile; ekhoneni elilungile lubukeka njenge-butt). \u003Cstrong\u003ENext\u003C/strong\u003E, noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, yenza omunye udonga abe ngowedlulayo. Uhlu lwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EStyle\u003C/strong\u003E emugqeni lubonisa ikhona oliqonde kulo ekugcineni. Lezi zinketho ezimbili zisemaphrophathini wodonga oyedwa we-\u003Cstrong\u003EProperties\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cstrong\u003EJoin style at start / at end\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003ERuns through\u003C/strong\u003E. Ngayinye iyisinyathelo esisodwa ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EChanges\u003C/strong\u003E. Ipulani, umzimba we-3D, amagumbi kanye nezinto kuyalandela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-T udonga osebhekwe ngohlangothi lwalo luhlala ludlulayo. Lapho izindonga ezimbili zidlula ezinye, ukuchofoza (noma \u003Cstrong\u003EContinuous where it crosses\u003C/strong\u003E ku-Properties) kuchaza ukuthi yiyiphi eyodwa eqhubekayo; lokho kunquma ukuthi izendlalelo zodonga zidwetshwa kanjani ngokudlula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsitayela sisemuhlanganweni: sihlala lapho izindonga zihamba, sihamba kuphela uma ukuhlangana kuhamba (udonga uyasuswa, uhlukaniswa ekugcineni lapho, noma ugcina i-Disallow join). Ikhona lapho kukhona udonga oluyigobo, noma lapho izindonga ezintathu noma ngaphezulu zihlangana, lihlala lingu-mitre. Ikhona elibukhali ngaphezu kwama-30 degrees, noma elincane kakhulu kuno-150, nalo luyabuya lube mitre.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDisallow join\u003C/strong\u003E: chofoza eduze kwesiphetho sodonga. Lowo mphetho uyakhululeka: awuhlanganisi lutho, noma udonga lunjani, kuze kube yilapho uyichofoza kabusha. Iziphetho ezikhululekile ziphawulwa ngesiphambano uma ithuluzi livuliwe. Isiwishi esifanayo yi \u003Cstrong\u003EJoin at start / Join at end\u003C/strong\u003E ku-Properties.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELayer priority\u003C/strong\u003E: lapho izindonga ezinezendlalelo zihlangana, isendlalelo esinamandla siyasika esibuthakathaka, ngakho izingqikithi zihlangana nezingqikithi, nokuqeda kumile phambi kwesendlalelo esinamandla. Isendlalelo ngasinye sinokubaluleka okusuka ku-0 kuya ku-999; ngokuzenzakalela kuvela emsebenzini wesendlalelo (isakhiwo 800, isisekelo 600, ukugoqa 400, imembrane 300, ukuqeda 200, ingaphakathi 100). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayer priority\u003C/span\u003E ivula izakhiwo zodonga, lapho ikholomu ethi \u003Cstrong\u003EPriority\u003C/strong\u003E isetha inombolo yesendlalelo ngasinye. Izendlalelo ezinokubaluleka okufanayo ziyamelana, nomugqa udwetshwa phakathi kwezinto ezehlukene kuphela. Ubona lokhu epulanini ngemininingwane \u003Cstrong\u003EMedium\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003EFine\u003C/strong\u003E, ezikhoneni, kuma-T nasemiqansweni yezindonga ezimbili ezigudlekile; i-Izilungiselelo › BimCraft › Izindonga › \u003Cstrong\u003EClean wall layers where walls meet\u003C/strong\u003E iyavala. Ishintsha okudwetshwa phakathi kwezindonga kuphela: imiphetho yezindonga nezinto zazo zihlala njengoba uhlobo lokuhlangana lukunika.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shintsha-uhlobo-lwezindonga-eziningi\"\u003EShintsha uhlobo lwezindonga eziningi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkusuka ezipulanini zokuskeba kuya ezipulanini zokusebenza kuyikakhulu ushintsho lohlobo: udonga ojwayelekile uba ukwakha okuthile. Ayikho into oyidweba kabusha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha izindonga (eyodwa, noma eziningi nge-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-Properties, cindezela \u003Cstrong\u003ESwap type…\u003C/strong\u003E ngaphansi kuka-Wall type (noma vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalls\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini le-Edit bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESwap type\u003C/span\u003E, okuvula uhlu olufanayo). Uhlu luvula ngaphakathi ku-Properties, endaweni yezindonga ezikhethiwe. Ayisiyo ingxoxo futhi ayimboni lutho: ipulani, umbono we-3D nokukhetha kuyaqhubeka nokusebenza lapho luvuliwe, futhi lulandela izindonga oziKhethayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUhlu lukhombisa wonke uhlobo lodonga nobukhulu bawo nophawu lwe-LOD, isibonelo &quot;Wall 230 generic, LOD 200&quot; kanye &quot;230 clay brick, plastered both sides, LOD 300&quot;. Izinhlobo izindonga ezikhethiwe zinazo manje ziyamakwa. Thayipha \u003Cstrong\u003EFind\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze uncishise: igama, ubukhulu, noma \u003Ccode\u003Elod 300\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza uhlobo. Yonke indonga ekhethiwe iyashintsha kuso kwisinyathelo esisodwa, ngakho i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E eyodwa ibuyisela konke ukushintsha. Inkinobho encane x ivala uhlu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUdonga ngalunye ugcina umugqa wendawo yalo. Udonga olusemgqeni wayo wephakathi lukhula ngakuzo zombili izinhlangothi; udonga umugqa wendawo waso ubuso uyagcina lobo buso bese ukhula ngenye indlela, nezindonga ezixhunyiwe kuwo zilandela ezikhoneni. Izindonga ezikhiyiwe ngokushintshiwe nazo ziyalandela. Izinmnyango nezifasiteli zihlala ezindongeni zazo futhi zisikwa kabusha ngobukhulu obusha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEmva kokushintsha uhlu lubonisa \u003Cstrong\u003EWhat moved\u003C/strong\u003E: izindonga ezingaki ezishintshile nokuthi zishintshele kwini, ubukhulu ne-LOD ngaphambi nangemva, izindonga ezinyakazele ngohlangothini ukuze zigcine umugqa wazo wendawo, izindonga ezixhunyiwe ezilandele, izinmnyango nezifasiteli ezifakwe kabusha, nagumbi ngalinye elishintshe indawo yalo nendawo yalo ngaphambi nangemva. Umugqa wesimo ukusho okufanayo ngomugqa owodwa. Umbiko ukutshela kuphela; awukaze umise ukushintsha. Izinto ezimbili zingama ukushintsha, bese kungashintshi lutho: umnyango noma iwindi okungeke lilingane odongeni lwalo (udonga luyafinyeleka lapho ikhona ilandela, yenza umnyango ube mncane noma uwususele kude nekhona kuqala), kanye nokukhiya okuzophula ukushintsha (udonga okhiywe kugridi ngomugqa wawo wephakathi lapho umugqa wendawo uyibuso; ukhulule noma ubuyisele umugqa wendawo emugqeni wephakathi).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmsizi oxhunyiwe ku-BimCraft angenza ukushintsha okufanayo (amathuluzi \u003Ccode\u003Ewall_types_list\u003C/code\u003E kanye \u003Ccode\u003Ewalls_swap_type\u003C/code\u003E) futhi uthola umbiko ofanayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUhlobo lodonga lwe-LOD lusethwa kumhleli wezakhiwo zodonga: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/wall-assemblies\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/wall-assemblies\"\u003EWall assemblies\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuhlukanisa-ngaphandle-kanye-nokweluleka-ngebhokisi\"\u003EUkuhlukanisa ngaphandle kanye nokweluleka ngebhokisi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOffset\u003C/strong\u003E: chofoza udonga, bese uchofoza uhlangothi okufanele lunyakazele kulo, noma thayipha ibanga. Udonga uyanyakaza ngqo kuwona, nezindonga ezixhunyiwe kuwo zelula. Khetha \u003Cstrong\u003ECopy\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze uthole ikhophi ehambisana neyokuqala (ayixhunyiwe kuyo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBox stretch\u003C/strong\u003E: chofoza amakhona amabili ebhokisi, bese uphawu lokunyakaza nephuzu lokuya kulo. Yonke isiphetho sodonga esingaphakathi kwebhokisi siyanyakaza; udonga oluphelele ngaphakathi luyanyakaza nezindonga ezihlanganayo nalo nazo ziyeza; izindonga ezidlula ebhokisini ziyelulwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlela-ibanga-bese-uyikhiya\"\u003EHlela ibanga bese uyikhiya\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha isilinganiso sesibhekiselo (Annotate › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReference dimension\u003C/span\u003E) bese uthayipha inani lakho ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EProperties\u003C/strong\u003E: udonga wesibhekiselo sesibili uyanyakaza ngqo kuwona, isibhekiselo sokuqala siyahlala, nezindonga ezixhunyiwe ziyalandela. Khetha \u003Cstrong\u003ELock this dimension\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze ugcine inani: uma kamuva udonga olulodwa lunyakaza, elinye liyalandela. Inani elikhiyiwe alikwazi ukubhalwa phezu kwalo uze uliphinde ukhetha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlanganisa-futhi-ukhiye\"\u003EHlanganisa futhi ukhiye\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAlign and lock\u003C/strong\u003E: chofoza ubuso bodonga (noma umugqa wephakathi, eduze kwephakathi kodonga) noma umugqa wegridi, bese ubuso bodonga obuzolethwa kulowo mugqa. Udonga uyanyakaza ngqo kuwo. Khetha \u003Cstrong\u003ELock\u003C/strong\u003E kuqala ukuze ugcine zihlanganisiwe: iphadi lokukhiya liyabonakala epulanini, uma udonga olulodwa lunyakaza elinye liyalandela. \u003Cstrong\u003EProperties\u003C/strong\u003E zodonga zihlu ngezikhiyo zalo, ngayinye no-\u003Cstrong\u003EUnlock\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khiya-izindonga-emigqeni-yegridi\"\u003EKhiya izindonga emigqeni yegridi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha udonga ohamba ngomugqa wegridi, noma osekhoneni lapho lukhona, bese ukhetha umugqa wegridi ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EProperties\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003ELock to grid\u003C/strong\u003E. Bese ukhetha umugqa wegridi ngethuluzi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGrid\u003C/span\u003E bese uthayipha ibanga ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EMove by\u003C/strong\u003E: umugqa uyanyakaza ngqo kuwona, nezindonga ezikhiyiwe kuwo ziyalandela, nezindonga ezixhunyiwe kuzo, kwisinyathelo esisodwa. Udonga okhiywe kumugqa wegridi awukwazi ukuphuma kuwo wedwa (hambisa umugqa, noma khulula udonga); umugqa wegridi oshintshwa ngendlela lapho udonga okhiywe ungahlala ungqo kuwo unqatshelwa. Ukuqamba kabusha umugqa kugcina ukukhiya; ukususa kuyakususa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ubude-iyiphi-inhlangothi-emile-nokukalwa\"\u003EUbude: iyiphi inhlangothi emile, nokukalwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGrow from\u003C/strong\u003E (Properties yodonga oyedwa): \u003Cstrong\u003EStart holds\u003C/strong\u003E (isiphetho siyanyakaza), \u003Cstrong\u003EEnd holds\u003C/strong\u003E (isiqalo siyanyakaza) noma \u003Cstrong\u003ECentre holds\u003C/strong\u003E (zombili iziphetho zinyakaza ngehhafu). Ngenkathi uthayipha ubude, ipulani ibonisa iphuzu elimile. Udonga oxhunyiwe esiphethweni esinyakazayo uyanyakaza ngqo kuwona futhi ugcina ikona layo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMeasure from\u003C/strong\u003E (ngasese kwe-Dimensions epulanini, ku-Properties, nakwi-Izilungiselelo › BimCraft › Izindonga): umugqa wephakathi, ubuso bangaphakathi noma ubuso bangaphandle. Inkambu yobude nezilinganiso zezindonga zepulani zifunda okufanayo, ngakho ziyavumelana. Iqala emugqeni wephakathi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuhambisa udonga ngaphandle kwezixhumanisi zawo (ziyephuka, udonga ugcina ubuqu bawo), bamba i-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uma uhudula isibambi sawo esiphakathi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuhle-ukukwazi\"\u003EOkuhle ukukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELezi zindlela zichazwe ngumbhalo wethuluzi lodonga (amakhasi 4 kuya ku-9). Uhlobo lokuhlangana nokubaluleka kwezendlalelo kwakhelwe izindonga ezigudlekile; ukubaluleka kwezendlalelo kubonakala epulanini kuphela (hhayi ezigatshaneni, ekubukekeni kohlangothi noma ku-3D, lapho udonga kuwumzimba munye), hhayi ezindaweni zezindonga ezintathu noma ngaphezulu, futhi imembrane ayithwalwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUhlobo lokuhlangana lugcinwa erekhodini layo kufayela le-IFC (igama le-\u003Ccode\u003EIfcRelConnectsPathElements\u003C/code\u003E, isibonelo \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft join L butt 1\u003C/code\u003E), ngakho ezinye izinhlelo zisafunda ukuhlangana futhi ifayela elidala livula nge-mitre.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzikhiyo nokuhlangana kugcinwa kufayela le-IFC (izikhiyo njenge-\u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_WallHolds\u003C/code\u003E kwiphrojekthi, ukuhlangana njenge-\u003Ccode\u003EIfcRelConnectsPathElements\u003C/code\u003E), ngakho zikhona uma uvula kabusha ifayela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzindonga ezigobile zingahlukaniswa, zihlanganiswe kabusha futhi zisuswe ingxenye; azihlanganisi noma zikhiywe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBheka futhi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/draw-walls\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/draw-walls\"\u003EDweba izindonga\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/change-a-wall-or-door\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/change-a-wall-or-door\"\u003EShintsha udonga, umnyango noma iwindi\u003C/a\u003E kanye \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/wall-shape\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/wall-shape\"\u003EYakha udonga\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Yenza futhi ushintshe izindonga ngezindlela zethuluzi lodonga. Ngayinye iphela ngendlela efanayo nokudweba udonga ngamakhona awo: amakhona ahlanganisa ngokwawo, ukuxhumana kugcinwa kufayela, nakho konke ukushintsha kuyisinyathelo esisodwa ku-Changes esiqhubeka sihlehlisa nge-Undo. Izindonga zigcina ubuqu bazo: udonga owuhlukanisile, owuhlukanise ngaphandle noma owulelule usalo lowo owuqala, nezimnyango, amawindi nezilinganiso zawo. Dweba isikwele, ipholigoni noma ingxenye yesiyingi Ngo-Draw ovulekile, vula Shapes eqenjini le-Draw (noma khetha umumo ohlwini lwe-Shape emugqeni wodonga). Umugqa wodonga ubonisa uhlobo lodonga, ireferensi yokudweba, uhlangothi lwangaphandle nophezulu, njengakwethuluzi le-Wall. Bese uchofoza, noma uthayiphe amaphuzu (x,y · @dx,dy · @length\u003Cangle · ubude ngaphansi kwesikhombi): Rectangle: amakhona amabili aphambene. Izindonga ezine, amakhona amane okuhlangana, isinyathelo esisodwa. Rotated rectangle: lapho uhlangothi lokuqala luqala khona nalapho luphela khona (lokho kusetha ukujikeka kwalo nobude), bese uchofoza ngesithathu ukuze uthole olunye uhlangothi. Polygon: isikhungo, bese ikhona (Inscribed) noma uhhafu wohlangothi (Circumscribed). Setha Sides (3 kuya ku-64) kuqala. Arc, centre: isikhungo, isiqalo (lokho kusetha ukuma), isiphetho. Way round: indlela emfushane, ngokuphambene nokuqondile noma ngokuqondile. Ukujikeka okungaphezu kwezingxenye ezintathu zesiyingi kudwetshwa njengezindonga ezimbili. Tangent arc: chofoza isiphetho sodonga, bese lapho isiyingi siphela khona. Isiyingi siphuma ekuphetheni kodonga ngendlela yodonga ngokwalo. Umumo ovalekile uthola ukuphuma kwawo ngaphandle. Uma udwetshwe ku-Outside face noma Inside face, ubuso okuchofozwa kuwo yibona obuhlala bunjalo. Izindonga emigqeni osunayo Pick lines: chofoza umugqa bese udonga luyawuhlala kuwo. Cindezela Tab (noma bamba i-Shift ngenkathi uchofoza) ukuze uthathe ukulandelana konke kwemigqa exhunyiwe ngokuphela. Imigqa yale mbono imigqa yokudweba, ireferensi ye-trace kanye nemigqa yegridi. Trace outline: chofoza phakathi endaweni evaliwe yimigqa leyo noma izindonga. Izindonga zizungeza indawo encane kakhulu ezungeze lokhu okuchofozwe. Setha ngaphambi kokudweba: ukuhlukanisa nokuhlanganisa Umugqa wodonga unezinkambu ezimbili ezengeziwe, zisetshenziswa ithuluzi le-Wall nemumo: Offset: izindonga zidwetshwa kukhashane kuleyo ngxenye emugqeni ochofozayo: + ngakwesobunxele salo, − ngakwesokudla, obukwa ngendlela oyidweba ngayo. Join: yiqede ukuze udwebe izindonga ezizimele. Iziphetho zazo zithola Disallow join zihlale zikhululekile naphi lapho zihamba khona (bheka Shintsha udonga). Hlukanisa, susa ingxenye, hlanganisa kabusha Vula Walls eqenjini le-Edit. Split: chofoza udonga lapho kufanele kusikwe khona, noma thayipha ibanga kusukela esiqalweni salo. Eduze kodonga olwelula kulo, ukusika kuyabambelela lapho bahlangana khona. Izingxenye ezimbili zinohlobo olufanayo futhi zihlala zixhumene ngokulandelana. I-Gap ishiya igebe lobude obukhethiwe elimaphakathi nokusika. Free ends ikhipha iziphetho zokusika i-Disallow join esikhundleni salokho (Izilungiselelo › BimCraft › Izindonga › When a wall is split ikhomba ukuthi yiyiphi ephawulwe ekuqaleni). Umnyango noma iwindi lihamba nengxenye elimi kuyo; ukusika kulo kuyenqatshelwa. Delete segment: chofoza lapho ingxenye iqala khona nalapho iphela khona. Umnyango kuyo uhamba nayo. Rejoin: chofoza izingxenye ezimbili zodonga oyedwa (ngomugqa ofanayo, uhlobo olufanayo). Zingaba udonga oyedwa futhi, owokuqala ochofoze, nezimnyango zazo zombili. Uhlobo lokuhlangana, Disallow join, ukubaluleka kwezendlalelo Vula Walls eqenjini le-Edit. Join style: chofoza ikhona lapho izindonga ezimbili ezigudlekile zihlangana khona. Ngayinye ukuchofoza kudlulela kolandelayo: Mitre (zombili iziphetho zisikwa emugqeni osuka kwikhona elingaphakathi kuya kwelingaphandle, okuqala ngakho konke ikhona), Butt (udonga olulodwa ludlula kubuso bangaphandle bomunye, oluma ngaseceleni lawo) kanye Square off (njenge-butt, nodonga oludlulayo luphela ngokuqondile; ekhoneni elilungile lubukeka njenge-butt). Next, noma Tab, yenza omunye udonga abe ngowedlulayo. Uhlu lwe-Style emugqeni lubonisa ikhona oliqonde kulo ekugcineni. Lezi zinketho ezimbili zisemaphrophathini wodonga oyedwa we-Properties: Join style at start / at end kanye Runs through. Ngayinye iyisinyathelo esisodwa ku-Changes. Ipulani, umzimba we-3D, amagumbi kanye nezinto kuyalandela. Ku-T udonga osebhekwe ngohlangothi lwalo luhlala ludlulayo. Lapho izindonga ezimbili zidlula ezinye, ukuchofoza (noma Continuous where it crosses ku-Properties) kuchaza ukuthi yiyiphi eyodwa eqhubekayo; lokho kunquma ukuthi izendlalelo zodonga zidwetshwa kanjani ngokudlula. Isitayela sisemuhlanganweni: sihlala lapho izindonga zihamba, sihamba kuphela uma ukuhlangana kuhamba (udonga uyasuswa, uhlukaniswa ekugcineni lapho, noma ugcina i-Disallow join). Ikhona lapho kukhona udonga oluyigobo, noma lapho izindonga ezintathu noma ngaphezulu zihlangana, lihlala lingu-mitre. Ikhona elibukhali ngaphezu kwama-30 degrees, noma elincane kakhulu kuno-150, nalo luyabuya lube mitre. Disallow join: chofoza eduze kwesiphetho sodonga. Lowo mphetho uyakhululeka: awuhlanganisi lutho, noma udonga lunjani, kuze kube yilapho uyichofoza kabusha. Iziphetho ezikhululekile ziphawulwa ngesiphambano uma ithuluzi livuliwe. Isiwishi esifanayo yi Join at start / Join at end ku-Properties. Layer priority: lapho izindonga ezinezendlalelo zihlangana, isendlalelo esinamandla siyasika esibuthakathaka, ngakho izingqikithi zihlangana nezingqikithi, nokuqeda kumile phambi kwesendlalelo esinamandla. Isendlalelo ngasinye sinokubaluleka okusuka ku-0 kuya ku-999; ngokuzenzakalela kuvela emsebenzini wesendlalelo (isakhiwo 800, isisekelo 600, ukugoqa 400, imembrane 300, ukuqeda 200, ingaphakathi 100). Layer priority ivula izakhiwo zodonga, lapho ikholomu ethi Priority isetha inombolo yesendlalelo ngasinye. Izendlalelo ezinokubaluleka okufanayo ziyamelana, nomugqa udwetshwa phakathi kwezinto ezehlukene kuphela. Ubona lokhu epulanini ngemininingwane Medium noma Fine, ezikhoneni, kuma-T nasemiqansweni yezindonga ezimbili ezigudlekile; i-Izilungiselelo › BimCraft › Izindonga › Clean wall layers where walls meet iyavala. Ishintsha okudwetshwa phakathi kwezindonga kuphela: imiphetho yezindonga nezinto zazo zihlala njengoba uhlobo lokuhlangana lukunika. Shintsha uhlobo lwezindonga eziningi Ukusuka ezipulanini zokuskeba kuya ezipulanini zokusebenza kuyikakhulu ushintsho lohlobo: udonga ojwayelekile uba ukwakha okuthile. Ayikho into oyidweba kabusha. Khetha izindonga (eyodwa, noma eziningi nge-Ctrl noma Shift). Ku-Properties, cindezela Swap type… ngaphansi kuka-Wall type (noma vula Walls eqenjini le-Edit bese ukhetha Swap type, okuvula uhlu olufanayo). Uhlu luvula ngaphakathi ku-Properties, endaweni yezindonga ezikhethiwe. Ayisiyo ingxoxo futhi ayimboni lutho: ipulani, umbono we-3D nokukhetha kuyaqhubeka nokusebenza lapho luvuliwe, futhi lulandela izindonga oziKhethayo. Uhlu lukhombisa wonke uhlobo lodonga nobukhulu bawo nophawu lwe-LOD, isibonelo \"Wall 230 generic, LOD 200\" kanye \"230 clay brick, plastered both sides, LOD 300\". Izinhlobo izindonga ezikhethiwe zinazo manje ziyamakwa. Thayipha Find ukuze uncishise: igama, ubukhulu, noma lod 300. Chofoza uhlobo. Yonke indonga ekhethiwe iyashintsha kuso kwisinyathelo esisodwa, ngakho i-Undo eyodwa ibuyisela konke ukushintsha. Inkinobho encane x ivala uhlu. Udonga ngalunye ugcina umugqa wendawo yalo. Udonga olusemgqeni wayo wephakathi lukhula ngakuzo zombili izinhlangothi; udonga umugqa wendawo waso ubuso uyagcina lobo buso bese ukhula ngenye indlela, nezindonga ezixhunyiwe kuwo zilandela ezikhoneni. Izindonga ezikhiyiwe ngokushintshiwe nazo ziyalandela. Izinmnyango nezifasiteli zihlala ezindongeni zazo futhi zisikwa kabusha ngobukhulu obusha. Emva kokushintsha uhlu lubonisa What moved: izindonga ezingaki ezishintshile nokuthi zishintshele kwini, ubukhulu ne-LOD ngaphambi nangemva, izindonga ezinyakazele ngohlangothini ukuze zigcine umugqa wazo wendawo, izindonga ezixhunyiwe ezilandele, izinmnyango nezifasiteli ezifakwe kabusha, nagumbi ngalinye elishintshe indawo yalo nendawo yalo ngaphambi nangemva. Umugqa wesimo ukusho okufanayo ngomugqa owodwa. Umbiko ukutshela kuphela; awukaze umise ukushintsha. Izinto ezimbili zingama ukushintsha, bese kungashintshi lutho: umnyango noma iwindi okungeke lilingane odongeni lwalo (udonga luyafinyeleka lapho ikhona ilandela, yenza umnyango ube mncane noma uwususele kude nekhona kuqala), kanye nokukhiya okuzophula ukushintsha (udonga okhiywe kugridi ngomugqa wawo wephakathi lapho umugqa wendawo uyibuso; ukhulule noma ubuyisele umugqa wendawo emugqeni wephakathi). Umsizi oxhunyiwe ku-BimCraft angenza ukushintsha okufanayo (amathuluzi wall_types_list kanye walls_swap_type) futhi uthola umbiko ofanayo. Uhlobo lodonga lwe-LOD lusethwa kumhleli wezakhiwo zodonga: bheka Wall assemblies. Ukuhlukanisa ngaphandle kanye nokweluleka ngebhokisi Offset: chofoza udonga, bese uchofoza uhlangothi okufanele lunyakazele kulo, noma thayipha ibanga. Udonga uyanyakaza ngqo kuwona, nezindonga ezixhunyiwe kuwo zelula. Khetha Copy ukuze uthole ikhophi ehambisana neyokuqala (ayixhunyiwe kuyo). Box stretch: chofoza amakhona amabili ebhokisi, bese uphawu lokunyakaza nephuzu lokuya kulo. Yonke isiphetho sodonga esingaphakathi kwebhokisi siyanyakaza; udonga oluphelele ngaphakathi luyanyakaza nezindonga ezihlanganayo nalo nazo ziyeza; izindonga ezidlula ebhokisini ziyelulwa. Hlela ibanga bese uyikhiya Khetha isilinganiso sesibhekiselo (Annotate › Reference dimension) bese uthayipha inani lakho ku-Properties: udonga wesibhekiselo sesibili uyanyakaza ngqo kuwona, isibhekiselo sokuqala siyahlala, nezindonga ezixhunyiwe ziyalandela. Khetha Lock this dimension ukuze ugcine inani: uma kamuva udonga olulodwa lunyakaza, elinye liyalandela. Inani elikhiyiwe alikwazi ukubhalwa phezu kwalo uze uliphinde ukhetha. Hlanganisa futhi ukhiye Align and lock: chofoza ubuso bodonga (noma umugqa wephakathi, eduze kwephakathi kodonga) noma umugqa wegridi, bese ubuso bodonga obuzolethwa kulowo mugqa. Udonga uyanyakaza ngqo kuwo. Khetha Lock kuqala ukuze ugcine zihlanganisiwe: iphadi lokukhiya liyabonakala epulanini, uma udonga olulodwa lunyakaza elinye liyalandela. Properties zodonga zihlu ngezikhiyo zalo, ngayinye no-Unlock. Khiya izindonga emigqeni yegridi Khetha udonga ohamba ngomugqa wegridi, noma osekhoneni lapho lukhona, bese ukhetha umugqa wegridi ku-Properties › Lock to grid. Bese ukhetha umugqa wegridi ngethuluzi Grid bese uthayipha ibanga ku-Move by: umugqa uyanyakaza ngqo kuwona, nezindonga ezikhiyiwe kuwo ziyalandela, nezindonga ezixhunyiwe kuzo, kwisinyathelo esisodwa. Udonga okhiywe kumugqa wegridi awukwazi ukuphuma kuwo wedwa (hambisa umugqa, noma khulula udonga); umugqa wegridi oshintshwa ngendlela lapho udonga okhiywe ungahlala ungqo kuwo unqatshelwa. Ukuqamba kabusha umugqa kugcina ukukhiya; ukususa kuyakususa. Ubude: iyiphi inhlangothi emile, nokukalwa Grow from (Properties yodonga oyedwa): Start holds (isiphetho siyanyakaza), End holds (isiqalo siyanyakaza) noma Centre holds (zombili iziphetho zinyakaza ngehhafu). Ngenkathi uthayipha ubude, ipulani ibonisa iphuzu elimile. Udonga oxhunyiwe esiphethweni esinyakazayo uyanyakaza ngqo kuwona futhi ugcina ikona layo. Measure from (ngasese kwe-Dimensions epulanini, ku-Properties, nakwi-Izilungiselelo › BimCraft › Izindonga): umugqa wephakathi, ubuso bangaphakathi noma ubuso bangaphandle. Inkambu yobude nezilinganiso zezindonga zepulani zifunda okufanayo, ngakho ziyavumelana. Iqala emugqeni wephakathi. Ukuhambisa udonga ngaphandle kwezixhumanisi zawo (ziyephuka, udonga ugcina ubuqu bawo), bamba i-Alt uma uhudula isibambi sawo esiphakathi. Okuhle ukukwazi Lezi zindlela zichazwe ngumbhalo wethuluzi lodonga (amakhasi 4 kuya ku-9). Uhlobo lokuhlangana nokubaluleka kwezendlalelo kwakhelwe izindonga ezigudlekile; ukubaluleka kwezendlalelo kubonakala epulanini kuphela (hhayi ezigatshaneni, ekubukekeni kohlangothi noma ku-3D, lapho udonga kuwumzimba munye), hhayi ezindaweni zezindonga ezintathu noma ngaphezulu, futhi imembrane ayithwalwa. Uhlobo lokuhlangana lugcinwa erekhodini layo kufayela le-IFC (igama le-IfcRelConnectsPathElements, isibonelo CadCraft join L butt 1), ngakho ezinye izinhlelo zisafunda ukuhlangana futhi ifayela elidala livula nge-mitre. Izikhiyo nokuhlangana kugcinwa kufayela le-IFC (izikhiyo njenge-CadCraft_WallHolds kwiphrojekthi, ukuhlangana njenge-IfcRelConnectsPathElements), ngakho zikhona uma uvula kabusha ifayela. Izindonga ezigobile zingahlukaniswa, zihlanganiswe kabusha futhi zisuswe ingxenye; azihlanganisi noma zikhiywe. Bheka futhi Dweba izindonga, Shintsha udonga, umnyango noma iwindi kanye Yakha udonga.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"wall-assemblies","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Izakhiwo zodonga nezilinganiso zokubhekisela","summary":"Yakha izinhlobo zakho zodonga ngesendlalelo ngesendlalelo ngomgogodla ocacile, gcina umtapo wezinto zephrojekthi, bese ulinganisa kubuso nasemigqeni ehlala ixhunyiwe lapho udonga lushintsha.","section":"tasks","order":17,"keywords":["lod","izinga lokuthuthukiswa","lod 200","lod 300","jikelele","izakhiwo zodonga","uhlobo lodonga","izendlalelo","ingaphakathi","ubuso bengaphakathi","umugqa wengaphakathi","ingaphakathi lomoya","imembrane","ukugoqa indlu","umtapo wezinto","izinto","ubukhulu","isilinganiso sokubhekisela","isilinganiso","ukuxhumana","umugqa wendawo","ukugoqa","ukuhlaka","ukwakha","ugwadule"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"yenza-uhlobo-lodonga","text":"Yenza uhlobo lodonga","level":2},{"id":"phawula-uhlobo-ngezinga-lokuthuthukiswa-lod","text":"Phawula uhlobo ngezinga lokuthuthukiswa (LOD)","level":2},{"id":"izindonga-ezijikelele-zesigaba-sokuskeba","text":"Izindonga ezijikelele zesigaba sokuskeba","level":2},{"id":"nika-uhlobo-idatha-yokubala-amanani","text":"Nika uhlobo idatha yokubala amanani","level":2},{"id":"bamba-umgogodla-ungashintshi","text":"Bamba umgogodla ungashintshi","level":2},{"id":"izinto-zephrojekthi","text":"Izinto zephrojekthi","level":2},{"id":"izilinganiso-zokubhekisela","text":"Izilinganiso zokubhekisela","level":2},{"id":"linganisa-ipulani-yonke-ngemithetho","text":"Linganisa ipulani yonke ngemithetho","level":3},{"id":"bona-nokunye","text":"Bona nokunye","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYakha uhlobo lodonga olufana nodonga ozolakha: ukugoqa, ukugoqwa okungaphansi, umgogodla wensimbi ye-5½ amainshi kanye ne-drywall, noma ingqalasizinda, ingaphakathi lomoya kanye nodonga lohlaka lwezinkuni. Phawula izendlalelo ezingumgogodla, ukuze isilinganiso noma umugqa wendawo ugcine ingaphakathi kuthi izendlalelo eziphezu kwalo zishintshe. Bese ulinganisa izindonga ngobuso nangemigqa ehlala iphakathi oyifunayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yenza-uhlobo-lodonga\"\u003EYenza uhlobo lodonga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQala isakhiwo noma vula imodeli ye-IFC bese uvula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw\u003C/span\u003E, bese ukhetha ithuluzi le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWall\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha isisekelo ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWall type\u003C/span\u003E bese uvula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWall assemblies…\u003C/span\u003E. Isisekelo sivula njengekhophi; nika uhlobo olusha igama.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzendlalelo zihamba kusuka ngaphandle, phezulu kuhlu, kuya ngaphakathi, phansi kuhlu. Khetha izinto zendlalelo ngayinye, uthayiphe ubukhulu bayo (ubukhulu bephrojekthi, noma ubukhulu obucacile obufana no-\u003Ccode\u003E12.7 mm\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E), khetha umsebenzi wayo (ukuqeda, isisekelo, isakhiwo, ukugoqa, imembrane) bese uyiqaphela izendlalelo ze-\u003Cstrong\u003ECore\u003C/strong\u003E. Ingaphakathi kumele libe yiqoqo elilodwa elingaphazamisekile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd layer\u003C/span\u003E yengeza isendlalelo, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd cavity\u003C/span\u003E yengeza ingaphakathi lomoya kanye nokungena komoya (akucacisiwe, akunawo umoya, nomoya), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd membrane\u003C/span\u003E yengeza isendlalelo esingenaso ubukhulu obubalwayo, njengokugoqa indlu. Izicibisi zihambisa isendlalelo ngaphandle noma ngaphakathi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkubuka kuphrinta izendlalelo ngesikali, ingaphakathi ligcizelelwe, linombolo njengemigqa, futhi kulinganise isendlalelo ngasinye, ingaphakathi nobukhulu bonke. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave type\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUhlobo olusha lusemenwini ye-Wall tool nakwi-\u003Cstrong\u003EProperties\u003C/strong\u003E yodonga olukhethiwe. Ukugcina uhlobo olulungisiwe kushintsha yonke indonga esilisebenzisayo; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDuplicate type\u003C/span\u003E yenza olunye oluhlukile futhi luninikeze kuphela izindonga ozikhethile. Ukugcina ngakunye kungesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa, kanye nezindonga ezihamba nakho, izinmnyango nezifasiteli ezikuzo kanye nezilinganiso ezincike kuzo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIngaphakathi lomoya lengeza ububanzi. Imembrane ayengezi lutho: ihlala kuhlobo ukuze uhlu lokuhlola lungayithola kamuva, futhi ayibalwa ekubhekeni ubukhulu bodonga noma bengaphakathi. Ingaphakathi lomoya noma imembrane akusoze kubalwe njengento eqinile. Kufayela elilondolozwe njenge-IFC2X3, imembrane igcinwa erekhodini lohlobo kodwa ishiywa ngaphandle kwezendlalelo zezinto ezibonakalayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"phawula-uhlobo-ngezinga-lokuthuthukiswa-lod\"\u003EPhawula uhlobo ngezinga lokuthuthukiswa (LOD)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUhlobo lungatshela ukuthi luthuthukiswe kangakanani. Kumhleli, \u003Cstrong\u003ELevel of development (LOD)\u003C/strong\u003E inikeza isikali esisethiwe esingu-100, 200, 300, 350, 400 no-500, noma \u003Cstrong\u003ENot set\u003C/strong\u003E. Udonga jikelele (&quot;Wall 230 generic&quot;) buyi-LOD 100 noma 200; ukwakha okuthile okunezendlalelo zalo zangempela (&quot;230 clay brick, plastered both sides&quot;) buyi-LOD 300 noma ngaphezulu. Ukuphawula kungokwakho ukukusetha: i-BimCraft ayiyibali, futhi izisekelo ezingenazo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUphawu luvela eduzane negama lohlobo ohlwini lwe-Wall tool, ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EProperties\u003C/strong\u003E yodonga nohlwini lwe-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/wall-tools\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/wall-tools\"\u003ESwap type\u003C/a\u003E, nombiko emva kokushintsha uhlobo utshela ukuthi izinga liphakame noma liphansi. Ukuze ulibone ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EWalls by type\u003C/strong\u003E nakwi-CSV yalo, phawula i-\u003Cstrong\u003EShow each wall type&#039;s LOD in the wall schedule\u003C/strong\u003E ku-Izilungiselelo › BimCraft › Izindonga: kwengezwa ikholomu yokugcina, LOD. Igcinwa kufayela le-IFC kanye nohlobo (kusethi yempahla ye-\u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_WallType\u003C/code\u003E, njengempahla ethi \u003Ccode\u003ELOD\u003C/code\u003E nangaphakathi kwerekhodi lohlobo), ukuze ikhona uma uvula kabusha ifayela. Uphawu lusebenza kuhlobo lodonga kuphela okwamanje, hhayi ezintweni ezikodwa noma ezinye izinhlobo zezinto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izindonga-ezijikelele-zesigaba-sokuskeba\"\u003EIzindonga ezijikelele zesigaba sokuskeba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUhlu lohlobo lwe-Wall tool luqala ngezindonga ezimbili \u003Cstrong\u003Eezijikelele\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cstrong\u003EGeneric wall 200 mm (exterior)\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003EGeneric wall 100 mm (interior)\u003C/strong\u003E. Ngayinye iyisendlalelo esisodwa sempahla ejikelele, ephawulwe njenge-LOD 200. Sebenzisa lezi uma wazi lapho izindonga zizokwenziwa khona kodwa ungakwazi okwenziwe ngakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUdonga olunohlobo oluphawulwe \u003Cstrong\u003ELOD 100\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003ELOD 200\u003C/strong\u003E lubonakala kuwo wonke amapulani njengomqimba oyodwa onemigqa, emazingeni wonke wemininingwane: akukho zendlalelo, akukho imigqa yezendlalelo. Lokho kuyiqiniso kwezindonga ezijikelele nakunoma yiluphi uhlobo lwakho oluphawula njenge-LOD 100 noma 200. Udonga ngokwalo luphelele: linobukhulu balo, izinmnyango nezifasiteli zalo, amagumbi alo nobuningi balo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuzeulithuthukise, shintsha uhlobo lwalo (Edit › Izindonga › \u003Cstrong\u003ESwap type\u003C/strong\u003E, noma Type ku-Properties). Udonga alusoze ludweywe kabusha: udonga olufanayo lungena kuhlobo olusha, nombiko utshela ukuthi yini eshintshile. Uhlobo oluphawulwe LOD 300 noma ngaphezulu lidwetshwa ngezendlalelo zalo njengakuqala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze udwebe zonke izindonga ngezendlalelo zazo nanoma yiluphi uphawu: Izilungiselelo › BimCraft › Izindonga, khipha \u003Cstrong\u003EDraw walls of an LOD 100 or LOD 200 type as one hatched band\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinmnyango nezifasiteli zesisekelo nazo ziyizinhlobo ezijikelele (usayizi kanye nendlela yokuvula, hhayi umkhiqizo). Ngokuthi \u003Cstrong\u003EShow each wall type&#039;s LOD in the wall schedule\u003C/strong\u003E isebenze, uhlu lwezinmnyango nezifasiteli lubonisa i-LOD 200 kuzo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nika-uhlobo-idatha-yokubala-amanani\"\u003ENika uhlobo idatha yokubala amanani\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-editor yohlobo lodonga, \u003Cstrong\u003ETakeoff data\u003C/strong\u003E ithatha okudingwa yi-estimator ngodonga, kanye kanye ngohlobo: \u003Cstrong\u003Eiyunithi\u003C/strong\u003E elakhiwe ngayo (ibhulokhi noma ingyeza: igama lalo, ubude, ukuphakama nobubanzi), \u003Cstrong\u003Ei-mortar\u003C/strong\u003E (igama nobukhulu bokuhlanganisa) kanye \u003Cstrong\u003Ene-rate\u003C/strong\u003E ngekhodi yayo yemali (izinhlamvu ezintathu, njengo-USD, EUR noma ZAR) nokuthi iyini ngayinye: isikwele se-metre noma se-foot sendawo yodonga esisebenzayo, imitha noma i-foot yobude bodonga, noma ngayinye indonga. Konke lokhu akunandaba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIgcinwa nohlobo kufayela. Yonke indonga yohlobo ibika kokukhona: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESchedules\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EWall types: takeoff data\u003C/strong\u003E ibhala iyunithi, i-mortar, i-rate kanye ne-rate ephindaphindwe ngesamba esilinganisiwe, futhi isiphakamiso esiya ku-TakeoffCraft sithwala lokho ku-item yalolu hlobo lodonga. Shintsha kuhlobo, bese zonke izindonga ziyalandela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEzinye izinkambu ezintathu zokubala izingyeza noma amabhulokhi kanye ne-mortar:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWaste on units, %\u003C/strong\u003E iyengezwa kunani lamayunithi. Yishiye ingenalutho ukuze usebenzise inani lendlela yokulinganisa yephrojekthi, noma lutho uma indlela ingenalo. Faka 0 ukuze ube nokulahlekelwa okungu-zero noma yini indlela ethi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EExtra mortar, %\u003C/strong\u003E ilolo amafrogs noma imingxunya eyamukela i-mortar. Yengezwa kuvolumu ye-mortar. Yishiye ingenalutho uma ingekho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELayers built of this unit\u003C/strong\u003E: phawula isendlalelo ngasinye esiyiqabunga lalesi singyeza noma ibhulokhi. Udonga oluyingqimba ololubili linamaqabunga amabili. Uma kungekho okuphawulwe, kubalwa izendlalelo ezingumgogodla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-rate ingaba futhi ngeyunithi ngayinye yokuyoda, ngamayunithi angu-1000 ngayinye okuyoda, noma nge-m³ ye-mortar. Lapho iyunithi inobude nokuphakama, \u003Cstrong\u003EWall types: takeoff data\u003C/strong\u003E ibonisa amayunithi nge-m² (noma ft²) yeqabunga elilodwa, amayunithi okuyoda kanye nevolumu ye-mortar; izifomula zisekuthi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/plan-schedules-and-pdf#bricks-blocks-and-mortar\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/plan-schedules-and-pdf\" data-hash=\"bricks-blocks-and-mortar\"\u003EBricks, blocks and mortar\u003C/a\u003E. Uhlobo linombono oyodwa weyunithi: amaqabunga amabili ngamayunithi ahlukene (iqabunga langaphandle lengyeza kanye neqabunga langaphakathi lebhulokhi) akwazi ukubalwa kuhlobo oluyodwa okwamanje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bamba-umgogodla-ungashintshi\"\u003EBamba umgogodla ungashintshi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-\u003Cstrong\u003EProperties\u003C/strong\u003E, setha \u003Cstrong\u003ELocation line\u003C/strong\u003E yodonga ibe ubuso bengaphakathi noma umugqa wengaphakathi. Uma kamuva wengeza noma ukhulisa okuqediwe, lowo mugqa uhlala lapho ukhona bese udonga lukhula luzungeze wona; izindonga ezihlangana nawo ekhoneni ziyawulandela, ngakho amakhona aqondile avale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinto-zephrojekthi\"\u003EIzinto zephrojekthi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaterial library…\u003C/span\u003E idla izinto zephrojekthi: igama, isigaba, ubukhulu isendlalelo esiqala ngabo, umbala wokubonisa, iphethini yokugcwalisa yokusika kanye namanothi. Umtapo ugcinwa ku-IFC kanye nephrojekthi. Ukukhetha into yesendlalelo kunika leso sendlalelo ubukhulu bokuzenzakalela bento, obungashintshwa; ukuhlela umtapo kamuva akuwushintshi udonga ovele wadweba. Ungenza futhi into entsha ohlwini lwezinto zesendlalelo ngo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E+ New material…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izilinganiso-zokubhekisela\"\u003EIzilinganiso zokubhekisela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAnnotate\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReference dimension\u003C/span\u003E: khetha okuthi horizontal, vertical noma aligned, bese ukhetha isibhekiselo: ubuso bokuqeda bangaphandle noma bangaphakathi, ubuso womgogodla bangaphandle noma bangaphakathi, umugqa wodonga ophakathi noma umugqa womgogodla. Khetha udonga lokuqala, shintsha isibhekiselo uma ufuna, khetha lesibili, bese uchofoza lapho umugqa wesilinganiso uzohlala khona. Izibhekiselo ezimbili kudonga oyodwa zilinganisa ubukhulu bayo bonke noma bomgogodla. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReference dimensions…\u003C/span\u003E ibhala izilinganiso zombono, kuhlanganise nalezo ezilahlekelwe udonga, ngePhrophathi, Rebind references kanye Delete.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"linganisa-ipulani-yonke-ngemithetho\"\u003ELinganisa ipulani yonke ngemithetho\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAnnotate\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDimension the plan…\u003C/span\u003E ilinganisa ingaphandle lepulani yesitezi oyibukile: usayizi ophelele ngaleyo ndlela, umugqa wezilinganiso eduze kwangaphandle ngalinye (izikhawu zezindonga, izindonga ezihlangana nomphetho, nezinmnyango nezifasiteli kuwo), izimiso zibekwe zikhululekile ekwakheni. Phawula okufunayo, bese ufunda inani, bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd the dimensions\u003C/span\u003E. Ziyizilinganiso zesibhekiselo ezijwayelekile, ngakho zilandela izindonga uma zinyakaza, futhi ungakhetha, uhambise noma usule noma yiyiphi kuzo; konke kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa, futhi ukuqalisa kabusha akwenzi nakancane.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIlinganisa ingaphandle kuphela: amagumbi angaphakathi kwesakhiwo, izindonga ezigobile nezindonga ezingekho ngokuqondile kwepulani ziyashiywa ngamathuluzi wesandla, futhi imigqa yegridi akuyona izindonga, ngakho izilinganiso phakathi kwegridi azenziwa lapha. Umsizi wakho oxhunyiwe angenza okufanayo nge-\u003Ccode\u003Eplan_dimension\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsilinganiso sixhunyiwe ezindongeni, hhayi endaweni ethile esikrinini: lapho udonga luhamba noma uhlobo lwalo lushintsha, inani liyalandela. Uma udonga lususiwe isilinganiso sithi asixazululiwe futhi asibonisi inombolo, kuze kube yilapho usibopha kabusha noma uhlehlise. Ibhokisi lobude lamukela nezixhumanisi zepulani ezifana no-\u003Ccode\u003E10&#039;,12&#039;\u003C/code\u003E womugqa wesilinganiso endaweni ethile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzilinganiso zezindonga ezakhiwe yi-BimCraft, emibonweni yepulani. Akusakhiwe okwamanje: izilinganiso ezigatshaneni nasemibonweni yobude, kwizinhlobo, amawindi nezinye izingxenye, nezendlalelo zokwakha ezidwetshwe epulanini nasigatshaneni; bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EOkungakakhiwa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bona-nokunye\"\u003EBona nokunye\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/draw-walls\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/draw-walls\"\u003EDweba izindonga\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/change-a-wall-or-door\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/change-a-wall-or-door\"\u003EShintsha udonga, umnyango noma iwindi\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/properties-panel\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/properties-panel\"\u003EProperties\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Yakha uhlobo lodonga olufana nodonga ozolakha: ukugoqa, ukugoqwa okungaphansi, umgogodla wensimbi ye-5½ amainshi kanye ne-drywall, noma ingqalasizinda, ingaphakathi lomoya kanye nodonga lohlaka lwezinkuni. Phawula izendlalelo ezingumgogodla, ukuze isilinganiso noma umugqa wendawo ugcine ingaphakathi kuthi izendlalelo eziphezu kwalo zishintshe. Bese ulinganisa izindonga ngobuso nangemigqa ehlala iphakathi oyifunayo. Yenza uhlobo lodonga Qala isakhiwo noma vula imodeli ye-IFC bese uvula Draw, bese ukhetha ithuluzi le-Wall. Khetha isisekelo ku-Wall type bese uvula Wall assemblies…. Isisekelo sivula njengekhophi; nika uhlobo olusha igama. Izendlalelo zihamba kusuka ngaphandle, phezulu kuhlu, kuya ngaphakathi, phansi kuhlu. Khetha izinto zendlalelo ngayinye, uthayiphe ubukhulu bayo (ubukhulu bephrojekthi, noma ubukhulu obucacile obufana no-12.7 mm noma 1/2\"), khetha umsebenzi wayo (ukuqeda, isisekelo, isakhiwo, ukugoqa, imembrane) bese uyiqaphela izendlalelo ze-Core. Ingaphakathi kumele libe yiqoqo elilodwa elingaphazamisekile. Add layer yengeza isendlalelo, Add cavity yengeza ingaphakathi lomoya kanye nokungena komoya (akucacisiwe, akunawo umoya, nomoya), Add membrane yengeza isendlalelo esingenaso ubukhulu obubalwayo, njengokugoqa indlu. Izicibisi zihambisa isendlalelo ngaphandle noma ngaphakathi. Ukubuka kuphrinta izendlalelo ngesikali, ingaphakathi ligcizelelwe, linombolo njengemigqa, futhi kulinganise isendlalelo ngasinye, ingaphakathi nobukhulu bonke. Save type. Uhlobo olusha lusemenwini ye-Wall tool nakwi-Properties yodonga olukhethiwe. Ukugcina uhlobo olulungisiwe kushintsha yonke indonga esilisebenzisayo; Duplicate type yenza olunye oluhlukile futhi luninikeze kuphela izindonga ozikhethile. Ukugcina ngakunye kungesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa, kanye nezindonga ezihamba nakho, izinmnyango nezifasiteli ezikuzo kanye nezilinganiso ezincike kuzo. Ingaphakathi lomoya lengeza ububanzi. Imembrane ayengezi lutho: ihlala kuhlobo ukuze uhlu lokuhlola lungayithola kamuva, futhi ayibalwa ekubhekeni ubukhulu bodonga noma bengaphakathi. Ingaphakathi lomoya noma imembrane akusoze kubalwe njengento eqinile. Kufayela elilondolozwe njenge-IFC2X3, imembrane igcinwa erekhodini lohlobo kodwa ishiywa ngaphandle kwezendlalelo zezinto ezibonakalayo. Phawula uhlobo ngezinga lokuthuthukiswa (LOD) Uhlobo lungatshela ukuthi luthuthukiswe kangakanani. Kumhleli, Level of development (LOD) inikeza isikali esisethiwe esingu-100, 200, 300, 350, 400 no-500, noma Not set. Udonga jikelele (\"Wall 230 generic\") buyi-LOD 100 noma 200; ukwakha okuthile okunezendlalelo zalo zangempela (\"230 clay brick, plastered both sides\") buyi-LOD 300 noma ngaphezulu. Ukuphawula kungokwakho ukukusetha: i-BimCraft ayiyibali, futhi izisekelo ezingenazo. Uphawu luvela eduzane negama lohlobo ohlwini lwe-Wall tool, ku-Properties yodonga nohlwini lwe-Swap type, nombiko emva kokushintsha uhlobo utshela ukuthi izinga liphakame noma liphansi. Ukuze ulibone ku-Walls by type nakwi-CSV yalo, phawula i-Show each wall type's LOD in the wall schedule ku-Izilungiselelo › BimCraft › Izindonga: kwengezwa ikholomu yokugcina, LOD. Igcinwa kufayela le-IFC kanye nohlobo (kusethi yempahla ye-CadCraft_WallType, njengempahla ethi LOD nangaphakathi kwerekhodi lohlobo), ukuze ikhona uma uvula kabusha ifayela. Uphawu lusebenza kuhlobo lodonga kuphela okwamanje, hhayi ezintweni ezikodwa noma ezinye izinhlobo zezinto. Izindonga ezijikelele zesigaba sokuskeba Uhlu lohlobo lwe-Wall tool luqala ngezindonga ezimbili ezijikelele: Generic wall 200 mm (exterior) kanye Generic wall 100 mm (interior). Ngayinye iyisendlalelo esisodwa sempahla ejikelele, ephawulwe njenge-LOD 200. Sebenzisa lezi uma wazi lapho izindonga zizokwenziwa khona kodwa ungakwazi okwenziwe ngakho. Udonga olunohlobo oluphawulwe LOD 100 noma LOD 200 lubonakala kuwo wonke amapulani njengomqimba oyodwa onemigqa, emazingeni wonke wemininingwane: akukho zendlalelo, akukho imigqa yezendlalelo. Lokho kuyiqiniso kwezindonga ezijikelele nakunoma yiluphi uhlobo lwakho oluphawula njenge-LOD 100 noma 200. Udonga ngokwalo luphelele: linobukhulu balo, izinmnyango nezifasiteli zalo, amagumbi alo nobuningi balo. Ukuzeulithuthukise, shintsha uhlobo lwalo (Edit › Izindonga › Swap type, noma Type ku-Properties). Udonga alusoze ludweywe kabusha: udonga olufanayo lungena kuhlobo olusha, nombiko utshela ukuthi yini eshintshile. Uhlobo oluphawulwe LOD 300 noma ngaphezulu lidwetshwa ngezendlalelo zalo njengakuqala. Ukuze udwebe zonke izindonga ngezendlalelo zazo nanoma yiluphi uphawu: Izilungiselelo › BimCraft › Izindonga, khipha Draw walls of an LOD 100 or LOD 200 type as one hatched band. Izinmnyango nezifasiteli zesisekelo nazo ziyizinhlobo ezijikelele (usayizi kanye nendlela yokuvula, hhayi umkhiqizo). Ngokuthi Show each wall type's LOD in the wall schedule isebenze, uhlu lwezinmnyango nezifasiteli lubonisa i-LOD 200 kuzo. Nika uhlobo idatha yokubala amanani Ku-editor yohlobo lodonga, Takeoff data ithatha okudingwa yi-estimator ngodonga, kanye kanye ngohlobo: iyunithi elakhiwe ngayo (ibhulokhi noma ingyeza: igama lalo, ubude, ukuphakama nobubanzi), i-mortar (igama nobukhulu bokuhlanganisa) kanye ne-rate ngekhodi yayo yemali (izinhlamvu ezintathu, njengo-USD, EUR noma ZAR) nokuthi iyini ngayinye: isikwele se-metre noma se-foot sendawo yodonga esisebenzayo, imitha noma i-foot yobude bodonga, noma ngayinye indonga. Konke lokhu akunandaba. Igcinwa nohlobo kufayela. Yonke indonga yohlobo ibika kokukhona: Schedules › Wall types: takeoff data ibhala iyunithi, i-mortar, i-rate kanye ne-rate ephindaphindwe ngesamba esilinganisiwe, futhi isiphakamiso esiya ku-TakeoffCraft sithwala lokho ku-item yalolu hlobo lodonga. Shintsha kuhlobo, bese zonke izindonga ziyalandela. Ezinye izinkambu ezintathu zokubala izingyeza noma amabhulokhi kanye ne-mortar: Waste on units, % iyengezwa kunani lamayunithi. Yishiye ingenalutho ukuze usebenzise inani lendlela yokulinganisa yephrojekthi, noma lutho uma indlela ingenalo. Faka 0 ukuze ube nokulahlekelwa okungu-zero noma yini indlela ethi. Extra mortar, % ilolo amafrogs noma imingxunya eyamukela i-mortar. Yengezwa kuvolumu ye-mortar. Yishiye ingenalutho uma ingekho. Layers built of this unit: phawula isendlalelo ngasinye esiyiqabunga lalesi singyeza noma ibhulokhi. Udonga oluyingqimba ololubili linamaqabunga amabili. Uma kungekho okuphawulwe, kubalwa izendlalelo ezingumgogodla. I-rate ingaba futhi ngeyunithi ngayinye yokuyoda, ngamayunithi angu-1000 ngayinye okuyoda, noma nge-m³ ye-mortar. Lapho iyunithi inobude nokuphakama, Wall types: takeoff data ibonisa amayunithi nge-m² (noma ft²) yeqabunga elilodwa, amayunithi okuyoda kanye nevolumu ye-mortar; izifomula zisekuthi Bricks, blocks and mortar. Uhlobo linombono oyodwa weyunithi: amaqabunga amabili ngamayunithi ahlukene (iqabunga langaphandle lengyeza kanye neqabunga langaphakathi lebhulokhi) akwazi ukubalwa kuhlobo oluyodwa okwamanje. Bamba umgogodla ungashintshi Ku-Properties, setha Location line yodonga ibe ubuso bengaphakathi noma umugqa wengaphakathi. Uma kamuva wengeza noma ukhulisa okuqediwe, lowo mugqa uhlala lapho ukhona bese udonga lukhula luzungeze wona; izindonga ezihlangana nawo ekhoneni ziyawulandela, ngakho amakhona aqondile avale. Izinto zephrojekthi Material library… idla izinto zephrojekthi: igama, isigaba, ubukhulu isendlalelo esiqala ngabo, umbala wokubonisa, iphethini yokugcwalisa yokusika kanye namanothi. Umtapo ugcinwa ku-IFC kanye nephrojekthi. Ukukhetha into yesendlalelo kunika leso sendlalelo ubukhulu bokuzenzakalela bento, obungashintshwa; ukuhlela umtapo kamuva akuwushintshi udonga ovele wadweba. Ungenza futhi into entsha ohlwini lwezinto zesendlalelo ngo-+ New material…. Izilinganiso zokubhekisela Annotate › Reference dimension: khetha okuthi horizontal, vertical noma aligned, bese ukhetha isibhekiselo: ubuso bokuqeda bangaphandle noma bangaphakathi, ubuso womgogodla bangaphandle noma bangaphakathi, umugqa wodonga ophakathi noma umugqa womgogodla. Khetha udonga lokuqala, shintsha isibhekiselo uma ufuna, khetha lesibili, bese uchofoza lapho umugqa wesilinganiso uzohlala khona. Izibhekiselo ezimbili kudonga oyodwa zilinganisa ubukhulu bayo bonke noma bomgogodla. Reference dimensions… ibhala izilinganiso zombono, kuhlanganise nalezo ezilahlekelwe udonga, ngePhrophathi, Rebind references kanye Delete. Linganisa ipulani yonke ngemithetho Annotate › Dimension the plan… ilinganisa ingaphandle lepulani yesitezi oyibukile: usayizi ophelele ngaleyo ndlela, umugqa wezilinganiso eduze kwangaphandle ngalinye (izikhawu zezindonga, izindonga ezihlangana nomphetho, nezinmnyango nezifasiteli kuwo), izimiso zibekwe zikhululekile ekwakheni. Phawula okufunayo, bese ufunda inani, bese uchofoza Add the dimensions. Ziyizilinganiso zesibhekiselo ezijwayelekile, ngakho zilandela izindonga uma zinyakaza, futhi ungakhetha, uhambise noma usule noma yiyiphi kuzo; konke kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa, futhi ukuqalisa kabusha akwenzi nakancane. Ilinganisa ingaphandle kuphela: amagumbi angaphakathi kwesakhiwo, izindonga ezigobile nezindonga ezingekho ngokuqondile kwepulani ziyashiywa ngamathuluzi wesandla, futhi imigqa yegridi akuyona izindonga, ngakho izilinganiso phakathi kwegridi azenziwa lapha. Umsizi wakho oxhunyiwe angenza okufanayo nge-plan_dimension. Isilinganiso sixhunyiwe ezindongeni, hhayi endaweni ethile esikrinini: lapho udonga luhamba noma uhlobo lwalo lushintsha, inani liyalandela. Uma udonga lususiwe isilinganiso sithi asixazululiwe futhi asibonisi inombolo, kuze kube yilapho usibopha kabusha noma uhlehlise. Ibhokisi lobude lamukela nezixhumanisi zepulani ezifana no-10',12' womugqa wesilinganiso endaweni ethile. Izilinganiso zezindonga ezakhiwe yi-BimCraft, emibonweni yepulani. Akusakhiwe okwamanje: izilinganiso ezigatshaneni nasemibonweni yobude, kwizinhlobo, amawindi nezinye izingxenye, nezendlalelo zokwakha ezidwetshwe epulanini nasigatshaneni; bheka Okungakakhiwa. Bona nokunye Dweba izindonga, Shintsha udonga, umnyango noma iwindi, Properties.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"classification","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Amakhodi okuhlukaniswa (Uniclass, OmniClass, UniFormat)","summary":"Nika yonke into nohlobo ikhodi yokuhlukaniswa, khetha izinhlelo ephrojekthi esetshenziswa, sesha amathebula e-Uniclass afika ne-app, layisha amathebula asemtapweni wakho alayisensiwe, bese ubonisa amakhodi kumashejuli. Amakhodi abhalwa ku-IFC ukuze asetshenziswe ezinye izinhlelo.","section":"tasks","order":18,"keywords":["ukuhlukaniswa","hlukanisa","ikhodi","uniclass","omniclass","uniformat","nbs","csi","ef","ss","pr","ithebula","ikhodi yento","ikhodi yohlobo","ikhodi ezenzakalelayo","IfcClassification","IfcClassificationReference","cobie","ikholomu yeshedyuli","csv","ilayisensi","licence"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"nika-into-ikhodi","text":"Nika into ikhodi","level":2},{"id":"khetha-izinhlelo-zephrojekthi","text":"Khetha izinhlelo zephrojekthi","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukwazi","text":"Okufanele ukwazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBeka ikhodi yokuhlukaniswa ezindongeni, emafolweni, kuphahla, emasilaweni, emawindini nakho konke okunye kumodeli, ezinhlelweni ezintathu ngakunye: Uniclass, OmniClass ne-UniFormat. Ezinye izigaba nezinhlelo zesofthiwe zincika ekhodini, hhayi egameni, ngakho amakhodi agcinwa kufayela le-IFC njengezinkomba zokuhlukaniswa ezifundwa yinoma iyiphi inhlelo ye-BIM.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nika-into-ikhodi\"\u003ENika into ikhodi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha into (noma ezimbalwa) bese uvula \u003Cstrong\u003EIprophathi\u003C/strong\u003E. Vula isigaba esithi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClassification\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBhala ikhodi ebhokisini lohlelo lwayo bese ucindezela Enter. Uma uhlu lwamakhodi selulayishiwe, bhala ingxenye yekhodi noma amagama ambalwa (&quot;curtain wall&quot;) bese ukhetha okufanayo: isihloko sekhodi sigcwaliswa wena.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EApplies to\u003C/span\u003E ichaza ukuthi ikhodi iya kuphi: \u003Cstrong\u003ELe nto\u003C/strong\u003E, noma \u003Cstrong\u003EUhlobo lwayo (yonke into yohlobo)\u003C/strong\u003E. Ikhodi kuhlobo lodonga ifundwa wonke amadonga alolohlobo, nalawo ozawadweba kamuva.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESula\u003C/span\u003E isusa ikhodi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgaphansi kwekhodi ngayinye isigaba sitshela ukuthi itholakala kuphi: isethwe kule nto, isuka ohlobeni lwayo, noma i-default yephrojekthi yesigaba sayo. Ikhodi yento yayo ngokwayo ihlala ibaluleke kunekhodi yohlobo lwayo, nekhodi yohlobo ibaluleke kunezenzakalelo. Uma kukhethwe izinto eziningi, ibhokisi elithi &quot;ahlukile&quot; lisho ukuthi azabelani ngekhodi eyodwa; ukubhala eyodwa iyinika zonke. Ushintsho ngalunye kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIkhodi ingabhalwa njalo, noma uhlu lulayishiwe noma akulayishiwe. Uma ingafani nekhodi yalolu hlelo, noma ingekho ohlwini olulayishiwe, isaziso siyakusho lokho futhi ikhodi igcinwa njengoba uyibhalile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khetha-izinhlelo-zephrojekthi\"\u003EKhetha izinhlelo zephrojekthi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula \u003Cstrong\u003EIdatha\u003C/strong\u003E ebhareni lemodeli bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClassification\u003C/span\u003E (noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProject classification…\u003C/span\u003E esigabeni se-Iprophathi).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThikha izinhlelo ephrojekthi esetshenziswa. Iprophathi ibonisa kuphela lezo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUniclass\u003C/strong\u003E: amathebula e-Elements/ functions (EF), Systems (Ss) nawe-Products (Pr) afika ne-app. Ayi-© NBS, alayisensiwe nge-Creative Commons Attribution-NoDerivatives 4.0, futhi adluliselwa engashintshiwe. Ingxoxo ibonisa inguqulo yethebula ngalinye nosuku lokuthi lafundwa ngalo. Awona amathebula amasha kakhulu: umshicileli uwashicilela njalo ngekota kusayithi lakhe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOmniClass\u003C/strong\u003E ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EUniFormat\u003C/strong\u003E: akukho uhlu lwamakhodi olufika ne-app, ngoba umshicileli wabo akavumeli amathebula ukudluliselwa ngaphandle kwelayisensi. Bhala noma yiliphi ikhodi, noma layisha ithebula elilayisensiwe lomtapo wakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELoad a table (CSV)…\u003C/span\u003E ifunda ithebula lomtapo wakho kufayela le-CSV elinekholomu yekhodi nekholomu yesihloko (umugqa wekhanda othi Code, Number noma Identifier kanye no-Title, Name noma Description utholakala wodwa; uma kungekho, kusetshenziswa amakholomu amabili okuqala). Ithebula lihlala kulesi sisheshi sebhrawuza futhi alifakwa ephrojekthini. Amakhodi owabelayo kuphela ayagcinwa kufayela. Ungalayisha ithebula elisha le-Uniclass ngale ndlela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGive elements a default code by their class\u003C/span\u003E inika wonke udonga, ifolo, uphahla, umnyango, ifasitele, isitebhisi, indlela ethambile, insika, ibhimu nento yefenisha ikhodi yokuqala ye-Uniclass kusuka kuthebula le-Elements/ functions uma lingenayo eyayo. Izinto ozidweba kamuva nazo ziyayithola.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow the codes as columns in the schedules\u003C/span\u003E yengeza ikholomu eyodwa ngohlelo ngalunye kumashejuli we-Iminyango, Amawindi, Izindonga ngohlobo kanye Namagumbi nakwi-CSV yawo. Umugqa wezinto ezimbalwa ubonisa &quot;ahlukile&quot; uma amakhodi azo ehlukile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukwazi\"\u003EOkufanele ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAma-default amakhodi ayisinqumo sokuqala se-CadCraft, hhayi se-publisher, futhi awakahlolwa ngumuntu oyisazi. Hlola wona ngokumelene nezinga lephrojekthi yakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEfayelini, i-default iwukuhlukaniswa okuqinile, imakwe ngegama lobudlelwano elithi &quot;CadCraft default&quot;, futhi iyanyamalala uma into noma uhlobo lwayo sekutholile ikhodi yayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmakhodi asevele efayelini eyethulwe ayafundwa abonakale, nanoma yiliphi igama lesigaba elisetshenziswa yenye inhlelo. Amakhodi wanoma yiluphi uhlelo olunye (lwehhovisi) ayalandwa futhi aziwathintwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmakhodi ayafundwa futhi uma ifayela livulwa futhi, lapha noma kwenye inhlelo. Aphinde afakwe ku-IFC5 alpha (IFCX) uma leyo ngoyokuhlola ivuliwe, ngaphandle kwekhodi esethwe kuphahla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkwakhiwe okwamanje: umthi wokuphequlula ithebula ngezinga ngezinga, amakhodi emazingeni namakamelo njengezenzakalelo zephrojekthi, nokuhlola ikhodi ngokuhambisana nenguqulo echazwe kufayela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Beka ikhodi yokuhlukaniswa ezindongeni, emafolweni, kuphahla, emasilaweni, emawindini nakho konke okunye kumodeli, ezinhlelweni ezintathu ngakunye: Uniclass, OmniClass ne-UniFormat. Ezinye izigaba nezinhlelo zesofthiwe zincika ekhodini, hhayi egameni, ngakho amakhodi agcinwa kufayela le-IFC njengezinkomba zokuhlukaniswa ezifundwa yinoma iyiphi inhlelo ye-BIM. Nika into ikhodi Khetha into (noma ezimbalwa) bese uvula Iprophathi. Vula isigaba esithi Classification. Bhala ikhodi ebhokisini lohlelo lwayo bese ucindezela Enter. Uma uhlu lwamakhodi selulayishiwe, bhala ingxenye yekhodi noma amagama ambalwa (\"curtain wall\") bese ukhetha okufanayo: isihloko sekhodi sigcwaliswa wena. Applies to ichaza ukuthi ikhodi iya kuphi: Le nto, noma Uhlobo lwayo (yonke into yohlobo). Ikhodi kuhlobo lodonga ifundwa wonke amadonga alolohlobo, nalawo ozawadweba kamuva. Sula isusa ikhodi. Ngaphansi kwekhodi ngayinye isigaba sitshela ukuthi itholakala kuphi: isethwe kule nto, isuka ohlobeni lwayo, noma i-default yephrojekthi yesigaba sayo. Ikhodi yento yayo ngokwayo ihlala ibaluleke kunekhodi yohlobo lwayo, nekhodi yohlobo ibaluleke kunezenzakalelo. Uma kukhethwe izinto eziningi, ibhokisi elithi \"ahlukile\" lisho ukuthi azabelani ngekhodi eyodwa; ukubhala eyodwa iyinika zonke. Ushintsho ngalunye kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Ikhodi ingabhalwa njalo, noma uhlu lulayishiwe noma akulayishiwe. Uma ingafani nekhodi yalolu hlelo, noma ingekho ohlwini olulayishiwe, isaziso siyakusho lokho futhi ikhodi igcinwa njengoba uyibhalile. Khetha izinhlelo zephrojekthi Vula Idatha ebhareni lemodeli bese ukhetha Classification (noma Project classification… esigabeni se-Iprophathi). Thikha izinhlelo ephrojekthi esetshenziswa. Iprophathi ibonisa kuphela lezo. Uniclass: amathebula e-Elements/ functions (EF), Systems (Ss) nawe-Products (Pr) afika ne-app. Ayi-© NBS, alayisensiwe nge-Creative Commons Attribution-NoDerivatives 4.0, futhi adluliselwa engashintshiwe. Ingxoxo ibonisa inguqulo yethebula ngalinye nosuku lokuthi lafundwa ngalo. Awona amathebula amasha kakhulu: umshicileli uwashicilela njalo ngekota kusayithi lakhe. OmniClass ne-UniFormat: akukho uhlu lwamakhodi olufika ne-app, ngoba umshicileli wabo akavumeli amathebula ukudluliselwa ngaphandle kwelayisensi. Bhala noma yiliphi ikhodi, noma layisha ithebula elilayisensiwe lomtapo wakho. Load a table (CSV)… ifunda ithebula lomtapo wakho kufayela le-CSV elinekholomu yekhodi nekholomu yesihloko (umugqa wekhanda othi Code, Number noma Identifier kanye no-Title, Name noma Description utholakala wodwa; uma kungekho, kusetshenziswa amakholomu amabili okuqala). Ithebula lihlala kulesi sisheshi sebhrawuza futhi alifakwa ephrojekthini. Amakhodi owabelayo kuphela ayagcinwa kufayela. Ungalayisha ithebula elisha le-Uniclass ngale ndlela. Give elements a default code by their class inika wonke udonga, ifolo, uphahla, umnyango, ifasitele, isitebhisi, indlela ethambile, insika, ibhimu nento yefenisha ikhodi yokuqala ye-Uniclass kusuka kuthebula le-Elements/ functions uma lingenayo eyayo. Izinto ozidweba kamuva nazo ziyayithola. Show the codes as columns in the schedules yengeza ikholomu eyodwa ngohlelo ngalunye kumashejuli we-Iminyango, Amawindi, Izindonga ngohlobo kanye Namagumbi nakwi-CSV yawo. Umugqa wezinto ezimbalwa ubonisa \"ahlukile\" uma amakhodi azo ehlukile. Okufanele ukwazi Ama-default amakhodi ayisinqumo sokuqala se-CadCraft, hhayi se-publisher, futhi awakahlolwa ngumuntu oyisazi. Hlola wona ngokumelene nezinga lephrojekthi yakho. Efayelini, i-default iwukuhlukaniswa okuqinile, imakwe ngegama lobudlelwano elithi \"CadCraft default\", futhi iyanyamalala uma into noma uhlobo lwayo sekutholile ikhodi yayo. Amakhodi asevele efayelini eyethulwe ayafundwa abonakale, nanoma yiliphi igama lesigaba elisetshenziswa yenye inhlelo. Amakhodi wanoma yiluphi uhlelo olunye (lwehhovisi) ayalandwa futhi aziwathintwa. Amakhodi ayafundwa futhi uma ifayela livulwa futhi, lapha noma kwenye inhlelo. Aphinde afakwe ku-IFC5 alpha (IFCX) uma leyo ngoyokuhlola ivuliwe, ngaphandle kwekhodi esethwe kuphahla. Akwakhiwe okwamanje: umthi wokuphequlula ithebula ngezinga ngezinga, amakhodi emazingeni namakamelo njengezenzakalelo zephrojekthi, nokuhlola ikhodi ngokuhambisana nenguqulo echazwe kufayela.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"change-a-wall-or-door","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Shintsha udonga, umnyango noma iwindi","summary":"Chofoza udonga, umnyango noma iwindi elidwetshiwe bese ushintsha uhlobo, usayizi, ukuphakama noma indawo yalo ku-Izakhiwo, noma uyidonse epulanini; ushintsho ngalunye ingesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa.","section":"tasks","order":18,"keywords":["yenza isikwele","isikwele","90","i-angle elilungile","ukuphambuka","i-angle","ortho","usayizi wegumbi","ubuso bangaphakathi","ubuso bangaphandle","linganisa kusuka","ibanga lokuhamba","ibanga elithayiphiwe","ogobile","arc","ukuphakama kwe-arc","umsakazo","umugqa wendawo","ukulinganisa","shintsha","hlela","izakhiwo","uhlobo lodonga","ukujula","ubude","ukuphakama","ukubekwa esisekelweni","phezulu","izinga","phendula","ngaphandle","usayizi womnyango","usayizi wewindi","isill","ibanga","hambisa","isibambo","donsa","shintsha uhlobo","amaningi"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"shintsha-udonga","text":"Shintsha udonga","level":2},{"id":"hambisa-udonga-epulanini","text":"Hambisa udonga epulanini","level":2},{"id":"shintsha-umnyango-noma-iwindi","text":"Shintsha umnyango noma iwindi","level":2},{"id":"shintsha-okuningi-ngesikhathi-esisodwa","text":"Shintsha okuningi ngesikhathi esisodwa","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukwazi","text":"Okufanele ukwazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShintsha okudwetshile: khetha udonga, umnyango noma iwindi, bese uthayipha inombolo entsha ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzakhiwo\u003C/strong\u003E noma uyidonse epulanini. Ipulani nombono we-3D kuyalandela, amakhona ayahlangana futhi, namasango namawindi ahlala ezindongeni zawo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shintsha-udonga\"\u003EShintsha udonga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw\u003C/span\u003E ovuliwe no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E uvuliwe, chofoza udonga epulanini (noma embonweni we-3D).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzakhiwo\u003C/strong\u003E ibonisa ibhokisi elinezinombolo zodonga. Shintsha enye bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUhlobo lodonga\u003C/strong\u003E: enye yezinhlobo ezisisekelo. Ukujula nezendlalelo kushintsha nakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkujula\u003C/strong\u003E: noma yikuphi ukujula. Uhlobo luhlala nezendlalelo zalo, nendlalelo yalo enkulu (imbanjwa noma ibhulokhi) ithatha umehluko, isibonelo &quot;Exterior 2×6, 200 mm&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELinganisa kusuka\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cstrong\u003EUmugqa wephakathi\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EUbuso bangaphakathi\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003EUbuso bangaphandle\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EUbude\u003C/strong\u003E nesi-\u003Cstrong\u003EUsayizi wegumbi\u003C/strong\u003E kufundwa futhi kusethwe kusukela kulo. Ubuso bangaphandle yilokho okukhonjiswa izilinganiso zepulani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUbude\u003C/strong\u003E: ukuphela kodonga kuhamba ngomugqa wakho. Udonga oluxhunyelwe kuleyo ngxenye luhamba lusesikwele kwalo, luhlale lunengange layo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUsayizi wegumbi\u003C/strong\u003E (uma kukhona udonga oluhambisana nalo egumbini): thayipha usayizi ofuna. Lolu donga luhamba lusesikwele, nezindonga ezixhunyiwe zelula ukuze zilandele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHambisa isikwele\u003C/strong\u003E: thayipha ukuthi udonga luhanjiswe kangakanani luye esikwele kwalo: inombolo evamile iyaliphelelisa ngaphandle, inombolo enokuthi ngaphansi iyalingenisa ngaphakathi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EI-angle kudonga oluxhunyiwe\u003C/strong\u003E: i-angle kudonga oluxhunyiwe ekuqaleni kwalo. Thayipha 90 ukuze ibe sesikwele. Udonga oluxhunywe ngalutho luveza \u003Cstrong\u003EUkuqondisa\u003C/strong\u003E, ngamadigri kusuka empumalanga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESquare up\u003C/span\u003E: ibuyisela izindonga ezixhunyiwe kulo ezingama-angle alungile, ngendlela ubude bazo obuningi obuhamba kuyo. Lisebenza ngoyonke umgomo oxhunyiwe noma ngolunye lwezindonga ozikhethayo. Udonga oludlula ama-degree angu-10 ngaphandle kwe-angle elilungile luhlala njengalo, ngakho owasethwa ku-45 degrees uyavikeleka. Ukuhlehlisa okukodwa (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E) kubuyisela konke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuphakama kodonga\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cstrong\u003EKuze kufike phezulu kwezinga elingaphezulu\u003C/strong\u003E kulandela leyo nzinga, \u003Cstrong\u003EKuze kufike ku-Izinga 3\u003C/strong\u003E (nanoma yiliphi izinga elingaphezulu) yenza udonga oludlula amazinga aphakathi; ukuthayipha ukuphakama kusetha ukuthi phezulu kunjani ngaphansi noma ngaphezulu kwalelo zinga. \u003Cstrong\u003EUkuphakama okuqinisiwe\u003C/strong\u003E kugcina inombolo oyithayipha. \u003Cstrong\u003EIgijima ngaphakathi\u003C/strong\u003E ibala amazinga udonga ohamba kuwo: ukhombisa kukhanye ezipulanini zawo, amagumbi alapho avalekela kuwo, nemihlaba namawindi ingabekwa kuwo kusuka kulawo mapulani. Lihanjiswa futhi lihlelwe ngokwakhiwa esingeni aqala kulo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkubekwa esisekelweni\u003C/strong\u003E: kuphakama kangakanani phezu kwezinga udonga aqala kulo. Phezulu kwawo kuhlala lapho bekukhona khona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENgaphandle\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFlip\u003C/span\u003E ibeka izendlalelo zangaphandle ohlangothini olunye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmugqa wendawo\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cstrong\u003EUmugqa wephakathi\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EUbuso bangaphandle\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EUbuso bangaphakathi\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EUbuso bangakwesobunxele\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003EUbuso bangakwesokudla\u003C/strong\u003E. Ukushintsha lokho akuhambisi lutho. Kamuva, uma udonga lukhula (ngohlobo noma \u003Cstrong\u003EUkujula\u003C/strong\u003E) noma ngaphandle kwalo kuphenduliwe, umugqa wendawo uhlala lapho uhlala khona, udonga lukhule noma luphendulwe lungene ngawo. Udonga oluqondile olwehlangana nalo ekhoneni luyalandela, ngakho ikhona iyavaleka. Umugqa wendawo wodonga oluke lwakhethwa udwetshwa ngodashi epulanini. Khetha izindonga eziningi ukuze uwusethe kuzo zonke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuphakama kwe-arc\u003C/strong\u003E (izindonga ezigobile): ukuthi umphakathi ubheke kangakanani ngaphandle komugqa oqondile. 0 uyenza iqondile; inani elingamanani elibi liyigoba ngakolunye uhlangothi. Umsakazo ukhonjiswa eceleni kwayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUshintsho ngalunye yisinyathelo esisodwa kwi-\u003Cstrong\u003EChanges\u003C/strong\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E iyahlehlisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hambisa-udonga-epulanini\"\u003EHambisa udonga epulanini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELapho udonga olulodwa lukhethiwe, lubonisa izibambo ezintathu: isikwele ekugcineni ngakunye nesiyingi maphakathi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDonsa ukuphela ukwenza udonga lube side, lufinyeke noma luguqule. Luyazizwa njengethuluzi lodonga, futhi luzithinte luye esikwele nodonga oluxhunywe kwesinye isiphetho uma ususeduze kwamadigri angu-3; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ilugcina ngama-axis epulani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzindonga ezixhunywe kwisiphetho odonsa kuso zigcina i-angle yazo: ukuphela kwazo kuhamba ngemigqa yazo ukuze kuhlangane nomugqa omusha wodonga, ngakho akukho okuthambekile. Bamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze uhambe ngokukhululekile (ukuphela kodonga oluxhunyiwe kuhamba nowakho futhi lowo donga luyaphendulwa), noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze uchithe ukuxhumana kulo donga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDonsa esiyingini phakathi ukuze uhambise udonga lonke lube sesikwele kwalo, noma ngasiphi isiqondiso. Amakhona alo ahamba ezindongeni ezixhunyiwe, ngakho lezo zindonga zigcina i-angle yazo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ngenkathi udonsa esiyingini ukuze uhambe ngokukhululekile, uma ufuna ukwephula i-angle. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESquare up\u003C/span\u003E iyibuyisela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgenkathi kubanjwe isibambo, thayipha ibanga bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (noma uyeke): udonga luhamba kanye leli banga, ngendlela owayedonsa ngayo. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyayeka ukuhamba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUdonga oluge lukhethiwe lubonisa izibambo ezisemaphethelweni nesibambo esijikelezayo ephakathi kwe-arc yalo. Donsa isibambo esijikelezayo ukuze ugoba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIminyango namawindi ahlala edongeni. Udonga olumfishane kakhulu ngokwalokho olubambe lunqatshelwa ngomlayezo othi &quot;It doesn&#039;t fit in that wall.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shintsha-umnyango-noma-iwindi\"\u003EShintsha umnyango noma iwindi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza umnyango noma iwindi epulanini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzakhiwo\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cstrong\u003EUhlobo\u003C/strong\u003E (omunye umnyango noma iwindi lohlobo olufanayo), \u003Cstrong\u003EUbubanzi\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EUkuphakama\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EIsill\u003C/strong\u003E (amawindi), \u003Cstrong\u003EKusuka esiqalweni\u003C/strong\u003E nochungechunge \u003Cstrong\u003EKusuka esiphethelweni\u003C/strong\u003E (ibanga kusuka kulo lonke iphethelo lobuso bodonga kuya ocingweni lwalo), \u003Cstrong\u003EIzimbadada\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFlip\u003C/span\u003E (iminyango enelitha elilodwa namawindi amagobolo; iminyango esuka ngaphansi, eyisikhwama, yesitebhisi nebhalwe ngaphezulu ithi \u003Cstrong\u003EIvulela ku\u003C/strong\u003E esikhundleni; amawindi amile, alenga nemifanekiso kanye neminyango emibili awanalo), no-\u003Cstrong\u003EIvulela ku\u003C/strong\u003E (iminyango) noma \u003Cstrong\u003EUhlangothi lwefreyimu\u003C/strong\u003E (amawindi) \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFlip\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENoma uyidonse ngodonga lwayo, noma uyisunduze odongeni olunye: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/doors-and-windows\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/doors-and-windows\"\u003EIminyango namawindi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shintsha-okuningi-ngesikhathi-esisodwa\"\u003EShintsha okuningi ngesikhathi esisodwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha izindonga eziningi (noma iminyango, noma amawindi) nge-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+chofoza noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+chofoza. \u003Cstrong\u003EIzakhiwo\u003C/strong\u003E inikeza lokho ababelana ngakho: \u003Cstrong\u003EShintsha uhlobo…\u003C/strong\u003E, ukuphakama, usayizi. Ushintsho olulodwa lubeka zonke, nokuhlehlisa okukodwa (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E) kubuyisela konke.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukwazi\"\u003EOkufanele ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinombolo zibonakala ngo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnits\u003C/span\u003E okukhethwe kwibha yamathuluzi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzindonga, iminyango namawindi avela kwezinye izinhlelo zibonisa idatha yabo ye-IFC ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzakhiwo\u003C/strong\u003E njengakuqala, ngaphandle kwalelo bhokisi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Shintsha okudwetshile: khetha udonga, umnyango noma iwindi, bese uthayipha inombolo entsha ku-Izakhiwo noma uyidonse epulanini. Ipulani nombono we-3D kuyalandela, amakhona ayahlangana futhi, namasango namawindi ahlala ezindongeni zawo. Shintsha udonga Ngo-Draw ovuliwe no-Select uvuliwe, chofoza udonga epulanini (noma embonweni we-3D). Izakhiwo ibonisa ibhokisi elinezinombolo zodonga. Shintsha enye bese ucindezela Enter: Uhlobo lodonga: enye yezinhlobo ezisisekelo. Ukujula nezendlalelo kushintsha nakho. Ukujula: noma yikuphi ukujula. Uhlobo luhlala nezendlalelo zalo, nendlalelo yalo enkulu (imbanjwa noma ibhulokhi) ithatha umehluko, isibonelo \"Exterior 2×6, 200 mm\". Linganisa kusuka: Umugqa wephakathi, Ubuso bangaphakathi noma Ubuso bangaphandle. Ubude nesi-Usayizi wegumbi kufundwa futhi kusethwe kusukela kulo. Ubuso bangaphandle yilokho okukhonjiswa izilinganiso zepulani. Ubude: ukuphela kodonga kuhamba ngomugqa wakho. Udonga oluxhunyelwe kuleyo ngxenye luhamba lusesikwele kwalo, luhlale lunengange layo. Usayizi wegumbi (uma kukhona udonga oluhambisana nalo egumbini): thayipha usayizi ofuna. Lolu donga luhamba lusesikwele, nezindonga ezixhunyiwe zelula ukuze zilandele. Hambisa isikwele: thayipha ukuthi udonga luhanjiswe kangakanani luye esikwele kwalo: inombolo evamile iyaliphelelisa ngaphandle, inombolo enokuthi ngaphansi iyalingenisa ngaphakathi. I-angle kudonga oluxhunyiwe: i-angle kudonga oluxhunyiwe ekuqaleni kwalo. Thayipha 90 ukuze ibe sesikwele. Udonga oluxhunywe ngalutho luveza Ukuqondisa, ngamadigri kusuka empumalanga. Square up: ibuyisela izindonga ezixhunyiwe kulo ezingama-angle alungile, ngendlela ubude bazo obuningi obuhamba kuyo. Lisebenza ngoyonke umgomo oxhunyiwe noma ngolunye lwezindonga ozikhethayo. Udonga oludlula ama-degree angu-10 ngaphandle kwe-angle elilungile luhlala njengalo, ngakho owasethwa ku-45 degrees uyavikeleka. Ukuhlehlisa okukodwa (Undo) kubuyisela konke. Ukuphakama kodonga: Kuze kufike phezulu kwezinga elingaphezulu kulandela leyo nzinga, Kuze kufike ku-Izinga 3 (nanoma yiliphi izinga elingaphezulu) yenza udonga oludlula amazinga aphakathi; ukuthayipha ukuphakama kusetha ukuthi phezulu kunjani ngaphansi noma ngaphezulu kwalelo zinga. Ukuphakama okuqinisiwe kugcina inombolo oyithayipha. Igijima ngaphakathi ibala amazinga udonga ohamba kuwo: ukhombisa kukhanye ezipulanini zawo, amagumbi alapho avalekela kuwo, nemihlaba namawindi ingabekwa kuwo kusuka kulawo mapulani. Lihanjiswa futhi lihlelwe ngokwakhiwa esingeni aqala kulo. Ukubekwa esisekelweni: kuphakama kangakanani phezu kwezinga udonga aqala kulo. Phezulu kwawo kuhlala lapho bekukhona khona. Ngaphandle: Flip ibeka izendlalelo zangaphandle ohlangothini olunye. Umugqa wendawo: Umugqa wephakathi, Ubuso bangaphandle, Ubuso bangaphakathi, Ubuso bangakwesobunxele noma Ubuso bangakwesokudla. Ukushintsha lokho akuhambisi lutho. Kamuva, uma udonga lukhula (ngohlobo noma Ukujula) noma ngaphandle kwalo kuphenduliwe, umugqa wendawo uhlala lapho uhlala khona, udonga lukhule noma luphendulwe lungene ngawo. Udonga oluqondile olwehlangana nalo ekhoneni luyalandela, ngakho ikhona iyavaleka. Umugqa wendawo wodonga oluke lwakhethwa udwetshwa ngodashi epulanini. Khetha izindonga eziningi ukuze uwusethe kuzo zonke. Ukuphakama kwe-arc (izindonga ezigobile): ukuthi umphakathi ubheke kangakanani ngaphandle komugqa oqondile. 0 uyenza iqondile; inani elingamanani elibi liyigoba ngakolunye uhlangothi. Umsakazo ukhonjiswa eceleni kwayo. Ushintsho ngalunye yisinyathelo esisodwa kwi-Changes; Undo iyahlehlisa. Hambisa udonga epulanini Lapho udonga olulodwa lukhethiwe, lubonisa izibambo ezintathu: isikwele ekugcineni ngakunye nesiyingi maphakathi. Donsa ukuphela ukwenza udonga lube side, lufinyeke noma luguqule. Luyazizwa njengethuluzi lodonga, futhi luzithinte luye esikwele nodonga oluxhunywe kwesinye isiphetho uma ususeduze kwamadigri angu-3; Shift ilugcina ngama-axis epulani. Izindonga ezixhunywe kwisiphetho odonsa kuso zigcina i-angle yazo: ukuphela kwazo kuhamba ngemigqa yazo ukuze kuhlangane nomugqa omusha wodonga, ngakho akukho okuthambekile. Bamba Ctrl ukuze uhambe ngokukhululekile (ukuphela kodonga oluxhunyiwe kuhamba nowakho futhi lowo donga luyaphendulwa), noma Alt ukuze uchithe ukuxhumana kulo donga. Donsa esiyingini phakathi ukuze uhambise udonga lonke lube sesikwele kwalo, noma ngasiphi isiqondiso. Amakhona alo ahamba ezindongeni ezixhunyiwe, ngakho lezo zindonga zigcina i-angle yazo. Bamba Ctrl ngenkathi udonsa esiyingini ukuze uhambe ngokukhululekile, uma ufuna ukwephula i-angle. Square up iyibuyisela. Ngenkathi kubanjwe isibambo, thayipha ibanga bese ucindezela Enter (noma uyeke): udonga luhamba kanye leli banga, ngendlela owayedonsa ngayo. Esc iyayeka ukuhamba. Udonga oluge lukhethiwe lubonisa izibambo ezisemaphethelweni nesibambo esijikelezayo ephakathi kwe-arc yalo. Donsa isibambo esijikelezayo ukuze ugoba. Iminyango namawindi ahlala edongeni. Udonga olumfishane kakhulu ngokwalokho olubambe lunqatshelwa ngomlayezo othi \"It doesn't fit in that wall.\" Shintsha umnyango noma iwindi Chofoza umnyango noma iwindi epulanini. Ku-Izakhiwo: Uhlobo (omunye umnyango noma iwindi lohlobo olufanayo), Ububanzi, Ukuphakama, Isill (amawindi), Kusuka esiqalweni nochungechunge Kusuka esiphethelweni (ibanga kusuka kulo lonke iphethelo lobuso bodonga kuya ocingweni lwalo), Izimbadada Flip (iminyango enelitha elilodwa namawindi amagobolo; iminyango esuka ngaphansi, eyisikhwama, yesitebhisi nebhalwe ngaphezulu ithi Ivulela ku esikhundleni; amawindi amile, alenga nemifanekiso kanye neminyango emibili awanalo), no-Ivulela ku (iminyango) noma Uhlangothi lwefreyimu (amawindi) Flip. Noma uyidonse ngodonga lwayo, noma uyisunduze odongeni olunye: bona Iminyango namawindi. Shintsha okuningi ngesikhathi esisodwa Khetha izindonga eziningi (noma iminyango, noma amawindi) nge-Shift+chofoza noma Ctrl+chofoza. Izakhiwo inikeza lokho ababelana ngakho: Shintsha uhlobo…, ukuphakama, usayizi. Ushintsho olulodwa lubeka zonke, nokuhlehlisa okukodwa (Undo) kubuyisela konke. Okufanele ukwazi Izinombolo zibonakala ngo-Units okukhethwe kwibha yamathuluzi. Izindonga, iminyango namawindi avela kwezinye izinhlelo zibonisa idatha yabo ye-IFC ku-Izakhiwo njengakuqala, ngaphandle kwalelo bhokisi.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"wall-shape","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Yakha udonga: hlanganisa, iphrofayili, ukuthambeka nezimbobo","summary":"Hlanganisa phezulu kwedonga nophahla, isilele noma ukhilingi, ulenze ube nokuthambeka, noma usike imbobo ngaphandle komnyango noma iwindi, ku-Properties, kubuso bohlangothi noma esigabeni, embonweni wawo wobuso noma ku-3D; ngayinye iwukuhlehlisa okukodwa.","section":"tasks","order":18,"keywords":["hlanganisa","hlanganisa phezulu","hlanganisa isisekelo","uphahla","iphansi","ulwelwesi","igable","iphrofayili","hlela iphrofayili","umugqa wohlangothi","ukwenyuka","parapet","ukuthambeka","ukuthambeka okuphindwe kabili","ukukhombisa","ukugoba","imbobo","imbobo yodonga","umgodi","ukudlula","akukho mnyango","izibambi","isilinganiso","isigaba","3D","ubuso","udonga olugobile","ikhophi"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"lapho-ungenza-khona","text":"Lapho ungenza khona","level":2},{"id":"hlanganisa-phezulu-noma-isisekelo","text":"Hlanganisa phezulu noma isisekelo","level":2},{"id":"hlela-iphrofayili","text":"Hlela iphrofayili","level":2},{"id":"ukuthambekisa-udonga","text":"Ukuthambekisa udonga","level":2},{"id":"izimbobo-ngaphandle-komnyango-noma-iwindi","text":"Izimbobo ngaphandle komnyango noma iwindi","level":2},{"id":"esigabeni-nasekubukekeni-kohlangothi","text":"Esigabeni nasekubukekeni kohlangothi","level":2},{"id":"epulanini-nasemibonweni-ye-3d","text":"Epulanini nasemibonweni ye-3D","level":2},{"id":"epulanini","text":"Epulanini","level":2},{"id":"amakhophi","text":"Amakhophi","level":2},{"id":"efayeleni","text":"Efayeleni","level":2},{"id":"akusakhiwe-okwamanje","text":"Akusakhiwe okwamanje","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShintsha ukwakheka kodonga phezulu nangaphansi kwepulani yalo: phezulu kwalo kungalandela uphahla, iphansi lesilele noma ulwelwesi, lunganikwa umugqa walo wohlangothi, lungathambeka, futhi lunezimbobo ezingenamnyango noma iwindi kuzo. Ipulani yodonga, amakhona nomugqa wendawo kuhlala njengoba kwakunjalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lapho-ungenza-khona\"\u003ELapho ungenza khona\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EProperties\u003C/strong\u003E: ngo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw\u003C/span\u003E ovulekile no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E ovulekile, chofoza udonga oludweyiwe. \u003Cstrong\u003EProperties\u003C/strong\u003E ibonisa imigqa yodonga, bese \u003Cstrong\u003EShape\u003C/strong\u003E, lapho konke kuthayiphwa khona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkubukeka kohlangothi noma isigaba\u003C/strong\u003E: ipensela lomsizi wephrojekthi (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit in this view\u003C/span\u003E) livula umbono; khetha udonga lapho bese udonsa izibambi zalo. Bheka &quot;Esigabeni nasekubukekeni kohlangothi&quot; ngezansi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmbono wobuso bodonga\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalls\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit profile\u003C/span\u003E, bese uchofoza udonga kwipulani. Lokhu kusebenza kunoma yiliphi udonga, nedonga elingakaze libukwe ngqo yinoma yiluphi ukubukeka kohlangothi, nodonga olugobile (olubonakala lusongwe).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIpulani nombono we-3D\u003C/strong\u003E: imiyalo emine ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalls\u003C/span\u003E (iqembu le-Edit): \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAttach top / base\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit profile\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESlant\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWall opening\u003C/span\u003E. Bheka &quot;Epulanini nasemibonweni ye-3D&quot; ngezansi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENoma ikuphi okukhethile, kuyinguquko efanayo: isinyathelo esisodwa ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EChanges\u003C/strong\u003E, futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E iyasuthula.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzindonga ezigobile nezingagobile zamukela zonke izithuluzi zokwakheka. Kudonga olugobile, izinkulungwane zihamba eduze kwalo ugobo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlanganisa-phezulu-noma-isisekelo\"\u003EHlanganisa phezulu noma isisekelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAttach top\u003C/strong\u003E: khetha uphahla, iphansi noma ulwelwesi. Phezulu kodonga kulandela ingaphansi kwalokho okukhethile, ngqo phezu kwalo ikhona ngakunye ikhona yodonga. Ngaphansi kophahla olunamagumbi, udonga luthola phezulu oluthambekile, futhi lapho uphahla lushintsha ubuso (uphethe noma i-hip), phezulu kodonga luyagoba nalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAttach base\u003C/strong\u003E: khetha iphansi noma ulwelwesi. Isisekelo sodonga silandela ubuso bayo obuphezulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELapho kungekho lutho phezulu (noma phansi) kwengxenye yodonga, leyo ngxenye igcina ukuphakama kwayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuxhumana kuyahlala: shintsha ukuthambeka noma ukukhishwa kophahla, noma ukuphakama kolwelwesi, bese izindonga ezixhunyiwe ziyalandela kwisinyathelo esifanayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EIts own height\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze ukhulule.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlela-iphrofayili\"\u003EHlela iphrofayili\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit profile…\u003C/span\u003E ivula umugqa wodonga obonwa uvela ohlangothini lwawo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETop line\u003C/strong\u003E: imigqa ye-\u003Cstrong\u003EAlong\u003C/strong\u003E (ibanga kusukela esiqalweni sodonga) ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EHeight\u003C/strong\u003E (ngaphezu kwesisekelo sodonga). Imigqa emithathu 0 / 3000, 2500 / 4500, 5000 / 3000 yenza umphetho we-gable edongeni elingu-5 m.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBottom line\u003C/strong\u003E: yishiye ingenalutho ukuze kube isisekelo sezinga, noma ufake imigqa yodonga oluphezu kwesisekelo esiyiqhwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a point\u003C/span\u003E yengeza umugqa, \u003Cstrong\u003ERemove\u003C/strong\u003E uwususe. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse this profile\u003C/span\u003E iyisebenzisa; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack to straight\u003C/span\u003E iyasusa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmugqa ngamunye uhamba kudonga kanye, kusukela esiqalweni sawo kuya ekugcineni; umugqa obuyela emuva kuwona, noma phezulu oyehlela esisekelweni, awamukelwa. Uma kukhona nophezulu oxhunyiwe, okuphansi kwalo kwamukelwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuthambekisa-udonga\"\u003EUkuthambekisa udonga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESlant\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cstrong\u003EUpright\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ESlanted\u003C/strong\u003E (zombili izinhlangothi zithambekela ohlangothini olufanayo, ukuqina kuhlala) noma \u003Cstrong\u003EDouble slant\u003C/strong\u003E (uhlangothi ngalunye lunekona yalo: udonga oluba luncane noma lukhule lapho lukhuphuka). Thayiphu amadigri ukusuka emaqondini; i-engeli elihle lithambekela ngakwesobunxele kodonga, libukwa esiqalweni salo. Udonga luhlala lapho lidweywe khona esisekelweni salo; izindonga ezixhunyiwe kuyo azithambeki nayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izimbobo-ngaphandle-komnyango-noma-iwindi\"\u003EIzimbobo ngaphandle komnyango noma iwindi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd opening\u003C/span\u003E isika umgodi ububanzi obungu-900 phakathi kodonga. Umugqa wayo ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EOpenings\u003C/strong\u003E usetha \u003Cstrong\u003EFrom start\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EWidth\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ESill\u003C/strong\u003E (kusukela ezingeni) ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EHeight\u003C/strong\u003E; \u003Cstrong\u003ERemove\u003C/strong\u003E iyasusa. Imbobo idlula kodonga lonke, izinto zodonga azibalwa kuyo, futhi ipulani iveza igebe lapho ifinyelela ekuphakamisweni kwesigaba sepulani. Uma isiqalo sodonga sihamba eduze komugqa walo, imbobo ihlala endaweni yayo; ushintsho olungayishiya ngaphandle kodonga luyenqatshelwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"esigabeni-nasekubukekeni-kohlangothi\"\u003EEsigabeni nasekubukekeni kohlangothi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula umbono ngepensela lomsizi wephrojekthi. Ngo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect and move\u003C/span\u003E ovulekile:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EProfile\u003C/strong\u003E: chofoza udonga obhekene nombono. Imigqa yawo ephezulu nephansi ibe luhlaza, nezibambi ezinesikwele kuyo yonke iphuzu nedonsa phakathi kwayo yonke ingxenye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDonsa isikwele ukuze uhambise leliphuzu (amaphuzu amabili aphelayo anyuka aphansi kuphela).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDonsa idonsa ukuze uhambise ingxenye yonke phezulu noma phansi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza kabili umugqa (noma uwucindezele ngokudla) ukuze wengeze iphuzu lapho; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a point (top)\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a point (bottom)\u003C/span\u003E zengeza ngaphakathi kwengxenye ende kakhulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza isikwele bese ucindezela Delete (noma uwucindezele ngokudla) ukuze ususe leliphuzu. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack to straight\u003C/span\u003E isusa iphrofayili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma kukhethwe iphuzu, thayipha i-\u003Cstrong\u003EAlong\u003C/strong\u003E nethi \u003Cstrong\u003EHeight\u003C/strong\u003E kwisitrip ngaphansi kwethuluzi lokusebenza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAttach\u003C/strong\u003E: isitrip sinohlu \u003Cstrong\u003EAttach top\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003EAttach base\u003C/strong\u003E lodonga olukhethiwe. Noma sebenzisa ithuluzi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAttach top\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAttach base\u003C/span\u003E: chofoza izindonga, bese uphahla, iphansi noma ulwelwesi, okuboniswa njengamabhokisi amadashi. Zonke izindonga ezikhethiwe zixhunyiwe kwisinyathelo esisodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWall openings\u003C/strong\u003E: ngethuluzi le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWall opening\u003C/span\u003E, donsa unxantathu kubuso bodonga. Ubuyele ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect and move\u003C/span\u003E, donsa imbobo ukuze uyihambise, donsa esinye sezibambi zayo eziyisishiyagalombili ukuze uyilungise usayizi, thayipha \u003Cstrong\u003EFrom start\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EWidth\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ESill\u003C/strong\u003E ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EHeight\u003C/strong\u003E esitripini, noma cindezela Delete ukuze uyisuse.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESlant\u003C/strong\u003E: udonga umbono obheka ngalo (obonakala uma ubheka ngasemuphethweni, njengesigaba ngalo noma kubukeko lohlangothi ngasemuphethweni) nalo ungachofozwa. Donsa isibambi esijikelele esiphezulu kuso ukuze uthambekise, noma khetha \u003Cstrong\u003EUpright\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ESlanted\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003EDouble slant\u003C/strong\u003E esitripini bese uthayipha ama-engeli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUsayizi ulinganiswa ku-10 mm; thayipha inani lanoma yini engaphansi kwalokho. Udonga oluyigobo lungahlelwa ekubukekeni kohlangothi uma lubheka indlela eyodwa phezu kombono; umbono wobuso bodonga wona usebenza njalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"epulanini-nasemibonweni-ye-3d\"\u003EEpulanini nasemibonweni ye-3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalls\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini le-Edit:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAttach top / base\u003C/span\u003E: khetha \u003Cstrong\u003EAttach top\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003EAttach base\u003C/strong\u003E emugqeni wethuluzi. Chofoza izindonga (epulanini noma kumbono we-3D), bese kuthi yini okuyixhumanisa kuyo: ku-3D chofoza uphahla, iphansi noma ulwelwesi ngqo; epulanini chofoza iphuzu ngaphansi kwalo (uma kukhona okungaphezu kwesisodwa, uhlu luyabuza).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit profile\u003C/span\u003E: epulanini, chofoza udonga ukuze uvule umbono wobuso bawo. Ku-3D, chofoza udonga: amaphuzu eprofayili alo athola izibambi; donsa elilodwa endizeni yodonga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESlant\u003C/span\u003E: chofoza udonga (epulanini noma ku-3D) bese uthayipha ukuthi lunyakazela kangakanani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWall opening\u003C/span\u003E: epulanini, chofoza udonga lapho imbobo izophuma khona; i-\u003Cstrong\u003EWidth\u003C/strong\u003E, i-\u003Cstrong\u003EHeight\u003C/strong\u003E kanye ne-\u003Cstrong\u003ESill\u003C/strong\u003E zisemugqeni wethuluzi. Ku-3D, chofoza ikhona elilodwa ebusweni bodonga, bese ikhona elingaphambili. Uma kukhethwe udonga ku-3D, izimbobo zalo zinezibambi: amakhona alungisa usayizi, ummaphakathi uyahamba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzibambi ze-3D ziyizibambi zombono we-3D ngokwawo, ngakho zilinda lapho ibhokisi lesigaba libonisa izibambi zalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"epulanini\"\u003EEpulanini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUdonga othambekile udweywa lapho ipulani iwusika khona (1200 ngaphezu kwezinga, ngaphandle uma umbono usho ngenye indlela): umphetho walo uyahanjiswa ngokuthi uthambekele kangakanani kulowo mkhawulo, futhi i-slant ephindwe kabili iba banzi noma incane lapho. Umphetho walo esitezi udwetshwa ngemigqa emincane yalokho okuphansi kwesigaba. Izikhona zodonga, izibambi kanye nezilinganiso zihlala esisekelweni salo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amakhophi\"\u003EAmakhophi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy this level…\u003C/span\u003E kanye Hambisa ngo-\u003Cstrong\u003ECopy\u003C/strong\u003E zithatha iphrofayili yodonga, ukuthambeka kwalo kanye nezimbobo zodonga kanye nazo. Udonga oxhunyiwe eniphansi noma kulwelwesi uxhunyiwa eniphansini elikopishiwe noma kulwelwesi lezinga elisha; ukuxhumana noluphahla akukopishwa nezinga (uphahla alukopishwa). Ikhophi esitezini esifanayo ihlala ixhunyiwe kuphahla, phansi noma kulwelwesi olufanayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"efayeleni\"\u003EEfayeleni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUdonga oluyibumbe lubhalwa njengento eqinile enezinhlangothi (IfcFacetedBrep), izinhlelo zezinye ziyilonde njengoba ibonakala; izilungiselelo zalo zisedongeni (CadCraft_Wall Profile, AttachTop, AttachBase, Slant). Imbobo iyi-IfcOpeningElement ekodongeni engagcwele lutho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akusakhiwe-okwamanje\"\u003EAkusakhiwe okwamanje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIphrofayili enemiphetho ephuma noma izimbobo esilweni (sebenzisa izimbobo ukwenza imingxunya).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-3D: ukwengeza noma ukususa amaphuzu eprofayili, nokuthambeka ngesibambi (sebenzisa umbono wobuso bodonga, ukubukeka kohlangothi noma isigaba, noma uthayiphe).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffset\u003C/span\u003E no-Copy avikopishi ubumo noma izimbobo zodonga (Hambisa ngo-Copy kuyakwenza).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzendlalelo zodonga othambekile azidwetshwa ezipulanini eziphakathi nezincane (kodwa umphetho wawo uyadwetshwa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzimbobo ezingesikwele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Shintsha ukwakheka kodonga phezulu nangaphansi kwepulani yalo: phezulu kwalo kungalandela uphahla, iphansi lesilele noma ulwelwesi, lunganikwa umugqa walo wohlangothi, lungathambeka, futhi lunezimbobo ezingenamnyango noma iwindi kuzo. Ipulani yodonga, amakhona nomugqa wendawo kuhlala njengoba kwakunjalo. Lapho ungenza khona Properties: ngo-Draw ovulekile no-Select ovulekile, chofoza udonga oludweyiwe. Properties ibonisa imigqa yodonga, bese Shape, lapho konke kuthayiphwa khona. Ukubukeka kohlangothi noma isigaba: ipensela lomsizi wephrojekthi (Edit in this view) livula umbono; khetha udonga lapho bese udonsa izibambi zalo. Bheka \"Esigabeni nasekubukekeni kohlangothi\" ngezansi. Umbono wobuso bodonga: Walls › Edit profile, bese uchofoza udonga kwipulani. Lokhu kusebenza kunoma yiliphi udonga, nedonga elingakaze libukwe ngqo yinoma yiluphi ukubukeka kohlangothi, nodonga olugobile (olubonakala lusongwe). Ipulani nombono we-3D: imiyalo emine ku-Walls (iqembu le-Edit): Attach top / base, Edit profile, Slant kanye Wall opening. Bheka \"Epulanini nasemibonweni ye-3D\" ngezansi. Noma ikuphi okukhethile, kuyinguquko efanayo: isinyathelo esisodwa ku-Changes, futhi Undo iyasuthula. Izindonga ezigobile nezingagobile zamukela zonke izithuluzi zokwakheka. Kudonga olugobile, izinkulungwane zihamba eduze kwalo ugobo. Hlanganisa phezulu noma isisekelo Attach top: khetha uphahla, iphansi noma ulwelwesi. Phezulu kodonga kulandela ingaphansi kwalokho okukhethile, ngqo phezu kwalo ikhona ngakunye ikhona yodonga. Ngaphansi kophahla olunamagumbi, udonga luthola phezulu oluthambekile, futhi lapho uphahla lushintsha ubuso (uphethe noma i-hip), phezulu kodonga luyagoba nalo. Attach base: khetha iphansi noma ulwelwesi. Isisekelo sodonga silandela ubuso bayo obuphezulu. Lapho kungekho lutho phezulu (noma phansi) kwengxenye yodonga, leyo ngxenye igcina ukuphakama kwayo. Ukuxhumana kuyahlala: shintsha ukuthambeka noma ukukhishwa kophahla, noma ukuphakama kolwelwesi, bese izindonga ezixhunyiwe ziyalandela kwisinyathelo esifanayo. Khetha Its own height ukuze ukhulule. Hlela iphrofayili Edit profile… ivula umugqa wodonga obonwa uvela ohlangothini lwawo: Top line: imigqa ye-Along (ibanga kusukela esiqalweni sodonga) ne-Height (ngaphezu kwesisekelo sodonga). Imigqa emithathu 0 / 3000, 2500 / 4500, 5000 / 3000 yenza umphetho we-gable edongeni elingu-5 m. Bottom line: yishiye ingenalutho ukuze kube isisekelo sezinga, noma ufake imigqa yodonga oluphezu kwesisekelo esiyiqhwa. Add a point yengeza umugqa, Remove uwususe. Use this profile iyisebenzisa; Back to straight iyasusa. Umugqa ngamunye uhamba kudonga kanye, kusukela esiqalweni sawo kuya ekugcineni; umugqa obuyela emuva kuwona, noma phezulu oyehlela esisekelweni, awamukelwa. Uma kukhona nophezulu oxhunyiwe, okuphansi kwalo kwamukelwa. Ukuthambekisa udonga Slant: Upright, Slanted (zombili izinhlangothi zithambekela ohlangothini olufanayo, ukuqina kuhlala) noma Double slant (uhlangothi ngalunye lunekona yalo: udonga oluba luncane noma lukhule lapho lukhuphuka). Thayiphu amadigri ukusuka emaqondini; i-engeli elihle lithambekela ngakwesobunxele kodonga, libukwa esiqalweni salo. Udonga luhlala lapho lidweywe khona esisekelweni salo; izindonga ezixhunyiwe kuyo azithambeki nayo. Izimbobo ngaphandle komnyango noma iwindi Add opening isika umgodi ububanzi obungu-900 phakathi kodonga. Umugqa wayo ku-Openings usetha From start, Width, Sill (kusukela ezingeni) ne-Height; Remove iyasusa. Imbobo idlula kodonga lonke, izinto zodonga azibalwa kuyo, futhi ipulani iveza igebe lapho ifinyelela ekuphakamisweni kwesigaba sepulani. Uma isiqalo sodonga sihamba eduze komugqa walo, imbobo ihlala endaweni yayo; ushintsho olungayishiya ngaphandle kodonga luyenqatshelwa. Esigabeni nasekubukekeni kohlangothi Vula umbono ngepensela lomsizi wephrojekthi. Ngo-Select and move ovulekile: Profile: chofoza udonga obhekene nombono. Imigqa yawo ephezulu nephansi ibe luhlaza, nezibambi ezinesikwele kuyo yonke iphuzu nedonsa phakathi kwayo yonke ingxenye. Donsa isikwele ukuze uhambise leliphuzu (amaphuzu amabili aphelayo anyuka aphansi kuphela). Donsa idonsa ukuze uhambise ingxenye yonke phezulu noma phansi. Chofoza kabili umugqa (noma uwucindezele ngokudla) ukuze wengeze iphuzu lapho; Add a point (top) kanye Add a point (bottom) zengeza ngaphakathi kwengxenye ende kakhulu. Chofoza isikwele bese ucindezela Delete (noma uwucindezele ngokudla) ukuze ususe leliphuzu. Back to straight isusa iphrofayili. Uma kukhethwe iphuzu, thayipha i-Along nethi Height kwisitrip ngaphansi kwethuluzi lokusebenza. Attach: isitrip sinohlu Attach top kanye Attach base lodonga olukhethiwe. Noma sebenzisa ithuluzi Attach top noma Attach base: chofoza izindonga, bese uphahla, iphansi noma ulwelwesi, okuboniswa njengamabhokisi amadashi. Zonke izindonga ezikhethiwe zixhunyiwe kwisinyathelo esisodwa. Wall openings: ngethuluzi le-Wall opening, donsa unxantathu kubuso bodonga. Ubuyele ku-Select and move, donsa imbobo ukuze uyihambise, donsa esinye sezibambi zayo eziyisishiyagalombili ukuze uyilungise usayizi, thayipha From start, Width, Sill ne-Height esitripini, noma cindezela Delete ukuze uyisuse. Slant: udonga umbono obheka ngalo (obonakala uma ubheka ngasemuphethweni, njengesigaba ngalo noma kubukeko lohlangothi ngasemuphethweni) nalo ungachofozwa. Donsa isibambi esijikelele esiphezulu kuso ukuze uthambekise, noma khetha Upright, Slanted noma Double slant esitripini bese uthayipha ama-engeli. Usayizi ulinganiswa ku-10 mm; thayipha inani lanoma yini engaphansi kwalokho. Udonga oluyigobo lungahlelwa ekubukekeni kohlangothi uma lubheka indlela eyodwa phezu kombono; umbono wobuso bodonga wona usebenza njalo. Epulanini nasemibonweni ye-3D Vula Walls eqenjini le-Edit: Attach top / base: khetha Attach top noma Attach base emugqeni wethuluzi. Chofoza izindonga (epulanini noma kumbono we-3D), bese kuthi yini okuyixhumanisa kuyo: ku-3D chofoza uphahla, iphansi noma ulwelwesi ngqo; epulanini chofoza iphuzu ngaphansi kwalo (uma kukhona okungaphezu kwesisodwa, uhlu luyabuza). Edit profile: epulanini, chofoza udonga ukuze uvule umbono wobuso bawo. Ku-3D, chofoza udonga: amaphuzu eprofayili alo athola izibambi; donsa elilodwa endizeni yodonga. Slant: chofoza udonga (epulanini noma ku-3D) bese uthayipha ukuthi lunyakazela kangakanani. Wall opening: epulanini, chofoza udonga lapho imbobo izophuma khona; i-Width, i-Height kanye ne-Sill zisemugqeni wethuluzi. Ku-3D, chofoza ikhona elilodwa ebusweni bodonga, bese ikhona elingaphambili. Uma kukhethwe udonga ku-3D, izimbobo zalo zinezibambi: amakhona alungisa usayizi, ummaphakathi uyahamba. Izibambi ze-3D ziyizibambi zombono we-3D ngokwawo, ngakho zilinda lapho ibhokisi lesigaba libonisa izibambi zalo. Epulanini Udonga othambekile udweywa lapho ipulani iwusika khona (1200 ngaphezu kwezinga, ngaphandle uma umbono usho ngenye indlela): umphetho walo uyahanjiswa ngokuthi uthambekele kangakanani kulowo mkhawulo, futhi i-slant ephindwe kabili iba banzi noma incane lapho. Umphetho walo esitezi udwetshwa ngemigqa emincane yalokho okuphansi kwesigaba. Izikhona zodonga, izibambi kanye nezilinganiso zihlala esisekelweni salo. Amakhophi Copy this level… kanye Hambisa ngo-Copy zithatha iphrofayili yodonga, ukuthambeka kwalo kanye nezimbobo zodonga kanye nazo. Udonga oxhunyiwe eniphansi noma kulwelwesi uxhunyiwa eniphansini elikopishiwe noma kulwelwesi lezinga elisha; ukuxhumana noluphahla akukopishwa nezinga (uphahla alukopishwa). Ikhophi esitezini esifanayo ihlala ixhunyiwe kuphahla, phansi noma kulwelwesi olufanayo. Efayeleni Udonga oluyibumbe lubhalwa njengento eqinile enezinhlangothi (IfcFacetedBrep), izinhlelo zezinye ziyilonde njengoba ibonakala; izilungiselelo zalo zisedongeni (CadCraft_Wall Profile, AttachTop, AttachBase, Slant). Imbobo iyi-IfcOpeningElement ekodongeni engagcwele lutho. Akusakhiwe okwamanje Iphrofayili enemiphetho ephuma noma izimbobo esilweni (sebenzisa izimbobo ukwenza imingxunya). Ku-3D: ukwengeza noma ukususa amaphuzu eprofayili, nokuthambeka ngesibambi (sebenzisa umbono wobuso bodonga, ukubukeka kohlangothi noma isigaba, noma uthayiphe). Offset no-Copy avikopishi ubumo noma izimbobo zodonga (Hambisa ngo-Copy kuyakwenza). Izendlalelo zodonga othambekile azidwetshwa ezipulanini eziphakathi nezincane (kodwa umphetho wawo uyadwetshwa). Izimbobo ezingesikwele.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"floors-and-roofs","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Amagumbi, amaphansi, amasilingi nophahla","summary":"Amagumbi avela njengoba izindonga ziwavala; nikeza igumbi noma wonke umakhiwo iphansi nesilingi, bese ubeka uphahla kudonga. Konke kulandela uma izindonga zinyakaza.","section":"tasks","order":19,"keywords":["igumbi","amagumbi","isikhala","indawo","umjikelezo","iphansi","islebhu","iphansi elingaphansi","isilingi","uphahla","uphahla oluyisikhwama","igable","ukuthambeka","ukweqa","ukuphela","izikhala","6/12"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"amagumbi","text":"Amagumbi","level":2},{"id":"amaphansi","text":"Amaphansi","level":2},{"id":"izilingi","text":"Izilingi","level":2},{"id":"uphahla","text":"Uphahla","level":2},{"id":"shintsha","text":"Shintsha","level":2},{"id":"nikeza-iphansi-isilingi-noma-uphahla-uhlobo-ngezendlalelo","text":"Nikeza iphansi, isilingi noma uphahla uhlobo ngezendlalelo","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukwazi","text":"Okufanele ukwazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQedela isakhiwo sesakhiwo. Amagumbi avela ngokwawo kusuka ezindongeni; amaphansi, amasilingi nophahla kuthatha ukuchofoza kanye ngakunye. Ngoba atholakala kusuka ezindongeni, alandela uma izindonga zinyakaza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amagumbi\"\u003EAmagumbi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYonke indawo evalwe izindonga ezidwetshiwe iyigumbi. Livela ngokushesha lapho udonga lokugcina seluwuvalile, linenombolo (101, 102 … esitezini sokuqala, 201 … esilandelayo) negama (\u003Cstrong\u003EIgumbi 1\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EIgumbi 2\u003C/strong\u003E …), nendawo yalo ibonakala phakathi kwalo kupulani.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha\u003C/span\u003E evuliwe, chofoza phakathi kwegumbi ukuze ulikhethe. Ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzici\u003C/strong\u003E shintsha \u003Cstrong\u003EIgama\u003C/strong\u003E (isibonelo \u003Ccode\u003EIkhishi\u003C/code\u003E) ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EInombolo\u003C/strong\u003E; indawo nomjikelezo kuyabonakala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESusa udonga phakathi kwamagumbi amabili bese zibe elilodwa; dweba udonga udlule igumbi bese libe amabili. Igumbiligcina igama nenombolo yalo lapho izindonga ezilizungezile zinyakaza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIgumbi alikwazi ukususwa ngokwalo: liyisikhala izindonga ezakha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzindawo zilinganiswa ngaphakathi kobuso bezindonga. Amagumbi agcinwa njengezikhala ze-IFC ne-indawo yephansi, umjikelezo, ukuphakama nevolumu, ukuze amashidi azifunde (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/quantity-totals\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/quantity-totals\"\u003EEngeza izinani, uhlele izinto futhi uhlele izikhala\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amaphansi\"\u003EAmaphansi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIphansi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003ELesi sigumbi\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003EWonke umakhiwo\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EUhlobo\u003C/strong\u003E (iphansi lokhuni noma islebhu lekhonkolo) nobukhulu bayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza phakathi kwegumbi (noma noma yiliphi iphoyinti phakathi komakhiwo). Okuzomboza iphansi kuqaqwa nendawo yalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza. Phezulu kwephansi kuyiphansi lesitezi; liyehla ngobukhulu balo. Iphansi lomakhiwo wonke lifinyelela ubuso bangaphandle bezindonga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izilingi\"\u003EIzilingi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsilingi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003ELesi sigumbi\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003EWonke umakhiwo\u003C/strong\u003E, bese \u003Cstrong\u003EUkuphakama\u003C/strong\u003E kwawo phezu kwephansi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPhakathi phawula bese uchofoza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuze uyibone isuka ezansi, nogridi nezibani ezisesilingini, shintsha ipulani ibe yipulani yesilingi: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/views-and-sheets\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/views-and-sheets\"\u003EImibono, izinhlobo zokubuka namashidi akho\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uphahla\"\u003EUphahla\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEsitezini lezindonga ezithwala uphahla, chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUphahla\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThayipha \u003Cstrong\u003EUkuthambeka\u003C/strong\u003E njengokukhuphuka ngaphezu kuka-12 (\u003Ccode\u003E6/12\u003C/code\u003E) noma ngamadigri (\u003Ccode\u003E30\u003C/code\u003E), kanye \u003Cstrong\u003EUkweqa\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EUkuphela\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cstrong\u003EUphahla oluyisikhwama\u003C/strong\u003E (zonke izinhlangothi ziyathambeka), \u003Cstrong\u003EAmagable ezinhlangothini ezimfushane\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003EAmagable ezinhlangothini ezinde\u003C/strong\u003E (isakhiwo esinezinhlangothi ezine), noma \u003Cstrong\u003EIshedi\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPhakathi kwesakhiwo: ukweqa nomphetho ophezulu kubonakala ePulani. Chofoza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUphahla lumi phezu kwezindonga, esitezini eliphezulu kwazo, nomphetho wawo ongaphansi uhlangana nobuso bangaphandle bezindonga. Ukuphela kwamagable kugcwaliswa udonga lwegable olunobukhulu obulingana nodonga oluphansi. Isakhiwo esinesimo se-L, T noma U sithola uphahla oluyisikhwama lapho amaphiko ahlangana ezikhaleni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shintsha\"\u003EShintsha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha iphansi, isilingi noma uphahla (kumbono we-3D, kumuthi wemodeli, noma uphahla ngokuchofoza phakathi kwesakhiwo sawo esitezini eliphezulu) bese ulishintsha ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzici\u003C/strong\u003E: uhlobo lwephansi, ubukhulu nokuthi liphakama kangakanani phezu kwesitezi; uhlobo lwesilingi, ukuphakama, ubukhulu kanye \u003Cstrong\u003EIpharetheni\u003C/strong\u003E (igridi isilingi esiyidweba ePulani yesilingi: lutho, 600 × 600, 600 × 1200, 2&#039; × 2&#039; noma 2&#039; × 4&#039;); uhlobo lophahla, ukuthambeka, ukweqa, ukuphela nobukhulu. Yonke inguquko iyisinyathelo esisodwa se-Undo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nikeza-iphansi-isilingi-noma-uphahla-uhlobo-ngezendlalelo\"\u003ENikeza iphansi, isilingi noma uphahla uhlobo ngezendlalelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIphansi, isilingi nophahla kungathatha \u003Cstrong\u003Euhlobo\u003C/strong\u003E, njengodonga: ukwakheka okunegama lwezendlalelo, ngayinye inempahla yayo nobukhulu bayo bangempela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELapho uyibeka.\u003C/strong\u003E Amathuluzi Iphansi, Isilingi, Uphahla kanye ne-Draw floor anolu hlu \u003Cstrong\u003EUhlobo\u003C/strong\u003E esihlokweni sawo. \u003Cstrong\u003EAwukho uhlobo\u003C/strong\u003E ibeka njengakuqala, ngobukhulu bayo. Uhlobo luyibeka ngobukhulu bezendlalelo zalo ndawonye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKamuva.\u003C/strong\u003E Khetha iphansi, isilingi noma uphahla bese ukhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EUhlobo\u003C/strong\u003E ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzici\u003C/strong\u003E. Into ihlala iyinto efanayo: indawo yayo, igumbi nedatha yayo kuyagcinwa, akukho okuphinde kudwetshwe. Kushintsha kuphela uhlobo, ubukhulu nempahla. Yileyo ndlela into eyisikethi iba ngayo eyakhiwe ngokugcwele: shintsha uhlobo lwayo lwejwayelekile ube uhlobo langempela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHlela uhlobo…\u003C/strong\u003E ivula umhleli wohlobo kulolo hlobo: izendlalelo kusuka \u003Cstrong\u003Ephezulu\u003C/strong\u003E kuya phansi, umgogodla, umsebenzi wendlalelo ngayinye, nethegi ye-LOD yohlobo. Ukulondoloza kushintsha zonke izinto zohlobo esinyathelweni esisodwa, futhi i-Undo eyodwa iyabuyisela. Ukushintsha uhlobo lokuqala kugcina ikhophi njengohlobo lwakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgenkathi into inohlobo, ubukhulu bayo bungohlobo futhi abukwazi ukuthayiphwa. Khetha olunye uhlobo, noma \u003Cstrong\u003EAwukho uhlobo\u003C/strong\u003E, ukuze ushintshe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUhlobo lokuqala luyisisodwa \u003Cstrong\u003Ejikelele\u003C/strong\u003E ngalinye (indlalelo eyodwa yempahla ejwayelekile, ethegiwe LOD 200) kanye nezimbili ezinezendlalelo (ezithegiwe LOD 300): iphansi lamapulangwe okhuni nephansi lekhonkolo elinesendlalelo sokulinganisa; uphahla lokhuni nophahla lekhonkolo oluyisicaba; nesilingi sebhodi lejipsamu nesilingi samathayili asingiwe. Lawa amanani okuqala, hhayi ukwakheka okuhloliwe: hlola izendlalelo ngaphambi kokuwathembela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUhlu \u003Cstrong\u003EIzendlalelo: indawo nevolumu\u003C/strong\u003E lunikeza zonke izendlalelo zawo zonke izinhlobo ezisebenzayo; bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/plan-schedules-and-pdf\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/plan-schedules-and-pdf\"\u003EUhlu, ubukhulu nePDF\u003C/a\u003E. Uhlobo lwephansi, lophahla nelesilingi luhamba phakathi kwamaphrojekthi ephakethe lohlobo noma njengento ye-Library; bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/type-packs\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/type-packs\"\u003EAmaphakethe ohlobo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukwazi\"\u003EOkufanele ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuhamba, ukungeza noma ukususa izindonga kwenza kabusha amagumbi, amaphansi, amasilingi nophahla phezu kwazo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUphahla luvumelana nanoma yimuphi umumo. Ukuze unikeze udonga ngalunye ukuthambeka, igable noma ukuphela okuyishedi, isiqeshana esiphakanyisiwe, i-fascia ne-soffit, noma ukudweba indiza eyodwa yophahla, bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/roofs\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/roofs\"\u003EUphahla: ukuthambeka kodonga ngalunye, amagable, amashedi namapuleni ophahla\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E isusa iphansi, isilingi noma uphahla oluqokiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Qedela isakhiwo sesakhiwo. Amagumbi avela ngokwawo kusuka ezindongeni; amaphansi, amasilingi nophahla kuthatha ukuchofoza kanye ngakunye. Ngoba atholakala kusuka ezindongeni, alandela uma izindonga zinyakaza. Amagumbi Yonke indawo evalwe izindonga ezidwetshiwe iyigumbi. Livela ngokushesha lapho udonga lokugcina seluwuvalile, linenombolo (101, 102 … esitezini sokuqala, 201 … esilandelayo) negama (Igumbi 1, Igumbi 2 …), nendawo yalo ibonakala phakathi kwalo kupulani. Uma Khetha evuliwe, chofoza phakathi kwegumbi ukuze ulikhethe. Ku-Izici shintsha Igama (isibonelo Ikhishi) ne-Inombolo; indawo nomjikelezo kuyabonakala. Susa udonga phakathi kwamagumbi amabili bese zibe elilodwa; dweba udonga udlule igumbi bese libe amabili. Igumbiligcina igama nenombolo yalo lapho izindonga ezilizungezile zinyakaza. Igumbi alikwazi ukususwa ngokwalo: liyisikhala izindonga ezakha. Izindawo zilinganiswa ngaphakathi kobuso bezindonga. Amagumbi agcinwa njengezikhala ze-IFC ne-indawo yephansi, umjikelezo, ukuphakama nevolumu, ukuze amashidi azifunde (bona Engeza izinani, uhlele izinto futhi uhlele izikhala). Amaphansi Chofoza Iphansi. Khetha Lesi sigumbi noma Wonke umakhiwo, Uhlobo (iphansi lokhuni noma islebhu lekhonkolo) nobukhulu bayo. Chofoza phakathi kwegumbi (noma noma yiliphi iphoyinti phakathi komakhiwo). Okuzomboza iphansi kuqaqwa nendawo yalo. Chofoza. Phezulu kwephansi kuyiphansi lesitezi; liyehla ngobukhulu balo. Iphansi lomakhiwo wonke lifinyelela ubuso bangaphandle bezindonga. Izilingi Chofoza Isilingi. Khetha Lesi sigumbi noma Wonke umakhiwo, bese Ukuphakama kwawo phezu kwephansi. Phakathi phawula bese uchofoza. Ukuze uyibone isuka ezansi, nogridi nezibani ezisesilingini, shintsha ipulani ibe yipulani yesilingi: bona Imibono, izinhlobo zokubuka namashidi akho. Uphahla Esitezini lezindonga ezithwala uphahla, chofoza Uphahla. Thayipha Ukuthambeka njengokukhuphuka ngaphezu kuka-12 (6/12) noma ngamadigri (30), kanye Ukweqa. Khetha Ukuphela: Uphahla oluyisikhwama (zonke izinhlangothi ziyathambeka), Amagable ezinhlangothini ezimfushane noma Amagable ezinhlangothini ezinde (isakhiwo esinezinhlangothi ezine), noma Ishedi. Phakathi kwesakhiwo: ukweqa nomphetho ophezulu kubonakala ePulani. Chofoza. Uphahla lumi phezu kwezindonga, esitezini eliphezulu kwazo, nomphetho wawo ongaphansi uhlangana nobuso bangaphandle bezindonga. Ukuphela kwamagable kugcwaliswa udonga lwegable olunobukhulu obulingana nodonga oluphansi. Isakhiwo esinesimo se-L, T noma U sithola uphahla oluyisikhwama lapho amaphiko ahlangana ezikhaleni. Shintsha Khetha iphansi, isilingi noma uphahla (kumbono we-3D, kumuthi wemodeli, noma uphahla ngokuchofoza phakathi kwesakhiwo sawo esitezini eliphezulu) bese ulishintsha ku-Izici: uhlobo lwephansi, ubukhulu nokuthi liphakama kangakanani phezu kwesitezi; uhlobo lwesilingi, ukuphakama, ubukhulu kanye Ipharetheni (igridi isilingi esiyidweba ePulani yesilingi: lutho, 600 × 600, 600 × 1200, 2' × 2' noma 2' × 4'); uhlobo lophahla, ukuthambeka, ukweqa, ukuphela nobukhulu. Yonke inguquko iyisinyathelo esisodwa se-Undo. Nikeza iphansi, isilingi noma uphahla uhlobo ngezendlalelo Iphansi, isilingi nophahla kungathatha uhlobo, njengodonga: ukwakheka okunegama lwezendlalelo, ngayinye inempahla yayo nobukhulu bayo bangempela. Lapho uyibeka. Amathuluzi Iphansi, Isilingi, Uphahla kanye ne-Draw floor anolu hlu Uhlobo esihlokweni sawo. Awukho uhlobo ibeka njengakuqala, ngobukhulu bayo. Uhlobo luyibeka ngobukhulu bezendlalelo zalo ndawonye. Kamuva. Khetha iphansi, isilingi noma uphahla bese ukhetha Uhlobo ku-Izici. Into ihlala iyinto efanayo: indawo yayo, igumbi nedatha yayo kuyagcinwa, akukho okuphinde kudwetshwe. Kushintsha kuphela uhlobo, ubukhulu nempahla. Yileyo ndlela into eyisikethi iba ngayo eyakhiwe ngokugcwele: shintsha uhlobo lwayo lwejwayelekile ube uhlobo langempela. Hlela uhlobo… ivula umhleli wohlobo kulolo hlobo: izendlalelo kusuka phezulu kuya phansi, umgogodla, umsebenzi wendlalelo ngayinye, nethegi ye-LOD yohlobo. Ukulondoloza kushintsha zonke izinto zohlobo esinyathelweni esisodwa, futhi i-Undo eyodwa iyabuyisela. Ukushintsha uhlobo lokuqala kugcina ikhophi njengohlobo lwakho. Ngenkathi into inohlobo, ubukhulu bayo bungohlobo futhi abukwazi ukuthayiphwa. Khetha olunye uhlobo, noma Awukho uhlobo, ukuze ushintshe. Uhlobo lokuqala luyisisodwa jikelele ngalinye (indlalelo eyodwa yempahla ejwayelekile, ethegiwe LOD 200) kanye nezimbili ezinezendlalelo (ezithegiwe LOD 300): iphansi lamapulangwe okhuni nephansi lekhonkolo elinesendlalelo sokulinganisa; uphahla lokhuni nophahla lekhonkolo oluyisicaba; nesilingi sebhodi lejipsamu nesilingi samathayili asingiwe. Lawa amanani okuqala, hhayi ukwakheka okuhloliwe: hlola izendlalelo ngaphambi kokuwathembela. Uhlu Izendlalelo: indawo nevolumu lunikeza zonke izendlalelo zawo zonke izinhlobo ezisebenzayo; bona Uhlu, ubukhulu nePDF. Uhlobo lwephansi, lophahla nelesilingi luhamba phakathi kwamaphrojekthi ephakethe lohlobo noma njengento ye-Library; bona Amaphakethe ohlobo. Okufanele ukwazi Ukuhamba, ukungeza noma ukususa izindonga kwenza kabusha amagumbi, amaphansi, amasilingi nophahla phezu kwazo. Uphahla luvumelana nanoma yimuphi umumo. Ukuze unikeze udonga ngalunye ukuthambeka, igable noma ukuphela okuyishedi, isiqeshana esiphakanyisiwe, i-fascia ne-soffit, noma ukudweba indiza eyodwa yophahla, bona Uphahla: ukuthambeka kodonga ngalunye, amagable, amashedi namapuleni ophahla. Delete isusa iphansi, isilingi noma uphahla oluqokiwe.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"type-packs","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Amaphakheji ohlobo: yabelana ngezinhlobo zodonga njengamafayela avulekile","summary":"Gcina izinhlobo zodonga nezingqimba zazo, izimpahla, amathegi nezikhodi zokuhlukaniswa, nemindeni njengefayela elivulekile elilodwa (umbhalo we-JSON ojwayelekile noma i-IFC), bese uyengeza kwenye iphrojekthi. Izinhlobo zodonga zefayela le-IFC evela kwenye inhlelo nazo zingafundwa.","section":"tasks","order":19,"keywords":["iphakheji lohlobo","izinhlobo","uhlobo lodonga","yabelana","thumela","ngenisa","umtapo","ifomethi evulekile","json","ifc","IfcWallType","IfcMaterialLayerSet","IfcProjectLibrary","izimpahla","izingqimba","isifanekiso","umgomo wehhovisi","imindeni"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"londoloza-izinhlobo-kusuka-kwiphrojekthi","text":"Londoloza izinhlobo kusuka kwiphrojekthi","level":2},{"id":"engeza-izinhlobo-ephrojekthini","text":"Engeza izinhlobo ephrojekthini","level":2},{"id":"izinhlobo-zephansi-zophahla-nelilingi","text":"Izinhlobo zephansi, zophahla nelilingi","level":2},{"id":"uhlobo-olulodwa-njengento-yelibrary","text":"Uhlobo olulodwa njengento yeLibrary","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-wazi","text":"Okufanele wazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThutha izinhlobo zakho zodonga kusuka kwiphrojekthi eyodwa iye kwenye, noma uzinikeze umuntu osebenza kwenye inhlelo. Iphakheji lohlobo linohlobo ngalunye lodonga nezingqimba zalo, ukuthi lujulile kangakanani, izimpahla, ingxenye emaphakathi, izikhala, ukubaluleka kwezingqimba, izinga lokuthuthukiswa, idatha yokubala amanani nezikhodi zokuhlukaniswa, kanye nanoma yimiphi imindeni oyengezile. Iyifayela elivulekile: umbhalo we-JSON ojwayelekile ongafundwa noma ubani, noma ifayela le-IFC. Akukho okukhiyelwe kufemu, ezweni noma ku-akhawunti.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"londoloza-izinhlobo-kusuka-kwiphrojekthi\"\u003ELondoloza izinhlobo kusuka kwiphrojekthi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cstrong\u003EIdatha\u003C/strong\u003E embarini yemodeli bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmaphakheji ohlobo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza izinhlobo kule phrojekthi\u003C/span\u003E, thikha izinhlobo zodonga ozofaka. Izinhlobo zephrojekthi ngokwayo ziyathikwa; uhlobo lokuqala lungangezwa futhi lingene njengekhophi. Thikha imindeni uma ufuna ukuthi ifake.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThayipha i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIgama lephakheji\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza njengephakheji (.json)\u003C/span\u003E ilanda ifayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.cctypes.json\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza njenge-IFC (.ifc)\u003C/span\u003E ilanda ifayela le-IFC eliphethe izinhlobo kuphela: ngohlobo ngalunye lodonga njenge-IfcWallType nesethi yalo yezingqimba zezimpahla, izimpahla nokuhlukaniswa, kunoma iyiphi inhlelo ye-BIM.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"engeza-izinhlobo-ephrojekthini\"\u003EEngeza izinhlobo ephrojekthini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKuleyo ngxoxo efanayo, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula iphakheji noma ifayela le-IFC…\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha iphakheji le-\u003Ccode\u003E.json\u003C/code\u003E noma ifayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.ifc\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIngxoxo ibala lokho ifayela eliphethe: uhlobo ngalunye lodonga nokujula kwalo, inani lezingqimba namakhodi, izimpahla nemindeni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha okwenzeka ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlobo esinalo lale phrojekthi\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cstrong\u003EGcina leyo yephrojekthi\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EEngeza leyo yephakheji njengekhophi\u003C/strong\u003E (izothola igama elisha elisiphela nge-&quot;(2)&quot;), noma \u003Cstrong\u003EYithathele indawo (kuphela uma kungekho dongo elilusebenzisayo)\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza kuphrojekthi\u003C/span\u003E. Ingxoxo ibala okwengeziwe, okukopishiwe, okuthathelwe indawo noma okugcinwe. Kuyisinyathelo sokuhlehlisa esisodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinhlobo ezintsha zisendaweni yohlu lwezinhlobo zethuluzi lodonga ngokushesha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinhlobo-zephansi-zophahla-nelilingi\"\u003EIzinhlobo zephansi, zophahla nelilingi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUhlu lwezinhlobo ezigcinwayo luphinde lube nezinhlobo zephrojekthi zephansi, zophahla nelilingi nezokuqala zazo (zimakwe ngokuthi Iphansi, Uphahla, Ilingi). Iphakheji lingathwala zonke izinhlobo ezine; uhlobo ngalunye lubiza igama layo le-IFC (IfcWallType, IfcSlabType, IfcCoveringType). Uhlobo lwephansi, luphahla noma lwelilingi esetshenziswa izinto alufakwa esikhundleni kusuka ephakheji: lushintshe kumhleli wohlobo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uhlobo-olulodwa-njengento-yelibrary\"\u003EUhlobo olulodwa njengento yeLibrary\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThikha into eyodwa yohlobo bese ukhetha \u003Cstrong\u003ELondoloza njengento yeLibrary…\u003C/strong\u003E. Igcina ifayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.cctype.json\u003C/code\u003E: into yeLibrary yohlobo lwe-Types eyodwa ebamba lolohlobo (izingqimba, izimpahla, i-LOD namakhodi okuhlukaniswa). Ilayishe ku-Library ukuze uyabelane nayo. \u003Cstrong\u003EVula iphakheji noma ifayela le-IFC\u003C/strong\u003E ifunda nento enjalo futhi yengeze uhlobo lwayo kuphrojekthi njengephakheji.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-wazi\"\u003EOkufanele wazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIfayela le-IFC evela kwenye inhlelo lingavulwa lapha futhi. Uhlobo ngalunye lodonga oluneziqu zezingqimba luyafundwa: igama, izimpahla zezingqimba nobukhulu, nanoma yisiphi isikhala kwifayela ngokwalo. Yiziphi izingqimba eziyisisekelo nokuthi ingqimba ngayinye yenzani (ukuqeda, isakhiwo, ukugcinwa kokushisa) kuqagelwa, uhlobo luphawulwa \u003Cstrong\u003E(kuqagelwe)\u003C/strong\u003E, futhi kufanele ulihlole kumhleli wohlobo lodonga. Uhlobo lodonga oluntuleyo ezingqimbeni lushiywa ngaphandle futhi lubizwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImpahla ephrojekthi isivele inayo igcinwa njengoba njalo. Impahla entsha egama lalo selithathiwe ithola &quot;(iphakheji)&quot; ngemva kwegama lalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUhlobo lodonga abalusebenzisayo alusoze lwathathelwa indawo ephakheji. Lushintshe kumhleli wohlobo lodonga, okuhambisa izindonga zalo ngokufanele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIkhodi esethwe kudonga owodwa ayihambi: yeyalowo dongo. Ikhodi esethwe ohlobweni iyahamba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIfayela linensimu ifomethi engenayo, ingqimba enezimpahla ezingekho, noma okungasiyo umbhalo ojwayelekile, liyenqatshwa, nomlayezo utshela lapho nokuthi kungani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkwakhiwe: izinhlobo zephansi, zophahla nelilingi (azinazo izinhlobo kulenguqulo: ngalinye linobukhulu bayo), izinhlobo zeminyango namawindi ngaphandle kwemindeni, namahetshi noma imibala evela kwenye inhlelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Thutha izinhlobo zakho zodonga kusuka kwiphrojekthi eyodwa iye kwenye, noma uzinikeze umuntu osebenza kwenye inhlelo. Iphakheji lohlobo linohlobo ngalunye lodonga nezingqimba zalo, ukuthi lujulile kangakanani, izimpahla, ingxenye emaphakathi, izikhala, ukubaluleka kwezingqimba, izinga lokuthuthukiswa, idatha yokubala amanani nezikhodi zokuhlukaniswa, kanye nanoma yimiphi imindeni oyengezile. Iyifayela elivulekile: umbhalo we-JSON ojwayelekile ongafundwa noma ubani, noma ifayela le-IFC. Akukho okukhiyelwe kufemu, ezweni noma ku-akhawunti. Londoloza izinhlobo kusuka kwiphrojekthi Vula Idatha embarini yemodeli bese ukhetha Amaphakheji ohlobo. Ngaphansi kwe-Londoloza izinhlobo kule phrojekthi, thikha izinhlobo zodonga ozofaka. Izinhlobo zephrojekthi ngokwayo ziyathikwa; uhlobo lokuqala lungangezwa futhi lingene njengekhophi. Thikha imindeni uma ufuna ukuthi ifake. Thayipha i-Igama lephakheji. Londoloza njengephakheji (.json) ilanda ifayela le-.cctypes.json. Londoloza njenge-IFC (.ifc) ilanda ifayela le-IFC eliphethe izinhlobo kuphela: ngohlobo ngalunye lodonga njenge-IfcWallType nesethi yalo yezingqimba zezimpahla, izimpahla nokuhlukaniswa, kunoma iyiphi inhlelo ye-BIM. Engeza izinhlobo ephrojekthini Kuleyo ngxoxo efanayo, khetha Vula iphakheji noma ifayela le-IFC… bese ukhetha iphakheji le-.json noma ifayela le-.ifc. Ingxoxo ibala lokho ifayela eliphethe: uhlobo ngalunye lodonga nokujula kwalo, inani lezingqimba namakhodi, izimpahla nemindeni. Khetha okwenzeka ku-Uhlobo esinalo lale phrojekthi: Gcina leyo yephrojekthi, Engeza leyo yephakheji njengekhophi (izothola igama elisha elisiphela nge-\"(2)\"), noma Yithathele indawo (kuphela uma kungekho dongo elilusebenzisayo). Engeza kuphrojekthi. Ingxoxo ibala okwengeziwe, okukopishiwe, okuthathelwe indawo noma okugcinwe. Kuyisinyathelo sokuhlehlisa esisodwa. Izinhlobo ezintsha zisendaweni yohlu lwezinhlobo zethuluzi lodonga ngokushesha. Izinhlobo zephansi, zophahla nelilingi Uhlu lwezinhlobo ezigcinwayo luphinde lube nezinhlobo zephrojekthi zephansi, zophahla nelilingi nezokuqala zazo (zimakwe ngokuthi Iphansi, Uphahla, Ilingi). Iphakheji lingathwala zonke izinhlobo ezine; uhlobo ngalunye lubiza igama layo le-IFC (IfcWallType, IfcSlabType, IfcCoveringType). Uhlobo lwephansi, luphahla noma lwelilingi esetshenziswa izinto alufakwa esikhundleni kusuka ephakheji: lushintshe kumhleli wohlobo. Uhlobo olulodwa njengento yeLibrary Thikha into eyodwa yohlobo bese ukhetha Londoloza njengento yeLibrary…. Igcina ifayela le-.cctype.json: into yeLibrary yohlobo lwe-Types eyodwa ebamba lolohlobo (izingqimba, izimpahla, i-LOD namakhodi okuhlukaniswa). Ilayishe ku-Library ukuze uyabelane nayo. Vula iphakheji noma ifayela le-IFC ifunda nento enjalo futhi yengeze uhlobo lwayo kuphrojekthi njengephakheji. Okufanele wazi Ifayela le-IFC evela kwenye inhlelo lingavulwa lapha futhi. Uhlobo ngalunye lodonga oluneziqu zezingqimba luyafundwa: igama, izimpahla zezingqimba nobukhulu, nanoma yisiphi isikhala kwifayela ngokwalo. Yiziphi izingqimba eziyisisekelo nokuthi ingqimba ngayinye yenzani (ukuqeda, isakhiwo, ukugcinwa kokushisa) kuqagelwa, uhlobo luphawulwa (kuqagelwe), futhi kufanele ulihlole kumhleli wohlobo lodonga. Uhlobo lodonga oluntuleyo ezingqimbeni lushiywa ngaphandle futhi lubizwe. Impahla ephrojekthi isivele inayo igcinwa njengoba njalo. Impahla entsha egama lalo selithathiwe ithola \"(iphakheji)\" ngemva kwegama lalo. Uhlobo lodonga abalusebenzisayo alusoze lwathathelwa indawo ephakheji. Lushintshe kumhleli wohlobo lodonga, okuhambisa izindonga zalo ngokufanele. Ikhodi esethwe kudonga owodwa ayihambi: yeyalowo dongo. Ikhodi esethwe ohlobweni iyahamba. Ifayela linensimu ifomethi engenayo, ingqimba enezimpahla ezingekho, noma okungasiyo umbhalo ojwayelekile, liyenqatshwa, nomlayezo utshela lapho nokuthi kungani. Akwakhiwe: izinhlobo zephansi, zophahla nelilingi (azinazo izinhlobo kulenguqulo: ngalinye linobukhulu bayo), izinhlobo zeminyango namawindi ngaphandle kwemindeni, namahetshi noma imibala evela kwenye inhlelo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"plan-schedules-and-pdf","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Amathebula, izilinganiso kanye ne-PDF yepulani","summary":"Amathebula wezicabha, amawindi, izindonga namagumbi ashintsha njengoba udweba, izilinganiso epulanini, kanye nepulani yezinga egcinwa njenge-PDF ngesilinganiso esijwayelekile.","section":"tasks","order":20,"keywords":["uhlu","uhlu lwezicabha","uhlu lwamawindi","uhlu lwezindonga","uhlu lwamagumbi","izinani","takeoff","indawo","csv","ishidi lezinani","izilinganiso","dimension","phrinta","pdf","plot","isikali","ishidi","1/4\"","1:50"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"uhlu","text":"Uhlu","level":2},{"id":"indawo-nevolumu-yesendlalelo-ngasinye","text":"Indawo nevolumu yesendlalelo ngasinye","level":2},{"id":"indlela-izindawo-ezilinganiswa-ngayo","text":"Indlela izindawo ezilinganiswa ngayo","level":2},{"id":"khetha-indlela-yokulinganisa","text":"Khetha indlela yokulinganisa","level":2},{"id":"indlela-yehhovisi-lakho","text":"Indlela yehhovisi lakho","level":3},{"id":"izitsha-amabhulokhi-nomortar","text":"Izitsha, amabhulokhi nomortar","level":2},{"id":"izilinganiso","text":"Izilinganiso","level":2},{"id":"gcina-ipulani-njenge-pdf","text":"Gcina ipulani njenge-PDF","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukwazi","text":"Okufanele ukwazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBona ukuthi isakhiwo osidwetshile siyini, njengoba usidweba: ziningaki izicabha namawindi ngosayizi ngamunye, udonga olungakanani ngohlobo ngalunye, kanye nokuthi igumbi ngalinye likhulu kangakanani. Beka izilinganiso epulanini bese uyigcina njenge-PDF ukuze uyiphrinte noma uyithumele.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uhlu\"\u003EUhlu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDweba\u003C/span\u003E usebenza, \u003Cstrong\u003EUhlu\u003C/strong\u003E kwiphaneli yesobunxele ibonisa ithebula elilodwa ngesikhathi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzicabha\u003C/strong\u003E nemawindi: ngalinye ngophawu lwalo (D1, D2 … kanye no-W1 …, anikezwa njengoba ufaka), uhlobo lwalo, ububanzi, ukuphakama (nesill), izinga kanye nodonga okuwo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzindonga ngohlobo\u003C/strong\u003E: ngohlobo ngalunye lodonga, ziningaki izindonga, ubukhulu bazo, ubude bazo bonke kanye nendawo yazo eseceleni njenge-\u003Cstrong\u003EGross area\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EDeductions\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003ENet area\u003C/strong\u003E, nesamba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmagumbi\u003C/strong\u003E: inombolo, igama, izinga, indawo kanye nomjikelezo, kanye nesamba sendawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmafulo\u003C/strong\u003E: ngayinye ngezinga layo, uhlobo kanye nobukhulu, kanye nendawo yawo egcwele, izinciphiso kanye ne-net area.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuphela\u003C/strong\u003E: ungqimba ngalunye lokuphela kwezohlobo lwezindonga (ngempahla nangohlangothi lodonga) kanye nesiling, nenani lobuso kanye nesamba, izinciphiso kanye ne-net.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzindonga ngohlobo: idatha yokubalwa\u003C/strong\u003E: okufakwe kanye kuhlobo ngalunye lodonga (iyunithi, umhlanganiso, izinga), nenani lezindonga, ubude bazo kanye ne-net area, kanye nezinga eliphindwe ngokulinganiswa okulinganisiwe. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/wall-assemblies\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/wall-assemblies\"\u003EIzinhlelo zezindonga\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuphela ngegumbi\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EUkuphela ngodonga\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EUkuphela ngesigaba\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003EIzinombolo zokuphela\u003C/strong\u003E: okugubha igumbi ngalinye, nezindawo, izinani lamathayili ahlanganisa ukusika kanye nevolumu yesisekelo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/room-finishes\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/room-finishes\"\u003EUkuphela kwamagumbi kanye namathebula okuphela\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinhlelo zakho zokuhlela, \u003Cstrong\u003Eset-ups\u003C/strong\u003E: ithebula owayelihlanganise, wenza isamba, wagcina ngegama. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/schedule-layouts\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/schedule-layouts\"\u003EHlela, gcina futhi uhambise ithebula\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELawa mathebula ashintsha ngalo lonke ushintsho olwenzayo. Chofoza umugqa, noma inani elilodwa, ukukhetha izinto ezivela kulo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELanda i-CSV\u003C/span\u003E igcina ithebula, ukuze uvule kusipredishithi; \u003Cstrong\u003ELanda i-Excel\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003EKopisha ye-Google Sheets\u003C/strong\u003E zisezansi kwalo. \u003Cstrong\u003EUkuphela kwamagumbi\u003C/strong\u003E ne-\u003Cstrong\u003ESpecification\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/specification\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/specification\"\u003EBhala i-specification kusuka kumodeli\u003C/a\u003E kuvulwa endaweni efanayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"indawo-nevolumu-yesendlalelo-ngasinye\"\u003EIndawo nevolumu yesendlalelo ngasinye\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003ELayers: area and volume\u003C/strong\u003E ohlwini lwe-Schedules. Linomugqa owodwa wesendlalelo ngasinye sohlobo lwezindonga, amafulo, uphahla kanye nesiling ezisetshenziswayo: into, uhlobo lwayo kanye ne-LOD, isendlalelo (ibalwa kusuka ohlangothini lwangaphandle lodonga, kusuka phezulu kwefulo, uphahla noma isiling), impahla yaso kanye nomsebenzi, ukujula kwaso, inani lezinto, \u003Cstrong\u003Enet area\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003Evolume\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIndawo iyi-net area yezinto zalolo hlobo, ilinganiswe njengoba kwenziwa ku-Walls by type, Floors kanye ne-Finishes, ngendlela yokulinganisa yephrojekthi. Uphahla lulinganiswa ngokuthambekile; akukho mthetho wendlela yokulinganisa wophahla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIvolumu iyiyo leyo ndawo iphindwe ngokujula kwesendlalelo sayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIfulo, uphahla noma isiling ngaphandle kohlobo kuyisigaba esisodwa: isendlalelo esisodwa sobukhulu bayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIndawo yomoya ibalwa ngendawo yayo futhi ayifakwa kwevolumu yonke. Imembrane inendawo kodwa ayinavolumu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza umugqa ukukhetha izinto zawo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELanda i-CSV\u003C/span\u003E igcina ithebula.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"indlela-izindawo-ezilinganiswa-ngayo\"\u003EIndlela izindawo ezilinganiswa ngayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYonke indawo inezinombolo ezintathu ezengeza ndawonye: gross ngaphandle kokuncishiswa kuba i-net. Umthetho ubhalwe ngaphezulu kwalawa mathebula wonke, futhi ngumthetho munye: amashidi, izinani ezigcinwe efayeleni le-IFC kanye nokubalwa okunikezwa ku-TakeoffCraft konke kusebenzisa wona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUdonga\u003C/strong\u003E: gross ngubuso bodonga bodwa, ubude bayo ngomugqa wasembindini iphindwe ngobude bayo (ubuso bangempela bodonga olunophephelo olumile noma isisekelo esinesimo). Konke okuvulekile (imigoqo, amawindi nezinye izimbobo) kuyancishiswa, ububanzi ngobude, kuvulwe kanye ngalinye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIfulo noma isiling\u003C/strong\u003E: gross ngendawo engaphakathi komgogodla wayo. Konke okuvulekile nokusikwa okungaphakathi kuyancishiswa kanye kanye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuphela kodonga\u003C/strong\u003E: ungqimba ngalunye lokuphela lohlobo lodonga lumboza ubuso bodonga bodwa, lulinganiswa njengodonga, kususwa izimbobo ezifanayo. Ukuphela kuyisendlalelo sodonga: sikhonjiswa ngaphansi kwe-Ukuphela futhi asingezwa endaweni yodonga, ngakho udonga olunomnyango alubalwa kabili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELowo ngu-\u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft default\u003C/strong\u003E: konke okuvulekile kuyancishiswa, noma ngabe kunosayizi muni; izindonga zilinganiswa ngomugqa wasembindini; ama-reveal akalinganiswa. Yilokho okusetshenziswa yiphrojekthi ngayinye uze ukhethe enye indlela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khetha-indlela-yokulinganisa\"\u003EKhetha indlela yokulinganisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgaphezu kwe-schedule, \u003Cstrong\u003EMeasurement method\u003C/strong\u003E ilanda izindlela ezifika ne-BimCraft, bese \u003Cstrong\u003ELoad a method file\u003C/strong\u003E ithatha eyakho yehhovisi. Ukukhetha kugcinwa efayeleni le-IFC, njengesinyathelo esisodwa se-undo, futhi izinto ezintathu zilandela kanyekanye: amathebula, izinani ezinetha ezigcinwe efayeleni, kanye nokubalwa okunikezwa ku-TakeoffCraft. Umthetho ongaphezu kwethebula ngalinye-ke uqala ngendlela, umthombo wayo, usuku umthombo wafundwa ngalo namagama \u003Cstrong\u003EAkuhlolwe ngumsindisi wezinani\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIndlela ingufayela elincane lezimo, hhayi ikhodi yohlelo. Ngenani ngalinye ithi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Eimbobo encane kakhulu esusiwe\u003C/strong\u003E: isibonelo, imbobo engu-0.5 m² noma ngaphansi ihlala endaweni yodonga;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Eindlela izindawo zezindonga ezihlangana ngayo elinganiswa ngayo\u003C/strong\u003E: ngomugqa wasembindini; noma udonga oluphela kudonga olunye lulinganiswa kuya ebusweni balowo mdonga; noma wonke umkhawulo wodonga ohlangana nodonga olunye ulinganiswa kuya ebusweni obuseduze;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Ekulinganiswa yini ama-reveal\u003C/strong\u003E okuphela ngawo (ukubuyela kokuphela kwemigoqo), njengendawo noma, uma kuncane, njengobude. Ukujula kwe-reveal kuthathwa njengesigamu sobukhulu bodonga;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Eithini ngesakhiwo sebhilidi (masonry)\u003C/strong\u003E: sinqunywa kanjani, nanoma yimaphi ama-waste noma ama-mortar ayisho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzindlela ezifika ne-BimCraft:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIndlela\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIzindonga: imbobo encane kakhulu esusiwe\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkuphela kodonga\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIziling\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkwakha ngebhilidi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECadCraft default\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekonke okuvulekile\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekonke okuvulekile\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekonke okusikiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eakukho okuvunyelwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERICS NRM 2 (United Kingdom), 2nd edition 2021\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0.5 m² noma ngaphansi kuyahlala\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E1 m² noma ngaphansi kuyahlala\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E1 m² noma ngaphansi kuyahlala\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Engendawo; azikho amaphesenti ashiwo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAAQS Standard Method for Africa 2015\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0.5 m² noma ngaphansi kuyahlala\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0.5 m² noma ngaphansi kuyahlala\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0.5 m² noma ngaphansi kuyahlala\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Engendawo; ilinganiswa ngaphandle, 0% waste\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIS 1200 (India), 1976, brickwork\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0.1 m² noma ngaphansi kuyahlala\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eokuzenzakalelayo (bona ngezansi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eokuzenzakalelayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Engevolumu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBIA Technical Note 10 (United States), 2009\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekonke okuvulekile\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eokuzenzakalelayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eokuzenzakalelayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E5% waste kumayunithi, 15% kumortar\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFunda lezi zimingcele ngaphambi kokuthembela endleleni:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkukho quantity surveyor ohlolile noma yiyiphi kuzo.\u003C/strong\u003E Ngayinye yenziwa ngokufunda umthombo obhekisela kuwo nokurekhoda izinombolo zawo nesigatshana esizivela kuso. Uma uyi-quantity surveyor futhi ungahlola enye, abenzi be-app bangathanda ukukwazi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELapho umthetho ungafundeka emthonjeni, indlela ithi \u003Cstrong\u003Enot confirmed\u003C/strong\u003E kuwo futhi kusetshenziswa i-CadCraft default. Akukho ndlela efika ne-BimCraft enomthetho oqinisekisiwe wezixhumi zezindonga, ama-reveal noma amafulo, ngakho ezo zilinganiswa ngendlela ejwayelekile ngaphansi kwazo zonke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIS 1200 ikhipha izimbobo ku-plaster ngamabhendi amathathu. Ifayela lendlela alikwazi ukugcina amabhendi okwamanje, ngakho ukuphela kwezindonga kusebenzisa okuzenzakalelayo ngaphansi kwalolo hlelo, futhi umthetho uyashoyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-South African Standard System of Measuring Building Work \u003Cstrong\u003Eayikho\u003C/strong\u003E kuzo: umbhalo wayo awukwazanga ukufundwa. Indlela ye-AAQS yase-Africa ithi yakhelwe ku-1991 edition yalolo hlelo, kodwa iyidokhumenti ehlukile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBIA Technical Note 10 yinothi yokulinganisa yemboni, hhayi indlela ejwayelekile yokulinganisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImbobo esayizi encane kakhulu ilandela amagama endlela (&quot;not exceeding&quot;, &quot;less than&quot;). Usayizi ongaphakathi kwezingxenye ezi-2 ku-10 000 kuyo ubalwa njengalowo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphansi kwendlela, indawo ye-net yohlangothi lodonga nendawo ye-net yefulo noma isiling kulandela indlela, nesethi yezinani iyitshela. Izinani ezigcwele nevolumu efayeleni zihlala njengoba zidwetshwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinkomba zale ndlela\u003C/strong\u003E, ngaphansi kwesikhethi, zisho ukuthi yisiphi isithombo ngasinye sishiya siveziwe. \u003Cstrong\u003EVula umthombo\u003C/strong\u003E ukuya kudokhumenti.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"indlela-yehhovisi-lakho\"\u003EIndlela yehhovisi lakho\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIfayela lendlela liyi-JSON ngefomethi \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft-measurement-method\u003C/code\u003E. Yonke inani kulo libiza isigatshana lisuka kuso; inani elingenaso isigatshana alamukelwa. Ifayela liyahlolwa lapho ulayisha, inkinga ikhonjiswa ngegama, futhi akukho okusetshenziswa kwifayela elingadlulisi. Uma lisekhethiwe, lilondolozwa ngaphakathi kwephrojekthi, ngakho iphrojekthi ivula ngendlela efanayo kwenye ikhompyutha. Ikhodi yalo ingegama elilula lakho (kungenzeka ingabi ikhodi yendlela enikezwa uhlelo).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izitsha-amabhulokhi-nomortar\"\u003EIzitsha, amabhulokhi nomortar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzindonga ngohlobo: idatha yokubalwa\u003C/strong\u003E ibala amayunithi nomortar wohlobo ngalunye lodonga oluneyunithi enobude nokuphakama (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/wall-assemblies#give-a-type-its-takeoff-data\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/wall-assemblies\" data-hash=\"give-a-type-its-takeoff-data\"\u003ENika uhlobo idatha yalo yokubalwa\u003C/a\u003E). Lezi yizifomula, njengoba zibalwa ngokuqondile:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmayunithi ngendawo yesendlalelo esisodwa\u003C/strong\u003E = 1 / ((ubude besiyunithi + ijoyinti) × (ukuphakama kwesiyunithi + ijoyinti)). Ibhulokhi elingu-215 × 65 mm elinejoyinti elingu-10 mm: 1 / (225 × 75 mm) = 59.26 ngu-m².\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmayunithi abubanzi ngokuhlanganyela kwesendlalelo\u003C/strong\u003E = (ukujula kwesendlalelo + ijoyinti) / (ububanzi besiyunithi + ijoyinti), kusondelwe ku-whole number, okungenani 1. Isendlalelo esingu-102.5 mm sezibhulokhi ezingu-102.5 mm singu-1; udonga olungu-215 mm lwezibhulokhi zefanayo lungu-2.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmayunithi\u003C/strong\u003E = amayunithi ngendawo × amayunithi abubanzi × indawo ye-net yobuso bodonga, ihlanganiswe phezu kwezendlalelo zohlobo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmayunithi okuoda\u003C/strong\u003E = amayunithi × (1 + waste % / 100), asondelwe phezulu ku-whole unit. Ukonakala kuthathwa kohlobo, uma kukhona; uma kungekho, kwendlela, uma ikhombisa okuthile; kungenjalo 0%.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmortar\u003C/strong\u003E = indawo ye-net × ukujula kwesendlalelo, ngaphandle kwevolumu yamayunithi (amayunithi × ubude × ukuphakama × ububanzi), bese kwengezwa iphesenti elengeziwe elifakwe kohlobo lwama-frog noma imbobo, bese kwengezwa okuvunyelwe kwendlela uma luyakhomba. Idinga ububanzi besiyunithi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkuthathwayo: isendlalelo ngasinye sohlobo sakhiwa ngeyunithi yohlobo lwaso; isendlalelo esijulile kunobubanzi bayunithi eyodwa sibalwa njengobubanzi bayunithi abaningi, ngayinye njengesendlalelo esibekwe ngobude, ngakho izinhlaka ezisikiwe, ama-closer nezimo ezikhethekile azibalwa ngokwahlukana; lapho kungakhethwa sendlalelo esakhiwe ngeyunithi, izendlalelo eziphakathi zithathwa njengezendlalelo, futhi inothi ngaphezulu kwethebula liyakutshela lokho. \u003Cstrong\u003EAmount\u003C/strong\u003E yisilinganiso esiphindwe ngalokho esilinganiswa ngakho, okungaba futhi iyunithi yokuoda, amayunithi okuoda angu-1000 noma i-m³ yomortar.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmamaki yizinombolo ze-IFC zezinto: shintsha enye ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EProperties\u003C/strong\u003E (Tag) nethebula lilandele. Kuyo yonke imodeli ye-IFC, edwetshiwe noma cha, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/quantity-totals\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/quantity-totals\"\u003EEngeza izinani, uhlu izinto kanye nezikhala zethebula\u003C/a\u003E yengeza noma yiyiphi impahla.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izilinganiso\"\u003EIzilinganiso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIpulani likhombisa ubude bodonga ngalunye odwetshiwe ngaseceleni langaphandle (udonga wangaphakathi: ngohlangothi olunye) futhi, kudonga oneminyango namawindi, ichain esuka emakhoneni iye kwelinye nelinye imbobo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilinganiso\u003C/span\u003E ebhareni lemodeli iyazicasha futhi ibuyise.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gcina-ipulani-njenge-pdf\"\u003EGcina ipulani njenge-PDF\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBonisa izinga ofuna bese usetha iyunithi ephaneli ethi \u003Cstrong\u003ELevels\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhrinta\u003C/span\u003E ebhareni lemodeli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-BimCraft igcina &quot;&lt;file&gt; — &lt;level&gt;.pdf&quot;: ipulani ngombala omnyama nomhlophe ngesilinganiso esijwayelekile esikhulu esifanele ikhasi (1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;, 1/8&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot; … ku-Letter ngamafiti namayintshi; 1:50, 1:100 … ku-A4 ngamamillimitha), nodonga ogcwele, iminyango, amawindi, amagama wamagumbi nezindawo, izilinganiso, kanye nebhande lesihloko elinezinga, ifayela, ukuphakama kokusika, usuku kanye nesilinganiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-PDF idwetshwe ngemigqa nombhalo, ngakho ihlala icacile kunoma yisiphi isilinganiso sokusondeza futhi umbhalo wayo ungasesakwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukwazi\"\u003EOkufanele ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmathebula abala okudwetshwe ngamathuluzi wokudweba. Izicabha namawindi avela kwezinye izinhlelo zibonakala ku-Quantity totals esikhundleni salokho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuze ubize umsebenzi, nikeza izinani ku-TakeoffCraft: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/takeoff\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/takeoff\"\u003EIzinani ku-TakeoffCraft\u003C/a\u003E. Ukulanda kwe-CSV kuhlala kwelamathebula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Bona ukuthi isakhiwo osidwetshile siyini, njengoba usidweba: ziningaki izicabha namawindi ngosayizi ngamunye, udonga olungakanani ngohlobo ngalunye, kanye nokuthi igumbi ngalinye likhulu kangakanani. Beka izilinganiso epulanini bese uyigcina njenge-PDF ukuze uyiphrinte noma uyithumele. Uhlu Ngo-Dweba usebenza, Uhlu kwiphaneli yesobunxele ibonisa ithebula elilodwa ngesikhathi: Izicabha nemawindi: ngalinye ngophawu lwalo (D1, D2 … kanye no-W1 …, anikezwa njengoba ufaka), uhlobo lwalo, ububanzi, ukuphakama (nesill), izinga kanye nodonga okuwo. Izindonga ngohlobo: ngohlobo ngalunye lodonga, ziningaki izindonga, ubukhulu bazo, ubude bazo bonke kanye nendawo yazo eseceleni njenge-Gross area, Deductions kanye Net area, nesamba. Amagumbi: inombolo, igama, izinga, indawo kanye nomjikelezo, kanye nesamba sendawo. Amafulo: ngayinye ngezinga layo, uhlobo kanye nobukhulu, kanye nendawo yawo egcwele, izinciphiso kanye ne-net area. Ukuphela: ungqimba ngalunye lokuphela kwezohlobo lwezindonga (ngempahla nangohlangothi lodonga) kanye nesiling, nenani lobuso kanye nesamba, izinciphiso kanye ne-net. Izindonga ngohlobo: idatha yokubalwa: okufakwe kanye kuhlobo ngalunye lodonga (iyunithi, umhlanganiso, izinga), nenani lezindonga, ubude bazo kanye ne-net area, kanye nezinga eliphindwe ngokulinganiswa okulinganisiwe. Bona Izinhlelo zezindonga. Ukuphela ngegumbi, Ukuphela ngodonga, Ukuphela ngesigaba kanye Izinombolo zokuphela: okugubha igumbi ngalinye, nezindawo, izinani lamathayili ahlanganisa ukusika kanye nevolumu yesisekelo. Bona Ukuphela kwamagumbi kanye namathebula okuphela. Izinhlelo zakho zokuhlela, set-ups: ithebula owayelihlanganise, wenza isamba, wagcina ngegama. Bona Hlela, gcina futhi uhambise ithebula. Lawa mathebula ashintsha ngalo lonke ushintsho olwenzayo. Chofoza umugqa, noma inani elilodwa, ukukhetha izinto ezivela kulo. Landa i-CSV igcina ithebula, ukuze uvule kusipredishithi; Landa i-Excel kanye Kopisha ye-Google Sheets zisezansi kwalo. Ukuphela kwamagumbi ne-Specification Bhala i-specification kusuka kumodeli kuvulwa endaweni efanayo. Indawo nevolumu yesendlalelo ngasinye Khetha Layers: area and volume ohlwini lwe-Schedules. Linomugqa owodwa wesendlalelo ngasinye sohlobo lwezindonga, amafulo, uphahla kanye nesiling ezisetshenziswayo: into, uhlobo lwayo kanye ne-LOD, isendlalelo (ibalwa kusuka ohlangothini lwangaphandle lodonga, kusuka phezulu kwefulo, uphahla noma isiling), impahla yaso kanye nomsebenzi, ukujula kwaso, inani lezinto, net area kanye volume. Indawo iyi-net area yezinto zalolo hlobo, ilinganiswe njengoba kwenziwa ku-Walls by type, Floors kanye ne-Finishes, ngendlela yokulinganisa yephrojekthi. Uphahla lulinganiswa ngokuthambekile; akukho mthetho wendlela yokulinganisa wophahla. Ivolumu iyiyo leyo ndawo iphindwe ngokujula kwesendlalelo sayo. Ifulo, uphahla noma isiling ngaphandle kohlobo kuyisigaba esisodwa: isendlalelo esisodwa sobukhulu bayo. Indawo yomoya ibalwa ngendawo yayo futhi ayifakwa kwevolumu yonke. Imembrane inendawo kodwa ayinavolumu. Chofoza umugqa ukukhetha izinto zawo. Landa i-CSV igcina ithebula. Indlela izindawo ezilinganiswa ngayo Yonke indawo inezinombolo ezintathu ezengeza ndawonye: gross ngaphandle kokuncishiswa kuba i-net. Umthetho ubhalwe ngaphezulu kwalawa mathebula wonke, futhi ngumthetho munye: amashidi, izinani ezigcinwe efayeleni le-IFC kanye nokubalwa okunikezwa ku-TakeoffCraft konke kusebenzisa wona. Udonga: gross ngubuso bodonga bodwa, ubude bayo ngomugqa wasembindini iphindwe ngobude bayo (ubuso bangempela bodonga olunophephelo olumile noma isisekelo esinesimo). Konke okuvulekile (imigoqo, amawindi nezinye izimbobo) kuyancishiswa, ububanzi ngobude, kuvulwe kanye ngalinye. Ifulo noma isiling: gross ngendawo engaphakathi komgogodla wayo. Konke okuvulekile nokusikwa okungaphakathi kuyancishiswa kanye kanye. Ukuphela kodonga: ungqimba ngalunye lokuphela lohlobo lodonga lumboza ubuso bodonga bodwa, lulinganiswa njengodonga, kususwa izimbobo ezifanayo. Ukuphela kuyisendlalelo sodonga: sikhonjiswa ngaphansi kwe-Ukuphela futhi asingezwa endaweni yodonga, ngakho udonga olunomnyango alubalwa kabili. Lowo ngu-CadCraft default: konke okuvulekile kuyancishiswa, noma ngabe kunosayizi muni; izindonga zilinganiswa ngomugqa wasembindini; ama-reveal akalinganiswa. Yilokho okusetshenziswa yiphrojekthi ngayinye uze ukhethe enye indlela. Khetha indlela yokulinganisa Ngaphezu kwe-schedule, Measurement method ilanda izindlela ezifika ne-BimCraft, bese Load a method file ithatha eyakho yehhovisi. Ukukhetha kugcinwa efayeleni le-IFC, njengesinyathelo esisodwa se-undo, futhi izinto ezintathu zilandela kanyekanye: amathebula, izinani ezinetha ezigcinwe efayeleni, kanye nokubalwa okunikezwa ku-TakeoffCraft. Umthetho ongaphezu kwethebula ngalinye-ke uqala ngendlela, umthombo wayo, usuku umthombo wafundwa ngalo namagama Akuhlolwe ngumsindisi wezinani. Indlela ingufayela elincane lezimo, hhayi ikhodi yohlelo. Ngenani ngalinye ithi: imbobo encane kakhulu esusiwe: isibonelo, imbobo engu-0.5 m² noma ngaphansi ihlala endaweni yodonga; indlela izindawo zezindonga ezihlangana ngayo elinganiswa ngayo: ngomugqa wasembindini; noma udonga oluphela kudonga olunye lulinganiswa kuya ebusweni balowo mdonga; noma wonke umkhawulo wodonga ohlangana nodonga olunye ulinganiswa kuya ebusweni obuseduze; kulinganiswa yini ama-reveal okuphela ngawo (ukubuyela kokuphela kwemigoqo), njengendawo noma, uma kuncane, njengobude. Ukujula kwe-reveal kuthathwa njengesigamu sobukhulu bodonga; ithini ngesakhiwo sebhilidi (masonry): sinqunywa kanjani, nanoma yimaphi ama-waste noma ama-mortar ayisho. Izindlela ezifika ne-BimCraft: Indlela Izindonga: imbobo encane kakhulu esusiwe Ukuphela kodonga Iziling Ukwakha ngebhilidi CadCraft default konke okuvulekile konke okuvulekile konke okusikiwe akukho okuvunyelwe RICS NRM 2 (United Kingdom), 2nd edition 2021 0.5 m² noma ngaphansi kuyahlala 1 m² noma ngaphansi kuyahlala 1 m² noma ngaphansi kuyahlala ngendawo; azikho amaphesenti ashiwo AAQS Standard Method for Africa 2015 0.5 m² noma ngaphansi kuyahlala 0.5 m² noma ngaphansi kuyahlala 0.5 m² noma ngaphansi kuyahlala ngendawo; ilinganiswa ngaphandle, 0% waste IS 1200 (India), 1976, brickwork 0.1 m² noma ngaphansi kuyahlala okuzenzakalelayo (bona ngezansi) okuzenzakalelayo ngevolumu BIA Technical Note 10 (United States), 2009 konke okuvulekile okuzenzakalelayo okuzenzakalelayo 5% waste kumayunithi, 15% kumortar Funda lezi zimingcele ngaphambi kokuthembela endleleni: Akukho quantity surveyor ohlolile noma yiyiphi kuzo. Ngayinye yenziwa ngokufunda umthombo obhekisela kuwo nokurekhoda izinombolo zawo nesigatshana esizivela kuso. Uma uyi-quantity surveyor futhi ungahlola enye, abenzi be-app bangathanda ukukwazi. Lapho umthetho ungafundeka emthonjeni, indlela ithi not confirmed kuwo futhi kusetshenziswa i-CadCraft default. Akukho ndlela efika ne-BimCraft enomthetho oqinisekisiwe wezixhumi zezindonga, ama-reveal noma amafulo, ngakho ezo zilinganiswa ngendlela ejwayelekile ngaphansi kwazo zonke. IS 1200 ikhipha izimbobo ku-plaster ngamabhendi amathathu. Ifayela lendlela alikwazi ukugcina amabhendi okwamanje, ngakho ukuphela kwezindonga kusebenzisa okuzenzakalelayo ngaphansi kwalolo hlelo, futhi umthetho uyashoyo. I-South African Standard System of Measuring Building Work ayikho kuzo: umbhalo wayo awukwazanga ukufundwa. Indlela ye-AAQS yase-Africa ithi yakhelwe ku-1991 edition yalolo hlelo, kodwa iyidokhumenti ehlukile. BIA Technical Note 10 yinothi yokulinganisa yemboni, hhayi indlela ejwayelekile yokulinganisa. Imbobo esayizi encane kakhulu ilandela amagama endlela (\"not exceeding\", \"less than\"). Usayizi ongaphakathi kwezingxenye ezi-2 ku-10 000 kuyo ubalwa njengalowo. Ngaphansi kwendlela, indawo ye-net yohlangothi lodonga nendawo ye-net yefulo noma isiling kulandela indlela, nesethi yezinani iyitshela. Izinani ezigcwele nevolumu efayeleni zihlala njengoba zidwetshwe. Izinkomba zale ndlela, ngaphansi kwesikhethi, zisho ukuthi yisiphi isithombo ngasinye sishiya siveziwe. Vula umthombo ukuya kudokhumenti. Indlela yehhovisi lakho Ifayela lendlela liyi-JSON ngefomethi cadcraft-measurement-method. Yonke inani kulo libiza isigatshana lisuka kuso; inani elingenaso isigatshana alamukelwa. Ifayela liyahlolwa lapho ulayisha, inkinga ikhonjiswa ngegama, futhi akukho okusetshenziswa kwifayela elingadlulisi. Uma lisekhethiwe, lilondolozwa ngaphakathi kwephrojekthi, ngakho iphrojekthi ivula ngendlela efanayo kwenye ikhompyutha. Ikhodi yalo ingegama elilula lakho (kungenzeka ingabi ikhodi yendlela enikezwa uhlelo). Izitsha, amabhulokhi nomortar Izindonga ngohlobo: idatha yokubalwa ibala amayunithi nomortar wohlobo ngalunye lodonga oluneyunithi enobude nokuphakama (bona Nika uhlobo idatha yalo yokubalwa). Lezi yizifomula, njengoba zibalwa ngokuqondile: Amayunithi ngendawo yesendlalelo esisodwa = 1 / ((ubude besiyunithi + ijoyinti) × (ukuphakama kwesiyunithi + ijoyinti)). Ibhulokhi elingu-215 × 65 mm elinejoyinti elingu-10 mm: 1 / (225 × 75 mm) = 59.26 ngu-m². Amayunithi abubanzi ngokuhlanganyela kwesendlalelo = (ukujula kwesendlalelo + ijoyinti) / (ububanzi besiyunithi + ijoyinti), kusondelwe ku-whole number, okungenani 1. Isendlalelo esingu-102.5 mm sezibhulokhi ezingu-102.5 mm singu-1; udonga olungu-215 mm lwezibhulokhi zefanayo lungu-2. Amayunithi = amayunithi ngendawo × amayunithi abubanzi × indawo ye-net yobuso bodonga, ihlanganiswe phezu kwezendlalelo zohlobo. Amayunithi okuoda = amayunithi × (1 + waste % / 100), asondelwe phezulu ku-whole unit. Ukonakala kuthathwa kohlobo, uma kukhona; uma kungekho, kwendlela, uma ikhombisa okuthile; kungenjalo 0%. Umortar = indawo ye-net × ukujula kwesendlalelo, ngaphandle kwevolumu yamayunithi (amayunithi × ubude × ukuphakama × ububanzi), bese kwengezwa iphesenti elengeziwe elifakwe kohlobo lwama-frog noma imbobo, bese kwengezwa okuvunyelwe kwendlela uma luyakhomba. Idinga ububanzi besiyunithi. Okuthathwayo: isendlalelo ngasinye sohlobo sakhiwa ngeyunithi yohlobo lwaso; isendlalelo esijulile kunobubanzi bayunithi eyodwa sibalwa njengobubanzi bayunithi abaningi, ngayinye njengesendlalelo esibekwe ngobude, ngakho izinhlaka ezisikiwe, ama-closer nezimo ezikhethekile azibalwa ngokwahlukana; lapho kungakhethwa sendlalelo esakhiwe ngeyunithi, izendlalelo eziphakathi zithathwa njengezendlalelo, futhi inothi ngaphezulu kwethebula liyakutshela lokho. Amount yisilinganiso esiphindwe ngalokho esilinganiswa ngakho, okungaba futhi iyunithi yokuoda, amayunithi okuoda angu-1000 noma i-m³ yomortar. Amamaki yizinombolo ze-IFC zezinto: shintsha enye ku-Properties (Tag) nethebula lilandele. Kuyo yonke imodeli ye-IFC, edwetshiwe noma cha, Engeza izinani, uhlu izinto kanye nezikhala zethebula yengeza noma yiyiphi impahla. Izilinganiso Ipulani likhombisa ubude bodonga ngalunye odwetshiwe ngaseceleni langaphandle (udonga wangaphakathi: ngohlangothi olunye) futhi, kudonga oneminyango namawindi, ichain esuka emakhoneni iye kwelinye nelinye imbobo. Izilinganiso ebhareni lemodeli iyazicasha futhi ibuyise. Gcina ipulani njenge-PDF Bonisa izinga ofuna bese usetha iyunithi ephaneli ethi Levels. Chofoza Phrinta ebhareni lemodeli. I-BimCraft igcina \"\u003Cfile\u003E — \u003Clevel\u003E.pdf\": ipulani ngombala omnyama nomhlophe ngesilinganiso esijwayelekile esikhulu esifanele ikhasi (1/4\" = 1'-0\", 1/8\" = 1'-0\" … ku-Letter ngamafiti namayintshi; 1:50, 1:100 … ku-A4 ngamamillimitha), nodonga ogcwele, iminyango, amawindi, amagama wamagumbi nezindawo, izilinganiso, kanye nebhande lesihloko elinezinga, ifayela, ukuphakama kokusika, usuku kanye nesilinganiso. I-PDF idwetshwe ngemigqa nombhalo, ngakho ihlala icacile kunoma yisiphi isilinganiso sokusondeza futhi umbhalo wayo ungasesakwa. Okufanele ukwazi Amathebula abala okudwetshwe ngamathuluzi wokudweba. Izicabha namawindi avela kwezinye izinhlelo zibonakala ku-Quantity totals esikhundleni salokho. Ukuze ubize umsebenzi, nikeza izinani ku-TakeoffCraft: bona Izinani ku-TakeoffCraft. Ukulanda kwe-CSV kuhlala kwelamathebula.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"storeys-and-spaces","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Bonisa futhi ufihle izitezi, izindawo kanye nemiphetho","summary":"Vala izitezi ukuze ubone ngaphakathi kwesakhiwo, bonisa amagumbi nezindawo, bese uvula noma uvale imigqa yemiphetho.","section":"tasks","order":20,"keywords":["izitezi","amaleveli","amafloor","fihla","hlukanisa","amagumbi","izindawo","ifcspace","imiphetho","ukubonakala","isigaba"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo-bheka-isitezi-esisodwa","text":"Izinyathelo: bheka isitezi esisodwa","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukubone","text":"Okufanele ukubone","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo-bonisa-amagumbi-nezindawo","text":"Izinyathelo: bonisa amagumbi nezindawo","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo-imiphetho","text":"Izinyathelo: imiphetho","level":2},{"id":"izinkinga-ezivamile","text":"Izinkinga ezivamile","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBheka ngaphakathi kumodeli ye-IFC ngokuvala izitezi ezingaphezu kwalena ofuna ukuyibona, bese ubonisa amagumbi nezindawo, futhi uvale imigqa yemiphetho ukuze kube sobala ngaphezulu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo-bheka-isitezi-esisodwa\"\u003EIzinyathelo: bheka isitezi esisodwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula imodeli ye-IFC. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/open-ifc-model\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/open-ifc-model\"\u003EVula imodeli ye-IFC bese ubheka ku-3D\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThola uhlu lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzitezi\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesobunxele. Isitezi esiphezulu siqala, njengokufunda isigaba kusuka ophahleni kuya phansi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESusa ukhetho ophahleni nakuzo zonke izitezi ezingaphezulu kwesitezi ofuna sona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhezulu\u003C/span\u003E ukuze ubheke phansi kulelo floor.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha futhi izitezi ukuze uzibuyisele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukubone\"\u003EOkufanele ukubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsitezi ngasinye osisusa ukhetho sinyamalala ngokushesha, nakho konke okusitezi. Uhlu lubonisa kuphela izitezi ezinento ebonakalayo. Izinto ezingabelwe isitezi esithile ziqoqwa njenge-\u003Cstrong\u003EAkusesitezini\u003C/strong\u003E ngaphansi; izinto zesayithi nezinye izinsiza zivamise ukufika lapho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo-bonisa-amagumbi-nezindawo\"\u003EIzinyathelo: bonisa amagumbi nezindawo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzindawo\u003C/span\u003E kumbhalo ongaphezu komodeli. Inkinobho ihlala icindezelwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBheka imodeli: amagumbi nezindawo ziveza njengamavolumu amakhanya, abonakala ngokuphelele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza indawo ukuze ufunde izici zayo, njengegama layo, inombolo kanye nendawo, ngakwesokudla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzindawo\u003C/span\u003E futhi ukuze uzifihle.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzindawo ziyafihlwa lapho imodeli ivulwa ngoba kungenjalo zizogubha odongeni namafloor.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo-imiphetho\"\u003EIzinyathelo: imiphetho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImiphetho\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uvale imigqa emincane yemiphetho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza futhi ukuze uyivule.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEzimodelini ezinkulu kakhulu (ngaphezu kwezigidi ezingu-1.5 zama-triangle) inkinobho iba yimpunga nethiphu elithi &quot;Imiphetho ivaliwe ezimodelini ezinkulu kakhulu&quot;. Lokhu kulondoloza inkumbulo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinkinga-ezivamile\"\u003EIzinkinga ezivamile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkususa ukhetho esitezini bese usabona izingxenye zaso.\u003C/strong\u003E Into ibhekele isitezi okuwuhlelele kuso umkhiqizi wefayela. Udonga oluphakeme noma isinyathelo ngokuvamile sibhekele isitezi sayo esiyisisekelo, ngakho sihlala uma isitezi esingaphezulu sifihliwe, noma sinyamalale nesitezi esingaphansi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkufihla izitezi ukuze ubone ngaphakathi.\u003C/strong\u003E Ibhokisi lesigaba livame ukuba lisheshe: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/section-plane#a-section-box\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/section-plane\" data-hash=\"a-section-box\"\u003ESika imodeli ye-IFC ngendiza yesigaba\u003C/a\u003E. Ungakwazi futhi ukukhipha imigqa ku-\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmuthi wemodeli\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/model-tree\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/model-tree\"\u003EThola indlela yakho ngomuthi wemodeli\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuchofoza indawo ngodonga.\u003C/strong\u003E Ukuchofoza kukhetha umphezulu obonakalayo oseduze kakhulu. Fihla isitezi esingaphezulu, noma shintshela ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhezulu\u003C/span\u003E, bese uchofoza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmagama wezitezi abukeka ngendlela engajwayelekile.\u003C/strong\u003E I-BimCraft ikhombisa amagama wezitezi alondolozwe efayelini. Uma athi &quot;Level 1&quot; noma inombolo, yilokho umkhiqizi wefayela akubhalile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Bheka ngaphakathi kumodeli ye-IFC ngokuvala izitezi ezingaphezu kwalena ofuna ukuyibona, bese ubonisa amagumbi nezindawo, futhi uvale imigqa yemiphetho ukuze kube sobala ngaphezulu. Izinyathelo: bheka isitezi esisodwa Vula imodeli ye-IFC. Bheka Vula imodeli ye-IFC bese ubheka ku-3D. Thola uhlu lwe-Izitezi ngakwesobunxele. Isitezi esiphezulu siqala, njengokufunda isigaba kusuka ophahleni kuya phansi. Susa ukhetho ophahleni nakuzo zonke izitezi ezingaphezulu kwesitezi ofuna sona. Chofoza Phezulu ukuze ubheke phansi kulelo floor. Khetha futhi izitezi ukuze uzibuyisele. Okufanele ukubone Isitezi ngasinye osisusa ukhetho sinyamalala ngokushesha, nakho konke okusitezi. Uhlu lubonisa kuphela izitezi ezinento ebonakalayo. Izinto ezingabelwe isitezi esithile ziqoqwa njenge-Akusesitezini ngaphansi; izinto zesayithi nezinye izinsiza zivamise ukufika lapho. Izinyathelo: bonisa amagumbi nezindawo Chofoza Izindawo kumbhalo ongaphezu komodeli. Inkinobho ihlala icindezelwe. Bheka imodeli: amagumbi nezindawo ziveza njengamavolumu amakhanya, abonakala ngokuphelele. Chofoza indawo ukuze ufunde izici zayo, njengegama layo, inombolo kanye nendawo, ngakwesokudla. Chofoza Izindawo futhi ukuze uzifihle. Izindawo ziyafihlwa lapho imodeli ivulwa ngoba kungenjalo zizogubha odongeni namafloor. Izinyathelo: imiphetho Chofoza Imiphetho ukuze uvale imigqa emincane yemiphetho. Chofoza futhi ukuze uyivule. Ezimodelini ezinkulu kakhulu (ngaphezu kwezigidi ezingu-1.5 zama-triangle) inkinobho iba yimpunga nethiphu elithi \"Imiphetho ivaliwe ezimodelini ezinkulu kakhulu\". Lokhu kulondoloza inkumbulo. Izinkinga ezivamile Ukususa ukhetho esitezini bese usabona izingxenye zaso. Into ibhekele isitezi okuwuhlelele kuso umkhiqizi wefayela. Udonga oluphakeme noma isinyathelo ngokuvamile sibhekele isitezi sayo esiyisisekelo, ngakho sihlala uma isitezi esingaphezulu sifihliwe, noma sinyamalale nesitezi esingaphansi. Ukufihla izitezi ukuze ubone ngaphakathi. Ibhokisi lesigaba livame ukuba lisheshe: bheka Sika imodeli ye-IFC ngendiza yesigaba. Ungakwazi futhi ukukhipha imigqa ku-Umuthi wemodeli (bheka Thola indlela yakho ngomuthi wemodeli). Ukuchofoza indawo ngodonga. Ukuchofoza kukhetha umphezulu obonakalayo oseduze kakhulu. Fihla isitezi esingaphezulu, noma shintshela ku-Phezulu, bese uchofoza. Amagama wezitezi abukeka ngendlela engajwayelekile. I-BimCraft ikhombisa amagama wezitezi alondolozwe efayelini. Uma athi \"Level 1\" noma inombolo, yilokho umkhiqizi wefayela akubhalile.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"library-types-and-kits","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Izimpawu, izinhlobo nezinto ezibonakalayo, izifanekiso zephrojekthi nama-Quick Kit","summary":"Umtapo unezinhlobo ezintathu zezinto (Izimpawu, Izinhlobo, Izinto ezibonakalayo). Engeza uhlobo kuphrojekthi yakho, qala kusuka esifanekisweni sephrojekthi esabelwane ngaso, engeza i-Quick Kit, bese wabelana ngezakho ngekhasi lokulayisha lomtapo.","section":"tasks","order":20,"keywords":["umtapo","izimpawu","izinhlobo","izinto ezibonakalayo","uhlobo","uhlobo lodonga","uhlobo lwephansi","uhlobo lophahla","uhlobo lwesiling","ithempulethi yephrojekthi","ithempulethi","i-quick kit","ikhithi","yabelana","layisha","inguqulo","logi yokushintsha","LOD","ukuhlelwa","ilayisensi","amanothi asensimini"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinhlobo-ezintathu-zezinto-zomtapo","text":"Izinhlobo ezintathu zezinto zomtapo","level":2},{"id":"engeza-uhlobo-kuphrojekthi-yakho","text":"Engeza uhlobo kuphrojekthi yakho","level":2},{"id":"amathempulethi-ephrojekthi-nama-quick-kit","text":"Amathempulethi ephrojekthi nama-Quick Kit","level":2},{"id":"yabelana-ngezakho","text":"Yabelana ngezakho","level":2},{"id":"amanothi-asensimini","text":"Amanothi asensimini","level":2},{"id":"okuwusizo-ukukwazi","text":"Okuwusizo ukukwazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThola okudingayo emtapweni ngokuthi yini, engeza uhlobo kuphrojekthi oyidweba, qala iphrojekthi entsha kusuka ethempulethini umuntu ayibelanile, bese wabelana ngezifanekiso zakho, izinhlobo nezikhithi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinhlobo-ezintathu-zezinto-zomtapo\"\u003EIzinhlobo ezintathu zezinto zomtapo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzimpawu\u003C/strong\u003E yizinkomba zokudweba: ze-2D kuphela, zidwetshwe ngosayizi wokuchaza, zihlelwe ngomkhakha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinhlobo\u003C/strong\u003E zitshela ukuthi into yakhiwe ngani: izendlalelo zayo ngobukhulu bazo bangempela, izinga lokuthuthuka layo (LOD) nekhodi yokuhlelwa kwayo. Uhlobo lungezwa kuphrojekthi, akudwetshwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinto ezibonakalayo\u003C/strong\u003E zinto zangempela njengeminyango, amawindi, izimpahla, izixhobo zamapayipi nemishini, zinombono wepulani nomzimba we-3D ngosayizi wangempela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-ithebhu ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELibrary\u003C/span\u003E, sebenzisa \u003Cstrong\u003EUhlobo lwento\u003C/strong\u003E ukubonisa Konke, Izimpawu, Izinhlobo noma Izinto ezibonakalayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"engeza-uhlobo-kuphrojekthi-yakho\"\u003EEngeza uhlobo kuphrojekthi yakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EIzinhlobo\u003C/strong\u003E ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EUhlobo lwento\u003C/strong\u003E bese uvula enye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHlola isakhiwo sayo, i-LOD nokuhlelwa ngaphansi kwesithombe, bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd to this project\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIngezwa njengohlobo lodonga, lwephansi, lophahla noma lwesiling oyolidweba ngalo. Uma uhlobo olunegama elifanayo sekukhona, olusha lungezwa njengekhophi futhi okwakho kuhlala njengakwakunjalo. I-Undo eyodwa iyasisusa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amathempulethi-ephrojekthi-nama-quick-kit\"\u003EAmathempulethi ephrojekthi nama-Quick Kit\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKits\u003C/span\u003E ukubona okwabelwane ngakho abanye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIthempulethi yephrojekthi\u003C/strong\u003E yifayela le-IFC elinamazinga, amagridi, izinhlobo nezilungiselelo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave to my templates\u003C/span\u003E ilibeka ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EIsakhiwo esisha\u003C/strong\u003E ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EQala kusuka ku\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EI-Quick Kit\u003C/strong\u003E uhlu lwezinto zomtapo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow the kit&#039;s items\u003C/span\u003E ziveza njengamakhadi ongawabeka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIkhithi ngayinye inenguqulo nelogi yokushintsha, eyokuqala kuqala. Inguqulo eqala nge-0 ilungele ukuxoxisana; 1.0.0 ilungele okwamukelwe ngumnikazi womugqa kuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yabelana-ngezakho\"\u003EYabelana ngezakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIthempulethi yephrojekthi:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave as template\u003C/span\u003E, thikha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAlso make a file to share in the Library\u003C/span\u003E, engeza okuqukethwe kuyo nenguqulo. Uthola ifayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.json\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EI-Quick Kit:\u003C/strong\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKits\u003C/span\u003E, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMake a Quick Kit from this project\u003C/span\u003E. Ibala izinto zomtapo esetshenziswa yiphrojekthi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUhlobo:\u003C/strong\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EType packs\u003C/span\u003E, thikha uhlobo olulodwa bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave as a Library item…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELayisha ifayela ekhasini lokulayisha lomtapo. Lidlula ukubuyekezwa okufanayo njanoma yisiphi isinto, futhi ukhetha ilayisensi lapho: yonke into imemezela ilayisensi yayo. Izinto zicelwa i-LOD yazo, ikilasi le-IFC nekhodi yokuhlelwa (ikhodi, hhayi igama kuphela).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amanothi-asensimini\"\u003EAmanothi asensimini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEkhasini lanoma yiyiphi into yomtapo, amalungu angenile angangeza inothi: isetshenzisiwe ephrojekthini yangempela, izanywe ephrojekthini yesampula, noma ithole inkinga. Chaza uhlobo lweprojekthi ngamagama ambalwa bese ugwema amagama amakhasimende. Inothi lisobala futhi aliyona ukubuyekezwa: alishintshi into.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuwusizo-ukukwazi\"\u003EOkuwusizo ukukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkukho okuthunyelwa ohlelweni. Amafayela akhiqizwa ekhompyutheni yakho futhi wena uwalayisha ngokwakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIkhithi eyenziwe kusuka ethempulethini ithwala umbhalo we-IFC njengoba wagcinwa. Hlola ukuthi awukho okuyimfihlo ngaphambi kokulayisha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-CadCraft ibonisa izimpawu namazinto abonakalayo ku-ithebhu yayo yomtapo; izinhlobo nezithempulethi zamaphrojekthi e-BimCraft kuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Thola okudingayo emtapweni ngokuthi yini, engeza uhlobo kuphrojekthi oyidweba, qala iphrojekthi entsha kusuka ethempulethini umuntu ayibelanile, bese wabelana ngezifanekiso zakho, izinhlobo nezikhithi. Izinhlobo ezintathu zezinto zomtapo Izimpawu yizinkomba zokudweba: ze-2D kuphela, zidwetshwe ngosayizi wokuchaza, zihlelwe ngomkhakha. Izinhlobo zitshela ukuthi into yakhiwe ngani: izendlalelo zayo ngobukhulu bazo bangempela, izinga lokuthuthuka layo (LOD) nekhodi yokuhlelwa kwayo. Uhlobo lungezwa kuphrojekthi, akudwetshwa. Izinto ezibonakalayo zinto zangempela njengeminyango, amawindi, izimpahla, izixhobo zamapayipi nemishini, zinombono wepulani nomzimba we-3D ngosayizi wangempela. Ku-ithebhu ethi Library, sebenzisa Uhlobo lwento ukubonisa Konke, Izimpawu, Izinhlobo noma Izinto ezibonakalayo. Engeza uhlobo kuphrojekthi yakho Khetha Izinhlobo ngaphansi kwe-Uhlobo lwento bese uvula enye. Hlola isakhiwo sayo, i-LOD nokuhlelwa ngaphansi kwesithombe, bese ukhetha Add to this project. Ingezwa njengohlobo lodonga, lwephansi, lophahla noma lwesiling oyolidweba ngalo. Uma uhlobo olunegama elifanayo sekukhona, olusha lungezwa njengekhophi futhi okwakho kuhlala njengakwakunjalo. I-Undo eyodwa iyasisusa. Amathempulethi ephrojekthi nama-Quick Kit Khetha Kits ukubona okwabelwane ngakho abanye. Ithempulethi yephrojekthi yifayela le-IFC elinamazinga, amagridi, izinhlobo nezilungiselelo. Save to my templates ilibeka ku-Isakhiwo esisha ngaphansi kwe-Qala kusuka ku. I-Quick Kit uhlu lwezinto zomtapo. Show the kit's items ziveza njengamakhadi ongawabeka. Ikhithi ngayinye inenguqulo nelogi yokushintsha, eyokuqala kuqala. Inguqulo eqala nge-0 ilungele ukuxoxisana; 1.0.0 ilungele okwamukelwe ngumnikazi womugqa kuphela. Yabelana ngezakho Ithempulethi yephrojekthi: Save as template, thikha Also make a file to share in the Library, engeza okuqukethwe kuyo nenguqulo. Uthola ifayela le-.json. I-Quick Kit: ku-Kits, khetha Make a Quick Kit from this project. Ibala izinto zomtapo esetshenziswa yiphrojekthi. Uhlobo: ku-Type packs, thikha uhlobo olulodwa bese ukhetha Save as a Library item…. Layisha ifayela ekhasini lokulayisha lomtapo. Lidlula ukubuyekezwa okufanayo njanoma yisiphi isinto, futhi ukhetha ilayisensi lapho: yonke into imemezela ilayisensi yayo. Izinto zicelwa i-LOD yazo, ikilasi le-IFC nekhodi yokuhlelwa (ikhodi, hhayi igama kuphela). Amanothi asensimini Ekhasini lanoma yiyiphi into yomtapo, amalungu angenile angangeza inothi: isetshenzisiwe ephrojekthini yangempela, izanywe ephrojekthini yesampula, noma ithole inkinga. Chaza uhlobo lweprojekthi ngamagama ambalwa bese ugwema amagama amakhasimende. Inothi lisobala futhi aliyona ukubuyekezwa: alishintshi into. Okuwusizo ukukwazi Akukho okuthunyelwa ohlelweni. Amafayela akhiqizwa ekhompyutheni yakho futhi wena uwalayisha ngokwakho. Ikhithi eyenziwe kusuka ethempulethini ithwala umbhalo we-IFC njengoba wagcinwa. Hlola ukuthi awukho okuyimfihlo ngaphambi kokulayisha. I-CadCraft ibonisa izimpawu namazinto abonakalayo ku-ithebhu yayo yomtapo; izinhlobo nezithempulethi zamaphrojekthi e-BimCraft kuphela.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"roofs","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Uphahla: ukuthambeka kwodonga ngalunye, amagabhula, amashedi nezindawo zophahla","summary":"Setha udonga ngalunye ngaphansi kophahla ukuthi lube nokuthambeka, sibe yigabhula noma lungabi nalo; sebenzisa izilungiselelo ze-hip, igabhula neshedi; phakamisa uphahla ngobude be-plate; engeza i-fascia ne-soffit; bese udweba izindawo zophahla ezodwa lapho uphahla lokuzenzakalela lungafaneli.","section":"tasks","order":20,"keywords":["shintsha uphahla","hlela uphahla","uphahla olukhethiwe","izici zophahla","hlehlisa uphahla","uphahla","ukuthambeka","udonga ngalunye","igabhula","iphethelo legabhula","ishedi","lean-to","hip","isigodi","umgogodla","ukuphakama kwe-plate","heel","fascia","soffit","eave","rake","overhang","indawo yophahla","uphahla lwesivandeki","ifasitela lophahla","ifasitela legabhula","ifasitela leshedi"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenziwa","text":"Okuzokwenziwa","level":2},{"id":"faka-uphahla","text":"Faka uphahla","level":2},{"id":"udonga-ngalunye-ngesikhathi","text":"Udonga ngalunye ngesikhathi","level":2},{"id":"shintsha-uphahla-owuvele-wabeka","text":"Shintsha uphahla owuvele wabeka","level":2},{"id":"ukuphakama-kwe-plate-i-fascia-ne-soffit","text":"Ukuphakama kwe-plate, i-fascia ne-soffit","level":2},{"id":"dweba-indawo-yophahla","text":"Dweba indawo yophahla","level":2},{"id":"engeza-ifasitela-lophahla","text":"Engeza ifasitela lophahla","level":2},{"id":"okulondolozwayo","text":"Okulondolozwayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenziwa\"\u003EOkuzokwenziwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYakha uphahla ngokusuka kodonga abaphansi kwalo. Udonga ngalunye unokusethwa kwalo, ngakho uphahla olulodwa lungaba ne-hip ngaphambili, amagabhula emaphethelweni futhi lume lufinyelele odongeni olude ngemuva. Esivandekeni noma kunoma yiluphi uhlangothi uphahla lokuzenzakalela olungakwazi ukukwenza, dweba indawo yophahla ngamakhona ayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faka-uphahla\"\u003EFaka uphahla\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEsiqeshini esinezindonga zophahla, chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERoof\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThayipha i-\u003Cstrong\u003EPitch\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Ccode\u003E6/12\u003C/code\u003E, noma amadigri afana njengo \u003Ccode\u003E30\u003C/code\u003E) ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EOverhang\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha ilungiselelo: \u003Cstrong\u003EUphahla lwe-hip\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EAmagabhula ezinhlangothini ezimfushane\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EAmagabhula ezinhlangothini ezinde\u003C/strong\u003E, noma \u003Cstrong\u003EIshedi\u003C/strong\u003E (uhlangothi oseduze nesikhombi yiwo ophansi; ezinye izinhlangothi ziyimiphetho yamagabhula).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShiya \u003Cstrong\u003EI-fascia ne-soffit\u003C/strong\u003E ichofoziwe uma ufuna imiphetho ebhokisiwe nebhodi le-fascia, noma yikhiphe uma ufuna umphetho wophahla ongenalutho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ngaphakathi esakhiweni: iphethelo, umgogodla, ama-hip nezigodi zibonakala ku-plan. Chofoza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENoma yisiphi isakhiwo siyasebenza: izimo ze-L, T, U nezimo ezinamaphuzu, amakhona agxumile nezinqena. Ama-hip, imigogodla nezigodi zitholakala lapho izindawo zophahla zihlangana.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"udonga-ngalunye-ngesikhathi\"\u003EUdonga ngalunye ngesikhathi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha uphahla (esiqeshini esingaphezulu kwezindonga, chofoza ngaphakathi komgca walo) bese ubheka ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EEach wall\u003C/strong\u003E ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EProperties\u003C/strong\u003E. Ukuphakamisa umugqa kumaka leso sidonga ku-plan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPitched\u003C/strong\u003E: udonga unendawo yophahla ethambekile phezu kwalo. Thayipha ukuthambeka kwalo, njengo \u003Ccode\u003E12/12\u003C/code\u003E ukuze kube nemiphetho emile kuphahla olungu \u003Ccode\u003E6/12\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGable end\u003C/strong\u003E: uphahla luyeka ngomphetho oqondile phezu kwalo dongo, udonga ugcwaliswa kuze kufike ophahleni, bese uphahla lugoqa ngaphaya kwalo nge-\u003Cstrong\u003EGable overhang\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENone (stops flush)\u003C/strong\u003E: uphahla luyeka odongeni ngaphandle kokuphuphuma nangaphandle komphetho wegabhula, lapho uphahla lumelana nodonga oluphakeme.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUhlu lwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EEnds\u003C/strong\u003E phezulu lusetha zonke izindonga ngesikhathi esisodwa; \u003Cstrong\u003ESet per wall\u003C/strong\u003E iyavela uma izindonga sezingahambisani nelungiselelo elithile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shintsha-uphahla-owuvele-wabeka\"\u003EShintsha uphahla owuvele wabeka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha uphahla bese \u003Cstrong\u003EProperties\u003C/strong\u003E ikhombisa izilungiselelo ezifanayo nalezo ezisethweni lethuluzi lophahla: \u003Cstrong\u003EPitch\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EOverhang\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EGable overhang\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EPlate height\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EFascia height\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EBoxed eaves\u003C/strong\u003E ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EThickness\u003C/strong\u003E. Noma yisiphi isishintsho sibonakala ngokushesha ku-plan nasekubukeni kwe-3D, ngezinhlolo ezifanayo nalezo zethuluzi (ukuthambeka okungu-80 degrees noma ngaphezulu kuyenqatshwa, kanjalo nesilungiselelo esingeke senze uphahla). Thayipha inani bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, noma uphume ebhokisini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUshintsho ngalunye luyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuHlehlisa. Izishintsho eziningi ebhokisini elifanayo ngokulandelana (thayipha \u003Ccode\u003E6/12\u003C/code\u003E, bese \u003Ccode\u003E7/12\u003C/code\u003E, bese \u003Ccode\u003E8/12\u003C/code\u003E) ziyahlanganiswa zibe isinyathelo esisodwa, ngakho i-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Z\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E eyodwa ibuyisela okwakukhona ngaphambi kolandelano; ukushintsha ibhokisi elihlukile kuqala isinyathelo esisha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuphakama-kwe-plate-i-fascia-ne-soffit\"\u003EUkuphakama kwe-plate, i-fascia ne-soffit\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPlate height\u003C/strong\u003E yindawo lapho izindawo zophahla zihlangana ngaphandle kwezindonga, zikalwa kusukela ephansini lesiLinga. Yishiye ingenalutho ukuze uphahla uhlale phezu kwezindonga; thayipha inani elikhulu uma ufuna isithende esiphakanyisiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFascia height\u003C/strong\u003E yibhodi elingaphansi kwemiphetho nasemagabhuleni. Thayipha \u003Ccode\u003E0\u003C/code\u003E uma ingekho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBoxed eaves\u003C/strong\u003E ifaka i-soffit elinganayo ngaphansi komphetho ngamunye, kusuka odongeni kuya emuva le-fascia.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYonke indawo ihlangana nodonga wayo ngokuphakama kwe-plate, ngakho izindonga ezinokuthambeka okuhlukile zigcina umugqa we-plate munye, bese imiphetho yazo iphela ngezinkomba ezahlukile, njengoba kwakhiwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dweba-indawo-yophahla\"\u003EDweba indawo yophahla\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEsiqeshini lapho izindonga zendawo ezihlezi khona, vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuild\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERoof plane\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThayipha i-\u003Cstrong\u003EPitch\u003C/strong\u003E kanye ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EEave height\u003C/strong\u003E uma ingesiyo phezulu kwezindonga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza amakhona. Uhlangothi lokuqala oludwetshwe luyiphethelo; indawo ikhuphuka kulo iye ekwakheni kwalo kwonke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ikhona lokuqala futhi, phinda ukuchofoza kabili, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuqeda. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ulahla amakhona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIndawo yophahla ayilandeli izindonga. Yikhethe esiqeshini esingenhla (chofoza ngaphakathi kwayo) ukuze ushintshe ukuthambeka kwayo, ukuphakama kwephethelo noma ubukhulu, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuyisusa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"engeza-ifasitela-lophahla\"\u003EEngeza ifasitela lophahla\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBonisa isiLinga uphahla olusisekelo sawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuild\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDormer\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEsihlanganweni sezinketho khetha \u003Cstrong\u003EDormer kind\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Cstrong\u003EGable\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003EShed\u003C/strong\u003E) bese usetha \u003Cstrong\u003EWidth\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EFront wall\u003C/strong\u003E (ukuphakama kodonga lwangaphambili kusuka ophahleni olungenhla kuya kumphetho wefasitela), \u003Cstrong\u003EPitch\u003C/strong\u003E ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EOverhang\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ophahleni lapho kuzoba khona phakathi kwangaphambili kwefasitela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-BimCraft yakha odongeni lwangaphambili, izindonga ezimbili zohlangothi nophahla lwefasitela, bese iyilandisa iye emuva kuze ihlangane nophahla. Ifasitela legabhula linezindawo ezimbili ezihlangana emgogodleni. Ifasitela leshedi linendawo eyodwa, okufanele ibe ngaphansi kophahla kakhulu. Uphahla ngaphansi kwefasitela luyasikwa. Ifasitela lilandela uphahla uma izindonga zinyakaziswa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza ukuze ushintshe uhlobo, ububanzi, udonga lwangaphambili, ukuthambeka noma ukuphuphuma ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EProperties\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyasusa futhi ivale uphahla futhi. Kumele ifanele ngasohlangothini olulodwa lophahla, ngaphandle kwama-hip, izigodi nomgogodla, futhi ama-roof akhiwa ngethuluzi le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERoof\u003C/span\u003E kuphela athatha amafasitela, hhayi izindawo zophahla ezidwetshwe ngesandla. Akusakhiwe okwamanje: iwindi ngaphambili kwefasitela namafasitela ezindawo zophahla ezidwetshwe ngesandla.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulondolozwayo\"\u003EOkulondolozwayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUphahla lutholakala njengophahla lwe-IFC lwesilebhu esisodwa ngendawo ngayinye, izindonga zamagabhula, ilunga elilodwa le-fascia nesembozo esisodwa se-soffit. Uphahla luphethe ubude bomgogodla, ama-hip, izigodi, iziphethelo nama-rake, nezindawo zalo, ukuze kubalwe amanani. Indawo yophahla iwuphahla we-IFC olunesilebhu esisodwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHlehlisa ibuyisela noma yiliphi ushintsho lophahla ngesinyathelo esisodwa, kuhlanganise nelungiselelo elishintsha wonke amadonga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenziwa Yakha uphahla ngokusuka kodonga abaphansi kwalo. Udonga ngalunye unokusethwa kwalo, ngakho uphahla olulodwa lungaba ne-hip ngaphambili, amagabhula emaphethelweni futhi lume lufinyelele odongeni olude ngemuva. Esivandekeni noma kunoma yiluphi uhlangothi uphahla lokuzenzakalela olungakwazi ukukwenza, dweba indawo yophahla ngamakhona ayo. Faka uphahla Esiqeshini esinezindonga zophahla, chofoza Roof. Thayipha i-Pitch (6/12, noma amadigri afana njengo 30) ne-Overhang. Khetha ilungiselelo: Uphahla lwe-hip, Amagabhula ezinhlangothini ezimfushane, Amagabhula ezinhlangothini ezinde, noma Ishedi (uhlangothi oseduze nesikhombi yiwo ophansi; ezinye izinhlangothi ziyimiphetho yamagabhula). Shiya I-fascia ne-soffit ichofoziwe uma ufuna imiphetho ebhokisiwe nebhodi le-fascia, noma yikhiphe uma ufuna umphetho wophahla ongenalutho. Chofoza ngaphakathi esakhiweni: iphethelo, umgogodla, ama-hip nezigodi zibonakala ku-plan. Chofoza. Noma yisiphi isakhiwo siyasebenza: izimo ze-L, T, U nezimo ezinamaphuzu, amakhona agxumile nezinqena. Ama-hip, imigogodla nezigodi zitholakala lapho izindawo zophahla zihlangana. Udonga ngalunye ngesikhathi Khetha uphahla (esiqeshini esingaphezulu kwezindonga, chofoza ngaphakathi komgca walo) bese ubheka ngaphansi kwe-Each wall ku-Properties. Ukuphakamisa umugqa kumaka leso sidonga ku-plan. Pitched: udonga unendawo yophahla ethambekile phezu kwalo. Thayipha ukuthambeka kwalo, njengo 12/12 ukuze kube nemiphetho emile kuphahla olungu 6/12. Gable end: uphahla luyeka ngomphetho oqondile phezu kwalo dongo, udonga ugcwaliswa kuze kufike ophahleni, bese uphahla lugoqa ngaphaya kwalo nge-Gable overhang. None (stops flush): uphahla luyeka odongeni ngaphandle kokuphuphuma nangaphandle komphetho wegabhula, lapho uphahla lumelana nodonga oluphakeme. Uhlu lwe-Ends phezulu lusetha zonke izindonga ngesikhathi esisodwa; Set per wall iyavela uma izindonga sezingahambisani nelungiselelo elithile. Shintsha uphahla owuvele wabeka Khetha uphahla bese Properties ikhombisa izilungiselelo ezifanayo nalezo ezisethweni lethuluzi lophahla: Pitch, Overhang, Gable overhang, Plate height, Fascia height, Boxed eaves ne-Thickness. Noma yisiphi isishintsho sibonakala ngokushesha ku-plan nasekubukeni kwe-3D, ngezinhlolo ezifanayo nalezo zethuluzi (ukuthambeka okungu-80 degrees noma ngaphezulu kuyenqatshwa, kanjalo nesilungiselelo esingeke senze uphahla). Thayipha inani bese ucindezela Enter, noma uphume ebhokisini. Ushintsho ngalunye luyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuHlehlisa. Izishintsho eziningi ebhokisini elifanayo ngokulandelana (thayipha 6/12, bese 7/12, bese 8/12) ziyahlanganiswa zibe isinyathelo esisodwa, ngakho i-Ctrl+Z eyodwa ibuyisela okwakukhona ngaphambi kolandelano; ukushintsha ibhokisi elihlukile kuqala isinyathelo esisha. Ukuphakama kwe-plate, i-fascia ne-soffit Plate height yindawo lapho izindawo zophahla zihlangana ngaphandle kwezindonga, zikalwa kusukela ephansini lesiLinga. Yishiye ingenalutho ukuze uphahla uhlale phezu kwezindonga; thayipha inani elikhulu uma ufuna isithende esiphakanyisiwe. Fascia height yibhodi elingaphansi kwemiphetho nasemagabhuleni. Thayipha 0 uma ingekho. Boxed eaves ifaka i-soffit elinganayo ngaphansi komphetho ngamunye, kusuka odongeni kuya emuva le-fascia. Yonke indawo ihlangana nodonga wayo ngokuphakama kwe-plate, ngakho izindonga ezinokuthambeka okuhlukile zigcina umugqa we-plate munye, bese imiphetho yazo iphela ngezinkomba ezahlukile, njengoba kwakhiwa. Dweba indawo yophahla Esiqeshini lapho izindonga zendawo ezihlezi khona, vula Build bese ukhetha Roof plane. Thayipha i-Pitch kanye ne-Eave height uma ingesiyo phezulu kwezindonga. Chofoza amakhona. Uhlangothi lokuqala oludwetshwe luyiphethelo; indawo ikhuphuka kulo iye ekwakheni kwalo kwonke. Chofoza ikhona lokuqala futhi, phinda ukuchofoza kabili, noma cindezela Enter ukuqeda. Esc ulahla amakhona. Indawo yophahla ayilandeli izindonga. Yikhethe esiqeshini esingenhla (chofoza ngaphakathi kwayo) ukuze ushintshe ukuthambeka kwayo, ukuphakama kwephethelo noma ubukhulu, noma cindezela Delete ukuyisusa. Engeza ifasitela lophahla Bonisa isiLinga uphahla olusisekelo sawo. Vula Build bese ukhetha Dormer. Esihlanganweni sezinketho khetha Dormer kind (Gable noma Shed) bese usetha Width, Front wall (ukuphakama kodonga lwangaphambili kusuka ophahleni olungenhla kuya kumphetho wefasitela), Pitch ne-Overhang. Chofoza ophahleni lapho kuzoba khona phakathi kwangaphambili kwefasitela. I-BimCraft yakha odongeni lwangaphambili, izindonga ezimbili zohlangothi nophahla lwefasitela, bese iyilandisa iye emuva kuze ihlangane nophahla. Ifasitela legabhula linezindawo ezimbili ezihlangana emgogodleni. Ifasitela leshedi linendawo eyodwa, okufanele ibe ngaphansi kophahla kakhulu. Uphahla ngaphansi kwefasitela luyasikwa. Ifasitela lilandela uphahla uma izindonga zinyakaziswa. Chofoza ukuze ushintshe uhlobo, ububanzi, udonga lwangaphambili, ukuthambeka noma ukuphuphuma ku-Properties. Delete iyasusa futhi ivale uphahla futhi. Kumele ifanele ngasohlangothini olulodwa lophahla, ngaphandle kwama-hip, izigodi nomgogodla, futhi ama-roof akhiwa ngethuluzi le-Roof kuphela athatha amafasitela, hhayi izindawo zophahla ezidwetshwe ngesandla. Akusakhiwe okwamanje: iwindi ngaphambili kwefasitela namafasitela ezindawo zophahla ezidwetshwe ngesandla. Okulondolozwayo Uphahla lutholakala njengophahla lwe-IFC lwesilebhu esisodwa ngendawo ngayinye, izindonga zamagabhula, ilunga elilodwa le-fascia nesembozo esisodwa se-soffit. Uphahla luphethe ubude bomgogodla, ama-hip, izigodi, iziphethelo nama-rake, nezindawo zalo, ukuze kubalwe amanani. Indawo yophahla iwuphahla we-IFC olunesilebhu esisodwa. Hlehlisa ibuyisela noma yiliphi ushintsho lophahla ngesinyathelo esisodwa, kuhlanganise nelungiselelo elishintsha wonke amadonga.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"schedule-layouts","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Hlela, londoloza futhi uthumele uhlu","summary":"Hlanganisa uhlu, unikeze izinkomba zamasamba nezamba eliphelele, engeza ikholomu efundwa kusuka empahleni, uyilondoloze njengesethi ngaphakathi kwefayela, bese uyithumela njengefayela le-spreadsheet (.xlsx), njengombhalo wokunamathisela kushidi le-inthanethi, noma njenge-CSV. Umgomo wehhovisi uyagcwalisa lokho uhlu olungakushongo.","section":"tasks","order":21,"keywords":["ukuhlela uhlu","hlanganisa ngo","isamba esiphansi","isamba","izihloko","umgomo wehhovisi","izinqubomgomo ezizenzakalelayo","isethi yokusetha","uhlu lwemnyango ngesitezi","ukumelana nomlilo","izinsimbi zemnyango","ikholomu","ibha yezinhlobo","ukuhlanganisa","xlsx","incwadi yomsebenzi","ishidi le-inthanethi","namathisela","csv","thumela","izinto","khetha kusuka kuhlu","inani"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenziwa","text":"Okuzokwenziwa","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"chofoza-inani-ukukhetha-lapho-livela-khona","text":"Chofoza inani ukukhetha lapho livela khona","level":2},{"id":"ukuthumela","text":"Ukuthumela","level":2},{"id":"umgomo-wehhovisi","text":"Umgomo wehhovisi","level":2},{"id":"okuhle-ukwazi","text":"Okuhle ukwazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenziwa\"\u003EOkuzokwenziwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuqula uhlu olujwayelekile libe lolo ihhovisi lakho elilukhipha: luhlanganiswe ngezitezi, ngohlobo noma ngamagumbi, nezinkomba zamasamba, nezikholomu ozidingayo, ngegama lalo. Bese uyithumela esheethini lesipredishithi. Yonke imigqa nawo wonke amanani asalazi izinto azivela kuzo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw\u003C/span\u003E bese uvula \u003Cstrong\u003ESchedules\u003C/strong\u003E esiqeshini sakwesobunxele. Khetha uhlu, njengo \u003Cstrong\u003EDoors\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPhezu kwethebula, khetha \u003Cstrong\u003EGroup by\u003C/strong\u003E (ikholomu yohlu, njengo-Level noma Type, noma \u003Cstrong\u003ENo grouping\u003C/strong\u003E) ne-\u003Cstrong\u003ETotals\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Cstrong\u003ENo totals\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EOne total\u003C/strong\u003E, noma \u003Cstrong\u003ESubtotals and a total\u003C/strong\u003E). \u003Cstrong\u003EAs set\u003C/strong\u003E ishiya ukukhetha esethini elilondoloziwe noma komgomo wehhovisi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuze wengeze ikholomu efundwa ezintweni, thayipha igama lempahla noma legama lethegi ngaphansi kwethebula (njengo \u003Ccode\u003EFireRating\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EPset_DoorCommon.FireRating\u003C/code\u003E noma igama lethegi njengo \u003Ccode\u003EIronmongery\u003C/code\u003E) bese uchofoza \u003Cstrong\u003EAdd column\u003C/strong\u003E. I-BimCraft ifunda amasethi wezakhiwo wento kuqala, bese wohlobo lwayo. Uma kungekho nanye inani okwamanje iyakutshela; ikholomu igcwala yodwa inani lisethiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThayipha igama (njengo &quot;Uhlu lwemnyango ngesitezi&quot;) bese uchofoza \u003Cstrong\u003ESave as a set-up\u003C/strong\u003E. Isethi igcinwa efayeleni lesakhiwo ijoyine uhlu lwe-Schedules ngegama layo. Ilandela wonke ushintsho emodelini. \u003Cstrong\u003ERemove this set-up\u003C/strong\u003E iyisusa. Kokubili kuyisinyathelo esisodwa ku-Undo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"chofoza-inani-ukukhetha-lapho-livela-khona\"\u003EChofoza inani ukukhetha lapho livela khona\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza noma yimuphi umugqa, noma noma yiliphi inani elilodwa, ukuze ukhethe izinto ezingemuva kwawo ephlaneni nasekubukeni kwe-3D:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eumugqa ukhetha izinto zalowo mugqa;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eisamba esiphansi noma isamba esiphelele sikhetha konke okufakayo, nekhanda leqembu likhetha iqembu lalo;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Einani elinezinto zalo lizikhetha lezo: i-\u003Cstrong\u003EDeductions\u003C/strong\u003E yohlobo lodonga ikhetha iminyango nemawindi alo, indawo yodonga yegumbi ikhetha izindonga zalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkufanayo kusebenza kudokhumenti eyenziwe kusuka emodelini: ku-preview, chofoza inani lohlu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuthumela\"\u003EUkuthumela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDownload Excel\u003C/strong\u003E ilondoloza ifayela le-.xlsx. Ubude, izindawo, amavolumu nezinani ziyizinombolo zangempela ngeyunithi ikholomu eyibonisayo (amafidi namainchi asala engumbhalo). Ishidi lesibili, \u003Cstrong\u003EElements\u003C/strong\u003E, lihlu ngomugqa ngamunye oGlobalIds wezinto ezingemuva kwawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECopy for Google Sheets\u003C/strong\u003E ibeka uhlu ku-clipboard njengombhalo ohlukaniswe ngamathebhu. Ku-Google Sheet, chofoza iseli A1 bese unamathisela. \u003Cstrong\u003EOpen a new Google Sheet\u003C/strong\u003E ivula \u003Ccode\u003Esheets.new\u003C/code\u003E, ikheli likaGoogle lesheet elingenalutho, kuakhawunti yakho yeGoogle. I-BimCraft ayingeni ngemvume kuGoogle futhi ayithumeli lutho lapho: ukunamathisela kungokwakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDownload CSV\u003C/strong\u003E ilondoloza ithebula njengoba lihlelwe esikrinini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"umgomo-wehhovisi\"\u003EUmgomo wehhovisi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIhhovisi lingasho kanye ukuthi amahlu alo ahlelwa kanjani: vula i-add-on ye-\u003Cstrong\u003EDefault Policies\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/default-policies\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/default-policies\"\u003EDefault Policies\u003C/a\u003E) bese usetha, ku-\u003Cstrong\u003ESettings › Global › Default Policies › Schedule layout (the office standard)\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInqubomgomo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYenzani\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGroup schedules by\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELevel, Type, Room noma ukungahlanganisi, kuwo wonke amahlu anale kholomu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETotals in schedules\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkukho samba, isamba esisodwa ekugcineni, noma isamba esiphansi ngaphansi kwelinye iqembu nesamba esiphelele\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESchedule title\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIphethini, njengo \u003Ccode\u003E{project}: {schedule}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EColumn headings\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENjengoba kubhalwe, NGEZINHLAMVU EZINKULU noma Ngezinhlamvu Ezinkulu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmgomo usebenza kuwo wonke amahlu, noma ngubani owasethile: amahlu avamile aphaneli, isethi elondoloziwe, uhlu umsizi olusethayo, izimpendulo nezidwebo kudokhumenti. Isethi esho ukuhlanganisa, izamba noma isihloko sayo siyagcina lokho; umgomo ugcwalisa okusele. Iphaneli ikhombisa yiziphi izingxenye umgomo wehhovisi uzisethile. Izinqubomgomo zihamba nefayela le-Default Policies kanye nezinye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuhle-ukwazi\"\u003EOkuhle ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsethi ibiza umthombo wayo wohlu namakholomu ayo; ayibambi zinombolo. Izinombolo zifundwa emodelini njalo lapho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUhlu olungayona imigqa yezinto (izakhiwo zezindonga nencwadi yezinto) alunalo ilayawuti noma ukuthumela lapha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmsizi ungakwenzela yonke lena: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/assistants\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/assistants\"\u003EVumela umsizi we-AI asebenze nemodeli yakho\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenziwa Guqula uhlu olujwayelekile libe lolo ihhovisi lakho elilukhipha: luhlanganiswe ngezitezi, ngohlobo noma ngamagumbi, nezinkomba zamasamba, nezikholomu ozidingayo, ngegama lalo. Bese uyithumela esheethini lesipredishithi. Yonke imigqa nawo wonke amanani asalazi izinto azivela kuzo. Izinyathelo Vula Draw bese uvula Schedules esiqeshini sakwesobunxele. Khetha uhlu, njengo Doors. Phezu kwethebula, khetha Group by (ikholomu yohlu, njengo-Level noma Type, noma No grouping) ne-Totals (No totals, One total, noma Subtotals and a total). As set ishiya ukukhetha esethini elilondoloziwe noma komgomo wehhovisi. Ukuze wengeze ikholomu efundwa ezintweni, thayipha igama lempahla noma legama lethegi ngaphansi kwethebula (njengo FireRating, Pset_DoorCommon.FireRating noma igama lethegi njengo Ironmongery) bese uchofoza Add column. I-BimCraft ifunda amasethi wezakhiwo wento kuqala, bese wohlobo lwayo. Uma kungekho nanye inani okwamanje iyakutshela; ikholomu igcwala yodwa inani lisethiwe. Thayipha igama (njengo \"Uhlu lwemnyango ngesitezi\") bese uchofoza Save as a set-up. Isethi igcinwa efayeleni lesakhiwo ijoyine uhlu lwe-Schedules ngegama layo. Ilandela wonke ushintsho emodelini. Remove this set-up iyisusa. Kokubili kuyisinyathelo esisodwa ku-Undo. Chofoza inani ukukhetha lapho livela khona Chofoza noma yimuphi umugqa, noma noma yiliphi inani elilodwa, ukuze ukhethe izinto ezingemuva kwawo ephlaneni nasekubukeni kwe-3D: umugqa ukhetha izinto zalowo mugqa; isamba esiphansi noma isamba esiphelele sikhetha konke okufakayo, nekhanda leqembu likhetha iqembu lalo; inani elinezinto zalo lizikhetha lezo: i-Deductions yohlobo lodonga ikhetha iminyango nemawindi alo, indawo yodonga yegumbi ikhetha izindonga zalo. Okufanayo kusebenza kudokhumenti eyenziwe kusuka emodelini: ku-preview, chofoza inani lohlu. Ukuthumela Download Excel ilondoloza ifayela le-.xlsx. Ubude, izindawo, amavolumu nezinani ziyizinombolo zangempela ngeyunithi ikholomu eyibonisayo (amafidi namainchi asala engumbhalo). Ishidi lesibili, Elements, lihlu ngomugqa ngamunye oGlobalIds wezinto ezingemuva kwawo. Copy for Google Sheets ibeka uhlu ku-clipboard njengombhalo ohlukaniswe ngamathebhu. Ku-Google Sheet, chofoza iseli A1 bese unamathisela. Open a new Google Sheet ivula sheets.new, ikheli likaGoogle lesheet elingenalutho, kuakhawunti yakho yeGoogle. I-BimCraft ayingeni ngemvume kuGoogle futhi ayithumeli lutho lapho: ukunamathisela kungokwakho. Download CSV ilondoloza ithebula njengoba lihlelwe esikrinini. Umgomo wehhovisi Ihhovisi lingasho kanye ukuthi amahlu alo ahlelwa kanjani: vula i-add-on ye-Default Policies (Default Policies) bese usetha, ku-Settings › Global › Default Policies › Schedule layout (the office standard): Inqubomgomo Yenzani Group schedules by Level, Type, Room noma ukungahlanganisi, kuwo wonke amahlu anale kholomu Totals in schedules Akukho samba, isamba esisodwa ekugcineni, noma isamba esiphansi ngaphansi kwelinye iqembu nesamba esiphelele Schedule title Iphethini, njengo {project}: {schedule} Column headings Njengoba kubhalwe, NGEZINHLAMVU EZINKULU noma Ngezinhlamvu Ezinkulu Umgomo usebenza kuwo wonke amahlu, noma ngubani owasethile: amahlu avamile aphaneli, isethi elondoloziwe, uhlu umsizi olusethayo, izimpendulo nezidwebo kudokhumenti. Isethi esho ukuhlanganisa, izamba noma isihloko sayo siyagcina lokho; umgomo ugcwalisa okusele. Iphaneli ikhombisa yiziphi izingxenye umgomo wehhovisi uzisethile. Izinqubomgomo zihamba nefayela le-Default Policies kanye nezinye. Okuhle ukwazi Isethi ibiza umthombo wayo wohlu namakholomu ayo; ayibambi zinombolo. Izinombolo zifundwa emodelini njalo lapho. Uhlu olungayona imigqa yezinto (izakhiwo zezindonga nencwadi yezinto) alunalo ilayawuti noma ukuthumela lapha. Umsizi ungakwenzela yonke lena: bheka Vumela umsizi we-AI asebenze nemodeli yakho.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"site-building-and-levels","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Indawo yokwakha, isakhiwo kuyo namazinga","summary":"Dweba umumo wendawo yokwakha, mise futhi uphendule isakhiwo endaweni, engeza amazinga ngobude obunikeziwe noma wehlukanise ubude besakhiwo, futhi udwebe esitezini oyikhethile.","section":"tasks","order":21,"keywords":["indawo yokwakha","ipulani yendawo","umugqa wesakhiwo","ukuhlehla","ilungelo lokusebenzisa","ilungelo lendlela","umkhawulo wepropathi","ipulazi","isiza","umkhawulo","ukumiswa kwesakhiwo","phendula isakhiwo","misa isakhiwo","amazinga","izitezi","amaphansi","engeza amazinga","ukuhlukanisa ubude","ubude phakathi kwamazinga","IfcSite","IfcBuilding","IfcBuildingStorey","isakhiwo sendawo"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"dweba-indawo-yokwakha","text":"Dweba indawo yokwakha","level":2},{"id":"beka-isakhiwo-endaweni-yokwakha","text":"Beka isakhiwo endaweni yokwakha","level":2},{"id":"imigqa-yesakhiwo-namalungelo","text":"Imigqa yesakhiwo namalungelo","level":2},{"id":"engeza-amazinga","text":"Engeza amazinga","level":2},{"id":"dweba-esitezini","text":"Dweba esitezini","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukubone","text":"Okufanele ukubone","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESetha izingxenye zemodeli ye-IFC ezibamba konke okunye: indawo yokwakha, isakhiwo esisendaweni nezinga lesakhiwo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImodeli ihlelwa njengendawo yokwakha ebamba \u003Cstrong\u003Eisakhiwo\u003C/strong\u003E, esibamba \u003Cstrong\u003Eamazinga\u003C/strong\u003E (izitezi) aso; izindonga, amaphansi nakho konke okunye kungokwezinga. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfayela\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsakhiwo esisha\u003C/span\u003E zisetha zonke ezintathu. Imodeli evela kolunye uhlelo enesakhiwo kodwa ingenayo indawo yokwakha ithola indawo yokwakha uma udweba okokuqala: isakhiwo sibekwa kuyo lapho sasikhona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dweba-indawo-yokwakha\"\u003EDweba indawo yokwakha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDweba\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkwakhiwa\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo yokwakha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza amakhona endawo yokwakha (ithuluzi libamba njengethuluzi lodonga). Chofoza futhi ikhona lokuqala, chofoza kabili noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze uqede. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ithatha ikhona elilodwa emuva.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmugqa ubonisa indawo yokwakha ubonisa indawo. Dweba futhi ukuze ushintshe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIpulani yalo lonke izinga ibonisa umumo wendawo yokwakha njengomugqa wepropathi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beka-isakhiwo-endaweni-yokwakha\"\u003EBeka isakhiwo endaweni yokwakha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELapho \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo yokwakha\u003C/span\u003E isebenza, thayipha \u003Cstrong\u003EX\u003C/strong\u003E ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EY\u003C/strong\u003E besakhiwo endaweni yokwakha kanye ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuphenduka\u003C/strong\u003E ngamadigri, noma chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMisa isakhiwo ngokuchofoza\u003C/span\u003E bese uchofoza lapho iphoyinti lesakhiwo likhona. Konke esakhiweni (amazinga, izindonga, amagridi, konke okudwetshwe) kuyahamba nakho; indawo yokwakha nomumo wayo kuhlala. Amapulani agcina ukubonisa ngizinga ngalinye ngokuqondile kusakhiwo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imigqa-yesakhiwo-namalungelo\"\u003EImigqa yesakhiwo namalungelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImigqa yesakhiwo namalungelo (amalungelo okusebenzisa, amalungelo endlela) idwetshwa endaweni yokwakha njengemikhawulo. \u003Cstrong\u003EZiyaxwayisa, azivimbi\u003C/strong\u003E: udonga olungaphezu kwayo udwetshwa njengoba ucelile, futhi isexwayiso esibiza udonga nomugqa noma ilungelo sivela ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinkinga\u003C/span\u003E. Hambisa udonga emuva isexwayiso siyasuswa. Isexwayiso singamukelwa ngesizathu (ukuhlehliswa okunikezwe umphathi, ngokwesibonelo).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmugqa wesakhiwo ovela ekuhlehleni.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDweba\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmugqa wesakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuhlehla\u003C/span\u003E: thayipha ukuthi umugqa umi kangakanani ngaphakathi kumkhawulo ngamunye wendawo yokwakha. Imikhawulo ibhalwa epulanini lapho ithuluzi lisebenza. Umugqa wakhiwa ngalezo zinombolo futhi uyalandela umumo wendawo yokwakha uma udwetshwa kabusha nemikhawulo efanayo. Lezo zinombolo zakho: uzithola esitifiketini sakho somhlaba noma ohlelweni lokuhlukaniswa kwezindawo; i-BimCraft ayifaki noma yiluphi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmugqa wesakhiwo odwetshiwe.\u003C/strong\u003E Nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmugqa wesakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E ivuliwe, chofoza amaphoyinti walo bese uqeda ngokuchofoza kabili noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Qeda ephoyintini lokuqala ukuze wenze umugqa ovaliwe: indawo ngaphakathi kuyindawo yokwakha, nodonga olunengxenye ephandle kwayo luyaxwayiswa. Umugqa ovulekile uxwayisa kuphela udonga olunqamula kuwo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIlungelo.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDweba\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIlungelo lokusebenzisa\u003C/span\u003E: khetha uhlobo lwalo, thayipha igama lalo, inkomba yalo ebhalisiwe nobubanzi balo, bese uchofoza umugqa wayo ophakathi bese uqeda (umsele), noma uvale ephoyintini lokuqala (indawo). Udonga olunengxenye yalo kulo luyaxwayiswa, kuzo zonke izinga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUbuso obuqondile ngqo phezu komugqa buyathinta, abuqambi (ukubekezelela ngu-1 mm).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInketho yomumo yamanje ngayinye yesethi yezinketho ihlolwa njengodonga: umumo ongaphandle komkhawulo, ngaphezu komugqa wesakhiwo noma ekulungelweni uyaxwayiswa. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/massing-options\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/massing-options\"\u003EIzinketho zomumo ezihlala ngokuhlangana\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha okukodwa nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha\u003C/span\u003E ukuze ushintshe igama, inkomba, uhlobo noma ububanzi balo, uyihambise, noma uyisuse.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELokhu kudwetshwa epulanini lalo lonke izinga, emashidini nasepulanini le-PDF: imigqa yesakhiwo idashiwe, amalungelo ahlanganiswe, ngayinye inelebula layo. Efayeleni le-IFC ngayinye iyisichazi (IfcAnnotation, uhlobo BuildingLine noma Servitude) endaweni yokwakha, nomugqa wayo njengegobo elilula ezinye izinhlelo ezingalifunda. Ukuhlola kusebenzisa umumo wangempela wodonga ngalunye epulanini, nezixhumanisi zalo njengoba zidwetshwe; udonga olugobile luhlolwa ngobukhulu balo ngokuzungeza umugqa wayo ophakathi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"engeza-amazinga\"\u003EEngeza amazinga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEpaneli ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmazinga\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza izinga phezulu\u003C/span\u003E yengeza elilodwa, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza izinga ngaphansi\u003C/span\u003E yengeza elilodwa ngaphansi kwelisezansi kakhulu (isisekelo, ngobude obungemuva). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza amazinga…\u003C/span\u003E yengeza amaningi ngesikhathi esisodwa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENgalezi zibonelo:\u003C/strong\u003E thayipha ubude ngaphezu kwezinga eliphansi kakhulu, zihlukaniswe ngamakhoma (isibonelo \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;, 24&#039;, 36&#039;\u003C/code\u003E). Ubude elukhona ngamazinga buyadlulwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHlukanisa ubude besakhiwo:\u003C/strong\u003E thayipha ubude besakhiwo nenani lamazinga. Amazinga osewanawo ahamba aye ezingeni labo elisha kusukela phansi kuya phezulu, amazinga angekho ayengezwa, nalawo asezingeni eliphezulu kwawo ahlala lapho ayekhona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzindonga eziya ezingeni eliphezulu zilandela lona, kanjalo nezinsika namarampu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKopisha leli zinga…\u003C/span\u003E (epaneli efanayo) ikopisha lokho okudwetshwe esitezini osibukayo esitezini esinye noma esitezini esisha phezulu, ngakho ipulani lesitezi lingakhuphukela esakhiweni ngesinyathelo esisodwa. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/draw-walls\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/draw-walls\"\u003EDweba izindonga\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dweba-esitezini\"\u003EDweba esitezini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYonke ithuluzi le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDweba\u003C/span\u003E lisebenza esitezini esikhethwe ohlwini lwamazinga epulanini (noma likhethwe epaneli \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmazinga\u003C/span\u003E): lokho ozakudweba kuyoba salowo sitezi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukubone\"\u003EOkufanele ukubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYonke lezi zinguquko ingesinyathelo esisodwa: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyayibuyisela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEfayeleni le-IFC: indawo yokwakha (IfcSite) nomumo wayo nendawo yayo, isakhiwo (IfcBuilding) esibekwe kuyo, namazinga (IfcBuildingStorey) esakhiweni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBheka futhi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/coordinates\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/coordinates\"\u003EIzixhumanisi ku-BimCraft\u003C/a\u003E ngomsuka wephrojekthi nephoyinti lokuhlola.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Setha izingxenye zemodeli ye-IFC ezibamba konke okunye: indawo yokwakha, isakhiwo esisendaweni nezinga lesakhiwo. Imodeli ihlelwa njengendawo yokwakha ebamba isakhiwo, esibamba amazinga (izitezi) aso; izindonga, amaphansi nakho konke okunye kungokwezinga. Ifayela › Isakhiwo esisha zisetha zonke ezintathu. Imodeli evela kolunye uhlelo enesakhiwo kodwa ingenayo indawo yokwakha ithola indawo yokwakha uma udweba okokuqala: isakhiwo sibekwa kuyo lapho sasikhona. Dweba indawo yokwakha Vula Dweba bese ukhetha Ukwakhiwa › Indawo yokwakha. Chofoza amakhona endawo yokwakha (ithuluzi libamba njengethuluzi lodonga). Chofoza futhi ikhona lokuqala, chofoza kabili noma cindezela Enter ukuze uqede. Backspace ithatha ikhona elilodwa emuva. Umugqa ubonisa indawo yokwakha ubonisa indawo. Dweba futhi ukuze ushintshe. Ipulani yalo lonke izinga ibonisa umumo wendawo yokwakha njengomugqa wepropathi. Beka isakhiwo endaweni yokwakha Lapho Indawo yokwakha isebenza, thayipha X ne-Y besakhiwo endaweni yokwakha kanye ne-Ukuphenduka ngamadigri, noma chofoza Misa isakhiwo ngokuchofoza bese uchofoza lapho iphoyinti lesakhiwo likhona. Konke esakhiweni (amazinga, izindonga, amagridi, konke okudwetshwe) kuyahamba nakho; indawo yokwakha nomumo wayo kuhlala. Amapulani agcina ukubonisa ngizinga ngalinye ngokuqondile kusakhiwo. Imigqa yesakhiwo namalungelo Imigqa yesakhiwo namalungelo (amalungelo okusebenzisa, amalungelo endlela) idwetshwa endaweni yokwakha njengemikhawulo. Ziyaxwayisa, azivimbi: udonga olungaphezu kwayo udwetshwa njengoba ucelile, futhi isexwayiso esibiza udonga nomugqa noma ilungelo sivela ku-Izinkinga. Hambisa udonga emuva isexwayiso siyasuswa. Isexwayiso singamukelwa ngesizathu (ukuhlehliswa okunikezwe umphathi, ngokwesibonelo). Umugqa wesakhiwo ovela ekuhlehleni. Dweba › Umugqa wesakhiwo, bese Ukuhlehla: thayipha ukuthi umugqa umi kangakanani ngaphakathi kumkhawulo ngamunye wendawo yokwakha. Imikhawulo ibhalwa epulanini lapho ithuluzi lisebenza. Umugqa wakhiwa ngalezo zinombolo futhi uyalandela umumo wendawo yokwakha uma udwetshwa kabusha nemikhawulo efanayo. Lezo zinombolo zakho: uzithola esitifiketini sakho somhlaba noma ohlelweni lokuhlukaniswa kwezindawo; i-BimCraft ayifaki noma yiluphi. Umugqa wesakhiwo odwetshiwe. Nge-Umugqa wesakhiwo ivuliwe, chofoza amaphoyinti walo bese uqeda ngokuchofoza kabili noma Enter. Qeda ephoyintini lokuqala ukuze wenze umugqa ovaliwe: indawo ngaphakathi kuyindawo yokwakha, nodonga olunengxenye ephandle kwayo luyaxwayiswa. Umugqa ovulekile uxwayisa kuphela udonga olunqamula kuwo. Ilungelo. Dweba › Ilungelo lokusebenzisa: khetha uhlobo lwalo, thayipha igama lalo, inkomba yalo ebhalisiwe nobubanzi balo, bese uchofoza umugqa wayo ophakathi bese uqeda (umsele), noma uvale ephoyintini lokuqala (indawo). Udonga olunengxenye yalo kulo luyaxwayiswa, kuzo zonke izinga. Ubuso obuqondile ngqo phezu komugqa buyathinta, abuqambi (ukubekezelela ngu-1 mm). Inketho yomumo yamanje ngayinye yesethi yezinketho ihlolwa njengodonga: umumo ongaphandle komkhawulo, ngaphezu komugqa wesakhiwo noma ekulungelweni uyaxwayiswa. Bona Izinketho zomumo ezihlala ngokuhlangana. Khetha okukodwa nge-Khetha ukuze ushintshe igama, inkomba, uhlobo noma ububanzi balo, uyihambise, noma uyisuse. Lokhu kudwetshwa epulanini lalo lonke izinga, emashidini nasepulanini le-PDF: imigqa yesakhiwo idashiwe, amalungelo ahlanganiswe, ngayinye inelebula layo. Efayeleni le-IFC ngayinye iyisichazi (IfcAnnotation, uhlobo BuildingLine noma Servitude) endaweni yokwakha, nomugqa wayo njengegobo elilula ezinye izinhlelo ezingalifunda. Ukuhlola kusebenzisa umumo wangempela wodonga ngalunye epulanini, nezixhumanisi zalo njengoba zidwetshwe; udonga olugobile luhlolwa ngobukhulu balo ngokuzungeza umugqa wayo ophakathi. Engeza amazinga Epaneli ethi Amazinga, Engeza izinga phezulu yengeza elilodwa, Engeza izinga ngaphansi yengeza elilodwa ngaphansi kwelisezansi kakhulu (isisekelo, ngobude obungemuva). Engeza amazinga… yengeza amaningi ngesikhathi esisodwa: Ngalezi zibonelo: thayipha ubude ngaphezu kwezinga eliphansi kakhulu, zihlukaniswe ngamakhoma (isibonelo 12', 24', 36'). Ubude elukhona ngamazinga buyadlulwa. Hlukanisa ubude besakhiwo: thayipha ubude besakhiwo nenani lamazinga. Amazinga osewanawo ahamba aye ezingeni labo elisha kusukela phansi kuya phezulu, amazinga angekho ayengezwa, nalawo asezingeni eliphezulu kwawo ahlala lapho ayekhona. Izindonga eziya ezingeni eliphezulu zilandela lona, kanjalo nezinsika namarampu. Kopisha leli zinga… (epaneli efanayo) ikopisha lokho okudwetshwe esitezini osibukayo esitezini esinye noma esitezini esisha phezulu, ngakho ipulani lesitezi lingakhuphukela esakhiweni ngesinyathelo esisodwa. Bona Dweba izindonga. Dweba esitezini Yonke ithuluzi le-Dweba lisebenza esitezini esikhethwe ohlwini lwamazinga epulanini (noma likhethwe epaneli Amazinga): lokho ozakudweba kuyoba salowo sitezi. Okufanele ukubone Yonke lezi zinguquko ingesinyathelo esisodwa: Ctrl+Z iyayibuyisela. Efayeleni le-IFC: indawo yokwakha (IfcSite) nomumo wayo nendawo yayo, isakhiwo (IfcBuilding) esibekwe kuyo, namazinga (IfcBuildingStorey) esakhiweni. Bheka futhi Izixhumanisi ku-BimCraft ngomsuka wephrojekthi nephoyinti lokuhlola.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"foundations","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Izisekelo ngaphansi kwezindonga","summary":"Faka ipulati ezansi emhlabeni, izindonga zesisekelo nepulati, i-crawlspace noma ibhasimende ngaphansi kwesakhiwo ngokuchofoza kanye; izisekelo zibalwa ngezindonga nenani lezitezi, nesisekelo siyenziwa kabusha uma izindonga zinyakaza.","section":"tasks","order":21,"keywords":["isisekelo","ukuphakamisa","ipulati ezansi emhlabeni","ukugoba ukwelashwa","ipulati eliphelele","udonga lwesisekelo","crawlspace","ibhasimende","udonga lwebhasimende","ukuqandisa","ikhonkolo","ububanzi besisekelo"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"faka-isisekelo","text":"Faka isisekelo","level":2},{"id":"shintsha","text":"Shintsha","level":2},{"id":"okugciniwe","text":"Okugciniwe","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukwazi","text":"Okufanele ukwazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENika isakhiwo isisekelo esihambisana nezindonga zaso. BimCraft ilandela ngaphandle kwezindonga, ilinganisa izisekelo ngohlobo lodonga nokuthi izitezi zingaki ezimi phezu kwazo, futhi yenza isisekelo kabusha uma izindonga zishintsha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faka-isisekelo\"\u003EFaka isisekelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEsitezini lezindonga ezimi kuso (ngokuvamile okokuqala), vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkwakhiwa\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsisekelo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha uhlobo:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIpulati ezansi emhlabeni\u003C/strong\u003E: ipulati lekhonkolo elingu-4&quot; elinephezulu lingumgogodla, nomphetho ogqoliwe ngaphansi kwezindonga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzindonga zesisekelo nepulati\u003C/strong\u003E: izindonga zesisekelo kuze kufike emgogodleni ezisekelweni, nepulati ngaphakathi kwazo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECrawlspace\u003C/strong\u003E: izindonga zesisekelo ezima ngaphansi kwesakhiwo samaphansi, ezisekelweni, ngaphandle kwepulati.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbhasimende\u003C/strong\u003E: izindonga zesisekelo ezigcwele ukuphakama konke ezisekelweni nepulati lebhasimende, ngaphansi kwesakhiwo samaphansi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPhakathi kwesakhiwo phawula: izisekelo zibonakala zidashiwe nosayizi wazo. Chofoza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuchofoza isakhiwo esinesisekelo sesivele sikhetha lesi, ukuze ushintshe esinye kunokusho esinye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shintsha\"\u003EShintsha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha isisekelo (chofoza phakathi kwesakhiwo nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsisekelo\u003C/span\u003E, noma chofoza noma iyiphi ingxenye yaso kumbono we-3D noma kumuthi wemodeli) bese ushintsha ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzici\u003C/strong\u003E: uhlobo, ububanzi nokujula kwezisekelo, ukuthi phansi kangakanani ukuhlangana kwaso, ubukhulu bodonga, ukuthi izindonga zimi kangakanani ngaphansi kwephansi, ukuphakama kwebhasimende nobukhulu bepulati. Yonke inguquko iyisinyathelo esisodwa se-undo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinkulumo ezimaka \u003Cstrong\u003Eauto\u003C/strong\u003E zivela ezindongeni: izisekelo ezingu-12&quot;, 15&quot; noma 23&quot; ububanzi zesitezi esisodwa, ezimbili noma ezintathu ezisekelweni nasezindongeni zesisekelo; 18&quot;, 22&quot; noma 27&quot; ngaphansi kwe-crawlspace noma ibhasimende, nobubanzi obengeziwe nge-4&quot; ngaphansi kwezindonga zebhilikhi noma zekhonkolo. Thayipha usayizi ukuze usethe owakho; thayipha \u003Ccode\u003E0\u003C/code\u003E ukubuyela ku-auto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUsayizi ozenzekelayo ungamanani ajwayelekile wezindlu ezilula zokwakha, hhayi ukuklama. Umklami noma unjiniyela uhlola izisekelo, ukujula nezindonga ngokomhlabathi, ukujula kokuqandisa nemithwalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okugciniwe\"\u003EOkugciniwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsisekelo sigcinwa njengendlela ye-IFC element assembly (&quot;Foundation&quot;) eyakhiwe ngesisekelo (noma ukuthambeka kwepulati ezansi emhlabeni), udonga lwesisekelo nepulati njengoba uhlobo lwaso lufuna, konke kukhonkolo, ngayinye inezinanikelo zayo: ubude, ububanzi, ukuphakama, izindawo nevolumu, ilungele ukubala amanani.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukwazi\"\u003EOkufanele ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHambisa, engeza noma sula izindonga, isisekelo ngaphansi kwazo siyenziwa kabusha; dweba izindonga esitezini eliphezulu, bese izisekelo ezingaphansi ziyanda ngesitezi esengeziwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E isusa isisekelo esikhethiwe nazo zonke izingxenye zaso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma umhlabathi wesayithi usemodeli (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/terrain\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/terrain\"\u003EUmhlabathi wesayithi, isiza sesakhiwo nokufakwa kwendlela\u003C/a\u003E), izindonga zesisekelo ne-crawlspace nezisekelo zehla nawo ngezinyathelo ze-8&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzisekelo ngaphansi kwezindonga zangaphakathi azikakwenziwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Nika isakhiwo isisekelo esihambisana nezindonga zaso. BimCraft ilandela ngaphandle kwezindonga, ilinganisa izisekelo ngohlobo lodonga nokuthi izitezi zingaki ezimi phezu kwazo, futhi yenza isisekelo kabusha uma izindonga zishintsha. Faka isisekelo Esitezini lezindonga ezimi kuso (ngokuvamile okokuqala), vula Ukwakhiwa bese ukhetha Isisekelo. Khetha uhlobo: Ipulati ezansi emhlabeni: ipulati lekhonkolo elingu-4\" elinephezulu lingumgogodla, nomphetho ogqoliwe ngaphansi kwezindonga. Izindonga zesisekelo nepulati: izindonga zesisekelo kuze kufike emgogodleni ezisekelweni, nepulati ngaphakathi kwazo. Crawlspace: izindonga zesisekelo ezima ngaphansi kwesakhiwo samaphansi, ezisekelweni, ngaphandle kwepulati. Ibhasimende: izindonga zesisekelo ezigcwele ukuphakama konke ezisekelweni nepulati lebhasimende, ngaphansi kwesakhiwo samaphansi. Phakathi kwesakhiwo phawula: izisekelo zibonakala zidashiwe nosayizi wazo. Chofoza. Ukuchofoza isakhiwo esinesisekelo sesivele sikhetha lesi, ukuze ushintshe esinye kunokusho esinye. Shintsha Khetha isisekelo (chofoza phakathi kwesakhiwo nge-Isisekelo, noma chofoza noma iyiphi ingxenye yaso kumbono we-3D noma kumuthi wemodeli) bese ushintsha ku-Izici: uhlobo, ububanzi nokujula kwezisekelo, ukuthi phansi kangakanani ukuhlangana kwaso, ubukhulu bodonga, ukuthi izindonga zimi kangakanani ngaphansi kwephansi, ukuphakama kwebhasimende nobukhulu bepulati. Yonke inguquko iyisinyathelo esisodwa se-undo. Izinkulumo ezimaka auto zivela ezindongeni: izisekelo ezingu-12\", 15\" noma 23\" ububanzi zesitezi esisodwa, ezimbili noma ezintathu ezisekelweni nasezindongeni zesisekelo; 18\", 22\" noma 27\" ngaphansi kwe-crawlspace noma ibhasimende, nobubanzi obengeziwe nge-4\" ngaphansi kwezindonga zebhilikhi noma zekhonkolo. Thayipha usayizi ukuze usethe owakho; thayipha 0 ukubuyela ku-auto. Usayizi ozenzekelayo ungamanani ajwayelekile wezindlu ezilula zokwakha, hhayi ukuklama. Umklami noma unjiniyela uhlola izisekelo, ukujula nezindonga ngokomhlabathi, ukujula kokuqandisa nemithwalo. Okugciniwe Isisekelo sigcinwa njengendlela ye-IFC element assembly (\"Foundation\") eyakhiwe ngesisekelo (noma ukuthambeka kwepulati ezansi emhlabeni), udonga lwesisekelo nepulati njengoba uhlobo lwaso lufuna, konke kukhonkolo, ngayinye inezinanikelo zayo: ubude, ububanzi, ukuphakama, izindawo nevolumu, ilungele ukubala amanani. Okufanele ukwazi Hambisa, engeza noma sula izindonga, isisekelo ngaphansi kwazo siyenziwa kabusha; dweba izindonga esitezini eliphezulu, bese izisekelo ezingaphansi ziyanda ngesitezi esengeziwe. Delete isusa isisekelo esikhethiwe nazo zonke izingxenye zaso. Uma umhlabathi wesayithi usemodeli (bona Umhlabathi wesayithi, isiza sesakhiwo nokufakwa kwendlela), izindonga zesisekelo ne-crawlspace nezisekelo zehla nawo ngezinyathelo ze-8\". Izisekelo ngaphansi kwezindonga zangaphakathi azikakwenziwa.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"kitchens-and-baths","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Amakhishi, izindlu zokugezela nempahla kusethi yasekhaya","summary":"Beka amakhabethe, amatafula okugezela, izinsiza, izixhobo zamapayipi nempahla ngomtapo ngokumelene nodonga, bese ubeka amakhawunta phezu kwamakhabethe asesisekelo alandela lawo.","section":"tasks","order":22,"keywords":["ikhishi","ikhabethe","ikhabethe lesisekelo","ikhabethe lodonga","ikhabethe eliphezulu","ikhabethe lokugcina","ikhabethe lesinki","lazy susan","ikhabethe lekhona","itafula lokugezela","ikhawunta","isikhala sokusebenza","insiza","ifriji","isitofu","umshini wokugeza izitsha","ihhudi","isinki","ishawa","ibhavu","ithoyilethi","umshini wokuwasha","umshini wokomisa","impahla","isofa","ibhedi","itafula","ekhaya"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"beka-amakhabethe-nezinsiza","text":"Beka amakhabethe nezinsiza","level":2},{"id":"amakhawunta","text":"Amakhawunta","level":2},{"id":"iminyango-namawindi","text":"Iminyango namawindi","level":2},{"id":"okuwusizo-ukukwazi","text":"Okuwusizo ukukwazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHlela amakhishi, izindlu zokugezela namagumbi asebenzisa isethi yasekhaya: amakhabethe, amatafula okugezela, izinsiza, izixhobo zamapayipi nempahla eyenziwe yi-CadCraft futhi ekhululekile ukusetshenziswa (CC0). Zivela emtapweni futhi zihambisana nezindonga; amakhawunta bese ebekwa phezu kwamakhabethe esisekelo ngokuchofoza kanye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beka-amakhabethe-nezinsiza\"\u003EBeka amakhabethe nezinsiza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula ithebhu ethi \u003Cstrong\u003EUmtapo\u003C/strong\u003E bese ukhetha isigaba: \u003Cstrong\u003EAmakhabethe\u003C/strong\u003E (amakhabethe esisekelo, odonga namakhabethe amade), \u003Cstrong\u003EIzinsiza zasekhaya\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EUkuxhumana kwamanzi\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EImpahla\u003C/strong\u003E. Ukusesha \u003Ccode\u003Ebase cabinet\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EB24\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EW3030\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003Etoilet\u003C/code\u003E nakho kuyazithola.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha into bese ukhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EBeka\u003C/strong\u003E. Khetha izinga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESondela odongeni bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze ulibambe: ingemuva lento libamba ubuso bodonga. Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuyiphendula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ukuyibeka. Beka eyilandelayo eduze kwayo; uchungechunge lwamakhabethe ngumane amakhabethe ecaleni kwawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmakhabethe odonga, i-microwave ephezu kwesitofu, amahhudi esitofu namasinki asekhishini anobude bawo: abeke phansi njengazo zonke izinto, azilenga noma ahlale lapho kufanele khona — amakhabethe odonga aphakama ngama-54&quot;, isinki esikhawunteni esiphakeme nge-36&quot;. Amakhabethe ekhoneni angena ekhoneni elingaphakathi, ngemuva kwawo kumi odonga olulodwa, uhlangothi lwawo kumi odonga olunye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amakhawunta\"\u003EAmakhawunta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEzingeni, vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuild\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECountertop\u003C/span\u003E. Setha \u003Cstrong\u003EUkuphuma kwangaphambili\u003C/strong\u003E ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EUbukhulu\u003C/strong\u003E uma zingeyona i-1&quot; ne-1½&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza phezu kochungechunge lwamakhabethe esisekelo: ikhawunta eyenziwa izobonakala phezu kwawo wonke amakhabethe ahlangene, nasezikhonweni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIkhawunta yenziwa kumakhabethe angaphansi kwayo. Uma wengeza noma uke wasusa ikhabethe, ikhawunta idwetshwa ngomugqa ophukile epulanini kuze ilingane futhi: chofoza uchungechunge ngo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECountertop\u003C/span\u003E, noma khetha ikhawunta bese ukhetha \u003Cstrong\u003ELwanele kumakhabethe\u003C/strong\u003E ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzici\u003C/strong\u003E. Noma yiluphi ushintsho odongeni kuleso zinga lulinganisa amakhawunta ngokuzenzakalelayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"iminyango-namawindi\"\u003EIminyango namawindi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmathuluzi e-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDoor\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWindow\u003C/span\u003E nawo anezinhlobo zasekhaya: \u003Cstrong\u003EBifold closet door\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EFrench doors\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EBarn door (on the wall)\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EEntry door with sidelites\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EAwning\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EPicture window\u003C/strong\u003E kanye ne-\u003Cstrong\u003ETransom\u003C/strong\u003E (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/doors-and-windows\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/doors-and-windows\"\u003EIminyango namawindi\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuwusizo-ukukwazi\"\u003EOkuwusizo ukukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmakhawunta alondolozwa njengempahla (&quot;Countertop&quot;) nendawo yawo, ububanzi bawo nomphetho wangaphambili, alungele ukubalwa kwamanani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkusikwa kwesinki kumakhawunta nasezidonga zokuvikela akukakwenziwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUsayizi ungosayizi ovamile abamiwe, hhayi umkhiqizi othile; hlola usayizi womkhiqizi wangempela ngaphambi kokuoda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Hlela amakhishi, izindlu zokugezela namagumbi asebenzisa isethi yasekhaya: amakhabethe, amatafula okugezela, izinsiza, izixhobo zamapayipi nempahla eyenziwe yi-CadCraft futhi ekhululekile ukusetshenziswa (CC0). Zivela emtapweni futhi zihambisana nezindonga; amakhawunta bese ebekwa phezu kwamakhabethe esisekelo ngokuchofoza kanye. Beka amakhabethe nezinsiza Vula ithebhu ethi Umtapo bese ukhetha isigaba: Amakhabethe (amakhabethe esisekelo, odonga namakhabethe amade), Izinsiza zasekhaya, Ukuxhumana kwamanzi, Impahla. Ukusesha base cabinet, B24, W3030 noma toilet nakho kuyazithola. Khetha into bese ukhetha Beka. Khetha izinga. Sondela odongeni bese ucindezela Tab ukuze ulibambe: ingemuva lento libamba ubuso bodonga. Cindezela R ukuyiphendula. Chofoza ukuyibeka. Beka eyilandelayo eduze kwayo; uchungechunge lwamakhabethe ngumane amakhabethe ecaleni kwawo. Amakhabethe odonga, i-microwave ephezu kwesitofu, amahhudi esitofu namasinki asekhishini anobude bawo: abeke phansi njengazo zonke izinto, azilenga noma ahlale lapho kufanele khona — amakhabethe odonga aphakama ngama-54\", isinki esikhawunteni esiphakeme nge-36\". Amakhabethe ekhoneni angena ekhoneni elingaphakathi, ngemuva kwawo kumi odonga olulodwa, uhlangothi lwawo kumi odonga olunye. Amakhawunta Ezingeni, vula Build bese ukhetha Countertop. Setha Ukuphuma kwangaphambili ne-Ubukhulu uma zingeyona i-1\" ne-1½\". Chofoza phezu kochungechunge lwamakhabethe esisekelo: ikhawunta eyenziwa izobonakala phezu kwawo wonke amakhabethe ahlangene, nasezikhonweni. Chofoza. Ikhawunta yenziwa kumakhabethe angaphansi kwayo. Uma wengeza noma uke wasusa ikhabethe, ikhawunta idwetshwa ngomugqa ophukile epulanini kuze ilingane futhi: chofoza uchungechunge ngo-Countertop, noma khetha ikhawunta bese ukhetha Lwanele kumakhabethe ku-Izici. Noma yiluphi ushintsho odongeni kuleso zinga lulinganisa amakhawunta ngokuzenzakalelayo. Iminyango namawindi Amathuluzi e-Door ne-Window nawo anezinhlobo zasekhaya: Bifold closet door, French doors, Barn door (on the wall), Entry door with sidelites, Awning, Picture window kanye ne-Transom (bona Iminyango namawindi). Okuwusizo ukukwazi Amakhawunta alondolozwa njengempahla (\"Countertop\") nendawo yawo, ububanzi bawo nomphetho wangaphambili, alungele ukubalwa kwamanani. Ukusikwa kwesinki kumakhawunta nasezidonga zokuvikela akukakwenziwa. Usayizi ungosayizi ovamile abamiwe, hhayi umkhiqizi othile; hlola usayizi womkhiqizi wangempela ngaphambi kokuoda.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"massing-options","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Izinketho zokwakheka ezigcinwe ngokuhlangana","summary":"Gcina izinketho eziningi zokwakheka emodelini efanayo, yenze enye ibe yinketho yamanje, uyihlole ngokumelene nemigqa yokwakha nezilungelo zesayithi, uthathe ukwakheka okuvela ku-ModelCraft, futhi uthuthukise inketho ekhethiwe ibe izindonga nezendawo.","section":"tasks","order":22,"keywords":["ukwakheka","isisindo","inketho","izinketho","iseti yezinketho","isikimu","umqondo","ukuklama komqondo","isigaba 2","ezinye izinketho","qhathanisa izinketho","inketho yamanje","isisindo sesakhiwo","ukuthatha isisekelo","ModelCraft","CivilCraft","indawo yesakhiwo","umthamo","ukuthuthukisa isisindo","ilungelo lokusebenzisa umhlaba","umugqa wokwakha","ukubuyela emuva"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"gcina-inketho","text":"Gcina inketho","level":2},{"id":"inketho-yamanje","text":"Inketho yamanje","level":2},{"id":"ukwakheka-okuvela-ku-modelcraft","text":"Ukwakheka okuvela ku-ModelCraft","level":2},{"id":"thuthukisa-inketho-ekhethiwe","text":"Thuthukisa inketho ekhethiwe","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukubone","text":"Okufanele ukubone","level":2},{"id":"okwaziwayo-okuhle","text":"Okwaziwayo okuhle","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGcina izinketho zokwakheka zomqondo ndawonye emodelini eyodwa esikhundleni samafayela ahlukene: izisindo zesakhiwo eziningi zisecaleni komunye, eyodwa yazo iyi-\u003Cstrong\u003Einketho yamanje\u003C/strong\u003E, ezinye zigcinelwa ukuqhathanisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInketho yokwakheka yisisindo sesakhiwo: umugqa wangaphandle ophakanyiswe ukuya ebudeni obuthile, nenani lamazinga. Akusibo amadonga okwamanje. Ungagcina noma yiziphi ezinengi ongazifuna, uzihlele ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003Eamasethi ezinketho\u003C/strong\u003E (izinketho zeseti eyodwa ziyizinketho ezizodwa).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gcina-inketho\"\u003EGcina inketho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlelo lwamagumbi kuya kumumo wesakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E, thayipha uhlelo lwamagumbi nomugqa wangaphandle, bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThola izinketho\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha enye yezinketho ezidweshiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphansi kwesigaba \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinketho zokwakheka kwemodeli\u003C/span\u003E, thayipha igama le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsethi yezinketho\u003C/span\u003E uma ufuna elilodwa, bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGcina inketho ekhethiwe\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInketho ivela emodelini njengesisindo sesakhiwo nohlwini, namazinga ayo, indawo yayo yokwakheka, indawo ephelele yesakhiwo kanye nevolumu. Akukho okwakhiwayo. Gcina enye ngendlela efanayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInketho yokuqala yeseti iyinketho yayo yamanje. Isinyathelo ngasinye siyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"inketho-yamanje\"\u003EInketho yamanje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEnye yezinketho zeseti ngayinye iyeyamanje. Lokho kusho izinto ezimbili:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmazinga ayo abalwa njengezindawo zesakhiwo.\u003C/strong\u003E Inketho yamanje inesikhala esisodwa ngezinga ngalinye esiphethe indawo ephelele yalelo zinga, ngakho noma yini efunda izindawo zamazinga ibona inketho esebenza khona kuphela hhayi enye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIhlolwa ngokumelene nesayithi.\u003C/strong\u003E Uma imi ngaphandle komkhawulo wesayithi, phezu komugqa wokwakha noma phezu kwelungelo lokusebenzisa umhlaba (servitude), isexwayiso esibiza kona siyavela ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinkinga\u003C/span\u003E. Yisexwayiso kuphela: akukho okwenqatshwa. Izinketho ezingeyona eyamanje azihloliwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYenza eyamanje\u003C/span\u003E kwenye inketho ukuze uyishintshe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFihla izinketho ezingesona ezamanje\u003C/span\u003E ifihla ezinye ku-3D view. Lokho kusebenza kule bhrawuza kuphela futhi akulondolozwa efayelini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukwakheka-okuvela-ku-modelcraft\"\u003EUkwakheka okuvela ku-ModelCraft\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-ModelCraft, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkwakheka kuya ku-BimCraft…\u003C/span\u003E ithumela iqembu noma ingxenye ngayinye njengenketho eyodwa. BimCraft ivula ifayela ngezinketho ezidweshiwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze uzilethe emodelini esevulekile, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza izinketho zokwakheka kusuka kufayela\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha ifayela \u003Ccode\u003E.ifc\u003C/code\u003E. Izisindo zalo zingena njengezinketho zeseti, esinyathelweni esisodwa sokuhlehlisa, zime lapho zamodelwa khona. Ifayela lezisindo zesakhiwo ezivela ku-CivilCraft lisebenza ngendlela efanayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInketho emakwe ngokuthi &quot;(ibonakala ilula)&quot; ayikona ibhulokhi eqondile ku-ModelCraft (iyaphindela emuva, iyathambeka noma ayivalekile). Isisindo sayo lapha umugqa wangaphandle wesisekelo sayo ophakanyisiwe ukuya ebudeni bayo; indawo yamazinga ayo nevolumu yayo kulinganiswa kusukela kulowo mzimba oqinile uqobo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"thuthukisa-inketho-ekhethiwe\"\u003EThuthukisa inketho ekhethiwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThuthukisa\u003C/span\u003E kwinketho. Iba amazinga (angezwa ngenani lamazinga ayo), izindonga ezizungeze umugqa wangaphandle wayo kuwo wonke amazinga nesilabhu sephansi ngalinye, kusinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Inketho iphuma ohlwini; ezinye izinketho zihlala zinjalo. Akukho uphahla okwamanje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQamba kabusha\u003C/span\u003E ishintsha igama lenketho, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa\u003C/span\u003E iyiphuma emodelini. Ukususa inketho yamanje kwenza inketho yokuqala yeseti eseyinye ibe yeyamanje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukubone\"\u003EOkufanele ukubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInketho ngayinye elondoloziwe njengebhulokhi ku-3D view nomugqa ohlwini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;(yamanje)&quot; eduze kwenketho eyodwa yeseti ngayinye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsexwayiso ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinkinga\u003C/span\u003E lapho inketho yamanje idlula umkhawulo wesayithi, umugqa wokwakha noma ilungelo lokusebenzisa umhlaba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okwaziwayo-okuhle\"\u003EOkwaziwayo okuhle\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKufayela le-IFC inketho iyisiprokisi sento yesakhiwo enesethi yempahla \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_SiteMass\u003C/code\u003E (iseti yayo yezinketho, igama lenketho nokuthi iyamanje yini kulelo sethi). Amazinga enketho yamanje ayizindawo zohlobo \u003Ccode\u003EMassingFloor\u003C/code\u003E. Eminye imikhiqizo ifunda isiprokisi njengento ejwayelekile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkugcina inketho akusoze kwengeze amazinga; ukuthuthukisa kuwengeza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmsizi angahlu izinketho ezigciniwe, agcine enye, enze enye yamanje, aqamba kabusha, athuthukise noma asuse enye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Gcina izinketho zokwakheka zomqondo ndawonye emodelini eyodwa esikhundleni samafayela ahlukene: izisindo zesakhiwo eziningi zisecaleni komunye, eyodwa yazo iyi-inketho yamanje, ezinye zigcinelwa ukuqhathanisa. Inketho yokwakheka yisisindo sesakhiwo: umugqa wangaphandle ophakanyiswe ukuya ebudeni obuthile, nenani lamazinga. Akusibo amadonga okwamanje. Ungagcina noma yiziphi ezinengi ongazifuna, uzihlele ngaphansi kwe-amasethi ezinketho (izinketho zeseti eyodwa ziyizinketho ezizodwa). Gcina inketho Vula Uhlelo lwamagumbi kuya kumumo wesakhiwo, thayipha uhlelo lwamagumbi nomugqa wangaphandle, bese ukhetha Thola izinketho. Khetha enye yezinketho ezidweshiwe. Ngaphansi kwesigaba Izinketho zokwakheka kwemodeli, thayipha igama le-Isethi yezinketho uma ufuna elilodwa, bese ukhetha Gcina inketho ekhethiwe. Inketho ivela emodelini njengesisindo sesakhiwo nohlwini, namazinga ayo, indawo yayo yokwakheka, indawo ephelele yesakhiwo kanye nevolumu. Akukho okwakhiwayo. Gcina enye ngendlela efanayo. Inketho yokuqala yeseti iyinketho yayo yamanje. Isinyathelo ngasinye siyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Inketho yamanje Enye yezinketho zeseti ngayinye iyeyamanje. Lokho kusho izinto ezimbili: Amazinga ayo abalwa njengezindawo zesakhiwo. Inketho yamanje inesikhala esisodwa ngezinga ngalinye esiphethe indawo ephelele yalelo zinga, ngakho noma yini efunda izindawo zamazinga ibona inketho esebenza khona kuphela hhayi enye. Ihlolwa ngokumelene nesayithi. Uma imi ngaphandle komkhawulo wesayithi, phezu komugqa wokwakha noma phezu kwelungelo lokusebenzisa umhlaba (servitude), isexwayiso esibiza kona siyavela ku-Izinkinga. Yisexwayiso kuphela: akukho okwenqatshwa. Izinketho ezingeyona eyamanje azihloliwe. Khetha Yenza eyamanje kwenye inketho ukuze uyishintshe. Fihla izinketho ezingesona ezamanje ifihla ezinye ku-3D view. Lokho kusebenza kule bhrawuza kuphela futhi akulondolozwa efayelini. Ukwakheka okuvela ku-ModelCraft Ku-ModelCraft, Thumela › Ukwakheka kuya ku-BimCraft… ithumela iqembu noma ingxenye ngayinye njengenketho eyodwa. BimCraft ivula ifayela ngezinketho ezidweshiwe. Ukuze uzilethe emodelini esevulekile, khetha Engeza izinketho zokwakheka kusuka kufayela bese ukhetha ifayela .ifc. Izisindo zalo zingena njengezinketho zeseti, esinyathelweni esisodwa sokuhlehlisa, zime lapho zamodelwa khona. Ifayela lezisindo zesakhiwo ezivela ku-CivilCraft lisebenza ngendlela efanayo. Inketho emakwe ngokuthi \"(ibonakala ilula)\" ayikona ibhulokhi eqondile ku-ModelCraft (iyaphindela emuva, iyathambeka noma ayivalekile). Isisindo sayo lapha umugqa wangaphandle wesisekelo sayo ophakanyisiwe ukuya ebudeni bayo; indawo yamazinga ayo nevolumu yayo kulinganiswa kusukela kulowo mzimba oqinile uqobo. Thuthukisa inketho ekhethiwe Khetha Thuthukisa kwinketho. Iba amazinga (angezwa ngenani lamazinga ayo), izindonga ezizungeze umugqa wangaphandle wayo kuwo wonke amazinga nesilabhu sephansi ngalinye, kusinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Inketho iphuma ohlwini; ezinye izinketho zihlala zinjalo. Akukho uphahla okwamanje. Qamba kabusha ishintsha igama lenketho, Susa iyiphuma emodelini. Ukususa inketho yamanje kwenza inketho yokuqala yeseti eseyinye ibe yeyamanje. Okufanele ukubone Inketho ngayinye elondoloziwe njengebhulokhi ku-3D view nomugqa ohlwini. \"(yamanje)\" eduze kwenketho eyodwa yeseti ngayinye. Isexwayiso ku-Izinkinga lapho inketho yamanje idlula umkhawulo wesayithi, umugqa wokwakha noma ilungelo lokusebenzisa umhlaba. Okwaziwayo okuhle Kufayela le-IFC inketho iyisiprokisi sento yesakhiwo enesethi yempahla CadCraft_SiteMass (iseti yayo yezinketho, igama lenketho nokuthi iyamanje yini kulelo sethi). Amazinga enketho yamanje ayizindawo zohlobo MassingFloor. Eminye imikhiqizo ifunda isiprokisi njengento ejwayelekile. Ukugcina inketho akusoze kwengeze amazinga; ukuthuthukisa kuwengeza. Umsizi angahlu izinketho ezigciniwe, agcine enye, enze enye yamanje, aqamba kabusha, athuthukise noma asuse enye.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"find","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Thola izinto ngeklasi, igama noma isici","summary":"Thola zonke izinto ezihambisana nomthetho owodwa noma ngaphezulu — iklasi yazo, igama, uhlobo, isitezi, impahla noma noma yiliphi inani lesici — zikhethe zonke, bese ugcina imithetho njengesethi yokusesha egciniwe.","section":"tasks","order":22,"keywords":["thola","sesha","hlunga","buza","umthetho","sethi yokusesha","sethi yokukhetha","ukusesha okugciniwe","isici","inani","iklasi","impahla","khetha konke"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukubone","text":"Okufanele ukubone","level":2},{"id":"izinkinga-ezivamile","text":"Izinkinga ezivamile","level":2},{"id":"okulandelayo","text":"Okulandelayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha izinto zohlobo olulodwa noma ezinenani elilodwa ngesinyathelo esisodwa: yonke indlela, yonke indonga ku-Izinga 2, yonke into enesilinganiso somlilo esingu-EI60, yonke indonga ebiza ngaphezu kwesamba esithile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula imodeli ye-IFC.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThola\u003C/span\u003E epaneli elisekhohlo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKumthetho wokuqala, khetha isici (izici zento ngokwayo kuqala, ezifana ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIklasi\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsitezi\u003C/span\u003E, bese izethi zezici zemodeli), indlela yokuqhathanisa, nenani. Ibhokisi lenani liphakamisa amanani emodeli inawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuze unciphise, chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza umthetho\u003C/span\u003E. Khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYonke imithetho\u003C/span\u003E ukuze udinge zonke, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENoma yimuphi umthetho\u003C/span\u003E ukuze udinge enye yazo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThola\u003C/span\u003E, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ebhokisini lenani. Okuhambisanayo kukhethwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkugcina imithetho, chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza njengesethi\u003C/span\u003E, thayipha igama, bese uchofoza futhi. Chofoza igama lesethi kamuva ukuze uthole ngayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukubone\"\u003EOkufanele ukubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOkuhambisanayo kukhethwe kumbono we-3D nakumuthi wemodeli, kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzici\u003C/span\u003E ezitshela ukuthi zingaki ngeklasi. Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"I\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukubonisa kuphela zona, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"H\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuzifihla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmagama ahambisana noma kungabi namakhamandla obukhulu nobuncane. Izinombolo ziqhathaniswa njengezinombolo: &quot;ingaphezu kuka-1000&quot; isho inani, hhayi umbhalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003Einalo inani\u003C/span\u003E no \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003Ealinalo inani\u003C/span\u003E abadingi inani; zithola okugcwele noma okungekho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzethi ezigciniwe zihlala kule msebenzisi kuzo zonke izimodeli ozivulayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinkinga-ezivamile\"\u003EIzinkinga ezivamile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkutholakali lutho.\u003C/strong\u003E Umthetho udinga inani elingahambisana nalo: bheka okuphakanyiswa ebhokisini lenani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsici asitholakali ohlwini.\u003C/strong\u003E Akukho sakhiwo kule modeli esinaso lesi sici.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulandelayo\"\u003EOkulandelayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/color-by-property\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/color-by-property\"\u003EPhenza izinto zibe nombala ngesici\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\"\u003EFihla, hlukanisa futhi ubone ngaphakathi kwezinto\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Khetha izinto zohlobo olulodwa noma ezinenani elilodwa ngesinyathelo esisodwa: yonke indlela, yonke indonga ku-Izinga 2, yonke into enesilinganiso somlilo esingu-EI60, yonke indonga ebiza ngaphezu kwesamba esithile. Izinyathelo Vula imodeli ye-IFC. Vula Thola epaneli elisekhohlo. Kumthetho wokuqala, khetha isici (izici zento ngokwayo kuqala, ezifana ne-Iklasi ne-Isitezi, bese izethi zezici zemodeli), indlela yokuqhathanisa, nenani. Ibhokisi lenani liphakamisa amanani emodeli inawo. Ukuze unciphise, chofoza Engeza umthetho. Khetha Yonke imithetho ukuze udinge zonke, noma Noma yimuphi umthetho ukuze udinge enye yazo. Chofoza Thola, noma cindezela Enter ebhokisini lenani. Okuhambisanayo kukhethwa. Ukugcina imithetho, chofoza Londoloza njengesethi, thayipha igama, bese uchofoza futhi. Chofoza igama lesethi kamuva ukuze uthole ngayo. Okufanele ukubone Okuhambisanayo kukhethwe kumbono we-3D nakumuthi wemodeli, kanye Izici ezitshela ukuthi zingaki ngeklasi. Cindezela I ukubonisa kuphela zona, H ukuzifihla. Amagama ahambisana noma kungabi namakhamandla obukhulu nobuncane. Izinombolo ziqhathaniswa njengezinombolo: \"ingaphezu kuka-1000\" isho inani, hhayi umbhalo. inalo inani no alinalo inani abadingi inani; zithola okugcwele noma okungekho. Izethi ezigciniwe zihlala kule msebenzisi kuzo zonke izimodeli ozivulayo. Izinkinga ezivamile Akutholakali lutho. Umthetho udinga inani elingahambisana nalo: bheka okuphakanyiswa ebhokisini lenani. Isici asitholakali ohlwini. Akukho sakhiwo kule modeli esinaso lesi sici. Okulandelayo Phenza izinto zibe nombala ngesici Fihla, hlukanisa futhi ubone ngaphakathi kwezinto","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"room-finishes","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Ukuqedwa kwamagumbi nohlu lokuqedwa","summary":"Chaza okumboza iphansi, izindonga nesilingi sengumbi ngalinye, engeza izingxenye ezikhethekile njengebhodi lamathayili esendongeni, bese uthola uhlu lokuqedwa ngamagumbi, ngezindonga nangezindawo, nezinani zamathayili kuhlanganise nokusikwa kanye namavolumu esisekelo.","section":"tasks","order":22,"keywords":["ukuqedwa","ukuqedwa kwamagumbi","uhlu lokuqedwa","ukuqedwa kwephansi","ukuqedwa kodonga","ukuqedwa kwesilingi","ibhodi lokuzungeza","ithayili","amathayili","amathayili asikiwe","inani lamathayili","ukulahlekelwa","isisekelo","i-screed","ibhodi lokusekela","ipulasta","indawo ezungezayo","ingxenye yodonga","indawo emanzi","ukuqedwa kwangaphakathi","amanani"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenziwa","text":"Okuzokwenziwa","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"uhlu","text":"Uhlu","level":2},{"id":"ukubalwa-kokuqedwa","text":"Ukubalwa kokuqedwa","level":2},{"id":"okuhle-ukwazi","text":"Okuhle ukwazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenziwa\"\u003EOkuzokwenziwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETshela i-BimCraft kanye ukuthi igumbi ngalinye lichithwe ngani. Uhlu lokuqedwa lunika izindawo, amathayili okuwaoda kanye namavolumu esisekelo, futhi lushintsha ngemodeli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw\u003C/span\u003E, vula \u003Cstrong\u003ESchedules\u003C/strong\u003E esiqeshini sangakwesobunxele bese uchofoza \u003Cstrong\u003EUkuqedwa kwamagumbi\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EFinish types\u003C/strong\u003E, chofoza \u003Cstrong\u003EAdd a finish type\u003C/strong\u003E. Yinike igama, uhlobo (Ithayili, Ishidi, Ungqimba noma Ibhodi) nobukhulu. Ithayili linikeze ubude nobubanzi balo, ukuhlangana kwalo nephesenti lokulahlekelwa. Uma kukhona okungaphansi kokuqedwa (i-screed, ibhodi lokusekela, ungqimba lwepulasta), liqambe ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003ESubstrate\u003C/strong\u003E unikeze ubukhulu balo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003ERooms\u003C/strong\u003E, khetha ukuqedwa kwephansi, kodonga nesilingi kwegumbi ngalinye. Thayipha igama lebhodi lokuzungeza nobude balo uma igumbi linalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EZones\u003C/strong\u003E, chofoza \u003Cstrong\u003EAdd a zone\u003C/strong\u003E kwingxenye yegumbi edinga ukuqedwa okuhlukile:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIndawo \u003Cstrong\u003Eyodonga\u003C/strong\u003E ingxenye ephakathi kwamazinga amabili ngaphezu kwephansi (ibhodi elithayiliwe kusuka ku-0 kuya ku-1200, ingxenye yodonga). Itholakala kuzo zonke izindonga zalelo gumbi, noma khetha izindonga zalelo gumbi emodelini bese uchofoza inkinobho ye-\u003Cstrong\u003EOn\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze uyigcine kuzona kuphela;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIndawo \u003Cstrong\u003Eyephansi\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003Eyesilingi\u003C/strong\u003E iyindawo oyithayipha. Iyasuswa kokuqedwa komgumbi wayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cstrong\u003ESave\u003C/strong\u003E. Yisinyathelo esisodwa ku-Undo. Ubude buthayipha ngamayunithi wephrojekthi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uhlu\"\u003EUhlu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKungeza izingenisi ezine kuhlu lwe-Schedules:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFinishes by room\u003C/strong\u003E: igumbi ngalinye nokuqedwa kwalo kwephansi, kodonga nesilingi, izindawo zawo, nebhodi lokuzungeza nobude balo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFinishes by wall\u003C/strong\u003E: ingxenye ngayinye yodonga ohlangothini lwegumbi nengxenye yalo okumbozwe ukuqedwa, nobude balo, indawo ephelele, ukukhishwa, indawo yangempela nokwamathayili, amathayili aphelele, amathayili asikiwe namathayili okuwaoda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFinishes by zone\u003C/strong\u003E: indawo ngayinye nokuqedwa kwayo, indawo yangempela, amathayili nevolumu yesisekelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFinish quantities\u003C/strong\u003E: umugqa owodwa ngokuqedwa ngakunye: indawo yangempela, amathayili aphelele nasikiwe, amathayili okuwaoda, isisekelo nevolumu yaso, nevolumu yokuqedwa ngokwakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHlanganisa, unikeze isamba, uqophe futhi uthumele njengalo naliphi uhlu: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/schedule-layouts\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/schedule-layouts\"\u003EHlela, londoloza uthumele uhlu\u003C/a\u003E. Chofoza inani ukukhetha lapho livela khona: ukukhishwa kwezindonga kukhetha iminyango nemawindi alo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukubalwa-kokuqedwa\"\u003EUkubalwa kokuqedwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzindonga\u003C/strong\u003E: ingxenye ngayinye yodonga ohlangothini lwegumbi, ubude bayo ngokuhambisana negumbi kuphindaphindwe ngokuphakama okumbozwa ukuqedwa, kukhishwe ingxenye yomnyango nowindi ngaphakathi kwalokho kuphakama. Udonga ophansi kunegumbi uqedwa kuze kufike phezulu kwawo. Umgomo wokulinganisa wephrojekthi unquma ukuthi yimaphi amasango amancane kakhulu ukuthi angakhishwa (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/plan-schedules-and-pdf\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/plan-schedules-and-pdf\"\u003EUhlu\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmaphansi nezilingi\u003C/strong\u003E: igumbi ngaphakathi kwezindonga zalo, kukhishwe izihlahla ezingaphakathi kwalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbhodi lokuzungeza\u003C/strong\u003E: ubude bodonga legumbi kukhishwe ububanzi bemiyango yalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmathayili\u003C/strong\u003E: ahlelwe njengegridi ukusuka kwelinye ikhona lendawo, nokuhlangana kukodwa phakathi kwamathayili. Ithayili eliphelele endaweni liyithayili elipheleleyo; ithayili elingxenye yalo kuyo (emphethelweni, lizungeze isimo) liyithayili elisikiwe. Amathayili okuwaoda ayaphelele plus asikiwe, plus indawo yokulahlekelwa, ajikijelwe phezulu. Ithayili ngalinye elisikiwe libalwa njengethayili elisha: izingcezu ezisele azisetshenziswa futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIvolumu yesisekelo\u003C/strong\u003E: indawo yangempela iphindaphindwe ngobukhulu besisekelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInani elimakwe ngo-\u003Cstrong\u003E≈\u003C/strong\u003E libalwa ngendawo kunokuba lihlelwe ithayili ngethayili: indawo enendawo ethile yesikhathi esikhishiwe kuyo, noma enkulu kakhulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuhle-ukwazi\"\u003EOkuhle ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuqedwa kugcinwa efayeleni lesakhiwo (isethi yezakhiwo \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_Finishes\u003C/code\u003E ephrojekthini). Igumbi ngalinye elinokuqedwa lithola futhi isethi esemgangathweni yezakhiwo ye-IFC \u003Ccode\u003EPset_SpaceCoveringRequirements\u003C/code\u003E, ukuze ezinye izinhlelo zifunde amagama.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuhlelwa kwamathayili kuqala ekhoneni. Ukuhlelwa okuphakathi kwegumbi, iphethini (i-herringbone, i-brick bond) nokusetshenziswa kabusha kwezingcezu azibalwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUdonga oluyigobe, nomkhawulo wegumbi ongewona udonga (isihlukanisi segumbi), kuhlu njenge-\u003Cstrong\u003EOther boundary\u003C/strong\u003E nobude balo, ngaphandle kwemigodi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIngenisi ye-\u003Cstrong\u003EFinishes\u003C/strong\u003E eyayikhona ngaphambili ihlu izingqimba zokuqedwa zezinhlobo zezindonga; i-\u003Cstrong\u003ELayers: area and volume\u003C/strong\u003E ihlu yonke ingqimba yazo zonke izinhlobo ezinezingqimba. Ukuqedwa kwamagumbi lapha yikho okusetshenziswa egumbini ngaphezu kwalezo zingqimba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmsizi ungakwenzela ukusetha ukuqedwa nge-\u003Ccode\u003Efinishes_set\u003C/code\u003E: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/assistants\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/assistants\"\u003EVumela umsizi we-AI asebenze nemodeli yakho\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenziwa Tshela i-BimCraft kanye ukuthi igumbi ngalinye lichithwe ngani. Uhlu lokuqedwa lunika izindawo, amathayili okuwaoda kanye namavolumu esisekelo, futhi lushintsha ngemodeli. Izinyathelo Vula Draw, vula Schedules esiqeshini sangakwesobunxele bese uchofoza Ukuqedwa kwamagumbi. Ngaphansi kwe-Finish types, chofoza Add a finish type. Yinike igama, uhlobo (Ithayili, Ishidi, Ungqimba noma Ibhodi) nobukhulu. Ithayili linikeze ubude nobubanzi balo, ukuhlangana kwalo nephesenti lokulahlekelwa. Uma kukhona okungaphansi kokuqedwa (i-screed, ibhodi lokusekela, ungqimba lwepulasta), liqambe ngaphansi kwe-Substrate unikeze ubukhulu balo. Ngaphansi kwe-Rooms, khetha ukuqedwa kwephansi, kodonga nesilingi kwegumbi ngalinye. Thayipha igama lebhodi lokuzungeza nobude balo uma igumbi linalo. Ngaphansi kwe-Zones, chofoza Add a zone kwingxenye yegumbi edinga ukuqedwa okuhlukile: Indawo yodonga ingxenye ephakathi kwamazinga amabili ngaphezu kwephansi (ibhodi elithayiliwe kusuka ku-0 kuya ku-1200, ingxenye yodonga). Itholakala kuzo zonke izindonga zalelo gumbi, noma khetha izindonga zalelo gumbi emodelini bese uchofoza inkinobho ye-On ukuze uyigcine kuzona kuphela; Indawo yephansi noma yesilingi iyindawo oyithayipha. Iyasuswa kokuqedwa komgumbi wayo. Chofoza Save. Yisinyathelo esisodwa ku-Undo. Ubude buthayipha ngamayunithi wephrojekthi. Uhlu Kungeza izingenisi ezine kuhlu lwe-Schedules: Finishes by room: igumbi ngalinye nokuqedwa kwalo kwephansi, kodonga nesilingi, izindawo zawo, nebhodi lokuzungeza nobude balo. Finishes by wall: ingxenye ngayinye yodonga ohlangothini lwegumbi nengxenye yalo okumbozwe ukuqedwa, nobude balo, indawo ephelele, ukukhishwa, indawo yangempela nokwamathayili, amathayili aphelele, amathayili asikiwe namathayili okuwaoda. Finishes by zone: indawo ngayinye nokuqedwa kwayo, indawo yangempela, amathayili nevolumu yesisekelo. Finish quantities: umugqa owodwa ngokuqedwa ngakunye: indawo yangempela, amathayili aphelele nasikiwe, amathayili okuwaoda, isisekelo nevolumu yaso, nevolumu yokuqedwa ngokwakho. Hlanganisa, unikeze isamba, uqophe futhi uthumele njengalo naliphi uhlu: bheka Hlela, londoloza uthumele uhlu. Chofoza inani ukukhetha lapho livela khona: ukukhishwa kwezindonga kukhetha iminyango nemawindi alo. Ukubalwa kokuqedwa Izindonga: ingxenye ngayinye yodonga ohlangothini lwegumbi, ubude bayo ngokuhambisana negumbi kuphindaphindwe ngokuphakama okumbozwa ukuqedwa, kukhishwe ingxenye yomnyango nowindi ngaphakathi kwalokho kuphakama. Udonga ophansi kunegumbi uqedwa kuze kufike phezulu kwawo. Umgomo wokulinganisa wephrojekthi unquma ukuthi yimaphi amasango amancane kakhulu ukuthi angakhishwa (Uhlu). Amaphansi nezilingi: igumbi ngaphakathi kwezindonga zalo, kukhishwe izihlahla ezingaphakathi kwalo. Ibhodi lokuzungeza: ubude bodonga legumbi kukhishwe ububanzi bemiyango yalo. Amathayili: ahlelwe njengegridi ukusuka kwelinye ikhona lendawo, nokuhlangana kukodwa phakathi kwamathayili. Ithayili eliphelele endaweni liyithayili elipheleleyo; ithayili elingxenye yalo kuyo (emphethelweni, lizungeze isimo) liyithayili elisikiwe. Amathayili okuwaoda ayaphelele plus asikiwe, plus indawo yokulahlekelwa, ajikijelwe phezulu. Ithayili ngalinye elisikiwe libalwa njengethayili elisha: izingcezu ezisele azisetshenziswa futhi. Ivolumu yesisekelo: indawo yangempela iphindaphindwe ngobukhulu besisekelo. Inani elimakwe ngo-≈ libalwa ngendawo kunokuba lihlelwe ithayili ngethayili: indawo enendawo ethile yesikhathi esikhishiwe kuyo, noma enkulu kakhulu. Okuhle ukwazi Ukuqedwa kugcinwa efayeleni lesakhiwo (isethi yezakhiwo CadCraft_Finishes ephrojekthini). Igumbi ngalinye elinokuqedwa lithola futhi isethi esemgangathweni yezakhiwo ye-IFC Pset_SpaceCoveringRequirements, ukuze ezinye izinhlelo zifunde amagama. Ukuhlelwa kwamathayili kuqala ekhoneni. Ukuhlelwa okuphakathi kwegumbi, iphethini (i-herringbone, i-brick bond) nokusetshenziswa kabusha kwezingcezu azibalwa. Udonga oluyigobe, nomkhawulo wegumbi ongewona udonga (isihlukanisi segumbi), kuhlu njenge-Other boundary nobude balo, ngaphandle kwemigodi. Ingenisi ye-Finishes eyayikhona ngaphambili ihlu izingqimba zokuqedwa zezinhlobo zezindonga; i-Layers: area and volume ihlu yonke ingqimba yazo zonke izinhlobo ezinezingqimba. Ukuqedwa kwamagumbi lapha yikho okusetshenziswa egumbini ngaphezu kwalezo zingqimba. Umsizi ungakwenzela ukusetha ukuqedwa nge-finishes_set: bheka Vumela umsizi we-AI asebenze nemodeli yakho.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"specification","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Bhala ukucaciswa kusukela kumodeli","summary":"Isigaba sokucaciswa esisodwa ngohlobo ngalunye lodonga, umnyango, iwindi, iphansi kanye nokuqedela okusetshenziswayo, nezici zaso ezifundwa kumodeli kanye nombhalo wakho, kwenziwe idokhumenti ye-PDF noma ye-Word.","section":"tasks","order":23,"keywords":["ukucaciswa","spec","imidwebo yokwakha","isinyathelo 5","amadokhumenti okwakha","isigaba","uhlobo lodonga","uhlobo lomnyango","uhlobo lwewindi","ukuqedela","ukuhlelwa","uniclass","omniclass","masterformat","idokhumenti","pdf","word","docx","uhlu"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"uhlu-lwemidwebo-yokwakha-njengedokhumenti","text":"Uhlu lwemidwebo yokwakha njengedokhumenti","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-wazi","text":"Okufanele wazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThola ukucaciswa okulandela imodeli: isigaba sohlobo ngalunye olusemakhaya ngempela, ngakunye nokwakhiwa kwalo namanani afundwa kumodeli, kanye nombhalo oyibhalayo ngawo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDweba\u003C/span\u003E, vula \u003Cstrong\u003EUhlu\u003C/strong\u003E kumqulu wesobunxele bese uchofoza \u003Cstrong\u003EUkucaciswa\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUhlu lunesigaba ngasinye sohlobo lodonga, uhlobo lomnyango, uhlobo lewindi, iphansi nokuqedela kwegumbi okusetshenziswayo. Ngaphansi kwesihloko ngasinye kukhona \u003Cstrong\u003Eizici\u003C/strong\u003E zaso, ezifundwa kumodeli: ukuqina, izendlalelo ngazinye, izinga lokuthuthukiswa, usayizi, inani nobuningi. Isigaba esinamakhodi okuhlelwa ezintweni zaso sibonisa ikhodi esihlokweni saso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBhala umbhalo wakho wokucaciswa ebhokisini ngaphansi kwesigaba. \u003Cstrong\u003EKhetha izinto zaso\u003C/strong\u003E ibonisa ukuthi isigaba sihilela ini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E. Kuyisinyathelo esisodwa ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlehlisa\u003C/span\u003E, futhi umbhalo ugcinwa efayelini lesakhiwo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cstrong\u003EAmadokhumenti kusukela kumodeli\u003C/strong\u003E, khetha isifanekiso \u003Cstrong\u003EUkucaciswa\u003C/strong\u003E bese uchofoza \u003Cstrong\u003EBuka kuqala\u003C/strong\u003E, bese ulondoloza njenge-PDF, Word noma Markdown. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/documents-from-the-model\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/documents-from-the-model\"\u003EAmadokhumenti kusukela kumodeli\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uhlu-lwemidwebo-yokwakha-njengedokhumenti\"\u003EUhlu lwemidwebo yokwakha njengedokhumenti\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsifanekiso \u003Cstrong\u003EUhlu lwemidwebo yokwakha\u003C/strong\u003E siphrinta uhlu lweminyango, lwewindi nolwemiphetho lusuka kumodeli ngqo, ngokwesakhiwo sehhovisi lakho. Esifanekisweni sakho sibhale \u003Ccode\u003E{{schedule doors}}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{{schedule windows}}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{{schedule roomfinishes}}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{{schedule finishtotals}}\u003C/code\u003E, noma igama lesethi-phansi elonghiwe, isibonelo \u003Ccode\u003E{{schedule Door schedule by floor}}\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Ccode\u003E{{specification}}\u003C/code\u003E iphrinta ukucaciswa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-wazi\"\u003EOkufanele wazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzici zingezemodeli. Ziyashintsha uma imodeli ishintsha; umbhalo wakho awushintshi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBimCraft ayibhali isigatshana sanoma yiluphi izinga noma umbhalo womkhiqizi. Isigaba esingenambhalo siphrinta &quot;Umbhalo wokucaciswa awukabhalwa.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmbhalo obhalelwe uhlobo okungasaphinde kube semodeli uyagcinwa futhi ubhalwe ohlwini lwethi &quot;Umbhalo wezinhlobo ezingasaphinde zibe semodeli&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkushintsha uhlobo jikelele lube yisakhiwo esithile, bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/wall-tools\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/wall-tools\"\u003EAmathuluzi odonga\u003C/a\u003E (Shintsha uhlobo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Thola ukucaciswa okulandela imodeli: isigaba sohlobo ngalunye olusemakhaya ngempela, ngakunye nokwakhiwa kwalo namanani afundwa kumodeli, kanye nombhalo oyibhalayo ngawo. Izinyathelo Vula Dweba, vula Uhlu kumqulu wesobunxele bese uchofoza Ukucaciswa. Uhlu lunesigaba ngasinye sohlobo lodonga, uhlobo lomnyango, uhlobo lewindi, iphansi nokuqedela kwegumbi okusetshenziswayo. Ngaphansi kwesihloko ngasinye kukhona izici zaso, ezifundwa kumodeli: ukuqina, izendlalelo ngazinye, izinga lokuthuthukiswa, usayizi, inani nobuningi. Isigaba esinamakhodi okuhlelwa ezintweni zaso sibonisa ikhodi esihlokweni saso. Bhala umbhalo wakho wokucaciswa ebhokisini ngaphansi kwesigaba. Khetha izinto zaso ibonisa ukuthi isigaba sihilela ini. Chofoza Londoloza. Kuyisinyathelo esisodwa ku-Hlehlisa, futhi umbhalo ugcinwa efayelini lesakhiwo. Vula Amadokhumenti kusukela kumodeli, khetha isifanekiso Ukucaciswa bese uchofoza Buka kuqala, bese ulondoloza njenge-PDF, Word noma Markdown. Bheka Amadokhumenti kusukela kumodeli. Uhlu lwemidwebo yokwakha njengedokhumenti Isifanekiso Uhlu lwemidwebo yokwakha siphrinta uhlu lweminyango, lwewindi nolwemiphetho lusuka kumodeli ngqo, ngokwesakhiwo sehhovisi lakho. Esifanekisweni sakho sibhale {{schedule doors}}, {{schedule windows}}, {{schedule roomfinishes}}, {{schedule finishtotals}}, noma igama lesethi-phansi elonghiwe, isibonelo {{schedule Door schedule by floor}}. {{specification}} iphrinta ukucaciswa. Okufanele wazi Izici zingezemodeli. Ziyashintsha uma imodeli ishintsha; umbhalo wakho awushintshi. BimCraft ayibhali isigatshana sanoma yiluphi izinga noma umbhalo womkhiqizi. Isigaba esingenambhalo siphrinta \"Umbhalo wokucaciswa awukabhalwa.\" Umbhalo obhalelwe uhlobo okungasaphinde kube semodeli uyagcinwa futhi ubhalwe ohlwini lwethi \"Umbhalo wezinhlobo ezingasaphinde zibe semodeli\". Ukushintsha uhlobo jikelele lube yisakhiwo esithile, bheka Amathuluzi odonga (Shintsha uhlobo).","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"stairs-and-railings","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Izinyathelo nezirelingi","summary":"Dweba izinyathelo eziqondile, ezingu-L, ezingu-U nezigoqayo ezilinganisa ukuphakama kwazo nezinyathelo kusuka ekuphakameni phakathi kwezitezi, nezinsimbi zokubamba namabhodlela, nokusikwa kwesikhala sesitezi esitezini esingaphezulu; dweba amarelingi ezinhlangothini zamaphaneli nasezungeze izimbobo.","section":"tasks","order":23,"keywords":["isigoqo","isitebhisi esigoqayo","isitebhisi","izinyathelo","indiza yezinyathelo","ukuphakama kwenyathelo","inyathelo","ibhalansi","ugoqo","u-L","u-U","irelingi","irelingi lokubamba","irelingi lokuvikela","ukuvikela","ibhodlela","isigxobo","iposti","isikhala sesitezi","ikhanda","ideki","ibhalkoni"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"dweba-isitebhisi","text":"Dweba isitebhisi","level":2},{"id":"dweba-isitebhisi-esigoqayo","text":"Dweba isitebhisi esigoqayo","level":2},{"id":"indlela-izinyathelo-ezibalwa-ngayo","text":"Indlela izinyathelo ezibalwa ngayo","level":2},{"id":"shintsha-isitebhisi","text":"Shintsha isitebhisi","level":2},{"id":"isikhala-sesitezi","text":"Isikhala sesitezi","level":2},{"id":"dweba-irelingi","text":"Dweba irelingi","level":2},{"id":"dweba-ifenisi","text":"Dweba ifenisi","level":2},{"id":"okulondolozwayo","text":"Okulondolozwayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEngeza izinyathelo phakathi kwamazinga namarelingi lapho abantu bedinga khona. Isitebhisi siqamba izinyathelo zaso ngokwaso ngokuphakama phakathi kwamazinga, sihlale ngaphakathi kwemikhawulo ejwayelekile yokuhlala, sibeke amarelingi okubamba ezinhlangothini zaso ezivulekile, futhi sisike isikhala sesitezi esitezini esingaphezulu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dweba-isitebhisi\"\u003EDweba isitebhisi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEsitezini isitebhisi esiqala kuso, vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkwakhiwa\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha uhlobo — \u003Cstrong\u003EEqondile\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EL nebhalansi\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EU nebhalansi\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003EL nezinyathelo ezigoqayo\u003C/strong\u003E — ukuthi kuphi \u003Cstrong\u003Ekugoqa\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003Eububanzi\u003C/strong\u003E bayo, nokuthi \u003Cstrong\u003Eamarelingi okubamba\u003C/strong\u003E azoya kuphi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza lapho isitebhisi siqala khona: maphakathi nomphetho wangaphambili wenyathelo lokuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHambisa ukhesho ngendlela isitebhisi esiya ngayo phezulu; izinyathelo ziyalandela, nenombolo yezinyathelo ezinokuphakama nezinyathelo zokuhamba. Sibambelela ezindongeni nasezinyathelweni ezingu-15°; bamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze sihlale sisikwele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iqala kabusha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dweba-isitebhisi-esigoqayo\"\u003EDweba isitebhisi esigoqayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkwakhiwa\u003C/span\u003E, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/span\u003E, bese ukhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EIsigoqo\u003C/strong\u003E njengohlobo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESetha \u003Cstrong\u003EUkugoqa\u003C/strong\u003E, ukuthi kugoqa kanjani siya phezulu (kwesobunxele kuwukuphambene nowashi).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza maphakathi nesigxobo sawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza indlela inyathelo lokuqala elibheka ngayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESiqala ngobubanzi obungu-30&quot; (inyathelo, kusukela esigxobeni kuya ngaphandle), nesigxobo esingu-4½&quot;. Izinyathelo zibalwa ngokuphakama phakathi kwezitezi, zifike ku-9½&quot; ngokuzenzakalelayo. Izinyathelo zijule ngu-7½&quot; emgwaqweni wokuhamba, ngu-12&quot; kusuka esigxobeni. Irelingi lokubamba lisebenza ngaphandle.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuma-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzici\u003C/strong\u003E isitebhisi esigoqayo sengeza \u003Cstrong\u003EIsigxobo esiphakathi\u003C/strong\u003E, ububanzi baso. Inkambu ye-\u003Cstrong\u003EInyathelo\u003C/strong\u003E ilinganiswa emgwaqweni wokuhamba. Izinhlolo zaso ziyizinkomba ezibizwa ngokuthi okuzenzakalelayo kwezitebhisi ezigoqayo: ububanzi obuvulekile obungu-26&quot;, ukujula kwenyathelo emgwaqweni wokuhamba okungenani ngu-6¾&quot;, izinyathelo ezingeqi ku-9½&quot; kanye namarelingi okubamba angu-34&quot;–38&quot;. Azikona izibalo zobunjiniyela; umphathi wokwakha uyanquma.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"indlela-izinyathelo-ezibalwa-ngayo\"\u003EIndlela izinyathelo ezibalwa ngayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIbanga phakathi kwephansi lezinga nezinga elingaphezulu lihlukaniswa libe ukuphakama okulinganayo okungeqi ku-7¾&quot;, kanti inyathelo ngalinye lijule ngu-10&quot; (zombili lezi zingashintsha ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzici\u003C/strong\u003E). Ibhalansi ibalwa njengenyathelo elilodwa; izinyathelo ezigoqayo ziyizinyathelo ezintathu ezigoqwe ezungeze ikhona langaphakathi. Shintsha ukuphakama kwezinga, bese zonke izitebhisi esitezini salowo zibalwa kabusha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuphakama kwenyathelo nge-7¾&quot;, izinyathelo nge-10&quot;, ububanzi nge-36&quot;, ikhanda nge-6&#039;-8&quot;, nezinsimbi zokubamba ezingu-34&quot;–38&quot; kuyizinkomba ezizenzakalelayo ngemva kwekhodi evamile yokuhlala, hhayi ubunjiniyela. \u003Cstrong\u003EIzici\u003C/strong\u003E ibonisa ezihlangabezwayo; umphathi wokwakha unquma ukuthi yimuphi umthetho osebenza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shintsha-isitebhisi\"\u003EShintsha isitebhisi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha (chofoza kusona ku-plan noma ku-3D) bese ushintsha ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzici\u003C/strong\u003E: uhlobo nokugoqa kwaso, ububanzi, ukuphakama okuphezulu kwenyathelo, ukujula kwenyathelo, amarelingi okubamba nokuphakama kwawo, kanye ne-\u003Cstrong\u003ESika isitezi esingaphezulu\u003C/strong\u003E sesikhala sesitezi. Izinyathelo nokuphakama kwazo okuphele ngakho kubonakala ngaphansi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isikhala-sesitezi\"\u003EIsikhala sesitezi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma isitezi esingaphezulu sinofloro, isitebhisi siyisika lapho izinyathelo zingaba nekhanda elingaphansi kwe-6&#039;-8&quot;. Ukusikwa kuhamba nesitebhisi futhi kunyamalala uma isitebhisi sisusiwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dweba-irelingi\"\u003EDweba irelingi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkwakhiwa\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIrelingi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EIrelingi lokuvikela\u003C/strong\u003E (36&quot; ukuphakama) noma \u003Cstrong\u003EIrelingi lokubamba\u003C/strong\u003E nokuphakama kwalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza eduze komphetho — ideki, ibhalkoni, ozungeze isikhala sesitezi — bese uchofoza kabili noma ucindezele \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze uqede.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmarelingi athola amaposti emaphethelweni nasezikhonweni namabhodlela aneziqhephu ezingaphansi kwe-4&quot;. Khetha elilodwa ukuze ushintshe uhlobo lwalo, ukuphakama kwalo, noma ukuthi liqala kangakanani ngaphezu kwephansi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dweba-ifenisi\"\u003EDweba ifenisi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EIfenisi\u003C/strong\u003E kwithuluzi elifanayo lerelingi, setha ukuphakama kwayo (1800 mm ukuqala), chofoza eduze komugqa wefenisi bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIfenisi ithola isigxobo emaphethelweni nasezikhonweni, nesigxobo esingaphezu kwe-2.4 m phakathi kwazo. Ifenisi yamaphaneli inephaneli phakathi kwamaposti; ifenisi yamagxa inamagxa amabili. Lobu bukhulu bungokwesikhethi esivamile, hhayi isidingo sekhodi; imithetho yendawo ikhawulela ukuphakama kwefenisi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIyisakhi esisodwa emodelini (i-IfcRailing ebizwa ngokuthi Fence) enesethi yezici \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft_Fence\u003C/span\u003E: isitayela, ukuphakama, amaposti, amaphaneli, amagxa, amasango, ubude nendawo yephaneli. Isinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAyidwetshwe lapha: amasango (umkhiqizi kwi-CivilCraft uwahlela), izinti zefenisi, umhlaba (ifenisi imi phezu kwezinga), nokukhetha isigxobo esisodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulondolozwayo\"\u003EOkulondolozwayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsitebhisi silondolozwa njenge-IFC stair esakhiwe ngezinyathelo zamaflight (nokuphakama nobude bokuhamba kwazo), amabhalansi, izinyathelo ezigoqayo namarelingi okubamba; isikhala sesitezi siyimbobo kuslabhu yefloro esingaphezulu. Amarelingi alondolozwa njenge-IFC railings anobude bawo kanye nenani lamabhodlela namaposti.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Engeza izinyathelo phakathi kwamazinga namarelingi lapho abantu bedinga khona. Isitebhisi siqamba izinyathelo zaso ngokwaso ngokuphakama phakathi kwamazinga, sihlale ngaphakathi kwemikhawulo ejwayelekile yokuhlala, sibeke amarelingi okubamba ezinhlangothini zaso ezivulekile, futhi sisike isikhala sesitezi esitezini esingaphezulu. Dweba isitebhisi Esitezini isitebhisi esiqala kuso, vula Ukwakhiwa bese ukhetha Izinyathelo. Khetha uhlobo — Eqondile, L nebhalansi, U nebhalansi noma L nezinyathelo ezigoqayo — ukuthi kuphi kugoqa, ububanzi bayo, nokuthi amarelingi okubamba azoya kuphi. Chofoza lapho isitebhisi siqala khona: maphakathi nomphetho wangaphambili wenyathelo lokuqala. Hambisa ukhesho ngendlela isitebhisi esiya ngayo phezulu; izinyathelo ziyalandela, nenombolo yezinyathelo ezinokuphakama nezinyathelo zokuhamba. Sibambelela ezindongeni nasezinyathelweni ezingu-15°; bamba Shift ukuze sihlale sisikwele. Chofoza. Esc iqala kabusha. Dweba isitebhisi esigoqayo Vula Ukwakhiwa, khetha Izinyathelo, bese ukhetha Isigoqo njengohlobo. Setha Ukugoqa, ukuthi kugoqa kanjani siya phezulu (kwesobunxele kuwukuphambene nowashi). Chofoza maphakathi nesigxobo sawo. Chofoza indlela inyathelo lokuqala elibheka ngayo. Siqala ngobubanzi obungu-30\" (inyathelo, kusukela esigxobeni kuya ngaphandle), nesigxobo esingu-4½\". Izinyathelo zibalwa ngokuphakama phakathi kwezitezi, zifike ku-9½\" ngokuzenzakalelayo. Izinyathelo zijule ngu-7½\" emgwaqweni wokuhamba, ngu-12\" kusuka esigxobeni. Irelingi lokubamba lisebenza ngaphandle. Kuma-Izici isitebhisi esigoqayo sengeza Isigxobo esiphakathi, ububanzi baso. Inkambu ye-Inyathelo ilinganiswa emgwaqweni wokuhamba. Izinhlolo zaso ziyizinkomba ezibizwa ngokuthi okuzenzakalelayo kwezitebhisi ezigoqayo: ububanzi obuvulekile obungu-26\", ukujula kwenyathelo emgwaqweni wokuhamba okungenani ngu-6¾\", izinyathelo ezingeqi ku-9½\" kanye namarelingi okubamba angu-34\"–38\". Azikona izibalo zobunjiniyela; umphathi wokwakha uyanquma. Indlela izinyathelo ezibalwa ngayo Ibanga phakathi kwephansi lezinga nezinga elingaphezulu lihlukaniswa libe ukuphakama okulinganayo okungeqi ku-7¾\", kanti inyathelo ngalinye lijule ngu-10\" (zombili lezi zingashintsha ku-Izici). Ibhalansi ibalwa njengenyathelo elilodwa; izinyathelo ezigoqayo ziyizinyathelo ezintathu ezigoqwe ezungeze ikhona langaphakathi. Shintsha ukuphakama kwezinga, bese zonke izitebhisi esitezini salowo zibalwa kabusha. Ukuphakama kwenyathelo nge-7¾\", izinyathelo nge-10\", ububanzi nge-36\", ikhanda nge-6'-8\", nezinsimbi zokubamba ezingu-34\"–38\" kuyizinkomba ezizenzakalelayo ngemva kwekhodi evamile yokuhlala, hhayi ubunjiniyela. Izici ibonisa ezihlangabezwayo; umphathi wokwakha unquma ukuthi yimuphi umthetho osebenza. Shintsha isitebhisi Khetha (chofoza kusona ku-plan noma ku-3D) bese ushintsha ku-Izici: uhlobo nokugoqa kwaso, ububanzi, ukuphakama okuphezulu kwenyathelo, ukujula kwenyathelo, amarelingi okubamba nokuphakama kwawo, kanye ne-Sika isitezi esingaphezulu sesikhala sesitezi. Izinyathelo nokuphakama kwazo okuphele ngakho kubonakala ngaphansi. Isikhala sesitezi Uma isitezi esingaphezulu sinofloro, isitebhisi siyisika lapho izinyathelo zingaba nekhanda elingaphansi kwe-6'-8\". Ukusikwa kuhamba nesitebhisi futhi kunyamalala uma isitebhisi sisusiwe. Dweba irelingi Vula Ukwakhiwa bese ukhetha Irelingi. Khetha Irelingi lokuvikela (36\" ukuphakama) noma Irelingi lokubamba nokuphakama kwalo. Chofoza eduze komphetho — ideki, ibhalkoni, ozungeze isikhala sesitezi — bese uchofoza kabili noma ucindezele Enter ukuze uqede. Amarelingi athola amaposti emaphethelweni nasezikhonweni namabhodlela aneziqhephu ezingaphansi kwe-4\". Khetha elilodwa ukuze ushintshe uhlobo lwalo, ukuphakama kwalo, noma ukuthi liqala kangakanani ngaphezu kwephansi. Dweba ifenisi Khetha Ifenisi kwithuluzi elifanayo lerelingi, setha ukuphakama kwayo (1800 mm ukuqala), chofoza eduze komugqa wefenisi bese ucindezela Enter. Ifenisi ithola isigxobo emaphethelweni nasezikhonweni, nesigxobo esingaphezu kwe-2.4 m phakathi kwazo. Ifenisi yamaphaneli inephaneli phakathi kwamaposti; ifenisi yamagxa inamagxa amabili. Lobu bukhulu bungokwesikhethi esivamile, hhayi isidingo sekhodi; imithetho yendawo ikhawulela ukuphakama kwefenisi. Iyisakhi esisodwa emodelini (i-IfcRailing ebizwa ngokuthi Fence) enesethi yezici CadCraft_Fence: isitayela, ukuphakama, amaposti, amaphaneli, amagxa, amasango, ubude nendawo yephaneli. Isinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Ayidwetshwe lapha: amasango (umkhiqizi kwi-CivilCraft uwahlela), izinti zefenisi, umhlaba (ifenisi imi phezu kwezinga), nokukhetha isigxobo esisodwa. Okulondolozwayo Isitebhisi silondolozwa njenge-IFC stair esakhiwe ngezinyathelo zamaflight (nokuphakama nobude bokuhamba kwazo), amabhalansi, izinyathelo ezigoqayo namarelingi okubamba; isikhala sesitezi siyimbobo kuslabhu yefloro esingaphezulu. Amarelingi alondolozwa njenge-IFC railings anobude bawo kanye nenani lamabhodlela namaposti.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"model-tree","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Thola indlela yakho ngomuthi wemodeli","summary":"Hlola imodeli ye-IFC ngephrojekthi, isayithi, isakhiwo, izitezi nendawo, nezinto zayo ziqoqwe ngohlobo; faka amabhokisi ukuze ubonise nokufihle, chofoza umugqa ukhethe, chofoza kabili ukuze usondele.","section":"tasks","order":23,"keywords":["umuthi wemodeli","umuthi","isakhiwo","isakhiwo sendawo","isiphequluli","umhlahlandlela","izitezi","izinga","ifulowa","indawo","igumbi","iqembu","uhlobo","fihla","bonisa","khetha","sondeza"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukubone","text":"Okufanele ukubone","level":2},{"id":"okhiye","text":"Okhiye","level":2},{"id":"amaphutha-ajwayelekile","text":"Amaphutha ajwayelekile","level":2},{"id":"okulandelayo","text":"Okulandelayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBona ukuthi imodeli yakhiwe kanjani, ufinyelele noma yiyiphi into ngaphandle kokuyifuna ku-3D: isakhiwo, izitezi zaso, izindawo ezisezitezini ngayinye, nezinto ezisendaweni, eziqoqwe ngohlobo (izindonga, iminyango, amaslebhu…).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula imodeli ye-IFC. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmuthi wemodeli\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesobunxele uvula kuze kube sezitezini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza umcibisholo oseduze komugqa ukuze uwuvule noma uwuvale. Isitezi sibamba izindawo zaso kuqala, bese izinto zaso ngohlobo nenani lazo. Into eyakhiwe ngezingxenye, njengesitebhisi, ibamba izingxenye zayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESusa ibhokisi lomugqa ukuze ufihle konke okuphakathi kwawo; faka ukuze ubuyisele. Ibhokisi elinodashi lisho ukuthi kubonakala okuthile kuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza igama lomugqa ukukhetha okumelwa yiwo: into eyodwa, noma zonke izinto eqenjini, esitezini noma endaweni. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+chofoza ukwengeza ekukhetheni, noma ukususa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza inkinobho \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003Ei\u003C/span\u003E eseduze kwesitezi, indawo noma isakhiwo ukuze ubone izici zaso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza kabili umugqa ukuze usondele kuwo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukubone\"\u003EOkufanele ukubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma ukhetha into ku-3D view, umuthi uvuleka kuyo uyiphawule.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinto ezifihliwe zishaywe ngomugqa. Amabhokisi womuthi kanye ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"H\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"I\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift H\"\u003E⇧H\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+H\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) asebenza ndawonye: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\"\u003EFihla, hlukanisa futhi ubone ngaphandle kwezinto\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinto imodeli engazibeki esitezini ngalinye zisendaweni yeqembu ekugcineni, \u003Cstrong\u003EAkusesakhiweni sendawo\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIqembu elide likhombisa imigqa engu-200 ngesikhathi; chofoza \u003Cstrong\u003EBonisa okwengeziwe\u003C/strong\u003E ngaphansi kwalo ukuze uthole eyengeziwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okhiye\"\u003EOkhiye\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgegama lomugqa eligxilile: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↑\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↓\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayahamba, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ivula, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ivala noma iphakamisa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E imaka ibhokisi, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ikhetha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amaphutha-ajwayelekile\"\u003EAmaphutha ajwayelekile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbhokisi lesitezi limakiwe kodwa akukho okubonakalayo.\u003C/strong\u003E Uhlu lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzitezi\u003C/span\u003E oluphansi komuthi luvala izitezi ngokwalo: maka nalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmugqa awukhethi lutho.\u003C/strong\u003E Eminye imigqa, njengendawo engenalutho, ayinazinto ezingadwetshwa; umugqa wesimo uyatshela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulandelayo\"\u003EOkulandelayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/edit-elements\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/edit-elements\"\u003ESusa, sika, kopisha namathisela izinto zesakhiwo\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/storeys-and-spaces\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/storeys-and-spaces\"\u003EBonisa nofihle izitezi, izindawo nemiphetho\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Bona ukuthi imodeli yakhiwe kanjani, ufinyelele noma yiyiphi into ngaphandle kokuyifuna ku-3D: isakhiwo, izitezi zaso, izindawo ezisezitezini ngayinye, nezinto ezisendaweni, eziqoqwe ngohlobo (izindonga, iminyango, amaslebhu…). Izinyathelo Vula imodeli ye-IFC. Umuthi wemodeli ngakwesobunxele uvula kuze kube sezitezini. Chofoza umcibisholo oseduze komugqa ukuze uwuvule noma uwuvale. Isitezi sibamba izindawo zaso kuqala, bese izinto zaso ngohlobo nenani lazo. Into eyakhiwe ngezingxenye, njengesitebhisi, ibamba izingxenye zayo. Susa ibhokisi lomugqa ukuze ufihle konke okuphakathi kwawo; faka ukuze ubuyisele. Ibhokisi elinodashi lisho ukuthi kubonakala okuthile kuphela. Chofoza igama lomugqa ukukhetha okumelwa yiwo: into eyodwa, noma zonke izinto eqenjini, esitezini noma endaweni. Ctrl+chofoza ukwengeza ekukhetheni, noma ukususa. Chofoza inkinobho i eseduze kwesitezi, indawo noma isakhiwo ukuze ubone izici zaso. Chofoza kabili umugqa ukuze usondele kuwo. Okufanele ukubone Uma ukhetha into ku-3D view, umuthi uvuleka kuyo uyiphawule. Izinto ezifihliwe zishaywe ngomugqa. Amabhokisi womuthi kanye ne-Bonisa (H, I, Shift+H) asebenza ndawonye: bheka Fihla, hlukanisa futhi ubone ngaphandle kwezinto. Izinto imodeli engazibeki esitezini ngalinye zisendaweni yeqembu ekugcineni, Akusesakhiweni sendawo. Iqembu elide likhombisa imigqa engu-200 ngesikhathi; chofoza Bonisa okwengeziwe ngaphansi kwalo ukuze uthole eyengeziwe. Okhiye Ngegama lomugqa eligxilile: ↑ no-↓ ayahamba, → ivula, ← ivala noma iphakamisa, Space imaka ibhokisi, Enter ikhetha. Amaphutha ajwayelekile Ibhokisi lesitezi limakiwe kodwa akukho okubonakalayo. Uhlu lwe-Izitezi oluphansi komuthi luvala izitezi ngokwalo: maka nalo. Umugqa awukhethi lutho. Eminye imigqa, njengendawo engenalutho, ayinazinto ezingadwetshwa; umugqa wesimo uyatshela. Okulandelayo Susa, sika, kopisha namathisela izinto zesakhiwo Bonisa nofihle izitezi, izindawo nemiphetho","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"framing","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Faka uhlaka lwezindonga, amaphansi nophahla","summary":"Khiqiza izitendi, amapuleti, izinkubo zokuvula, amajoyisi, amarafa noma amatrasi kumodeli bese uwagcina nayo; enziwa kabusha uma izindonga, izimbobo, amaphansi noma uphahla kushintsha, nohlu lwe-Lumber yisilinganiso sokusika.","section":"tasks","order":24,"keywords":["TJI","I-joist","ithebula lesikhala samajoyisi","layisha ithebula","uhlaka","isitendi","izitendi","ipuleti","ipuleti eliphezulu","ihedha","king stud","jack stud","trimmer","cripple","sill","blocking","ikhona","ikhona lase-California","tee","ijoyisi","rim joist","band joist","irafa","hip rafter","valley rafter","jack rafter","ridge board","ceiling joist","collar tie","itrasi","lumber","uhlu lokusika","board feet","2x4","2x6","ukuhlukana","on center"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"yakha","text":"Yakha","level":2},{"id":"okuzotholakala","text":"Okuzotholakala","level":2},{"id":"shintsha","text":"Shintsha","level":2},{"id":"amaphansi-e-tji-ngethebula-oyilayishayo","text":"Amaphansi e-TJI ngethebula oyilayishayo","level":2},{"id":"uhlu-lokusika","text":"Uhlu lokusika","level":2},{"id":"okugciniwe","text":"Okugciniwe","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAkha uhlaka lomakhiwo kusuka kokudwetshiwe. BimCraft ibeka izitendi, amapuleti nehedha ezindongeni, amajoyisi emaphansini namarafa (noma amatrasi) ophahleni, ibakhethe ngamathebula amanani ahlukile, ibagcina nemodeli futhi iwakha kabusha noma nini lapho okubakhayo kushintsha. \u003Cstrong\u003ELumber\u003C/strong\u003E ohlwini lulona luhlu lokusika.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yakha\"\u003EYakha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEsitezini, vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkwakhiwa\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlaka lokwakha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003Eukuhlukana\u003C/strong\u003E (16&quot; noma 24&quot; on center; 400 noma 600 mm), \u003Cstrong\u003Eamakhona\u003C/strong\u003E (izitendi ezintathu noma i-California), \u003Cstrong\u003EAmarafa\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003EAmatrasi\u003C/strong\u003E ophahleni, nokuthi izindonga zithola yini umugqa wokuvinjwa maphakathi nobude. Amaphansi khetha \u003Cstrong\u003EUkhuni olusikiwe\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003ETJI (ngokwesihlahla)\u003C/strong\u003E bese usetha ukuqondisa kwamajoyisi kube ngokuzenzekelayo, i-plan X, noma i-plan Y.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cstrong\u003EAkha wonke udonga\u003C/strong\u003E, noma chofoza udonga oluodwa, iphansi noma uphahla (esitezini uphahla oluhlala kulo) ukuze wakhe lowo kuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVala \u003Cstrong\u003EBonisa uhlaka\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze ufihle zonke izingcezu zohlaka, njengengqimba; \u003Cstrong\u003ESee through\u003C/strong\u003E ifihla izindonga, amaphansi noma uphahla oluhlakiwe ukuze ubone uhlaka lodwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzotholakala\"\u003EOkuzotholakala\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzindonga:\u003C/strong\u003E ipuleti eliphansi (lisikwe ezindaweni zezivalo), ipuleti eliphezulu eliphindwe kabili, izitendi ezilayini kusuka esiqalweni sodonga, ama-king stud nama-jack stud nehedha ngayo yonke imbobo nefasitele, ama-cripple phezu kwehedha nangaphansi kwamafasitele, i-sill engaphelele ngaphansi kwamafasitele, amakhona lapho izindonga zihlangana (udonga oludlula lunikeza izitendi zekhona), izitendi ezimbili zokusekela lapho enye indonga ihlangana khona, nokuvinjwa phakathi kwezitendi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmaphansi:\u003C/strong\u003E amajoyisi aphambene nendlela emfushane yephansi ngokuzenzekelayo, noma ecaleni kwe-axis yepulani oyikhethile; ama-rim joist azungeze umphetho, nama-trimmer nehedha aphindwe kabili azungeze isitezi, nama-joist adlula kuso asikwe amfushane (ama-tail joist). Imodi ye-TJI ikhetha uhlobo oluncane oluhlu nojulile olufinyelela isikhala esicacile esilinganiswe ngokuhlukana okukhethiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUphahla:\u003C/strong\u003E amarafa ajwayelekile asikwa ngesikwele kuyo yonke i-eave, ama-jack rafter lapho ama-hip namavalley esika khona, amarafa e-hip nevalley, amabhodi e-ridge, amajoyisi kasilingi ezipuletini nama-collar tie — noma amatrasi alula ekuhlukaneni, ingxenye eyodwa ngayinye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shintsha\"\u003EShintsha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha noma yiliphi uhlaka ku-3D view noma kumuthi wemodeli. Ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzici\u003C/strong\u003E kubonisa uhlaka lwayo: shintsha ukuhlukana, uhlobo lwamajoyisi aphansi nokuqondiswa, amakhona, ukuvinjwa noma uhlaka lophahla. Ukuhamba kwezindonga, izivalo nezifasitele, noma ukushintsha iphansi noma uphahla, kwenza uhlaka kabusha ngokwalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze ugcine ingxenye owayibeka ngamabomu uhlaka lapho lwenziwa kabusha, khetha kuyo bese ukhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EGcina le ngxenye lapho uhlaka lwenziwa kabusha\u003C/strong\u003E. Ingxenye egciniwe ihlala lapho ikhona; uma uhlaka oluyizungezile lushintsha, iphawulwa ukuze uhlole.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amaphansi-e-tji-ngethebula-oyilayishayo\"\u003EAmaphansi e-TJI ngethebula oyilayishayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBimCraft ayinawo amathebula wesikhala samajoyisi womenzi (ngoba ngabenzi, futhi aguqukela kokuhlobo ngakunye). Khetha uhlaka lwephansi, setha \u003Cstrong\u003EAmajoyisi aphansi\u003C/strong\u003E ku-\u003Cstrong\u003ETJI (ngokwesihlahla)\u003C/strong\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayisha ithebula…\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzici\u003C/strong\u003E: ifayela lefomethi \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft-tji-table\u003C/code\u003E, JSON noma CSV, owalenza kusuka kumathebula wesikhala amanje womenzi. Libiza umenzi, umkhiqizo nohlobo, nokuthi amanani avela kuphi, futhi libala kucala lomthwalo ngamunye (umthwalo ophilayo, umthwalo wesisindo, umkhawulo wokuphambuka, ubude bokuphatha) isikhala esikhulu esicacile somhlaka ngamunye nokujula ngakunye ngesikhala ngasinye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBimCraft ithatha \u003Cstrong\u003Eisikhala esicacile\u003C/strong\u003E sephansi, ikhethe ukujula okuncane kakhulu, phakathi kwalokho uhlu, olufinyelela kwesikhala esikhonjiswe ngesikhala nomthwalo okhethiwe, bese uhlaka liyafakwa ngalo. Uma isikhala noma isikhala esiphakathi singaphandle kwethebula, isho lokho futhi ayishintshi lutho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImithwalo, umkhawulo wokuphambuka, ubude bokuphatha, ithebula nemishwana ethi &quot;Isiqondiso sokuhlela sokuqala; ukukhethwa kokugcina kudinga amathebula womenzi nemithwalo yephrojekthi&quot; kubhalwa kwi-Lumber schedule, kubhalwa kwimodeli nohlaka, futhi kudwetshwa ohlwini lwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinkinga\u003C/strong\u003E njengesaziso. Ithebula elimaka njengesibonelo lisho lokho ngesexwayiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgenkathi i-add-on ye-\u003Cstrong\u003EBuilding regulations\u003C/strong\u003E ivulwe, umthetho wayo wamajoyisi aphansi nawo ufunda ithebula elilayishiwe; ngaphandle kwethebula amajoyisi e-TJI ahlala ngaphandle kwalowo mhlolo, njengakuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIthebula lihlala kule msebenzisi kuze kube yilapho ulisusa noma ulayisha elinye. Ifayela: \u003Ccode\u003Eformat\u003C/code\u003E (\u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft-tji-table\u003C/code\u003E), \u003Ccode\u003Eversion\u003C/code\u003E 1, \u003Ccode\u003Emanufacturer\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eproduct\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eedition\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Esource\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eunits\u003C/code\u003E (\u003Ccode\u003Eimperial\u003C/code\u003E: inches, feet, psf; noma \u003Ccode\u003Emetric\u003C/code\u003E: mm, metres, kPa), \u003Ccode\u003Ecases\u003C/code\u003E (\u003Ccode\u003Eid\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Elive\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Edead\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Edeflection\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ebearing\u003C/code\u003E) kanye \u003Ccode\u003Erows\u003C/code\u003E (\u003Ccode\u003Eseries\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Edepth\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Espans\u003C/code\u003E: ngalowo cala ngamunye, ukuhlukana nesikhala esikhulu esicacile, njengo \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;16&quot;: &quot;15-6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E). Ku-CSV, lezi zinto zifana kuzo \u003Ccode\u003E# key = value\u003C/code\u003E, bese \u003Ccode\u003Eseries,depth,case,spacing,span\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma kungalayishwanga ithebula, uhlelo lwe-TJI luyenqatshwa futhi akukho okushintsha: \u003Cstrong\u003ELayisha ithebula le-TJI: amathebula womenzi ngawabo futhi awakhiwe ngaphakathi.\u003C/strong\u003E Imodeli eyakhelwe ngethebula elakhelwe ngaphakathi le-TJI (ngaphambi kwalolu shintsho) igcina yonke amajoyisi ayo; Izici nezinkinga zithi ithebula liyadingeka, futhi iphansi lingakhiwa kabusha uma ulayisha elinye. Amajoyisi ensimbi ahlala njengakuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELokhu kuyisiqondiso sohlelo. Ukukhethwa kokugcina kwamajoyisi kudinga amathebula womenzi, imithwalo yephrojekthi nonjiniyela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uhlu-lokusika\"\u003EUhlu lokusika\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-\u003Cstrong\u003EIpaneli yezinhlu\u003C/strong\u003E khetha \u003Cstrong\u003ELumber\u003C/strong\u003E: yonke ingcezu yohlaka ihlelwe ngosayizi nangobude bemvelo ongawuthenga (izinde ezipheleleyo ze-2&#039; kusuka ku-8&#039;; izinyathelo ze-600 mm kusuka ku-2400 uma kumamilimitha), ngenani lezingcezu nama-board feet. \u003Cstrong\u003ECSV\u003C/strong\u003E iyilanda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUsayizi wehedha, wamajoyisi, wamarafa nowesilingi usuka kumathebula amanani ajwayelekile wendlu eyodwa noma ezimbili, hhayi ukuklama. \u003Cstrong\u003EIzici\u003C/strong\u003E zitshela lapho isikhala noma imbobo idlula ithebula laso. Umklami noma unjiniyela uhlola izikhala, imithwalo, nezixhumanisi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuhlelwa kwe-TJI kusebenzisa ithebula olilayishayo kuphela, olilungisayo kumathebula amanje womenzi; i-BimCraft ayinalo nelodwa. Lesi siphakamiso akihloli ukubamba, imithwalo yamaphoyinti, ama-cantilever, izimbobo, amahedha esitezi noma izixhumanisi, nesigaba se-I semodeli sisemgogodla.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okugciniwe\"\u003EOkugciniwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUhlaka ngalunye lodonga, iphansi noma uphahla kuyi-IFC element assembly (&quot;Framing&quot;) yezinto ze-IFC (izitendi, amapuleti, amarafa, ama-collar tie, ukuvinjwa, amatrasi) namabhimu (amahedha, amajoyisi, amarimu, amabhodi e-ridge), ngayinye inosayizi wayo, ubude nama-board feet.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Akha uhlaka lomakhiwo kusuka kokudwetshiwe. BimCraft ibeka izitendi, amapuleti nehedha ezindongeni, amajoyisi emaphansini namarafa (noma amatrasi) ophahleni, ibakhethe ngamathebula amanani ahlukile, ibagcina nemodeli futhi iwakha kabusha noma nini lapho okubakhayo kushintsha. Lumber ohlwini lulona luhlu lokusika. Yakha Esitezini, vula Ukwakhiwa bese ukhetha Uhlaka lokwakha. Khetha ukuhlukana (16\" noma 24\" on center; 400 noma 600 mm), amakhona (izitendi ezintathu noma i-California), Amarafa noma Amatrasi ophahleni, nokuthi izindonga zithola yini umugqa wokuvinjwa maphakathi nobude. Amaphansi khetha Ukhuni olusikiwe noma TJI (ngokwesihlahla) bese usetha ukuqondisa kwamajoyisi kube ngokuzenzekelayo, i-plan X, noma i-plan Y. Chofoza Akha wonke udonga, noma chofoza udonga oluodwa, iphansi noma uphahla (esitezini uphahla oluhlala kulo) ukuze wakhe lowo kuphela. Vala Bonisa uhlaka ukuze ufihle zonke izingcezu zohlaka, njengengqimba; See through ifihla izindonga, amaphansi noma uphahla oluhlakiwe ukuze ubone uhlaka lodwa. Okuzotholakala Izindonga: ipuleti eliphansi (lisikwe ezindaweni zezivalo), ipuleti eliphezulu eliphindwe kabili, izitendi ezilayini kusuka esiqalweni sodonga, ama-king stud nama-jack stud nehedha ngayo yonke imbobo nefasitele, ama-cripple phezu kwehedha nangaphansi kwamafasitele, i-sill engaphelele ngaphansi kwamafasitele, amakhona lapho izindonga zihlangana (udonga oludlula lunikeza izitendi zekhona), izitendi ezimbili zokusekela lapho enye indonga ihlangana khona, nokuvinjwa phakathi kwezitendi. Amaphansi: amajoyisi aphambene nendlela emfushane yephansi ngokuzenzekelayo, noma ecaleni kwe-axis yepulani oyikhethile; ama-rim joist azungeze umphetho, nama-trimmer nehedha aphindwe kabili azungeze isitezi, nama-joist adlula kuso asikwe amfushane (ama-tail joist). Imodi ye-TJI ikhetha uhlobo oluncane oluhlu nojulile olufinyelela isikhala esicacile esilinganiswe ngokuhlukana okukhethiwe. Uphahla: amarafa ajwayelekile asikwa ngesikwele kuyo yonke i-eave, ama-jack rafter lapho ama-hip namavalley esika khona, amarafa e-hip nevalley, amabhodi e-ridge, amajoyisi kasilingi ezipuletini nama-collar tie — noma amatrasi alula ekuhlukaneni, ingxenye eyodwa ngayinye. Shintsha Khetha noma yiliphi uhlaka ku-3D view noma kumuthi wemodeli. Ku-Izici kubonisa uhlaka lwayo: shintsha ukuhlukana, uhlobo lwamajoyisi aphansi nokuqondiswa, amakhona, ukuvinjwa noma uhlaka lophahla. Ukuhamba kwezindonga, izivalo nezifasitele, noma ukushintsha iphansi noma uphahla, kwenza uhlaka kabusha ngokwalo. Ukuze ugcine ingxenye owayibeka ngamabomu uhlaka lapho lwenziwa kabusha, khetha kuyo bese ukhetha Gcina le ngxenye lapho uhlaka lwenziwa kabusha. Ingxenye egciniwe ihlala lapho ikhona; uma uhlaka oluyizungezile lushintsha, iphawulwa ukuze uhlole. Amaphansi e-TJI ngethebula oyilayishayo BimCraft ayinawo amathebula wesikhala samajoyisi womenzi (ngoba ngabenzi, futhi aguqukela kokuhlobo ngakunye). Khetha uhlaka lwephansi, setha Amajoyisi aphansi ku-TJI (ngokwesihlahla) bese ukhetha Layisha ithebula… ku-Izici: ifayela lefomethi cadcraft-tji-table, JSON noma CSV, owalenza kusuka kumathebula wesikhala amanje womenzi. Libiza umenzi, umkhiqizo nohlobo, nokuthi amanani avela kuphi, futhi libala kucala lomthwalo ngamunye (umthwalo ophilayo, umthwalo wesisindo, umkhawulo wokuphambuka, ubude bokuphatha) isikhala esikhulu esicacile somhlaka ngamunye nokujula ngakunye ngesikhala ngasinye. BimCraft ithatha isikhala esicacile sephansi, ikhethe ukujula okuncane kakhulu, phakathi kwalokho uhlu, olufinyelela kwesikhala esikhonjiswe ngesikhala nomthwalo okhethiwe, bese uhlaka liyafakwa ngalo. Uma isikhala noma isikhala esiphakathi singaphandle kwethebula, isho lokho futhi ayishintshi lutho. Imithwalo, umkhawulo wokuphambuka, ubude bokuphatha, ithebula nemishwana ethi \"Isiqondiso sokuhlela sokuqala; ukukhethwa kokugcina kudinga amathebula womenzi nemithwalo yephrojekthi\" kubhalwa kwi-Lumber schedule, kubhalwa kwimodeli nohlaka, futhi kudwetshwa ohlwini lwe-Izinkinga njengesaziso. Ithebula elimaka njengesibonelo lisho lokho ngesexwayiso. Ngenkathi i-add-on ye-Building regulations ivulwe, umthetho wayo wamajoyisi aphansi nawo ufunda ithebula elilayishiwe; ngaphandle kwethebula amajoyisi e-TJI ahlala ngaphandle kwalowo mhlolo, njengakuqala. Ithebula lihlala kule msebenzisi kuze kube yilapho ulisusa noma ulayisha elinye. Ifayela: format (cadcraft-tji-table), version 1, manufacturer, product, edition, source, units (imperial: inches, feet, psf; noma metric: mm, metres, kPa), cases (id, live, dead, deflection, bearing) kanye rows (series, depth, spans: ngalowo cala ngamunye, ukuhlukana nesikhala esikhulu esicacile, njengo \"16\": \"15-6\"). Ku-CSV, lezi zinto zifana kuzo # key = value, bese series,depth,case,spacing,span. Uma kungalayishwanga ithebula, uhlelo lwe-TJI luyenqatshwa futhi akukho okushintsha: Layisha ithebula le-TJI: amathebula womenzi ngawabo futhi awakhiwe ngaphakathi. Imodeli eyakhelwe ngethebula elakhelwe ngaphakathi le-TJI (ngaphambi kwalolu shintsho) igcina yonke amajoyisi ayo; Izici nezinkinga zithi ithebula liyadingeka, futhi iphansi lingakhiwa kabusha uma ulayisha elinye. Amajoyisi ensimbi ahlala njengakuqala. Lokhu kuyisiqondiso sohlelo. Ukukhethwa kokugcina kwamajoyisi kudinga amathebula womenzi, imithwalo yephrojekthi nonjiniyela. Uhlu lokusika Ku-Ipaneli yezinhlu khetha Lumber: yonke ingcezu yohlaka ihlelwe ngosayizi nangobude bemvelo ongawuthenga (izinde ezipheleleyo ze-2' kusuka ku-8'; izinyathelo ze-600 mm kusuka ku-2400 uma kumamilimitha), ngenani lezingcezu nama-board feet. CSV iyilanda. Usayizi wehedha, wamajoyisi, wamarafa nowesilingi usuka kumathebula amanani ajwayelekile wendlu eyodwa noma ezimbili, hhayi ukuklama. Izici zitshela lapho isikhala noma imbobo idlula ithebula laso. Umklami noma unjiniyela uhlola izikhala, imithwalo, nezixhumanisi. Ukuhlelwa kwe-TJI kusebenzisa ithebula olilayishayo kuphela, olilungisayo kumathebula amanje womenzi; i-BimCraft ayinalo nelodwa. Lesi siphakamiso akihloli ukubamba, imithwalo yamaphoyinti, ama-cantilever, izimbobo, amahedha esitezi noma izixhumanisi, nesigaba se-I semodeli sisemgogodla. Okugciniwe Uhlaka ngalunye lodonga, iphansi noma uphahla kuyi-IFC element assembly (\"Framing\") yezinto ze-IFC (izitendi, amapuleti, amarafa, ama-collar tie, ukuvinjwa, amatrasi) namabhimu (amahedha, amajoyisi, amarimu, amabhodi e-ridge), ngayinye inosayizi wayo, ubude nama-board feet.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"hide-and-isolate","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Fihla, hlukanisa futhi ubone ngokusobala izinto","summary":"Khetha izinto eziningi, uzifihle, ubonise zona kuphela, noma ubonise zona ngokusobala nakokunye konke, bese ubuyisela konke.","section":"tasks","order":24,"keywords":["fihla","hlukanisa","ngokusobala","okusobala","ghost","x-ray","bonisa konke","veza futhi","khetha okuningi","ukukhetha okuningi","ctrl click","shift click","ukubonakala"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukubone","text":"Okufanele ukubone","level":2},{"id":"amaphutha-ajwayelekile","text":"Amaphutha ajwayelekile","level":2},{"id":"okulandelayo","text":"Okulandelayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESula umbono ufike kulokho obukela kuwo: fihla izinto ezikuvimbayo, bonisa ezikhethile kuphela, noma gcina konke okunye kusekuboneni njengomugqa oyisithunzi ukuze usazi lapho ukhona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula imodeli ye-IFC. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/open-ifc-model\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/open-ifc-model\"\u003EVula imodeli ye-IFC ubheke ngo-3D\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza into ukuze uyikhethe. Ukuze ukhethe eminye, bamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bese uchofoza ngayinye. Ukuchofoza into ekhethiwe ngalendlela iyayisusa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow\u003C/span\u003E kumbhalo wamathuluzi bese ukhetha okufanele ukwenziwe, noma cindezela ukhiye waso:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHide\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"H\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) ifihla izinto ezikhethiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsolate\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"I\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) ibonisa izinto ezikhethiwe kuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESee-through\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"T\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) ibonisa izinto ezikhethiwe njengoba zinjalo, nakho konke okunye ngokusobala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow all\u003C/span\u003E kumenyu efanayo, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift H\"\u003E⇧H\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+H\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ukuze ubonise zonke izinto futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuze usike konke okuzungeze izinto ezikhethiwe esikhundleni salokho, chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESection box round the pick\u003C/span\u003E kumenyu efanayo, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift X\"\u003E⇧X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/section-plane\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/section-plane\"\u003ESika imodeli ye-IFC ngomkhawulo wesigaba\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukubone\"\u003EOkufanele ukubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma kukhethwe izinto eziningi, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E ibala ukuthi zingaki futhi ziziluhla ngohlobo. Chofoza enye yodwa ukuze ubone izici zayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinto ezifihliwe azikwazi ukukhethwa: ukuchofoza kufinyelela lokho okungemuva kwazo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinto ezibonakala ngokusobala nazo azikwazi ukukhethwa, ngakho ungachofoza uye ngqo ngodonga uye kokuhlukanisile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImiphetho ifihlwa nento yayo, futhi ibe yisithunzi nayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkufihla, ukuhlukanisa nokubona ngokusobala kuhlala njengoba kunjalo uma uhlela, wengeza into ethonjeni noma usika imodeli ngomkhawulo wesigaba. Ukuvula enye imodeli kubonisa konke futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amaphutha-ajwayelekile\"\u003EAmaphutha ajwayelekile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinketho zemenyu azisebenzi (zifiphele).\u003C/strong\u003E Akukho okukhethiwe. Chofoza into kuqala; beka isikhombisi kunto ukuze ufunde ukuthi kungani ingenza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuhlukanisa kubonise udonga owawufihlile.\u003C/strong\u003E Ukuhlukanisa kubonisa kuphela okukhethile, kungakhathaliseki ukuthi kufihliwe yini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsitezi sonke sisweleka.\u003C/strong\u003E Lokho kuluhlu lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStoreys\u003C/span\u003E, hhayi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow all\u003C/span\u003E: faka itiki kusitezi futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulandelayo\"\u003EOkulandelayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/storeys-and-spaces\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/storeys-and-spaces\"\u003EBonisa nofihle izitezi, izindawo nemiphetho\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/section-plane\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/section-plane\"\u003ESika imodeli ye-IFC ngomkhawulo wesigaba\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Sula umbono ufike kulokho obukela kuwo: fihla izinto ezikuvimbayo, bonisa ezikhethile kuphela, noma gcina konke okunye kusekuboneni njengomugqa oyisithunzi ukuze usazi lapho ukhona. Izinyathelo Vula imodeli ye-IFC. Bona Vula imodeli ye-IFC ubheke ngo-3D. Chofoza into ukuze uyikhethe. Ukuze ukhethe eminye, bamba Ctrl noma Shift bese uchofoza ngayinye. Ukuchofoza into ekhethiwe ngalendlela iyayisusa. Vula Show kumbhalo wamathuluzi bese ukhetha okufanele ukwenziwe, noma cindezela ukhiye waso: Hide (H) ifihla izinto ezikhethiwe. Isolate (I) ibonisa izinto ezikhethiwe kuphela. See-through (T) ibonisa izinto ezikhethiwe njengoba zinjalo, nakho konke okunye ngokusobala. Chofoza Show all kumenyu efanayo, noma cindezela Shift+H, ukuze ubonise zonke izinto futhi. Ukuze usike konke okuzungeze izinto ezikhethiwe esikhundleni salokho, chofoza Section box round the pick kumenyu efanayo, noma cindezela Shift+X. Bona Sika imodeli ye-IFC ngomkhawulo wesigaba. Okufanele ukubone Uma kukhethwe izinto eziningi, Properties ibala ukuthi zingaki futhi ziziluhla ngohlobo. Chofoza enye yodwa ukuze ubone izici zayo. Izinto ezifihliwe azikwazi ukukhethwa: ukuchofoza kufinyelela lokho okungemuva kwazo. Izinto ezibonakala ngokusobala nazo azikwazi ukukhethwa, ngakho ungachofoza uye ngqo ngodonga uye kokuhlukanisile. Imiphetho ifihlwa nento yayo, futhi ibe yisithunzi nayo. Ukufihla, ukuhlukanisa nokubona ngokusobala kuhlala njengoba kunjalo uma uhlela, wengeza into ethonjeni noma usika imodeli ngomkhawulo wesigaba. Ukuvula enye imodeli kubonisa konke futhi. Amaphutha ajwayelekile Izinketho zemenyu azisebenzi (zifiphele). Akukho okukhethiwe. Chofoza into kuqala; beka isikhombisi kunto ukuze ufunde ukuthi kungani ingenza. Ukuhlukanisa kubonise udonga owawufihlile. Ukuhlukanisa kubonisa kuphela okukhethile, kungakhathaliseki ukuthi kufihliwe yini. Isitezi sonke sisweleka. Lokho kuluhlu lwe-Storeys, hhayi Show all: faka itiki kusitezi futhi. Okulandelayo Bonisa nofihle izitezi, izindawo nemiphetho Sika imodeli ye-IFC ngomkhawulo wesigaba","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"section-plane","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Sika imodeli ye-IFC ngendiza yesigaba","summary":"Sika imodeli ye-3D kusuka phezulu, ngaphambili noma ngohlangothi, noma gcina kuphela lokho okungaphakathi kwebhokisi lesigaba noma kwevolumu yamabhokisi amaningi anezinhlangothi ezithambekile, ukuze ubone ngaphakathi; hambisa ukusika ngokudonsa noma ngokuthayipha, uyiphendule, bese ukhetha lokho ukusika okubonisa.","section":"tasks","order":25,"keywords":["isigaba","indiza yesigaba","ibhokisi lesigaba","amabanga","donsa","umkhawulo","ibhokisi lokukhetha","ibhokisi lokusika","sika","ukusikwa","ukusika","ipulani yokusika","ipulani yefloor","ukubukeka kohlangothi","ngaphakathi","indawo yangaphakathi","phendula","ukuhlukana","ivolumu yesigaba","isigaba esinezinyathelo","esinesimo se-L","ukuthambeka","ukusika okuthambekile","indiza ethambekile","indiza eyengeziwe"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"ibhokisi-lesigaba","text":"Ibhokisi lesigaba","level":2},{"id":"ivolumu-yamabhokisi-amaningi-izinhlangothi-ezithambekile-kanye-nezindiza-ezengeziwe","text":"Ivolumu yamabhokisi amaningi, izinhlangothi ezithambekile kanye nezindiza ezengeziwe","level":2},{"id":"isakhiwo-esiphendukile-endaweni-yaso","text":"Isakhiwo esiphendukile endaweni yaso","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukubone","text":"Okufanele ukubone","level":2},{"id":"izinkinga-ezivamile","text":"Izinkinga ezivamile","level":2},{"id":"okulandelayo","text":"Okulandelayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESika imodeli ye-IFC ngendiza eyodwa ukuze ubone ngaphakathi kwayo: kusuka phezulu ukuze uthole ipulani, noma ngaphambili noma ngohlangothi ukuze uthole isigaba esidlula esakhiweni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula imodeli ye-IFC. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/open-ifc-model\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/open-ifc-model\"\u003EVula imodeli ye-IFC uyibuke ku-3D\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsigaba\u003C/span\u003E ethuluzini, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Imodeli isikwa ngesigamu sobude bayo, kuvele ibha ngaphansi kwethuluzi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha lapho ozosika khona: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhezulu\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhambili\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlangothi\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhambili\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlangothi\u003C/span\u003E futhi ajikisa ukubuka ukuze kubonakale ukusika.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHambisa ukusika: donsa isilayidi esithi \u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuhlukana\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E, noma thayipha ibanga ngamamitha ebhokisini bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Ungathayipha namamilimitha, isibonelo \u003Ccode\u003E1200 mm\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhendula\u003C/span\u003E ukuze ugcine olunye uhlangothi lokusika.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza into esikweni ukuze ubone izakhiwo zayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EValiwe\u003C/span\u003E, chofoza futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsigaba\u003C/span\u003E, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze ususe ukusika.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ibhokisi-lesigaba\"\u003EIbhokisi lesigaba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbhokisi\u003C/span\u003E kubha efanayo ukuze ugcine kuphela lokho okungaphakathi kwebhokisi. Ngayinye yakwa-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EY\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E inezilayidi ezimbili: lapho ibhokisi liqala khona nalapho liphela khona, ngamamitha kusukela emphethweni wemodeli. Amanani abonakala eduze kwazo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbhokisi lizungeze okukhethiwe\u003C/span\u003E ifaka ibhokisi ezungeze izinto ozikhethile futhi isondeze kuzo. Ishiya i-300 mm ngakho zonke izinhlangothi; shintsha lokho ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › BimCraft › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo ezungeze okukhethiwe\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma izinto zikhethiwe, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbhokisi lesigaba elizungeze okukhethiwe\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift X\"\u003E⇧X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E yenza okufanayo ngesinyathelo esisodwa, ngisho nalapho kungekho sikwa esivuliwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzibambi\u003C/strong\u003E kwibhokisi zilihambisa ngesandla: donsa isikwele esiphakathi kwenhlangothi ukuze uhambise leyo nhlangothi, esiphakathi komphetho ukuze uhambise izinhlangothi ezimbili ezihlangana khona, noma esikhonweni ukuze uhambise ezintathu. Izilayidi ziyalandela. Ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhezulu\u003C/span\u003E ikhona lihambisa ibhokisi ku-plan, ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhambili\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlangothi\u003C/span\u003E ekubukekeni kohlangothi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImodeli yonke\u003C/span\u003E ivula ibhokisi ibe imodeli yonke futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhezulu\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhambili\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlangothi\u003C/span\u003E zibuyela kundiza eyodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ivolumu-yamabhokisi-amaningi-izinhlangothi-ezithambekile-kanye-nezindiza-ezengeziwe\"\u003EIvolumu yamabhokisi amaningi, izinhlangothi ezithambekile kanye nezindiza ezengeziwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIbhokisi akuvamile ukuba yisimo osidingayo: isigaba esinezinyathelo, iphiko elinesimo se-L, noma ukusika ngodonga olungaqondile kugridi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbhokisi\u003C/span\u003E, chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza ibhokisi\u003C/span\u003E. Ukusika manje kugcina lokho okungaphakathi kwanoma iyiphi yamabhokisi, ngakho amabhokisi amabili enza ivolumu enezinyathelo noma eneshepu le-L. Uhlu oluseduze lukhombisa ibhokisi ezilayidi zalo eziguqula (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbhokisi 1\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbhokisi 2\u003C/span\u003E…); \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa lebhokisi\u003C/span\u003E isusa elikhethiwe. Ivolumu ingaba namabhokisi angu-8 kuya kwangaphezulu kancane.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuthambeka nezindiza\u003C/span\u003E ukuze wakhe ibhokisi elikhethiwe:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUbuso\u003C/span\u003E bese uthayipha ukuthi lithambeka kangakanani ngakunoma iyiphi yezinhlangothi ezimbili, ngamadigri (kuze kube ngu-80). Ubuso bujikela phakathi kwabo; ezinye izinhlangothi zihlala lapho izilayidi zazibeke khona. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBekwe ngokuqondile\u003C/span\u003E ilibuyisela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza indiza\u003C/span\u003E isika ibhokisi ngenye indiza. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinhlangothi\u003C/span\u003E yindlela uhlangothi olusikiwe olubheke ngayo, ngamadigri kusukela ku-X kuya ku-Y; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuthambeka\u003C/span\u003E yindlela eyijikela phezulu ngayo (0 ngendiza eqondile, 90 ngendiza esezingeni); \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuhlukana\u003C/span\u003E yindlela indiza ekude ngayo nephakathi kwebhokisi, ngamamitha. × iyisusa. Ibhokisi linezindiza ezengeziwe ezingafika kwezi-6.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELapho ivolumu isika izinto eziqinile, izindawo ezisikiwe ziyagcwaliswa njengakuqala, nalapho amabhokisi amabili ehlangana esinyathelweni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma umugqa wangaphandle unyamalala futhi kungasali lutho, ukuthambeka noma izindiza zishiya lutho ngaphakathi kwaleyo bhokisi; ibha iyakutshela lokho. Buyisela ubuso emuva noma shintsha ukuhlukana kwendiza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isakhiwo-esiphendukile-endaweni-yaso\"\u003EIsakhiwo esiphendukile endaweni yaso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmamodeli amaningi abeka isakhiwo ngokuthambeka ezinhlelweni zefayela (inyawo yeqiniso, izixhumanisi ezabelanwayo). Lapho izindonga zigijima ngokuthambeka, isigaba esisha siqala siqondile kusakhiwo: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhambili\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlangothi\u003C/span\u003E nebhokisi zigijima ngezindonga zalo, futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESisesikwele nesakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E ebhalini yesigaba iyavulwa. Chofoza kuyo ukuze uthole ama-axis emodeli, futhi uphinde uchofoze ukuze ubuyele emuva (umugqa wesimo ukutshela ukuthi isakhiwo siphendukile kangakanani). Ngo-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzilungiselelo › BimCraft › Isakhiwo esiphendukile endaweni yaso › Njengoba sibekwe esizeni\u003C/strong\u003E, izigaba nokubuka kuqala ku-ama-axis emodeli. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/settings\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukubone\"\u003EOkufanele ukubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhezulu\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E igcina lokho okungaphansi kokusika, ngakho ubheka phansi ezigumbini. Ukuhlukana kulinganiswa kusukela ezansi kwemodeli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhambili\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E igcina lokho okungemuva kokusika, kubonwa kusuka phambili; \u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlangothi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E igcina lokho okungaphesheya kwakho, kubonwa ngohlangothi. Ukuhlukana kulinganiswa kusukela phambili noma ohlangothini lwemodeli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmugqa omncane onombala omncane ubonisa lapho indiza ikhona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELapho indiza isika udonga, ulwelwesi noma enye into eqinile, indawo esikiwe igcwaliswa ngombala omnyama, njengesigaba esidwetshiwe. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGcwalisa\u003C/span\u003E ebhalini iyavula ivale lokhu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIkhyubhu lokubuka ekhoneni elingezansi kwesokudla liphendula imodeli ukuze ubuke ukusika kunoma yisiphi uhlangothi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuchofoza kukhetha lokho okubonakalayo: okusikiwe akukwazi ukukhethwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinkinga-ezivamile\"\u003EIzinkinga ezivamile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkukho okushintshile.\u003C/strong\u003E Ukusika kungaba phezu kophahla noma ngaphandle kwemodeli. Hambisa isilayidi, noma thayipha ukuhlukana okuncane.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuhlukana kubuyile emuva.\u003C/strong\u003E Ibanga elidlula imodeli lihanjiswa lifike ekupheleni kwayo, futhi umugqa wesimo uyakutshela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsihloko (BCF) sibonisa ingxenye yevolumu yami kuphela.\u003C/strong\u003E Isihloko sigcina ibhokisi elilodwa elinezinhlangothi zalo ezithambekile nezindiza: ibhokisi lokuqala levolumu. Umugqa wesimo uyakutshela lapho wenza isihloko.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkusika kuyize.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGcwalisa\u003C/span\u003E ebhalini iyavaliwe: chofoza ukuze ugcwalise ubuso bokusika bodonga, amaphansi nezinye izinto eziqinile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkusika okugcwaliwe kubonakala kunamawele noma kukhubazekile.\u003C/strong\u003E Ukugcwaliswa kudinga izinto eziqinile ezivaliwe; into engavaliwe efayeleni (ishidi elilodwa, amaqabunga emithi) ishiywa ingagcwaliswanga kunokuba ipendwe phezu kwayo. Into eyakhiwe ngezingxenye ezinemibala ehlukene (uhlaka nengilazi yalo) iyagcwaliswa uma izingxenye zayo zihlangana.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbha yesigaba ikuphi?\u003C/strong\u003E Ihlala phezulu kwe-3D view esikayo: ingxenyeni ye-3D ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESplit\u003C/span\u003E, nangaphansi kwebha yomdwebo ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlan\u003C/span\u003E yodwa. Esibukweni esifushane iyashelela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulandelayo\"\u003EOkulandelayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/storeys-and-spaces\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/storeys-and-spaces\"\u003EBonisa futhi ufihle izitezi, izindawo nemiphetho\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/dwg-in-3d\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/dwg-in-3d\"\u003EBona umdwebo we-DWG noma we-DXF ngo-3D\u003C/a\u003E — imidwebo ye-3D inendiza yesigaba efanayo\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Sika imodeli ye-IFC ngendiza eyodwa ukuze ubone ngaphakathi kwayo: kusuka phezulu ukuze uthole ipulani, noma ngaphambili noma ngohlangothi ukuze uthole isigaba esidlula esakhiweni. Izinyathelo Vula imodeli ye-IFC. Bona Vula imodeli ye-IFC uyibuke ku-3D. Chofoza Isigaba ethuluzini, noma cindezela X. Imodeli isikwa ngesigamu sobude bayo, kuvele ibha ngaphansi kwethuluzi. Khetha lapho ozosika khona: Phezulu, Phambili noma Uhlangothi. Phambili no-Uhlangothi futhi ajikisa ukubuka ukuze kubonakale ukusika. Hambisa ukusika: donsa isilayidi esithi Ukuhlukana, noma thayipha ibanga ngamamitha ebhokisini bese ucindezela Enter. Ungathayipha namamilimitha, isibonelo 1200 mm. Chofoza Phendula ukuze ugcine olunye uhlangothi lokusika. Chofoza into esikweni ukuze ubone izakhiwo zayo. Chofoza Valiwe, chofoza futhi Isigaba, noma cindezela X ukuze ususe ukusika. Ibhokisi lesigaba Chofoza Ibhokisi kubha efanayo ukuze ugcine kuphela lokho okungaphakathi kwebhokisi. Ngayinye yakwa-X, Y no-Z inezilayidi ezimbili: lapho ibhokisi liqala khona nalapho liphela khona, ngamamitha kusukela emphethweni wemodeli. Amanani abonakala eduze kwazo. Ibhokisi lizungeze okukhethiwe ifaka ibhokisi ezungeze izinto ozikhethile futhi isondeze kuzo. Ishiya i-300 mm ngakho zonke izinhlangothi; shintsha lokho ku-Izilungiselelo › BimCraft › Indawo ezungeze okukhethiwe. Uma izinto zikhethiwe, Bonisa › Ibhokisi lesigaba elizungeze okukhethiwe noma Shift+X yenza okufanayo ngesinyathelo esisodwa, ngisho nalapho kungekho sikwa esivuliwe. Izibambi kwibhokisi zilihambisa ngesandla: donsa isikwele esiphakathi kwenhlangothi ukuze uhambise leyo nhlangothi, esiphakathi komphetho ukuze uhambise izinhlangothi ezimbili ezihlangana khona, noma esikhonweni ukuze uhambise ezintathu. Izilayidi ziyalandela. Ku-Phezulu ikhona lihambisa ibhokisi ku-plan, ku-Phambili noma Uhlangothi ekubukekeni kohlangothi. Imodeli yonke ivula ibhokisi ibe imodeli yonke futhi. Phezulu, Phambili noma Uhlangothi zibuyela kundiza eyodwa. Ivolumu yamabhokisi amaningi, izinhlangothi ezithambekile kanye nezindiza ezengeziwe Ibhokisi akuvamile ukuba yisimo osidingayo: isigaba esinezinyathelo, iphiko elinesimo se-L, noma ukusika ngodonga olungaqondile kugridi. Ku-Ibhokisi, chofoza Engeza ibhokisi. Ukusika manje kugcina lokho okungaphakathi kwanoma iyiphi yamabhokisi, ngakho amabhokisi amabili enza ivolumu enezinyathelo noma eneshepu le-L. Uhlu oluseduze lukhombisa ibhokisi ezilayidi zalo eziguqula (Ibhokisi 1, Ibhokisi 2…); Susa lebhokisi isusa elikhethiwe. Ivolumu ingaba namabhokisi angu-8 kuya kwangaphezulu kancane. Vula Ukuthambeka nezindiza ukuze wakhe ibhokisi elikhethiwe: Khetha Ubuso bese uthayipha ukuthi lithambeka kangakanani ngakunoma iyiphi yezinhlangothi ezimbili, ngamadigri (kuze kube ngu-80). Ubuso bujikela phakathi kwabo; ezinye izinhlangothi zihlala lapho izilayidi zazibeke khona. Bekwe ngokuqondile ilibuyisela. Engeza indiza isika ibhokisi ngenye indiza. Izinhlangothi yindlela uhlangothi olusikiwe olubheke ngayo, ngamadigri kusukela ku-X kuya ku-Y; Ukuthambeka yindlela eyijikela phezulu ngayo (0 ngendiza eqondile, 90 ngendiza esezingeni); Ukuhlukana yindlela indiza ekude ngayo nephakathi kwebhokisi, ngamamitha. × iyisusa. Ibhokisi linezindiza ezengeziwe ezingafika kwezi-6. Lapho ivolumu isika izinto eziqinile, izindawo ezisikiwe ziyagcwaliswa njengakuqala, nalapho amabhokisi amabili ehlangana esinyathelweni. Uma umugqa wangaphandle unyamalala futhi kungasali lutho, ukuthambeka noma izindiza zishiya lutho ngaphakathi kwaleyo bhokisi; ibha iyakutshela lokho. Buyisela ubuso emuva noma shintsha ukuhlukana kwendiza. Isakhiwo esiphendukile endaweni yaso Amamodeli amaningi abeka isakhiwo ngokuthambeka ezinhlelweni zefayela (inyawo yeqiniso, izixhumanisi ezabelanwayo). Lapho izindonga zigijima ngokuthambeka, isigaba esisha siqala siqondile kusakhiwo: Phambili, Uhlangothi nebhokisi zigijima ngezindonga zalo, futhi Sisesikwele nesakhiwo ebhalini yesigaba iyavulwa. Chofoza kuyo ukuze uthole ama-axis emodeli, futhi uphinde uchofoze ukuze ubuyele emuva (umugqa wesimo ukutshela ukuthi isakhiwo siphendukile kangakanani). Ngo-Izilungiselelo › BimCraft › Isakhiwo esiphendukile endaweni yaso › Njengoba sibekwe esizeni, izigaba nokubuka kuqala ku-ama-axis emodeli. Bona Izilungiselelo. Okufanele ukubone Phezulu igcina lokho okungaphansi kokusika, ngakho ubheka phansi ezigumbini. Ukuhlukana kulinganiswa kusukela ezansi kwemodeli. Phambili igcina lokho okungemuva kokusika, kubonwa kusuka phambili; Uhlangothi igcina lokho okungaphesheya kwakho, kubonwa ngohlangothi. Ukuhlukana kulinganiswa kusukela phambili noma ohlangothini lwemodeli. Umugqa omncane onombala omncane ubonisa lapho indiza ikhona. Lapho indiza isika udonga, ulwelwesi noma enye into eqinile, indawo esikiwe igcwaliswa ngombala omnyama, njengesigaba esidwetshiwe. Gcwalisa ebhalini iyavula ivale lokhu. Ikhyubhu lokubuka ekhoneni elingezansi kwesokudla liphendula imodeli ukuze ubuke ukusika kunoma yisiphi uhlangothi. Ukuchofoza kukhetha lokho okubonakalayo: okusikiwe akukwazi ukukhethwa. Izinkinga ezivamile Akukho okushintshile. Ukusika kungaba phezu kophahla noma ngaphandle kwemodeli. Hambisa isilayidi, noma thayipha ukuhlukana okuncane. Ukuhlukana kubuyile emuva. Ibanga elidlula imodeli lihanjiswa lifike ekupheleni kwayo, futhi umugqa wesimo uyakutshela. Isihloko (BCF) sibonisa ingxenye yevolumu yami kuphela. Isihloko sigcina ibhokisi elilodwa elinezinhlangothi zalo ezithambekile nezindiza: ibhokisi lokuqala levolumu. Umugqa wesimo uyakutshela lapho wenza isihloko. Ukusika kuyize. Gcwalisa ebhalini iyavaliwe: chofoza ukuze ugcwalise ubuso bokusika bodonga, amaphansi nezinye izinto eziqinile. Ukusika okugcwaliwe kubonakala kunamawele noma kukhubazekile. Ukugcwaliswa kudinga izinto eziqinile ezivaliwe; into engavaliwe efayeleni (ishidi elilodwa, amaqabunga emithi) ishiywa ingagcwaliswanga kunokuba ipendwe phezu kwayo. Into eyakhiwe ngezingxenye ezinemibala ehlukene (uhlaka nengilazi yalo) iyagcwaliswa uma izingxenye zayo zihlangana. Ibha yesigaba ikuphi? Ihlala phezulu kwe-3D view esikayo: ingxenyeni ye-3D ku-Split, nangaphansi kwebha yomdwebo ku-Plan yodwa. Esibukweni esifushane iyashelela. Okulandelayo Bonisa futhi ufihle izitezi, izindawo nemiphetho Bona umdwebo we-DWG noma we-DXF ngo-3D — imidwebo ye-3D inendiza yesigaba efanayo","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"terrain","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Umhlaba wesiza, isisekelo sesakhiwo nokufaka ipavumende","summary":"Letha umhlaba emodelini kusuka emaphointini okuhlola, amakhonthuwa, ukuskena kwe-LAS / LAZ, i-GeoTIFF, umphezulu we-LandXML (ka-CivilCraft) noma amaphuzu ambalwa wokuphakama; sika isisekelo sesakhiwo ngezimpendulo zaso nokumba / ukugcwalisa; faka imigwaqo yokungena, izindlela nezindawo zangaphandle phezu kwawo; uyinikeze ku-CivilCraft njenge-LandXML.","section":"tasks","order":25,"keywords":["umhlaba","isiza","ukuhlola","topography","amaphoyinti","PNEZD","amakhonthuwa","LAS","LAZ","LiDAR","GeoTIFF","DEM","ukuphakama","ukuphakama kwendawo","izinga","ukulinganisa","isisekelo","isisekelo sesakhiwo","ukumba","ukugcwalisa","ukwenza umhlaba","ukukhanya kwemini","ithambeka","umgwaqo wokungena","indlela yabahambi","ipatiyo","ukufaka ipavumende","LandXML","CivilCraft"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"letha-umhlaba","text":"Letha umhlaba","level":2},{"id":"isisekelo-sesakhiwo","text":"Isisekelo sesakhiwo","level":2},{"id":"imigwaqo-yokungena-izindlela-nezindawo-zangaphandle","text":"Imigwaqo yokungena, izindlela nezindawo zangaphandle","level":2},{"id":"izisekelo-zilandela-izinga","text":"Izisekelo zilandela izinga","level":2},{"id":"yinikeze-ku-civilcraft","text":"Yinikeze ku-CivilCraft","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-wazi","text":"Okufanele wazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBeka indlu endaweni yayo. Umhlaba uba yingxenye yemodeli: uboniswa ku-3D, usikwa ezigabeni nasekubukeni kohlangothi, namakhonthuwa ephlanini. Isisekelo sesakhiwo sisikwa ngaphansi kwendlu, imigwaqo yokungena nezindlela zabahambi ziyilandela, nezisekelo zehla nayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"letha-umhlaba\"\u003ELetha umhlaba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkwakhiwa\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmhlaba\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENoma:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EVula ifayela lokuhlola…\u003C/strong\u003E: amaphoyinti okuhlola (PNEZD, PENZD noma empumalanga, enyakatho nokuphakama kuphela; ahlukaniswe ngekhoma, ithebhu noma isikhala), amakhonthuwa ku-DXF noma DWG (imigqa eyi-polyline ngokuphakama kwayo, imigqa eyi-polyline ye-3D), ukuskena kwe-LAS noma LAZ (amaphoyinti omhlaba agcinwe, anciphisiwe abe cishe elilodwa ngesikwele samitha ngasinye), i-GeoTIFF noma igridi yokuphakama ye-ASCII, noma \u003Cstrong\u003Eumphezulu we-LandXML\u003C/strong\u003E njengalowo ukhishwa yi-CivilCraft (amaphoyinti nezinxantathu zawo ziyagcinwa; uma ifayela linamaphezulu amaningi, i-BimCraft iyabuza ukuthi yiyiphi umhlaba; izinyunithi zayo zivela kulo fayela). Khetha izinyunithi zefayela kuqala (i-LandXML ichaza zayo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENoma uthayipe \u003Cstrong\u003EUkuphakama kwendawo\u003C/strong\u003E (kusuka ephansi lalelizinga, ngakho \u003Ccode\u003E-1&#039;\u003C/code\u003E kuyinyawo eyodwa ngaphansi kwalo) bese uchofoza amaphoyinti ephlanini, ushintshe ukuphakama bese uchofoza ezinye, bese uchofoza \u003Cstrong\u003EYenza umhlaba\u003C/strong\u003E. Amaphoyinti amathathu ayanele ukuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzixhumanisi zokuhlola ezikude nemodeli (state plane, UTM) ziyahanjiswa zifike endlini, nokuphakama kusethwe ukuze umhlaba endlini ube cishe ngu-8&quot; ngaphansi kwephansi lokuqala. \u003Cstrong\u003EPhakamisa umhlaba\u003C/strong\u003E ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzici\u003C/strong\u003E iyalungisa lokho ngalo nanoma yisiphi isilinganiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isisekelo-sesakhiwo\"\u003EIsisekelo sesakhiwo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsisekelo sesakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESetha \u003Cstrong\u003EUmda\u003C/strong\u003E ozungeze indlu, ukuthi \u003Cstrong\u003Eisisekelo sihlala kangakanani ngaphansi kwephansi\u003C/strong\u003E (8&quot; ngaphansi kwesilabhu, ngaphezulu ngaphansi kwe-crawlspace) nezimpendulo \u003Cstrong\u003EIzimpendulo\u003C/strong\u003E eziya emhlabeni osele (\u003Ccode\u003E2:1\u003C/code\u003E = izinyawo ezimbili ngaphandle ngayo yonke inyawo ephakanyiswa noma yehliswa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza phakathi kwendlu bese uchofoza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmhlaba ulinganiswa ngaphansi kwendlu nakuze kube umda, bese uthambeka waya ezintabeni (ukumba) nasezansi ohlangothini oluphansi (ukugcwalisa) kuze kuhlangane nomhlaba okhona. \u003Cstrong\u003EIzici\u003C/strong\u003E zomhlaba nezesisekelo zinikeza amavolumu okumba nokugcwalisa. Hambisa izindonga, isisekelo siyalandela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imigwaqo-yokungena-izindlela-nezindawo-zangaphandle\"\u003EImigwaqo yokungena, izindlela nezindawo zangaphandle\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkufaka ipavumende\u003C/span\u003E, khetha \u003Cstrong\u003EIndlela yabahambi\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EUmgwaqo wokungena\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003EIpatiyo\u003C/strong\u003E, bese uchofoza amakhona. Chofoza ikhona lokuqala futhi, chofoza kabili noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze uqede. Ipavumende ilandela izinga eliqediwe; shintsha uhlobo lwayo noma ukujula kwayo ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzici\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izisekelo-zilandela-izinga\"\u003EIzisekelo zilandela izinga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELapho umhlaba usemodeli, izindonga zesisekelo nezisekelo zesikhala ngaphansi kwendlu ziwulandela. Ngaseduze kwazo zonke izindonga, isisekelo sihlala ngokujula kwaso ngaphansi komhlaba ongaphandle, sinyuke ngezinyathelo ezigcwele ezingu-8&quot; lapho umhlaba wehla (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/foundations\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/foundations\"\u003EIzisekelo ngaphansi kwezindonga\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yinikeze-ku-civilcraft\"\u003EYinikeze ku-CivilCraft\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EI-LandXML ye-CivilCraft\u003C/strong\u003E (kumugqa we-Umhlaba, noma ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzici\u003C/strong\u003E zomhlaba) ilanda umhlaba okhona nezinga eliqediwe njengefayela le-LandXML. Vula ku-CivilCraft ukuze uthole ukulinganisa umhlaba okuqotho, ukudonsa amanzi nemisebenzi yokumba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-wazi\"\u003EOkufanele wazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmhlaba udinga imodeli ye-IFC4, njengakho konke okwakhiwa okusha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmakhonthuwa abonakala ephlanini lezinga lomhlaba ngobude obusethwe ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzici\u003C/strong\u003E zomhlaba; wonke wesihlanu uba mkhulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmhlaba ugcinwa njengento ye-IFC yomhlaba (indawo evaliwe ehlukaniswe ngezinxantathu, ukuze izigaba ziyisike); isisekelo nepavumende zigcinwa nawo. Susa umhlaba ukuze uqale kabusha — isisekelo sawo nepavumende zihamba nawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Beka indlu endaweni yayo. Umhlaba uba yingxenye yemodeli: uboniswa ku-3D, usikwa ezigabeni nasekubukeni kohlangothi, namakhonthuwa ephlanini. Isisekelo sesakhiwo sisikwa ngaphansi kwendlu, imigwaqo yokungena nezindlela zabahambi ziyilandela, nezisekelo zehla nayo. Letha umhlaba Vula Ukwakhiwa bese ukhetha Umhlaba. Noma: Vula ifayela lokuhlola…: amaphoyinti okuhlola (PNEZD, PENZD noma empumalanga, enyakatho nokuphakama kuphela; ahlukaniswe ngekhoma, ithebhu noma isikhala), amakhonthuwa ku-DXF noma DWG (imigqa eyi-polyline ngokuphakama kwayo, imigqa eyi-polyline ye-3D), ukuskena kwe-LAS noma LAZ (amaphoyinti omhlaba agcinwe, anciphisiwe abe cishe elilodwa ngesikwele samitha ngasinye), i-GeoTIFF noma igridi yokuphakama ye-ASCII, noma umphezulu we-LandXML njengalowo ukhishwa yi-CivilCraft (amaphoyinti nezinxantathu zawo ziyagcinwa; uma ifayela linamaphezulu amaningi, i-BimCraft iyabuza ukuthi yiyiphi umhlaba; izinyunithi zayo zivela kulo fayela). Khetha izinyunithi zefayela kuqala (i-LandXML ichaza zayo). Noma uthayipe Ukuphakama kwendawo (kusuka ephansi lalelizinga, ngakho -1' kuyinyawo eyodwa ngaphansi kwalo) bese uchofoza amaphoyinti ephlanini, ushintshe ukuphakama bese uchofoza ezinye, bese uchofoza Yenza umhlaba. Amaphoyinti amathathu ayanele ukuqala. Izixhumanisi zokuhlola ezikude nemodeli (state plane, UTM) ziyahanjiswa zifike endlini, nokuphakama kusethwe ukuze umhlaba endlini ube cishe ngu-8\" ngaphansi kwephansi lokuqala. Phakamisa umhlaba ku-Izici iyalungisa lokho ngalo nanoma yisiphi isilinganiso. Isisekelo sesakhiwo Khetha Isisekelo sesakhiwo. Setha Umda ozungeze indlu, ukuthi isisekelo sihlala kangakanani ngaphansi kwephansi (8\" ngaphansi kwesilabhu, ngaphezulu ngaphansi kwe-crawlspace) nezimpendulo Izimpendulo eziya emhlabeni osele (2:1 = izinyawo ezimbili ngaphandle ngayo yonke inyawo ephakanyiswa noma yehliswa). Chofoza phakathi kwendlu bese uchofoza. Umhlaba ulinganiswa ngaphansi kwendlu nakuze kube umda, bese uthambeka waya ezintabeni (ukumba) nasezansi ohlangothini oluphansi (ukugcwalisa) kuze kuhlangane nomhlaba okhona. Izici zomhlaba nezesisekelo zinikeza amavolumu okumba nokugcwalisa. Hambisa izindonga, isisekelo siyalandela. Imigwaqo yokungena, izindlela nezindawo zangaphandle Khetha Ukufaka ipavumende, khetha Indlela yabahambi, Umgwaqo wokungena noma Ipatiyo, bese uchofoza amakhona. Chofoza ikhona lokuqala futhi, chofoza kabili noma cindezela Enter ukuze uqede. Ipavumende ilandela izinga eliqediwe; shintsha uhlobo lwayo noma ukujula kwayo ku-Izici. Izisekelo zilandela izinga Lapho umhlaba usemodeli, izindonga zesisekelo nezisekelo zesikhala ngaphansi kwendlu ziwulandela. Ngaseduze kwazo zonke izindonga, isisekelo sihlala ngokujula kwaso ngaphansi komhlaba ongaphandle, sinyuke ngezinyathelo ezigcwele ezingu-8\" lapho umhlaba wehla (bona Izisekelo ngaphansi kwezindonga). Yinikeze ku-CivilCraft I-LandXML ye-CivilCraft (kumugqa we-Umhlaba, noma ku-Izici zomhlaba) ilanda umhlaba okhona nezinga eliqediwe njengefayela le-LandXML. Vula ku-CivilCraft ukuze uthole ukulinganisa umhlaba okuqotho, ukudonsa amanzi nemisebenzi yokumba. Okufanele wazi Umhlaba udinga imodeli ye-IFC4, njengakho konke okwakhiwa okusha. Amakhonthuwa abonakala ephlanini lezinga lomhlaba ngobude obusethwe ku-Izici zomhlaba; wonke wesihlanu uba mkhulu. Umhlaba ugcinwa njengento ye-IFC yomhlaba (indawo evaliwe ehlukaniswe ngezinxantathu, ukuze izigaba ziyisike); isisekelo nepavumende zigcinwa nawo. Susa umhlaba ukuze uqale kabusha — isisekelo sawo nepavumende zihamba nawo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"color-by-property","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Dweba izinto ngesici","summary":"Dweba zonke izinto ngenani lesici esisodwa, njengeklasi, uhlobo, isitezi, impahla yokwakha, izinga lokumelana nomlilo noma izindleko; funda ithebula lemibala, chofoza inani ukuze ubonise lezo zinto kuphela, bese ugcina imibala njengesikimu ozosisebenzisa kwamanye amamodeli.","section":"tasks","order":26,"keywords":["umbala","color","colour","color by","legend","smart view","appearance","property","uhlobo","impahla yokwakha","fire rating","filter","isolate","theme","values","scheme","color scheme","save colors","reuse","team","json","swatch"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukubone","text":"Okufanele ukubone","level":2},{"id":"shintsha-imibala-ugcine-njengesikimu","text":"Shintsha imibala ugcine njengesikimu","level":2},{"id":"izinkinga-ezivamile","text":"Izinkinga ezivamile","level":2},{"id":"okulandelayo","text":"Okulandelayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBona ngokushesha ukuthi isici sisatshalaliswe kanjani kumodeli: yimaphi amadonga angaphandle, yimaphi amapahla okwakha asetshenziswa kuphi, yimaphi amazinto angenalo izinga lokumelana nomlilo. Yonke into ithola umbala wenani layo, nethebula liveza ukuthi umbala ngamunye usho ini nokuthi izinto eziningi kangakanani zinawo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula imodeli ye-IFC.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ithebhu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmbala\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesokudla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha isici ohlwini. Okokuqala kwaziwe ngakho konke okuyizinto (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIklasi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlobo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsitezi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImpahla yokwakha\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIgama\u003C/span\u003E…); okunye kuvela kumasethi ezici namasethi wamanani wemodeli, ngaphansi kwegama leseti. Inombolo ngemuva kwecici ngalinye yinani lezinto eziliphethe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFunda ithebula: umbala, inani, nokuthi izinto eziningi kangakanani zinalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza inani ukuze ubonise lezo zinto kuphela. Bamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bese uchofoza ukuze wengeze amanani amaningi. Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift H\"\u003E⇧H\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+H\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze ubonise konke futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EValiwe\u003C/span\u003E ukuze ubuyele emibaleni yemodeli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukubone\"\u003EOkufanele ukubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKufika kwamanani ayisikhombisa, ngalinye linombala walo, eliphindeka kakhulu kuqala. Amanani amaningi kunalokho ahlanganiswa abe umbala ogxilile ofanayo, adwetshwe njenge-\u003Cstrong\u003Eamanye amanani\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInani elinamanani amaningi ahlukene lihlukaniswa libe izinhlu eziyisithupha ezilinganayo, kusukela ekukhanyeni (phansi) kuya emnyameni (phezulu).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinto ezingenalo isici zingumbala ogwalayo okhanyayo, ohlwini oluthi \u003Cstrong\u003EAkukho nani\u003C/strong\u003E, ukuze izinto ezinemibala zibonakale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImibala iyashintsha uma kushintsha Iphepha neModeli, futhi ihlala uma uhlela imodeli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsici sohlobo sibalwa ezintweni zalolo hlobo lonke; uma into inenani layo elihlukile lalesi sici, inani layo liyanqoba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shintsha-imibala-ugcine-njengesikimu\"\u003EShintsha imibala ugcine njengesikimu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza i-swatch yenani ethebuleni ukuze ukhethe omunye umbala walo. Imodeli ipendwa kabusha ngokushesha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza isikimu\u003C/span\u003E ilanda imibala njengefayela elincane le-\u003Ccode\u003E.json\u003C/code\u003E elibizwa ngegama lesici, isibonelo \u003Ccode\u003EClass colors.json\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKwesinye imodeli, noma ekhompyutheni komunye ilungu leqembu, chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula isikimu…\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha lelo fayela. Yonke inani esikimini lithola umbala walo, ngakho ukuzinzile kwezinga lokumelana nomlilo noma uhlelo oluthile kuba umbala ofanayo kuyo yonke imodeli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInani esingelona esikimini lipendwa libe igrey futhi libhalwe njengelinganani &quot;akukho esikimini&quot;; amanani esikimini angekho kule modeli ahlala ohlwini ngo-0, ukuze ubone isikimu sonke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsikimu sigcina imibala yaso kuzo zombili izindikimba. Ukukhetha isici ohlwini kuqala kusuka emibaleni ezenzakalelayo futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinkinga-ezivamile\"\u003EIzinkinga ezivamile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Le modeli alinawo amanani …&quot;.\u003C/strong\u003E Isikimu salondolozwa ngesici le modeli ingasinaso (negama leseti lezici elehlukile, isibonelo). Vula isikimu esenziwe ngalolu hlobo lwemodeli, noma ukhethe isici ohlwini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsici asikho ohlwini.\u003C/strong\u003E Akukho nto emodelini enesimo esinalo. Izici zezitezi nezindawo ngokwazo azidwetshwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EYonke into inombala ofanayo.\u003C/strong\u003E Yonke into inenani elifanayo, noma ayinalo: bheka izinombolo zethebula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulandelayo\"\u003EOkulandelayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\"\u003EFihla, hlukanisa futhi ubone ngakho ezintweni\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/model-tree\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/model-tree\"\u003EThola indlela yakho ngomuthi wemodeli\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Bona ngokushesha ukuthi isici sisatshalaliswe kanjani kumodeli: yimaphi amadonga angaphandle, yimaphi amapahla okwakha asetshenziswa kuphi, yimaphi amazinto angenalo izinga lokumelana nomlilo. Yonke into ithola umbala wenani layo, nethebula liveza ukuthi umbala ngamunye usho ini nokuthi izinto eziningi kangakanani zinawo. Izinyathelo Vula imodeli ye-IFC. Chofoza ithebhu Umbala ngakwesokudla. Khetha isici ohlwini. Okokuqala kwaziwe ngakho konke okuyizinto (Iklasi, Uhlobo, Isitezi, Impahla yokwakha, Igama…); okunye kuvela kumasethi ezici namasethi wamanani wemodeli, ngaphansi kwegama leseti. Inombolo ngemuva kwecici ngalinye yinani lezinto eziliphethe. Funda ithebula: umbala, inani, nokuthi izinto eziningi kangakanani zinalo. Chofoza inani ukuze ubonise lezo zinto kuphela. Bamba Ctrl bese uchofoza ukuze wengeze amanani amaningi. Cindezela Shift+H ukuze ubonise konke futhi. Chofoza Valiwe ukuze ubuyele emibaleni yemodeli. Okufanele ukubone Kufika kwamanani ayisikhombisa, ngalinye linombala walo, eliphindeka kakhulu kuqala. Amanani amaningi kunalokho ahlanganiswa abe umbala ogxilile ofanayo, adwetshwe njenge-amanye amanani. Inani elinamanani amaningi ahlukene lihlukaniswa libe izinhlu eziyisithupha ezilinganayo, kusukela ekukhanyeni (phansi) kuya emnyameni (phezulu). Izinto ezingenalo isici zingumbala ogwalayo okhanyayo, ohlwini oluthi Akukho nani, ukuze izinto ezinemibala zibonakale. Imibala iyashintsha uma kushintsha Iphepha neModeli, futhi ihlala uma uhlela imodeli. Isici sohlobo sibalwa ezintweni zalolo hlobo lonke; uma into inenani layo elihlukile lalesi sici, inani layo liyanqoba. Shintsha imibala ugcine njengesikimu Chofoza i-swatch yenani ethebuleni ukuze ukhethe omunye umbala walo. Imodeli ipendwa kabusha ngokushesha. Londoloza isikimu ilanda imibala njengefayela elincane le-.json elibizwa ngegama lesici, isibonelo Class colors.json. Kwesinye imodeli, noma ekhompyutheni komunye ilungu leqembu, chofoza Vula isikimu… bese ukhetha lelo fayela. Yonke inani esikimini lithola umbala walo, ngakho ukuzinzile kwezinga lokumelana nomlilo noma uhlelo oluthile kuba umbala ofanayo kuyo yonke imodeli. Inani esingelona esikimini lipendwa libe igrey futhi libhalwe njengelinganani \"akukho esikimini\"; amanani esikimini angekho kule modeli ahlala ohlwini ngo-0, ukuze ubone isikimu sonke. Isikimu sigcina imibala yaso kuzo zombili izindikimba. Ukukhetha isici ohlwini kuqala kusuka emibaleni ezenzakalelayo futhi. Izinkinga ezivamile \"Le modeli alinawo amanani …\". Isikimu salondolozwa ngesici le modeli ingasinaso (negama leseti lezici elehlukile, isibonelo). Vula isikimu esenziwe ngalolu hlobo lwemodeli, noma ukhethe isici ohlwini. Isici asikho ohlwini. Akukho nto emodelini enesimo esinalo. Izici zezitezi nezindawo ngokwazo azidwetshwa. Yonke into inombala ofanayo. Yonke into inenani elifanayo, noma ayinalo: bheka izinombolo zethebula. Okulandelayo Fihla, hlukanisa futhi ubone ngakho ezintweni Thola indlela yakho ngomuthi wemodeli","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"sheets","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Ukubukeka kohlangothi, izigaba namashidi","summary":"Dweba imigqa yesigaba epulanini, bese uvula Amashidi ukuze uthole isethi elungele ukuphrintwa eyenziwe emodelini: amapulani amazinga ngamazinga, ukubukeka okune kohlangothi, izigaba zesakhiwo, amahlu, ukwakheka kodonga, namabhulokhi wesihloko nezikali, njenge-PDF eyodwa.","section":"tasks","order":26,"keywords":["amashidi","isethi yemidwebo","imidwebo yokwakha","phrinta","plot","pdf","ukubukeka kohlangothi","ukubukeka kohlangothi kwenyakatho","isigaba","isigaba sesakhiwo","umugqa wesigaba","sika","imigqa efihliwe","ibhulokhi lesihloko","inombolo yeshidi","isikali","iphepha","11x17","24x36","A3","A1","isethi yemvume"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"dweba-umugqa-wesigaba","text":"Dweba umugqa wesigaba","level":2},{"id":"vula-amashidi","text":"Vula amashidi","level":2},{"id":"amanothi-ajwayelekile-avela-esethini-yemithetho","text":"Amanothi ajwayelekile avela esethini yemithetho","level":2},{"id":"okusemashidini","text":"Okusemashidini","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYenza isethi yemidwebo kusuka emodelini: ipulani yesitezi ngasinye, ukubukeka okune kohlangothi (enyakatho, empumalanga, eningizimu nasentshonalanga), isigaba sesakhiwo kumugqa wesigaba ngamunye, amahlu eminyango, amawindi, amakamelo nezinkuni, nombukiso wohlaka lwendawo yodonga ngalunye oluhlaliswe. Isethi ilungiswa kabusha kusuka emodelini njalo lapho uyivula, ngakho ihambisana nakho konke okwakhile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dweba-umugqa-wesigaba\"\u003EDweba umugqa wesigaba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEsitezini, vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkwakhiwa\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmugqa wesigaba\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza lapho umugqa uqala khona nalapho uphela khona. Umugqa omncane esiphakathi kwawo ukhombisa uhlangothi lokusika olubukeka kulo: kwesobunxele komugqa, uhamba kusuka ekuchofozeni kokuqala kuya kokwesibili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmugqa ubonakala epulanini nezinhloko zawo nochungechunge lwawo (A, bese B, njalo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha umugqa ukuze uwushintshe ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzakhiwo\u003C/strong\u003E: uchungechunge lwawo, \u003Cstrong\u003EPhendula umbono\u003C/strong\u003E ukubuka ngakolunye uhlangothi, no-\u003Cstrong\u003EBheka kuze kube\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze umise ibanga oqondile ngemuva kokusika (0 ibonisa konke okungemuva kwawo). Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze uwususe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vula-amashidi\"\u003EVula amashidi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmashidi\u003C/span\u003E ebhalini yemodeli (eduze kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhrinta\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmashidi ohlwini ngakwesobunxele: \u003Cstrong\u003EA-101\u003C/strong\u003E nokunye kumapulani, \u003Cstrong\u003EA-201\u003C/strong\u003E wokubukeka kohlangothi, \u003Cstrong\u003EA-301\u003C/strong\u003E wezigaba, \u003Cstrong\u003EA-401\u003C/strong\u003E wamahlu, kanye \u003Cstrong\u003ES-101\u003C/strong\u003E wokwakheka kodonga. Chofoza elilodwa ukuze uliboneke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EIphepha\u003C/strong\u003E: Letter, Tabloid (11 × 17), Arch D (24 × 36), A3 noma A1. Iphepha ligcina igama lalo elijwayelekile, nosayizi walo ubhalwa ngama-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmayunithi\u003C/span\u003E okhethile, isibonelo \u003Cem\u003ELetter · 8.5 × 11 in\u003C/em\u003E noma \u003Cem\u003EA3 · 297 × 420 mm\u003C/em\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELanda isethi njenge-PDF\u003C/span\u003E: ikhasi elilodwa ngeshidi ngalinye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amanothi-ajwayelekile-avela-esethini-yemithetho\"\u003EAmanothi ajwayelekile avela esethini yemithetho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKushidi, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmanothi ajwayelekile\u003C/span\u003E ikuvumela ukuthi ubeke amanothi avela esethini yemithetho (ngomkhakha) ekholomini yesokudla yeshidi. Inothi ngalinye ligcina isethi nesigatshana okuvela kuso, futhi ishidi eliphrintiwe lithi lapho isethi ingaqinisekisiwe. Amanothi ayisisekelo nje: umuntu obhekele umdwebo unquma ukuthi athini. Adinga okwengeziwe kwemithetho yokwakha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okusemashidini\"\u003EOkusemashidini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmapulani\u003C/strong\u003E akhombisa udonga, iminyango, amawindi, amakamelo ngezindawo zawo, izilinganiso nemigqa yezigaba, ngesikali esikhulu esijwayelekile esilingana nawo: 1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot; noma esincane (1:50 noma esincane ngamamilimitha).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkubukeka kohlangothi\u003C/strong\u003E kudwetshwa emodelini ye-3D ngemigqa efihliwe esusiwe, ababili ngeshidi, bonke ngesikali esifanayo, nomugqa womhlaba ngaphansi kwabo. Uphahla, izisekelo nomhlaba kubonakala njengoba kwenziwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzigaba\u003C/strong\u003E zigcwalisa lokho okudlula kukho ukusika (izindonga, amaphansi, uphahla) futhi zidwebe okubonakala ngaphesheya kwakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkubukeka nezigaba kunamanothi azo:\u003C/strong\u003E ukumaka kwesinye nesinye isitezi ngegama nobude bakhe ngakwesokudla, ubude phakathi kwamazinga ngakwesobunxele, nokubukeka kohlangothi ububanzi besakhiwo ngaphansi kwabo nethegi (D1, W1) kunoma yimuphi umnyango nawo wonke amawindi odongeni oluhlangene nawe. Ngezindonga zegumbi ngalinye bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/interior-elevations\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/interior-elevations\"\u003EUkubukeka kwangaphakathi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmahlu\u003C/strong\u003E afana nalawo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlu\u003C/span\u003E ebhalini yemodeli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkwakheka\u003C/strong\u003E kukhombisa imisumpa, amapuleti, izinhloko nezinsimbi zezindonga ezakhiwe njengoba zibonakala ngaphandle, ukuze iqembu likwazi ukuzibeka phansi. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/framing\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/framing\"\u003EUkwakha udonga, amaphansi nophahla\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIshidi ngalinye linebhulokhi lesihloko elinenombolo yalo, isihloko salo, igama lefayela nosuku.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmashidi avela emodelini: ukuze ushintshe umdwebo, shintsha imodeli bese uvula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmashidi\u003C/span\u003E futhi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkubukeka nezigaba kubonisa imigqa nokugcwaliswa kuphela: izilinganiso, amamaki wamazinga nezinkomba phezu kwawo abikho okwamanje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Yenza isethi yemidwebo kusuka emodelini: ipulani yesitezi ngasinye, ukubukeka okune kohlangothi (enyakatho, empumalanga, eningizimu nasentshonalanga), isigaba sesakhiwo kumugqa wesigaba ngamunye, amahlu eminyango, amawindi, amakamelo nezinkuni, nombukiso wohlaka lwendawo yodonga ngalunye oluhlaliswe. Isethi ilungiswa kabusha kusuka emodelini njalo lapho uyivula, ngakho ihambisana nakho konke okwakhile. Dweba umugqa wesigaba Esitezini, vula Ukwakhiwa bese ukhetha Umugqa wesigaba. Chofoza lapho umugqa uqala khona nalapho uphela khona. Umugqa omncane esiphakathi kwawo ukhombisa uhlangothi lokusika olubukeka kulo: kwesobunxele komugqa, uhamba kusuka ekuchofozeni kokuqala kuya kokwesibili. Umugqa ubonakala epulanini nezinhloko zawo nochungechunge lwawo (A, bese B, njalo). Khetha umugqa ukuze uwushintshe ku-Izakhiwo: uchungechunge lwawo, Phendula umbono ukubuka ngakolunye uhlangothi, no-Bheka kuze kube ukuze umise ibanga oqondile ngemuva kokusika (0 ibonisa konke okungemuva kwawo). Cindezela Delete ukuze uwususe. Vula amashidi Chofoza Amashidi ebhalini yemodeli (eduze kwe-Phrinta). Amashidi ohlwini ngakwesobunxele: A-101 nokunye kumapulani, A-201 wokubukeka kohlangothi, A-301 wezigaba, A-401 wamahlu, kanye S-101 wokwakheka kodonga. Chofoza elilodwa ukuze uliboneke. Khetha Iphepha: Letter, Tabloid (11 × 17), Arch D (24 × 36), A3 noma A1. Iphepha ligcina igama lalo elijwayelekile, nosayizi walo ubhalwa ngama-Amayunithi okhethile, isibonelo Letter · 8.5 × 11 in noma A3 · 297 × 420 mm. Chofoza Landa isethi njenge-PDF: ikhasi elilodwa ngeshidi ngalinye. Amanothi ajwayelekile avela esethini yemithetho Kushidi, Amanothi ajwayelekile ikuvumela ukuthi ubeke amanothi avela esethini yemithetho (ngomkhakha) ekholomini yesokudla yeshidi. Inothi ngalinye ligcina isethi nesigatshana okuvela kuso, futhi ishidi eliphrintiwe lithi lapho isethi ingaqinisekisiwe. Amanothi ayisisekelo nje: umuntu obhekele umdwebo unquma ukuthi athini. Adinga okwengeziwe kwemithetho yokwakha. Okusemashidini Amapulani akhombisa udonga, iminyango, amawindi, amakamelo ngezindawo zawo, izilinganiso nemigqa yezigaba, ngesikali esikhulu esijwayelekile esilingana nawo: 1/4\" = 1'-0\" noma esincane (1:50 noma esincane ngamamilimitha). Ukubukeka kohlangothi kudwetshwa emodelini ye-3D ngemigqa efihliwe esusiwe, ababili ngeshidi, bonke ngesikali esifanayo, nomugqa womhlaba ngaphansi kwabo. Uphahla, izisekelo nomhlaba kubonakala njengoba kwenziwe. Izigaba zigcwalisa lokho okudlula kukho ukusika (izindonga, amaphansi, uphahla) futhi zidwebe okubonakala ngaphesheya kwakho. Ukubukeka nezigaba kunamanothi azo: ukumaka kwesinye nesinye isitezi ngegama nobude bakhe ngakwesokudla, ubude phakathi kwamazinga ngakwesobunxele, nokubukeka kohlangothi ububanzi besakhiwo ngaphansi kwabo nethegi (D1, W1) kunoma yimuphi umnyango nawo wonke amawindi odongeni oluhlangene nawe. Ngezindonga zegumbi ngalinye bona Ukubukeka kwangaphakathi. Amahlu afana nalawo Uhlu ebhalini yemodeli. Ukwakheka kukhombisa imisumpa, amapuleti, izinhloko nezinsimbi zezindonga ezakhiwe njengoba zibonakala ngaphandle, ukuze iqembu likwazi ukuzibeka phansi. Bona Ukwakha udonga, amaphansi nophahla. Ishidi ngalinye linebhulokhi lesihloko elinenombolo yalo, isihloko salo, igama lefayela nosuku. Amashidi avela emodelini: ukuze ushintshe umdwebo, shintsha imodeli bese uvula Amashidi futhi. Ukubukeka nezigaba kubonisa imigqa nokugcwaliswa kuphela: izilinganiso, amamaki wamazinga nezinkomba phezu kwawo abikho okwamanje.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"several-models","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Bona amamodeli e-IFC amaningi ndawonye","summary":"Engeza amafayela e-IFC amaningi esithombeni, njengezakhiwo, izakhiwo nezinsiza, uwabone endaweni eyodwa ngokuhlelwa okufanayo, uhambise elilodwa, ufihle elilodwa, futhi ukhethe elihlelwayo.","section":"tasks","order":27,"keywords":["federate","federation","imodeli exhunyiwe","amamodeli amaningi","amafayela amaningi","hlanganisa","ukuhlanganiswa","ukuhlelwa","isigaba","imodeli yezakhiwo","izinsiza","ukuhlukana","hambisa imodeli","imodeli esebenzayo","engeza imodeli"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"vula-amamodeli-ethimba","text":"Vula amamodeli ethimba","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukubone","text":"Okufanele ukubone","level":2},{"id":"izinkinga-ezivamile","text":"Izinkinga ezivamile","level":2},{"id":"okulandelayo","text":"Okulandelayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBheka amamodeli ahlukene endaweni eyodwa: imodeli yomklami wezakhiwo nemodeli yezakhiwo nezinsiza ikuyo. Lowo nalowo uhlala engufayela wakhe; i-BimCraft ibakhombisa ndawonye kuphela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula imodeli yokuqala ye-IFC njengoba ujwayelekile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmamodeli\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesobunxele, chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza imodeli…\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha ifayela le-IFC elilodwa noma amaningi. Ngalinye livela kuhlu nakumbono we-3D.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESusa ukukhetha imodeli ukuze uyifihle; yikhethe futhi ukuze uyibonise.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma imodeli ifika endaweni engafanele (ipoyinti lokuhlola elihlukile), chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwayo, thayipha ukuthi uyihambisa kangakanani ku-X, Y no-Z ngamamitha, bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESebenzisa\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImodeli enesichashazi yona oyihlelayo. Chofoza isichashazi semodeli enye ukuze uyihlele leyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza × eduze kwemodeli ukuze uyisuse esithombeni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vula-amamodeli-ethimba\"\u003EVula amamodeli ethimba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELapho imodeli evuliwe iyifayela elifu eprojekthini lethimba, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula amamodeli ethimba\u003C/span\u003E ivela ngaphansi kohlu. Ivula amanye amamodeli e-IFC eprojekthi ecaleni kwalo, ngalinye lihanjiswe ngokuhlukana okubekwe yiprojekthi. Amamodeli afihlwe kuwe ayahlala ngaphandle futhi abalwe; imodeli eshintshwe yiprojekthi ivulwa ingaphendulwanga futhi nayo ibalwe; amafayela angewona e-IFC (njenge-DWG, ngokwesibonelo) ayadlulwa futhi abizwe emugqeni wesimo. Imodeli esevele ivuliwe ayikaze ivulwe kabili. Inkinobho ifihlwa ngefayela elingekho eprojekthini lethimba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukubone\"\u003EOkufanele ukubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYonke imodeli ngokuhlelwa kwendawo yemodeli yokuqala, njengoba ifayela lazibeka. Amamodeli akhishwe ngaphansi kweprojekthi efanayo ahlelwa ngaphandle kokuhambisa lutho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkukhetha into yemodeli ongayihleli kubonisa izakhiwo zayo zifundeka kuphela, ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlela leyo modeli\u003C/span\u003E ukushintsha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmuthi wemodeli\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzitezi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmbala\u003C/span\u003E, uhlu lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinguquko\u003C/span\u003E, ukubeka izinto zemitapo kanye ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGcina njenge-IFC\u003C/span\u003E zonke zisebenza emodelini oyihlelayo. Ukufihla, ukuhlukanisa, ukubonisa ngaphakathi nokuthi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha konke\u003C/span\u003E kusebenza kuwo wonke amamodeli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGcina njenge-IFC\u003C/span\u003E ilanda imodeli oyihlelayo, nezinguquko zayo kuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinkinga-ezivamile\"\u003EIzinkinga ezivamile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImodeli ikude noma ayikho.\u003C/strong\u003E Ifayela layo lisebenzisa ezinye izixhumanisi. Sebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELwanele\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uyithole, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uyibeke endaweni yayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESusa noma Kopisha kuyagxilile enkeni okhethiwe.\u003C/strong\u003E Yeyomunye imodeli: shintshela kuyo kuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuvula ifayela ngo-Khetha ifayela kushintshe konke.\u003C/strong\u003E Lokho kuqala isithombe esisha. Sebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza imodeli…\u003C/span\u003E ukungeza amafayela esithombeni osinaso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulandelayo\"\u003EOkulandelayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\"\u003EFihla, hlukanisa futhi ubone ngaphakathi izinto\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/color-by-property\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/color-by-property\"\u003ENikeza izinto umbala ngesici\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Bheka amamodeli ahlukene endaweni eyodwa: imodeli yomklami wezakhiwo nemodeli yezakhiwo nezinsiza ikuyo. Lowo nalowo uhlala engufayela wakhe; i-BimCraft ibakhombisa ndawonye kuphela. Izinyathelo Vula imodeli yokuqala ye-IFC njengoba ujwayelekile. Ku-Amamodeli ngakwesobunxele, chofoza Engeza imodeli… bese ukhetha ifayela le-IFC elilodwa noma amaningi. Ngalinye livela kuhlu nakumbono we-3D. Susa ukukhetha imodeli ukuze uyifihle; yikhethe futhi ukuze uyibonise. Uma imodeli ifika endaweni engafanele (ipoyinti lokuhlola elihlukile), chofoza Hambisa ngaphansi kwayo, thayipha ukuthi uyihambisa kangakanani ku-X, Y no-Z ngamamitha, bese uchofoza Sebenzisa. Imodeli enesichashazi yona oyihlelayo. Chofoza isichashazi semodeli enye ukuze uyihlele leyo. Chofoza × eduze kwemodeli ukuze uyisuse esithombeni. Vula amamodeli ethimba Lapho imodeli evuliwe iyifayela elifu eprojekthini lethimba, Vula amamodeli ethimba ivela ngaphansi kohlu. Ivula amanye amamodeli e-IFC eprojekthi ecaleni kwalo, ngalinye lihanjiswe ngokuhlukana okubekwe yiprojekthi. Amamodeli afihlwe kuwe ayahlala ngaphandle futhi abalwe; imodeli eshintshwe yiprojekthi ivulwa ingaphendulwanga futhi nayo ibalwe; amafayela angewona e-IFC (njenge-DWG, ngokwesibonelo) ayadlulwa futhi abizwe emugqeni wesimo. Imodeli esevele ivuliwe ayikaze ivulwe kabili. Inkinobho ifihlwa ngefayela elingekho eprojekthini lethimba. Okufanele ukubone Yonke imodeli ngokuhlelwa kwendawo yemodeli yokuqala, njengoba ifayela lazibeka. Amamodeli akhishwe ngaphansi kweprojekthi efanayo ahlelwa ngaphandle kokuhambisa lutho. Ukukhetha into yemodeli ongayihleli kubonisa izakhiwo zayo zifundeka kuphela, ne-Hlela leyo modeli ukushintsha. Umuthi wemodeli, Izitezi, Umbala, uhlu lwe-Izinguquko, ukubeka izinto zemitapo kanye ne-Gcina njenge-IFC zonke zisebenza emodelini oyihlelayo. Ukufihla, ukuhlukanisa, ukubonisa ngaphakathi nokuthi Khetha konke kusebenza kuwo wonke amamodeli. Gcina njenge-IFC ilanda imodeli oyihlelayo, nezinguquko zayo kuphela. Izinkinga ezivamile Imodeli ikude noma ayikho. Ifayela layo lisebenzisa ezinye izixhumanisi. Sebenzisa Lwanele ukuze uyithole, bese Hambisa ukuze uyibeke endaweni yayo. Susa noma Kopisha kuyagxilile enkeni okhethiwe. Yeyomunye imodeli: shintshela kuyo kuqala. Ukuvula ifayela ngo-Khetha ifayela kushintshe konke. Lokho kuqala isithombe esisha. Sebenzisa Engeza imodeli… ukungeza amafayela esithombeni osinaso. Okulandelayo Fihla, hlukanisa futhi ubone ngaphakathi izinto Nikeza izinto umbala ngesici","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"point-clouds","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Bonisa ifu lamaphoyinti ecaleni kwemodeli","summary":"Vula ukuskena ngelaser (LAS, LAZ, E57, PLY, PCD, PTX, PTS noma XYZ) ku-view ye-3D wedwa noma nemodeli ye-IFC, unikeze umbala, usike isilayisi esincane kuso, ulinganise kumaphoyinti walo, bese uwunikeza isofthiwe yokudweba ukuze uwulandele ngemigqa yesakhiwo esakhiwe.","section":"tasks","order":27,"keywords":["ifu lamaphoyinti","ukuskena ngelaser","ukuskena","lidar","las","laz","e57","ply","pcd","ptx","xyz","pts","njengoba kwakhiwe","as built","ukuhlola","ukuhlanganisa","isilayisi","ukusika kwepulani","snap","linganisa","landela","ukuskena kuya ku-bim"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenziwa","text":"Okuzokwenziwa","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"lapho-kuya-khona-ifu","text":"Lapho kuya khona ifu","level":2},{"id":"landela-imigqa-njengoba-kwakhiwe","text":"Landela imigqa njengoba kwakhiwe","level":2},{"id":"amaphoyinti-angaki","text":"Amaphoyinti angaki","level":2},{"id":"ukuskena-okuningi","text":"Ukuskena okuningi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenziwa\"\u003EOkuzokwenziwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBheka ukuskena ngelaser kwesakhiwo ecaleni kwemodeli yaso: hlola ukuthi okwakhiwe kuyahambisana yini nomklamo, linganisa phakathi kwamaphoyinti askeniwe, bese usika isilayisi esincane ukuze ufunde izindonga, izivalo nezinsika kuso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula ifu: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIvulekile\u003C/span\u003E ifayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.las\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.laz\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.e57\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.ply\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.pcd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.ptx\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.pts\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E.xyz\u003C/code\u003E, noma liwishe ekhasini (bheka isihloko sefomethi zamafu amaphoyinti ukuze uthole okuletha ngayinye, nokuthi yini okufanele uyithumele kusofthiwe womkhiqizi womshini). Uma kukhona imodeli evulekile, ifu lijoyina imodeli ku-view ye-3D; ukuvula ifu akuvaleli imodeli noma izinguquko ezingakalondolozwa. Uma kungekho modeli, ifu livula lodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIbha yefu ivela ngaphansi kwethuluzi. Ikhombisa ukuthi amaphoyinti angaki abonakala nokuthi ifayela linawo angaki.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmbala ngokwe\u003C/span\u003E: imibala yefayela (uma umskena wayigcina), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuphakama\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmandla okukhanya\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIklasi\u003C/span\u003E (amakilasi e-LiDAR afana nomhlaba, izitshalo nesakhiwo) noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmbala owodwa\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUsayizi\u003C/span\u003E wenza amaphoyinti abe makhulu noma amancane.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIpulani\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkusika\u003C/span\u003E ukuze ugcine ibhendi elincane kuphela eli-1.2 m ngaphezulu kwephoyinti eliphansi kakhulu, libonwa phezulu: izindonga, izimbobo zezitofu nezinsika zifunda njengepulani yesakhiwo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhambili\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlangothi\u003C/span\u003E zisika amabhendi amile wezinhlelo nezigaba. Hambisa ibhendi nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgo\u003C/span\u003E, bese ushintsha i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkujiya\u003C/span\u003E (ngamamitha). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EValiwe\u003C/span\u003E ibonisa ifu lonke futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinganisa\u003C/span\u003E kwithuluzi. Isikhombi sibamba amaphoyinti afu (ilebula ithi &quot;ifu lamaphoyinti&quot;), ukuze ulinganise kusuka odongeni kuya kudonga kusilayisi, noma kusuka kwisinto semodeli kuya kuskeni. Ikhona yemodeli (ikhoni noma umphetho) eseduze iyanqoba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinganisa\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo\u003C/span\u003E, iphoyinti lefu linikeza i-latitude nolongitude yalo kusuka kuhlelo lokugonya lwefu lalo, uma ifayela lisho lona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFihla\u003C/span\u003E ifihla ifu okwesikhashana; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa\u003C/span\u003Eliyisusa ngokuphelele. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfu lamaphoyinti\u003C/span\u003E ifihla noma ibonise ibha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lapho-kuya-khona-ifu\"\u003ELapho kuya khona ifu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMisa\u003C/span\u003E ebhange ichaza ukuthi ifu lihambisana kanjani nemodeli:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzixhumanisi zemodeli\u003C/strong\u003E: izinombolo zefu ziyizinombolo zemodeli (ukuskena okuhlelwe ngezixhumanisi zomklamo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzixhumanisi zemephu\u003C/strong\u003E: imodeli inokuguqulwa kwemephu (IfcMapConversion) nefu lisesistimini efanayo ye-projected: ifu limiswa ngayo. Uma kokubili kubiza izinhlelo ezahlukene, umugqa wesimo uyasho lokho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIgxile kumodeli\u003C/strong\u003E: lapho kokubili kungafaki ifu eduze nemodeli, phakathi kwalo kubekwa phakathi kwemodeli, nephoyinti lalo eliphansi kumgangatho wemodeli. Khetha esinye isinqumo ukuze ushintshe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma ifayela lingasho amayunithi alo, i-BimCraft ifunda ngamamitha futhi inikeza i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmayunithi\u003C/span\u003E ebhandeni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"landela-imigqa-njengoba-kwakhiwe\"\u003ELandela imigqa njengoba kwakhiwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELandelela ku-CadCraft\u003C/span\u003E ukuze unikeze ifu uhlelo lokudweba ethebhu entsha. Livula khona ngaphansi komdwebo, lapho isilayisi sepulani nesinamathelo sento sikuvumela ukuthi udwebe izindonga phezu koskeni. Bheka isihloko se-CadCraft mayelana namafu amaphoyinti.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amaphoyinti-angaki\"\u003EAmaphoyinti angaki\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuskena kungaba namaphoyinti ayizinkulungwane zezigidi. I-BimCraft ifunda iphoyinti ngalinye kanye bese igcina isabelo esilinganayo kuwo ukuze idwebe: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa\u003C/span\u003E ebhange isetha ukuthi mangaki (1, 2, 5 noma 10 izigidi). Amaphoyinti amaningi adinga inkumbulo eyengeziwe nekhadi lezithombe elisheshayo. Izibalo zeklasi ngayinye ze-LiDAR zingazo zonke amaphoyinti afayeleni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmafayela ayafundwa kukhompyutha yakho; akulayishwa muhla. LAS 1.0–1.4 kanye ne-LAZ kuyafundwa (amafayela e-LAZ kuya ku-1 GB, abanjwe enkumbulweni ngenkathi efundwa); amafayela e-E57 kuya kumaphoyinti ayizigidi ezi-6 nama-512 MB njengamanje (ukuskena okukhulu: thumela i-LAS noma i-LAZ); i-PLY, i-PCD ne-PTX ngokugcwele; amafu ombhalo ayi-\u003Ccode\u003Ex y z\u003C/code\u003E, nemibala (\u003Ccode\u003Er g b\u003C/code\u003E) namakholomu wamandla okukhanya uma ekhona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuskena-okuningi\"\u003EUkuskena okuningi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuskena okwenziwe ngezindawo ezahlukene kungahlanganiswa kube yifreyimu eyodwa, kuthuthukiswe nge-ICP bese kuthunyelwa njenge-LAS noma i-E57 eyodwa: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/register-scans\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/register-scans\"\u003EHlanganisa ukuskena okuningi kube kunye\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenziwa Bheka ukuskena ngelaser kwesakhiwo ecaleni kwemodeli yaso: hlola ukuthi okwakhiwe kuyahambisana yini nomklamo, linganisa phakathi kwamaphoyinti askeniwe, bese usika isilayisi esincane ukuze ufunde izindonga, izivalo nezinsika kuso. Izinyathelo Vula ifu: Ivulekile ifayela le-.las, .laz, .e57, .ply, .pcd, .ptx, .pts noma .xyz, noma liwishe ekhasini (bheka isihloko sefomethi zamafu amaphoyinti ukuze uthole okuletha ngayinye, nokuthi yini okufanele uyithumele kusofthiwe womkhiqizi womshini). Uma kukhona imodeli evulekile, ifu lijoyina imodeli ku-view ye-3D; ukuvula ifu akuvaleli imodeli noma izinguquko ezingakalondolozwa. Uma kungekho modeli, ifu livula lodwa. Ibha yefu ivela ngaphansi kwethuluzi. Ikhombisa ukuthi amaphoyinti angaki abonakala nokuthi ifayela linawo angaki. Khetha Umbala ngokwe: imibala yefayela (uma umskena wayigcina), Ukuphakama, Amandla okukhanya, Iklasi (amakilasi e-LiDAR afana nomhlaba, izitshalo nesakhiwo) noma Umbala owodwa. Usayizi wenza amaphoyinti abe makhulu noma amancane. Chofoza Ipulani ngaphansi kwe-Ukusika ukuze ugcine ibhendi elincane kuphela eli-1.2 m ngaphezulu kwephoyinti eliphansi kakhulu, libonwa phezulu: izindonga, izimbobo zezitofu nezinsika zifunda njengepulani yesakhiwo. Phambili no-Uhlangothi zisika amabhendi amile wezinhlelo nezigaba. Hambisa ibhendi nge-Ngo, bese ushintsha i-Ukujiya (ngamamitha). Valiwe ibonisa ifu lonke futhi. Chofoza Linganisa kwithuluzi. Isikhombi sibamba amaphoyinti afu (ilebula ithi \"ifu lamaphoyinti\"), ukuze ulinganise kusuka odongeni kuya kudonga kusilayisi, noma kusuka kwisinto semodeli kuya kuskeni. Ikhona yemodeli (ikhoni noma umphetho) eseduze iyanqoba. Nge-Linganisa › Indawo, iphoyinti lefu linikeza i-latitude nolongitude yalo kusuka kuhlelo lokugonya lwefu lalo, uma ifayela lisho lona. Fihla ifihla ifu okwesikhashana; Susaliyisusa ngokuphelele. Bonisa › Ifu lamaphoyinti ifihla noma ibonise ibha. Lapho kuya khona ifu Misa ebhange ichaza ukuthi ifu lihambisana kanjani nemodeli: Izixhumanisi zemodeli: izinombolo zefu ziyizinombolo zemodeli (ukuskena okuhlelwe ngezixhumanisi zomklamo). Izixhumanisi zemephu: imodeli inokuguqulwa kwemephu (IfcMapConversion) nefu lisesistimini efanayo ye-projected: ifu limiswa ngayo. Uma kokubili kubiza izinhlelo ezahlukene, umugqa wesimo uyasho lokho. Igxile kumodeli: lapho kokubili kungafaki ifu eduze nemodeli, phakathi kwalo kubekwa phakathi kwemodeli, nephoyinti lalo eliphansi kumgangatho wemodeli. Khetha esinye isinqumo ukuze ushintshe. Uma ifayela lingasho amayunithi alo, i-BimCraft ifunda ngamamitha futhi inikeza i-Amayunithi ebhandeni. Landela imigqa njengoba kwakhiwe Chofoza Landelela ku-CadCraft ukuze unikeze ifu uhlelo lokudweba ethebhu entsha. Livula khona ngaphansi komdwebo, lapho isilayisi sepulani nesinamathelo sento sikuvumela ukuthi udwebe izindonga phezu koskeni. Bheka isihloko se-CadCraft mayelana namafu amaphoyinti. Amaphoyinti angaki Ukuskena kungaba namaphoyinti ayizinkulungwane zezigidi. I-BimCraft ifunda iphoyinti ngalinye kanye bese igcina isabelo esilinganayo kuwo ukuze idwebe: Bonisa ebhange isetha ukuthi mangaki (1, 2, 5 noma 10 izigidi). Amaphoyinti amaningi adinga inkumbulo eyengeziwe nekhadi lezithombe elisheshayo. Izibalo zeklasi ngayinye ze-LiDAR zingazo zonke amaphoyinti afayeleni. Amafayela ayafundwa kukhompyutha yakho; akulayishwa muhla. LAS 1.0–1.4 kanye ne-LAZ kuyafundwa (amafayela e-LAZ kuya ku-1 GB, abanjwe enkumbulweni ngenkathi efundwa); amafayela e-E57 kuya kumaphoyinti ayizigidi ezi-6 nama-512 MB njengamanje (ukuskena okukhulu: thumela i-LAS noma i-LAZ); i-PLY, i-PCD ne-PTX ngokugcwele; amafu ombhalo ayi-x y z, nemibala (r g b) namakholomu wamandla okukhanya uma ekhona. Ukuskena okuningi Ukuskena okwenziwe ngezindawo ezahlukene kungahlanganiswa kube yifreyimu eyodwa, kuthuthukiswe nge-ICP bese kuthunyelwa njenge-LAS noma i-E57 eyodwa: bheka Hlanganisa ukuskena okuningi kube kunye.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"annotation-sizes","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Dweba ngosayizi ogcwele, chaza ngesikali","summary":"Isakhiwo sihlala sidwetshwa ngosayizi ogcwele. Umbhalo, izilinganiso, amathegi, amagama amagumbi, amabhamuza egridi nezimpawu zilinganiswa ephepheni, ngamamilimitha njengoba zishicilelwe, futhi zigcina lowo sayizi uma isikali sedwetshwe siguquka sisuka ku-1:100 siya ku-1:50.","section":"tasks","order":27,"keywords":["isikali sezichasiso","okuchazayo","usayizi wombhalo","ukuphakama kombhalo","ukuphakama kephepha","usayizi wombhalo wesilinganiso","usayizi wethegi","usayizi wegama legumbi","ibhamuza legridi","usayizi wesimpawu","isikali sedwetshwe","1:50","1:100","izinga lehhovisi","ukubhala","ukudweba ngo-1:1","ngosayizi ogcwele","umbhalo weshidi"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"indlela-esebenza-ngayo","text":"Indlela esebenza ngayo","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"ipulani-enesikali-sayo","text":"Ipulani enesikali sayo","level":2},{"id":"usayizi-wehhovisi-lakho","text":"Usayizi wehhovisi lakho","level":2},{"id":"usayizi-wephakheji-yemithetho","text":"Usayizi wephakheji yemithetho","level":2},{"id":"okuzokubona","text":"Okuzokubona","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukwazi","text":"Okufanele ukwazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESetha ukuthi amagama emidwebo yakho aphakama kangakanani ephepheni, kanye ngesakhiwo. Awulokothi ulinganise imodeli futhi awulokothi uguqule usayizi wombhalo ngesikali: i-BimCraft ibala usayizi ngokuphakama kephepha nesikali sedwetshwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"indlela-esebenza-ngayo\"\u003EIndlela esebenza ngayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImodeli isayizi ogcwele. Udonga olunobude be-10 m luyi-10 000 mm ubude kuzo zonke izikali.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuchazwa kunokuphakama \u003Cstrong\u003Ekwephepha\u003C/strong\u003E: ukuphakama kohlamvu olukhulu ekhasini elishicilelwe, ngamamilimitha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgesikali se-1:100 umbhalo ongu-2.5 mm uba ngu-250 mm ukuphakama emodelini; ku-1:50 uba ngu-125 mm. Ephepheni ungu-2.5 mm kokubili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzimpawu zepulani (zikagesi, zepayipi) zidwetshwa ngamamilimitha ephepheni futhi zilandela umthetho ofanayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula i-project browser. Ngaphansi kwesihloko \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESheets\u003C/span\u003E chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAnnotation sizes…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThayipha ukuphakama ngamamilimitha ezinhlobeni ofuna ukuzisetha: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENotes and labels\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDimension text\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETags and level names\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERoom names\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGrid bubble letters\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView titles on sheets\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESchedule text\u003C/span\u003E. Ibhokisi elingenalutho ligcina usayizi we-BimCraft, obonakala ngegrey.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave\u003C/span\u003E. Kuyisinyathelo esisodwa ongasihlehlisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZonke amashidi, isethi yokudweba, i-PDF yepulani kanye nokubukeka kohlangothi nezigaba zisebenzisa lolu sayizi kusukela manje. Igebe phakathi komugqa wesilinganiso nombhalo wawo, usayizi webhamuza legridi nokuphakama komugqa wohlu kukhula kanye nombhalo wabo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ipulani-enesikali-sayo\"\u003EIpulani enesikali sayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENika ipulani isikali sayo kuluhlu lokubuka (ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale\u003C/span\u003E; bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/views-and-sheets\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/views-and-sheets\"\u003EUkubuka namashidi\u003C/a\u003E). Khona:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eekuboneni, amagama amagumbi, amathegi, umbhalo wezilinganiso namabhamuza egridi adwetshwa ngosayizi wawo ophrintiwe ngokumelene nemodeli, ngakho okubonayo kufana nalokho ishidi lizokukhombisa;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eizimpawu zepulani namathegi awo zilinganiswa ngalesi sikali. Shintsha isikali sisuke ku-1:100 siye ku-1:50 zibe ngamahhafu emodelini futhi zifane ephepheni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIpulani engenaso isikali sayo igcina umbhalo wayo wesikrini osungiwe, nezimpawu zayo zilinganiswa ku-1:50 (1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot; ngamayunithi ezinyawo nezintshi), njengakuqala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"usayizi-wehhovisi-lakho\"\u003EUsayizi wehhovisi lakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgesengezo i-Default Policies ivulekile, setha amabanga ombhalo wehhovisi ku-Izilungiselelo › Global › Default Policies › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUsayizi wezichasiso ephepheni\u003C/span\u003E. Isakhiwo esisha sithatha lawo mabanga lapho uchofoza Create. Esakhiweni osesiqalile, ingxoxo inayo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESebenzisa usayizi wehhovisi lami\u003C/span\u003E. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/default-policies\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/default-policies\"\u003EDefault Policies\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"usayizi-wephakheji-yemithetho\"\u003EUsayizi wephakheji yemithetho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIphakheji yemithetho inganikeza amabanga ombhalo aphakanyiswa yindawo yayo (i-add-on yeBuilding regulations, izivumelwano zokudweba). Thikha iphakheji ku-Izilungiselelo › Building regulations, bese ku-ingxoxo uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESebenzisa usayizi wephakheji yemithetho\u003C/span\u003E: amabhokisi ayagcwala, uwahlole bese uyagcina. Usayizi iphakheji elinikeza ngamapoyinti ungusayizi wefonti, futhi uguqulwa ube ukuphakama kohlamvu olukhulu, ngakho hlola. Akukho okusethwayo kuze ulondoloze.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokubona\"\u003EOkuzokubona\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuphakama kombhalo okufanayo ngamamilimitha ishidi elingu-1:100 nelingu-1:50, kuyilapho ipulani ngokwayo ingaphindwe kabili ku-1:50.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUsayizi uhamba nesakhiwo: ugcinwa kufayela lakhe le-IFC.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukwazi\"\u003EOkufanele ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUsayizi we-BimCraft ngokwawo wukhona ayewusebenzisa amashidi ayo kuze kube manje (cishe ohlamvu olukhulu abangu-1.5 mm wombhalo wezilinganiso). Awuyona imigomo yokudweba: setha owehhovisi lakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuphakama kufanele kube phakathi kuka-0.5 no-50 mm.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmbhalo wesihloko sephepha nezincazelo zokhiye azihlangene nalokhu: zigcina usayizi wazo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Setha ukuthi amagama emidwebo yakho aphakama kangakanani ephepheni, kanye ngesakhiwo. Awulokothi ulinganise imodeli futhi awulokothi uguqule usayizi wombhalo ngesikali: i-BimCraft ibala usayizi ngokuphakama kephepha nesikali sedwetshwe. Indlela esebenza ngayo Imodeli isayizi ogcwele. Udonga olunobude be-10 m luyi-10 000 mm ubude kuzo zonke izikali. Ukuchazwa kunokuphakama kwephepha: ukuphakama kohlamvu olukhulu ekhasini elishicilelwe, ngamamilimitha. Ngesikali se-1:100 umbhalo ongu-2.5 mm uba ngu-250 mm ukuphakama emodelini; ku-1:50 uba ngu-125 mm. Ephepheni ungu-2.5 mm kokubili. Izimpawu zepulani (zikagesi, zepayipi) zidwetshwa ngamamilimitha ephepheni futhi zilandela umthetho ofanayo. Izinyathelo Vula i-project browser. Ngaphansi kwesihloko Sheets chofoza Annotation sizes…. Thayipha ukuphakama ngamamilimitha ezinhlobeni ofuna ukuzisetha: Notes and labels, Dimension text, Tags and level names, Room names, Grid bubble letters, View titles on sheets and Schedule text. Ibhokisi elingenalutho ligcina usayizi we-BimCraft, obonakala ngegrey. Chofoza Save. Kuyisinyathelo esisodwa ongasihlehlisa. Zonke amashidi, isethi yokudweba, i-PDF yepulani kanye nokubukeka kohlangothi nezigaba zisebenzisa lolu sayizi kusukela manje. Igebe phakathi komugqa wesilinganiso nombhalo wawo, usayizi webhamuza legridi nokuphakama komugqa wohlu kukhula kanye nombhalo wabo. Ipulani enesikali sayo Nika ipulani isikali sayo kuluhlu lokubuka (ku-Scale; bona Ukubuka namashidi). Khona: ekuboneni, amagama amagumbi, amathegi, umbhalo wezilinganiso namabhamuza egridi adwetshwa ngosayizi wawo ophrintiwe ngokumelene nemodeli, ngakho okubonayo kufana nalokho ishidi lizokukhombisa; izimpawu zepulani namathegi awo zilinganiswa ngalesi sikali. Shintsha isikali sisuke ku-1:100 siye ku-1:50 zibe ngamahhafu emodelini futhi zifane ephepheni. Ipulani engenaso isikali sayo igcina umbhalo wayo wesikrini osungiwe, nezimpawu zayo zilinganiswa ku-1:50 (1/4\" = 1'-0\" ngamayunithi ezinyawo nezintshi), njengakuqala. Usayizi wehhovisi lakho Ngesengezo i-Default Policies ivulekile, setha amabanga ombhalo wehhovisi ku-Izilungiselelo › Global › Default Policies › Usayizi wezichasiso ephepheni. Isakhiwo esisha sithatha lawo mabanga lapho uchofoza Create. Esakhiweni osesiqalile, ingxoxo inayo Sebenzisa usayizi wehhovisi lami. Bona Default Policies. Usayizi wephakheji yemithetho Iphakheji yemithetho inganikeza amabanga ombhalo aphakanyiswa yindawo yayo (i-add-on yeBuilding regulations, izivumelwano zokudweba). Thikha iphakheji ku-Izilungiselelo › Building regulations, bese ku-ingxoxo uchofoza Sebenzisa usayizi wephakheji yemithetho: amabhokisi ayagcwala, uwahlole bese uyagcina. Usayizi iphakheji elinikeza ngamapoyinti ungusayizi wefonti, futhi uguqulwa ube ukuphakama kohlamvu olukhulu, ngakho hlola. Akukho okusethwayo kuze ulondoloze. Okuzokubona Ukuphakama kombhalo okufanayo ngamamilimitha ishidi elingu-1:100 nelingu-1:50, kuyilapho ipulani ngokwayo ingaphindwe kabili ku-1:50. Usayizi uhamba nesakhiwo: ugcinwa kufayela lakhe le-IFC. Okufanele ukwazi Usayizi we-BimCraft ngokwawo wukhona ayewusebenzisa amashidi ayo kuze kube manje (cishe ohlamvu olukhulu abangu-1.5 mm wombhalo wezilinganiso). Awuyona imigomo yokudweba: setha owehhovisi lakho. Ukuphakama kufanele kube phakathi kuka-0.5 no-50 mm. Umbhalo wesihloko sephepha nezincazelo zokhiye azihlangene nalokhu: zigcina usayizi wazo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"electrical-plan","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Ipulani likagesi","summary":"Misa izinsiza, izinkinobho, izibani, izinzwa, amabhokisi okuhlanganisa kanye nopanele kupulani ngezimbonakalo ezifanayo nezeCadCraft's okwengeziwe kwe-Electrical, xhumanisa izinkinobho nezibani abazivulayo, bese ubhala izinsiza nezisekethe kuhlu.","section":"tasks","order":27,"keywords":["ugesi","ipulani likagesi","isokhethi","isixhumi","duplex","iswishi","iswishi ezintathu","dimmer","isibani","isibani sophahla","isibani esicwiliziwe","downlight","inzwa yokunyakaza","ibhokisi lokuhlanganisa","upanele","ibhodi lokusabalalisa","isekethi","umthwalo","watt","amp","umlenze weswishi","uhlu lwezinsiza","uhlu lukapanele"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"misa-izinsiza","text":"Misa izinsiza","level":2},{"id":"xhumanisa-amaswishi-nezibani","text":"Xhumanisa amaswishi nezibani","level":2},{"id":"igumbi-insiza-lapho-imi-khona","text":"Igumbi insiza lapho imi khona","level":2},{"id":"vumela-umsizi-akumisele-zona","text":"Vumela umsizi akumisele zona","level":2},{"id":"shintsha-nobhale-ohlwini","text":"Shintsha nobhale ohlwini","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDweba ipulani likagesi lendlu kumodeli: amasokhethi, amaswishi nopanele odongeni, izibani nezinzwa esilingeni. Isinsiza ngasinye yinto yangempela yikagesi kufayela le-IFC, enethegi yayo, isekethi nomthwalo wayo, namaswishi akhumbula izibani avula zona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"misa-izinsiza\"\u003EMisa izinsiza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEsitezini, vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuild\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EElectrical\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha insiza: amasokhethi (amandla, idatha, ucingo, i-audio-video), amaswishi nezinzwa (ithemostati nesikhathi nazo), izibani, izinzwa zokutholela nezezwi, ibhokisi lokuhlanganisa, upanele noma upanele omncane.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBhala \u003Cstrong\u003EIsekethi\u003C/strong\u003E uma uyazi (noma yiliphi igama: 1, 2, A-3). Shiya \u003Cstrong\u003EUkuphakama kokumisa\u003C/strong\u003E ingenalutho ukuze uthole ukuphakama okujwayelekile kalezo zinsiza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza kupulani. Amasokhethi, amaswishi nopanele kuya ngaphezulu kodonga oluseduze, bheka ngaphakathi kwegumbi; izibani, izinzwa namabhokisi okuhlanganisa kuya esilingeni lapho uchofoza khona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinsiza ziphawulwa ngesikhathi zimiswa: \u003Cstrong\u003ER\u003C/strong\u003E wamasokhethi, \u003Cstrong\u003ES\u003C/strong\u003E wamaswishi, \u003Cstrong\u003EL\u003C/strong\u003E wezibani, \u003Cstrong\u003EM\u003C/strong\u003E wezinzwa zokunyakaza, \u003Cstrong\u003EJ\u003C/strong\u003E wamabhokisi okuhlanganisa, \u003Cstrong\u003EP\u003C/strong\u003E wopanele. Izinsiza ezisodongeni zihamba nodonga uma uhambisa lodonga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUthanda ukubheka ngezithombe? Vula i-\u003Cstrong\u003ESymbol palette\u003C/strong\u003E kusuka ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuild\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uthole insiza ngegama, uthande ezisetshenziswa kakhulu bese uyimisa ngocingo olulodwa: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/symbol-palette\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/symbol-palette\"\u003EIpharethi yezimbonakalo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xhumanisa-amaswishi-nezibani\"\u003EXhumanisa amaswishi nezibani\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha iswishi (noma inzwa yokunyakaza) bese uchofoza \u003Cstrong\u003EXhuma izibani\u003C/strong\u003E ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzici\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza wonke isibani esivulayo. Chofoza futhi isibani esixhumiwe ukuze usixhumule.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma uchofoze \u003Cstrong\u003EKwenziwe\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIpulani lidweba ijika elinamachashaza lisuka ku-iswishi liye kuzo zonke izibani zalo. I-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzici\u003C/strong\u003E yesibani ikhombisa ukuthi yimaphi amaswishi awuvulayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"igumbi-insiza-lapho-imi-khona\"\u003EIgumbi insiza lapho imi khona\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYonke insiza yazi igumbi eliyo kulo. Insiza esodongeni isegumbini eliyibheke; insiza esilingeni isegumbini ngaphansi kwayo. I-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzici\u003C/strong\u003E ikhombisa \u003Cstrong\u003EIgumbi\u003C/strong\u003E, nesikhala sohlu \u003Cstrong\u003EIzinsiza zikagesi\u003C/strong\u003E sinekholomu \u003Cstrong\u003EIgumbi\u003C/strong\u003E (inombolo negama, njengo-101 Ikhishi).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIgcinwa ilungile: uma ubiza kabusha noma uvuselele igumbi, uhambise insiza, noma uhambise udonga, igumbi liyalandela ngesinyathelo esifanayo. Insiza esedongeni langaphandle lesakhiwo, noma endaweni engeyona igumbi, ibika ukuthi ayisegumbini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIgumbi futhi libhalwa kufayela ngaphakathi kwesethi yezici yensiza ethi \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_Location\u003C/code\u003E (Room, RoomNumber, RoomName), ukuze i-Find, i-Color by property nohlu lwamathegi kukwazi ukulisebenzisa, nezinye izinhlelo nazo zikwazi ukulisebenzisa. Izimbonakalo zepulani nezinto ezixhunywe kwimbonakalo zithola isethi efanayo; bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/symbol-palette\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/symbol-palette\"\u003EIpharethi yezimbonakalo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vumela-umsizi-akumisele-zona\"\u003EVumela umsizi akumisele zona\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma umsizi exhunyiwe (Izilungiselelo › Abasizi, nokuhlela kuvunyelwe), ungacela izinsiza ngamazwi: &quot;faka isokhethi elikabili buhlelo lwezindonga zegumbi lokuhlala, ngo-300 mm ukuphakama, esekethini 3&quot;, noma &quot;engeza isibani sophahla neswishi yaso eduze komnyango&quot;. Umsizi usebenzisa amathuluzi amahlanu: \u003Ccode\u003Edevices_add\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Edevice_change\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Elights_set\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Edevices_delete\u003C/code\u003E kanye no-\u003Ccode\u003Edevices_list\u003C/code\u003E. Adala izinsiza ezifanayo nalezo ithuluzi likagesi elizenzayo, ezindongeni nasemathegini, nasezisekethini, nakumthwalo nasezingeni lokuphakama ezifanayo, futhi ukubizwa ngakunye kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInsiza ayikaze ithole uhlobo ithuluzi likagesi elingalenzi: uhlobo olungaziwa luyenqatshwa, nomsizi unikezwa uhlu. Isokhethi noma iswishi kufanele libe ngaphakathi kwe-600 mm kuphansi wodonga, njengokuchofoza, uma kungenjalo ukubizwa kuyenqatshwa futhi akukho okumiswayo. Izinkomba zokuphakama zisemamilimitha: 300 wamasokhethi, 1100 wamaswishi; insiza yesilingo imi ngaphansi kwesilingo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shintsha-nobhale-ohlwini\"\u003EShintsha nobhale ohlwini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha insiza ukuze ushintshe ithegi, isekethi, umthwalo (watt) nokuphakama kokumisa. Khetha eziningi ukuze uzifake esekethini eyodwa ngesikhathi esisodwa. Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze usule eyodwa; isibani esisusiwe sisuswa namaswishi aso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESchedules\u003C/span\u003E khetha \u003Cstrong\u003EIzinsiza zikagesi\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze uthole yonke insiza nezinga layo, isekethi, umthwalo, ukuphakama nezibani ngalinye iswishi elivula zona, noma \u003Cstrong\u003EAmasekethi\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze uthole izinsiza zesekethi ngayinye, umthwalo wayo wonke nokugeleza kwayo kwamanje. Zombili zisendaweni yohlu lwesethi yemidwebo: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/sheets\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/sheets\"\u003EOkuphakanyisiwe, izigaba namashidi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuphakama kokumisa nemithwalo kungokuzenzakalelayo kokuhlela (isokhethi ku-16&quot; ngaphezulu no-200 W, iswishi ku-48&quot;, isibani sophahla ku-60 W), akusona ukuklama: uthisha kagesi noma unjiniyela uyaziqondisa izisekethi bese ehlola ikhodi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzimbonakalo ngezifanayo nezokwengeziwe kwe-Electrical kwe-CadCraft ezidweba kumapulani okufakwa, ngakho ipulani kwelinye lezi zinhlelo lifundeka ngendlela efanayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Dweba ipulani likagesi lendlu kumodeli: amasokhethi, amaswishi nopanele odongeni, izibani nezinzwa esilingeni. Isinsiza ngasinye yinto yangempela yikagesi kufayela le-IFC, enethegi yayo, isekethi nomthwalo wayo, namaswishi akhumbula izibani avula zona. Misa izinsiza Esitezini, vula Build bese ukhetha Electrical. Khetha insiza: amasokhethi (amandla, idatha, ucingo, i-audio-video), amaswishi nezinzwa (ithemostati nesikhathi nazo), izibani, izinzwa zokutholela nezezwi, ibhokisi lokuhlanganisa, upanele noma upanele omncane. Bhala Isekethi uma uyazi (noma yiliphi igama: 1, 2, A-3). Shiya Ukuphakama kokumisa ingenalutho ukuze uthole ukuphakama okujwayelekile kalezo zinsiza. Chofoza kupulani. Amasokhethi, amaswishi nopanele kuya ngaphezulu kodonga oluseduze, bheka ngaphakathi kwegumbi; izibani, izinzwa namabhokisi okuhlanganisa kuya esilingeni lapho uchofoza khona. Izinsiza ziphawulwa ngesikhathi zimiswa: R wamasokhethi, S wamaswishi, L wezibani, M wezinzwa zokunyakaza, J wamabhokisi okuhlanganisa, P wopanele. Izinsiza ezisodongeni zihamba nodonga uma uhambisa lodonga. Uthanda ukubheka ngezithombe? Vula i-Symbol palette kusuka ku-Build ukuze uthole insiza ngegama, uthande ezisetshenziswa kakhulu bese uyimisa ngocingo olulodwa: bona Ipharethi yezimbonakalo. Xhumanisa amaswishi nezibani Khetha iswishi (noma inzwa yokunyakaza) bese uchofoza Xhuma izibani ku-Izici. Chofoza wonke isibani esivulayo. Chofoza futhi isibani esixhumiwe ukuze usixhumule. Cindezela Enter noma uchofoze Kwenziwe. Ipulani lidweba ijika elinamachashaza lisuka ku-iswishi liye kuzo zonke izibani zalo. I-Izici yesibani ikhombisa ukuthi yimaphi amaswishi awuvulayo. Igumbi insiza lapho imi khona Yonke insiza yazi igumbi eliyo kulo. Insiza esodongeni isegumbini eliyibheke; insiza esilingeni isegumbini ngaphansi kwayo. I-Izici ikhombisa Igumbi, nesikhala sohlu Izinsiza zikagesi sinekholomu Igumbi (inombolo negama, njengo-101 Ikhishi). Igcinwa ilungile: uma ubiza kabusha noma uvuselele igumbi, uhambise insiza, noma uhambise udonga, igumbi liyalandela ngesinyathelo esifanayo. Insiza esedongeni langaphandle lesakhiwo, noma endaweni engeyona igumbi, ibika ukuthi ayisegumbini. Igumbi futhi libhalwa kufayela ngaphakathi kwesethi yezici yensiza ethi CadCraft_Location (Room, RoomNumber, RoomName), ukuze i-Find, i-Color by property nohlu lwamathegi kukwazi ukulisebenzisa, nezinye izinhlelo nazo zikwazi ukulisebenzisa. Izimbonakalo zepulani nezinto ezixhunywe kwimbonakalo zithola isethi efanayo; bona Ipharethi yezimbonakalo. Vumela umsizi akumisele zona Uma umsizi exhunyiwe (Izilungiselelo › Abasizi, nokuhlela kuvunyelwe), ungacela izinsiza ngamazwi: \"faka isokhethi elikabili buhlelo lwezindonga zegumbi lokuhlala, ngo-300 mm ukuphakama, esekethini 3\", noma \"engeza isibani sophahla neswishi yaso eduze komnyango\". Umsizi usebenzisa amathuluzi amahlanu: devices_add, device_change, lights_set, devices_delete kanye no-devices_list. Adala izinsiza ezifanayo nalezo ithuluzi likagesi elizenzayo, ezindongeni nasemathegini, nasezisekethini, nakumthwalo nasezingeni lokuphakama ezifanayo, futhi ukubizwa ngakunye kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Insiza ayikaze ithole uhlobo ithuluzi likagesi elingalenzi: uhlobo olungaziwa luyenqatshwa, nomsizi unikezwa uhlu. Isokhethi noma iswishi kufanele libe ngaphakathi kwe-600 mm kuphansi wodonga, njengokuchofoza, uma kungenjalo ukubizwa kuyenqatshwa futhi akukho okumiswayo. Izinkomba zokuphakama zisemamilimitha: 300 wamasokhethi, 1100 wamaswishi; insiza yesilingo imi ngaphansi kwesilingo. Shintsha nobhale ohlwini Khetha insiza ukuze ushintshe ithegi, isekethi, umthwalo (watt) nokuphakama kokumisa. Khetha eziningi ukuze uzifake esekethini eyodwa ngesikhathi esisodwa. Cindezela Delete ukuze usule eyodwa; isibani esisusiwe sisuswa namaswishi aso. Ku-Schedules khetha Izinsiza zikagesi ukuze uthole yonke insiza nezinga layo, isekethi, umthwalo, ukuphakama nezibani ngalinye iswishi elivula zona, noma Amasekethi ukuze uthole izinsiza zesekethi ngayinye, umthwalo wayo wonke nokugeleza kwayo kwamanje. Zombili zisendaweni yohlu lwesethi yemidwebo: bona Okuphakanyisiwe, izigaba namashidi. Ukuphakama kokumisa nemithwalo kungokuzenzakalelayo kokuhlela (isokhethi ku-16\" ngaphezulu no-200 W, iswishi ku-48\", isibani sophahla ku-60 W), akusona ukuklama: uthisha kagesi noma unjiniyela uyaziqondisa izisekethi bese ehlola ikhodi. Izimbonakalo ngezifanayo nezokwengeziwe kwe-Electrical kwe-CadCraft ezidweba kumapulani okufakwa, ngakho ipulani kwelinye lezi zinhlelo lifundeka ngendlela efanayo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"save-dwg-dxf","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Save a plan, elevation or section as DWG or DXF","summary":"Save the plan you are looking at, or every plan, elevation and section of the drawing set, as a DWG or DXF drawing at true size, with a layer for each kind of line, text and dimensions you can edit.","section":"tasks","order":27,"keywords":["dwg","dxf","export","save as","cad","2d","drawing","plan","floor plan","ceiling plan","elevation","section","drawing set","layers","dimensions","true size","model space","hand off","consultant","r2018","r2013","r2010","r2007","r2004","r2000"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-ll-do","text":"What you'll do","level":2},{"id":"save-the-plan","text":"Save the plan","level":2},{"id":"save-the-drawing-set","text":"Save the drawing set","level":2},{"id":"what-is-in-the-file","text":"What is in the file","level":2},{"id":"what-is-not-in-the-file","text":"What is not in the file","level":2},{"id":"check-the-file","text":"Check the file","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-ll-do\"\u003EWhat you&#039;ll do\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHand a plan, or the whole drawing set, to someone who works in a CAD program. The file holds the same drawing BimCraft prints, at true size, so it can be measured, dimensioned and drawn over.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"save-the-plan\"\u003ESave the plan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShow the level you want, as a floor plan or a ceiling plan, the way you want it: the cut height, the view range and the pens are all used.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClick \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave as DWG or DXF\u003C/span\u003E in the model bar (beside \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrint\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile type\u003C/span\u003E: DWG for AutoCAD 2018, 2013, 2010, 2007, 2004 or 2000, or DXF (AutoCAD 2000). DWG 2018 opens in every current CAD program. Choose an older one only for an older program. BimCraft remembers your choice in this browser.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClick \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave\u003C/span\u003E. The file is named after the model and the level, for example \u003Cem\u003Esmall-house — Ground floor.dwg\u003C/em\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"save-the-drawing-set\"\u003ESave the drawing set\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClick \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESheets\u003C/span\u003E in the model bar.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClick \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDWG or DXF\u003C/span\u003E beside \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDownload the set as PDF\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile type\u003C/span\u003E and click \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEvery plan, the four elevations and every section go into one drawing, each with its title under it. The plans sit in a row: the first is where the model is, and the next ones are moved to the right by the same distance, so grid lines line up from level to level. The elevations and sections are in a row under the plans. Title blocks and schedules stay in the PDF of the set.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-is-in-the-file\"\u003EWhat is in the file\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETrue size, in the model&#039;s place.\u003C/strong\u003E Lengths are in millimeters. A model in feet and inches is written in inches. The file&#039;s units say which, so the drawing comes in at the right size.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EA layer for each kind of line.\u003C/strong\u003E The names follow the US National CAD Standard:\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ELayer\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat is on it\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA-WALL\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWall outlines (0.50 mm)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA-WALL-PATT\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWall fills and the hatching of wall layers, in their material colours\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA-WALL-PHAS\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERenovation phases: existing, to demolish (dashed), new\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA-CUT, A-CUT-PATT\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOther elements the cut passes through, such as columns, slabs and stairs, and their fills\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA-BELOW\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWhat is seen below the cut\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA-ABOVE\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWhat is above the cut, under the top of the view range (HIDDEN line)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA-DOOR, A-GLAZ\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDoors with their swings, windows\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA-ROOF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERoof edges and ridges\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA-UNDR\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAnother level shown under this one\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA-DETL, A-DETL-PATT\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELines and fills drafted in the view\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA-GRID, A-GRID-IDEN\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGrid lines (CENTER line), their bubbles and tags\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA-AREA-IDEN\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERoom names, numbers and areas\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA-ANNO-DIMS\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDimensions\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA-ANNO-TEXT\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENotes and labels\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA-ANNO-SYMB\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELevel marks and tags on elevations and sections\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA-ELEV, A-ELEV-GRND\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELines seen in an elevation or section, the ground line\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA-SECT, A-SECT-PATT\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWhat a section cuts, and its fills\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA-VIEW-TITL\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EView titles in a drawing set\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELines keep their weight, dash and colour.\u003C/strong\u003E A pen you set for the view (see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/trace-pens-stairs-obj\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/trace-pens-stairs-obj\"\u003EPens\u003C/a\u003E) keeps its weight, dash and colour on that object. Solid fills are solid hatches.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDoor swings are arcs\u003C/strong\u003E and grid bubbles are circles, not short straight lines.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EText is text\u003C/strong\u003E (Arial, and Arial Bold for room names and grid tags), as high as it prints on paper times the scale. At 1:100, text 2 mm high on paper is 200 mm high in the drawing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDimensions are dimensions.\u003C/strong\u003E Each one keeps its two points, where its line sits and the text BimCraft shows. The drawing&#039;s Standard dimension style is set for the same scale, with ticks.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe scale used for the text is the one the plan prints at (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrint\u003C/span\u003E on the plan&#039;s bar). The status bar says which, for example \u003Cem\u003ESaved the plan as DWG (AutoCAD 2018), with text and dimensions sized for 1:100.\u003C/em\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-is-not-in-the-file\"\u003EWhat is not in the file\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPictures placed in the model.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe white masks under door and window symbols. A CAD drawing has no white that hides what is under it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA crop region: the whole view is written, and the status bar says so.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESheets, title blocks and schedules: use \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDownload the set as PDF\u003C/span\u003E for those.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"check-the-file\"\u003ECheck the file\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe files are checked by opening them with CadCraft&#039;s own DWG and DXF readers and with other programs. Open one in the CadCraft drafting app to see its layers and measure it.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you'll do Hand a plan, or the whole drawing set, to someone who works in a CAD program. The file holds the same drawing BimCraft prints, at true size, so it can be measured, dimensioned and drawn over. Save the plan Show the level you want, as a floor plan or a ceiling plan, the way you want it: the cut height, the view range and the pens are all used. Click Save as DWG or DXF in the model bar (beside Print). Choose the File type: DWG for AutoCAD 2018, 2013, 2010, 2007, 2004 or 2000, or DXF (AutoCAD 2000). DWG 2018 opens in every current CAD program. Choose an older one only for an older program. BimCraft remembers your choice in this browser. Click Save. The file is named after the model and the level, for example small-house — Ground floor.dwg. Save the drawing set Click Sheets in the model bar. Click DWG or DXF beside Download the set as PDF. Choose the File type and click Save. Every plan, the four elevations and every section go into one drawing, each with its title under it. The plans sit in a row: the first is where the model is, and the next ones are moved to the right by the same distance, so grid lines line up from level to level. The elevations and sections are in a row under the plans. Title blocks and schedules stay in the PDF of the set. What is in the file True size, in the model's place. Lengths are in millimeters. A model in feet and inches is written in inches. The file's units say which, so the drawing comes in at the right size. A layer for each kind of line. The names follow the US National CAD Standard: Layer What is on it A-WALL Wall outlines (0.50 mm) A-WALL-PATT Wall fills and the hatching of wall layers, in their material colours A-WALL-PHAS Renovation phases: existing, to demolish (dashed), new A-CUT, A-CUT-PATT Other elements the cut passes through, such as columns, slabs and stairs, and their fills A-BELOW What is seen below the cut A-ABOVE What is above the cut, under the top of the view range (HIDDEN line) A-DOOR, A-GLAZ Doors with their swings, windows A-ROOF Roof edges and ridges A-UNDR Another level shown under this one A-DETL, A-DETL-PATT Lines and fills drafted in the view A-GRID, A-GRID-IDEN Grid lines (CENTER line), their bubbles and tags A-AREA-IDEN Room names, numbers and areas A-ANNO-DIMS Dimensions A-ANNO-TEXT Notes and labels A-ANNO-SYMB Level marks and tags on elevations and sections A-ELEV, A-ELEV-GRND Lines seen in an elevation or section, the ground line A-SECT, A-SECT-PATT What a section cuts, and its fills A-VIEW-TITL View titles in a drawing set Lines keep their weight, dash and colour. A pen you set for the view (see Pens) keeps its weight, dash and colour on that object. Solid fills are solid hatches. Door swings are arcs and grid bubbles are circles, not short straight lines. Text is text (Arial, and Arial Bold for room names and grid tags), as high as it prints on paper times the scale. At 1:100, text 2 mm high on paper is 200 mm high in the drawing. Dimensions are dimensions. Each one keeps its two points, where its line sits and the text BimCraft shows. The drawing's Standard dimension style is set for the same scale, with ticks. The scale used for the text is the one the plan prints at (Print on the plan's bar). The status bar says which, for example Saved the plan as DWG (AutoCAD 2018), with text and dimensions sized for 1:100. What is not in the file Pictures placed in the model. The white masks under door and window symbols. A CAD drawing has no white that hides what is under it. A crop region: the whole view is written, and the status bar says so. Sheets, title blocks and schedules: use Download the set as PDF for those. Check the file The files are checked by opening them with CadCraft's own DWG and DXF readers and with other programs. Open one in the CadCraft drafting app to see its layers and measure it.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"takeoff","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Amanani aya ku-TakeoffCraft","summary":"Ukuchofoza okukodwa kuthumela amanani emodelini ku-TakeoffCraft — izindonga ngohlobo, uphahla ngendawo epheqile, imiphezulu, izinhlangothi nezigodi, izisekelo, iminyango namawindi, amakhabethi, amadivayisi kagesi, indawo yephansi nohlu lokusika izinkuni — kumakisiwe ephlanini lezinga ngalinye, nezinhlanganisela zamaphakheji omsebenzi kulezi zinto.","section":"tasks","order":28,"keywords":["ukubala amanani","ukubala amanani okuhlolwayo","isilinganiso","ukuhlola izindleko","uhlu lwezinto","uhlu lwempahla","takeoffcraft","amanani","indawo yodonga","indawo yophahla","izikwele","isisekelo","ukhonkolo","amayadi ekhyubhu","uhlu lokusika","izinkuni","iphakheji lomsebenzi","inhlanganisela"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"thumela","text":"Thumela","level":2},{"id":"okulinganiswayo","text":"Okulinganiswayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuqula imodeli ibe uhlu lwezinto nesilinganiso ku-TakeoffCraft. I-BimCraft idweba ipulani lalo lonke izinga ngesikali esijwayelekile, imaka kuwo wonke amanani, bese ifaka ukubala amanani ngaphakathi kwe-PDF. I-TakeoffCraft ilinganisa izimaki ngokwayo, ngakho inombolo ngayinye ingahlolwa ephepheni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"thumela\"\u003EThumela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubala amanani\u003C/span\u003E kubha yemodeli (ngasese kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmashidi\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-TakeoffCraft ivula ithebhu entsha ngamapulani. Lapho ibuza, khetha ukuvula ukubala amanani iyitholile ku-PDF.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEngeza amanani akho etafuleni lamanani le-TakeoffCraft; izinhlanganisela sezinikeza kakade izimpahla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma i-TakeoffCraft ingatholakali lapha, inkinobho ilanda i-PDF esikhundleni salokho. Yivule ku-TakeoffCraft kamuva: izothola ukubala amanani ngaphakathi kwayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulinganiswayo\"\u003EOkulinganiswayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzindonga\u003C/strong\u003E ngohlobo nobude: imigqa yazo emaphakathi njengezingxenye, nobude bodonga kulesi sinto, ukuze i-TakeoffCraft inikeze ubude kanye nendawo yodonga. Yonke ingxenye iphethe iminyango namawindi alo, ngakho i-TakeoffCraft iwasusa endaweni yodonga kanye, ngomthetho ofanayo nohlu lwe-BimCraft: bobabili bavumelana ngokuphelele, ngokususiwe nangokusele. Idatha yokubala amanani yohlobo lodonga (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/wall-assemblies\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/wall-assemblies\"\u003EIzinhlanganisela zezindonga\u003C/a\u003E) ifika njengomugqa owodwa onentengo kulesi sinto sohlobo. Ngaphansi kwendlela yokulinganisa engeyona eyejwayelekile (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/plan-schedules-and-pdf#choose-a-measurement-method\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/plan-schedules-and-pdf\" data-hash=\"choose-a-measurement-method\"\u003EKhetha indlela yokulinganisa\u003C/a\u003E), ukubala amanani kuthwala indlela, yonke ingxenye ithwala lokho okususwa yizixhumanisi ebusweni bodonga, futhi i-TakeoffCraft ilinganisa ngendlela efanayo iyibize ngegama. Uhlobo lodonga lapho iyunithi inobude nobude, lunikeza izingxenye ezimbili ezinamanani: izinyunithi zokuyala kanye nevolumu ye-mortar, kubhidwa uma izinga lohlobo liyisilinganiso ngeyunithi, ngamayunithi angu-1000 noma ngama-m³ e-mortar. Inani elifika ngokuphelele ku-nombolo ephelele lingaba yiyunithi eyodwa ngaphezulu ku-TakeoffCraft, ngoba ukuthunyelwa kuzungeza izikhundla ephepheni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUphahla\u003C/strong\u003E: indiza ngayinye yophahla njengendawo enokuphakama kwayo (i-TakeoffCraft inikeza indawo ephethwe), imiphezulu, izinhlangothi nezigodi (izinhlangothi nezigodi ngokuphakama kwazo), imiphetho yokuphuma nemiphetho esemaceleni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzisekelo\u003C/strong\u003E: izinsika zesisekelo nezindonga zesisekelo njengemigqa ezungeze iziphakathi zazo, namaslabhu njengendawo enobukhulu bawo, ukuze ukhonkolo uphume ngevolumu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIminyango namawindi\u003C/strong\u003E ibalwa ngohlobo, nokuqedwa kwewindi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmakhabethi asesisekelweni\u003C/strong\u003E ngobude bezinhlangothi zawo ezingaphambili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmadivayisi kagesi\u003C/strong\u003E abalwa ngohlobo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIndawo yephansi\u003C/strong\u003E yalo lonke izinga, isuka emakamelweni alo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUhlu lokusika izinkuni\u003C/strong\u003E kusuka ekwakhiweni, lubalwe ephepheni lalo (ichashazi elilodwa ngalinye).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELapho iphakheji lomsebenzi linenhlanganisela efanayo — izindonga zangaphandle nangaphakathi, amaslabhu, izisekelo, izinsika zesisekelo, amashingles, ukuphela kophahla nezigodi, imiphetho yokuphuma, iminyango yangaphakathi, ukuqedwa kwamawindi, amakhabethi asesisekelweni, amasokhethi, iziswitshi, izibani, amabhokisi okuxhuma nephaneli — into ifika ngezimpahla zayo nezifomula zayo. Amaphakheji awafiki ngezintengo futhi awakahlolwa umbali wezindleko.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmapulani enziwa kusuka emodelini njalo lapho uchofoza, ngakho ngemva kokushintsha, chofoza kuphinde \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubala amanani\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Guqula imodeli ibe uhlu lwezinto nesilinganiso ku-TakeoffCraft. I-BimCraft idweba ipulani lalo lonke izinga ngesikali esijwayelekile, imaka kuwo wonke amanani, bese ifaka ukubala amanani ngaphakathi kwe-PDF. I-TakeoffCraft ilinganisa izimaki ngokwayo, ngakho inombolo ngayinye ingahlolwa ephepheni. Thumela Chofoza Ukubala amanani kubha yemodeli (ngasese kwe-Amashidi). I-TakeoffCraft ivula ithebhu entsha ngamapulani. Lapho ibuza, khetha ukuvula ukubala amanani iyitholile ku-PDF. Engeza amanani akho etafuleni lamanani le-TakeoffCraft; izinhlanganisela sezinikeza kakade izimpahla. Uma i-TakeoffCraft ingatholakali lapha, inkinobho ilanda i-PDF esikhundleni salokho. Yivule ku-TakeoffCraft kamuva: izothola ukubala amanani ngaphakathi kwayo. Okulinganiswayo Izindonga ngohlobo nobude: imigqa yazo emaphakathi njengezingxenye, nobude bodonga kulesi sinto, ukuze i-TakeoffCraft inikeze ubude kanye nendawo yodonga. Yonke ingxenye iphethe iminyango namawindi alo, ngakho i-TakeoffCraft iwasusa endaweni yodonga kanye, ngomthetho ofanayo nohlu lwe-BimCraft: bobabili bavumelana ngokuphelele, ngokususiwe nangokusele. Idatha yokubala amanani yohlobo lodonga (bona Izinhlanganisela zezindonga) ifika njengomugqa owodwa onentengo kulesi sinto sohlobo. Ngaphansi kwendlela yokulinganisa engeyona eyejwayelekile (bona Khetha indlela yokulinganisa), ukubala amanani kuthwala indlela, yonke ingxenye ithwala lokho okususwa yizixhumanisi ebusweni bodonga, futhi i-TakeoffCraft ilinganisa ngendlela efanayo iyibize ngegama. Uhlobo lodonga lapho iyunithi inobude nobude, lunikeza izingxenye ezimbili ezinamanani: izinyunithi zokuyala kanye nevolumu ye-mortar, kubhidwa uma izinga lohlobo liyisilinganiso ngeyunithi, ngamayunithi angu-1000 noma ngama-m³ e-mortar. Inani elifika ngokuphelele ku-nombolo ephelele lingaba yiyunithi eyodwa ngaphezulu ku-TakeoffCraft, ngoba ukuthunyelwa kuzungeza izikhundla ephepheni. Uphahla: indiza ngayinye yophahla njengendawo enokuphakama kwayo (i-TakeoffCraft inikeza indawo ephethwe), imiphezulu, izinhlangothi nezigodi (izinhlangothi nezigodi ngokuphakama kwazo), imiphetho yokuphuma nemiphetho esemaceleni. Izisekelo: izinsika zesisekelo nezindonga zesisekelo njengemigqa ezungeze iziphakathi zazo, namaslabhu njengendawo enobukhulu bawo, ukuze ukhonkolo uphume ngevolumu. Iminyango namawindi ibalwa ngohlobo, nokuqedwa kwewindi. Amakhabethi asesisekelweni ngobude bezinhlangothi zawo ezingaphambili. Amadivayisi kagesi abalwa ngohlobo. Indawo yephansi yalo lonke izinga, isuka emakamelweni alo. Uhlu lokusika izinkuni kusuka ekwakhiweni, lubalwe ephepheni lalo (ichashazi elilodwa ngalinye). Lapho iphakheji lomsebenzi linenhlanganisela efanayo — izindonga zangaphandle nangaphakathi, amaslabhu, izisekelo, izinsika zesisekelo, amashingles, ukuphela kophahla nezigodi, imiphetho yokuphuma, iminyango yangaphakathi, ukuqedwa kwamawindi, amakhabethi asesisekelweni, amasokhethi, iziswitshi, izibani, amabhokisi okuxhuma nephaneli — into ifika ngezimpahla zayo nezifomula zayo. Amaphakheji awafiki ngezintengo futhi awakahlolwa umbali wezindleko. Amapulani enziwa kusuka emodelini njalo lapho uchofoza, ngakho ngemva kokushintsha, chofoza kuphinde Ukubala amanani.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"register-scans","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Hlanganisa izikena eziningi zibe sinye","summary":"Beka izikena ezithathwe kumaphozishini ahlukene ohlaka olulodwa ngamapheya amaphoyinti akhethiwe noma izinhloso ezithayiphiwe, uzithuthukise nge-ICP, ulondoloze ukuhlanganisa njengephrojekthi, bese uthumela ifu elihlanganisiwe njenge-LAS noma i-E57.","section":"tasks","order":28,"keywords":["hlanganisa","ukuhlanganisa","izikena","ifu lephoyinti","icp","iterative closest point","izinhloso","amapheya amaphoyinti","ukuguqulwa okuqinile","ukulinganisa","ukuhlanganisa","e57","las","scan to bim"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"beka-izikena","text":"Beka izikena","level":2},{"id":"thuthukisa-nge-icp","text":"Thuthukisa nge-ICP","level":2},{"id":"londoloza-nokuthumela","text":"Londoloza nokuthumela","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzikena eziningana zendawo eyodwa (ngayinye isuka endaweni yayo yesikena) ziqala ezixhumanisweni zazo. Zihlanganise: nika iskena ngayinye indawo eyodwa ukuze zonke zihlale ohlakeni olulodwa, bese ulondoloza lokho njengephrojekthi bese ubhala ifu elihlanganisiwe njengefayela elilodwa le-LAS noma le-E57.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beka-izikena\"\u003EBeka izikena\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula ingxoxo (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlanganisa izikena…\u003C/span\u003E ephaneli yokuqala, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlanganisa izikena…\u003C/span\u003E uma imodeli seyivuliwe). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza izikena…\u003C/span\u003E uthatha amafayela e-LAS, LAZ, E57, PLY, PCD, PTX, PTS noma XYZ, noma uwayise engxoxweni. Izikena ezisebenzisa iyunithi ezahlukene ziyenqatshwa ngenothi: guqula eyodwa kuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIskena okufanele lihanjiswe\u003C/span\u003E no \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBeka eceleni kwalo\u003C/span\u003E. Isithombe sibonisa wonke amaskena ohlaka njengoba likunjalo manje, umbala owodwa ngamunye: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIpulani\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhambili\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlangothi\u003C/span\u003E; hudula ukuze uhambise, sebenzisa ivili lemouse ukuze usondeze.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENgamapheya amaphoyinti.\u003C/strong\u003E Chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha ipheya\u003C/span\u003E, bese uchofoza iphoyinti kuskena okufanele lihanjiswe, bese uchofoza indawo efanayo kwenye iskena (ikhona, isiqondisi, unyawo lensika). Yenza lokhu okungenani kathathu, ngamaphoyinti angelona umugqa owodwa futhi ahlukaniswe kabanzi. Chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBeka ngamapheya\u003C/span\u003E: iskena libekwa ngokufanelana kwamaskwele amancane kakhulu, futhi \u003Cstrong\u003EOkusele\u003C/strong\u003E kukhombisa ukuthi ipheya ngayinye isazophuthela kangakanani. Ipheya enenombolo enkulu iphuthe ngokukhethwa: yisuse ngesiphambano bese ubeka futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENgezinhloso.\u003C/strong\u003E Uma izixhumanisi zephoyinti ezingempela sizaziwa (izinhloso ezihlolwe), chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha, bese uthayipha inhloso\u003C/span\u003E, chofoza iphoyinti kuskena lalo, bese uthayipha i-X, i-Y ne-Z yenhloso emgqeni. Amapheya nezinhloso ezithayiphiwe zingaxutshwa ngokukhululeka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"thuthukisa-nge-icp\"\u003EThuthukisa nge-ICP\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmapheya anika ukubekwa okuyinkomba. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThuthukisa\u003C/span\u003E ihambisa iskena kuze izindawo zalo zihlale kwezezinye: kuqala \u003Cstrong\u003Eiphoyinti kuya kwiphoyinti\u003C/strong\u003E, bese \u003Cstrong\u003Eiphoyinti kuya kundiza\u003C/strong\u003E. Ithebula lidweba isinyathelo ngasinye ngephutha lalo nenani lamaphoyinti ahlanganisiwe; umugqa ongaphezulu kwalo udweba iphutha lehla. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMisa\u003C/span\u003E iphelisa ukusebenza ngalesi sinyathelo esiqhubekayo bese igcina lapho ifike khona. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlehlisa\u003C/span\u003E ithatha bonke ukusebenza (noma ukubekwa kokugcina) buyele emuva; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESetha kabusha\u003C/span\u003E ibuyisela iskena ezixhumanisweni zalo zefayela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze kube lula kulaptop, i-ICP isebenza ngesabelo esincishisiwe samaphoyinti (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmaphoyinti asetshenzisiwe\u003C/span\u003E, 5,000 kuya ku-60,000) futhi ilahla okuhlangana okukude kunalokho okushiwo yi-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbanga elikhulu lokuhlangana\u003C/span\u003E (ngokuzenzakalelayo 5% wosayizi weskena, uncipha lapho uzinzile). Idinga ukubekwa okuyinkomba kuqala: amaskena ahlanganayo kancane abika ukuthi awakwazi ukuhlangana. Izindawo ezibukeka zilingene noma zigoqekile kuphela azikwazi ukulungisa indawo ngaphansi kwazo; engeza amapheya kulokho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"londoloza-nokuthumela\"\u003ELondoloza nokuthumela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza iphrojekthi\u003C/span\u003E ibhala ifayela elincane le-\u003Ccode\u003E.ccscans.json\u003C/code\u003E: igama leskena ngalinye, usayizi walo nesigaxa sokuqala se-64 KB, kanye nokuguqulwa kwalo. Alibambi amaphoyinti. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula iphrojekthi…\u003C/span\u003E ithola amafayela eskena ngalezo zinkomba (amafayela kufanele engezwe kuqala) futhi ibuyisele wonke ukuguqulwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela i-LAS\u003C/span\u003E no \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela i-E57\u003C/span\u003E babhala ifayela elilodwa elinawo wonke amaskena endaweni yawo ehlanganisiwe. Amaphoyinti awabhalwa kabusha emithonjeni; ukuguqulwa kusetshenziswa ekuphumeni. Uma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFunda wonke amaphoyinti kumafayela\u003C/span\u003E ivuliwe, ifayela ngalinye liyafundwa futhi ngephoyinti ngalinye (kuze kufike kuma-20 million ngeskena); uma livaliwe, kubhalwa kuphela amaphoyinti abonakala kumbukeli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhombisa iclawudi elihlanganisiwe\u003C/span\u003E (BimCraft) ibhala i-LAS ivule kumbukeli we-3D eceleni kwemodeli, njengoba kwenza nanoma iyiphi iclawudi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAkukho okulayishwa. Ukuhlanganisa kusebenza ngeziyunithi zamafayela uqobo futhi kugcina amamilimitha: i-LAS ibhalwa ngesikali esilingana (kuze kufike ku-0.1 mm), i-E57 ngamanani amade. Uhlelo lokuqondanisa lungena ku-LAS kuphela uma wonke amaskena eqamba ikhodi efanayo ye-EPSG. Umbhali we-E57 ungowethu; uhlolwa ngokufunda amafayela ayo ngalo mfundi nangelibE57Format.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Izikena eziningana zendawo eyodwa (ngayinye isuka endaweni yayo yesikena) ziqala ezixhumanisweni zazo. Zihlanganise: nika iskena ngayinye indawo eyodwa ukuze zonke zihlale ohlakeni olulodwa, bese ulondoloza lokho njengephrojekthi bese ubhala ifu elihlanganisiwe njengefayela elilodwa le-LAS noma le-E57. Beka izikena Vula ingxoxo (Hlanganisa izikena… ephaneli yokuqala, noma Bonisa › Hlanganisa izikena… uma imodeli seyivuliwe). Engeza izikena… uthatha amafayela e-LAS, LAZ, E57, PLY, PCD, PTX, PTS noma XYZ, noma uwayise engxoxweni. Izikena ezisebenzisa iyunithi ezahlukene ziyenqatshwa ngenothi: guqula eyodwa kuqala. Khetha Iskena okufanele lihanjiswe no Beka eceleni kwalo. Isithombe sibonisa wonke amaskena ohlaka njengoba likunjalo manje, umbala owodwa ngamunye: Ipulani, Phambili noma Uhlangothi; hudula ukuze uhambise, sebenzisa ivili lemouse ukuze usondeze. Ngamapheya amaphoyinti. Chofoza Khetha ipheya, bese uchofoza iphoyinti kuskena okufanele lihanjiswe, bese uchofoza indawo efanayo kwenye iskena (ikhona, isiqondisi, unyawo lensika). Yenza lokhu okungenani kathathu, ngamaphoyinti angelona umugqa owodwa futhi ahlukaniswe kabanzi. Chofoza Beka ngamapheya: iskena libekwa ngokufanelana kwamaskwele amancane kakhulu, futhi Okusele kukhombisa ukuthi ipheya ngayinye isazophuthela kangakanani. Ipheya enenombolo enkulu iphuthe ngokukhethwa: yisuse ngesiphambano bese ubeka futhi. Ngezinhloso. Uma izixhumanisi zephoyinti ezingempela sizaziwa (izinhloso ezihlolwe), chofoza Khetha, bese uthayipha inhloso, chofoza iphoyinti kuskena lalo, bese uthayipha i-X, i-Y ne-Z yenhloso emgqeni. Amapheya nezinhloso ezithayiphiwe zingaxutshwa ngokukhululeka. Thuthukisa nge-ICP Amapheya anika ukubekwa okuyinkomba. Thuthukisa ihambisa iskena kuze izindawo zalo zihlale kwezezinye: kuqala iphoyinti kuya kwiphoyinti, bese iphoyinti kuya kundiza. Ithebula lidweba isinyathelo ngasinye ngephutha lalo nenani lamaphoyinti ahlanganisiwe; umugqa ongaphezulu kwalo udweba iphutha lehla. Misa iphelisa ukusebenza ngalesi sinyathelo esiqhubekayo bese igcina lapho ifike khona. Hlehlisa ithatha bonke ukusebenza (noma ukubekwa kokugcina) buyele emuva; Setha kabusha ibuyisela iskena ezixhumanisweni zalo zefayela. Ukuze kube lula kulaptop, i-ICP isebenza ngesabelo esincishisiwe samaphoyinti (Amaphoyinti asetshenzisiwe, 5,000 kuya ku-60,000) futhi ilahla okuhlangana okukude kunalokho okushiwo yi-Ibanga elikhulu lokuhlangana (ngokuzenzakalelayo 5% wosayizi weskena, uncipha lapho uzinzile). Idinga ukubekwa okuyinkomba kuqala: amaskena ahlanganayo kancane abika ukuthi awakwazi ukuhlangana. Izindawo ezibukeka zilingene noma zigoqekile kuphela azikwazi ukulungisa indawo ngaphansi kwazo; engeza amapheya kulokho. Londoloza nokuthumela Londoloza iphrojekthi ibhala ifayela elincane le-.ccscans.json: igama leskena ngalinye, usayizi walo nesigaxa sokuqala se-64 KB, kanye nokuguqulwa kwalo. Alibambi amaphoyinti. Vula iphrojekthi… ithola amafayela eskena ngalezo zinkomba (amafayela kufanele engezwe kuqala) futhi ibuyisele wonke ukuguqulwa. Thumela i-LAS no Thumela i-E57 babhala ifayela elilodwa elinawo wonke amaskena endaweni yawo ehlanganisiwe. Amaphoyinti awabhalwa kabusha emithonjeni; ukuguqulwa kusetshenziswa ekuphumeni. Uma Funda wonke amaphoyinti kumafayela ivuliwe, ifayela ngalinye liyafundwa futhi ngephoyinti ngalinye (kuze kufike kuma-20 million ngeskena); uma livaliwe, kubhalwa kuphela amaphoyinti abonakala kumbukeli. Khombisa iclawudi elihlanganisiwe (BimCraft) ibhala i-LAS ivule kumbukeli we-3D eceleni kwemodeli, njengoba kwenza nanoma iyiphi iclawudi. Akukho okulayishwa. Ukuhlanganisa kusebenza ngeziyunithi zamafayela uqobo futhi kugcina amamilimitha: i-LAS ibhalwa ngesikali esilingana (kuze kufike ku-0.1 mm), i-E57 ngamanani amade. Uhlelo lokuqondanisa lungena ku-LAS kuphela uma wonke amaskena eqamba ikhodi efanayo ye-EPSG. Umbhali we-E57 ungowethu; uhlolwa ngokufunda amafayela ayo ngalo mfundi nangelibE57Format.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"map-layers","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Imephu emhlabeni ngaphansi kwemodeli","summary":"Beka imephu yesitaladi noma isithombe sendiza emhlabeni ngaphansi kwemodeli ye-IFC enendawo yayo emephini, kusuka ematheyelini emephu, emasevisini emephu noma esithombeni esinefayela lomhlaba.","section":"tasks","order":28,"keywords":["imephu","izingqimba zemephu","imephu yesisekelo","isithombe sendiza","isathelayithi","isayithi","phansi","amathayela","xyz","wms","wmts","isevisi yemephu","ifayela lomhlaba","ukubhalisa indawo","IfcMapConversion","ifreyimu elihlelekile","epsg","umongo wesayithi"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBona imodeli endaweni yayo: imephu yesitaladi noma isithombe sendiza sesayithi emhlabeni ngaphansi kwayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula imodeli ye-IFC ethwele indawo yayo emephini (ukuguqulwa kwemephu, IfcMapConversion, nohlelo lokuhlela oluhlelekile). Abathumeli bayibhala lapho izindawo zeprojekthi (iphoyinti lokuhlola, izindawo ezabelwanayo) sezisethiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzingqimba zemephu…\u003C/span\u003E. Ingxoxo ichaza uhlelo lwemodeli, njengo-EPSG:28356. Imodeli engenayo ukuguqulwa kwemephu ayikwazi ukuba nezingqimba zemephu: ingxoxo iyakusho lokho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzingqimba zemephu ezivela ku-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E. Kuze kube yilapho, akukho okucelwa noyiphi iseva; uma livuliwe, amaseva onezengeza abona indawo ezungeze imodeli nekheli lakho le-inthanethi, hhayi imodeli yakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza iqoqo\u003C/span\u003E khetha amathayela (ikheli elinezi-\u003Ccode\u003E{z}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{x}\u003C/code\u003E kanye \u003Ccode\u003E{y}\u003C/code\u003E), isevisi ye-WMS, WMTS noma ArcGIS (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThola izingqimba\u003C/span\u003E, bese ukhetha eyodwa), noma isithombe nefayela lomhlaba laso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVala ingxoxo. Imephu ilele emhlabeni ngaphansi kwephoyinti eliphansi kakhulu lemodeli, ngaphezu kwendawo imodeli emi kuyo, nokuphinde kube kude kangaka kuyo yonke indawo ezungezile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImephu ibonakala esikrinini kuphela; ayilondolozwa efayelini le-IFC. Uhlu lwezingqimba ligcinwa kule bhrawuza. Sebenzisa kuphela amasevisi emephu okuvunyelwe imigomo yawo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Bona imodeli endaweni yayo: imephu yesitaladi noma isithombe sendiza sesayithi emhlabeni ngaphansi kwayo. Izinyathelo Vula imodeli ye-IFC ethwele indawo yayo emephini (ukuguqulwa kwemephu, IfcMapConversion, nohlelo lokuhlela oluhlelekile). Abathumeli bayibhala lapho izindawo zeprojekthi (iphoyinti lokuhlola, izindawo ezabelwanayo) sezisethiwe. Khetha Bonisa › Izingqimba zemephu…. Ingxoxo ichaza uhlelo lwemodeli, njengo-EPSG:28356. Imodeli engenayo ukuguqulwa kwemephu ayikwazi ukuba nezingqimba zemephu: ingxoxo iyakusho lokho. Vula Izingqimba zemephu ezivela ku-inthanethi. Kuze kube yilapho, akukho okucelwa noyiphi iseva; uma livuliwe, amaseva onezengeza abona indawo ezungeze imodeli nekheli lakho le-inthanethi, hhayi imodeli yakho. Ku-Engeza iqoqo khetha amathayela (ikheli elinezi-{z}, {x} kanye {y}), isevisi ye-WMS, WMTS noma ArcGIS (Thola izingqimba, bese ukhetha eyodwa), noma isithombe nefayela lomhlaba laso. Vala ingxoxo. Imephu ilele emhlabeni ngaphansi kwephoyinti eliphansi kakhulu lemodeli, ngaphezu kwendawo imodeli emi kuyo, nokuphinde kube kude kangaka kuyo yonke indawo ezungezile. Imephu ibonakala esikrinini kuphela; ayilondolozwa efayelini le-IFC. Uhlu lwezingqimba ligcinwa kule bhrawuza. Sebenzisa kuphela amasevisi emephu okuvunyelwe imigomo yawo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"symbol-palette","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Iphalethi yezimpawu","summary":"Thola izimpawu zikagesi nezepayipi ngegama noma ngesithombe, ngamagama ozisebenzisayo, bese uzibeka epulanini ngokuchofoza kanye.","section":"tasks","order":28,"keywords":["iphalethi yezimpawu","inkinobho yezimpawu emugqeni wamathuluzi","odonga abalandelayo","izimpawu","izimpawu zikagesi","izimpawu zepayipi","ipulani lepayipi","ibhodwe langasese","ibhodwe","ilavatri","isinki","ibhavu","ishawa","idrenishi yomhlabathi","ihlanzo","ipayipi lamanzi","ivalvu","ivalvu yesango","amanzi abandayo","amanzi ashisayo","udoti","ukuphefumula","isitayela somugqa","izintandokazi","sesha"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"vula-futhi-ubeke-impawu","text":"Vula futhi ubeke impawu","level":2},{"id":"okusethwe-isethi-yepayipi","text":"Okusethwe isethi yepayipi","level":2},{"id":"izintandokazi-nekhibhodi","text":"Izintandokazi nekhibhodi","level":2},{"id":"xhumanisa-into-ebekiwe-nempawu","text":"Xhumanisa into ebekiwe nempawu","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula iphaneli eyodwa ebhala izimpawu zikagesi nezepulani lepayipi ngezithombe nangamagama azo, thola eyodwa oyifunayo, bese uyibeka epulanini. Akukho okudinga i-inthanethi lapha: izimpawu ziza nohlelo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vula-futhi-ubeke-impawu\"\u003EVula futhi ubeke impawu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula imodeli bese uvula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkwakhiwa\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIphalethi yezimpawu\u003C/span\u003E (umyalo obhaliwe: SYMBOLS). Inkinobho efanayo itholakala nakumenyu we-Tools yebha ye-Draw nanjengo \u003Cstrong\u003ESymbols\u003C/strong\u003E eqenjini le-Library emugqeni wamathuluzi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha isethi: \u003Cstrong\u003EElectrical\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003EPlumbing\u003C/strong\u003E, noma \u003Cstrong\u003EAll sets\u003C/strong\u003E. Bhala ebhokisini lokusesha ukuze ufinyeze uhlu. Ungasesha ngegama noma ngesifinyezo (WC, CW, HB).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza impawu. Ipulani selilungele ukuyibeka.\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImpawu \u003Cstrong\u003Ekagesi\u003C/strong\u003E iqala ithuluzi likagesi ngedivayisi ekhethiwe, ngakho konke okusemgqeni we-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/electrical-plan\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/electrical-plan\"\u003EThe electrical plan\u003C/a\u003E kuyasebenza: chofoza epulanini, isinyathelo esisodwa se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlehlisa\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImpawu \u003Cstrong\u003Eyepayipi\u003C/strong\u003E iqala ithuluzi lezimpawu zepulani. Chofoza epulanini. Ifitshure ehlala odongeni (ibhodwe, ilavatri, ibhavu, isinki, ibhavu lepayipi) ihlanganiswa necala lodonga eliseduze ngesimo sayo sigxile odongeni; idrenishi, amavalvu, ihita lamanzi nezitayela zemigqa zihamba lapho uchofoza khona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukujikisa impawu ngama-90 degrees (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ijikisa ngakolunye uhlangothi), noma uthayiphe i-engeli ku-\u003Cstrong\u003ERotation\u003C/strong\u003E ebhareni yokukhetha. Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuyeka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIfitshure noma ibhavu lepayipi elihlanganiswe nodonga likhumbula lelo donga: uma udonga lushintsha impawu iyashintsha nalo (ngalolo hlangothi, ngalobo bude odongeni) esinyathelweni sokuhlehlisa sinye. Uma ususa udonga, impawu ihlala lapho ibikhona futhi i-\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinkinga\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E iyabhala ukuthi &quot;ilahlekelwe udonga&quot;; yiyihambise noma uyisuse. Izimpawu ezibekwe kude nodonga aziboshwanga kulutho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImpawu ngayinye oyibekayo iyisinyathelo esisodwa se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlehlisa\u003C/span\u003E. Impawu ebekiwe iyisichasiso sepulani kufayela le-IFC ngethegi yayo (WC1, WC2, ...). Yikhethe ukuze ushintshe ithegi noma ukujika kwayo ku-\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzici\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okusethwe-isethi-yepayipi\"\u003EOkusethwe isethi yepayipi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinto zokusebenza (ibhodwe, urinal, ilavatri, ibhavu, ishawa, isinki sasekhishini, isinki elilodwa), idrenishi yomhlabathi, amahlanzo womhlaba nodonga, ipayipi lamanzi odongeni, i-hose bib, i-water heater, amavalvu (esango, i-globe, ebhola, ye-check, ye-butterfly, ye-pressure reducing) nezitayela zemigqa nezifinyezo zazo: amanzi abandayo (CW), amanzi ashisayo (HW), ukubuyisela kwamanzi ashisayo (HWR), udoti (W), ukuphefumula (V), idrenishi yesiphepho (SD) kanye negesi (G). Imidwebo ilinganiswa nepulani, ngakho igcina usayizi wayo esheethini eliphrintiwe. Isitayela somugqa siyisiphambano esifushane sokubonisa isitayela epulanini; dweba imigqa yangempela yamapayipi ngamathuluzi wamapayipi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELezi yizinkambiso ezijwayelekile zepulani lepayipi, zadwetshwa ngabathi; azinaziqinisekiso ze-ISO 4067-1 noma ASME Y32.4. Zaqhathaniswa nezincazelo zomdwebo ezitholakalayo nemihlahlandlela yokuqeqesha (uhlu luseceleni lomthombo wesethi, olutshela lapho sivumelana khona nalapho sihluke khona), azikopiwe kunoma yiyiphi imikhiqizo, futhi zikhululekile ukusetshenziswa (Apache-2.0). Amasethi emidwebo ayahluka, ngakho hlola inkomba yephrojekthi yakho. Zizimpawu zepulani, hhayi uklelo lwepayipi: azilinganisi amapayipi noma zihlola amakhodi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izintandokazi-nekhibhodi\"\u003EIzintandokazi nekhibhodi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza inkanyezi kumpawu (noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kuyo) ukuze uyigcine njengentandokazi. Izintandokazi zibekwa kuqala futhi zihlala kulesi sisheshi. \u003Cstrong\u003EIzintandokazi kuphela\u003C/strong\u003E ikhombisa lezo kuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↓\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kusuka ebhokisini lokusesha ifika ezimpaweni; izinkinobho zomcibisholo, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ←\"\u003Efn ←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EHome\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kanye \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn →\"\u003Efn →\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnd\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E zihambisa phakathi kwazo; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ikhetha eyigxilile; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ivala iphalethi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-foni iphalethi iba yishidi ngaphansi kwesikrini; liyashintsha uma ukhetha impawu ukuze ubone ipulani. Yivule futhi kumenyu ye-Build noma kunkinobho ethi \u003Cstrong\u003EPalette\u003C/strong\u003E ebhareni yokukhetha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma ifayela lisebenzisa isethi yezimpawu le-build lingenayo, ipulani likhombisa ibhokisi lapho impawu ibikhona, futhi i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinkinga\u003C/span\u003E iyayibhala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xhumanisa-into-ebekiwe-nempawu\"\u003EXhumanisa into ebekiwe nempawu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIfitshure ethathwe emtapweni ingento ye-3D, kodwa uhlelo lukagesi lubonisa njengempawu yayo. Uyibeka \u003Cstrong\u003Ekanye\u003C/strong\u003E bese uyixhumanisa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha Build › \u003Cstrong\u003ESymbol link\u003C/strong\u003E (noma thayipha SYMBOLLINK). Isigaba se-Symbol link siyavuleka ngakwesobunxele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha izinto ezibekiwe epulanini noma ku-3D. Isigaba sibonisa ukuthi zingaki ezikhethiwe nokuthi zixhunyene nani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003ESymbol\u003C/strong\u003E (kunoma iyiphi isethi yezimpawu: Electrical, Plumbing) bese ukhetha \u003Cstrong\u003ELink\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInto isengento eyodwa, futhi wonke amatafula awubala kanye:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E3D\u003C/strong\u003E ihlala ibonisa umzimba wayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIpulani\u003C/strong\u003E libonisa ifomu layo lepulani, njengakuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIpulani lapho i-\u003Cstrong\u003EThis view shows linked elements as\u003C/strong\u003E isethelwe ku-\u003Cstrong\u003ETheir symbol (a services layout)\u003C/strong\u003E libonisa impawu esikhundleni sayo. Ukuchofoza impawu kukhetha into. Ukukhetha kugcinwa lowo mbono (ipulani lomgangatho welevele, ipulani lesiling, noma i-callout) kufayela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJikisa impawu ngama-90°\u003C/strong\u003E iyijikisa ngokuphambene nento yayo. \u003Cstrong\u003ESusa ixhumanisi\u003C/strong\u003E iyasusa ukuxhumana; into ihlala. Itafula le-\u003Cstrong\u003ELinked symbols\u003C/strong\u003E libala ngalinye into exhunyiwe kanye nelevele layo negumbi limi kulo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAkwakhiwe: ukukhetha komumo esihlokweni kuyiyona yepulani lelevele elibonisa; izinsiza ezibekwe ngethuluzi likagesi zingizimpawu kuzo zonke amapulani, njengakuqala.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Vula iphaneli eyodwa ebhala izimpawu zikagesi nezepulani lepayipi ngezithombe nangamagama azo, thola eyodwa oyifunayo, bese uyibeka epulanini. Akukho okudinga i-inthanethi lapha: izimpawu ziza nohlelo. Vula futhi ubeke impawu Vula imodeli bese uvula Ukwakhiwa › Iphalethi yezimpawu (umyalo obhaliwe: SYMBOLS). Inkinobho efanayo itholakala nakumenyu we-Tools yebha ye-Draw nanjengo Symbols eqenjini le-Library emugqeni wamathuluzi. Khetha isethi: Electrical noma Plumbing, noma All sets. Bhala ebhokisini lokusesha ukuze ufinyeze uhlu. Ungasesha ngegama noma ngesifinyezo (WC, CW, HB). Chofoza impawu. Ipulani selilungele ukuyibeka. Impawu kagesi iqala ithuluzi likagesi ngedivayisi ekhethiwe, ngakho konke okusemgqeni we-The electrical plan kuyasebenza: chofoza epulanini, isinyathelo esisodwa se-Hlehlisa. Impawu yepayipi iqala ithuluzi lezimpawu zepulani. Chofoza epulanini. Ifitshure ehlala odongeni (ibhodwe, ilavatri, ibhavu, isinki, ibhavu lepayipi) ihlanganiswa necala lodonga eliseduze ngesimo sayo sigxile odongeni; idrenishi, amavalvu, ihita lamanzi nezitayela zemigqa zihamba lapho uchofoza khona. Cindezela R ukujikisa impawu ngama-90 degrees (Shift+R ijikisa ngakolunye uhlangothi), noma uthayiphe i-engeli ku-Rotation ebhareni yokukhetha. Cindezela Esc ukuyeka. Ifitshure noma ibhavu lepayipi elihlanganiswe nodonga likhumbula lelo donga: uma udonga lushintsha impawu iyashintsha nalo (ngalolo hlangothi, ngalobo bude odongeni) esinyathelweni sokuhlehlisa sinye. Uma ususa udonga, impawu ihlala lapho ibikhona futhi i-Izinkinga iyabhala ukuthi \"ilahlekelwe udonga\"; yiyihambise noma uyisuse. Izimpawu ezibekwe kude nodonga aziboshwanga kulutho. Impawu ngayinye oyibekayo iyisinyathelo esisodwa se-Hlehlisa. Impawu ebekiwe iyisichasiso sepulani kufayela le-IFC ngethegi yayo (WC1, WC2, ...). Yikhethe ukuze ushintshe ithegi noma ukujika kwayo ku-Izici, noma cindezela Delete. Okusethwe isethi yepayipi Izinto zokusebenza (ibhodwe, urinal, ilavatri, ibhavu, ishawa, isinki sasekhishini, isinki elilodwa), idrenishi yomhlabathi, amahlanzo womhlaba nodonga, ipayipi lamanzi odongeni, i-hose bib, i-water heater, amavalvu (esango, i-globe, ebhola, ye-check, ye-butterfly, ye-pressure reducing) nezitayela zemigqa nezifinyezo zazo: amanzi abandayo (CW), amanzi ashisayo (HW), ukubuyisela kwamanzi ashisayo (HWR), udoti (W), ukuphefumula (V), idrenishi yesiphepho (SD) kanye negesi (G). Imidwebo ilinganiswa nepulani, ngakho igcina usayizi wayo esheethini eliphrintiwe. Isitayela somugqa siyisiphambano esifushane sokubonisa isitayela epulanini; dweba imigqa yangempela yamapayipi ngamathuluzi wamapayipi. Lezi yizinkambiso ezijwayelekile zepulani lepayipi, zadwetshwa ngabathi; azinaziqinisekiso ze-ISO 4067-1 noma ASME Y32.4. Zaqhathaniswa nezincazelo zomdwebo ezitholakalayo nemihlahlandlela yokuqeqesha (uhlu luseceleni lomthombo wesethi, olutshela lapho sivumelana khona nalapho sihluke khona), azikopiwe kunoma yiyiphi imikhiqizo, futhi zikhululekile ukusetshenziswa (Apache-2.0). Amasethi emidwebo ayahluka, ngakho hlola inkomba yephrojekthi yakho. Zizimpawu zepulani, hhayi uklelo lwepayipi: azilinganisi amapayipi noma zihlola amakhodi. Izintandokazi nekhibhodi Chofoza inkanyezi kumpawu (noma cindezela F kuyo) ukuze uyigcine njengentandokazi. Izintandokazi zibekwa kuqala futhi zihlala kulesi sisheshi. Izintandokazi kuphela ikhombisa lezo kuphela. ↓ kusuka ebhokisini lokusesha ifika ezimpaweni; izinkinobho zomcibisholo, Home kanye End zihambisa phakathi kwazo; Enter ikhetha eyigxilile; Esc ivala iphalethi. Ku-foni iphalethi iba yishidi ngaphansi kwesikrini; liyashintsha uma ukhetha impawu ukuze ubone ipulani. Yivule futhi kumenyu ye-Build noma kunkinobho ethi Palette ebhareni yokukhetha. Uma ifayela lisebenzisa isethi yezimpawu le-build lingenayo, ipulani likhombisa ibhokisi lapho impawu ibikhona, futhi i-Izinkinga iyayibhala. Xhumanisa into ebekiwe nempawu Ifitshure ethathwe emtapweni ingento ye-3D, kodwa uhlelo lukagesi lubonisa njengempawu yayo. Uyibeka kanye bese uyixhumanisa: Khetha Build › Symbol link (noma thayipha SYMBOLLINK). Isigaba se-Symbol link siyavuleka ngakwesobunxele. Khetha izinto ezibekiwe epulanini noma ku-3D. Isigaba sibonisa ukuthi zingaki ezikhethiwe nokuthi zixhunyene nani. Khetha Symbol (kunoma iyiphi isethi yezimpawu: Electrical, Plumbing) bese ukhetha Link. Into isengento eyodwa, futhi wonke amatafula awubala kanye: 3D ihlala ibonisa umzimba wayo. Ipulani libonisa ifomu layo lepulani, njengakuqala. Ipulani lapho i-This view shows linked elements as isethelwe ku-Their symbol (a services layout) libonisa impawu esikhundleni sayo. Ukuchofoza impawu kukhetha into. Ukukhetha kugcinwa lowo mbono (ipulani lomgangatho welevele, ipulani lesiling, noma i-callout) kufayela. Jikisa impawu ngama-90° iyijikisa ngokuphambene nento yayo. Susa ixhumanisi iyasusa ukuxhumana; into ihlala. Itafula le-Linked symbols libala ngalinye into exhunyiwe kanye nelevele layo negumbi limi kulo. Akwakhiwe: ukukhetha komumo esihlokweni kuyiyona yepulani lelevele elibonisa; izinsiza ezibekwe ngethuluzi likagesi zingizimpawu kuzo zonke amapulani, njengakuqala.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"measure","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Linganisa amabanga, izindawo zobuso nezindawo ku-3D","summary":"Linganisa phakathi kwamaphoyinti amabili emodelini ye-IFC ngokubamba izikhonwa nemiphetho, funda umehluko ngo-X, Y no-Z, futhi ulinganise indawo yobuso obuqondile.","section":"tasks","order":28,"keywords":["linganisa","ukulinganisa","ibanga","ubude","isilinganiso","indawo","indawo yobuso","ukubamba","isikhonwa","umphetho","ithephu","umbusi","ukukhululeka","indawo","ukuphakama","ilongithudi","ilathithudi","lat long","ukuhlangana","ukuguqulwa kwemephu","EPSG","ukuhlola umhlaba","eastings","northings","WGS 84","idatamu"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukubone","text":"Okufanele ukubone","level":2},{"id":"lapho-iphoyinti-likhona-emhlabeni","text":"Lapho iphoyinti likhona emhlabeni","level":2},{"id":"amaphutha-ajwayelekile","text":"Amaphutha ajwayelekile","level":2},{"id":"okulandelayo","text":"Okulandelayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHlola ukukhululeka, ubude bodonga noma usayizi wobuso ngqo kusuka emodelini, ngaphandle kokuvula uhlelo lokuhlela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula imodeli ye-IFC.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinganisa\u003C/span\u003E ethuluzini, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Ibha ivuleka ngaphansi kombono.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbanga:\u003C/strong\u003E uma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbanga\u003C/span\u003E likhethiwe, chofoza iphoyinti lokuqala, bese lesibili. Eduze nesikhonwa isikhombi siyasibamba, eduze nomphetho siyawubamba; ilebula elincane esikhombisini liyakusho okubanjwe. Ukuchofoza okubili ngakunye kwenza isilinganiso esisodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIndawo yobuso:\u003C/strong\u003E khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo yobuso\u003C/span\u003E bese uchofoza ubuso. Ubuso bonke obuqondile buyakhanya, futhi indawo yabo iyabonakala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImigqa eqondile:\u003C/strong\u003E bamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ngenkathi ukhetha iphoyinti lesibili, noma chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgqo\u003C/span\u003E ebheni ukuze uyigcine. Umugqa ngalesi sikhathi uhamba ngalowo eksini isikhombi esiseduze kakhulu nawo (kwi-top view, ngo-X noma Y wepulani; ezinye izibuko ngo-X, Y noma Z), futhi ilebula lesikhombi lithi &quot;straight along an axis&quot;. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E isaqala futhi imise ukulinganisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESula\u003C/span\u003E ukususa izilinganiso, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKuqediwe\u003C/span\u003E (noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) ukuze uyeke ukulinganisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukubone\"\u003EOkufanele ukubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmugqa phakathi kwamaphoyinti amabili nobude bawo phezu kwawo, nasebhalwe ngalo ukuthi uhamba kangakanani ngo-X, Y no-Z (emaxhezini emodeli, u-Z uphakama), konke ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmayunithi\u003C/span\u003E okhethe ethuluzini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIndawo yobuso ngamamitha ayisikwele, ebusweni nasebhalweni ebheni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmalebula ahlala kuzilinganiso zawo lapho uzungeza, uhambisa futhi usondeze.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELapho ulinganisa, ukuchofoza akukhethi izinto. Isigaba esinqunyiwe noma ibhokisi liyasahlukanisa imodeli, futhi ungalinganisa lokho okubonisayo, kubandakanya nobuso obusikiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lapho-iphoyinti-likhona-emhlabeni\"\u003ELapho iphoyinti likhona emhlabeni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo\u003C/span\u003E ebheni lokulinganisa, bese uchofoza iphoyinti emodelini (libamba izikhonwa nemiphetho njengamabanga). Ibha iyabonisa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Eubude nobubanzi bendawo\u003C/strong\u003E (ilathithudi nelongithudi), ngamadigri ahlukaniswe ngamadesimali nangamadigri, amaminithi nemizuzwana, ku-WGS 84 okokuqala;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Eizindawo zemephu\u003C/strong\u003E (ama-eastings nama-northings, abhalwe ngo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmayunithi\u003C/span\u003E akhethwe ethuluzini) ohlelweni lwemephu lwemodeli, njenge-\u003Ccode\u003EEPSG:28356\u003C/code\u003E;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Eukuphakama\u003C/strong\u003E nedatamu eliphakeme elifayela elilibiza, nedatamu \u003Cstrong\u003Elayo\u003C/strong\u003E lefayela (njenge-GDA94).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKopisha\u003C/span\u003E ifaka konke ebhodini lokukopisha ngomugqa owodwa. Shintsha uhlelo lobude nobubanzi esikusebenzisayo ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › BimCraft › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo\u003C/span\u003E: WGS 84 (njengoba kwenziwa yi-GPS namamephu awebhu), idatamu layo lefayela, noma enye ejwayelekile njenge-ETRS89 noma i-NAD83.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELokhu kudinga imodeli enendawo yomhlaba: eyathunyelwa ngezindawo zemephu (ukuguqulwa kwemephu kuhlelo oluhlelekile olunekhodi ye-EPSG). Imodeli enobude nobubanzi besayithi kuphela ithola indawo esondelene, eyenziwe kusukela ephoyinteni lesayithi nasenyakatho yayo yangempela, futhi ibha iyakusho lokho. Lapho kuvulwe amamodeli amaningi, iphoyinti ngalinye lisebenzisa indawo yomhlaba yemodeli yalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkushintsha phakathi kwamadatamu (njengo-GDA94 kuya ku-WGS 84) kwenziwa ngaphandle kwamafayela egridi, ngakho kulungile ngamamitha ambalwa; umugqa wesimo uyakusho ukuthi kulungile kangakanani. Izindawo zemephu ngokwazo zinembile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amaphutha-ajwayelekile\"\u003EAmaphutha ajwayelekile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;…ayinayo indawo yomhlaba&quot;.\u003C/strong\u003E Ifayela alinaso ukuguqulwa kwemephu futhi alinaso ubude nobubanzi besayithi. Lithumele futhi ngohlelo lwalo lokuhlela olusethiwe (izindawo ezabelwanayo / iphoyinti lokuhlola ethuluzini lokwakha).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzindawo zemephu kodwa azikho ubude nobubanzi.\u003C/strong\u003E Ifayela libiza uhlelo lwalo lwemephu ngaphandle kwekhodi ye-EPSG, noma ngekhodi engekho ohlwini; umugqa wesimo uyakusho ukuthi yiphi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIphoyinti lifika ebusweni, hhayi esikhonweni.\u003C/strong\u003E Ukubamba kubheka into ephansi kwesikhombi. Sondela esikhonweni, noma sondeza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIndawo incane kunalokho obekulindelwe.\u003C/strong\u003E Izimbobo ziyasuswa, futhi ubuso obugobile buyizinhlangothi eziningi: chofoza ngayinye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E imise ukulinganisa.\u003C/strong\u003E Ukucindezela kokuqala kususa ibanga elingaphelele; okwesibili kuyayeka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulandelayo\"\u003EOkulandelayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/section-plane\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/section-plane\"\u003ESika imodeli ye-IFC ngendiza esinqunyiwe\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\"\u003EFihla, hlukanisa nokubona ngaphakathi kwezinto\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Hlola ukukhululeka, ubude bodonga noma usayizi wobuso ngqo kusuka emodelini, ngaphandle kokuvula uhlelo lokuhlela. Izinyathelo Vula imodeli ye-IFC. Chofoza Linganisa ethuluzini, noma cindezela M. Ibha ivuleka ngaphansi kombono. Ibanga: uma Ibanga likhethiwe, chofoza iphoyinti lokuqala, bese lesibili. Eduze nesikhonwa isikhombi siyasibamba, eduze nomphetho siyawubamba; ilebula elincane esikhombisini liyakusho okubanjwe. Ukuchofoza okubili ngakunye kwenza isilinganiso esisodwa. Indawo yobuso: khetha Indawo yobuso bese uchofoza ubuso. Ubuso bonke obuqondile buyakhanya, futhi indawo yabo iyabonakala. Imigqa eqondile: bamba Shift ngenkathi ukhetha iphoyinti lesibili, noma chofoza Ngqo ebheni ukuze uyigcine. Umugqa ngalesi sikhathi uhamba ngalowo eksini isikhombi esiseduze kakhulu nawo (kwi-top view, ngo-X noma Y wepulani; ezinye izibuko ngo-X, Y noma Z), futhi ilebula lesikhombi lithi \"straight along an axis\". M isaqala futhi imise ukulinganisa. Chofoza Sula ukususa izilinganiso, noma Kuqediwe (noma Esc) ukuze uyeke ukulinganisa. Okufanele ukubone Umugqa phakathi kwamaphoyinti amabili nobude bawo phezu kwawo, nasebhalwe ngalo ukuthi uhamba kangakanani ngo-X, Y no-Z (emaxhezini emodeli, u-Z uphakama), konke ngaphansi kwe-Amayunithi okhethe ethuluzini. Indawo yobuso ngamamitha ayisikwele, ebusweni nasebhalweni ebheni. Amalebula ahlala kuzilinganiso zawo lapho uzungeza, uhambisa futhi usondeze. Lapho ulinganisa, ukuchofoza akukhethi izinto. Isigaba esinqunyiwe noma ibhokisi liyasahlukanisa imodeli, futhi ungalinganisa lokho okubonisayo, kubandakanya nobuso obusikiwe. Lapho iphoyinti likhona emhlabeni Chofoza Indawo ebheni lokulinganisa, bese uchofoza iphoyinti emodelini (libamba izikhonwa nemiphetho njengamabanga). Ibha iyabonisa: ubude nobubanzi bendawo (ilathithudi nelongithudi), ngamadigri ahlukaniswe ngamadesimali nangamadigri, amaminithi nemizuzwana, ku-WGS 84 okokuqala; izindawo zemephu (ama-eastings nama-northings, abhalwe ngo-Amayunithi akhethwe ethuluzini) ohlelweni lwemephu lwemodeli, njenge-EPSG:28356; ukuphakama nedatamu eliphakeme elifayela elilibiza, nedatamu layo lefayela (njenge-GDA94). Kopisha ifaka konke ebhodini lokukopisha ngomugqa owodwa. Shintsha uhlelo lobude nobubanzi esikusebenzisayo ku-Izilungiselelo › BimCraft › Indawo: WGS 84 (njengoba kwenziwa yi-GPS namamephu awebhu), idatamu layo lefayela, noma enye ejwayelekile njenge-ETRS89 noma i-NAD83. Lokhu kudinga imodeli enendawo yomhlaba: eyathunyelwa ngezindawo zemephu (ukuguqulwa kwemephu kuhlelo oluhlelekile olunekhodi ye-EPSG). Imodeli enobude nobubanzi besayithi kuphela ithola indawo esondelene, eyenziwe kusukela ephoyinteni lesayithi nasenyakatho yayo yangempela, futhi ibha iyakusho lokho. Lapho kuvulwe amamodeli amaningi, iphoyinti ngalinye lisebenzisa indawo yomhlaba yemodeli yalo. Ukushintsha phakathi kwamadatamu (njengo-GDA94 kuya ku-WGS 84) kwenziwa ngaphandle kwamafayela egridi, ngakho kulungile ngamamitha ambalwa; umugqa wesimo uyakusho ukuthi kulungile kangakanani. Izindawo zemephu ngokwazo zinembile. Amaphutha ajwayelekile \"…ayinayo indawo yomhlaba\". Ifayela alinaso ukuguqulwa kwemephu futhi alinaso ubude nobubanzi besayithi. Lithumele futhi ngohlelo lwalo lokuhlela olusethiwe (izindawo ezabelwanayo / iphoyinti lokuhlola ethuluzini lokwakha). Izindawo zemephu kodwa azikho ubude nobubanzi. Ifayela libiza uhlelo lwalo lwemephu ngaphandle kwekhodi ye-EPSG, noma ngekhodi engekho ohlwini; umugqa wesimo uyakusho ukuthi yiphi. Iphoyinti lifika ebusweni, hhayi esikhonweni. Ukubamba kubheka into ephansi kwesikhombi. Sondela esikhonweni, noma sondeza. Indawo incane kunalokho obekulindelwe. Izimbobo ziyasuswa, futhi ubuso obugobile buyizinhlangothi eziningi: chofoza ngayinye. Esc imise ukulinganisa. Ukucindezela kokuqala kususa ibanga elingaphelele; okwesibili kuyayeka. Okulandelayo Sika imodeli ye-IFC ngendiza esinqunyiwe Fihla, hlukanisa nokubona ngaphakathi kwezinto","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"scan-to-walls","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Izindonga nemingcele kusukela ekuskenweni ngefoni noma nge-laser","summary":"Guqula ukuskena kwegumbi libe izindonga, iminyango namagumbi ahlongozwayo ovumela ngayinye ngayinye.","section":"tasks","order":29,"keywords":["skena","ukuskena ngefoni","lidar","ifu lamaphoyinti","izindonga ekuskeneni","iminyango ekuskeneni","ukuskena kwegumbi","ply","e57","las","obj","phakamisa"],"headings":[{"id":"yini-eyenzayo","text":"Yini eyenzayo","level":2},{"id":"okuhlolwayo","text":"Okuhlolwayo","level":2},{"id":"akuqinisekiswanga-kuze-kuhlolwe","text":"Akuqinisekiswanga kuze kuhlolwe","level":2},{"id":"akukwenzi-okwamanje","text":"Akukwenzi okwamanje","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"yini-eyenzayo\"\u003EYini eyenzayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma ukuskena kuvulekile (ifu lamaphoyinti njenge-PLY, E57 noma LAS, noma imesh njenge-OBJ), i-BimCraft iyasika ukuskena ekuphakameni kwepulani, iyikhombise ibe yisikwele ngokubhekene nesakhiwo, bese ifuna imizila ende nebhoshiwe yamaphoyinti: lezo zindonga. Igebe elicishe libe ububanzi bomnyango phakathi kwemizila emibili esemgqeni owodwa lingena udonga olunomnyango. Izindonga ezivala indawo yenza igumbi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAkukho okudwetshwayo kuze kwamukelwe. Izindonga, iminyango nezindawo ziyafika njengohlu lwezincomo (zingoshintsho bemodi ye-Suggest): gcina ezilungile, nqaba ezingalungile, bese konke okugcinile kudwetshwa ngesinyathelo esisodwa se-Hlehlisa. Amagumbi avela ngokwawo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuhlolwayo\"\u003EOkuhlolwayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzindonga ezingavaliwe, imizila yezindonga emfushane kunobukhulu bodonga, negebe elinobukhulu bomnyango elingenalo udonga ozungeze lona, zibikwa njengezinkinga ngendawo, ukuze ubukele ukuskena lapho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akuqinisekiswanga-kuze-kuhlolwe\"\u003EAkuqinisekiswanga kuze kuhlolwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzindonga, iminyango namagumbi owamukele ekuskeneni amaka njengaqinisekiswanga: ibhokisi elinemigqa nombuzo &quot;?&quot; ephlaneni, uze ukumaka njengabahlolisisiwe. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/verification\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/verification\"\u003EMaka izinto njengezihlolisisiwe noma ezaqinisekiswa endaweni\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akukwenzi-okwamanje\"\u003EAkukwenzi okwamanje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIthola izindonga ezigijima ezimbili ezingqamanayo. Udonga oluchwekile noma oluyisangqa ayitholwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsitezi esisodwa ngesikhathi. Amawindi awatholwa (iwindi liyigebe kuphela uma ukusika kusezingeni lesiyingi).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIlinyelwe kuskeno lamagumbi elenziwe nakumesh, kodwa akukaze linyelwe ekuskeneni kwefoni yangempela. Ukuthi lusebenza kanjani ekuskeneni kwangempela (ukuphambuka emgwaqeni omude, impahla eseduze kwezindonga, ingilazi, iminyango evulekile) akwaziwa, futhi ukulungisa ngokwezinkomba zangempela yisinyathelo esilandelayo. Hlola yonke incomo ngokuskena ngaphambi kokuyamukela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Yini eyenzayo Uma ukuskena kuvulekile (ifu lamaphoyinti njenge-PLY, E57 noma LAS, noma imesh njenge-OBJ), i-BimCraft iyasika ukuskena ekuphakameni kwepulani, iyikhombise ibe yisikwele ngokubhekene nesakhiwo, bese ifuna imizila ende nebhoshiwe yamaphoyinti: lezo zindonga. Igebe elicishe libe ububanzi bomnyango phakathi kwemizila emibili esemgqeni owodwa lingena udonga olunomnyango. Izindonga ezivala indawo yenza igumbi. Akukho okudwetshwayo kuze kwamukelwe. Izindonga, iminyango nezindawo ziyafika njengohlu lwezincomo (zingoshintsho bemodi ye-Suggest): gcina ezilungile, nqaba ezingalungile, bese konke okugcinile kudwetshwa ngesinyathelo esisodwa se-Hlehlisa. Amagumbi avela ngokwawo. Okuhlolwayo Izindonga ezingavaliwe, imizila yezindonga emfushane kunobukhulu bodonga, negebe elinobukhulu bomnyango elingenalo udonga ozungeze lona, zibikwa njengezinkinga ngendawo, ukuze ubukele ukuskena lapho. Akuqinisekiswanga kuze kuhlolwe Izindonga, iminyango namagumbi owamukele ekuskeneni amaka njengaqinisekiswanga: ibhokisi elinemigqa nombuzo \"?\" ephlaneni, uze ukumaka njengabahlolisisiwe. Bheka Maka izinto njengezihlolisisiwe noma ezaqinisekiswa endaweni. Akukwenzi okwamanje Ithola izindonga ezigijima ezimbili ezingqamanayo. Udonga oluchwekile noma oluyisangqa ayitholwa. Isitezi esisodwa ngesikhathi. Amawindi awatholwa (iwindi liyigebe kuphela uma ukusika kusezingeni lesiyingi). Ilinyelwe kuskeno lamagumbi elenziwe nakumesh, kodwa akukaze linyelwe ekuskeneni kwefoni yangempela. Ukuthi lusebenza kanjani ekuskeneni kwangempela (ukuphambuka emgwaqeni omude, impahla eseduze kwezindonga, ingilazi, iminyango evulekile) akwaziwa, futhi ukulungisa ngokwezinkomba zangempela yisinyathelo esilandelayo. Hlola yonke incomo ngokuskena ngaphambi kokuyamukela.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"issues-bcf","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Izinkinga namafayela e-BCF","summary":"Gcina umbono wemodeli njengenkinga — ikhamera, izakhi ezikhethiwe, ezifihliwe, isigaba — yabelane ngayo njengefayela le-BCF nezinye izinsiza zokuhlanganisa, futhi uvule amafayela abo e-BCF ukuze ubone izinkinga zabo.","section":"tasks","order":29,"keywords":["bcf","bcfzip","inkinga","izinkinga","isihloko","indawo yokubuka","umbiko wokungqubuzana","ukuhlanganisa","izimvo","isithombe","vula bcf","londoloza bcf","khipha","ngenisa"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okubonakalayo","text":"Okubonakalayo","level":2},{"id":"okuwusizo-ukukwazi","text":"Okuwusizo ukukwazi","level":2},{"id":"amaphutha-ajwayelekile","text":"Amaphutha ajwayelekile","level":2},{"id":"okulandelayo","text":"Okulandelayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza ngqo enkingeni emodelini bese ugcina umbono oyibonisayo, bese uyidlulisela ngefayela le-BCF, ifomethi ezinye izinsiza zokuhlanganisa ezifunda nezibhala kuyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula imodeli ye-IFC bese usetha umbono: zungeza kuyo, khetha izakhi ezihileleke, fihla okuvimbelayo, uyisike ngendiza yesigaba noma ngebhokisi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ithebhu ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIssues\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesokudla, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew issue from this view\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBhala isihloko, nombono uma ufuna; khetha isimo; nika igama lakho noma i-e-mail (uma ungenile, igama lo-akhawunti yakho liyagcwaliswa; bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/settings#your-name-on-issues\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/settings\" data-hash=\"your-name-on-issues\"\u003EIzilungiselelo ze-BimCraft\u003C/a\u003E). Chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECreate issue\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow\u003C/span\u003E enkingeni ukuze ubuyisele umbono wayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza i-BCF\u003C/span\u003E ukulanda zonke izinkinga njengefayela elilodwa le-\u003Ccode\u003E.bcf\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuze ubone izinkinga ezenziwe omunye umuntu, chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen BCF…\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha ifayela lakhe le-\u003Ccode\u003E.bcf\u003C/code\u003E noma le-\u003Ccode\u003E.bcfzip\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okubonakalayo\"\u003EOkubonakalayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInkinga ngayinye ohlwini ngesithombe sombono wayo, isihloko, isimo, umbhali nosuku.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow\u003C/span\u003E ibuyisela ikhamera, izakhi ezikhethiwe, okwafihlwa (noma izinto kuphela ezibonisiwe) kanye nesigaba. Izakhi zitholakala nge-GlobalId yazo kuzo zonke izimodeli ezivuliwe; umugqa wesimo uyatshela uma ezinye zingekho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIpulani yesigaba noma ibhokisi evela kwenye insiza iboniswa uma ihambisana nama-akhisi emodeli; amapulani athambekile noma angeziwe abuya njengevolumu yesigaba (kuze kube ngamapulani ayi-6). Inkinga igcina ibhokisi lokuqala levolumu enamabhokisi amaningi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuwusizo-ukukwazi\"\u003EOkuwusizo ukukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIfayela liyi-BCF 2.1 futhi ligcina umbono ngokuhlelwa kwemodeli, ngakho ezinye izinsiza zibeka ikhamera endaweni efanayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinkinga zihlala kule thebhu uze uzigcine. Ukuvula enye imodeli kugcina uhlu; vula imodeli izinkinga ezihlobene nayo ngaphambi kokuzibonisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIkhamera ye-parallel (orthogonal) evela kwenye insiza iboniswa ngekhamera ye-perspective yalo mbonisi, ibuyiselwe emuva ukuze ingxenye efanayo yemodeli igcwalise umbono.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amaphutha-ajwayelekile\"\u003EAmaphutha ajwayelekile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkubonisa kuhambise ikhamera endaweni engavamile.\u003C/strong\u003E Inkinga yenziwa kwenye imodeli noma ngamanye ama-coordinates. Vula imodeli efanele kuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIfayela alivuleki.\u003C/strong\u003E Alisona i-BCF zip, noma lonakele; umugqa wesimo uchaza ngani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulandelayo\"\u003EOkulandelayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\"\u003EFihla, khipha bodwa nobone ngokudlulisa izakhi\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/section-plane\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/section-plane\"\u003ESika imodeli ye-IFC ngendiza yesigaba\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Chofoza ngqo enkingeni emodelini bese ugcina umbono oyibonisayo, bese uyidlulisela ngefayela le-BCF, ifomethi ezinye izinsiza zokuhlanganisa ezifunda nezibhala kuyo. Izinyathelo Vula imodeli ye-IFC bese usetha umbono: zungeza kuyo, khetha izakhi ezihileleke, fihla okuvimbelayo, uyisike ngendiza yesigaba noma ngebhokisi. Chofoza ithebhu ethi Issues ngakwesokudla, bese New issue from this view. Bhala isihloko, nombono uma ufuna; khetha isimo; nika igama lakho noma i-e-mail (uma ungenile, igama lo-akhawunti yakho liyagcwaliswa; bona Izilungiselelo ze-BimCraft). Chofoza Create issue. Chofoza Show enkingeni ukuze ubuyisele umbono wayo. Chofoza Londoloza i-BCF ukulanda zonke izinkinga njengefayela elilodwa le-.bcf. Ukuze ubone izinkinga ezenziwe omunye umuntu, chofoza Open BCF… bese ukhetha ifayela lakhe le-.bcf noma le-.bcfzip. Okubonakalayo Inkinga ngayinye ohlwini ngesithombe sombono wayo, isihloko, isimo, umbhali nosuku. Show ibuyisela ikhamera, izakhi ezikhethiwe, okwafihlwa (noma izinto kuphela ezibonisiwe) kanye nesigaba. Izakhi zitholakala nge-GlobalId yazo kuzo zonke izimodeli ezivuliwe; umugqa wesimo uyatshela uma ezinye zingekho. Ipulani yesigaba noma ibhokisi evela kwenye insiza iboniswa uma ihambisana nama-akhisi emodeli; amapulani athambekile noma angeziwe abuya njengevolumu yesigaba (kuze kube ngamapulani ayi-6). Inkinga igcina ibhokisi lokuqala levolumu enamabhokisi amaningi. Okuwusizo ukukwazi Ifayela liyi-BCF 2.1 futhi ligcina umbono ngokuhlelwa kwemodeli, ngakho ezinye izinsiza zibeka ikhamera endaweni efanayo. Izinkinga zihlala kule thebhu uze uzigcine. Ukuvula enye imodeli kugcina uhlu; vula imodeli izinkinga ezihlobene nayo ngaphambi kokuzibonisa. Ikhamera ye-parallel (orthogonal) evela kwenye insiza iboniswa ngekhamera ye-perspective yalo mbonisi, ibuyiselwe emuva ukuze ingxenye efanayo yemodeli igcwalise umbono. Amaphutha ajwayelekile Ukubonisa kuhambise ikhamera endaweni engavamile. Inkinga yenziwa kwenye imodeli noma ngamanye ama-coordinates. Vula imodeli efanele kuqala. Ifayela alivuleki. Alisona i-BCF zip, noma lonakele; umugqa wesimo uchaza ngani. Okulandelayo Fihla, khipha bodwa nobone ngokudlulisa izakhi Sika imodeli ye-IFC ngendiza yesigaba","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"model-from-a-scan","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Yakha imodeli kusukeni","summary":"Uhambo olufushane kusuka ku-laser scan kuya kodonga: vula ifu lamaphoyinti eduze kwesakhiwo esisha, uliqondanise nezinga, bese uwulandela udonga epulanini.","section":"tasks","order":29,"keywords":["skena","skena nge-laser","ifu lamaphoyinti","njengoba kwakhiwa","isakhiwo esikhona","ukuhlola umhlaba","landela","skena kuya ku-BIM","imodeli kusukeni","isendlalelo","qondanisa","ngqo","LAS","LAZ","E57","PLY"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukubone","text":"Okufanele ukubone","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDweba isakhiwo esikhona ngale-laser scan yaso: izindonga lapho iskena izikhombisa khona, ezingqeni ezifanele, zibhekene ngqo nakwezinye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsakhiwo lapho ozodweba khona.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfayela\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsakhiwo esisha\u003C/span\u003E, nezitezi zakhona ngokwenani lezitezi esinazo (ungazengeza ezinye kamuva, bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/site-building-and-levels\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/site-building-and-levels\"\u003EIsayithi, isakhiwo esisesayithini nezitezi zaso\u003C/a\u003E). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDweba\u003C/span\u003E iyavuleka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIskena.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfu lamaphoyinti\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha ifayela (LAS, LAZ, E57, PLY, PCD, PTX noma XYZ: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/point-clouds\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/point-clouds\"\u003EBonisa ifu lamaphoyinti eduze kwemodeli\u003C/a\u003E). Ifu likhombisa ekubukeni kwe-3D, nepulani likhombisa \u003Cstrong\u003Eisendlalelo\u003C/strong\u003E salo: amaphoyinti eskenwe angu-1200 mm (4 feet) phezu kwezinga, njengamachashaza. Yile ndawo lapho izindonga, iminyango namafasitela kufundeka khona kangcono.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELiqondanise nezinga.\u003C/strong\u003E Vula imenyu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESkena\u003C/span\u003E kwibha yemodeli bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELungisa iphansi lalo libe kulelizinga\u003C/span\u003E: ifu liyanyuka noma lehle, kuze iphansi elaskenwa lihlale phezu kwezinga elikhonjisiwe. Hlola ukuthi isendlalelo manje sihlikihla izindonga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQondanisa nesakhiwo.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESkena\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYenza ibe ngqo nesakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E ijikeleza ifu ukuze izindonga esendlalelweni yalo zihambisane nama-axis epulani, ngakho izindonga ozidweba ngokubamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ziqondane nskena. Ijikeleza eduze kwephakathi lezindonga ezitholiwe, ngakho izihlahla noma udonga lomakhelwane olubanjwe esendlalelweni alungeli ifu ngaphandle. Qala ngokulungisa iphansi kuqala: isendlalelo bese sihlikihla izindonga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELandela izindonga.\u003C/strong\u003E Khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUdonga\u003C/span\u003E bese uchofoza ngasemachasheni: ithuluzi libamba amaphoyinti eskenwe (uphawu lokubamba luyidayimane elincane) kanye nezindonga ozidwebile. Udonga ludwetshwa ngomugqa walo ophakathi; chofoza phakathi kwemigqa emibili yamachashaza udonga oluhamba kuwo; thayipha ubukhulu balo ngokukhetha uhlobo lodonga kuqala. Bese wengeza iminyango namafasitela lapho isendlalelo sikhombisa khona izikhala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzitezi ezilandelayo.\u003C/strong\u003E Khetha izinga eliphezulu ohlwini lwezinga lwepulani: isendlalelo silandela ukuphakama kokusikwa kwezinga. Qondanisa iphansi nalelo zinga futhi kuphela uma amaphansi eskenwe engakahlali lapho amazinga akho ewakhona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukubone\"\u003EOkufanele ukubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsendlalelo siyashintsha uma ushintsha izinga, nesendlalelo esikhulu (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESkena\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUbukhulu besendlalelo\u003C/span\u003E) sikhombisa amaphoyinti amaningi lapho iskena ilula khona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESkena\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlehlisa ukulungisa\u003C/span\u003E ibuyisela ifu endaweni yalo lapho livulwa khona. Ukulungisa kuhambisa ifu ekubukeni kuphela: alugcinwa efayelweni le-IFC, izindonga ozidwebile zihlala lapho zazikhona. Ukulungisa kuhamba nofu uma ushintsha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMisa\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmayunithi\u003C/span\u003E, noma uvule enye imodeli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESkena\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa isendlalelo epulanini\u003C/span\u003E iyafihla noma ibonise amachashaza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmaskena amakhulu: ipulani lidweba kuze kube ngamaphoyinti angu-60,000 esendlalelweni, nombono we-3D udweba amaphoyinti ambalwa ezigidi zefu lonke, kokubili akhethwe ngokulinganayo kuskena, ngakho ifayela elikhulu lihlala lisheshe. Ukuze ulandele ku-drafting app, sebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELandela ku-CadCraft\u003C/span\u003E kubha yefu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Dweba isakhiwo esikhona ngale-laser scan yaso: izindonga lapho iskena izikhombisa khona, ezingqeni ezifanele, zibhekene ngqo nakwezinye. Izinyathelo Isakhiwo lapho ozodweba khona. Ifayela › Isakhiwo esisha, nezitezi zakhona ngokwenani lezitezi esinazo (ungazengeza ezinye kamuva, bheka Isayithi, isakhiwo esisesayithini nezitezi zaso). Dweba iyavuleka. Iskena. Bonisa › Ifu lamaphoyinti bese ukhetha ifayela (LAS, LAZ, E57, PLY, PCD, PTX noma XYZ: bheka Bonisa ifu lamaphoyinti eduze kwemodeli). Ifu likhombisa ekubukeni kwe-3D, nepulani likhombisa isendlalelo salo: amaphoyinti eskenwe angu-1200 mm (4 feet) phezu kwezinga, njengamachashaza. Yile ndawo lapho izindonga, iminyango namafasitela kufundeka khona kangcono. Liqondanise nezinga. Vula imenyu Skena kwibha yemodeli bese uchofoza Lungisa iphansi lalo libe kulelizinga: ifu liyanyuka noma lehle, kuze iphansi elaskenwa lihlale phezu kwezinga elikhonjisiwe. Hlola ukuthi isendlalelo manje sihlikihla izindonga. Qondanisa nesakhiwo. Skena › Yenza ibe ngqo nesakhiwo ijikeleza ifu ukuze izindonga esendlalelweni yalo zihambisane nama-axis epulani, ngakho izindonga ozidweba ngokubamba Shift ziqondane nskena. Ijikeleza eduze kwephakathi lezindonga ezitholiwe, ngakho izihlahla noma udonga lomakhelwane olubanjwe esendlalelweni alungeli ifu ngaphandle. Qala ngokulungisa iphansi kuqala: isendlalelo bese sihlikihla izindonga. Landela izindonga. Khetha Udonga bese uchofoza ngasemachasheni: ithuluzi libamba amaphoyinti eskenwe (uphawu lokubamba luyidayimane elincane) kanye nezindonga ozidwebile. Udonga ludwetshwa ngomugqa walo ophakathi; chofoza phakathi kwemigqa emibili yamachashaza udonga oluhamba kuwo; thayipha ubukhulu balo ngokukhetha uhlobo lodonga kuqala. Bese wengeza iminyango namafasitela lapho isendlalelo sikhombisa khona izikhala. Izitezi ezilandelayo. Khetha izinga eliphezulu ohlwini lwezinga lwepulani: isendlalelo silandela ukuphakama kokusikwa kwezinga. Qondanisa iphansi nalelo zinga futhi kuphela uma amaphansi eskenwe engakahlali lapho amazinga akho ewakhona. Okufanele ukubone Isendlalelo siyashintsha uma ushintsha izinga, nesendlalelo esikhulu (Skena › Ubukhulu besendlalelo) sikhombisa amaphoyinti amaningi lapho iskena ilula khona. Skena › Hlehlisa ukulungisa ibuyisela ifu endaweni yalo lapho livulwa khona. Ukulungisa kuhambisa ifu ekubukeni kuphela: alugcinwa efayelweni le-IFC, izindonga ozidwebile zihlala lapho zazikhona. Ukulungisa kuhamba nofu uma ushintsha Misa noma Amayunithi, noma uvule enye imodeli. Skena › Bonisa isendlalelo epulanini iyafihla noma ibonise amachashaza. Amaskena amakhulu: ipulani lidweba kuze kube ngamaphoyinti angu-60,000 esendlalelweni, nombono we-3D udweba amaphoyinti ambalwa ezigidi zefu lonke, kokubili akhethwe ngokulinganayo kuskena, ngakho ifayela elikhulu lihlala lisheshe. Ukuze ulandele ku-drafting app, sebenzisa Landela ku-CadCraft kubha yefu.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"floors-by-outline-and-ramps","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Amaphansi nanoma yimuphi umumo, izimbobo namarampu","summary":"Dweba iphansi noma islebhu ngomugqa walo wangaphandle (ibhalikhoni, i-cantilever, ipulatifomu), sike izimbobo kuwo, bese udweba amarampu namaphulatifomu awo.","section":"tasks","order":30,"keywords":["iphansi","islebhu","umugqa wangaphandle","ibhalikhoni","cantilever","ipulatifomu","idekhi","imbobo yephansi","imbobo","ishafu","isikhala","irampu","ukuthambeka","irampu yokufinyelela","irampu yesihlalo sejubane","1:12","IfcRamp","IfcSlab"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"dweba-iphansi-ngomugqa-walo-wangaphandle","text":"Dweba iphansi ngomugqa walo wangaphandle","level":2},{"id":"sika-ukuvulwa","text":"Sika ukuvulwa","level":2},{"id":"dweba-irampu","text":"Dweba irampu","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukubone","text":"Okufanele ukubone","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYenza amaphansi angalandeli amagumbi, njengebhalikhoni elingaphesheya kwezindonga, bese udweba amarampu phakathi kwezitezi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dweba-iphansi-ngomugqa-walo-wangaphandle\"\u003EDweba iphansi ngomugqa walo wangaphandle\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDweba\u003C/span\u003E, khetha izinga, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkwakhiwa\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIphansi ngomugqa\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-row ngaphansi kwamathuluzi, khetha uhlobo (islebhu lekhonkolo noma iphansi lokhuni), ukusetshenziswa kwalo (iphansi noma ipulatifomu), ubukhulu, nokuthi liphakama kangakanani phezu kwezinga (0 = lilingana nephansi lezinga; inani elingaphansi libeka liphansi kakhudlwana).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza amakhona. Ithuluzi liyalandela izindonga, imigqa yegridi namaxhumanisi awo; bamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukugcina umphetho uqondile. Ubude bomphetho ngamunye nendawo kuyabonakala njengoba uhamba. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ibuyisela ikhona lokugcina.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ikhona lokuqala futhi, chofoza kabili, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuqeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sika-ukuvulwa\"\u003ESika ukuvulwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza iphansi (kumbono we-3D, noma umugqa walo kupulani), bese ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzici\u003C/span\u003E chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza ukuvuleka\u003C/span\u003E bese uchofoza amakhona okuvuleka phakathi kwephansi, uqede njengasenhla. Uhlu lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzici\u003C/span\u003E zephansi lubala izimbobo zalo, ngayinye ine-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa\u003C/span\u003E, nendawo yalo ngaphandle kwazo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dweba-irampu\"\u003EDweba irampu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkwakhiwa\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIrampu\u003C/span\u003E. Setha ububanzi bayo, nokuthi iya \u003Cstrong\u003Eesitezini eliphezulu\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003Ephezu kokukhuphuka\u003C/strong\u003E othayipha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha indlela esethwe ngayo: \u003Cstrong\u003Engokuthambeka\u003C/strong\u003E (1:12 ekuqaleni; irampu ide njengoba ukukhuphuka kudinga) noma \u003Cstrong\u003Engobude\u003C/strong\u003E (ukuchofoza kwakho kwesibili kusetha ubude, nokuthambeka kulandela).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza unyawo lwerampu (phakathi komphetho wayo ongaphansi), bese uchofoza indlela eya phezulu. Ukubukwa kwangaphambili kukhombisa ubude bayo, izindiza zayo nokuthambeka kwayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIrampu ephakama ngaphezu kwe-30 inches (760 mm) iyahlukaniswa ibe izindiza, nesikhala se-5-foot (1525 mm) phakathi kwazo. Lawa ngamanani wokuhlela ajwayelekile, hhayi umthetho wakho: hlola izimiso lapho uwakha khona. Irampu eliphakeme kuna 1:12 liyaphawulwa ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzici\u003C/span\u003E zalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukubone\"\u003EOkufanele ukubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIphansi ngalinye, ukuvulwa nerampu ngayinye kuyisinyathelo esisodwa: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyabuyisela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKupulani, umugqa wephansi elidwetshiwe (ukuvulwa kudwetshwa kuqanjwe), umugqa werampu, izindiza, amaphulatifomu nomcibisholo oya phezulu nokuthambeka kwawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzici zephansi elidwetshiwe (uhlobo, ukusetshenziswa, ubukhulu, ukuphakama, indawo, izimbobo) nerampu (ububanzi, ukuphakama, ukukhuphuka, ukuthambeka noma ubude); \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E isusa noma yiliphi kuzo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIrampu eya esitezini eliphezulu ilandela leso sitezi uma ukuphakama kwaso kushintsha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKufayela le-IFC: iphansi elidwetshiwe liyi-slab (IfcSlab, iphansi noma ipulatifomu) ngezimbobo zalo ezisikiwe (IfcOpeningElement); irampu liyi-IfcRamp eyakhiwe ngezindiza ezithambekile (IfcRampFlight) namaslabhu wepulatifomu, nokuthambeka nobubanzi bayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmaphansi adwetshwe ngale ndlela ahlala lapho uwadwetshe khona. Amaphansi akhiwe ngo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIphansi\u003C/span\u003E alandela amagumbi uma izindonga zinyakaza: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/floors-and-roofs\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/floors-and-roofs\"\u003EAmagumbi, amaphansi, amasilingi nophahla\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Yenza amaphansi angalandeli amagumbi, njengebhalikhoni elingaphesheya kwezindonga, bese udweba amarampu phakathi kwezitezi. Dweba iphansi ngomugqa walo wangaphandle Vula Dweba, khetha izinga, bese Ukwakhiwa › Iphansi ngomugqa. Ku-row ngaphansi kwamathuluzi, khetha uhlobo (islebhu lekhonkolo noma iphansi lokhuni), ukusetshenziswa kwalo (iphansi noma ipulatifomu), ubukhulu, nokuthi liphakama kangakanani phezu kwezinga (0 = lilingana nephansi lezinga; inani elingaphansi libeka liphansi kakhudlwana). Chofoza amakhona. Ithuluzi liyalandela izindonga, imigqa yegridi namaxhumanisi awo; bamba Shift ukugcina umphetho uqondile. Ubude bomphetho ngamunye nendawo kuyabonakala njengoba uhamba. Backspace ibuyisela ikhona lokugcina. Chofoza ikhona lokuqala futhi, chofoza kabili, noma cindezela Enter ukuqeda. Sika ukuvulwa Chofoza iphansi (kumbono we-3D, noma umugqa walo kupulani), bese ku-Izici chofoza Engeza ukuvuleka bese uchofoza amakhona okuvuleka phakathi kwephansi, uqede njengasenhla. Uhlu lwe-Izici zephansi lubala izimbobo zalo, ngayinye ine-Susa, nendawo yalo ngaphandle kwazo. Dweba irampu Khetha Ukwakhiwa › Irampu. Setha ububanzi bayo, nokuthi iya esitezini eliphezulu noma phezu kokukhuphuka othayipha. Khetha indlela esethwe ngayo: ngokuthambeka (1:12 ekuqaleni; irampu ide njengoba ukukhuphuka kudinga) noma ngobude (ukuchofoza kwakho kwesibili kusetha ubude, nokuthambeka kulandela). Chofoza unyawo lwerampu (phakathi komphetho wayo ongaphansi), bese uchofoza indlela eya phezulu. Ukubukwa kwangaphambili kukhombisa ubude bayo, izindiza zayo nokuthambeka kwayo. Irampu ephakama ngaphezu kwe-30 inches (760 mm) iyahlukaniswa ibe izindiza, nesikhala se-5-foot (1525 mm) phakathi kwazo. Lawa ngamanani wokuhlela ajwayelekile, hhayi umthetho wakho: hlola izimiso lapho uwakha khona. Irampu eliphakeme kuna 1:12 liyaphawulwa ku-Izici zalo. Okufanele ukubone Iphansi ngalinye, ukuvulwa nerampu ngayinye kuyisinyathelo esisodwa: Ctrl+Z iyabuyisela. Kupulani, umugqa wephansi elidwetshiwe (ukuvulwa kudwetshwa kuqanjwe), umugqa werampu, izindiza, amaphulatifomu nomcibisholo oya phezulu nokuthambeka kwawo. Izici zephansi elidwetshiwe (uhlobo, ukusetshenziswa, ubukhulu, ukuphakama, indawo, izimbobo) nerampu (ububanzi, ukuphakama, ukukhuphuka, ukuthambeka noma ubude); Delete isusa noma yiliphi kuzo. Irampu eya esitezini eliphezulu ilandela leso sitezi uma ukuphakama kwaso kushintsha. Kufayela le-IFC: iphansi elidwetshiwe liyi-slab (IfcSlab, iphansi noma ipulatifomu) ngezimbobo zalo ezisikiwe (IfcOpeningElement); irampu liyi-IfcRamp eyakhiwe ngezindiza ezithambekile (IfcRampFlight) namaslabhu wepulatifomu, nokuthambeka nobubanzi bayo. Amaphansi adwetshwe ngale ndlela ahlala lapho uwadwetshe khona. Amaphansi akhiwe ngo-Iphansi alandela amagumbi uma izindonga zinyakaza: bona Amagumbi, amaphansi, amasilingi nophahla.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"clash-check","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Hlola ukungqubuzana","summary":"Thola lapho izinto zesethi eyodwa zingena ezinye zesethi yesibili — imisele edlula emabhimini, izindonga ezingena emasilebeni — kumodeli eyodwa noma kumamodeli amaningi, netholeransi, bese uguqula ukungqubuzana kube yinkinga.","section":"tasks","order":30,"keywords":["ukungqubuzana","ukutholwa kokungqubuzana","ukuhlola ukungqubuzana","ukungqubuzana okuqinile","ukuphazamiseka","ukushayisana","ukuhlelelana","ukwehlelana","itholeransi","mep","isakhiwo"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukubone","text":"Okufanele ukubone","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukwazi","text":"Okufanele ukwazi","level":2},{"id":"okulandelayo","text":"Okulandelayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThola lapho amasethi amabili wezinto ezingenana khona, isibonelo konke esemodelini yezinsizakalo nesakhiwo, bese ubheka ngalinye bese ugcina okubalulekile njengezinkinga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula imodeli ye-IFC, bese wengeza amanye ngokuchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a model…\u003C/span\u003E uma uhlola kumamodeli amaningi. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/several-models\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/several-models\"\u003EBona amamodeli e-IFC amaningi ndawonye\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClash check\u003C/span\u003E kwipaneli yesobunxele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha amasethi amabili emabhokisini \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAgainst\u003C/span\u003E: izinto ozikhethile, isigaba (kuwo wonke amamodeli avuliwe), isethi yokusesha elonga (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/find\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/find\"\u003EThola izinto ngohlobo, igama noma impahla\u003C/a\u003E), noma konke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESetha ukuthi ukuhlangana kuyonakaliswa kangakanani, ngamamitha. 0.01 ayinaki izinto ezihlangene nje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERun\u003C/span\u003E. Ukuhlola kuqhubeka ngemuva; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECancel\u003C/span\u003E iyakuyeka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza umphumela ukuwubona: izinto zombili ziyakhethwa futhi zibonakale, konke okunye kubonakala ngokudlula, nombono usondela kuzo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMake an issue of it\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi komphumela ukuwubhala ethebhini le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIssues\u003C/span\u003E. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/issues-bcf\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/issues-bcf\"\u003EIzinkinga namafayela e-BCF\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukubone\"\u003EOkufanele ukubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkungqubuzana okuhlu namagama ezinto zombili (namafayela azo, uma kuvulwe amamodeli amaningi) nokuthi zihlangana kangakanani, okujulile kuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinhlangothi ezithintana nje, njengodonga oma phezu kwesilebe noma umnyango emgodini wawo, asiyona ukungqubuzana.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukwazi\"\u003EOkufanele ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELena ukuhlolwa okuyisisekelo kokungqubuzana okuqinile: izinto ezigoqana izinhlangothi. Into efihlekele ngokuphelele kwenye (ipayipi elingcwatshwe odongeni) akutholwa okwamanje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkujula kuwukuthi imingcele yezinto zombili ihlangana kangakanani kancane kakhulu: umhlahlandlela, hhayi ukukala okunembile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulandelayo\"\u003EOkulandelayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/measure\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/measure\"\u003ELinganisa izibalo, izindawo zobuso nezindawo ku-3D\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\"\u003EFihla, hlukanisa futhi wenze izinto zibonakale ngokudlula\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Thola lapho amasethi amabili wezinto ezingenana khona, isibonelo konke esemodelini yezinsizakalo nesakhiwo, bese ubheka ngalinye bese ugcina okubalulekile njengezinkinga. Izinyathelo Vula imodeli ye-IFC, bese wengeza amanye ngokuchofoza Add a model… uma uhlola kumamodeli amaningi. Bona Bona amamodeli e-IFC amaningi ndawonye. Vula Clash check kwipaneli yesobunxele. Khetha amasethi amabili emabhokisini Check ne-Against: izinto ozikhethile, isigaba (kuwo wonke amamodeli avuliwe), isethi yokusesha elonga (bona Thola izinto ngohlobo, igama noma impahla), noma konke. Setha ukuthi ukuhlangana kuyonakaliswa kangakanani, ngamamitha. 0.01 ayinaki izinto ezihlangene nje. Chofoza Run. Ukuhlola kuqhubeka ngemuva; Cancel iyakuyeka. Chofoza umphumela ukuwubona: izinto zombili ziyakhethwa futhi zibonakale, konke okunye kubonakala ngokudlula, nombono usondela kuzo. Chofoza Make an issue of it ngaphansi komphumela ukuwubhala ethebhini le-Issues. Bona Izinkinga namafayela e-BCF. Okufanele ukubone Ukungqubuzana okuhlu namagama ezinto zombili (namafayela azo, uma kuvulwe amamodeli amaningi) nokuthi zihlangana kangakanani, okujulile kuqala. Izinhlangothi ezithintana nje, njengodonga oma phezu kwesilebe noma umnyango emgodini wawo, asiyona ukungqubuzana. Okufanele ukwazi Lena ukuhlolwa okuyisisekelo kokungqubuzana okuqinile: izinto ezigoqana izinhlangothi. Into efihlekele ngokuphelele kwenye (ipayipi elingcwatshwe odongeni) akutholwa okwamanje. Ukujula kuwukuthi imingcele yezinto zombili ihlangana kangakanani kancane kakhulu: umhlahlandlela, hhayi ukukala okunembile. Okulandelayo Linganisa izibalo, izindawo zobuso nezindawo ku-3D Fihla, hlukanisa futhi wenze izinto zibonakale ngokudlula","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"site-from-civilcraft","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Izakhiwo eziseduze nepulazi ukusuka ku-CivilCraft","summary":"Thatha izakhiwo nepulazi okutholwe ngu-Address to site ye-CivilCraft ezungeze ikheli njengokuphakanyiswa, bese wengeza lezo oziphawulile.","section":"tasks","order":30,"keywords":["indawo yokwakha","ikheli","ipulazi","izakhamuzi","umongo","civilcraft","ccsite","izakhiwo","umkhawulo wendawo yokwakha","phakamisa"],"headings":[{"id":"yini-okwenziwayo","text":"Yini okwenziwayo","level":2},{"id":"ukusebenzisa","text":"Ukusebenzisa","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-wazi","text":"Okufanele wazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"yini-okwenziwayo\"\u003EYini okwenziwayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-CivilCraft, Ubuso › Okuningi › Address to site ithola izakhiwo, ipulazi, ukuhlelwa kwezindawo, indawo yezikhukhula nenhlabathi ezungeze ikheli kusuka kudatha evulekile. Inkinobho ethi &quot;Thumela ku-BimCraft njengezincomo&quot; (noma &quot;Gcina indawo yokwakha njengefayela&quot;, bese uvula \u003Ccode\u003E.ccsite.json\u003C/code\u003E lapha) iwaletha ku-BimCraft. Akukho okwengezwayo uze usho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukusebenzisa\"\u003EUkusebenzisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQala noma vula imodeli. Iphoyinti lekheli lihlala emsukeni wesinga oliso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIbhokisi lidwesa ngayinye isakhiwo esiseduze nepulazi ngebhokisi lokukhetha. Susa lokho ongakufuni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzakhiwo ezingakunikezi ubude komthombo wazo zisebenzisa ubude obuthayiphwe phezulu kwebhokisi. Isakhiwo esinikeze inani lamazinga wakhe kuphela sibalwa ngu-3 m isinga ngalinye, futhi ibhokisi liyasho lokho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela &quot;Engeza ezikhonjisiwe&quot;. Izakhiwo ziba izindonga ezizungeze umumo wazo ngaphansi, ziphakeme njengoba zidwetshwe, ngokuhlehlisa okukodwa. Ipulazi liba umkhawulo wendawo yokwakha, njengokuhlehlisa kwesibili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzindawo zohlelo lokwakha, ipulazi, izindawo zezikhukhula nenhlabathi zidwetshwa ukuze zinikezwe ulwazi kuphela; ayidwetshwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-wazi\"\u003EOkufanele wazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImigqa ilungile njengedatha evulekile: i-OpenStreetMap namapuleti ezindawo zesifunda ahluka kakhulu kuya kokunye. Hlola okubalulekile ngesivivinyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzindawo ziyimitha empumalanga naseNyakatho yephoyinti lekheli ngokulinganisa kwendawo okuyisicaba, zinembile ngamamitha ambalwa phakathi kwamakhilomitha ambalwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIdatha ithwele amalayisense emithombo yayo (i-OpenStreetMap ingu-ODbL); ibhokisi libonisa umugqa wokuncoma.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Yini okwenziwayo Ku-CivilCraft, Ubuso › Okuningi › Address to site ithola izakhiwo, ipulazi, ukuhlelwa kwezindawo, indawo yezikhukhula nenhlabathi ezungeze ikheli kusuka kudatha evulekile. Inkinobho ethi \"Thumela ku-BimCraft njengezincomo\" (noma \"Gcina indawo yokwakha njengefayela\", bese uvula .ccsite.json lapha) iwaletha ku-BimCraft. Akukho okwengezwayo uze usho. Ukusebenzisa Qala noma vula imodeli. Iphoyinti lekheli lihlala emsukeni wesinga oliso. Ibhokisi lidwesa ngayinye isakhiwo esiseduze nepulazi ngebhokisi lokukhetha. Susa lokho ongakufuni. Izakhiwo ezingakunikezi ubude komthombo wazo zisebenzisa ubude obuthayiphwe phezulu kwebhokisi. Isakhiwo esinikeze inani lamazinga wakhe kuphela sibalwa ngu-3 m isinga ngalinye, futhi ibhokisi liyasho lokho. Cindezela \"Engeza ezikhonjisiwe\". Izakhiwo ziba izindonga ezizungeze umumo wazo ngaphansi, ziphakeme njengoba zidwetshwe, ngokuhlehlisa okukodwa. Ipulazi liba umkhawulo wendawo yokwakha, njengokuhlehlisa kwesibili. Izindawo zohlelo lokwakha, ipulazi, izindawo zezikhukhula nenhlabathi zidwetshwa ukuze zinikezwe ulwazi kuphela; ayidwetshwa. Okufanele wazi Imigqa ilungile njengedatha evulekile: i-OpenStreetMap namapuleti ezindawo zesifunda ahluka kakhulu kuya kokunye. Hlola okubalulekile ngesivivinyo. Izindawo ziyimitha empumalanga naseNyakatho yephoyinti lekheli ngokulinganisa kwendawo okuyisicaba, zinembile ngamamitha ambalwa phakathi kwamakhilomitha ambalwa. Idatha ithwele amalayisense emithombo yayo (i-OpenStreetMap ingu-ODbL); ibhokisi libonisa umugqa wokuncoma.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"inspect-element","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Khetha into bese ufunda izici zayo","summary":"Chofoza noma iyiphi into kumodeli ye-3D ukuze uyigqamise ufunde igama layo, uhlobo, i-tag, i-GlobalId, amasethi wezici nezilinganiso.","section":"tasks","order":30,"keywords":["izici","khetha","chofoza","into","amapharamitha","amasethi wezici","pset","izilinganiso","globalid","guid","uhlobo","hlola"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukubone","text":"Okufanele ukubone","level":2},{"id":"ukufinyelela-izinto-ezifihliwe","text":"Ukufinyelela izinto ezifihliwe","level":2},{"id":"amaphutha-ajwayelekile","text":"Amaphutha ajwayelekile","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha izinto kumodeli ye-IFC bese ufunda konke ifayela elikushoyo ngazo: izimpawu, amasethi wezici, izici zohlobo nezilinganiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula imodeli ye-IFC.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza into, isibonelo umnyango. Chofoza ungadonsi: ukudonsa okungaphezu kwamapikseli ambalwa kuzungeza esikhundleni sokukhetha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBheka into: iqanjiswa ngoluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBheka iphaneli ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesokudla. Phezulu kukhona uhlobo lwento (njengo &quot;Door&quot; noma &quot;WallStandardCase&quot;) negama layo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFunda ibhlokhi yokuqala: \u003Cstrong\u003EIgama\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EUhlobo\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EUhlobo lwento\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EIthegi\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EIncazelo\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EGlobalId\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003EUmugqa\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESkrola phansi kumasethi wezici. Ayo amathathu okuqala avulekile; chofoza igama lanoma yiliphi elinye ukuze uvule.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza enye into ukuze uyishintshele kuyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, noma chofoza indawo engenalutho, ukuze ususe ukukhethwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukubone\"\u003EOkufanele ukubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInto egqanjiswe nedatha yayo ngakwesokudla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmasethi wezici ahlelwe ngokwenhlamvu. Amasethi avela ku\u003Cstrong\u003Ehlobo\u003C/strong\u003E lwento aba nelebula &quot; (type)&quot; ngemva kwegama lawo kanye nesaziso ethi &quot;Type property: a change here applies to every element of this type.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmasethi ezilinganiso (njengobude, izindawo nevolumu) ohlwini lwamanye amasethi. Izilinganiso azishintshwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmanani owakwazi ukushintsha abonakala njengamaconso. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/edit-ifc-properties\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/edit-ifc-properties\"\u003EShintsha izici ze-IFC ugcine ikhophi eshintshiwe\u003C/a\u003E ikhombisa indlela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/properties-panel\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/properties-panel\"\u003EIzinkambu zephaneli Yezici\u003C/a\u003E zichaza ngayinye yazo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukufinyelela-izinto-ezifihliwe\"\u003EUkufinyelela izinto ezifihliwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuze ufinyelele okuthile ngaphakathi esakhiweni, susa ukukhethwa kwezitezi ezisezingeni eliphezulu kuluhlu lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStoreys\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuze ufinyelele udonga ongemuva kwevolumu yegumbi, vala \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpaces\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza into.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amaphutha-ajwayelekile\"\u003EAmaphutha ajwayelekile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkudonsa kancane ngenkathi uchofoza.\u003C/strong\u003E I-BimCraft iyakuthatha njengokujikeleza futhi ayikhethi. Bamba imbewu inganyakazi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkulindele amayunithi ngasemuva kwamanani.\u003C/strong\u003E Amanani abonakala njengoba agcinwe kufayela, azungezwe kuma-decimal amane, ngaphandle kophawu lweyunithi. Ubude kokuthunyelwa kwe-metric kuvame ukuba ngamamilimitha noma amamitha; hlola izilungiselelo zomthumeli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkulindele ipharamitha ngegama oliziyo.\u003C/strong\u003E Abathumeli baqamba kabusha futhi bahlele kabusha amapharamitha ube amasethi wezici we-IFC afana ne-\u003Ccode\u003EPset_WallCommon\u003C/code\u003E. Hlola yonke isethi; amapharamitha ngokwezifiso ahlala kwisethi eqanjwe ngohlelo olwathumela noma ngenkampani yakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkulindele ibhokisi lokusesha.\u003C/strong\u003E Chofoza ukuze ukhethe into; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+chofoza noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+chofoza zikhetha okuningi, bese \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ikhetha zonke izinto ezibonakalayo. Uhlu lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EElements\u003C/span\u003E oluseceleni lokunxele lubala izinto ngohlobo kuphela; alukwazi ukuchofozwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkukhetha ifayela leprojekthi.\u003C/strong\u003E Ikhadi lefayela alinazinto zokukhetha: &quot;Izici zento zidinga imodeli ye-3D. Vula i-IFC export yalelo fayela ukuze uzibone.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Khetha izinto kumodeli ye-IFC bese ufunda konke ifayela elikushoyo ngazo: izimpawu, amasethi wezici, izici zohlobo nezilinganiso. Izinyathelo Vula imodeli ye-IFC. Chofoza into, isibonelo umnyango. Chofoza ungadonsi: ukudonsa okungaphezu kwamapikseli ambalwa kuzungeza esikhundleni sokukhetha. Bheka into: iqanjiswa ngoluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka. Bheka iphaneli ethi Properties ngakwesokudla. Phezulu kukhona uhlobo lwento (njengo \"Door\" noma \"WallStandardCase\") negama layo. Funda ibhlokhi yokuqala: Igama, Uhlobo, Uhlobo lwento, Ithegi, Incazelo, GlobalId kanye Umugqa. Skrola phansi kumasethi wezici. Ayo amathathu okuqala avulekile; chofoza igama lanoma yiliphi elinye ukuze uvule. Chofoza enye into ukuze uyishintshele kuyo. Cindezela Esc, noma chofoza indawo engenalutho, ukuze ususe ukukhethwa. Okufanele ukubone Into egqanjiswe nedatha yayo ngakwesokudla. Amasethi wezici ahlelwe ngokwenhlamvu. Amasethi avela kuhlobo lwento aba nelebula \" (type)\" ngemva kwegama lawo kanye nesaziso ethi \"Type property: a change here applies to every element of this type.\" Amasethi ezilinganiso (njengobude, izindawo nevolumu) ohlwini lwamanye amasethi. Izilinganiso azishintshwa. Amanani owakwazi ukushintsha abonakala njengamaconso. Shintsha izici ze-IFC ugcine ikhophi eshintshiwe ikhombisa indlela. Izinkambu zephaneli Yezici zichaza ngayinye yazo. Ukufinyelela izinto ezifihliwe Ukuze ufinyelele okuthile ngaphakathi esakhiweni, susa ukukhethwa kwezitezi ezisezingeni eliphezulu kuluhlu lwe-Storeys. Ukuze ufinyelele udonga ongemuva kwevolumu yegumbi, vala Spaces. Chofoza into. Amaphutha ajwayelekile Ukudonsa kancane ngenkathi uchofoza. I-BimCraft iyakuthatha njengokujikeleza futhi ayikhethi. Bamba imbewu inganyakazi. Ukulindele amayunithi ngasemuva kwamanani. Amanani abonakala njengoba agcinwe kufayela, azungezwe kuma-decimal amane, ngaphandle kophawu lweyunithi. Ubude kokuthunyelwa kwe-metric kuvame ukuba ngamamilimitha noma amamitha; hlola izilungiselelo zomthumeli. Ukulindele ipharamitha ngegama oliziyo. Abathumeli baqamba kabusha futhi bahlele kabusha amapharamitha ube amasethi wezici we-IFC afana ne-Pset_WallCommon. Hlola yonke isethi; amapharamitha ngokwezifiso ahlala kwisethi eqanjwe ngohlelo olwathumela noma ngenkampani yakho. Ukulindele ibhokisi lokusesha. Chofoza ukuze ukhethe into; Ctrl+chofoza noma Shift+chofoza zikhetha okuningi, bese Ctrl+A ikhetha zonke izinto ezibonakalayo. Uhlu lwe-Elements oluseceleni lokunxele lubala izinto ngohlobo kuphela; alukwazi ukuchofozwa. Ukukhetha ifayela leprojekthi. Ikhadi lefayela alinazinto zokukhetha: \"Izici zento zidinga imodeli ye-3D. Vula i-IFC export yalelo fayela ukuze uzibone.\"","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"walk","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Hamba ngemodeli","summary":"Hamba ngemodeli ye-IFC ngobude beso ngekhibhodi, ngegravithi egcina usesiliphansi kanye nezindonga ezikumisa.","section":"tasks","order":31,"keywords":["hamba","uhambo","umuntu wokuqala","ndiza","zula","ubude beso","gravithi","ukushaya","wasd","ngaphakathi","uhambo oluhlelekile"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukubone","text":"Okufanele ukubone","level":2},{"id":"izinkinga-ezivamile","text":"Izinkinga ezivamile","level":2},{"id":"okulandelayo","text":"Okulandelayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBona imodeli njengomuntu omi kuyo: hamba ngomgwaqo wangaphakathi, ungene egumbini, ukhwele isitebhisi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula imodeli ye-IFC bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalk\u003C/span\u003E kwithuluzi lokusebenza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza phansi lapho ofuna ukuma khona. Umi lapho amehlo akho ekhona ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEye height\u003C/span\u003E (1.6 m ekuqaleni, kuboniswe futhi kuthayiphwe ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnits\u003C/span\u003E oyikhethile: 5&#039;-3&quot; ngamafiti nangamainshi, 1600 ngamamilimitha; inombolo ecacile ikuleyo yunithi, noma ubhale iyunithi njenge-1.8 m), ubheke njengoba imbono ibibheka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHamba ngo-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma ngamacala okhiye. Bamba i-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze uhambe ngokushesha. Hudula endaweni yombono ukuze ubheke ozungezile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDone\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uyeke. Imbono ihlala lapho wawukhona khona, ilungele ukuzungeza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukubone\"\u003EOkufanele ukubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGravithi\u003C/strong\u003E ikugcina usesiliphansi ongaphansi kwakho futhi ikuphakamisa ezitebhisini nasezitebhisini. Yicime ukuze udablule: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↑\"\u003Efn ↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Up\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kuyaphakama, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Q\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↓\"\u003Efn ↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Down\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kuyehla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIma ezindongeni\u003C/strong\u003E ikumisa ngaphambi nje kwezindonga, kwemisantsi nakunoma yini enikela ngayo, futhi ikuvumela ukuthi uhambe ngaseceleni kwazo. Yicime ukuze uhambe ungene kuzo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinto ezifihliwe nezibonakala ngokuqhelile, nalokho okusikwe yisigaba, akukumisi futhi awukwazi ukuma phezu kwazo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinkinga-ezivamile\"\u003EIzinkinga ezivamile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkwenzeki lutho uma ngicindezela W.\u003C/strong\u003E Okhiye baya kubhokisi olibhalayo: chofoza embonweni kuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENgiwe ibanga elide.\u003C/strong\u003E Ibingekho phansi ngaphansi kwendawo (kukhona ukuvuleka, noma iphansi lifihliwe). Vala igravithi, noma qala ephansi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulandelayo\"\u003EOkulandelayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\"\u003EFihla, uzihlukanise futhi ubone ngaphakathi kwezinto\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/section-plane\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/section-plane\"\u003ESika imodeli ye-IFC nge-section plane\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Bona imodeli njengomuntu omi kuyo: hamba ngomgwaqo wangaphakathi, ungene egumbini, ukhwele isitebhisi. Izinyathelo Vula imodeli ye-IFC bese uchofoza Walk kwithuluzi lokusebenza. Chofoza phansi lapho ofuna ukuma khona. Umi lapho amehlo akho ekhona ku-Eye height (1.6 m ekuqaleni, kuboniswe futhi kuthayiphwe ku-Units oyikhethile: 5'-3\" ngamafiti nangamainshi, 1600 ngamamilimitha; inombolo ecacile ikuleyo yunithi, noma ubhale iyunithi njenge-1.8 m), ubheke njengoba imbono ibibheka. Hamba ngo-W A S D noma ngamacala okhiye. Bamba i-Shift ukuze uhambe ngokushesha. Hudula endaweni yombono ukuze ubheke ozungezile. Cindezela Esc noma chofoza Done ukuze uyeke. Imbono ihlala lapho wawukhona khona, ilungele ukuzungeza. Okufanele ukubone Gravithi ikugcina usesiliphansi ongaphansi kwakho futhi ikuphakamisa ezitebhisini nasezitebhisini. Yicime ukuze udablule: E noma Page Up kuyaphakama, Q noma Page Down kuyehla. Ima ezindongeni ikumisa ngaphambi nje kwezindonga, kwemisantsi nakunoma yini enikela ngayo, futhi ikuvumela ukuthi uhambe ngaseceleni kwazo. Yicime ukuze uhambe ungene kuzo. Izinto ezifihliwe nezibonakala ngokuqhelile, nalokho okusikwe yisigaba, akukumisi futhi awukwazi ukuma phezu kwazo. Izinkinga ezivamile Akwenzeki lutho uma ngicindezela W. Okhiye baya kubhokisi olibhalayo: chofoza embonweni kuqala. Ngiwe ibanga elide. Ibingekho phansi ngaphansi kwendawo (kukhona ukuvuleka, noma iphansi lifihliwe). Vala igravithi, noma qala ephansi. Okulandelayo Fihla, uzihlukanise futhi ubone ngaphakathi kwezinto Sika imodeli ye-IFC nge-section plane","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"grids-and-columns","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Igridi nezinsika","summary":"Hlela imigqa yegridi ngamabhamuza anezinombolo nezinhlamvu, ngebanga noma ngomugqa ngamunye, udwebe izindonga nezinsika ngasemigqeni, bese ubona kumapulani, kuma-elevation nakuma-section.","section":"tasks","order":31,"keywords":["igridi","amagridi","umugqa wegridi","igridi yensika","izimbazo","axis","bhamuza","gridline","igridi yesakhiwo","1 2 3","A B C","insika","izinsika","insika yokwakha","insika","ukubamba","IfcGrid","IfcColumn"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"misa-igridi-yonke","text":"Misa igridi yonke","level":2},{"id":"dweba-imigqa-yegridi-ngayinye","text":"Dweba imigqa yegridi ngayinye","level":2},{"id":"shintsha-umugqa-wegridi","text":"Shintsha umugqa wegridi","level":2},{"id":"dweba-ngasegridini","text":"Dweba ngasegridini","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukubone","text":"Okufanele ukubone","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHlela isakhiwo ngegridi, bese udwebe izindonga nomise izinsika ngasemigqeni yayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"misa-igridi-yonke\"\u003EMisa igridi yonke\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw\u003C/span\u003E, bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuild\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGrid\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlace a grid…\u003C/span\u003E. Tshela ukuthi zingaki \u003Cstrong\u003Eimigqa ebalwe ngezinombolo\u003C/strong\u003E (1, 2, 3…) kanye \u003Cstrong\u003Enemigqa ebalwe ngezinhlamvu\u003C/strong\u003E (A, B, C…) ofuna, nokuthi zikhethene kangakanani. Thayipha ibanga elilodwa, noma amabanga amaningi ahlukaniswe ngamakhefu uma amabheyi engalingani (isibonelo \u003Ccode\u003E20&#039;, 24&#039;, 20&#039;\u003C/code\u003E). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPast the last lines\u003C/span\u003E ukuthi umugqa ngamunye uqhubeka kangakanani ngaphesheya kwemigqa yangaphandle yolunye uhlobo, futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETurned (degrees)\u003C/span\u003E ijikisa igridi yonke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlace it\u003C/span\u003E, bese uchofoza lapho ukuhlangana kokuqala (1 / A) kuzoba khona. Ukubuka kulandela isikhombisi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImigqa ebalwe ngezinombolo igijima ngaphezulu kwepulani futhi ihlukaniswa kuwo; imigqa ebalwe ngezinhlamvu igijima ngokuhlangene nepulani futhi ihlukaniswa ngaphezulu kwawo. Izinhlamvu zidlula I no-O, njengakumadrowing, ukuze zingafundeki njengo-1 no-0.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dweba-imigqa-yegridi-ngayinye\"\u003EDweba imigqa yegridi ngayinye\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGrid\u003C/span\u003E uvuliwe, chofoza lapho umugqa uqala khona nalapho uphela khona. Uthola inhlamvu noma inombolo elandelayo yemigqa ugijima kuyo (ngemva kwe-3 kuza ku-4; ngemva kwe-B kuza ku-C). Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze umise.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shintsha-umugqa-wegridi\"\u003EShintsha umugqa wegridi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGrid\u003C/span\u003E uvuliwe, chofoza umugqa ukuze uwukhethe. Thayipha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELabel\u003C/span\u003E entsha bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, noma chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete this line\u003C/span\u003E (noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBubbles\u003C/span\u003E ibeka amabhamuza ezingxenyeni zombili, ekuqaleni noma ekugcineni komugqa ngamunye, noma ayikho. Ushintsho ngalunye luyisinyathelo esisodwa: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyasihlehlisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dweba-ngasegridini\"\u003EDweba ngasegridini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthuluzi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWall\u003C/span\u003E, ithuluzi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EColumn\u003C/span\u003E namanye amathuluzi okudweba aguqukela emigqeni yegridi nasezihlanganweni zayo (uphawu lokubamba luyisiyingi esincane esinomgingci).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinsika:\u003C/strong\u003E khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuild\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EColumn\u003C/span\u003E, bese ukhetha umumo (ongunxantathu noma ongaphambili), usayizi, nokuthi insika ihamba \u003Cstrong\u003Ekuze kube sezingeni elingaphezulu\u003C/strong\u003E noma ibe nobude obumisiwe, bese uchofoza. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAt every grid crossing\u003C/span\u003E imisa insika ngayinye ehlanganweni olungenayo ngaphambili. Chofoza insika ukuze ushintshe umumo, usayizi noma ubude kuma-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyayisusa. Izinsika ezihamba kuze kube sezingeni elingaphezulu ziyalandela leli zinga uma ukuphakama kwalo kushintsha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukubone\"\u003EOkufanele ukubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIgridi kupulani lalo lonke izinga, nehamba namabhamuza nelebula yalo ezingxenyeni zomugqa ngamunye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImigqa yegridi kusethi yokudweba: kumapulani, nakuma-elevation nakuma-section lapho umugqa ubonakala ubheke phansi, namabhamuza wawo phezu kwesakhiwo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/sheets\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/sheets\"\u003EMa-elevation, ama-section namashidi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKufayela le-IFC: igridi eyodwa yesakhiwo (IfcGrid, imigqa yayo ebalwe ngezinombolo ohlwini olulodwa nemigqa yayo ebalwe ngezinhlamvu ohlwini olunye), nezinsika njenge-IfcColumn nosayizi, ubude nezilinganiso zazo. Ezinye izinhlelo ze-BIM ziyakubonisa kokubili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIgridi eyafika kufayela elivela kolunye uhlelo iyabonakala, namathuluzi ayibamba, kodwa imigqa yayo ayishintshwa lapha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Hlela isakhiwo ngegridi, bese udwebe izindonga nomise izinsika ngasemigqeni yayo. Misa igridi yonke Vula Draw, bese ukhetha Build › Grid. Chofoza Place a grid…. Tshela ukuthi zingaki imigqa ebalwe ngezinombolo (1, 2, 3…) kanye nemigqa ebalwe ngezinhlamvu (A, B, C…) ofuna, nokuthi zikhethene kangakanani. Thayipha ibanga elilodwa, noma amabanga amaningi ahlukaniswe ngamakhefu uma amabheyi engalingani (isibonelo 20', 24', 20'). Past the last lines ukuthi umugqa ngamunye uqhubeka kangakanani ngaphesheya kwemigqa yangaphandle yolunye uhlobo, futhi Turned (degrees) ijikisa igridi yonke. Chofoza Place it, bese uchofoza lapho ukuhlangana kokuqala (1 / A) kuzoba khona. Ukubuka kulandela isikhombisi. Imigqa ebalwe ngezinombolo igijima ngaphezulu kwepulani futhi ihlukaniswa kuwo; imigqa ebalwe ngezinhlamvu igijima ngokuhlangene nepulani futhi ihlukaniswa ngaphezulu kwawo. Izinhlamvu zidlula I no-O, njengakumadrowing, ukuze zingafundeki njengo-1 no-0. Dweba imigqa yegridi ngayinye Ngo-Grid uvuliwe, chofoza lapho umugqa uqala khona nalapho uphela khona. Uthola inhlamvu noma inombolo elandelayo yemigqa ugijima kuyo (ngemva kwe-3 kuza ku-4; ngemva kwe-B kuza ku-C). Cindezela Esc ukuze umise. Shintsha umugqa wegridi Ngo-Grid uvuliwe, chofoza umugqa ukuze uwukhethe. Thayipha Label entsha bese ucindezela Enter, noma chofoza Delete this line (noma cindezela Delete). Bubbles ibeka amabhamuza ezingxenyeni zombili, ekuqaleni noma ekugcineni komugqa ngamunye, noma ayikho. Ushintsho ngalunye luyisinyathelo esisodwa: Ctrl+Z iyasihlehlisa. Dweba ngasegridini Ithuluzi Wall, ithuluzi Column namanye amathuluzi okudweba aguqukela emigqeni yegridi nasezihlanganweni zayo (uphawu lokubamba luyisiyingi esincane esinomgingci). Izinsika: khetha Build › Column, bese ukhetha umumo (ongunxantathu noma ongaphambili), usayizi, nokuthi insika ihamba kuze kube sezingeni elingaphezulu noma ibe nobude obumisiwe, bese uchofoza. At every grid crossing imisa insika ngayinye ehlanganweni olungenayo ngaphambili. Chofoza insika ukuze ushintshe umumo, usayizi noma ubude kuma-Properties; Delete iyayisusa. Izinsika ezihamba kuze kube sezingeni elingaphezulu ziyalandela leli zinga uma ukuphakama kwalo kushintsha. Okufanele ukubone Igridi kupulani lalo lonke izinga, nehamba namabhamuza nelebula yalo ezingxenyeni zomugqa ngamunye. Imigqa yegridi kusethi yokudweba: kumapulani, nakuma-elevation nakuma-section lapho umugqa ubonakala ubheke phansi, namabhamuza wawo phezu kwesakhiwo. Bona Ma-elevation, ama-section namashidi. Kufayela le-IFC: igridi eyodwa yesakhiwo (IfcGrid, imigqa yayo ebalwe ngezinombolo ohlwini olulodwa nemigqa yayo ebalwe ngezinhlamvu ohlwini olunye), nezinsika njenge-IfcColumn nosayizi, ubude nezilinganiso zazo. Ezinye izinhlelo ze-BIM ziyakubonisa kokubili. Igridi eyafika kufayela elivela kolunye uhlelo iyabonakala, namathuluzi ayibamba, kodwa imigqa yayo ayishintshwa lapha.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"clash-fixes","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Xazulula ukungqubuzana ngezixazululo zesigaba ngasinye","summary":"Kusukela emiphumeleni yokungqubuzana, uhlu lwe-Izixazululo eziphakanyisiwe luveza, ngokungqubuzana ngakunye, okungenziwa ngesigaba ngasinye — umsele ozungezwa, ipayipi elisuswa eceleni, insika ehanjiswayo, ukuvulwa emgoqweni webhimu — ngayinye izanywa ekhophini lemodeli nokuhwebelana kwayo, ukuze uyamukele noma uyenqabe. Izixazululo ezamukelwe zingeniswa njengesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa.","section":"tasks","order":31,"keywords":["ukungqubuzana","ukulungiswa kokungqubuzana","xazulula ukungqubuzana","lungisa ukungqubuzana","ukuhlelelana","phakamisa izixazululo","ukuqondisa kabusha","ukuzungeza","ukuthuthwa","umsele","ipayipi","ithreyi","ibhimu","insika","ukuvulwa","isileve","ukuhwebelana","isigaba","isakhiwo","imishini","ipulamba","kagesi","ukwakhiwa","umsizi"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"yini-esigaba-ngasinye-esingayenza","text":"Yini esigaba ngasinye esingayenza","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukubone","text":"Okufanele ukubone","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukwazi","text":"Okufanele ukwazi","level":2},{"id":"okulandelayo","text":"Okulandelayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuqula uhlu lwezingqubuzano lube yizinqumo. Isigaba ngasinye (isakhiwo, imishini, ipulamba, kagesi, ukwakhiwa) siphakamisa izixazululo zezinto zaso kuphela, yonke iphakamiso ihlolwa ekhophini lemodeli, wena ukhetha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQala wenze ukuhlola kokungqubuzana. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/clash-check\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/clash-check\"\u003EHlola ukungqubuzana\u003C/a\u003E kanye \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/mep-against-structure\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/mep-against-structure\"\u003EHlola amapayipi nemisele ngokumelene nesakhiwo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphansi kwemiphumela, chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhakamisa izixazululo\u003C/span\u003E. Ipaneli ethi \u003Cstrong\u003EIzixazululo eziphakanyisiwe\u003C/strong\u003E ivula ecaleni kwemodeli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKungokungqubuzana ngakunye uzobona iziphakamiso zesigaba ngasinye, eziphezulu kakhulu phezulu. Umugqa ngamunye uchaza ukuthi yenzani nokuhwebelana kwayo: noma ixazulula ukungqubuzana, ingakhi kangakanani okusha, yephula yiphi imithetho, ingeza kangakanani umugqa noma ihamba kangakanani, izinhlanganisela ezingakanani, nesilinganiso sezindleko.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow\u003C/span\u003E ukubona izinto ku-3D. Chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAccept\u003C/span\u003E kwisixazululo ofuna (eyodwa ngokungqubuzana ngakunye), noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYenqaba\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmugqa ongaphansi uchaza ukuthi zonke izixazululo ozamukele zenza ndawonye yini: ukungqubuzana kangakanani okuxazululiwe, kangakanani okusele, nokuthi kukhona okusha okungqubuzanayo yini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESebenzisa izixazululo ezamukelwe (isinyathelo sokuhlehlisa esisodwa)\u003C/span\u003E. Ukuhlola kokungqubuzana kuqhubeka futhi. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E ibuyisela zonke ngesikhathi esisodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yini-esigaba-ngasinye-esingayenza\"\u003EYini esigaba ngasinye esingayenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImishini\u003C/strong\u003E (imisele, amapayipi okushisa nokupholisa): zungeza phezulu noma ngaphansi ngahlangothi olugoqayo, phakamisa noma yehlisa wonke umugqa, uwususe eceleni, noma wenze umsele onqamunxeni ube mncane ngobude kodwa indawo ifane.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIpulamba\u003C/strong\u003E (amanzi, ukukhipha, igesi, umlilo): imihlahlandlela efanayo, ngaphandle kokuthi ipayipi lokukhipha elisebenza ngodonsela womhlaba alikaze linikezwe ukuzungezwa; lingahanjiswa njengoyunithi, ligcine ukwehla kwalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKagesi\u003C/strong\u003E (amathreyi nemisele yocingo): imihlahlandlela efanayo; ithreyi kufanele ligcine i-150 mm ecacile phezulu kwalo ukuze kubekwe ucingo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsakhiwo\u003C/strong\u003E: hambisa insika (kufika ku-300 mm), noma ivulo esiphakathini kwebhimu noma esilebeni ngomugqa odlula. Konke ukulungiswa kwesakhiwo kuthi umhlahlandlela wesakhiwo uyasayina.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkwakhiwa\u003C/strong\u003E: isileve odongeni ngomugqa odlula, noma hambisa udonga okwaziwa ukuthi alwethwe umthwalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukubone\"\u003EOkufanele ukubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzixazululo eziphula umthetho ziyamakwa: eziseduze kakhulu nengaphezu kwe-25 mm yegebe kwenye into, ngaphansi komgoqo wokuphakama ongu-2,100 mm, ivulo esiphakathini kwebhimu elikhulu kuno-40 % wokujula kwebhimu noma eliseduze kakhulu nokuphela kwalo, nebhimu eliyoshintsha ibanga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzixazululo ezingenziwa yi-BimCraft zisetshenziswa kumodeli: imigqa odwebe ngamathuluzi e-Pipe ne-Duct nezinsika ozidwebile. Ezinye zithi \u003Cstrong\u003EIseluleko kuphela\u003C/strong\u003E: ukuzamukela kwazo kwengeza inkinga ethebhini le-Issues.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukwazi\"\u003EOkufanele ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzixazululo zivela ezimthethweni ezakhelwe ku-app; ayisetshenziswa i-AI kuzo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma uxhuma umsizi (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/assistants\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/assistants\"\u003EVumela umsizi we-AI asebenze nemodeli yakho\u003C/a\u003E), angafunda ukungqubuzana futhi angangeza iziphakamiso zakhe zesigaba esisodwa kupaneli evulekile. Zihlolwa ngendlela efanayo, zimakwe ngegama lomsizi, futhi akukho okushintshwa kuze kube yilapho uyamukela futhi usebenzisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIkhophi ihlolwa ngamabhokisi azungeze isinto ngasinye nomgoqo wesinto ngasinye womugqa, ngakho umugqa othambekile ungabonisa ukungqubuzana okungase kungatholakali ekuhloleni kokungqubuzana. Phinda wenze ukuhlola kokungqubuzana ngemva kokusebenzisa: yiyo ekugcineni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImikhawulo (umugqa ongakanani ongahamba, ukuphakama kokuzungeza, igebe) iyizinkambiso ezizenzakalelayo ezibhalwe kupaneli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulandelayo\"\u003EOkulandelayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/issues-bcf\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/issues-bcf\"\u003EIzinkinga namafayela e-BCF\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/pipes-and-ducts\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/pipes-and-ducts\"\u003EDweba imigqa yamapayipi nemisele\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Guqula uhlu lwezingqubuzano lube yizinqumo. Isigaba ngasinye (isakhiwo, imishini, ipulamba, kagesi, ukwakhiwa) siphakamisa izixazululo zezinto zaso kuphela, yonke iphakamiso ihlolwa ekhophini lemodeli, wena ukhetha. Izinyathelo Qala wenze ukuhlola kokungqubuzana. Bona Hlola ukungqubuzana kanye Hlola amapayipi nemisele ngokumelene nesakhiwo. Ngaphansi kwemiphumela, chofoza Phakamisa izixazululo. Ipaneli ethi Izixazululo eziphakanyisiwe ivula ecaleni kwemodeli. Kungokungqubuzana ngakunye uzobona iziphakamiso zesigaba ngasinye, eziphezulu kakhulu phezulu. Umugqa ngamunye uchaza ukuthi yenzani nokuhwebelana kwayo: noma ixazulula ukungqubuzana, ingakhi kangakanani okusha, yephula yiphi imithetho, ingeza kangakanani umugqa noma ihamba kangakanani, izinhlanganisela ezingakanani, nesilinganiso sezindleko. Chofoza Show ukubona izinto ku-3D. Chofoza Accept kwisixazululo ofuna (eyodwa ngokungqubuzana ngakunye), noma Yenqaba. Umugqa ongaphansi uchaza ukuthi zonke izixazululo ozamukele zenza ndawonye yini: ukungqubuzana kangakanani okuxazululiwe, kangakanani okusele, nokuthi kukhona okusha okungqubuzanayo yini. Chofoza Sebenzisa izixazululo ezamukelwe (isinyathelo sokuhlehlisa esisodwa). Ukuhlola kokungqubuzana kuqhubeka futhi. Undo ibuyisela zonke ngesikhathi esisodwa. Yini esigaba ngasinye esingayenza Imishini (imisele, amapayipi okushisa nokupholisa): zungeza phezulu noma ngaphansi ngahlangothi olugoqayo, phakamisa noma yehlisa wonke umugqa, uwususe eceleni, noma wenze umsele onqamunxeni ube mncane ngobude kodwa indawo ifane. Ipulamba (amanzi, ukukhipha, igesi, umlilo): imihlahlandlela efanayo, ngaphandle kokuthi ipayipi lokukhipha elisebenza ngodonsela womhlaba alikaze linikezwe ukuzungezwa; lingahanjiswa njengoyunithi, ligcine ukwehla kwalo. Kagesi (amathreyi nemisele yocingo): imihlahlandlela efanayo; ithreyi kufanele ligcine i-150 mm ecacile phezulu kwalo ukuze kubekwe ucingo. Isakhiwo: hambisa insika (kufika ku-300 mm), noma ivulo esiphakathini kwebhimu noma esilebeni ngomugqa odlula. Konke ukulungiswa kwesakhiwo kuthi umhlahlandlela wesakhiwo uyasayina. Ukwakhiwa: isileve odongeni ngomugqa odlula, noma hambisa udonga okwaziwa ukuthi alwethwe umthwalo. Okufanele ukubone Izixazululo eziphula umthetho ziyamakwa: eziseduze kakhulu nengaphezu kwe-25 mm yegebe kwenye into, ngaphansi komgoqo wokuphakama ongu-2,100 mm, ivulo esiphakathini kwebhimu elikhulu kuno-40 % wokujula kwebhimu noma eliseduze kakhulu nokuphela kwalo, nebhimu eliyoshintsha ibanga. Izixazululo ezingenziwa yi-BimCraft zisetshenziswa kumodeli: imigqa odwebe ngamathuluzi e-Pipe ne-Duct nezinsika ozidwebile. Ezinye zithi Iseluleko kuphela: ukuzamukela kwazo kwengeza inkinga ethebhini le-Issues. Okufanele ukwazi Izixazululo zivela ezimthethweni ezakhelwe ku-app; ayisetshenziswa i-AI kuzo. Uma uxhuma umsizi (bona Vumela umsizi we-AI asebenze nemodeli yakho), angafunda ukungqubuzana futhi angangeza iziphakamiso zakhe zesigaba esisodwa kupaneli evulekile. Zihlolwa ngendlela efanayo, zimakwe ngegama lomsizi, futhi akukho okushintshwa kuze kube yilapho uyamukela futhi usebenzisa. Ikhophi ihlolwa ngamabhokisi azungeze isinto ngasinye nomgoqo wesinto ngasinye womugqa, ngakho umugqa othambekile ungabonisa ukungqubuzana okungase kungatholakali ekuhloleni kokungqubuzana. Phinda wenze ukuhlola kokungqubuzana ngemva kokusebenzisa: yiyo ekugcineni. Imikhawulo (umugqa ongakanani ongahamba, ukuphakama kokuzungeza, igebe) iyizinkambiso ezizenzakalelayo ezibhalwe kupaneli. Okulandelayo Izinkinga namafayela e-BCF Dweba imigqa yamapayipi nemisele","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"model-checks","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Hlola imodeli ukuthola izinkinga ezivamile","summary":"Thola izakhi ezingenayo isici odingayo, ama-GlobalId asetshenziswe kabili, izakhi ezingekho esitezini nezikhopi ezibekwe phezu kwenye.","section":"tasks","order":32,"keywords":["hlola","ukuhlola imodeli","ukuqinisekisa","qa","ukuhlola ikhwalithi","isici esingekho","kudingekayo","kabili","globalid","guid","isitezi","phezu kwenye","ukuhlangana"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukubone","text":"Okufanele ukubone","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-wazi","text":"Okufanele wazi","level":2},{"id":"okulandelayo","text":"Okulandelayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHlola imodeli ngaphambi kokuyidlulisela: izinkinga ezephula izinkomba, izinani nezinhlelo zabanye abantu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula imodeli ye-IFC.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuhlola imodeli\u003C/span\u003E kwiphaneli elingakwesobunxele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzici ezidingekayo\u003C/span\u003E umthetho usuvele. Shintsha isigaba sawo (noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENoma yiluphi uhlobo\u003C/span\u003E) nesici, noma chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza isici\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uthole omunye umthetho; i-x isusa owodwa. Isakhi siyehluleka umthetho uma isici singekho noma singenalutho. Imithetho ihlala kulesi sisiphequluli kuyo yonke imodeli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlola\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza umphumela ukuze ukhethe lezo zakhi usondele kuzo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukubone\"\u003EOkufanele ukubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsici esidingekayo esingekho\u003C/strong\u003E: umthetho ngamunye nezakhi ezingenalutho lwawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EI-GlobalId esetshenziswe kabili\u003C/strong\u003E: izakhi ezabelana nge-GlobalId eyodwa. Ezinye izinhlelo zithatha izakhi ezimbili njengento eyodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAyisesitezini\u003C/strong\u003E: izakhi ezinesimo esingekho sitezi esisiphethe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmakhophi phezu kwenye\u003C/strong\u003E: izakhi zesigaba nohlobo olufanayo nesimo esifanayo endaweni efanayo, ezibalwa kabili ezinanini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmugqa ngamunye emiphumeleni uyinkinobho: chofoza kuwo ukuze ukhethe lezo zakhi usondele kuzo. Kudweba kuphela amaqembu angu-50 okuqala ohlolweni ngalunye. Lezi zitholakalo zifakwa nakwi-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinkinga\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-wazi\"\u003EOkufanele wazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuhlola kubheka imodeli esebenzayo uma kuvulwe eziningi. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/several-models\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/several-models\"\u003EBona amamodeli e-IFC amaningi ndawonye\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEmva kokuhlela, hlola futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEphaneli ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinkinga\u003C/span\u003E, ubude, izindawo nevolumu emazwini enkinga kulandela i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmayunithi\u003C/span\u003E akhethwe kwithuluzi (umnyango ongu-&quot;800 mm&quot; uthi 2&#039;-7 1/2&quot; ngamafidi nangamayintshi); shintsha iyunithi nephaneli iwabhale kabusha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulandelayo\"\u003EOkulandelayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/audit-the-model\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/audit-the-model\"\u003EHlola imodeli: izigaba, amathegi, LOD, ukushayisana nezixhumanisi\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/find\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/find\"\u003EThola izakhi ngesigaba, igama noma isici\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/copy-paste\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/copy-paste\"\u003ESusa, sika, kopisha futhi unamathisele izakhi\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Hlola imodeli ngaphambi kokuyidlulisela: izinkinga ezephula izinkomba, izinani nezinhlelo zabanye abantu. Izinyathelo Vula imodeli ye-IFC. Vula Ukuhlola imodeli kwiphaneli elingakwesobunxele. Ngaphansi kwe-Izici ezidingekayo umthetho usuvele. Shintsha isigaba sawo (noma Noma yiluphi uhlobo) nesici, noma chofoza Engeza isici ukuze uthole omunye umthetho; i-x isusa owodwa. Isakhi siyehluleka umthetho uma isici singekho noma singenalutho. Imithetho ihlala kulesi sisiphequluli kuyo yonke imodeli. Chofoza Hlola. Chofoza umphumela ukuze ukhethe lezo zakhi usondele kuzo. Okufanele ukubone Isici esidingekayo esingekho: umthetho ngamunye nezakhi ezingenalutho lwawo. I-GlobalId esetshenziswe kabili: izakhi ezabelana nge-GlobalId eyodwa. Ezinye izinhlelo zithatha izakhi ezimbili njengento eyodwa. Ayisesitezini: izakhi ezinesimo esingekho sitezi esisiphethe. Amakhophi phezu kwenye: izakhi zesigaba nohlobo olufanayo nesimo esifanayo endaweni efanayo, ezibalwa kabili ezinanini. Umugqa ngamunye emiphumeleni uyinkinobho: chofoza kuwo ukuze ukhethe lezo zakhi usondele kuzo. Kudweba kuphela amaqembu angu-50 okuqala ohlolweni ngalunye. Lezi zitholakalo zifakwa nakwi-Izinkinga. Okufanele wazi Ukuhlola kubheka imodeli esebenzayo uma kuvulwe eziningi. Bona Bona amamodeli e-IFC amaningi ndawonye. Emva kokuhlela, hlola futhi. Ephaneli ye-Izinkinga, ubude, izindawo nevolumu emazwini enkinga kulandela i-Amayunithi akhethwe kwithuluzi (umnyango ongu-\"800 mm\" uthi 2'-7 1/2\" ngamafidi nangamayintshi); shintsha iyunithi nephaneli iwabhale kabusha. Okulandelayo Hlola imodeli: izigaba, amathegi, LOD, ukushayisana nezixhumanisi Thola izakhi ngesigaba, igama noma isici Susa, sika, kopisha futhi unamathisele izakhi","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"walls-from-a-drawing","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Izindonga kusuka kumdwebo olandelwe","summary":"Guqula ipulani ye-DWG noma i-DXF ibe yizindonga, izinmnyango nezifasiteli esigabeni, bese ugcina umdwebo ungaphansi kwepulani njengesibhekiselo.","section":"tasks","order":32,"keywords":["dwg","dxf","landela","kulandelwe","ngenisa ipulani","guqula","i-cad kuya ku-bim","2d kuya ku-3d","izindonga emigqeni","izendlalelo","amabhulokhi","izinmnyango kumabhulokhi","underlay","umdwebo wesibhekiselo","ingemuva","xref","uhlelo lokudweba"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukubone","text":"Okufanele ukubone","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESebenzisa ipulani owayidweba wena (noma omunye umuntu) ohlelweni lokudweba njengokuqala kwemodeli: imigqa yayo yodonga iba yizindonga, namabhulokhi emnyango nawo afeleyo abe yizinmnyango nezifasiteli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha isigaba umdwebo oyibonisayo kuhlu lwezigaba zepulani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuild\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom a drawing…\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChoose a drawing…\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha i-DWG noma i-DXF.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKuxoxo:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDrawing units\u003C/strong\u003E zivela kumdwebo; khetha ezinye uma zingalungile (ipulani edwetshwe ngamafiti kodwa yafundwa njengamainshi incane ngamaphindwe ayishumi nambili).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELayers with the walls\u003C/strong\u003E: phawula izendlalelo imigqa yodonga etholakala kuzo. Izendlalelo ezinamagama athi &quot;wall&quot; ziphawulwa ngawe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe lines are\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cstrong\u003Eboth faces of each wall\u003C/strong\u003E (indlela ejwayelekile yokudweba amapulani: yonke ipheya yemigqa ehlanganayo ehlukaniswe ngama-600 mm ingaba udonga olulodwa olunobukhulu befanayo nebanga), \u003Cstrong\u003Ethe walls&#039; center lines\u003C/strong\u003E (imigqa yephakathi yezindonga), noma \u003Cstrong\u003Eone face\u003C/strong\u003E kanye nodonga ngakwesobunxele noma ngakwesokudla. Kuma-center lines noma ubuso obuyodwa, uhlobo lodonga lusetha ubukhulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWall type\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003EWall height\u003C/strong\u003E, njengakwethuluzi le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWall\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBlocks\u003C/strong\u003E: khetha uhlobo lomnyango noma lefasitele kwelinye ibhulokhi ngalinye elingumnyango noma iwindi, noma uliyeke. Amabhulokhi amagama awo athi &quot;door&quot; noma &quot;window&quot; akhethelwe wena. Ngalinye libekwa kodongeni okuhlezi kulo, libanzi njengebhulokhi ngokuhamba kodonga; umnyango uvula ngakuhlangothi lapho umjikelo wawo udwetshwe khona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWhere it goes\u003C/strong\u003E: ngokuxhumanisa komdwebo, noma ikhona layo elingaphansi kwesobunxele libekwe ku-origin yepulani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKeep the drawing under the plan of this level\u003C/strong\u003E: yishiye iphawulwe ukuze ubone umdwebo njengemigqa emincane ngaphansi kwalokho okwenzayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmugqa ongaphansi kwezinketho utshela ukuthi izindonga, izinmnyango nezifasiteli zingaki ozozenza. Chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMake them\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukubone\"\u003EOkufanele ukubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzindonga, izinmnyango nezifasiteli esigabeni, zihlanganisiwe lapho zihlangana khona, nezindawo ezivalwe yizo; konke kuyisinyathelo esisodwa, ngakho \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyasuthula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmdwebo njengemigqa emincane ngaphansi kwepulani. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuild\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom a drawing…\u003C/span\u003E idla imidwebo egcinwe esigabeni, ngayinye no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove\u003C/span\u003E; ukususa eyodwa kushiya izindonga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKufayela le-IFC umdwebo ogciniwe uyisichazi esigabeni (imigqa yawo), ngakho nezinye izinhlelo ze-BIM ziyawubonisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-PDF noma isikena nakho kuyasebenza: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/walls-from-plans\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/walls-from-plans\"\u003EIzindonga kusuka kumasethi wamapulani\u003C/a\u003E. Amajika ayashiywa (i-BimCraft idweba izindonga ezigobile), kanjalo imigqa ngaphakathi kwamabhulokhi. Imigqa engenayo iyeni ku-&quot;both faces&quot; ibalwa ngaphakathi kuxoxo futhi ishiywe ngaphandle: dweba lezo zindonga nethuluzi le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWall\u003C/span\u003E, noma uzilungise nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModify\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETrim / extend\u003C/span\u003E (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/trim-extend-walls\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/trim-extend-walls\"\u003ETrim, extend and join walls\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUlandele esikeni ohlelweni lokudweba? Vula nesikena lapha futhi uhlole izindonga ngaso: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/model-from-a-scan\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/model-from-a-scan\"\u003EModel from a scan\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Sebenzisa ipulani owayidweba wena (noma omunye umuntu) ohlelweni lokudweba njengokuqala kwemodeli: imigqa yayo yodonga iba yizindonga, namabhulokhi emnyango nawo afeleyo abe yizinmnyango nezifasiteli. Izinyathelo Vula Draw bese ukhetha isigaba umdwebo oyibonisayo kuhlu lwezigaba zepulani. Khetha Build › From a drawing…, bese Choose a drawing… bese ukhetha i-DWG noma i-DXF. Kuxoxo: Drawing units zivela kumdwebo; khetha ezinye uma zingalungile (ipulani edwetshwe ngamafiti kodwa yafundwa njengamainshi incane ngamaphindwe ayishumi nambili). Layers with the walls: phawula izendlalelo imigqa yodonga etholakala kuzo. Izendlalelo ezinamagama athi \"wall\" ziphawulwa ngawe. The lines are: both faces of each wall (indlela ejwayelekile yokudweba amapulani: yonke ipheya yemigqa ehlanganayo ehlukaniswe ngama-600 mm ingaba udonga olulodwa olunobukhulu befanayo nebanga), the walls' center lines (imigqa yephakathi yezindonga), noma one face kanye nodonga ngakwesobunxele noma ngakwesokudla. Kuma-center lines noma ubuso obuyodwa, uhlobo lodonga lusetha ubukhulu. Wall type kanye Wall height, njengakwethuluzi le-Wall. Blocks: khetha uhlobo lomnyango noma lefasitele kwelinye ibhulokhi ngalinye elingumnyango noma iwindi, noma uliyeke. Amabhulokhi amagama awo athi \"door\" noma \"window\" akhethelwe wena. Ngalinye libekwa kodongeni okuhlezi kulo, libanzi njengebhulokhi ngokuhamba kodonga; umnyango uvula ngakuhlangothi lapho umjikelo wawo udwetshwe khona. Where it goes: ngokuxhumanisa komdwebo, noma ikhona layo elingaphansi kwesobunxele libekwe ku-origin yepulani. Keep the drawing under the plan of this level: yishiye iphawulwe ukuze ubone umdwebo njengemigqa emincane ngaphansi kwalokho okwenzayo. Umugqa ongaphansi kwezinketho utshela ukuthi izindonga, izinmnyango nezifasiteli zingaki ozozenza. Chofoza Make them. Okufanele ukubone Izindonga, izinmnyango nezifasiteli esigabeni, zihlanganisiwe lapho zihlangana khona, nezindawo ezivalwe yizo; konke kuyisinyathelo esisodwa, ngakho Ctrl+Z iyasuthula. Umdwebo njengemigqa emincane ngaphansi kwepulani. Build › From a drawing… idla imidwebo egcinwe esigabeni, ngayinye no-Remove; ukususa eyodwa kushiya izindonga. Kufayela le-IFC umdwebo ogciniwe uyisichazi esigabeni (imigqa yawo), ngakho nezinye izinhlelo ze-BIM ziyawubonisa. I-PDF noma isikena nakho kuyasebenza: bheka Izindonga kusuka kumasethi wamapulani. Amajika ayashiywa (i-BimCraft idweba izindonga ezigobile), kanjalo imigqa ngaphakathi kwamabhulokhi. Imigqa engenayo iyeni ku-\"both faces\" ibalwa ngaphakathi kuxoxo futhi ishiywe ngaphandle: dweba lezo zindonga nethuluzi le-Wall, noma uzilungise nge-Modify › Trim / extend (bheka Trim, extend and join walls). Ulandele esikeni ohlelweni lokudweba? Vula nesikena lapha futhi uhlole izindonga ngaso: bheka Model from a scan.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"route-systems-automatically","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Qondisa amapayipi omoya, imifudlana, amapayipi amanzi nezokupholisa ngokuzenzakalelayo","summary":"Ekuhloleni ukuxabana, i-BimCraft ithola indlela ezungeze imodeli evulekile yamapayipi omoya, imifudlana ngamandla adonsayo, amapayipi amanzi abandayo nashisayo, namapayipi e-refrigerant ahlukaniswayo noma ahlukaniswa kabaningi, bese idweba imigqa nezifakelo zayo ngesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Isisiza sokudweba: usayizi, ukuthambeka nokuhlolwa kuvela ezitebhuleni zesofthiwe nasezinombolweni ozithayiphayo; lapha akukho okusho ukuthi idizayini ihlangabezana nekhodi.","section":"tasks","order":32,"keywords":["qondisa ngokuzenzakalelayo","autoroute","qondisa amapayipi omoya","qondisa amapayipi","ukukhipha amanzi","isanitari","amandla adonsayo","isitaki","ukuphefumula","itrapu","amanzi","amanzi ashisayo","isiyingi sokubuyisela","ukuzungezisa","igesi yokupholisa","ukuhlukanisa","ukuhlukaniswa kabaningi","vrf","ubude olulinganayo","ikhithi yesihlukanisi","wye"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukubone","text":"Okufanele ukubone","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukwazi","text":"Okufanele ukwazi","level":2},{"id":"okulandelayo","text":"Okulandelayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVumela i-BimCraft yakhe inethiwekhi yemigqa phakathi kwezixhumi ezikhona kimodeli, izungeze izindonga nemishayo, bese uyihlola ngezinombolo oziboná.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula imodeli nokuhlola ukuxabana. Ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EQondisa amapayipi omoya ngokuzenzakalelayo\u003C/strong\u003E khetha isiphephisi somoya nezinsiza zaso, noma ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EQondisa ezinye izinhlelo ngokuzenzakalelayo\u003C/strong\u003E khetha uhlelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkukhipha amanzi isanitari ngamandla adonsayo.\u003C/strong\u003E Thayipha indawo yesikhala somgodi nezindawo zesitaki uma unazo. Thika \u003Cstrong\u003EQondisa zonke izitezi ngesikhathi esisodwa\u003C/strong\u003E ukuthatha zonke izitezi ezinezifakelo: imifudlana yesitezi ngasinye ihlangana nesitaki ezingeni layo, futhi isitaki sigijima kusukela phezu kwepayipi eliphakeme kakhulu kuya esiseni sayo. Cindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQondisa\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EItrapu kuya ophephumulweni.\u003C/strong\u003E Ipaneli ikhomba ibanga kusukela kwitrapu ngayinye kuya kumbobo wayo wokuphefumula. Thayipha ibanga elikhulu kakhulu ikhodi yakho elivumela ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EIbanga elikhulu kusukela etrapini kuya ophephumulweni\u003C/strong\u003E; noma yisiphi isifakelo esidlula lapho sikhonjiswa njengesingenziwe, nobukhulu obudlula ngamamilimitha. Thika \u003Cstrong\u003EPhefumula ngesitaki\u003C/strong\u003E uma izifakelo zingenawo amakhonkco okuphefumula azo: ibanga-ke likalwa kuya esitakini. I-BimCraft ayinathebula lekhodi kulokhu: wena uthayipha inombolo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmanzi abandayo nashisayo.\u003C/strong\u003E Khetha umthombo, uthayipha uxinzelelo emthonjeni nalo olidingayo esifakelweni. Thika \u003Cstrong\u003EAmanzi ashisayo\u003C/strong\u003E, khetha ixhumi elishisayo lesishisi, bese uthika \u003Cstrong\u003EIsiyingi sokubuyisela\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze uphelise umugqa wokubuyisa ekhonjini le-\u003Cstrong\u003Ehot-return\u003C/strong\u003E lesishisi, noma kunoma yiliphi ixhumi okukhethayo (leli liphela ngo-150 mm ngaphansi, livulekile, ukuze uwuxhumanise wena).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuhlukanisa, ukuhlukaniswa kabaningi kanye ne-VRF.\u003C/strong\u003E Khetha iyunithi yangaphandle, thika iyunithi yangaphakathi, bese uthayipha amandla ngayinye. Thayipha imikhawulo esuka kudatha yomkhiqizi wakho. Thayipha \u003Cstrong\u003Eubude olulinganayo\u003C/strong\u003E bokugoba nekhithi yesihlukanisi (amanani omkhiqizi), bese ubude obude nobuphelele buhlolwa ngobude obulinganayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQondisa\u003C/span\u003E. Ipaneli ikhomba ukuthi mingaki imigqa edwebiwe, nanoma yini engakwazanga ukuyenza nesizathu sayo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlehlisa\u003C/span\u003E ibuyisela konke ngesinyathelo esisodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukubone\"\u003EOkufanele ukubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmapayipi anamaqhina, amathi nezinciphisi; imifudlana ewela okungenani ukuthambeka okuncane kakhulu kusayizi wayo; izinti zokuphefumula ezifakelweni; imigqa ye-refrigerant njengepheya lolwelo negesi eguquka ngendlela efanayo kuwo wonke amakhona, nekhithi yesihlukanisi emakiwe lapho igatsha liphuma kumgogodla.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukwazi\"\u003EOkufanele ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELapho impompo yomfudlana ihlangana nomunye umfudlana, imodeli idweba ithi. Ipulani ibiza lezo zindawo ngokuthi amaxhumano e-wye angu-45 amadigri ukuze ushintshe isifakelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmanzi ashisayo asebenzisa ixhumi lokushisa lesifakelo uma umndeni waso unalo, kanti uma ungenalo asebenzise ixhumi elingu-100 mm eceleni kwelibandayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImigqa ye-refrigerant iqala phakathi kwezimbobo ezimbili zeyunithi ngayinye. Uma izimbobo zeyunithi zimi zisondelene kakhulu ukuze kugobe, ipheya ihlala iphakathi kwazo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInethiwekhi yamanzi isebenzisa ijika lesidingo nezinombolo zokumelana ezikhonjiswa ezibalweni; zishintshe ngezekhodi yakho ngaphambi kokuthembela kuzingcindezelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzindlu ezinkulu zingathatha isigamu sesikhathi noma ngaphezulu, ikakhulu inethiwekhi eshisayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELesi yisisiza sokudweba. Umuntu oqeqeshiwe uhlola usayizi, ukuthambeka, izimbobo zokuphefumula nezingcindezelo ngokumelana nekhodi esebenzayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulandelayo\"\u003EOkulandelayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/clash-check\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/clash-check\"\u003EHlola ukuxabana\u003C/a\u003E · \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/mep-against-structure\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/mep-against-structure\"\u003EHlola amapayipi nemishayo ngesakhiwo\u003C/a\u003E · \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/mep-connections\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/mep-connections\"\u003EOkuxhumanisa phakathi kwamapayipi nezinsiza\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Vumela i-BimCraft yakhe inethiwekhi yemigqa phakathi kwezixhumi ezikhona kimodeli, izungeze izindonga nemishayo, bese uyihlola ngezinombolo oziboná. Izinyathelo Vula imodeli nokuhlola ukuxabana. Ngaphansi kwe-Qondisa amapayipi omoya ngokuzenzakalelayo khetha isiphephisi somoya nezinsiza zaso, noma ngaphansi kwe-Qondisa ezinye izinhlelo ngokuzenzakalelayo khetha uhlelo. Ukukhipha amanzi isanitari ngamandla adonsayo. Thayipha indawo yesikhala somgodi nezindawo zesitaki uma unazo. Thika Qondisa zonke izitezi ngesikhathi esisodwa ukuthatha zonke izitezi ezinezifakelo: imifudlana yesitezi ngasinye ihlangana nesitaki ezingeni layo, futhi isitaki sigijima kusukela phezu kwepayipi eliphakeme kakhulu kuya esiseni sayo. Cindezela Qondisa. Itrapu kuya ophephumulweni. Ipaneli ikhomba ibanga kusukela kwitrapu ngayinye kuya kumbobo wayo wokuphefumula. Thayipha ibanga elikhulu kakhulu ikhodi yakho elivumela ku-Ibanga elikhulu kusukela etrapini kuya ophephumulweni; noma yisiphi isifakelo esidlula lapho sikhonjiswa njengesingenziwe, nobukhulu obudlula ngamamilimitha. Thika Phefumula ngesitaki uma izifakelo zingenawo amakhonkco okuphefumula azo: ibanga-ke likalwa kuya esitakini. I-BimCraft ayinathebula lekhodi kulokhu: wena uthayipha inombolo. Amanzi abandayo nashisayo. Khetha umthombo, uthayipha uxinzelelo emthonjeni nalo olidingayo esifakelweni. Thika Amanzi ashisayo, khetha ixhumi elishisayo lesishisi, bese uthika Isiyingi sokubuyisela ukuze uphelise umugqa wokubuyisa ekhonjini le-hot-return lesishisi, noma kunoma yiliphi ixhumi okukhethayo (leli liphela ngo-150 mm ngaphansi, livulekile, ukuze uwuxhumanise wena). Ukuhlukanisa, ukuhlukaniswa kabaningi kanye ne-VRF. Khetha iyunithi yangaphandle, thika iyunithi yangaphakathi, bese uthayipha amandla ngayinye. Thayipha imikhawulo esuka kudatha yomkhiqizi wakho. Thayipha ubude olulinganayo bokugoba nekhithi yesihlukanisi (amanani omkhiqizi), bese ubude obude nobuphelele buhlolwa ngobude obulinganayo. Cindezela Qondisa. Ipaneli ikhomba ukuthi mingaki imigqa edwebiwe, nanoma yini engakwazanga ukuyenza nesizathu sayo. Hlehlisa ibuyisela konke ngesinyathelo esisodwa. Okufanele ukubone Amapayipi anamaqhina, amathi nezinciphisi; imifudlana ewela okungenani ukuthambeka okuncane kakhulu kusayizi wayo; izinti zokuphefumula ezifakelweni; imigqa ye-refrigerant njengepheya lolwelo negesi eguquka ngendlela efanayo kuwo wonke amakhona, nekhithi yesihlukanisi emakiwe lapho igatsha liphuma kumgogodla. Okufanele ukwazi Lapho impompo yomfudlana ihlangana nomunye umfudlana, imodeli idweba ithi. Ipulani ibiza lezo zindawo ngokuthi amaxhumano e-wye angu-45 amadigri ukuze ushintshe isifakelo. Amanzi ashisayo asebenzisa ixhumi lokushisa lesifakelo uma umndeni waso unalo, kanti uma ungenalo asebenzise ixhumi elingu-100 mm eceleni kwelibandayo. Imigqa ye-refrigerant iqala phakathi kwezimbobo ezimbili zeyunithi ngayinye. Uma izimbobo zeyunithi zimi zisondelene kakhulu ukuze kugobe, ipheya ihlala iphakathi kwazo. Inethiwekhi yamanzi isebenzisa ijika lesidingo nezinombolo zokumelana ezikhonjiswa ezibalweni; zishintshe ngezekhodi yakho ngaphambi kokuthembela kuzingcindezelo. Izindlu ezinkulu zingathatha isigamu sesikhathi noma ngaphezulu, ikakhulu inethiwekhi eshisayo. Lesi yisisiza sokudweba. Umuntu oqeqeshiwe uhlola usayizi, ukuthambeka, izimbobo zokuphefumula nezingcindezelo ngokumelana nekhodi esebenzayo. Okulandelayo Hlola ukuxabana · Hlola amapayipi nemishayo ngesakhiwo · Okuxhumanisa phakathi kwamapayipi nezinsiza","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"render","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Renda isithombe semodeli","summary":"Yenza isithombe semini sombono we-3D: isibhakabhaka, ilanga ngokolatitudi wesayithi, izithunzi ezithambile, amawindi engilazi; nge-WebGPU, ilandelwa indlela ekhadini lezithombe ngesibhakabhaka, ikhamera, ukuxuba ukukhanya, ukuhlela imibala, umsi nohlu lokurenda.","section":"tasks","order":32,"keywords":["renda","preset","presets","scene preset","ingaphakathi","ingaphandle","umbono wokusika","ubusuku","ukuchofoza kanye","ukurenda","ukulandelela indlela","ukulandelela okuqhubekayo","ubukhazimulo","ukukhanya kwelanga","izithunzi","izithunzi ezithambile","ukubonakala","ingilazi","amawindi","insimbi","izimpahla","ukuvezwa","ukukhanya","umsindo","ukukhanya okusabalele","ukhohlo","umsi","caustics","uhlu lokurenda","webgpu","hdri","ies","ukujula kokugxila","ipanorama","ibhalansi yombala","ukuxuba ukukhanya","izakhi zokurenda","exr","png amabhithi 16","ukhohlo","uhlu lokurenda"],"headings":[{"id":"renda-umbono","text":"Renda umbono","level":2},{"id":"izilungiselelo-zesimo-isithombe-esihle-ngokuchofoza-kanye","text":"Izilungiselelo zesimo: isithombe esihle ngokuchofoza kanye","level":2},{"id":"okubonakala-esithombeni","text":"Okubonakala esithombeni","level":2},{"id":"izilungiselelo","text":"Izilungiselelo","level":2},{"id":"izibani","text":"Izibani","level":2},{"id":"iglasi-nezinye-izimpahla","text":"Iglasi nezinye izimpahla","level":2},{"id":"ikhwalithi-ephezulu","text":"Ikhwalithi ephezulu","level":2},{"id":"izinsa-nemaphrofayili-wokukhanya-ekhadini-lezithombe","text":"Izinsa nemaphrofayili wokukhanya ekhadini lezithombe","level":2},{"id":"ikhamera","text":"Ikhamera","level":2},{"id":"qeda-isithombe","text":"Qeda isithombe","level":2},{"id":"londoloza-isithombe","text":"Londoloza isithombe","level":2},{"id":"xuba-izibani-ngemva-kokurenda","text":"Xuba izibani ngemva kokurenda","level":2},{"id":"ukhohlo-intuthu-umsindo-nokukhanya-okugoqekile","text":"Ukhohlo, intuthu, umsindo nokukhanya okugoqekile","level":2},{"id":"uhlu-lokurenda","text":"Uhlu lokurenda","level":2},{"id":"isikhathi-esithathayo","text":"Isikhathi esithathayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda\u003C/span\u003E ebhareni lamathuluzi yenza isithombe sombono we-3D esibukeka njengosuku: isibhakabhaka, ilanga lapho indawo yesayithi libeka khona, izithunzi ezithambile, ukukhanya okuvela esibhakabhakeni sonke okufiphaza amakhona, nemibala engabukeka njengengilazi noma insimbi. Imodeli nefayela akushintshwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"renda-umbono\"\u003ERenda umbono\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELungisa umbono we-3D ngendlela ofuna ngayo isithombe: zungeza futhi usondeze, fihla izitezi noma izinto ongazidingi, futhi setha \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/section-plane\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/section-plane\"\u003Eisigaba\u003C/a\u003E uma isithombe kufanele sibonise ukusika.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda\u003C/span\u003E ebhareni lamathuluzi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsimo\u003C/span\u003E uma eyayicindezelwe ingeyona ofuna (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render#scene-presets-a-good-picture-in-one-click\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render\" data-hash=\"scene-presets-a-good-picture-in-one-click\"\u003EIzilungiselelo zesimo\u003C/a\u003E), khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUsayizi\u003C/span\u003E, bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda\u003C/span\u003E engxoxweni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsithombe sigcwala sisarenderwa futhi sibushelelezi ngayinye ukudlula. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMisa\u003C/span\u003E (noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) iyiphelisa ngaphambi kwesikhathi igcine isithombe sanamuhla.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza\u003C/span\u003E ukulanda njenge-PNG, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza njenge\u003C/span\u003E ukuze ukhethe ifomethi enye (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render#save-the-picture\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render\" data-hash=\"save-the-picture\"\u003ELondoloza isithombe\u003C/a\u003E). Siqanjwa ngegama lefayela lemodeli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQala ngo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlaka\u003C/span\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUsayizi wombono\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uhlole ikhamera, bese urenda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkuhle\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkuhle kakhulu\u003C/span\u003E ngosayizi omkhulu wesithombe sokugcina.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izilungiselelo-zesimo-isithombe-esihle-ngokuchofoza-kanye\"\u003EIzilungiselelo zesimo: isithombe esihle ngokuchofoza kanye\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPhezulu kwengxoxo kukhona izinkinobho ezine ze-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsimo\u003C/span\u003E. Ngayinye iseta isibhakabhaka, ukukhanya, umhlaba, imigqa yemiphetho, ikhwalithi kanye nelanga ngokuchofoza kanye, ngakho akukho okudingeka ukufunde ngaphambi kwesithombe sokuqala. Chofoza esinye, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsimo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkusethiwe\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkusetshenziselwa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhandle\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsibhakabhaka esicacile, ilanga lemodeli, umhlaba uvuliwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsakhiwo ngaphandle\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhakathi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzulu elimpunga (ukukhanya okulinganayo, akukho amabala elanga anzima), ukukhanya okukhanya ngesigamu sesitobhi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmbono ngaphakathi kwegumbi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubuka ngokusikwa\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIstudiyo esimhlophe, akukho mhlaba, imigqa yemiphetho ekurendeni okusheshayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImodeli esikwe yisigaba\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUbusuku\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIlanga lingaphansi (ubusuku embusika kuhhafu wendawo), ukukhanya ngesitobhi esisodwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzibani ezikhanyisa imodeli. Ngaphandle kwezibani isithombe simnyama\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha ngalo mbono\u003C/span\u003E ikukhethela: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubuka ngokusikwa\u003C/span\u003E uma kukhona ukusika, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhakathi\u003C/span\u003E uma ikhamera isemodeleni, kungenjalo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhandle\u003C/span\u003E. Okokuqala lapho uvula ingxoxo iqala ngale ndlela ngokwayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWonke amasethingi asalele ngezansi futhi angashintshwa. Uma ushintsha okukodwa, isimo asisasethwa, akukho nkinobho ecindezelwe, futhi umugqa ongaphansi kwezinkinobho uthi amasethingi ngawakho. Chofoza isimo futhi ukuze ubuyisele amanani aso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsimo asithinti injini, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndlela\u003C/span\u003E, usayizi, izimpahla, ikhamera noma izibani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzimo zinika amanani afanayo ku-ModelCraft nasku-BimCraft. Isithombe sokugcina sincike emodelini yakho nasekhadini lakho lezithombe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okubonakala-esithombeni\"\u003EOkubonakala esithombeni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkubonakala ku-3D view njengokuqinile kuyafakwa esithombeni: izinto ezifihliwe nezibonakala ngokukhanyayo, izitezi ezifihliwe namamodeli afihliwe ayashiywa, namagumbi abonakala kuphela uma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzindawo\u003C/span\u003E ivuliwe. Ideleyi yesigaba nebhokisi lokusika zisika isithombe njengoba zisika umbono. Izinto zibonakala ngemibala yazo: ukudweba ngempahla (ithebhu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmbala\u003C/span\u003E) akusetshenziswa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izilungiselelo\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsilungiselelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYenzani\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUsayizi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUsayizi wombono, kabili walo, i-Full HD, i-4K noma isikwele\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndlela\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgokushesha\u003C/span\u003E, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIkhwalithi ephezulu (ukulandelela indlela)\u003C/span\u003E ngalo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmkhawulo wesikhathi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIkhwalithi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInani lokudlula (noma, ekhwalithini ephezulu, amasampula) elilinganiswa: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlaka\u003C/span\u003E 16, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkuhle\u003C/span\u003E 64, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkuhle kakhulu\u003C/span\u003E 256. Okudlula okuningi kunika izithunzi nemiphetho ebushelelezi futhi kuthatha isikhathi eside\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsibhakabhaka\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsibhakabhaka esicacile\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzulu elimpunga\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIntambama\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIstudiyo esimhlophe\u003C/span\u003E (ingemuva elimhlophe elilula)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIlanga\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENgo-21 kuJuni ngo-15:00 ngokolatitudi ifayela elinikeza ngesayithi yalo (IfcSite), liphendulwe kunyoka weqiniso wemodeli. Khomba \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESebenzisa enye insuku nesikhathi salesi sithombe\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uthole esinye isikhathi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkukhanya\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkukhanya okungaphezulu noma okuphansi, ngezinyathelo (izitobhi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmhlaba ngaphansi kwemodeli\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmhlaba endaweni esezansi kakhulu yemodeli owamukela izithunzi futhi unyamalale ukuya esibhakabhakeni\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDweba imiphetho\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUdweba imiphetho yezinto ngokuncane phezu kwesithombe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma ilanga lingaphansi kwesibhakabhaka ngesikhathi esikhethiwe kuba busuku: isibhakabhaka siba mnyama bese izibani zemodeli zikhanyisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izibani\"\u003EIzibani\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYonke impahla yokukhanyisa emodelini iyisibani esithombeni: izinto zokukhanyisa kufayela le-IFC (IfcLightFixture, noma into ehlelwe njengempahla yokukhanyisa), kuhlanganise nalezo ozibeka kusuka kulabhulari. Ngayinye ikhanya kusuka ngaphansi kancane kwempahla. Uma ifayela linikeza amandla kawathi wempahla, ukukhanya kwayo kulandela lokho; kungenjalo kungu-800 lumens, ukukhanya okumhlophe okufudumele.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIngxoxo ibhala izibani ohlwini \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzibani\u003C/span\u003E: khipha esinye ukuze usivale, noma uthayipha ukukhanya kwaso ngama-lumens. Lezi zinguquko zilondolozwa ku-IFC (isethi yempahla \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_Light\u003C/code\u003E, lapho ungazishintsha khona nakwezakhiwo), futhi \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Z\"\u003E⌃Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyazihlehlisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma ifayela lingasho lutho ngapho isayithi yalo ikhona, ilanga libekwa ku-40° enyakatho, futhi ingxoxo iyasho lokho. Isikhathi yisikhathi sewashi lesayithi, esibalwa ngolongitudi walo, ngakho kungaba ngehora elilodwa endaweni lapho amawashi esetshenziswa ngokwehlukile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELezi zilungiselelo zigcinwa kulesi siphequluli sesithombe esilandelayo. Azilondolozwa kufayela le-IFC.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"iglasi-nezinye-izimpahla\"\u003EIglasi nezinye izimpahla\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOhlwini \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzimpahla zokwakha\u003C/span\u003E, yonke imibala ekuskrini inombono: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngakhazimuli\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkukhanya okuthambile\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkukhazimulayo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInsimbi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInsimbi ecwebezelayo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIngilazi\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIngilazi eqhwabile\u003C/span\u003E. Imibala efayela le-IFC eyenza ibonakale (njengengilazi yewindi, isibonelo) iqala njenge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIngilazi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgendlela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgokushesha\u003C/span\u003E, iglasi nensimbi zibonisa isibhakabhaka, hhayi enye imodeli, futhi ukukhanya akugobeki ngeglasi. Imodi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIkhwalithi ephezulu (ukulandelela indlela)\u003C/span\u003E engezansi ikwenza kokubili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ikhwalithi-ephezulu\"\u003EIkhwalithi ephezulu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndlela\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIkhwalithi ephezulu (ukulandelela indlela)\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uthole isithombe esilandela ukukhanya ngendlela ikhamera ayibona ngayo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eukukhanya kugxumayo phakathi kwezindawo, ngakho igumbi elikhanyiswa ngewindi, noma ngesibani, likhanyiswa lonke, nemibala iyagudluka ezindaweni eziseduze;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eingilazi iyingilazi yangempela: ukukhanya kuyagoba kuyo futhi ibonisa imodeli;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Einsimbi nezindawo ezicwebezelayo zibonisa ingxenye esalayo yemodeli;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eamapanelo okukhanya akhanya njengamapanelo, nezithunzi ezithambile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIlinde kakhulu kune-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgokushesha\u003C/span\u003E: iphikseli ngalinye lisanda ukukhanya kwalo futhi. Isithombe siqala sinensali bese siyahlanzeka njengoba amasampula evolozwa, ngakho qala ngosayizi omncane (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUsayizi wombono\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlaka\u003C/span\u003E) bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmkhawulo wesikhathi\u003C/span\u003E: lapho isikhathi siphela, isithombe sakuleso sikhathi siyagcinwa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMisa\u003C/span\u003E nayo iyagcina. Ukuqala kokudlula kokuqala kulinda isiphequluli silungise isilandeli sendlela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELapho isiphequluli sinaye-WebGPU, isilandeli sendlela sayo siyeCadCraft futhi siqhuba ekhadini lezithombe; umugqa ongaphansi kwesithombe uyakusho lokho. Ngemva kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMisa\u003C/span\u003E noma umkhawulo wesikhathi, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQhubeka\u003C/span\u003E ithatha isithombe esifanayo iye kumasampula aso wonke; ukushintsha isilungiselelo noma ukucindezela futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda\u003C/span\u003E kuqala kusha. Ngaphandle kwe-WebGPU isithombe sishintshwa ngokulandelela indlela nge-WebGL (umugqa uyakusho lokho) futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQhubeka\u003C/span\u003E ayikhonjiswa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:linux\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ELinux\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-Firefox nezimo eziningi ze-Chrome ku-Linux azinayo i-WebGPU okwamanje, ngakho ikhwalithi ephezulu isebenzisa i-WebGL lapho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKule modi imiphetho ayidwetshwa, izinkombandlela zibonisa umbala nokuqina kodwa hhayi amabhampu, futhi ukusika kwenziwa emodelini ngaphambi kokuqala kwesithombe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkususa umsindo (kususa okusele ngemva kwamasampula)\u003C/span\u003E ivulwe ngokuzenzakalelayo: lapho isithombe siqediwe, noma simisiwe, umsindo osele uyasuswa yinethiwekhi yamanyuroni eyenzelwe lokhu (i-Intel Open Image Denoise eshicilelwe, eqhutshwa kukhompyutha yakho: ekhadini lezithombe, noma kuprosesa uma kungenjalo). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsithombe ngaphambi kokususa umsindo\u003C/span\u003E sikhombisa njengoba senziwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinsa-nemaphrofayili-wokukhanya-ekhadini-lezithombe\"\u003EIzinsa nemaphrofayili wokukhanya ekhadini lezithombe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENge-WebGPU, ikhwalithi ephezulu inezinsa ezimbili ezengeziwe:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsibhakabhaka sefiziksi\u003C/span\u003E sisebenza ukukhanya kwemini ngokuphakama kwelanga: ukuluhlaza okujulile phezulu, ibhendi elikhanyayo eduze nesibhakabhaka, nelanga elishisa kancane futhi likhanye kancane lapho liphansi. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmusi\u003C/span\u003E uhamba kusuku olucacile kakhulu (2) kuya kolunomhwamuko (10).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsithombe sesibhakabhaka (HDRI)\u003C/span\u003E sikhanyisa imodeli ngesithombe sepanorama sendawo yangempela. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha isithombe…\u003C/span\u003E ithatha ifayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.hdr\u003C/code\u003E noma le-\u003Ccode\u003E.exr\u003C/code\u003E le-equirectangular; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikeleza\u003C/span\u003E iyijikeleza imodeli futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkukhanya kwesithombe\u003C/span\u003E iyenza ikhanye noma imnyame. Isithombe sinelanga layo, ngakho ilanga lemodeli alengezwa. Sigcinwa ngesikhathi ikhasi livulekile kuphela: ngemva kokuvula kabusha, khetha kabusha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsibani ngasinye ohlwini \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzibani\u003C/span\u003E singathatha iphrofayili yokukhanya yomenzi: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIphrofayili ye-IES…\u003C/span\u003E ifunda ifayela le-IES (LM-63) bese isibani sichitha ukukhanya kwaso njengokuthi impahla leyo yenza (isibani esinomsakazo omncane, esigeza udonga). Zonke izibani ezinalelo gama zisebenzisa leyo, futhi isibani silondoloza ukukhanya kwaso. Chofoza igama leprofayili ukuze uyeke ukuyisebenzisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmawindi engilazi ecacile asiza ukukhanya kwesibhakabhaka kuthole indlela yakho ngene ekamelweni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIndlela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgokushesha\u003C/span\u003E nesilandeli sendlela se-WebGL zibonisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsibhakabhaka sefiziksi\u003C/span\u003E kanye nesithombe sesibhakabhaka njengesibhakabhaka esicacile futhi zinganaki amaphrofayili wokukhanya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ikhamera\"\u003EIkhamera\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIkhamera\u003C/span\u003E isetha isithombe njengesithombe esithathwe ngekhamera:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuvezwa\u003C/span\u003E: gcina \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsilayidi sokukhanya\u003C/span\u003E, noma khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo zekhamera\u003C/span\u003E usethe \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuvulwa kwembobo (f-stop)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsivinini sesibambi\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EISO\u003C/span\u003E njengakukhamera; i-EV eseduze kwazo iyisilinganiso sokuvezwa esijwayelekile. f/16 ku-1/100 s ne-ISO 100 ifana nosuku olunelanga; isikhala esimnyama sidinga ukuvulwa okubanzi, isivinini esiphansi noma i-ISO ephezulu. Lokhu kusebenza kuzo zonke izindlela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkujula kokugxila\u003C/span\u003E kushaqisa okusondele noma okude kunobude be-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbanga lokugxila (m)\u003C/span\u003E njengoba ilensi yalobo f-stop ingenza (shiya kungenalutho ukuze ugxile kokuphakathi kombono); \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkwakheka kwembobo\u003C/span\u003E kunika izinkanyiso ezingagxilile isimo esijikelezile noma esinezimpaphe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubonakala kwamaphuzu amabili (imigqa emile ihlala imile)\u003C/span\u003E ilinganisa ikhamera futhi ihambisa isithombe, njengalensi yesakhiwo ye-tilt-shift, ukuze izindonga zingaphenduleki uma ubheka phezulu noma phansi ebhilidini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbhalansi yombala\u003C/span\u003E isetha umbala wokukhanya okubonakala njengomhlophe: ophansi (isibonelo 3000 K) ngokukhanya kwezibani okufudumele, ophakeme ngomthunzi nezinsuku ezinamafu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuprojekta\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIpanorama ye-360°\u003C/span\u003E yenza isithombe esingu-2:1 sakho konke okuzungeze ikhamera, sezibukeli ze-panorama; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIpanorama yesterio ye-360°\u003C/span\u003E ibeka ndawonye ipanorama yeso lesokunxele nelesokudla zezingilazi zekhanda; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImephu yekyubhu (izinhlangothi eziyi-6)\u003C/span\u003E yenza imibono eyisikwele eyisithupha ngegridi ye-3 × 2. Ububanzi buvela ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUsayizi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuprojekta, ukujula kokugxila, umbono wamaphuzu amabili nebhalansi yombala kudinga isilandeli sendlela ekhadini lezithombe (WebGPU), ngakho zibonakala kuphela ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIkhwalithi ephezulu (ukulandelela indlela)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qeda-isithombe\"\u003EQeda isithombe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsithombe\u003C/span\u003E silungisa isithombe sekhwalithi ephezulu njengesithombe sefoto, futhi isilawuli ngasinye sishintsha isithombe esiqediwe ngesikhathi esifanayo, ngaphandle kokurenda futhi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubukeka (ukuguqulwa kokubuka)\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EACES filmic\u003C/span\u003E (isithombe njengakuqala), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAgX\u003C/span\u003E (esithambile, sigcina umbala ekukhanyeni okukhanya kakhulu), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFilmic\u003C/span\u003E (ijika lefilimu elithambile) noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEjwayelekile\u003C/span\u003E (okujwayelekile, ukukhanya okukhanya kakhulu kuguqukela kumhlophe).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuphambana\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkucindezelwa kokukhanya okukhulu\u003C/span\u003E (ibuyisela imininingwane ezindaweni ezikhanya kakhulu).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBloom\u003C/span\u003E (ukukhanya okuthambile okuzungeze ukukhanya okukhanyayo), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlare\u003C/span\u003E kanye ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImigqa ye-glare\u003C/span\u003E (imigqa yezinkanyezi kumaphuzu akhanya kakhulu) ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVignette\u003C/span\u003E (imikhawulo emnyama).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIthebula lemibala (.cube)…\u003C/span\u003E lisebenzisa ukuhlelwa kombala kusuka kufayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.cube\u003C/code\u003E, ngamandla \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmandla ethebula lemibala\u003C/span\u003E; njengesithombe sesibhakabhaka, ligcinwa kuphela ngesikhathi ikhasi livulekile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"londoloza-isithombe\"\u003ELondoloza isithombe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEceleni kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza njenge\u003C/span\u003E ikhetha ifayela: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPNG\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJPEG\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWebP\u003C/span\u003E ukwabelana (i-JPEG ne-WebP kuphela lapho isiphequluli singazibhala khona), futhi emva kokurenda kwekhwalithi ephezulu ekhadini lezithombe nalezi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPNG, amabhithi 16\u003C/span\u003E: isithombe esihlelwe ngezinyathelo ezinembe phakathi kwezithunzi, sokuphrinta noma ukuhlelwa okwengeziwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEXR, zonke izendlalelo (float ye-32-bit)\u003C/span\u003E: isithombe njengoba sirenderiwe (ukukhanya okuqondile, akukho ukuhlelwa) nezakhi zokurenda zonke kanye neqembu ngalinye lokukhanya njengezendlalelo ezizimele, zezinhlelo zokuhlanganisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfayela lokurenda (.ccrender, ukuze ulungise futhi kamuva)\u003C/span\u003E: konke ingxoxo edinga ukuxuba nokuhlela isithombe futhi. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula ifayela lokurenda…\u003C/span\u003E liyabuyisa, nokuxuba kwalo nokuhlelwa kwalo, ngaphandle kokurenda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xuba-izibani-ngemva-kokurenda\"\u003EXuba izibani ngemva kokurenda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuxuba ukukhanya (shintsha umbala nokukhanya kwesibani ngasinye ngemva kokurenda)\u003C/span\u003E ngaphambi kokucindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda\u003C/span\u003E. Lapho isithombe siqediwe (noma simisiwe), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXuba isithombe\u003C/span\u003E ikhombisa izibani zaso ngamaqembu: isibhakabhaka, ilanga, nezibani ngegama (sonke isibani esinegama elifanayo siyiqembu elilodwa). Vala iqembu, linike umbala, noma yenza likhanye noma libe mnyama, futhi isithombe siyashintsha ngokushesha, ngaphandle kokurenda futhi. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza ukuxuba\u003C/span\u003E igcina ukuxuba ngegama ukuze ukhethe futhi kamuva; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENjengoba kurenderiwe\u003C/span\u003E ibuyela esithombeni njengoba senziwa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza\u003C/span\u003E ilondoloza isithombe esixubile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzakhi zokurenda (albedo, normals, depth, diffuse, specular, transmission, emission, IDs)\u003C/span\u003E ilondoloza izingxenye zesithombe nazo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa\u003C/span\u003E iguqula ukubuka ibe enye yazo: imibala yephezu (albedo), izinormali, ukujula, ukukhanya okusabalele, okuqondile nokudlula (ngayinye eqondile nengqondile), okukhanyayo nesibhakabhaka, nombala ngento noma ngempahla ukuze kwenziwe amamaski.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZombili zigcina izendlalelo ezengeziwe ekhadini lezithombe. Ezinkulwini ikhadi lezithombe lingenawo indawo; ingxoxo iyakushoya futhi usayizi omncane uyasebenza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukhohlo-intuthu-umsindo-nokukhanya-okugoqekile\"\u003EUkhohlo, intuthu, umsindo nokukhanya okugoqekile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELokhu kukhona ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkhohlo, intuthu nomsindo\u003C/span\u003E futhi kusebenza ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIkhwalithi ephezulu (ukulandelela indlela)\u003C/span\u003E ekhadini lezithombe; ezinye izinjini ziyazishiya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkhohlo nomhwamuko\u003C/span\u003E ugcwalisa umoya kuze kufike ebudeni nomsi onokukhanya kwelanga, kwesibhakabhaka nezibani. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubona kukude kangakanani, ngamamitha\u003C/span\u003E kusetha ukuthi kujiya kangakanani (cishe ama-100 m ukuba umhwamuko omncane, ama-20 m ukhohlo oluqinile), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuphakama kokhohlo ngaphezu komhlaba, ngamamitha\u003C/span\u003E kuyinhla lapho liphela khona, futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImisebe yokukhanya\u003C/span\u003E ukuthi ukhohlo luyakhanya kangakanani ngasekukhanyeni. Ukukhanya kwelanga kushiya ukhohlo ngaphezulu kwalo, ngakho lapho ilanga lingena ngewindi noma phakathi kwezakhiwo ubona njengemisebe yokukhanya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIntuthu noma ifu\u003C/span\u003E yengeza ivolumu eyodwa yentuthu noma ifu elikhanyiswa njengokhohlo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlobo\u003C/span\u003E luba \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfu\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIkholomu yentuthu\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKusuka kufayela levolumu (.ccvol)\u003C/span\u003E, ifomethi yegridi yeCadCraft. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImininingwane\u003C/span\u003E no \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuhlukahluka\u003C/span\u003E zishintsha ifu noma ikholomu eyenziwe, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUbude obude kakhulu ohlangothini olulodwa, ngamamitha (0 = usayizi wemodeli)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa X (m)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa Y (m)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa Z (m)\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikeleza\u003C/span\u003E zibeka kona (iqala phakathi kwemodeli), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkujiya\u003C/span\u003E yenza kube nzima kakhulu, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkukhanya phambili\u003C/span\u003E yenza kukhanye kakhulu ngasekukhanyeni, futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmbala\u003C/span\u003E uyidaya. Ifayela levolumu ligcinwa kuphela ngesikhathi ikhasi livulekile, njengesithombe sesibhakabhaka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYima ngokushesha lapho isithombe sihlanzekile (ukusampula okuzivumelanisayo)\u003C/span\u003E ayinikezi amasampula amaningi amaphikseli asezinzile. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmsindo okwamukelekayo\u003C/span\u003E uthi umsindo osele kangakanani lapho iphikseli liyima. Umugqa ongaphansi kwesithombe ukhomba ukuthi iphikseli ngalinye lithole amasampula angaki kangakanani ngokuvamile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EI-caustics (ukukhanya okugoqwa ngeglasi noma okubuyiselwa yizibuko)\u003C/span\u003E ilandela ukukhanya okuvela ezibanini nelanga, ngakho isiza ingxenye ekhanyayo ngaphansi kwebhola leglasi noma ukukhanya kwesibuko odongeni kuvele kuhlanzekile kunokuba kube nensali. Ivaliwe lapho ukhohlo, intuthu, ukuxuba ukukhanya noma izakhi zokurenda zivuliwe, futhi yenzelwe izithombe, hhayi izithombe ze-360°.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uhlu-lokurenda\"\u003EUhlu lokurenda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlu lokurenda\u003C/span\u003E engxoxweni: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza lesi sithombe kuhlu\u003C/span\u003E igcina izilungiselelo nombono wesithombe, futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQala uhlu\u003C/span\u003E irenda okulindile, okukodwa ngemva kokukodwa, kule khompyutha. Ukuvala ikhasi kugcina uhlu; vula imodeli efanayo ukuze uqhubeke. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza\u003C/span\u003E ilondoloza eyodwa eqediwe; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa\u003C/span\u003E no \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESula okuphelile\u003C/span\u003E zihlela uhlu. Uhlu lurenda ngekhwalithi ephezulu, ngakho ludinga i-WebGPU.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isikhathi-esithathayo\"\u003EIsikhathi esithathayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsithombe senziwa ekhompyutheni yakho, yikhadi lezithombe; akukho okulayishwa. Isikhathi sikhula ngokudlula namaphikseli: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkuhle kakhulu\u003C/span\u003E inamadlulo ayi-16 kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlaka\u003C/span\u003E, nesithombe se-4K sinamaphikseli acishe abe ka-4 kune-Full HD. Amamodeli amakhulu athatha isikhathi eside ngokudlula ngakunye.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Renda ebhareni lamathuluzi yenza isithombe sombono we-3D esibukeka njengosuku: isibhakabhaka, ilanga lapho indawo yesayithi libeka khona, izithunzi ezithambile, ukukhanya okuvela esibhakabhakeni sonke okufiphaza amakhona, nemibala engabukeka njengengilazi noma insimbi. Imodeli nefayela akushintshwa. Renda umbono Lungisa umbono we-3D ngendlela ofuna ngayo isithombe: zungeza futhi usondeze, fihla izitezi noma izinto ongazidingi, futhi setha isigaba uma isithombe kufanele sibonise ukusika. Chofoza Renda ebhareni lamathuluzi. Khetha Isimo uma eyayicindezelwe ingeyona ofuna (bona Izilungiselelo zesimo), khetha Usayizi, bese uchofoza Renda engxoxweni. Isithombe sigcwala sisarenderwa futhi sibushelelezi ngayinye ukudlula. Misa (noma Esc) iyiphelisa ngaphambi kwesikhathi igcine isithombe sanamuhla. Chofoza Londoloza ukulanda njenge-PNG, noma Londoloza njenge ukuze ukhethe ifomethi enye (bona Londoloza isithombe). Siqanjwa ngegama lefayela lemodeli. Qala ngo-Uhlaka ku-Usayizi wombono ukuze uhlole ikhamera, bese urenda Okuhle noma Okuhle kakhulu ngosayizi omkhulu wesithombe sokugcina. Izilungiselelo zesimo: isithombe esihle ngokuchofoza kanye Phezulu kwengxoxo kukhona izinkinobho ezine ze-Isimo. Ngayinye iseta isibhakabhaka, ukukhanya, umhlaba, imigqa yemiphetho, ikhwalithi kanye nelanga ngokuchofoza kanye, ngakho akukho okudingeka ukufunde ngaphambi kwesithombe sokuqala. Chofoza esinye, bese Renda. Isimo Okusethiwe Okusetshenziselwa Phandle Isibhakabhaka esicacile, ilanga lemodeli, umhlaba uvuliwe Isakhiwo ngaphandle Phakathi Izulu elimpunga (ukukhanya okulinganayo, akukho amabala elanga anzima), ukukhanya okukhanya ngesigamu sesitobhi Umbono ngaphakathi kwegumbi Ukubuka ngokusikwa Istudiyo esimhlophe, akukho mhlaba, imigqa yemiphetho ekurendeni okusheshayo Imodeli esikwe yisigaba Ubusuku Ilanga lingaphansi (ubusuku embusika kuhhafu wendawo), ukukhanya ngesitobhi esisodwa Izibani ezikhanyisa imodeli. Ngaphandle kwezibani isithombe simnyama Khetha ngalo mbono ikukhethela: Ukubuka ngokusikwa uma kukhona ukusika, Phakathi uma ikhamera isemodeleni, kungenjalo Phandle. Okokuqala lapho uvula ingxoxo iqala ngale ndlela ngokwayo. Wonke amasethingi asalele ngezansi futhi angashintshwa. Uma ushintsha okukodwa, isimo asisasethwa, akukho nkinobho ecindezelwe, futhi umugqa ongaphansi kwezinkinobho uthi amasethingi ngawakho. Chofoza isimo futhi ukuze ubuyisele amanani aso. Isimo asithinti injini, Indlela, usayizi, izimpahla, ikhamera noma izibani. Izimo zinika amanani afanayo ku-ModelCraft nasku-BimCraft. Isithombe sokugcina sincike emodelini yakho nasekhadini lakho lezithombe. Okubonakala esithombeni Okubonakala ku-3D view njengokuqinile kuyafakwa esithombeni: izinto ezifihliwe nezibonakala ngokukhanyayo, izitezi ezifihliwe namamodeli afihliwe ayashiywa, namagumbi abonakala kuphela uma Izindawo ivuliwe. Ideleyi yesigaba nebhokisi lokusika zisika isithombe njengoba zisika umbono. Izinto zibonakala ngemibala yazo: ukudweba ngempahla (ithebhu ye-Umbala) akusetshenziswa. Izilungiselelo Isilungiselelo Yenzani Usayizi Usayizi wombono, kabili walo, i-Full HD, i-4K noma isikwele Indlela Ngokushesha, noma Ikhwalithi ephezulu (ukulandelela indlela) ngalo Umkhawulo wesikhathi Ikhwalithi Inani lokudlula (noma, ekhwalithini ephezulu, amasampula) elilinganiswa: Uhlaka 16, Okuhle 64, Okuhle kakhulu 256. Okudlula okuningi kunika izithunzi nemiphetho ebushelelezi futhi kuthatha isikhathi eside Isibhakabhaka Isibhakabhaka esicacile, Izulu elimpunga, Intambama noma Istudiyo esimhlophe (ingemuva elimhlophe elilula) Ilanga Ngo-21 kuJuni ngo-15:00 ngokolatitudi ifayela elinikeza ngesayithi yalo (IfcSite), liphendulwe kunyoka weqiniso wemodeli. Khomba Sebenzisa enye insuku nesikhathi salesi sithombe ukuze uthole esinye isikhathi Ukukhanya Ukukhanya okungaphezulu noma okuphansi, ngezinyathelo (izitobhi) Umhlaba ngaphansi kwemodeli Umhlaba endaweni esezansi kakhulu yemodeli owamukela izithunzi futhi unyamalale ukuya esibhakabhakeni Dweba imiphetho Udweba imiphetho yezinto ngokuncane phezu kwesithombe Uma ilanga lingaphansi kwesibhakabhaka ngesikhathi esikhethiwe kuba busuku: isibhakabhaka siba mnyama bese izibani zemodeli zikhanyisa. Izibani Yonke impahla yokukhanyisa emodelini iyisibani esithombeni: izinto zokukhanyisa kufayela le-IFC (IfcLightFixture, noma into ehlelwe njengempahla yokukhanyisa), kuhlanganise nalezo ozibeka kusuka kulabhulari. Ngayinye ikhanya kusuka ngaphansi kancane kwempahla. Uma ifayela linikeza amandla kawathi wempahla, ukukhanya kwayo kulandela lokho; kungenjalo kungu-800 lumens, ukukhanya okumhlophe okufudumele. Ingxoxo ibhala izibani ohlwini Izibani: khipha esinye ukuze usivale, noma uthayipha ukukhanya kwaso ngama-lumens. Lezi zinguquko zilondolozwa ku-IFC (isethi yempahla CadCraft_Light, lapho ungazishintsha khona nakwezakhiwo), futhi Ctrl+Z iyazihlehlisa. Uma ifayela lingasho lutho ngapho isayithi yalo ikhona, ilanga libekwa ku-40° enyakatho, futhi ingxoxo iyasho lokho. Isikhathi yisikhathi sewashi lesayithi, esibalwa ngolongitudi walo, ngakho kungaba ngehora elilodwa endaweni lapho amawashi esetshenziswa ngokwehlukile. Lezi zilungiselelo zigcinwa kulesi siphequluli sesithombe esilandelayo. Azilondolozwa kufayela le-IFC. Iglasi nezinye izimpahla Ohlwini Izimpahla zokwakha, yonke imibala ekuskrini inombono: Engakhazimuli, Ukukhanya okuthambile, Okukhazimulayo, Insimbi, Insimbi ecwebezelayo, Ingilazi noma Ingilazi eqhwabile. Imibala efayela le-IFC eyenza ibonakale (njengengilazi yewindi, isibonelo) iqala njenge-Ingilazi. Ngendlela Ngokushesha, iglasi nensimbi zibonisa isibhakabhaka, hhayi enye imodeli, futhi ukukhanya akugobeki ngeglasi. Imodi Ikhwalithi ephezulu (ukulandelela indlela) engezansi ikwenza kokubili. Ikhwalithi ephezulu Khetha Indlela › Ikhwalithi ephezulu (ukulandelela indlela) ukuze uthole isithombe esilandela ukukhanya ngendlela ikhamera ayibona ngayo: ukukhanya kugxumayo phakathi kwezindawo, ngakho igumbi elikhanyiswa ngewindi, noma ngesibani, likhanyiswa lonke, nemibala iyagudluka ezindaweni eziseduze; ingilazi iyingilazi yangempela: ukukhanya kuyagoba kuyo futhi ibonisa imodeli; insimbi nezindawo ezicwebezelayo zibonisa ingxenye esalayo yemodeli; amapanelo okukhanya akhanya njengamapanelo, nezithunzi ezithambile. Ilinde kakhulu kune-Ngokushesha: iphikseli ngalinye lisanda ukukhanya kwalo futhi. Isithombe siqala sinensali bese siyahlanzeka njengoba amasampula evolozwa, ngakho qala ngosayizi omncane (Usayizi wombono, Uhlaka) bese ukhetha Umkhawulo wesikhathi: lapho isikhathi siphela, isithombe sakuleso sikhathi siyagcinwa. Misa nayo iyagcina. Ukuqala kokudlula kokuqala kulinda isiphequluli silungise isilandeli sendlela. Lapho isiphequluli sinaye-WebGPU, isilandeli sendlela sayo siyeCadCraft futhi siqhuba ekhadini lezithombe; umugqa ongaphansi kwesithombe uyakusho lokho. Ngemva kwe-Misa noma umkhawulo wesikhathi, Qhubeka ithatha isithombe esifanayo iye kumasampula aso wonke; ukushintsha isilungiselelo noma ukucindezela futhi Renda kuqala kusha. Ngaphandle kwe-WebGPU isithombe sishintshwa ngokulandelela indlela nge-WebGL (umugqa uyakusho lokho) futhi Qhubeka ayikhonjiswa. I-Firefox nezimo eziningi ze-Chrome ku-Linux azinayo i-WebGPU okwamanje, ngakho ikhwalithi ephezulu isebenzisa i-WebGL lapho. Kule modi imiphetho ayidwetshwa, izinkombandlela zibonisa umbala nokuqina kodwa hhayi amabhampu, futhi ukusika kwenziwa emodelini ngaphambi kokuqala kwesithombe. Ukususa umsindo (kususa okusele ngemva kwamasampula) ivulwe ngokuzenzakalelayo: lapho isithombe siqediwe, noma simisiwe, umsindo osele uyasuswa yinethiwekhi yamanyuroni eyenzelwe lokhu (i-Intel Open Image Denoise eshicilelwe, eqhutshwa kukhompyutha yakho: ekhadini lezithombe, noma kuprosesa uma kungenjalo). Bonisa › Isithombe ngaphambi kokususa umsindo sikhombisa njengoba senziwe. Izinsa nemaphrofayili wokukhanya ekhadini lezithombe Nge-WebGPU, ikhwalithi ephezulu inezinsa ezimbili ezengeziwe: Isibhakabhaka sefiziksi sisebenza ukukhanya kwemini ngokuphakama kwelanga: ukuluhlaza okujulile phezulu, ibhendi elikhanyayo eduze nesibhakabhaka, nelanga elishisa kancane futhi likhanye kancane lapho liphansi. Umusi uhamba kusuku olucacile kakhulu (2) kuya kolunomhwamuko (10). Isithombe sesibhakabhaka (HDRI) sikhanyisa imodeli ngesithombe sepanorama sendawo yangempela. Khetha isithombe… ithatha ifayela le-.hdr noma le-.exr le-equirectangular; Jikeleza iyijikeleza imodeli futhi Ukukhanya kwesithombe iyenza ikhanye noma imnyame. Isithombe sinelanga layo, ngakho ilanga lemodeli alengezwa. Sigcinwa ngesikhathi ikhasi livulekile kuphela: ngemva kokuvula kabusha, khetha kabusha. Isibani ngasinye ohlwini Izibani singathatha iphrofayili yokukhanya yomenzi: Iphrofayili ye-IES… ifunda ifayela le-IES (LM-63) bese isibani sichitha ukukhanya kwaso njengokuthi impahla leyo yenza (isibani esinomsakazo omncane, esigeza udonga). Zonke izibani ezinalelo gama zisebenzisa leyo, futhi isibani silondoloza ukukhanya kwaso. Chofoza igama leprofayili ukuze uyeke ukuyisebenzisa. Amawindi engilazi ecacile asiza ukukhanya kwesibhakabhaka kuthole indlela yakho ngene ekamelweni. Indlela Ngokushesha nesilandeli sendlela se-WebGL zibonisa Isibhakabhaka sefiziksi kanye nesithombe sesibhakabhaka njengesibhakabhaka esicacile futhi zinganaki amaphrofayili wokukhanya. Ikhamera Ikhamera isetha isithombe njengesithombe esithathwe ngekhamera: Ukuvezwa: gcina Isilayidi sokukhanya, noma khetha Izilungiselelo zekhamera usethe Ukuvulwa kwembobo (f-stop), Isivinini sesibambi ne-ISO njengakukhamera; i-EV eseduze kwazo iyisilinganiso sokuvezwa esijwayelekile. f/16 ku-1/100 s ne-ISO 100 ifana nosuku olunelanga; isikhala esimnyama sidinga ukuvulwa okubanzi, isivinini esiphansi noma i-ISO ephezulu. Lokhu kusebenza kuzo zonke izindlela. Ukujula kokugxila kushaqisa okusondele noma okude kunobude be-Ibanga lokugxila (m) njengoba ilensi yalobo f-stop ingenza (shiya kungenalutho ukuze ugxile kokuphakathi kombono); Ukwakheka kwembobo kunika izinkanyiso ezingagxilile isimo esijikelezile noma esinezimpaphe. Ukubonakala kwamaphuzu amabili (imigqa emile ihlala imile) ilinganisa ikhamera futhi ihambisa isithombe, njengalensi yesakhiwo ye-tilt-shift, ukuze izindonga zingaphenduleki uma ubheka phezulu noma phansi ebhilidini. Ibhalansi yombala isetha umbala wokukhanya okubonakala njengomhlophe: ophansi (isibonelo 3000 K) ngokukhanya kwezibani okufudumele, ophakeme ngomthunzi nezinsuku ezinamafu. Ukuprojekta: Ipanorama ye-360° yenza isithombe esingu-2:1 sakho konke okuzungeze ikhamera, sezibukeli ze-panorama; Ipanorama yesterio ye-360° ibeka ndawonye ipanorama yeso lesokunxele nelesokudla zezingilazi zekhanda; Imephu yekyubhu (izinhlangothi eziyi-6) yenza imibono eyisikwele eyisithupha ngegridi ye-3 × 2. Ububanzi buvela ku-Usayizi. Ukuprojekta, ukujula kokugxila, umbono wamaphuzu amabili nebhalansi yombala kudinga isilandeli sendlela ekhadini lezithombe (WebGPU), ngakho zibonakala kuphela ku-Ikhwalithi ephezulu (ukulandelela indlela). Qeda isithombe Isithombe silungisa isithombe sekhwalithi ephezulu njengesithombe sefoto, futhi isilawuli ngasinye sishintsha isithombe esiqediwe ngesikhathi esifanayo, ngaphandle kokurenda futhi: Ukubukeka (ukuguqulwa kokubuka): ACES filmic (isithombe njengakuqala), AgX (esithambile, sigcina umbala ekukhanyeni okukhanya kakhulu), Filmic (ijika lefilimu elithambile) noma Ejwayelekile (okujwayelekile, ukukhanya okukhanya kakhulu kuguqukela kumhlophe). Ukuphambana kanye Ukucindezelwa kokukhanya okukhulu (ibuyisela imininingwane ezindaweni ezikhanya kakhulu). Bloom (ukukhanya okuthambile okuzungeze ukukhanya okukhanyayo), Glare kanye ne-Imigqa ye-glare (imigqa yezinkanyezi kumaphuzu akhanya kakhulu) ne-Vignette (imikhawulo emnyama). Ithebula lemibala (.cube)… lisebenzisa ukuhlelwa kombala kusuka kufayela le-.cube, ngamandla Amandla ethebula lemibala; njengesithombe sesibhakabhaka, ligcinwa kuphela ngesikhathi ikhasi livulekile. Londoloza isithombe Eceleni kwe-Londoloza, Londoloza njenge ikhetha ifayela: PNG, JPEG noma WebP ukwabelana (i-JPEG ne-WebP kuphela lapho isiphequluli singazibhala khona), futhi emva kokurenda kwekhwalithi ephezulu ekhadini lezithombe nalezi: PNG, amabhithi 16: isithombe esihlelwe ngezinyathelo ezinembe phakathi kwezithunzi, sokuphrinta noma ukuhlelwa okwengeziwe. EXR, zonke izendlalelo (float ye-32-bit): isithombe njengoba sirenderiwe (ukukhanya okuqondile, akukho ukuhlelwa) nezakhi zokurenda zonke kanye neqembu ngalinye lokukhanya njengezendlalelo ezizimele, zezinhlelo zokuhlanganisa. Ifayela lokurenda (.ccrender, ukuze ulungise futhi kamuva): konke ingxoxo edinga ukuxuba nokuhlela isithombe futhi. Vula ifayela lokurenda… liyabuyisa, nokuxuba kwalo nokuhlelwa kwalo, ngaphandle kokurenda. Xuba izibani ngemva kokurenda Vula Ukuxuba ukukhanya (shintsha umbala nokukhanya kwesibani ngasinye ngemva kokurenda) ngaphambi kokucindezela Renda. Lapho isithombe siqediwe (noma simisiwe), Xuba isithombe ikhombisa izibani zaso ngamaqembu: isibhakabhaka, ilanga, nezibani ngegama (sonke isibani esinegama elifanayo siyiqembu elilodwa). Vala iqembu, linike umbala, noma yenza likhanye noma libe mnyama, futhi isithombe siyashintsha ngokushesha, ngaphandle kokurenda futhi. Londoloza ukuxuba igcina ukuxuba ngegama ukuze ukhethe futhi kamuva; Njengoba kurenderiwe ibuyela esithombeni njengoba senziwa. Londoloza ilondoloza isithombe esixubile. Izakhi zokurenda (albedo, normals, depth, diffuse, specular, transmission, emission, IDs) ilondoloza izingxenye zesithombe nazo. Bonisa iguqula ukubuka ibe enye yazo: imibala yephezu (albedo), izinormali, ukujula, ukukhanya okusabalele, okuqondile nokudlula (ngayinye eqondile nengqondile), okukhanyayo nesibhakabhaka, nombala ngento noma ngempahla ukuze kwenziwe amamaski. Zombili zigcina izendlalelo ezengeziwe ekhadini lezithombe. Ezinkulwini ikhadi lezithombe lingenawo indawo; ingxoxo iyakushoya futhi usayizi omncane uyasebenza. Ukhohlo, intuthu, umsindo nokukhanya okugoqekile Lokhu kukhona ku-Ukhohlo, intuthu nomsindo futhi kusebenza ku-Ikhwalithi ephezulu (ukulandelela indlela) ekhadini lezithombe; ezinye izinjini ziyazishiya. Ukhohlo nomhwamuko ugcwalisa umoya kuze kufike ebudeni nomsi onokukhanya kwelanga, kwesibhakabhaka nezibani. Ukubona kukude kangakanani, ngamamitha kusetha ukuthi kujiya kangakanani (cishe ama-100 m ukuba umhwamuko omncane, ama-20 m ukhohlo oluqinile), Ukuphakama kokhohlo ngaphezu komhlaba, ngamamitha kuyinhla lapho liphela khona, futhi Imisebe yokukhanya ukuthi ukhohlo luyakhanya kangakanani ngasekukhanyeni. Ukukhanya kwelanga kushiya ukhohlo ngaphezulu kwalo, ngakho lapho ilanga lingena ngewindi noma phakathi kwezakhiwo ubona njengemisebe yokukhanya. Intuthu noma ifu yengeza ivolumu eyodwa yentuthu noma ifu elikhanyiswa njengokhohlo. Uhlobo luba Ifu, Ikholomu yentuthu noma Kusuka kufayela levolumu (.ccvol), ifomethi yegridi yeCadCraft. Imininingwane no Ukuhlukahluka zishintsha ifu noma ikholomu eyenziwe, Ubude obude kakhulu ohlangothini olulodwa, ngamamitha (0 = usayizi wemodeli), Hambisa X (m), Hambisa Y (m), Hambisa Z (m) ne-Jikeleza zibeka kona (iqala phakathi kwemodeli), Ukujiya yenza kube nzima kakhulu, Ukukhanya phambili yenza kukhanye kakhulu ngasekukhanyeni, futhi Umbala uyidaya. Ifayela levolumu ligcinwa kuphela ngesikhathi ikhasi livulekile, njengesithombe sesibhakabhaka. Yima ngokushesha lapho isithombe sihlanzekile (ukusampula okuzivumelanisayo) ayinikezi amasampula amaningi amaphikseli asezinzile. Umsindo okwamukelekayo uthi umsindo osele kangakanani lapho iphikseli liyima. Umugqa ongaphansi kwesithombe ukhomba ukuthi iphikseli ngalinye lithole amasampula angaki kangakanani ngokuvamile. I-caustics (ukukhanya okugoqwa ngeglasi noma okubuyiselwa yizibuko) ilandela ukukhanya okuvela ezibanini nelanga, ngakho isiza ingxenye ekhanyayo ngaphansi kwebhola leglasi noma ukukhanya kwesibuko odongeni kuvele kuhlanzekile kunokuba kube nensali. Ivaliwe lapho ukhohlo, intuthu, ukuxuba ukukhanya noma izakhi zokurenda zivuliwe, futhi yenzelwe izithombe, hhayi izithombe ze-360°. Uhlu lokurenda Uhlu lokurenda engxoxweni: Engeza lesi sithombe kuhlu igcina izilungiselelo nombono wesithombe, futhi Qala uhlu irenda okulindile, okukodwa ngemva kokukodwa, kule khompyutha. Ukuvala ikhasi kugcina uhlu; vula imodeli efanayo ukuze uqhubeke. Londoloza ilondoloza eyodwa eqediwe; Susa no Sula okuphelile zihlela uhlu. Uhlu lurenda ngekhwalithi ephezulu, ngakho ludinga i-WebGPU. Isikhathi esithathayo Isithombe senziwa ekhompyutheni yakho, yikhadi lezithombe; akukho okulayishwa. Isikhathi sikhula ngokudlula namaphikseli: Okuhle kakhulu inamadlulo ayi-16 kwe-Uhlaka, nesithombe se-4K sinamaphikseli acishe abe ka-4 kune-Full HD. Amamodeli amakhulu athatha isikhathi eside ngokudlula ngakunye.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"quantity-totals","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Engeza ndawonye izinani, uhlu lwezinto nezindawo zohlelo","summary":"Bala izinto futhi wengeze ubude, izindawo, amavolumu noma noma iyiphi inombolo yezici, uhlelwe ngayo noma yiyiphi isici; uhlu lomugqa owodwa ngento; noma uhlele izindawo ngezindawo nevolumu zazo. Ngayinye ilandwa njenge-CSV.","section":"tasks","order":33,"keywords":["izinani","quantity","quantities","takeoff","amanani aphelele","isamba","uhlelo","bill of quantities","boq","qto","csv","hlanganisa ngo","bala","ubude","indawo","ivolumu","izindawo","amagumbi","uhlelo lwamagumbi","uhlelo lwezindawo","uhlu lwezinto"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenziwa","text":"Okuzokwenziwa","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ubone","text":"Okufanele ubone","level":2},{"id":"umugqa-owodwa-ngento-noma-izindawo","text":"Umugqa owodwa ngento, noma izindawo","level":2},{"id":"okulandelayo","text":"Okulandelayo","level":2},{"id":"ukwakhiwa-ifc-4-3","text":"Ukwakhiwa (IFC 4.3)","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenziwa\"\u003EOkuzokwenziwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThola amanani aphelele kumodeli: ubude bezindonga ngezitezi, inani lezivalo ngohlobo, ivolumu yesilabhu ngento, nezindleko zayo yonke indawo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula imodeli ye-IFC.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmanani aphelele\u003C/span\u003E ephaneli yangakwesobunxele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBala\u003C/span\u003E, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYonke into\u003C/span\u003E noma izinto ezikhethiwe kuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlanganisa ngo\u003C/span\u003E, khetha isici, njengo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIklasi\u003C/span\u003E. Chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza iqembu\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uhlukanise kabili, kuze kube kathathu, isibonelo ngo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsitezi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza ndawonye\u003C/span\u003E, thikha izinombolo ozofaka amanani kuzo. Amasethi wezibalo wemodeli athikwe ekuqaleni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELanda i-CSV\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uvule ithebula kusipredishithi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ubone\"\u003EOkufanele ubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmugqa ngamunye weqembu nenani lezinto zawo, nomugqa wesamba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinto ezingenalo inani ziyabalwa kodwa azengezi lutho. Lapho kwenzeka lokho, i-CSV yengeza ikholomu ethi &quot;ishiyiwe&quot; eduze kwesamba ukuze ubone ukuthi zingaki.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinombolo zisezinyunithini zefayela, njengoba ifayela ziligcina, ngokuvamile amamilimitha ngobude.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"umugqa-owodwa-ngento-noma-izindawo\"\u003EUmugqa owodwa ngento, noma izindawo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShintsha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmugqa owodwa ngento\u003C/strong\u003E: into ngayinye emgqeni wayo, nezici ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmakholomu\u003C/span\u003E namanani ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza ndawonye\u003C/span\u003E. I-CSV iqala ngeGlobalId yento ngayinye. Chofoza inani lokuqala emgqeni ukuze ukhethe lowo nto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzindawo\u003C/strong\u003E: igumbi ngalinye nenombolo yalo, igama, isitezi, indawo nevolumu, namasamba azo. Izindawo nevolumu ziwuthela kuma-quantity wesikhala njengoba ifayela lisho. Uma ingenawo, ziyalinganiswa kusimo sesikhala ngo-m² no-m³ futhi zibonisiwe ngohlobo lwe-italic; i-CSV ichaza ukuthi yiyiphi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulandelayo\"\u003EOkulandelayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/find\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/find\"\u003EThola izinto ngeklasi, igama noma isici\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/color-by-property\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/color-by-property\"\u003EUmbala wezinto ngesici\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukwakhiwa-ifc-4-3\"\u003EUkwakhiwa (IFC 4.3)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EInfrastructure (IFC 4.3)\u003C/strong\u003E ohlwini lwe-view ukuze ubone imigwaqo, imizila yesitimela, amabhuloho nemisebenzi yolwandle ihlanganiswe ngeklasi nangohlobo, ngobude, indawo nevolumu ifayela elizibhala ngokwalo. Inani elingalitshiwe yifayela liyashiywa lingenalutho, lingalinganiswanga. \u003Cstrong\u003EThumela amanani okwakhiwa ku-TakeoffCraft\u003C/strong\u003E lilondoloza ifayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.quantities.json\u003C/code\u003E ethi i-TakeoffCraft iyivule njengamanani ahlelwe.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenziwa Thola amanani aphelele kumodeli: ubude bezindonga ngezitezi, inani lezivalo ngohlobo, ivolumu yesilabhu ngento, nezindleko zayo yonke indawo. Izinyathelo Vula imodeli ye-IFC. Vula Amanani aphelele ephaneli yangakwesobunxele. Ku-Bala, khetha Yonke into noma izinto ezikhethiwe kuphela. Ngaphansi kwe-Hlanganisa ngo, khetha isici, njengo-Iklasi. Chofoza Engeza iqembu ukuze uhlukanise kabili, kuze kube kathathu, isibonelo ngo-Isitezi. Ngaphansi kwe-Engeza ndawonye, thikha izinombolo ozofaka amanani kuzo. Amasethi wezibalo wemodeli athikwe ekuqaleni. Chofoza Landa i-CSV ukuze uvule ithebula kusipredishithi. Okufanele ubone Umugqa ngamunye weqembu nenani lezinto zawo, nomugqa wesamba. Izinto ezingenalo inani ziyabalwa kodwa azengezi lutho. Lapho kwenzeka lokho, i-CSV yengeza ikholomu ethi \"ishiyiwe\" eduze kwesamba ukuze ubone ukuthi zingaki. Izinombolo zisezinyunithini zefayela, njengoba ifayela ziligcina, ngokuvamile amamilimitha ngobude. Umugqa owodwa ngento, noma izindawo Shintsha Bonisa: Umugqa owodwa ngento: into ngayinye emgqeni wayo, nezici ngaphansi kwe-Amakholomu namanani ngaphansi kwe-Engeza ndawonye. I-CSV iqala ngeGlobalId yento ngayinye. Chofoza inani lokuqala emgqeni ukuze ukhethe lowo nto. Izindawo: igumbi ngalinye nenombolo yalo, igama, isitezi, indawo nevolumu, namasamba azo. Izindawo nevolumu ziwuthela kuma-quantity wesikhala njengoba ifayela lisho. Uma ingenawo, ziyalinganiswa kusimo sesikhala ngo-m² no-m³ futhi zibonisiwe ngohlobo lwe-italic; i-CSV ichaza ukuthi yiyiphi. Okulandelayo Thola izinto ngeklasi, igama noma isici Umbala wezinto ngesici Ukwakhiwa (IFC 4.3) Khetha Infrastructure (IFC 4.3) ohlwini lwe-view ukuze ubone imigwaqo, imizila yesitimela, amabhuloho nemisebenzi yolwandle ihlanganiswe ngeklasi nangohlobo, ngobude, indawo nevolumu ifayela elizibhala ngokwalo. Inani elingalitshiwe yifayela liyashiywa lingenalutho, lingalinganiswanga. Thumela amanani okwakhiwa ku-TakeoffCraft lilondoloza ifayela le-.quantities.json ethi i-TakeoffCraft iyivule njengamanani ahlelwe.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"vr-review","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Hlola imodeli nge-VR headset","summary":"Hamba ngemodeli ye-IFC ngobukhulu obuphelele nge-VR headset: dlula, phendukela, linganisa, uyisike uyivule, beka izinkinga ze-BCF ngesithombe, ubone njengemodeli etafuleni, uhlangane nabanye besikhathi esiphilayo.","section":"tasks","order":33,"keywords":["vr","virtual reality","headset","webxr","xr","immersive","quest","oculus","vive","index","pico","hamba ngaphakathi","uhambo","thelepoti","ukubuka kwedizayini","ukuhlelwa","ukubuka","linganisa","isigaba","sika","inkinga","izinkinga","bcf","etafula","imodeli yesikali","ukuba khona","ama-avatar","okuphilayo","ndawonye"],"headings":[{"id":"okudingekayo","text":"Okudingekayo","level":2},{"id":"qala","text":"Qala","level":2},{"id":"hamba-uzungeze","text":"Hamba uzungeze","level":2},{"id":"linganisa","text":"Linganisa","level":2},{"id":"yisike-uyivule","text":"Yisike uyivule","level":2},{"id":"beka-inkinga","text":"Beka inkinga","level":2},{"id":"yibone-njengemodeli-etafuleni","text":"Yibone njengemodeli etafuleni","level":2},{"id":"nabanye-ngesikhathi-esiphilayo","text":"Nabanye, ngesikhathi esiphilayo","level":2},{"id":"phuma","text":"Phuma","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVR\u003C/span\u003E kwithuluzi lokusebenza lapho uzothola ukuthi ungena kumodeli nge-VR headset, ngobukhulu obuphelele. Umi lapho kamera yombono we-3D ikhona, phansi kwayo, ubheke ohlangothini olufanayo. Ibuka okubonisa imbono ye-3D: izinga, izinto kanye namamodeli afihliwe akusalokothi avele, nezinto ezipendiwe ziyaphinde zifike. Akukho lutho oluthunyelwayo: isiphequluli sidweba lokhu kulesi sikhombisi (noma kusiphequluli se-headset).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okudingekayo\"\u003EOkudingekayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-headset esiphequluli singayilawula (WebXR): isiphequluli se-headset eyimeleyo, noma i-Chrome noma i-Edge kwi-PC enohlobo oluxhunyiwe ku-headset.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImodeli ye-IFC evuliwe, kwikhasi eliphephile (https), njengoba kunjalo kule sayithi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma kungekho headset, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVR\u003C/span\u003E ayisebenzi futhi iyakutshela ukuthi kungani.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qala\"\u003EQala\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELungiselela imbono ye-3D lapho ofuna ukuqala khona: egumbini, noma ngaphandle ubheka isakhiwo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVR\u003C/span\u003E kwithuluzi lokusebenza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGqoka i-headset.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImenyu isenhlanganweni yangasekhohlo. Yibheke ngesilawuli sangakwesokunxele bese udonsa isiqalo ukukhetha inkinobho. (Uma kuyisandla esisodwa kuphela, imenyu iyaphaphama phambi kwendawo owaqala kuyo.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hamba-uzungeze\"\u003EHamba uzungeze\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDlula:\u003C/strong\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove\u003C/span\u003E, bheka phansi bese udonsa isiqalo; uzofika lapho. Noma sunda induku phambili ukuze ulawule, bese uyiyeka ukuze udlule. Ungafika kuphansi, kumashaftha, nasemhlabeni kuphela (izindawo ezibheke phezulu), hhayi kudonga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPhendukela:\u003C/strong\u003E sunda induku ngakwesokunxele noma ngakwesokudla: uphendukela ngama-30° njalo lapho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHamba:\u003C/strong\u003E endaweni yakho yokudlala, hamba nje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"linganisa\"\u003ELinganisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMeasure\u003C/span\u003E, bese udonsa isiqalo kumaphuzu amabili. Ibanga liboniswa phakathi kwawo, ngamamitha. Iphuzu eliseduze nekhona liyabambelela ekhoneni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yisike-uyivule\"\u003EYisike uyivule\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESection\u003C/span\u003E bese udonsa isiqalo endaweni:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ekudonga (noma kunoma yini engayisilo phansi): konke okuphakathi kwakho nalendawo kuyasikwa, ukuze ubone ngaphakathi. Lokhu kusebenza kangcono uma ubheka ngaphandle, noma ngaphesheya kwegumbi;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ephezu kwesilele, usuka phezulu: ipulani esikwe ngama-1.2 m ngaphezu kwalesi silele, ukuze izindonga zibonise ingxenye yazo ephansi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClear\u003C/span\u003E isusa ukusika kanye nemilinganiso. Uma i-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/section-plane\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/section-plane\"\u003Esection plane\u003C/a\u003E isika imodeli lapho uqala, i-headset iqala nayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beka-inkinga\"\u003EBeka inkinga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIssue\u003C/span\u003E bese udonsa isiqalo lapho kukhona inkinga. Ukhonkolo onenombolo uyibonisa, inkinga ifika kuthebhu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIssues\u003C/span\u003E njengesihloko se-BCF, nesithombe sakho ekubonile kanye nekhamera lapho wayemi khona, ezixhumanisweni zemodeli ngokwayo. Zigcine kanye nezinye \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/issues-bcf\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/issues-bcf\"\u003Eizinkinga\u003C/a\u003E zakho njengefayela le-BCF; ezinye izinsiza zokuhlela ziyovula zibonise lo mbono ofanayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEngeza ikhomenti enkingeni ngemva kokuphuma ku-VR, kuthebhu ye-Issues: ukubhala ku-headset akukakwakhiwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yibone-njengemodeli-etafuleni\"\u003EYibone njengemodeli etafuleni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETable top\u003C/span\u003E yenza imodeli ilingane etafuleni phambi kwakho; zungeza kuyo, noma uyiphendule ngenduku. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFull size\u003C/span\u003E ikubuyisela lapho wawukhona khona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nabanye-ngesikhathi-esiphilayo\"\u003ENabanye, ngesikhathi esiphilayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/work-live\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/work-live\"\u003Elive session\u003C/a\u003E, wonke umuntu ku-VR ubona abanye njengekhanda nezandla ezimbili ngombala wabo, negama labo, nedonsa lapho ngalinye libheka khona. Izinguquko zanoma ubani zifika ku-headset yakho ngokushesha. Abantu edeskini abakabonakali ku-headset okwamanje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"phuma\"\u003EPhuma\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELeave VR\u003C/span\u003E (nomaususe i-headset uphele ngaleyo ndlela). Imbono ye-3D esikrinini ihamba iye lapho ikhanda lakho lase likhona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuhlolwe nge-headset emulator, hhayi kuzo zonke izinhlobo ze-headset okwamanje. Imodeli enkulu ingenza i-headset ibe nemvamisa: fihla izitezi noma amamodeli ongawadingi kuqala (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\"\u003Ehide and isolate\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"VR kwithuluzi lokusebenza lapho uzothola ukuthi ungena kumodeli nge-VR headset, ngobukhulu obuphelele. Umi lapho kamera yombono we-3D ikhona, phansi kwayo, ubheke ohlangothini olufanayo. Ibuka okubonisa imbono ye-3D: izinga, izinto kanye namamodeli afihliwe akusalokothi avele, nezinto ezipendiwe ziyaphinde zifike. Akukho lutho oluthunyelwayo: isiphequluli sidweba lokhu kulesi sikhombisi (noma kusiphequluli se-headset). Okudingekayo I-headset esiphequluli singayilawula (WebXR): isiphequluli se-headset eyimeleyo, noma i-Chrome noma i-Edge kwi-PC enohlobo oluxhunyiwe ku-headset. Imodeli ye-IFC evuliwe, kwikhasi eliphephile (https), njengoba kunjalo kule sayithi. Uma kungekho headset, VR ayisebenzi futhi iyakutshela ukuthi kungani. Qala Lungiselela imbono ye-3D lapho ofuna ukuqala khona: egumbini, noma ngaphandle ubheka isakhiwo. Chofoza VR kwithuluzi lokusebenza. Gqoka i-headset. Imenyu isenhlanganweni yangasekhohlo. Yibheke ngesilawuli sangakwesokunxele bese udonsa isiqalo ukukhetha inkinobho. (Uma kuyisandla esisodwa kuphela, imenyu iyaphaphama phambi kwendawo owaqala kuyo.) Hamba uzungeze Dlula: ku-Move, bheka phansi bese udonsa isiqalo; uzofika lapho. Noma sunda induku phambili ukuze ulawule, bese uyiyeka ukuze udlule. Ungafika kuphansi, kumashaftha, nasemhlabeni kuphela (izindawo ezibheke phezulu), hhayi kudonga. Phendukela: sunda induku ngakwesokunxele noma ngakwesokudla: uphendukela ngama-30° njalo lapho. Hamba: endaweni yakho yokudlala, hamba nje. Linganisa Khetha Measure, bese udonsa isiqalo kumaphuzu amabili. Ibanga liboniswa phakathi kwawo, ngamamitha. Iphuzu eliseduze nekhona liyabambelela ekhoneni. Yisike uyivule Khetha Section bese udonsa isiqalo endaweni: kudonga (noma kunoma yini engayisilo phansi): konke okuphakathi kwakho nalendawo kuyasikwa, ukuze ubone ngaphakathi. Lokhu kusebenza kangcono uma ubheka ngaphandle, noma ngaphesheya kwegumbi; phezu kwesilele, usuka phezulu: ipulani esikwe ngama-1.2 m ngaphezu kwalesi silele, ukuze izindonga zibonise ingxenye yazo ephansi. Clear isusa ukusika kanye nemilinganiso. Uma i-section plane isika imodeli lapho uqala, i-headset iqala nayo. Beka inkinga Khetha Issue bese udonsa isiqalo lapho kukhona inkinga. Ukhonkolo onenombolo uyibonisa, inkinga ifika kuthebhu ye-Issues njengesihloko se-BCF, nesithombe sakho ekubonile kanye nekhamera lapho wayemi khona, ezixhumanisweni zemodeli ngokwayo. Zigcine kanye nezinye izinkinga zakho njengefayela le-BCF; ezinye izinsiza zokuhlela ziyovula zibonise lo mbono ofanayo. Engeza ikhomenti enkingeni ngemva kokuphuma ku-VR, kuthebhu ye-Issues: ukubhala ku-headset akukakwakhiwa. Yibone njengemodeli etafuleni Table top yenza imodeli ilingane etafuleni phambi kwakho; zungeza kuyo, noma uyiphendule ngenduku. Full size ikubuyisela lapho wawukhona khona. Nabanye, ngesikhathi esiphilayo Ku-live session, wonke umuntu ku-VR ubona abanye njengekhanda nezandla ezimbili ngombala wabo, negama labo, nedonsa lapho ngalinye libheka khona. Izinguquko zanoma ubani zifika ku-headset yakho ngokushesha. Abantu edeskini abakabonakali ku-headset okwamanje. Phuma Khetha Leave VR (nomaususe i-headset uphele ngaleyo ndlela). Imbono ye-3D esikrinini ihamba iye lapho ikhanda lakho lase likhona. Kuhlolwe nge-headset emulator, hhayi kuzo zonke izinhlobo ze-headset okwamanje. Imodeli enkulu ingenza i-headset ibe nemvamisa: fihla izitezi noma amamodeli ongawadingi kuqala (hide and isolate).","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"check-against-ids","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Hlola imodeli ngokuya ku-IDS yeklayenti","summary":"Layisha ifayela le-.ids onikezwe lona bese ubona zonke izinto ezingahlangabezani nalo ku-Inkinga, ngaphambi kokuthumela i-IFC.","section":"tasks","order":33,"keywords":["ids","information delivery specification","buildingsmart","izidingo","ukulethwa","hlola","ukuqinisekisa","qa","eir","bep","ipropathi","ukuhlukaniswa","impahla yokwakha","ukuthenga"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukubone","text":"Okufanele ukubone","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukwazi","text":"Okufanele ukwazi","level":2},{"id":"okulandelayo","text":"Okulandelayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-IDS (Information Delivery Specification, indinganiso ye-buildingSMART) uhlu lokuthi i-IFC kufanele iqukathe ini: iziphi izigaba, iziphi ipropathi namanani azo, ukuhlukaniswa, izinto zokwakha, nokuthi izinto zibekwe kuphi. Abaklayenti nokuthenga komphakathi bayithumela kanye nomsebenzi. I-BimCraft ihlola imodeli evulekile ye-IFC ngayo futhi ibhale yonke into engafinyeleli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula imodeli ye-IFC.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck against an IDS\u003C/span\u003E kwipaneli yesobunxele, ngaphansi kwesihloko \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel checks\u003C/span\u003E, noma khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck against IDS…\u003C/span\u003E kumenyu yesitayela sakho semenyu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELoad an .ids file…\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha ifayela. Akukho okuthunyelwa kwenye indawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFunda umphumela: isicacisi ngasinye nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPass\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFail\u003C/span\u003E kanye nokuthi zingaki izinto esisebenza kuzo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula Inkinga (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift M\"\u003E⌃⇧M\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+M\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) bese uchofoza ukwehluleka ukuze ukhethe into bese usondela kuyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukubone\"\u003EOkufanele ukubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsexwayiso esisodwa ngento ngayinye nesidingo esingayifinyeleli, negama lesicacisi, lokho i-IDS ekucela kona nalokho into enakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsicacisi esidingekayo esingekho lutho emodelini esihambisana naso siyisexwayiso saso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmbiko wokuhlola (ku-Inkinga) uqala nge-IDS: isihloko sayo, inguqulo, umbhali, kanye nenani lezinto ezisebenza kuzo, ezidlule nezehlulekile kwesicacisi ngasinye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukwazi\"\u003EOkufanele ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-IFC igcina kuphela isethulo se-IDS (igama, isihloko, inguqulo ne-hash), hhayi i-IDS ngokwayo: i-IDS yeklayenti ingaba yimfihlo, futhi i-IFC iya kubantu abanye. I-IDS ihlala kulesi sisheshi sebhrawuza eceleni kwemodeli, ngakho uma uvula i-IFC elondoloziwe lapha futhi, iyahlolwa futhi. Ukulayisha noma ukukhohlwa i-IDS kuyisinyathelo esisodwa osingasihlehlisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma uvulwe kenye ikhompyutha noma kenye ibhrawuza, u-Inkinga ubonisa isaziso sokuthi i-IDS ayitholakalanga: yilayishe futhi ukuze uphinde uhlole.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuze uthumele i-IDS ne-IFC ndawonye, vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKeep the IDS inside the IFC\u003C/span\u003E kuZilungiselelo, ethebhini le-BimCraft, ngaphambi kokuyilayisha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYonke inguquko, ukuhlehlisa nokuphinda wenze ihlolwa futhi emizuzwini embalwa kamuva.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmanani aqhathaniswa ngendlela ye-IDS: umbhalo ngokuqondile (uhlamvu olukhulu noluncane kubalulekile), izinombolo ngamayunithi e-SI netholeransi encane (ubude ngamamitha, ngakho imodeli ngamamilimitha iguqulwa kuqala).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsicacisi esabhalelwa enye inguqulo ye-IFC (njenge-IFC2X3 lapho imodeli iyi-IFC4) siyahlolwa noma kunjalo; umphumela uyakusho lokho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma ifayela le-IDS linamaphutha okungase kuwabike i-IDS audit, ingxoxo iwadwebela; izicacisi ahlala kuzo ziyehluleka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUngamukela ukwehluleka ngesizathu, njenganoma iyiphi inkinga. Ihlala ikhona ngenkathi amanani ezinto esahlala efanana.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmaphethini ku-IDS afundwa njengenani lonke. I-\u003Ccode\u003E^\u003C/code\u003E ekuqaleni nethe \u003Ccode\u003E$\u003C/code\u003E ekugcineni nazo zithathwa njengo &quot;inani lonke&quot;, njengoba amafayela amaningi e-IDS esho lokho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulandelayo\"\u003EOkulandelayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/model-checks\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/model-checks\"\u003EHlola imodeli ngezinkinga ezivamile\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/change-a-wall-or-door\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/change-a-wall-or-door\"\u003EShintsha udonga noma umnyango\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza I-IDS (Information Delivery Specification, indinganiso ye-buildingSMART) uhlu lokuthi i-IFC kufanele iqukathe ini: iziphi izigaba, iziphi ipropathi namanani azo, ukuhlukaniswa, izinto zokwakha, nokuthi izinto zibekwe kuphi. Abaklayenti nokuthenga komphakathi bayithumela kanye nomsebenzi. I-BimCraft ihlola imodeli evulekile ye-IFC ngayo futhi ibhale yonke into engafinyeleli. Izinyathelo Vula imodeli ye-IFC. Vula Check against an IDS kwipaneli yesobunxele, ngaphansi kwesihloko Model checks, noma khetha Check against IDS… kumenyu yesitayela sakho semenyu. Chofoza Load an .ids file… bese ukhetha ifayela. Akukho okuthunyelwa kwenye indawo. Funda umphumela: isicacisi ngasinye nge-Pass noma Fail kanye nokuthi zingaki izinto esisebenza kuzo. Vula Inkinga (Ctrl+Shift+M) bese uchofoza ukwehluleka ukuze ukhethe into bese usondela kuyo. Okufanele ukubone Isexwayiso esisodwa ngento ngayinye nesidingo esingayifinyeleli, negama lesicacisi, lokho i-IDS ekucela kona nalokho into enakho. Isicacisi esidingekayo esingekho lutho emodelini esihambisana naso siyisexwayiso saso. Umbiko wokuhlola (ku-Inkinga) uqala nge-IDS: isihloko sayo, inguqulo, umbhali, kanye nenani lezinto ezisebenza kuzo, ezidlule nezehlulekile kwesicacisi ngasinye. Okufanele ukwazi I-IFC igcina kuphela isethulo se-IDS (igama, isihloko, inguqulo ne-hash), hhayi i-IDS ngokwayo: i-IDS yeklayenti ingaba yimfihlo, futhi i-IFC iya kubantu abanye. I-IDS ihlala kulesi sisheshi sebhrawuza eceleni kwemodeli, ngakho uma uvula i-IFC elondoloziwe lapha futhi, iyahlolwa futhi. Ukulayisha noma ukukhohlwa i-IDS kuyisinyathelo esisodwa osingasihlehlisa. Uma uvulwe kenye ikhompyutha noma kenye ibhrawuza, u-Inkinga ubonisa isaziso sokuthi i-IDS ayitholakalanga: yilayishe futhi ukuze uphinde uhlole. Ukuze uthumele i-IDS ne-IFC ndawonye, vula Keep the IDS inside the IFC kuZilungiselelo, ethebhini le-BimCraft, ngaphambi kokuyilayisha. Yonke inguquko, ukuhlehlisa nokuphinda wenze ihlolwa futhi emizuzwini embalwa kamuva. Amanani aqhathaniswa ngendlela ye-IDS: umbhalo ngokuqondile (uhlamvu olukhulu noluncane kubalulekile), izinombolo ngamayunithi e-SI netholeransi encane (ubude ngamamitha, ngakho imodeli ngamamilimitha iguqulwa kuqala). Isicacisi esabhalelwa enye inguqulo ye-IFC (njenge-IFC2X3 lapho imodeli iyi-IFC4) siyahlolwa noma kunjalo; umphumela uyakusho lokho. Uma ifayela le-IDS linamaphutha okungase kuwabike i-IDS audit, ingxoxo iwadwebela; izicacisi ahlala kuzo ziyehluleka. Ungamukela ukwehluleka ngesizathu, njenganoma iyiphi inkinga. Ihlala ikhona ngenkathi amanani ezinto esahlala efanana. Amaphethini ku-IDS afundwa njengenani lonke. I-^ ekuqaleni nethe $ ekugcineni nazo zithathwa njengo \"inani lonke\", njengoba amafayela amaningi e-IDS esho lokho. Okulandelayo Hlola imodeli ngezinkinga ezivamile Shintsha udonga noma umnyango","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"drawing-advice","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Iseluleko sokudweba: usayizi ongavamile wenziwa, ngesexwayiso","summary":"BimCraft yenza lokho ocelayo. Usayizi ongaphandle kwesivamile uba yisexwayiso kwi-Izinkinga; akuvimbeli ukudweba noma ukugcina.","section":"tasks","order":33,"keywords":["iseluleko","isexwayiso","izinkinga","kuyenqatshwa","ngeke udwebe","incane kakhulu","mncane kakhulu","okuncane","umkhawulo","ububanzi besitebhisi","ukuphakama kwesinyathelo","iphaneli","ithreyidi","insika","indlela yokukhwela","usayizi womnyango","umugqa wegridi","ukuphakama kwezinga","udonga oluphephile","isilinganiso sesisekelo","akukho ukuvimbela"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"yini-eyiseluleko","text":"Yini eyiseluleko","level":2},{"id":"okusenqatshwayo","text":"Okusenqatshwayo","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukwazi","text":"Okufanele ukwazi","level":2},{"id":"okulandelayo","text":"Okulandelayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDweba noma shintsha usayizi ongavamile, bese ubona lapho iBimCraft ikutshela ngakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDweba noma shintsha into njengoba ufuna: isibonelo isitebhisi esinobubanzi obungu-400 mm.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBimCraft iyayenza njengoba icelwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProblems\u003C/span\u003E kwibha ephezulu. Ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EDrawing advice\u003C/strong\u003E kukhona isexwayiso esibiza into, usayizi owunikeze nobubanzi obujwayelekile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza isexwayiso ukuze ukhethe into. Shintsha usayizi uma kwakuyiphutha, noma ushiye: isexwayiso siyamukeleka, ngisho nangesizathu noma ngaphandle kwaso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yini-eyiseluleko\"\u003EYini eyiseluleko\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELokhu bekwake kwenqatshwa. Manje kuyenziwa, ngalunye nesexwayiso:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzitebhisi\u003C/strong\u003E: ezincane kunama-500 mm noma ezinkulu kunama-5 m; izinyathelo ezingaphandle kwama-100 kuya kwama-300 mm; amaphaneli angaphandle kwama-150 kuya kwama-600 mm.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzitebhisi ezijikelezayo\u003C/strong\u003E: iposi elingaphandle kwama-40 kuya kwama-400 mm; amaphaneli angaphansi kuka-100 mm ngokujula komugqa wokuhamba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinsika\u003C/strong\u003E: ezincane kunama-50 mm ngobubanzi noma ezincane kunama-300 mm ngobude.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmarempu\u003C/strong\u003E: ancane kunama-300 mm ngobubanzi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIminyango namawindi\u003C/strong\u003E: ancane kuna-100 mm ngobubanzi noma ngobude.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImigqa yegridi\u003C/strong\u003E: ncane kuna-100 mm ngobude.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzindonga\u003C/strong\u003E: udonga oluncane kuna-50 mm ubude, isibonelo ngenxa yokusika.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmazinga\u003C/strong\u003E: ngaphansi kwe-1 m noma angaphezu kwe-100 m ngobude (isakhiwo esisha, amazinga ahlukene, ukuphakama kwezinga).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzindlu eziphezulu\u003C/strong\u003E: ezingaphandle kwama-600 mm kuya kwama-12 m ngobubanzi, udonga lwangaphambili olungaphandle kwama-300 mm kuya kwama-4 m, ukweqa okungaphezu kuka-1 m, izindonga ezingaphandle kwama-50 kuya kwama-400 mm.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmaphedi wesakhiwo\u003C/strong\u003E: ukuthambeka kwamacala okungaphandle kwe-1:1 kuya ku-10:1.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okusenqatshwayo\"\u003EOkusenqatshwayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkungakwazi ukwakhiwa noma ukutholakala kuphela, ngalinye nomlayezo ochaza ukuthi kungani:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUsayizi ongaphansi kwe-10 mm (udonga oluncane kuna-1 mm): akukho okwakhiwayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIndlu eliphezulu elingaphezu kwekhulu ububanzi bodonga lwayo kabili: izindonga zayo ezimbili zingahlangana.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIphedi lesakhiwo elinamacala athambekile ngaphezu kwe-0.1:1 (lokho kuyindonga yokubamba) noma ngaphansi kwe-100:1 (ukulinganisa kuyoqhubeka ngosuku).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOkuthile okunganeli lapho ukubeke khona, umugqa ozinqamulayo, noma into engasasebenzi emodelini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukwazi\"\u003EOkufanele ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIseluleko sisebenza kusuka kumodeli, ngakho siyabuya lapho uvula ifayela kamuva, futhi siyanyamalala uma usayizi ulungisiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuhlolwa kwemodeli, amaphakheji emithetho namahlolo e-IDS nakho kuthi kuphela kubonise lokho akutholayo. Akukho okusenza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProblems\u003C/span\u003E ivimbele ukudweba noma ukugcina.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinhlobo ezijwayelekile zezinga lokusebenza elijwayelekile, hhayi ikhodi yokwakha. Ukuze uthole ikhodi, engeza okwengeziwe kwemithetho yokwakha bese ukhetha indawo yakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulandelayo\"\u003EOkulandelayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/model-checks\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/model-checks\"\u003EHlola imodeli ngezinkinga ezivamile\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/stairs-and-railings\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/stairs-and-railings\"\u003EIzitebhisi nezindingilizi\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Dweba noma shintsha usayizi ongavamile, bese ubona lapho iBimCraft ikutshela ngakho. Izinyathelo Dweba noma shintsha into njengoba ufuna: isibonelo isitebhisi esinobubanzi obungu-400 mm. BimCraft iyayenza njengoba icelwe. Vula Problems kwibha ephezulu. Ngaphansi kwe-Drawing advice kukhona isexwayiso esibiza into, usayizi owunikeze nobubanzi obujwayelekile. Chofoza isexwayiso ukuze ukhethe into. Shintsha usayizi uma kwakuyiphutha, noma ushiye: isexwayiso siyamukeleka, ngisho nangesizathu noma ngaphandle kwaso. Yini eyiseluleko Lokhu bekwake kwenqatshwa. Manje kuyenziwa, ngalunye nesexwayiso: Izitebhisi: ezincane kunama-500 mm noma ezinkulu kunama-5 m; izinyathelo ezingaphandle kwama-100 kuya kwama-300 mm; amaphaneli angaphandle kwama-150 kuya kwama-600 mm. Izitebhisi ezijikelezayo: iposi elingaphandle kwama-40 kuya kwama-400 mm; amaphaneli angaphansi kuka-100 mm ngokujula komugqa wokuhamba. Izinsika: ezincane kunama-50 mm ngobubanzi noma ezincane kunama-300 mm ngobude. Amarempu: ancane kunama-300 mm ngobubanzi. Iminyango namawindi: ancane kuna-100 mm ngobubanzi noma ngobude. Imigqa yegridi: ncane kuna-100 mm ngobude. Izindonga: udonga oluncane kuna-50 mm ubude, isibonelo ngenxa yokusika. Amazinga: ngaphansi kwe-1 m noma angaphezu kwe-100 m ngobude (isakhiwo esisha, amazinga ahlukene, ukuphakama kwezinga). Izindlu eziphezulu: ezingaphandle kwama-600 mm kuya kwama-12 m ngobubanzi, udonga lwangaphambili olungaphandle kwama-300 mm kuya kwama-4 m, ukweqa okungaphezu kuka-1 m, izindonga ezingaphandle kwama-50 kuya kwama-400 mm. Amaphedi wesakhiwo: ukuthambeka kwamacala okungaphandle kwe-1:1 kuya ku-10:1. Okusenqatshwayo Okungakwazi ukwakhiwa noma ukutholakala kuphela, ngalinye nomlayezo ochaza ukuthi kungani: Usayizi ongaphansi kwe-10 mm (udonga oluncane kuna-1 mm): akukho okwakhiwayo. Indlu eliphezulu elingaphezu kwekhulu ububanzi bodonga lwayo kabili: izindonga zayo ezimbili zingahlangana. Iphedi lesakhiwo elinamacala athambekile ngaphezu kwe-0.1:1 (lokho kuyindonga yokubamba) noma ngaphansi kwe-100:1 (ukulinganisa kuyoqhubeka ngosuku). Okuthile okunganeli lapho ukubeke khona, umugqa ozinqamulayo, noma into engasasebenzi emodelini. Okufanele ukwazi Iseluleko sisebenza kusuka kumodeli, ngakho siyabuya lapho uvula ifayela kamuva, futhi siyanyamalala uma usayizi ulungisiwe. Ukuhlolwa kwemodeli, amaphakheji emithetho namahlolo e-IDS nakho kuthi kuphela kubonise lokho akutholayo. Akukho okusenza Problems ivimbele ukudweba noma ukugcina. Izinhlobo ezijwayelekile zezinga lokusebenza elijwayelekile, hhayi ikhodi yokwakha. Ukuze uthole ikhodi, engeza okwengeziwe kwemithetho yokwakha bese ukhetha indawo yakho. Okulandelayo Hlola imodeli ngezinkinga ezivamile Izitebhisi nezindingilizi","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"walls-from-plans","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Izindonga kusuka kumasethi wamapulani (PDF noma isikena)","summary":"Guqula amakhasi e-PDF, noma umdwebo oskeniwe, ube yizindonga, izinmnyango nezifasiteli, izitezi ezingu-isitezi esisodwa ngekhasi ngalinye, nekhasi lihlala ngaphansi kwepulani ngayinye.","section":"tasks","order":33,"keywords":["pdf","amapulani","isethi yamapulani","skena","umdwebo oskeniwe","tiff","landela","izindonga kusuka ku-pdf","izindonga kusuka kusikena","izitezi","amakhasi","isikali","izinmnyango","amawindi","ukuvuleka","isile","underlay"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"ukuthi-ifunda-kanjani-ikhasi","text":"Ukuthi ifunda kanjani ikhasi","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukubone","text":"Okufanele ukubone","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQala imodeli ngamapulani osanawo ephepheni: i-PDF (edwetshwe njengemigqa, noma isikena ngaphakathi kwe-PDF) noma isikena (PNG, JPEG, TIFF enekhasi elilodwa noma amaningi). Ikhasi ngalinye liba izindonga, izinmnyango nezifasiteli zesitezi esisodwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw\u003C/span\u003E. Khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuild\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom a drawing…\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChoose a drawing…\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha i-PDF noma isikena.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPages and levels.\u003C/strong\u003E Ikhasi ngalinye lidwetshwa ngalokho okuyikho (\u003Cstrong\u003Eline work\u003C/strong\u003E, noma \u003Cstrong\u003Ea picture (traced)\u003C/strong\u003E) nesitezi okuya kuso: elinye lezitezi onazo, \u003Cstrong\u003Ea new level above the others\u003C/strong\u003E, noma \u003Cstrong\u003Eleave this page out\u003C/strong\u003E. Amakhasi afanisiwa nezitezi zakho ngokulandelana; shintsha noma yiliphi kuwo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EScale.\u003C/strong\u003E Ye-PDF, chaza ukuthi yadwetshwa kanjani (\u003Cstrong\u003E1 : 100\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003E1 : 50\u003C/strong\u003E…). Kokunye, noma uma ungazi, khetha \u003Cstrong\u003Efrom a distance I know\u003C/strong\u003E: chofoza amaphuzu amabili esilinganiso noma ibha yesikali esibukwayo, bese uthayipha ibanga langempela. Onke amakhasi asebenzisa isikali esisodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003Euhlobo lodonga\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003Enobude besitezi esisha\u003C/strong\u003E. Shiya \u003Cstrong\u003EKeep each page under the plan of its level\u003C/strong\u003E ukuthi iphawulwe ukuze ubone ikhasi ngalinye njengemigqa emincane ngaphansi kwepulani yesitezi sayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmugqa ongaphansi kwezinketho utshela ukuthi izindonga, izinmnyango nezifasiteli zingaki ozozenza, nokuthi ziyizitezi ezingaki. Chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMake them\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuthi-ifunda-kanjani-ikhasi\"\u003EUkuthi ifunda kanjani ikhasi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzindonga\u003C/strong\u003E zivela ezipheyeni zemigqa ehlanganayo ehlukaniswe ngama-600 mm ngokukhulu (izinhlangothi ezimbili zodonga); udonga ububanzi bebanga phakathi kwemigqa. Ukuhluzwa nokubhalwa kwalo kuyashiywa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinmnyango nezifasiteli.\u003C/strong\u003E Igebe kodonga (500 kuya ku-2600 mm) elinomjikelo womnyango odwetshwe eduze kwalo liyinmnyango, ligonywe ekugcineni kwegebe futhi livule ngakuhlangothi lomjikelo. Igebe noma udonga okunemigqa yesile kuwo liyifasitela. Igebe elingenalutho kulokho zombili livulwa njengomnyango ufika ku-1300 mm, nokuphezulu kwalokho kube yifasitela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsikena\u003C/strong\u003E siyaqondiswa kuqala uma sakhishwa siphambeke (ingxoxo iyasho lokho), senziwa mnyama nomhlophe, sihlanzwe izimpawu ezincane futhi silandelwe; ikhasi le-\u003Cstrong\u003EPDF elingumfanekiso\u003C/strong\u003E lidwetshwa kuqala bese lisetshenziswa ngendlela efanayo. Ukulandela kuthola umugqa ophakathi kwesitiroko ngasinye bese kufanelana imigqa eqondile namajika kuwo; asisebenzisi unethiwekhi noma imodeli eqeqeshiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmagumbi\u003C/strong\u003E alandela ngokwawo kulolo luhlu lwezindonga oluvaliwe. Uma i-PDF inombhalo, igumbi lithatha igama lalo kumbhalo ongaphakathi kwalo (obukhulu kakhulu; isilinganiso, isikali noma inombolo yeshidi akuyona igama). Isikena alinambhalo, ngakho amagumbi awo agcina amagama anikezwe uhlelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EYonke into efundwe ekhasini imakwe ingaqinisekisiwe\u003C/strong\u003E: udonga ngalunye, umnyango, ifasitela negumbi linebhokisi elidashiwe nombuzo &quot;?&quot; epulanini kuze kube yilapho uyihlola. Khetha okuhlolile bese usebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETools\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMark as checked\u003C/span\u003E. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/verification\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/verification\"\u003EMark elements as checked or field-verified\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukubone\"\u003EOkufanele ukubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzindonga, izinmnyango, amafasitela namagumbi esitezi ngasinye, kanye nezitezi ezintsha, konke kuyisinyathelo esisodwa: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyasuthula konke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIkhasi ngalinye njengemigqa emincane ngaphansi kwepulani yesitezi sayo, oluhlu lwalo ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuild\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom a drawing…\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELokhu yilokho imigqa eyinikeze, ngokunemba kwekhasi. Isikena singalahlekelwa udonga oluncane, sihlanganise izindonga ezisondelene kakhulu, noma sithole udonga esitaneni. Umjikelo womnyango ongakhonjiswa umdwebo wenza igebe libe umnyango ovamile. Hlola isitezi ngasinye nekhasi lakho ngaphambi kokuthembela kukho, futhi ulungise okungalungile ngamathuluzi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWall\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDoor\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWindow\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Qala imodeli ngamapulani osanawo ephepheni: i-PDF (edwetshwe njengemigqa, noma isikena ngaphakathi kwe-PDF) noma isikena (PNG, JPEG, TIFF enekhasi elilodwa noma amaningi). Ikhasi ngalinye liba izindonga, izinmnyango nezifasiteli zesitezi esisodwa. Izinyathelo Vula Draw. Khetha Build › From a drawing…, bese Choose a drawing… bese ukhetha i-PDF noma isikena. Pages and levels. Ikhasi ngalinye lidwetshwa ngalokho okuyikho (line work, noma a picture (traced)) nesitezi okuya kuso: elinye lezitezi onazo, a new level above the others, noma leave this page out. Amakhasi afanisiwa nezitezi zakho ngokulandelana; shintsha noma yiliphi kuwo. Scale. Ye-PDF, chaza ukuthi yadwetshwa kanjani (1 : 100, 1 : 50…). Kokunye, noma uma ungazi, khetha from a distance I know: chofoza amaphuzu amabili esilinganiso noma ibha yesikali esibukwayo, bese uthayipha ibanga langempela. Onke amakhasi asebenzisa isikali esisodwa. Khetha uhlobo lodonga kanye nobude besitezi esisha. Shiya Keep each page under the plan of its level ukuthi iphawulwe ukuze ubone ikhasi ngalinye njengemigqa emincane ngaphansi kwepulani yesitezi sayo. Umugqa ongaphansi kwezinketho utshela ukuthi izindonga, izinmnyango nezifasiteli zingaki ozozenza, nokuthi ziyizitezi ezingaki. Chofoza Make them. Ukuthi ifunda kanjani ikhasi Izindonga zivela ezipheyeni zemigqa ehlanganayo ehlukaniswe ngama-600 mm ngokukhulu (izinhlangothi ezimbili zodonga); udonga ububanzi bebanga phakathi kwemigqa. Ukuhluzwa nokubhalwa kwalo kuyashiywa. Izinmnyango nezifasiteli. Igebe kodonga (500 kuya ku-2600 mm) elinomjikelo womnyango odwetshwe eduze kwalo liyinmnyango, ligonywe ekugcineni kwegebe futhi livule ngakuhlangothi lomjikelo. Igebe noma udonga okunemigqa yesile kuwo liyifasitela. Igebe elingenalutho kulokho zombili livulwa njengomnyango ufika ku-1300 mm, nokuphezulu kwalokho kube yifasitela. Isikena siyaqondiswa kuqala uma sakhishwa siphambeke (ingxoxo iyasho lokho), senziwa mnyama nomhlophe, sihlanzwe izimpawu ezincane futhi silandelwe; ikhasi le-PDF elingumfanekiso lidwetshwa kuqala bese lisetshenziswa ngendlela efanayo. Ukulandela kuthola umugqa ophakathi kwesitiroko ngasinye bese kufanelana imigqa eqondile namajika kuwo; asisebenzisi unethiwekhi noma imodeli eqeqeshiwe. Amagumbi alandela ngokwawo kulolo luhlu lwezindonga oluvaliwe. Uma i-PDF inombhalo, igumbi lithatha igama lalo kumbhalo ongaphakathi kwalo (obukhulu kakhulu; isilinganiso, isikali noma inombolo yeshidi akuyona igama). Isikena alinambhalo, ngakho amagumbi awo agcina amagama anikezwe uhlelo. Yonke into efundwe ekhasini imakwe ingaqinisekisiwe: udonga ngalunye, umnyango, ifasitela negumbi linebhokisi elidashiwe nombuzo \"?\" epulanini kuze kube yilapho uyihlola. Khetha okuhlolile bese usebenzisa Tools › Mark as checked. Bheka Mark elements as checked or field-verified. Okufanele ukubone Izindonga, izinmnyango, amafasitela namagumbi esitezi ngasinye, kanye nezitezi ezintsha, konke kuyisinyathelo esisodwa: Ctrl+Z iyasuthula konke. Ikhasi ngalinye njengemigqa emincane ngaphansi kwepulani yesitezi sayo, oluhlu lwalo ku-Build › From a drawing… no-Remove. Lokhu yilokho imigqa eyinikeze, ngokunemba kwekhasi. Isikena singalahlekelwa udonga oluncane, sihlanganise izindonga ezisondelene kakhulu, noma sithole udonga esitaneni. Umjikelo womnyango ongakhonjiswa umdwebo wenza igebe libe umnyango ovamile. Hlola isitezi ngasinye nekhasi lakho ngaphambi kokuthembela kukho, futhi ulungise okungalungile ngamathuluzi Wall, Door kanye Window.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"render-engines","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Khetha uhlelo olwenza isithombe","summary":"Injini ku-engxoxweni yokurenda: izinjini zethu ezimbili, ezinye izinhlelo ku-CadCraft Studio, nokuthi iwebhu yenza nini esikhundleni salokho.","section":"tasks","order":33,"keywords":["renda","injini","umenzi wesithombe","injini yokurenda","plug-in","plugin","studio","uhlelo lwangaphandle","kudwetshwe ngu","uhlu lokurenda","injini ye-add-on"],"headings":[{"id":"ukuthi-ukukhetha-kuziphatha-kanjani","text":"Ukuthi ukukhetha kuziphatha kanjani","level":2},{"id":"okwenziwa-yisimo-yiyo-yonke-injini","text":"Okwenziwa yisimo yiyo yonke injini","level":2},{"id":"uhlu-lokurenda","text":"Uhlu lokurenda","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda\u003C/span\u003E inento ethi \u003Cstrong\u003EInjini\u003C/strong\u003E ngaphezulu kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndlela\u003C/span\u003E. Izinjini zethu ezimbili zikhona njalo futhi zisebenza noma yikuphi; ama-add-on angangeza ezinye, futhi ku-CadCraft Studio uhlu luphinde lube nezinhlelo ezithatha isimo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInjini\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYenzani\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ELapho\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEyakhelwe: Ngokushesha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsithombe esisheshayo: ukukhanya kwemini, izithunzi ezithambile, izimo zengilazi nensimbi, emasekhondeni\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIwebhu ne-Studio\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEyakhelwe: Isilandeli sendlela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkukhanya okugxumayo phakathi kwezindawo, ekhadini lezithombe noma kuprosesa, uhlu lokurenda kanye namanye amakhompyutha kunethiwekhi yakho\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIwebhu ne-Studio\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInjini ye-add-on\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIyadweba futhi ibuyisele isithombe: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render-other-program\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render-other-program\"\u003EDweba isithombe ngolunye uhlelo\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIwebhu (injini ebhalwe nge-JavaScript) noma i-Studio (injini eqhuba uhlelo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUhlelo oluthatha isimo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-Studio ibeka isimo efolda yayo futhi iyilondoloza ilingana\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStudio\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVula ku…\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIlondoloza isimo bese ilivula kuhlelo; akukho okubuyela: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render-open-in\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render-open-in\"\u003EVula isimo kolunye uhlelo\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIwebhu ilondoloza ifayela\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuthi-ukukhetha-kuziphatha-kanjani\"\u003EUkuthi ukukhetha kuziphatha kanjani\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkukhetha i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgokushesha\u003C/span\u003E noma isilandeli sendlela kushintsha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndlela\u003C/span\u003E nakho, nangokuphambene. Akukho okunye okushintsha engxoxweni kwabantu abangakaze basebenzise enye injini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInjini engatholakali ihlala ohlwini nesizathu (“akutholakalanga”, “idinga inguqulo entsha”); awukwazi ukuyikhetha. Kuwebhu, injini esebenza kuStudio kuphela ibonisa “ilondoloza ifayela”: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda\u003C/span\u003E ilondoloza isimo nezilungiselelo zaso kufayela oliyisa kuleyo nhlelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkukhetha kugcinwa kanye nezilungiselelo zokurenda zefayela, futhi injini oyikhethe ekugcineni iyinjini yokuqala yamafayela angenayo ukukhetha kwawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsithombe esivela kolunye uhlelo sibonisa ukuthi yiluphi uhlelo olwenze lona nenguqulo yalo, engxoxweni nasohlwini lokurenda. Izithembiso zekhasi le-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render\"\u003ERenda\u003C/a\u003E zihlanganisa \u003Cstrong\u003Eizinjini zethu\u003C/strong\u003E kuphela: olunye uhlelo luyakhanyisa, luthinte futhi lube ngamasampula ngendlela yalo, ngakho izithombe ezimbili zesimo esifanayo zifana ngekhamera, ilanga, izibani nokuvezwa, kodwa hhayi ngepikseli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okwenziwa-yisimo-yiyo-yonke-injini\"\u003EOkwenziwa yisimo yiyo yonke injini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsimo siya kolunye uhlelo njenge-\u003Cstrong\u003Eipakethe\u003C/strong\u003E: imodeli njengefayela le-USD (ifayela elifanayo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/usd\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/usd\"\u003Eouligcina ngokuthi Londoloza njenge-USD\u003C/a\u003E), kanye nefayela lezilungiselelo elibamba okungathenjwa ngakho umlethi we-USD: amanani ezinto zokwakha ngokunembile, izibani ezivulekile ngamandla nemaphrofayili wokukhanya, ilanga, isibhakabhaka, ukuvezwa nekhamera njengoba ingxoxo ingayidweba. Akukho lapho okulayishwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uhlu-lokurenda\"\u003EUhlu lokurenda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsithombe esivela kolunye uhlelo singalinda kuhlu lokurenda njengezethu (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render#the-render-queue\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render\" data-hash=\"the-render-queue\"\u003Ebona uhlu lokurenda\u003C/a\u003E); umsebenzi wawo ukhumbula ukuthi iyiphi injini eyiyo.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Renda inento ethi Injini ngaphezulu kwe-Indlela. Izinjini zethu ezimbili zikhona njalo futhi zisebenza noma yikuphi; ama-add-on angangeza ezinye, futhi ku-CadCraft Studio uhlu luphinde lube nezinhlelo ezithatha isimo. Injini Yenzani Lapho Eyakhelwe: Ngokushesha Isithombe esisheshayo: ukukhanya kwemini, izithunzi ezithambile, izimo zengilazi nensimbi, emasekhondeni Iwebhu ne-Studio Eyakhelwe: Isilandeli sendlela Ukukhanya okugxumayo phakathi kwezindawo, ekhadini lezithombe noma kuprosesa, uhlu lokurenda kanye namanye amakhompyutha kunethiwekhi yakho Iwebhu ne-Studio Injini ye-add-on Iyadweba futhi ibuyisele isithombe: bona Dweba isithombe ngolunye uhlelo Iwebhu (injini ebhalwe nge-JavaScript) noma i-Studio (injini eqhuba uhlelo) Uhlelo oluthatha isimo I-Studio ibeka isimo efolda yayo futhi iyilondoloza ilingana Studio Vula ku… Ilondoloza isimo bese ilivula kuhlelo; akukho okubuyela: bona Vula isimo kolunye uhlelo Iwebhu ilondoloza ifayela Ukuthi ukukhetha kuziphatha kanjani Ukukhetha i-Ngokushesha noma isilandeli sendlela kushintsha Indlela nakho, nangokuphambene. Akukho okunye okushintsha engxoxweni kwabantu abangakaze basebenzise enye injini. Injini engatholakali ihlala ohlwini nesizathu (“akutholakalanga”, “idinga inguqulo entsha”); awukwazi ukuyikhetha. Kuwebhu, injini esebenza kuStudio kuphela ibonisa “ilondoloza ifayela”: Renda ilondoloza isimo nezilungiselelo zaso kufayela oliyisa kuleyo nhlelo. Ukukhetha kugcinwa kanye nezilungiselelo zokurenda zefayela, futhi injini oyikhethe ekugcineni iyinjini yokuqala yamafayela angenayo ukukhetha kwawo. Isithombe esivela kolunye uhlelo sibonisa ukuthi yiluphi uhlelo olwenze lona nenguqulo yalo, engxoxweni nasohlwini lokurenda. Izithembiso zekhasi le-Renda zihlanganisa izinjini zethu kuphela: olunye uhlelo luyakhanyisa, luthinte futhi lube ngamasampula ngendlela yalo, ngakho izithombe ezimbili zesimo esifanayo zifana ngekhamera, ilanga, izibani nokuvezwa, kodwa hhayi ngepikseli. Okwenziwa yisimo yiyo yonke injini Isimo siya kolunye uhlelo njenge-ipakethe: imodeli njengefayela le-USD (ifayela elifanayo ouligcina ngokuthi Londoloza njenge-USD), kanye nefayela lezilungiselelo elibamba okungathenjwa ngakho umlethi we-USD: amanani ezinto zokwakha ngokunembile, izibani ezivulekile ngamandla nemaphrofayili wokukhanya, ilanga, isibhakabhaka, ukuvezwa nekhamera njengoba ingxoxo ingayidweba. Akukho lapho okulayishwa. Uhlu lokurenda Isithombe esivela kolunye uhlelo singalinda kuhlu lokurenda njengezethu (bona uhlu lokurenda); umsebenzi wawo ukhumbula ukuthi iyiphi injini eyiyo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"paint-materials","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Penda izakhi zodonga, amaphansi namaphahla ngempahla yokwakha","summary":"Nikeza izakhi impahla yokwakha efana nebhulokhi, ukugoqa, izinhlanga zophahla, izinkuni noma ithayela, phezu kwento yonke noma ohlangothini olulodwa, egcinwe ku-IFC futhi ibonakale ezithombeni ezinemibala.","section":"tasks","order":33,"keywords":["penda","impahla yokwakha","impahla","ukuqeda","ukuthungwa","ibhulokhi","ukugoqa","izinhlanga zophahla","izinkuni","itshe","ithayela","ukhonkolo","utshani","igravel","ingilazi","insimbi","uhlangothi lodonga","ngaphakathi","ngaphandle","ukuqedwa kwephansi","igumbi","isitayela sendawo"],"headings":[{"id":"penda-izakhi","text":"Penda izakhi","level":2},{"id":"penda-uhlangothi-olulodwa","text":"Penda uhlangothi olulodwa","level":2},{"id":"susa-impahla-yokwakha","text":"Susa impahla yokwakha","level":2},{"id":"ku-ifc","text":"Ku-IFC","level":2},{"id":"ukuthungwa-ku-3d-view","text":"Ukuthungwa ku-3D view","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPenda\u003C/span\u003E ku-toolbar ivula umtapo wempahla yokwakha ngaphezu kwe-3D view: ibhulokhi nezitoko, ukugoqa, izinhlanga zophahla, izinkuni, itshe, ithayela, ukhonkolo, umhlabathi, ingilazi nensimbi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"penda-izakhi\"\u003EPenda izakhi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPenda\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza impahla yokwakha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza izakhi ku-3D view. Ukuchofoza ngakunye kupenda leyo nto ochofoze kuyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze upende izinto eziningi ngesikhathi esisodwa, zikhethe kuqala (chofoza, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+chofoza, noma \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/find\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/find\"\u003Esesha\u003C/a\u003E), bese uchofoza impahla yokwakha: yonke izakhi ezikhethiwe ithola yona ngesinyathelo esisodwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInto ibonisa umbala wempahla yokwakha ku-3D view ngokushesha. Ukuthungwa kwayo kuvela ku-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render\"\u003Eisithombe esinemibala\u003C/a\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVala\u003C/span\u003E kuyeka ukupenda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"penda-uhlangothi-olulodwa\"\u003EPenda uhlangothi olulodwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlangothi oluchofozwe kuphela\u003C/span\u003E, bese uchofoza uhlangothi ofuna: ingaphandle lodonga ngokugoqa kanye nangaphakathi ngesinye isiqedo, phezulu kwephansi ngezinkuni nangaphansi kulushiywe njengoba kunjalo. Yonke enye ingxenye yento igcina impahla yayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUhlangothi litholakala ngezinqondiso zento ngokwayo, ngakho lihlala luhlangothi olufanayo uma uhambisa noma ujikeleza into.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkupenda amaphansi igumbi ngegumbi, nika igumbi ngalinye iphansi lalo (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDweba\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIphansi\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003ELolu gumbi\u003C/strong\u003E, bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/floors-and-roofs\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/floors-and-roofs\"\u003EAmagumbi, amaphansi, amasilingi namaphahla\u003C/a\u003E), bese upenda phezulu kwephansi ngalinye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"susa-impahla-yokwakha\"\u003ESusa impahla yokwakha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza iswishi enemigqa (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAkukho mpahla yokwakha\u003C/span\u003E), bese uchofoza into. Yonke impahla yayo, kubandakanya nezinhlangothi, iyasuswa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-ifc\"\u003EKu-IFC\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkupenda kushintsha i-IFC (isinyathelo esisodwa ngasinye, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Z\"\u003E⌃Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyakuhlehlisa) futhi kugcina ku-IFC elula:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Engayinye into epenjiwe ithola isethi yezakhiwo ethi \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_Render\u003C/code\u003E ebiza impahla yayo, nepropathi eyodwa ngohlangothi ngalunye olupenjiwe;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eumzimba wayo uthola isitayela sendawo ngombala wempahla yokwakha, ukuze ezinye izinhlelo ze-BIM zibonise umbala. Ku-IFC4 isitayela siphinde sibize nokuthungwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma i-BimCraft iyibumba kabusha udonga owulipentile (njengalapho uhambisa ukuphela kwawo), udonga ugcina impahla yalo nombala walo, ku-BimCraft, ezithombeni nasezinhlelweni zabanye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuthungwa kudwetshwa yi-BimCraft ngokwayo: kusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi futhi kukhululekile ukusetshenziswa noma yini (CC0). Ukuthungwa kwezithombe zakho akukakwakhiwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuthungwa-ku-3d-view\"\u003EUkuthungwa ku-3D view\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUdonga webhulokhi ophenjiwe ubonisa amabhulokhi alo, iphansi lezinkuni libonisa amapuleti alo, ngosayizi wangempela, uma nje sekukhona upende. Khipha ithikhi ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EBonisa ukuthungwa ku-3D view\u003C/strong\u003E kuphalethi lokupenda ukuze ubone imibala eqinile. Imodeli enkulu kakhulu iyayivala ngokwayo futhi iyasho lokho. Umbala ngepropathi uhlala ubonisa imibala yawo. Ukuthungwa kudwetshwa yiprogramu, ngakho akukho okulandiwayo, futhi izithombe ezinemibala kanye nefayela le-glTF zinakho kunoma iyiphi indlela.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Penda ku-toolbar ivula umtapo wempahla yokwakha ngaphezu kwe-3D view: ibhulokhi nezitoko, ukugoqa, izinhlanga zophahla, izinkuni, itshe, ithayela, ukhonkolo, umhlabathi, ingilazi nensimbi. Penda izakhi Chofoza Penda. Chofoza impahla yokwakha. Chofoza izakhi ku-3D view. Ukuchofoza ngakunye kupenda leyo nto ochofoze kuyo. Ukuze upende izinto eziningi ngesikhathi esisodwa, zikhethe kuqala (chofoza, Ctrl+chofoza, noma sesha), bese uchofoza impahla yokwakha: yonke izakhi ezikhethiwe ithola yona ngesinyathelo esisodwa. Into ibonisa umbala wempahla yokwakha ku-3D view ngokushesha. Ukuthungwa kwayo kuvela ku-isithombe esinemibala. Esc noma Vala kuyeka ukupenda. Penda uhlangothi olulodwa Khetha Uhlangothi oluchofozwe kuphela, bese uchofoza uhlangothi ofuna: ingaphandle lodonga ngokugoqa kanye nangaphakathi ngesinye isiqedo, phezulu kwephansi ngezinkuni nangaphansi kulushiywe njengoba kunjalo. Yonke enye ingxenye yento igcina impahla yayo. Uhlangothi litholakala ngezinqondiso zento ngokwayo, ngakho lihlala luhlangothi olufanayo uma uhambisa noma ujikeleza into. Ukupenda amaphansi igumbi ngegumbi, nika igumbi ngalinye iphansi lalo (Dweba › Iphansi › Lolu gumbi, bheka Amagumbi, amaphansi, amasilingi namaphahla), bese upenda phezulu kwephansi ngalinye. Susa impahla yokwakha Chofoza iswishi enemigqa (Akukho mpahla yokwakha), bese uchofoza into. Yonke impahla yayo, kubandakanya nezinhlangothi, iyasuswa. Ku-IFC Ukupenda kushintsha i-IFC (isinyathelo esisodwa ngasinye, Ctrl+Z iyakuhlehlisa) futhi kugcina ku-IFC elula: ngayinye into epenjiwe ithola isethi yezakhiwo ethi CadCraft_Render ebiza impahla yayo, nepropathi eyodwa ngohlangothi ngalunye olupenjiwe; umzimba wayo uthola isitayela sendawo ngombala wempahla yokwakha, ukuze ezinye izinhlelo ze-BIM zibonise umbala. Ku-IFC4 isitayela siphinde sibize nokuthungwa. Uma i-BimCraft iyibumba kabusha udonga owulipentile (njengalapho uhambisa ukuphela kwawo), udonga ugcina impahla yalo nombala walo, ku-BimCraft, ezithombeni nasezinhlelweni zabanye. Ukuthungwa kudwetshwa yi-BimCraft ngokwayo: kusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi futhi kukhululekile ukusetshenziswa noma yini (CC0). Ukuthungwa kwezithombe zakho akukakwakhiwa. Ukuthungwa ku-3D view Udonga webhulokhi ophenjiwe ubonisa amabhulokhi alo, iphansi lezinkuni libonisa amapuleti alo, ngosayizi wangempela, uma nje sekukhona upende. Khipha ithikhi ku-Bonisa ukuthungwa ku-3D view kuphalethi lokupenda ukuze ubone imibala eqinile. Imodeli enkulu kakhulu iyayivala ngokwayo futhi iyasho lokho. Umbala ngepropathi uhlala ubonisa imibala yawo. Ukuthungwa kudwetshwa yiprogramu, ngakho akukho okulandiwayo, futhi izithombe ezinemibala kanye nefayela le-glTF zinakho kunoma iyiphi indlela.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"trim-extend-walls","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Sika, eleza futhi uxhume izindonga","summary":"Sika noma eleza izindonga kudonga oluthile, bese uxhuma izindonga ezimbili endaweni lapho zihlangana, ngayinye njengesinyathelo esisodwa ongasihlehlisa.","section":"tasks","order":33,"keywords":["sika","eleza","ikhona","xhuma","hlangana","hlanza","ukuphela kodonga","ikhona lodonga","sika emuva","elula","fushanisa","guqula","TR"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukubone","text":"Okufanele ukubone","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-wazi","text":"Okufanele wazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHlanza izindonga oziDwebile: sika odongeni olugijima olunye, elula odongeni olufushane, noma uvale ikhona elivulekile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDweba\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha izinga ohlwini lwezinga lephlani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESika noma elula kudonga:\u003C/strong\u003E khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELungisa\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESika / eleza\u003C/span\u003E. Chofoza udonga okuzosikwa kuwo noma okuzoelulwa kuwo (umphetho), bese uchofoza yonke indonga ofuna ukuyishintsha. Udonga oludlula emphethweni luyasikwa lubuyiselwe kuwo, futhi ingxenye oyichofozile yiyo ehlala; udonga oluma lufinyeleli luyelulwa kuze kufike emphethweni. Umphetho uhlala ukhethiwe, ngakho ungachofoza izindonga eziningi ngolandelana. Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukukhetha omunye umphetho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXhuma izindonga ezimbili ekhonweni:\u003C/strong\u003E khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELungisa\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIkhona\u003C/span\u003E, chofoza udonga lokuqala, bese olwesibili. Zombili ziyafika endaweni lapho zihlangana, futhi i-BimCraft iyahlanza ikhona. Lapho udonga lunqamula olunye, ingxenye oyichofozile iyahlala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuqala kabusha, noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukubuyela ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukubone\"\u003EOkufanele ukubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELapho ukhomba udonga, iphlani likhombisa lapho lingayoya khona, selihlanganiswe kakade nezindonga ezihlangana nalo, nobude balo obusha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUshintsho ngalunye luyisinyathelo esisodwa: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyalihlehlisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmagumbi, amaphansi, amasilingi, amaphahla nakho konke okulandela izindonga kwenziwa kabusha, njengemva kwanoma yiluphi ushintsho odongeni. Igumbi elivalwe yikhona libonakala nenombolo nendawo yalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmnyango noma iwindi endaweni esikiwe liyasuswa nayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-wazi\"\u003EOkufanele wazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzindonga zidwetshwa ngomugqa wazo maphakathi, ngakho ziyasikwa ziphinde zelulwe ngawo: udonga luhlangana nomugqa maphakathi womunye, nesixhumanisi sihlanzwa sibe yi-T noma i-L.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-BimCraft iyasho ukuthi kungani ingakwazi: izindonga zimbili ziyafana, umugqa wodonga udlula eduze komunye, umnyango noma iwindi liyisithiyo (lihambise noma lisuse kuqala), noma kungeke kushiye lutho lodonga (ngaphansi kuka-1 mm). Udonga oshiywe mfushane kuno-50 mm luyakhiwa, nesexwayiso ku-Izinkinga: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/drawing-advice\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/drawing-advice\"\u003EIseluleko sokudweba\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzindonga ezidwetshwe ku-BimCraft kuphela ziyasikwa noma ziyelulwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBona futhi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/draw-walls\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/draw-walls\"\u003EDweba izindonga\u003C/a\u003E kanye \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/change-a-wall-or-door\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/change-a-wall-or-door\"\u003EShintsha udonga, umnyango noma iwindi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Hlanza izindonga oziDwebile: sika odongeni olugijima olunye, elula odongeni olufushane, noma uvale ikhona elivulekile. Izinyathelo Vula Dweba bese ukhetha izinga ohlwini lwezinga lephlani. Sika noma elula kudonga: khetha Lungisa › Sika / eleza. Chofoza udonga okuzosikwa kuwo noma okuzoelulwa kuwo (umphetho), bese uchofoza yonke indonga ofuna ukuyishintsha. Udonga oludlula emphethweni luyasikwa lubuyiselwe kuwo, futhi ingxenye oyichofozile yiyo ehlala; udonga oluma lufinyeleli luyelulwa kuze kufike emphethweni. Umphetho uhlala ukhethiwe, ngakho ungachofoza izindonga eziningi ngolandelana. Cindezela Esc ukukhetha omunye umphetho. Xhuma izindonga ezimbili ekhonweni: khetha Lungisa › Ikhona, chofoza udonga lokuqala, bese olwesibili. Zombili ziyafika endaweni lapho zihlangana, futhi i-BimCraft iyahlanza ikhona. Lapho udonga lunqamula olunye, ingxenye oyichofozile iyahlala. Cindezela Esc ukuqala kabusha, noma V ukubuyela ku-Khetha. Okufanele ukubone Lapho ukhomba udonga, iphlani likhombisa lapho lingayoya khona, selihlanganiswe kakade nezindonga ezihlangana nalo, nobude balo obusha. Ushintsho ngalunye luyisinyathelo esisodwa: Ctrl+Z iyalihlehlisa. Amagumbi, amaphansi, amasilingi, amaphahla nakho konke okulandela izindonga kwenziwa kabusha, njengemva kwanoma yiluphi ushintsho odongeni. Igumbi elivalwe yikhona libonakala nenombolo nendawo yalo. Umnyango noma iwindi endaweni esikiwe liyasuswa nayo. Okufanele wazi Izindonga zidwetshwa ngomugqa wazo maphakathi, ngakho ziyasikwa ziphinde zelulwe ngawo: udonga luhlangana nomugqa maphakathi womunye, nesixhumanisi sihlanzwa sibe yi-T noma i-L. I-BimCraft iyasho ukuthi kungani ingakwazi: izindonga zimbili ziyafana, umugqa wodonga udlula eduze komunye, umnyango noma iwindi liyisithiyo (lihambise noma lisuse kuqala), noma kungeke kushiye lutho lodonga (ngaphansi kuka-1 mm). Udonga oshiywe mfushane kuno-50 mm luyakhiwa, nesexwayiso ku-Izinkinga: bona Iseluleko sokudweba. Izindonga ezidwetshwe ku-BimCraft kuphela ziyasikwa noma ziyelulwa. Bona futhi Dweba izindonga kanye Shintsha udonga, umnyango noma iwindi.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"live-view","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Umbono ophilayo","summary":"Ipaneli eseceleni kwemodeli eyibonisa ngombono wesikhathi sangempela, nelanga, izithunzi nokukhanya okubuyayo, futhi ilandela yonke into oyenzayo; hamba kuyo futhi usethe isikhathi sosuku nenyanga.","section":"tasks","order":33,"keywords":["ukubuka okuphilayo","isikhathi sangempela","ukuvelisa isikhathi sangempela","ukuhamba","hamba","umuntu wokuqala","ukwethula","ikhasimende","isikrini sesibili","iwindi lesibili","isikhathi sosuku","ilanga","isizini","inyanga","izithunzi","ukukhanya okubuyayo","ukukhanya kwendawo yonke","webgpu","webgl"],"headings":[{"id":"ukuyivula","text":"Ukuyivula","level":2},{"id":"izilawuli","text":"Izilawuli","level":2},{"id":"hamba-emodelini","text":"Hamba emodelini","level":2},{"id":"ukukhanya-okubuyayo","text":"Ukukhanya okubuyayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EUmbono ophilayo ubonisa imodeli ngombono wesikhathi sangempela: isibhakabhaka nelanga ngokusho kwendawo nedethi yesayithi lakho, izithunzi zelanga, upende nezimpahla ozinike izinto, izibani, nokukhanya okubuyiswa yidonga nasephansi. Ulandela lokho okwenzayo: uma ujikisa i-3D view nawo uyajika, uma ushintsha imodeli uyakhombisa lowo mshintsho ngemuva kwesikhashana. Akukho okulayishwayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIdweba isimo esifanayo, upende, izibani nelanga njengo\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render\"\u003EYenza isithombe\u003C/a\u003E; ukuze uthole isithombe esiphelele sebenzisa lokho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuyivula\"\u003EUkuyivula\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula imodeli bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubuka okuphilayo\u003C/span\u003E kumbhalo wamathuluzi. Ipaneli ivuleka phezu kohlelo, ngakwesokudla esingezansi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHudula ibha yesihloko ukuze uyihambise, udonsele ikhona ukuze uyenze ibe mkhulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubuka okuphilayo kuwindi elisha\u003C/span\u003E (inkinobho eseceleni kwayo) noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWindi entsha\u003C/span\u003E ngaphakathi kwepaneli iyihambisela endaweni yewindi layo, ukuze ibe sesikrinini sesibili. Uma ibhrawuza yakho ivimbela amawindi avelayo, ivulwa njengepaneli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVala\u003C/span\u003E iyavala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izilawuli\"\u003EIzilawuli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIlawuli\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYenza ini\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELandela ukubuka\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUma kuvuliwe: umbono ophilayo ubheka lapho i-3D view ibheka khona. Ukuhamba kuyasivala\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHamba\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHamba emodelini (ngezansi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkudonsela phansi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELapho uhamba: ume phezu kwamaphansi futhi ukhuphuke izitebhisi. Uma kuvaliwe: ndiza\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsikhathi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIhora losuku. Ilanga liyanyakaziswa uma uhudula\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInyanga\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInyanga, ukuze ubone ilanga ebusika nasehlobo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIkhwalithi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKulolu komputha\u003C/span\u003E, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhansi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhakathi\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhezulu\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmugqa ongaphansi uchaza ukuthi yini edweba umbono (WebGPU noma WebGL 2), ikhwalithi, nokukhanya okubuyayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hamba-emodelini\"\u003EHamba emodelini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJikisa i-3D view ibheke lapho ofuna ukuma khona bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHamba\u003C/span\u003E. Umi phezu kwephansi ngaphansi kwephoyinti lokubuka kombono, ude ngo-1.6 m.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza umbono ophilayo, bese usebenzisa \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma izinkinobho zomcibisholo. Bamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukugijima. Hudula ukubheka ngakuzo zonke izinhlangothi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinyathelo ezifika ku-40 cm ziyakhushulwa (izitebhisi); konke okuphakeme kakhulu kuyidonga. Amadonga ayakumisa, futhi uyashelela ngecala lawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkudonsela phansi\u003C/span\u003E kuvaliwe uyandiza: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyakhuphuka, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Q\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyehla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyayeka ukuhamba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukukhanya-okubuyayo\"\u003EUkukhanya okubuyayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkukhanya okubuyela kudonga elikhanyiswe yilanga kuya phansi, nengaphakathi elimnyama legumbi, kusetshenziswa ngemuva kwesikhathi kuwo wonke ama-processor core. Ngenkathi ikhiqiza, umugqa ongaphansi uthi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkukhanya okubuyayo: 40 %\u003C/span\u003E; lapho isilungile umbono uyakuthatha. Ngemva kokushintsha kuyaqala kabusha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELokhu kulinganiselwa kombono ophilayo, hhayi isithombe esiqediwe: imininingwane emincane phakathi kwamaphoyinti ithola ukukhanya okubuyayo kwamaphoyinti aseduze nawo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmabhrawuza ayahluka. Lapho ibhrawuza linayo i-WebGPU, umbono ophilayo uyisebenzisa; kwezinye izindawo usebenzisa i-WebGL 2 futhi ubukeka ufanayo. Kokubili kungenayo, ipaneli iyakusho lokho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Umbono ophilayo ubonisa imodeli ngombono wesikhathi sangempela: isibhakabhaka nelanga ngokusho kwendawo nedethi yesayithi lakho, izithunzi zelanga, upende nezimpahla ozinike izinto, izibani, nokukhanya okubuyiswa yidonga nasephansi. Ulandela lokho okwenzayo: uma ujikisa i-3D view nawo uyajika, uma ushintsha imodeli uyakhombisa lowo mshintsho ngemuva kwesikhashana. Akukho okulayishwayo. Idweba isimo esifanayo, upende, izibani nelanga njengoYenza isithombe; ukuze uthole isithombe esiphelele sebenzisa lokho. Ukuyivula Vula imodeli bese ukhetha Ukubuka okuphilayo kumbhalo wamathuluzi. Ipaneli ivuleka phezu kohlelo, ngakwesokudla esingezansi. Hudula ibha yesihloko ukuze uyihambise, udonsele ikhona ukuze uyenze ibe mkhulu. Ukubuka okuphilayo kuwindi elisha (inkinobho eseceleni kwayo) noma Windi entsha ngaphakathi kwepaneli iyihambisela endaweni yewindi layo, ukuze ibe sesikrinini sesibili. Uma ibhrawuza yakho ivimbela amawindi avelayo, ivulwa njengepaneli. Vala iyavala. Izilawuli Ilawuli Yenza ini Landela ukubuka Uma kuvuliwe: umbono ophilayo ubheka lapho i-3D view ibheka khona. Ukuhamba kuyasivala Hamba Hamba emodelini (ngezansi) Ukudonsela phansi Lapho uhamba: ume phezu kwamaphansi futhi ukhuphuke izitebhisi. Uma kuvaliwe: ndiza Isikhathi Ihora losuku. Ilanga liyanyakaziswa uma uhudula Inyanga Inyanga, ukuze ubone ilanga ebusika nasehlobo Ikhwalithi Kulolu komputha, noma Phansi, Phakathi noma Phezulu Umugqa ongaphansi uchaza ukuthi yini edweba umbono (WebGPU noma WebGL 2), ikhwalithi, nokukhanya okubuyayo. Hamba emodelini Jikisa i-3D view ibheke lapho ofuna ukuma khona bese ukhetha Hamba. Umi phezu kwephansi ngaphansi kwephoyinti lokubuka kombono, ude ngo-1.6 m. Chofoza umbono ophilayo, bese usebenzisa W A S D noma izinkinobho zomcibisholo. Bamba Shift ukugijima. Hudula ukubheka ngakuzo zonke izinhlangothi. Izinyathelo ezifika ku-40 cm ziyakhushulwa (izitebhisi); konke okuphakeme kakhulu kuyidonga. Amadonga ayakumisa, futhi uyashelela ngecala lawo. Uma Ukudonsela phansi kuvaliwe uyandiza: E iyakhuphuka, Q iyehla. Esc iyayeka ukuhamba. Ukukhanya okubuyayo Ukukhanya okubuyela kudonga elikhanyiswe yilanga kuya phansi, nengaphakathi elimnyama legumbi, kusetshenziswa ngemuva kwesikhathi kuwo wonke ama-processor core. Ngenkathi ikhiqiza, umugqa ongaphansi uthi Ukukhanya okubuyayo: 40 %; lapho isilungile umbono uyakuthatha. Ngemva kokushintsha kuyaqala kabusha. Lokhu kulinganiselwa kombono ophilayo, hhayi isithombe esiqediwe: imininingwane emincane phakathi kwamaphoyinti ithola ukukhanya okubuyayo kwamaphoyinti aseduze nawo. Amabhrawuza ayahluka. Lapho ibhrawuza linayo i-WebGPU, umbono ophilayo uyisebenzisa; kwezinye izindawo usebenzisa i-WebGL 2 futhi ubukeka ufanayo. Kokubili kungenayo, ipaneli iyakusho lokho.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"rooms-and-separators","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Amagumbi nezihlukanisi zegumbi","summary":"Khetha igumbi ukuze ulinike igama bese uliphiwa inombolo, bese ufunda indawo yalo, ubude bomkhawulo nevolumu. Dweba isihlukanisi segumbi lapho amagumbi amabili ehlangana ngaphandle kodonga phakathi kwawo.","section":"tasks","order":34,"keywords":["igumbi","amagumbi","isihlukanisi segumbi","umugqa wokuhlukanisa","isikhala","IfcSpace","igama","inombolo","indawo","ubude bomkhawulo","ivolumu","isikhala esivulekile","ukuhlukanisa igumbi","ikhishi nendawo yokuhlala","akuvaliwe"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenziwa","text":"Okuzokwenziwa","level":2},{"id":"lapho-kukhona-amathuluzi","text":"Lapho kukhona amathuluzi","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okwenziwa-yisihlukanisi","text":"Okwenziwa yisihlukanisi","level":2},{"id":"uma-kungekho-gumbi-lapho-uchofoza","text":"Uma kungekho gumbi lapho uchofoza","level":2},{"id":"ku-ifc","text":"Ku-IFC","level":2},{"id":"akukakwakhiwa-okwamanje","text":"Akukakwakhiwa okwamanje","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenziwa\"\u003EOkuzokwenziwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQamba amagumbi odonga abawenza, bese uhlukanisa igumbi elivulekile libe ngamabili ngaphandle kodonga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lapho-kukhona-amathuluzi\"\u003ELapho kukhona amathuluzi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzakhiwo ze-Ribbon: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArchitecture\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EIgumbi nendawo\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERoom\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERoom Separator\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsakhiwo sakudala: ibha ye-Draw › imenyu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERooms\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENoma yisiphi isitayela semenyu: imiyalo ibizwa ngokuthi Room ne-Room Separator; ibha yemiyalo iyayithola.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDweba izindonga. Yonke ilufu elivaliwe lezindonga seligumbi ngokwalo: i-BimCraft iyenza, iyibalele futhi inikeze indawo yayo ngenkathi udweba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERoom\u003C/span\u003E. Hambisa phezu kwe-plan: igumbi elingaphansi kwesikhombi liyakhanya ngendawo, umkhawulo nevolumu yalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuze uqambe amagumbi ngokushesha, thayipha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EName\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENumber\u003C/span\u003E ohlwini kuqala, bese uchofoza egumbini. Inombolo ikhuphuka ngu-1 egumbini elilandelayo (101, 102; A-09, A-10).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENoma chofoza nje igumbi: liyakhethwa, futhi \u003Cstrong\u003EProperties\u003C/strong\u003E inegama, inombolo, indawo, ubude bomkhawulo, ivolumu nethegi laleligumbi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuze uhlukanise igumbi elivulekile, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERoom Separator\u003C/span\u003E bese uchofoza amaphoyinti amabili: odongeni kuya kodonga, noma kodonga kuya kwesinye isihlukanisi. Qhubeka uchofoza ukwenza uchungechunge; i-Enter, i-Esc noma ukuchofoza kabili kuyiqeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okwenziwa-yisihlukanisi\"\u003EOkwenziwa yisihlukanisi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESimisa amagumbi njengodonga olungenabukhulu. Izindawo zamagumbi amabili zifinyelela ngokuphelele egumbini ebeliwukuba yilo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIgumbi elibamba iphakathi lendala ligcina igama nenombolo yalo. Elinye lisha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsihlukanisi esima endaweni evulekile, singathintani nakuthile ngesinye sesiphetho, asihlukanisi lutho. Sinwebe futhi kuzokwenza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIngxenye yesihlukanisi esiphakathi kodonga iyanganakwa, ngakho ungabophela emigqeni yasemaphakathini wezindonga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha isihlukanisi bese ucindezela Delete ukusisusa: amagumbi amabili abuyela kube munye. I-Hlehlisa iyasibuyisela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uma-kungekho-gumbi-lapho-uchofoza\"\u003EUma kungekho gumbi lapho uchofoza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmugqa wesimo uyasitshela: izindonga azivali lapho. Vala igebe, noma dweba isihlukanisi kulo. Akukho lutho olwenqatshwa; kungolje nje akukho gumbi elivaliwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-ifc\"\u003EKu-IFC\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIgumbi liyi-IfcSpace nenombolo yalo (Name), igama lalo (LongName) kanye ne-Qto_SpaceBaseQuantities: NetFloorArea, NetPerimeter, Height, NetVolume. Ivolumu iyindawo ephindaphindwe ngokuphakama kuya kulelo zinga elingenhla.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsihlukanisi segumbi liyi-IfcVirtualElement, uhlobo lwe-IFC lomkhawulo ongakakhiwe. Linomugqa futhi alinawo umzimba, ngakho olunye uhlelo alufundi odonga, futhi alubali lutho ngakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akukakwakhiwa-okwamanje\"\u003EAkukakwakhiwa okwamanje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzihlukanisi ezigoqayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIgumbi elilandela uphahla oluthambekile: ivolumu ihlala iyindawo ephindaphindwe ngokuphakama kwezinga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuxhumana komkhawulo wesikhala (IfcRelSpaceBoundary) akubhalwa, kwezindonga noma zezihlukanisi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBona nokunye: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/room-and-area-tags\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/room-and-area-tags\"\u003EAmathegi egumbi nendawo\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/areas-and-area-boundaries\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/areas-and-area-boundaries\"\u003EIzindawo nemikhawulo yezindawo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenziwa Qamba amagumbi odonga abawenza, bese uhlukanisa igumbi elivulekile libe ngamabili ngaphandle kodonga. Lapho kukhona amathuluzi Izakhiwo ze-Ribbon: Architecture › Igumbi nendawo › Room ne-Room Separator. Isakhiwo sakudala: ibha ye-Draw › imenyu ye-Rooms. Noma yisiphi isitayela semenyu: imiyalo ibizwa ngokuthi Room ne-Room Separator; ibha yemiyalo iyayithola. Izinyathelo Dweba izindonga. Yonke ilufu elivaliwe lezindonga seligumbi ngokwalo: i-BimCraft iyenza, iyibalele futhi inikeze indawo yayo ngenkathi udweba. Khetha Room. Hambisa phezu kwe-plan: igumbi elingaphansi kwesikhombi liyakhanya ngendawo, umkhawulo nevolumu yalo. Ukuze uqambe amagumbi ngokushesha, thayipha Name ne-Number ohlwini kuqala, bese uchofoza egumbini. Inombolo ikhuphuka ngu-1 egumbini elilandelayo (101, 102; A-09, A-10). Noma chofoza nje igumbi: liyakhethwa, futhi Properties inegama, inombolo, indawo, ubude bomkhawulo, ivolumu nethegi laleligumbi. Ukuze uhlukanise igumbi elivulekile, khetha Room Separator bese uchofoza amaphoyinti amabili: odongeni kuya kodonga, noma kodonga kuya kwesinye isihlukanisi. Qhubeka uchofoza ukwenza uchungechunge; i-Enter, i-Esc noma ukuchofoza kabili kuyiqeda. Okwenziwa yisihlukanisi Simisa amagumbi njengodonga olungenabukhulu. Izindawo zamagumbi amabili zifinyelela ngokuphelele egumbini ebeliwukuba yilo. Igumbi elibamba iphakathi lendala ligcina igama nenombolo yalo. Elinye lisha. Isihlukanisi esima endaweni evulekile, singathintani nakuthile ngesinye sesiphetho, asihlukanisi lutho. Sinwebe futhi kuzokwenza. Ingxenye yesihlukanisi esiphakathi kodonga iyanganakwa, ngakho ungabophela emigqeni yasemaphakathini wezindonga. Khetha isihlukanisi bese ucindezela Delete ukusisusa: amagumbi amabili abuyela kube munye. I-Hlehlisa iyasibuyisela. Uma kungekho gumbi lapho uchofoza Umugqa wesimo uyasitshela: izindonga azivali lapho. Vala igebe, noma dweba isihlukanisi kulo. Akukho lutho olwenqatshwa; kungolje nje akukho gumbi elivaliwe. Ku-IFC Igumbi liyi-IfcSpace nenombolo yalo (Name), igama lalo (LongName) kanye ne-Qto_SpaceBaseQuantities: NetFloorArea, NetPerimeter, Height, NetVolume. Ivolumu iyindawo ephindaphindwe ngokuphakama kuya kulelo zinga elingenhla. Isihlukanisi segumbi liyi-IfcVirtualElement, uhlobo lwe-IFC lomkhawulo ongakakhiwe. Linomugqa futhi alinawo umzimba, ngakho olunye uhlelo alufundi odonga, futhi alubali lutho ngakho. Akukakwakhiwa okwamanje Izihlukanisi ezigoqayo. Igumbi elilandela uphahla oluthambekile: ivolumu ihlala iyindawo ephindaphindwe ngokuphakama kwezinga. Ukuxhumana komkhawulo wesikhala (IfcRelSpaceBoundary) akubhalwa, kwezindonga noma zezihlukanisi. Bona nokunye: Amathegi egumbi nendawo, Izindawo nemikhawulo yezindawo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"rollover-and-tooltips","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Amathiphu ngezigaba ezimbili, nolwazi lokuhamba phezu kwepulani","summary":"Beka isikhombi kuthuluzi ukuze ubone igama nesinqamuleli salo ngokushesha nokuthi lenzani kamuva. Phumula isikhombi kudonga, emnyango, iwindi, egumbini noma kusilinganiso ukuze ukufunde ngaphandle kokukukhetha.","section":"tasks","order":34,"keywords":["thiphu","isiphakamiso","isinqamuleli","ukhiye","umyalo obhalwayo","incazelo","ukuhamba phezu","rollover","beka isikhombi","uhlobo lodonga","izinga","usayizi","eqondile","eqengile","ngaphandle kwesikwele","egobile","umnyango","iwindi","igumbi","indawo","isilinganiso","ngaphandle kokukhetha"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okubonakala-yithiphu-yethuluzi","text":"Okubonakala yithiphu yethuluzi","level":2},{"id":"okubonakala-yisikhombi","text":"Okubonakala yisikhombi","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-wazi","text":"Okufanele wazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFunda isinqamuleli sethuluzi ngokubeka isikhombi kulo, futhi ufunde ukuthi yini esepulanini ngaphandle kokuyikhetha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBeka isikhombi kuthuluzi, isibonelo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUdonga\u003C/span\u003E ebha yokudweba. Maduzane ithiphu iyavela ibonise igama lalo nesinqamuleli (\u003Cstrong\u003EUdonga\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EW\u003C/strong\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGcina isikhombi lapho. Ngemva kwesikhathi esincane umugqa owodwa ngaphansi kwaso uchaza ukuthi ithuluzi lenzani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula ipulani, nethuluzi le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha\u003C/span\u003E livuliwe. Phumula isikhombi kudonga. Ithiphu eseduze nesikhombi ibonisa uhlobo lwalo, izinga lalo, ubude nobukhulu balo, nokuthi liqondile noma liqengile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHamba uye emnyango, ewindini, egumbini noma kusilinganiso ukuze ufunde lowo esikhundleni. Akukho okukhethiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okubonakala-yithiphu-yethuluzi\"\u003EOkubonakala yithiphu yethuluzi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsigaba 1\u003C/strong\u003E: igama lomyalo ngendlela yemenyu oyisebenzisayo, nokhiye balo ngalendlela. Uma kukhona umugqa womyalo esikrinini, ubonisa negama okufanele ulithayiphe uma umyalo ungenayo ukhiye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsigaba 2\u003C/strong\u003E: umugqa owodwa wencazelo. Ungumbhalo wenkinobho yomyalo uqobo, ngakho zonke izindawo lapho umyalo uvela (ibha yokudweba, iribhoni, imenyu, izimpande zesakhiwo) ziveza okufanayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIthuluzi elivaliwe libonisa isizathu esikhundleni salo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okubonakala-yisikhombi\"\u003EOkubonakala yisikhombi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUdonga\u003C/strong\u003E: uhlobo, izinga, ubude nobukhulu, kanye \u003Cstrong\u003EEqondile\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EEqengile\u003C/strong\u003E (nengqondo) noma \u003Cstrong\u003EEgobile\u003C/strong\u003E. Eqondile kusho ukuthi ilingana nendlela eyinhloko yezindonga ezixhunyiwe kuyo: isakhiwo esijikelezwe ephepheni sisaqondile. Udonga oludwa luqondile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmnyango noma iwindi\u003C/strong\u003E: uhlobo, ububanzi nobude, ukuphakama kwesill kwewindi, nodonga okuwo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIgumbi\u003C/strong\u003E: igama nenombolo, izinga, nendawo njengoba ipulaniliyibhala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsilinganiso\u003C/strong\u003E: ubude bayo, noma kuyiludonga lonke noma ingxenye phakathi kwezimbobo, uhlangothi olulinganiswa kuwo, nodonga eliyalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-wazi\"\u003EOkufanele wazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuhamba phezu kusebenza nethuluzi le-Select. Lapho ithuluzi lokudweba lisebenza, ithuluzi liboniswa izimpawu zalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELiyanyamalala uma uhamba uphuma kukho, ucindezela inkinobho yemouse, ujikeleze ivili noma ucindezela ukhiye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmathiphu awukuvele ekuthinteni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Funda isinqamuleli sethuluzi ngokubeka isikhombi kulo, futhi ufunde ukuthi yini esepulanini ngaphandle kokuyikhetha. Izinyathelo Beka isikhombi kuthuluzi, isibonelo Udonga ebha yokudweba. Maduzane ithiphu iyavela ibonise igama lalo nesinqamuleli (Udonga, W). Gcina isikhombi lapho. Ngemva kwesikhathi esincane umugqa owodwa ngaphansi kwaso uchaza ukuthi ithuluzi lenzani. Vula ipulani, nethuluzi le-Khetha livuliwe. Phumula isikhombi kudonga. Ithiphu eseduze nesikhombi ibonisa uhlobo lwalo, izinga lalo, ubude nobukhulu balo, nokuthi liqondile noma liqengile. Hamba uye emnyango, ewindini, egumbini noma kusilinganiso ukuze ufunde lowo esikhundleni. Akukho okukhethiwe. Okubonakala yithiphu yethuluzi Isigaba 1: igama lomyalo ngendlela yemenyu oyisebenzisayo, nokhiye balo ngalendlela. Uma kukhona umugqa womyalo esikrinini, ubonisa negama okufanele ulithayiphe uma umyalo ungenayo ukhiye. Isigaba 2: umugqa owodwa wencazelo. Ungumbhalo wenkinobho yomyalo uqobo, ngakho zonke izindawo lapho umyalo uvela (ibha yokudweba, iribhoni, imenyu, izimpande zesakhiwo) ziveza okufanayo. Ithuluzi elivaliwe libonisa isizathu esikhundleni salo. Okubonakala yisikhombi Udonga: uhlobo, izinga, ubude nobukhulu, kanye Eqondile, Eqengile (nengqondo) noma Egobile. Eqondile kusho ukuthi ilingana nendlela eyinhloko yezindonga ezixhunyiwe kuyo: isakhiwo esijikelezwe ephepheni sisaqondile. Udonga oludwa luqondile. Umnyango noma iwindi: uhlobo, ububanzi nobude, ukuphakama kwesill kwewindi, nodonga okuwo. Igumbi: igama nenombolo, izinga, nendawo njengoba ipulaniliyibhala. Isilinganiso: ubude bayo, noma kuyiludonga lonke noma ingxenye phakathi kwezimbobo, uhlangothi olulinganiswa kuwo, nodonga eliyalo. Okufanele wazi Ukuhamba phezu kusebenza nethuluzi le-Select. Lapho ithuluzi lokudweba lisebenza, ithuluzi liboniswa izimpawu zalo. Liyanyamalala uma uhamba uphuma kukho, ucindezela inkinobho yemouse, ujikeleze ivili noma ucindezela ukhiye. Amathiphu awukuvele ekuthinteni.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"render-other-program","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Dweba isithombe ngolunye uhlelo","summary":"Isilandeli sendlela sethu sidweba isithombe sokurenda; olunye uhlelo lungadweba kuphela uma kulethwa yi-add-on yenjini yokurenda ku-CadCraft Studio. Yini edluliselwayo, nokuthi kungani ezinye izinhlelo zingakaze zinikezwe.","section":"tasks","order":34,"keywords":["render","injini","uhlelo lwangaphandle","injini ye-add-on","studio","ngemuva","uhlu lokurenda","usd","gltf","kudwetshwe ngu","blender","gpl"],"headings":[{"id":"dweba-isithombe-ngenjini-ye-add-on","text":"Dweba isithombe ngenjini ye-add-on","level":2},{"id":"okudluliselwayo","text":"Okudluliselwayo","level":2},{"id":"izinhlelo-i-cadcraft-ingakaze-iziqhube","text":"Izinhlelo i-CadCraft ingakaze iziqhube","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIsithombe ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda\u003C/span\u003E sidwetshwa \u003Cstrong\u003Eyizinjini zethu\u003C/strong\u003E: Ngokushesha nesilandeli sendlela, kwiwebhu nasku-CadCraft Studio. Olunye uhlelo lungadweba kuphela uma kuletha \u003Cstrong\u003Ei-add-on yenjini yokurenda\u003C/strong\u003E: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render-engine-addons\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render-engine-addons\"\u003EEngeza injini yokurenda nge-add-on\u003C/a\u003E. Ukuthatha isimo siye kolunye uhlelo nokuqhubeka usebenza kulo, sebenzisa \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render-open-in\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render-open-in\"\u003EVula isimo kolunye uhlelo\u003C/a\u003E noma \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render-unreal\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render-unreal\"\u003EThumela isimo kwinjini yomdlalo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dweba-isithombe-ngenjini-ye-add-on\"\u003EDweba isithombe ngenjini ye-add-on\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula i-add-on ku-Izilungiselelo › Okwengeziwe. Injini yayo ivela ohlwini lwe-Injini engxoxweni \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYikhethe. Izilungiselelo zayo zivela ngaphansi kohlu lwe-Injini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda\u003C/span\u003E. Ku-Studio, okokuqala lapho i-add-on iqhuba uhlelo, i-Studio ikubuza engxoxweni yayo. Inqubekelaphambili ibonakala ngenkathi idweba; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMisa\u003C/span\u003E iyiphelisa. Isithombe sivela sibhalwe ngenjini eyidwebile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInjini ebhalwe nge-JavaScript iqhuba nakuwebhu. Injini eqhuba uhlelo kule khompyutha iqhuba kuStudio kuphela; kuwebhu ibonakala njengefayela okufanele silondolozwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okudluliselwayo\"\u003EOkudluliselwayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInjini ithola \u003Cstrong\u003Eipakethe\u003C/strong\u003E: imodeli njengefayela le-USD (nefayela le-glTF uma icela), nefayela lezilungiselelo elinezinani zezinto zokwakha ngokunembile, ilanga nesibhakabhaka, kanye nezibani ngazinye ezivulekile ngamandla nephrofayili yazo yokukhanya, ikhamera nokuvezwa. Uhlelo ngalunye luyakhanyisa, luhlele amanani emibala futhi lube ngamasampula ngendlela yalo, ngakho izithombe zifana ngekhamera, ilanga, izibani nokuvezwa, kodwa hhayi ngepikseli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinhlelo-i-cadcraft-ingakaze-iziqhube\"\u003EIzinhlelo i-CadCraft ingakaze iziqhube\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-CadCraft ayikaze iqale uhlelo olunelayisensi ye-GNU GPL, futhi ayikaze iluhlanganise njengenjini noma njengento ye-Vula ku. I-Blender yenye yazo, ngakho ayikho ohlwini lwe-Injini. Ifayela le-USD noma le-glTF elilondoloziwe kusuka ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda\u003C/span\u003E livula kuyo njengakunoma yiluphi uhlelo olufunda lawo mafayela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmakhamera epanorama nesterio nesithombe sesibhakabhaka (imibala yesibhakabhaka isetshenziswa esikhundleni salo) akudluliselwa kolunye uhlelo. Akukho okwenziwa kolunye uhlelo okubuyela emodelini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Isithombe ku-Renda sidwetshwa yizinjini zethu: Ngokushesha nesilandeli sendlela, kwiwebhu nasku-CadCraft Studio. Olunye uhlelo lungadweba kuphela uma kuletha i-add-on yenjini yokurenda: bona Engeza injini yokurenda nge-add-on. Ukuthatha isimo siye kolunye uhlelo nokuqhubeka usebenza kulo, sebenzisa Vula isimo kolunye uhlelo noma Thumela isimo kwinjini yomdlalo. Dweba isithombe ngenjini ye-add-on Vula i-add-on ku-Izilungiselelo › Okwengeziwe. Injini yayo ivela ohlwini lwe-Injini engxoxweni Renda. Yikhethe. Izilungiselelo zayo zivela ngaphansi kohlu lwe-Injini. Chofoza Renda. Ku-Studio, okokuqala lapho i-add-on iqhuba uhlelo, i-Studio ikubuza engxoxweni yayo. Inqubekelaphambili ibonakala ngenkathi idweba; Misa iyiphelisa. Isithombe sivela sibhalwe ngenjini eyidwebile. Injini ebhalwe nge-JavaScript iqhuba nakuwebhu. Injini eqhuba uhlelo kule khompyutha iqhuba kuStudio kuphela; kuwebhu ibonakala njengefayela okufanele silondolozwe. Okudluliselwayo Injini ithola ipakethe: imodeli njengefayela le-USD (nefayela le-glTF uma icela), nefayela lezilungiselelo elinezinani zezinto zokwakha ngokunembile, ilanga nesibhakabhaka, kanye nezibani ngazinye ezivulekile ngamandla nephrofayili yazo yokukhanya, ikhamera nokuvezwa. Uhlelo ngalunye luyakhanyisa, luhlele amanani emibala futhi lube ngamasampula ngendlela yalo, ngakho izithombe zifana ngekhamera, ilanga, izibani nokuvezwa, kodwa hhayi ngepikseli. Izinhlelo i-CadCraft ingakaze iziqhube I-CadCraft ayikaze iqale uhlelo olunelayisensi ye-GNU GPL, futhi ayikaze iluhlanganise njengenjini noma njengento ye-Vula ku. I-Blender yenye yazo, ngakho ayikho ohlwini lwe-Injini. Ifayela le-USD noma le-glTF elilondoloziwe kusuka ku-Renda livula kuyo njengakunoma yiluphi uhlelo olufunda lawo mafayela. Amakhamera epanorama nesterio nesithombe sesibhakabhaka (imibala yesibhakabhaka isetshenziswa esikhundleni salo) akudluliselwa kolunye uhlelo. Akukho okwenziwa kolunye uhlelo okubuyela emodelini.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"views-and-sheets","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Imibono, izinhlu zemibono namashidi akho","summary":"Thola zonke amapulani, ukubukeka kohlangothi, izigaba, imibono ye-3D, amathebula namashidi kwisiphequluli sephrojekthi, setha ukuthi ipulani ngayinye inqunyiwe kanjani futhi ibonisani, yenza izikhulisi, udwebe imigqa namahatshi embonweni owodwa, ugcine izilungiselelo kumafanekiso embono, bese uhlela amashidi akho.","section":"tasks","order":34,"keywords":["isikhulisi","umbono wesikhulisi","umbono wemininingwane","ukudweba","imigqa yemininingwane","imigqa yokudweba","ukufiphaza","indawo yokufiphaza","ipulani yesilingi","rcp","ighreyidi yesilingi","izibani","isiphequluli sephrojekthi","imibono","uhlu lombono","sika","indawo yokusika","isikali sombono","ingaphansi","umugqa wokusika","ukuphakama kokusika","phezulu","phansi","ukujula kombono","ukubonakala","izigaba","ifanekiso lombono","izifanekiso","ishidi","amashidi","ibhulokhi lesihloko","ifreyimu yokubonisa","isikali","ipulani","ukwakheka","pdf","isiphequluli"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"isiphequluli-sephrojekthi","text":"Isiphequluli sephrojekthi","level":2},{"id":"setha-uhla-lwepulani","text":"Setha uhla lwepulani","level":2},{"id":"sika-ipulani-nika-isikali-bonisa-elinye-izinga-ngaphansi-kwayo","text":"Sika ipulani, nika isikali, bonisa elinye izinga ngaphansi kwayo","level":2},{"id":"ipulani-yesilingi-selinga","text":"Ipulani yesilingi selinga","level":2},{"id":"yenza-isikhulisi","text":"Yenza isikhulisi","level":2},{"id":"dweba-imigqa-nemigqa-yokufiphaza-embonweni-owodwa","text":"Dweba imigqa nemigqa yokufiphaza embonweni owodwa","level":2},{"id":"gcina-izilungiselelo-kwisifanekiso-sembono","text":"Gcina izilungiselelo kwisifanekiso sembono","level":2},{"id":"hlela-ishidi-lakho","text":"Hlela ishidi lakho","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ubone","text":"Okufanele ubone","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESebenza ngendlela amaphrojekthi e-BIM ahlelwe ngayo: yonke imibono kuhlu olulodwa, ipulani ngayinye inqunyiwe lapho ufuna, izilungiselelo ezifanayo kumapulani amaningi ngesifanekiso, namashidi olungiselela wena.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isiphequluli-sephrojekthi\"\u003EIsiphequluli sephrojekthi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDweba\u003C/span\u003E. Ingxenye yokunxele inesiphequluli sephrojekthi ngaphansi kwamamodeli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELapho kukhona:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmapulani esitezi\u003C/strong\u003E: izinga ngalinye. Chofoza elilodwa ukuze ubone ipulani lalo. Inkinobho yesilayida eseduze nalo isetha ukubuka kwalo (ngezansi). Ipulani elilandela isifanekiso libonisa igama lesifanekiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmapulani esilingi\u003C/strong\u003E: ipulani yesilingi yezinga ngalinye (ngezansi).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzikhulisi\u003C/strong\u003E: isikhulisi ngasinye nombono okudwetshwe kuwo, nango \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsikhulisi esisha\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EOkungekho\u003C/strong\u003E ibala izikhulisi ezingasenambono wazo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkubukeka kohlangothi\u003C/strong\u003E nezigaba: izinhlangothi ezine nomugqa wesigaba ngamunye. Chofoza elilodwa ukuze uvule iseti yemidwebo edwetshwe kuyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImibono ye-3D\u003C/strong\u003E: imibono oyigcinile ngo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubuka\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmathebula\u003C/strong\u003E: chofoza elilodwa ukuze ubonise ngaphansi kwepulani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmashidi\u003C/strong\u003E: amashidi owenzile, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIshidi elisha\u003C/span\u003E, ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIseti yemidwebo…\u003C/span\u003E yeseti yonke eyenziwe emodelini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmafanekiso embono\u003C/strong\u003E, ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsifanekiso esisha\u003C/span\u003E, nezixhumanisi (amamodeli axhunyiwe).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"setha-uhla-lwepulani\"\u003ESetha uhla lwepulani\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza inkinobho yesilayida eseduze nezinga ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EAmapulani esitezi\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESetha amabanga, ngaphezu kwalelo zinga:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESika ku-\u003C/strong\u003E: lapho ipulani isika khona ezindongeni, emasulweni namawindi (1200 mm, cishe 4 ft, umaungashintshi).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPhezulu\u003C/strong\u003E: izinto eziphezu kokusika nangaphansi kokuphezulu zidwetshwa ngamadashi (ikhabethi elikhulu, ibhimu). Shiya kungenalutho ukuze kube ukuphakama kwezinga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPhansi\u003C/strong\u003E no-\u003Cstrong\u003EUkujula ngaphansi kophansi\u003C/strong\u003E: izinto ezingaphansi kokusika zidwetshwa ngemigqa emincane kuya ngaphansi kophansi, nangaphansi kwalo kulokho okujulile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EKuboniswe kule pulani\u003C/strong\u003E, susa lokho ipulani lishiya ngaphandle: impahla, amagumbi, izinsika njalo njalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuze ushiye izinto ezithile ngaphandle: khetha zipulani noma kumbono we-3D, vula ingxoxo bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFihla lokho okukhethiwe lapha\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa zonke\u003C/span\u003E ziyazibuyisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESebenzisa lezi zilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIpulani liyasikwa kabusha masinyane, namashidi akho neseti yemidwebo kuyalandela. Isilayisi se-point cloud silandela nokuphakama kokusika.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sika-ipulani-nika-isikali-bonisa-elinye-izinga-ngaphansi-kwayo\"\u003ESika ipulani, nika isikali, bonisa elinye izinga ngaphansi kwayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKonke lokhu kusendaweni efanayo (inkinobho yesilayida eseduze nezinga):\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsikali\u003C/strong\u003E: isikali ipulani elishicilelwa ngaso (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhrinta\u003C/span\u003E ebhalini lepulani) futhi elifika ngaso eshidini. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELwanele\u003C/span\u003E ikhetha isikali esikhulu esijwayelekile esilingana.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIndawo yokusika\u003C/strong\u003E: chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDweba kupulani…\u003C/span\u003E, bese uchofoza ikhona elilodwa nekhona elingeleceleni epulani (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyayima). Ipulani ngaphandle kwendawo lifihlwa ngesithunzi esikrinini, futhi ungasasebenza khona; kushicilelwe, emashidini nakuseti yemidwebo, ipulani libonisa okungaphakathi kuphela. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESula\u003C/span\u003E isusa ukusika. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELwanele\u003C/span\u003E ilwanelisa ukusika.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIngaphansi\u003C/strong\u003E: khetha elinye izinga. Izindonga zalo, izinto ezinqunyiwe, izicabha namawindi zidwetshwa zikhanye ngaphansi kwale pulani, ukuze uhlanganise izinto nezinga elingaphansi noma elingaphezulu. Awukwazi ukuzikhetha lapha, futhi zishicilelwa ngegrey elikhanyayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsifanekiso sembono sithwala isikali nokuphakama nezigaba. Indawo yokusika neyingaphansi zihlala zeqa lapho kupulani eliyodwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ipulani-yesilingi-selinga\"\u003EIpulani yesilingi selinga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELinga ngalinye linepulani yesilingi eseduze nepulani layo lesitezi: ipulani ebonwa ngaphansi, ukuze kulungiswe izilingi nalokho okuhangela kuzo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza izinga ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EAmapulani esilingi\u003C/strong\u003E kusiphequluli, noma khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIpulani yesilingi\u003C/span\u003E eseduze nezinga ebhalini lepulani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzindonga zisikwa ku-2300 mm (cishe 7&#039;-6&quot;). Lokho okulele ngaphezu kwalokho kokusika nangaphansi kokuphakama kwezinga kudwetshwa: izilingi negridi yazo nethegi yokuphakama (\u003Ccode\u003ECLG 2438\u003C/code\u003E), izibani, amabhimu. Iminyango, amawindi nalokho okulele ngaphansi kokusika kushiyiwe ngaphandle.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuze wenze isilingi, sebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsilingi\u003C/span\u003E njengasepulanini lesitezi, bese ukhetha sona bese ukhetha i-\u003Cstrong\u003EIphathini\u003C/strong\u003E kuphaneli \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzici\u003C/span\u003E. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/floors-and-roofs\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/floors-and-roofs\"\u003EAmagumbi, amafulowa, izilingi nophahla\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuze ulengise isibani kuso, beka into kusuka emtapweni lapho kukhonjiswa ipulani yesilingi: ifaka ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EEsilingeni\u003C/strong\u003E. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/place-from-library\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/place-from-library\"\u003EBeka izinsiza nempahla kusuka emtapweni\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInkinobho yesilayida eseduze nepulani yesilingi isetha ukusika kwayo nokuphezulu, isikali, izigaba, indawo yokusika nengaphansi, njengepulani yesitezi. Amapulani esilingi awamukeli sifanekiso sembono.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIdwetshwa ngendlela efanayo nepulani yesitezi (ipulani ebonakala ngaphansi, hhayi isithombe esiphambene). Isilingi esingaphansi kokusika asidwetshwa: nciphisa ukusika kwalelo zinga kwepulani yesilingi. Amapulani esilingi ayahamba emashidini akho njengamapulani; iseti yemidwebo ayengezi yona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yenza-isikhulisi\"\u003EYenza isikhulisi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsikhulisi sibonisa ingxenye yepulani inkulu, ngesikali sayo, njengombono wayo siqu: ikhishi, isitebhisi, ikhona lodonga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBonisa ipulani, ipulani yesilingi noma isikhulisi esiyiyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChaza\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsikhulisi\u003C/span\u003E ebhalini lepulani (noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsikhulisi esisha\u003C/span\u003E kusiphequluli), bese uchofoza ikhona elilodwa lendawo nekhona elingeleceleni. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyayima.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsikhulisi senziwa ku-1:20 (1/2&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot; ngamafidi namainshi). Isikwele sayo nethegi elijikeleziwe zidwetshwa epulanini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ithegi nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha\u003C/span\u003E, noma isikhulisi kusiphequluli, ukuze uvule: ipulani libonisa lendawo kuphela, ngesikali sesikhulisi. Ibha ithi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsikhulisi:\u003C/span\u003E negama layo; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhezulu\u003C/span\u003E ibuyela embonweni esidwetshwe kuwo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInkinobho yesilayida eseduze naso (kusiphequluli noma ebhalini) iyasiqamba kabusha, ishintshe isikali, idwebe kabusha isikwele sawo noma iyasisusa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsikhulisi sibonisa okubonakala embonweni waso: ukusika okufanayo, izigaba ezifanayo, izilingi zepulani yesilingi. Isikhulisi sesikhulisi siyasebenza ngendlela efanayo. Beka isikhulisi eshidini njengepulani; ithegi yaso isho lapho likhona (\u003Ccode\u003E1 / A-501\u003C/code\u003E: umbono wokuqala eshidini A-501). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhrinta\u003C/span\u003E kwisikhulisi ishicilela lendawo kuphela ngesikali sayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkususa isikhulisi kususa nezikhulisi ezidwetshwe ngaphakathi kwaso, nemigqa nemigqa yokufiphaza edwetshwe kuzo (uyabuzwa kuqala). Uma izinga isikhulisi esidwetshwe kulo lisuswa, isikhulisi sihlala ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EOkungekho\u003C/strong\u003E kuze usisuse, namashidi asikuwo abike ukuthi sekungekho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dweba-imigqa-nemigqa-yokufiphaza-embonweni-owodwa\"\u003EDweba imigqa nemigqa yokufiphaza embonweni owodwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkudweba kuyisebenzo se-2D esihlobene nombono owodwa kuphela: amanothi ngemigqa, indawo efakwe amahatshi yekhonkolo noma yomhlaba, isifunda esigcwele. Akusoze kube ku-3D noma epulanini elinye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBonisa ipulani yesitezi, ipulani yesilingi noma isikhulisi okuzodwetshwa kuso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha kusuka ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChaza\u003C/span\u003E ebhalini lepulani:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmugqa\u003C/span\u003E: chofoza lapho iqala khona nalapho iphela khona. Umugqa olandelayo uqala lapho owedlule uphela khona; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iqala kabusha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIphola-layini\u003C/span\u003E: chofoza amaphoyinti; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma ukuchofoza kabili kuyayiphelisa, ukuchofoza iphoyinti lokuqala kuyivala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIrektangeli\u003C/span\u003E: amakhona amabili aphambene.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo yemigqa yokufiphaza\u003C/span\u003E: khetha i-\u003Cstrong\u003EIphathini\u003C/strong\u003E (Solid, Diagonal, Cross-hatch, Concrete, Insulation, Earth) nesikali sayo ebhalini, bese uchofoza amakhona; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ukuchofoza kabili noma ukuchofoza iphoyinti lokuqala kuyayivala. Uma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGcwalisa igumbi\u003C/span\u003E ikhethiwe, ukuchofoza kamunye ngaphakathi kwegumbi kufaka amahatshi ngaphakathi kwemigqa yalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmaphoyinti ahlanganiswa njengezindonga; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E igcina umugqa uqondile, futhi ungathayipha ubude njengasezindongeni. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ithatha iphoyinti lokugcina.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha umugqa noma ihatshi nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha\u003C/span\u003E epulanini. Properties ishintsha iphathini nesikali sehatshi futhi inomyalo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa…\u003C/span\u003E (chofoza iphoyinti okuzohanjiswa kulo, bese kuthi lapho lisiya khona). \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyasisusa. Umugqa ngamunye, ihatshi nokushintsha ngakunye kuyisinyathelo esisodwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImigqa nemigqa yokufiphaza ishicilelwa nepulani, ifika emashidini nayo, futhi itholakala eseti yemidwebo. Susa ukukhethwa kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzincazelo\u003C/strong\u003E ohlelweni lwesinye izinga ukuze uzikhiphe embonweni waleyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gcina-izilungiselelo-kwisifanekiso-sembono\"\u003EGcina izilungiselelo kwisifanekiso sembono\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsifanekiso esisha\u003C/span\u003E kusiphequluli, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza njengesifanekiso…\u003C/span\u003E kwi-view range yepulani (lelo pulani bese liyasisebenzisa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENikeza igama, setha amabanga nezigaba, bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza isifanekiso\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKunoma iyiphi i-view range yepulani, khetha isifanekiso. Ipulani lithatha amabanga nezigaba; shintsha isifanekiso ukuze ushintshe wonke amapulani asisebenzisayo. Izinto oziye wazifihla ngayinye zihlala zifihliwe kwepulani yazo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza isifanekiso kusiphequluli ukuze usishintshe, usiqamba kabusha noma usisuse. Ukususa kushiya amapulani aso nezilungiselelo zawo njengezawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlela-ishidi-lakho\"\u003EHlela ishidi lakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIshidi elisha\u003C/span\u003E. Thayipha inombolo yalo nesihloko bese ukhetha iphepha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza\u003C/span\u003E eseduze kwepulani, kwepulani yesilingi, kwesikhulisi, kubukeka kohlangothi, kwisigaba noma kwithebula. Lingena phakathi kweshidi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHudula ngelapho okuya khona. Lapho likhethiwe, khetha \u003Cstrong\u003EIsikali\u003C/strong\u003E, noma lishiye kusikali salo pulani (uma linaso), noma isikali esilingana nengxenye yesithathu yeshidi. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhipha ishidi\u003C/span\u003E liyakususa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza ishidi\u003C/span\u003E. Libalwa ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EAmashidi\u003C/strong\u003E; chofoza kulo ukuze uliguqule kamuva.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELanda nge-PDF\u003C/span\u003E igcina leshidi njengekhasi elilodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ubone\"\u003EOkufanele ubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmapulani aqinywe ngamabanga akho, lokho okungaphezulu kokusika kudwetshwe ngamadashi nalokho ohlanze khona kushiyiwe ngaphandle.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIpulani eliqinywe lifihliwe ngaphandle kwendawo yalo esikrinini futhi lisikwe kuyo ephepheni, ngesikali onikeze lona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIpulani yesilingi nemigqa yezilingi namathegi okuphakama, nezibani esilingeni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzikhulisi nomkhawulo wazo nethegi epulanini, ngalinye livula ngesikali salo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImigqa nemigqa yokufiphaza kuphela embonweni owadwetshwa kuwo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmashidi akho adwetshwa kabusha emodelini njalo lapho uwavula, ngakho ahlala evumelana nawo. Umbono ongasasekho izinga lawo noma umugqa wesigaba wawo owususiwe uyabikwa, awudwetshwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELonke ushintsho lapha yisinyathelo esisodwa: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyalihlehlisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKonke lokhu kugcinwa ku-IFC njengamasethi ezici ezinye izinhlelo ezingazithinti: i-view range nepulani yesilingi yezinga ngalinye ezingeni lalo, izifanekiso, izikhulisi namashidi akho kuphrojekthi. Imigqa nemigqa yokufiphaza kuyizincazelo ze-IFC ezingeni lazo, ngakho ezinye izinhlelo zibona izigoqo zamanje ezingu-2D namagatsha ahlanganisiwe (umdwebo wazo wephathini ngalinye), nakuba zingazi ukuthi zabelwe muphi umbono.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEzinye izinhlelo ze-BIM zibiza ukusika ngokuthi i-view range noma i-cut plane, izifanekiso ngokuthi izifanekiso zombono noma izilungiselelo zombono, imigqa yokudweba ngokuthi imigqa yemininingwane, nezifunda ezigcwele ngokuthi izifunda ezigcwalisiwe. Imibono ifanayo; izilungiselelo zombono azihambi nazo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Sebenza ngendlela amaphrojekthi e-BIM ahlelwe ngayo: yonke imibono kuhlu olulodwa, ipulani ngayinye inqunyiwe lapho ufuna, izilungiselelo ezifanayo kumapulani amaningi ngesifanekiso, namashidi olungiselela wena. Isiphequluli sephrojekthi Vula Dweba. Ingxenye yokunxele inesiphequluli sephrojekthi ngaphansi kwamamodeli. Lapho kukhona: Amapulani esitezi: izinga ngalinye. Chofoza elilodwa ukuze ubone ipulani lalo. Inkinobho yesilayida eseduze nalo isetha ukubuka kwalo (ngezansi). Ipulani elilandela isifanekiso libonisa igama lesifanekiso. Amapulani esilingi: ipulani yesilingi yezinga ngalinye (ngezansi). Izikhulisi: isikhulisi ngasinye nombono okudwetshwe kuwo, nango Isikhulisi esisha. Okungekho ibala izikhulisi ezingasenambono wazo. Ukubukeka kohlangothi nezigaba: izinhlangothi ezine nomugqa wesigaba ngamunye. Chofoza elilodwa ukuze uvule iseti yemidwebo edwetshwe kuyo. Imibono ye-3D: imibono oyigcinile ngo-Ukubuka. Amathebula: chofoza elilodwa ukuze ubonise ngaphansi kwepulani. Amashidi: amashidi owenzile, Ishidi elisha, ne-Iseti yemidwebo… yeseti yonke eyenziwe emodelini. Amafanekiso embono, ne-Isifanekiso esisha, nezixhumanisi (amamodeli axhunyiwe). Setha uhla lwepulani Chofoza inkinobho yesilayida eseduze nezinga ku-Amapulani esitezi. Setha amabanga, ngaphezu kwalelo zinga: Sika ku-: lapho ipulani isika khona ezindongeni, emasulweni namawindi (1200 mm, cishe 4 ft, umaungashintshi). Phezulu: izinto eziphezu kokusika nangaphansi kokuphezulu zidwetshwa ngamadashi (ikhabethi elikhulu, ibhimu). Shiya kungenalutho ukuze kube ukuphakama kwezinga. Phansi no-Ukujula ngaphansi kophansi: izinto ezingaphansi kokusika zidwetshwa ngemigqa emincane kuya ngaphansi kophansi, nangaphansi kwalo kulokho okujulile. Ngaphansi kwe-Kuboniswe kule pulani, susa lokho ipulani lishiya ngaphandle: impahla, amagumbi, izinsika njalo njalo. Ukuze ushiye izinto ezithile ngaphandle: khetha zipulani noma kumbono we-3D, vula ingxoxo bese uchofoza Fihla lokho okukhethiwe lapha. Bonisa zonke ziyazibuyisa. Chofoza Sebenzisa lezi zilungiselelo. Ipulani liyasikwa kabusha masinyane, namashidi akho neseti yemidwebo kuyalandela. Isilayisi se-point cloud silandela nokuphakama kokusika. Sika ipulani, nika isikali, bonisa elinye izinga ngaphansi kwayo Konke lokhu kusendaweni efanayo (inkinobho yesilayida eseduze nezinga): Isikali: isikali ipulani elishicilelwa ngaso (Phrinta ebhalini lepulani) futhi elifika ngaso eshidini. Lwanele ikhetha isikali esikhulu esijwayelekile esilingana. Indawo yokusika: chofoza Dweba kupulani…, bese uchofoza ikhona elilodwa nekhona elingeleceleni epulani (Esc iyayima). Ipulani ngaphandle kwendawo lifihlwa ngesithunzi esikrinini, futhi ungasasebenza khona; kushicilelwe, emashidini nakuseti yemidwebo, ipulani libonisa okungaphakathi kuphela. Sula isusa ukusika. Lwanele ilwanelisa ukusika. Ingaphansi: khetha elinye izinga. Izindonga zalo, izinto ezinqunyiwe, izicabha namawindi zidwetshwa zikhanye ngaphansi kwale pulani, ukuze uhlanganise izinto nezinga elingaphansi noma elingaphezulu. Awukwazi ukuzikhetha lapha, futhi zishicilelwa ngegrey elikhanyayo. Isifanekiso sembono sithwala isikali nokuphakama nezigaba. Indawo yokusika neyingaphansi zihlala zeqa lapho kupulani eliyodwa. Ipulani yesilingi selinga Linga ngalinye linepulani yesilingi eseduze nepulani layo lesitezi: ipulani ebonwa ngaphansi, ukuze kulungiswe izilingi nalokho okuhangela kuzo. Chofoza izinga ngaphansi kwe-Amapulani esilingi kusiphequluli, noma khetha Ipulani yesilingi eseduze nezinga ebhalini lepulani. Izindonga zisikwa ku-2300 mm (cishe 7'-6\"). Lokho okulele ngaphezu kwalokho kokusika nangaphansi kokuphakama kwezinga kudwetshwa: izilingi negridi yazo nethegi yokuphakama (CLG 2438), izibani, amabhimu. Iminyango, amawindi nalokho okulele ngaphansi kokusika kushiyiwe ngaphandle. Ukuze wenze isilingi, sebenzisa Isilingi njengasepulanini lesitezi, bese ukhetha sona bese ukhetha i-Iphathini kuphaneli Izici. Bheka Amagumbi, amafulowa, izilingi nophahla. Ukuze ulengise isibani kuso, beka into kusuka emtapweni lapho kukhonjiswa ipulani yesilingi: ifaka ku-Esilingeni. Bheka Beka izinsiza nempahla kusuka emtapweni. Inkinobho yesilayida eseduze nepulani yesilingi isetha ukusika kwayo nokuphezulu, isikali, izigaba, indawo yokusika nengaphansi, njengepulani yesitezi. Amapulani esilingi awamukeli sifanekiso sembono. Idwetshwa ngendlela efanayo nepulani yesitezi (ipulani ebonakala ngaphansi, hhayi isithombe esiphambene). Isilingi esingaphansi kokusika asidwetshwa: nciphisa ukusika kwalelo zinga kwepulani yesilingi. Amapulani esilingi ayahamba emashidini akho njengamapulani; iseti yemidwebo ayengezi yona. Yenza isikhulisi Isikhulisi sibonisa ingxenye yepulani inkulu, ngesikali sayo, njengombono wayo siqu: ikhishi, isitebhisi, ikhona lodonga. Bonisa ipulani, ipulani yesilingi noma isikhulisi esiyiyo. Khetha Chaza › Isikhulisi ebhalini lepulani (noma Isikhulisi esisha kusiphequluli), bese uchofoza ikhona elilodwa lendawo nekhona elingeleceleni. Esc iyayima. Isikhulisi senziwa ku-1:20 (1/2\" = 1'-0\" ngamafidi namainshi). Isikwele sayo nethegi elijikeleziwe zidwetshwa epulanini. Chofoza ithegi nge-Khetha, noma isikhulisi kusiphequluli, ukuze uvule: ipulani libonisa lendawo kuphela, ngesikali sesikhulisi. Ibha ithi Isikhulisi: negama layo; Phezulu ibuyela embonweni esidwetshwe kuwo. Inkinobho yesilayida eseduze naso (kusiphequluli noma ebhalini) iyasiqamba kabusha, ishintshe isikali, idwebe kabusha isikwele sawo noma iyasisusa. Isikhulisi sibonisa okubonakala embonweni waso: ukusika okufanayo, izigaba ezifanayo, izilingi zepulani yesilingi. Isikhulisi sesikhulisi siyasebenza ngendlela efanayo. Beka isikhulisi eshidini njengepulani; ithegi yaso isho lapho likhona (1 / A-501: umbono wokuqala eshidini A-501). Phrinta kwisikhulisi ishicilela lendawo kuphela ngesikali sayo. Ukususa isikhulisi kususa nezikhulisi ezidwetshwe ngaphakathi kwaso, nemigqa nemigqa yokufiphaza edwetshwe kuzo (uyabuzwa kuqala). Uma izinga isikhulisi esidwetshwe kulo lisuswa, isikhulisi sihlala ngaphansi kwe-Okungekho kuze usisuse, namashidi asikuwo abike ukuthi sekungekho. Dweba imigqa nemigqa yokufiphaza embonweni owodwa Ukudweba kuyisebenzo se-2D esihlobene nombono owodwa kuphela: amanothi ngemigqa, indawo efakwe amahatshi yekhonkolo noma yomhlaba, isifunda esigcwele. Akusoze kube ku-3D noma epulanini elinye. Bonisa ipulani yesitezi, ipulani yesilingi noma isikhulisi okuzodwetshwa kuso. Khetha kusuka ku-Chaza ebhalini lepulani: Umugqa: chofoza lapho iqala khona nalapho iphela khona. Umugqa olandelayo uqala lapho owedlule uphela khona; Enter iqala kabusha. Iphola-layini: chofoza amaphoyinti; Enter noma ukuchofoza kabili kuyayiphelisa, ukuchofoza iphoyinti lokuqala kuyivala. Irektangeli: amakhona amabili aphambene. Indawo yemigqa yokufiphaza: khetha i-Iphathini (Solid, Diagonal, Cross-hatch, Concrete, Insulation, Earth) nesikali sayo ebhalini, bese uchofoza amakhona; Enter, ukuchofoza kabili noma ukuchofoza iphoyinti lokuqala kuyayivala. Uma Gcwalisa igumbi ikhethiwe, ukuchofoza kamunye ngaphakathi kwegumbi kufaka amahatshi ngaphakathi kwemigqa yalo. Amaphoyinti ahlanganiswa njengezindonga; Shift igcina umugqa uqondile, futhi ungathayipha ubude njengasezindongeni. Backspace ithatha iphoyinti lokugcina. Khetha umugqa noma ihatshi nge-Khetha epulanini. Properties ishintsha iphathini nesikali sehatshi futhi inomyalo Hambisa… (chofoza iphoyinti okuzohanjiswa kulo, bese kuthi lapho lisiya khona). Delete iyasisusa. Umugqa ngamunye, ihatshi nokushintsha ngakunye kuyisinyathelo esisodwa. Imigqa nemigqa yokufiphaza ishicilelwa nepulani, ifika emashidini nayo, futhi itholakala eseti yemidwebo. Susa ukukhethwa kwe-Izincazelo ohlelweni lwesinye izinga ukuze uzikhiphe embonweni waleyo. Gcina izilungiselelo kwisifanekiso sembono Chofoza Isifanekiso esisha kusiphequluli, noma Londoloza njengesifanekiso… kwi-view range yepulani (lelo pulani bese liyasisebenzisa). Nikeza igama, setha amabanga nezigaba, bese uchofoza Londoloza isifanekiso. Kunoma iyiphi i-view range yepulani, khetha isifanekiso. Ipulani lithatha amabanga nezigaba; shintsha isifanekiso ukuze ushintshe wonke amapulani asisebenzisayo. Izinto oziye wazifihla ngayinye zihlala zifihliwe kwepulani yazo. Chofoza isifanekiso kusiphequluli ukuze usishintshe, usiqamba kabusha noma usisuse. Ukususa kushiya amapulani aso nezilungiselelo zawo njengezawo. Hlela ishidi lakho Chofoza Ishidi elisha. Thayipha inombolo yalo nesihloko bese ukhetha iphepha. Chofoza Engeza eseduze kwepulani, kwepulani yesilingi, kwesikhulisi, kubukeka kohlangothi, kwisigaba noma kwithebula. Lingena phakathi kweshidi. Hudula ngelapho okuya khona. Lapho likhethiwe, khetha Isikali, noma lishiye kusikali salo pulani (uma linaso), noma isikali esilingana nengxenye yesithathu yeshidi. Khipha ishidi liyakususa. Chofoza Londoloza ishidi. Libalwa ngaphansi kwe-Amashidi; chofoza kulo ukuze uliguqule kamuva. Landa nge-PDF igcina leshidi njengekhasi elilodwa. Okufanele ubone Amapulani aqinywe ngamabanga akho, lokho okungaphezulu kokusika kudwetshwe ngamadashi nalokho ohlanze khona kushiyiwe ngaphandle. Ipulani eliqinywe lifihliwe ngaphandle kwendawo yalo esikrinini futhi lisikwe kuyo ephepheni, ngesikali onikeze lona. Ipulani yesilingi nemigqa yezilingi namathegi okuphakama, nezibani esilingeni. Izikhulisi nomkhawulo wazo nethegi epulanini, ngalinye livula ngesikali salo. Imigqa nemigqa yokufiphaza kuphela embonweni owadwetshwa kuwo. Amashidi akho adwetshwa kabusha emodelini njalo lapho uwavula, ngakho ahlala evumelana nawo. Umbono ongasasekho izinga lawo noma umugqa wesigaba wawo owususiwe uyabikwa, awudwetshwa. Lonke ushintsho lapha yisinyathelo esisodwa: Ctrl+Z iyalihlehlisa. Konke lokhu kugcinwa ku-IFC njengamasethi ezici ezinye izinhlelo ezingazithinti: i-view range nepulani yesilingi yezinga ngalinye ezingeni lalo, izifanekiso, izikhulisi namashidi akho kuphrojekthi. Imigqa nemigqa yokufiphaza kuyizincazelo ze-IFC ezingeni lazo, ngakho ezinye izinhlelo zibona izigoqo zamanje ezingu-2D namagatsha ahlanganisiwe (umdwebo wazo wephathini ngalinye), nakuba zingazi ukuthi zabelwe muphi umbono. Ezinye izinhlelo ze-BIM zibiza ukusika ngokuthi i-view range noma i-cut plane, izifanekiso ngokuthi izifanekiso zombono noma izilungiselelo zombono, imigqa yokudweba ngokuthi imigqa yemininingwane, nezifunda ezigcwele ngokuthi izifunda ezigcwalisiwe. Imibono ifanayo; izilungiselelo zombono azihambi nazo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"views-and-walkthroughs","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Londoloza imibono nokuhamba","summary":"Gcina izikhamera zombono we-3D ngamagama, uye kuzo, udlale ezilandelanayo, bese uqopha ukuhamba esakhiweni ukuze uzidlale kamuva.","section":"tasks","order":34,"keywords":["imibono","imibono egciniwe","ikhamera","izikhamera","indawo yokubuka","isimo","izimo","uhambo","isethulo","ukuhamba","hamba ngaphakathi","ukundiza ngaphakathi","qopha","dlala","indlela","ukunyakaza"],"headings":[{"id":"londoloza-umbono","text":"Londoloza umbono","level":2},{"id":"dlala-imibono","text":"Dlala imibono","level":2},{"id":"qopha-uhambo","text":"Qopha uhambo","level":2},{"id":"renda-uhambo-ube-yividiyo","text":"Renda uhambo ube yividiyo","level":2},{"id":"chaza-uhambo","text":"Chaza uhambo","level":2},{"id":"ngaphakathi-kwefayela","text":"Ngaphakathi kwefayela","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubuka\u003C/span\u003E ethuleni lamathuluzi igcina izikhamera zombono we-3D kufayela lemodeli, ukuze wena nalowo omthumela kuye uphindele kuzo ngqo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"londoloza-umbono\"\u003ELondoloza umbono\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELungisa umbono we-3D: zungeza, sondeza, fihla lokho ongakufuni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubuka\u003C/span\u003E, thayipha igama (noma gcina elinikezwayo) bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza umbono\u003C/span\u003E noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkulondoloza ngegama elisevele ohlwini kubuyekeza lowo mbono. Chofoza igama lombono ukuze ubuyele kuwo; ikhamera ihamba ngobumnene iye lapho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzikhombi zishintsha ukulandelana, ipensela liqamba kabusha, ibhinsi liyasusa. Ushintsho ngalunye yisinyathelo esisodwa, ngakho \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Z\"\u003E⌃Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyalihlehlisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dlala-imibono\"\u003EDlala imibono\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDlala imibono\u003C/span\u003E ihamba kusuka kombono ukuya kwelilandelayo ohlwini, imise isikhashana kuyo ngayinye. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMisa\u003C/span\u003E iyaphelisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qopha-uhambo\"\u003EQopha uhambo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/walk\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/walk\"\u003EUkuhamba\u003C/a\u003E bese uqala ukuhamba ngaphakathi esakhiweni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubuka\u003C/span\u003E, chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQopha ukuhamba\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHamba ngo-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ubheke ngozungezileyo ngemouse.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMisa ukuqopha\u003C/span\u003E. Uhambo lugcinwa njengo-&quot;Walk 1&quot;, kanye nobude balo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza uhambo ukuze ulidlale njengoba walihamba. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyalimisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"renda-uhambo-ube-yividiyo\"\u003ERenda uhambo ube yividiyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza isithombe sefilimu eseduze nohambo. Ingxoxo yevidiyo idwetsha wonke ama-frame wohambo ngezilungiselelo zokurenda owakhetha ekugcineni, ngosayizi, izinga lama-frame nekhwalithi okhetha lapho. Gcina njenge-WebM noma i-MP4 video, noma njenge-ZIP enesithombe esisodwa ngakunye ku-frame. Ama-frame athatha isikhathi esifanayo nezithombe, ngakho qala nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkusheshayo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"chaza-uhambo\"\u003EChaza uhambo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza isithombe sogwebu lokukhuluma eseduze nohambo. Bhala umugqa owodwa ngalokho okushiwo, bese uqala umugqa ngesikhathi esiqala ngaso (\u003Ccode\u003E12\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E0:12\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E1:02.5\u003C/code\u003E); umugqa ongenaso isikhathi ulandela umugqa ongaphezulu ngemva kwesikhathi esithatha ukuwushona. Khetha ulimi, ngolimi lweklayenti uma yilona olizobukela. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBukela kuqala\u003C/span\u003E idlala amazwi ngezwi lale khompyutha bese iwabonisa njengezihloko ezingaphansi; okufanayo kwenzeka uhambo lapho lidlalwa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGcina nohambo\u003C/span\u003E igcina incazelo ku-IFC kanye nohambo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmsizi wakho oxhunyiwe angakubhalela incazelo: mcele ukuthi abuke uhambo nemibono egciniwe, uzosetha imigqa ngolimi okutshela ngalo, njengesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIvidiyo eshunyiwe ayinalo izwi layo, ngoba isiphequluli asikwazi ukuqopha izwi layo. Gcina izihloko ezingaphansi (\u003Ccode\u003E.srt\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E.vtt\u003C/code\u003E) bese uzengeza kuvidiyo kumdlali wakho wevidiyo noma kumhleli. Ozwini oyoza bungakanani kuncike ekhompyutheni; ulimi olungenalo izwi elifakiwe lisathola izihloko ezingaphansi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ngaphakathi-kwefayela\"\u003ENgaphakathi kwefayela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImibono nohambo kugcinwa ku-IFC njengesethi yezici \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_Views\u003C/code\u003E kuphrojekthi: izici ezijwayelekile ze-IFC ezinye izinhlelo ziyazinaka. Zisezixhumanisweni zemodeli yokuqala, ngakho zisahambisana uma imodeli ilayishwa kabusha noma kwengezwa enye imodeli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze udwebe isithombe kusuka embonweni ogciniwe, hamba kuwo, bese uchofoza \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render\"\u003ERenda\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Ukubuka ethuleni lamathuluzi igcina izikhamera zombono we-3D kufayela lemodeli, ukuze wena nalowo omthumela kuye uphindele kuzo ngqo. Londoloza umbono Lungisa umbono we-3D: zungeza, sondeza, fihla lokho ongakufuni. Chofoza Ukubuka, thayipha igama (noma gcina elinikezwayo) bese uchofoza Londoloza umbono noma cindezela Enter. Ukulondoloza ngegama elisevele ohlwini kubuyekeza lowo mbono. Chofoza igama lombono ukuze ubuyele kuwo; ikhamera ihamba ngobumnene iye lapho. Izikhombi zishintsha ukulandelana, ipensela liqamba kabusha, ibhinsi liyasusa. Ushintsho ngalunye yisinyathelo esisodwa, ngakho Ctrl+Z iyalihlehlisa. Dlala imibono Dlala imibono ihamba kusuka kombono ukuya kwelilandelayo ohlwini, imise isikhashana kuyo ngayinye. Esc noma Misa iyaphelisa. Qopha uhambo Vula Ukuhamba bese uqala ukuhamba ngaphakathi esakhiweni. Ku-Ukubuka, chofoza Qopha ukuhamba. Hamba ngo-W A S D ubheke ngozungezileyo ngemouse. Chofoza Misa ukuqopha. Uhambo lugcinwa njengo-\"Walk 1\", kanye nobude balo. Chofoza uhambo ukuze ulidlale njengoba walihamba. Esc iyalimisa. Renda uhambo ube yividiyo Chofoza isithombe sefilimu eseduze nohambo. Ingxoxo yevidiyo idwetsha wonke ama-frame wohambo ngezilungiselelo zokurenda owakhetha ekugcineni, ngosayizi, izinga lama-frame nekhwalithi okhetha lapho. Gcina njenge-WebM noma i-MP4 video, noma njenge-ZIP enesithombe esisodwa ngakunye ku-frame. Ama-frame athatha isikhathi esifanayo nezithombe, ngakho qala nge-Okusheshayo. Chaza uhambo Chofoza isithombe sogwebu lokukhuluma eseduze nohambo. Bhala umugqa owodwa ngalokho okushiwo, bese uqala umugqa ngesikhathi esiqala ngaso (12, 0:12 noma 1:02.5); umugqa ongenaso isikhathi ulandela umugqa ongaphezulu ngemva kwesikhathi esithatha ukuwushona. Khetha ulimi, ngolimi lweklayenti uma yilona olizobukela. Bukela kuqala idlala amazwi ngezwi lale khompyutha bese iwabonisa njengezihloko ezingaphansi; okufanayo kwenzeka uhambo lapho lidlalwa. Gcina nohambo igcina incazelo ku-IFC kanye nohambo. Umsizi wakho oxhunyiwe angakubhalela incazelo: mcele ukuthi abuke uhambo nemibono egciniwe, uzosetha imigqa ngolimi okutshela ngalo, njengesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Ividiyo eshunyiwe ayinalo izwi layo, ngoba isiphequluli asikwazi ukuqopha izwi layo. Gcina izihloko ezingaphansi (.srt noma .vtt) bese uzengeza kuvidiyo kumdlali wakho wevidiyo noma kumhleli. Ozwini oyoza bungakanani kuncike ekhompyutheni; ulimi olungenalo izwi elifakiwe lisathola izihloko ezingaphansi. Ngaphakathi kwefayela Imibono nohambo kugcinwa ku-IFC njengesethi yezici CadCraft_Views kuphrojekthi: izici ezijwayelekile ze-IFC ezinye izinhlelo ziyazinaka. Zisezixhumanisweni zemodeli yokuqala, ngakho zisahambisana uma imodeli ilayishwa kabusha noma kwengezwa enye imodeli. Ukuze udwebe isithombe kusuka embonweni ogciniwe, hamba kuwo, bese uchofoza Renda.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"tags-and-schedules","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Phawula izinto bese wenza uhlu ngamathegi","summary":"Chaza amathegi akho (igama, uhlobo, amanani avunyelwe, namakilasi ahlobene nawo), phawula izinto eziningi ngesikhathi esisodwa, bese wenza amauhlu amakholomu, izihlungi nezinhlobo zifunda amathegi. Amathegi agcinwa ku-IFC.","section":"tasks","order":34,"keywords":["amathegi","ithegi","ukuphawula","izici zakho","ama-parameter","izici ezabelanwa","isethi yezakhiwo","pset","uhlu","ihlungi","hlanganisa ngo","ukuqedela","izinga lomlilo","ukuhlela okuningi","csv"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukubone","text":"Okufanele ukubone","level":2},{"id":"izinhlobo","text":"Izinhlobo","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-wazi","text":"Okufanele wazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthegi yisici sakho, njengo-\u003Cem\u003EUkuqedela\u003C/em\u003E noma \u003Cem\u003EIzinga lomlilo\u003C/em\u003E. Uyichaza kanye kuphrojekthi, uyisete ezintweni eziningi ngesikhathi esisodwa, futhi wonke amauhlu ku-BimCraft angayifunda: uhlu lwamathegi lapha, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmanani\u003C/span\u003E, Thola, Umbala ngesici kanye \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/documents-from-the-model\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/documents-from-the-model\"\u003EAmadokhumenti kusukela kumodeli\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula imodeli ye-IFC, noma qala isakhiwo esisha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgakwesobunxele, ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmanani\u003C/span\u003E, vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmathegi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza ithegi\u003C/span\u003E. Liniki igama, khetha uhlobo lwalo, uma uthanda bhala amanani avunyelwe (ngamakhoma) namakilasi ayo (\u003Ccode\u003EIfcDoor\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EIfcWall\u003C/code\u003E …). Chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza ithegi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha izinto emodelini (Thola iyasiza: khetha yonke imisamo ngesikhathi esisodwa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThegisa okukhethiwe\u003C/span\u003E, khetha noma uthayiphe inani ngalinye ithegi ofuna ukulisetha, ushiye amanye njengoba ayunjalo, bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESebenzisa ku-… izinto ezikhethiwe\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlu lwamathegi\u003C/span\u003E, thikha amakholomu, engeza izihlungi, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlanganisa ngo\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELanda i-CSV\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukubone\"\u003EOkufanele ukubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsinyathelo ohlwini lwezinguquko ngasinye sochaza elilondoloziwe nasinye sokuphawula; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlehlisa\u003C/span\u003E iyasibuyisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinto zohlobo ithegi engelona lawo ziyeqiwa kuleyo thegi, futhi umugqa wesimo uyatshela ukuthi zingaki.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUhlu lwamathegi lubala umugqa owodwa ngento ngayinye, luqoqwe ngensimu okhethe ngayo; chofoza iseli lokuqala lomugqa ukukhetha leyo nto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmanani\u003C/span\u003E ibala amathegi ngaphansi kwe-\u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_Tags\u003C/code\u003E, ukuze ufake izindawo noma izinani ngokuthi ithegi lalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinhlobo\"\u003EIzinhlobo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinhlobo zifana nohlu lwama-parameter omndeni: Length (millimeters), Angle (degrees), Number, Whole number, Yes / No, Pen (1–16), Text, Material kanye Fill. Inani elingafaneli uhlobo lwalo, noma elingelona elivunyelwe, liyenqatshwa ngomyalezo, futhi akukho okushintsha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-wazi\"\u003EOkufanele wazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKonke kuyi-IFC evamile, ngakho ezinye izinhlelo zifunda amanani: izincazelo zisesethini yezakhiwo i-\u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_TagDefs\u003C/code\u003E kuprojekthi, namanani asesethini i-\u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_Tags\u003C/code\u003E kuyo yonke into (isici esisodwa ngethegi ngayinye). Ubude bubhalwa ngeyunithi yobude yefayela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EIfcWall\u003C/code\u003E kumakilasi wethegi ibuye ifake odonga abajwayelekile nodonga abahlukaniswe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuqamba kabusha ithegi kuqamba kabusha namanani ayo kuzo zonke izinto esinyathelweni esisodwa. Ukususa ithegi kususa kuphela incazelo yalo: amanani asevele asetwe ezintweni agcina njengezici ezijwayelekile. Wacishe uwasule kuqala (khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESula\u003C/span\u003E) ukuze uwasuse.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmathegi ohlelweni lokuhlanganisa elibhalwe ngu-CadCraft (izinsimbi zebhulokhi) awakwakhiwe okwamanje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Ithegi yisici sakho, njengo-Ukuqedela noma Izinga lomlilo. Uyichaza kanye kuphrojekthi, uyisete ezintweni eziningi ngesikhathi esisodwa, futhi wonke amauhlu ku-BimCraft angayifunda: uhlu lwamathegi lapha, Amanani, Thola, Umbala ngesici kanye Amadokhumenti kusukela kumodeli. Izinyathelo Vula imodeli ye-IFC, noma qala isakhiwo esisha. Ngakwesobunxele, ngaphansi kwe-Amanani, vula Amathegi. Chofoza Engeza ithegi. Liniki igama, khetha uhlobo lwalo, uma uthanda bhala amanani avunyelwe (ngamakhoma) namakilasi ayo (IfcDoor, IfcWall …). Chofoza Engeza ithegi. Khetha izinto emodelini (Thola iyasiza: khetha yonke imisamo ngesikhathi esisodwa). Ngaphansi kwe-Thegisa okukhethiwe, khetha noma uthayiphe inani ngalinye ithegi ofuna ukulisetha, ushiye amanye njengoba ayunjalo, bese uchofoza Sebenzisa ku-… izinto ezikhethiwe. Ngaphansi kwe-Uhlu lwamathegi, thikha amakholomu, engeza izihlungi, khetha Hlanganisa ngo, bese Landa i-CSV. Okufanele ukubone Isinyathelo ohlwini lwezinguquko ngasinye sochaza elilondoloziwe nasinye sokuphawula; Hlehlisa iyasibuyisa. Izinto zohlobo ithegi engelona lawo ziyeqiwa kuleyo thegi, futhi umugqa wesimo uyatshela ukuthi zingaki. Uhlu lwamathegi lubala umugqa owodwa ngento ngayinye, luqoqwe ngensimu okhethe ngayo; chofoza iseli lokuqala lomugqa ukukhetha leyo nto. Amanani ibala amathegi ngaphansi kwe-CadCraft_Tags, ukuze ufake izindawo noma izinani ngokuthi ithegi lalo. Izinhlobo Izinhlobo zifana nohlu lwama-parameter omndeni: Length (millimeters), Angle (degrees), Number, Whole number, Yes / No, Pen (1–16), Text, Material kanye Fill. Inani elingafaneli uhlobo lwalo, noma elingelona elivunyelwe, liyenqatshwa ngomyalezo, futhi akukho okushintsha. Okufanele wazi Konke kuyi-IFC evamile, ngakho ezinye izinhlelo zifunda amanani: izincazelo zisesethini yezakhiwo i-CadCraft_TagDefs kuprojekthi, namanani asesethini i-CadCraft_Tags kuyo yonke into (isici esisodwa ngethegi ngayinye). Ubude bubhalwa ngeyunithi yobude yefayela. IfcWall kumakilasi wethegi ibuye ifake odonga abajwayelekile nodonga abahlukaniswe. Ukuqamba kabusha ithegi kuqamba kabusha namanani ayo kuzo zonke izinto esinyathelweni esisodwa. Ukususa ithegi kususa kuphela incazelo yalo: amanani asevele asetwe ezintweni agcina njengezici ezijwayelekile. Wacishe uwasule kuqala (khetha Sula) ukuze uwasuse. Amathegi ohlelweni lokuhlanganisa elibhalwe ngu-CadCraft (izinsimbi zebhulokhi) awakwakhiwe okwamanje.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"compare-versions","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Qhathanisa izinguqulo ezimbili zemodeli","summary":"Vula izinguqulo ezimbili zemodeli efanayo ye-IFC bese ubona ukuthi yimaphi amazinto angeziwe, asusiwe noshintshiwe, ahlanganiswa ngama-GlobalId awo, nefayela le-CSV lakho lonke ushintsho.","section":"tasks","order":34,"keywords":["qhathanisa","diff","difference","izinguqulo","revision","changes","changed","added","removed","moved","globalid","guid","yini eshintshile"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukubone","text":"Okufanele ukubone","level":2},{"id":"okuhle-ukukwazi","text":"Okuhle ukukwazi","level":2},{"id":"okulandelayo","text":"Okulandelayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBona okushintshile phakathi kwemodeli onayo nowathunyelwe kuwe: yimaphi amazinto amasha, ayasusiwe, ayahanjiswa noma athola amanani ezici amasha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula inguqulo entsha, bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza imodeli…\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha eyendala. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/several-models\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/several-models\"\u003EBona amamodeli e-IFC amaningi ndawonye\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmamodeli\u003C/span\u003E, vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQhathanisa izinguqulo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInguqulo endala\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInguqulo entsha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQhathanisa\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza into ohlwini ukuze uyikhethe ubone izici zayo. Chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELanda i-CSV\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uthole konke okushintshile, isici ngesici.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESula\u003C/span\u003E ukuze ubuyele embonweni ojwayelekile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukubone\"\u003EOkufanele ukubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzakhi ezengeziwe\u003C/strong\u003E zibe obhakabhaka, zivela enguqulweni entsha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzakhi ezisusiwe\u003C/strong\u003E zibe bomvu, zivela enguqulweni endala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzakhi ezishintshiwe\u003C/strong\u003E zibe okuphuzi okunsundu, zivela enguqulweni entsha, zishela ukuthi yini eshintshile: izici, ukuhamba nokuthi kukhulu kangakanani, noma umumo omusha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKonke okufanayo kubonakala kukhanye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuhle-ukukwazi\"\u003EOkuhle ukukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzakhi zihlanganiswa ngama-GlobalId awo. Uhlelo olunika izakhi ama-GlobalId amasha ekukhishweni ngakunye lenza ukuthi zonke izakhi zibonakale zisusiwe futhi zengeziwe kabusha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzindawo zifaniswa lapho amamodeli ehlala khona esigcawini. Uma enye inguqulo yahanjiswa ngenhloso, yilinganise kuqala ngethuluzi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa\u003C/span\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmamodeli\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-GlobalId esetshenziswe kabili kumodeli eyodwa ishiywe ngaphandle kokuqhathaniswa. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/model-checks\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/model-checks\"\u003EHlola imodeli ngezinkinga ezivamile\u003C/a\u003E iyazithola.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulandelayo\"\u003EOkulandelayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/issues-bcf\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/issues-bcf\"\u003EIzinkinga namafayela e-BCF\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/quantity-totals\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/quantity-totals\"\u003EEngeza phezulu izinani ngesici\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Bona okushintshile phakathi kwemodeli onayo nowathunyelwe kuwe: yimaphi amazinto amasha, ayasusiwe, ayahanjiswa noma athola amanani ezici amasha. Izinyathelo Vula inguqulo entsha, bese uchofoza Engeza imodeli… bese ukhetha eyendala. Bona Bona amamodeli e-IFC amaningi ndawonye. Ku-Amamodeli, vula Qhathanisa izinguqulo. Khetha Inguqulo endala kanye Inguqulo entsha. Chofoza Qhathanisa. Chofoza into ohlwini ukuze uyikhethe ubone izici zayo. Chofoza Landa i-CSV ukuze uthole konke okushintshile, isici ngesici. Chofoza Sula ukuze ubuyele embonweni ojwayelekile. Okufanele ukubone Izakhi ezengeziwe zibe obhakabhaka, zivela enguqulweni entsha. Izakhi ezisusiwe zibe bomvu, zivela enguqulweni endala. Izakhi ezishintshiwe zibe okuphuzi okunsundu, zivela enguqulweni entsha, zishela ukuthi yini eshintshile: izici, ukuhamba nokuthi kukhulu kangakanani, noma umumo omusha. Konke okufanayo kubonakala kukhanye. Okuhle ukukwazi Izakhi zihlanganiswa ngama-GlobalId awo. Uhlelo olunika izakhi ama-GlobalId amasha ekukhishweni ngakunye lenza ukuthi zonke izakhi zibonakale zisusiwe futhi zengeziwe kabusha. Izindawo zifaniswa lapho amamodeli ehlala khona esigcawini. Uma enye inguqulo yahanjiswa ngenhloso, yilinganise kuqala ngethuluzi Hambisa ku-Amamodeli. I-GlobalId esetshenziswe kabili kumodeli eyodwa ishiywe ngaphandle kokuqhathaniswa. Hlola imodeli ngezinkinga ezivamile iyazithola. Okulandelayo Izinkinga namafayela e-BCF Engeza phezulu izinani ngesici","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"model-for-rendering","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Thumela imodeli kuhlelo lokurenda","summary":"Londoloza okubonakala kumbono we-3D njengemodeli ye-glTF (.glb) enezinto zayo, izindwangu namabhoni, yezinhlelo zokurenda nezokubonisa ezifunda i-glTF.","section":"tasks","order":34,"keywords":["glb","gltf","gl transmission format","thumela","ukurenda","ukubonisa","isikhathi sangempela","archviz","izinto","izindwangu","amabhoni","ukuvezwa","impahla","impahla yakho"],"headings":[{"id":"londoloza","text":"Londoloza","level":2},{"id":"okuphethwe-yifayela","text":"Okuphethwe yifayela","level":2},{"id":"lokho-okushiywayo","text":"Lokho okushiywayo","level":2},{"id":"enscape-nezinye-izikhombimzimba-zeplagi","text":"Enscape nezinye izikhombimzimba zeplagi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuze kurendrelwe\u003C/span\u003E kwithuluzi lamathuluzi longa okubonakala kumbono we-3D njengefayela elilodwa le-\u003Cstrong\u003E.glb\u003C/strong\u003E (glTF 2.0, ifomethi evulekile evela ku-Khronos Group). Izinhlelo zokurenda ezifunda i-glTF ziyasivula ngezinto zemodeli namabhoni wayo; i-Twinmotion ibhala i-glTF ne-GLB phakathi kwamafayela ejiyometri ayawalayisha futhi igcina izibani zawo (incwadi yokusiza ye-Epic, &quot;Importing geometry in Twinmotion&quot;): sebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuze kurendrelwe\u003C/span\u003E bese ungenisa i-.glb lapho. Akukho okulayishwayo: ifayela lenziwa kulesi sikhombisa-mbono.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"londoloza\"\u003ELondoloza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula imodeli ye-IFC bese usetha umbono we-3D: fihla izitezi, izinto noma amamodeli axhunyiwe ongawadingi, bese \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/paint-materials\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/paint-materials\"\u003Eupenta izinto\u003C/a\u003E ofuna ukuzibona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuze kurendrelwe\u003C/span\u003E (noma uthayipha \u003Ccode\u003EGLB\u003C/code\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIfayela liyalandwa njenge-&quot;&lt;igama lemodeli&gt;.glb&quot;. Ibha yesimo ikhombisa ukuthi inama-triangle amangaki, izinto nezibani eziphethe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuphethwe-yifayela\"\u003EOkuphethwe yifayela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIjiyometri\u003C/strong\u003E yazo zonke izinto umbono we-3D ozikhombisayo, ngamamitha, no-Y ephezulu (ama-axes we-glTF ngokwawo). Into eyodwa ngesitezi ngasinye nangomumo ngamunye, ibizwa ngokuthi &quot;Level 1 — Brick, red&quot;, ukuze ukhethe impahla yokwakha kuhlelo lokurenda uyishintshe ngeyayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImpahla yokwakha:\u003C/strong\u003E umbala ngamunye ngesimo osikhethe kwi-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render\"\u003ERender\u003C/a\u003E (matte, satin, glossy, metal, glass…), nendwangu ngayinye yelabhulali epenjiwe ngombala wayo, ukuqina kwayo nesithombe sayo sesihlobiso (isithombe sayo sifakwe ngosayizi wayo wangempela: ibhulokhi libe ngosayizi webhulokhi). Ingilazi iyabonakala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzibani:\u003C/strong\u003E yonke isibani esivulwe ku-Render › Izibani, njengomthombo wokukhanya owu-point noma owu-spot, nokukhanya kwayo (ama-lumen aguqulwa abe ama-candela), umbala nobubanzi bomkhondo wokukhanya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELapho isiza likhona:\u003C/strong\u003E ububanzi nobude besiza kubhalwa efayeleni ukuze kubhekiswe kuwo. Izinhlelo zokurenda zinelanga layazo: thayipha indawo lapho kuyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lokho-okushiywayo\"\u003ELokho okushiywayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsigaba esinqunyiwe (izinto eziphelele ziyangena) nezinto ezibonakala ngokuzidlulisa (zishiywa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinto ngazinye njengezinto (into eyodwa ngesitezi nangomumo ngamunye kunalokho), izici ze-IFC, ama-bump map, imibono elondoloziwe nezinhambo ezirekhodiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImiphetho nengemuva.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"enscape-nezinye-izikhombimzimba-zeplagi\"\u003EEnscape nezinye izikhombimzimba zeplagi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-Enscape isebenza ngaphakathi kolunye uhlelo lokuklama futhi ayinafayela lokuvula iprojekthi yonke. Izindlela ezimbili:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cstrong\u003Ei-IFC\u003C/strong\u003E yemodeli (Ifayela › Londoloza) kuhlelo i-Enscape esebenza kulo; eziningi zalezo zifunda i-IFC. Imibala iyafika; izinto zelabhulali zifika njengemibala yazo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELetha \u003Cstrong\u003Eingxenye encane\u003C/strong\u003E (impahla, isixhobo) njengento yakho ye-custom asset: yihlukanise kuqala, bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYe-Enscape (.gltf)\u003C/span\u003E. Ilabhulali yemipahla yokwenziwe ye-Enscape ibala amafayela .gltf, .obj no-.fbx, hhayi .glb, ngakho lolu cindezelo lulondoloza leso sigcawu njenge-\u003Cstrong\u003E.gltf\u003C/strong\u003E eyodwa ezimele (idatha yebhinali nezithombe zingaphakathi kwefayela; akukho okunye okudingeka ukukopisha nayo). I-Enscape incoma izimpahla ezincane (ngaphansi kwama-triangle angu-20,000 cishe).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-CadCraft Studio ifayela elifanayo le-glTF (nelifayela le-USD) lingalondolozwa nakusuka ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda\u003C/span\u003E › Injini › \u003Cstrong\u003Eifayela le-glTF\u003C/strong\u003E / \u003Cstrong\u003Eifayela le-USD\u003C/strong\u003E, noma livulwe ngqo kuhlelo oluselwini kule kompyutha: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render-open-in\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render-open-in\"\u003EVula isigcawu kolunye uhlelo\u003C/a\u003E. I-plug-in noma uxhumo olubukhoma lwe-Enscape noma lwe-Twinmotion alukakwakhiwa. Amafomethi e-FBX ne-Datasmith awanasipesifikhethi esishicilelwe, ngakho i-BimCraft ayiwabhali; i-glTF yindlela evulekile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Ukuze kurendrelwe kwithuluzi lamathuluzi longa okubonakala kumbono we-3D njengefayela elilodwa le-.glb (glTF 2.0, ifomethi evulekile evela ku-Khronos Group). Izinhlelo zokurenda ezifunda i-glTF ziyasivula ngezinto zemodeli namabhoni wayo; i-Twinmotion ibhala i-glTF ne-GLB phakathi kwamafayela ejiyometri ayawalayisha futhi igcina izibani zawo (incwadi yokusiza ye-Epic, \"Importing geometry in Twinmotion\"): sebenzisa Ukuze kurendrelwe bese ungenisa i-.glb lapho. Akukho okulayishwayo: ifayela lenziwa kulesi sikhombisa-mbono. Londoloza Vula imodeli ye-IFC bese usetha umbono we-3D: fihla izitezi, izinto noma amamodeli axhunyiwe ongawadingi, bese upenta izinto ofuna ukuzibona. Chofoza Ukuze kurendrelwe (noma uthayipha GLB). Ifayela liyalandwa njenge-\"\u003Cigama lemodeli\u003E.glb\". Ibha yesimo ikhombisa ukuthi inama-triangle amangaki, izinto nezibani eziphethe. Okuphethwe yifayela Ijiyometri yazo zonke izinto umbono we-3D ozikhombisayo, ngamamitha, no-Y ephezulu (ama-axes we-glTF ngokwawo). Into eyodwa ngesitezi ngasinye nangomumo ngamunye, ibizwa ngokuthi \"Level 1 — Brick, red\", ukuze ukhethe impahla yokwakha kuhlelo lokurenda uyishintshe ngeyayo. Impahla yokwakha: umbala ngamunye ngesimo osikhethe kwi-Render (matte, satin, glossy, metal, glass…), nendwangu ngayinye yelabhulali epenjiwe ngombala wayo, ukuqina kwayo nesithombe sayo sesihlobiso (isithombe sayo sifakwe ngosayizi wayo wangempela: ibhulokhi libe ngosayizi webhulokhi). Ingilazi iyabonakala. Izibani: yonke isibani esivulwe ku-Render › Izibani, njengomthombo wokukhanya owu-point noma owu-spot, nokukhanya kwayo (ama-lumen aguqulwa abe ama-candela), umbala nobubanzi bomkhondo wokukhanya. Lapho isiza likhona: ububanzi nobude besiza kubhalwa efayeleni ukuze kubhekiswe kuwo. Izinhlelo zokurenda zinelanga layazo: thayipha indawo lapho kuyo. Lokho okushiywayo Isigaba esinqunyiwe (izinto eziphelele ziyangena) nezinto ezibonakala ngokuzidlulisa (zishiywa). Izinto ngazinye njengezinto (into eyodwa ngesitezi nangomumo ngamunye kunalokho), izici ze-IFC, ama-bump map, imibono elondoloziwe nezinhambo ezirekhodiwe. Imiphetho nengemuva. Enscape nezinye izikhombimzimba zeplagi I-Enscape isebenza ngaphakathi kolunye uhlelo lokuklama futhi ayinafayela lokuvula iprojekthi yonke. Izindlela ezimbili: Vula i-IFC yemodeli (Ifayela › Londoloza) kuhlelo i-Enscape esebenza kulo; eziningi zalezo zifunda i-IFC. Imibala iyafika; izinto zelabhulali zifika njengemibala yazo. Letha ingxenye encane (impahla, isixhobo) njengento yakho ye-custom asset: yihlukanise kuqala, bese uchofoza Ye-Enscape (.gltf). Ilabhulali yemipahla yokwenziwe ye-Enscape ibala amafayela .gltf, .obj no-.fbx, hhayi .glb, ngakho lolu cindezelo lulondoloza leso sigcawu njenge-.gltf eyodwa ezimele (idatha yebhinali nezithombe zingaphakathi kwefayela; akukho okunye okudingeka ukukopisha nayo). I-Enscape incoma izimpahla ezincane (ngaphansi kwama-triangle angu-20,000 cishe). Ku-CadCraft Studio ifayela elifanayo le-glTF (nelifayela le-USD) lingalondolozwa nakusuka ku-Renda › Injini › ifayela le-glTF / ifayela le-USD, noma livulwe ngqo kuhlelo oluselwini kule kompyutha: bona Vula isigcawu kolunye uhlelo. I-plug-in noma uxhumo olubukhoma lwe-Enscape noma lwe-Twinmotion alukakwakhiwa. Amafomethi e-FBX ne-Datasmith awanasipesifikhethi esishicilelwe, ngakho i-BimCraft ayiwabhali; i-glTF yindlela evulekile.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"linked-models","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Xhuma amanye amamodeli ukuze kuhlelwe","summary":"Bonisa enye imodeli ye-IFC ecishe ifane nengakho ngokuyikhomba (ingakaze ihlanganiswe), uyibeke ngezindawo ezabelwanayo, ngezindawo zemephu noma ngamaphoyinti amabili, ubambelele kuyo lapho udweba, futhi uyilayishe kabusha uma ifayela layo lishintsha.","section":"tasks","order":34,"keywords":["xhuma","imodeli exhunyiwe","isikhombi","xref","ukuhlela","ukuhlanganisa","isakhiwo","MEP","ikhonsathi","izindawo ezabelwanayo","ukuhlola","izindawo zemephu","layisha kabusha","khipha","isikhombi sedokhumenti","IfcDocumentReference"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"xhuma-imodeli","text":"Xhuma imodeli","level":2},{"id":"ukusebenza-nakho","text":"Ukusebenza nakho","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukubone","text":"Okufanele ukubone","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDweba ngokumelene nemodeli yekhonsathi (isakhiwo, izinsiza, isakhiwo esikhona) ngaphandle kokukopisha lutho kufayela lakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImodeli exhunyiwe\u003C/strong\u003E iboniswa ku-3D view futhi inqunywa emaplanini akho, kodwa ayishintshwa futhi ayilondolozwa emodelini yakho. Imodeli yakho igcina kuphela isixhumanisi: igama lefayela nendawo lapho liya khona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xhuma-imodeli\"\u003EXhuma imodeli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEsigabeni se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmamodeli axhunyiwe\u003C/span\u003E sepaneli esingakhashana kwesokunxele, chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXhuma imodeli…\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha ifayela le-IFC. Liboniswa masinyane, futhi umugqa walo uthi \u003Cstrong\u003EIbonisiwe\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha lapho iyakhona ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubekwa\u003C/span\u003E:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzindawo ezabelwanayo\u003C/strong\u003E (ukuqala): izindawo zayo zingezakho, njengalapho zombili amamodeli ebekwe ngomsuka ofanayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzindawo zemephu\u003C/strong\u003E: izindawo zemephu zamafayela womabili zizihlanganisa (zombili kudingeka ukuguqulwa kwemephu; i-BimCraft iyakusho uma enye ingenayo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENgamaphoyinti amabili…\u003C/strong\u003E: chofoza iphoyinti emodelini exhunyiwe, bese lapho lingena khona kwakho; bese kuba khona ipheya yesibili. Ixhumanisi liyahanjiswa futhi liphendulwe ngokuzungeza ngokuthi lime, ukuze lifane.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUshintsho ngalunye lwesixhumanisi nokubekwa kwaso kuyisinyathelo esisodwa: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyasibuyisela emuva.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukusebenza-nakho\"\u003EUkusebenza nakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmaplani abonisa imodeli exhunyiwe njengemigqa emincane esemkhawulweni wokunqunywa kwezinga, futhi ithuluzi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUdonga\u003C/span\u003E namanye amathuluzi okudweba ayambelela ezikhonweni nasemaphethelweni ayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha izinto zayo ku-3D view ukuze ufunde izimpahla zazo; imodeli exhunyiwe akuyona eyohlelwa nguwe, ngakho inkinobho yokukhetha yayo ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmamodeli\u003C/span\u003E ayikhethiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIfayela lishintshile?\u003C/strong\u003E Uma ibhrawuza ingakwazi ukubheka ifayela (ifayela elivulwe ngomkhethi walo wamafayela, noma ku-Studio), i-BimCraft iyayilayisha kabusha ngokuzenzakalela amasekhondi ambalwa ngemva kokuthi ifayela lilondolozwe futhi, iyakusho lokho. Ngaphandle kwalokho chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayisha kabusha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhipha\u003C/span\u003E iyayifihla futhi ikhulule inkumbulo; ixhumanisi lihlala emodelini yakho. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayisha…\u003C/span\u003E iyayibonisa futhi (ukhetha ifayela: ibhrawuza alikwazi ukuvula ifayela ngegama lalo lodwa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuthi × ususa ixhumanisi emodelini yakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukubone\"\u003EOkufanele ukubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKufayela lakho le-IFC: i-IfcDocumentReference yalo lonke ixhumanisi (igama lefayela), ehlobene neprojekthi, nendawo yalo ezethulweni zempahla yeprojekthi ethi CadCraft_Links. Ukuvula kabusha imodeli yakho kuzodwetsha izixhumanisi zayo njengo-\u003Cstrong\u003EAyilayishiwe\u003C/strong\u003E size uzilayishe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuhlola ukuphambana, Qhathanisa noThola kungasebenzisa ixhumanisi elilayishiwe njengalo naliphi elinye imodeli evulekile: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/several-models\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/several-models\"\u003EBona amamodeli e-IFC amaningi ndawonye\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Dweba ngokumelene nemodeli yekhonsathi (isakhiwo, izinsiza, isakhiwo esikhona) ngaphandle kokukopisha lutho kufayela lakho. Imodeli exhunyiwe iboniswa ku-3D view futhi inqunywa emaplanini akho, kodwa ayishintshwa futhi ayilondolozwa emodelini yakho. Imodeli yakho igcina kuphela isixhumanisi: igama lefayela nendawo lapho liya khona. Xhuma imodeli Esigabeni se-Amamodeli axhunyiwe sepaneli esingakhashana kwesokunxele, chofoza Xhuma imodeli… bese ukhetha ifayela le-IFC. Liboniswa masinyane, futhi umugqa walo uthi Ibonisiwe. Khetha lapho iyakhona ku-Ukubekwa: Izindawo ezabelwanayo (ukuqala): izindawo zayo zingezakho, njengalapho zombili amamodeli ebekwe ngomsuka ofanayo. Izindawo zemephu: izindawo zemephu zamafayela womabili zizihlanganisa (zombili kudingeka ukuguqulwa kwemephu; i-BimCraft iyakusho uma enye ingenayo). Ngamaphoyinti amabili…: chofoza iphoyinti emodelini exhunyiwe, bese lapho lingena khona kwakho; bese kuba khona ipheya yesibili. Ixhumanisi liyahanjiswa futhi liphendulwe ngokuzungeza ngokuthi lime, ukuze lifane. Ushintsho ngalunye lwesixhumanisi nokubekwa kwaso kuyisinyathelo esisodwa: Ctrl+Z iyasibuyisela emuva. Ukusebenza nakho Amaplani abonisa imodeli exhunyiwe njengemigqa emincane esemkhawulweni wokunqunywa kwezinga, futhi ithuluzi Udonga namanye amathuluzi okudweba ayambelela ezikhonweni nasemaphethelweni ayo. Khetha izinto zayo ku-3D view ukuze ufunde izimpahla zazo; imodeli exhunyiwe akuyona eyohlelwa nguwe, ngakho inkinobho yokukhetha yayo ku-Amamodeli ayikhethiwe. Ifayela lishintshile? Uma ibhrawuza ingakwazi ukubheka ifayela (ifayela elivulwe ngomkhethi walo wamafayela, noma ku-Studio), i-BimCraft iyayilayisha kabusha ngokuzenzakalela amasekhondi ambalwa ngemva kokuthi ifayela lilondolozwe futhi, iyakusho lokho. Ngaphandle kwalokho chofoza Layisha kabusha. Khipha iyayifihla futhi ikhulule inkumbulo; ixhumanisi lihlala emodelini yakho. Layisha… iyayibonisa futhi (ukhetha ifayela: ibhrawuza alikwazi ukuvula ifayela ngegama lalo lodwa). Ukuthi × ususa ixhumanisi emodelini yakho. Okufanele ukubone Kufayela lakho le-IFC: i-IfcDocumentReference yalo lonke ixhumanisi (igama lefayela), ehlobene neprojekthi, nendawo yalo ezethulweni zempahla yeprojekthi ethi CadCraft_Links. Ukuvula kabusha imodeli yakho kuzodwetsha izixhumanisi zayo njengo-Ayilayishiwe size uzilayishe. Ukuhlola ukuphambana, Qhathanisa noThola kungasebenzisa ixhumanisi elilayishiwe njengalo naliphi elinye imodeli evulekile: bheka Bona amamodeli e-IFC amaningi ndawonye.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"documents-from-the-model","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Amadokhumenti kusuka kumodeli","summary":"Bhala ukucaciswa noma incazelo kanye njengethempulethi, namasimu wamanani, izici namathegi, bese ugcwalisa kusuka ku-IFC evuliwe njenge-PDF noma idokhumenti ye-Word.","section":"tasks","order":35,"keywords":["idokhumenti","amadokhumenti","ukucaciswa","incazelo","ithempulethi","markdown","umbiko","word","docx","pdf","amanani","uhlu","ubuchwepheshe","uhlu lwezinyango","ukuqedwa","documentcad"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukubone","text":"Okufanele ukubone","level":2},{"id":"amasimu","text":"Amasimu","level":2},{"id":"ukucaciswa-nohlu-kwidokhumenti","text":"Ukucaciswa nohlu kwidokhumenti","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukwazi","text":"Okufanele ukwazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthempulethi ngumbhalo ku-Markdown onezindawo zensimu ezingqeni ezimbili. I-BimCraft igcwalisa lezi zindawo kusuka kumodeli evuliwe (izinombolo, amanani ngohlobo, izici, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/tags-and-schedules\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/tags-and-schedules\"\u003Eamathegi\u003C/a\u003E akho) bese igcina umphumela njenge-PDF, idokhumenti ye-Word (.docx) noma Markdown.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula imodeli ye-IFC.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmanani\u003C/span\u003E ohlangothini lwesobunxele, vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmadokhumenti kusuka kumodeli\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha ithempulethi: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIminyango nezinsimbi\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdonga, izinhlangothi nokuqedwa\u003C/span\u003E, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayisha ithempulethi (.md)…\u003C/span\u003E eyakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma ithempulethi ifunda amathegi imodeli engakachazi, cofa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza amathegi alesi thempulethi\u003C/span\u003E, bese uthegi izakhi ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmathegi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShintsha umbhalo njengoba ufuna bese ucofa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa idokhumenti\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECofa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF\u003C/span\u003E (khetha i-A4 noma i-Letter kuqala) noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWord (.docx)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukubone\"\u003EOkufanele ukubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIdokhumenti egcwalisiwe ngaphansi kwezinkinobho, namathebula ayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUhlu lwezexwayiso uma insimu ingafundeki (ithegi elingachazwanga, impahla imodeli engayinaki, ibhulokhi engavalwa): insimu enjalo iphrintwa njenge-\u003Ccode\u003E[?…]\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmakhasi e-PDF anesihloko sedokhumenti nombhalo othi &quot;Ikhasi 1 kwezi-3&quot; ezansi kwekhasi ngalinye; amathebula amade aqhubeka nomugqa wawo wekhanda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amasimu\"\u003EAmasimu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInsimu\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInikeza\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{{project}}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{{project description}}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{{file}}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{{date}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eigama leprojekthi nencazelo yayo, igama lefayela, namuhla\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{{count IfcDoor}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Einani lezinyango\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{{sum IfcWall NetSideArea}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eisamba, neyunithi yaso\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{{calc [sum IfcWall NetSideArea] * 1.1 round 1 unit m²}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eizibalo (\u003Ccode\u003E+ - * /\u003C/code\u003E nezakhiwo) phezu kwamagama phakathi kwezikwele: \u003Ccode\u003E[sum …]\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E[count …]\u003C/code\u003E, nangaphakathi kwe-each \u003Ccode\u003E[qty Width]\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Ccode\u003Eround n\u003C/code\u003E isetha izinombolo zamashumi, \u003Ccode\u003Eunit\u003C/code\u003E yengeza iyunithi. Okungafundeki, noma ukuhlukanisa ngo-zero, kuphrinta \u003Ccode\u003E[?…]\u003C/code\u003E futhi kuxwayise\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{{qty IfcWall NetSideArea by Type}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eithebula: umugqa ngamunye ngohlobo nenani lawo nesamba, nomugqa wesamba\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{{table IfcDoor cols Mark, Type, Width, tag:Fire rating}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eithebula, umugqa ngamunye ngesakhi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{{tag Finish}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eekuphindeni, inani lesakhi; kwenye indawo, zonke izinani ezisetshenzisiwe (Oak, Paint)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{{tags}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eizincazelo zamathegi njengethebula\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{{#each IfcDoor}} … {{else}} … {{/each}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eumbhalo kanye ngesakhi ngasinye; ingxenye ngemva kwe-\u003Ccode\u003E{{else}}\u003C/code\u003E uma kungekho lutho\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{{#group IfcWall by Type}} … {{/group}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eumbhalo kanye ngohlobo, nezi-\u003Ccode\u003E{{value}}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{{count}}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{{sum Length}}\u003C/code\u003E nokuphindwa okuvamile kwe-\u003Ccode\u003E{{#each}}\u003C/code\u003E ngaphakathi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPhakathi kwe-\u003Ccode\u003E{{#each}}\u003C/code\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003E{{name}}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{{type}}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{{storey}}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{{class}}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{{material}}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{{mark}}\u003C/code\u003E (i-IFC Tag), \u003Ccode\u003E{{guid}}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{{n}}\u003C/code\u003E (1, 2, 3 …), \u003Ccode\u003E{{prop Pset_DoorCommon.FireRating}}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{{qty Width}}\u003C/code\u003E (eyakhe, nayo iyunithi).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUhlobo lungaba ngaphezu kwelilodwa (\u003Ccode\u003EIfcDoor|IfcWindow\u003C/code\u003E) noma zonke izakhi (\u003Ccode\u003E*\u003C/code\u003E). Yincisha nganoma yiliphi ngo-\u003Ccode\u003Ewhere\u003C/code\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003E{{#each IfcDoor where Fire rating &gt;= 60}}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{{count IfcWall where Wall finish hasnot}}\u003C/code\u003E. Izivivinyo yi-\u003Ccode\u003E=\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E!=\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E~\u003C/code\u003E (iqukethe), \u003Ccode\u003E&gt;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E&gt;=\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;=\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ehas\u003C/code\u003E no-\u003Ccode\u003Ehasnot\u003C/code\u003E; xhuma okuningi nge-\u003Ccode\u003Eand\u003C/code\u003E; faka inani elinezikhala phakathi kwezinkomba ezithi &quot;quotes&quot;. \u003Ccode\u003Esort Name\u003C/code\u003E ihlela ilophu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukucaciswa-nohlu-kwidokhumenti\"\u003EUkucaciswa nohlu kwidokhumenti\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{{schedule doors}}\u003C/code\u003E iphrinta uhlu lwemodeli njengethebula, ngolayout yakho yehhovisi: \u003Ccode\u003Edoors\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ewindows\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ewalls\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Erooms\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efloors\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eroomfinishes\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ewallfinishes\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ezonefinishes\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efinishtotals\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Elayers\u003C/code\u003E, noma igama lesethi oyigcine kuUhlu. \u003Ccode\u003E{{specification}}\u003C/code\u003E iphrinta ukucaciswa kweprojekthi. Amathempulethi \u003Cstrong\u003EUhlu lwemidwebo yokusebenza\u003C/strong\u003E no-\u003Cstrong\u003EUkucaciswa\u003C/strong\u003E eziwasebenzisa. Kwi-preview, cofa inombolo yohlu lwalolu hlobo ukuze ukhethe izakhi ezivela kuzo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/schedule-layouts\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/schedule-layouts\"\u003EHlela, gcina futhi uthumele uhlu\u003C/a\u003E no \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/specification\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/specification\"\u003EBhala ukucaciswa kusuka kumodeli\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukwazi\"\u003EOkufanele ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInsimu ibiza isakhiwo esakhelwe ngaphambili (Name, Type, Storey, Class, Material, Mark), ithegi (\u003Ccode\u003Etag:Fire rating\u003C/code\u003E, noma igama lalo), izimfanelo (\u003Ccode\u003EPset_WallCommon.FireRating\u003C/code\u003E) noma nje igama lesimfanelo (\u003Ccode\u003ENetSideArea\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EWidth\u003C/code\u003E): igama elilodwa lifunda isethi yesakhi ngasinye, izethi zobukhulu kuqala, ngakho \u003Ccode\u003EWidth\u003C/code\u003E kumnyango kubububanzi bomnyango, hhayi ukuqina kodonga. Ngaphakathi kwe-\u003Ccode\u003Ewhere\u003C/code\u003E, igama elilodwa lifunda isethi abaningi bezakhi ezikhethiwe abayinayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinombolo ziwukuthi amafayela wesethi wamanani athini (i-BimCraft iwabhalela lokho ayidwetshile); iyunithi ivela ezilungiselelweni zeyunithi zefayela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmagama wensimu (\u003Ccode\u003Ecount\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Esum\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eqty\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eby\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ecols\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ewhere\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eeach\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Egroup\u003C/code\u003E …) ahlala esiNgisini kuzo zonke izilimi. Amathempulethi wesampula asesiNgisini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmbhalo ovela kumodeli awuphenduki ukwakheka: igama elinendondo \u003Ccode\u003E*\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E|\u003C/code\u003E liphrintwa njengoba kunjalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGcina ithempulethi oyishintshile nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGcina kulesi siphequluli\u003C/span\u003E (lolu siphequluli kuphela lunayo) noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhipha ithempulethi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmbhalo we-PDF usebenzisa amafonti ajwayelekile we-PDF: uhlamvu olungaphandle kombhalo waseNtshonalanga Yurophu luphrintwa njenge-&quot;?&quot;, nomugqa wesimo uyatshela ukuthi luningi kangaki.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmathempulethi ngohlobo ngalunye atholakala kuMtapo (uhlobo Document template). Ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmadokhumenti kusuka kumodeli\u003C/span\u003E, khetha Kusuka Emtapweni…, khetha eyodwa, umbhalo wayo namathegi ayifundayo angena; yihlele njengoba ufuna. Ukushicilela ithempulethi yakho emtapweni kuyinkinga efanayo yokulayisha njengezinye izinto. Akukakhiwa okungaphezu kokubala nezinani: izinani nesamba kuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Ithempulethi ngumbhalo ku-Markdown onezindawo zensimu ezingqeni ezimbili. I-BimCraft igcwalisa lezi zindawo kusuka kumodeli evuliwe (izinombolo, amanani ngohlobo, izici, amathegi akho) bese igcina umphumela njenge-PDF, idokhumenti ye-Word (.docx) noma Markdown. Izinyathelo Vula imodeli ye-IFC. Ngaphansi kwe-Amanani ohlangothini lwesobunxele, vula Amadokhumenti kusuka kumodeli. Khetha ithempulethi: Iminyango nezinsimbi noma Odonga, izinhlangothi nokuqedwa, noma Layisha ithempulethi (.md)… eyakho. Uma ithempulethi ifunda amathegi imodeli engakachazi, cofa Engeza amathegi alesi thempulethi, bese uthegi izakhi ngaphansi kwe-Amathegi. Shintsha umbhalo njengoba ufuna bese ucofa Bonisa idokhumenti. Cofa PDF (khetha i-A4 noma i-Letter kuqala) noma Word (.docx). Okufanele ukubone Idokhumenti egcwalisiwe ngaphansi kwezinkinobho, namathebula ayo. Uhlu lwezexwayiso uma insimu ingafundeki (ithegi elingachazwanga, impahla imodeli engayinaki, ibhulokhi engavalwa): insimu enjalo iphrintwa njenge-[?…]. Amakhasi e-PDF anesihloko sedokhumenti nombhalo othi \"Ikhasi 1 kwezi-3\" ezansi kwekhasi ngalinye; amathebula amade aqhubeka nomugqa wawo wekhanda. Amasimu Insimu Inikeza {{project}}, {{project description}}, {{file}}, {{date}} igama leprojekthi nencazelo yayo, igama lefayela, namuhla {{count IfcDoor}} inani lezinyango {{sum IfcWall NetSideArea}} isamba, neyunithi yaso {{calc [sum IfcWall NetSideArea] * 1.1 round 1 unit m²}} izibalo (+ - * / nezakhiwo) phezu kwamagama phakathi kwezikwele: [sum …], [count …], nangaphakathi kwe-each [qty Width]. round n isetha izinombolo zamashumi, unit yengeza iyunithi. Okungafundeki, noma ukuhlukanisa ngo-zero, kuphrinta [?…] futhi kuxwayise {{qty IfcWall NetSideArea by Type}} ithebula: umugqa ngamunye ngohlobo nenani lawo nesamba, nomugqa wesamba {{table IfcDoor cols Mark, Type, Width, tag:Fire rating}} ithebula, umugqa ngamunye ngesakhi {{tag Finish}} ekuphindeni, inani lesakhi; kwenye indawo, zonke izinani ezisetshenzisiwe (Oak, Paint) {{tags}} izincazelo zamathegi njengethebula {{#each IfcDoor}} … {{else}} … {{/each}} umbhalo kanye ngesakhi ngasinye; ingxenye ngemva kwe-{{else}} uma kungekho lutho {{#group IfcWall by Type}} … {{/group}} umbhalo kanye ngohlobo, nezi-{{value}}, {{count}}, {{sum Length}} nokuphindwa okuvamile kwe-{{#each}} ngaphakathi Phakathi kwe-{{#each}}: {{name}}, {{type}}, {{storey}}, {{class}}, {{material}}, {{mark}} (i-IFC Tag), {{guid}}, {{n}} (1, 2, 3 …), {{prop Pset_DoorCommon.FireRating}}, {{qty Width}} (eyakhe, nayo iyunithi). Uhlobo lungaba ngaphezu kwelilodwa (IfcDoor|IfcWindow) noma zonke izakhi (*). Yincisha nganoma yiliphi ngo-where: {{#each IfcDoor where Fire rating \u003E= 60}}, {{count IfcWall where Wall finish hasnot}}. Izivivinyo yi-=, !=, ~ (iqukethe), \u003E, \u003C, \u003E=, \u003C=, has no-hasnot; xhuma okuningi nge-and; faka inani elinezikhala phakathi kwezinkomba ezithi \"quotes\". sort Name ihlela ilophu. Ukucaciswa nohlu kwidokhumenti {{schedule doors}} iphrinta uhlu lwemodeli njengethebula, ngolayout yakho yehhovisi: doors, windows, walls, rooms, floors, roomfinishes, wallfinishes, zonefinishes, finishtotals, layers, noma igama lesethi oyigcine kuUhlu. {{specification}} iphrinta ukucaciswa kweprojekthi. Amathempulethi Uhlu lwemidwebo yokusebenza no-Ukucaciswa eziwasebenzisa. Kwi-preview, cofa inombolo yohlu lwalolu hlobo ukuze ukhethe izakhi ezivela kuzo. Bona Hlela, gcina futhi uthumele uhlu no Bhala ukucaciswa kusuka kumodeli. Okufanele ukwazi Insimu ibiza isakhiwo esakhelwe ngaphambili (Name, Type, Storey, Class, Material, Mark), ithegi (tag:Fire rating, noma igama lalo), izimfanelo (Pset_WallCommon.FireRating) noma nje igama lesimfanelo (NetSideArea, Width): igama elilodwa lifunda isethi yesakhi ngasinye, izethi zobukhulu kuqala, ngakho Width kumnyango kubububanzi bomnyango, hhayi ukuqina kodonga. Ngaphakathi kwe-where, igama elilodwa lifunda isethi abaningi bezakhi ezikhethiwe abayinayo. Izinombolo ziwukuthi amafayela wesethi wamanani athini (i-BimCraft iwabhalela lokho ayidwetshile); iyunithi ivela ezilungiselelweni zeyunithi zefayela. Amagama wensimu (count, sum, qty, by, cols, where, each, group …) ahlala esiNgisini kuzo zonke izilimi. Amathempulethi wesampula asesiNgisini. Umbhalo ovela kumodeli awuphenduki ukwakheka: igama elinendondo * noma | liphrintwa njengoba kunjalo. Gcina ithempulethi oyishintshile nge-Gcina kulesi siphequluli (lolu siphequluli kuphela lunayo) noma Khipha ithempulethi. Umbhalo we-PDF usebenzisa amafonti ajwayelekile we-PDF: uhlamvu olungaphandle kombhalo waseNtshonalanga Yurophu luphrintwa njenge-\"?\", nomugqa wesimo uyatshela ukuthi luningi kangaki. Amathempulethi ngohlobo ngalunye atholakala kuMtapo (uhlobo Document template). Ku-Amadokhumenti kusuka kumodeli, khetha Kusuka Emtapweni…, khetha eyodwa, umbhalo wayo namathegi ayifundayo angena; yihlele njengoba ufuna. Ukushicilela ithempulethi yakho emtapweni kuyinkinga efanayo yokulayisha njengezinye izinto. Akukakhiwa okungaphezu kokubala nezinani: izinani nesamba kuphela.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"place-an-elevation","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Faka ukubukeka kohlangothi bese uvula umbono wakho","summary":"Beka uphawu lokubukeka kohlangothi epulanini lomgangatho, liqondise ngendlela okubukeka ngayo, bese uthola umdwebo waso ku-project browser, uhlele kuwo futhi uwubeke esheetini. Izinyathelo zamalayawudi eribhoni nezelayawudi yakudala.","section":"tasks","order":35,"keywords":["ukubukeka kohlangothi","ukubuka kohlangothi","uphawu lokubukeka kohlangothi","ithegi yokubukeka kohlangothi","faka ukubukeka kohlangothi","ukubukeka okusha","yenza ukubukeka kohlangothi","ukubukeka kwangaphandle","ukubuka kwangaphambili","ukubuka kusuka kuphoyinti","ukubukeka kwami kuphi","vula ukubukeka kohlangothi","ukubukeka esheetini","guqula ukubukeka kohlangothi","ukubukeka kwenyakatho","ukwabelana ngombono","ukwahlukanisa kombono","ipulani ne-3D ecaleni kwenye"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"lapho-ithuluzi-likhona","text":"Lapho ithuluzi likhona","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"vula-umdwebo","text":"Vula umdwebo","level":2},{"id":"okubonisa-ukubuka","text":"Okubonisa ukubuka","level":2},{"id":"shintsha-kona","text":"Shintsha kona","level":2},{"id":"imikhawulo","text":"Imikhawulo","level":2},{"id":"ku-ifc","text":"Ku-IFC","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYenza ukubukeka kohlangothi lwakho: umdwebo wesakhiwo obonwa usuka kuphoyinti okhethile, ubheke ngendlela okhetha ngayo. Kuthatha ukuchofoza kabili epulanini lomgangatho. Umdwebo ubhalwa ohlwini lokubukeka kohlangothi lwesakhiwo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinhlangothi ezine sezikhona. Sonke isakhiwo sinokubukeka Okusenyakatho, Okusempumalanga, Okusemaphakathini nokusentshonalanga ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsiphequluli sephrojekthi\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubukeka kohlangothi\u003C/span\u003E ngaphandle kokubeka lutho. Beka eyakho uma ufuna ukubuka kwenye indawo: ngaqondile kwesiphambano esigxiwe, usuka ngaphakathi kwesikhala esingaphakathi, noma ubuke udonga oyedwa ngaphakathi kwegumbi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lapho-ithuluzi-likhona\"\u003ELapho ithuluzi likhona\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmalayawudi eribhoni: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubuka\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EDala\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuphakama\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIlayawudi yakudala: vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDweba\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkwakhiwa\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuphakama\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENoma yisiphi isitayela semenyu: umyalo ubizwa ngokuthi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuphakama\u003C/span\u003E; ipharetha yomyalo iyawuthola, futhi umugqa womyalo uwubiza ngokuthi ELEVATION.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuphakama\u003C/span\u003E. Ukubukeka kohlangothi kubekwa epulanini lomgangatho, ngakho uma wawusembonweni we-3D i-BimCraft ikhombisa ipulani lesitezi owawusesitezini. Umcibisholo uthi \u003Cstrong\u003EChofoza lapho ukubukeka kuma khona\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza lapho umbono uthathwa khona. Ukubukeka kwangaphandle, chofoza ngaphandle kwesakhiwo, kancane kude nodonga ofuna ukulubona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmcibisholo manje uthi \u003Cstrong\u003EChofoza indlela okubukeka ngayo\u003C/strong\u003E. Sondela esakhiweni: umcibisholo ukhombisa indlela, nomugqa omfishane ophambi kokuchofoza kwakho kokuqala ungumphetho okubukwa kuwo. Chofoza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIpharetha enenombolo nentonga ivela epulanini. Leyo ngophawu lokubukeka kohlangothi. Okokuqala ngu-1, okulandelayo ngu-2.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela Esc ukuqeda, noma uqhubeke ubeke elinye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkubeka uphawu kuyinyathelo elilodwa: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyasihlehlisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vula-umdwebo\"\u003EVula umdwebo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIpulani lisahlala phambi kwakho ngemva kokuchofoza kwesibili. Umdwebo usesi-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsiphequluli sephrojekthi\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubukeka kohlangothi\u003C/span\u003E. Okwakho kubhalwa ngemuva kwezinhlangothi ezine njenge-\u003Cstrong\u003EElevation 1\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza inkinobho yepeni \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlela kulokhu kubuka\u003C/span\u003E emgqeni wayo ukuze ubone umdwebo usebenze kuwo: hambisa izindonga, iminyango, amawindi namazinga, engeze amanothi nezilinganiso. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/edit-in-elevations\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/edit-in-elevations\"\u003EHlela kumabukeko kohlangothi nakuma-section\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza umgqa uqobo ukuze uvule isethi yomdwebo, noma engeze umbono esheetini yakho. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/views-and-sheets\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/views-and-sheets\"\u003EImibono namashidi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKwelayawudi yakudala, i-project browser isendaweni yangakwesobunxele uma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDweba\u003C/span\u003E livuliwe. Kumalayawudi eribhoni, yithebhu ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsiphequluli sephrojekthi\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwe-Izici.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okubonisa-ukubuka\"\u003EOkubonisa ukubuka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKonke okuphambi kophawu, kuze kube sekufinyeleleni kwesakhiwo. Akukho okungemuva kwalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmazinga, amagama wawo nokuphakama kwawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma uphawu lumi phakathi kwesakhiwo, noma yini ilapho imi ikhishwa khona, njengoba i-section iyisika. Ukuze uthole ukubukeka okucacile kwangaphandle, mi ngaphandle.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shintsha-kona\"\u003EShintsha kona\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha uphawu epulanini (chofoza isiyingi salo nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha\u003C/span\u003E). Ku-Properties kukhona:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIlebula\u003C/span\u003E: inombolo yalo noma igama lakho, kuze kube izinhlamvu ezingu-8.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuqula ukubuka\u003C/span\u003E: bheka ngendlela ephambene kusuka endaweni efanayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBheka kuze kube\u003C/span\u003E: ukubuka kufinyelela kangakanani phambi kophawu. 0 ibonisa konke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECindezela Delete ukususa uphawu nomdwebo walo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlehlisa\u003C/span\u003E ibuyisela kokubili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze ubone ipulani kanye nombono we-3D ngesikhathi esisodwa uma usebenza, sebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubuka\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EAmawindi\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkwabelana ngombono\u003C/span\u003E emalayawudini eribhoni, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlukanisa\u003C/span\u003E kwelayawudi yakudala. Ukuchofoza ithebhu yombono kubuyisela kombono oyedwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imikhawulo\"\u003EImikhawulo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUphawu alukakwazi ukudonswa noma lujikeleze epulanini okwamanje. Lisuse bese ulibeka futhi, noma sebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuqula ukubuka\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOhlwini lwemibono ongayengeza esheetini, ukubukeka kohlangothi lwakho luhlelwa kanye namasekhishini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmathegi wemisindo nowezifasiteli adwetshwa ezinhlangothini ezine zesakhiwo, hhayi kolunye ohlangothi olubekiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-ifc\"\u003EKu-IFC\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUphawu lugcinwa efayeleni njenge-IfcAnnotation enegama elithi &quot;Elevation 1&quot; nohlobo lwento &quot;Elevation marker&quot;, esitezini lapho lwabekwa khona. Olunye uhlelo lubonisa njengesichazi; umdwebo ngokwawo wenziwa yi-BimCraft kusukela emodelini njalo.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Yenza ukubukeka kohlangothi lwakho: umdwebo wesakhiwo obonwa usuka kuphoyinti okhethile, ubheke ngendlela okhetha ngayo. Kuthatha ukuchofoza kabili epulanini lomgangatho. Umdwebo ubhalwa ohlwini lokubukeka kohlangothi lwesakhiwo. Izinhlangothi ezine sezikhona. Sonke isakhiwo sinokubukeka Okusenyakatho, Okusempumalanga, Okusemaphakathini nokusentshonalanga ku-Isiphequluli sephrojekthi ngaphansi kwe-Ukubukeka kohlangothi ngaphandle kokubeka lutho. Beka eyakho uma ufuna ukubuka kwenye indawo: ngaqondile kwesiphambano esigxiwe, usuka ngaphakathi kwesikhala esingaphakathi, noma ubuke udonga oyedwa ngaphakathi kwegumbi. Lapho ithuluzi likhona Amalayawudi eribhoni: Ukubuka › Dala › Ukuphakama. Ilayawudi yakudala: vula Dweba, bese Ukwakhiwa › Ukuphakama. Noma yisiphi isitayela semenyu: umyalo ubizwa ngokuthi Ukuphakama; ipharetha yomyalo iyawuthola, futhi umugqa womyalo uwubiza ngokuthi ELEVATION. Izinyathelo Khetha Ukuphakama. Ukubukeka kohlangothi kubekwa epulanini lomgangatho, ngakho uma wawusembonweni we-3D i-BimCraft ikhombisa ipulani lesitezi owawusesitezini. Umcibisholo uthi Chofoza lapho ukubukeka kuma khona. Chofoza lapho umbono uthathwa khona. Ukubukeka kwangaphandle, chofoza ngaphandle kwesakhiwo, kancane kude nodonga ofuna ukulubona. Umcibisholo manje uthi Chofoza indlela okubukeka ngayo. Sondela esakhiweni: umcibisholo ukhombisa indlela, nomugqa omfishane ophambi kokuchofoza kwakho kokuqala ungumphetho okubukwa kuwo. Chofoza. Ipharetha enenombolo nentonga ivela epulanini. Leyo ngophawu lokubukeka kohlangothi. Okokuqala ngu-1, okulandelayo ngu-2. Cindezela Esc ukuqeda, noma uqhubeke ubeke elinye. Ukubeka uphawu kuyinyathelo elilodwa: Ctrl+Z iyasihlehlisa. Vula umdwebo Ipulani lisahlala phambi kwakho ngemva kokuchofoza kwesibili. Umdwebo usesi-Isiphequluli sephrojekthi: Vula Ukubukeka kohlangothi. Okwakho kubhalwa ngemuva kwezinhlangothi ezine njenge-Elevation 1. Chofoza inkinobho yepeni Hlela kulokhu kubuka emgqeni wayo ukuze ubone umdwebo usebenze kuwo: hambisa izindonga, iminyango, amawindi namazinga, engeze amanothi nezilinganiso. Bona Hlela kumabukeko kohlangothi nakuma-section. Chofoza umgqa uqobo ukuze uvule isethi yomdwebo, noma engeze umbono esheetini yakho. Bona Imibono namashidi. Kwelayawudi yakudala, i-project browser isendaweni yangakwesobunxele uma Dweba livuliwe. Kumalayawudi eribhoni, yithebhu ethi Isiphequluli sephrojekthi ngaphansi kwe-Izici. Okubonisa ukubuka Konke okuphambi kophawu, kuze kube sekufinyeleleni kwesakhiwo. Akukho okungemuva kwalo. Amazinga, amagama wawo nokuphakama kwawo. Uma uphawu lumi phakathi kwesakhiwo, noma yini ilapho imi ikhishwa khona, njengoba i-section iyisika. Ukuze uthole ukubukeka okucacile kwangaphandle, mi ngaphandle. Shintsha kona Khetha uphawu epulanini (chofoza isiyingi salo nge-Khetha). Ku-Properties kukhona: Ilebula: inombolo yalo noma igama lakho, kuze kube izinhlamvu ezingu-8. Guqula ukubuka: bheka ngendlela ephambene kusuka endaweni efanayo. Bheka kuze kube: ukubuka kufinyelela kangakanani phambi kophawu. 0 ibonisa konke. Cindezela Delete ukususa uphawu nomdwebo walo. Hlehlisa ibuyisela kokubili. Ukuze ubone ipulani kanye nombono we-3D ngesikhathi esisodwa uma usebenza, sebenzisa Ukubuka › Amawindi › Ukwabelana ngombono emalayawudini eribhoni, noma Hlukanisa kwelayawudi yakudala. Ukuchofoza ithebhu yombono kubuyisela kombono oyedwa. Imikhawulo Uphawu alukakwazi ukudonswa noma lujikeleze epulanini okwamanje. Lisuse bese ulibeka futhi, noma sebenzisa Guqula ukubuka. Ohlwini lwemibono ongayengeza esheetini, ukubukeka kohlangothi lwakho luhlelwa kanye namasekhishini. Amathegi wemisindo nowezifasiteli adwetshwa ezinhlangothini ezine zesakhiwo, hhayi kolunye ohlangothi olubekiwe. Ku-IFC Uphawu lugcinwa efayeleni njenge-IfcAnnotation enegama elithi \"Elevation 1\" nohlobo lwento \"Elevation marker\", esitezini lapho lwabekwa khona. Olunye uhlelo lubonisa njengesichazi; umdwebo ngokwawo wenziwa yi-BimCraft kusukela emodelini njalo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"working-style","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Isitayela sokusebenza, imibono ephindaphindiwe, amapeni ephepheni, Bika njenge nezithempulethi","summary":"Khetha ukuthi i-BimCraft iziphatha kanjani ngendlela osebenza ngayo, phinda noma yiliphi ibuko njengekhophi yalo noma enxhunyiwe, gcina ukweqa kwamapeni efayelini bese uphrinta njengoba kubonakala noma ngethebula lamapeni, bika into njengenye ikilasi le-IFC, futhi uqale amaphrojekthi kuzithempulethi zakho.","section":"tasks","order":35,"keywords":["isitayela sokusebenza","phinda ibuko","phinda","kopisha ibuko","ibuko elixhunyiwe","ibuko lekhophi","ukweqa kwamapeni","amapeni","amagatsha omugqa","phrinta njengoba kubonakala","ithebula lamapeni","plot style","ctb","monochrome","grayscale","bika njenge","ikilasi le-ifc","qamba kabusha ikilasi","uhlobo olunqunyiwe","imodeli jikelele","islebhu njengomgwaqo","udonga njengephaneli","uphahla njengerempu","ithempulethi","ithempulethi yephrojekthi","londoloza njengethempulethi","qala kusuka kuthempulethi","izinga lehhovisi"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"khetha-isitayela-sokusebenza","text":"Khetha isitayela sokusebenza","level":2},{"id":"phinda-ibuko","text":"Phinda ibuko","level":2},{"id":"amapeni-ahlala-nebuko-aphrintwe-njengoba-kubonakala","text":"Amapeni ahlala nebuko, aphrintwe njengoba kubonakala","level":2},{"id":"bika-into-njengenye-ikilasi","text":"Bika into njengenye ikilasi","level":2},{"id":"londoloza-ipulojekthi-njengethempulethi-uqale-kuyo","text":"Londoloza ipulojekthi njengethempulethi, uqale kuyo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELungisa i-BimCraft ngendlela osebenza ngayo, phinda izibuko, uphrinte ngendlela olindele ngayo, bale izinto njengoba ziyizona ngempela, futhi uqale wonke amaphrojekthi kuthempulethi yehhovisi lakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khetha-isitayela-sokusebenza\"\u003EKhetha isitayela sokusebenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E bese uvula ithebhu ye-BimCraft. Thola \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsitayela sokusebenza\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha okukodwa:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbuko ngalinye lalo\u003C/span\u003E (okokuqala okukhethwayo): ibuko eliphindiwe likopisha izincazelo zalo futhi zihlala zalo lelo buko; amashidi aphrinta njengoba isikrini sibonisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzincazelo nemithebula yamapeni ezabelwanwayo\u003C/span\u003E: imibono ephindaphindiwe yabelana ngezincazelo; ukuphrinta kudlula kuthebula lamapeni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphansi kokukhethwa kukhona izinto ezine esizisethayo. Shintsha noma iyiphi kuzo kuyodwa; isitayela sese sifundeka njengo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwenziwe ngokwakho\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsitayela sokusebenza sigcinwa kulesi siphequluli, njengesakhiwo sewindi. Ithempulethi iyasithwala kumamodeli amasha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"phinda-ibuko\"\u003EPhinda ibuko\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsiphequluli sephrojekthi\u003C/span\u003E, yonke ipulani yesitezi, ipulani yesilingi, i-callout, ukubukeka kohlangothi nesigaba esinqunyiwe inenkinobho \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhinda\u003C/span\u003E (isithonjana samashidi amabili).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQamba ikhophi bese ukhetha ukuthi iziphatha kanjani:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIkhophi lalo\u003C/span\u003E: ukudweba kwalo, izilinganiso, ukusikwa, izinto ezifihliwe namapeni akopishelwa futhi ahlala ezalo. Ukuhlela noma yiliphi ibuko akusoze kushintshe elinye, ngakho ibuko ku-sheet esikhishiwe lihlala njengoba likhishwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEnxhunyiwe\u003C/span\u003E: ibonisa leli buko ngesethi eyodwa yezincazelo nezilungiselelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIkhophi ihlu ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImibono ephindaphindiwe\u003C/span\u003E. Chofoza ukuze uyivule; ibha ephezu kwepulani ithi iyikhophi, ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhezulu\u003C/span\u003E ibuyela kubuko bayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInkinobho yayo yesilayidi ivula izilungiselelo zayo: igama, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUbubanzi bokubuka\u003C/span\u003E (ikhophi lalo linalo lalo), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYenza ikhophi lalo\u003C/span\u003E ye-enxhunyiwe, kanye ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmakhophi ama-elevation nama-section ahamba kumashidi akho njengamabuko avela kuwo. Ukuphinda kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa, futhi amakhophi agcinwa ku-IFC ecaleni kwama-callout.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amapeni-ahlala-nebuko-aphrintwe-njengoba-kubonakala\"\u003EAmapeni ahlala nebuko, aphrintwe njengoba kubonakala\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDweba\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmapeni\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYa\u003C/span\u003E manje ihlu yonke imikhakha: udonga, iminyango namawindi, islebhu, uphahla, insika, izinyathelo, impahla nokunye, kanye nokudweba nezilinganiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESebenzisa\u003C/span\u003E igcina ipeni ku-IFC nebuko elibonisiwe: ipulani, ipulani yesilingi, i-callout noma ibuko eliphindiwe. Amapeni adalwe ngaphambi kwe-0.9 agcinwa esiphequluleni; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGcina lawa emafayelini\u003C/span\u003E awathutha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmashidi nePDF adweba ipeni ngalinye njengoba isikrini sikubonisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuphrinta ngethebula lamapeni kunalokho, setha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhrinta\u003C/span\u003E komugqa we-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmapeni\u003C/span\u003E ibe ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgethebula lamapeni\u003C/span\u003E, bese ukhetha ithebula (umbala, monochrome, grayscale) noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlela ithebula lamapeni…\u003C/span\u003E: umbala ngamunye uthola umbala, ububanzi nokufiphaza okuphrintwa ngakho. Ithebula liyifayela le-plot style ye-CadCraft, ngakho \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgenisa…\u003C/span\u003E ithatha ithebula elenziwe kwi-CadCraft app, futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E linikeza elinye. Imodeli igcina ukukhetha kwayo; uma lingekho, isitayela sokusebenza siyanquma.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bika-into-njengenye-ikilasi\"\u003EBika into njengenye ikilasi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInto edwetshwe njengomgwaqo, udonga oluyisebenzisa njengephaneli, uphahla oluyisimo serempu: gcina ithuluzi owayidwebe ngalo futhi uyibike njengalokho okuyikho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha into bese uvula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzici\u003C/span\u003E. Vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBika njenge\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThayipha ebhokisini lokusesha ukuze uthole ikilasi elihambisana nesimo, uyikhethe kanye nohlobo layo olunqunyiwe. Ohlobo lwakho, khetha USERDEFINED bese unikeza igama.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESebenzisa\u003C/span\u003E (isinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESula\u003C/span\u003E ibika kabusha njengoba yadwetshwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUsahlela ngethuluzi owayidwebe ngalo. I-IFC egciniwe ibhala njengekilasi elibikiwe, ngakho ezinye izinhlelo, ukubala kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmanani\u003C/span\u003E, Thola, Umbala ngokwe-Color by, ukuhlolwa kwemodeli nezi-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinkinga\u003C/span\u003E kuyibala njengalo. Izinhlu zisusa udonga obikwe njengephaneli ohlwini lwezindonga, futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinto ngekilasi elibikiwe\u003C/span\u003E zidweba zonke. Lokhu kusebenza kumafayela e-IFC4 ne-IFC2X3; uhlu luphakamisa kuphela amakilasi enguqulo ye-IFC yefayela. Iminyango, amawindi, izinyathelo, amagumbi namazinga kugcina amakilasi awo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"londoloza-ipulojekthi-njengethempulethi-uqale-kuyo\"\u003ELondoloza ipulojekthi njengethempulethi, uqale kuyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgephrojekthi evulekile, chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza njengethempulethi\u003C/span\u003E eceleni kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQamba igama. Khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELanda nefayela lethempulethi\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uyabelane ngalo njengefayela le-IFC, no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQala amamodeli amasha kuyo\u003C/span\u003E ukuze ube yidifolt yakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIthempulethi igcina amazinga, izithempulethi zokubuka nezilungiselelo zokubuka, imibono ephindaphindiwe nezibizo, ukudweba, amapeni nethebula lamapeni, amathegi, imindeni nezinhlobo, amashidi, usayizi wamashidi, amablokhi wesihloko nesitayela sokusebenza. Udonga, amaphansi, iminyango nazo zonke ezinye izinto zemodeli ziyashiywa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsakhiwo esisha\u003C/span\u003E bese uyikhetha ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQala kusuka\u003C/span\u003E, noma khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfayela lethempulethi…\u003C/span\u003E ethile okuthunyelwe kuwe. Iphrojekthi entsha ithola igama layo nesazisi sayo sephrojekthi; konke okunye kuyofana nakuthempulethi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzithempulethi zigcinwa kulesi siphequluli. Izithempulethi zethimba ezabelwana nge-CadCraft Studio azikakwakhiwa kahle: thumela ifayela lethempulethi esikhundleni salo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Lungisa i-BimCraft ngendlela osebenza ngayo, phinda izibuko, uphrinte ngendlela olindele ngayo, bale izinto njengoba ziyizona ngempela, futhi uqale wonke amaphrojekthi kuthempulethi yehhovisi lakho. Khetha isitayela sokusebenza Vula Izilungiselelo bese uvula ithebhu ye-BimCraft. Thola Isitayela sokusebenza. Khetha okukodwa: Ibuko ngalinye lalo (okokuqala okukhethwayo): ibuko eliphindiwe likopisha izincazelo zalo futhi zihlala zalo lelo buko; amashidi aphrinta njengoba isikrini sibonisa. Izincazelo nemithebula yamapeni ezabelwanwayo: imibono ephindaphindiwe yabelana ngezincazelo; ukuphrinta kudlula kuthebula lamapeni. Ngaphansi kokukhethwa kukhona izinto ezine esizisethayo. Shintsha noma iyiphi kuzo kuyodwa; isitayela sese sifundeka njengo-Okwenziwe ngokwakho. Isitayela sokusebenza sigcinwa kulesi siphequluli, njengesakhiwo sewindi. Ithempulethi iyasithwala kumamodeli amasha. Phinda ibuko Ku-Isiphequluli sephrojekthi, yonke ipulani yesitezi, ipulani yesilingi, i-callout, ukubukeka kohlangothi nesigaba esinqunyiwe inenkinobho Phinda (isithonjana samashidi amabili). Qamba ikhophi bese ukhetha ukuthi iziphatha kanjani: Ikhophi lalo: ukudweba kwalo, izilinganiso, ukusikwa, izinto ezifihliwe namapeni akopishelwa futhi ahlala ezalo. Ukuhlela noma yiliphi ibuko akusoze kushintshe elinye, ngakho ibuko ku-sheet esikhishiwe lihlala njengoba likhishwe. Enxhunyiwe: ibonisa leli buko ngesethi eyodwa yezincazelo nezilungiselelo. Ikhophi ihlu ngaphansi kwe-Imibono ephindaphindiwe. Chofoza ukuze uyivule; ibha ephezu kwepulani ithi iyikhophi, ne-Phezulu ibuyela kubuko bayo. Inkinobho yayo yesilayidi ivula izilungiselelo zayo: igama, Ububanzi bokubuka (ikhophi lalo linalo lalo), Yenza ikhophi lalo ye-enxhunyiwe, kanye ne-Susa. Amakhophi ama-elevation nama-section ahamba kumashidi akho njengamabuko avela kuwo. Ukuphinda kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa, futhi amakhophi agcinwa ku-IFC ecaleni kwama-callout. Amapeni ahlala nebuko, aphrintwe njengoba kubonakala Vula Dweba bese ukhetha Amapeni. Ya manje ihlu yonke imikhakha: udonga, iminyango namawindi, islebhu, uphahla, insika, izinyathelo, impahla nokunye, kanye nokudweba nezilinganiso. Sebenzisa igcina ipeni ku-IFC nebuko elibonisiwe: ipulani, ipulani yesilingi, i-callout noma ibuko eliphindiwe. Amapeni adalwe ngaphambi kwe-0.9 agcinwa esiphequluleni; Gcina lawa emafayelini awathutha. Amashidi nePDF adweba ipeni ngalinye njengoba isikrini sikubonisa. Ukuphrinta ngethebula lamapeni kunalokho, setha Phrinta komugqa we-Amapeni ibe ku-Ngethebula lamapeni, bese ukhetha ithebula (umbala, monochrome, grayscale) noma Hlela ithebula lamapeni…: umbala ngamunye uthola umbala, ububanzi nokufiphaza okuphrintwa ngakho. Ithebula liyifayela le-plot style ye-CadCraft, ngakho Ngenisa… ithatha ithebula elenziwe kwi-CadCraft app, futhi Thumela linikeza elinye. Imodeli igcina ukukhetha kwayo; uma lingekho, isitayela sokusebenza siyanquma. Bika into njengenye ikilasi Into edwetshwe njengomgwaqo, udonga oluyisebenzisa njengephaneli, uphahla oluyisimo serempu: gcina ithuluzi owayidwebe ngalo futhi uyibike njengalokho okuyikho. Khetha into bese uvula Izici. Vula Bika njenge. Thayipha ebhokisini lokusesha ukuze uthole ikilasi elihambisana nesimo, uyikhethe kanye nohlobo layo olunqunyiwe. Ohlobo lwakho, khetha USERDEFINED bese unikeza igama. Sebenzisa (isinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa). Sula ibika kabusha njengoba yadwetshwa. Usahlela ngethuluzi owayidwebe ngalo. I-IFC egciniwe ibhala njengekilasi elibikiwe, ngakho ezinye izinhlelo, ukubala kwe-Amanani, Thola, Umbala ngokwe-Color by, ukuhlolwa kwemodeli nezi-Izinkinga kuyibala njengalo. Izinhlu zisusa udonga obikwe njengephaneli ohlwini lwezindonga, futhi Izinto ngekilasi elibikiwe zidweba zonke. Lokhu kusebenza kumafayela e-IFC4 ne-IFC2X3; uhlu luphakamisa kuphela amakilasi enguqulo ye-IFC yefayela. Iminyango, amawindi, izinyathelo, amagumbi namazinga kugcina amakilasi awo. Londoloza ipulojekthi njengethempulethi, uqale kuyo Ngephrojekthi evulekile, chofoza Londoloza njengethempulethi eceleni kwe-Londoloza. Qamba igama. Khetha Landa nefayela lethempulethi ukuze uyabelane ngalo njengefayela le-IFC, no-Qala amamodeli amasha kuyo ukuze ube yidifolt yakho. Ithempulethi igcina amazinga, izithempulethi zokubuka nezilungiselelo zokubuka, imibono ephindaphindiwe nezibizo, ukudweba, amapeni nethebula lamapeni, amathegi, imindeni nezinhlobo, amashidi, usayizi wamashidi, amablokhi wesihloko nesitayela sokusebenza. Udonga, amaphansi, iminyango nazo zonke ezinye izinto zemodeli ziyashiywa. Chofoza Isakhiwo esisha bese uyikhetha ngaphansi kwe-Qala kusuka, noma khetha Ifayela lethempulethi… ethile okuthunyelwe kuwe. Iphrojekthi entsha ithola igama layo nesazisi sayo sephrojekthi; konke okunye kuyofana nakuthempulethi. Izithempulethi zigcinwa kulesi siphequluli. Izithempulethi zethimba ezabelwana nge-CadCraft Studio azikakwakhiwa kahle: thumela ifayela lethempulethi esikhundleni salo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"areas-and-area-boundaries","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Izindawo nemikhawulo yezindawo","summary":"Linganisa indawo ephelele yesakhiwo noma indawo ethengiswayo ngaphakathi kwemigqa emikhawulo oyidwetshayo noma oyithatha kwizindonga, bese ulanda izindawo ohlwini lohlu.","section":"tasks","order":35,"keywords":["indawo","izindawo","umkhawulo wendawo","uhlelo lwendawo","indawo ephelele yesakhiwo","indawo ephelele yomgangatho","gfa","ethengiswayo","ipulani yendawo","uhlu lwezindawo","khetha izindonga","akuvalekile"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"lapho-kukhona-amathuluzi","text":"Lapho kukhona amathuluzi","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okulandelayo","text":"Okulandelayo","level":2},{"id":"uma-imikhawulo-ingavali","text":"Uma imikhawulo ingavali","level":2},{"id":"uhlu","text":"Uhlu","level":2},{"id":"ku-ifc","text":"Ku-IFC","level":2},{"id":"akukakwakhiwa","text":"Akukakwakhiwa","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDweba imikhawulo yohlelo lwendawo, beka izindawo ngaphakathi kwayo, bese ufunda izinhlanganisela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lapho-kukhona-amathuluzi\"\u003ELapho kukhona amathuluzi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzakhiwo zeribhoni: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArchitecture\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EIgumbi nendawo\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea Boundary\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsakhiwo sakudala: ibha yokudweba › imenyu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERooms\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea Boundary\u003C/span\u003E. Ku-row khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScheme\u003C/span\u003E: Indawo ephelele yesakhiwo noma Ethengiswayo. Uhlelo ngalunye lunemikhawulo yalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha indlela yokwenza imigqa ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMake by\u003C/span\u003E:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDweba\u003C/strong\u003E: chofoza iphoyinti ngelinye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKhetha izindonga: umugqa wephakathi\u003C/strong\u003E: chofoza udonga, umugqa waphakathi walo ube umkhawulo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKhetha izindonga: ubuso obuchofoziwe\u003C/strong\u003E: chofoza udonga ohlangothini ofuna ukuba khona; lobo buso bube umkhawulo. Ye-indawo ephelele yesakhiwo chofoza ngaphandle kwezindonga zangaphandle.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E. Khetha uhlelo olufanayo, thayipha igama, inombolo noma uhlobo uma ufisa, bese uchofoza ngaphakathi kwemikhawulo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIndawo ilinganiswa masinyane. Yikhethe ukuze uguqule igama, inombolo noma uhlobo ku-Izakhiwo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulandelayo\"\u003EOkulandelayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmkhawulo owenziwe ngokukhetha udonga uyalandela leyo ndonga: hambisa udonga bese indawo ilinganiswa futhi ngesinyathelo esifanayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmkhawulo owudwetshile uhlala lapho wawudwetshe khona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinhlangothi zezindonga ezihlangana ekhoneni nazo zihlangana khona, ngakho izindonga ezine ezikhethiwe zivala indawo ngaphandle kwezikhala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImikhawulo yezindawo ibonakala epulanini uma isithuluzi segumbi noma sendawo sisesandleni sakho, ukuze ingavimbi ipulani esikhathini esisele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uma-imikhawulo-ingavali\"\u003EUma imikhawulo ingavali\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIndawo isabekwa. Ibhala \u003Cstrong\u003EAkuvalekile\u003C/strong\u003E futhi ayilinganisi lutho uze imikhawulo ivale yonke. Lesi iseluleko: akukho okunqatshelwayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uhlu\"\u003EUhlu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIpaneli yesobunxele › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESchedules\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EIzindawo\u003C/strong\u003E: uhlelo, inombolo, igama, uhlobo, izinga, indawo nesibungu, nesamba. Ukuchofoza umugqa kukhetha indawo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDownload CSV\u003C/span\u003E inikeza ithebula elifanayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-ifc\"\u003EKu-IFC\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIndawo iyi-IfcSpace engenayo umzimba: PredefinedType GFA ohlelweni lwendawo ephelele yesakhiwo, USERDEFINED ne-ObjectType Rentable ethengiswayo. Iphethe GrossFloorArea ne-GrossPerimeter, kanti ayinayo indawo yenethi, ngakho ingadidekiswa negumbi. Umkhawulo uyi-IfcVirtualElement.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akukakwakhiwa\"\u003EAkukakwakhiwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinhlelo zakho (kukhona Gross building ne-Rentable kuphela).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkugcwalisa ngemibala ngohlobo lwendawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImithetho ebeka umkhawulo ngokuzenzakalelayo, njengokuthi &quot;kuze kufike umugqa weglasi&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBheka futhi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/rooms-and-separators\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/rooms-and-separators\"\u003EAmagumbi nezihlukanisi zamagumbi\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/room-and-area-tags\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/room-and-area-tags\"\u003EAmathegi amagumbi nendawo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Dweba imikhawulo yohlelo lwendawo, beka izindawo ngaphakathi kwayo, bese ufunda izinhlanganisela. Lapho kukhona amathuluzi Izakhiwo zeribhoni: Architecture › Igumbi nendawo › Area kanye Area Boundary. Isakhiwo sakudala: ibha yokudweba › imenyu Rooms. Izinyathelo Khetha Area Boundary. Ku-row khetha Scheme: Indawo ephelele yesakhiwo noma Ethengiswayo. Uhlelo ngalunye lunemikhawulo yalo. Khetha indlela yokwenza imigqa ku-Make by: Dweba: chofoza iphoyinti ngelinye. Khetha izindonga: umugqa wephakathi: chofoza udonga, umugqa waphakathi walo ube umkhawulo. Khetha izindonga: ubuso obuchofoziwe: chofoza udonga ohlangothini ofuna ukuba khona; lobo buso bube umkhawulo. Ye-indawo ephelele yesakhiwo chofoza ngaphandle kwezindonga zangaphandle. Khetha Area. Khetha uhlelo olufanayo, thayipha igama, inombolo noma uhlobo uma ufisa, bese uchofoza ngaphakathi kwemikhawulo. Indawo ilinganiswa masinyane. Yikhethe ukuze uguqule igama, inombolo noma uhlobo ku-Izakhiwo. Okulandelayo Umkhawulo owenziwe ngokukhetha udonga uyalandela leyo ndonga: hambisa udonga bese indawo ilinganiswa futhi ngesinyathelo esifanayo. Umkhawulo owudwetshile uhlala lapho wawudwetshe khona. Izinhlangothi zezindonga ezihlangana ekhoneni nazo zihlangana khona, ngakho izindonga ezine ezikhethiwe zivala indawo ngaphandle kwezikhala. Imikhawulo yezindawo ibonakala epulanini uma isithuluzi segumbi noma sendawo sisesandleni sakho, ukuze ingavimbi ipulani esikhathini esisele. Uma imikhawulo ingavali Indawo isabekwa. Ibhala Akuvalekile futhi ayilinganisi lutho uze imikhawulo ivale yonke. Lesi iseluleko: akukho okunqatshelwayo. Uhlu Ipaneli yesobunxele › Schedules › Izindawo: uhlelo, inombolo, igama, uhlobo, izinga, indawo nesibungu, nesamba. Ukuchofoza umugqa kukhetha indawo. Download CSV inikeza ithebula elifanayo. Ku-IFC Indawo iyi-IfcSpace engenayo umzimba: PredefinedType GFA ohlelweni lwendawo ephelele yesakhiwo, USERDEFINED ne-ObjectType Rentable ethengiswayo. Iphethe GrossFloorArea ne-GrossPerimeter, kanti ayinayo indawo yenethi, ngakho ingadidekiswa negumbi. Umkhawulo uyi-IfcVirtualElement. Akukakwakhiwa Izinhlelo zakho (kukhona Gross building ne-Rentable kuphela). Ukugcwalisa ngemibala ngohlobo lwendawo. Imithetho ebeka umkhawulo ngokuzenzakalelayo, njengokuthi \"kuze kufike umugqa weglasi\". Bheka futhi Amagumbi nezihlukanisi zamagumbi, Amathegi amagumbi nendawo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"interior-elevations","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Ukubukeka kwangaphakathi","summary":"Yenza ishidi elilodwa elibonisa izindonga ezine zegumbi ngaphakathi, nezilinganiso namathegi, bese ulilondoloza njenge-PDF.","section":"tasks","order":35,"keywords":["ukubukeka kwangaphakathi","igumbi","udonga","ikhabethe","ikhishi","ukubukeka","ishidi","PDF","isilinganiso","ithegi","indawo","A-501"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"yenza-ishidi","text":"Yenza ishidi","level":2},{"id":"okubonakala-ishidi","text":"Okubonakala ishidi","level":2},{"id":"kumashidi-akho","text":"Kumashidi akho","level":2},{"id":"akukakwakhiwa","text":"Akukakwakhiwa","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha igumbi bese uthola ishidi elilodwa elibonisa izindonga zalo ezine njengoba uzibona usemi ngaphakathi. Lenzelwe amakhishi, izindlu zokugezela nanoma yiliphi igumbi lapho udinga khona ukubona amakhabethe, iminyango namawindi ngodonga ngalunye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yenza-ishidi\"\u003EYenza ishidi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha igumbi. Ku-pulani ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw\u003C/span\u003E ivuliwe, chofoza phakathi kwegumbi. Ku-3D view noma ku-model tree, khetha indawo (i-IfcSpace).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzici\u003C/strong\u003E, chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInterior elevations…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIngxoxo ivula ishidi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDownload PDF\u003C/span\u003E ukuze ulilondoloze. Ifayela libizwa ngokuthi &quot;&lt;file&gt; — Interior elevations — &lt;room&gt;.pdf&quot; futhi liyi-vector PDF.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClose\u003C/span\u003E uma usuqedile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okubonakala-ishidi\"\u003EOkubonakala ishidi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIshidi linemibono emine, emibili ngemibili, ngesikali esisodwa: isikali esijwayelekile esikhulu kakhulu esilingana. Yi-\u003Cstrong\u003ENorth wall\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EEast wall\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ESouth wall\u003C/strong\u003E kanye ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EWest wall\u003C/strong\u003E. Ibhulokhi yesihloko iphethe inombolo yeshidi A-501, isihloko &quot;Ukubukeka kwangaphakathi — &quot; nenombolo negama legumbi, iphrojekthi nosuku.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgayinye imbono inqunywe phakathi kwegumbi ibheke udonga oluseceleni. Izindonga eziseceleni, kanye nalokho okusikiwe kuzo njengewindi, zibonakala njengepoché enombala ogrey ezungeze umbono. Umbono uyeka kancane ngaphesheya kobuso bodonga, ngakho akukho okubonakala ngemuva kwalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgayinye imbono iqukethe:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eububanzi begumbi ngaphansi kwayo, kusuka ebusweni bangaphakathi kuya ebusweni bangaphakathi;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eukuphakama kwegumbi ngasohlangothini, kusuka phansi kuya ezingeni elingaphezulu;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eithegi elisikwele kunoma yiluphi umnyango nethegi le-hexagon kunoma yiliphi iwindi kuleyo ndonga, nenombolo yalo (D1, W1 njll.);\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eithegi lesiyingi nenombolo yento kunoma yiyiphi into yomtapo ebekwe phambi kwalowo donga: amakhabethe, izixhobo nezinsiza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImibono yenziwa kusuka kumodeli njalo lapho uvula ingxoxo, ngakho ihlala ifana nayo. Hambisa ikhabethe, bese uvula ingxoxo futhi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kumashidi-akho\"\u003EKumashidi akho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUdonga ngalunye lwegumbi ngalinye nalo ingumbono ongawubeka ishidi oyenzile: kumbonisi wephrojekthi, chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew sheet\u003C/span\u003E, bese ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EUkubukeka kwangaphakathi\u003C/strong\u003E wengeza &quot;101 Ikhishi — North wall&quot; nezinye. Lifika nezilinganiso namathegi afanayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akukakwakhiwa\"\u003EAkukakwakhiwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkubukeka kwangaphakathi kusethi yemizobo ekhiqizwe (kuvela ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzici\u003C/strong\u003E zegumbi noma emashidini akho), amagumbi angewona ama-rectangle amaningi (umbono wenziwa ngesikwele ohlangothini ngalunye lwebhokisi legumbi), ukudweba, amanothi noma izilinganiso zakho kuwo, nokukhetha izindonga ezizobonakala. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EOkungakakwakhiwa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Khetha igumbi bese uthola ishidi elilodwa elibonisa izindonga zalo ezine njengoba uzibona usemi ngaphakathi. Lenzelwe amakhishi, izindlu zokugezela nanoma yiliphi igumbi lapho udinga khona ukubona amakhabethe, iminyango namawindi ngodonga ngalunye. Yenza ishidi Khetha igumbi. Ku-pulani ne-Draw ivuliwe, chofoza phakathi kwegumbi. Ku-3D view noma ku-model tree, khetha indawo (i-IfcSpace). Ku-Izici, chofoza Interior elevations…. Ingxoxo ivula ishidi. Chofoza Download PDF ukuze ulilondoloze. Ifayela libizwa ngokuthi \"\u003Cfile\u003E — Interior elevations — \u003Croom\u003E.pdf\" futhi liyi-vector PDF. Chofoza Close uma usuqedile. Okubonakala ishidi Ishidi linemibono emine, emibili ngemibili, ngesikali esisodwa: isikali esijwayelekile esikhulu kakhulu esilingana. Yi-North wall, East wall, South wall kanye ne-West wall. Ibhulokhi yesihloko iphethe inombolo yeshidi A-501, isihloko \"Ukubukeka kwangaphakathi — \" nenombolo negama legumbi, iphrojekthi nosuku. Ngayinye imbono inqunywe phakathi kwegumbi ibheke udonga oluseceleni. Izindonga eziseceleni, kanye nalokho okusikiwe kuzo njengewindi, zibonakala njengepoché enombala ogrey ezungeze umbono. Umbono uyeka kancane ngaphesheya kobuso bodonga, ngakho akukho okubonakala ngemuva kwalo. Ngayinye imbono iqukethe: ububanzi begumbi ngaphansi kwayo, kusuka ebusweni bangaphakathi kuya ebusweni bangaphakathi; ukuphakama kwegumbi ngasohlangothini, kusuka phansi kuya ezingeni elingaphezulu; ithegi elisikwele kunoma yiluphi umnyango nethegi le-hexagon kunoma yiliphi iwindi kuleyo ndonga, nenombolo yalo (D1, W1 njll.); ithegi lesiyingi nenombolo yento kunoma yiyiphi into yomtapo ebekwe phambi kwalowo donga: amakhabethe, izixhobo nezinsiza. Imibono yenziwa kusuka kumodeli njalo lapho uvula ingxoxo, ngakho ihlala ifana nayo. Hambisa ikhabethe, bese uvula ingxoxo futhi. Kumashidi akho Udonga ngalunye lwegumbi ngalinye nalo ingumbono ongawubeka ishidi oyenzile: kumbonisi wephrojekthi, chofoza New sheet, bese ngaphansi kwe-Ukubukeka kwangaphakathi wengeza \"101 Ikhishi — North wall\" nezinye. Lifika nezilinganiso namathegi afanayo. Akukakwakhiwa Ukubukeka kwangaphakathi kusethi yemizobo ekhiqizwe (kuvela ku-Izici zegumbi noma emashidini akho), amagumbi angewona ama-rectangle amaningi (umbono wenziwa ngesikwele ohlangothini ngalunye lwebhokisi legumbi), ukudweba, amanothi noma izilinganiso zakho kuwo, nokukhetha izindonga ezizobonakala. Bona Okungakakwakhiwa.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"command-line","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Umugqa womyalo ebhendeni lesimo","summary":"Esakhiweni esinomugqa womyalo, thayipha noma yikuphi lapho amagama afika emugqeni ongezansi. Ukhomba okufanayo, ugcina umlando, futhi awuyimboze umdwebo.","section":"tasks","order":35,"keywords":["umugqa womyalo","thayipha noma yikuphi","umyalo othayiphiwe","ibha yesimo","umlando","izinkinobho zomcibisholo","enter","space","WALL","DOOR","Duncan layout","Rhino layout","shortcut","okhiye","isifufuzi somyalo"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okungathayiphwa","text":"Okungathayiphwa","level":2},{"id":"okuhle-ukukwazi","text":"Okuhle ukukwazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYenza amathuluzi ngokuthayipha amagama awo, ngaphandle kokuqala uchofoze ibhokisi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha isakhiwo esinomugqa womyalo: vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikelele\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E, bese ukhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EDuncan\u003C/strong\u003E (noma \u003Cstrong\u003ERhino\u003C/strong\u003E). Umugqa uhlala ebhendeni lesimo ngaphansi kwewindi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENomshini noma ngabe ukuphi futhi ingekho bhokisi lisetshenziswa, thayipha \u003Ccode\u003Ewall\u003C/code\u003E. Izinhlamvu zivela emugqeni womyalo, futhi uhlu olungaphezulu kwawo lubonisa imiyalo ehambisanayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Ithuluzi le-Wall liqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza emugqeni womyalo (noma cindezela okhiye futhi). Ngomugqa ongenalutho, uhlu lubonisa imiyalo owayithayipha ngaphambili. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↑\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E no \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↓\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ahambisa kuyo; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ishayela leyo oyibonayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okungathayiphwa\"\u003EOkungathayiphwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIgama lomyalo lemodi yemenyu esetshenziswayo, lapho lesi sitayela sinawo (\u003Ccode\u003EWALL\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EWA\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EDOOR\u003C/code\u003E esitayelweni sokudweba).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOkhiye womyalo, njengegama: \u003Ccode\u003EW\u003C/code\u003E bese \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kuyi-Wall, \u003Ccode\u003ED\u003C/code\u003E kuyi-Door.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIgama lomyalo, nangaphandle kwezithuba zalo: \u003Ccode\u003Esplit wall\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ewallrectangle\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuqala kwegama noma kwegama lomyalo, uma kukhona umyalo oyodwa oqala ngalokho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENoma yini enye ivula isifufuzi somyalo ngalokho obhalile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuhle-ukukwazi\"\u003EOkuhle ukukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ihlanza umugqa futhi ibuyisela okhiye emdwebeni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKulezi zakhiwo, uhlamvu olulodwa aluqali ithuluzi ngokwalo: lulinda emugqeni \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Okhiye abane \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, okhiye bemisebenzi, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kanye \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E basebenza njengakuqala. Kwezinye izakhiwo akukho okushintshayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELapho ithuluzi lokudweba lisebenza, izinombolo zihlala nalo (ubude obuthayiphiwe).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuthayipha ebhokisini, ekuxoxisaneni noma ezilungiselelweni kuhlala lapho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmlando ugcinwa kule khompyutha, imiyalo engu-50 kwi-app ngayinye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Yenza amathuluzi ngokuthayipha amagama awo, ngaphandle kokuqala uchofoze ibhokisi. Izinyathelo Khetha isakhiwo esinomugqa womyalo: vula Izilungiselelo, khetha Jikelele, bese Isakhiwo, bese ukhetha Duncan (noma Rhino). Umugqa uhlala ebhendeni lesimo ngaphansi kwewindi. Nomshini noma ngabe ukuphi futhi ingekho bhokisi lisetshenziswa, thayipha wall. Izinhlamvu zivela emugqeni womyalo, futhi uhlu olungaphezulu kwawo lubonisa imiyalo ehambisanayo. Cindezela Enter. Ithuluzi le-Wall liqala. Chofoza emugqeni womyalo (noma cindezela okhiye futhi). Ngomugqa ongenalutho, uhlu lubonisa imiyalo owayithayipha ngaphambili. ↑ no ↓ ahambisa kuyo; Enter ishayela leyo oyibonayo. Okungathayiphwa Igama lomyalo lemodi yemenyu esetshenziswayo, lapho lesi sitayela sinawo (WALL, WA, DOOR esitayelweni sokudweba). Okhiye womyalo, njengegama: W bese Enter noma Space kuyi-Wall, D kuyi-Door. Igama lomyalo, nangaphandle kwezithuba zalo: split wall, wallrectangle. Ukuqala kwegama noma kwegama lomyalo, uma kukhona umyalo oyodwa oqala ngalokho. Noma yini enye ivula isifufuzi somyalo ngalokho obhalile. Okuhle ukukwazi Esc ihlanza umugqa futhi ibuyisela okhiye emdwebeni. Kulezi zakhiwo, uhlamvu olulodwa aluqali ithuluzi ngokwalo: lulinda emugqeni Enter noma Space. Okhiye abane Ctrl, okhiye bemisebenzi, Delete kanye Esc basebenza njengakuqala. Kwezinye izakhiwo akukho okushintshayo. Lapho ithuluzi lokudweba lisebenza, izinombolo zihlala nalo (ubude obuthayiphiwe). Ukuthayipha ebhokisini, ekuxoxisaneni noma ezilungiselelweni kuhlala lapho. Umlando ugcinwa kule khompyutha, imiyalo engu-50 kwi-app ngayinye.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"open-in-another-app","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Vula ifayela kwenye i-app","summary":"Nikeza umdwebo noma imodeli ovulekile enye i-app ohlwini ethebhini elisha — umdwebo kuhlelo lokudweba, imodeli kuhlelo lokuqoqa imininingwane — ngaphandle kokulayisha noma yini.","section":"tasks","order":35,"keywords":["ukudlulisa","dlulisa","vula ku","hlela ku","enye i-app","ithebhu elisha","thumela ku","ukuqoqa imininingwane","ukudweba","cadcraft","detailcraft"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okuzobona","text":"Okuzobona","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukwazi","text":"Okufanele ukwazi","level":2},{"id":"okulandelayo","text":"Okulandelayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQhubeka nefayela ku-app eyenzelwe umsebenzi olandelayo, ngaphandle kokuligcina nokulivula futhi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula umdwebo we-DWG noma we-DXF ukuze uwuhlele ku-app yokudweba, noma imodeli ye-IFC ukuze uyiqoqe ku-app yokuqoqa imininingwane.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlela ku-CadCraft\u003C/span\u003E ku-2D view yomdwebo, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula ku-DetailCraft\u003C/span\u003E ku-toolbar yemodeli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-app enye ivula ethebhini elisha ngefayela selivulekile kakade.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzobona\"\u003EOkuzobona\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIfayela ethebhini elisha. I-BimCraft nayo iyaligcina livuleke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImodeli enezinguquko ezingakagcinwa idlulela nazo lezo zinguquko kuyo. Ikopi yakho ayigcinwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmdwebo udlulela ngaphandle kwemidwebo exhunyiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukwazi\"\u003EOkufanele ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIfayela ludlula phakathi kwamathebhu amabili ngaphakathi kwesiphequluli sakho. Akukho okulayishwayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELe \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInkinobho\u003C/span\u003E ivela kuphela uma enye i-app ivulekile lapho ukhona futhi ingamukela ifayela ngale ndlela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma kungavulwa lutho, isiphequluli sivimbe ithebhu elisha: vumela ama-pop-up kule sayithi bese uchofoza futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulandelayo\"\u003EOkulandelayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/view-dwg\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/view-dwg\"\u003EBona umdwebo we-DWG noma we-DXF\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/files\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/files\"\u003EAmafayela i-BimCraft evula futhi elondoloza\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Qhubeka nefayela ku-app eyenzelwe umsebenzi olandelayo, ngaphandle kokuligcina nokulivula futhi. Izinyathelo Vula umdwebo we-DWG noma we-DXF ukuze uwuhlele ku-app yokudweba, noma imodeli ye-IFC ukuze uyiqoqe ku-app yokuqoqa imininingwane. Chofoza Hlela ku-CadCraft ku-2D view yomdwebo, noma Vula ku-DetailCraft ku-toolbar yemodeli. I-app enye ivula ethebhini elisha ngefayela selivulekile kakade. Okuzobona Ifayela ethebhini elisha. I-BimCraft nayo iyaligcina livuleke. Imodeli enezinguquko ezingakagcinwa idlulela nazo lezo zinguquko kuyo. Ikopi yakho ayigcinwa. Umdwebo udlulela ngaphandle kwemidwebo exhunyiwe. Okufanele ukwazi Ifayela ludlula phakathi kwamathebhu amabili ngaphakathi kwesiphequluli sakho. Akukho okulayishwayo. Le Inkinobho ivela kuphela uma enye i-app ivulekile lapho ukhona futhi ingamukela ifayela ngale ndlela. Uma kungavulwa lutho, isiphequluli sivimbe ithebhu elisha: vumela ama-pop-up kule sayithi bese uchofoza futhi. Okulandelayo Bona umdwebo we-DWG noma we-DXF Amafayela i-BimCraft evula futhi elondoloza","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"render-open-in","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Vula isimo kolunye uhlelo","summary":"Londoloza isimo njengefayela le-USD noma le-glTF noma yikuphi uhlelo olukufundayo, noma uvule usuka ku-Studio kuhlelo oluselikhompyutha.","section":"tasks","order":35,"keywords":["vula ku","usd","gltf","glb","ukuthumela","uhlelo lokurenda","archviz","studio","usdview","thumela","ukudlulisa","ipakethe","ifolda ye-unreal"],"headings":[{"id":"ifayela-lanoma-yiluphi-uhlelo","text":"Ifayela lanoma yiluphi uhlelo","level":2},{"id":"ku-studio-vula-kuhlelo","text":"Ku-Studio: vula kuhlelo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EKhetha okuthi \u003Cstrong\u003EVula ku…\u003C/strong\u003E ohlwini lwe-Injini engxoxweni \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda\u003C/span\u003E ukuthatha isimo siye kolunye uhlelo. Akukho okubuyela kumodeli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ifayela-lanoma-yiluphi-uhlelo\"\u003EIfayela lanoma yiluphi uhlelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIfayela le-USD\u003C/strong\u003E lilondoloza isimo njenge-\u003Ccode\u003E.usdc\u003C/code\u003E (noma \u003Ccode\u003E.usdz\u003C/code\u003E uma imodeli inezithombe): \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/usd\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/usd\"\u003Eifayela elifanayo njengalelo Londoloza njenge-USD\u003C/a\u003E, nezinto zokwakha, izibani namakhamera. Ligcina ukuphindeka nezinani eliqondile zezinto zokwakha. Iningi lezinjini zokurenda, izinjini zemidlalo nezibukeli lifunda i-USD.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIfayela le-glTF (.glb)\u003C/strong\u003E lilondoloza ifayela elikhanyayo le-glTF 2.0 ngezinto zokwakha, izithombe zokwakha nezibani; bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/model-for-rendering\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/model-for-rendering\"\u003EThumela imodeli kuhlelo lokurenda\u003C/a\u003E ukuthola okulifakayo nokungalifaki.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIfolda yephrojekthi ye-Unreal (.zip)\u003C/strong\u003E lilondoloza ifolda \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render-unreal\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render-unreal\"\u003EThumela isimo kwinjini yomdlalo\u003C/a\u003E ibhala, yephrojekthi kunoma iyiphi ikhompyutha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZombili zisebenza kuwebhu nakuStudio.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-studio-vula-kuhlelo\"\u003EKu-Studio: vula kuhlelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStudio ibhala uhlu lwezinhlelo ezitholakala kule khompyutha ezingavula isimo: i-usdview uma isendleleni yakho yokusesha, nohlelo lwekhompyutha lwalolo hlobo lwefayela. Khetha olulodwa, khetha i-USD noma i-glTF lapho lufunda zombili, bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda\u003C/span\u003E. Studio ibhala ipakethe efolda entsha ngaphansi kwe-Amadokhumenti (\u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft hand-off\u003C/code\u003E; akukho okubhalwa phezu kwakho, ukuthumela ngakunye kuthola efolda yakho), bese iqala uhlelo kuyo, bese ikhomba lapho amafayela akhona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUhlelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ELufunda kangcono\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eusdview\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUSD\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUhlelo lwekhompyutha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENoma yini ikhompyutha inayo ngohlobo lwefayela\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStudio iqala kuphela izinhlelo kulolu hlu oluqinile; ayikwenzi lutho okucelwa yikhasi ngegama, futhi ayiqali uhlelo olunelayisensi ye-GNU GPL (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render-other-program#programs-cadcraft-never-runs\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render-other-program\" data-hash=\"programs-cadcraft-never-runs\"\u003EDweba isithombe ngolunye uhlelo\u003C/a\u003E). Noma yiluphi uhlelo olufunda i-USD noma i-glTF luvula ifayela elisuka ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EIfayela lanoma yiluphi uhlelo\u003C/strong\u003E lapha phezulu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-Twinmotion, i-Enscape nezinye izinhlelo zokubonisa azikho kulolu hlu: i-CadCraft ayikahlolwa nazo futhi ayithi lutho ngazo. Ifayela le-glTF noma le-USD kusuka lapha yindlela yokungena; bona izinkomba ku-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/model-for-rendering#enscape-and-other-plug-in-renderers\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/model-for-rendering\" data-hash=\"enscape-and-other-plug-in-renderers\"\u003Eizinjini zokurenda ze-plug-in\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Khetha okuthi Vula ku… ohlwini lwe-Injini engxoxweni Renda ukuthatha isimo siye kolunye uhlelo. Akukho okubuyela kumodeli. Ifayela lanoma yiluphi uhlelo Ifayela le-USD lilondoloza isimo njenge-.usdc (noma .usdz uma imodeli inezithombe): ifayela elifanayo njengalelo Londoloza njenge-USD, nezinto zokwakha, izibani namakhamera. Ligcina ukuphindeka nezinani eliqondile zezinto zokwakha. Iningi lezinjini zokurenda, izinjini zemidlalo nezibukeli lifunda i-USD. Ifayela le-glTF (.glb) lilondoloza ifayela elikhanyayo le-glTF 2.0 ngezinto zokwakha, izithombe zokwakha nezibani; bona Thumela imodeli kuhlelo lokurenda ukuthola okulifakayo nokungalifaki. Ifolda yephrojekthi ye-Unreal (.zip) lilondoloza ifolda Thumela isimo kwinjini yomdlalo ibhala, yephrojekthi kunoma iyiphi ikhompyutha. Zombili zisebenza kuwebhu nakuStudio. Ku-Studio: vula kuhlelo Studio ibhala uhlu lwezinhlelo ezitholakala kule khompyutha ezingavula isimo: i-usdview uma isendleleni yakho yokusesha, nohlelo lwekhompyutha lwalolo hlobo lwefayela. Khetha olulodwa, khetha i-USD noma i-glTF lapho lufunda zombili, bese uchofoza Renda. Studio ibhala ipakethe efolda entsha ngaphansi kwe-Amadokhumenti (CadCraft hand-off; akukho okubhalwa phezu kwakho, ukuthumela ngakunye kuthola efolda yakho), bese iqala uhlelo kuyo, bese ikhomba lapho amafayela akhona. Uhlelo Lufunda kangcono usdview USD Uhlelo lwekhompyutha Noma yini ikhompyutha inayo ngohlobo lwefayela Studio iqala kuphela izinhlelo kulolu hlu oluqinile; ayikwenzi lutho okucelwa yikhasi ngegama, futhi ayiqali uhlelo olunelayisensi ye-GNU GPL (bona Dweba isithombe ngolunye uhlelo). Noma yiluphi uhlelo olufunda i-USD noma i-glTF luvula ifayela elisuka ku-Ifayela lanoma yiluphi uhlelo lapha phezulu. I-Twinmotion, i-Enscape nezinye izinhlelo zokubonisa azikho kulolu hlu: i-CadCraft ayikahlolwa nazo futhi ayithi lutho ngazo. Ifayela le-glTF noma le-USD kusuka lapha yindlela yokungena; bona izinkomba ku-izinjini zokurenda ze-plug-in.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"pipes-and-ducts","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Amapayipi namapayipi omoya","summary":"Dweba imigqa yamapayipi nemimoya epulanini ngemigqa yasembindini; ama-elbow, ama-tee, ama-reducer nezinguquko zenziwa ngawe, imigqa ingeyezinhlelo ezinamaphothi axhunyiwe ku-faela ye-IFC, futhi ibonakala emapulanini, emathebulini nasekubaleni kwezinani.","section":"tasks","order":36,"keywords":["ipayipi","amapayipi","ukufakwa kwepayipi","ukuhlanganisa kwamapayipi","idaktho","amapayipi omoya","hvac","mep","mechanical","elbow","tee","reducer","transition","fitting","fittings","valve","valves","gate valve","ball valve","globe valve","check valve","riser","slope","drain","sanitary","storm","vent","cold water","hot water","chilled water","heating","gas","fire protection","supply air","return air","exhaust","system","systems","port","ports","connector","connectors","fixture","fixtures","plumbing fixture","basin","sink","toilet","water closet","lavatory","kitchen sink","shower","laundry tub","fixture units","uhc","dfu","size the drains","drain sizing","building drain","branch","ramal","coletor","airflow","cfm","friction","equal friction","sizing","schedule","takeoff","nbr","nbr 5648","nbr 5688","nbr 8160","pvc soldável","esgoto","dn"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"dweba-ipayipi","text":"Dweba ipayipi","level":2},{"id":"setha-inqubomgomo-yepulumbing-yephrojekthi","text":"Setha inqubomgomo yepulumbing yephrojekthi","level":2},{"id":"dweba-idaktho","text":"Dweba idaktho","level":2},{"id":"izisetshenziswa-zepulumbing","text":"Izisetshenziswa zepulumbing","level":2},{"id":"kusukela-kuconnector-yesisetshenziswa","text":"Kusukela kuconnector yesisetshenziswa","level":2},{"id":"izixhumi-ezenziwe-ngawe","text":"Izixhumi ezenziwe ngawe","level":2},{"id":"amarisa","text":"Amarisa","level":2},{"id":"imifantu-nokuhlamuka-kwayo","text":"Imifantu nokuhlamuka kwayo","level":2},{"id":"linganisa-izindawo-zodaka-ngamayunithi-wesisetshenziswa","text":"Linganisa izindawo zodaka ngamayunithi wesisetshenziswa","level":2},{"id":"amavalvu","text":"Amavalvu","level":2},{"id":"shintsha-umugqa","text":"Shintsha umugqa","level":2},{"id":"amapulani","text":"Amapulani","level":2},{"id":"amathebula-nokubalwa-kwezinani","text":"Amathebula nokubalwa kwezinani","level":2},{"id":"ku-faela-ye-ifc","text":"Ku-faela ye-IFC","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDweba amapayipi namapayipi omoya esakhiweni njengoba udweba izindonga: chofoza amakhoni emgqeni wasembindini ngobude obusethiwe. I-BimCraft yenza izixhumi, ibeka ingxenye ngayinye esistimini bese iyixhuma, ngakho ezinye izinhlelo zifunda umugqa njengesistimu eyodwa exhunyiwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dweba-ipayipi\"\u003EDweba ipayipi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDweba\u003C/span\u003E, vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkwakhiwa\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIpayipi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEbhareni, khetha \u003Cstrong\u003Eisistimu\u003C/strong\u003E (amanzi abandayo, amanzi ashisayo, udaka lwezempilo, igesi…). Iyasetha impahla evamile: ethusi lamanzi, i-PVC yodaka nemimoya, insimbi yokushisa, amanzi apholile, igesi kanye nokuvikela umlilo. Shintsha \u003Cstrong\u003Eimpahla\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003Eikilasi\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003Enosayizi\u003C/strong\u003E uma udinga. Osayizi nodonga bavela ezindinganisweni zomphakathi: ipayipi lensimbi ASME B36.10M, ithubhu lethusi ASTM B88, i-PVC ASTM D1785 kanye ne-PEX ASTM F876. Amaphrojekthi aseBrazil angasebenzisa \u003Cstrong\u003Eipayipi lamanzi e-PVC (NBR 5648)\u003C/strong\u003E, i-PVC ebotshelwa ngesolvent yamanzi abandayo, kanye \u003Cstrong\u003Enepayipi lodaka le-PVC (NBR 5688)\u003C/strong\u003E, i-série normal noma reforçada, lezodaka nemimoya: osayizi babo babizwa ngo-DN (DN 25, DN 100). Uma usekhethe enye yazo, ukukhetha esinye isistimu kugcina amapayipi aseBrazil (ipayipi lodaka le-PVC lodaka lwezempilo ngemuva kwepayipi lamanzi e-PVC).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESetha \u003Cstrong\u003EAt\u003C/strong\u003E: ukuphakama komugqa wepayipi ngaphezu kwesitezi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza lapho ipayipi liqala, bese kwiKhoni ngalinye. Chofoza kabili, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, endaweni yokugcina. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ibuyisela ikhoni elidlule; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ilahla umugqa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIpayipi liyambambelela njengezindonga, nakwezinye imigqa: qala ekugcineni kwepayipi ukuze uqhubeke kulo, noma uphele emgqeni wepayipi ukuze uhlukanise. Umugqa omusha uthatha ukuphakama kwepayipi ambambelela kulo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmugqa oqala noma ophele ephothini lensiza uthatha usayizi nesistimu yalo futhi uhlala ubambelelwe kulo: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/mep-equipment\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/mep-equipment\"\u003EIzinsiza ze-MEP ezinamaphothi\u003C/a\u003E kanye \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/mep-connections\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/mep-connections\"\u003EXhuma amapayipi namapayipi omoya kwezinsiza\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"setha-inqubomgomo-yepulumbing-yephrojekthi\"\u003ESetha inqubomgomo yepulumbing yephrojekthi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUhlu lokuqala ebhareni lepayipi yi-\u003Cstrong\u003Einqubomgomo yepulumbing\u003C/strong\u003E yemodeli: \u003Cstrong\u003EUS (IPC, inches)\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003EBrazil (ABNT, DN)\u003C/strong\u003E. Igcinwa kumodeli, ngakho wonke umuntu ovula ifayela uqala imigqa ngendlela efanayo. Ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EUS\u003C/strong\u003E, umugqa omusha uqala ethusini (amanzi) noma i-PVC Schedule 40 (udaka), ngamayintshi, nokuhlamuka kwe-International Plumbing Code. Ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EBrazil\u003C/strong\u003E, amanzi abandayo aqala njenge-PVC soldável DN 25, udaka lwezempilo nelwemvula kanye nemimoya njenge-PVC esgoto DN 100 nokuhlamuka kwe-NBR 8160, namanzi ashisayo ethusini. Iphinde isebenze nakumugqa oqala ku-connector yesisetshenziswa noma ephothini lensiza. Amapayipi asevele edwetshiwe agcina impahla yawo nezithebula zawo; uhlu lwezimpahla luyahlala luvuliwe, ngakho ungadweba omunye umugqa waseBrazil kumodeli yase-US ngamabomu. Ifayela elingenakukhetho liziphatha njengangaphambili: umugqa omusha ulandela impahla esetshenziswayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dweba-idaktho\"\u003EDweba idaktho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIdaktho\u003C/span\u003E. Khetha isistimu (ukunikeza, ukubuya, ukukhipha noma umoya wangaphandle) kanye nesimo: sizungezile, sinekhona noma sinemifantu eyisicaba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThayipha ububanzi (ububanzi bedaktho ozungezile buyidayamitha yalo) kanye \u003Cstrong\u003EAt\u003C/strong\u003E yokuphakama komugqa wasembindini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuze uyisayize ngokwomoya, thayipha \u003Cstrong\u003EAirflow\u003C/strong\u003E kanye nezinga le-\u003Cstrong\u003EFriction\u003C/strong\u003E bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinganisa usayizi\u003C/span\u003E. Idaktho isayizwa ngokulingana kokuhwaqeka, indlela esencwadini yedizayini yedaktho ye-ASHRAE Handbook, futhi ijikelezwa ibe usayizi otholakalayo, ngakho ukuhwaqeka kuphuma kulo noma ngaphansi kwalelo zinga oliithaye. Uma kungathayiwe zinga, kusebenzisa i-0.08 in. of water ngamafidi ayi-100 (0.8 Pa/m). Idaktho enekhona ligcina ukuphakama oluthayiwe futhi lithola ububanzi; i-BimCraft iyatshela uma izinhlangothi zalo ziyi-4 kuya ku-1.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza amakhoni njengakwepayipi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izisetshenziswa-zepulumbing\"\u003EIzisetshenziswa zepulumbing\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkwakhiwa\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaka umndeni\u003C/span\u003E unikeza izisetshenziswa ezinhlanu zokuqala, ngayinye nedrenishi nokuxhumana kwamanzi abandayo: i-\u003Cstrong\u003EWater closet\u003C/strong\u003E, i-\u003Cstrong\u003ELavatory\u003C/strong\u003E, i-\u003Cstrong\u003EKitchen sink\u003C/strong\u003E, i-\u003Cstrong\u003EShower tray\u003C/strong\u003E kanye ne-\u003Cstrong\u003ELaundry tub\u003C/strong\u003E. Ubuso bazo bubheke wena ngenkathi ubeka, nemuva lazo lishaywe odongeni. Udrenishi wazo unosayizi omncane kakhulu wedrenishi yesisetshenziswa ye-NBR 8160 (DN 100 ye-water closet, DN 50 ye-kitchen sink, DN 40 kwezinye); amanzi ngu-DN 20. Shintsha osayizi bazo, noma uzihlele njengomndeni noma yiluphi: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/families\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/families\"\u003EImindeni nosayizi bayo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmndeni utshela ukuthi yisiphi isisetshenziswa ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsisetshenziswa samanzi\u003C/span\u003E ethebhini le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzixhumi\u003C/span\u003E kumhleli womndeni. Udrenishi wayo ke ubalwa ngamayunithi wesisetshenziswa: 6 UHC ye-water closet, 1 ye-lavatory, 3 ye-kitchen sink noma i-laundry tub, 2 ye-shower (NBR 8160), noma amayunithi edrenishi e-IPC Table 709.1.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kusukela-kuconnector-yesisetshenziswa\"\u003EKusukela kuconnector yesisetshenziswa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinto ezibekwe kusuka emndenini onama-connector (udrenishi nethephu yebhesini, nentamo yesiphephisi somoya: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/family-editor\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/family-editor\"\u003EHlela umndeni\u003C/a\u003E) zikhombisa ama-connector abo akhululekile njengamaphoyinti lapho i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIpayipi\u003C/span\u003E noma i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIdaktho\u003C/span\u003E sivuliwe, futhi iphoyinta iyambambelela kuwo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQala ku-connector\u003C/strong\u003E: umugqa uthatha isistimu nosayizi wawo (ipayipi lempahla yebha elingana noma libe nkulu kancane kusayizi we-connector; idaktho elizungezile lalo ububanzi balo). Uma i-connector ibheke phansi noma phezulu, njengedrenishi ngaphansi kwebhesini, umugqa uqala uhamba uye phansi noma phezulu ukuya ekuphakameni kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EAt\u003C/strong\u003E, bese uqhubeka ngokuchofoza kwakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPhela ku-connector\u003C/strong\u003E: umugqa wehla noma uphakama uye kuyo, bese uphela lapho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmugqa uxhunyiwe kulokhu okwesisetshenziswa ku-faela ye-IFC, ngakho ezinye izinhlelo zibona isisetshenziswa njengengxenye yesistimu yaso. Into ebekwe kamuva nge-connector ekugcineni komugqa nayo iyaxhunywa kuwo. Umugqa osuswa ku-connector awusaxhunyiwe kuyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izixhumi-ezenziwe-ngawe\"\u003EIzixhumi ezenziwe ngawe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ELapho\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkwenziwa yi-BimCraft\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmugqa uyajika\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-elbow. Ipayipi lensimbi ngomsakazo omude we-ASME B16.9 (1.5 × usayizi), amanye amapayipi ngobubanzi bangaphandle obubodwa, idaktho elizungezile ngama-diameter angu-1.5, idaktho elinesikhwama ngobubanzi obubodwa (noma ukuphakama okubodwa uma kujikwa phansi noma phezulu)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmugqa uphela emgqeni womunye umugqa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-tee; omunye umugqa uyahlukaniswa lapho\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImigqa emibili ihlangana ekugcineni ngosayizi abahlukile\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-reducer (amapayipi) noma i-transition (amapayipi omoya)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImigqa emibili yosayizi ofanayo ihlangana ekugcineni nge-engeli\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-elbow\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma ushintsha, uhambise noma usule umugqa, yonke ixhumanisi kuleli zinga yenziwa kabusha. Uma umlenze ufushane kakhulu kumaxhumanisi asezinhlangothini zawo, i-BimCraft iyatshela futhi ayishintshi lutho: hambisa ikhoni kude.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzixhumi namavalvu ayizinto ezijwayelekile: zidwetshwe kusuka osayizini wepayipi noma wedaktho, hhayi kukhathalogi yomkhiqizi. Izixhumi zokuxhuma, zokucindezela nezegrooved, imizimba yamavalvu kanye nezinsiza zinosayizi womkhiqizi wazo; zihlole nomhlinzeki wakho ngaphambi kokuoda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amarisa\"\u003EAmarisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELapho udweba, thayipha ukuphakama okusha ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EAt\u003C/strong\u003E bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: umugqa uhamba uye phezulu noma phansi ekhoneni lokugcina, nge-elbow ekugcineni ngakunye. Irisa lingakhuphuka lingene kwesitezi esingaphezulu. Ilevili ngalinye likhombisa izingxenye zomugqa ibubanzi bayo bokubuka obuzifinyelelayo, nge-\u003Cstrong\u003EUP\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003EDN\u003C/strong\u003E kurisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imifantu-nokuhlamuka-kwayo\"\u003EImifantu nokuhlamuka kwayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzindawo zodaka nezemvula ziqala ngokuhlamuka okuncane okuvunyelwe yi-International Plumbing Code ngosayizi wazo: 1/4 in. ngefidi kuze kube ngu-2-1/2 in., 1/8 in. ngefidi kusuka ku-3 kuya ku-6 in., 1/16 in. ngefidi kusuka ku-8 in. Udaka lwePVC lwaseBrazil luqala ngokuhlamuka kwe-NBR 8160: 2 % kuze kube ngu-DN 75, 1 % kusuka ku-DN 100. Thayipha okunye ukuhlamuka ebhareni noma ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzici\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003E1/4&quot;/ft\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2 %\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E1:50\u003C/code\u003E. Umugqa wehla kusukela phuthuma lawo lokuqala, ngakho dweba izindawo zodaka ngendlela egeleza ngayo. Ipulani likhombisa ukwehla kanye nomcibisholo. Izici ziyakhomba uma udaka lulele kunokuhlamuka okuncane kwe-code.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"linganisa-izindawo-zodaka-ngamayunithi-wesisetshenziswa\"\u003ELinganisa izindawo zodaka ngamayunithi wesisetshenziswa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha udaka lwezempilo: \u003Cstrong\u003EFixture units\u003C/strong\u003E ku-Properties itshela ukuthi ithwala amayunithi amangaki nosayizi omncane kakhulu awadingayo. Yonke isisetshenziswa sepulumbing enedrenishi ye-connector yayo emgqeni iyabalwa, nodaka lwonke oluphuma kulo luyabalwa: dweba izindawo zodaka ngendlela ezigeleza ngayo, ngayinye iphela esindaweni yodaka elingena kuyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUdaka lwePVC lwaseBrazil lubala \u003Cstrong\u003EUHC\u003C/strong\u003E futhi lulandela i-NBR 8160; ezinye zibala \u003Cstrong\u003EDFU\u003C/strong\u003E futhi zilandela i-International Plumbing Code.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDrain\u003C/strong\u003E: i-\u003Cstrong\u003EBranch\u003C/strong\u003E isayizwa ngethebula le-code lamagatsha wezisetshenziswa; i-\u003Cstrong\u003EBuilding drain\u003C/strong\u003E ngethebula layo ngokuhlamuka, ngakho i-\u003Cstrong\u003ESlope\u003C/strong\u003E ibalulekile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUdaka alukaze lube mncane kunodaka wezisetshenziswa aluphakelayo (i-water closet idinga DN 100, noma 3 in.), futhi kunodaka olungena kulo. Ngaphansi kwe-NBR 8160 i-building drain ingu-DN 100 okungenani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinganisa ubukhulu bokukhipha\u003C/span\u003E yenza wonke udaka lwezempilo lwemodeli olumncane kakhulu ngamayunithi wezisetshenziswa lube usayizi odingekayo, njengesinyathelo esisodwa osingasihlehlisa. Udaka olwenziwe bukhulu kunalokho okudingekayo ushiywa njengoba kunjalo. Uma udaka lwethwala ngaphezu kwalokho usayizi omkhulu kakhulu wepayipi lwawo ungakwenza ngalo ukuhlamuka kwalo, i-BimCraft iyatshela: yinike ukuhlamuka okunamandla noma ipayipi elinye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmathebula ngawezindawo zodaka ezinengama. Izitaki, iziventilishi kanye nodaka lwemvula alisayizwa lapha: zihlole, kanye nodizayini wonke, ngokuhambisana nekhodi esebenza kwiphrojekthi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amavalvu\"\u003EAmavalvu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIvalvu\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha uhlobo: isango, ibhola, iglobe noma i-check.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza epayipini lapho okuya khona. Ipayipi liyasikwa lizungeze lona futhi ivalvu iyaxhunywa ohlangothini lwombili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEzicini zomugqa zibala amavalvu awo, ngayinye nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinhlobo eziningi zamavalvu, isihlungi, amadampha emidwebo, izinkombandlela zepayipi zakho kanye nemindeni yabakhiqizi: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/pipe-specs\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/pipe-specs\"\u003EIzinkombandlela zepayipi, amavalvu, amadampha nemindeni yabakhiqizi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shintsha-umugqa\"\u003EShintsha umugqa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha noma iyiphi ingxenye yomugqa, epulanini noma ku-3D view. Ku-Properties:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESystem\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EMaterial\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EClass\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003ESize\u003C/strong\u003E (amapayipi), noma \u003Cstrong\u003EShape\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EWidth\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EHeight\u003C/strong\u003E (amapayipi omoya).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHeight above the level\u003C/strong\u003E ihambisa umugqa wonke phezulu noma phansi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInsulation\u003C/strong\u003E: ububanzi bayo, bugcinwa ukuhlola ukukhululeka nohlu lwezimbobo (ayidwetshwa lutho ngayo): bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/mep-against-structure\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/mep-against-structure\"\u003EHlola amapayipi namapayipi omoya ngokumelene nesakhiwo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIpayipi lensimbi: \u003Cstrong\u003ESika ibe amaspuli\u003C/strong\u003E: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/pipe-spools\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/pipe-spools\"\u003EAmaspuli epayipi lensimbi namashidi amaspuli\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESlope\u003C/strong\u003E (amapayipi).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFlow\u003C/strong\u003E nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinganisa usayizi\u003C/span\u003E: kumanzi, osayizi omncane kakhulu ogcina amanzi ku-8 ft/s (2.4 m/s), noma ku-5 ft/s (1.5 m/s) kumanzi ashisayo; ku-3 m/s ngepayipi lamanzi e-PVC laseBrazil (NBR 5626). Kumapayipi omoya, ijubane kanye nezinga lokuhwaqeka kwedaktho njengoba lidwetshiwe. Udaka lwezempilo lusayizwa ngamayunithi wesisetshenziswa esikhundleni salokho: bona \u003Cstrong\u003ELinganisa ubukhulu bodaka ngamayunithi wezisetshenziswa\u003C/strong\u003E ngezansi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUshintsho ngalunye lungesinyathelo esisodwa se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlehlisa\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E isusa umugqa wonke.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amapulani\"\u003EAmapulani\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmapayipi amancane kuna-150 mm (cishe 6 in.) adwetshwa njengomugqa owodwa emugqeni wasembindini, amapayipi amakhulu kanye nawo wonke amapayipi omoya njengemigqa emibili ngobubanzi bawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsistimu ngayinye inombala wayo; i-PDF yepulani iwaphrinta emnyama.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmugqa ngamunye umakwe ngosayizi nesistimu yawo (isibonelo \u003Ccode\u003E2&quot; CW\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E16×10 SA\u003C/code\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUhla lombono wepulani lunquma imigqa okubonisa, futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkuboniswa kule pulani\u003C/span\u003E ingashiya \u003Cstrong\u003EIzinkombandlela\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003EIdaktho\u003C/strong\u003E ngaphandle: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/views-and-sheets\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/views-and-sheets\"\u003EImibono, uhla lombono namashidi akho\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amathebula-nokubalwa-kwezinani\"\u003EAmathebula nokubalwa kwezinani\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIpaneli ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlu\u003C/span\u003E yengeza \u003Cstrong\u003EAmapayipi\u003C/strong\u003E (ngesistimu, impahla kanye nosayizi, nobude bawo), \u003Cstrong\u003EAmapayipi omoya\u003C/strong\u003E (ngesistimu, isimo kanye nosayizi, nobude nendawo yobuso bangaphandle) kanye \u003Cstrong\u003EIzixhumi namavalvu\u003C/strong\u003E (ngohlobo nosayizi, ibalwa). Chofoza umugqa ukukhetha okuhlwini, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELanda i-CSV\u003C/span\u003E iyalilanda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubala amanani\u003C/span\u003E luthatha imigqa iye ku-TakeoffCraft: ipayipi namapayipi omoya ngosayizi njengemigqa edwetshwe epulanini (udaka olunokuhlamuka kulinganiswa ngokuhamba kwalo), izixhumi namavalvu zibalwa lapho zikhona: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/takeoff\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/takeoff\"\u003EThumela izinani zemodeli ku-TakeoffCraft\u003C/a\u003E. Imirisa ishiywa ngaphandle kwalelo shidi, ngoba ipulani alikwazi ukuyilinganisa; ithebula lamapayipi linobude bayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-faela-ye-ifc\"\u003EKu-faela ye-IFC\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmugqa ngamunye uyi-assembly equkethe izingxenye zawo: izingxenye zepayipi nedaktho, izixhumi namavalvu, ngayinye nohlobo lwayo, impahla, umbala wesistimu yayo kanye namaphothi ayo. Amaphothi ahlanganayo axhunyiwe, futhi yonke ingxenye ingeyesistimu yayo yokusabalalisa (amafayela e-IFC2X3 athola okufanayo njengezigaba zokugeleza, izixhumi nezilawuli esistimini). Ezinye izinhlelo ezifunda izistimu ze-IFC zibona umugqa oyodwa oxhunyiwe ngesistimu ngayinye. Incazelo yomugqa wawo ilondolozwa nawo, ngakho i-BimCraft iyawenza kabusha ngendlela efanayo lapho uwushintsha.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Dweba amapayipi namapayipi omoya esakhiweni njengoba udweba izindonga: chofoza amakhoni emgqeni wasembindini ngobude obusethiwe. I-BimCraft yenza izixhumi, ibeka ingxenye ngayinye esistimini bese iyixhuma, ngakho ezinye izinhlelo zifunda umugqa njengesistimu eyodwa exhunyiwe. Dweba ipayipi Vula Dweba, vula Ukwakhiwa bese ukhetha Ipayipi. Ebhareni, khetha isistimu (amanzi abandayo, amanzi ashisayo, udaka lwezempilo, igesi…). Iyasetha impahla evamile: ethusi lamanzi, i-PVC yodaka nemimoya, insimbi yokushisa, amanzi apholile, igesi kanye nokuvikela umlilo. Shintsha impahla, ikilasi kanye nosayizi uma udinga. Osayizi nodonga bavela ezindinganisweni zomphakathi: ipayipi lensimbi ASME B36.10M, ithubhu lethusi ASTM B88, i-PVC ASTM D1785 kanye ne-PEX ASTM F876. Amaphrojekthi aseBrazil angasebenzisa ipayipi lamanzi e-PVC (NBR 5648), i-PVC ebotshelwa ngesolvent yamanzi abandayo, kanye nepayipi lodaka le-PVC (NBR 5688), i-série normal noma reforçada, lezodaka nemimoya: osayizi babo babizwa ngo-DN (DN 25, DN 100). Uma usekhethe enye yazo, ukukhetha esinye isistimu kugcina amapayipi aseBrazil (ipayipi lodaka le-PVC lodaka lwezempilo ngemuva kwepayipi lamanzi e-PVC). Setha At: ukuphakama komugqa wepayipi ngaphezu kwesitezi. Chofoza lapho ipayipi liqala, bese kwiKhoni ngalinye. Chofoza kabili, noma cindezela Enter, endaweni yokugcina. Backspace ibuyisela ikhoni elidlule; Esc ilahla umugqa. Ipayipi liyambambelela njengezindonga, nakwezinye imigqa: qala ekugcineni kwepayipi ukuze uqhubeke kulo, noma uphele emgqeni wepayipi ukuze uhlukanise. Umugqa omusha uthatha ukuphakama kwepayipi ambambelela kulo. Umugqa oqala noma ophele ephothini lensiza uthatha usayizi nesistimu yalo futhi uhlala ubambelelwe kulo: bona Izinsiza ze-MEP ezinamaphothi kanye Xhuma amapayipi namapayipi omoya kwezinsiza. Setha inqubomgomo yepulumbing yephrojekthi Uhlu lokuqala ebhareni lepayipi yi-inqubomgomo yepulumbing yemodeli: US (IPC, inches) noma Brazil (ABNT, DN). Igcinwa kumodeli, ngakho wonke umuntu ovula ifayela uqala imigqa ngendlela efanayo. Ngaphansi kwe-US, umugqa omusha uqala ethusini (amanzi) noma i-PVC Schedule 40 (udaka), ngamayintshi, nokuhlamuka kwe-International Plumbing Code. Ngaphansi kwe-Brazil, amanzi abandayo aqala njenge-PVC soldável DN 25, udaka lwezempilo nelwemvula kanye nemimoya njenge-PVC esgoto DN 100 nokuhlamuka kwe-NBR 8160, namanzi ashisayo ethusini. Iphinde isebenze nakumugqa oqala ku-connector yesisetshenziswa noma ephothini lensiza. Amapayipi asevele edwetshiwe agcina impahla yawo nezithebula zawo; uhlu lwezimpahla luyahlala luvuliwe, ngakho ungadweba omunye umugqa waseBrazil kumodeli yase-US ngamabomu. Ifayela elingenakukhetho liziphatha njengangaphambili: umugqa omusha ulandela impahla esetshenziswayo. Dweba idaktho Khetha Idaktho. Khetha isistimu (ukunikeza, ukubuya, ukukhipha noma umoya wangaphandle) kanye nesimo: sizungezile, sinekhona noma sinemifantu eyisicaba. Thayipha ububanzi (ububanzi bedaktho ozungezile buyidayamitha yalo) kanye At yokuphakama komugqa wasembindini. Ukuze uyisayize ngokwomoya, thayipha Airflow kanye nezinga le-Friction bese uchofoza Linganisa usayizi. Idaktho isayizwa ngokulingana kokuhwaqeka, indlela esencwadini yedizayini yedaktho ye-ASHRAE Handbook, futhi ijikelezwa ibe usayizi otholakalayo, ngakho ukuhwaqeka kuphuma kulo noma ngaphansi kwalelo zinga oliithaye. Uma kungathayiwe zinga, kusebenzisa i-0.08 in. of water ngamafidi ayi-100 (0.8 Pa/m). Idaktho enekhona ligcina ukuphakama oluthayiwe futhi lithola ububanzi; i-BimCraft iyatshela uma izinhlangothi zalo ziyi-4 kuya ku-1. Chofoza amakhoni njengakwepayipi. Izisetshenziswa zepulumbing Ukwakhiwa › Faka umndeni unikeza izisetshenziswa ezinhlanu zokuqala, ngayinye nedrenishi nokuxhumana kwamanzi abandayo: i-Water closet, i-Lavatory, i-Kitchen sink, i-Shower tray kanye ne-Laundry tub. Ubuso bazo bubheke wena ngenkathi ubeka, nemuva lazo lishaywe odongeni. Udrenishi wazo unosayizi omncane kakhulu wedrenishi yesisetshenziswa ye-NBR 8160 (DN 100 ye-water closet, DN 50 ye-kitchen sink, DN 40 kwezinye); amanzi ngu-DN 20. Shintsha osayizi bazo, noma uzihlele njengomndeni noma yiluphi: bona Imindeni nosayizi bayo. Umndeni utshela ukuthi yisiphi isisetshenziswa ngaphansi kwe-Isisetshenziswa samanzi ethebhini le-Izixhumi kumhleli womndeni. Udrenishi wayo ke ubalwa ngamayunithi wesisetshenziswa: 6 UHC ye-water closet, 1 ye-lavatory, 3 ye-kitchen sink noma i-laundry tub, 2 ye-shower (NBR 8160), noma amayunithi edrenishi e-IPC Table 709.1. Kusukela kuconnector yesisetshenziswa Izinto ezibekwe kusuka emndenini onama-connector (udrenishi nethephu yebhesini, nentamo yesiphephisi somoya: bona Hlela umndeni) zikhombisa ama-connector abo akhululekile njengamaphoyinti lapho i-Ipayipi noma i-Idaktho sivuliwe, futhi iphoyinta iyambambelela kuwo. Qala ku-connector: umugqa uthatha isistimu nosayizi wawo (ipayipi lempahla yebha elingana noma libe nkulu kancane kusayizi we-connector; idaktho elizungezile lalo ububanzi balo). Uma i-connector ibheke phansi noma phezulu, njengedrenishi ngaphansi kwebhesini, umugqa uqala uhamba uye phansi noma phezulu ukuya ekuphakameni kwe-At, bese uqhubeka ngokuchofoza kwakho. Phela ku-connector: umugqa wehla noma uphakama uye kuyo, bese uphela lapho. Umugqa uxhunyiwe kulokhu okwesisetshenziswa ku-faela ye-IFC, ngakho ezinye izinhlelo zibona isisetshenziswa njengengxenye yesistimu yaso. Into ebekwe kamuva nge-connector ekugcineni komugqa nayo iyaxhunywa kuwo. Umugqa osuswa ku-connector awusaxhunyiwe kuyo. Izixhumi ezenziwe ngawe Lapho Okwenziwa yi-BimCraft Umugqa uyajika I-elbow. Ipayipi lensimbi ngomsakazo omude we-ASME B16.9 (1.5 × usayizi), amanye amapayipi ngobubanzi bangaphandle obubodwa, idaktho elizungezile ngama-diameter angu-1.5, idaktho elinesikhwama ngobubanzi obubodwa (noma ukuphakama okubodwa uma kujikwa phansi noma phezulu) Umugqa uphela emgqeni womunye umugqa I-tee; omunye umugqa uyahlukaniswa lapho Imigqa emibili ihlangana ekugcineni ngosayizi abahlukile I-reducer (amapayipi) noma i-transition (amapayipi omoya) Imigqa emibili yosayizi ofanayo ihlangana ekugcineni nge-engeli I-elbow Uma ushintsha, uhambise noma usule umugqa, yonke ixhumanisi kuleli zinga yenziwa kabusha. Uma umlenze ufushane kakhulu kumaxhumanisi asezinhlangothini zawo, i-BimCraft iyatshela futhi ayishintshi lutho: hambisa ikhoni kude. Izixhumi namavalvu ayizinto ezijwayelekile: zidwetshwe kusuka osayizini wepayipi noma wedaktho, hhayi kukhathalogi yomkhiqizi. Izixhumi zokuxhuma, zokucindezela nezegrooved, imizimba yamavalvu kanye nezinsiza zinosayizi womkhiqizi wazo; zihlole nomhlinzeki wakho ngaphambi kokuoda. Amarisa Lapho udweba, thayipha ukuphakama okusha ku-At bese ucindezela Enter: umugqa uhamba uye phezulu noma phansi ekhoneni lokugcina, nge-elbow ekugcineni ngakunye. Irisa lingakhuphuka lingene kwesitezi esingaphezulu. Ilevili ngalinye likhombisa izingxenye zomugqa ibubanzi bayo bokubuka obuzifinyelelayo, nge-UP noma DN kurisa. Imifantu nokuhlamuka kwayo Izindawo zodaka nezemvula ziqala ngokuhlamuka okuncane okuvunyelwe yi-International Plumbing Code ngosayizi wazo: 1/4 in. ngefidi kuze kube ngu-2-1/2 in., 1/8 in. ngefidi kusuka ku-3 kuya ku-6 in., 1/16 in. ngefidi kusuka ku-8 in. Udaka lwePVC lwaseBrazil luqala ngokuhlamuka kwe-NBR 8160: 2 % kuze kube ngu-DN 75, 1 % kusuka ku-DN 100. Thayipha okunye ukuhlamuka ebhareni noma ku-Izici: 1/4\"/ft, 2 % noma 1:50. Umugqa wehla kusukela phuthuma lawo lokuqala, ngakho dweba izindawo zodaka ngendlela egeleza ngayo. Ipulani likhombisa ukwehla kanye nomcibisholo. Izici ziyakhomba uma udaka lulele kunokuhlamuka okuncane kwe-code. Linganisa izindawo zodaka ngamayunithi wesisetshenziswa Khetha udaka lwezempilo: Fixture units ku-Properties itshela ukuthi ithwala amayunithi amangaki nosayizi omncane kakhulu awadingayo. Yonke isisetshenziswa sepulumbing enedrenishi ye-connector yayo emgqeni iyabalwa, nodaka lwonke oluphuma kulo luyabalwa: dweba izindawo zodaka ngendlela ezigeleza ngayo, ngayinye iphela esindaweni yodaka elingena kuyo. Udaka lwePVC lwaseBrazil lubala UHC futhi lulandela i-NBR 8160; ezinye zibala DFU futhi zilandela i-International Plumbing Code. Drain: i-Branch isayizwa ngethebula le-code lamagatsha wezisetshenziswa; i-Building drain ngethebula layo ngokuhlamuka, ngakho i-Slope ibalulekile. Udaka alukaze lube mncane kunodaka wezisetshenziswa aluphakelayo (i-water closet idinga DN 100, noma 3 in.), futhi kunodaka olungena kulo. Ngaphansi kwe-NBR 8160 i-building drain ingu-DN 100 okungenani. Linganisa ubukhulu bokukhipha yenza wonke udaka lwezempilo lwemodeli olumncane kakhulu ngamayunithi wezisetshenziswa lube usayizi odingekayo, njengesinyathelo esisodwa osingasihlehlisa. Udaka olwenziwe bukhulu kunalokho okudingekayo ushiywa njengoba kunjalo. Uma udaka lwethwala ngaphezu kwalokho usayizi omkhulu kakhulu wepayipi lwawo ungakwenza ngalo ukuhlamuka kwalo, i-BimCraft iyatshela: yinike ukuhlamuka okunamandla noma ipayipi elinye. Amathebula ngawezindawo zodaka ezinengama. Izitaki, iziventilishi kanye nodaka lwemvula alisayizwa lapha: zihlole, kanye nodizayini wonke, ngokuhambisana nekhodi esebenza kwiphrojekthi. Amavalvu Khetha Ivalvu bese ukhetha uhlobo: isango, ibhola, iglobe noma i-check. Chofoza epayipini lapho okuya khona. Ipayipi liyasikwa lizungeze lona futhi ivalvu iyaxhunywa ohlangothini lwombili. Ezicini zomugqa zibala amavalvu awo, ngayinye nge-Susa. Izinhlobo eziningi zamavalvu, isihlungi, amadampha emidwebo, izinkombandlela zepayipi zakho kanye nemindeni yabakhiqizi: bona Izinkombandlela zepayipi, amavalvu, amadampha nemindeni yabakhiqizi. Shintsha umugqa Khetha noma iyiphi ingxenye yomugqa, epulanini noma ku-3D view. Ku-Properties: System, Material, Class kanye Size (amapayipi), noma Shape, Width, Height (amapayipi omoya). Height above the level ihambisa umugqa wonke phezulu noma phansi. Insulation: ububanzi bayo, bugcinwa ukuhlola ukukhululeka nohlu lwezimbobo (ayidwetshwa lutho ngayo): bona Hlola amapayipi namapayipi omoya ngokumelene nesakhiwo. Ipayipi lensimbi: Sika ibe amaspuli: bona Amaspuli epayipi lensimbi namashidi amaspuli. Slope (amapayipi). Flow nge-Linganisa usayizi: kumanzi, osayizi omncane kakhulu ogcina amanzi ku-8 ft/s (2.4 m/s), noma ku-5 ft/s (1.5 m/s) kumanzi ashisayo; ku-3 m/s ngepayipi lamanzi e-PVC laseBrazil (NBR 5626). Kumapayipi omoya, ijubane kanye nezinga lokuhwaqeka kwedaktho njengoba lidwetshiwe. Udaka lwezempilo lusayizwa ngamayunithi wesisetshenziswa esikhundleni salokho: bona Linganisa ubukhulu bodaka ngamayunithi wezisetshenziswa ngezansi. Ushintsho ngalunye lungesinyathelo esisodwa se-Hlehlisa. Delete isusa umugqa wonke. Amapulani Amapayipi amancane kuna-150 mm (cishe 6 in.) adwetshwa njengomugqa owodwa emugqeni wasembindini, amapayipi amakhulu kanye nawo wonke amapayipi omoya njengemigqa emibili ngobubanzi bawo. Isistimu ngayinye inombala wayo; i-PDF yepulani iwaphrinta emnyama. Umugqa ngamunye umakwe ngosayizi nesistimu yawo (isibonelo 2\" CW noma 16×10 SA). Uhla lombono wepulani lunquma imigqa okubonisa, futhi Okuboniswa kule pulani ingashiya Izinkombandlela noma Idaktho ngaphandle: bona Imibono, uhla lombono namashidi akho. Amathebula nokubalwa kwezinani Ipaneli ye-Uhlu yengeza Amapayipi (ngesistimu, impahla kanye nosayizi, nobude bawo), Amapayipi omoya (ngesistimu, isimo kanye nosayizi, nobude nendawo yobuso bangaphandle) kanye Izixhumi namavalvu (ngohlobo nosayizi, ibalwa). Chofoza umugqa ukukhetha okuhlwini, Landa i-CSV iyalilanda. Ukubala amanani luthatha imigqa iye ku-TakeoffCraft: ipayipi namapayipi omoya ngosayizi njengemigqa edwetshwe epulanini (udaka olunokuhlamuka kulinganiswa ngokuhamba kwalo), izixhumi namavalvu zibalwa lapho zikhona: bona Thumela izinani zemodeli ku-TakeoffCraft. Imirisa ishiywa ngaphandle kwalelo shidi, ngoba ipulani alikwazi ukuyilinganisa; ithebula lamapayipi linobude bayo. Ku-faela ye-IFC Umugqa ngamunye uyi-assembly equkethe izingxenye zawo: izingxenye zepayipi nedaktho, izixhumi namavalvu, ngayinye nohlobo lwayo, impahla, umbala wesistimu yayo kanye namaphothi ayo. Amaphothi ahlanganayo axhunyiwe, futhi yonke ingxenye ingeyesistimu yayo yokusabalalisa (amafayela e-IFC2X3 athola okufanayo njengezigaba zokugeleza, izixhumi nezilawuli esistimini). Ezinye izinhlelo ezifunda izistimu ze-IFC zibona umugqa oyodwa oxhunyiwe ngesistimu ngayinye. Incazelo yomugqa wawo ilondolozwa nawo, ngakho i-BimCraft iyawenza kabusha ngendlela efanayo lapho uwushintsha.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"room-and-area-tags","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Amathegi egumbi nendawo","summary":"Faka ithegi elinenombolo, igama kanye nendawo egumbini noma endaweni. Ithegi liyalilandela bese lilinganiswa ngobude balo ephepheni.","section":"tasks","order":36,"keywords":["ithegi","ithegi legumbi","ithegi lendawo","thegisa igumbi","thegisa indawo","thegisa konke","ilebula","ubude bombhalo","ubude ephepheni","isichazo"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenziwa","text":"Okuzokwenziwa","level":2},{"id":"lapho-kukhona-amathuluzi","text":"Lapho kukhona amathuluzi","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okwenziwa-yithegi","text":"Okwenziwa yithegi","level":2},{"id":"ku-ifc","text":"Ku-IFC","level":2},{"id":"akukakwakhiwa-okwamanje","text":"Akukakwakhiwa okwamanje","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenziwa\"\u003EOkuzokwenziwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThegisa amagumbi nezindawo ngayinye noma zonke ngesikhathi esisodwa, bese uhambisa ithegi lapho lifundeka kahle.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lapho-kukhona-amathuluzi\"\u003ELapho kukhona amathuluzi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzakhiwo ze-Ribbon: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArchitecture\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EIgumbi nendawo\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETag Room\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETag Area\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsakhiwo sakudala: ibha ye-Draw › imenyu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERooms\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIgumbi noma indawo ekhethiwe: Properties › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a tag\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETag Room\u003C/span\u003E bese uchofoza egumbini, lapho ithegi kufanele libe khona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENoma cindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETag all untagged\u003C/span\u003E ohlwini: wonke amagumbi aleli zinga angenalo ithegi athola elilodwa, emaphakathini awo. Yisinyathelo esisodwa sokuHlehlisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuze uhambise ithegi,liyikhethe ngo-Khetha bese uliphonsa. I-Properties inawo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut it back in the middle\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOkufanayo kusebenza ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETag Area\u003C/span\u003E yezindawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okwenziwa-yithegi\"\u003EOkwenziwa yithegi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIkhomba inombolo, igama kanye nendawo, ngamayunithi wokubonisa akho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIlandela igumbi lalo: qamba kabusha igumbi, hambisa udonga, namazwi nendawo yethegi kushintsha ngesinyathelo esifanayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIlinganiswa ephepheni: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EText height on paper\u003C/span\u003E ikalwa ngamamilimitha (2.5 ukuqala). Ekubukeni kwe-1:50 ithegi elingu-2.5 mm libe ngu-125 mm ebukeni lemodeli; ku-1:100 libe ngu-250 mm.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIgumbi elinethegi likhombisa ithegi esikhundleni selebhili layo elijwayelekile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma igumbi noma indawo yalo inyamalala, ithegi liyanyamalala nalo. I-Hlehlisa ibuyisela kokubili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-ifc\"\u003EKu-IFC\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthegi liyi-IfcAnnotation (ObjectType ROOMTAG noma AREATAG) nombhalo walo njengombhalo oqondile, ne-GlobalId yalokho okubizayo. Umbhalo ofayeleni unikeza indawo ngamamitha ayisikwele.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akukakwakhiwa-okwamanje\"\u003EAkukakwakhiwa okwamanje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzimo zamathegi ozenzela wena, nomugqa oholayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmathegi emasangweni, emawindini nasezindongeni yithuluzi elihlukile (bheka izitayela zamathegi zamashidi).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBona nokunye: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/rooms-and-separators\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/rooms-and-separators\"\u003EAmagumbi nezihlukanisi zegumbi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenziwa Thegisa amagumbi nezindawo ngayinye noma zonke ngesikhathi esisodwa, bese uhambisa ithegi lapho lifundeka kahle. Lapho kukhona amathuluzi Izakhiwo ze-Ribbon: Architecture › Igumbi nendawo › Tag Room ne-Tag Area. Isakhiwo sakudala: ibha ye-Draw › imenyu ye-Rooms. Igumbi noma indawo ekhethiwe: Properties › Add a tag. Izinyathelo Khetha Tag Room bese uchofoza egumbini, lapho ithegi kufanele libe khona. Noma cindezela Tag all untagged ohlwini: wonke amagumbi aleli zinga angenalo ithegi athola elilodwa, emaphakathini awo. Yisinyathelo esisodwa sokuHlehlisa. Ukuze uhambise ithegi,liyikhethe ngo-Khetha bese uliphonsa. I-Properties inawo Put it back in the middle. Okufanayo kusebenza ku-Tag Area yezindawo. Okwenziwa yithegi Ikhomba inombolo, igama kanye nendawo, ngamayunithi wokubonisa akho. Ilandela igumbi lalo: qamba kabusha igumbi, hambisa udonga, namazwi nendawo yethegi kushintsha ngesinyathelo esifanayo. Ilinganiswa ephepheni: Text height on paper ikalwa ngamamilimitha (2.5 ukuqala). Ekubukeni kwe-1:50 ithegi elingu-2.5 mm libe ngu-125 mm ebukeni lemodeli; ku-1:100 libe ngu-250 mm. Igumbi elinethegi likhombisa ithegi esikhundleni selebhili layo elijwayelekile. Uma igumbi noma indawo yalo inyamalala, ithegi liyanyamalala nalo. I-Hlehlisa ibuyisela kokubili. Ku-IFC Ithegi liyi-IfcAnnotation (ObjectType ROOMTAG noma AREATAG) nombhalo walo njengombhalo oqondile, ne-GlobalId yalokho okubizayo. Umbhalo ofayeleni unikeza indawo ngamamitha ayisikwele. Akukakwakhiwa okwamanje Izimo zamathegi ozenzela wena, nomugqa oholayo. Amathegi emasangweni, emawindini nasezindongeni yithuluzi elihlukile (bheka izitayela zamathegi zamashidi). Bona nokunye: Amagumbi nezihlukanisi zegumbi.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"4d-schedule","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Dlala uhlelo lokwakha emodelini","summary":"Vula uhlu lomsebenzi njenge-CSV, xhumanisa umsebenzi ngamunye ezintweni ngempahla ethile, bese uhamba phakathi kwamadethi ukuze ubone okusekwakhiwe, okusaqhubeka nokungakaqali.","section":"tasks","order":36,"keywords":["4d","uhlelo","ukulandelana kokwakha","isikhathi","ukwahlukanisa izigaba","uhlelo lwesikhathi","phasing","programme","gantt","imisebenzi","amadethi","ukulingisa","inqubekela phambili","kwakhiwe","csv","isigaba","isigaba sokwakha","iphakheji lomsebenzi","wbs","iqembu"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"uhlu-lomsebenzi","text":"Uhlu lomsebenzi","level":2},{"id":"izigaba-namaphakheji-womsebenzi","text":"Izigaba namaphakheji womsebenzi","level":2},{"id":"okuzobona","text":"Okuzobona","level":2},{"id":"izixhumanisi-i-gantt-chart-ne-ms-project","text":"Izixhumanisi, i-Gantt chart ne-MS Project","level":2},{"id":"okulandelayo","text":"Okulandelayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBheka isakhiwo sikhula: umsebenzi ngamunye ohlelweni lwakho uxhunywe ezintweni ezizowakha, ubonakale ngosuku ngalunye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula imodeli ye-IFC bese uvula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E4D schedule\u003C/span\u003E kwiphaneli eselwakhohlangothi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDownload a template\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uthole uhlu lomsebenzi onesonto ngesitezi ngasinye, bese uyaliguqula ku-spreadsheet. Noma bhala owakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen a task list…\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha i-CSV.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHudula isilayidi sedethi, noma chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlay\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uhlu-lomsebenzi\"\u003EUhlu lomsebenzi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-CSV enomugqa wekhanda nezikholomu \u003Cstrong\u003ETask\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EStart\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EFinish\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EField\u003C/strong\u003E and \u003Cstrong\u003EValue\u003C/strong\u003E. Amakhoma noma amasemikholoni kokubili kuyasebenza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETask\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EStart\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFinish\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EField\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EValue\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELevel 1\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2026-11-02\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2026-11-13\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStorey\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELevel 1\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERoof\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2026-11-16\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2026-11-20\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EClass\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfcRoof\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERoof\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2026-11-16\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2026-11-20\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPset_WallCommon.IsExternal\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYes\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBhala amadethi njenge-YYYY-MM-DD.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmugqa ngamunye uxhumanisa umsebenzi nazo zonke izinto ezinensimu \u003Cstrong\u003EField\u003C/strong\u003E enenani \u003Cstrong\u003EValue\u003C/strong\u003E elifanayo ngokuphelele. Insimu iyipharamitha efana ne-Storey, Class, Name, Type, Material, Tag noma GlobalId, noma noma yiyiphi ipharamitha ebhalwe ngesethi negama layo: \u003Ccode\u003EPset_WallCommon.FireRating\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPhinda umsebenzi emigqeni eminingi, ngamadethi afanayo, ukuze uxhumanise izinto eziningi kuwo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izigaba-namaphakheji-womsebenzi\"\u003EIzigaba namaphakheji womsebenzi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEngeza ikholomu \u003Cstrong\u003EStage\u003C/strong\u003E, ikholomu \u003Cstrong\u003EPackage\u003C/strong\u003E, noma zombili, ukuze uqoqe imisebenzi ibe izigaba namaphakheji womsebenzi. I-Phase ne-WBS nazo zisebenza njengamagama amakholomu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETask\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EStart\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFinish\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EField\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EValue\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EStage\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EPackage\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELevel 1 slab\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2026-11-02\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2026-11-04\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EClass\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfcSlab\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStructure\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFrame\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELevel 1 walls\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2026-11-05\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2026-11-13\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStorey\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELevel 1\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStructure\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFrame\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDoors\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2026-11-30\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2026-12-04\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EClass\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfcDoor\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFit-out\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJoinery\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmsebenzi owodwa ungena esigabeni esisodwa nakuphakheji elilodwa. Uma umugqa olandelayo walo msebenzi ubiza enye, lowo mugqa ubhalwa ngenombolo yomugqa wawo bese uyakhishwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIgama lephakheji elifanayo ezigabeni ezimbili ngamaphakheji amabili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma uhlu lunamaqembu, uhlu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow\u003C/span\u003E luvela phezu kwedethi. Khetha isigaba noma iphakheji bese silingiswa njengento eyodwa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eisilayidi ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlay\u003C/span\u003E kusebenza kusukela ekuqaleni kokuqala kweqembu kuya ekugcineni kokugcina kwalo,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ekuvela imisebenzi yeqembu kuphela, futhi konke okungaphandle kweqembu kube ngokuqondakalayo,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eumugqa ongaphansi kohlu utshela ukuthi imisebenzi emingaki eseqediwe, eseqhubeka nokuzayo ngalolo suku,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect its elements\u003C/span\u003E ikhetha zonke izinto zeqembu, ukuze kusetshenziswe \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESection\u003C/span\u003E noma uhlu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EWomsebenzi wonke\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze ubuyele ebonweni lonke lohlelo lwesikhathi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzobona\"\u003EOkuzobona\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKwakhiwe\u003C/strong\u003E: izinto zonke imisebenzi yazo eseqediwe, ngemibala yazo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKuyaqhubeka\u003C/strong\u003E: izinto ezinomsebenzi oqhubekayo ngalolo suku, ngombala we-ochre. Umsebenzi uqhubeka kusukela ngedethi yokuqala kuya ngedethi yokugcina.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkuqalwanga\u003C/strong\u003E: ziyabonakala ngokuqondakalayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinto ezingekho emsebenzini ziyahlala njengoba zinjalo. Uhlu lukhombisa ukuthi izinto zingaki umsebenzi ngamunye ozithole. Imigqa engafundeki, noma engathola lutho, ibhalwa ngezinombolo zemigqa yayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izixhumanisi-i-gantt-chart-ne-ms-project\"\u003EIzixhumanisi, i-Gantt chart ne-MS Project\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula ifayela le-Microsoft Project XML (\u003Ccode\u003E.xml\u003C/code\u003E) noma i-CSV enekholomu \u003Ccode\u003EPredecessors\u003C/code\u003E. Izixhumanisi zingaba finish to start, start to start, finish to finish noma start to finish, ngamunye unokusheshisa noma ukubambezeleka ngezinsuku.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphansi kohlu lomsebenzi, i-Gantt chart idweba umsebenzi ngamunye njengebha enamatshwayi ezixhumanisi. Imisebenzi esendleleni ebucayi ibomvu. Iluphu yesixhumanisi noma i-predecessor engekho ikhonjwa kuphaneli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave as MS Project XML\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave CSV with links\u003C/span\u003E zibhala uhlelo emuva ngezixhumanisi zalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulandelayo\"\u003EOkulandelayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/find\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/find\"\u003EThola izinto ngeklasi, igama noma impahla\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/color-by-property\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/color-by-property\"\u003EPhahlaza izinto ngempahla\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Bheka isakhiwo sikhula: umsebenzi ngamunye ohlelweni lwakho uxhunywe ezintweni ezizowakha, ubonakale ngosuku ngalunye. Izinyathelo Vula imodeli ye-IFC bese uvula 4D schedule kwiphaneli eselwakhohlangothi. Chofoza Download a template ukuze uthole uhlu lomsebenzi onesonto ngesitezi ngasinye, bese uyaliguqula ku-spreadsheet. Noma bhala owakho. Chofoza Open a task list… bese ukhetha i-CSV. Hudula isilayidi sedethi, noma chofoza Play. Uhlu lomsebenzi I-CSV enomugqa wekhanda nezikholomu Task, Start, Finish, Field and Value. Amakhoma noma amasemikholoni kokubili kuyasebenza. Task Start Finish Field Value Level 1 2026-11-02 2026-11-13 Storey Level 1 Roof 2026-11-16 2026-11-20 Class IfcRoof Roof 2026-11-16 2026-11-20 Pset_WallCommon.IsExternal Yes Bhala amadethi njenge-YYYY-MM-DD. Umugqa ngamunye uxhumanisa umsebenzi nazo zonke izinto ezinensimu Field enenani Value elifanayo ngokuphelele. Insimu iyipharamitha efana ne-Storey, Class, Name, Type, Material, Tag noma GlobalId, noma noma yiyiphi ipharamitha ebhalwe ngesethi negama layo: Pset_WallCommon.FireRating. Phinda umsebenzi emigqeni eminingi, ngamadethi afanayo, ukuze uxhumanise izinto eziningi kuwo. Izigaba namaphakheji womsebenzi Engeza ikholomu Stage, ikholomu Package, noma zombili, ukuze uqoqe imisebenzi ibe izigaba namaphakheji womsebenzi. I-Phase ne-WBS nazo zisebenza njengamagama amakholomu. Task Start Finish Field Value Stage Package Level 1 slab 2026-11-02 2026-11-04 Class IfcSlab Structure Frame Level 1 walls 2026-11-05 2026-11-13 Storey Level 1 Structure Frame Doors 2026-11-30 2026-12-04 Class IfcDoor Fit-out Joinery Umsebenzi owodwa ungena esigabeni esisodwa nakuphakheji elilodwa. Uma umugqa olandelayo walo msebenzi ubiza enye, lowo mugqa ubhalwa ngenombolo yomugqa wawo bese uyakhishwa. Igama lephakheji elifanayo ezigabeni ezimbili ngamaphakheji amabili. Uma uhlu lunamaqembu, uhlu Show luvela phezu kwedethi. Khetha isigaba noma iphakheji bese silingiswa njengento eyodwa: isilayidi ne-Play kusebenza kusukela ekuqaleni kokuqala kweqembu kuya ekugcineni kokugcina kwalo, kuvela imisebenzi yeqembu kuphela, futhi konke okungaphandle kweqembu kube ngokuqondakalayo, umugqa ongaphansi kohlu utshela ukuthi imisebenzi emingaki eseqediwe, eseqhubeka nokuzayo ngalolo suku, Select its elements ikhetha zonke izinto zeqembu, ukuze kusetshenziswe Show, Section noma uhlu. Khetha Womsebenzi wonke ukuze ubuyele ebonweni lonke lohlelo lwesikhathi. Okuzobona Kwakhiwe: izinto zonke imisebenzi yazo eseqediwe, ngemibala yazo. Kuyaqhubeka: izinto ezinomsebenzi oqhubekayo ngalolo suku, ngombala we-ochre. Umsebenzi uqhubeka kusukela ngedethi yokuqala kuya ngedethi yokugcina. Akuqalwanga: ziyabonakala ngokuqondakalayo. Izinto ezingekho emsebenzini ziyahlala njengoba zinjalo. Uhlu lukhombisa ukuthi izinto zingaki umsebenzi ngamunye ozithole. Imigqa engafundeki, noma engathola lutho, ibhalwa ngezinombolo zemigqa yayo. Izixhumanisi, i-Gantt chart ne-MS Project Vula ifayela le-Microsoft Project XML (.xml) noma i-CSV enekholomu Predecessors. Izixhumanisi zingaba finish to start, start to start, finish to finish noma start to finish, ngamunye unokusheshisa noma ukubambezeleka ngezinsuku. Ngaphansi kohlu lomsebenzi, i-Gantt chart idweba umsebenzi ngamunye njengebha enamatshwayi ezixhumanisi. Imisebenzi esendleleni ebucayi ibomvu. Iluphu yesixhumanisi noma i-predecessor engekho ikhonjwa kuphaneli. Save as MS Project XML ne-Save CSV with links zibhala uhlelo emuva ngezixhumanisi zalo. Okulandelayo Thola izinto ngeklasi, igama noma impahla Phahlaza izinto ngempahla","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"edit-in-elevations","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Hlela ku-elevation nasezigabeni, usayizi wamashidi, amabhulokhi esihloko nokuqamba kabusha","summary":"Hambisa izindonga, izimnyango, amawindi namazinga bese udweba izindonga, izimbobo, amazinga, ubukhulu nezinothi ngqo ku-elevation noma esigabeni, gcina usayizi wakho wamashidi namabhulokhi esihloko njengedatha, bese uqamba kabusha imindeni, usayizi nezinto kusiphequluli sephrojekthi.","section":"tasks","order":36,"keywords":["izinga elisha ku-elevation","ubukhulu ku-elevation","hlela ku-elevation","hlela esigabeni","ukubuka kohlangothi","ukubuka isigaba","hambisa udonga ku-elevation","indiza yewindi","ukuphakama kwezinga","hudula izinga","dweba udonga esigabeni","izinothi ku-elevation","isimo","usayizi weshidi","usayizi weshidi wangokwezifiso","usayizi wephepha","ibhulokhi yesihloko","isikebhe sebhulokhi yesihloko","ifomethi yeshidi","umngcele","izinkambu","ikhasimende","kudwetshwe ngu","ukubuyekeza","qamba kabusha umndeni","qamba kabusha uhlobo","qamba kabusha into","isiphequluli sephrojekthi"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"hlela-ku-elevation-noma-esigabeni","text":"Hlela ku-elevation noma esigabeni","level":2},{"id":"usayizi-wamashidi-namabhulokhi-esihloko","text":"Usayizi wamashidi namabhulokhi esihloko","level":2},{"id":"qamba-kabusha-imindeni-usayizi-nezinto","text":"Qamba kabusha imindeni, usayizi nezinto","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShintsha isakhiwo lapho ukibona ngohlangothi, lungisa amashidi asetshenziswa yihhovisi lakho, bese unikeza imindeni, usayizi nezinto amagama ofuna.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlela-ku-elevation-noma-esigabeni\"\u003EHlela ku-elevation noma esigabeni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw\u003C/span\u003E. Ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProject browser\u003C/span\u003E, vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EElevations\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESections\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza inkinobho yepensela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit in this view\u003C/span\u003E kumugqa ngamunye. Ukubuka kuvulwa njengoba kudwetshwa emashidini, nezinto ozingashintsha phezulu kwakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect and move\u003C/span\u003E:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ehudula udonga obheke ukubuka ngalo;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ehudula umnyango noma iwindi ngasodongeni walo, neweindi phezulu noma phansi ukuze ushintshe i-sill yalo;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ehudula umugqa wezinga phezulu noma phansi ukuze ushintshe ukuphakama kwalo;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ehudula inothi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDoor\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWindow\u003C/span\u003E: chofoza odongeni lapho okufanele khona (iwindi ekuphakameni ochofoza khona).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWall\u003C/span\u003E (ezigabeni): chofoza lapho iqala khona nalapho iphela khona endizeni yesigaba; idwetshwa ezingeni ngaphansi kokuchofoza kwakho kokuqala, kuze kufike ezingeni elilandelayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENote\u003C/span\u003E: chofoza bese ubhala. Izinothi zigcinwa efayeleni futhi zidwetshwa kuwo wonke amashidi abonisa lokubuka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELevel\u003C/span\u003E: chofoza ekuphakameni lapho izinga elisha kumele khona. Lifana nekhala eliphakathi kwalo nezinga elingaphezulu (3000 mm ngaphezulu); hudula umugqa walo ukuze ushintshe. Izinga lesibili elingaphakathi kwe-50 mm kwelinye liyenqatshwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDimension\u003C/span\u003E: chofoza lapho iqala khona nalapho iphela khona. Ukuchofoza kubamba imiphetho yodonga, yomnyango, yewindi nezinga, futhi ubukhulu buba bomile noma buba bomile, nanoma ungayihamba kanjani. Igcinwa efayeleni futhi idwetshwa, nobude bayo, kuwo wonke amashidi abonisa lokubuka. Yichofoze ngo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect and move\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uyikhethe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E noma inkinobho ye-Delete isusa udonga, umnyango, iwindi, ubukhulu noma inothi okhethiwe. Ctrl+Z ihlehlisa inguquko yokugcina lapho iphaneli ivulekile. Esc ibuyela ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect and move\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInguquko ngayinye iyinguquko efanayo enziwa yipulani, isinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa: ipulani, ukubuka kwe-3D namashidi kuyalandela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"usayizi-wamashidi-namabhulokhi-esihloko\"\u003EUsayizi wamashidi namabhulokhi esihloko\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula ishidi (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew sheet\u003C/span\u003E, noma eyodwa yakho ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESheets\u003C/span\u003E). Eduze kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaper\u003C/span\u003E kukhona \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETitle block\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFormats…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaper\u003C/span\u003E ibala yonke usayizi ojwayelekile (Letter kuya ku-Arch E, A4 kuya ku-A0) nowakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETitle block\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStrip (bottom)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EColumn (right)\u003C/span\u003E nezinkambu ezivamile, noma eyakho. Izinkambu zeyodwa ozikhethile zivela ngaphansi kwegama leshidi: thayipha ikhasimende, owayidweba, ukubuyekeza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFormats…\u003C/span\u003E yenza eyakho: usayizi weshidi (igama, ububanzi, ubude, umngcele) nebhulokhi yesihloko (lapho iya khona, ububanzi bayo, izinkambu zayo ngomugqa ngamunye; qeda inkambu ngu-* ukuze uyenze inkulu).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E iyilondoloza njengefayela lelabhulali, futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport…\u003C/span\u003E iyengeza kwenye imodeli. Igcinwa emodelini, ngakho isifanekiso sithwala lezi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qamba-kabusha-imindeni-usayizi-nezinto\"\u003EQamba kabusha imindeni, usayizi nezinto\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProject browser\u003C/span\u003E, vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFamilies\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIpensela eseceleni komndeni liwuqamba kabusha; uhlobo lwalo lonke usayizi luthatha igama elisha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula usayizi womndeni ukuze uqamba kabusha usayizi, noma into ebekwe kusuka kuwo (kuya kwezingu-40 ngosayizi ngamunye ziyadwetshwa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuqamba kabusha ngakunye kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Shintsha isakhiwo lapho ukibona ngohlangothi, lungisa amashidi asetshenziswa yihhovisi lakho, bese unikeza imindeni, usayizi nezinto amagama ofuna. Hlela ku-elevation noma esigabeni Vula Draw. Ku-Project browser, vula Elevations noma Sections. Chofoza inkinobho yepensela Edit in this view kumugqa ngamunye. Ukubuka kuvulwa njengoba kudwetshwa emashidini, nezinto ozingashintsha phezulu kwakho. Ngo-Select and move: hudula udonga obheke ukubuka ngalo; hudula umnyango noma iwindi ngasodongeni walo, neweindi phezulu noma phansi ukuze ushintshe i-sill yalo; hudula umugqa wezinga phezulu noma phansi ukuze ushintshe ukuphakama kwalo; hudula inothi. Door ne-Window: chofoza odongeni lapho okufanele khona (iwindi ekuphakameni ochofoza khona). Wall (ezigabeni): chofoza lapho iqala khona nalapho iphela khona endizeni yesigaba; idwetshwa ezingeni ngaphansi kokuchofoza kwakho kokuqala, kuze kufike ezingeni elilandelayo. Note: chofoza bese ubhala. Izinothi zigcinwa efayeleni futhi zidwetshwa kuwo wonke amashidi abonisa lokubuka. Level: chofoza ekuphakameni lapho izinga elisha kumele khona. Lifana nekhala eliphakathi kwalo nezinga elingaphezulu (3000 mm ngaphezulu); hudula umugqa walo ukuze ushintshe. Izinga lesibili elingaphakathi kwe-50 mm kwelinye liyenqatshwa. Dimension: chofoza lapho iqala khona nalapho iphela khona. Ukuchofoza kubamba imiphetho yodonga, yomnyango, yewindi nezinga, futhi ubukhulu buba bomile noma buba bomile, nanoma ungayihamba kanjani. Igcinwa efayeleni futhi idwetshwa, nobude bayo, kuwo wonke amashidi abonisa lokubuka. Yichofoze ngo-Select and move ukuze uyikhethe. Delete noma inkinobho ye-Delete isusa udonga, umnyango, iwindi, ubukhulu noma inothi okhethiwe. Ctrl+Z ihlehlisa inguquko yokugcina lapho iphaneli ivulekile. Esc ibuyela ku-Select and move. Inguquko ngayinye iyinguquko efanayo enziwa yipulani, isinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa: ipulani, ukubuka kwe-3D namashidi kuyalandela. Usayizi wamashidi namabhulokhi esihloko Vula ishidi (New sheet, noma eyodwa yakho ngaphansi kwe-Sheets). Eduze kwe-Paper kukhona Title block ne-Formats…. Paper ibala yonke usayizi ojwayelekile (Letter kuya ku-Arch E, A4 kuya ku-A0) nowakho. Title block: Strip (bottom), Column (right) nezinkambu ezivamile, noma eyakho. Izinkambu zeyodwa ozikhethile zivela ngaphansi kwegama leshidi: thayipha ikhasimende, owayidweba, ukubuyekeza. Formats… yenza eyakho: usayizi weshidi (igama, ububanzi, ubude, umngcele) nebhulokhi yesihloko (lapho iya khona, ububanzi bayo, izinkambu zayo ngomugqa ngamunye; qeda inkambu ngu-* ukuze uyenze inkulu). Export iyilondoloza njengefayela lelabhulali, futhi Import… iyengeza kwenye imodeli. Igcinwa emodelini, ngakho isifanekiso sithwala lezi. Qamba kabusha imindeni, usayizi nezinto Ku-Project browser, vula Families. Ipensela eseceleni komndeni liwuqamba kabusha; uhlobo lwalo lonke usayizi luthatha igama elisha. Vula usayizi womndeni ukuze uqamba kabusha usayizi, noma into ebekwe kusuka kuwo (kuya kwezingu-40 ngosayizi ngamunye ziyadwetshwa). Ukuqamba kabusha ngakunye kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"units-on-import","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Izinyunithi lapho kungeniswa: ifayela lisho izinyunithi zalo, noma ubuzwa kuqala","summary":"Uma ifayela oliletha lisho izinyunithi zalo, i-BimCraft iyazisebenzisa futhi iyakutshela. Uma lingazishongi, i-BimCraft iyakubuza ngaphambi kokubeka noma yini bese ikhumbula impendulo yakho kulelo fayela.","section":"tasks","order":36,"keywords":["izinyunithi","ukungenisa","vula","OBJ","STL","DWG","DXF","IFC","iphoyinti lamafu","into yelayibrari","amamilimitha","amamitha","amainshi","amafidi","isikali","usayizi ongalungile","omkhulu kakhulu","omncane kakhulu","amahlandla angu-1000","buza","kukhunjulwe"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"yiziphi-izifayela-ezishongo-izinyunithi-zazo","text":"Yiziphi izifayela ezishongo izinyunithi zazo","level":2},{"id":"okuhle-ukwazi","text":"Okuhle ukwazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgenisa ifayela bese uqinisekisa ukuthi lingena ngosayizi ofanele.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula noma engeza ifayela njengoba ujwayelekile: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIvulekile\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmafayela\u003C/span\u003E yelayibrari, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmafu wamaphoyinti\u003C/span\u003E, noma Build › Kusuka emdwebeni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma ifayela lisho izinyunithi zalo, akukho okubuzwayo. Umugqa wesimo uyakusho ukuthi yiziphi izinyunithi ifayela elizishongo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma lingazishongi, ingxoxo ibuza \u003Cstrong\u003EIzinyunithi zefayela\u003C/strong\u003E. Khetha ukuthi iyiphi iyunithi eyodwa kufayela, bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESebenzisa lezi zinyunithi\u003C/span\u003E. Akukho okubekwayo ngaphambi kokuthi uphendule.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhansela\u003C/span\u003E (noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) akulethi lutho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yiziphi-izifayela-ezishongo-izinyunithi-zazo\"\u003EYiziphi izifayela ezishongo izinyunithi zazo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIFC\u003C/strong\u003E: ishongo yunithi yobude bayo, futhi &quot;Ivuliwe&quot; isho ukuthi yiyiphi. I-IFC engashongi lutho ibuzwa ngaphambi kokuthi ivulwe; impendulo yakho ibhalwa kumodeli, ngakho ifayela liyishongo kanye lapho ulondoloza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDWG ne-DXF\u003C/strong\u003E: izinyunithi zokufaka zomdwebo. Umdwebo ongazo ubuzwa (amafayela elayibrari, Build › Kusuka emdwebeni, umhlaba kusuka kumakhonthuwa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUhlu lwamaphoyinti\u003C/strong\u003E komhlaba: alishongi zinyunithi. Uyabuzwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmafu wamaphoyinti\u003C/strong\u003E: i-LAS ne-LAZ enohlelo lwamakhoordinethi, i-E57, i-PTX ne-PLY zishongo zazo. Ezinye ziyabuzwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOBJ ne-STL\u003C/strong\u003E: azikaze zishongo izinyunithi. Uyabuzwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EglTF ne-GLB\u003C/strong\u003E: amamitha, ngomthetho wefomethi ngokwayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzithombe\u003C/strong\u003E: azinosayizi wazo. Isithombe sifakwa ekubukeni bese usetha usayizi wazo nge-Scale by two points. Usayizi onikeza ukhunjulwa kulelo fayela: uma sibekwa futhi, singena ngalowo sayizi, nomugqa wesimo uyakusho lokho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOkwengeziwe kwamafu wamaphoyinti\u003C/strong\u003E: iyabuza uma wakha ifu elingashongi yunithi, futhi ilebhula izinombolo zefu ngeyunithi elilethayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuhle-ukwazi\"\u003EOkuhle ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImpendulo ikhunjulwa kulelo fayela (igama, usayizi nosuku) kulelo khompyutha, kuzo zonke izinhlelo ze-CadCraft. Ngesikhathi esilandelayo lapho ifayela elifanayo lingena, awubuzwa, nomugqa wesimo uyakusho ukuthi izinyunithi ezikhunjuliwe zisetshenzisiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuze ubuzwe futhi: i-command palette (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) › \u003Cstrong\u003EBuza futhi izinyunithi zamafayela angeniswayo\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUhlu lwezinyunithi olusuke seluqala ukungeniswa (Izinyunithi zelayibrari, Izinyunithi zebha lefu, Izinyunithi zomdwebo ku-Kusuka emdwebeni) luseshintsha izinyunithi emva kwalokho. Uhlu lwezinyunithi lwethuluzi lomhlaba manje lulokho okuqala ngakho umbuzo kuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Ngenisa ifayela bese uqinisekisa ukuthi lingena ngosayizi ofanele. Izinyathelo Vula noma engeza ifayela njengoba ujwayelekile: Ivulekile, Amafayela yelayibrari, Amafu wamaphoyinti, noma Build › Kusuka emdwebeni. Uma ifayela lisho izinyunithi zalo, akukho okubuzwayo. Umugqa wesimo uyakusho ukuthi yiziphi izinyunithi ifayela elizishongo. Uma lingazishongi, ingxoxo ibuza Izinyunithi zefayela. Khetha ukuthi iyiphi iyunithi eyodwa kufayela, bese uchofoza Sebenzisa lezi zinyunithi. Akukho okubekwayo ngaphambi kokuthi uphendule. Khansela (noma Esc) akulethi lutho. Yiziphi izifayela ezishongo izinyunithi zazo IFC: ishongo yunithi yobude bayo, futhi \"Ivuliwe\" isho ukuthi yiyiphi. I-IFC engashongi lutho ibuzwa ngaphambi kokuthi ivulwe; impendulo yakho ibhalwa kumodeli, ngakho ifayela liyishongo kanye lapho ulondoloza. DWG ne-DXF: izinyunithi zokufaka zomdwebo. Umdwebo ongazo ubuzwa (amafayela elayibrari, Build › Kusuka emdwebeni, umhlaba kusuka kumakhonthuwa). Uhlu lwamaphoyinti komhlaba: alishongi zinyunithi. Uyabuzwa. Amafu wamaphoyinti: i-LAS ne-LAZ enohlelo lwamakhoordinethi, i-E57, i-PTX ne-PLY zishongo zazo. Ezinye ziyabuzwa. OBJ ne-STL: azikaze zishongo izinyunithi. Uyabuzwa. glTF ne-GLB: amamitha, ngomthetho wefomethi ngokwayo. Izithombe: azinosayizi wazo. Isithombe sifakwa ekubukeni bese usetha usayizi wazo nge-Scale by two points. Usayizi onikeza ukhunjulwa kulelo fayela: uma sibekwa futhi, singena ngalowo sayizi, nomugqa wesimo uyakusho lokho. Okwengeziwe kwamafu wamaphoyinti: iyabuza uma wakha ifu elingashongi yunithi, futhi ilebhula izinombolo zefu ngeyunithi elilethayo. Okuhle ukwazi Impendulo ikhunjulwa kulelo fayela (igama, usayizi nosuku) kulelo khompyutha, kuzo zonke izinhlelo ze-CadCraft. Ngesikhathi esilandelayo lapho ifayela elifanayo lingena, awubuzwa, nomugqa wesimo uyakusho ukuthi izinyunithi ezikhunjuliwe zisetshenzisiwe. Ukuze ubuzwe futhi: i-command palette (Ctrl+K) › Buza futhi izinyunithi zamafayela angeniswayo. Uhlu lwezinyunithi olusuke seluqala ukungeniswa (Izinyunithi zelayibrari, Izinyunithi zebha lefu, Izinyunithi zomdwebo ku-Kusuka emdwebeni) luseshintsha izinyunithi emva kwalokho. Uhlu lwezinyunithi lwethuluzi lomhlaba manje lulokho okuqala ngakho umbuzo kuphela.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"render-unreal","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Thumela isimo kwinjini yomdlalo","summary":"I-Studio ingabhala isimo kuphrojekthi ye-Unreal Engine futhi iyigcine ilingana ngokuthunyelwa ngakunye; okuhlelwe yiwe kuhlala kwisendlalelo i-CadCraft ngaze yayibhala. Ipulaginini evula kuyo ayikakhishwa.","section":"tasks","order":36,"keywords":["unreal","unreal engine","injini yomdlalo","xhuma","thumela","usd stage","iphrojekthi","philayo","cine camera","uhlu lokurenda lwemuvi"],"headings":[{"id":"thumela-isimo","text":"Thumela isimo","level":2},{"id":"okwakho-kuphephile","text":"Okwakho kuphephile","level":2},{"id":"ngaphandle-kwe-studio","text":"Ngaphandle kwe-Studio","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EKu-CadCraft Studio uhlu lwe-Injini lungaba nesixhumanisi kuphrojekthi ye-Unreal Engine. Indlela eyodwa kuphela: kusuka ku-CadCraft iye ku-Unreal.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"thumela-isimo\"\u003EThumela isimo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha inkombandlela ye-Unreal ohlwini lwe-Injini. Okokuqala, i-Studio icela ukuthi ukhethe ifolda yephrojekthi yakho (enefayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.uproject\u003C/code\u003E); iyayikhumbula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E. I-Studio ibhala \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft/&lt;igama lefayela&gt;/\u003C/code\u003E ngaphakathi kwephrojekthi: isimo njengefayela le-USD, ifayela lezilungiselelo, amaphrofayili okukhanya, namafayela amabili amancane esendlalelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShintsha imodeli, londoloza bese uthumela futhi. Kuphela isimo nefayela lezilungiselelo ziyashintshwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okwakho-kuphephile\"\u003EOkwakho kuphephile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsiteji evulwa yi-Unreal iyisendlalelo esincane esenziwa kanye, nezendlalelo ezimbili ngaphansi kwayo: \u003Cstrong\u003Eeyakho\u003C/strong\u003E phezulu (\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;igama&gt;.user.usda\u003C/code\u003E, ingenalutho ekuqaleni, ayikaze ibhalwe kabusha yi-CadCraft) nesimo se-CadCraft ngaphansi. Ukuhlelwa okulondolozela esendlalelweni yakho kuhlala uma isimo sithunyelwa futhi. Izibani nezinye izinto ozibeka kuleveli ye-Unreal ziphandle kwesiteji futhi azithintwa nazo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ngaphandle-kwe-studio\"\u003ENgaphandle kwe-Studio\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuwebhu, noma kukhompyutha lapho i-Studio ingathola i-Unreal, khetha \u003Cstrong\u003EIfolda yephrojekthi ye-Unreal (.zip)\u003C/strong\u003E ohlwini lwe-Injini bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda\u003C/span\u003E. Ibhala ifolda efanayo njenge-zip: yiyiphathe ifolda ye-\u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft\u003C/code\u003E yephrojekthi yakho. Yishiye ivuliwe \u003Cstrong\u003EFaka amafayela esiteji\u003C/strong\u003E okokuqala; yicime ekulondolozeni okulandelayo, ukuze i-zip iqukathe isimo nefayela lezilungiselelo kuphela, nesendlalelo sakho singabhalwa kabusha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIpulaginini ye-Unreal evula isiteji, isebenzisa ilanga, izibani, amakhamera nokuvezwa, ilandela ukuthunyelwa ngakunye futhi ikhiphe ikhamera \u003Cstrong\u003Eayikakhishwa\u003C/strong\u003E, futhi ayikaze iqhutshwe ku-Unreal. Kuze kube yilapho, Thumela ifaka amafayela ephrojekthini futhi amathuluzi we-USD e-Unreal angawavula. I-Windows yesistimu yokuqala; i-macOS iyalandela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Ku-CadCraft Studio uhlu lwe-Injini lungaba nesixhumanisi kuphrojekthi ye-Unreal Engine. Indlela eyodwa kuphela: kusuka ku-CadCraft iye ku-Unreal. Thumela isimo Khetha inkombandlela ye-Unreal ohlwini lwe-Injini. Okokuqala, i-Studio icela ukuthi ukhethe ifolda yephrojekthi yakho (enefayela le-.uproject); iyayikhumbula. Chofoza Thumela. I-Studio ibhala CadCraft/\u003Cigama lefayela\u003E/ ngaphakathi kwephrojekthi: isimo njengefayela le-USD, ifayela lezilungiselelo, amaphrofayili okukhanya, namafayela amabili amancane esendlalelo. Shintsha imodeli, londoloza bese uthumela futhi. Kuphela isimo nefayela lezilungiselelo ziyashintshwa. Okwakho kuphephile Isiteji evulwa yi-Unreal iyisendlalelo esincane esenziwa kanye, nezendlalelo ezimbili ngaphansi kwayo: eyakho phezulu (\u003Cigama\u003E.user.usda, ingenalutho ekuqaleni, ayikaze ibhalwe kabusha yi-CadCraft) nesimo se-CadCraft ngaphansi. Ukuhlelwa okulondolozela esendlalelweni yakho kuhlala uma isimo sithunyelwa futhi. Izibani nezinye izinto ozibeka kuleveli ye-Unreal ziphandle kwesiteji futhi azithintwa nazo. Ngaphandle kwe-Studio Kuwebhu, noma kukhompyutha lapho i-Studio ingathola i-Unreal, khetha Ifolda yephrojekthi ye-Unreal (.zip) ohlwini lwe-Injini bese uchofoza Renda. Ibhala ifolda efanayo njenge-zip: yiyiphathe ifolda ye-CadCraft yephrojekthi yakho. Yishiye ivuliwe Faka amafayela esiteji okokuqala; yicime ekulondolozeni okulandelayo, ukuze i-zip iqukathe isimo nefayela lezilungiselelo kuphela, nesendlalelo sakho singabhalwa kabusha. Ipulaginini ye-Unreal evula isiteji, isebenzisa ilanga, izibani, amakhamera nokuvezwa, ilandela ukuthunyelwa ngakunye futhi ikhiphe ikhamera ayikakhishwa, futhi ayikaze iqhutshwe ku-Unreal. Kuze kube yilapho, Thumela ifaka amafayela ephrojekthini futhi amathuluzi we-USD e-Unreal angawavula. I-Windows yesistimu yokuqala; i-macOS iyalandela.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"shafts-and-vertical-openings","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Amashafu nokuvulwa kumaphansi","summary":"Ishafu iyinqwaba eyodwa esika wonke amaphansi, isilingi nophahla phakathi kwamazinga amabili. Ukuvulwa okuqondile kusika elilodwa kuzo. Ukuvuleka kodonga kusika udonga.","section":"tasks","order":37,"keywords":["ishafu","ishafu yelifiti","ishafu yesitezi","ukuvulwa kwesitebhisi","isinyathelo","ukuvulwa okuqondile","ukuvulwa kwephansi","ukuvulwa kwesilingi","ukuvulwa kophahla","ukuvulwa kwesibani sophahla","umbobo ophansini","ukuvuleka kodonga","IfcOpeningElement","ukukhishwa","indawo esele"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"lapho-kukhona-amathuluzi","text":"Lapho kukhona amathuluzi","level":2},{"id":"ishafu","text":"Ishafu","level":2},{"id":"ukuvulwa-okuqondile","text":"Ukuvulwa okuqondile","level":2},{"id":"ukuvuleka-kodonga","text":"Ukuvuleka kodonga","level":2},{"id":"izinani","text":"Izinani","level":2},{"id":"uma-kungasikwa-lutho","text":"Uma kungasikwa lutho","level":2},{"id":"ku-ifc","text":"Ku-IFC","level":2},{"id":"akusakhiwe-okwamanje","text":"Akusakhiwe okwamanje","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESika ishafu yelifiti ngokuhamba kwesakhiwo ngomdwebo oyodwa, sika umbobo kwesinye isitezi, bese ufunda ukuthi yini ekhishwe ezindaweni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lapho-kukhona-amathuluzi\"\u003ELapho kukhona amathuluzi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzakhiwo zebhoni: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkwakheka\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EUkuvuleka\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIshafu\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuvulwa okuqondile\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuvuleka kodonga\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsakhiwo sakudala: ibha yokudweba › imenyu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmagumbi\u003C/span\u003E (Ishafu, Ukuvulwa okuqondile) kanye nemenyu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzindonga\u003C/span\u003E (ukuvuleka kodonga).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ishafu\"\u003EIshafu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula ipulani yesitezi ishafu eqala kuso. Khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIshafu\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEmgqeni khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinga lesisekelo\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinga eliphezulu\u003C/span\u003E, nokuhlukana uma iqala noma iphela ngaphezu noma ngaphansi kwawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza amakhona womugqa. Chofoza futhi ikhona lokuqala, chofoza kabili, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze uqede.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYonke iphansi, isilingi nophahla phakathi kwalawo mazinga amabili kuyasikwa. Umugqa wesimo uyakutshela ukuthi zingaki.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIshafu ingento eyodwa. Khetha umumo walo kunoma yisiphi isitezi edlula kuso: \u003Cstrong\u003EIzakhiwo\u003C/strong\u003E inezinto zalo, amazinga nokuhlukana, okusikiwe nendawo ekhishiwe. Uyishintsha bese wonke umbobo uyalandela. Uyisusa bese wonke umbobo uyanyamalala. Ngayinye iyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIshafu iyaqhubeka nokusika: iphansi elenziwe kamuva phakathi kwamazinga ayo lisikwa ngaphandle kokucelwa, nephansi oliyisusayo liyekwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIphansi elimi phezu kwalo ishafu alisikwa (ophezulu balo ungu-base). Nika isisekelo ukuhlukana okungamanani ukuze nalo lisikwe. Nika ophezulu ukuhlukana okuhle ukuze udlule uphahla.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuvulwa-okuqondile\"\u003EUkuvulwa okuqondile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuvulwa okuqondile\u003C/span\u003E. Emgqeni khetha ukuthi yini ozoyisika: iphansi, isilingi noma uphahla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza amakhona womugqa bese uqeda njengaphezulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIphansi, isilingi noma uphahla lalesi sitezi ngaphansi komugqa liyasikwa. Lingeleyo into eyodwa: susa iphansi nokuvulwa kuyanyamalala nalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuvuleka-kodonga\"\u003EUkuvuleka kodonga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuvuleka kodonga\u003C/span\u003E yithuluzi lalo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/wall-shape\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/wall-shape\"\u003EUmumo wodonga\u003C/a\u003E: chofoza udonga epulanini, noma amakhona amabili ebusweni balo nge-3D.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinani\"\u003EIzinani\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgomthetho wokulinganisa wamaphansi, indawo esele yento iyindawo yayo ephelele ngaphandle kwalokho okukhishwe kuyo. Ishafu noma ukuvulwa okuqondile kuyokukhishwa kuyo yonke iphansi nesilingi okusikayo; Amahlu Amaphansi Nokuqeda nemibalo ye-IFC akhombisa izinombolo ezifanayo. Ophahleni ukukhishwa kuyindawo yobuso bophahla: indawo yepulani ihlukaniswe nge-cosine yokuthambeka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmugqa ongaphandle okhahlela ngaphezu komphetho ukhipha kuphela ingxenye ekuleyo nto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uma-kungasikwa-lutho\"\u003EUma kungasikwa lutho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIshafu engenalutho ezindleleni zayo iyenziwa futhi iyasho lokho: izosika lokho okuzakhiwa khona kamuva. Ukuvulwa okuqondile kudinga okuthile ngaphansi kwakho; uma kungekho lutho, umugqa wesimo uyasho futhi akwenziwa lutho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-ifc\"\u003EKu-IFC\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkusika ngakunye kuyi-IfcOpeningElement enesixhumanisi ne-IfcRelVoidsElement kuleyo nto eyisikayo, ngakho noma yiluphi uhlelo lwe-IFC lubonisa umbobo. Uphahla lusikwa ngobuso ngabunye. Ishafu ngokwayo iyi-IfcGroup equkethe okuvulekile kwayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akusakhiwe-okwamanje\"\u003EAkusakhiwe okwamanje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImigqa egobile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUdonga lweshafu: udwebe ngethuluzi le-Wall.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuhlela umugqa ngokudonsa amakhona (shintsha ku-Izakhiwo, noma susa bese udweba kabusha).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzakhiwo zephansi elidwetshiwe ziveza indawo yalo ngaphandle kokuvulwa kwalo kuphela; amahlu nemibalo ye-IFC ihlanganisa leyo yeshafu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBheka futhi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/rooms-and-separators\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/rooms-and-separators\"\u003EAmakamelo nezahlukanisi zamakamelo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Sika ishafu yelifiti ngokuhamba kwesakhiwo ngomdwebo oyodwa, sika umbobo kwesinye isitezi, bese ufunda ukuthi yini ekhishwe ezindaweni. Lapho kukhona amathuluzi Izakhiwo zebhoni: Ukwakheka › Ukuvuleka › Ishafu, Ukuvulwa okuqondile no-Ukuvuleka kodonga. Isakhiwo sakudala: ibha yokudweba › imenyu Amagumbi (Ishafu, Ukuvulwa okuqondile) kanye nemenyu Izindonga (ukuvuleka kodonga). Ishafu Vula ipulani yesitezi ishafu eqala kuso. Khetha Ishafu. Emgqeni khetha Izinga lesisekelo no-Izinga eliphezulu, nokuhlukana uma iqala noma iphela ngaphezu noma ngaphansi kwawo. Chofoza amakhona womugqa. Chofoza futhi ikhona lokuqala, chofoza kabili, noma cindezela Enter ukuze uqede. Yonke iphansi, isilingi nophahla phakathi kwalawo mazinga amabili kuyasikwa. Umugqa wesimo uyakutshela ukuthi zingaki. Ishafu ingento eyodwa. Khetha umumo walo kunoma yisiphi isitezi edlula kuso: Izakhiwo inezinto zalo, amazinga nokuhlukana, okusikiwe nendawo ekhishiwe. Uyishintsha bese wonke umbobo uyalandela. Uyisusa bese wonke umbobo uyanyamalala. Ngayinye iyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Ishafu iyaqhubeka nokusika: iphansi elenziwe kamuva phakathi kwamazinga ayo lisikwa ngaphandle kokucelwa, nephansi oliyisusayo liyekwa. Iphansi elimi phezu kwalo ishafu alisikwa (ophezulu balo ungu-base). Nika isisekelo ukuhlukana okungamanani ukuze nalo lisikwe. Nika ophezulu ukuhlukana okuhle ukuze udlule uphahla. Ukuvulwa okuqondile Khetha Ukuvulwa okuqondile. Emgqeni khetha ukuthi yini ozoyisika: iphansi, isilingi noma uphahla. Chofoza amakhona womugqa bese uqeda njengaphezulu. Iphansi, isilingi noma uphahla lalesi sitezi ngaphansi komugqa liyasikwa. Lingeleyo into eyodwa: susa iphansi nokuvulwa kuyanyamalala nalo. Ukuvuleka kodonga Ukuvuleka kodonga yithuluzi lalo Umumo wodonga: chofoza udonga epulanini, noma amakhona amabili ebusweni balo nge-3D. Izinani Ngomthetho wokulinganisa wamaphansi, indawo esele yento iyindawo yayo ephelele ngaphandle kwalokho okukhishwe kuyo. Ishafu noma ukuvulwa okuqondile kuyokukhishwa kuyo yonke iphansi nesilingi okusikayo; Amahlu Amaphansi Nokuqeda nemibalo ye-IFC akhombisa izinombolo ezifanayo. Ophahleni ukukhishwa kuyindawo yobuso bophahla: indawo yepulani ihlukaniswe nge-cosine yokuthambeka. Umugqa ongaphandle okhahlela ngaphezu komphetho ukhipha kuphela ingxenye ekuleyo nto. Uma kungasikwa lutho Ishafu engenalutho ezindleleni zayo iyenziwa futhi iyasho lokho: izosika lokho okuzakhiwa khona kamuva. Ukuvulwa okuqondile kudinga okuthile ngaphansi kwakho; uma kungekho lutho, umugqa wesimo uyasho futhi akwenziwa lutho. Ku-IFC Ukusika ngakunye kuyi-IfcOpeningElement enesixhumanisi ne-IfcRelVoidsElement kuleyo nto eyisikayo, ngakho noma yiluphi uhlelo lwe-IFC lubonisa umbobo. Uphahla lusikwa ngobuso ngabunye. Ishafu ngokwayo iyi-IfcGroup equkethe okuvulekile kwayo. Akusakhiwe okwamanje Imigqa egobile. Udonga lweshafu: udwebe ngethuluzi le-Wall. Ukuhlela umugqa ngokudonsa amakhona (shintsha ku-Izakhiwo, noma susa bese udweba kabusha). Izakhiwo zephansi elidwetshiwe ziveza indawo yalo ngaphandle kokuvulwa kwalo kuphela; amahlu nemibalo ye-IFC ihlanganisa leyo yeshafu. Bheka futhi Amakamelo nezahlukanisi zamakamelo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"families","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Imindeni nosayizi bayo","summary":"Izimnyango, amawindi nezingubo zifike ngemindeni. Ngayinye yosayizi womndeni uyuhlobo olulodwa kufayela le-IFC, ngakho uhlu lwezinhlobo lusala lufushane ku-BimCraft kanti ezinye izinhlelo zifunda izinhlobo ezilula.","section":"tasks","order":37,"keywords":["umndeni","imindeni","uhlobo","izinhlobo","usayizi","usayizi","uhlobo lomnyango","uhlobo lwewindi","impahla","itafula","ishelufu","ikhabhinethi","usayizi omusha","phinda","misa umndeni","ifayela lomndeni","ccfamily","umtapo we-ifc","umtapo wephrojekthi","iqembu","ukubonakala","IfcDoorType","IfcWindowType","IfcGroup"],"headings":[{"id":"umndeni-ngokuwukuthi","text":"Umndeni ngokuwukuthi","level":2},{"id":"lapho-uwathola-khona","text":"Lapho uwathola khona","level":2},{"id":"iminyango-namawindi","text":"Iminyango namawindi","level":2},{"id":"usayizi-omusha-kulo-mndeni","text":"Usayizi omusha kulo mndeni","level":2},{"id":"faka-impahla","text":"Faka impahla","level":2},{"id":"usayizi-kusuka-ethebhulini","text":"Usayizi kusuka ethebhulini","level":2},{"id":"setha-kusinto-ngayinye","text":"Setha kusinto ngayinye","level":2},{"id":"izinga-lemininingwane","text":"Izinga lemininingwane","level":2},{"id":"phinda-umndeni","text":"Phinda umndeni","level":2},{"id":"amafayela-emindeni","text":"Amafayela emindeni","level":2},{"id":"imindeni-ku-library","text":"Imindeni ku-Library","level":2},{"id":"izinhlobo-zezinye-izinhlelo","text":"Izinhlobo zezinye izinhlelo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"umndeni-ngokuwukuthi\"\u003EUmndeni ngokuwukuthi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmndeni uhlobo olulodwa lwento olukhona ngosayizi abaningi: umnyango owodwa ovulekayo ofika ububanzi be-32, 36 no-42 amabhodlela, noma itafula elifika lide nelifushane. Ku-BimCraft ubona umndeni kanye, nosayizi bawo ngaphansi kwawo, esikhundleni sohlu olude lwezinhlobo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-IFC alinayo imindeni. Kwifayela ngayinye usayizi uyisinhlobo esijwayelekile (uhlobo lomnyango, uhlobo lwewindi, uhlobo lwempahla…), futhi umndeni uyiqembu elidwebela osayizi balo. Ezinye izinhlelo ze-BIM zifunda izinhlobo neqembu njengoba zinjalo; i-BimCraft ibuyisela umndeni kuzo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lapho-uwathola-khona\"\u003ELapho uwathola khona\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsilawuli sephrojekthi, iqembu le-\u003Cstrong\u003EFamilies\u003C/strong\u003E, sidwebela imindeni kulo modeli, nokuthi ngamuva ngamunye unosayizi abangaki nokuthi bangaki asetshenzisiwe. Ngaphansi kwazo kukhona i-\u003Cstrong\u003EStarter families\u003C/strong\u003E: imisebenzi yomnyango newindi kumathuluzi omnyango newindi, nethebula, iyunithi yeshelufu, nekhabhinethi esezansi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuild\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFamilies…\u003C/span\u003E ibonisa uhlu olufanayo ewindini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza umndeni ukuze uwuvule: osayizi bawo, izinkomba zosayizi ngamunye, nokuthi zingaki izinto ezisebenzisa ngayinye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"iminyango-namawindi\"\u003EIminyango namawindi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmathuluzi omnyango newindi adwebela imindeni yalolo hlobo, bese kuseduze kwawo kukhona \u003Cstrong\u003Euhlu lwosayizi\u003C/strong\u003E. Khetha usayizi, noma ubhale \u003Cstrong\u003EW\u003C/strong\u003E no-\u003Cstrong\u003EH\u003C/strong\u003E: ububanzi nobude obungekho kosayizi bomndeni obuba usayizi omusha womndeni lapho umnyango umiswa. Iminyango yosayizi ofanayo yabelana ngohlobo olulodwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E, umnyango noma iwindi okhethiwe lubonisa \u003Cstrong\u003EUmndeni\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003EUsayizi\u003C/strong\u003E wawo. Khetha olunye usayizi oluvela ohlwini, noma ubhale ububanzi noma ubude obusha. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen the family\u003C/span\u003E ivula umndeni walo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUhlaka lomnyango noma lewindi lulandela ukuqina kodonga lwalo, njengakuqala kwemindeni. Uhlobo losayizi lugcina nomnyango odwetshwe odongeni olungu-140 mm, ukuze izinhlelo ezifunda izinhlobo zikwazi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"usayizi-omusha-kulo-mndeni\"\u003EUsayizi omusha kulo mndeni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula umndeni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003ENew size from this family\u003C/strong\u003E, bhala izinkomba zawo (Width, Height nezinye zamapharamitha womndeni) futhi, uma uthanda, igama. Uma ungawunikezi igama, lizoqanjwa ngokwezinkomba zalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMake the size\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUsayizi ababili abangabelana ngezinkomba ezifanayo. \u003Cstrong\u003EQamba kabusha\u003C/strong\u003E ishintsha igama losayizi; \u003Cstrong\u003ESusa\u003C/strong\u003E isusa usayizi ongasetshenziswa muntu; \u003Cstrong\u003EKhetha\u003C/strong\u003E ikhetha izinto zalowo sayizi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faka-impahla\"\u003EFaka impahla\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuild\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlace family\u003C/span\u003E, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlace\u003C/span\u003E ewindini lomndeni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEbhalweni, khetha umndeni nosayizi wawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza kupulani ukuze uyibeke esitezini. Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze uyiphendule ngama-90° ngaphambi kokuchofoza. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyayima.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E yendawo emisiwe ibonisa usayizi wayo, lapho ikhona nokuthi iphendulwe kangakanani; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyisusa. Yonke into yosayizi ofanayo yabelana ngesimo salowo sayizi, ngakho ukushintsha umndeni kushintsha zonke.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"usayizi-kusuka-ethebhulini\"\u003EUsayizi kusuka ethebhulini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESizes from a table…\u003C/span\u003E ewindini lomndeni ifunda ifayela le-CSV (ikhoma, isemikholoni noma i-tab). Umugqa wokuqala uqamba amakholomu: igama noma ilebula lephrameter, nokukhetha \u003Ccode\u003EName\u003C/code\u003E. Ubude buyamamilimitha uma ungabhali iyunithi (\u003Ccode\u003E1.2 m\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E36 in\u003C/code\u003E); amakholomu e-Yes / No amukela yes, no, true, false, 1 noma 0, nephrameter engenaKholomu igcina okuzenzakalelayo kwayo. Umugqa ngamunye uba usayizi, ngesinyathelo esisodwa osingabuyiselwa emuva; usayizi osekhona uyadlulwa. Umugqa owodwa ongafundeki, noma umndeni ongawudweba, uyala ithebhu yonke bese ubonisa umugqa wawo. Okungenani imigqa engu-200 nobukhulu obungu-1 MB. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave the sizes as a table\u003C/span\u003E ibhala ithebhu efanayo ibuyele ngaphandle.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"setha-kusinto-ngayinye\"\u003ESetha kusinto ngayinye\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIphrameter emaka ngokuthi \u003Cstrong\u003ENgesinto ngasinye\u003C/strong\u003E ohlelweni (i-Yes / No yengeza i-transom, ilebula, impahla) akuyona ingxenye yosayizi: iminyango ababili yosayizi ofanayo ingahluka. Khetha into bese i-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzici\u003C/strong\u003E ibonisa lezi zamapharamitha; shintsha enye bese leyo nto idwetshwa kabusha ngesimo sayo (impahla nezinto ezilungiselelwe zithola isimo sazo, iminyango namawindi yenziwa kabusha odongeni lwazo). Zibuyisele zonke ezizenzakalelayo, ibuyela esimweni sosayizi wayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinga-lemininingwane\"\u003EIzinga lemininingwane\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuild\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFamilies…\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EIzinga lemininingwane\u003C/strong\u003E isetha, kumndeni ngamunye emodelini, okugcinwa ezinhlanganweni nokudwetshwa ezimbonakalweni zepulani: \u003Cstrong\u003EFine\u003C/strong\u003E igcina konke, \u003Cstrong\u003EMedium\u003C/strong\u003E ne-\u003Cstrong\u003ECoarse\u003C/strong\u003E zisusa izingxenye ezihlelwe njengezinhle kakhulu (amafayela amancane, ukubuka okusheshayo). \u003Cstrong\u003EAutomatic\u003C/strong\u003E igcina konke futhi ivumela ukubuka kweshidi ukukhetha ngesikali sayo: u-1:50 nokukhulu fine, u-1:100 medium, u-1:200 nokuncane coarse. Isinyathelo esisodwa ongasihlehlisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"phinda-umndeni\"\u003EPhinda umndeni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAkudingeki uqale ngaphandle kwalutho. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDuplicate\u003C/span\u003E ikopisha umndeni namapharamitha, izinhlanganyelo nosayizi ngaphansi kwegama elisha. Shintsha ikhophi kumhleli; umndeni wangempela uhlala njengoba ubunjalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amafayela-emindeni\"\u003EAmafayela emindeni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave the family file\u003C/span\u003E igcina i-\u003Ccode\u003E.ccfamily.json\u003C/code\u003E: amapharamitha womndeni, izinhlanganyelo nosayizi. Yivule kwenye imodeli nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen a family file…\u003C/span\u003E eqenjini le-Families.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave as IFC\u003C/span\u003E igcina umndeni njengefayela elincane le-IFC: izinhlobo zosayizi bawo neqembu lawo, okumenyezelwa yithala lephrojekthi le-IFC. Ezinye izinhlelo ziyavula njengesethi yezinhlobo; i-BimCraft iyavula njengomndeni futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIfayela lomndeni elivulwe lapha lifundwa njengedatha bese lihlolwa ngaphambi kokubhalwa noma yini. Umndeni onokhiye osekhona kumodeli ufika njengomndeni ohlukile. Umndeni oqukethe abanye (bheka Families inside, ku-usizo lomhleli) uletha wona: ifayela libala wona, nemodeli igcina abasekhona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imindeni-ku-library\"\u003EImindeni ku-Library\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFamilies…\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom the Library…\u003C/span\u003E ukuze ubone imindeni eyabelwana ku-Library. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd to this project\u003C/span\u003E iyifunda njengefayela lomndeni: i-BimCraft ihlola yonke insimu ngaphambi kokuthi yenze noma yini, umndeni ufika njengomndeni wawo, bese uvuleka kumhleli. Ukuyengeza kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Ukwabelana ngowakho, sebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave all as a library\u003C/span\u003E bese uthumela ifayela ku-Library (abasebenzi be-Library bashicilela ifayela lomndeni ngomyalo, futhi ngamunye umndeni uyinto yawo nosayizi bawo). Uma i-Library ingafinyeleleki, uhlu luyashoyo futhi akukho okushintsha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinhlobo-zezinye-izinhlelo\"\u003EIzinhlobo zezinye izinhlelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinhlobo ezenziwe yizinye izinhlelo nazo zikhombisa eqenjini le-Families, zihlanganiswe ngokuqagela: ngengxenye yegama lezinto zazo ngaphambi kolunye usizo, noma ngamagama ezinhlobo ahlukahlukana kuphela ngezinombolo zazo. Iwindi lomndeni lisho ukuthi liqagele ngani. Ziyadwetshwa futhi ungakhetha izinto zazo, kodwa azihleliwe lapha: azinayo iresiphi yomndeni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIminyango namawindi okuqala adwetshwa ngokuphelele njengangaphambi kwemindeni. Amafayela akhiwe ngaphambi kwemindeni avula ngokungashintshi: iminyango namawindi awo abonakala ngaphansi komndeni wawo ngosayizi asetshenzisiwe, bese anyakazela aye kusayizi wawo ngokwawo lapho ushintsha okokuqala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBheka futhi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/family-editor\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/family-editor\"\u003EHlela umndeni\u003C/a\u003E kanye \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/doors-and-windows\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/doors-and-windows\"\u003EIminyango namawindi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Umndeni ngokuwukuthi Umndeni uhlobo olulodwa lwento olukhona ngosayizi abaningi: umnyango owodwa ovulekayo ofika ububanzi be-32, 36 no-42 amabhodlela, noma itafula elifika lide nelifushane. Ku-BimCraft ubona umndeni kanye, nosayizi bawo ngaphansi kwawo, esikhundleni sohlu olude lwezinhlobo. I-IFC alinayo imindeni. Kwifayela ngayinye usayizi uyisinhlobo esijwayelekile (uhlobo lomnyango, uhlobo lwewindi, uhlobo lwempahla…), futhi umndeni uyiqembu elidwebela osayizi balo. Ezinye izinhlelo ze-BIM zifunda izinhlobo neqembu njengoba zinjalo; i-BimCraft ibuyisela umndeni kuzo. Lapho uwathola khona Isilawuli sephrojekthi, iqembu le-Families, sidwebela imindeni kulo modeli, nokuthi ngamuva ngamunye unosayizi abangaki nokuthi bangaki asetshenzisiwe. Ngaphansi kwazo kukhona i-Starter families: imisebenzi yomnyango newindi kumathuluzi omnyango newindi, nethebula, iyunithi yeshelufu, nekhabhinethi esezansi. Build › Families… ibonisa uhlu olufanayo ewindini. Chofoza umndeni ukuze uwuvule: osayizi bawo, izinkomba zosayizi ngamunye, nokuthi zingaki izinto ezisebenzisa ngayinye. Iminyango namawindi Amathuluzi omnyango newindi adwebela imindeni yalolo hlobo, bese kuseduze kwawo kukhona uhlu lwosayizi. Khetha usayizi, noma ubhale W no-H: ububanzi nobude obungekho kosayizi bomndeni obuba usayizi omusha womndeni lapho umnyango umiswa. Iminyango yosayizi ofanayo yabelana ngohlobo olulodwa. Ku-Properties, umnyango noma iwindi okhethiwe lubonisa Umndeni kanye Usayizi wawo. Khetha olunye usayizi oluvela ohlwini, noma ubhale ububanzi noma ubude obusha. Open the family ivula umndeni walo. Uhlaka lomnyango noma lewindi lulandela ukuqina kodonga lwalo, njengakuqala kwemindeni. Uhlobo losayizi lugcina nomnyango odwetshwe odongeni olungu-140 mm, ukuze izinhlelo ezifunda izinhlobo zikwazi. Usayizi omusha kulo mndeni Vula umndeni. Ngaphansi kwe-New size from this family, bhala izinkomba zawo (Width, Height nezinye zamapharamitha womndeni) futhi, uma uthanda, igama. Uma ungawunikezi igama, lizoqanjwa ngokwezinkomba zalo. Chofoza Make the size. Usayizi ababili abangabelana ngezinkomba ezifanayo. Qamba kabusha ishintsha igama losayizi; Susa isusa usayizi ongasetshenziswa muntu; Khetha ikhetha izinto zalowo sayizi. Faka impahla Build › Place family, noma Place ewindini lomndeni. Ebhalweni, khetha umndeni nosayizi wawo. Chofoza kupulani ukuze uyibeke esitezini. Cindezela R ukuze uyiphendule ngama-90° ngaphambi kokuchofoza. Esc iyayima. I-Properties yendawo emisiwe ibonisa usayizi wayo, lapho ikhona nokuthi iphendulwe kangakanani; Delete iyisusa. Yonke into yosayizi ofanayo yabelana ngesimo salowo sayizi, ngakho ukushintsha umndeni kushintsha zonke. Usayizi kusuka ethebhulini Sizes from a table… ewindini lomndeni ifunda ifayela le-CSV (ikhoma, isemikholoni noma i-tab). Umugqa wokuqala uqamba amakholomu: igama noma ilebula lephrameter, nokukhetha Name. Ubude buyamamilimitha uma ungabhali iyunithi (1.2 m, 36 in); amakholomu e-Yes / No amukela yes, no, true, false, 1 noma 0, nephrameter engenaKholomu igcina okuzenzakalelayo kwayo. Umugqa ngamunye uba usayizi, ngesinyathelo esisodwa osingabuyiselwa emuva; usayizi osekhona uyadlulwa. Umugqa owodwa ongafundeki, noma umndeni ongawudweba, uyala ithebhu yonke bese ubonisa umugqa wawo. Okungenani imigqa engu-200 nobukhulu obungu-1 MB. Save the sizes as a table ibhala ithebhu efanayo ibuyele ngaphandle. Setha kusinto ngayinye Iphrameter emaka ngokuthi Ngesinto ngasinye ohlelweni (i-Yes / No yengeza i-transom, ilebula, impahla) akuyona ingxenye yosayizi: iminyango ababili yosayizi ofanayo ingahluka. Khetha into bese i-Izici ibonisa lezi zamapharamitha; shintsha enye bese leyo nto idwetshwa kabusha ngesimo sayo (impahla nezinto ezilungiselelwe zithola isimo sazo, iminyango namawindi yenziwa kabusha odongeni lwazo). Zibuyisele zonke ezizenzakalelayo, ibuyela esimweni sosayizi wayo. Izinga lemininingwane Build › Families… › Izinga lemininingwane isetha, kumndeni ngamunye emodelini, okugcinwa ezinhlanganweni nokudwetshwa ezimbonakalweni zepulani: Fine igcina konke, Medium ne-Coarse zisusa izingxenye ezihlelwe njengezinhle kakhulu (amafayela amancane, ukubuka okusheshayo). Automatic igcina konke futhi ivumela ukubuka kweshidi ukukhetha ngesikali sayo: u-1:50 nokukhulu fine, u-1:100 medium, u-1:200 nokuncane coarse. Isinyathelo esisodwa ongasihlehlisa. Phinda umndeni Akudingeki uqale ngaphandle kwalutho. Duplicate ikopisha umndeni namapharamitha, izinhlanganyelo nosayizi ngaphansi kwegama elisha. Shintsha ikhophi kumhleli; umndeni wangempela uhlala njengoba ubunjalo. Amafayela emindeni Save the family file igcina i-.ccfamily.json: amapharamitha womndeni, izinhlanganyelo nosayizi. Yivule kwenye imodeli nge-Open a family file… eqenjini le-Families. Save as IFC igcina umndeni njengefayela elincane le-IFC: izinhlobo zosayizi bawo neqembu lawo, okumenyezelwa yithala lephrojekthi le-IFC. Ezinye izinhlelo ziyavula njengesethi yezinhlobo; i-BimCraft iyavula njengomndeni futhi. Ifayela lomndeni elivulwe lapha lifundwa njengedatha bese lihlolwa ngaphambi kokubhalwa noma yini. Umndeni onokhiye osekhona kumodeli ufika njengomndeni ohlukile. Umndeni oqukethe abanye (bheka Families inside, ku-usizo lomhleli) uletha wona: ifayela libala wona, nemodeli igcina abasekhona. Imindeni ku-Library Vula Families… bese ukhetha From the Library… ukuze ubone imindeni eyabelwana ku-Library. Add to this project iyifunda njengefayela lomndeni: i-BimCraft ihlola yonke insimu ngaphambi kokuthi yenze noma yini, umndeni ufika njengomndeni wawo, bese uvuleka kumhleli. Ukuyengeza kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Ukwabelana ngowakho, sebenzisa Save all as a library bese uthumela ifayela ku-Library (abasebenzi be-Library bashicilela ifayela lomndeni ngomyalo, futhi ngamunye umndeni uyinto yawo nosayizi bawo). Uma i-Library ingafinyeleleki, uhlu luyashoyo futhi akukho okushintsha. Izinhlobo zezinye izinhlelo Izinhlobo ezenziwe yizinye izinhlelo nazo zikhombisa eqenjini le-Families, zihlanganiswe ngokuqagela: ngengxenye yegama lezinto zazo ngaphambi kolunye usizo, noma ngamagama ezinhlobo ahlukahlukana kuphela ngezinombolo zazo. Iwindi lomndeni lisho ukuthi liqagele ngani. Ziyadwetshwa futhi ungakhetha izinto zazo, kodwa azihleliwe lapha: azinayo iresiphi yomndeni. Iminyango namawindi okuqala adwetshwa ngokuphelele njengangaphambi kwemindeni. Amafayela akhiwe ngaphambi kwemindeni avula ngokungashintshi: iminyango namawindi awo abonakala ngaphansi komndeni wawo ngosayizi asetshenzisiwe, bese anyakazela aye kusayizi wawo ngokwawo lapho ushintsha okokuqala. Bheka futhi Hlela umndeni kanye Iminyango namawindi.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"mep-equipment","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Izinsiza ze-MEP ngamaphoyinti","summary":"Beka ama-air handler, amafeni, amapompo, amaboyila, izishisi zamanzi, amayunithi okuphela, ama-diffuser, amagrille nezigxobo, ngobukhulu obuthayiphwe ngamanani owathayipha, ngamunye namaxhumano wamapayipi nemisele yomoya ezinye izintambo ezixhumana nawo.","section":"tasks","order":37,"keywords":["mep","izinsiza","air handler","ahu","ifeni","ifeni elingaphakathi","ipompo","iboyila","ishisi lamanzi","iyunithi yokuphela","vav","diffuser","grille","register","ithange","iphoyinti","amaphoyinti","ukuxhuma","usayizi wentamo","hvac","mechanical","ifc","ifcpump","ifcairterminal","ifcunitaryequipment"],"headings":[{"id":"okufanele-ukwenze","text":"Okufanele ukwenze","level":2},{"id":"beka-isiqephu","text":"Beka isiqephu","level":2},{"id":"shintsha-noma-susa","text":"Shintsha noma susa","level":2},{"id":"ku-ifc","text":"Ku-IFC","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukwenze\"\u003EOkufanele ukwenze\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBeka izinsiza eziphelweni zamapayipi nemisele yomoya. Isiqephu ngasinye siyisimo esijwayelekile esibukhulu ngamanani owathayipha, nezixhumi zaso njengama-\u003Cstrong\u003Eamaphoyinti\u003C/strong\u003E: lapho ipayipi noma umsele womoya uxhuma khona, yisistimu, indlela okugeleza ngayo, nosayizi. Amapayipi nemisele yomoya edwetshwe kusuka ephoyinteni athatha usayizi nesistimu yalo futhi ahlala esekelwe kulo: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/mep-connections\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/mep-connections\"\u003EXhuma amapayipi nemisele yomoya kuzinsiza\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELesi isisiza sokudweba nokuhlanganisa, esibukhulu ngumenjiniyela. Lezi zinsiza akuyona imikhiqizo yomkhiqizi: akukho amandla, isisindo noma usayizi wokuxhuma wabakhiqizi. Letha imodeli yomkhiqizi evela ohlelweni lwakho lwe-MEP njenge-IFC uma uyidinga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beka-isiqephu\"\u003EBeka isiqephu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDweba\u003C/span\u003E, vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkwakhiwa\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinsiza\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEbhalini, khetha uhlobo bese uthayipha usayizi walo. Uhlobo ngalunye lubuza okwalo:\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUhlobo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUthayipha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAmaphoyinti alo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAir handler\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eubude, ububanzi, ukuphakama; izimbobo zokunikeza nokubuyisela; usayizi wepayipi lekhoyili nesistimu; usayizi we-condensate\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eumsele wokunikeza uphuma, umsele wokubuyisela ungena, khoyili ayangena nayaphuma, ukukhipha i-condensate\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfeni elingaphakathi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eububanzi, ubude, isistimu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eumsele ungena nophuma\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIpompo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eusayizi wepayipi, isistimu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eukungena nokuphuma\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIboyila\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eubude, ububanzi, ukuphakama, usayizi wepayipi, usayizi wegesi, ububanzi be-flue\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eukunikeza ukushisa kuphuma nokubuya kungena, igesi ingena, i-flue iphuma\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIshisi lamanzi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eububanzi, ukuphakama, usayizi wepayipi, igesi noma kagesi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eamanzi abandayo ayangena, amanzi ashisayo ayaphuma (negesi ingena ne-flue uma eshisa ngegesi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIyunithi yokuphela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eubude, ububanzi, ukuphakama, ukungena okujikelezile, ububanzi nokuphakama kokuphuma\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eumoya wokunikeza uyangena nophuma\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDiffuser\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eubuso, intamo, isistimu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eintamo yayo (umoya ungena)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGrille\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eububanzi nokuphakama kobuso, ububanzi nokuphakama kwentamo, isistimu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eintamo yayo (umoya uphuma uye emsele wokubuyisela noma wokukhipha)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIthange\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eububanzi, ukuphakama, usayizi wepayipi, isistimu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eukungena phezulu, ukuphuma eduze nansi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIradiyetha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eubude, ukuphakama, ukujula, usayizi wepayipi, isistimu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eukugeleza kungena phezulu kolunye uhlangothi, ukubuya kuphume ezansi kolunye\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkhonvekthafa / isishisi sephaneli\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eubude, ukuphakama, ukujula, usayizi wepayipi, isistimu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eukugeleza kungena ngolunye uhlangothi, ukubuya kuphume kolunye\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmndeni womkhiqizi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eumndeni (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/pipe-specs\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/pipe-specs\"\u003EIzici zamapayipi, ama-valve, amadampa nemindeni yabakhiqizi\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eamaphoyinti umndeni wawo owanikezwa wona\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESetha \u003Cstrong\u003EKu\u003C/strong\u003E, ukuphakama kwesisekelo sayo ngaphezu kwezinga. Ukuphakama kwe-diffuser noma kwe-grille kuwubuso bayo: thayipha ukuphakama kophahla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThayipha \u003Cstrong\u003EIthegi\u003C/strong\u003E uma ufuna enye (\u003Ccode\u003EAHU-1\u003C/code\u003E); isiqephu esilandelayo sohlobo olufanayo sithola inombolo elandelayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHambisa umbhalo phezu kwe-plan: isisekelo namaphoyinti sakho silandela. Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze uphendulise ngama-90°. Chofoza lapho sizobekwa khona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUsayizi wamapayipi ungusayizi wepayipi lensimbi (ASME B36.10M). Ipayipi edwetshwe kusuka epompweni ngempahla yalo ehlukile lithatha usayizi ojwayelekile ofanayo ngempahla yalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shintsha-noma-susa\"\u003EShintsha noma susa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha kwiplani noma kumbono we-3D. Ibhokisi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzici\u003C/span\u003E likhombisa yonke usayizi owathayipha, ithegi lawo, X, Y, ukuphakama nokuphendulwa, nephoyinti ngalinye: usayizi walo, isistimu, indlela okugeleza ngayo, nokuthi kukhona okuxhunyiwe yini. Ushintsho ngalunye lubalwa njengesinyathelo esisodwa se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlehlisa\u003C/span\u003E; izintambo ezisekelwe kumaphoyinti alo ziyahamba nalo. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyasusa; izintambo ezazisekelwe kuwo zihlala futhi uhlu lokuxhumana luzibhale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-ifc\"\u003EKu-IFC\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUhlobo ngalunye lulondolozwa njengeklasi yalo ye-IFC: IfcUnitaryEquipment (air handler), IfcFan, IfcPump, IfcBoiler (iboyila; ishisi lamanzi liba yi-IfcBoiler yohlobo lwamanzi enesikhombisi sohlobo &quot;Water heater&quot;), IfcAirTerminalBox (iyunithi yokuphela), IfcAirTerminal (diffuser, grille) kanye IfcTank, nohlobo olwabelwana ngalo wonke isiqephu sohlobo olufanayo nosayizi. Amafayela e-IFC2X3 athola IfcEnergyConversionDevice, IfcFlowMovingDevice, IfcFlowController, IfcFlowTerminal kanye IfcFlowStorageDevice nezinhlobo ezihambisanayo. Iphoyinti ngalinye liba yi-IfcDistributionPort ebekwe lapho kukhona ukuxhuma, ibheke ngaphandle, nendlela yokugeleza kanye nesistimu; ezinye izinhlelo zifunda ukuthi yiliphi ipayipi elixhuma kuliphi iphoyinti. Isiqephu sijoyina isistimu yalo ngalinye lamaphoyinti alo, futhi sithwala amasethi ezinto zelabhulali esinazo zonke izinto zelabhulali ezibekiwe.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Okufanele ukwenze Beka izinsiza eziphelweni zamapayipi nemisele yomoya. Isiqephu ngasinye siyisimo esijwayelekile esibukhulu ngamanani owathayipha, nezixhumi zaso njengama-amaphoyinti: lapho ipayipi noma umsele womoya uxhuma khona, yisistimu, indlela okugeleza ngayo, nosayizi. Amapayipi nemisele yomoya edwetshwe kusuka ephoyinteni athatha usayizi nesistimu yalo futhi ahlala esekelwe kulo: bona Xhuma amapayipi nemisele yomoya kuzinsiza. Lesi isisiza sokudweba nokuhlanganisa, esibukhulu ngumenjiniyela. Lezi zinsiza akuyona imikhiqizo yomkhiqizi: akukho amandla, isisindo noma usayizi wokuxhuma wabakhiqizi. Letha imodeli yomkhiqizi evela ohlelweni lwakho lwe-MEP njenge-IFC uma uyidinga. Beka isiqephu Vula Dweba, vula Ukwakhiwa bese ukhetha Izinsiza. Ebhalini, khetha uhlobo bese uthayipha usayizi walo. Uhlobo ngalunye lubuza okwalo: Uhlobo Uthayipha Amaphoyinti alo Air handler ubude, ububanzi, ukuphakama; izimbobo zokunikeza nokubuyisela; usayizi wepayipi lekhoyili nesistimu; usayizi we-condensate umsele wokunikeza uphuma, umsele wokubuyisela ungena, khoyili ayangena nayaphuma, ukukhipha i-condensate Ifeni elingaphakathi ububanzi, ubude, isistimu umsele ungena nophuma Ipompo usayizi wepayipi, isistimu ukungena nokuphuma Iboyila ubude, ububanzi, ukuphakama, usayizi wepayipi, usayizi wegesi, ububanzi be-flue ukunikeza ukushisa kuphuma nokubuya kungena, igesi ingena, i-flue iphuma Ishisi lamanzi ububanzi, ukuphakama, usayizi wepayipi, igesi noma kagesi amanzi abandayo ayangena, amanzi ashisayo ayaphuma (negesi ingena ne-flue uma eshisa ngegesi) Iyunithi yokuphela ubude, ububanzi, ukuphakama, ukungena okujikelezile, ububanzi nokuphakama kokuphuma umoya wokunikeza uyangena nophuma Diffuser ubuso, intamo, isistimu intamo yayo (umoya ungena) Grille ububanzi nokuphakama kobuso, ububanzi nokuphakama kwentamo, isistimu intamo yayo (umoya uphuma uye emsele wokubuyisela noma wokukhipha) Ithange ububanzi, ukuphakama, usayizi wepayipi, isistimu ukungena phezulu, ukuphuma eduze nansi Iradiyetha ubude, ukuphakama, ukujula, usayizi wepayipi, isistimu ukugeleza kungena phezulu kolunye uhlangothi, ukubuya kuphume ezansi kolunye Ikhonvekthafa / isishisi sephaneli ubude, ukuphakama, ukujula, usayizi wepayipi, isistimu ukugeleza kungena ngolunye uhlangothi, ukubuya kuphume kolunye Umndeni womkhiqizi umndeni (bona Izici zamapayipi, ama-valve, amadampa nemindeni yabakhiqizi) amaphoyinti umndeni wawo owanikezwa wona Setha Ku, ukuphakama kwesisekelo sayo ngaphezu kwezinga. Ukuphakama kwe-diffuser noma kwe-grille kuwubuso bayo: thayipha ukuphakama kophahla. Thayipha Ithegi uma ufuna enye (AHU-1); isiqephu esilandelayo sohlobo olufanayo sithola inombolo elandelayo. Hambisa umbhalo phezu kwe-plan: isisekelo namaphoyinti sakho silandela. Cindezela R ukuze uphendulise ngama-90°. Chofoza lapho sizobekwa khona. Usayizi wamapayipi ungusayizi wepayipi lensimbi (ASME B36.10M). Ipayipi edwetshwe kusuka epompweni ngempahla yalo ehlukile lithatha usayizi ojwayelekile ofanayo ngempahla yalo. Shintsha noma susa Khetha kwiplani noma kumbono we-3D. Ibhokisi Izici likhombisa yonke usayizi owathayipha, ithegi lawo, X, Y, ukuphakama nokuphendulwa, nephoyinti ngalinye: usayizi walo, isistimu, indlela okugeleza ngayo, nokuthi kukhona okuxhunyiwe yini. Ushintsho ngalunye lubalwa njengesinyathelo esisodwa se-Hlehlisa; izintambo ezisekelwe kumaphoyinti alo ziyahamba nalo. Delete iyasusa; izintambo ezazisekelwe kuwo zihlala futhi uhlu lokuxhumana luzibhale. Ku-IFC Uhlobo ngalunye lulondolozwa njengeklasi yalo ye-IFC: IfcUnitaryEquipment (air handler), IfcFan, IfcPump, IfcBoiler (iboyila; ishisi lamanzi liba yi-IfcBoiler yohlobo lwamanzi enesikhombisi sohlobo \"Water heater\"), IfcAirTerminalBox (iyunithi yokuphela), IfcAirTerminal (diffuser, grille) kanye IfcTank, nohlobo olwabelwana ngalo wonke isiqephu sohlobo olufanayo nosayizi. Amafayela e-IFC2X3 athola IfcEnergyConversionDevice, IfcFlowMovingDevice, IfcFlowController, IfcFlowTerminal kanye IfcFlowStorageDevice nezinhlobo ezihambisanayo. Iphoyinti ngalinye liba yi-IfcDistributionPort ebekwe lapho kukhona ukuxhuma, ibheke ngaphandle, nendlela yokugeleza kanye nesistimu; ezinye izinhlelo zifunda ukuthi yiliphi ipayipi elixhuma kuliphi iphoyinti. Isiqephu sijoyina isistimu yalo ngalinye lamaphoyinti alo, futhi sithwala amasethi ezinto zelabhulali esinazo zonke izinto zelabhulali ezibekiwe.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"mep-calculations","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Linganisa amapayipi nemisele yomoya, hlola ukugcwala kwekhebula nokukhanya","summary":"Hlola usayizi wamapayipi okunikezwa kwamanzi nemisele yomoya ngokwehla kwengcindezi, uhambise amakhebula ngamatreyi wekhebula nangokhondo ubone ukugcwala kwawo, ubale ukukhanya ezindlini ngamafayela we-IES noma we-EULUMDAT. Okuzenzakalelayo kubhalwe kahle; thayipha amanani ekhodi esebenzayo.","section":"tasks","order":37,"keywords":["ukulinganisa","usayizi wepayipi","usayizi womsele womoya","ukwehla kwengcindezi","izinto zokuhlinzeka","isidingo","hunter","hazen-williams","ijubane","ukumelana","ukumelana okulinganayo","ingcindezi yefeni","ibhamba","indlela ebalulekile","itreyi yekhebula","ikhondo","ukugcwala","uhlu lwamakhebula","ies","ldt","eulumdat","ukukhanya","lux","ukulingana","ukubalwa kokukhanya","ukuminyana kwamandla","mep","izibalo","izinkinga"],"headings":[{"id":"okufanele-ukwenze","text":"Okufanele ukwenze","level":2},{"id":"amapayipi","text":"Amapayipi","level":2},{"id":"imisele-yomoya","text":"Imisele yomoya","level":2},{"id":"amatreyi-wamakhebula-nokhondo","text":"Amatreyi wamakhebula nokhondo","level":2},{"id":"ukukhanya","text":"Ukukhanya","level":2},{"id":"izinkinobho-zomlilo","text":"Izinkinobho zomlilo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukwenze\"\u003EOkufanele ukwenze\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDweba amapayipi, imisele yomoya, amatreyi wamakhebula nokhondo njengejwayelekile, bese uvula ibhokisi \u003Cstrong\u003EIzibalo\u003C/strong\u003E. Ithebhu ngayinye ifunda imodeli, ibonise ithebula, futhi ibhale okungalungile njengezinkinga ephaneli ye-⚠. Lapho usayizi ozolungisa inkinga, \u003Cstrong\u003EFaka usayizi\u003C/strong\u003E uguqula izintambo ngesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELezi zisiza zokudweba. Yonke into ezenzakalelayo ibhalwe kuskrini, futhi akukho lapho olungu ithebula lekhodi: thayipha izinombolo ezisuka kumqondo oyiklama kuwo, bese umphumela uhlolwa yinjiniyela ephendula ngawo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amapayipi\"\u003EAmapayipi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha ukhiye we-\u003Cstrong\u003Esystem\u003C/strong\u003E (amanzi abandayo ngu-\u003Ccode\u003Ecw\u003C/code\u003E, amanzi ashisayo ngu-\u003Ccode\u003Ehw\u003C/code\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESetha ijubane eliphezulu kakhulu, futhi uma ufuna ingcindezi ihlolwe, ingcindezi emthonjeni nengcindezi encane isifaki esiyidingayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlola\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIpayipi ngalinye lithwala isidingo sezinto zokuhlinzeka ezingaphansi kalo. Isidingo sivela kwigrafu yezinto zokuhlinzeka ngokuya kokugeleza, ngendlela uHunter ayichaza ngayo. \u003Cstrong\u003EIgrafu eyakhelwe ngaphakathi iyisibonelo, hhayi ithebula lekhodi\u003C/strong\u003E; Izinkinga ziyakutshela lokho kuze kube yilapho uthayipha eyakho. Ukumelana kuyi-Hazen–Williams, izingxenye zokuxhuma yizilinganiso zokulahlekelwa, nokukhuphuka kuba ngu-9.8 kPa ngemitha. Izinto zokuhlinzeka zesifaki sihlala kuhlobo lwaso, noma kunani elisetha ngethuluzi losizo \u003Ccode\u003Eloads_set\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imisele-yomoya\"\u003EImisele yomoya\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESetha isistimu, izinga lokumelana (ukumelana okulinganayo) noma ijubane, nanoma yikuphi ukulahlekelwa kwekhoyili, kwesihlungi noma kwesifaki somsindo. Izindawo zokuphela zithatha umoya wazo ku-\u003Ccode\u003Eloads_set\u003C/code\u003E kwi-diffuser. Ithebula likhombisa ijubane nokumelana ngesiqephu ngasinye, \u003Cstrong\u003Eingcindezi yefeni\u003C/strong\u003E endleleni ebalulekile, nengcindezi okudingeka idampa lesinye isiphetho ngasinye lithathe. Ukulahlekelwa kwezingxenye zokuxhuma kusebenzisa izilinganiso ezizenzakalelayo ezijikelezile, hhayi idatabeyisi yezingxenye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amatreyi-wamakhebula-nokhondo\"\u003EAmatreyi wamakhebula nokhondo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDweba ngethuluzi le-Duct: izistimu \u003Cstrong\u003ECable tray\u003C/strong\u003E ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EConduit\u003C/strong\u003E zigcinwa njengabathwali bamakhebula, ngakho ezinye izinhlelo zizifunda njengamatreyi nokhondo. Kuthebhu le-Cables, namathisela uhlu lwamakhebula (i-tag, ububanzi bangaphandle ngamamillimitha, inani, kusuka, kuya). \u003Ccode\u003Efrom\u003C/code\u003E no \u003Ccode\u003Eto\u003C/code\u003E kuba yi-tag yesiqephu sezinsiza noma iphoyinti \u003Ccode\u003Ex,y,z\u003C/code\u003E ngamamillimitha. Amakhebula alandela indlela emfushane engaphazamisekile ngamatreyi nokhondo; isintambo ngasinye sikhombisa ukugcwala kwaso ngokumelene nemikhawulo oyithayipha, futhi uhlu luyagcinwa njenge-CSV nobude obufaka iphesenti lesikhala nezinhlangothi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukukhanya\"\u003EUkukhanya\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENikeza ama-luminaire ngamunye ifayela layo le-IES (LM-63) noma le-EULUMDAT ngethuluzi losizo \u003Ccode\u003Ephotometry_set\u003C/code\u003E. Thayipha izinhloso, ukuhlukana kwegridi nokuphakama kwendawo yokusebenza. Umphumela \u003Cstrong\u003Eukukhanya okuqondile\u003C/strong\u003E kuphela: akukho ukubuyiselwa phakathi nokuba khona kwezithunzi, ngakho uyisilinganiso esiphansi ekamelweni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinkinobho-zomlilo\"\u003EIzinkinobho zomlilo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-add-on \u003Cstrong\u003EFire sprinklers\u003C/strong\u003E inethebhu yayo; bheka usizo lwayo.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Okufanele ukwenze Dweba amapayipi, imisele yomoya, amatreyi wamakhebula nokhondo njengejwayelekile, bese uvula ibhokisi Izibalo. Ithebhu ngayinye ifunda imodeli, ibonise ithebula, futhi ibhale okungalungile njengezinkinga ephaneli ye-⚠. Lapho usayizi ozolungisa inkinga, Faka usayizi uguqula izintambo ngesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Lezi zisiza zokudweba. Yonke into ezenzakalelayo ibhalwe kuskrini, futhi akukho lapho olungu ithebula lekhodi: thayipha izinombolo ezisuka kumqondo oyiklama kuwo, bese umphumela uhlolwa yinjiniyela ephendula ngawo. Amapayipi Khetha ukhiye we-system (amanzi abandayo ngu-cw, amanzi ashisayo ngu-hw). Setha ijubane eliphezulu kakhulu, futhi uma ufuna ingcindezi ihlolwe, ingcindezi emthonjeni nengcindezi encane isifaki esiyidingayo. Chofoza Hlola. Ipayipi ngalinye lithwala isidingo sezinto zokuhlinzeka ezingaphansi kalo. Isidingo sivela kwigrafu yezinto zokuhlinzeka ngokuya kokugeleza, ngendlela uHunter ayichaza ngayo. Igrafu eyakhelwe ngaphakathi iyisibonelo, hhayi ithebula lekhodi; Izinkinga ziyakutshela lokho kuze kube yilapho uthayipha eyakho. Ukumelana kuyi-Hazen–Williams, izingxenye zokuxhuma yizilinganiso zokulahlekelwa, nokukhuphuka kuba ngu-9.8 kPa ngemitha. Izinto zokuhlinzeka zesifaki sihlala kuhlobo lwaso, noma kunani elisetha ngethuluzi losizo loads_set. Imisele yomoya Setha isistimu, izinga lokumelana (ukumelana okulinganayo) noma ijubane, nanoma yikuphi ukulahlekelwa kwekhoyili, kwesihlungi noma kwesifaki somsindo. Izindawo zokuphela zithatha umoya wazo ku-loads_set kwi-diffuser. Ithebula likhombisa ijubane nokumelana ngesiqephu ngasinye, ingcindezi yefeni endleleni ebalulekile, nengcindezi okudingeka idampa lesinye isiphetho ngasinye lithathe. Ukulahlekelwa kwezingxenye zokuxhuma kusebenzisa izilinganiso ezizenzakalelayo ezijikelezile, hhayi idatabeyisi yezingxenye. Amatreyi wamakhebula nokhondo Dweba ngethuluzi le-Duct: izistimu Cable tray ne-Conduit zigcinwa njengabathwali bamakhebula, ngakho ezinye izinhlelo zizifunda njengamatreyi nokhondo. Kuthebhu le-Cables, namathisela uhlu lwamakhebula (i-tag, ububanzi bangaphandle ngamamillimitha, inani, kusuka, kuya). from no to kuba yi-tag yesiqephu sezinsiza noma iphoyinti x,y,z ngamamillimitha. Amakhebula alandela indlela emfushane engaphazamisekile ngamatreyi nokhondo; isintambo ngasinye sikhombisa ukugcwala kwaso ngokumelene nemikhawulo oyithayipha, futhi uhlu luyagcinwa njenge-CSV nobude obufaka iphesenti lesikhala nezinhlangothi. Ukukhanya Nikeza ama-luminaire ngamunye ifayela layo le-IES (LM-63) noma le-EULUMDAT ngethuluzi losizo photometry_set. Thayipha izinhloso, ukuhlukana kwegridi nokuphakama kwendawo yokusebenza. Umphumela ukukhanya okuqondile kuphela: akukho ukubuyiselwa phakathi nokuba khona kwezithunzi, ngakho uyisilinganiso esiphansi ekamelweni. Izinkinobho zomlilo I-add-on Fire sprinklers inethebhu yayo; bheka usizo lwayo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"model-groups","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Amaqembu emodeli","summary":"Yenza izinto ezikhethiwe ibe iqembu elinegama, ubeke iqembu futhi endaweni enye, bese ushintsha ikhophi eyodwa ukuze kushintshe zonke.","section":"tasks","order":38,"keywords":["iqembu","iqembu lemodeli","ukuhlanganisa","susa iqembu","isibonelo","kopisha","phinda","iyunithi evamile","ibhe","ifulethi","hlela iqembu","IfcGroup"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"lapho-ithuluzi-likhona","text":"Lapho ithuluzi likhona","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"ezinye-izinto-ongazenza","text":"Ezinye izinto ongazenza","level":2},{"id":"okungaba-seqenjini","text":"Okungaba seqenjini","level":2},{"id":"ku-ifc","text":"Ku-IFC","level":2},{"id":"akukakwakhiwa","text":"Akukakwakhiwa","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHlanganisa ibhe evamile, uyibeke izikhathi eziningana, bese ushintsha yonke ikhophi ngokushintsha eyodwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lapho-ithuluzi-likhona\"\u003ELapho ithuluzi likhona\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzakhiwo ze-ribbon: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkwakheka\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EImodeli\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIqembu lemodeli\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsakhiwo esidala: ibha yokudweba › imenyu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmagumbi\u003C/span\u003E › Iqembu lemodeli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgokusebenzisa Khetha, khetha izinto: chofoza eyodwa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+chofoza noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+chofoza ezinye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIqembu lemodeli\u003C/span\u003E. Zishintsha zibe yiqembu ngokushesha. Thayipha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIgama leqembu\u003C/span\u003E kumugqa ngaphambili ukuze uliqambe igama, noma thayipha elinye kamuva ukuze uliqamise kabusha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBeka elinye\u003C/span\u003E bese uchofoza lapho ikhophi kufanele imi khona: ikhona yayo engezansi kwesobunxele iya endaweni ochofoze kuyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShintsha noma iyiphi ikhophi: hambisa uhlangothi lodonga, lungisa usayizi wesivalo, susa insika. Zonke ezinye zekhophi zeqembu ziyashintsha ngesinyathelo esisodwa, nokuhlehlisa okukodwa kubuyisa konke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIqembu lemodeli\u003C/span\u003E sekusesandleni sakho, ukuchofoza into kukhetha iqembu layo lonke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ezinye-izinto-ongazenza\"\u003EEzinye izinto ongazenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza ezikhethiwe\u003C/span\u003E: engeza izinto eziningi eqenjini okhethe kulo ekugcineni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa iqembu\u003C/span\u003E: lale khophi ibe izinto ezijwayelekile futhi. Ezinye zekhophi zihlala ziyiqembu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHambisa ikhophi yonke ngo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa\u003C/span\u003E: iyiqembu elifanayo endaweni entsha; ezinye azihambi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESusa izinto zekhophi bese leyo khophi iyanyamalala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okungaba-seqenjini\"\u003EOkungaba seqenjini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzindonga nemisebe yazo namafasitela, insika namafulowa adwetshwe zingabekwa futhi zigcinwe zifana. Iqembu lingabamba nezinye izinto, kodwa khona-ke alikwazi ukubekwa futhi; umugqa uchaza ngani.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmakhophi ayahanjiswa, akagujwa noma abonakaliswe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-ifc\"\u003EKu-IFC\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIqembu liyi-IfcGroup ene-IfcRelAssignsToGroup kwizinto zalo, ezihlala ziyizindonga, insika namafulowa ajwayelekile. Yonke ikhophi yeqembu elilodwa ithwele i-id yencazelo efanayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akukakwakhiwa\"\u003EAkukakwakhiwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkujikeleza noma ukubonakalisa ikhophi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzitebhisi, uphahla, amafulowa amagumbi nezinto zethala lemitapo eqenjini elibekwa futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIphrofayili yodonga, ukuthambeka kwalo nezimbobo zodonga akuyi kumakhophi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmaqembu ngaphakathi kwamaqembu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBheka futhi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/move-align-distribute\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/move-align-distribute\"\u003EHambisa, linganisa futhi sabalalisa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Hlanganisa ibhe evamile, uyibeke izikhathi eziningana, bese ushintsha yonke ikhophi ngokushintsha eyodwa. Lapho ithuluzi likhona Izakhiwo ze-ribbon: Ukwakheka › Imodeli › Iqembu lemodeli. Isakhiwo esidala: ibha yokudweba › imenyu Amagumbi › Iqembu lemodeli. Izinyathelo Ngokusebenzisa Khetha, khetha izinto: chofoza eyodwa, Ctrl+chofoza noma Shift+chofoza ezinye. Khetha Iqembu lemodeli. Zishintsha zibe yiqembu ngokushesha. Thayipha Igama leqembu kumugqa ngaphambili ukuze uliqambe igama, noma thayipha elinye kamuva ukuze uliqamise kabusha. Cindezela Beka elinye bese uchofoza lapho ikhophi kufanele imi khona: ikhona yayo engezansi kwesobunxele iya endaweni ochofoze kuyo. Shintsha noma iyiphi ikhophi: hambisa uhlangothi lodonga, lungisa usayizi wesivalo, susa insika. Zonke ezinye zekhophi zeqembu ziyashintsha ngesinyathelo esisodwa, nokuhlehlisa okukodwa kubuyisa konke. Uma Iqembu lemodeli sekusesandleni sakho, ukuchofoza into kukhetha iqembu layo lonke. Ezinye izinto ongazenza Engeza ezikhethiwe: engeza izinto eziningi eqenjini okhethe kulo ekugcineni. Susa iqembu: lale khophi ibe izinto ezijwayelekile futhi. Ezinye zekhophi zihlala ziyiqembu. Hambisa ikhophi yonke ngo-Hambisa: iyiqembu elifanayo endaweni entsha; ezinye azihambi. Susa izinto zekhophi bese leyo khophi iyanyamalala. Okungaba seqenjini Izindonga nemisebe yazo namafasitela, insika namafulowa adwetshwe zingabekwa futhi zigcinwe zifana. Iqembu lingabamba nezinye izinto, kodwa khona-ke alikwazi ukubekwa futhi; umugqa uchaza ngani. Amakhophi ayahanjiswa, akagujwa noma abonakaliswe. Ku-IFC Iqembu liyi-IfcGroup ene-IfcRelAssignsToGroup kwizinto zalo, ezihlala ziyizindonga, insika namafulowa ajwayelekile. Yonke ikhophi yeqembu elilodwa ithwele i-id yencazelo efanayo. Akukakwakhiwa Ukujikeleza noma ukubonakalisa ikhophi. Izitebhisi, uphahla, amafulowa amagumbi nezinto zethala lemitapo eqenjini elibekwa futhi. Iphrofayili yodonga, ukuthambeka kwalo nezimbobo zodonga akuyi kumakhophi. Amaqembu ngaphakathi kwamaqembu. Bheka futhi Hambisa, linganisa futhi sabalalisa.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"family-editor","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Hlela umndeni","summary":"Shintsha amapharamitha omndeni, amafomula nezinhlanganyelo, bonisa izingxenye ngephrameter ye-Yes / No, sika futhi uhlanganise izinto eziqinile, unike izixhumi zamapayipi namadakhithi, bese ubona umphumela udwetshwe kusuka ku-IFC ozoyigcina.","section":"tasks","order":38,"keywords":["umhleli womndeni","hlela umndeni","iphrameter","amapharamitha","ifomula","amafomula","ukubonakala","yes no","into eqinile","izinto eziqinile","ibhokisi","ukuphuma","ukuphuma","ukuzungeza","iphrofayili","i-arc","boolean","ama-boolean","sika","hlanganisa","umphathi","izibambo","indawo yomsebenzi","isikethi","umndeni omusha","isixhumi","izixhumi","uxhumano","ipayipi","idakhithi","ukukhipha","amanzi okuhlinzeka"],"headings":[{"id":"vula-umhleli","text":"Vula umhleli","level":2},{"id":"amapharamitha","text":"Amapharamitha","level":2},{"id":"izinto-eziqinile","text":"Izinto eziqinile","level":2},{"id":"dweba-iphrofayili","text":"Dweba iphrofayili","level":3},{"id":"ama-boolean","text":"Ama-Boolean","level":2},{"id":"isimbonakalo-sepulani","text":"Isimbonakalo sepulani","level":2},{"id":"imindeni-engaphakathi","text":"Imindeni engaphakathi","level":2},{"id":"amahotspot","text":"Amahotspot","level":2},{"id":"izixhumi","text":"Izixhumi","level":2},{"id":"ukubuka-kwangaphambili-nezibambo-zakho","text":"Ukubuka kwangaphambili nezibambo zakho","level":2},{"id":"ukugcina","text":"Ukugcina","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"vula-umhleli\"\u003EVula umhleli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula umndeni (iqembu le-\u003Cstrong\u003EFamilies\u003C/strong\u003E lesilawuli sephrojekthi, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuild\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFamilies…\u003C/span\u003E) bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit the family\u003C/span\u003E. Ukuqala ngaphandle kwalutho, chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew family\u003C/span\u003E: uninike igama, uchaze ukuthi yini (umnyango, iwindi, impahla, into ethile noma okunye) futhi, ngomnyango noma iwindi, ukuthi ipulani lalo nesandla salo kusuka kuphi. Umhleli uvula umndeni onamapharamitha ambalwa nento eyodwa eqinile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuhlela umndeni wokuqala kugcina izinguquko zakho kule modeli kuphela. Ezinye izimodeli zigcina okuqala njengoba kunjalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAkukho okushintsha kumodeli kuze kuchofozwe \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave the family\u003C/span\u003E. Umhleli unokuhlehlisa nokuphinda wenze wawo (izinkinobho zomcibisholo eduze negama, noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E); ukugcina kuyisinyathelo esisodwa kokuhlehlisa kwemodeli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amapharamitha\"\u003EAmapharamitha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthebhu ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EParameters\u003C/span\u003E idwebela amapharamitha omndeni: igama, uhlobo kanye nokuzenzakalelayo. Izinhlobo: \u003Cstrong\u003ELength\u003C/strong\u003E (mamilimitha), \u003Cstrong\u003EAngle\u003C/strong\u003E (amadigri), \u003Cstrong\u003ENumber\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EWhole number\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EYes / No\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EPen\u003C/strong\u003E (1–16), kanye nezintathu ezigcina amagama esikhundleni sezinombolo: \u003Cstrong\u003EText\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EMaterial\u003C/strong\u003E (enye yezinto zephrojekthi) kanye \u003Cstrong\u003EFill\u003C/strong\u003E (ukugcwala kwepulani). Amagama awasetshenziswa kumafomula; ayakhela into eqinile (i-\u003Cstrong\u003EMaterial\u003C/strong\u003E yayo), agcwalise ingxenye yesimbonakalo, noma aphrinte njenge \u003Ccode\u003E{Name}\u003C/code\u003E embhalweni wesimbonakalo. Ibhokisi elithi \u003Cstrong\u003EPer element\u003C/strong\u003E lenza iphrameter into ngayinye ezibekayo ngokwayo esikhundleni sosayizi wayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIfomula\u003C/strong\u003E yenza iphrameter ilandele ezinye, njengokuthi \u003Ccode\u003EWidth / 30\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003Eif(Width &gt; 1200, 2, 1)\u003C/code\u003E. Ubude kumafomula buyamamilimitha, noma bhala iyunithi: \u003Ccode\u003E3&#039;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E6in\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E50cm\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkubiza kabusha iphrameter kuyibiza kabusha kuwo wonke amafomula namasimu asetshenziswa kuwo. Iphrameter esasetshenziswa ayikwazi ukususwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMaterial\u003C/strong\u003E yento eqinile ithatha umbala wento yephrojekthi (noma iphrameter ye-Material), \u003Cstrong\u003EShown at\u003C/strong\u003E iyifihla emazingeni ancane wemininingwane, futhi \u003Cstrong\u003ERepeat\u003C/strong\u003E yenza amakhophi: inani (inombolo noma iphrameter yenombolo ephelele, 1 kuya ku-200) nesinyathelo phakathi kwawo ku-x, y no-z. Into eqinile ephindwayo iba umugqa wamapuleti, amabha noma izimbobo; esikelweni, amakhophi asikwa ndawonye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmnyango noma iwindi lomndeni nawo lithola amagama amabili kusuka odongeni lwalo: \u003Ccode\u003EWallThickness\u003C/code\u003E no-\u003Ccode\u003EFace\u003C/code\u003E (1 noma −1, uhlangothi umnyango ogingqa kulo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinto-eziqinile\"\u003EIzinto eziqinile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthebhu ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESolids\u003C/span\u003E idwebela izinto eziqinile. Engeza ibhokisi, i-extrusion, i-revolve noma i-sweep:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInto eqinile\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkusethayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbhokisi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eamakona amabili: x0 kuya ku-x1, y0 kuya ku-y1, z0 kuya ku-z1\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EExtrusion\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eiphrofayili endizeni yokusebenza (ipulani, ingaphambili noma eceleni), lapho indiza ikhona, nokujula\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERevolve\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eiphrofayili, i-axis endizeni, nangle kuya ku-360°\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESweep\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eindlela yamaphoyinti nomsakazo (induku noma irela)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInombolo ngayinye ingaba yinombolo ebhalwe noma isiphrofaji samapharamitha. Into ngayinye eqinile inombala kanye ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EShown when\u003C/strong\u003E: yishiye ingenalutho ukuze ibonakale njalo, noma uqamba iphrameter ye-Yes / No (noma ubhale ukuqhathanisa njengo \u003Ccode\u003EShelves &gt;= 3\u003C/code\u003E) ukuze ibonakale kuphela lapho. Lokho kuyiphrameter yokubonakala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"dweba-iphrofayili\"\u003EDweba iphrofayili\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIphrofayili ye-extrusion noma ye-revolve idwetshwa endizeni yayo yokusebenza ngaphansi kokubuka kwangaphambili:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ephepheni ukuze wengeze iphoyinti ngemva kwelikhethiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHudula iphoyinti ukuze liyishintshe. Amaphoyinti ahlanganyela egridini; bamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze uwamise ngokukhululekile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza isikwele esincane esingxenyeni yomugqa ukuze wengeze iphoyinti lapho. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+chofoza kuyo ukuze lowo mugqa wenze i-arc (chofoza futhi ukuze uye ngakolunye uhlangothi, bese ulinganisa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza kabili iphoyinti ukuze uliyise.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmaphoyinti angenalutho asethwa ngamapharamitha: shintsha kuthebhu, hhayi ngokuhudula.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ama-boolean\"\u003EAma-Boolean\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthebhu ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBooleans\u003C/span\u003E isika into yesibili ngaphandle kwayokuqala, noma iyihlanganise. Umphumela we-Boolean ungasikwa noma uhlanganiswe futhi. Into eqinile esetshenziswa ku-Boolean idwetshwa njengengxenye yakhona kuphela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma into yesibili ifihlwe yiphrameter yayo ye-Yes / No, eyokuqala igcinwa njengoba injalo; uma eyokuqala ifihliwe, umphumela uyafihlwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isimbonakalo-sepulani\"\u003EIsimbonakalo sepulani\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthebhu ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlan symbol\u003C/span\u003E idweba okubonisa ipulani ngalo mndeni esikhundleni sesikwa sezinto eziqinile: imigqa, amakhonco, izindilinga, ama-arc, izinxantathu nombhalo, ezindizeni zomndeni ngokwawo. Ingxenye ngayinye inophenkili (\u003Cstrong\u003Epen\u003C/strong\u003E) (1–16, ukuvezwa noma iphrameter ye-Pen), \u003Cstrong\u003Efill\u003C/strong\u003E (akukho, okuqinile, okuchazwe, okuqandekile, ukhonkolo, insulation, umhlabathi, noma iphrameter ye-Fill), \u003Cstrong\u003Eshown by\u003C/strong\u003E ukuvezwa, \u003Cstrong\u003Ecut range\u003C/strong\u003E ngamamilimitha phezu kwesisekelo sayo (ingxenye edwetshwe ngobukhulu obugcwele uma ukusika kwepulani kusenkabeni yayo, incane ngaphansi kwayo, idashi ngaphezulu kwayo; ikhabhinethi ephezu kokusika ibonakala idashi), izinga lemininingwane nokuphindwa. Umbhalo ungabiza amapharamitha njenge \u003Ccode\u003E{Name}\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EThe plan shows: The cut of the solids\u003C/strong\u003E igcina ukusika kwezinto eziqinile kupulani ngenkathi isimbonakalo sisalokhu emndenini. Ezinye izinhlelo zifunda isimbonakalo njengendawo womndeni (imigqa nezimo; umbhalo usala ku-BimCraft).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imindeni-engaphakathi\"\u003EImindeni engaphakathi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthebhu ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFamilies inside\u003C/span\u003E ifaka omunye umndeni kulo: umlenze wetafula, isibambo somnyango. Khetha umndeni, bese ubhala lapho uwuya khona (x, y, z), ukuthi uphenduleke kangakanani (ama-quarter turn kuphela: 0, 90, 180, 270), ukuthi ubonakala nini, nezinkomba olizithola, elinye ngomugqa ngamunye njengokuthi \u003Ccode\u003EHeight = Height - 40\u003C/code\u003E. Ukugcina umndeni ongaphakathi kudwetsha lo mndeni kabusha; umndeni obanjwe ngomunye awukwazi ukususwa; umndeni awukwazi ukubamba wona, nakancane ngomunye, futhi ukuhlanganyela kuyama emazingeni amane.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amahotspot\"\u003EAmahotspot\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-hotspot iphoyinti noma imiphetho oyihudulayo ukuze ushintshe iphrameter. Ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHotspots\u003C/span\u003E engeza eyodwa, khetha i-axis ehudulwa kuyo kanye nephrameter yenombolo eyishintshayo, bese ubhala indawo yayo ngamafomula afanayo nezinto eziqinile. Ekubukeni kwangaphambili, khetha \u003Cstrong\u003EHotspots\u003C/strong\u003E ngaphansi kwezibambo ukuze uzihudule. Esinsizeni esimiswe kupulani (khetha ngo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E) ama-hotspot x no-y abonakala njengezibambo: hudula elilodwa bese into ithatha usayizi ofaka i-hotspot lapho, ngaphezu kwanoma yiziphi ifomula phakathi kwawo; okukodwa kokuHlehlisa kuyibuyisela. I-hotspot ayikwazi ukushintsha iphrameter elawulwayo, i-Yes / No noma igama.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKubuka kwe-3D, ama-hotspot afanayo abonakala njengezibambo ento ekhethiwe, nama-hotspot aphezulu nasezansi (i-axis z) nawo ayabonakala lapho, lokho ipulani elingakwazi ukukudweba. Khetha into, hudula isibambo ngendlela ye-axis yaso bese uyeqa: into ithatha usayizi ofaka i-hotspot lapho, njengesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Izibambo ziyafihlwa uma ibhokisi lesigaba livuliwe, njengoba lisebenzisa izibambo ezifanayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izixhumi\"\u003EIzixhumi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImindeni ebekwe phansi (impahla, izinto ezilungiselelwe nezinye) inethebhu ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EConnectors\u003C/span\u003E: amaphoyinti lapho ipayipi noma idakhithi lijoyina into, njengempompi nesifunda sesinki. Chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a connector\u003C/span\u003E bese usetha:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKind\u003C/strong\u003E: ipayipi noma idakhithi, kanye \u003Cstrong\u003ESystem\u003C/strong\u003E yayo (amanzi abandayo, ukukhipha okungcolile, umoya wokuhlinzeka…).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Ex\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003Ey\u003C/strong\u003E no-\u003Cstrong\u003Ez\u003C/strong\u003E: lapho ikhona, ezindizeni zomndeni ngokwawo. Njengezinombolo zesinto eqinile, ngayinye ingaba yinombolo noma ifomula yamapharamitha, ukuze isixhumi sihambe nosayizi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWay out\u003C/strong\u003E: indlela ipayipi noma idakhithi eliphuma ngayo, eduze kwe-axis yomndeni (ukukhipha ngaphansi kwesinki kuba \u003Cstrong\u003EDown\u003C/strong\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESize (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E: usayizi wephayipi onyuliwe (DN) noma ububanzi bedakhithi elijikelezile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFlow\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cstrong\u003EIn\u003C/strong\u003E kwesixhumi esinikezwayo (impompi), \u003Cstrong\u003EOut\u003C/strong\u003E kwesikhipha (esikhipha).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkubuka kwangaphambili kudweba isixhumi ngasinye njengesongo nomcibisholo oqonda ngaphandle. Iminyango namawindi akunalo uxhumano.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgomsebenzi wamapayipi, khetha ukuthi yiyiphi ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EPlumbing fixture\u003C/strong\u003E (indlu yangasese, i-lavatory, isinki yekhishi, ishawa, ithangi lokugezela). Impahla ezenziwe ngaphambili zisho lokho ngokwazo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYonke into emiswe emndenini ithola izixhumi zayo njengamachweba kufayela le-IFC, futhi ziyadwetshwa kabusha uma into ishintsha usayizi noma umndeni ugcinwa. Izinhlelo ezifunda amasistimu e-IFC zibona ukuthi ipayipi nedakhithi ngalunye kufanele liyephi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukubuka-kwangaphambili-nezibambo-zakho\"\u003EUkubuka kwangaphambili nezibambo zakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkubuka kwangaphambili umndeni ophrintwe njenge-IFC, ngekhodi efanayo eyawugcina emodelini, bese udwetshwa kabusha. Okubonayo yikho ezinye izinhlelo zizokuthola. Ngaphansi kwakho, \u003Cstrong\u003ESize shown\u003C/strong\u003E isetha amanani amapharamitha ukubuka kwangaphambili kuwasebenzisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzibambo\u003C/strong\u003E ziyizinhlamba ekubukeni kwangaphambili: \u003Cstrong\u003EThe size\u003C/strong\u003E ikhombisa izibambo zeWidth, Depth ne-Height; \u003Cstrong\u003EThe solid picked\u003C/strong\u003E ikhombisa enye ngayinye ngaphezu kohlangothi lwento oyikhethile. Hudula isibambo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eohlangothini oluhlelwe yiphrameter, usayizi okhonjisiwe uyashintsha (amafomula omndeni agcinwa);\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eohlangothini oluhlelwe yinombolo ebhaliwe, inombolo iyashintsha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukugcina\"\u003EUkugcina\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave the family\u003C/span\u003E ihlola umndeni, bese idweba wonke usayizi wawo futhi yenze wonke umuntu wawo kabusha, njengesinyathelo esisodwa osingahlehlisa. Uma usayizi ungadwetshwa ngoshintsho (isibonelo into eqinile ingaba nobubanzi obungenalutho kuleyo sayizi), akukho okugciniwe futhi umhleli usho ukuthi yiliphi usayizi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma omunye umuntu egcine lo mndeni ngesikhathi umhleli wakho uvulekile (esikhathini se-Live TeamWork, noma kwenye iwindi), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave the family\u003C/span\u003E iyenqaba iphinde ichaze lokho kunokuba ibhale ushintsho lwakho esikhundleni salokho. Vala umhleli, vula umndeni futhi ubone ushintsho lwakhe, bese wenza lwakho kabusha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIjiyomethri igcinwa njengezinto eziqinile zangempela ze-IFC: ama-extrusion, ama-revolve, amadiski ahudulwayo, nemiphumela ye-Boolean. Akukho okuguqulwa kube uhlu lwamatriyangela, ngakho amafayela ayancipha futhi ezinye izinhlelo zifunda izimo njengezimo. Iphrofayili enama-arc igcinwa namakhonco ku-IFC4; i-IFC2X3 ayinawo amakhonco ephrofayili, ngakho lapho ama-arc agcinwa njengezingcezu ezimfushane ezigqamile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBheka futhi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/families\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/families\"\u003EImindeni nosayizi bayo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Vula umhleli Vula umndeni (iqembu le-Families lesilawuli sephrojekthi, noma Build › Families…) bese uchofoza Edit the family. Ukuqala ngaphandle kwalutho, chofoza New family: uninike igama, uchaze ukuthi yini (umnyango, iwindi, impahla, into ethile noma okunye) futhi, ngomnyango noma iwindi, ukuthi ipulani lalo nesandla salo kusuka kuphi. Umhleli uvula umndeni onamapharamitha ambalwa nento eyodwa eqinile. Ukuhlela umndeni wokuqala kugcina izinguquko zakho kule modeli kuphela. Ezinye izimodeli zigcina okuqala njengoba kunjalo. Akukho okushintsha kumodeli kuze kuchofozwe Save the family. Umhleli unokuhlehlisa nokuphinda wenze wawo (izinkinobho zomcibisholo eduze negama, noma Ctrl+Z no-Ctrl+Y); ukugcina kuyisinyathelo esisodwa kokuhlehlisa kwemodeli. Amapharamitha Ithebhu ethi Parameters idwebela amapharamitha omndeni: igama, uhlobo kanye nokuzenzakalelayo. Izinhlobo: Length (mamilimitha), Angle (amadigri), Number, Whole number, Yes / No, Pen (1–16), kanye nezintathu ezigcina amagama esikhundleni sezinombolo: Text, Material (enye yezinto zephrojekthi) kanye Fill (ukugcwala kwepulani). Amagama awasetshenziswa kumafomula; ayakhela into eqinile (i-Material yayo), agcwalise ingxenye yesimbonakalo, noma aphrinte njenge {Name} embhalweni wesimbonakalo. Ibhokisi elithi Per element lenza iphrameter into ngayinye ezibekayo ngokwayo esikhundleni sosayizi wayo. Ifomula yenza iphrameter ilandele ezinye, njengokuthi Width / 30 noma if(Width \u003E 1200, 2, 1). Ubude kumafomula buyamamilimitha, noma bhala iyunithi: 3', 6in, 50cm. Ukubiza kabusha iphrameter kuyibiza kabusha kuwo wonke amafomula namasimu asetshenziswa kuwo. Iphrameter esasetshenziswa ayikwazi ukususwa. Material yento eqinile ithatha umbala wento yephrojekthi (noma iphrameter ye-Material), Shown at iyifihla emazingeni ancane wemininingwane, futhi Repeat yenza amakhophi: inani (inombolo noma iphrameter yenombolo ephelele, 1 kuya ku-200) nesinyathelo phakathi kwawo ku-x, y no-z. Into eqinile ephindwayo iba umugqa wamapuleti, amabha noma izimbobo; esikelweni, amakhophi asikwa ndawonye. Umnyango noma iwindi lomndeni nawo lithola amagama amabili kusuka odongeni lwalo: WallThickness no-Face (1 noma −1, uhlangothi umnyango ogingqa kulo). Izinto eziqinile Ithebhu ethi Solids idwebela izinto eziqinile. Engeza ibhokisi, i-extrusion, i-revolve noma i-sweep: Into eqinile Okusethayo Ibhokisi amakona amabili: x0 kuya ku-x1, y0 kuya ku-y1, z0 kuya ku-z1 Extrusion iphrofayili endizeni yokusebenza (ipulani, ingaphambili noma eceleni), lapho indiza ikhona, nokujula Revolve iphrofayili, i-axis endizeni, nangle kuya ku-360° Sweep indlela yamaphoyinti nomsakazo (induku noma irela) Inombolo ngayinye ingaba yinombolo ebhalwe noma isiphrofaji samapharamitha. Into ngayinye eqinile inombala kanye ne-Shown when: yishiye ingenalutho ukuze ibonakale njalo, noma uqamba iphrameter ye-Yes / No (noma ubhale ukuqhathanisa njengo Shelves \u003E= 3) ukuze ibonakale kuphela lapho. Lokho kuyiphrameter yokubonakala. Dweba iphrofayili Iphrofayili ye-extrusion noma ye-revolve idwetshwa endizeni yayo yokusebenza ngaphansi kokubuka kwangaphambili: Chofoza ephepheni ukuze wengeze iphoyinti ngemva kwelikhethiwe. Hudula iphoyinti ukuze liyishintshe. Amaphoyinti ahlanganyela egridini; bamba Shift ukuze uwamise ngokukhululekile. Chofoza isikwele esincane esingxenyeni yomugqa ukuze wengeze iphoyinti lapho. Shift+chofoza kuyo ukuze lowo mugqa wenze i-arc (chofoza futhi ukuze uye ngakolunye uhlangothi, bese ulinganisa). Chofoza kabili iphoyinti ukuze uliyise. Amaphoyinti angenalutho asethwa ngamapharamitha: shintsha kuthebhu, hhayi ngokuhudula. Ama-Boolean Ithebhu ethi Booleans isika into yesibili ngaphandle kwayokuqala, noma iyihlanganise. Umphumela we-Boolean ungasikwa noma uhlanganiswe futhi. Into eqinile esetshenziswa ku-Boolean idwetshwa njengengxenye yakhona kuphela. Uma into yesibili ifihlwe yiphrameter yayo ye-Yes / No, eyokuqala igcinwa njengoba injalo; uma eyokuqala ifihliwe, umphumela uyafihlwa. Isimbonakalo sepulani Ithebhu ethi Plan symbol idweba okubonisa ipulani ngalo mndeni esikhundleni sesikwa sezinto eziqinile: imigqa, amakhonco, izindilinga, ama-arc, izinxantathu nombhalo, ezindizeni zomndeni ngokwawo. Ingxenye ngayinye inophenkili (pen) (1–16, ukuvezwa noma iphrameter ye-Pen), fill (akukho, okuqinile, okuchazwe, okuqandekile, ukhonkolo, insulation, umhlabathi, noma iphrameter ye-Fill), shown by ukuvezwa, cut range ngamamilimitha phezu kwesisekelo sayo (ingxenye edwetshwe ngobukhulu obugcwele uma ukusika kwepulani kusenkabeni yayo, incane ngaphansi kwayo, idashi ngaphezulu kwayo; ikhabhinethi ephezu kokusika ibonakala idashi), izinga lemininingwane nokuphindwa. Umbhalo ungabiza amapharamitha njenge {Name}. The plan shows: The cut of the solids igcina ukusika kwezinto eziqinile kupulani ngenkathi isimbonakalo sisalokhu emndenini. Ezinye izinhlelo zifunda isimbonakalo njengendawo womndeni (imigqa nezimo; umbhalo usala ku-BimCraft). Imindeni engaphakathi Ithebhu ethi Families inside ifaka omunye umndeni kulo: umlenze wetafula, isibambo somnyango. Khetha umndeni, bese ubhala lapho uwuya khona (x, y, z), ukuthi uphenduleke kangakanani (ama-quarter turn kuphela: 0, 90, 180, 270), ukuthi ubonakala nini, nezinkomba olizithola, elinye ngomugqa ngamunye njengokuthi Height = Height - 40. Ukugcina umndeni ongaphakathi kudwetsha lo mndeni kabusha; umndeni obanjwe ngomunye awukwazi ukususwa; umndeni awukwazi ukubamba wona, nakancane ngomunye, futhi ukuhlanganyela kuyama emazingeni amane. Amahotspot I-hotspot iphoyinti noma imiphetho oyihudulayo ukuze ushintshe iphrameter. Ku-Hotspots engeza eyodwa, khetha i-axis ehudulwa kuyo kanye nephrameter yenombolo eyishintshayo, bese ubhala indawo yayo ngamafomula afanayo nezinto eziqinile. Ekubukeni kwangaphambili, khetha Hotspots ngaphansi kwezibambo ukuze uzihudule. Esinsizeni esimiswe kupulani (khetha ngo-Select) ama-hotspot x no-y abonakala njengezibambo: hudula elilodwa bese into ithatha usayizi ofaka i-hotspot lapho, ngaphezu kwanoma yiziphi ifomula phakathi kwawo; okukodwa kokuHlehlisa kuyibuyisela. I-hotspot ayikwazi ukushintsha iphrameter elawulwayo, i-Yes / No noma igama. Kubuka kwe-3D, ama-hotspot afanayo abonakala njengezibambo ento ekhethiwe, nama-hotspot aphezulu nasezansi (i-axis z) nawo ayabonakala lapho, lokho ipulani elingakwazi ukukudweba. Khetha into, hudula isibambo ngendlela ye-axis yaso bese uyeqa: into ithatha usayizi ofaka i-hotspot lapho, njengesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Izibambo ziyafihlwa uma ibhokisi lesigaba livuliwe, njengoba lisebenzisa izibambo ezifanayo. Izixhumi Imindeni ebekwe phansi (impahla, izinto ezilungiselelwe nezinye) inethebhu ethi Connectors: amaphoyinti lapho ipayipi noma idakhithi lijoyina into, njengempompi nesifunda sesinki. Chofoza Add a connector bese usetha: Kind: ipayipi noma idakhithi, kanye System yayo (amanzi abandayo, ukukhipha okungcolile, umoya wokuhlinzeka…). x, y no-z: lapho ikhona, ezindizeni zomndeni ngokwawo. Njengezinombolo zesinto eqinile, ngayinye ingaba yinombolo noma ifomula yamapharamitha, ukuze isixhumi sihambe nosayizi. Way out: indlela ipayipi noma idakhithi eliphuma ngayo, eduze kwe-axis yomndeni (ukukhipha ngaphansi kwesinki kuba Down). Size (mm): usayizi wephayipi onyuliwe (DN) noma ububanzi bedakhithi elijikelezile. Flow: In kwesixhumi esinikezwayo (impompi), Out kwesikhipha (esikhipha). Ukubuka kwangaphambili kudweba isixhumi ngasinye njengesongo nomcibisholo oqonda ngaphandle. Iminyango namawindi akunalo uxhumano. Ngomsebenzi wamapayipi, khetha ukuthi yiyiphi ngaphansi kwe-Plumbing fixture (indlu yangasese, i-lavatory, isinki yekhishi, ishawa, ithangi lokugezela). Impahla ezenziwe ngaphambili zisho lokho ngokwazo. Yonke into emiswe emndenini ithola izixhumi zayo njengamachweba kufayela le-IFC, futhi ziyadwetshwa kabusha uma into ishintsha usayizi noma umndeni ugcinwa. Izinhlelo ezifunda amasistimu e-IFC zibona ukuthi ipayipi nedakhithi ngalunye kufanele liyephi. Ukubuka kwangaphambili nezibambo zakho Ukubuka kwangaphambili umndeni ophrintwe njenge-IFC, ngekhodi efanayo eyawugcina emodelini, bese udwetshwa kabusha. Okubonayo yikho ezinye izinhlelo zizokuthola. Ngaphansi kwakho, Size shown isetha amanani amapharamitha ukubuka kwangaphambili kuwasebenzisa. Izibambo ziyizinhlamba ekubukeni kwangaphambili: The size ikhombisa izibambo zeWidth, Depth ne-Height; The solid picked ikhombisa enye ngayinye ngaphezu kohlangothi lwento oyikhethile. Hudula isibambo: ohlangothini oluhlelwe yiphrameter, usayizi okhonjisiwe uyashintsha (amafomula omndeni agcinwa); ohlangothini oluhlelwe yinombolo ebhaliwe, inombolo iyashintsha. Ukugcina Save the family ihlola umndeni, bese idweba wonke usayizi wawo futhi yenze wonke umuntu wawo kabusha, njengesinyathelo esisodwa osingahlehlisa. Uma usayizi ungadwetshwa ngoshintsho (isibonelo into eqinile ingaba nobubanzi obungenalutho kuleyo sayizi), akukho okugciniwe futhi umhleli usho ukuthi yiliphi usayizi. Uma omunye umuntu egcine lo mndeni ngesikhathi umhleli wakho uvulekile (esikhathini se-Live TeamWork, noma kwenye iwindi), Save the family iyenqaba iphinde ichaze lokho kunokuba ibhale ushintsho lwakho esikhundleni salokho. Vala umhleli, vula umndeni futhi ubone ushintsho lwakhe, bese wenza lwakho kabusha. Ijiyomethri igcinwa njengezinto eziqinile zangempela ze-IFC: ama-extrusion, ama-revolve, amadiski ahudulwayo, nemiphumela ye-Boolean. Akukho okuguqulwa kube uhlu lwamatriyangela, ngakho amafayela ayancipha futhi ezinye izinhlelo zifunda izimo njengezimo. Iphrofayili enama-arc igcinwa namakhonco ku-IFC4; i-IFC2X3 ayinawo amakhonco ephrofayili, ngakho lapho ama-arc agcinwa njengezingcezu ezimfushane ezigqamile. Bheka futhi Imindeni nosayizi bayo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"check-with-energyplus","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Hlola ukushisa nokupholisa nge-EnergyPlus","summary":"Bhala imodeli njengefayela le-EnergyPlus, noma qhuba i-EnergyPlus inguqulo 26.2.0 kuyo ebhrawuzeni, bese uqhathanisa imithwalo yayo yokuklama nosizo olusheshayo lokushisa nokupholisa. Ukubheka kwesibili kokuklama kokuqala, hhayi ukubala ukuthobela.","section":"tasks","order":38,"keywords":["energyplus","ukulingisa amandla","usuku lokuklama","umthwalo wokushisa","umthwalo wokupholisa","ifayela lesimo sezulu","epw","idf","ubukhulu bokushisa","amandla onyaka","lingisa"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"setha-injini","text":"Setha injini","level":2},{"id":"izinsuku-zokuklama-noma-unyaka","text":"Izinsuku zokuklama noma unyaka","level":2},{"id":"ubukhulu-bokushisa","text":"Ubukhulu bokushisa","level":2},{"id":"ukufunda-ukuqhathanisa","text":"Ukufunda ukuqhathanisa","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIpane ethi \u003Cstrong\u003EHlola nge-EnergyPlus\u003C/strong\u003E ibhala imodeli evuliwe njengefayela lokufaka le-EnergyPlus (i-IDF): isifunda esisodwa ngasinye segumbi, izindonga, izinsimbi, uphahla namawindi nama-U-value abo, ukushintshwa komoya nokushisa nokupholisa okufanelekile. Ungakwazi njalo \u003Cstrong\u003Eukulondoloza leyo fayela\u003C/strong\u003E uyiqhube ku-EnergyPlus yakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma nawe usethe injini, ipane ingalingisa lapho, futhi ibale ukushisa nokupholisa okuklanyelwe kwe-EnergyPlus ecaleni kosizo olusheshayo, igumbi ngalinye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELokhu kuyisisekelo sokuklama. Izinkambiso zamandla, isitifiketi nezimvume zidinga ithuluzi elamukelekile nedatha yesimo sezulu edingekayo, futhi umphumela udinga ukubhekwa ngumuntu oyiphendulelayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"setha-injini\"\u003ESetha injini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-BimCraft ayiphathi i-EnergyPlus. Iyisakhiwo esikhulu se-WebAssembly (cishe ama-6 MB ecindeziwe, kanye nefayela ledatha elingu-4.6 MB), ngakho uyiqhubela kwenye indawo bese ufaka ikheli layo kupane. Ikhasi liyilayisha kuphela uma ucindezela inkinobho yokulingisa, hhayi ekuqaleni. Ikheli kufanele libe yi-https, indlela kulesi sayithi, noma i-localhost.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinsuku-zokuklama-noma-unyaka\"\u003EIzinsuku zokuklama noma unyaka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELingisa izinsuku zokuklama\u003C/strong\u003E alidingi ifayela lesimo sezulu. Liqhuba usuku olubandayo lasebusika olungenalanga, nosuku lwasehlobo olushisayo olucacile ngamazinga okushisa asezigabeni zokushisa nokupholisa kuthebhu ye-Daylight, bese libika umthwalo wegumbi ngalinye ngama-watt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELingisa unyaka\u003C/strong\u003E udinga ifayela lesimo sezulu ngefomethi ye-EPW oyikhethayo. Lengeza abantu, izibani nemishini ngokusuka ezigabeni ezifanayo (ivulekile njalo, njengoba isikhathi singazange sisungulwe), bese libika amandla okushisa nokupholisa kwegumbi ngalinye ngama-kWh. Amafayela esimo sezulu anezimvume zawo, ngakho sebenzisa elilungele ukusetshenziswa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ubukhulu-bokushisa\"\u003EUbukhulu bokushisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThikha \u003Cstrong\u003ENikeza izindonga ezinezendlalelo ezaziwayo ubukhulu bokushisa\u003C/strong\u003E bese izindonga, uphahla namafolo ezinezendlalelo zezinto ezaziwayo zibhalwa ngendlalelo ngayinye, nokuminyana nokushisa okuthile kuthathwa kwithebula elifushane lamanani ajwayelekile ngamagama ezinto. Izendlalelo zithathwa ngaphandle kuqala, ngendlela uhlu lwefayela olubhala ngayo. Izinto ezingenazendlalelo zihlala ku-U-value yazo ngaphandle kobukhulu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukufunda-ukuqhathanisa\"\u003EUkufunda ukuqhathanisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzindlela ezimbili ziphendula imibuzo ehluke kancane. Usizo olusheshayo ligcina yonke into; ifayela le-EnergyPlus lilinganisa ama-U-value wegumbi ngalinye ngohlobo lomphezulu. Umehluko oludlula u-15 % ekushiseni kwegumbi lokuklama uhlu ngesaziso ku-ipane ye-⚠, kanye nazo zombili izibalo. Ukupholisa kwehluka kakhulu ngokuklanyelwe: usizo olusheshayo lubala ukuphakama kusuka elangeni ngosuku olulodwa, kanti i-EnergyPlus ilinganisa ngosuku lwayo lokuklama.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Ipane ethi Hlola nge-EnergyPlus ibhala imodeli evuliwe njengefayela lokufaka le-EnergyPlus (i-IDF): isifunda esisodwa ngasinye segumbi, izindonga, izinsimbi, uphahla namawindi nama-U-value abo, ukushintshwa komoya nokushisa nokupholisa okufanelekile. Ungakwazi njalo ukulondoloza leyo fayela uyiqhube ku-EnergyPlus yakho. Uma nawe usethe injini, ipane ingalingisa lapho, futhi ibale ukushisa nokupholisa okuklanyelwe kwe-EnergyPlus ecaleni kosizo olusheshayo, igumbi ngalinye. Lokhu kuyisisekelo sokuklama. Izinkambiso zamandla, isitifiketi nezimvume zidinga ithuluzi elamukelekile nedatha yesimo sezulu edingekayo, futhi umphumela udinga ukubhekwa ngumuntu oyiphendulelayo. Setha injini I-BimCraft ayiphathi i-EnergyPlus. Iyisakhiwo esikhulu se-WebAssembly (cishe ama-6 MB ecindeziwe, kanye nefayela ledatha elingu-4.6 MB), ngakho uyiqhubela kwenye indawo bese ufaka ikheli layo kupane. Ikhasi liyilayisha kuphela uma ucindezela inkinobho yokulingisa, hhayi ekuqaleni. Ikheli kufanele libe yi-https, indlela kulesi sayithi, noma i-localhost. Izinsuku zokuklama noma unyaka Lingisa izinsuku zokuklama alidingi ifayela lesimo sezulu. Liqhuba usuku olubandayo lasebusika olungenalanga, nosuku lwasehlobo olushisayo olucacile ngamazinga okushisa asezigabeni zokushisa nokupholisa kuthebhu ye-Daylight, bese libika umthwalo wegumbi ngalinye ngama-watt. Lingisa unyaka udinga ifayela lesimo sezulu ngefomethi ye-EPW oyikhethayo. Lengeza abantu, izibani nemishini ngokusuka ezigabeni ezifanayo (ivulekile njalo, njengoba isikhathi singazange sisungulwe), bese libika amandla okushisa nokupholisa kwegumbi ngalinye ngama-kWh. Amafayela esimo sezulu anezimvume zawo, ngakho sebenzisa elilungele ukusetshenziswa. Ubukhulu bokushisa Thikha Nikeza izindonga ezinezendlalelo ezaziwayo ubukhulu bokushisa bese izindonga, uphahla namafolo ezinezendlalelo zezinto ezaziwayo zibhalwa ngendlalelo ngayinye, nokuminyana nokushisa okuthile kuthathwa kwithebula elifushane lamanani ajwayelekile ngamagama ezinto. Izendlalelo zithathwa ngaphandle kuqala, ngendlela uhlu lwefayela olubhala ngayo. Izinto ezingenazendlalelo zihlala ku-U-value yazo ngaphandle kobukhulu. Ukufunda ukuqhathanisa Izindlela ezimbili ziphendula imibuzo ehluke kancane. Usizo olusheshayo ligcina yonke into; ifayela le-EnergyPlus lilinganisa ama-U-value wegumbi ngalinye ngohlobo lomphezulu. Umehluko oludlula u-15 % ekushiseni kwegumbi lokuklama uhlu ngesaziso ku-ipane ye-⚠, kanye nazo zombili izibalo. Ukupholisa kwehluka kakhulu ngokuklanyelwe: usizo olusheshayo lubala ukuphakama kusuka elangeni ngosuku olulodwa, kanti i-EnergyPlus ilinganisa ngosuku lwayo lokuklama.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"split-vrf-fan-coils","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Iyunithi ze-split, VRF kanye nama-fan coil","summary":"Beka iyunithi zangaphakathi zodonga, zekhabethe nezenombobo, iyunithi zangaphandle ze-single-split neze-VRF, izixhumanisi ze-refnet kanye nama-fan coil anemigqa emi-2 noma emi-4, ngayinye nezixhumi zayo zesiphephisi, zamanzi, zokuphuphuthekisa nezokudlulisa umoya, bese udweba izethi yemigqa phakathi kwazo ezilinganiswe ngetafula ongalishintsha.","section":"tasks","order":38,"keywords":["split","mini split","minisplit","multi split","vrf","vrv","ukugeleza kwesiphephisi okuguqukayo","ipompo lokushisa","iyunithi yangaphakathi","iyunithi yangaphandle","iyunithi yokuphuphuthekisa","eshiwo odongeni","udonga oluphezulu","cassette","enombobo","efihliwe","fan coil","fcu","2-pipe","4-pipe","refnet","ukuxhumana kwesigaba","y joint","isethi yemigqa","lineset","isiphephisi","umugqa woketshezi","umugqa wegesi","umugqa wokumunca","acr","ikhopha","ukuphuphuthekisa","hvac","ifcunitaryequipment","splitsystem","ifcpipefitting"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"beka-iyunithi","text":"Beka iyunithi","level":2},{"id":"dweba-isethi-yemigqa","text":"Dweba isethi yemigqa","level":2},{"id":"shintsha-itafula-lesethi-yemigqa","text":"Shintsha itafula lesethi yemigqa","level":2},{"id":"kufayela-le-ifc","text":"Kufayela le-IFC","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaka iyunithi zohlelo lwe-split, lwe-multi-split noma lwe-VRF kanye ne-fan coil zalo emodeli, bese uzixhumanisa ngezethi yemigqa: umugqa woketshezi nomugqa wegesi ngekhopha le-ACR, ahlanganiswe nezimbobo zeyunithi. Iyunithi zisebenza njengazo zonke ezinye izinto ze-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/mep-equipment\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/mep-equipment\"\u003EMEP equipment with ports\u003C/a\u003E: ibha efanayo, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzici\u003C/span\u003E, izimbobo kanye nezixhumanisi (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/mep-connections\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/mep-connections\"\u003Econnections\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELo ungumsizi wokudweba nokuhlanganisa. Iyunithi ziyizimo ezijwayelekile ezilingana ngamanani owabhalayo, hhayi imikhiqizo yomkhiqizi othile. Usayizi wamapayipi azo uvela etafuleni lezinxaneli \u003Cstrong\u003Eezijwayelekile zesibonelo\u003C/strong\u003E zezinsiza ze-R410A ne-R32, hhayi kumkhiqizi othile: incwadi yokufaka yomkhiqizi weyunithi yona inquma usayizi wangempela, futhi imigqa ende noma umehluko omkhulu wobude uyawushintsha. Shintsha itafula, noma bhala usayizi, ukuze ufanane neyunithi oyisebenzisayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beka-iyunithi\"\u003EBeka iyunithi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDweba\u003C/span\u003E, vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkwakhiwa\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinsiza\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha uhlobo bese usetha amanani alo:\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUhlobo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkusetha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIzixhumi zayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIyunithi yangaphakathi ye-split, odongeni\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eamandla, umugqa woketshezi nomugqa wegesi, ubude, ubujule, ukuphakama, usayizi wokuphuphuthekisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eisiphephisi soketshezi nesegesi, ukukhipha ukuphuphuthekisa (ngakwesokudla, eduze kodonga)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIyunithi yangaphakathi ye-split, ye-cassette\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eamandla, umugqa woketshezi nomugqa wegesi, ipanele, umzimba, ukuphakama, usayizi wokuphuphuthekisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eisiphephisi soketshezi nesegesi, ukukhipha ukuphuphuthekisa (ngakolunye uhlangothi, eduze kwaphezulu)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIyunithi yangaphakathi ye-split, enombobo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eamandla, umugqa woketshezi nomugqa wegesi, ubude, ububanzi, ukuphakama, izimbobo zokunikeza nokubuyisa, usayizi wokuphuphuthekisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eumbobo wokunikeza ophumayo, umbobo wokubuyisa ongenayo, isiphephisi soketshezi nesegesi, ukukhipha ukuphuphuthekisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIyunithi yangaphandle ye-split\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eamandla, umugqa woketshezi nomugqa wegesi, ububanzi, ubujule, ukuphakama\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eisiphephisi soketshezi nesegesi (ngakwesokudla)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIyunithi yangaphandle ye-VRF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eamandla, umugqa woketshezi nomugqa wegesi, ububanzi, ubujule, ukuphakama\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eisiphephisi soketshezi nesegesi (phambili, phansi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuxhumana kwe-refnet\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eumugqa woketshezi noma wegesi, umthwalo kwelinye ngalinye igatsha, ipayipi ekugcineni ngakunye\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eukungena, igatsha A, igatsha B\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIyunithi ye-fan coil\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eama-2-pipe noma ama-4-pipe, ubude, ububanzi, ukuphakama, izimbobo zokunikeza nokubuyisa, ipayipi nesistimu ye-coil, ipayipi lokushisisa, usayizi wokuphuphuthekisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eumbobo wokunikeza ophumayo, umbobo wokubuyisa ongenayo, i-coil ngenayo nephumayo, ukushisisa ngenayo nephumayo (ama-4-pipe), ukukhipha ukuphuphuthekisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESetha \u003Cstrong\u003EKu-\u003C/strong\u003E: ukuphakama kwesisekelo seyunithi ngaphezu kwezinga. Isisekelo seyunithi yodonga yisiphansi sayo (njalo ngo-2100 mm); eseyilingi isibhamu sayo ngaphakathi kophahla; eye-refnet ukuphakama komugqa wepayipi wayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza lapho iyoya khona (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyijikisa ngama-90°).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmandla\u003C/strong\u003E ayizinga lokupholisa elibekiwe leyunithi ngo-kW, kanye no-Btu/h eduze kwawo. Uma \u003Cstrong\u003EUmugqa woketshezi\u003C/strong\u003E nes \u003Cstrong\u003EUmugqa wegesi\u003C/strong\u003E ushiywe ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EKusuka etafuleni\u003C/strong\u003E, ukuxhumana kweyunithi kuthatha usayizi wetafula kulawo mandla; khetha usayizi wetyubhu ukuze usebenzise weyunithi yakho. Ukungena kwe-refnet kulinganiswa ngamagatsha womabili ndawonye, nelingi ligatsha ngomthwalo waleligatsha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzixhumi zesiphephisi zisebenza zombili izindlela (ipompo lokushisa lisebenza nakweyiphi indlela). Ukukhipha ukuphuphuthekisa kungusayizi wepayipi njenganoma yiliphi idrenishi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dweba-isethi-yemigqa\"\u003EDweba isethi yemigqa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha izinto ezimbili (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+chofoza eyesibili): iyunithi yangaphandle neyunithi yangaphakathi (i-single split), noma iyunithi yangaphandle ne-refnet, i-refnet neyunithi yangaphakathi, noma ama-refnet amabili (VRF).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkwakhiwa\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsethi yemigqa\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBimCraft idweba imigqa yoketshezi negesi phakathi kwezimbobo zazo ezikhululekile, iphuma kwisimbobo ngasinye iye ebangeni elifanayo elingaphezulu, ngekhopha le-ACR (i-coil ethambile kuya ku-1-5/8 in, ityubhu ehlanganisiwe ngaphezulu kwalo), njengesinyathelo esisodwa se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlehlisa\u003C/span\u003E. I-refnet ithatha umugqa wayo kuphela: ingena ivela ngakolwangaphandle, iphume ilunge egatsheni elibheka iziyunithi zangaphakathi. Umugqa ngamunye uthatha usayizi wokugcina lawo okuwusangane (iyunithi yangaphakathi, noma ukungena kwe-refnet); uma isimbobo sokugcina esinye sinosayizi ohlukile, i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlola ukuxhumana\u003C/span\u003E iyawudweba: yilapho okudingeka khona i-reducer. Iziyunithi zangaphakathi ezimbili zidinga i-refnet phakathi kwazo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHambisa imigqa ngemuva njengalanoma yimuphi umugqa wepayipi; iziphetho zawo zihlala ezimbobeni. Imigqa phakathi kwezitezi idwetshwa nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIpayipi\u003C/span\u003E: ipayipi eliqalwa esimbobeni sesiphephisi lithatha isistimu yalo, ikhopha le-ACR nosayizi walo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shintsha-itafula-lesethi-yemigqa\"\u003EShintsha itafula lesethi yemigqa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkwakhiwa\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUsayizi wesethi yemigqa\u003C/span\u003E. Umugqa ngamunye uthi: kuze kulesi sandla (kW), leli thubhu loketshezi nalelithubhu legesi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKuze ku-\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUketshezi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIgesi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2.8 kW\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EØ6.35 (1/4&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EØ9.52 (3/8&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E5.6 kW\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EØ6.35 (1/4&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EØ12.7 (1/2&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E16 kW\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EØ9.52 (3/8&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EØ15.88 (5/8&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E22.4 kW\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EØ9.52 (3/8&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EØ19.05 (3/4&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E33 kW\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EØ9.52 (3/8&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EØ22.22 (7/8&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E47 kW\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EØ12.7 (1/2&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EØ28.58 (1-1/8&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E71 kW\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EØ15.88 (5/8&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EØ28.58 (1-1/8&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E104 kW\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EØ19.05 (3/4&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EØ34.92 (1-3/8&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E180 kW\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EØ19.05 (3/4&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EØ41.28 (1-5/8&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELezi ngamanani okuqala ajwayelekile. Shintsha umugqa, engeza nomaususe imigqa, bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza\u003C/span\u003E: itafulaligcinwa emodelini, ngakho wonke umuntu osebenza kufayela uyilisebenzisa, futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlehlisa\u003C/span\u003E iyibuyisela emuva. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESebenzisa amanani ajwayelekile\u003C/span\u003E ibuyisela itafula lokuqala. Izinto ezisha ezivele zigcina izimbobo zazo kuze kube yilapho uzishintsha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kufayela-le-ifc\"\u003EKufayela le-IFC\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIyunithi zangaphakathi nezangaphandle zezinhlelo ze-split ne-VRF ziyi-IfcUnitaryEquipment ngohlobo i-SPLITSYSTEM, nohlobo lwento lusho ukuthi yiyiphi (&quot;Split indoor unit, wall-mounted&quot;, &quot;Split indoor unit, ceiling cassette&quot;, &quot;Split indoor unit, ducted&quot;, &quot;Split outdoor unit&quot;, &quot;VRF outdoor unit&quot;). I-fan coil ingu-IfcUnitaryEquipment ohlobo i-AIRHANDLER nohlobo lwento &quot;Fan coil unit&quot;: i-IFC4 ayinahlobo lwe-fan coil, futhi ifeni, i-coil nefilthara yegumbi elilodwa yileyo i-AIRHANDLER echaza. Ukuxhumana kwe-refnet ngu-IfcPipeFitting ohlobo i-JUNCTION (&quot;Refnet joint&quot;). Amafayela e-IFC2X3 athola i-IfcEnergyConversionDevice ne-IfcFlowFitting ngohlobo olufanayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzimbobo zesiphephisi nemigqa ziseziphephisini i-REFRIGERATION (enye yemigqa yoketshezi, enye yemigqa yegesi), nokuphuphuthekisa kusesistimini ye-DRAINAGE. Imigqa ye-ACR iqanjwa ngobubanzi bangaphandle. Itafula lesethi yemigqa liyisethi yezakhiwo i-CadCraft_HvacLineSets kuprojekthi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBheka futhi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/mep-equipment\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/mep-equipment\"\u003EMEP equipment with ports\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/mep-connections\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/mep-connections\"\u003EConnect pipes and ducts to equipment\u003C/a\u003E kanye \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/pipes-and-ducts\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/pipes-and-ducts\"\u003EPipes and ducts\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Faka iyunithi zohlelo lwe-split, lwe-multi-split noma lwe-VRF kanye ne-fan coil zalo emodeli, bese uzixhumanisa ngezethi yemigqa: umugqa woketshezi nomugqa wegesi ngekhopha le-ACR, ahlanganiswe nezimbobo zeyunithi. Iyunithi zisebenza njengazo zonke ezinye izinto ze-MEP equipment with ports: ibha efanayo, Izici, izimbobo kanye nezixhumanisi (connections). Lo ungumsizi wokudweba nokuhlanganisa. Iyunithi ziyizimo ezijwayelekile ezilingana ngamanani owabhalayo, hhayi imikhiqizo yomkhiqizi othile. Usayizi wamapayipi azo uvela etafuleni lezinxaneli ezijwayelekile zesibonelo zezinsiza ze-R410A ne-R32, hhayi kumkhiqizi othile: incwadi yokufaka yomkhiqizi weyunithi yona inquma usayizi wangempela, futhi imigqa ende noma umehluko omkhulu wobude uyawushintsha. Shintsha itafula, noma bhala usayizi, ukuze ufanane neyunithi oyisebenzisayo. Beka iyunithi Vula Dweba, vula Ukwakhiwa bese ukhetha Izinsiza. Khetha uhlobo bese usetha amanani alo: Uhlobo Ukusetha Izixhumi zayo Iyunithi yangaphakathi ye-split, odongeni amandla, umugqa woketshezi nomugqa wegesi, ubude, ubujule, ukuphakama, usayizi wokuphuphuthekisa isiphephisi soketshezi nesegesi, ukukhipha ukuphuphuthekisa (ngakwesokudla, eduze kodonga) Iyunithi yangaphakathi ye-split, ye-cassette amandla, umugqa woketshezi nomugqa wegesi, ipanele, umzimba, ukuphakama, usayizi wokuphuphuthekisa isiphephisi soketshezi nesegesi, ukukhipha ukuphuphuthekisa (ngakolunye uhlangothi, eduze kwaphezulu) Iyunithi yangaphakathi ye-split, enombobo amandla, umugqa woketshezi nomugqa wegesi, ubude, ububanzi, ukuphakama, izimbobo zokunikeza nokubuyisa, usayizi wokuphuphuthekisa umbobo wokunikeza ophumayo, umbobo wokubuyisa ongenayo, isiphephisi soketshezi nesegesi, ukukhipha ukuphuphuthekisa Iyunithi yangaphandle ye-split amandla, umugqa woketshezi nomugqa wegesi, ububanzi, ubujule, ukuphakama isiphephisi soketshezi nesegesi (ngakwesokudla) Iyunithi yangaphandle ye-VRF amandla, umugqa woketshezi nomugqa wegesi, ububanzi, ubujule, ukuphakama isiphephisi soketshezi nesegesi (phambili, phansi) Ukuxhumana kwe-refnet umugqa woketshezi noma wegesi, umthwalo kwelinye ngalinye igatsha, ipayipi ekugcineni ngakunye ukungena, igatsha A, igatsha B Iyunithi ye-fan coil ama-2-pipe noma ama-4-pipe, ubude, ububanzi, ukuphakama, izimbobo zokunikeza nokubuyisa, ipayipi nesistimu ye-coil, ipayipi lokushisisa, usayizi wokuphuphuthekisa umbobo wokunikeza ophumayo, umbobo wokubuyisa ongenayo, i-coil ngenayo nephumayo, ukushisisa ngenayo nephumayo (ama-4-pipe), ukukhipha ukuphuphuthekisa Setha Ku-: ukuphakama kwesisekelo seyunithi ngaphezu kwezinga. Isisekelo seyunithi yodonga yisiphansi sayo (njalo ngo-2100 mm); eseyilingi isibhamu sayo ngaphakathi kophahla; eye-refnet ukuphakama komugqa wepayipi wayo. Chofoza lapho iyoya khona (R iyijikisa ngama-90°). Amandla ayizinga lokupholisa elibekiwe leyunithi ngo-kW, kanye no-Btu/h eduze kwawo. Uma Umugqa woketshezi nes Umugqa wegesi ushiywe ku-Kusuka etafuleni, ukuxhumana kweyunithi kuthatha usayizi wetafula kulawo mandla; khetha usayizi wetyubhu ukuze usebenzise weyunithi yakho. Ukungena kwe-refnet kulinganiswa ngamagatsha womabili ndawonye, nelingi ligatsha ngomthwalo waleligatsha. Izixhumi zesiphephisi zisebenza zombili izindlela (ipompo lokushisa lisebenza nakweyiphi indlela). Ukukhipha ukuphuphuthekisa kungusayizi wepayipi njenganoma yiliphi idrenishi. Dweba isethi yemigqa Khetha izinto ezimbili (Shift+chofoza eyesibili): iyunithi yangaphandle neyunithi yangaphakathi (i-single split), noma iyunithi yangaphandle ne-refnet, i-refnet neyunithi yangaphakathi, noma ama-refnet amabili (VRF). Vula Ukwakhiwa bese ukhetha Isethi yemigqa. BimCraft idweba imigqa yoketshezi negesi phakathi kwezimbobo zazo ezikhululekile, iphuma kwisimbobo ngasinye iye ebangeni elifanayo elingaphezulu, ngekhopha le-ACR (i-coil ethambile kuya ku-1-5/8 in, ityubhu ehlanganisiwe ngaphezulu kwalo), njengesinyathelo esisodwa se-Hlehlisa. I-refnet ithatha umugqa wayo kuphela: ingena ivela ngakolwangaphandle, iphume ilunge egatsheni elibheka iziyunithi zangaphakathi. Umugqa ngamunye uthatha usayizi wokugcina lawo okuwusangane (iyunithi yangaphakathi, noma ukungena kwe-refnet); uma isimbobo sokugcina esinye sinosayizi ohlukile, i-Hlola ukuxhumana iyawudweba: yilapho okudingeka khona i-reducer. Iziyunithi zangaphakathi ezimbili zidinga i-refnet phakathi kwazo. Hambisa imigqa ngemuva njengalanoma yimuphi umugqa wepayipi; iziphetho zawo zihlala ezimbobeni. Imigqa phakathi kwezitezi idwetshwa nge-Ipayipi: ipayipi eliqalwa esimbobeni sesiphephisi lithatha isistimu yalo, ikhopha le-ACR nosayizi walo. Shintsha itafula lesethi yemigqa Vula Ukwakhiwa bese ukhetha Usayizi wesethi yemigqa. Umugqa ngamunye uthi: kuze kulesi sandla (kW), leli thubhu loketshezi nalelithubhu legesi. Kuze ku- Uketshezi Igesi 2.8 kW Ø6.35 (1/4\") Ø9.52 (3/8\") 5.6 kW Ø6.35 (1/4\") Ø12.7 (1/2\") 16 kW Ø9.52 (3/8\") Ø15.88 (5/8\") 22.4 kW Ø9.52 (3/8\") Ø19.05 (3/4\") 33 kW Ø9.52 (3/8\") Ø22.22 (7/8\") 47 kW Ø12.7 (1/2\") Ø28.58 (1-1/8\") 71 kW Ø15.88 (5/8\") Ø28.58 (1-1/8\") 104 kW Ø19.05 (3/4\") Ø34.92 (1-3/8\") 180 kW Ø19.05 (3/4\") Ø41.28 (1-5/8\") Lezi ngamanani okuqala ajwayelekile. Shintsha umugqa, engeza nomaususe imigqa, bese ukhetha Londoloza: itafulaligcinwa emodelini, ngakho wonke umuntu osebenza kufayela uyilisebenzisa, futhi Hlehlisa iyibuyisela emuva. Sebenzisa amanani ajwayelekile ibuyisela itafula lokuqala. Izinto ezisha ezivele zigcina izimbobo zazo kuze kube yilapho uzishintsha. Kufayela le-IFC Iyunithi zangaphakathi nezangaphandle zezinhlelo ze-split ne-VRF ziyi-IfcUnitaryEquipment ngohlobo i-SPLITSYSTEM, nohlobo lwento lusho ukuthi yiyiphi (\"Split indoor unit, wall-mounted\", \"Split indoor unit, ceiling cassette\", \"Split indoor unit, ducted\", \"Split outdoor unit\", \"VRF outdoor unit\"). I-fan coil ingu-IfcUnitaryEquipment ohlobo i-AIRHANDLER nohlobo lwento \"Fan coil unit\": i-IFC4 ayinahlobo lwe-fan coil, futhi ifeni, i-coil nefilthara yegumbi elilodwa yileyo i-AIRHANDLER echaza. Ukuxhumana kwe-refnet ngu-IfcPipeFitting ohlobo i-JUNCTION (\"Refnet joint\"). Amafayela e-IFC2X3 athola i-IfcEnergyConversionDevice ne-IfcFlowFitting ngohlobo olufanayo. Izimbobo zesiphephisi nemigqa ziseziphephisini i-REFRIGERATION (enye yemigqa yoketshezi, enye yemigqa yegesi), nokuphuphuthekisa kusesistimini ye-DRAINAGE. Imigqa ye-ACR iqanjwa ngobubanzi bangaphandle. Itafula lesethi yemigqa liyisethi yezakhiwo i-CadCraft_HvacLineSets kuprojekthi. Bheka futhi MEP equipment with ports, Connect pipes and ducts to equipment kanye Pipes and ducts.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"mep-connections","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Xhuma amapayipi nemisele yomoya kuzinsiza","summary":"Qala noma uphelise ipayipi noma umsele womoya ephoyinteni ukuze uthathe usayizi nesistimu yephoyinti bese uhlala usekelwe kulo, bese uhlola ukuxhumana: amaphoyinti avulekile, ukungafani kosayizi nezistimu, nezintambo ezingenamthombo.","section":"tasks","order":38,"keywords":["mep","xhuma","ukuxhumana","ixhumano","iphoyinti","iphoyinti elivulekile","ukungafani kosayizi","ukungafani kwesistimu","umthombo","hlola ukuxhumana","elisekelwe","lilandele","hambisa izinsiza","ifcrelconnectsports","ukuhlanganisa"],"headings":[{"id":"okufanele-ukwenze","text":"Okufanele ukwenze","level":2},{"id":"dweba-usuka-ephoyinteni","text":"Dweba usuka ephoyinteni","level":2},{"id":"hlola-ukuxhumana","text":"Hlola ukuxhumana","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukwenze\"\u003EOkufanele ukwenze\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXhuma izintambo kuzinsiza ukuze imodeli ibe yisistimu eyodwa exhunyiwe: okuphuma kwepompo kuye epayipini elishiya kuyo, nentamo yediffuser kumsele wegatsha lakhe. Bese uvumela i-BimCraft ibhale lokho okungaxhunyiwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dweba-usuka-ephoyinteni\"\u003EDweba usuka ephoyinteni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIpayipi\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIpayipi lomoya\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHambisa isikhombi phezu kwephoyinti lesinsiza (izindilinga ezincane; iphoyinti elivulekile lidwetshwa ngombala wesexwayiso). Isikhombi siyanamathela kulo bese sithi \u003Cstrong\u003Eephoyinteni\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza: intambo iqala ngobude bephoyinti \u003Cstrong\u003Efuthi ithatha usayizi nesistimu yalo\u003C/strong\u003E (ipayipi nalo lithatha izinto ezijwayelekile zesistimu). Umugqa wesimo utshela okuthathile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDweba uqhubeke njengejwayelekile. Ukuphela kwentambo kwephoyinti elinye nakho kuyaxhuma lolo luhlangothi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsiphetho sentambo ephoyinteni sihlala \u003Cstrong\u003Esisekelwe\u003C/strong\u003E kulo: hambisa noma ujikise isinsiza (ku-Izici) bese isiphetho sentambo sihamba nakho; hlela intambo bese lolo luhlangothi lihlala ephoyinteni. Amakhoveni wentambo ayo amanye ahlala lapho ayekhona, ngakho ngemva kokuhamba okukhulu, umlenze wokuqala ungase uphume ephoyinteni ngokuthambeka: hambisa nekhoveni elilandelayo futhi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlola-ukuxhumana\"\u003EHlola ukuxhumana\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkwakhiwa\u003C/span\u003E bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlola ukuxhumana\u003C/span\u003E. Uhlu olungaphansi kwebha luwubonisa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUmugqa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkusho\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIphoyinti alixhunyiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsinsiza sinokuxhuma okungadwetshwanga lutho kuso\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkukho lutho esiphethweni\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIntambo iphela emoyeni\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmaphoyinti axhunyiwe anosayizi abahlukile\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIntambo yosayizi oyodwa ihlangana nephoyinti noma nentambo yosayizi omunye ngaphandle kwenciphisi (usayizi ojwayelekile wepayipi, isimo nezinhlangothi zomsele)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmaphoyinti axhunyiwe ezistimu ezahlukile\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsibonelo: umsele wokubuyisela esigedeni sokunikeza\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIpayipi lixhunywe emsele womoya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzixhumi ezimbili zezinhlobo ezihlukile ziyahlangana\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkukho sinsiza esinethiwekhi yaso esinikezayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkukho okuxhunyiwe entanjeni, noma kude kangakanani, okunomthombo. Imifudlana, amanzi esiphepho nezimbobo zokuphefumula azibuzwa lokhu: amanzi azo avela ezinsizeni\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIxhunywe ephoyinteni lesinsiza esingasasekho kumodeli\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsinsiza sasusiwe; dweba kabusha isiphetho noma susa intambo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmaphutha avela kuqala. Chofoza umugqa ukukhetha okuchazwa yiwo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVala\u003C/span\u003E ifihla uhlu. Ukuhlola kufunda imodeli njengoba idwetshiwe: kuhlola ukuxhumana nosayizi, hhayi okugeleza, ingcindezi noma ukulinganisa.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Okufanele ukwenze Xhuma izintambo kuzinsiza ukuze imodeli ibe yisistimu eyodwa exhunyiwe: okuphuma kwepompo kuye epayipini elishiya kuyo, nentamo yediffuser kumsele wegatsha lakhe. Bese uvumela i-BimCraft ibhale lokho okungaxhunyiwe. Dweba usuka ephoyinteni Khetha Ipayipi noma Ipayipi lomoya. Hambisa isikhombi phezu kwephoyinti lesinsiza (izindilinga ezincane; iphoyinti elivulekile lidwetshwa ngombala wesexwayiso). Isikhombi siyanamathela kulo bese sithi ephoyinteni. Chofoza: intambo iqala ngobude bephoyinti futhi ithatha usayizi nesistimu yalo (ipayipi nalo lithatha izinto ezijwayelekile zesistimu). Umugqa wesimo utshela okuthathile. Dweba uqhubeke njengejwayelekile. Ukuphela kwentambo kwephoyinti elinye nakho kuyaxhuma lolo luhlangothi. Isiphetho sentambo ephoyinteni sihlala sisekelwe kulo: hambisa noma ujikise isinsiza (ku-Izici) bese isiphetho sentambo sihamba nakho; hlela intambo bese lolo luhlangothi lihlala ephoyinteni. Amakhoveni wentambo ayo amanye ahlala lapho ayekhona, ngakho ngemva kokuhamba okukhulu, umlenze wokuqala ungase uphume ephoyinteni ngokuthambeka: hambisa nekhoveni elilandelayo futhi. Hlola ukuxhumana Vula Ukwakhiwa bese uchofoza Hlola ukuxhumana. Uhlu olungaphansi kwebha luwubonisa: Umugqa Okusho Iphoyinti alixhunyiwe Isinsiza sinokuxhuma okungadwetshwanga lutho kuso Akukho lutho esiphethweni Intambo iphela emoyeni Amaphoyinti axhunyiwe anosayizi abahlukile Intambo yosayizi oyodwa ihlangana nephoyinti noma nentambo yosayizi omunye ngaphandle kwenciphisi (usayizi ojwayelekile wepayipi, isimo nezinhlangothi zomsele) Amaphoyinti axhunyiwe ezistimu ezahlukile Isibonelo: umsele wokubuyisela esigedeni sokunikeza Ipayipi lixhunywe emsele womoya Izixhumi ezimbili zezinhlobo ezihlukile ziyahlangana Akukho sinsiza esinethiwekhi yaso esinikezayo Akukho okuxhunyiwe entanjeni, noma kude kangakanani, okunomthombo. Imifudlana, amanzi esiphepho nezimbobo zokuphefumula azibuzwa lokhu: amanzi azo avela ezinsizeni Ixhunywe ephoyinteni lesinsiza esingasasekho kumodeli Isinsiza sasusiwe; dweba kabusha isiphetho noma susa intambo Amaphutha avela kuqala. Chofoza umugqa ukukhetha okuchazwa yiwo. Vala ifihla uhlu. Ukuhlola kufunda imodeli njengoba idwetshiwe: kuhlola ukuxhumana nosayizi, hhayi okugeleza, ingcindezi noma ukulinganisa.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"mep-against-structure","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Hlola amapayipi nemisele yomoya ngokuhlangana nesakhiwo","summary":"Qalisa amasethi okuhlangana ahlelwe ngaphambili amapayipi nemisele yomoya namadonga, amasilabhu, amabhimu namakholomu, uthole izintambo ezisondele esakhiweni kunokugoqwa kwazo negebe, bese uhlu lwezimbobo ezidingwa yizintambo ngamadonga nangamasilabhu njenge-CSV ne-BCF.","section":"tasks","order":39,"keywords":["mep","ukungqubuzana","ukuhlola ukungqubuzana","ukuhlanganisa","isakhiwo","amadonga","amasilabhu","amabhimu","amakholomu","amabanga","ukungqubuzana okuthambile","ukugoqa","igebe","imbobo","ukudlula","isleve","ukubhoboza","umsebenzi womakhi","bcf","csv"],"headings":[{"id":"okufanele-ukwenze","text":"Okufanele ukwenze","level":2},{"id":"ukungqubuzana-okuqinile","text":"Ukungqubuzana okuqinile","level":2},{"id":"amagebe","text":"Amagebe","level":2},{"id":"izimbobo-ezidingekayo","text":"Izimbobo ezidingekayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukwenze\"\u003EOkufanele ukwenze\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQinisekisa ukuthi amasevisi ayahambisana nesakhiwo: yini engena esakhiweni, yini edlula eduze kakhulu nakho, nokuthi amadonga namasilabhu adinga izimbobo kuphi. Vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuhlola ukungqubuzana\u003C/span\u003E ephaneli yesokunxele; isigaba \u003Cstrong\u003EAmapayipi nemisele yomoya kanye nesakhiwo\u003C/strong\u003E sisendaweni evamile yokuhlola.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukungqubuzana-okuqinile\"\u003EUkungqubuzana okuqinile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUhlu lwamasethi amabili manje lunikeza futhi \u003Cstrong\u003EAmapayipi nemisele yomoya\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EAmadonga\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EAmasilabhu namaphahla\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EAmabhimu\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EAmakholomu\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003ENesakhiwo\u003C/strong\u003E (zonke ezine), kanye nenani lezinto ngayinye. Chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmapayipi nemisele yomoya × isakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E ukukhetha okokuqala nokokugcina bese uqalisa ukuhlola; noma khetha noma yiluphi uhlobo lwemibili wena bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQalisa\u003C/span\u003E. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/clash-check\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/clash-check\"\u003EHlola ukungqubuzana\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amagebe\"\u003EAmagebe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEzinye izinsiza zidinga indawo ezizungezile: ukugoqa kwazo, nendawo yokusebenza noma yeleve.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENikeza ipayipi noma umsele womoya ubukhulu be-\u003Cstrong\u003EInsulation\u003C/strong\u003E kuZici (akukho okudwetshwa ngakho).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThayipha i-\u003Cstrong\u003EIgebe elizungeze amapayipi nemisele yomoya\u003C/strong\u003E (mm) ku-Ukuhlola ukungqubuzana.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlola amabanga\u003C/span\u003E: yonke ingxenye esondele kudonga, kusilabhu, kubhimu noma kukholomu kunokugoqwa kwayo kuphezu kwegebe ibhalwa kanye nebanga elinalo nelifunayo. Chofoza umugqa ukubona izingxenye ezimbili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIngxenye edlula ngodonga noma ngesilabhu iyimbobo, hhayi ibanga, futhi ibhalwa lapho esikhundleni salokho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izimbobo-ezidingekayo\"\u003EIzimbobo ezidingekayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzimbobo ezidingekayo\u003C/span\u003E. Lapho umugqa omaphakathi wentambo udlula udonga noma isilabhu, i-BimCraft ibhala imbobo edingekayo: ejikelezile ipayipi noma umsele ojikelezile, ngaphandle kwalokho iyisikwele, ilingane nosayizi wangaphandle wentambo kanye nokugoqwa kwayo okuphindwe kabili kanye negebe eliphindwe kabili, ibekwe maphakathi lapho intambo idlula khona. Chofoza umugqa ukubona intambo nodonga noma isilabhu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzimbobo njenge-CSV\u003C/span\u003E: umugqa owodwa ngembobo ngayinye onentambo, usayizi wayo nokugoqwa kwayo, usayizi wembobo, into edlula kuyo ne-GlobalId yayo, izinga, izinga-X, Y no-Z zamaphakathi, nokuthi intambo idlula kangakanani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzimbobo njenge-BCF izindaba\u003C/span\u003E: indaba eyodwa ngembobo ngayinye, nekhamera ebheka kuyo nentambo nento ekhethiwe, ye-programu yonjiniyela wesakhiwo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAkukho okusikwayo: izimbobo luhlu lwabantu abazilinganisela. Igebe ngelakho ukulithayipha; akukho khodi etshela ukuthi imbobo kufanele ibe kanjani inkulu. Amabhimu namakholomu ngukungqubuzana, hhayi izimbobo: ukuthi ipayipi lingadlula kwelinye yisinqumo somenjiniyela wesakhiwo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Okufanele ukwenze Qinisekisa ukuthi amasevisi ayahambisana nesakhiwo: yini engena esakhiweni, yini edlula eduze kakhulu nakho, nokuthi amadonga namasilabhu adinga izimbobo kuphi. Vula Ukuhlola ukungqubuzana ephaneli yesokunxele; isigaba Amapayipi nemisele yomoya kanye nesakhiwo sisendaweni evamile yokuhlola. Ukungqubuzana okuqinile Uhlu lwamasethi amabili manje lunikeza futhi Amapayipi nemisele yomoya, Amadonga, Amasilabhu namaphahla, Amabhimu, Amakholomu kanye Nesakhiwo (zonke ezine), kanye nenani lezinto ngayinye. Chofoza Amapayipi nemisele yomoya × isakhiwo ukukhetha okokuqala nokokugcina bese uqalisa ukuhlola; noma khetha noma yiluphi uhlobo lwemibili wena bese uchofoza Qalisa. Bona Hlola ukungqubuzana. Amagebe Ezinye izinsiza zidinga indawo ezizungezile: ukugoqa kwazo, nendawo yokusebenza noma yeleve. Nikeza ipayipi noma umsele womoya ubukhulu be-Insulation kuZici (akukho okudwetshwa ngakho). Thayipha i-Igebe elizungeze amapayipi nemisele yomoya (mm) ku-Ukuhlola ukungqubuzana. Chofoza Hlola amabanga: yonke ingxenye esondele kudonga, kusilabhu, kubhimu noma kukholomu kunokugoqwa kwayo kuphezu kwegebe ibhalwa kanye nebanga elinalo nelifunayo. Chofoza umugqa ukubona izingxenye ezimbili. Ingxenye edlula ngodonga noma ngesilabhu iyimbobo, hhayi ibanga, futhi ibhalwa lapho esikhundleni salokho. Izimbobo ezidingekayo Chofoza Izimbobo ezidingekayo. Lapho umugqa omaphakathi wentambo udlula udonga noma isilabhu, i-BimCraft ibhala imbobo edingekayo: ejikelezile ipayipi noma umsele ojikelezile, ngaphandle kwalokho iyisikwele, ilingane nosayizi wangaphandle wentambo kanye nokugoqwa kwayo okuphindwe kabili kanye negebe eliphindwe kabili, ibekwe maphakathi lapho intambo idlula khona. Chofoza umugqa ukubona intambo nodonga noma isilabhu. Izimbobo njenge-CSV: umugqa owodwa ngembobo ngayinye onentambo, usayizi wayo nokugoqwa kwayo, usayizi wembobo, into edlula kuyo ne-GlobalId yayo, izinga, izinga-X, Y no-Z zamaphakathi, nokuthi intambo idlula kangakanani. Izimbobo njenge-BCF izindaba: indaba eyodwa ngembobo ngayinye, nekhamera ebheka kuyo nentambo nento ekhethiwe, ye-programu yonjiniyela wesakhiwo. Akukho okusikwayo: izimbobo luhlu lwabantu abazilinganisela. Igebe ngelakho ukulithayipha; akukho khodi etshela ukuthi imbobo kufanele ibe kanjani inkulu. Amabhimu namakholomu ngukungqubuzana, hhayi izimbobo: ukuthi ipayipi lingadlula kwelinye yisinqumo somenjiniyela wesakhiwo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"embodied-carbon-and-5d-cost","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Ikhabhoni elisetshenzisiwe nezindleko kuhlelo","summary":"Engeza ikhabhoni elisetshenzisiwe lemodeli etafuleni elivulekile nelihleleka lezinto, bese usakaza amanani ohlelweni le-4D abe yiwhali yezindleko nokugeleza kwemali. Zombili ziqala ngamanani owabhalayo noma owangenisa.","section":"tasks","order":39,"keywords":["ikhabhoni elisetshenzisiwe","ikhabhoni","co2","kgco2e","ukukhishwa","ithebula lezinto","epd","5d","izindleko","ukugeleza kwemali","ijika le-s","izindleko zohlelo","amanani","amanani okubala amanani"],"headings":[{"id":"ikhabhoni-elisetshenzisiwe","text":"Ikhabhoni elisetshenzisiwe","level":2},{"id":"izindleko-kuhlelo-le-4d","text":"Izindleko kuhlelo le-4D","level":2},{"id":"imali","text":"Imali","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"ikhabhoni-elisetshenzisiwe\"\u003EIkhabhoni elisetshenzisiwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula ipane ethi \u003Cstrong\u003ECarbon\u003C/strong\u003E. Ubukhulu bento ngayinye (ivolumu, indawo noma ubude) buphindwa ngesinto kusuka etafuleni, ngemodyuli yomjikelezo wokuphila: isigaba somkhiqizo siyadingeka; ukuthuthwa nemfucuza kuyazikhethela. Imiphumela iphuma ngezinto, ngezigaba nangesitezi, nangemitha ngayinye yesikwele yophahla.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIthebula lezinto ngelakho.\u003C/strong\u003E Imigqa eza ne-BimCraft ngamanani okuqala ajwayelekile ngohlobo oluwukuthi ahambisana nobukhulu. Awavela kudathabhesi, aphawulwa njengengahlolwanga, futhi kufanele ashintshwe ngomthombo osetshenziswa yini (i-EPD, idathabhesi kazwelonke, noma izibalo zenkampani yakho). Hlela imigqa kwipane, noma ngenisa noma ukhiphe ithebula njenge-CSV noma i-JSON. Imigqa oyengezayo idlula umugqa wokuqala onalo kanye nokhomba. Ithebulaligcinwa kumodeli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinto ezingenakuhambisana, noma ezingenabukhulu, zidwetshwa njengezinkinga kunokuba zibalwe njengo-zero.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izindleko-kuhlelo-le-4d\"\u003EIzindleko kuhlelo le-4D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula ipane ethi \u003Cstrong\u003ECost\u003C/strong\u003E eduze kohlelo le-4D. Yinike amanani (wawabhale, noma wangenise i-CSV noma i-JSON, noma uletha imigqa ye-TakeoffCraft), bese uhlobanisa ngayinye yamanani nezinto zemodeli ngamagama okhiye, futhi ipane ibiza zonke izinto zomsebenzi ngamunye. Izindleko zomsebenzi ngamunye zisakazwa phakathi kwezinsuku zokuqala kuya ezokuphela (ngokulinganayo, noma ezilayishwe phambili noma emuva), futhi ipane idweba ijika lokugeleza kwemali elibalwe ngosuku, ngeviki noma ngenyanga, nezindleko ngesigaba nangephakheji, nokuthi okuhleliwe kuqhathaniswa kanjani nokwakhiwe ngosuku oluthile. Iphuma njenge-CSV. Akukho okubizwa kuze kube yilapho unikeza amanani: awekho alethwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imali\"\u003EImali\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthebula lamanani lingasho imali anikezwa ngayo (izinhlamvu ezintathu, njengo-USD noma i-EUR). Ipane ye-5D inebhokisi lalokho, igcinwa kufayela kanye namanani, futhi ukuthumela kwe-JSON kuthwala lokho. Ithebula elenziwe ngaphambi kwalokhu, noma elishiywe lingenalutho, alinayo imali: izindleko zalo zikhonjiswa njenge-USD, okuwukuzenzakalela kwe-shell, futhi ipane namanani aphelele ayakusho lokho. Akukho ukuguqulwa kwemali phakathi kwezimali.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ikhabhoni elisetshenzisiwe Vula ipane ethi Carbon. Ubukhulu bento ngayinye (ivolumu, indawo noma ubude) buphindwa ngesinto kusuka etafuleni, ngemodyuli yomjikelezo wokuphila: isigaba somkhiqizo siyadingeka; ukuthuthwa nemfucuza kuyazikhethela. Imiphumela iphuma ngezinto, ngezigaba nangesitezi, nangemitha ngayinye yesikwele yophahla. Ithebula lezinto ngelakho. Imigqa eza ne-BimCraft ngamanani okuqala ajwayelekile ngohlobo oluwukuthi ahambisana nobukhulu. Awavela kudathabhesi, aphawulwa njengengahlolwanga, futhi kufanele ashintshwe ngomthombo osetshenziswa yini (i-EPD, idathabhesi kazwelonke, noma izibalo zenkampani yakho). Hlela imigqa kwipane, noma ngenisa noma ukhiphe ithebula njenge-CSV noma i-JSON. Imigqa oyengezayo idlula umugqa wokuqala onalo kanye nokhomba. Ithebulaligcinwa kumodeli. Izinto ezingenakuhambisana, noma ezingenabukhulu, zidwetshwa njengezinkinga kunokuba zibalwe njengo-zero. Izindleko kuhlelo le-4D Vula ipane ethi Cost eduze kohlelo le-4D. Yinike amanani (wawabhale, noma wangenise i-CSV noma i-JSON, noma uletha imigqa ye-TakeoffCraft), bese uhlobanisa ngayinye yamanani nezinto zemodeli ngamagama okhiye, futhi ipane ibiza zonke izinto zomsebenzi ngamunye. Izindleko zomsebenzi ngamunye zisakazwa phakathi kwezinsuku zokuqala kuya ezokuphela (ngokulinganayo, noma ezilayishwe phambili noma emuva), futhi ipane idweba ijika lokugeleza kwemali elibalwe ngosuku, ngeviki noma ngenyanga, nezindleko ngesigaba nangephakheji, nokuthi okuhleliwe kuqhathaniswa kanjani nokwakhiwe ngosuku oluthile. Iphuma njenge-CSV. Akukho okubizwa kuze kube yilapho unikeza amanani: awekho alethwa. Imali Ithebula lamanani lingasho imali anikezwa ngayo (izinhlamvu ezintathu, njengo-USD noma i-EUR). Ipane ye-5D inebhokisi lalokho, igcinwa kufayela kanye namanani, futhi ukuthumela kwe-JSON kuthwala lokho. Ithebula elenziwe ngaphambi kwalokhu, noma elishiywe lingenalutho, alinayo imali: izindleko zalo zikhonjiswa njenge-USD, okuwukuzenzakalela kwe-shell, futhi ipane namanani aphelele ayakusho lokho. Akukho ukuguqulwa kwemali phakathi kwezimali.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"pipe-specs","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Izinkombandlela zepayipi, amavalvu, amadampha kanye nemindeni yabakhiqizi","summary":"Setha izinkombandlela zakho zepayipi (amathebula osayizi anempahla, ukuhlangana kanye nokuqina), ogcinwa kufayela lemodeli; faka amavalvu, isihlungi kanye namadampha emigqeni; bese ulethe imodeli yevalvu noma yesisetshenziswa somkhiqizi njengomndeni onamaphothi okuxhuma.","section":"tasks","order":39,"keywords":["inkombandlela yepayipi","izinkombandlela zepayipi","inkombandlela yokwakha","ipayipi elenziwe ngokwakho","ithebula losayizi","ithubhu","ithubhu yokuhlanzeka","insimbi engagqwali","ishejuli","ububanzi bangaphandle","ukhulu wodonga","ububanzi bangaphakathi","ukuqina","izinga lokucindezela","csv","json","ngenisa","hambisa","ishidi","umgaqo","bpe","din","en 10357","en 10255","ivalvu","amavalvu","ivalvu yebhathafula","ivalvu yokulinganisa","ivalvu yokulawula","isihlungi","idampha","idampha levolumu","idampha lomlilo","oem","umkhiqizi","umenzi","umndeni","imindeni","amaphothi","ukuxhuma","step","obj","gltf","ifc","iradiyetha","ikhonvekhtha","ipaneli yokushisa","umphathi womoya","isikhishi","igridi"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"setha-inkombandlela-yepayipi","text":"Setha inkombandlela yepayipi","level":2},{"id":"sebenzisa-kabusha-inkombandlela-kwenye-imodeli","text":"Sebenzisa kabusha inkombandlela kwenye imodeli","level":2},{"id":"izinkombandlela-zesampula","text":"Izinkombandlela zesampula","level":2},{"id":"dweba-umugqa-kwinkombandlela","text":"Dweba umugqa kwinkombandlela","level":2},{"id":"amavalvu-isihlungi-namadampha","text":"Amavalvu, isihlungi namadampha","level":2},{"id":"imodeli-yomkhiqizi-njengomndeni","text":"Imodeli yomkhiqizi njengomndeni","level":2},{"id":"iradiyetha-namakhonvekhtha","text":"Iradiyetha namakhonvekhtha","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDweba ipayipi ngenkombandlela yakho ngokwakho esikhundleni samathebula asekhona ensimbi, ethusi nepulasitiki, faka amavalvu namadampha emigqeni, bese ufaka imodeli yomkhiqizi enamaphothi lapho amapayipi axhuma khona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsisekelo sokudweba nokuhlanganisa. Inkombandlela yepayipi igcina izinombolo ozithayipha noma oziletha: hlola yonke ithebula ngendinganiso yephrojekthi yakho. Amavalvu, izihlungi namadampha asemathulini ayizimo ezibonakalayo ezilinganiswa ngomugqa, hhayi ubude bomkhiqizi noma bendinganiso yevalvu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"setha-inkombandlela-yepayipi\"\u003ESetha inkombandlela yepayipi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDweba\u003C/span\u003E, vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkwakhiwa\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinkombandlela zepayipi\u003C/span\u003E. Iqhosha elifanayo likhona ebhareni lethuluzi lePayipi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkusha\u003C/span\u003E, noma qala ngefayela, ukunamathisela noma inkombandlela yesampula (ngezansi).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThayipha igama layo, umgaqo noma isethenjwa elilandelwayo, impahla kanye nohlobo lwesiphetho noma lokuxhuma.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThayipha umugqa owodwa ngosayizi ngamunye: igama losayizi, ububanzi bangaphandle kanye nodonga, ngamamillimitha. Thayipha ububanzi bangaphakathi esikhundleni sodonga uma yilokho onakho: enye iyagcwaliswa. I-DN, izinga lokucindezela kanye nesisindo kuyinketho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOkuzikhethela: ukuqina ngamamillimitha (ukubalwa kokwehla kwengcindezi kuyasisebenzisa), ubukhulu bokufaka insulation okuqala ngabo imigqa emisha, umugqa we-elbow njengesilinganiso sobubanzi bangaphandle, uma inkombandlela inama-tee nama-reducer, kanye nombala wayo wokuqala ku-3D.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThikha izinsizakalo okufanele imigqa emisha iqale kule nkombandlela, njengamanzi apholile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGcina kumodeli\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInkombandlela, noma osayizi bayo, akukwazi ukususwa ngenkathi kukhona umugqa odwetshwe kuyo. Ukushintsha izinombolo zosayizi kudweba kabusha imigqa yalowo sayizi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sebenzisa-kabusha-inkombandlela-kwenye-imodeli\"\u003ESebenzisa kabusha inkombandlela kwenye imodeli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa njenge-.json\u003C/span\u003E igcina inkombandlela ekhethiwe njengefayela elincane; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa konke\u003C/span\u003E igcina zonke izinkombandlela zemodeli. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgenisa ifayela\u003C/span\u003E ziyafunda futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa njenge-.csv\u003C/span\u003E igcina ithebula losayizi lespredishithi. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgenisa ifayela\u003C/span\u003E ifunda futhi i-\u003Ccode\u003E.csv\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENamathisela imigqa\u003C/span\u003E ithatha ithebula elikopishwe kusipredishithi. Umugqa wokuqala uqamba amakholomu: \u003Ccode\u003ESize\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EOD\u003C/code\u003E kanye \u003Ccode\u003EWall\u003C/code\u003E (noma \u003Ccode\u003EID\u003C/code\u003E), kanye ngokuzikhethela \u003Ccode\u003EDN\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EPressure\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EWeight\u003C/code\u003E. Umugqa owodwa ngosayizi ngamunye. Izinombolo ziyamamillimitha ngaphandle uma ukhetha amayintshi noma iseli libhala iyunithi yalo (\u003Ccode\u003E0.065 in\u003C/code\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinkombandlela-zesampula\"\u003EIzinkombandlela zesampula\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza inkombandlela yesampula\u003C/span\u003E yengeza enye yalezi emodelini yakho njengekhophi oyingalungisa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsampula\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOsayizi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EASME BPE tube\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E1/4&quot; kuya ku-6&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEN 10357 series A tube (DIN 11850 row 2)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDN10 kuya ku-DN200\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEN 10255 steel tube, medium series\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDN15 kuya ku-DN150\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEN 10255 steel tube, heavy series\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDN15 kuya ku-DN125\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELawa mathebula ngobubanzi bangaphandle nodonga okunikezwa amakhasi amabili noma ngaphezulu wabahlinzeki abashicilelwe ngalesi sitandade futhi avumelana ngawo. Awathathwanga kwizitandade ngokwazo. Osayizi abanikezwa ikhasi elilodwa baphuthelwe. Isampula ngasinye likhombisa amakhasi womthombo wayo futhi limakwe ngokuthi &quot;check against your project standard&quot;. Ayinikezwa ukuqina, izinga lokucindezela noma isisindo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dweba-umugqa-kwinkombandlela\"\u003EDweba umugqa kwinkombandlela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIpayipi\u003C/span\u003E. Umugqa wokuqala ngesistimu oyikhethile kwinkombandlela uyaqala kuyo. Kwayo yonke enye imigqa, khetha inkombandlela ohlwini lwezimpahla: izinkombandlela zibhalwa ngemuva kwezimpahla zakhiwe ngaphakathi njenge &quot;Spec: igama&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUhlu losayizi manje lubamba losayizi balowo mugqa kuphela. Khetha elilodwa bese udweba umugqa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze ufake umugqa kwinkombandlela kamuva, wukhethe bese ushintsha \u003Cstrong\u003EImpahla yokwakha\u003C/strong\u003E ku-Properties (Izici). Usayizi wawo ube wusayizi weNkombandlela oseduze kakhulu ngobubanzi bangaphandle.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-faela ye-IFC ipayipi lithwala igama lenkombandlela, umgaqo, impahla, ukuhlangana kanye nezilinganiso (\u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_PipeSpec\u003C/code\u003E kanye \u003Ccode\u003EPset_PipeSegmentTypeCommon\u003C/code\u003E, kwipayipi nakuhlobo lwalo).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkubalwa kosayizi kanye nokwehla kwengcindezi kufunda ububanzi bangaphakathi benkombandlela. Uma inkombandlela inokuqina, ukuhwaqeka komugqa kubalwa ngalo (Darcy-Weisbach); uma kungenjalo, kusetshenziswa okuzenzakalelayo kokubalwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amavalvu-isihlungi-namadampha\"\u003EAmavalvu, isihlungi namadampha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIvalvu\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha uhlobo ebhareni: isango (gate), ibhola (ball), ibhathafula (butterfly), iglobe (globe), ukuhlola (check), ukulinganisa (balancing) noma ukulawula (control), noma isihlungi, kumapayipi; idampha levolumu noma idampha lomlilo, kumapayipi omoya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza emgqeni lapho okuya khona. Umugqa unqunywa ezungeze lona, bese zombili izinhlangothi ziyahlala zixhumekile. Lithatha usayizi womugqa futhi lihamba nomugqa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEzicini zomugqa zibala ngayinye ngayinye nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa\u003C/span\u003E; umugqa uyavala futhi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkubalwa kokwehla kwengcindezi kubala ukulahleka kokuxhuma kumavalvu we-gate, ball, globe nowe-check kuphela. Ezinye izinhlobo, amadampha kanye nemindeni yabakhiqizi azengezi ukulahleka lapho: yenza ukuhlola kwakho ngokwakho. Zibalwa ku-schedule ethi \u003Cstrong\u003EIzixhumi namavalvu\u003C/strong\u003E nakumbala wokuthatha, futhi zibhalwa ku-IFC njengamavalvu, isihlungi (i-strainer) namadampha anamaphothi amabili axhunyiwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imodeli-yomkhiqizi-njengomndeni\"\u003EImodeli yomkhiqizi njengomndeni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkwakhiwa\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImindeni\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgenisa imodeli\u003C/span\u003E. Amafayela e-IFC, STEP, OBJ, STL, glTF kanye nezinto ze-Library ayafundwa. Ku-OBJ kanye ne-STL, setha iyunithi yefayela kanye ne-axis ephezulu kuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-dayalogi yamaphothi, thayipha igama, umenzi kanye nenombolo yemodeli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha ukuthi uyofakwa \u003Cstrong\u003EEmugqeni\u003C/strong\u003E (ivalvu, isihlungi noma idampha) noma ube \u003Cstrong\u003EIzinsiza\u003C/strong\u003E, kanye nokuthi ibhalwa njani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMnike amaphothi ayo. Ngamunye unegama, ipayipi noma ipayipi lomoya, insiza, usayizi ngamamillimitha (ububanzi bangaphandle bepayipi), usayizi wenkombandlela yakho njengoba uwubiza, uhlobo lokuphela, indawo yawo kanye nendlela ebheka ngayo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEsiqondweni\u003C/span\u003E ubeka iphoyinti endaweni ephakathi yohlangothi lwebhokisi lemodeli. Ukubukeka okuncane okuphezulu kubonisa amaphothi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza umndeni emodelini\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmndeni ofakwa emugqeni udinga amaphothi amabili kuphela abheke kwezinye ngaphandle, emgqeni owodwa. Khetha wona ohlwini lwethuluzi leValvu bese uchofoza emgqeni: ufakwa ubude bawo bona bese amapayipi axhuma kumaphothi awo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmndeni awukaze welulwe. Uma amaphothi awo engafani nosayizi womugqa, uyatshelwa lapho ufakwa, futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlola ukuxhumana\u003C/span\u003E uyawudweba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmndeni wezinsiza ufakwa nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinsiza\u003C/span\u003E, uhlobo \u003Cstrong\u003EUmndeni womkhiqizi\u003C/strong\u003E. Amapayipi namapayipi omoya ayaxhuma kumaphothi awo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELandela njengento yeLibrary\u003C/span\u003E igcina umndeni namaphothi awo njengefayela ongalithumela ku-Library.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"iradiyetha-namakhonvekhtha\"\u003EIradiyetha namakhonvekhtha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinsiza\u003C/span\u003E futhi inezinhlobo \u003Cstrong\u003EIradiyetha\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003EIkhonvekhtha / ipaneli yokushisa\u003C/strong\u003E: izimbiza ezijwayelekile ezinokuxhuma kokugeleza nokubuya kwamanzi okushisa. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/mep-equipment\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/mep-equipment\"\u003EIzinsiza ze-MEP ezinamaphothi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Dweba ipayipi ngenkombandlela yakho ngokwakho esikhundleni samathebula asekhona ensimbi, ethusi nepulasitiki, faka amavalvu namadampha emigqeni, bese ufaka imodeli yomkhiqizi enamaphothi lapho amapayipi axhuma khona. Isisekelo sokudweba nokuhlanganisa. Inkombandlela yepayipi igcina izinombolo ozithayipha noma oziletha: hlola yonke ithebula ngendinganiso yephrojekthi yakho. Amavalvu, izihlungi namadampha asemathulini ayizimo ezibonakalayo ezilinganiswa ngomugqa, hhayi ubude bomkhiqizi noma bendinganiso yevalvu. Setha inkombandlela yepayipi Vula Dweba, vula Ukwakhiwa bese ukhetha Izinkombandlela zepayipi. Iqhosha elifanayo likhona ebhareni lethuluzi lePayipi. Khetha Okusha, noma qala ngefayela, ukunamathisela noma inkombandlela yesampula (ngezansi). Thayipha igama layo, umgaqo noma isethenjwa elilandelwayo, impahla kanye nohlobo lwesiphetho noma lokuxhuma. Thayipha umugqa owodwa ngosayizi ngamunye: igama losayizi, ububanzi bangaphandle kanye nodonga, ngamamillimitha. Thayipha ububanzi bangaphakathi esikhundleni sodonga uma yilokho onakho: enye iyagcwaliswa. I-DN, izinga lokucindezela kanye nesisindo kuyinketho. Okuzikhethela: ukuqina ngamamillimitha (ukubalwa kokwehla kwengcindezi kuyasisebenzisa), ubukhulu bokufaka insulation okuqala ngabo imigqa emisha, umugqa we-elbow njengesilinganiso sobubanzi bangaphandle, uma inkombandlela inama-tee nama-reducer, kanye nombala wayo wokuqala ku-3D. Thikha izinsizakalo okufanele imigqa emisha iqale kule nkombandlela, njengamanzi apholile. Khetha Gcina kumodeli. Inkombandlela, noma osayizi bayo, akukwazi ukususwa ngenkathi kukhona umugqa odwetshwe kuyo. Ukushintsha izinombolo zosayizi kudweba kabusha imigqa yalowo sayizi. Sebenzisa kabusha inkombandlela kwenye imodeli Hambisa njenge-.json igcina inkombandlela ekhethiwe njengefayela elincane; Hambisa konke igcina zonke izinkombandlela zemodeli. Ngenisa ifayela ziyafunda futhi. Hambisa njenge-.csv igcina ithebula losayizi lespredishithi. Ngenisa ifayela ifunda futhi i-.csv. Namathisela imigqa ithatha ithebula elikopishwe kusipredishithi. Umugqa wokuqala uqamba amakholomu: Size, OD kanye Wall (noma ID), kanye ngokuzikhethela DN, Pressure, Weight. Umugqa owodwa ngosayizi ngamunye. Izinombolo ziyamamillimitha ngaphandle uma ukhetha amayintshi noma iseli libhala iyunithi yalo (0.065 in). Izinkombandlela zesampula Engeza inkombandlela yesampula yengeza enye yalezi emodelini yakho njengekhophi oyingalungisa: Isampula Osayizi ASME BPE tube 1/4\" kuya ku-6\" EN 10357 series A tube (DIN 11850 row 2) DN10 kuya ku-DN200 EN 10255 steel tube, medium series DN15 kuya ku-DN150 EN 10255 steel tube, heavy series DN15 kuya ku-DN125 Lawa mathebula ngobubanzi bangaphandle nodonga okunikezwa amakhasi amabili noma ngaphezulu wabahlinzeki abashicilelwe ngalesi sitandade futhi avumelana ngawo. Awathathwanga kwizitandade ngokwazo. Osayizi abanikezwa ikhasi elilodwa baphuthelwe. Isampula ngasinye likhombisa amakhasi womthombo wayo futhi limakwe ngokuthi \"check against your project standard\". Ayinikezwa ukuqina, izinga lokucindezela noma isisindo. Dweba umugqa kwinkombandlela Khetha Ipayipi. Umugqa wokuqala ngesistimu oyikhethile kwinkombandlela uyaqala kuyo. Kwayo yonke enye imigqa, khetha inkombandlela ohlwini lwezimpahla: izinkombandlela zibhalwa ngemuva kwezimpahla zakhiwe ngaphakathi njenge \"Spec: igama\". Uhlu losayizi manje lubamba losayizi balowo mugqa kuphela. Khetha elilodwa bese udweba umugqa. Ukuze ufake umugqa kwinkombandlela kamuva, wukhethe bese ushintsha Impahla yokwakha ku-Properties (Izici). Usayizi wawo ube wusayizi weNkombandlela oseduze kakhulu ngobubanzi bangaphandle. Ku-faela ye-IFC ipayipi lithwala igama lenkombandlela, umgaqo, impahla, ukuhlangana kanye nezilinganiso (CadCraft_PipeSpec kanye Pset_PipeSegmentTypeCommon, kwipayipi nakuhlobo lwalo). Ukubalwa kosayizi kanye nokwehla kwengcindezi kufunda ububanzi bangaphakathi benkombandlela. Uma inkombandlela inokuqina, ukuhwaqeka komugqa kubalwa ngalo (Darcy-Weisbach); uma kungenjalo, kusetshenziswa okuzenzakalelayo kokubalwa. Amavalvu, isihlungi namadampha Khetha Ivalvu bese ukhetha uhlobo ebhareni: isango (gate), ibhola (ball), ibhathafula (butterfly), iglobe (globe), ukuhlola (check), ukulinganisa (balancing) noma ukulawula (control), noma isihlungi, kumapayipi; idampha levolumu noma idampha lomlilo, kumapayipi omoya. Chofoza emgqeni lapho okuya khona. Umugqa unqunywa ezungeze lona, bese zombili izinhlangothi ziyahlala zixhumekile. Lithatha usayizi womugqa futhi lihamba nomugqa. Ezicini zomugqa zibala ngayinye ngayinye nge-Susa; umugqa uyavala futhi. Ukubalwa kokwehla kwengcindezi kubala ukulahleka kokuxhuma kumavalvu we-gate, ball, globe nowe-check kuphela. Ezinye izinhlobo, amadampha kanye nemindeni yabakhiqizi azengezi ukulahleka lapho: yenza ukuhlola kwakho ngokwakho. Zibalwa ku-schedule ethi Izixhumi namavalvu nakumbala wokuthatha, futhi zibhalwa ku-IFC njengamavalvu, isihlungi (i-strainer) namadampha anamaphothi amabili axhunyiwe. Imodeli yomkhiqizi njengomndeni Vula Ukwakhiwa bese ukhetha Imindeni, bese Ngenisa imodeli. Amafayela e-IFC, STEP, OBJ, STL, glTF kanye nezinto ze-Library ayafundwa. Ku-OBJ kanye ne-STL, setha iyunithi yefayela kanye ne-axis ephezulu kuqala. Ku-dayalogi yamaphothi, thayipha igama, umenzi kanye nenombolo yemodeli. Khetha ukuthi uyofakwa Emugqeni (ivalvu, isihlungi noma idampha) noma ube Izinsiza, kanye nokuthi ibhalwa njani. Mnike amaphothi ayo. Ngamunye unegama, ipayipi noma ipayipi lomoya, insiza, usayizi ngamamillimitha (ububanzi bangaphandle bepayipi), usayizi wenkombandlela yakho njengoba uwubiza, uhlobo lokuphela, indawo yawo kanye nendlela ebheka ngayo. Esiqondweni ubeka iphoyinti endaweni ephakathi yohlangothi lwebhokisi lemodeli. Ukubukeka okuncane okuphezulu kubonisa amaphothi. Khetha Londoloza umndeni emodelini. Umndeni ofakwa emugqeni udinga amaphothi amabili kuphela abheke kwezinye ngaphandle, emgqeni owodwa. Khetha wona ohlwini lwethuluzi leValvu bese uchofoza emgqeni: ufakwa ubude bawo bona bese amapayipi axhuma kumaphothi awo. Umndeni awukaze welulwe. Uma amaphothi awo engafani nosayizi womugqa, uyatshelwa lapho ufakwa, futhi Hlola ukuxhumana uyawudweba. Umndeni wezinsiza ufakwa nge-Izinsiza, uhlobo Umndeni womkhiqizi. Amapayipi namapayipi omoya ayaxhuma kumaphothi awo. Landela njengento yeLibrary igcina umndeni namaphothi awo njengefayela ongalithumela ku-Library. Iradiyetha namakhonvekhtha Izinsiza futhi inezinhlobo Iradiyetha kanye Ikhonvekhtha / ipaneli yokushisa: izimbiza ezijwayelekile ezinokuxhuma kokugeleza nokubuya kwamanzi okushisa. Bona Izinsiza ze-MEP ezinamaphothi.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"pipe-spools","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Amaspuli epayipi lensimbi namashidi amaspuli","summary":"Sika umugqa wepayipi lensimbi lebutt-weld ube amaspuli ngobude obuphezulu kakhulu nasemashidini okushisela endaweni ofaka, uwanombolo, bese ulanda ishidi ngalinye lespuli (ukubuka kwe-3D, ubude bokusika, izixhumi, ukushisela, uhlu lwezinto) njenge-PDF ne-CSV; amapayipi omoya athola uhlu lokusika lwezingxenye ezithe xaxa.","section":"tasks","order":40,"keywords":["ispuli","amaspuli","ishidi lespuli","isometric","ukwenza ngaphambili","ukwakha ngaphambili","ukushisela endaweni","ukushisela esitolo","butt weld","ubude bokusika","uhlu lokusika","bill of materials","bom","ipayipi lensimbi","ishejuli 40","inombolo yomugqa","uhlu lokusika kwepayipi lomoya","izingxenye zepayipi lomoya"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"sika-umugqa-ube-amaspuli","text":"Sika umugqa ube amaspuli","level":2},{"id":"faka-ukushisela-endaweni","text":"Faka ukushisela endaweni","level":2},{"id":"amashidi-amaspuli","text":"Amashidi amaspuli","level":2},{"id":"ku-faela-ye-ifc","text":"Ku-faela ye-IFC","level":2},{"id":"amapayipi-omoya-uhlu-lokusika","text":"Amapayipi omoya: uhlu lokusika","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShintsha umugqa wepayipi lensimbi ube yizingxenye ezinikezwa umsebenzi wesitolo ozoxhuma futhi umfakeli azifake: amaspuli angadluli ubude obukhethwa nawe, ahlukaniswe lapho ubeka khona ukushisela endaweni, ngamunye uneshidi lawo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuphela \u003Cstrong\u003Eipayipi lensimbi lebutt-weld\u003C/strong\u003E lisikwa libe ngamaspuli (usayizi wamapayipi ASME B36.10M, ama-elbow ku-ASME B16.9 long radius). Amapayipi ethusi, PVC kanye ne-PEX awanazo izixhumi zebutt-weld, ngakho imigqa yawo ayinawo amaspuli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sika-umugqa-ube-amaspuli\"\u003ESika umugqa ube amaspuli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha umugqa wepayipi lensimbi. Ku-Properties, thikha \u003Cstrong\u003ESika ibe amaspuli\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIspuli elide kakhulu\u003C/strong\u003E: ubude obukhulu bomugqa wesikhungo ispuli elilodwa elingaba nabo (6 m, cishe 20 ft, okokuqala).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInombolo yomugqa\u003C/strong\u003E: ingxenye yenombolo yawo wonke amaspuli. Umugqa oyispuli omusha uthola inombolo engakasetshenziswa yesistimu yawo elandelayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmaspuli anikezwa izinombolo ngokulandelana komugqa kusukela kuphoyinti lawo lokuqala: \u003Ccode\u003ECHW-12-S01\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003ECHW-12-S02\u003C/code\u003E … (isistimu, inombolo yomugqa, ispuli). Ispuli likhula ingxenye ngengxenye; ingxenye eyenza libe lide kakhulu iqala elilandelayo, futhi ubude obuqondile obudlula ispuli busikwa lapho ispuli ligcwele khona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faka-ukushisela-endaweni\"\u003EFaka ukushisela endaweni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkwakhiwa\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkushisela endaweni\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza epayipini elinamaspuli lapho ukushisela endaweni kuya khona. Phakathi komugqa oqondile, ipayipi liyasikwa lapho; phakathi kwe-fitting noma ivalvu, ukushisela kuyanyakaza kuye kokuxhuma okusondele kakhulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEzicini kubhalwe imigqa yokushisela endaweni yomugqa, ngayinye nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa\u003C/span\u003E. Ushintsho ngalunye lungesinyathelo esisodwa se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlehlisa\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amashidi-amaspuli\"\u003EAmashidi amaspuli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-Properties womugqa onamaspuli:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmashidi amaspuli (PDF)\u003C/span\u003E: ikhasi elilodwa ngelilodwa lespuli. Ngakwesobunxele, ispuli ku-isometric view ka-30°: izingxenye zalo ezinde zibalwe, ukushisela kwesitolo kukhonjiswa njengamachashazi, ukushisela endaweni kumakwe ngokuthi FW, nonyakatho wepulani. Ngakwesokudla, inombolo yespuli, usayizi, ishejuli kanye nobude, bese kulandela \u003Cstrong\u003Eubude bokusika\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003Eizixhumi\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003Eukushisela\u003C/strong\u003E (ukushisela kwesitolo kwe-butt kuyo yonke ukuxhuma phakathi kwespuli, nokushisela endaweni lapho lihlangana khona nespuli elilandelayo) kanye \u003Cstrong\u003Enohlu lwezinto\u003C/strong\u003E nesisindo sepayipi (isisindo se-ASME B36.10M plain-end).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlu lwamaspuli (CSV)\u003C/span\u003E: okufanayo, ibhlokhi elilodwa ngelilodwa lespuli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUbude bokusika bulinganiswa ukusuka ekugcineni kuya ekugcineni njengoba kudwetshwe: ayikho igebe lempande noma indawo yokushisela ethathwayo. Ama-elbow ayi-B16.9 long radius; ama-tee, ama-reducer kanye namavalvu ajwayelekile, ahlolwa ngokwepayipi, hhayi ngokwe-B16.9 noma komkhiqizi, futhi ishidi liyasho lokho. Izisindo zezixhumi aziniki. Isisekelo sokudweba nokuhlanganisa, esilinganiswa yinjiniyela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-faela-ye-ifc\"\u003EKu-faela ye-IFC\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYonke ingxenye yomugqa onamaspuli inayo \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft_Spool\u003C/strong\u003E enSpoolId yayo, umugqa, inombolo yespuli emgqeni, kanye nokuthi iqala kuphi futhi iphele kuphi ngokuhamba komugqa. Umugqa ugcina izimiso zawo (ispuli elide kakhulu, ukushisela endaweni, inombolo yomugqa) kusethi yawo, ukuze amaspuli abuye efana uma ifayela livulwa futhi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amapayipi-omoya-uhlu-lokusika\"\u003EAmapayipi omoya: uhlu lokusika\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkwakhiwa\u003C/span\u003E bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlu lokusika imibhobho\u003C/span\u003E: i-CSV yezingxenye zepayipi lomoya ezithe xaxa ngesistimu, ngesimo nangosayizi, ngomugqa oqondile ngamunye usikwe ube yizingxenye ze-\u003Cstrong\u003EUbude besiqephu\u003C/strong\u003E kwibha ye-Duct (1500 mm, cishe 5 ft, okokuqala) nalokho okusele. Ubude kuphela: akukho ama-seam, amageji noma izixhumi.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Shintsha umugqa wepayipi lensimbi ube yizingxenye ezinikezwa umsebenzi wesitolo ozoxhuma futhi umfakeli azifake: amaspuli angadluli ubude obukhethwa nawe, ahlukaniswe lapho ubeka khona ukushisela endaweni, ngamunye uneshidi lawo. Kuphela ipayipi lensimbi lebutt-weld lisikwa libe ngamaspuli (usayizi wamapayipi ASME B36.10M, ama-elbow ku-ASME B16.9 long radius). Amapayipi ethusi, PVC kanye ne-PEX awanazo izixhumi zebutt-weld, ngakho imigqa yawo ayinawo amaspuli. Sika umugqa ube amaspuli Khetha umugqa wepayipi lensimbi. Ku-Properties, thikha Sika ibe amaspuli. Ispuli elide kakhulu: ubude obukhulu bomugqa wesikhungo ispuli elilodwa elingaba nabo (6 m, cishe 20 ft, okokuqala). Inombolo yomugqa: ingxenye yenombolo yawo wonke amaspuli. Umugqa oyispuli omusha uthola inombolo engakasetshenziswa yesistimu yawo elandelayo. Amaspuli anikezwa izinombolo ngokulandelana komugqa kusukela kuphoyinti lawo lokuqala: CHW-12-S01, CHW-12-S02 … (isistimu, inombolo yomugqa, ispuli). Ispuli likhula ingxenye ngengxenye; ingxenye eyenza libe lide kakhulu iqala elilandelayo, futhi ubude obuqondile obudlula ispuli busikwa lapho ispuli ligcwele khona. Faka ukushisela endaweni Vula Ukwakhiwa bese ukhetha Ukushisela endaweni. Chofoza epayipini elinamaspuli lapho ukushisela endaweni kuya khona. Phakathi komugqa oqondile, ipayipi liyasikwa lapho; phakathi kwe-fitting noma ivalvu, ukushisela kuyanyakaza kuye kokuxhuma okusondele kakhulu. Ezicini kubhalwe imigqa yokushisela endaweni yomugqa, ngayinye nge-Susa. Ushintsho ngalunye lungesinyathelo esisodwa se-Hlehlisa. Amashidi amaspuli Ku-Properties womugqa onamaspuli: Amashidi amaspuli (PDF): ikhasi elilodwa ngelilodwa lespuli. Ngakwesobunxele, ispuli ku-isometric view ka-30°: izingxenye zalo ezinde zibalwe, ukushisela kwesitolo kukhonjiswa njengamachashazi, ukushisela endaweni kumakwe ngokuthi FW, nonyakatho wepulani. Ngakwesokudla, inombolo yespuli, usayizi, ishejuli kanye nobude, bese kulandela ubude bokusika, izixhumi, ukushisela (ukushisela kwesitolo kwe-butt kuyo yonke ukuxhuma phakathi kwespuli, nokushisela endaweni lapho lihlangana khona nespuli elilandelayo) kanye nohlu lwezinto nesisindo sepayipi (isisindo se-ASME B36.10M plain-end). Uhlu lwamaspuli (CSV): okufanayo, ibhlokhi elilodwa ngelilodwa lespuli. Ubude bokusika bulinganiswa ukusuka ekugcineni kuya ekugcineni njengoba kudwetshwe: ayikho igebe lempande noma indawo yokushisela ethathwayo. Ama-elbow ayi-B16.9 long radius; ama-tee, ama-reducer kanye namavalvu ajwayelekile, ahlolwa ngokwepayipi, hhayi ngokwe-B16.9 noma komkhiqizi, futhi ishidi liyasho lokho. Izisindo zezixhumi aziniki. Isisekelo sokudweba nokuhlanganisa, esilinganiswa yinjiniyela. Ku-faela ye-IFC Yonke ingxenye yomugqa onamaspuli inayo CadCraft_Spool enSpoolId yayo, umugqa, inombolo yespuli emgqeni, kanye nokuthi iqala kuphi futhi iphele kuphi ngokuhamba komugqa. Umugqa ugcina izimiso zawo (ispuli elide kakhulu, ukushisela endaweni, inombolo yomugqa) kusethi yawo, ukuze amaspuli abuye efana uma ifayela livulwa futhi. Amapayipi omoya: uhlu lokusika Vula Ukwakhiwa bese uchofoza Uhlu lokusika imibhobho: i-CSV yezingxenye zepayipi lomoya ezithe xaxa ngesistimu, ngesimo nangosayizi, ngomugqa oqondile ngamunye usikwe ube yizingxenye ze-Ubude besiqephu kwibha ye-Duct (1500 mm, cishe 5 ft, okokuqala) nalokho okusele. Ubude kuphela: akukho ama-seam, amageji noma izixhumi.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"solar-pv","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Izinhlelo zamasola e-PV, ukufiphala nesivuno","summary":"Faka izinhlelo zamasola ophahleni noma phansi, ufiphaze emodelini, ulinganise amandla onyaka, usayize izintambo nedatha yomugqa owodwa. Zonke izifakelo ziyabonakala, futhi insiza yokuqala nokulahlekelwa okuyizinkomba ngokuvamile.","section":"tasks","order":40,"keywords":["solar","pv","photovoltaic","uhlelo","imodyuli","uphahla","ukufiphala","isivuno","kwh","kwp","ukusayiza izintambo","inverter","umugqa owodwa","ukuthambeka","azimuth","ukuhlukana kwemigqa"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"ukufiphala-isivuno-nezintambo","text":"Ukufiphala, isivuno nezintambo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula ipane ethi \u003Cstrong\u003ESolar PV\u003C/strong\u003E. Khetha uhlangothi lophahla (ukuthambeka nokubheka kwalo kufundwa emodelini) noma wenze uhlelo lwasemhlabathini ngokuthambeka nokubheka; izimodyuli zifakwa ngaphakathi zishiyiwe emaphethelweni futhi zibalwe, zinikeze amandla e-DC ngo-kWp. Ukufaka uhlelo kubhala kumodeli njengezinsiza zamasola, ngesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukufiphala-isivuno-nezintambo\"\u003EUkufiphala, isivuno nezintambo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkufiphala\u003C/strong\u003E kuthumela umugqa kusuka kwimodyuli ngayinye ukuya elangeni ngezinsuku ezijwayelekile zenyanga ngayinye, ngokumelene nejiyomethri yemodeli, ngakho izakhiwo eziseduze, izindonga eziphezulu nemigqa ephambili iyabalwa. Kuncishiswa kuphela ukukhanya kwelanga okuqondile, futhi uhlelo olunesiqephu esifiphele lulahlekelwa ngamandla ngokulingana.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsivuno\u003C/strong\u003E sinikeza ama-kWh ngenyanga nangonyaka, i-kWh ngayinye kWp, nesilinganiso sokusebenza. Ilanga livela ezinanini zakho zangenyanga ezingaphezulu kwendawo ebhalwe ngokuqondile uma uzithayipha. Ngaphandle kwazo ipane isebenzisa umkhawulo ophezulu wesibhakabhaka esicacile futhi iyakusho lokho. \u003Cstrong\u003ELanda isimo sezulu esivela ku-NASA POWER\u003C/strong\u003E ngenkinobho ethisekhweni lesivuno: ithumela kuphela ububanzi nobude besayithi, kanye, futhi igcina impendulo kulesi sikhombisi (ihlolwe kusiphequluli ngo-2026-10-30). PVGIS ayivumeli ikhasi lewebhu ukufunda impendulo yayo, ngakho ithebhu linikeza ixhumanisi elivula idatha yayo yenyanga ngayinye yesayithi kuthebhu elisha; namathisela lokho okubonisayo ebhokisini bese izinyanga eziyishumi nambili zigcwaliswa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzintambo\u003C/strong\u003E zihlola izimodyuli ngentambo ngayinye ngokuya ngewindi le-voltage ye-inverter ngosuku olubanda kakhulu nolushisa kakhulu, nezintambo ezixhunyiwe ngokufanayo ngamandla kwayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOne-line\u003C/strong\u003E yenza idatha yomdwebo (uhlelo, combiner, disconnect, inverter, ipanele, umthombo kagesi) nobukhulu bocingo nofuse ngezinto ozithayipha. Iyidatha ne-SVG; i-Electrical add-on ye-CadCraft ingayibeka njengezimpawu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImodyuli, i-inverter, ukulahlekelwa nezinkomba zocingo okuwukho i-BimCraft ngezibonelo ezijwayelekile, futhi zibhalwe ngokuthi zinjani emiphumeni yonke. Thayipha idatha yomkhiqizi nezinani lekhodi ozidizayinela kuzo, bese umuntu obhekele lokho ubuyekeza idizayini.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Vula ipane ethi Solar PV. Khetha uhlangothi lophahla (ukuthambeka nokubheka kwalo kufundwa emodelini) noma wenze uhlelo lwasemhlabathini ngokuthambeka nokubheka; izimodyuli zifakwa ngaphakathi zishiyiwe emaphethelweni futhi zibalwe, zinikeze amandla e-DC ngo-kWp. Ukufaka uhlelo kubhala kumodeli njengezinsiza zamasola, ngesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Ukufiphala, isivuno nezintambo Ukufiphala kuthumela umugqa kusuka kwimodyuli ngayinye ukuya elangeni ngezinsuku ezijwayelekile zenyanga ngayinye, ngokumelene nejiyomethri yemodeli, ngakho izakhiwo eziseduze, izindonga eziphezulu nemigqa ephambili iyabalwa. Kuncishiswa kuphela ukukhanya kwelanga okuqondile, futhi uhlelo olunesiqephu esifiphele lulahlekelwa ngamandla ngokulingana. Isivuno sinikeza ama-kWh ngenyanga nangonyaka, i-kWh ngayinye kWp, nesilinganiso sokusebenza. Ilanga livela ezinanini zakho zangenyanga ezingaphezulu kwendawo ebhalwe ngokuqondile uma uzithayipha. Ngaphandle kwazo ipane isebenzisa umkhawulo ophezulu wesibhakabhaka esicacile futhi iyakusho lokho. Landa isimo sezulu esivela ku-NASA POWER ngenkinobho ethisekhweni lesivuno: ithumela kuphela ububanzi nobude besayithi, kanye, futhi igcina impendulo kulesi sikhombisi (ihlolwe kusiphequluli ngo-2026-10-30). PVGIS ayivumeli ikhasi lewebhu ukufunda impendulo yayo, ngakho ithebhu linikeza ixhumanisi elivula idatha yayo yenyanga ngayinye yesayithi kuthebhu elisha; namathisela lokho okubonisayo ebhokisini bese izinyanga eziyishumi nambili zigcwaliswa. Izintambo zihlola izimodyuli ngentambo ngayinye ngokuya ngewindi le-voltage ye-inverter ngosuku olubanda kakhulu nolushisa kakhulu, nezintambo ezixhunyiwe ngokufanayo ngamandla kwayo. One-line yenza idatha yomdwebo (uhlelo, combiner, disconnect, inverter, ipanele, umthombo kagesi) nobukhulu bocingo nofuse ngezinto ozithayipha. Iyidatha ne-SVG; i-Electrical add-on ye-CadCraft ingayibeka njengezimpawu. Imodyuli, i-inverter, ukulahlekelwa nezinkomba zocingo okuwukho i-BimCraft ngezibonelo ezijwayelekile, futhi zibhalwe ngokuthi zinjani emiphumeni yonke. Thayipha idatha yomkhiqizi nezinani lekhodi ozidizayinela kuzo, bese umuntu obhekele lokho ubuyekeza idizayini.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"edit-ifc-properties","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Shintsha izici ze-IFC futhi gcina ikhophi eshintshiwe","summary":"Shintsha igama, ithegi, incazelo noma inani lesici lento, uhlehlise, bese ulanda ifayela elisha le-IFC ngenkathi umthombo ushiya njengoba wawunjalo.","section":"tasks","order":40,"keywords":["hlela","shintsha","izici","amapharamitha","ithegi","igama","qamba kabusha","marka","gcina njenge","landa","hlehlisa","kopisha","ifc","bhala"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"yini-ongayishintsha","text":"Yini ongayishintsha","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ubone","text":"Okufanele ubone","level":2},{"id":"izinhlobo-zamanani","text":"Izinhlobo zamanani","level":2},{"id":"hlehlisa","text":"Hlehlisa","level":2},{"id":"kungani-ukuhlela-kwakho-kushintsha-into-eyodwa-kuphela","text":"Kungani ukuhlela kwakho kushintsha into eyodwa kuphela","level":2},{"id":"izexwayiso-ngaphambi-kokulahlekelwa-umsebenzi","text":"Izexwayiso ngaphambi kokulahlekelwa umsebenzi","level":2},{"id":"amaphutha-ajwayelekile","text":"Amaphutha ajwayelekile","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELungisa idatha emodelini ye-IFC: qamba kabusha into, lungisa ithegi yayo, shintsha inani lesici. Bese ugcina ifayela elisha le-IFC ngezinguquko zakho. Ifayela ovule alikaze lithintwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yini-ongayishintsha\"\u003EYini ongayishintsha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInkambu\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIyahleleka\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIgama, Uhlobo lwento, Ithegi, Incazelo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmanani esici esisodwa (umbhalo, izinombolo, Yebo/Cha)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzici zohlobo (amasethi amakwa &quot;(type)&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYebo, futhi inguquko iyasebenza kuzo zonke izinto zalolo hlobo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUhlobo, GlobalId, Umugqa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzilinganiso (ubude, izindawo, amavolumu, izinani)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUhlu, izinhlu ezikhethwayo namanani anezingxenye eziningi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIjometri, indawo, ukungeza noma ukususa izinto\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula imodeli ye-IFC bese uchofoza into ofuna ukuyishintsha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKuphaneli ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E, chofoza inani ofuna ukulishintsha. Liguquka libe yibhokisi lokubhala. Inani elingenalutho libonisa \u003Cem\u003Eempty\u003C/em\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThayipha inani elisha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, noma chofoza kwenye indawo, ukugcina. Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze ukhansele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBheka inani: manje lilugqinsi futhi linebha eluhlaza ngasecaleni kwalo, okuphawula inani eliguquliwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBheka isigaba se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChanges\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesokunxele: inguquko ihlwiswe njenge-\u003Cem\u003Einto\u003C/em\u003E: \u003Cem\u003Einkambu\u003C/em\u003E, inani elidala laya kolisha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPhinda ngamanye amanani noma ngezinye izinto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave as IFC\u003C/span\u003E (ikhombisa inani lezinguquko ezilindele, isibonelo &quot;Save as IFC (3)&quot;), noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThola &quot;\u003Cem\u003Eigama lokuqala\u003C/em\u003E (edited).ifc&quot; kwifolda yakho yokulanda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ubone\"\u003EOkufanele ubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmugqa wesimo uthi &quot;Kugciniwe \u003Cem\u003Eigama\u003C/em\u003E (edited).ifc ngezinguquko ezingu-\u003Cem\u003En\u003C/em\u003E (… bytes). Ifayela lakho lokuqala alishintshiwe.&quot; Uhlu lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChanges\u003C/span\u003E luyaphela, lulungele okulandelayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinhlobo-zamanani\"\u003EIzinhlobo zamanani\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmbhalo\u003C/strong\u003E: noma yini oyithayipha igcinwa njengoba iyunjalo. Ukusula Igama, Uhlobo lwento, Ithegi noma Incazelo kususa inani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinombolo\u003C/strong\u003E: thayipha inombolo elula, njengo \u003Ccode\u003E2.4\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E1200\u003C/code\u003E, ngeyunithi yefayela ngokwalo. Akukho izimpawu zeyunithi. Noma yini enye iveza &quot;Sebenzisa inombolo.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinombolo ezigcwele\u003C/strong\u003E (izinani, izinombolo ezigcwele): &quot;Sebenzisa inombolo egcwele.&quot; uma uthayipha ingxenye edecimal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EYebo/Cha\u003C/strong\u003E: inani liba yimenyu enoYebo noCha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInani ngalinye ligcina uhlobo lwalo le-IFC, ngakho inombolo ihlala iyinombolo, nezinye izinhlelo ziyifunda ngendlela efanele.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlehlisa\"\u003EHlehlisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E esigabeni se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChanges\u003C/span\u003E, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E umaungabhali emkhakheni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPhinda ukuhlehlisa okwengeziwe. Ukuhlehlisa ngakunye kususa inguquko emusha kakhulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAwukwazi ukuhlehlisa ngaphesheya kokugcina: ngemva kokugcina, uhlu luyaqala kabusha. Ifayela eligciniwe ligcina konke.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kungani-ukuhlela-kwakho-kushintsha-into-eyodwa-kuphela\"\u003EKungani ukuhlela kwakho kushintsha into eyodwa kuphela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAbathumeli bagcina isikhala ngokwabelana ngedatha. Isethi yezici eyodwa ingabelwa izitezi ezingamashumi amabili, nenani elilodwa (&quot;Fire rating: 60 min&quot;) lingaba ezethini ezingamakhulu ayisishiyagalombili. Uma i-BimCraft yayishintsha inani elabelwanayo, zonke izinto ezabelana ngalo bezizoshintsha nazo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgakho i-BimCraft iyakopisha ngaphambi kokubhala:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma isethi yezici oyihlelayo ibelwane nezinye izinto, into yakho ithola ikhophi yayo, futhi ikhophi kuphela ishintsha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma inani libelwane nezinye izethi, iseti yakho ithola ikhophi yalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAbayizinhlangothi zakho bagcina idatha yabo endala. Lokhu kubizwa ngokuthi \u003Cem\u003Ecopy-on-write\u003C/em\u003E. Yengeza izinkomba ezimbalwa ezincane efayeleni, lezo zonke izinhlelo ze-IFC ziyazifunda ngokuvamile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzici zohlobo yisiphambeko ngenhloso.\u003C/strong\u003E Iseti emaka &quot;(type)&quot; ingeyohlobo lwento, futhi ku-IFC zonke izinto zalolo hlobo ziyayifunda kulo. Ukushintsha lokho kushintsha uhlobo, ngakho zonke izinto zohlobo zibonisa inani elisha. Uhlu lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChanges\u003C/span\u003E luphawula lezi zinguquko nge-&quot;(type)&quot;. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/type-vs-instance\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/type-vs-instance\"\u003EShintsha isici sohlobo sazo zonke izinto zohlobo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izexwayiso-ngaphambi-kokulahlekelwa-umsebenzi\"\u003EIzexwayiso ngaphambi kokulahlekelwa umsebenzi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuvula enye ifayela kuyilapho unezinguquko ezingagciniwe kubuza &quot;Unezinguquko ezingu-\u003Cem\u003En\u003C/em\u003E ezingagcinwanga ku-\u003Cem\u003Eifayela\u003C/em\u003E. Zilahle?&quot; Chofoza Cancel ukuze uqhubeke nokusebenza, bese ugcina.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuvala noma ukulayisha kabusha ithebhu enezinguquko ezingagcinwanga kubuza isiphequluli ukuthi uyafuna ukuphuma yini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amaphutha-ajwayelekile\"\u003EAmaphutha ajwayelekile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuthayipha iyunithi.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E2400 mm\u003C/code\u003E iyenqatshwa. Thayipha \u003Ccode\u003E2400\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkushintsha isici sohlobo kanti wawufuna into eyodwa.\u003C/strong\u003E Bheka inothi le-&quot;(type)&quot; ngaphambi kokuthayipha. Uma ufuna ukuthi into eyodwa ihluke, shintsha isici sento noma ithegi yayo noma igama.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkulindele ukuthi ifayela lakuqala lishintshe.\u003C/strong\u003E Ukugcina kulanda ifayela elisha njalo. Shintsha okuqala ngokwakho uma kuwukuthi ufuna, futhi ugcine ikhophi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ngaphandle kwezinguquko.\u003C/strong\u003E I-BimCraft igcina kuphela lapho kukhona okugcinwayo; ngaphandle kwalokho ukuthi &quot;Save page&quot; yesiphequluli ingavula. Yivale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkugcina kabili bese ulindele amafayela amabili amancane.\u003C/strong\u003E Ukugcina ngakunye kugcina wonke ukuhlela kusukela uvule imodeli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkulindele ukuthi ukuhlela kubuyele kufayela lephrojekthi.\u003C/strong\u003E I-BimCraft ibhala i-IFC kuphela. Landa i-IFC ehleliwe kuhlelo lwakho lokwakha njengoba wenza noma yimuphi okulethwayo nge-IFC.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Lungisa idatha emodelini ye-IFC: qamba kabusha into, lungisa ithegi yayo, shintsha inani lesici. Bese ugcina ifayela elisha le-IFC ngezinguquko zakho. Ifayela ovule alikaze lithintwe. Yini ongayishintsha Inkambu Iyahleleka Igama, Uhlobo lwento, Ithegi, Incazelo Yebo Amanani esici esisodwa (umbhalo, izinombolo, Yebo/Cha) Yebo Izici zohlobo (amasethi amakwa \"(type)\") Yebo, futhi inguquko iyasebenza kuzo zonke izinto zalolo hlobo Uhlobo, GlobalId, Umugqa Cha Izilinganiso (ubude, izindawo, amavolumu, izinani) Cha Uhlu, izinhlu ezikhethwayo namanani anezingxenye eziningi Cha Ijometri, indawo, ukungeza noma ukususa izinto Cha Izinyathelo Vula imodeli ye-IFC bese uchofoza into ofuna ukuyishintsha. Kuphaneli ye-Properties, chofoza inani ofuna ukulishintsha. Liguquka libe yibhokisi lokubhala. Inani elingenalutho libonisa empty. Thayipha inani elisha. Cindezela Enter, noma chofoza kwenye indawo, ukugcina. Cindezela Esc ukuze ukhansele. Bheka inani: manje lilugqinsi futhi linebha eluhlaza ngasecaleni kwalo, okuphawula inani eliguquliwe. Bheka isigaba se-Changes ngakwesokunxele: inguquko ihlwiswe njenge-into: inkambu, inani elidala laya kolisha. Phinda ngamanye amanani noma ngezinye izinto. Chofoza Save as IFC (ikhombisa inani lezinguquko ezilindele, isibonelo \"Save as IFC (3)\"), noma cindezela Ctrl+S. Thola \"igama lokuqala (edited).ifc\" kwifolda yakho yokulanda. Okufanele ubone Umugqa wesimo uthi \"Kugciniwe igama (edited).ifc ngezinguquko ezingu-n (… bytes). Ifayela lakho lokuqala alishintshiwe.\" Uhlu lwe-Changes luyaphela, lulungele okulandelayo. Izinhlobo zamanani Umbhalo: noma yini oyithayipha igcinwa njengoba iyunjalo. Ukusula Igama, Uhlobo lwento, Ithegi noma Incazelo kususa inani. Izinombolo: thayipha inombolo elula, njengo 2.4 noma 1200, ngeyunithi yefayela ngokwalo. Akukho izimpawu zeyunithi. Noma yini enye iveza \"Sebenzisa inombolo.\" Izinombolo ezigcwele (izinani, izinombolo ezigcwele): \"Sebenzisa inombolo egcwele.\" uma uthayipha ingxenye edecimal. Yebo/Cha: inani liba yimenyu enoYebo noCha. Inani ngalinye ligcina uhlobo lwalo le-IFC, ngakho inombolo ihlala iyinombolo, nezinye izinhlelo ziyifunda ngendlela efanele. Hlehlisa Chofoza Undo esigabeni se-Changes, noma cindezela Ctrl+Z umaungabhali emkhakheni. Phinda ukuhlehlisa okwengeziwe. Ukuhlehlisa ngakunye kususa inguquko emusha kakhulu. Awukwazi ukuhlehlisa ngaphesheya kokugcina: ngemva kokugcina, uhlu luyaqala kabusha. Ifayela eligciniwe ligcina konke. Kungani ukuhlela kwakho kushintsha into eyodwa kuphela Abathumeli bagcina isikhala ngokwabelana ngedatha. Isethi yezici eyodwa ingabelwa izitezi ezingamashumi amabili, nenani elilodwa (\"Fire rating: 60 min\") lingaba ezethini ezingamakhulu ayisishiyagalombili. Uma i-BimCraft yayishintsha inani elabelwanayo, zonke izinto ezabelana ngalo bezizoshintsha nazo. Ngakho i-BimCraft iyakopisha ngaphambi kokubhala: Uma isethi yezici oyihlelayo ibelwane nezinye izinto, into yakho ithola ikhophi yayo, futhi ikhophi kuphela ishintsha. Uma inani libelwane nezinye izethi, iseti yakho ithola ikhophi yalo. Abayizinhlangothi zakho bagcina idatha yabo endala. Lokhu kubizwa ngokuthi copy-on-write. Yengeza izinkomba ezimbalwa ezincane efayeleni, lezo zonke izinhlelo ze-IFC ziyazifunda ngokuvamile. Izici zohlobo yisiphambeko ngenhloso. Iseti emaka \"(type)\" ingeyohlobo lwento, futhi ku-IFC zonke izinto zalolo hlobo ziyayifunda kulo. Ukushintsha lokho kushintsha uhlobo, ngakho zonke izinto zohlobo zibonisa inani elisha. Uhlu lwe-Changes luphawula lezi zinguquko nge-\"(type)\". Bona Shintsha isici sohlobo sazo zonke izinto zohlobo. Izexwayiso ngaphambi kokulahlekelwa umsebenzi Ukuvula enye ifayela kuyilapho unezinguquko ezingagciniwe kubuza \"Unezinguquko ezingu-n ezingagcinwanga ku-ifayela. Zilahle?\" Chofoza Cancel ukuze uqhubeke nokusebenza, bese ugcina. Ukuvala noma ukulayisha kabusha ithebhu enezinguquko ezingagcinwanga kubuza isiphequluli ukuthi uyafuna ukuphuma yini. Amaphutha ajwayelekile Ukuthayipha iyunithi. 2400 mm iyenqatshwa. Thayipha 2400. Ukushintsha isici sohlobo kanti wawufuna into eyodwa. Bheka inothi le-\"(type)\" ngaphambi kokuthayipha. Uma ufuna ukuthi into eyodwa ihluke, shintsha isici sento noma ithegi yayo noma igama. Ukulindele ukuthi ifayela lakuqala lishintshe. Ukugcina kulanda ifayela elisha njalo. Shintsha okuqala ngokwakho uma kuwukuthi ufuna, futhi ugcine ikhophi. Ukucindezela Ctrl+S ngaphandle kwezinguquko. I-BimCraft igcina kuphela lapho kukhona okugcinwayo; ngaphandle kwalokho ukuthi \"Save page\" yesiphequluli ingavula. Yivale. Ukugcina kabili bese ulindele amafayela amabili amancane. Ukugcina ngakunye kugcina wonke ukuhlela kusukela uvule imodeli. Ukulindele ukuthi ukuhlela kubuyele kufayela lephrojekthi. I-BimCraft ibhala i-IFC kuphela. Landa i-IFC ehleliwe kuhlelo lwakho lokwakha njengoba wenza noma yimuphi okulethwayo nge-IFC.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"measure-on-the-plan","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Linganisa ephulani","summary":"Chofoza amaphoyinti amabili ephulani lezinga ukuze ufunde ibanga nokwehluka kwe-X no-Y, engeza okuchofozwa okwengeziwe ukuze uthole isamba esiqhubekayo, futhi ungagcini lutho emodelini.","section":"tasks","order":44,"keywords":["linganisa","ephulani","ibanga","isilinganiso","ithephu","isamba esiqhubekayo","ukuxhuma","dx","dy","ngqo","ukubamba","izincazelo zodonga","imigqa yegridi","insika","ukuhlola ubude"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"amanothi","text":"Amanothi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHlola ubude ephulani lezinga, njengobubanzi begumbi noma ibanga phakathi kwemigqa emibili yegridi, ngaphandle kokwengeza lutho emodelini. Ukulinganisa ku-3D view, bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/measure\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/measure\"\u003ELinganisa amabanga, izindawo zobuso nezindawo ku-3D\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBonisa ipulani lezinga ofuna: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIpulani\u003C/span\u003E ukuze ubone ipulani kuphela, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlukanisa\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEsigabeni \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDweba\u003C/span\u003E, chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinganisa\u003C/span\u003E. Uma kubonakala ipulani kuphela ungacindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E esikhundleni salokho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza iphoyinti lokuqala. Amaphoyinti ayabambelela odongeni, emigqeni yegridi nasezinsikeni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza iphoyinti lesibili. Umugqa wesilinganiso ubonisa ibanga, futhi umugqa wesimo unika ibanga kanye nokwehluka kwe-X no-Y.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuze uqhubeke, chofoza iphoyinti lesithathu. Isigaba ngasinye siyalinganiswa, futhi isamba siyangezwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uma uchofoza ukuze ugcine isigaba siqondile kusuka kwesangaphambili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze usule ukulinganisa, noma khetha elinye ithuluzi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amanothi\"\u003EAmanothi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkukho okubhalwa emodelini, futhi isilinganiso siyanyamalala uma usisula. Ngezilinganiso ezihlala khona, bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/wall-assemblies\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/wall-assemblies\"\u003EIzakhiwo zodonga nezilinganiso zesisekelo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgesibonisi se-3D esisesikrinini, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ihlala iyi-3D Measure. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift M\"\u003E⇧M\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+M\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ingu-Move.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIbanga lisebenzisa iyunithi yokubonisa oyikhethile ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Hlola ubude ephulani lezinga, njengobubanzi begumbi noma ibanga phakathi kwemigqa emibili yegridi, ngaphandle kokwengeza lutho emodelini. Ukulinganisa ku-3D view, bheka Linganisa amabanga, izindawo zobuso nezindawo ku-3D. Izinyathelo Bonisa ipulani lezinga ofuna: Ipulani ukuze ubone ipulani kuphela, noma Hlukanisa. Esigabeni Dweba, chofoza Linganisa. Uma kubonakala ipulani kuphela ungacindezela M esikhundleni salokho. Chofoza iphoyinti lokuqala. Amaphoyinti ayabambelela odongeni, emigqeni yegridi nasezinsikeni. Chofoza iphoyinti lesibili. Umugqa wesilinganiso ubonisa ibanga, futhi umugqa wesimo unika ibanga kanye nokwehluka kwe-X no-Y. Ukuze uqhubeke, chofoza iphoyinti lesithathu. Isigaba ngasinye siyalinganiswa, futhi isamba siyangezwa. Bamba Shift uma uchofoza ukuze ugcine isigaba siqondile kusuka kwesangaphambili. Cindezela Esc ukuze usule ukulinganisa, noma khetha elinye ithuluzi. Amanothi Akukho okubhalwa emodelini, futhi isilinganiso siyanyamalala uma usisula. Ngezilinganiso ezihlala khona, bheka Izakhiwo zodonga nezilinganiso zesisekelo. Ngesibonisi se-3D esisesikrinini, M ihlala iyi-3D Measure. Shift+M ingu-Move. Ibanga lisebenzisa iyunithi yokubonisa oyikhethile ku-Izilungiselelo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"grid-dimensions","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Linganisa igridi","summary":"Bonisa ibanga phakathi kwemigqa yegridi eseduze nosayizi jikelele wegridi kupulani walo lonke izinga, egcinwa ku-IFC futhi ilandela igridi uma imigqa ishintsha.","section":"tasks","order":45,"keywords":["igridi","izilinganiso zegridi","ilinganiso","ibanga","amabheyi","usayizi jikelele","amabhamuza","igridi yensika","ipulani","ishidi"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"amanothi","text":"Amanothi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBeka ibanga phakathi kwemigqa yegridi kanye nosayizi jikelele wegridi kumapulani, ngaphandle kwamabhamuza, ukuze amashidi akhiwe kuwo aphathe izilinganiso. Udinga igridi kuqala: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/grids-and-columns\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/grids-and-columns\"\u003EIgridi nezinsika\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBonisa ipulani lezinga bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGrid\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uvule ithuluzi legridi. Umugqa wezinketho zegridi uyavela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaka itiki ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDimensions\u003C/span\u003E. Ibanga phakathi kwemigqa eseduze ebalwe ngezinombolo nephakathi kwemigqa eseduze ebalwe ngezinhlamvu, kanye nosayizi jikelele ngayo yombili imiqondo, kudwetshwa kupulani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha elinye izinga: izilinganiso ezifanayo ziyabonakala kupulani lalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHambisa umugqa, uqamba kabusha noma wengeze elinye. Izilinganiso ziyalandela igridi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESusa itiki ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDimensions\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uzisuse futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amanothi\"\u003EAmanothi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUshintsho ngalunye luyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyasihlehlisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsilungiselelo sigcinwa ku-IFC kanye negridi, namapulani abekwe emashidini aphatha izilinganiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma imodeli ingenayo igridi ongayishintsha (igridi eyafika kufayela elivela kolunye uhlelo ayishintshwa lapha), umugqa wesimo uthi &quot;Ayikho igridi yokushintsha.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Beka ibanga phakathi kwemigqa yegridi kanye nosayizi jikelele wegridi kumapulani, ngaphandle kwamabhamuza, ukuze amashidi akhiwe kuwo aphathe izilinganiso. Udinga igridi kuqala: bheka Igridi nezinsika. Izinyathelo Bonisa ipulani lezinga bese uchofoza Grid ukuze uvule ithuluzi legridi. Umugqa wezinketho zegridi uyavela. Faka itiki ku-Dimensions. Ibanga phakathi kwemigqa eseduze ebalwe ngezinombolo nephakathi kwemigqa eseduze ebalwe ngezinhlamvu, kanye nosayizi jikelele ngayo yombili imiqondo, kudwetshwa kupulani. Khetha elinye izinga: izilinganiso ezifanayo ziyabonakala kupulani lalo. Hambisa umugqa, uqamba kabusha noma wengeze elinye. Izilinganiso ziyalandela igridi. Susa itiki ku-Dimensions ukuze uzisuse futhi. Amanothi Ushintsho ngalunye luyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa: Ctrl+Z iyasihlehlisa. Isilungiselelo sigcinwa ku-IFC kanye negridi, namapulani abekwe emashidini aphatha izilinganiso. Uma imodeli ingenayo igridi ongayishintsha (igridi eyafika kufayela elivela kolunye uhlelo ayishintshwa lapha), umugqa wesimo uthi \"Ayikho igridi yokushintsha.\"","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"assets-and-maintenance","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Gcina idatha yezimpahla nerekhodi lokulondolozwa emodelini","summary":"Sebenzisa imodeli ye-IFC enikezwe ukuze uphathe isakhiwo: umkhiqizi, imodeli, inombolo yochungechunge, iwaranti nesikhathi sokusebenza kwezinsiza nezinto ezifakiwe, kanye nerekhodi lomsebenzi wokulondolozwa, konke kubhalwe ku-IFC.","section":"tasks","order":47,"keywords":["ukunikezela","isitifiketi sokuqedwa","isitifiketi sokuhlala","njengokwakhiwe","iphakheji lokunikezela","izimpahla","irejista yezimpahla","ukuphatha izakhiwo","fm","ukusebenza","ukulondolozwa","isevisi","iwaranti","inombolo yochungechunge","ibhakhodi","umkhiqizi","imodeli","isikhathi sokusebenza","cobie","iphinde yakhe ngokudijithali","ephuzile","ifika","i-odolo yomsebenzi"],"headings":[{"id":"okudwetshiwe","text":"Okudwetshiwe","level":2},{"id":"idatha-yempahla","text":"Idatha yempahla","level":2},{"id":"imibhalo","text":"Imibhalo","level":2},{"id":"irekhodi-lokulondolozwa","text":"Irekhodi lokulondolozwa","level":2},{"id":"indlela-okugcinwa-ngayo-ku-ifc","text":"Indlela okugcinwa ngayo ku-IFC","level":2},{"id":"izifundo-zezinzwa","text":"Izifundo zezinzwa","level":2},{"id":"izifundo-eziphilayo","text":"Izifundo eziphilayo","level":2},{"id":"ishidi-le-cobie","text":"Ishidi le-COBie","level":2},{"id":"amadokhumenti-okunikezela","text":"Amadokhumenti okunikezela","level":2},{"id":"csv","text":"CSV","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIthebhu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAssets\u003C/span\u003E kuphaneli yesokudla iguqula imodeli evulekile ibe irekhodi lezinsiza zesakhiwo. Konke kubhalwa ku-IFC ngokwayo, ngama-property set nemisebenzi yayo, ukuze uhlelo olulandelayo oluvula ifayela luyifunde nakho. Akukho okulayishwayo, futhi akudingeki iseva: londoloza i-IFC ukuze uyigcine.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okudwetshiwe\"\u003EOkudwetshiwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinsiza nezinto zokufaka: ifenisha, izinto zasendlini yangasese, izinto zokukhanyisa, izinsiza zasekhishini, izinto zomoya, amavalvu, amaphampu, izibambi zomoya, amabhoyila, amathangi, amaawutlethi, amabhodi kagesi, amalifti nezinye izinto ezinjalo, nezinto zomtapo ezinedatha yezinsiza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENoma yini enye oyilandelayo: khetha emodelini (umnyango, udonga, ipheshi edwetshwe njengento evamile) bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETrack picked\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENoma yini esevele inedatha yezimpahla noma umsebenzi wokulondolozwa, ebhalwe lapha noma yinhlelo enye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkuphuzile kuqala, bese kufika phakathi kwezinsuku ezingu-30. Hlunga ngegama, ithegi, umkhiqizi, imodeli noma inombolo yochungechunge, ngezinga, noma chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly overdue or due within 30 days\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"idatha-yempahla\"\u003EIdatha yempahla\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza impahla ohlwini (noma uyikhethe emodelini) ukuze uvule idatha yayo: umkhiqizi, imodeli, inkomba yemodeli, inombolo yochungechunge, ibhakhodi, usuku olufakwe ngalo, inombolo yewaranti nokuqala nokuphela kwayo, nesikhathi sokusebenza ngeminyaka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave the data\u003C/span\u003E ibhala konke ngesinyathelo esisodwa (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyahlehlisa). Shiya ibhokisi lingenalutho ukuze ususe leyo nani.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imibhalo\"\u003EImibhalo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgaphansi kwedatha, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDocuments\u003C/span\u003E ibala imanuwali, iwaranti, izithombe, izitifiketi nemidwebo exhunywe kempahleni. Khetha uhlobo, unikeze isihloko (noma ushiye lingenalutho: kusetshenziswa igama lefayela) bese uchaza lapho itholakala:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Eikheli lewebhu\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Ccode\u003Ehttps://…\u003C/code\u003E): liba nesixhumanisi sokuvula, esivula ithebhu entsha;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Enoma \u003Cstrong\u003Eigama lefayela noma indlela\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Ccode\u003EManuals/AHU-1.pdf\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EC:\\FM\\pump.pdf\u003C/code\u003E, i-network share): gcina amafayela eduze kwe-IFC, esiqondisweni esifanayo noma esingaphansi kwaso, ukuze amagama asasebenze uma unikeza isikhwama. I-BimCraft ibonisa igama; vula ifayela kusuka esiqondisweni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmafayela ngokwawo awalayishwa noma akopishelwa ku-IFC: kubhalwa isixhumanisi kuphela. Ikheli lewebhu elinephasiwedi kulo, nanoma yisiphi isixhumanisi esingesona ikheli lewebhu noma ifayela (njengo \u003Ccode\u003Ejavascript:\u003C/code\u003E), ziyenqatshwa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove\u003C/span\u003E isusa idokhumenti kwempahla (isinyathelo esisodwa; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyahlehlisa).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImibhalo ebekwe yenye inhlelo ekuleli nto nayo iyabhalwa ohlwini. Imibhalo ekuhlobo \u003Cstrong\u003Elwento\u003C/strong\u003E ibonakala kuyo yonke into yalolo hlobo futhi iyashoyo lokho; yenza ushintshe lapho uhlobo lwenziwa khona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-IFC idokhumenti ngayinye iyinkomba yedokhumenti ye-IFC exhunywe kulento, nohlobo lwayo lugcinwe kulowo xhumano, ku-IFC4 nasku-IFC2X3 ngokufanayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"irekhodi-lokulondolozwa\"\u003EIrekhodi lokulondolozwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgaphansi kwemibhalo, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERecord work done\u003C/span\u003E: usuku umsebenzi owenziwe ngalo, umsebenzi, owewenzile, lapho okulandelayo kufanele kwenziwe khona, nezinsiza. Yonke intulo ingesinyathelo esisodwa; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E ziyishintsha kamuva. Usuku lokufika olusha kakhulu lwentulo lunquma ukuthi impahla iphuzile noma izofika maduze.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"indlela-okugcinwa-ngayo-ku-ifc\"\u003EIndlela okugcinwa ngayo ku-IFC\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmkhiqizi nemodeli ku-\u003Ccode\u003EPset_ManufacturerTypeInformation\u003C/code\u003E, inombolo yochungechunge, ibhakhodi nosuku olufakwe ngalo ku-\u003Ccode\u003EPset_ManufacturerOccurrence\u003C/code\u003E, iwaranti ku-\u003Ccode\u003EPset_Warranty\u003C/code\u003E, nesikhathi sokusebenza ku-\u003Ccode\u003EPset_ServiceLife\u003C/code\u003E, kulento uqobo. Uma uhlobo lwento seluke lunomkhiqizi noma imodeli, lubonakala size usibhale sakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkulondolozwa ngakunye kuyi-IFC \u003Cstrong\u003Etask\u003C/strong\u003E yohlobo lokulondolozwa, exhunywe kulento, nezinsuku zayo (ku-IFC4 futhi njengezikhathi zomsebenzi ngokwawo) kanye nesethi \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_Maintenance\u003C/code\u003E enosuku, owenzile nosuku olulandelayo olufanele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmanani okwabelana ngawo izinto ziyakopishelwa kuqala: ukushintsha impahla eyodwa akuyishintshi omakhelwane bayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEmafayeleni akudala e-IFC2X3 izinsuku zibhalwa njengombhalo (YYYY-MM-DD); lolo guqulo ludinga irekhodi ledethi elihlukile lapho, into i-BimCraft engayibhali.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izifundo-zezinzwa\"\u003EIzifundo zezinzwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESensor values\u003C/span\u003E bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen readings (CSV)…\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uletha izifundo ezithunyelwe kusuka ohlelweni lokuphatha isakhiwo, kusuka kulogger wedatha noma kwi-spreadsheet:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIkholomu yokuqala iyisikhathi\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003E2026-10-23 14:05\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2026-10-23T14:05:00Z\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2026-10-23T14:05+02:00\u003C/code\u003E noma imizuzwana ye-Unix. Isikhathi esingenazo izone sifundwa ngesikhathi sezone yekhompyutha yakho. Amadethi aqala ngosuku njengo \u003Ccode\u003E23/10/2026\u003C/code\u003E ayafundwa (ayabhida); thumela amadethi e-ISO.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EYonke enye ikholomu iyinzwa eyodwa\u003C/strong\u003E, ikhanda layo lingu-\u003Cstrong\u003Eithegi\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003Eigama\u003C/strong\u003E noma i-\u003Cstrong\u003EGlobalId\u003C/strong\u003E yempahla yayo. Ikhanda elingafani nanoma iyiphi impahla, noma elifana nezimpahla ezingaphezu kweyodwa, liyabhalwa futhi likhishwe. Amakhoma, amasemikholoni noma amathebu ahlukanisa amakholomu; ngamasemikholoni noma amathebu, ikhefu lamadesimali (\u003Ccode\u003E21,5\u003C/code\u003E) liyafundwa nalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzikhathi noma amanani angafundeki (igama, iyunithi ethayipiwe eseleni) ayabalwa futhi ayakhishwa, akuqagelwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkufunda kwakamuva kubonakala ekholomini \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReading\u003C/span\u003E yohlu nasebhokisini \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESensor\u003C/span\u003E lempahla, nesithombe esinesithombe \u003Cstrong\u003Eishathi\u003C/strong\u003E sazo zonke izifundo (esidlekeni, amashathi alinda ukuthi uthepha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow the chart\u003C/span\u003E). Setha \u003Cstrong\u003Eumkhawulo ophansi nophezulu\u003C/strong\u003E neyunithi empahleni bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave the limits\u003C/span\u003E: ukufunda okuphandle kwawo kumaka impahla. Khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow on the model\u003C/span\u003E ukuze udaye impahla ngayinye ngokufunda kwayo — eluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka ngaphansi komkhawulo ophansi, eluhlaza ngaphakathi kwemikhawulo, ebomvu ngaphezu komkhawulo ophezulu, futhi, kwezimpahla ezingenayo imikhawulo, isikali esisodwa seluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka kusuka ekufundweni okuphansi kakhulu kuye ekuphezulu kakhulu — nokufunda kwayo njengelebula (kuze kube ngama-60 amalebula, okumakiwe kuqala).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzifundo zihlala kule thebhu yesiphequluli\u003C/strong\u003E: azilondolozwa ku-IFC futhi azithunyelwa noma kuphi; vula i-CSV futhi ngesikhathi esilandelayo. \u003Cstrong\u003EImikhawulo igcinwa ku-IFC\u003C/strong\u003E (i-set \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_Sensor\u003C/code\u003E kulento: Low, High, Unit), ngakho umuntu olandelayo ovula ifayela ubona amakhalishi afanayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izifundo-eziphilayo\"\u003EIzifundo eziphilayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive feed\u003C/span\u003E ifunda amanani njengoba eshintsha, \u003Cstrong\u003Engqo kusuka kulesi siphequluli kuya kohlelo lwakho\u003C/strong\u003E. Akukho okudlula iseva yethu futhi akukho okugcinwa noma kuphi ngaphandle kwethebhu yakho yesiphequluli. Akukho okuxhuma lapho ifayela livulwa: kuphela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EConnect\u003C/span\u003E iyakwenza lokho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMQTT ngama-WebSockets\u003C/strong\u003E: ikheli lesilaleli se-WebSocket sombrokha wakho (\u003Ccode\u003Ewss://broker.example.com:8884/mqtt\u003C/code\u003E), nezihloko ezilodwa noma ezimbalwa ezine-\u003Ccode\u003E{tag}\u003C/code\u003E lapho kufakwa khona ithegi lempahla, isibonelo \u003Ccode\u003Esite/{tag}/temperature\u003C/code\u003E (i-BimCraft ibhalisela \u003Ccode\u003Esite/+/temperature\u003C/code\u003E ifunde ithegi kusihloko ngasinye somlayezo). Izihloko ezingenayo \u003Ccode\u003E{tag}\u003C/code\u003E zibiza izinzwa ngokwazo. Umlayezo ungaba inombolo elula (\u003Ccode\u003E21.5\u003C/code\u003E) noma i-JSON njengo \u003Ccode\u003E{&quot;value&quot;: 21.5, &quot;time&quot;: &quot;2026-10-23T14:05:00Z&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E (setha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EValue field in JSON\u003C/span\u003E uma eyakho ibizwa ngenye into).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBuza ikheli (HTTP)\u003C/strong\u003E: ikheli lewebhu inhlelo yakho yokuphatha isakhiwo noma isikripthi sakho esincane esiphendulayo, esibuzwa njalo ngamasekhondi athile (okungenani ama-5). Lingaphendula nge-JSON ekhiyelwe ngethegi (\u003Ccode\u003E{&quot;AHU-1&quot;: 21.5}\u003C/code\u003E), uhlu lwe-JSON (\u003Ccode\u003E[{&quot;tag&quot;: &quot;AHU-1&quot;, &quot;value&quot;: 21.5}]\u003C/code\u003E), noma i-CSV yezifundo njengaleyo engenhla. Uma lingaphenduli, i-BimCraft ilinda kabili isikhathi ngaphambi kokubuza futhi, kuze kube imizuzu emihlanu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkufunda ngakunye kuyaempahleni ethegi, igama noma i-GlobalId yayo kubizwa kuyo, njengakukholomu ye-CSV; amagama angafani nanoma iyiphi impahla ayabalwa. Izifundo zijoyina \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESensor values\u003C/span\u003E: uhlu, amashathi, imikhawulo nemibala emodelini kusebenza ngendlela efanayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIphasiwedi noma ithokheni yakho\u003C/strong\u003E ithayipwa ngokuxhuma okukodwa: iphiwa kuxhumo bese ibhokisi liyahlanzwa; ayilondolozwa kule thebhu yesiphequluli noma ku-IFC. Ithokheni ihamba njengesihloko esijwayelekile se-\u003Ccode\u003EAuthorization: Bearer\u003C/code\u003E, futhi azikho ama-cookie athunyelwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKeep these settings in the IFC\u003C/span\u003E ibhala ikheli, izihloko, insimu yenani nokuthi kangaki kubuzwa emodelini (i-set \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_Feed\u003C/code\u003E kwiphrojekthi; ayikho insimu yephasiwedi), ukuze umuntu olandelayo avula ifayela athayipe ulwazi lwakhe lokungena bese echofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EConnect\u003C/span\u003E. Ungafaki iphasiwedi noma ukhiye ekhelini ngokwalo: ikheli elinegama lomsebenzisi nephasiwedi kulo liyenqatshwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOkudingwa yibhrokha noma ikheli lakho.\u003C/strong\u003E Ikhasi lesiphequluli lingakhuluma kuphela neseva evumela lokho:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIkhasi liphephile (https), ngakho isiphequluli sixhuma kuphela kumakheli \u003Ccode\u003Ewss://\u003C/code\u003E ne-\u003Ccode\u003Ehttps://\u003C/code\u003E — ngaphandle kwekhompyutha yakho (\u003Ccode\u003Elocalhost\u003C/code\u003E), lapho \u003Ccode\u003Ews://\u003C/code\u003E ne-\u003Ccode\u003Ehttp://\u003C/code\u003E zisebenza ekuhloleni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIkheli le-HTTP kumele livume izicelo kusuka kulelikhasi (CORS: ikhanda \u003Ccode\u003EAccess-Control-Allow-Origin\u003C/code\u003E, kanye ne-\u003Ccode\u003EAuthorization\u003C/code\u003E phakathi kwamakhanda avumelekile uma usebenzisa ithokheni).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAbabrokha abaningi (Mosquitto, EMQX, HiveMQ nabanye) banikeza isilaleli se-WebSocket; sivame ukuba sivalwe size sivulwe. I-BimCraft ikhuluma i-MQTT 3.1.1.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAkukho \u003Cstrong\u003Ezaziso\u003C/strong\u003E lapho i-BimCraft ivaliwe: imikhawulo imaka impahla kuphela ngenkathi imodeli ivulekile futhi kuxhunywe isifudlana. Ukuqapha isakhiwo ngezikhathi zonke kudinga iseva, into i-BimCraft ingayenzi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ishidi-le-cobie\"\u003EIshidi le-COBie\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECOBie\u003C/strong\u003E iyispreadsheet yokunikezela abaningi abanikazi nezikhungo zokuphatha bayicela (ishicilelwe yi-National BIM Standard e-US; BS 1192-4 e-UK). Vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECOBie spreadsheet\u003C/span\u003E kuthebhu:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave as COBie (.xlsx)\u003C/span\u003E ibhala amashidi e-COBie 2.4 — Contact, Facility, Floor, Space, Type, Component, System, Job, Document and Attribute — kusukela emodelini nasedatheni yempahla: isakhiwo, amazinga aso namagumbi (izindawo zivela kwinani lemodeli), yonke impahla njengecomponent enenombolo yochungechunge, usuku olufakwe ngalo, usuku lokuqala lewaranti, ithegi nebhakhodi, uhlobo lwayo nomkhiqizi, imodeli, isikhathi sokusebenza nobude bewaranti, amasistimu azo, irekhodi lokulondolozwa njengemisebenzi nemibhalo exhunywe kuyo. Yonke icomponent iphethe i-GlobalId ye-IFC yento. Thayipha ikheli lakho le-imeyili ukuze kukholomu ye-COBie ethi &quot;created by&quot;, noma ushiye lingenalutho (lapho lithi n/a). Amanani emodeli angawanaye athi \u003Cstrong\u003En/a\u003C/strong\u003E; amakholomu wezigaba aphethe igama lekilasi le-IFC, hhayi ikhodi ye-OmniClass.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERead a COBie spreadsheet…\u003C/span\u003E ifunda enye ngasemuva, evela ku-BimCraft noma enye inhlelo, bese \u003Cstrong\u003Eibala konke okushintshile kuqala\u003C/strong\u003E: impahla, inani, elisuka kulo kuya kulo, nemibhalo emisha. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EApply\u003C/span\u003E ibhala konke ngesinyathelo esisodwa (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyahlehlisa). Imigqa ihlanganiswa nge-GlobalId, bese ngegama lecomponent. Imigqa engahlangani nalutho emodelini iyabalwa, ayengezwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIshidi liphathwa njengelingathembeki: izifomula azifundwa noma azisebenzi (kuphela inani elilondolozwe ekugcineni kuseli), inani elingenza iwaranti iphele ngaphambi kokuqala kwayo nesixhumanisi somnyango esingesona ikheli lewebhu noma igama lefayela aziphathwa futhi ziyabalwa, namabhukhu amakhulu kakhulu ayenqatshwa. Imisebenzi ye-COBie iyimisebenzi ehlelelwe uhlobo, ibhalwa kodwa ayifundwa ibuyele. Kuspreadsheet i-BimCraft ebhala, umbhalo ongaba yifomula ngokwawo (uqala nge-\u003Ccode\u003E=\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E+\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E-\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E@\u003C/code\u003E) umakwa njengombhalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELencwadi yomsebenzi ihlolwe ezivivinyweni zethu ngomfundi we-spreadsheet ozimele; ayikadlulwa i-validator ye-COBie. Uma ithimba elithola liyisebenzisa, sitshele ukuthi ithini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amadokhumenti-okunikezela\"\u003EAmadokhumenti okunikezela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmaphepha emukelwa umnikazi lapho isakhiwo sesiqediwe ngawo ayephrojekthi, hhayi empahleni eyodwa. Ku-ithebhu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAssets\u003C/span\u003E, vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHandover documents\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a document\u003C/span\u003E, khetha uhlobo lwayo (isitifiketi sokuqedwa, isitifiketi sokuhlala, iwaranti, imanuwali, imidwebo njengokwakhiwe, okunye), bese uthayipha isihloko sayo, usuku lokukhishwa, owayikhipha nenombolo yayo yereferensi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChaza lapho itholakala: ikheli lewebhu, igama lefayela elihlala eduze kwe-IFC, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAttach a file\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd to the list\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove\u003C/span\u003E zishintsha uhlu; yonke into ingesinyathelo esisodwa ongasihlehlisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuild the handover package\u003C/span\u003E ilanda i-zip eyodwa: ikhasi lesihloko elibala zonke izidokhumenti, uhlu olufana nespreadsheet, incwadi ye-COBie (izidokhumenti zisemshidini wayo we-Document, njengemigqa mayelana ne-Facility), imodeli, nefayela ngalinye elixhunyiwe. Isitifiketi sokuqedwa noma sokuhlala esingakafiki ohlwini sikhonjwa esihlokweni; iphakheji yakhiwa noma kunjalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImodeli esephakheji yimodeli \u003Cstrong\u003Eenjengokwakhiwe\u003C/strong\u003E: ibala izinto ezilinganiswe endaweni. Nayo, ngaphakathi kwesiqondisi \u003Ccode\u003Eas-built\u003C/code\u003E: isitatimende, uhlu lwayo yonke into nesimo sokuqinisekiswa kwayo, isethi yemidwebo njengoba ikunjalo manje njenge-PDF eyodwa (imidwebo njengokwakhiwe), nelogi yezinguquko zemidwebo uma imodeli inezethi ezikhishiwe. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/verification\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/verification\"\u003EMaka izinto njengezihloliwe noma ezi-qinisekiswe endaweni\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-IFC idokhumenti ngayinye iyi-IfcDocumentInformation exhunywe kuphrojekthi (IfcRelAssociatesDocument), enesihloko sayo, ireferensi, usuku, owayikhipha nendawo, ukuze ezinye izinhlelo ziyibale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIfayela elixhunyiwe libhalwa ngegama, usayizi ne-SHA-256. Ukugcina ifayela ngqo naphrojekthi, sebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave the project as a bundle\u003C/span\u003E (i-.ccbundle iphatha imodeli namafayela axhunyiwe; ukuyivula kuwabuyisela, ngalinye lihlolwa ngerekhodi lalo). Ukugcina okuvamile kubuza ukuthi yiyiphi oyifunayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-.ifc evamile igcina irekhodi, hhayi ifayela: emva kokuyivula, sebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAttach the file again\u003C/span\u003E. Ifayela elifanayo liyaziwa; elihlukile lishintsha irekhodi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"csv\"\u003ECSV\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E igcina yonke impahla ngedatha yayo, yonke intulo yokulondolozwa nawo wonke amadokhumenti, umugqa ngamunye, ye-spreadsheet noma enye inhlelo yokulondoloza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAkukakwakhiwa: iseva eyisingethwe egcina izifundo futhi ithumele izaziso lapho i-BimCraft ivaliwe, nokufunda imisebenzi ye-COBie ibuyele. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EAkukakwakhiwa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Ithebhu Assets kuphaneli yesokudla iguqula imodeli evulekile ibe irekhodi lezinsiza zesakhiwo. Konke kubhalwa ku-IFC ngokwayo, ngama-property set nemisebenzi yayo, ukuze uhlelo olulandelayo oluvula ifayela luyifunde nakho. Akukho okulayishwayo, futhi akudingeki iseva: londoloza i-IFC ukuze uyigcine. Okudwetshiwe Izinsiza nezinto zokufaka: ifenisha, izinto zasendlini yangasese, izinto zokukhanyisa, izinsiza zasekhishini, izinto zomoya, amavalvu, amaphampu, izibambi zomoya, amabhoyila, amathangi, amaawutlethi, amabhodi kagesi, amalifti nezinye izinto ezinjalo, nezinto zomtapo ezinedatha yezinsiza. Noma yini enye oyilandelayo: khetha emodelini (umnyango, udonga, ipheshi edwetshwe njengento evamile) bese uchofoza Track picked. Noma yini esevele inedatha yezimpahla noma umsebenzi wokulondolozwa, ebhalwe lapha noma yinhlelo enye. Okuphuzile kuqala, bese kufika phakathi kwezinsuku ezingu-30. Hlunga ngegama, ithegi, umkhiqizi, imodeli noma inombolo yochungechunge, ngezinga, noma chofoza Only overdue or due within 30 days. Idatha yempahla Chofoza impahla ohlwini (noma uyikhethe emodelini) ukuze uvule idatha yayo: umkhiqizi, imodeli, inkomba yemodeli, inombolo yochungechunge, ibhakhodi, usuku olufakwe ngalo, inombolo yewaranti nokuqala nokuphela kwayo, nesikhathi sokusebenza ngeminyaka. Save the data ibhala konke ngesinyathelo esisodwa (Ctrl+Z iyahlehlisa). Shiya ibhokisi lingenalutho ukuze ususe leyo nani. Imibhalo Ngaphansi kwedatha, Documents ibala imanuwali, iwaranti, izithombe, izitifiketi nemidwebo exhunywe kempahleni. Khetha uhlobo, unikeze isihloko (noma ushiye lingenalutho: kusetshenziswa igama lefayela) bese uchaza lapho itholakala: ikheli lewebhu (https://…): liba nesixhumanisi sokuvula, esivula ithebhu entsha; noma igama lefayela noma indlela (Manuals/AHU-1.pdf, C:\\FM\\pump.pdf, i-network share): gcina amafayela eduze kwe-IFC, esiqondisweni esifanayo noma esingaphansi kwaso, ukuze amagama asasebenze uma unikeza isikhwama. I-BimCraft ibonisa igama; vula ifayela kusuka esiqondisweni. Amafayela ngokwawo awalayishwa noma akopishelwa ku-IFC: kubhalwa isixhumanisi kuphela. Ikheli lewebhu elinephasiwedi kulo, nanoma yisiphi isixhumanisi esingesona ikheli lewebhu noma ifayela (njengo javascript:), ziyenqatshwa. Remove isusa idokhumenti kwempahla (isinyathelo esisodwa; Ctrl+Z iyahlehlisa). Imibhalo ebekwe yenye inhlelo ekuleli nto nayo iyabhalwa ohlwini. Imibhalo ekuhlobo lwento ibonakala kuyo yonke into yalolo hlobo futhi iyashoyo lokho; yenza ushintshe lapho uhlobo lwenziwa khona. Ku-IFC idokhumenti ngayinye iyinkomba yedokhumenti ye-IFC exhunywe kulento, nohlobo lwayo lugcinwe kulowo xhumano, ku-IFC4 nasku-IFC2X3 ngokufanayo. Irekhodi lokulondolozwa Ngaphansi kwemibhalo, Record work done: usuku umsebenzi owenziwe ngalo, umsebenzi, owewenzile, lapho okulandelayo kufanele kwenziwe khona, nezinsiza. Yonke intulo ingesinyathelo esisodwa; Edit ne-Delete ziyishintsha kamuva. Usuku lokufika olusha kakhulu lwentulo lunquma ukuthi impahla iphuzile noma izofika maduze. Indlela okugcinwa ngayo ku-IFC Umkhiqizi nemodeli ku-Pset_ManufacturerTypeInformation, inombolo yochungechunge, ibhakhodi nosuku olufakwe ngalo ku-Pset_ManufacturerOccurrence, iwaranti ku-Pset_Warranty, nesikhathi sokusebenza ku-Pset_ServiceLife, kulento uqobo. Uma uhlobo lwento seluke lunomkhiqizi noma imodeli, lubonakala size usibhale sakho. Ukulondolozwa ngakunye kuyi-IFC task yohlobo lokulondolozwa, exhunywe kulento, nezinsuku zayo (ku-IFC4 futhi njengezikhathi zomsebenzi ngokwawo) kanye nesethi CadCraft_Maintenance enosuku, owenzile nosuku olulandelayo olufanele. Amanani okwabelana ngawo izinto ziyakopishelwa kuqala: ukushintsha impahla eyodwa akuyishintshi omakhelwane bayo. Emafayeleni akudala e-IFC2X3 izinsuku zibhalwa njengombhalo (YYYY-MM-DD); lolo guqulo ludinga irekhodi ledethi elihlukile lapho, into i-BimCraft engayibhali. Izifundo zezinzwa Vula Sensor values bese Open readings (CSV)… ukuze uletha izifundo ezithunyelwe kusuka ohlelweni lokuphatha isakhiwo, kusuka kulogger wedatha noma kwi-spreadsheet: Ikholomu yokuqala iyisikhathi: 2026-10-23 14:05, 2026-10-23T14:05:00Z, 2026-10-23T14:05+02:00 noma imizuzwana ye-Unix. Isikhathi esingenazo izone sifundwa ngesikhathi sezone yekhompyutha yakho. Amadethi aqala ngosuku njengo 23/10/2026 ayafundwa (ayabhida); thumela amadethi e-ISO. Yonke enye ikholomu iyinzwa eyodwa, ikhanda layo lingu-ithegi, igama noma i-GlobalId yempahla yayo. Ikhanda elingafani nanoma iyiphi impahla, noma elifana nezimpahla ezingaphezu kweyodwa, liyabhalwa futhi likhishwe. Amakhoma, amasemikholoni noma amathebu ahlukanisa amakholomu; ngamasemikholoni noma amathebu, ikhefu lamadesimali (21,5) liyafundwa nalo. Izikhathi noma amanani angafundeki (igama, iyunithi ethayipiwe eseleni) ayabalwa futhi ayakhishwa, akuqagelwa. Ukufunda kwakamuva kubonakala ekholomini Reading yohlu nasebhokisini Sensor lempahla, nesithombe esinesithombe ishathi sazo zonke izifundo (esidlekeni, amashathi alinda ukuthi uthepha Show the chart). Setha umkhawulo ophansi nophezulu neyunithi empahleni bese Save the limits: ukufunda okuphandle kwawo kumaka impahla. Khetha Show on the model ukuze udaye impahla ngayinye ngokufunda kwayo — eluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka ngaphansi komkhawulo ophansi, eluhlaza ngaphakathi kwemikhawulo, ebomvu ngaphezu komkhawulo ophezulu, futhi, kwezimpahla ezingenayo imikhawulo, isikali esisodwa seluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka kusuka ekufundweni okuphansi kakhulu kuye ekuphezulu kakhulu — nokufunda kwayo njengelebula (kuze kube ngama-60 amalebula, okumakiwe kuqala). Izifundo zihlala kule thebhu yesiphequluli: azilondolozwa ku-IFC futhi azithunyelwa noma kuphi; vula i-CSV futhi ngesikhathi esilandelayo. Imikhawulo igcinwa ku-IFC (i-set CadCraft_Sensor kulento: Low, High, Unit), ngakho umuntu olandelayo ovula ifayela ubona amakhalishi afanayo. Izifundo eziphilayo Live feed ifunda amanani njengoba eshintsha, ngqo kusuka kulesi siphequluli kuya kohlelo lwakho. Akukho okudlula iseva yethu futhi akukho okugcinwa noma kuphi ngaphandle kwethebhu yakho yesiphequluli. Akukho okuxhuma lapho ifayela livulwa: kuphela Connect iyakwenza lokho. MQTT ngama-WebSockets: ikheli lesilaleli se-WebSocket sombrokha wakho (wss://broker.example.com:8884/mqtt), nezihloko ezilodwa noma ezimbalwa ezine-{tag} lapho kufakwa khona ithegi lempahla, isibonelo site/{tag}/temperature (i-BimCraft ibhalisela site/+/temperature ifunde ithegi kusihloko ngasinye somlayezo). Izihloko ezingenayo {tag} zibiza izinzwa ngokwazo. Umlayezo ungaba inombolo elula (21.5) noma i-JSON njengo {\"value\": 21.5, \"time\": \"2026-10-23T14:05:00Z\"} (setha Value field in JSON uma eyakho ibizwa ngenye into). Buza ikheli (HTTP): ikheli lewebhu inhlelo yakho yokuphatha isakhiwo noma isikripthi sakho esincane esiphendulayo, esibuzwa njalo ngamasekhondi athile (okungenani ama-5). Lingaphendula nge-JSON ekhiyelwe ngethegi ({\"AHU-1\": 21.5}), uhlu lwe-JSON ([{\"tag\": \"AHU-1\", \"value\": 21.5}]), noma i-CSV yezifundo njengaleyo engenhla. Uma lingaphenduli, i-BimCraft ilinda kabili isikhathi ngaphambi kokubuza futhi, kuze kube imizuzu emihlanu. Ukufunda ngakunye kuyaempahleni ethegi, igama noma i-GlobalId yayo kubizwa kuyo, njengakukholomu ye-CSV; amagama angafani nanoma iyiphi impahla ayabalwa. Izifundo zijoyina Sensor values: uhlu, amashathi, imikhawulo nemibala emodelini kusebenza ngendlela efanayo. Iphasiwedi noma ithokheni yakho ithayipwa ngokuxhuma okukodwa: iphiwa kuxhumo bese ibhokisi liyahlanzwa; ayilondolozwa kule thebhu yesiphequluli noma ku-IFC. Ithokheni ihamba njengesihloko esijwayelekile se-Authorization: Bearer, futhi azikho ama-cookie athunyelwa. Keep these settings in the IFC ibhala ikheli, izihloko, insimu yenani nokuthi kangaki kubuzwa emodelini (i-set CadCraft_Feed kwiphrojekthi; ayikho insimu yephasiwedi), ukuze umuntu olandelayo avula ifayela athayipe ulwazi lwakhe lokungena bese echofoza Connect. Ungafaki iphasiwedi noma ukhiye ekhelini ngokwalo: ikheli elinegama lomsebenzisi nephasiwedi kulo liyenqatshwa. Okudingwa yibhrokha noma ikheli lakho. Ikhasi lesiphequluli lingakhuluma kuphela neseva evumela lokho: Ikhasi liphephile (https), ngakho isiphequluli sixhuma kuphela kumakheli wss:// ne-https:// — ngaphandle kwekhompyutha yakho (localhost), lapho ws:// ne-http:// zisebenza ekuhloleni. Ikheli le-HTTP kumele livume izicelo kusuka kulelikhasi (CORS: ikhanda Access-Control-Allow-Origin, kanye ne-Authorization phakathi kwamakhanda avumelekile uma usebenzisa ithokheni). Ababrokha abaningi (Mosquitto, EMQX, HiveMQ nabanye) banikeza isilaleli se-WebSocket; sivame ukuba sivalwe size sivulwe. I-BimCraft ikhuluma i-MQTT 3.1.1. Akukho zaziso lapho i-BimCraft ivaliwe: imikhawulo imaka impahla kuphela ngenkathi imodeli ivulekile futhi kuxhunywe isifudlana. Ukuqapha isakhiwo ngezikhathi zonke kudinga iseva, into i-BimCraft ingayenzi. Ishidi le-COBie COBie iyispreadsheet yokunikezela abaningi abanikazi nezikhungo zokuphatha bayicela (ishicilelwe yi-National BIM Standard e-US; BS 1192-4 e-UK). Vula COBie spreadsheet kuthebhu: Save as COBie (.xlsx) ibhala amashidi e-COBie 2.4 — Contact, Facility, Floor, Space, Type, Component, System, Job, Document and Attribute — kusukela emodelini nasedatheni yempahla: isakhiwo, amazinga aso namagumbi (izindawo zivela kwinani lemodeli), yonke impahla njengecomponent enenombolo yochungechunge, usuku olufakwe ngalo, usuku lokuqala lewaranti, ithegi nebhakhodi, uhlobo lwayo nomkhiqizi, imodeli, isikhathi sokusebenza nobude bewaranti, amasistimu azo, irekhodi lokulondolozwa njengemisebenzi nemibhalo exhunywe kuyo. Yonke icomponent iphethe i-GlobalId ye-IFC yento. Thayipha ikheli lakho le-imeyili ukuze kukholomu ye-COBie ethi \"created by\", noma ushiye lingenalutho (lapho lithi n/a). Amanani emodeli angawanaye athi n/a; amakholomu wezigaba aphethe igama lekilasi le-IFC, hhayi ikhodi ye-OmniClass. Read a COBie spreadsheet… ifunda enye ngasemuva, evela ku-BimCraft noma enye inhlelo, bese ibala konke okushintshile kuqala: impahla, inani, elisuka kulo kuya kulo, nemibhalo emisha. Apply ibhala konke ngesinyathelo esisodwa (Ctrl+Z iyahlehlisa). Imigqa ihlanganiswa nge-GlobalId, bese ngegama lecomponent. Imigqa engahlangani nalutho emodelini iyabalwa, ayengezwa. Ishidi liphathwa njengelingathembeki: izifomula azifundwa noma azisebenzi (kuphela inani elilondolozwe ekugcineni kuseli), inani elingenza iwaranti iphele ngaphambi kokuqala kwayo nesixhumanisi somnyango esingesona ikheli lewebhu noma igama lefayela aziphathwa futhi ziyabalwa, namabhukhu amakhulu kakhulu ayenqatshwa. Imisebenzi ye-COBie iyimisebenzi ehlelelwe uhlobo, ibhalwa kodwa ayifundwa ibuyele. Kuspreadsheet i-BimCraft ebhala, umbhalo ongaba yifomula ngokwawo (uqala nge-=, +, - noma @) umakwa njengombhalo. Lencwadi yomsebenzi ihlolwe ezivivinyweni zethu ngomfundi we-spreadsheet ozimele; ayikadlulwa i-validator ye-COBie. Uma ithimba elithola liyisebenzisa, sitshele ukuthi ithini. Amadokhumenti okunikezela Amaphepha emukelwa umnikazi lapho isakhiwo sesiqediwe ngawo ayephrojekthi, hhayi empahleni eyodwa. Ku-ithebhu ye-Assets, vula Handover documents: Add a document, khetha uhlobo lwayo (isitifiketi sokuqedwa, isitifiketi sokuhlala, iwaranti, imanuwali, imidwebo njengokwakhiwe, okunye), bese uthayipha isihloko sayo, usuku lokukhishwa, owayikhipha nenombolo yayo yereferensi. Chaza lapho itholakala: ikheli lewebhu, igama lefayela elihlala eduze kwe-IFC, noma Attach a file. Add to the list. Edit ne-Remove zishintsha uhlu; yonke into ingesinyathelo esisodwa ongasihlehlisa. Build the handover package ilanda i-zip eyodwa: ikhasi lesihloko elibala zonke izidokhumenti, uhlu olufana nespreadsheet, incwadi ye-COBie (izidokhumenti zisemshidini wayo we-Document, njengemigqa mayelana ne-Facility), imodeli, nefayela ngalinye elixhunyiwe. Isitifiketi sokuqedwa noma sokuhlala esingakafiki ohlwini sikhonjwa esihlokweni; iphakheji yakhiwa noma kunjalo. Imodeli esephakheji yimodeli enjengokwakhiwe: ibala izinto ezilinganiswe endaweni. Nayo, ngaphakathi kwesiqondisi as-built: isitatimende, uhlu lwayo yonke into nesimo sokuqinisekiswa kwayo, isethi yemidwebo njengoba ikunjalo manje njenge-PDF eyodwa (imidwebo njengokwakhiwe), nelogi yezinguquko zemidwebo uma imodeli inezethi ezikhishiwe. Bona Maka izinto njengezihloliwe noma ezi-qinisekiswe endaweni. Ku-IFC idokhumenti ngayinye iyi-IfcDocumentInformation exhunywe kuphrojekthi (IfcRelAssociatesDocument), enesihloko sayo, ireferensi, usuku, owayikhipha nendawo, ukuze ezinye izinhlelo ziyibale. Ifayela elixhunyiwe libhalwa ngegama, usayizi ne-SHA-256. Ukugcina ifayela ngqo naphrojekthi, sebenzisa Save the project as a bundle (i-.ccbundle iphatha imodeli namafayela axhunyiwe; ukuyivula kuwabuyisela, ngalinye lihlolwa ngerekhodi lalo). Ukugcina okuvamile kubuza ukuthi yiyiphi oyifunayo. I-.ifc evamile igcina irekhodi, hhayi ifayela: emva kokuyivula, sebenzisa Attach the file again. Ifayela elifanayo liyaziwa; elihlukile lishintsha irekhodi. CSV CSV igcina yonke impahla ngedatha yayo, yonke intulo yokulondolozwa nawo wonke amadokhumenti, umugqa ngamunye, ye-spreadsheet noma enye inhlelo yokulondoloza. Akukakwakhiwa: iseva eyisingethwe egcina izifundo futhi ithumele izaziso lapho i-BimCraft ivaliwe, nokufunda imisebenzi ye-COBie ibuyele. Bona Akukakwakhiwa.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"daylight-factor","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Linganisa ukukhanya kwemini kwigumbi ngalinye","summary":"Isilinganiso sesici sokukhanya kwemini esiphakathi kwigumbi ngalinye, kusuka emawindini alo, izindawo zangaphakathi nesibhakabhaka ngasinye elibona iwindi, kanye nengonya lesibhakabhaka elilinganiswe emodelini. Isilinganiso sokuqala sokwakha, hhayi ukulingisa noma ukuhlolwa kwekhodi.","section":"tasks","order":48,"keywords":["ukukhanya kwemini","isici sokukhanya kwemini","isici sokukhanya kwemini esiphakathi","adf","isici sesibhakabhaka esiqondile","vsc","ukuthola kwelanga","ilanga","g-value","igridi","ukuhlukaniswa kwesibhakabhaka","isici sesibhakabhaka","ukukhanya kwemvelo","iwindi","ingilazi","ingonya lesibhakabhaka","isithiyo","ukufiphala","ibhalkhoni","ukuphuma kophahla","ukubuya kokukhanya","ukudlulisa","ukuklama kokuqala","ukuhlaziya","amagumbi","izindawo"],"headings":[{"id":"ukubala","text":"Ukubala","level":2},{"id":"ifomula","text":"Ifomula","level":2},{"id":"indlela-okulinganiswa-ngayo-ingonya-lesibhakabhaka","text":"Indlela okulinganiswa ngayo ingonya lesibhakabhaka","level":2},{"id":"isici-sesibhakabhaka-esiqondile-sewindi-ngalinye","text":"Isici sesibhakabhaka esiqondile sewindi ngalinye","level":2},{"id":"ilanga-ngamawindi-ngosuku-oluthile","text":"Ilanga ngamawindi ngosuku oluthile","level":2},{"id":"ukukhanya-kwemini-ngegridi","text":"Ukukhanya kwemini ngegridi","level":2},{"id":"okungafakiwe","text":"Okungafakiwe","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIthebhu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkukhanya kwemini\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesokunxele ibala \u003Cstrong\u003Eisici sokukhanya kwemini esiphakathi\u003C/strong\u003E kwigumbi ngalinye: ukukhanya kwesibhakabhaka esimpunga esingaphandle okungafinyelela kukho igumbi, esilinganiswe ngephesenti. Ifunda amagumbi (izindawo) nemawindi ye-IFC emodelini evuliwe. Akukho okushintshwa emodelini futhi akukho okulayishwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKonke kule thebhu \u003Cstrong\u003Ekuyisisiza sokuklama, hhayi ukubala kokuthobela\u003C/strong\u003E: izilinganiso zokuqala ngezindlela ezishicilelwe, \u003Cstrong\u003Ehhayi ukulingisa\u003C/strong\u003E futhi \u003Cstrong\u003Ehhayi ukuhlolwa okuhambisana nekhodi yokwakha noma nomgomo\u003C/strong\u003E. I-BS EN 17037, i-LEED, i-BREEAM nemithetho yamandla idinga ukulingisa kwemini ngesimo sendawo; sebenzisa uhlelo lokulingisa ukukhanya kwemini ngalezo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukubala\"\u003EUkubala\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula imodeli ye-IFC enamagumbi (izindawo) namawindi. Imodeli edwetshwe lapha inegumbi ngaphakathi kwesethi ngayinye evaliwe yezindonga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula ithebhu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkukhanya kwemini\u003C/span\u003E bese ucofa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBala\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIgumbi ngalinye likhombisa isici sokukhanya kwemini nebhendi: ngaphansi kuka-2 %, 2–5 %, 5 % noma ngaphezulu. Cofa igumbi ukuze ubone izindawo zalo nendawo kanye nengonya lesibhakabhaka lewindi ngalinye; igumbi namawindi alo akhethwa emodelini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShintsha okufakiwe, izinombolo zilandela ngokushesha; uma ushintsha imodeli, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBala futhi\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E igcina igumbi ngalinye nezinombolo zalo nokufakwa okusetshenziswe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ifomula\"\u003EIfomula\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsici sokukhanya kwemini esiphakathi (%) = T × Ag × θ × M ÷ (A × (1 − R²)), siphindaphindwe emawindini egumbi, siphelele (ifomula ka-Littlefair, esetshenziswa yi-BRE 209, i-BS 8206-2 ne-CIBSE LG10):\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ET\u003C/strong\u003E, ukudluliswa kokukhanya kwengilazi (0.7 ukuqala: sebenzisa inombolo yomkhiqizi).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAg\u003C/strong\u003E, indawo engilaziwe: indawo yewindi ngalinye (ububanzi bonke × ubude, noma usayizi walo emodelini) × \u003Cstrong\u003Eingxenye engilaziwe\u003C/strong\u003E (0.75 ukuqala: okusele kuwo kuyiframe).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Eθ\u003C/strong\u003E, ingonya lesibhakabhaka elibona iwindi, ngamadigri (ngezansi).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EM\u003C/strong\u003E, isici sokugcinwa ngenxa yothuli esingilazini (1 ukuqala).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EA\u003C/strong\u003E, zonke izindawo zangaphakathi zegumbi: floor, izindonga, uphahla lwangaphakathi namawindi, kuthathwe emumweni wegumbi ngokwalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ER\u003C/strong\u003E, ukubonakala kwazo okumaphakathi, kusindwe ngendawo: floor 0.2, izindonga 0.5, uphahla lwangaphakathi 0.7 ukuqala; ingilazi ibalwa njenge-0.1.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"indlela-okulinganiswa-ngayo-ingonya-lesibhakabhaka\"\u003EIndlela okulinganiswa ngayo ingonya lesibhakabhaka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEwindini ngalinye i-BimCraft isika imodeli ngendiza emile eqondile kuwindi, iqala ebusweni bengilazi obuphandle, bese ibheka phezulu ngqo emngceleni: konke okuhlangana nekhala phambi kwewindi (isakhiwo esiphambene, ibhalkhoni noma uphuma kophahla phezulu, umphetho wophahla) kuhlanganisa ingxenye yalo ama-90°. θ iyalokho okusele. Iwindi ngokwalo nodonga elibamba kuyasuswa. Lokhu kwenziwa ezindaweni ezinhlanu ngobubanzi bewindi bese kuthathwa isilinganiso, ngakho umthambo omncane phambi kwesikhungo uthatha ingxenye yawo, hhayi isibhakabhaka sonke.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsakhiwo esiphakama ngo-8.5 m ngaphezulu kwesikhungo sewindi futhi sikhashelwe ngo-9.9 m siyavimba i-40.65° (i-engeli enesipho sayo ingu-8.5 ÷ 9.9), kushiye θ = 49.35°.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isici-sesibhakabhaka-esiqondile-sewindi-ngalinye\"\u003EIsici sesibhakabhaka esiqondile sewindi ngalinye\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBala\u003C/span\u003E futhi ilinganisa, ewindini ngalinye, okubona kwawo sekwoneka isibhakabhaka sonke: ukusika okufanayo okumile, kuphendulwa kuzo zonke izinhlangothi ngaphezu kwebuso lewindi (njalo ngama-2°, kusuka olunye uhlangothi kuya kolunye), ngakho isakhiwo ngasohlangothini, ifini, noma umbhoshongo ojulile kuthatha ingxenye yawo. Kusuka lapho i-BimCraft yenza \u003Cstrong\u003Eisici sesibhakabhaka esiqondile (VSC)\u003C/strong\u003E: ukuthi ukukhanya kwesibhakabhaka esimpunga kufinyelela kangakanani engilazini, njengengxenye yesibhakabhaka esizobe sithola uphahla olucwebile oluyisicaba. Iwindi elingenalutho phambi kwalo lithola \u003Cstrong\u003E39.6 %\u003C/strong\u003E, okuphezulu kakhulu ewindini eliqondile; isakhiwo eside esiphakama ngo-25° ngaphezu kwewindi sishiya cishe \u003Cstrong\u003E27 %\u003C/strong\u003E, inani lomthetho wesandla izincomo zase-UK (BRE 209) ezisisebenzisayo. Iwindi ngalinye enkundleni yegumbi likhombisa i-VSC yalo nengonya lokuvinjwa kwalo (izinto eziphakama kangakanani eziphakama ngqo phambi kwalo).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsibhakabhaka yisibhakabhaka esimpunga esijwayelekile se-CIE, esikhanya kabili ngaphezulu uma uzama ukubheka phezulu kunasemngceleni, futhi ukusika kunembile: akukho okuthathwa isampula.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ilanga-ngamawindi-ngosuku-oluthile\"\u003EIlanga ngamawindi ngosuku oluthile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIlanga emawindini ngosuku oluthile\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha usuku. I-BimCraft ilandela ilanga ngalolo suku ngamakota ehora bese ingeza, ewindini ngalinye, ukushisa elanga elikungenisa ngengilazi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Eilanga eliqondile\u003C/strong\u003E, uma likhona phambi kwewindi futhi akukho okulifihla emodelini (ukusika okufanayo okunembile, okuphendulwe ngokuya elangeni: ibhalkhoni elifihla ilanga lasehlobo emini livumela ilanga lasebusika elisezansi ukungena);\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Eukukhanya kwesibhakabhaka\u003C/strong\u003E engilazini, ngaphandle kwalokho iwindi elingakubonile;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eukukhanya \u003Cstrong\u003Eokuvela emhlabeni\u003C/strong\u003E (ukubuya kwawo: 0.2 ukuqala);\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ekonke kudlula engilazini nge-\u003Cstrong\u003Eg-value\u003C/strong\u003E (ingxenye yamandla elanga eyivumelayo: 0.6 ukuqala; sebenzisa inombolo yomkhiqizi) nengxenye yayo engilaziwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIgumbi ngalinye likhombisa isamba sosuku ngo-kWh nesikhulumo sawo ngo-watt nesikhathi sawo; imininingwane yegumbi idweba usuku njengegrafu. Isibhakabhaka yisibhakabhaka esicacile ngemodeli ye-Hottel (Duffie &amp; Beckman, \u003Cem\u003ESolar Engineering of Thermal Processes\u003C/em\u003E), nezinombolo zasehlobo noma zasebusika zendawo nesizini, nokuphakama kwesayithi; indawo yelanga iyeNOAA. Ububanzi nobude besayithi kuvela kusayithi ye-IFC, nenyakatho kusuka enyakatheni yeqiniso yemodeli; uma imodeli ingenayo isayithi, bhala ububanzi nobude. Izikhathi ziyisikhathi esijwayelekile (akukho sikhathi sasehlobo) esikhalazini osibhalayo, noma esiphakanyiswa yi-longitude.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkushiywe ngaphandle: amafu (usuku olucwebile), ingilazi engangeni kakhulu ezingeni eliphansi, izinhlaka ezifihla ingilazi, izikhwezo, nalokho izindonga nophahla okuthatha. Isilinganiso sokupholisa kuleyo thebhu sisebenzisa isikhulumo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukukhanya-kwemini-ngegridi\"\u003EUkukhanya kwemini ngegridi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsici sokukhanya kwemini ngegridi\u003C/span\u003E bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBala igridi\u003C/span\u003E: i-BimCraft ibeka igridi phezu kwe-floor ngalinye egumbini ngobude besimo sokusebenza (0.85 m ukuqala), ingxenye yemitha ngaphakathi emadongeni, bese ibala isici sokukhanya kwemini ngasemaphoyinteni ngamunye ngendlela ye-\u003Cstrong\u003EBRE split-flux\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Eisici sesibhakabhaka\u003C/strong\u003E: isibhakabhaka esimpunga esibonwa kusuka kuphoyinti ngokudlula endaweni yokuvuleka kwewindi ngalinye, ngaphandle kwezinhlaka;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Eisici esibhekiswe ngaphandle\u003C/strong\u003E: lokho iphoyinti elibona lezakhiwo zangaphandle ngewindi, elikhanya ngeshumi lesibhakabhaka esingemuva kwazo (shintsha ukukhanya kwesithiyo uma zikhanya noma zimnyama kakhulu);\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Eisici esibhekiswe ngaphakathi\u003C/strong\u003E: ukukhanya okugxumayo egumbini, kusuka ezindaweni zegumbi nokubuya kwazo, indawo yamawindi nokuthi iyiphi ingxenye yayo ephumela ngaphandle (ifomula ye-BRE, nokudlula kwengilazi esikhundleni sengilazi ecacile ayeyicabanga).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIgumbi ngalinye likhombisa isilinganiso salo, ingxenye yalo ephansi kakhulu nokuthi yingakhi ethola u-2 % noma ngaphezulu; imininingwane yegumbi idweba ipulani yalo ngamaphoyinti ngamunye ekhulekile ngesici sokukhanya kwemini, namawindi abomvu. Ukuze kube lula kuyo yonke ikhompyutha, igumbi lithola \u003Cstrong\u003Eamaphoyinti angama-400\u003C/strong\u003E kuphela: egumbini elikhulu ibanga liyakhula ukuze lilingane (bhala ibanga ukuze ukhethe wena).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okungafakiwe\"\u003EOkungafakiwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmawindi ophahla (ingilazi elele noma ethambekile) ayadwetshwa kodwa awabalwa: ifomula lapha ngamawindi odongeni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmawindi angenagumbi emuva kwawo (iholo elingenayo indawo, umzekeliso) ayadwetshwa ngokwahlukana.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuvulwa kwewindi (imbobo ithathwa ebusweni obuphandle), ukuqhwaza, amahora elanga nokukhanya okuncike esimweni sezulu. Ngo-BS EN 17037, LEED noma BREEAM sebenzisa uhlelo lokulingisa ukukhanya kwemini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmabhendi avela kwizeluleko zakudala zaseBrithani (BS 8206-2), akhonjiswa njengesiqondiso kuphela, hhayi njengokudlula noma ukwehluleka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Ithebhu ye-Ukukhanya kwemini ngakwesokunxele ibala isici sokukhanya kwemini esiphakathi kwigumbi ngalinye: ukukhanya kwesibhakabhaka esimpunga esingaphandle okungafinyelela kukho igumbi, esilinganiswe ngephesenti. Ifunda amagumbi (izindawo) nemawindi ye-IFC emodelini evuliwe. Akukho okushintshwa emodelini futhi akukho okulayishwa. Konke kule thebhu kuyisisiza sokuklama, hhayi ukubala kokuthobela: izilinganiso zokuqala ngezindlela ezishicilelwe, hhayi ukulingisa futhi hhayi ukuhlolwa okuhambisana nekhodi yokwakha noma nomgomo. I-BS EN 17037, i-LEED, i-BREEAM nemithetho yamandla idinga ukulingisa kwemini ngesimo sendawo; sebenzisa uhlelo lokulingisa ukukhanya kwemini ngalezo. Ukubala Vula imodeli ye-IFC enamagumbi (izindawo) namawindi. Imodeli edwetshwe lapha inegumbi ngaphakathi kwesethi ngayinye evaliwe yezindonga. Vula ithebhu ye-Ukukhanya kwemini bese ucofa Bala. Igumbi ngalinye likhombisa isici sokukhanya kwemini nebhendi: ngaphansi kuka-2 %, 2–5 %, 5 % noma ngaphezulu. Cofa igumbi ukuze ubone izindawo zalo nendawo kanye nengonya lesibhakabhaka lewindi ngalinye; igumbi namawindi alo akhethwa emodelini. Shintsha okufakiwe, izinombolo zilandela ngokushesha; uma ushintsha imodeli, Bala futhi. CSV igcina igumbi ngalinye nezinombolo zalo nokufakwa okusetshenziswe. Ifomula Isici sokukhanya kwemini esiphakathi (%) = T × Ag × θ × M ÷ (A × (1 − R²)), siphindaphindwe emawindini egumbi, siphelele (ifomula ka-Littlefair, esetshenziswa yi-BRE 209, i-BS 8206-2 ne-CIBSE LG10): T, ukudluliswa kokukhanya kwengilazi (0.7 ukuqala: sebenzisa inombolo yomkhiqizi). Ag, indawo engilaziwe: indawo yewindi ngalinye (ububanzi bonke × ubude, noma usayizi walo emodelini) × ingxenye engilaziwe (0.75 ukuqala: okusele kuwo kuyiframe). θ, ingonya lesibhakabhaka elibona iwindi, ngamadigri (ngezansi). M, isici sokugcinwa ngenxa yothuli esingilazini (1 ukuqala). A, zonke izindawo zangaphakathi zegumbi: floor, izindonga, uphahla lwangaphakathi namawindi, kuthathwe emumweni wegumbi ngokwalo. R, ukubonakala kwazo okumaphakathi, kusindwe ngendawo: floor 0.2, izindonga 0.5, uphahla lwangaphakathi 0.7 ukuqala; ingilazi ibalwa njenge-0.1. Indlela okulinganiswa ngayo ingonya lesibhakabhaka Ewindini ngalinye i-BimCraft isika imodeli ngendiza emile eqondile kuwindi, iqala ebusweni bengilazi obuphandle, bese ibheka phezulu ngqo emngceleni: konke okuhlangana nekhala phambi kwewindi (isakhiwo esiphambene, ibhalkhoni noma uphuma kophahla phezulu, umphetho wophahla) kuhlanganisa ingxenye yalo ama-90°. θ iyalokho okusele. Iwindi ngokwalo nodonga elibamba kuyasuswa. Lokhu kwenziwa ezindaweni ezinhlanu ngobubanzi bewindi bese kuthathwa isilinganiso, ngakho umthambo omncane phambi kwesikhungo uthatha ingxenye yawo, hhayi isibhakabhaka sonke. Isakhiwo esiphakama ngo-8.5 m ngaphezulu kwesikhungo sewindi futhi sikhashelwe ngo-9.9 m siyavimba i-40.65° (i-engeli enesipho sayo ingu-8.5 ÷ 9.9), kushiye θ = 49.35°. Isici sesibhakabhaka esiqondile sewindi ngalinye Bala futhi ilinganisa, ewindini ngalinye, okubona kwawo sekwoneka isibhakabhaka sonke: ukusika okufanayo okumile, kuphendulwa kuzo zonke izinhlangothi ngaphezu kwebuso lewindi (njalo ngama-2°, kusuka olunye uhlangothi kuya kolunye), ngakho isakhiwo ngasohlangothini, ifini, noma umbhoshongo ojulile kuthatha ingxenye yawo. Kusuka lapho i-BimCraft yenza isici sesibhakabhaka esiqondile (VSC): ukuthi ukukhanya kwesibhakabhaka esimpunga kufinyelela kangakanani engilazini, njengengxenye yesibhakabhaka esizobe sithola uphahla olucwebile oluyisicaba. Iwindi elingenalutho phambi kwalo lithola 39.6 %, okuphezulu kakhulu ewindini eliqondile; isakhiwo eside esiphakama ngo-25° ngaphezu kwewindi sishiya cishe 27 %, inani lomthetho wesandla izincomo zase-UK (BRE 209) ezisisebenzisayo. Iwindi ngalinye enkundleni yegumbi likhombisa i-VSC yalo nengonya lokuvinjwa kwalo (izinto eziphakama kangakanani eziphakama ngqo phambi kwalo). Isibhakabhaka yisibhakabhaka esimpunga esijwayelekile se-CIE, esikhanya kabili ngaphezulu uma uzama ukubheka phezulu kunasemngceleni, futhi ukusika kunembile: akukho okuthathwa isampula. Ilanga ngamawindi ngosuku oluthile Vula Ilanga emawindini ngosuku oluthile bese ukhetha usuku. I-BimCraft ilandela ilanga ngalolo suku ngamakota ehora bese ingeza, ewindini ngalinye, ukushisa elanga elikungenisa ngengilazi: ilanga eliqondile, uma likhona phambi kwewindi futhi akukho okulifihla emodelini (ukusika okufanayo okunembile, okuphendulwe ngokuya elangeni: ibhalkhoni elifihla ilanga lasehlobo emini livumela ilanga lasebusika elisezansi ukungena); ukukhanya kwesibhakabhaka engilazini, ngaphandle kwalokho iwindi elingakubonile; ukukhanya okuvela emhlabeni (ukubuya kwawo: 0.2 ukuqala); konke kudlula engilazini nge-g-value (ingxenye yamandla elanga eyivumelayo: 0.6 ukuqala; sebenzisa inombolo yomkhiqizi) nengxenye yayo engilaziwe. Igumbi ngalinye likhombisa isamba sosuku ngo-kWh nesikhulumo sawo ngo-watt nesikhathi sawo; imininingwane yegumbi idweba usuku njengegrafu. Isibhakabhaka yisibhakabhaka esicacile ngemodeli ye-Hottel (Duffie & Beckman, Solar Engineering of Thermal Processes), nezinombolo zasehlobo noma zasebusika zendawo nesizini, nokuphakama kwesayithi; indawo yelanga iyeNOAA. Ububanzi nobude besayithi kuvela kusayithi ye-IFC, nenyakatho kusuka enyakatheni yeqiniso yemodeli; uma imodeli ingenayo isayithi, bhala ububanzi nobude. Izikhathi ziyisikhathi esijwayelekile (akukho sikhathi sasehlobo) esikhalazini osibhalayo, noma esiphakanyiswa yi-longitude. Okushiywe ngaphandle: amafu (usuku olucwebile), ingilazi engangeni kakhulu ezingeni eliphansi, izinhlaka ezifihla ingilazi, izikhwezo, nalokho izindonga nophahla okuthatha. Isilinganiso sokupholisa kuleyo thebhu sisebenzisa isikhulumo. Ukukhanya kwemini ngegridi Vula Isici sokukhanya kwemini ngegridi bese Bala igridi: i-BimCraft ibeka igridi phezu kwe-floor ngalinye egumbini ngobude besimo sokusebenza (0.85 m ukuqala), ingxenye yemitha ngaphakathi emadongeni, bese ibala isici sokukhanya kwemini ngasemaphoyinteni ngamunye ngendlela ye-BRE split-flux: isici sesibhakabhaka: isibhakabhaka esimpunga esibonwa kusuka kuphoyinti ngokudlula endaweni yokuvuleka kwewindi ngalinye, ngaphandle kwezinhlaka; isici esibhekiswe ngaphandle: lokho iphoyinti elibona lezakhiwo zangaphandle ngewindi, elikhanya ngeshumi lesibhakabhaka esingemuva kwazo (shintsha ukukhanya kwesithiyo uma zikhanya noma zimnyama kakhulu); isici esibhekiswe ngaphakathi: ukukhanya okugxumayo egumbini, kusuka ezindaweni zegumbi nokubuya kwazo, indawo yamawindi nokuthi iyiphi ingxenye yayo ephumela ngaphandle (ifomula ye-BRE, nokudlula kwengilazi esikhundleni sengilazi ecacile ayeyicabanga). Igumbi ngalinye likhombisa isilinganiso salo, ingxenye yalo ephansi kakhulu nokuthi yingakhi ethola u-2 % noma ngaphezulu; imininingwane yegumbi idweba ipulani yalo ngamaphoyinti ngamunye ekhulekile ngesici sokukhanya kwemini, namawindi abomvu. Ukuze kube lula kuyo yonke ikhompyutha, igumbi lithola amaphoyinti angama-400 kuphela: egumbini elikhulu ibanga liyakhula ukuze lilingane (bhala ibanga ukuze ukhethe wena). Okungafakiwe Amawindi ophahla (ingilazi elele noma ethambekile) ayadwetshwa kodwa awabalwa: ifomula lapha ngamawindi odongeni. Amawindi angenagumbi emuva kwawo (iholo elingenayo indawo, umzekeliso) ayadwetshwa ngokwahlukana. Ukuvulwa kwewindi (imbobo ithathwa ebusweni obuphandle), ukuqhwaza, amahora elanga nokukhanya okuncike esimweni sezulu. Ngo-BS EN 17037, LEED noma BREEAM sebenzisa uhlelo lokulingisa ukukhanya kwemini. Amabhendi avela kwizeluleko zakudala zaseBrithani (BS 8206-2), akhonjiswa njengesiqondiso kuphela, hhayi njengokudlula noma ukwehluleka.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"heating-and-cooling-loads","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Linganisa izidingo zokushisa nokupholisa","summary":"Ukulahlekelwa kukashisa kwegumbi ngalinye, ukushisa konyaka ngamasosha ezinsuku nesikhathi sokupholisa esiphezulu, kusuka kokuthi lingamelwe yini emodelini nakwi-U-value yento ngayinye, nazo zonke izigaba zokufaka zibonakala. Iyinsiza yokuklama, hhayi ukubala okuhambisana nemithetho.","section":"tasks","order":49,"keywords":["amandla","ukushisa","ukupholisa","ukulahlekelwa kukashisa","isidingo sokushisa","isidingo sokupholisa","u-value","ukudluliswa kukashisa","amasosha ezinsuku","hdd","ukuvuthwa komoya","izinguquko zomoya ngehora","ukushisa kwangaphakathi","ukushisa kwelanga","lambda","ukuqhuba","ukugoqwa","ukuklama kuqala","ukuhlaziya","amagumbi","izindawo"],"headings":[{"id":"yini-elingamele-igumbi-ngalinye","text":"Yini elingamele igumbi ngalinye","level":2},{"id":"u-values","text":"U-values","level":2},{"id":"ukushisa","text":"Ukushisa","level":2},{"id":"ukupholisa","text":"Ukupholisa","level":2},{"id":"okushiywa-yiyo","text":"Okushiywa yiyo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EKuthebhu ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDaylight\u003C/span\u003E, ngemva kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalculate\u003C/span\u003E, vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHeating and cooling loads\u003C/span\u003E bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWork out the loads\u003C/span\u003E. Igumbi ngalinye lithola \u003Cstrong\u003Eukulahlekelwa kukashisa\u003C/strong\u003E losuku olubandayo lokuklama, \u003Cstrong\u003Eukushisa konyaka\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003Enesikhathi sokupholisa esiphezulu\u003C/strong\u003E ngosuku olushisayo. Akukho okulayishwa; akukho okushintshwa emodelini ngaphandle kokuthi uthayipha i-U-value.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELena \u003Cstrong\u003Eyinsiza yokuklama, hhayi ukubala okuhambisana nemithetho\u003C/strong\u003E: isilinganiso esizinzile nezigaba zonke ezibonakala esikrinini. \u003Cstrong\u003EAkuyona\u003C/strong\u003E indlela ye-ISO 52016-1, akuyona ukulingisa, futhi akuyona isitifiketi samandla; ayilinganisi amabhoyila, ama-heat pump noma ama-chiller. Hlola imiphumela, futhi ulinganise izinto nonjiniyela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yini-elingamele-igumbi-ngalinye\"\u003EYini elingamele igumbi ngalinye\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-BimCraft iyithola emodelini qobo, ngakho i-IFC yanoma iyiphi inhlelo isebenza (ayidingi imingcele yezindawo ezinye izinhlelo ezizithumelayo). Kuyo yonke ingxenye yendawo yegumbi ngalinye ibheka ngqo phandle:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eushintsho lokuqala, iwindi, umnyango, ifloor, uphahla, isigubekeli, ukugoqa kwekhethini noma ibhimu alihlangabezanayo \u003Cstrong\u003Elimelela\u003C/strong\u003E lowo mucu;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Engemva kwalowo mbandela, noma \u003Cstrong\u003Eelinye igumbi\u003C/strong\u003E (libalwe njengelingakende, ngokushisa okufanayo: akukho ukulahlekelwa), \u003Cstrong\u003Eakukho lutho\u003C/strong\u003E (ngaphandle), noma, ngaphansi kwefloor esitezini esiphansi kakhulu, \u003Cstrong\u003Eumhlabathi\u003C/strong\u003E;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eumnyango ovulekile oya kwelinye igumbi ubalwa njengongakende; ingxenye engahlangabezani nalutho (ngaphakathi kwe-1.5 m ngasohlangothini noma ngaphansi, ne-8 m ngaphezulu) ihlinzwa phansi kwegumbi ibe ayibalwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmawindi nemisuka ithatha usayizi wayo kwi-IFC (ububanzi bonke × ubude) kusuka kudonga okuhlezi kulo. Chofoza igumbi ethebhuleni ukuze ubone yonke into elivalayo ngendawo yayo, i-U-value yayo nokuthi i-U-value yavela kuphi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"u-values\"\u003EU-values\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgento ngayinye i-BimCraft isebenzisa, kuleli odlweni:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EI-U-value yesi-IFC ngokwayo\u003C/strong\u003E — i-\u003Ccode\u003EThermalTransmittance\u003C/code\u003E esethini levo ejwayelekile yezici (isibonelo \u003Ccode\u003EPset_WallCommon\u003C/code\u003E) noma kuhlobo lwayo. Izinhlelo eziningi zokuklama zingayibhala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzendlalelo zayo zezinto\u003C/strong\u003E — 1 ÷ (ukumelana komphezulu wangaphakathi + ubukhulu ngalunye ÷ ukuqhuba kwalo λ + ukumelana komphezulu wangaphandle), nokumelana okujwayelekile komphezulu (0.13 kanye 0.04 m²K/W kumadonga; 0.10 phezulu kanye 0.17 phansi ngaphakathi). Ukuqhuba okujwayelekile ukuqala ngakho (i-mineral wool 0.035, ibhurikhi 0.77, ukhonkolo 1.4…); ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuqhuba kwezinto zokwakha\u003C/span\u003E thayipha eyomkhiqizi, futhi zonke ii-U-value ezivela kulezo zendlalelo ziyalandela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInani elijwayelekile\u003C/strong\u003E (amadonga 0.3, uphahla 0.2, ama-floor 0.25, amawindi 1.4, iminyango 1.6 W/m²K), libonakaliswa njengalo — thayipha eyakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-U-value othayipha ekuthinteni kwegumbi ibhalwa esethini levo ejwayelekile yezici njenge-\u003Ccode\u003EThermalTransmittance\u003C/code\u003E (isinyathelo esisodwa; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyasihlehlisa). Uma izinto eziningi zabelana ngalo sethi (uhlobo olulodwa lodonga, isibonelo), zonke ziyashintsha ndawonye, nomugqa wesimo uthi zingaki.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukushisa\"\u003EUkushisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkulahlekelwa kukashisa\u003C/strong\u003E = Σ U × A × (ngaphakathi − ngaphandle) kukho konke okuphandle + Σ U × A × (ngaphakathi − umhlabathi) kuma-floor asemhlabathini + 0.335 × izinguquko zomoya ngehora × ivolumu yegumbi × (ngaphakathi − ngaphandle). Ama-0.335 Wh ngelinye imitha yevolumu ngelinye ledigri lika-kelvin amelwe ukuthi ukuminyana komoya (1.2 kg/m³) kuphindwe ngamandla awo okushisa (1005 J/kgK).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkushisa konyaka\u003C/strong\u003E = (ukulahlekelwa kwegumbi ngedigri ngayinye phandle, ngokusebenzisa isakhiwo nomoya, kanye nokulahlekelwa kwalo emhlabathini okulinganiswe ngomehluko ofanayo) × \u003Cstrong\u003Eamasosha ezinsuku\u003C/strong\u003E × 24 ÷ 1000, ku-kWh. Thayipha amasosha ezinsuku endawo, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERead degree-days from a CSV…\u003C/span\u003E (umugqa owodwa ngosuku noma ngenyanga; inombolo yokugcina kuyo yonke imigqa iyengezwa). Sebenzisa amasosha ezinsuku ngezinga lokushisa lesisekelo umthombo wakho owasebenzisayo: lesi sisekelo sesivele sihlanganisa ukushisa mahhala kubantu, kumalambu nakulanga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukupholisa\"\u003EUkupholisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsikhathi sokupholisa esiphezulu\u003C/strong\u003E = ukushisa okudlula esakhiweni nomoya ekushiseni kwehlobo lokuklama + abantu (indawo ngomuntu × ukushisa ngomuntu) + ukukhanya nezinto zikagesi ngemitha yesikwele yendawo + \u003Cstrong\u003Eilanga\u003C/strong\u003E: isikhathi esiphezulu se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESun through the windows on a date\u003C/span\u003E salelo gumbi. Bala ilanga kuqala, ngosuku oshisayo; kuze kube yilapho, ilanga libalwa njengo-0 futhi isigaba siyasho lokho. Izikhathi eziphezulu zengxenye ngayinye zifakwa ndawonye nakuba zingawela ngamahora ahlukene, okweqisa kancane.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okushiywa-yiyo\"\u003EOkushiywa yiyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzindlela zesikhathi ze-ISO 52016-1 zangenyanga nangehora (isitandade esikhokhelwayo), ukushisa okugcinwe ngobukhulu besakhiwo, izixhumanisi zokushisa, ukusebenza kwezinhlelo zokushisa nokupholisa, namafayela wesimo sezulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzindawo ezihlanganayo zithathwa ngokushisa okufanayo; izindawo ezingashisiwe azenziwa njengemodeli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBona futhi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/daylight-factor\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/daylight-factor\"\u003ELinganisa ukukhanya kosuku kuleligumbi ngalinye\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Kuthebhu ethi Daylight, ngemva kwe-Calculate, vula Heating and cooling loads bese uchofoza Work out the loads. Igumbi ngalinye lithola ukulahlekelwa kukashisa losuku olubandayo lokuklama, ukushisa konyaka kanye nesikhathi sokupholisa esiphezulu ngosuku olushisayo. Akukho okulayishwa; akukho okushintshwa emodelini ngaphandle kokuthi uthayipha i-U-value. Lena yinsiza yokuklama, hhayi ukubala okuhambisana nemithetho: isilinganiso esizinzile nezigaba zonke ezibonakala esikrinini. Akuyona indlela ye-ISO 52016-1, akuyona ukulingisa, futhi akuyona isitifiketi samandla; ayilinganisi amabhoyila, ama-heat pump noma ama-chiller. Hlola imiphumela, futhi ulinganise izinto nonjiniyela. Yini elingamele igumbi ngalinye I-BimCraft iyithola emodelini qobo, ngakho i-IFC yanoma iyiphi inhlelo isebenza (ayidingi imingcele yezindawo ezinye izinhlelo ezizithumelayo). Kuyo yonke ingxenye yendawo yegumbi ngalinye ibheka ngqo phandle: ushintsho lokuqala, iwindi, umnyango, ifloor, uphahla, isigubekeli, ukugoqa kwekhethini noma ibhimu alihlangabezanayo limelela lowo mucu; ngemva kwalowo mbandela, noma elinye igumbi (libalwe njengelingakende, ngokushisa okufanayo: akukho ukulahlekelwa), akukho lutho (ngaphandle), noma, ngaphansi kwefloor esitezini esiphansi kakhulu, umhlabathi; umnyango ovulekile oya kwelinye igumbi ubalwa njengongakende; ingxenye engahlangabezani nalutho (ngaphakathi kwe-1.5 m ngasohlangothini noma ngaphansi, ne-8 m ngaphezulu) ihlinzwa phansi kwegumbi ibe ayibalwa. Amawindi nemisuka ithatha usayizi wayo kwi-IFC (ububanzi bonke × ubude) kusuka kudonga okuhlezi kulo. Chofoza igumbi ethebhuleni ukuze ubone yonke into elivalayo ngendawo yayo, i-U-value yayo nokuthi i-U-value yavela kuphi. U-values Ngento ngayinye i-BimCraft isebenzisa, kuleli odlweni: I-U-value yesi-IFC ngokwayo — i-ThermalTransmittance esethini levo ejwayelekile yezici (isibonelo Pset_WallCommon) noma kuhlobo lwayo. Izinhlelo eziningi zokuklama zingayibhala. Izendlalelo zayo zezinto — 1 ÷ (ukumelana komphezulu wangaphakathi + ubukhulu ngalunye ÷ ukuqhuba kwalo λ + ukumelana komphezulu wangaphandle), nokumelana okujwayelekile komphezulu (0.13 kanye 0.04 m²K/W kumadonga; 0.10 phezulu kanye 0.17 phansi ngaphakathi). Ukuqhuba okujwayelekile ukuqala ngakho (i-mineral wool 0.035, ibhurikhi 0.77, ukhonkolo 1.4…); ngaphansi kwe-Ukuqhuba kwezinto zokwakha thayipha eyomkhiqizi, futhi zonke ii-U-value ezivela kulezo zendlalelo ziyalandela. Inani elijwayelekile (amadonga 0.3, uphahla 0.2, ama-floor 0.25, amawindi 1.4, iminyango 1.6 W/m²K), libonakaliswa njengalo — thayipha eyakho. I-U-value othayipha ekuthinteni kwegumbi ibhalwa esethini levo ejwayelekile yezici njenge-ThermalTransmittance (isinyathelo esisodwa; Ctrl+Z iyasihlehlisa). Uma izinto eziningi zabelana ngalo sethi (uhlobo olulodwa lodonga, isibonelo), zonke ziyashintsha ndawonye, nomugqa wesimo uthi zingaki. Ukushisa Ukulahlekelwa kukashisa = Σ U × A × (ngaphakathi − ngaphandle) kukho konke okuphandle + Σ U × A × (ngaphakathi − umhlabathi) kuma-floor asemhlabathini + 0.335 × izinguquko zomoya ngehora × ivolumu yegumbi × (ngaphakathi − ngaphandle). Ama-0.335 Wh ngelinye imitha yevolumu ngelinye ledigri lika-kelvin amelwe ukuthi ukuminyana komoya (1.2 kg/m³) kuphindwe ngamandla awo okushisa (1005 J/kgK). Ukushisa konyaka = (ukulahlekelwa kwegumbi ngedigri ngayinye phandle, ngokusebenzisa isakhiwo nomoya, kanye nokulahlekelwa kwalo emhlabathini okulinganiswe ngomehluko ofanayo) × amasosha ezinsuku × 24 ÷ 1000, ku-kWh. Thayipha amasosha ezinsuku endawo, noma Read degree-days from a CSV… (umugqa owodwa ngosuku noma ngenyanga; inombolo yokugcina kuyo yonke imigqa iyengezwa). Sebenzisa amasosha ezinsuku ngezinga lokushisa lesisekelo umthombo wakho owasebenzisayo: lesi sisekelo sesivele sihlanganisa ukushisa mahhala kubantu, kumalambu nakulanga. Ukupholisa Isikhathi sokupholisa esiphezulu = ukushisa okudlula esakhiweni nomoya ekushiseni kwehlobo lokuklama + abantu (indawo ngomuntu × ukushisa ngomuntu) + ukukhanya nezinto zikagesi ngemitha yesikwele yendawo + ilanga: isikhathi esiphezulu se-Sun through the windows on a date salelo gumbi. Bala ilanga kuqala, ngosuku oshisayo; kuze kube yilapho, ilanga libalwa njengo-0 futhi isigaba siyasho lokho. Izikhathi eziphezulu zengxenye ngayinye zifakwa ndawonye nakuba zingawela ngamahora ahlukene, okweqisa kancane. Okushiywa yiyo Izindlela zesikhathi ze-ISO 52016-1 zangenyanga nangehora (isitandade esikhokhelwayo), ukushisa okugcinwe ngobukhulu besakhiwo, izixhumanisi zokushisa, ukusebenza kwezinhlelo zokushisa nokupholisa, namafayela wesimo sezulu. Izindawo ezihlanganayo zithathwa ngokushisa okufanayo; izindawo ezingashisiwe azenziwa njengemodeli. Bona futhi Linganisa ukukhanya kosuku kuleligumbi ngalinye.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"type-vs-instance","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Shintsha isici sohlobo ezintweni zonke zalolohlobo","summary":"Hlukanisa izici zohlobo kwezici zento ngayinye, shintsha inani ohlobweni ukuze zonke izinto zilandele, bese uqinisekisa ukuthi ukuhlelwa kwento eyodwa kuhlala kuyeyayo.","section":"tasks","order":50,"keywords":["uhlobo","isibonelo","izici zohlobo","uhlobo lomndeni","kwabelwana","kopisha lapho kubhalwa","zonke izinto","ukuhlela okuningi","umkhiqizi","imodeli"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"uhlobo-noma-isibonelo","text":"Uhlobo noma isibonelo?","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo-shintsha-uhlobo","text":"Izinyathelo: shintsha uhlobo","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo-shintsha-into-eyodwa-kuphela","text":"Izinyathelo: shintsha into eyodwa kuphela","level":2},{"id":"gcina","text":"Gcina","level":2},{"id":"imiphumela-ejwayelekile","text":"Imiphumela ejwayelekile","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESetha umkhiqizi ohlobweni lomnyango ukuze zonke iminyango yalolohlobo ziwubonise, bese unikeza omunye umnyango isilinganiso sawo somlilo ngaphandle kokuthinta eminye. Lokhu kubonisa umehluko phakathi kwezici zohlobo nezezibonelo ku-BimCraft.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uhlobo-noma-isibonelo\"\u003EUhlobo noma isibonelo?\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsibonelo\u003C/strong\u003E siyeka into eyodwa: ithegi yayo, imaki yayo, igumbi layo, isilinganiso sayo somlilo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsici sohlobo\u003C/strong\u003E siyeka uhlobo okwabelwana ngalo izinto eziningi: umkhiqizi, imodeli, ububanzi bohlobo lomnyango.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuphaneli \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzici\u003C/span\u003E, amasethi avela ohlobweni anesithi &quot; (type)&quot; emva kwegama lawo nomugqa othi &quot;Isici sohlobo: ushintsho lapha lusebenza kuzo zonke izinto zalolohlobo.&quot; Yonke esinye isethi siyeka into ngokwayo. \u003Cstrong\u003EUhlobo\u003C/strong\u003E ebhlokini lokuqala lubonisa igama lohlobo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo-shintsha-uhlobo\"\u003EIzinyathelo: shintsha uhlobo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula imodeli ye-IFC bese uchofoza umnyango.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaphela \u003Cstrong\u003EUhlobo\u003C/strong\u003E lwawo ebhlokini lokuqala lephaneli \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzici\u003C/span\u003E, isibonelo &quot;Single-Flush 900 x 2100&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESkrola kusethi igama layo eliphela ngo&quot; (type)&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza inani ofuna ukulishintsha, isibonelo \u003Cstrong\u003EUmkhiqizi\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThayipha inani elisha bese uchofoza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBheka uhlu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinguquko\u003C/span\u003E: ukungena kuphethwe nge-&quot; (type)&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza omunye umnyango walolohlobo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHlola inani elifanayo: nalo lisabonisa inani elisha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo-shintsha-into-eyodwa-kuphela\"\u003EIzinyathelo: shintsha into eyodwa kuphela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza umnyango oyodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula isethi engenalo &quot;(type)&quot; egameni layo, isibonelo \u003Ccode\u003EPset_DoorCommon\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza inani, isibonelo \u003Cstrong\u003EFireRating\u003C/strong\u003E, thayipha inani elisha bese uchofoza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza umnyango oseduze nawo, owalolohlobo olufanayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHlola inani elifanayo: lisabonisa inani elidala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENoma uma umthumeli wedatha ewabelana ngaleso sethi phakathi kwezicabha zombili, i-BimCraft inikeza umnyango wokuqala ikhophi yawo ngaphambi kokuwushintsha. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/edit-ifc-properties#why-your-edit-changes-only-one-element\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/edit-ifc-properties\" data-hash=\"why-your-edit-changes-only-one-element\"\u003EKungani ushintsho lwakho lushintsha into eyodwa kuphela\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gcina\"\u003EGcina\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGcina njenge-IFC\u003C/span\u003E noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula ikhophi egciniwe ku-BimCraft, noma kunoma yisiphi isibuki se-IFC, ukuze uhlole zombili izinguquko.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imiphumela-ejwayelekile\"\u003EImiphumela ejwayelekile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkuwona wonke amamodeli anohlobo.\u003C/strong\u003E Abanye abathumeli ababhali izinto zohlobo, noma babeka yonke into esicabheni. Ngakho akukho amasethi &quot;(type)&quot;, futhi isicabha ngasinye kumele sishintshwe ngokwaso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInani elifanayo livela esethini yohlobo nesethini yesibonelo.\u003C/strong\u003E Abanye abathumeli babhala ipharamitha endaweni ezimbili. Ezinye izinhlelo zingafunda noma iyiphi; shintsha zombili uma udinga ukuthi zivumelane.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkulindela ukukhetha &quot;zonke izinto zalolohlobo&quot; uzihlele ndawonye.\u003C/strong\u003E Akukho ukukhetha okuningi kule nguqulo. Isici sohlobo yindlela yokushintsha izinto eziningi ngesikhathi esisodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Setha umkhiqizi ohlobweni lomnyango ukuze zonke iminyango yalolohlobo ziwubonise, bese unikeza omunye umnyango isilinganiso sawo somlilo ngaphandle kokuthinta eminye. Lokhu kubonisa umehluko phakathi kwezici zohlobo nezezibonelo ku-BimCraft. Uhlobo noma isibonelo? Isibonelo siyeka into eyodwa: ithegi yayo, imaki yayo, igumbi layo, isilinganiso sayo somlilo. Isici sohlobo siyeka uhlobo okwabelwana ngalo izinto eziningi: umkhiqizi, imodeli, ububanzi bohlobo lomnyango. Kuphaneli Izici, amasethi avela ohlobweni anesithi \" (type)\" emva kwegama lawo nomugqa othi \"Isici sohlobo: ushintsho lapha lusebenza kuzo zonke izinto zalolohlobo.\" Yonke esinye isethi siyeka into ngokwayo. Uhlobo ebhlokini lokuqala lubonisa igama lohlobo. Izinyathelo: shintsha uhlobo Vula imodeli ye-IFC bese uchofoza umnyango. Qaphela Uhlobo lwawo ebhlokini lokuqala lephaneli Izici, isibonelo \"Single-Flush 900 x 2100\". Skrola kusethi igama layo eliphela ngo\" (type)\". Chofoza inani ofuna ukulishintsha, isibonelo Umkhiqizi. Thayipha inani elisha bese uchofoza Enter. Bheka uhlu Izinguquko: ukungena kuphethwe nge-\" (type)\". Chofoza omunye umnyango walolohlobo. Hlola inani elifanayo: nalo lisabonisa inani elisha. Izinyathelo: shintsha into eyodwa kuphela Chofoza umnyango oyodwa. Vula isethi engenalo \"(type)\" egameni layo, isibonelo Pset_DoorCommon. Chofoza inani, isibonelo FireRating, thayipha inani elisha bese uchofoza Enter. Chofoza umnyango oseduze nawo, owalolohlobo olufanayo. Hlola inani elifanayo: lisabonisa inani elidala. Noma uma umthumeli wedatha ewabelana ngaleso sethi phakathi kwezicabha zombili, i-BimCraft inikeza umnyango wokuqala ikhophi yawo ngaphambi kokuwushintsha. Bheka Kungani ushintsho lwakho lushintsha into eyodwa kuphela. Gcina Chofoza Gcina njenge-IFC noma cindezela Ctrl+S. Vula ikhophi egciniwe ku-BimCraft, noma kunoma yisiphi isibuki se-IFC, ukuze uhlole zombili izinguquko. Imiphumela ejwayelekile Akuwona wonke amamodeli anohlobo. Abanye abathumeli ababhali izinto zohlobo, noma babeka yonke into esicabheni. Ngakho akukho amasethi \"(type)\", futhi isicabha ngasinye kumele sishintshwe ngokwaso. Inani elifanayo livela esethini yohlobo nesethini yesibonelo. Abanye abathumeli babhala ipharamitha endaweni ezimbili. Ezinye izinhlelo zingafunda noma iyiphi; shintsha zombili uma udinga ukuthi zivumelane. Ukulindela ukukhetha \"zonke izinto zalolohlobo\" uzihlele ndawonye. Akukho ukukhetha okuningi kule nguqulo. Isici sohlobo yindlela yokushintsha izinto eziningi ngesikhathi esisodwa.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"piping-pcf","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Thumela ipayipi kuhlelo lwesitres noma le-isometric, bese ulifunda (PCF)","summary":"Bhala imigqa yamapayipi emodeli njengefayela lezingxenye zepayipi le-PCF, noma funda ifayela le-PCF kuhlelo lwesitres lwepayipi noma le-isometric bese udweba ipayipi lalo njengemigqa.","section":"tasks","order":58,"keywords":["pcf","piping component file","pipe stress","isometric","isometrics","hambisa","ngenisa","ukuxhuma kwamapayipi","izitshalo","ipayipi lensimbi","ukuhambisa umsebenzi","amanye amasoftware"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"hambisa","text":"Hambisa","level":2},{"id":"ngenisa","text":"Ngenisa","level":2},{"id":"hlola-okufikile","text":"Hlola okufikile","level":2},{"id":"ipayipi-elisesifakiwe-ku-faela-ye-ifc","text":"Ipayipi elisesifakiwe ku-faela ye-IFC","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-PCF ingumbhalo wombhalo owufunda futhi ubhale ohlelweni lwesitres lwepayipi namaisometric. Uhlu ngalinye lwezingxenye zomugqa wepayipi ngamaphoyinti alo okuphela nobubanzi balo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hambisa\"\u003EHambisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha ithuluzi le-Pipe. Umugqa wezinketho ubonisa \u003Cstrong\u003EHambisa i-PCF\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza kulo. Konke umugqa wepayipi kumodeli uyabhalwa: ipayipi eliqondile, ama-elbow (ukujika okungu-90 degrees, kungenjalo i-bend), ama-tee nephoyinti lawo legatsha, ama-reducer namavalvu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIfayela lisebenzisa amamillimitha. Ama-bore ngobubanzi obubizwa ngamamillimitha. Iphoyinti elimaphakathi le-elbow yikhoni lalo, lapho amagatsha awo amabili ahlangana khona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-PCF ibhalelwa ipayipi lensimbi lebutt-weld. Umugqa wempahla ehlukile nawo uyabhalwa, ngamakhodi wezingxenye zensimbi, futhi uyaphawulwa kwiphaneli Yezinkinga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ngenisa\"\u003ENgenisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha ithuluzi le-Pipe bese uchofoza \u003Cstrong\u003ENgenisa i-PCF…\u003C/strong\u003E, bese ukhetha ifayela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIpayipi eliqondile kuya kuma-elbow, ama-bend, amavalvu kanye namaflange liba umugqa owodwa esigabeni samanje. Ushintsho losayizi luqala umugqa omusha. Igatsha le-tee liba umugqa walo siqu oqala ephoyinteni le-tee.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImodeli yakha izixhumi zayo. Ama-reducer namatee awakopishwa: avela lapho imigqa yosayizi abahlukile, noma igatsha, lihlangana khona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmaphakama efayeleni afundwa njengamaphakama ngaphezu kwesigaba samanje. Imithwalo, izibambi kanye nokuhlaziya kwesitres ngokwako akusefayeleni le-PCF futhi akufiki.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlola-okufikile\"\u003EHlola okufikile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUbude bonke bepayipi ngomugqa ngamunye kufanele bufane nomthombo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIphaneli Yezinkinga ibhala, kanye kanye ngayinye: i-elbow ephoyinti lawo lesiqu elingafani ngobude kusuka kukho kokubili okuphela, ipayipi elingenabude, nebore elingeyona usayizi ojwayelekile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ipayipi-elisesifakiwe-ku-faela-ye-ifc\"\u003EIpayipi elisesifakiwe ku-faela ye-IFC\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma ifayela le-IFC livuliwe, \u003Cstrong\u003EHambisa i-PCF\u003C/strong\u003E futhi ibhala izingxenye zalo zepayipi, izixhumi namavalvu, eceleni kwemigqa oyidwetshile. Ingxenye ithola ukuphela kwayo kumaphothi ayo, noma kumaphethelo omzimba wayo. Ingxenye engenayo amaphothi iyashiywa ngaphandle futhi iphaneli Yezinkinga iyasho lokho. Ungahambisa kusuka ku-IFC kuphela uma imodeli ingenayo imigqa edwetshiwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELapho ungenisa, ama-supports, ama-olet, ama-flange, ama-gasket kanye nama-cap kufayela akudwetshwa. Iphaneli Yezinkinga ibala ukuthi kwashiywa kangaki kwngayinye, ukuze lutho lunganyamalali ngokungazelelwe.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza I-PCF ingumbhalo wombhalo owufunda futhi ubhale ohlelweni lwesitres lwepayipi namaisometric. Uhlu ngalinye lwezingxenye zomugqa wepayipi ngamaphoyinti alo okuphela nobubanzi balo. Hambisa Khetha ithuluzi le-Pipe. Umugqa wezinketho ubonisa Hambisa i-PCF. Chofoza kulo. Konke umugqa wepayipi kumodeli uyabhalwa: ipayipi eliqondile, ama-elbow (ukujika okungu-90 degrees, kungenjalo i-bend), ama-tee nephoyinti lawo legatsha, ama-reducer namavalvu. Ifayela lisebenzisa amamillimitha. Ama-bore ngobubanzi obubizwa ngamamillimitha. Iphoyinti elimaphakathi le-elbow yikhoni lalo, lapho amagatsha awo amabili ahlangana khona. I-PCF ibhalelwa ipayipi lensimbi lebutt-weld. Umugqa wempahla ehlukile nawo uyabhalwa, ngamakhodi wezingxenye zensimbi, futhi uyaphawulwa kwiphaneli Yezinkinga. Ngenisa Khetha ithuluzi le-Pipe bese uchofoza Ngenisa i-PCF…, bese ukhetha ifayela. Ipayipi eliqondile kuya kuma-elbow, ama-bend, amavalvu kanye namaflange liba umugqa owodwa esigabeni samanje. Ushintsho losayizi luqala umugqa omusha. Igatsha le-tee liba umugqa walo siqu oqala ephoyinteni le-tee. Imodeli yakha izixhumi zayo. Ama-reducer namatee awakopishwa: avela lapho imigqa yosayizi abahlukile, noma igatsha, lihlangana khona. Amaphakama efayeleni afundwa njengamaphakama ngaphezu kwesigaba samanje. Imithwalo, izibambi kanye nokuhlaziya kwesitres ngokwako akusefayeleni le-PCF futhi akufiki. Hlola okufikile Ubude bonke bepayipi ngomugqa ngamunye kufanele bufane nomthombo. Iphaneli Yezinkinga ibhala, kanye kanye ngayinye: i-elbow ephoyinti lawo lesiqu elingafani ngobude kusuka kukho kokubili okuphela, ipayipi elingenabude, nebore elingeyona usayizi ojwayelekile. Ipayipi elisesifakiwe ku-faela ye-IFC Uma ifayela le-IFC livuliwe, Hambisa i-PCF futhi ibhala izingxenye zalo zepayipi, izixhumi namavalvu, eceleni kwemigqa oyidwetshile. Ingxenye ithola ukuphela kwayo kumaphothi ayo, noma kumaphethelo omzimba wayo. Ingxenye engenayo amaphothi iyashiywa ngaphandle futhi iphaneli Yezinkinga iyasho lokho. Ungahambisa kusuka ku-IFC kuphela uma imodeli ingenayo imigqa edwetshiwe. Lapho ungenisa, ama-supports, ama-olet, ama-flange, ama-gasket kanye nama-cap kufayela akudwetshwa. Iphaneli Yezinkinga ibala ukuthi kwashiywa kangaki kwngayinye, ukuze lutho lunganyamalali ngokungazelelwe.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"read-rvt-file","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Funda ifayela lephrojekthi noma lomndeni","summary":"Vula ifayela le-.rvt, .rfa, .rte noma .rft bese ufunda ukukhishwa kwalo, ukusebenza ngokuhlanganyela, ulwazi lweprojekthi, amapharamitha omndeni, izixhumanisi nesithombe sokubuka, ngaphandle kwalolo hlelo elalenza.","section":"tasks","order":60,"keywords":["rvt","rfa","rte","rft","ifayela lephrojekthi","umndeni","ukukhishwa","inguqulo","iyiphi inguqulo","ibhildi","ukusebenza ngokuhlanganyela","central","ulwazi lweprojekthi","isithombe sokubuka","preview","thumbnail","izixhumanisi"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenziwa","text":"Okuzokwenziwa","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ubone","text":"Okufanele ubone","level":2},{"id":"kungani-kungekho-i-3d","text":"Kungani kungekho i-3D","level":2},{"id":"okuvamise-ukwenziwa-kabi","text":"Okuvamise ukwenziwa kabi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenziwa\"\u003EOkuzokwenziwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThola ukuthi kukhona ini efayeleni lephrojekthi noma lomndeni ngaphandle kokulivula ku-Revit: ukuthi yisiphi isikhundla esalilondoloza, uma lisebenza ngokuhlanganyela, ulwazi lweprojekthi nokuthi lixhumene nini. Kuyasiza uma ifayela lifika kuwe livela kwenye indawo futhi udinga ukwazi ukuthi kufanele livulwe kwisikhundla sini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha ifayela\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha ifayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.rvt\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.rfa\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.rte\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E.rft\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELinda isikhashana. Umugqa wesimo uthi &quot;Ifunda ifayela…&quot; bese &quot;Livuliwe \u003Cem\u003Eigama lefayela\u003C/em\u003E&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPhezulu kwekhadi, bheka isithombe sokubuka esilondolozwe efayeleni, uhlobo lwefayela nokukhishwa elalondolozwe kuso, negama lephrojekthi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESkrola phansi ufunde izigaba zekhadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ubone\"\u003EOkufanele ubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIkhadi maphakathi, nalezi zigaba uma ifayela lizibamba:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsigaba\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ELokho okusitshela kho\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFile\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIgama lefayela, usayizi, uhlobo (iphrojekthi, ithempulethi yephrojekthi, umndeni noma ithempulethi yomndeni), ukukhishwa nebhildi elalondolozwe kuzo, ukusebenza ngokuhlanganyela, indlela yemodeli emaphakathi, lapho kwalondolozwa khona okokugcina, ubani owalondoloza, ulimi, indawo ne-GUID yedokhumenti\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EProject information\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinkambu zephrojekthi ezakhe, njengegama, inombolo, iklayenti, ikheli nesimo. Izinkambu ezisahlala kwizinkomba zokuqala zephrojekthi entsha ziyashiywa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFamily, Family: …\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENgomndeni: igama, isigaba, ukukhishwa, ukubuyekezwa kokugcina namapharamitha wawo, iqembu ngeqembu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinked and referenced files\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYonke imodeli exhunyiwe, isixhumanisi se-CAD, isithombe nethebula lezitshoyo ifayela elibhekisela kuzo, nendlela yazo elondoloziwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEphaneli ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesobunxele iphinda izinhlobo ezibalulekile futhi yengeze \u003Cstrong\u003EKufundwe\u003C/strong\u003E: ingakanani ingxenye yefayela i-BimCraft eyifundile, ngokuvamile cishe i-40 KB kwefayela elinamamegabhithi amaningi ngosayizi. Ephaneli ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesokudla isho ukuthi izici zezinto zidinga imodeli ye-3D.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kungani-kungekho-i-3d\"\u003EKungani kungekho i-3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImodeli ye-3D nezinto ezisefayeleni lephrojekthi zigcinwe ngefomethi engachazwanga. I-BimCraft ifunda kuphela izingxenye zefayela ezichazwe noma ezifundeka kalula: ulwazi lwefayela, ulwazi lweprojekthi, idatha yomndeni, uhlu lwezixhumanisi nesithombe sokubuka. Ayiqagele okunye. Ukuze ubone imodeli ye-3D nokufunda izici zezinto, thumela i-IFC kuhlelo olwenza ifayela. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/rvt-to-ifc\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/rvt-to-ifc\"\u003EThola ifayela lephrojekthi ku-3D nge-IFC\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuvamise-ukwenziwa-kabi\"\u003EOkuvamise ukwenziwa kabi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkulindela i-3D.\u003C/strong\u003E Bheka ngenhla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzixhumanisi zibonisa indlela yazo elondoloziwe kuphela.\u003C/strong\u003E Ifayela elivulwa lodwa alikwazi ukuhlola ukuthi izixhumanisi zikhona. Vula ifolda lapho lihlala khona: i-BimCraft iyamaka ngalinye njengelitholakele noma kungatholakali. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/open-project-folder\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/open-project-folder\"\u003EVula ifolda yonke yephrojekthi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Lolu fayela alupheli…&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Ifayela liqunywe ngenkathi likhopishelwa, lilayishwa noma livunyelwa. Ifayela ledrayivu yefu elisesimweni &quot;online only&quot; nalo lenza lokhu. I-BimCraft isavula futhi ibonise okutholakele kuphela: isaziso esiphuzi phezulu kwekhadi, isigaba esithi \u003Cstrong\u003EKutholakele kulolu fayela\u003C/strong\u003E esilanda izingxenye ezinayo zonke amabhithi aseleyo kulo fayela, nesithi \u003Cstrong\u003EAkukho kulolu fayela\u003C/strong\u003E kwezinye. Akukho okugcwaliswayo engxenyeni eshoweyo, ngakho ukukhishwa, isithombe sokubuka noma ulwazi lweprojekthi kungashoda uma belondolozwe ngaphesheya kwalelo phoyinti elishoweyo. Uma uhlu lwezinto zefayela lunqunyiwe, akukho okuvulekayo. Kopisha ifayela kabusha bese uliphinda ukuze uthole ifayela eliphelele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Kulolu fayela akukho isithombe sokubuka&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Amanye amafayela alondolozwa engenalo. Lokho kujwayelekile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuvula ukusekelwa ngephutha.\u003C/strong\u003E Amafayela aqanjwe njengo-\u003Ccode\u003ETower.0004.rvt\u003C/code\u003E ngamabhaki anenombolo. Ukuvula ifolda kuwahlanganisa nemodeli yawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenziwa Thola ukuthi kukhona ini efayeleni lephrojekthi noma lomndeni ngaphandle kokulivula ku-Revit: ukuthi yisiphi isikhundla esalilondoloza, uma lisebenza ngokuhlanganyela, ulwazi lweprojekthi nokuthi lixhumene nini. Kuyasiza uma ifayela lifika kuwe livela kwenye indawo futhi udinga ukwazi ukuthi kufanele livulwe kwisikhundla sini. Izinyathelo Chofoza Khetha ifayela. Khetha ifayela le-.rvt, .rfa, .rte noma .rft. Linda isikhashana. Umugqa wesimo uthi \"Ifunda ifayela…\" bese \"Livuliwe igama lefayela\". Phezulu kwekhadi, bheka isithombe sokubuka esilondolozwe efayeleni, uhlobo lwefayela nokukhishwa elalondolozwe kuso, negama lephrojekthi. Skrola phansi ufunde izigaba zekhadi. Okufanele ubone Ikhadi maphakathi, nalezi zigaba uma ifayela lizibamba: Isigaba Lokho okusitshela kho File Igama lefayela, usayizi, uhlobo (iphrojekthi, ithempulethi yephrojekthi, umndeni noma ithempulethi yomndeni), ukukhishwa nebhildi elalondolozwe kuzo, ukusebenza ngokuhlanganyela, indlela yemodeli emaphakathi, lapho kwalondolozwa khona okokugcina, ubani owalondoloza, ulimi, indawo ne-GUID yedokhumenti Project information Izinkambu zephrojekthi ezakhe, njengegama, inombolo, iklayenti, ikheli nesimo. Izinkambu ezisahlala kwizinkomba zokuqala zephrojekthi entsha ziyashiywa. Family, Family: … Ngomndeni: igama, isigaba, ukukhishwa, ukubuyekezwa kokugcina namapharamitha wawo, iqembu ngeqembu Linked and referenced files Yonke imodeli exhunyiwe, isixhumanisi se-CAD, isithombe nethebula lezitshoyo ifayela elibhekisela kuzo, nendlela yazo elondoloziwe Ephaneli ye-File ngakwesobunxele iphinda izinhlobo ezibalulekile futhi yengeze Kufundwe: ingakanani ingxenye yefayela i-BimCraft eyifundile, ngokuvamile cishe i-40 KB kwefayela elinamamegabhithi amaningi ngosayizi. Ephaneli ye-Properties ngakwesokudla isho ukuthi izici zezinto zidinga imodeli ye-3D. Kungani kungekho i-3D Imodeli ye-3D nezinto ezisefayeleni lephrojekthi zigcinwe ngefomethi engachazwanga. I-BimCraft ifunda kuphela izingxenye zefayela ezichazwe noma ezifundeka kalula: ulwazi lwefayela, ulwazi lweprojekthi, idatha yomndeni, uhlu lwezixhumanisi nesithombe sokubuka. Ayiqagele okunye. Ukuze ubone imodeli ye-3D nokufunda izici zezinto, thumela i-IFC kuhlelo olwenza ifayela. Bheka Thola ifayela lephrojekthi ku-3D nge-IFC. Okuvamise ukwenziwa kabi Ukulindela i-3D. Bheka ngenhla. Izixhumanisi zibonisa indlela yazo elondoloziwe kuphela. Ifayela elivulwa lodwa alikwazi ukuhlola ukuthi izixhumanisi zikhona. Vula ifolda lapho lihlala khona: i-BimCraft iyamaka ngalinye njengelitholakele noma kungatholakali. Bheka Vula ifolda yonke yephrojekthi. \"Lolu fayela alupheli…\" Ifayela liqunywe ngenkathi likhopishelwa, lilayishwa noma livunyelwa. Ifayela ledrayivu yefu elisesimweni \"online only\" nalo lenza lokhu. I-BimCraft isavula futhi ibonise okutholakele kuphela: isaziso esiphuzi phezulu kwekhadi, isigaba esithi Kutholakele kulolu fayela esilanda izingxenye ezinayo zonke amabhithi aseleyo kulo fayela, nesithi Akukho kulolu fayela kwezinye. Akukho okugcwaliswayo engxenyeni eshoweyo, ngakho ukukhishwa, isithombe sokubuka noma ulwazi lweprojekthi kungashoda uma belondolozwe ngaphesheya kwalelo phoyinti elishoweyo. Uma uhlu lwezinto zefayela lunqunyiwe, akukho okuvulekayo. Kopisha ifayela kabusha bese uliphinda ukuze uthole ifayela eliphelele. \"Kulolu fayela akukho isithombe sokubuka\" Amanye amafayela alondolozwa engenalo. Lokho kujwayelekile. Ukuvula ukusekelwa ngephutha. Amafayela aqanjwe njengo-Tower.0004.rvt ngamabhaki anenombolo. Ukuvula ifolda kuwahlanganisa nemodeli yawo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"people-in-the-building","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Hambisa abantu esakhiweni","summary":"Ukuphuma kwabantu noma ukufika kwabantu bosuku olujwayelekile kumagumbi, emasivalweni nasezitebhisini, nemigqa lapho isakhiwo sincipha khona, ukuhamba okude kakhulu kuphuma kwigumbi ngalinye, nokutholakele njengezinkinga. Umfanekiso omncane wesixuku sezinqumo zokuklama, hhayi isitifiketi sokuvikela umlilo.","section":"tasks","order":60,"keywords":["abantu","ukuphuma","ukuphuma kwesakhiwo","ukuhamba okude","umugqa","isixuku","ukugeleza","ububanzi besivalo","izitebhisi","ukufika","ukuvimbeka","ukulingisa","abahlali","abahambi","yini uma","isivalo esivaliwe"],"headings":[{"id":"qalisa","text":"Qalisa","level":2},{"id":"yini-uma","text":"Yini uma…","level":2},{"id":"ukuthi-kusebenza-kanjani","text":"Ukuthi kusebenza kanjani","level":2},{"id":"abantu-egumbini-ngalinye","text":"Abantu egumbini ngalinye","level":2},{"id":"ukugeleza-okuphambene-emasivalweni","text":"Ukugeleza okuphambene emasivalweni","level":2},{"id":"izitebhisi-nezinhlanga","text":"Izitebhisi nezinhlanga","level":2},{"id":"ku-3d-view","text":"Ku-3D view","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAbantu esakhiweni\u003C/span\u003E ocezwini lwesobunxele luhamba abantu ngamagumbi, ngamasivalo nangezitebhisi zemodeli ye-IFC evulekile. Akukho okushintshwa emodelini futhi akukho okulayishwayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELokhu \u003Cstrong\u003Eingxenye yokuklama, hhayi isitifiketi sokuvikela umlilo\u003C/strong\u003E. Ayazi ngomlilo, intuthu, ukwesaba, umehluko wokunyakaza, noma okufunwa yikhodi kuwe. Imingcele ingeyakho: ukuhamba okude kakhulu kuphuma nesikhathi esitholakalayo yizinombolo ozibhalayo, akukho lutho olucatshangwayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qalisa\"\u003EQalisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula imodeli enamagumbi avaliwe namasivalo. Isivalo esinegumbi ohlangothini olulodwa siphuma; isivalo phakathi kwamagumbi amabili siwaxhumanisa; isitebhisi sixhuma amagumbi ezinhlangothini zaso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EUkuphuma\u003C/strong\u003E (wonke umuntu uhamba aye ophumeni), \u003Cstrong\u003EUkufika\u003C/strong\u003E (wonke umuntu uyangena bese ehamba aye egumbini) noma \u003Cstrong\u003EUkushintshana\u003C/strong\u003E (abantu egumbini baphuma kuthi abanye bangene ngasikhathi sinye), kanye nendawo yomgangatho ngomuntu ngamunye. Amagumbi aqanjwe njengendlela, isitebhisi, ihholo noma indlu yangasese awanabantu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQalisa\u003C/span\u003E. Uthola isikhathi sokuphuma komuntu wokugcina (nalapho kuphuma uhhafu nezingu-9 kwezingu-10), umugqa ezivalweni nasezitebhisini ngayinye, igumbi elinohambo olude kakhulu, nomklamo odlala ukuqalisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yini-uma\"\u003EYini uma…\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhipha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EValiwe\u003C/span\u003E esivalweni kutafula bese uqalisa futhi: abantu bathola enye indlela, noma amagumbi angenayo indlela yokuphuma aphawulwe njengamaphutha. Isivalo esibanzi kabili siphungula igumbi ngokushesha kakhulu; itafula likhombisa lapho kukhona imigqa khona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuthi-kusebenza-kanjani\"\u003EUkuthi kusebenza kanjani\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIgumbi ngalinye liyigridi, ngakho abantu bahamba ngaphambi kwamadonga, hhayi ngawo. Ijubane lehla igumbi lapho ligcwala (S = 1.4 (1 − 0.266 D) m/s, D ngabantu ngesikwele se-m²). Isivalo sidlulisa abantu ababili ngomzuzwana ngemitha ngayinye yobubanzi bayo, ngaphansi kuka-150 mm ohlangothini ngalunye; isitebhisi sidlulisa u-1.0 futhi abantu bahamba kancane. Abantu balinda ngomugqa owafika kuqala. Inombolo yokuqalisa iphinda ukuqalisa okufanayo ngokuqondile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmsizi ungaqalisa into efanayo: cela ukuphuma, noma ukuhamba okude kakhulu kuphuma kwigumbi ngalinye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"abantu-egumbini-ngalinye\"\u003EAbantu egumbini ngalinye\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAbantu egumbini ngalinye\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uthayiphe inombolo yanoma iyiphi igumbi. Ibhokisi elingenalutho lisebenzisa inani lendawo yomgangatho (libonakala ngombala ogreyi); 0 ihlanza igumbi. Izinombolo zakho zisetshenziselwa ukuqalisa futhi zigcinwa kulesi siphequluli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukugeleza-okuphambene-emasivalweni\"\u003EUkugeleza okuphambene emasivalweni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-\u003Cstrong\u003EUkushintshana\u003C/strong\u003E, abantu abaphumayo nabangenayo bahlangana emasivalweni afanayo. Lapho isivalo sidlula umuntu ohamba ngenye indlela eduze kakhulu nowokugcina, sigcina ingxenye yezinga lokudlula lapho (0.8 lapha; ukuqagela, ngoba amanani ashicilelwe ayahluka), futhi itafula libala ukushintsha kwendlela. Isivalo esishintsha indlela kaningi sibhalwa ohlwini lwezinkinga njengesaziso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izitebhisi-nezinhlanga\"\u003EIzitebhisi nezinhlanga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInhlanga ngayinye yesitebhisi ibiza umhambi isekhondi elilodwa ukuze aphenduke (ukuqagela). Isitebhisi esiqondile asinalo; isitebhisi esinesimo se-L noma se-U sinayo eyodwa. Izinga lesitebhisi lisathathwa ububanzi bolwendlela lwaso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-3d-view\"\u003EKu-3D view\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa abantu kumbono we-3D\u003C/span\u003E bese abahambi bavela njengezithombe emodelini, bamelwe ngemibala ngokwalokho abakwenzayo, futhi bahambe njengoba udlala ukuqalisa. Akukho okungezwa emodelini.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Abantu esakhiweni ocezwini lwesobunxele luhamba abantu ngamagumbi, ngamasivalo nangezitebhisi zemodeli ye-IFC evulekile. Akukho okushintshwa emodelini futhi akukho okulayishwayo. Lokhu ingxenye yokuklama, hhayi isitifiketi sokuvikela umlilo. Ayazi ngomlilo, intuthu, ukwesaba, umehluko wokunyakaza, noma okufunwa yikhodi kuwe. Imingcele ingeyakho: ukuhamba okude kakhulu kuphuma nesikhathi esitholakalayo yizinombolo ozibhalayo, akukho lutho olucatshangwayo. Qalisa Vula imodeli enamagumbi avaliwe namasivalo. Isivalo esinegumbi ohlangothini olulodwa siphuma; isivalo phakathi kwamagumbi amabili siwaxhumanisa; isitebhisi sixhuma amagumbi ezinhlangothini zaso. Khetha Ukuphuma (wonke umuntu uhamba aye ophumeni), Ukufika (wonke umuntu uyangena bese ehamba aye egumbini) noma Ukushintshana (abantu egumbini baphuma kuthi abanye bangene ngasikhathi sinye), kanye nendawo yomgangatho ngomuntu ngamunye. Amagumbi aqanjwe njengendlela, isitebhisi, ihholo noma indlu yangasese awanabantu. Chofoza Qalisa. Uthola isikhathi sokuphuma komuntu wokugcina (nalapho kuphuma uhhafu nezingu-9 kwezingu-10), umugqa ezivalweni nasezitebhisini ngayinye, igumbi elinohambo olude kakhulu, nomklamo odlala ukuqalisa. Yini uma… Khipha Valiwe esivalweni kutafula bese uqalisa futhi: abantu bathola enye indlela, noma amagumbi angenayo indlela yokuphuma aphawulwe njengamaphutha. Isivalo esibanzi kabili siphungula igumbi ngokushesha kakhulu; itafula likhombisa lapho kukhona imigqa khona. Ukuthi kusebenza kanjani Igumbi ngalinye liyigridi, ngakho abantu bahamba ngaphambi kwamadonga, hhayi ngawo. Ijubane lehla igumbi lapho ligcwala (S = 1.4 (1 − 0.266 D) m/s, D ngabantu ngesikwele se-m²). Isivalo sidlulisa abantu ababili ngomzuzwana ngemitha ngayinye yobubanzi bayo, ngaphansi kuka-150 mm ohlangothini ngalunye; isitebhisi sidlulisa u-1.0 futhi abantu bahamba kancane. Abantu balinda ngomugqa owafika kuqala. Inombolo yokuqalisa iphinda ukuqalisa okufanayo ngokuqondile. Umsizi ungaqalisa into efanayo: cela ukuphuma, noma ukuhamba okude kakhulu kuphuma kwigumbi ngalinye. Abantu egumbini ngalinye Vula Abantu egumbini ngalinye ukuze uthayiphe inombolo yanoma iyiphi igumbi. Ibhokisi elingenalutho lisebenzisa inani lendawo yomgangatho (libonakala ngombala ogreyi); 0 ihlanza igumbi. Izinombolo zakho zisetshenziselwa ukuqalisa futhi zigcinwa kulesi siphequluli. Ukugeleza okuphambene emasivalweni Ku-Ukushintshana, abantu abaphumayo nabangenayo bahlangana emasivalweni afanayo. Lapho isivalo sidlula umuntu ohamba ngenye indlela eduze kakhulu nowokugcina, sigcina ingxenye yezinga lokudlula lapho (0.8 lapha; ukuqagela, ngoba amanani ashicilelwe ayahluka), futhi itafula libala ukushintsha kwendlela. Isivalo esishintsha indlela kaningi sibhalwa ohlwini lwezinkinga njengesaziso. Izitebhisi nezinhlanga Inhlanga ngayinye yesitebhisi ibiza umhambi isekhondi elilodwa ukuze aphenduke (ukuqagela). Isitebhisi esiqondile asinalo; isitebhisi esinesimo se-L noma se-U sinayo eyodwa. Izinga lesitebhisi lisathathwa ububanzi bolwendlela lwaso. Ku-3D view Khetha Bonisa abantu kumbono we-3D bese abahambi bavela njengezithombe emodelini, bamelwe ngemibala ngokwalokho abakwenzayo, futhi bahambe njengoba udlala ukuqalisa. Akukho okungezwa emodelini.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"frame-analysis","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Hlaziya uhlaka lwesakhiwo","summary":"Amandla, okuphendula nokuphambuka kwamabhimu, amakholomu nezikhwepha zemodeli ngaphansi kwamacala womthwalo nezinhlanganisela ozisethayo, okugcinwa ku-IFC. Usizo lokuhlaziya, hhayi ukuhlola ikhodi.","section":"tasks","order":60,"keywords":["ukuhlaziya","amayunithi","amafidi namayintshi","iyunithi yokubonisa","ukuhlaziya kwesakhiwo","izinhlolo zedizayini","ukusetshenziswa","rolled","welded","AISC 360","EN 1993-1-1","ukuhlaziya kohlaka","imodeli yokuhlaziya","indlela yokuqina","imithwalo","icala lomthwalo","inhlanganisela","isisindo sakho","umthwalo ophilayo","ukuphendula","ukugoba kwebhimu","amandla e-axial","ukuphambuka","ukubukeka kokuphambuka","izinsimbi","izikhwepha","okuqinile","okukhululekile","umbiko","pdf","csv","craftscript","frame3d","amabhimu","amakholomu","izingxenye"],"headings":[{"id":"yenza-kanjani","text":"Yenza kanjani","level":2},{"id":"ukwakhiwa-kwemodeli-yokuhlaziya","text":"Ukwakhiwa kwemodeli yokuhlaziya","level":2},{"id":"amacala-izinhlanganisela-izimpawu-nombiko","text":"Amacala, izinhlanganisela, izimpawu nombiko","level":2},{"id":"amayunithi","text":"Amayunithi","level":2},{"id":"izinhlolo-zedizayini","text":"Izinhlolo zedizayini","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIthebhu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuhlaziya\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesokudla itholakala amandla emabhimini, amakholomu nezikhwepha emodeli evuliwe, izinhlanganisela ezisezinyaweni zamakholomu nokuthi izingxenye zigoba kangakanani, ngemithwalo oyinikezayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuyisisizo sokuhlaziya, \u003Cstrong\u003Ehhayi ukuhlola ikhodi\u003C/strong\u003E. Ukuhlaziya akusebenzisi ikhodi yokuklama: akulungisi izingxenye noma kuhlola amandla, futhi akukhethi izinxenye zemithwalo. Unjiniyela uhlola imodeli yokuhlaziya, imithwalo nokusekela, bese enquma ukuthi izinombolo zisho ukuthini. Ibhlokhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinhlolo zedizayini\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwayo ihlola amaI-shape ensimbi egoqiwe ngo-AISC 360 noma ngo-EN 1993-1-1, usizo kuze kubhekwe ngunjiniyela: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/frame-analysis#design-checks\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/frame-analysis\" data-hash=\"design-checks\"\u003EIzinhlolo zedizayini\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yenza-kanjani\"\u003EYenza kanjani\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula imodeli ye-IFC kanye nethebhu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuhlaziya\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha amabhimu, amakholomu noma izikhwepha ebhodweni lombono, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIcala\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmthwalo\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlangothi\u003C/span\u003E, thayipha inani bese ucindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza umthwalo\u003C/span\u003E: kN/m kumthwalo osabalele ngaphezu kwelungu, kN kumthwalo wephoyinti.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQalisa ukuhlaziya\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthebhula libala amandla amakhulu we-axial, ukusika, amabhendi, ukujikeka nokuphambuka kwelungu ngalinye; chofoza igama lelungu ukuze uyikhethe kumbono. Ngaphansi kukhona okuphendulwa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEmodelini\u003C/span\u003E udweba isimo esiphambukile, noma isenzo esisodwa njengedayagremu eceleni kwelungu ngalinye. Imiphumela iyahamba uma imodeli ishintsha: qalisa futhi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYonke imithwalo nesilungiselelo kuyinguquko eyodwa ohlwini \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinguquko\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlehlisa\u003C/span\u003E iyabuyisela emuva, futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGcina njenge-IFC\u003C/span\u003E iyazigcina kufayela (isethi yezici yephrojekthi \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_Analysis\u003C/code\u003E), ngakho ngokuvulwa kwemodeli kokulandelayo lapha imithwalo yayo isalapha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukwakhiwa-kwemodeli-yokuhlaziya\"\u003EUkwakhiwa kwemodeli yokuhlaziya\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYonke i-IfcBeam, i-IfcColumn ne-IfcMember okuyi-extrusion eyodwa eqondile ibe ilungu emgogodleni wesigaba sayo. Izici zesigaba zivela kuprofayili: izimo ze-I, U, L no-T, izikwele namatyubhu, izindilinga namatyubhu ajikelezile, noma noma yiliphi uhlaka oluvaliwe (khona-ke ukuqina kokujikeka kuyisilinganiso, kutshelwa emBikweni). Okunye akufakwa kanti kuyabalwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEmodelini, amabhimu amiswa ohlangothini lwekholomu futhi ahlale ngaphansi kwephansi. Ukuphela ngakunye kwelungu kuphethwa emgqeni wakho kuze kufike ku-axis yelungu okuxhumana nalo, uma leyo axis iseduze (cishe ngosayizi wezigaba), futhi leli lungu liyahlukaniswa khona. Umbiko utshela ukuthi amaphethelo angaki ahambile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinyawo zekholomu\u003C/strong\u003E lapho akukho okwehla ngaphansi kwazo ziyizisekelo: ezinqunyiwe (ukuqala) noma ezibanjiwe (zibanjwe endaweni nasekujikeni, zikhululekile ukujikeka).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmaphethelo ebhimu\u003C/strong\u003E aqinile noma abanjwe ngomthetho we-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkokugcina kwamabhimu ngaphandle kokuxhumana\u003C/span\u003E; \u003Cstrong\u003Eizikhwepha\u003C/strong\u003E (IfcMember) zibanjwe emaphethelweni omabili. Khetha ilungu elilodwa ukunikeza amaphethelo alo, noma unyawo lwekholomu, umthetho wawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinto ngegama: ukhonkolo (E = 30 GPa), ukhuni (E = 11 GPa), kungenjalo insimbi (E = 200 GPa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma uhlaka lunganyakaza lingagobi lutho — isistimu ehamba — ukuqalisa kuyama kutshele ukuthi kuphi nangasiphi isiqondiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amacala-izinhlanganisela-izimpawu-nombiko\"\u003EAmacala, izinhlanganisela, izimpawu nombiko\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuhlaziya kuqala nge-\u003Cstrong\u003EDead\u003C/strong\u003E (isisindo sakho), \u003Cstrong\u003ELive\u003C/strong\u003E ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EDead + live\u003C/strong\u003E; engeza amacala nezinhlanganisela ngezinto ezifunwa yikhodi yakho yokuklama. N &gt; 0 kuyinkanuko; My &gt; 0 ibeka uhlangothi lwelungu olungu −z esimweni sokuqina (ibhimu elishaywe yisisindo liba ne-My &gt; 0). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmbiko (PDF)\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmbiko (CSV)\u003C/span\u003E zinamaphepha okucabanga, izigaba, amacala, okuphendulwa nezinhlamba zazo, amandla ezingxenye, ukuphambuka nemvulophu. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela njenge-CraftScript\u003C/span\u003E ibhala uhlaka lwe-Script workspace ye-PartCraft, lapho umsebenzi wethala \u003Ccode\u003Eframe3d\u003C/code\u003E uyixazulula ngekhodi eyafundeka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIndlela ye-direct stiffness, eyilinear futhi eyi-first order ngaphandle uma uthikha \u003Cem\u003ESecond order (P-Delta)\u003C/em\u003E, ihlolwe ngamacala emibhalo yezifundo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESecond order (P-Delta).\u003C/strong\u003E Thikha \u003Cem\u003ESecond order (P-Delta)\u003C/em\u003E eduze kwe-Run: inhlanganisela ngayinye ixazululwa futhi ngamandla e-axial asebenza ohlakeni olugobile (ilungu ngalinye lisikwa libe izingxenye ezi-4, ukuze ukugoba kwelungu phakathi kwamaphethelo nakho kubalwe), kuze kuzinze amandla e-axial. Ulayini womphumela unikeza inani lamapasi nokuthi ukuhamba kukhule kangakanani; izikhathi, ukuphambuka, ukuhlolwa kwedizayini nombiko kusebenzisa lezi zimpendulo. Ngaphezu komthwalo ongakabi namandla wohlaka, ukuqalisa kuyama kutshele lokho. Iyi-elastic nezindlela ezincane, i-flexural kuphela, ngaphandle kokwehla kokuqina nemithwalo engabonakali (hhayi indlela ye-AISC direct analysis ngokwayo); amaslabhu, izindonga namaphansi aqinile ahlala kuma-first order.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkucindezela kwephansi kumaslabhu.\u003C/strong\u003E Kumaslabhu ekhonkolo (ukuhlaziya kufunda isilabhu njengamapuleti uma impahla yaso ingukhonkolo), ibhlokhi yemithwalo inayo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIngcindezelo kuwo wonke amaslabhu\u003C/span\u003E: thayipha kN/m², khetha icala elingenhla bese ucindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza kumaslabhu\u003C/span\u003E. Isatshalaliswa kuwo wonke amaslabhu ahlolwe ukuhlaziya, ehla phansi, futhi ibhalwe nesixhumanisi se-Remove. Ingcindezelo eyodwa kuwo wonke amaslabhu, hhayi eyodwa ngayinye, futhi akuyona imithwalo yekhodi: thayipha inani onikezwa unjiniyela wakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuqina kwemvelo (finite elements).\u003C/strong\u003E Ibhlokhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinhlayiya ezingaphelile: amafrikhwensi wemvelo\u003C/span\u003E ingaphansi kwemiphumela ithola izindlela eziphansi zemodeli efanayo ngenjini ye-finite element: amabhimu nokukhishwa kwawo emaphethelweni, amaslabhu nezindonga njengamashell amane amapuleti, amaphansi aqinile nokusekela. Khetha inani lezindlela (3, 6, 10 noma 20) nesilabhu element (i-four-node shell yamaslabhu ajulile noma amancane, noma eyesilabhu esincane) bese ucindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThola amafrikhwensi\u003C/span\u003E. Ithebhula linikeza ifrikhwensi yendlela ngayinye ngo-Hz, isikhathi sayo ngamasekhondi nobunzima bayo obusebenzayo ngomugqa wakwa-X, Y no-Z njengengxenye yobunzima obungahamba. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa kumodeli\u003C/span\u003E udweba noma yiyiphi indlela njengoba kudwetshwa isimo esiphambukile. Ubunzima bukhona ukuminyana kwempahla ngevolumu; imithwalo ayengezi ubunzima, futhi impahla engenaso ukuminyana ayinabo. Umbiko (PDF, CSV) unethebhula. Kuyi-elastic futhi kuncane kuphela ngokuhamba, akukho mthwalo wokuzamazama noma womoya owenziwa ngekhodi lapha. Akuhlolwa ngekhodi; unjiniyela wakho ubuyekeza imiphumela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsipektra yokuphendula, umlando wesikhathi ne-pushover.\u003C/strong\u003E Ezinye izibhlokhi ezintathu zisezansi kwamafrikhwensi, zisebenzisa imodeli efanayo ye-finite element. Ubunzima bazo bonke buyinhlanganisela yokuminyana kwempahla nemithwalo ephansi yamacala owakhethayo, ngayinye iphindaphindwa ngesisetshenziswa othayipha (isibonelo Dead ku-1 nemithwalo Live engxenyeni oyibala njengobunzima).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsipektra yokuphendula\u003C/span\u003E ifunda imodi ngayinye kusuka ku-spectrum oyinikezayo (ithebhula lesikhathi nokusheshisa, noma isimo se-ASCE 7 kusuka ku-SDS, SD1 ne-TL; inkinobho \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESebenzisa amanani webhlokhi lokunyakaza komhlaba\u003C/span\u003E ikopisha lawo kusuka kubhlokhi yokunyakaza komhlaba) bese ihlanganisa izindlela nge-CQC, SRSS, umthetho wamaphesenti ayishumi noma isamba esiphelele, bese ihlanganisa izikhombisi ze-X, Y no-Z (100 % + 30 % noma SRSS). Inikeza isisindo sokuqala, ukuhamba kwamazinga, amandla amaphethelo elungu nethebhula lezindlela elisho uma izindlela ezisetshenzisiwe zithwele ngaphansi kuka-90 % wobunzima. Ungalinganisa imiphumela ngesisetshenziswa noma kuya kusisindo sokuqala othayipha; ibhlokhi ayilibali lesi sisindo ngokwayo. Imiphumela ayinazo izimpawu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmlando wesikhathi\u003C/span\u003E usebenzisa ukusheshisa komhlaba ngokusebenzisa ukuhlanganiswa kwemodi (kuphelele ezintweni ezilula zerekhodi phakathi kwamaphoyinti) noma ngokuhlanganiswa okuqondile (Newmark average acceleration nedampingi ye-Rayleigh). Okokufaka kungu-sine noma i-pulse eyenziwe (inamelwe njengesifanekiso njalo), irekhodi oliliphastayo, noma ifayela lombhalo oliyivulayo (isikhathi nokusheshisa, okulodwa ngomugqa ngalinye nesinyathelo, noma ifayela elifana ne-PEER enomkhawulo we-DT=; ngo-g noma m/s²). Inikeza ukuhamba kophahla nesisekelo sesisekelo ngesikhathi, ukuhamba kwezinga ngalinye, nemvulophu yamandla amaphethelo ezingxenye. Imodeli enerekhodi elide kakhulu igcina lona ngesikhathi sokusebenza kuphela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPushover\u003C/span\u003E ishayela uphahla ngakohlangothini ngezinyathelo ezincane (iphethini efana nemodi yokuqala, noma efanayo), nezikhombisi zepulastiki emaphethelweni ezingxenye ezinesimo se-I. Isikhombisi siyavuma ngokunyathela okuyisibonelo, okuphansi njengoba amandla e-axial ekhula (kubalwa kusuka esimweni esidwetshiwe, ama-fillet ayashiywa); ukuqina ngokuhlasela kuyisinqumo, i-P-delta iyisinqumo, nenhlanganisela yomhlabathi ingasetshenziswa kuqala. Inikeza ijika lokuthwala (isisindo sokuqala ngokuhamba kophahla), isikhombisi sokuqala, nesimo nokujikeka kwepulastiki kwesikhombisi ngasinye. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQalisa umlando wesikhathi ongeyona-linear\u003C/span\u003E isebenzisa izikhombisi ezifanayo ngaphansi kwerekhodi lebhlokhi yoMlando wesikhathi emamodeli amancane. Izikhombisi zakha emaphethelweni wezingxenye kuphela (beka inodi lapho kufanele kwakheke khona ngaphakathi kwesikhala); ilungu elikhululekile emaphethelweni omabili alithola lutho; ukuvuthwa nokugoba kwamabhrasi akumodelwa; amaslabhu nezindonga zihlala ze-elastic; akukho mibandela yokwamukelwa enikeziwe. Akuhlolwa ngekhodi; unjiniyela wakho ubuyekeza imiphumela. Izilungiselelo zigcinwa nemodeli, nombiko uhlanganisa amathebhula.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAkukakwakhiwa: ukuvuthwa (buckling), ukulungiswa kwesisindo ekusabalaliseni kwesipektra, ukukalwa kwerekhodi, imibandela yokwamukelwa yamahinji, imithwalo yezindawo ngaphandle kwalowo mcindezelo oyedwa wawo wonke amaslabhu, ukuthuthwa kwamalungu, izikhwepha ezikhuphuka kuphela, izindonga namaslabhu ohlakeni, nokuhlolwa kwezakhiwo zensimbi ezingegoqiwe nezigaba ezingezona i-I ezigoqiwe. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EOkungakakwakhiwa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amayunithi\"\u003EAmayunithi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUbude ulandela iyunithi oyikhethayo ku-toolbar (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmayunithi\u003C/span\u003E), njengakho konke kwe-BimCraft: izindawo zemithwalo oyithayipha futhi oyibona (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKusuka\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKuya ku\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgo\u003C/span\u003E), amaphuzu emithwalo yenodi nokuphendula, ukuphakama kwamaphansi ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESeismic\u003C/span\u003E, nezikholomu zokuphambuka nokuhamba (amafidi namayintshi akhombisa lezi zinde ezincane ngamayintshi ezinhlamvu). Shintsha iyunithi noma nini; ithebhu iyabuya. Amandla agcina ku-kN nokN·m, nombiko (PDF, CSV) nefayela le-CraftScript zigcina ngamamilimitha nokuthi iyunithi ibhalwe. Usayizi wezigaba, ububanzi bamabha nokumbozwa ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkhonkolo\u003C/span\u003E kuhlala ngamamilimitha, njengoba zibizwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinhlolo-zedizayini\"\u003EIzinhlolo zedizayini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIbhlokhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinhlolo zedizayini\u003C/span\u003E (efana neyeDetailCraft) ithatha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIkhodi yedizayini\u003C/span\u003E, ASCE 7 + AISC 360 noma EN 1990 + EN 1993-1-1, nezinga lensimbi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbanga lensimbi\u003C/span\u003E. Nika icala ngalinye lomthwalo uhlobo lwalo (isisindo sakho, esiphilayo, umoya …) bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDala izinhlanganisela\u003C/span\u003E ibhala izinhlanganisela zomthwalo wekhodi yezimpahla zakho; ukuhlaziya kuzisebenzisa njengoba kunjalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlola izingxenye\u003C/span\u003E bese ihlola i-I-shape ngayinye ensimbi egoqiwe ngezinhlolo ze-DetailCraft (ukuqina, ukucindezela nokuvuthwa, ukugoba nokuvuthwa kwe-lateral-torsional, ukusika, ukugoba nomthwalo we-axial, ukuphambuka; izigatshana zisemBikweni) ibonise ukuthi isebenzisa kangakanani ukuthwala kwayo, ikhombise ngombala emodelini. Iyisisizo \u003Cstrong\u003Eaze unjiniyela ayibuyekeze\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzingxenye ezihlolwayo.\u003C/strong\u003E Ifayela le-IFC alisho ukuthi i-I-shape yensimbi igoqiwe noma iwelded, ngakho i-BimCraft iyithatha njengegoqiwe kuphela uma igama layo leprofayili (noma igama lohlobo lwento) liyisayizi kumathebula e-AISC W noma S noma i-EN 10365 IPE, HEA noma HEB (\u003Ccode\u003EW12x26\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EIPE 300\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EHEA200\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EHE 200 A\u003C/code\u003E) \u003Cstrong\u003Efuthi\u003C/strong\u003E ukujula, ububanzi, ukhalo nemiphetho efayeleni kuvumelana nalowo sayizi ngaphakathi kuka-1 %. Yonke enye i-I-shape (i-plate girder, usayizi ngegama elihlukile, usayizi oguquliwe) ithathwa njengewelded futhi ibuyela \u003Cstrong\u003Eingahlolwanga\u003C/strong\u003E, kanjalo namatyubhu, ama-angle, ama-channel namanye amasekhishini, izingxenye ezincane nokujikeka. Hlola lezo zilungu nonjiniyela.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ithebhu Ukuhlaziya ngakwesokudla itholakala amandla emabhimini, amakholomu nezikhwepha emodeli evuliwe, izinhlanganisela ezisezinyaweni zamakholomu nokuthi izingxenye zigoba kangakanani, ngemithwalo oyinikezayo. Kuyisisizo sokuhlaziya, hhayi ukuhlola ikhodi. Ukuhlaziya akusebenzisi ikhodi yokuklama: akulungisi izingxenye noma kuhlola amandla, futhi akukhethi izinxenye zemithwalo. Unjiniyela uhlola imodeli yokuhlaziya, imithwalo nokusekela, bese enquma ukuthi izinombolo zisho ukuthini. Ibhlokhi Izinhlolo zedizayini ngaphansi kwayo ihlola amaI-shape ensimbi egoqiwe ngo-AISC 360 noma ngo-EN 1993-1-1, usizo kuze kubhekwe ngunjiniyela: bona Izinhlolo zedizayini. Yenza kanjani Vula imodeli ye-IFC kanye nethebhu Ukuhlaziya. Khetha amabhimu, amakholomu noma izikhwepha ebhodweni lombono, khetha Icala, Umthwalo ne-Uhlangothi, thayipha inani bese ucindezela Engeza umthwalo: kN/m kumthwalo osabalele ngaphezu kwelungu, kN kumthwalo wephoyinti. Cindezela Qalisa ukuhlaziya. Ithebhula libala amandla amakhulu we-axial, ukusika, amabhendi, ukujikeka nokuphambuka kwelungu ngalinye; chofoza igama lelungu ukuze uyikhethe kumbono. Ngaphansi kukhona okuphendulwa. Emodelini udweba isimo esiphambukile, noma isenzo esisodwa njengedayagremu eceleni kwelungu ngalinye. Imiphumela iyahamba uma imodeli ishintsha: qalisa futhi. Yonke imithwalo nesilungiselelo kuyinguquko eyodwa ohlwini Izinguquko: Hlehlisa iyabuyisela emuva, futhi Gcina njenge-IFC iyazigcina kufayela (isethi yezici yephrojekthi CadCraft_Analysis), ngakho ngokuvulwa kwemodeli kokulandelayo lapha imithwalo yayo isalapha. Ukwakhiwa kwemodeli yokuhlaziya Yonke i-IfcBeam, i-IfcColumn ne-IfcMember okuyi-extrusion eyodwa eqondile ibe ilungu emgogodleni wesigaba sayo. Izici zesigaba zivela kuprofayili: izimo ze-I, U, L no-T, izikwele namatyubhu, izindilinga namatyubhu ajikelezile, noma noma yiliphi uhlaka oluvaliwe (khona-ke ukuqina kokujikeka kuyisilinganiso, kutshelwa emBikweni). Okunye akufakwa kanti kuyabalwa. Emodelini, amabhimu amiswa ohlangothini lwekholomu futhi ahlale ngaphansi kwephansi. Ukuphela ngakunye kwelungu kuphethwa emgqeni wakho kuze kufike ku-axis yelungu okuxhumana nalo, uma leyo axis iseduze (cishe ngosayizi wezigaba), futhi leli lungu liyahlukaniswa khona. Umbiko utshela ukuthi amaphethelo angaki ahambile. Izinyawo zekholomu lapho akukho okwehla ngaphansi kwazo ziyizisekelo: ezinqunyiwe (ukuqala) noma ezibanjiwe (zibanjwe endaweni nasekujikeni, zikhululekile ukujikeka). Amaphethelo ebhimu aqinile noma abanjwe ngomthetho we-Okokugcina kwamabhimu ngaphandle kokuxhumana; izikhwepha (IfcMember) zibanjwe emaphethelweni omabili. Khetha ilungu elilodwa ukunikeza amaphethelo alo, noma unyawo lwekholomu, umthetho wawo. Izinto ngegama: ukhonkolo (E = 30 GPa), ukhuni (E = 11 GPa), kungenjalo insimbi (E = 200 GPa). Uma uhlaka lunganyakaza lingagobi lutho — isistimu ehamba — ukuqalisa kuyama kutshele ukuthi kuphi nangasiphi isiqondiso. Amacala, izinhlanganisela, izimpawu nombiko Ukuhlaziya kuqala nge-Dead (isisindo sakho), Live ne-Dead + live; engeza amacala nezinhlanganisela ngezinto ezifunwa yikhodi yakho yokuklama. N \u003E 0 kuyinkanuko; My \u003E 0 ibeka uhlangothi lwelungu olungu −z esimweni sokuqina (ibhimu elishaywe yisisindo liba ne-My \u003E 0). Umbiko (PDF) ne-Umbiko (CSV) zinamaphepha okucabanga, izigaba, amacala, okuphendulwa nezinhlamba zazo, amandla ezingxenye, ukuphambuka nemvulophu. Thumela njenge-CraftScript ibhala uhlaka lwe-Script workspace ye-PartCraft, lapho umsebenzi wethala frame3d uyixazulula ngekhodi eyafundeka. Indlela ye-direct stiffness, eyilinear futhi eyi-first order ngaphandle uma uthikha Second order (P-Delta), ihlolwe ngamacala emibhalo yezifundo. Second order (P-Delta). Thikha Second order (P-Delta) eduze kwe-Run: inhlanganisela ngayinye ixazululwa futhi ngamandla e-axial asebenza ohlakeni olugobile (ilungu ngalinye lisikwa libe izingxenye ezi-4, ukuze ukugoba kwelungu phakathi kwamaphethelo nakho kubalwe), kuze kuzinze amandla e-axial. Ulayini womphumela unikeza inani lamapasi nokuthi ukuhamba kukhule kangakanani; izikhathi, ukuphambuka, ukuhlolwa kwedizayini nombiko kusebenzisa lezi zimpendulo. Ngaphezu komthwalo ongakabi namandla wohlaka, ukuqalisa kuyama kutshele lokho. Iyi-elastic nezindlela ezincane, i-flexural kuphela, ngaphandle kokwehla kokuqina nemithwalo engabonakali (hhayi indlela ye-AISC direct analysis ngokwayo); amaslabhu, izindonga namaphansi aqinile ahlala kuma-first order. Ukucindezela kwephansi kumaslabhu. Kumaslabhu ekhonkolo (ukuhlaziya kufunda isilabhu njengamapuleti uma impahla yaso ingukhonkolo), ibhlokhi yemithwalo inayo Ingcindezelo kuwo wonke amaslabhu: thayipha kN/m², khetha icala elingenhla bese ucindezela Engeza kumaslabhu. Isatshalaliswa kuwo wonke amaslabhu ahlolwe ukuhlaziya, ehla phansi, futhi ibhalwe nesixhumanisi se-Remove. Ingcindezelo eyodwa kuwo wonke amaslabhu, hhayi eyodwa ngayinye, futhi akuyona imithwalo yekhodi: thayipha inani onikezwa unjiniyela wakho. Ukuqina kwemvelo (finite elements). Ibhlokhi Izinhlayiya ezingaphelile: amafrikhwensi wemvelo ingaphansi kwemiphumela ithola izindlela eziphansi zemodeli efanayo ngenjini ye-finite element: amabhimu nokukhishwa kwawo emaphethelweni, amaslabhu nezindonga njengamashell amane amapuleti, amaphansi aqinile nokusekela. Khetha inani lezindlela (3, 6, 10 noma 20) nesilabhu element (i-four-node shell yamaslabhu ajulile noma amancane, noma eyesilabhu esincane) bese ucindezela Thola amafrikhwensi. Ithebhula linikeza ifrikhwensi yendlela ngayinye ngo-Hz, isikhathi sayo ngamasekhondi nobunzima bayo obusebenzayo ngomugqa wakwa-X, Y no-Z njengengxenye yobunzima obungahamba. Bonisa kumodeli udweba noma yiyiphi indlela njengoba kudwetshwa isimo esiphambukile. Ubunzima bukhona ukuminyana kwempahla ngevolumu; imithwalo ayengezi ubunzima, futhi impahla engenaso ukuminyana ayinabo. Umbiko (PDF, CSV) unethebhula. Kuyi-elastic futhi kuncane kuphela ngokuhamba, akukho mthwalo wokuzamazama noma womoya owenziwa ngekhodi lapha. Akuhlolwa ngekhodi; unjiniyela wakho ubuyekeza imiphumela. Isipektra yokuphendula, umlando wesikhathi ne-pushover. Ezinye izibhlokhi ezintathu zisezansi kwamafrikhwensi, zisebenzisa imodeli efanayo ye-finite element. Ubunzima bazo bonke buyinhlanganisela yokuminyana kwempahla nemithwalo ephansi yamacala owakhethayo, ngayinye iphindaphindwa ngesisetshenziswa othayipha (isibonelo Dead ku-1 nemithwalo Live engxenyeni oyibala njengobunzima). Isipektra yokuphendula ifunda imodi ngayinye kusuka ku-spectrum oyinikezayo (ithebhula lesikhathi nokusheshisa, noma isimo se-ASCE 7 kusuka ku-SDS, SD1 ne-TL; inkinobho Sebenzisa amanani webhlokhi lokunyakaza komhlaba ikopisha lawo kusuka kubhlokhi yokunyakaza komhlaba) bese ihlanganisa izindlela nge-CQC, SRSS, umthetho wamaphesenti ayishumi noma isamba esiphelele, bese ihlanganisa izikhombisi ze-X, Y no-Z (100 % + 30 % noma SRSS). Inikeza isisindo sokuqala, ukuhamba kwamazinga, amandla amaphethelo elungu nethebhula lezindlela elisho uma izindlela ezisetshenzisiwe zithwele ngaphansi kuka-90 % wobunzima. Ungalinganisa imiphumela ngesisetshenziswa noma kuya kusisindo sokuqala othayipha; ibhlokhi ayilibali lesi sisindo ngokwayo. Imiphumela ayinazo izimpawu. Umlando wesikhathi usebenzisa ukusheshisa komhlaba ngokusebenzisa ukuhlanganiswa kwemodi (kuphelele ezintweni ezilula zerekhodi phakathi kwamaphoyinti) noma ngokuhlanganiswa okuqondile (Newmark average acceleration nedampingi ye-Rayleigh). Okokufaka kungu-sine noma i-pulse eyenziwe (inamelwe njengesifanekiso njalo), irekhodi oliliphastayo, noma ifayela lombhalo oliyivulayo (isikhathi nokusheshisa, okulodwa ngomugqa ngalinye nesinyathelo, noma ifayela elifana ne-PEER enomkhawulo we-DT=; ngo-g noma m/s²). Inikeza ukuhamba kophahla nesisekelo sesisekelo ngesikhathi, ukuhamba kwezinga ngalinye, nemvulophu yamandla amaphethelo ezingxenye. Imodeli enerekhodi elide kakhulu igcina lona ngesikhathi sokusebenza kuphela. Pushover ishayela uphahla ngakohlangothini ngezinyathelo ezincane (iphethini efana nemodi yokuqala, noma efanayo), nezikhombisi zepulastiki emaphethelweni ezingxenye ezinesimo se-I. Isikhombisi siyavuma ngokunyathela okuyisibonelo, okuphansi njengoba amandla e-axial ekhula (kubalwa kusuka esimweni esidwetshiwe, ama-fillet ayashiywa); ukuqina ngokuhlasela kuyisinqumo, i-P-delta iyisinqumo, nenhlanganisela yomhlabathi ingasetshenziswa kuqala. Inikeza ijika lokuthwala (isisindo sokuqala ngokuhamba kophahla), isikhombisi sokuqala, nesimo nokujikeka kwepulastiki kwesikhombisi ngasinye. Qalisa umlando wesikhathi ongeyona-linear isebenzisa izikhombisi ezifanayo ngaphansi kwerekhodi lebhlokhi yoMlando wesikhathi emamodeli amancane. Izikhombisi zakha emaphethelweni wezingxenye kuphela (beka inodi lapho kufanele kwakheke khona ngaphakathi kwesikhala); ilungu elikhululekile emaphethelweni omabili alithola lutho; ukuvuthwa nokugoba kwamabhrasi akumodelwa; amaslabhu nezindonga zihlala ze-elastic; akukho mibandela yokwamukelwa enikeziwe. Akuhlolwa ngekhodi; unjiniyela wakho ubuyekeza imiphumela. Izilungiselelo zigcinwa nemodeli, nombiko uhlanganisa amathebhula. Akukakwakhiwa: ukuvuthwa (buckling), ukulungiswa kwesisindo ekusabalaliseni kwesipektra, ukukalwa kwerekhodi, imibandela yokwamukelwa yamahinji, imithwalo yezindawo ngaphandle kwalowo mcindezelo oyedwa wawo wonke amaslabhu, ukuthuthwa kwamalungu, izikhwepha ezikhuphuka kuphela, izindonga namaslabhu ohlakeni, nokuhlolwa kwezakhiwo zensimbi ezingegoqiwe nezigaba ezingezona i-I ezigoqiwe. Bona Okungakakwakhiwa. Amayunithi Ubude ulandela iyunithi oyikhethayo ku-toolbar (Amayunithi), njengakho konke kwe-BimCraft: izindawo zemithwalo oyithayipha futhi oyibona (Kusuka, Kuya ku, Ngo), amaphuzu emithwalo yenodi nokuphendula, ukuphakama kwamaphansi ku-Seismic, nezikholomu zokuphambuka nokuhamba (amafidi namayintshi akhombisa lezi zinde ezincane ngamayintshi ezinhlamvu). Shintsha iyunithi noma nini; ithebhu iyabuya. Amandla agcina ku-kN nokN·m, nombiko (PDF, CSV) nefayela le-CraftScript zigcina ngamamilimitha nokuthi iyunithi ibhalwe. Usayizi wezigaba, ububanzi bamabha nokumbozwa ku-Ukhonkolo kuhlala ngamamilimitha, njengoba zibizwa. Izinhlolo zedizayini Ibhlokhi Izinhlolo zedizayini (efana neyeDetailCraft) ithatha Ikhodi yedizayini, ASCE 7 + AISC 360 noma EN 1990 + EN 1993-1-1, nezinga lensimbi Ibanga lensimbi. Nika icala ngalinye lomthwalo uhlobo lwalo (isisindo sakho, esiphilayo, umoya …) bese Dala izinhlanganisela ibhala izinhlanganisela zomthwalo wekhodi yezimpahla zakho; ukuhlaziya kuzisebenzisa njengoba kunjalo. Hlola izingxenye bese ihlola i-I-shape ngayinye ensimbi egoqiwe ngezinhlolo ze-DetailCraft (ukuqina, ukucindezela nokuvuthwa, ukugoba nokuvuthwa kwe-lateral-torsional, ukusika, ukugoba nomthwalo we-axial, ukuphambuka; izigatshana zisemBikweni) ibonise ukuthi isebenzisa kangakanani ukuthwala kwayo, ikhombise ngombala emodelini. Iyisisizo aze unjiniyela ayibuyekeze. Izingxenye ezihlolwayo. Ifayela le-IFC alisho ukuthi i-I-shape yensimbi igoqiwe noma iwelded, ngakho i-BimCraft iyithatha njengegoqiwe kuphela uma igama layo leprofayili (noma igama lohlobo lwento) liyisayizi kumathebula e-AISC W noma S noma i-EN 10365 IPE, HEA noma HEB (W12x26, IPE 300, HEA200, HE 200 A) futhi ukujula, ububanzi, ukhalo nemiphetho efayeleni kuvumelana nalowo sayizi ngaphakathi kuka-1 %. Yonke enye i-I-shape (i-plate girder, usayizi ngegama elihlukile, usayizi oguquliwe) ithathwa njengewelded futhi ibuyela ingahlolwanga, kanjalo namatyubhu, ama-angle, ama-channel namanye amasekhishini, izingxenye ezincane nokujikeka. Hlola lezo zilungu nonjiniyela.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"assistants","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Vumela umsizi we-AI asebenze nemodeli yakho","summary":"Vula abasizi ku-Izilungiselelo ukuze umsizi ekhompyutheni yakho athole izakhi, afunde izici zazo, azihlukanise embonweni, adwebe izindonga, iminyango, amawindi, amaphansi, amazinga namagridi, ngoCadCraft Studio. Kuvaliwe kuze kuvulwe.","section":"tasks","order":60,"keywords":["ai","umsizi","mcp","isikripthi","ukuzenzakalela","studio","thola izakhi","hlukanisa","izici","izimvume","nqamula","umsebenzi","dweba izindonga","engeza iminyango","engeza amawindi","amazinga","amagridi","amaphansi","hlehlisa","londoloza","umugqa womyalo","cli","ngaphandle kwewindi","sebenzisa nabasizi be-ai"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzofunda","text":"Okuzofunda","level":2},{"id":"okwenziwa-umsizi-ku-bimcraft","text":"Okwenziwa umsizi ku-BimCraft","level":2},{"id":"vula","text":"Vula","level":2},{"id":"uma-umsizi-exhunyiwe","text":"Uma umsizi exhunyiwe","level":2},{"id":"ngaphandle-kwewindi-izikripthi-nomugqa-womyalo","text":"Ngaphandle kwewindi: izikripthi nomugqa womyalo","level":2},{"id":"vala","text":"Vala","level":2},{"id":"bona-nakho","text":"Bona nakho","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzofunda\"\u003EOkuzofunda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIndlela yokuvumela umsizi we-AI (noma yimuphi umsizi okhuluma i-MCP) ukuthi abheke imodeli ye-IFC evulekile futhi adwebe kuyo, okwazi ukukwenza nokungakwazi, nendlela yokumisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okwenziwa-umsizi-ku-bimcraft\"\u003EOkwenziwa umsizi ku-BimCraft\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIcela ukuthi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKwenzekani\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKudinga\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThola izakhi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUthola uhlu lwezakhi ngohlobo, izinga, igama noma inani lesici, njengoba \u003Cstrong\u003EThola\u003C/strong\u003E kwenza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFunda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFunda izici\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUthola izici zesakhi esisodwa, uhlobo, amasethi wezici nezinani, njengoba \u003Cstrong\u003EIzici\u003C/strong\u003E zikubonisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFunda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChaza imodeli, ohlu lwezindonga\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUthola amazinga, izindonga, iminyango, amawindi, amagumbi, amaphansi, amagridi namakholomu, nezimpelo, uhlobo nobude bongadonga ngamunye\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFunda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHlukanisa, bonakalise ngaphansi, fihla noma bonisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmbono we-3D uyashintsha njengoba ubuke usebenzise imenyu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShintsha umbono nokudweba\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDweba izindonga, iminyango, amawindi, amaphansi, amazinga noma imigqa yegridi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImodeli iyashintsha njengoba ubuke usebenzise amathuluzi e-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDweba\u003C/span\u003E: izindonga ziyahlangana, amagumbi, amaphansi nemifula alandela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShintsha umbono nokudweba\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShintsha igama noma inani lesici\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIgama, Incazelo, Uhlobo lwento noma Ithegi lesakhi esisodwa, noma inani lesici. Inani elabelana ngalo nezinye izakhi likopishelwa kuqala; inani lohlobo lishintsha kuphela uma umsizi esho, ngoba yonke into yalolohlobo iyalandela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShintsha umbono nokudweba\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHambisa, susa, shintsha izindonga, iminyango namawindi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzakhi ziyahanjiswa noma ziyasuswa kanye nalokho okuzibambele; izindonga ezidwetshwe ngamathuluzi e-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDweba\u003C/span\u003E zishintsha ngezimpelo noma uhlobo lwazo, iminyango namawindi ngendawo, usayizi noma uhlobo lwazo, amagumbi nokuxhuma kuyalandela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShintsha umbono nokudweba\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMisa, hlela futhi ufunde ishejuli\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Ishejuli yeminyango ngephansi, nezinga lokumelana nomlilo, nezinsimbi zomnyango&quot;: umsizi uqamba ishejuli, amakholomu ayo (isici noma ithegi sibe yikholomu) nokuhlelwa kwayo; i-BimCraft iyigcwalisa emodelini iphinde iyihlele, ithathe lokho umsizi angakushongo kumgomo wehhovisi. Ukumisa kujoyina uhlu lwakho lwama-Ishejuli. Umugqa ngamunye obuyayo ubiza izakhi zawo, ukuze azikhethe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFunda ukuze ufunde; Shintsha umbono nokudweba ukuze ulondoloze ukumisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhipha ishejuli\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Enge-CSV, i-Excel, noma umbhalo ohlukaniswe ngamathebhu ukuze unamathisele ku-Google Sheets (akukho okuthunyelwa ku-Google)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhipha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFunda futhi usethe ukuqedwa kwamagumbi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinhlobo zokuqeda, ukuqedwa kwephansi, kodonga nakosilingi lwegumbi ngalinye, izingxenye; izindawo, inani lamatayili nevolumu yesisekelo kuvela ezishejuleni zokuqeda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFunda; Shintsha umbono nokudweba ukuze usethe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhetha izakhi, uhlehlise izinyathelo zawo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzakhi zikhethwa embonweni; isinyathelo sawo sokugcina siyahlehliswa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShintsha umbono nokudweba\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELondoloza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfayela elisha le-IFC nazo zonke izinguquko, njengoba \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGcina njenge-IFC\u003C/span\u003E ikwenza (ifayela lokuqala alishintshwa)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELondoloza\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhipha i-USD\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImodeli evulekile njenge-OpenUSD (nge-.usda, .usdc noma .usdz), njengoba \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUSD\u003C/span\u003E ethuluzini le-toolbar iyibhala\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhipha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERenda isithombe, uqhube uhlu lokurenda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsithombe sombono we-3D, njengoba ingxoxo ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda\u003C/span\u003E isenza ngezilungiselelo zakho zokurenda uma ingacela ezinye, noma izithombe ezinekhwalithi ephezulu zengezwa kuhlu lwengxoxo futhi zirenderwe ngokulandelana (uhlu ludinga i-WebGPU). Akukho okushintsha emodelini (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render\"\u003ERenda isithombe\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhipha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsinyathelo ngasinye umsizi asenza yisinyathelo esisodwa ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinguquko\u003C/strong\u003E, esibizwa ngokuthi &quot;Umsizi: …&quot; (isibonelo &quot;Umsizi: engeza izindonga ezi-4&quot;), ngakho \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ithatha isenzo sawo sonke, futhi ubona ukuthi isinyathelo sembangi. Kuleli windi akakwazi ukuvula amafayela: wena uvula imodeli; usebenza nalena evulekile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vula\"\u003EVula\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAbasizi bafika ku-BimCraft ngoCadCraft Studio ekhompyutheni yakho; isiphequluli esijwayelekile asinayo indlela yokungena.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha ithebhu ye-\u003Cstrong\u003EBimCraft\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EAbasizi\u003C/strong\u003E, thika \u003Cstrong\u003EVumela abasizi be-AI nezikripthi basebenzise BimCraft\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFunda\u003C/strong\u003E ithikiwe ngawe. Thika \u003Cstrong\u003EShintsha umbono nokudweba\u003C/strong\u003E futhi uma umsizi ezokwazi ukuhlukanisa nokufihla izakhi nokudweba, no-\u003Cstrong\u003ELondoloza\u003C/strong\u003E uma engalondoloza imodeli njengefayela elisha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXhuma umsizi ku-Studio (i-Studio ikhombisa ikheli nezilungiselelo okufanele uzinamathisele kuwo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uma-umsizi-exhunyiwe\"\u003EUma umsizi exhunyiwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsaziso esiphezulu kwiphaneli eliseningizimu sitshela ukuthi ngumsizi muni oxhunyiwe nokuthi angenzani. Chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENqamula\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uphelise isikhathi sakhe masinyane; kufanele axhume futhi ukuze aqhubeke.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmsebenzi\u003C/strong\u003E, ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EAbasizi\u003C/strong\u003E ku-Izilungiselelo, uhlu lwayo yonke imibizo umsizi ayenzile, okusha kuqala, nokuthi yasebenza yini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBuza ngamagama alula, isibonelo &quot;hlukanisa izindonga zangaphandle ezingeni 1&quot;, &quot;yiziphi iminyango engenayo izinga lokumelana nomlilo?&quot; noma &quot;dweba igumbi elilingana no-6 ngo-4 mitha ezingeni 1 nomnyango odongeni lwaseningizimu&quot;. Umsizi uthola izakhi abonise kumbono wakho, noma adwebe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ngaphandle-kwewindi-izikripthi-nomugqa-womyalo\"\u003ENgaphandle kwewindi: izikripthi nomugqa womyalo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmathuluzi okudweba afanayo asebenza kumafayela e-IFC emafolda oyiqamba, ngaphandle kwewindi evulekile: iseva ye-MCP ye-CadCraft nomugqa womyalo zingaqala isakhiwo esisha noma zivule ifayela le-IFC, zichaze, zengeze izindonga, iminyango, amawindi, amaphansi, amazinga namagridi, zihlehlise bese ziyilondoloza njengefayela elisha le-\u003Ccode\u003E.ifc\u003C/code\u003E. Amanye amathuluzi amane asiza izikripthi: \u003Ccode\u003Eifc_batch\u003C/code\u003E iqhuba izinyathelo zokuhlela ezingama-200 njengesinyathelo esisodwa (zonke noma akukho: ukuhlehlisa okukodwa kuthatha lonke iqoqo, futhi isinyathelo esinqatshiwe sihlehlisa okunye bese sikhomba isinyathelo); \u003Ccode\u003Eifc_describe\u003C/code\u003E ohlu lwamazinga nazo zonke izindonga namaminyango namawindi azo; \u003Ccode\u003Eifc_render_png\u003C/code\u003E ibhala isithombe esilula sokuhlola semodeli (akukho zinto, ukuthungwa noma izithunzi) ngaphandle kwewindi; \u003Ccode\u003Eusd_export\u003C/code\u003E ibhala \u003Ccode\u003E.usda\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.usdc\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E.usdz\u003C/code\u003E. Emugqeni womyalo, \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft bim script.json --from model.ifc -o out.ifc\u003C/code\u003E iqhuba isikripthi sezinyathelo, futhi \u003Ccode\u003E--usd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E--png\u003C/code\u003E no-\u003Ccode\u003E--plan\u003C/code\u003E zibhala ifayela le-USD, isithombe noma ipulani kusuka kulokhu kuqhutshwa okufanayo. Wena unquma ukuthi yimaphi amafolda angawasebenzisa nokuthi ingashintsha noma ilondoloze yini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vala\"\u003EVala\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESusa ukukhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EVumela abasizi be-AI nezikripthi basebenzise BimCraft\u003C/strong\u003E. Wonke umsizi uyanqanyulwa masinyane, futhi lesi silungiselelo siyagcinwa kokulandelayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bona-nakho\"\u003EBona nakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/assistants-recipes\" data-topic=\"basics/assistants-recipes\"\u003EIzindlela zokusebenza zabasizi be-AI\u003C/a\u003E: izibonelo ezisebenzayo, ngayinye nemisebenzi ibiza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/find\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/find\"\u003EThola izakhi ngohlobo, igama noma isici\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\"\u003EFihla, hlukanisa futhi bonakalise izakhi\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/settings\"\u003EIzilungiselelo ze-BimCraft\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzofunda Indlela yokuvumela umsizi we-AI (noma yimuphi umsizi okhuluma i-MCP) ukuthi abheke imodeli ye-IFC evulekile futhi adwebe kuyo, okwazi ukukwenza nokungakwazi, nendlela yokumisa. Okwenziwa umsizi ku-BimCraft Icela ukuthi Kwenzekani Kudinga Thola izakhi Uthola uhlu lwezakhi ngohlobo, izinga, igama noma inani lesici, njengoba Thola kwenza Funda Funda izici Uthola izici zesakhi esisodwa, uhlobo, amasethi wezici nezinani, njengoba Izici zikubonisa Funda Chaza imodeli, ohlu lwezindonga Uthola amazinga, izindonga, iminyango, amawindi, amagumbi, amaphansi, amagridi namakholomu, nezimpelo, uhlobo nobude bongadonga ngamunye Funda Hlukanisa, bonakalise ngaphansi, fihla noma bonisa Umbono we-3D uyashintsha njengoba ubuke usebenzise imenyu ye-Bonisa Shintsha umbono nokudweba Dweba izindonga, iminyango, amawindi, amaphansi, amazinga noma imigqa yegridi Imodeli iyashintsha njengoba ubuke usebenzise amathuluzi e-Dweba: izindonga ziyahlangana, amagumbi, amaphansi nemifula alandela Shintsha umbono nokudweba Shintsha igama noma inani lesici Igama, Incazelo, Uhlobo lwento noma Ithegi lesakhi esisodwa, noma inani lesici. Inani elabelana ngalo nezinye izakhi likopishelwa kuqala; inani lohlobo lishintsha kuphela uma umsizi esho, ngoba yonke into yalolohlobo iyalandela Shintsha umbono nokudweba Hambisa, susa, shintsha izindonga, iminyango namawindi Izakhi ziyahanjiswa noma ziyasuswa kanye nalokho okuzibambele; izindonga ezidwetshwe ngamathuluzi e-Dweba zishintsha ngezimpelo noma uhlobo lwazo, iminyango namawindi ngendawo, usayizi noma uhlobo lwazo, amagumbi nokuxhuma kuyalandela Shintsha umbono nokudweba Misa, hlela futhi ufunde ishejuli \"Ishejuli yeminyango ngephansi, nezinga lokumelana nomlilo, nezinsimbi zomnyango\": umsizi uqamba ishejuli, amakholomu ayo (isici noma ithegi sibe yikholomu) nokuhlelwa kwayo; i-BimCraft iyigcwalisa emodelini iphinde iyihlele, ithathe lokho umsizi angakushongo kumgomo wehhovisi. Ukumisa kujoyina uhlu lwakho lwama-Ishejuli. Umugqa ngamunye obuyayo ubiza izakhi zawo, ukuze azikhethe Funda ukuze ufunde; Shintsha umbono nokudweba ukuze ulondoloze ukumisa Khipha ishejuli nge-CSV, i-Excel, noma umbhalo ohlukaniswe ngamathebhu ukuze unamathisele ku-Google Sheets (akukho okuthunyelwa ku-Google) Khipha Funda futhi usethe ukuqedwa kwamagumbi Izinhlobo zokuqeda, ukuqedwa kwephansi, kodonga nakosilingi lwegumbi ngalinye, izingxenye; izindawo, inani lamatayili nevolumu yesisekelo kuvela ezishejuleni zokuqeda Funda; Shintsha umbono nokudweba ukuze usethe Khetha izakhi, uhlehlise izinyathelo zawo Izakhi zikhethwa embonweni; isinyathelo sawo sokugcina siyahlehliswa Shintsha umbono nokudweba Londoloza Ifayela elisha le-IFC nazo zonke izinguquko, njengoba Gcina njenge-IFC ikwenza (ifayela lokuqala alishintshwa) Londoloza Khipha i-USD Imodeli evulekile njenge-OpenUSD (nge-.usda, .usdc noma .usdz), njengoba USD ethuluzini le-toolbar iyibhala Khipha Renda isithombe, uqhube uhlu lokurenda Isithombe sombono we-3D, njengoba ingxoxo ye-Renda isenza ngezilungiselelo zakho zokurenda uma ingacela ezinye, noma izithombe ezinekhwalithi ephezulu zengezwa kuhlu lwengxoxo futhi zirenderwe ngokulandelana (uhlu ludinga i-WebGPU). Akukho okushintsha emodelini (Renda isithombe) Khipha Isinyathelo ngasinye umsizi asenza yisinyathelo esisodwa ku-Izinguquko, esibizwa ngokuthi \"Umsizi: …\" (isibonelo \"Umsizi: engeza izindonga ezi-4\"), ngakho Ctrl+Z ithatha isenzo sawo sonke, futhi ubona ukuthi isinyathelo sembangi. Kuleli windi akakwazi ukuvula amafayela: wena uvula imodeli; usebenza nalena evulekile. Vula Abasizi bafika ku-BimCraft ngoCadCraft Studio ekhompyutheni yakho; isiphequluli esijwayelekile asinayo indlela yokungena. Vula Izilungiselelo bese ukhetha ithebhu ye-BimCraft. Ngaphansi kwe-Abasizi, thika Vumela abasizi be-AI nezikripthi basebenzise BimCraft. Funda ithikiwe ngawe. Thika Shintsha umbono nokudweba futhi uma umsizi ezokwazi ukuhlukanisa nokufihla izakhi nokudweba, no-Londoloza uma engalondoloza imodeli njengefayela elisha. Xhuma umsizi ku-Studio (i-Studio ikhombisa ikheli nezilungiselelo okufanele uzinamathisele kuwo). Uma umsizi exhunyiwe Isaziso esiphezulu kwiphaneli eliseningizimu sitshela ukuthi ngumsizi muni oxhunyiwe nokuthi angenzani. Chofoza Nqamula ukuze uphelise isikhathi sakhe masinyane; kufanele axhume futhi ukuze aqhubeke. Umsebenzi, ngaphansi kwe-Abasizi ku-Izilungiselelo, uhlu lwayo yonke imibizo umsizi ayenzile, okusha kuqala, nokuthi yasebenza yini. Buza ngamagama alula, isibonelo \"hlukanisa izindonga zangaphandle ezingeni 1\", \"yiziphi iminyango engenayo izinga lokumelana nomlilo?\" noma \"dweba igumbi elilingana no-6 ngo-4 mitha ezingeni 1 nomnyango odongeni lwaseningizimu\". Umsizi uthola izakhi abonise kumbono wakho, noma adwebe. Ngaphandle kwewindi: izikripthi nomugqa womyalo Amathuluzi okudweba afanayo asebenza kumafayela e-IFC emafolda oyiqamba, ngaphandle kwewindi evulekile: iseva ye-MCP ye-CadCraft nomugqa womyalo zingaqala isakhiwo esisha noma zivule ifayela le-IFC, zichaze, zengeze izindonga, iminyango, amawindi, amaphansi, amazinga namagridi, zihlehlise bese ziyilondoloza njengefayela elisha le-.ifc. Amanye amathuluzi amane asiza izikripthi: ifc_batch iqhuba izinyathelo zokuhlela ezingama-200 njengesinyathelo esisodwa (zonke noma akukho: ukuhlehlisa okukodwa kuthatha lonke iqoqo, futhi isinyathelo esinqatshiwe sihlehlisa okunye bese sikhomba isinyathelo); ifc_describe ohlu lwamazinga nazo zonke izindonga namaminyango namawindi azo; ifc_render_png ibhala isithombe esilula sokuhlola semodeli (akukho zinto, ukuthungwa noma izithunzi) ngaphandle kwewindi; usd_export ibhala .usda, .usdc noma .usdz. Emugqeni womyalo, cadcraft bim script.json --from model.ifc -o out.ifc iqhuba isikripthi sezinyathelo, futhi --usd, --png no---plan zibhala ifayela le-USD, isithombe noma ipulani kusuka kulokhu kuqhutshwa okufanayo. Wena unquma ukuthi yimaphi amafolda angawasebenzisa nokuthi ingashintsha noma ilondoloze yini. Vala Susa ukukhetha Vumela abasizi be-AI nezikripthi basebenzise BimCraft. Wonke umsizi uyanqanyulwa masinyane, futhi lesi silungiselelo siyagcinwa kokulandelayo. Bona nakho Izindlela zokusebenza zabasizi be-AI: izibonelo ezisebenzayo, ngayinye nemisebenzi ibiza. Thola izakhi ngohlobo, igama noma isici Fihla, hlukanisa futhi bonakalise izakhi Izilungiselelo ze-BimCraft","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"field-points","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Amaphoyinti okumaka nokuhlola okwakhiwe","summary":"Nombolela izindawo ibhodi elimisa kuzo kusuka kumodeli: amaphakathi wezinsika, izinhlangothi zezindonga, izikulufo ezibambayo, izimbobo, noma yinoma iyiphi into oyikhethayo, bese uzibhala ukuze i-total station, bese ufunda amaphoyinti okwakhiwe ibhodi elawabuyisela bese ubona okuphambukile.","section":"tasks","order":61,"keywords":["amaphoyinti okumaka","ukumisa","ukumaka","isiteshi esiphelele","total station","ukuhlola","ifayela lamaphoyinti","csv","txt","pnezd","penzd","xyz","northing","easting","ukuphakama","njengokwakhiwe","hlola","ukubekezelela","ukuphambuka","izikulufo ezibambayo","amaphakathi wezinsika","izinhlangothi zezindonga","izimbobo","izixhumanisi zokuhlola","ukuguqulwa kwemephu"],"headings":[{"id":"yenza-amaphoyinti","text":"Yenza amaphoyinti","level":2},{"id":"hlola-amaphoyinti-njengokwakhiwe","text":"Hlola amaphoyinti njengokwakhiwe","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EI-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPoints\u003C/span\u003E ithebhu esohlangothini lwesokudla yenza amaphoyinti ibhodi limisa esiza kusuka kumodeli evulekile, futhi ihlola amaphoyinti ibhodi elawalinganisa ngemva kwalokho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yenza-amaphoyinti\"\u003EYenza amaphoyinti\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula imodeli ye-IFC kanye ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPoints\u003C/span\u003E ithebhu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha okuzomiswa: \u003Cstrong\u003Ecolumn centres\u003C/strong\u003E (inyawo lomugqa wamaphakathi wensika ngayinye), \u003Cstrong\u003Ewall ends\u003C/strong\u003E (zombili izinhlangothi zomugqa wodonga ngayinye, esisekelweni), \u003Cstrong\u003Eanchor bolts\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003Esleeves\u003C/strong\u003E (izinto ezinegama noma uhlobo olubonisa i-sleeve), kanye \u003Cstrong\u003Epicked elements\u003C/strong\u003E (ngayinye endaweni yokumisa kwayo — uzikhethe ebukweni kuqala).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha inombolo yokuqala nesiqalo, izixhumanisi, amayunithi, izinsika nefayela:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EModel\u003C/strong\u003E: izixhumanisi zefayela ngokwalo. \u003Cstrong\u003ESurvey grid\u003C/strong\u003E: igridi yemephu yokuphindwa kwemodeli (ikhombisa kuphela uma i-IFC inokuguqulwa kwemephu), ngamamitha noma iyunithi oyikhethile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmakholomu \u003Cstrong\u003EPNEZD\u003C/strong\u003E (iphoyinti, northing, easting, ukuphakama, incazelo), \u003Cstrong\u003EPENZD\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003EXYZ\u003C/strong\u003E; \u003Cstrong\u003ECSV\u003C/strong\u003E (amakhoma) noma \u003Cstrong\u003ETXT\u003C/strong\u003E (ama-tab).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMake points\u003C/span\u003E: uhlu lubonisa wona, futhi ukubuka kuwamaka ngombala oluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDownload the points\u003C/span\u003E ibhala ifayela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmaphoyinti ahlelwa ngokulandelana okungaguquki — ngohlobo, bese ngemigqa kupulani — ngakho ukuwenza kabusha kusuka kumodeli efanayo kunika izinombolo ezifanayo. Ifayela yileli i-CivilCraft ilivulayo, nalo i-EXPORTPOINTS ye-CadCraft iyabhala: iphoyinti elilodwa ngomugqa ngamunye, izingxenye ezintathu zamadesimali, nencazelo phakathi kwamagwiyane uma iqukethe ikhoma.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlola-amaphoyinti-njengokwakhiwe\"\u003EHlola amaphoyinti njengokwakhiwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELapho ibhodi lithumela okulinganisiwe, khetha \u003Cstrong\u003Etolerance\u003C/strong\u003E ngamamilimitha nendlela yokuhlanganisa amaphoyinti — nge-\u003Cstrong\u003Epoint number\u003C/strong\u003E (agcina izinombolo zakho) noma \u003Cstrong\u003Enearest shot\u003C/strong\u003E — bese ucindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERead as-built points…\u003C/span\u003E. Funda ifayela ngamayunithi nezixhumanisi ofake kuzo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgemva kwalokho iphoyinti ngalinye lokuklama liba \u003Cstrong\u003Ewithin\u003C/strong\u003E ukubekezelela, \u003Cstrong\u003Eoutside\u003C/strong\u003E kukho, \u003Cstrong\u003Enot measured\u003C/strong\u003E, kanti noma iyiphi intshaya engabizwanga iba \u003Cstrong\u003Eextra\u003C/strong\u003E. Ithebhu inikeza umehluko ngeyunithi oyikhethayo kwithuluzi, amafidi abonakala njengamadesimali amaholo (njengokwakhiwe ukuhlola kokuklama: empumalanga, enyakatho, ukuphakama, nebanga kupulani). Ibuka ibhala ngalinye liphawulwe luhlaza noma lubomvu nomugqa oya kulokho okuthathwe, nagolwe uma lingalinganiswanga. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReport (CSV)\u003C/span\u003E ibhala ukuqhathanisa konke.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAkukho lapha okushintsha imodeli. Akusayenziwa: ukumisa kusuka emaphethelweni wephlothi, izimbobo zegridi noma izimbobo ezenziwe ngokuzenzakalelayo, nokuthumela amaphoyinti ngqo kwisixhumi — sebenzisa ifayela.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"I-Points ithebhu esohlangothini lwesokudla yenza amaphoyinti ibhodi limisa esiza kusuka kumodeli evulekile, futhi ihlola amaphoyinti ibhodi elawalinganisa ngemva kwalokho. Yenza amaphoyinti Vula imodeli ye-IFC kanye ne-Points ithebhu. Khetha okuzomiswa: column centres (inyawo lomugqa wamaphakathi wensika ngayinye), wall ends (zombili izinhlangothi zomugqa wodonga ngayinye, esisekelweni), anchor bolts, sleeves (izinto ezinegama noma uhlobo olubonisa i-sleeve), kanye picked elements (ngayinye endaweni yokumisa kwayo — uzikhethe ebukweni kuqala). Khetha inombolo yokuqala nesiqalo, izixhumanisi, amayunithi, izinsika nefayela: Model: izixhumanisi zefayela ngokwalo. Survey grid: igridi yemephu yokuphindwa kwemodeli (ikhombisa kuphela uma i-IFC inokuguqulwa kwemephu), ngamamitha noma iyunithi oyikhethile. Amakholomu PNEZD (iphoyinti, northing, easting, ukuphakama, incazelo), PENZD noma XYZ; CSV (amakhoma) noma TXT (ama-tab). Cindezela Make points: uhlu lubonisa wona, futhi ukubuka kuwamaka ngombala oluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka. Download the points ibhala ifayela. Amaphoyinti ahlelwa ngokulandelana okungaguquki — ngohlobo, bese ngemigqa kupulani — ngakho ukuwenza kabusha kusuka kumodeli efanayo kunika izinombolo ezifanayo. Ifayela yileli i-CivilCraft ilivulayo, nalo i-EXPORTPOINTS ye-CadCraft iyabhala: iphoyinti elilodwa ngomugqa ngamunye, izingxenye ezintathu zamadesimali, nencazelo phakathi kwamagwiyane uma iqukethe ikhoma. Hlola amaphoyinti njengokwakhiwe Lapho ibhodi lithumela okulinganisiwe, khetha tolerance ngamamilimitha nendlela yokuhlanganisa amaphoyinti — nge-point number (agcina izinombolo zakho) noma nearest shot — bese ucindezela Read as-built points…. Funda ifayela ngamayunithi nezixhumanisi ofake kuzo. Ngemva kwalokho iphoyinti ngalinye lokuklama liba within ukubekezelela, outside kukho, not measured, kanti noma iyiphi intshaya engabizwanga iba extra. Ithebhu inikeza umehluko ngeyunithi oyikhethayo kwithuluzi, amafidi abonakala njengamadesimali amaholo (njengokwakhiwe ukuhlola kokuklama: empumalanga, enyakatho, ukuphakama, nebanga kupulani). Ibuka ibhala ngalinye liphawulwe luhlaza noma lubomvu nomugqa oya kulokho okuthathwe, nagolwe uma lingalinganiswanga. Report (CSV) ibhala ukuqhathanisa konke. Akukho lapha okushintsha imodeli. Akusayenziwa: ukumisa kusuka emaphethelweni wephlothi, izimbobo zegridi noma izimbobo ezenziwe ngokuzenzakalelayo, nokuthumela amaphoyinti ngqo kwisixhumi — sebenzisa ifayela.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"room-acoustics","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Hlola isikhathi sokuphindaphinda komsindo wegumbi bese ulilalela","summary":"Isikhathi sokuphindaphinda komsindo ngamabhendi e-octave ngegumbi ngalinye (i-Sabine ne-Eyring) kusuka kusayizi walo nokuqedwa kwalo, inani lakho lokuhlosa, nezwi, uhlanzo noma umculo okudlalwa ngokusebenzisa i-impulse response yegumbi elibaliwe.","section":"tasks","order":61,"keywords":["ukuzwakala","ukuphindaphinda komsindo","isikhathi sokuphindaphinda","rt60","sabine","eyring","ukumunca","ukubuya komsindo","umsindo","lalela","impulse response","inkulumo","igumbi lokufundela","ihhovisi","ikhaphethi","ithayili lesilingi","umsindo ongadingekile"],"headings":[{"id":"khetha-ukuqedwa","text":"Khetha ukuqedwa","level":2},{"id":"funda-ithebula","text":"Funda ithebula","level":2},{"id":"lalela","text":"Lalela","level":2},{"id":"abantu-nezinto","text":"Abantu nezinto","level":2},{"id":"umthombo-nomlaleli","text":"Umthombo nomlaleli","level":2},{"id":"ukungafani-kokumunca-nezindlela-zegumbi","text":"Ukungafani kokumunca nezindlela zegumbi","level":2},{"id":"amayunithi","text":"Amayunithi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIsigaba se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERoom acoustics\u003C/span\u003E sesobunxele sibala isikhathi somsindo ohlala egumbini ngalinye. Sifunda ubukhulu bendawo yegumbi ngalinye, ukuphakama kwalo, izindonga, iminyango neziwindi kusuka kumodeli ye-IFC evuliwe. Akukho okushintshwa kumodeli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khetha-ukuqedwa\"\u003EKhetha ukuqedwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELapho imodeli isho ukuthi yini esembozweni, igumbi liyayifunda: ungqimba wangaphakathi wohlobo ngalunye lodonga (i-gypsum, ipulasta, udaka lwebhricks, ukhonkolo nebhulokhi kuyaziwa), uhlobo lwephansi (izinkuni noma ukhonkolo) nokuthi isilingi sinamathayili yini. Ilebula eseduze nokukhetha ngakunye likhombisa ukuthi ivela emodelini, kuyisisetho esizenzakalelayo noma ukukhetha kwakho; khetha ukuqedwa okuhlukile ukuze ushintshe. Konke imodeli engakushongo kuhlala kusetho esizenzakalelayo. Izinkomba ziyamanani ajwayelekile ashicilelwe; zishintshe ngedatha yokuhlola yomkhiqizo uma uyinayo. Thayipha i-\u003Cstrong\u003Etarget\u003C/strong\u003E (ukuphindaphinda okude kakhulu kwesilinganiso esiphakathi ofuna) futhi noma yiliphi igumbi elidlula kulo lizoba yisexwayiso, nokumunca okuzolehlisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"funda-ithebula\"\u003EFunda ithebula\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuphindaphinda komsindo kunikezwa kusukela ku-125 Hz kuya ku-4 kHz. I-Sabine ifanele amagumbi aphilile, neyi-Eyring amagumbi afile; umugqa omaka ngokuthi \u003Cem\u003EUsed\u003C/em\u003E uthatha i-Eyring lapho ukumunca okuphakathi kukhulu kuno-0.2. Ukumunca komoya kufakiwe (kunciphisa amabhendi aphezulu emagumbini amakhulu). Kuyimodeli yezibalo: iqagela ukuthi umsindo usakazeka ngokulinganayo, ngakho amagumbi amade noma abanzi kakhulu namagumbi amancane kakhulu ayisiqondiso esiyinkimbinkimbi, futhi impahla, abantu namasango avulekile akubalwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lalela\"\u003ELalela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlay it in this room\u003C/span\u003E idlala izwi (elenziwe lapha), ukushaya kwezandla, amanothi acutshungulwayo noma \u003Cstrong\u003Eifayela lakho lomsindo\u003C/strong\u003E (lihlala kukhompyutha yakho) ngokusebenzisa i-impulse response ebalwe yegumbi: umsindo oqondile, izibuyiselo zokuqala zebhokisi losayizi walo, nomsila ohlakazeka ngesikhathi somphindaphindo wegumbi ngalinye ebhendini. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlay it dry\u003C/span\u003E idlala umsindo ofanayo ngelinga elifanayo ngaphandle kwegumbi. Ungalondoloza i-impulse response noma umsindo osegumbini njengamafayela e-WAV. Uzwakala njengegumbi losayizi walo nokuqedwa kwalo, hhayi njengegumbi langempela elithile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"abantu-nezinto\"\u003EAbantu nezinto\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThayipha inani le-\u003Cstrong\u003Epeople in this room\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze wengeze ukumunca kwabo. Impahla imodeli inayo (amasofa, amabhedi, izihlalo, amatafula, amakhabethe, ngegama) yengeza ukumunca kwayo. Izibalo ziyizinkomba zokuhlela ezinembile, zizungeziwe; zishintshe ngezilinganiso uma igumbi libalulekile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"umthombo-nomlaleli\"\u003EUmthombo nomlaleli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESource and listener\u003C/span\u003E, cindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlace the source\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlace the listener\u003C/span\u003E bese uchofoza ipulani legumbi. Umsindo odlalwayo uzwakala kusukela lapho: umsindo oqondile ufika ngemuva kwebanga, nengxenye ephindaphindayo isemazingeni alingana nalelo banga. Susa kokubili ukuze ubuyele ebhokisini lebanga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukungafani-kokumunca-nezindlela-zegumbi\"\u003EUkungafani kokumunca nezindlela zegumbi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUneven absorption (box room)\u003C/span\u003E, thayipha igumbi njengebhokisi bese ukhetha ukuqedwa kwalo kwephansi, kwesilingi nezindonga. Ithebula lengeza i-Fitzroy ne-Arau-Puchades ku-Sabine ne-Eyring: zibheka amapheya amathathu ezindawo ezibhekene ngokwahlukana, ngakho igumbi elinekhaphethi nesilingi esiqinile alifundwa njengelifushane kakhulu. Lapho amapheya ehluka kakhulu, inothi lisho ukuthi yiliphi okufanele lethenjwe. Ngaphansi kwethebula, \u003Cstrong\u003ERoom modes\u003C/strong\u003E idwedwesa amagagasi amancane amile webhokisi nefrikhwensi ngaphansi kwayo igumbi linezindlela ezihlukile esikhundleni somsindo olinganayo. Lezi yizibikezelo zebhokisi legumbi, isisetshenziswa sokuklama hhayi ukulinganisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amayunithi\"\u003EAmayunithi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzindawo zamagumbi, ukuphakama, amavolumu nezibalo zikhonjiswa ngama-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnits\u003C/span\u003E okhethile (izikwele nezikhubo zamafidi, ama-inch, amamilimitha, amasentimitha noma amamitha). Ukubalwa ngokwakho kuhlala ku-SI; kushintsha kuphela ukubonakala. Izikhathi (amasekhondi), amafrikhwensi nemazinga akushintshi.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Isigaba se-Room acoustics sesobunxele sibala isikhathi somsindo ohlala egumbini ngalinye. Sifunda ubukhulu bendawo yegumbi ngalinye, ukuphakama kwalo, izindonga, iminyango neziwindi kusuka kumodeli ye-IFC evuliwe. Akukho okushintshwa kumodeli. Khetha ukuqedwa Lapho imodeli isho ukuthi yini esembozweni, igumbi liyayifunda: ungqimba wangaphakathi wohlobo ngalunye lodonga (i-gypsum, ipulasta, udaka lwebhricks, ukhonkolo nebhulokhi kuyaziwa), uhlobo lwephansi (izinkuni noma ukhonkolo) nokuthi isilingi sinamathayili yini. Ilebula eseduze nokukhetha ngakunye likhombisa ukuthi ivela emodelini, kuyisisetho esizenzakalelayo noma ukukhetha kwakho; khetha ukuqedwa okuhlukile ukuze ushintshe. Konke imodeli engakushongo kuhlala kusetho esizenzakalelayo. Izinkomba ziyamanani ajwayelekile ashicilelwe; zishintshe ngedatha yokuhlola yomkhiqizo uma uyinayo. Thayipha i-target (ukuphindaphinda okude kakhulu kwesilinganiso esiphakathi ofuna) futhi noma yiliphi igumbi elidlula kulo lizoba yisexwayiso, nokumunca okuzolehlisa. Funda ithebula Ukuphindaphinda komsindo kunikezwa kusukela ku-125 Hz kuya ku-4 kHz. I-Sabine ifanele amagumbi aphilile, neyi-Eyring amagumbi afile; umugqa omaka ngokuthi Used uthatha i-Eyring lapho ukumunca okuphakathi kukhulu kuno-0.2. Ukumunca komoya kufakiwe (kunciphisa amabhendi aphezulu emagumbini amakhulu). Kuyimodeli yezibalo: iqagela ukuthi umsindo usakazeka ngokulinganayo, ngakho amagumbi amade noma abanzi kakhulu namagumbi amancane kakhulu ayisiqondiso esiyinkimbinkimbi, futhi impahla, abantu namasango avulekile akubalwa. Lalela Play it in this room idlala izwi (elenziwe lapha), ukushaya kwezandla, amanothi acutshungulwayo noma ifayela lakho lomsindo (lihlala kukhompyutha yakho) ngokusebenzisa i-impulse response ebalwe yegumbi: umsindo oqondile, izibuyiselo zokuqala zebhokisi losayizi walo, nomsila ohlakazeka ngesikhathi somphindaphindo wegumbi ngalinye ebhendini. Play it dry idlala umsindo ofanayo ngelinga elifanayo ngaphandle kwegumbi. Ungalondoloza i-impulse response noma umsindo osegumbini njengamafayela e-WAV. Uzwakala njengegumbi losayizi walo nokuqedwa kwalo, hhayi njengegumbi langempela elithile. Abantu nezinto Thayipha inani le-people in this room ukuze wengeze ukumunca kwabo. Impahla imodeli inayo (amasofa, amabhedi, izihlalo, amatafula, amakhabethe, ngegama) yengeza ukumunca kwayo. Izibalo ziyizinkomba zokuhlela ezinembile, zizungeziwe; zishintshe ngezilinganiso uma igumbi libalulekile. Umthombo nomlaleli Ngaphansi kwe-Source and listener, cindezela Place the source noma Place the listener bese uchofoza ipulani legumbi. Umsindo odlalwayo uzwakala kusukela lapho: umsindo oqondile ufika ngemuva kwebanga, nengxenye ephindaphindayo isemazingeni alingana nalelo banga. Susa kokubili ukuze ubuyele ebhokisini lebanga. Ukungafani kokumunca nezindlela zegumbi Ngaphansi kwe-Uneven absorption (box room), thayipha igumbi njengebhokisi bese ukhetha ukuqedwa kwalo kwephansi, kwesilingi nezindonga. Ithebula lengeza i-Fitzroy ne-Arau-Puchades ku-Sabine ne-Eyring: zibheka amapheya amathathu ezindawo ezibhekene ngokwahlukana, ngakho igumbi elinekhaphethi nesilingi esiqinile alifundwa njengelifushane kakhulu. Lapho amapheya ehluka kakhulu, inothi lisho ukuthi yiliphi okufanele lethenjwe. Ngaphansi kwethebula, Room modes idwedwesa amagagasi amancane amile webhokisi nefrikhwensi ngaphansi kwayo igumbi linezindlela ezihlukile esikhundleni somsindo olinganayo. Lezi yizibikezelo zebhokisi legumbi, isisetshenziswa sokuklama hhayi ukulinganisa. Amayunithi Izindawo zamagumbi, ukuphakama, amavolumu nezibalo zikhonjiswa ngama-Units okhethile (izikwele nezikhubo zamafidi, ama-inch, amamilimitha, amasentimitha noma amamitha). Ukubalwa ngokwakho kuhlala ku-SI; kushintsha kuphela ukubonakala. Izikhathi (amasekhondi), amafrikhwensi nemazinga akushintshi.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"concrete-and-seismic","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Hlola izakhi zekhonkrithi nenza imithwalo yokuzamazama","summary":"Setha izinduku zamabhimu ekhonkrithi nezinsika zemodeli evulekile, uzihlole ngokwe-ACI 318-19, wenze amandla ansundu alinganayo ngokwe-ASCE 7-22 emasiteji aqinile, bese ubona ukuhamba kwesitezi. Isisiza umnjiniyela ukuthi ahlole.","section":"tasks","order":61,"keywords":["ikhonkrithi","reinforced concrete","ACI 318","ACI 318-19","rebar","beam","column","shear","ties","seismic","earthquake","equivalent lateral force","ELF","ASCE 7-22","drift","storey drift","floors","rigid diaphragm","story weight","utilisation","structural","engineer","analysis"],"headings":[{"id":"bimcraft-ifunda-ini","text":"BimCraft ifunda ini","level":2},{"id":"izinduku-izinhlanganisela-ukuhlola","text":"Izinduku, izinhlanganisela, ukuhlola","level":2},{"id":"amaphansi-namandla-okuzamazama","text":"Amaphansi namandla okuzamazama","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EAmabhlogo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzakhi zekhonkrithi\u003C/span\u003E no \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImithwalo yokuzamazama\u003C/span\u003E ethebhu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuhlaziya\u003C/span\u003E ahlola amabhimu nezinsika zekhonkrithi ye-IFC evulekile, futhi enza amandla okuzamazama aqondile emaphansini wesakhiwo sayo. Ngamabhlogo afanayo ne-DetailCraft, asebenza ngemva kokuhlaziya kwethebhu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuhlaziya\u003C/span\u003E, futhi agcinwa ku-IFC ndawonye nezinye izilungiselelo zokuhlaziya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImiphumela \u003Cstrong\u003Eyokuhlolwa umnjiniyela\u003C/strong\u003E: isisiza kuze kube yilapho enye yabonwa. Ukuhlolwa kwekhonkrithi kusebenzisa amandla e-first-order (insika esakhiweni esingeyona i-sway iklanywa ngomzwango wayo okhuliswe), ngaphandle kokukhulisa i-sway, ngaphandle kokuklanywa kwe-torsion, ngaphandle kwemininingwane yokuzamazama (isahluko 18 se-ACI) nangaphandle kwemininingwane yama-tie. Imithwalo yokuzamazama ishiya ngaphandle isici sokuvikela okuphindiwe, umphumela wokuzamazama ovundlile, ukukhuliswa kwe-torsion kanye nemiphumela ye-P-delta. \u003Cstrong\u003EImithwalo yomoya ayikakhiwe\u003C/strong\u003E: izahluko zomoya zomqondo azikho ezikhasini lezinkomba zephrojekthi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bimcraft-ifunda-ini\"\u003EBimCraft ifunda ini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuhlaziya kufunda amabhimu, izinsika nezinduku zemodeli, ngephrofayili zazo (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/frame-analysis\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/frame-analysis\"\u003EHlaziya uhlaka lwesakhiwo\u003C/a\u003E). Ibhlogo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzakhi zekhonkrithi\u003C/span\u003E idwala zonke izigaba ezisetshenziswa. Cindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESetha njengekhonkrithi…\u003C/span\u003E esigabeni esiyikhonkrithi: BimCraft ithatha uhlaka ngendawo nokuqina kwephrofayili (ububanzi b nokujula h ongakushintsha), ngakho isigaba esingasondelani nohlaka (isimo sensimbi esigoqiwe) sinika usayizi okufanele ulungise, noma sishiywe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsigaba esisethelwe njengekhonkrithi, nanoma yisiphi isakhi esinento ebizwa ngokuthi yikhonkrithi, sihlaziywa njengekhonkrithi: E = 4700 √f′c, 2400 kg/m³, futhi ngokuzenzakalelayo ngezigaba \u003Cstrong\u003Eezigqekiwe\u003C/strong\u003E (izinsika 0.70 Ig, amabhimu 0.35 Ig; ACI 318-19 Table 6.6.3.1.1(a)). Khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzigaba eziphelele\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uyivale. Ngaphandle kwalezi zilungiselelo imodeli ihlaziywa njengakuqala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinduku-izinhlanganisela-ukuhlola\"\u003EIzinduku, izinhlanganisela, ukuhlola\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENikeza ukumboza, izinduku ezingaphezulu, ezingaphansi nezohlangothi (noma ikheji yensimbi yensika) kanye namaxhuku wesigaba ngasinye, bese usetha f′c, fy, fyt, K kanye ne-sway noma i-non-sway. Nikeza amacala womthwalo uhlobo lwawo, cindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDala izinhlanganisela\u003C/span\u003E (ASCE 7 §5.3.1) bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlola ikhonkrithi\u003C/span\u003E: isakhi ngasinye sithola ukusetshenziswa, sidwetshwe emodelini. Izakhi ezedlule amandla, nokuhamba kwesitezi okudlule umkhawulo wakho, zishiwo ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinkinga\u003C/span\u003E ngesigatshana sazo; chofoza enye ukuze ukhethe isakhi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amaphansi-namandla-okuzamazama\"\u003EAmaphansi namandla okuzamazama\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEbhlogweni \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImithwalo yokuzamazama\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThola amaphansi\u003C/span\u003E uthatha amazinga lapho amabhimu amabili noma ngaphezulu ehlangana; ngalinye liba yidayaframu eqinile. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThatha izisindo emacaleni\u003C/span\u003E ifunda isisindo sokuzamazama sephansi ngalinye emacaleni onika isici kuwo. Gcwalisa i-SDS, SD1, S1, R, Ie, Cd, TL, uhlelo kanye nesigaba sengozi, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYenza amacala okuzamazama\u003C/span\u003E (ASCE 7-22 12.8: isikhathi, isisekelo sokunyakaza, ukusatshalaliswa phezu kwamaphansi, 5 % ukuphambuka okungazelelwe ngokuzenzakalelayo). Amandla esitezi nokuhlolwa kokuhamba kwesitezi (12.12) kuvela ngemva kokusebenza. Isikhathi esifanayo nokuqina kwesitezi kudla okuzamazama kwe-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/hazard-playback\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/hazard-playback\"\u003EDlala ukugeleza, umoya noma ukuzamazama\u003C/a\u003E uma ukhetha uhlaka lokuhlaziya njengomthombo wakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmasilabhu nodonga lwekhonkrithi aba ama-plate ekuhlaziyeni, nebhlogo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuqinisa kwesilabhu\u003C/span\u003E lisebenza ngensimbi edingekayo ngemitha ngayinye. Imininingwane yalokho kuhlolwa yonke ikhona kwitopiki ye-DetailCraft ngegama elifanayo.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Amabhlogo Izakhi zekhonkrithi no Imithwalo yokuzamazama ethebhu Ukuhlaziya ahlola amabhimu nezinsika zekhonkrithi ye-IFC evulekile, futhi enza amandla okuzamazama aqondile emaphansini wesakhiwo sayo. Ngamabhlogo afanayo ne-DetailCraft, asebenza ngemva kokuhlaziya kwethebhu Ukuhlaziya, futhi agcinwa ku-IFC ndawonye nezinye izilungiselelo zokuhlaziya. Imiphumela yokuhlolwa umnjiniyela: isisiza kuze kube yilapho enye yabonwa. Ukuhlolwa kwekhonkrithi kusebenzisa amandla e-first-order (insika esakhiweni esingeyona i-sway iklanywa ngomzwango wayo okhuliswe), ngaphandle kokukhulisa i-sway, ngaphandle kokuklanywa kwe-torsion, ngaphandle kwemininingwane yokuzamazama (isahluko 18 se-ACI) nangaphandle kwemininingwane yama-tie. Imithwalo yokuzamazama ishiya ngaphandle isici sokuvikela okuphindiwe, umphumela wokuzamazama ovundlile, ukukhuliswa kwe-torsion kanye nemiphumela ye-P-delta. Imithwalo yomoya ayikakhiwe: izahluko zomoya zomqondo azikho ezikhasini lezinkomba zephrojekthi. BimCraft ifunda ini Ukuhlaziya kufunda amabhimu, izinsika nezinduku zemodeli, ngephrofayili zazo (bona Hlaziya uhlaka lwesakhiwo). Ibhlogo Izakhi zekhonkrithi idwala zonke izigaba ezisetshenziswa. Cindezela Setha njengekhonkrithi… esigabeni esiyikhonkrithi: BimCraft ithatha uhlaka ngendawo nokuqina kwephrofayili (ububanzi b nokujula h ongakushintsha), ngakho isigaba esingasondelani nohlaka (isimo sensimbi esigoqiwe) sinika usayizi okufanele ulungise, noma sishiywe. Isigaba esisethelwe njengekhonkrithi, nanoma yisiphi isakhi esinento ebizwa ngokuthi yikhonkrithi, sihlaziywa njengekhonkrithi: E = 4700 √f′c, 2400 kg/m³, futhi ngokuzenzakalelayo ngezigaba ezigqekiwe (izinsika 0.70 Ig, amabhimu 0.35 Ig; ACI 318-19 Table 6.6.3.1.1(a)). Khetha Izigaba eziphelele ukuze uyivale. Ngaphandle kwalezi zilungiselelo imodeli ihlaziywa njengakuqala. Izinduku, izinhlanganisela, ukuhlola Nikeza ukumboza, izinduku ezingaphezulu, ezingaphansi nezohlangothi (noma ikheji yensimbi yensika) kanye namaxhuku wesigaba ngasinye, bese usetha f′c, fy, fyt, K kanye ne-sway noma i-non-sway. Nikeza amacala womthwalo uhlobo lwawo, cindezela Dala izinhlanganisela (ASCE 7 §5.3.1) bese Hlola ikhonkrithi: isakhi ngasinye sithola ukusetshenziswa, sidwetshwe emodelini. Izakhi ezedlule amandla, nokuhamba kwesitezi okudlule umkhawulo wakho, zishiwo ku-Izinkinga ngesigatshana sazo; chofoza enye ukuze ukhethe isakhi. Amaphansi namandla okuzamazama Ebhlogweni Imithwalo yokuzamazama, Thola amaphansi uthatha amazinga lapho amabhimu amabili noma ngaphezulu ehlangana; ngalinye liba yidayaframu eqinile. Thatha izisindo emacaleni ifunda isisindo sokuzamazama sephansi ngalinye emacaleni onika isici kuwo. Gcwalisa i-SDS, SD1, S1, R, Ie, Cd, TL, uhlelo kanye nesigaba sengozi, bese Yenza amacala okuzamazama (ASCE 7-22 12.8: isikhathi, isisekelo sokunyakaza, ukusatshalaliswa phezu kwamaphansi, 5 % ukuphambuka okungazelelwe ngokuzenzakalelayo). Amandla esitezi nokuhlolwa kokuhamba kwesitezi (12.12) kuvela ngemva kokusebenza. Isikhathi esifanayo nokuqina kwesitezi kudla okuzamazama kwe-Dlala ukugeleza, umoya noma ukuzamazama uma ukhetha uhlaka lokuhlaziya njengomthombo wakho. Amasilabhu nodonga lwekhonkrithi aba ama-plate ekuhlaziyeni, nebhlogo Ukuqinisa kwesilabhu lisebenza ngensimbi edingekayo ngemitha ngayinye. Imininingwane yalokho kuhlolwa yonke ikhona kwitopiki ye-DetailCraft ngegama elifanayo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"hazard-playback","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Dlala izikhukhula, umoya noma ukuzamazama komhlaba esakhiweni","summary":"Amanzi akhuphuka ngamagumbi, ingcindezi yomoya kwisitezi ngasinye, noma ukuzamazama komhlaba okuzamazamisa izitezi, kudlalwe epulanini noma ku-elevation ngesilayidi sesikhathi. Imodeli elula nezimo zayo zibhalwe; akuwona ukuhlolwa kwekhodi noma ukuklanywa kwesakhiwo.","section":"tasks","order":62,"keywords":["ingozi","izikhukhula","umoya","ukuzamazama komhlaba","ukuzamazama","ukuhamba","izinga lamanzi","isimo sezulu","isimo","izinga lolwandle","ukudlala","isitezi","isikhathi"],"headings":[{"id":"izikhukhula","text":"Izikhukhula","level":2},{"id":"umoya","text":"Umoya","level":2},{"id":"ukuzamazama-komhlaba","text":"Ukuzamazama komhlaba","level":2},{"id":"ukuqina-kwezitezi-kusuka-ku-analysis-frame","text":"Ukuqina kwezitezi kusuka ku-Analysis frame","level":2},{"id":"amayunithi","text":"Amayunithi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIngxenye ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHazard playback\u003C/span\u003E yephaneli elisekhohlo idlala ingozi kumodeli ye-IFC evulekile. Akukho okushintshwa kumodeli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELezi yimodeli \u003Cstrong\u003Eelula zokubona ukuthi ingozi yenza ini kulolu hlelo lwesakhiwo\u003C/strong\u003E, hhayi ucwaningo lwezikhukhula, ukuhlolwa kwekhodi yomoya noma ukuklanywa kwesakhiwo. Umphumela ngamunye ubhala izimo zawo ezithathiwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izikhukhula\"\u003EIzikhukhula\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESetha izinga eliphezulu lamanzi phezu kwesitezi esiphansi kakhulu nemizuzu yokukhuphuka, yokubamba nokwehla. Amanzi angena egumbini ngomgodi lapho ingcezu yawo yakudlula khona, nezindawo ezixhumene nezigumbi ezimanzi ngemigodi engaphansi kwamanzi zimi ezingeni elifanayo (quasi-static). Ithebhu ibonisa ukuthi yiliphi igumbi eliqala ukumanzisa nokujula kwalo; ipulani liyawudlala. Thayipha inani elikhulu kakhulu lamanzi igumbi elingawathatha, nezigumbi ezidlula kulona zibe yizexwayiso. \u003Cstrong\u003EIkusasa lesimo sezulu:\u003C/strong\u003E layisha ifayela lakho lesimo (JSON noma CSV enonyaka, ukukhuphuka kwezinga lolwandle nesici sezikhukhula) bese ukhetha unyaka. Noma vula okwengeziwe kwe-Climate futures bese ukhetha isimo nonyaka: izikhukhula zisebenza kabili, okwamanje kanye nokuzayo ngasohlangothini (bheka &quot;Climate futures: 2050 and 2080 flood, heat and wildfire&quot;). Izinhlobo ethi Wildfire exposure kanye ne-Heat: future weather file nazo zikuleli luhlu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"umoya\"\u003EUmoya\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIngcindezi ilandela ½ρV², nesivinini esikhuphuka ngokuphakama; amandla esitezi ngasinye yingcindezi leyo ephindwe ngesici sokuhlasela, izici ezimbili zengcindezi, ububanzi nobude besitezi. Uthola ukugoqa, umzuzu wokugingqika kanye nokunyakaza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuzamazama-komhlaba\"\u003EUkuzamazama komhlaba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsakhiwo se-shear: ubunzima ngasinye phansi (indawo esakheke kuyo × amakhilogremu ngemitha yesikwele, owawusetha), ukuqina okufanayo kuzo zonke izitezi okulinganiswa ngesikhathi sokuqala owasinikeza (isikhathi sesigamu sesibili ngesitezi uma usishiya singabhalwanga, futhi sikutshela lokho), ukuncipha, nokunyakaza komhlaba okwenziwe (isigameko esisodwa noma umsindo ohlungiwe) ngesivinini esiphezulu osikhethayo. Umphumela uba ukuhamba kwesitezi ngasinye, izivinini zamafloor nesisindo esiphansi; ukuphakama kuyidlala ukunyakaza, kudwetshwe kukhulu kunokuba kunjalo. Thayipha isilinganiso sokuhamba osivumelayo, nezitezi ezidlula kuso zibe yizexwayiso. Kuyisimo se-elastic: akukho okuvuma noma okuqhekeka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuqina-kwezitezi-kusuka-ku-analysis-frame\"\u003EUkuqina kwezitezi kusuka ku-Analysis frame\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze uthole ukuzamazama noma ukunyakaza komoya, khetha \u003Cstrong\u003EThe Analysis frame\u003C/strong\u003E njengomthombo wokuqina esikhundleni sokuthayipha isikhathi. Isitezi ngasinye siphushwa ecaleni ngokulandelana, ifreyimu (amabhimu, izinsika, izinsimbi zokuqinisa, namaslebhu) iyaxazululwa, futhi ukuqina kwezitezi konke kusebenza ndawonye kuyaqhuba ukusebenza. Isisindo yisisindo sezinto ezingokwazo kanye nomthwalo wesitezi ngamitha yesikwele owawusetha ipulani ngalinye lesitezi. Isikhathi sangempela sokuqala siyabonakala. Kuyisimo se-elastic: akukho okuvuma, nokujikeleza akumelwa. Ngomoya, amandla esitezi asasebenzisa lezi ezithathwe ngaphambili (iphrofayili yamandla, isici sakho sokuhlasela kanye nezici zengcindezi ezimisiwe, hhayi ikhodi yomoya; ukunyakaza kuphuma kufreyimu kuphela, ngokuxazulula ukuqina okuphelele kwefreyimu ngalawa mandla). Imodeli idinga i-IFC enefreyimu ethebhu Yokuhlaziya engayifunda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amayunithi\"\u003EAmayunithi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkujula kwamanzi, ukunyakaza nokuhamba ngesitezi, izibalo nezindawo kubonakala ngokusho kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnits\u003C/span\u003E oyikhethile. Amandla (kN), izikhathi nokusheshisa kugcina amayunithi azo, futhi inani olithayipha kubhokisi elibhalwe ngamamitha lihlala lingamamitha. Okufanayo kwimiphumela yokuhlanganiswa kwezindawo, ukukhanya kwemini, ukushisa nokupholisa kanye nokufaka izinto: ubude, izindawo nevolumu kulandela ukukhetha kwakho; ingcindezi, ukugeleza, izinga lokushisa, amandla nokusebenza kwawo akuguqulwa.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ingxenye ethi Hazard playback yephaneli elisekhohlo idlala ingozi kumodeli ye-IFC evulekile. Akukho okushintshwa kumodeli. Lezi yimodeli elula zokubona ukuthi ingozi yenza ini kulolu hlelo lwesakhiwo, hhayi ucwaningo lwezikhukhula, ukuhlolwa kwekhodi yomoya noma ukuklanywa kwesakhiwo. Umphumela ngamunye ubhala izimo zawo ezithathiwe. Izikhukhula Setha izinga eliphezulu lamanzi phezu kwesitezi esiphansi kakhulu nemizuzu yokukhuphuka, yokubamba nokwehla. Amanzi angena egumbini ngomgodi lapho ingcezu yawo yakudlula khona, nezindawo ezixhumene nezigumbi ezimanzi ngemigodi engaphansi kwamanzi zimi ezingeni elifanayo (quasi-static). Ithebhu ibonisa ukuthi yiliphi igumbi eliqala ukumanzisa nokujula kwalo; ipulani liyawudlala. Thayipha inani elikhulu kakhulu lamanzi igumbi elingawathatha, nezigumbi ezidlula kulona zibe yizexwayiso. Ikusasa lesimo sezulu: layisha ifayela lakho lesimo (JSON noma CSV enonyaka, ukukhuphuka kwezinga lolwandle nesici sezikhukhula) bese ukhetha unyaka. Noma vula okwengeziwe kwe-Climate futures bese ukhetha isimo nonyaka: izikhukhula zisebenza kabili, okwamanje kanye nokuzayo ngasohlangothini (bheka \"Climate futures: 2050 and 2080 flood, heat and wildfire\"). Izinhlobo ethi Wildfire exposure kanye ne-Heat: future weather file nazo zikuleli luhlu. Umoya Ingcindezi ilandela ½ρV², nesivinini esikhuphuka ngokuphakama; amandla esitezi ngasinye yingcindezi leyo ephindwe ngesici sokuhlasela, izici ezimbili zengcindezi, ububanzi nobude besitezi. Uthola ukugoqa, umzuzu wokugingqika kanye nokunyakaza. Ukuzamazama komhlaba Isakhiwo se-shear: ubunzima ngasinye phansi (indawo esakheke kuyo × amakhilogremu ngemitha yesikwele, owawusetha), ukuqina okufanayo kuzo zonke izitezi okulinganiswa ngesikhathi sokuqala owasinikeza (isikhathi sesigamu sesibili ngesitezi uma usishiya singabhalwanga, futhi sikutshela lokho), ukuncipha, nokunyakaza komhlaba okwenziwe (isigameko esisodwa noma umsindo ohlungiwe) ngesivinini esiphezulu osikhethayo. Umphumela uba ukuhamba kwesitezi ngasinye, izivinini zamafloor nesisindo esiphansi; ukuphakama kuyidlala ukunyakaza, kudwetshwe kukhulu kunokuba kunjalo. Thayipha isilinganiso sokuhamba osivumelayo, nezitezi ezidlula kuso zibe yizexwayiso. Kuyisimo se-elastic: akukho okuvuma noma okuqhekeka. Ukuqina kwezitezi kusuka ku-Analysis frame Ukuze uthole ukuzamazama noma ukunyakaza komoya, khetha The Analysis frame njengomthombo wokuqina esikhundleni sokuthayipha isikhathi. Isitezi ngasinye siphushwa ecaleni ngokulandelana, ifreyimu (amabhimu, izinsika, izinsimbi zokuqinisa, namaslebhu) iyaxazululwa, futhi ukuqina kwezitezi konke kusebenza ndawonye kuyaqhuba ukusebenza. Isisindo yisisindo sezinto ezingokwazo kanye nomthwalo wesitezi ngamitha yesikwele owawusetha ipulani ngalinye lesitezi. Isikhathi sangempela sokuqala siyabonakala. Kuyisimo se-elastic: akukho okuvuma, nokujikeleza akumelwa. Ngomoya, amandla esitezi asasebenzisa lezi ezithathwe ngaphambili (iphrofayili yamandla, isici sakho sokuhlasela kanye nezici zengcindezi ezimisiwe, hhayi ikhodi yomoya; ukunyakaza kuphuma kufreyimu kuphela, ngokuxazulula ukuqina okuphelele kwefreyimu ngalawa mandla). Imodeli idinga i-IFC enefreyimu ethebhu Yokuhlaziya engayifunda. Amayunithi Ukujula kwamanzi, ukunyakaza nokuhamba ngesitezi, izibalo nezindawo kubonakala ngokusho kwe-Units oyikhethile. Amandla (kN), izikhathi nokusheshisa kugcina amayunithi azo, futhi inani olithayipha kubhokisi elibhalwe ngamamitha lihlala lingamamitha. Okufanayo kwimiphumela yokuhlanganiswa kwezindawo, ukukhanya kwemini, ukushisa nokupholisa kanye nokufaka izinto: ubude, izindawo nevolumu kulandela ukukhetha kwakho; ingcindezi, ukugeleza, izinga lokushisa, amandla nokusebenza kwawo akuguqulwa.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"your-own-objects","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Letha izinto zakho namafayela omndeni emtapweni","summary":"Funda amafayela omndeni (.rfa) namafayela e-IFC, DWG, DXF, glTF noma OBJ kwithebhu ye-Umtapo, uwabeke njengamanye amaembulo womtapo, bese uwagcina ezintweni zami, uhlu oluyimfihlo oluyena wedwa okubonayo.","section":"tasks","order":62,"keywords":["rfa","umndeni","imindeni","umtapo womndeni","izinto zami","izinto zami","izinto ezizimele","umtapo ozimele","ngenisa izinto","okuqukethwe komkhiqizi","izinto ze-bim","into ye-ifc","gltf","obj","ibhulokhi ye-dwg","gcina","shintsha","fuduleka"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okufundwa-kusuka-kuhlobo-ngalunye-lwefayela","text":"Okufundwa kusuka kuhlobo ngalunye lwefayela","level":2},{"id":"amafayela-omndeni-nesimo-sawo-se-3d","text":"Amafayela omndeni nesimo sawo se-3D","level":2},{"id":"izinhlobo-zomndeni","text":"Izinhlobo zomndeni","level":2},{"id":"idatha-yomndeni-esimweni-sangempela","text":"Idatha yomndeni esimweni sangempela","level":2},{"id":"izinto-zami","text":"Izinto zami","level":2},{"id":"amaphutha-ajwayelekile","text":"Amaphutha ajwayelekile","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELetha izinto osezinazo ku-BimCraft: umtapo womndeni ovela ku-Revit, okulandwa komkhiqizi nge-IFC noma nge-DWG, noma i-mesh evela komunye umklami. Ufunda ifayela ethebhini le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmtapo\u003C/span\u003E, ubeke into emodelini yakho njengesakhi esifanele se-IFC, futhi, uma ufuna ukuyisebenzisa futhi kamuva, uyigcine ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinto zami\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula imodeli ye-IFC, noma qala isakhiwo esisha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ithebhu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmtapo\u003C/span\u003E eduze kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzici\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmafayela…\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha ifayela…\u003C/span\u003E. Khetha ifayela elilodwa noma amafayela amaningi ngesikhathi esisodwa: \u003Ccode\u003E.rfa\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.ifc\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.dwg\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.dxf\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.glb\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.gltf\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.obj\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E.csv\u003C/code\u003E. Noma chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha ifolda…\u003C/span\u003E ukufunda ifolda yonke namafolda angaphakathi kuyo (kuya kumafayela angu-200 ngesikhathi esisodwa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ikhadi ukubona okufundiwe: ukubuka kwepulani, igama, umkhiqizi nomodeli, usayizi nezinsiza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBeka epulanini\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBeka emodelini\u003C/span\u003E ukuyibeka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuze uyisebenzise futhi kwamanye amaphrojekthi, chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza ezintweni zami\u003C/span\u003E. Uma kufundwe amafayela amaningi, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza zonke ezintweni zami\u003C/span\u003E ayigcina ngesinyathelo esisodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKamuva, chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinto zami\u003C/span\u003E ethebhini le-Umtapo ukuze uzithole. Ziyabekwa, ziyashintshwa futhi ziyavuselelwa njenganoma yisiphi isinto somtapo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmafayela afundwa kule thebhu. Akukho okulayishelwa kuze kukhethwe \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza ezintweni zami\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufundwa-kusuka-kuhlobo-ngalunye-lwefayela\"\u003EOkufundwa kusuka kuhlobo ngalunye lwefayela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIfayela\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkuzothola\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIFC\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUhlobo ngalunye lwento njengento enesimo sayo sangempela se-3D, uhlobo lwe-IFC namasethi wezici\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EglTF, GLB, OBJ\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInto eyodwa enesimo sayo sangempela se-3D njenge-mesh. Setha iyunithi nokuthi yiliphi icala elikhombe phezulu kuqala.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDWG, DXF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbhulokhi ngayinye njengento enomdwebo wayo wepulani nezici\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfayela lomndeni (\u003Ccode\u003E.rfa\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIgama lomndeni, uhlobo, umkhiqizi, imodeli, amapharamitha nezinhlobo zawo. \u003Cstrong\u003EHhayi isimo sawo se-3D:\u003C/strong\u003E ibhokisi lobubanzi, ukujula nobude bomndeni liyamela.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECSV\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInto eyodwa ngomugqa ngayinye: igama, usayizi nedatha, idwetshwe njengebhokisi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amafayela-omndeni-nesimo-sawo-se-3d\"\u003EAmafayela omndeni nesimo sawo se-3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsimo se-3D esisefayeleni le-\u003Ccode\u003E.rfa\u003C/code\u003E sigcinwa ngefomethi engachazwanga, ngakho i-BimCraft ifunda idatha yomndeni futhi ayiqageli ijiyomethri yawo. Ikhadi liyasho: &quot;Ijiyomethri ayifundiwe kulo mndeni; ibhokisi liyamela.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze uletha umndeni nesimo sawo sangempela, uwukhiphe ohlelweni olwawenza (Revit):\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula umndeni, noma iphrojekthi enomndeni obekwe kuyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EFile &gt; Export &gt; IFC\u003C/strong\u003E. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/rvt-to-ifc\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/rvt-to-ifc\"\u003Eizilungiselelo zokukhipha ezivulwa kahle lapha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-BimCraft, funda ifayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.ifc\u003C/code\u003E nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmafayela…\u003C/span\u003E. Uhlobo ngalunye lomndeni lufika njengento yalo, nesimo nama-property sets alo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAbakhiqizi abaningi banikeza okulandwa nge-IFC noma nge-DWG ngasese kwefayela lomndeni. Lokho kufundeka ngqo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinhlobo-zomndeni\"\u003EIzinhlobo zomndeni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmndeni onezinhlobo eziningi ufika njengento eyodwa enesinqumo se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlobo\u003C/span\u003E, uhlobo olulodwa ngalunye. Uhlobo ngalunye lunamanani ahlukile phakathi kwezinhlobo, nebhokisi lalo uma uhlobo lunobubanzi nokujula. Umndeni onohlobo olulodwa uyinto evamile egcwele amanani alolohlobo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEzinye izindawo zigcina izinhlobo zazo ohlwini lwezinhlobo: ifayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.txt\u003C/code\u003E elinegama elifanayo elingaphansi kwefayela lomndeni. Khetha bobabili ndawonye, noma khetha ifolda, bese imigqa yohlu iba uhlobo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"idatha-yomndeni-esimweni-sangempela\"\u003EIdatha yomndeni esimweni sangempela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma ifolda inefayela lomndeni nefayela le-IFC, i-glTF noma i-OBJ elinegama elifanayo (\u003Ccode\u003EChair.rfa\u003C/code\u003E no-\u003Ccode\u003EChair.ifc\u003C/code\u003E), khetha bobabili ndawonye noma khetha ifolda. I-BimCraft yenza into eyodwa: ifayela lomndeni linikeza igama, umkhiqizi, imodeli, amapharamitha nezinhlobo, nelinye ifayela linikeza isimo sangempela se-3D. Izinothi zisho ukuthi isimo sivela kuphi. Isimo esisodwa sisetshenziswa kuzo zonke izinhlobo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma ifayela lomndeni linesithombe elisindisiwe kulo, imininingwane yento ikhombisa leso sithombe ngaphansi komdwebo wepulani. Isithombe sikhonjiswa khona kuphela; asigcinwa nento.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinto-zami\"\u003EIzinto zami\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinto zami\u003C/span\u003E uhlu lwakho oluzimele kumtapo. Wena kuphela ubona okukuwo: akusemtapweni womphakathi, akusesakheni, futhi akukhonjiswa ku-ithimba lakho. Ilandela i-akhawunti yakho, ngakho izinto ezifanayo zikhona kwenye ikhompyutha uma usungene kumtapo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKudingeka ungene kumtapo ukuze ugcine into. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/library-credits\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/library-credits\"\u003Engena kumtapo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkugcina into kuthumela into eyodwa ku-akhawunti yakho. Kuze kube yilapho, ihlala ekhompyutheni yakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa ezintweni zami\u003C/span\u003E isusa into ohlwini. Izikhopha ezisevele ezithombeni zomdwebo ziyahlala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuze wabelane nento nabo bonke, yilayishe emtapweni womphakathi, ngaphansi kwelayisensi okhetha wena.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinto zami zisahlolwa futhi kungenzeka zingakavulwa ku-akhawunti yakho. Uma umthombo ungekho, noma kuthi &quot;Izinto zami azikavulwa ku-akhawunti yale&quot;, ungafunda futhi ubeke amafayela akho nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmafayela…\u003C/span\u003E; alondolozwa ngaphakathi kumodeli yakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amaphutha-ajwayelekile\"\u003EAmaphutha ajwayelekile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkulindela isimo sangempela somndeni kwe-\u003Ccode\u003E.rfa\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/strong\u003E Idatha yayo kuphela ifundwa. Khipha i-IFC ukuze uthole isimo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinto ezimbili lapho ulindele eyodwa.\u003C/strong\u003E Umndeni nefayela lesimo yahlanganiswa kuphela uma amagama afana ngokuphelele, ngaphandle kokuphela, futhi zisefolda eyodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImesh ifika ingaphindwe ngamakhulu ayinkulungwane noma ilele ngasohlangothini.\u003C/strong\u003E Setha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmayunithi efayela\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEksi ephezulu ye-mesh\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmafayela…\u003C/span\u003E ngaphambi kokukhetha ifayela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Akukho datha yomndeni&quot; kwifayela.\u003C/strong\u003E Lena iphrojekthi (\u003Ccode\u003E.rvt\u003C/code\u003E egcinwe ngokuphela okwehlukile) noma ithemplethi yomndeni, hhayi umndeni. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/read-rvt-file\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/read-rvt-file\"\u003EFunda ifayela lephrojekthi noma lomndeni\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkugcina okuqukethwe ongavunyelwe ukukugcina.\u003C/strong\u003E Amanye amatheku akhokhelwayo awavumeli izikhopha ngaphandle kwesevisi yawo. Hlola imigomo yokuqukethwe ongakudalanga wena.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Letha izinto osezinazo ku-BimCraft: umtapo womndeni ovela ku-Revit, okulandwa komkhiqizi nge-IFC noma nge-DWG, noma i-mesh evela komunye umklami. Ufunda ifayela ethebhini le-Umtapo, ubeke into emodelini yakho njengesakhi esifanele se-IFC, futhi, uma ufuna ukuyisebenzisa futhi kamuva, uyigcine ku-Izinto zami. Izinyathelo Vula imodeli ye-IFC, noma qala isakhiwo esisha. Chofoza ithebhu ye-Umtapo eduze kwe-Izici. Chofoza Amafayela…, bese Khetha ifayela…. Khetha ifayela elilodwa noma amafayela amaningi ngesikhathi esisodwa: .rfa, .ifc, .dwg, .dxf, .glb, .gltf, .obj noma .csv. Noma chofoza Khetha ifolda… ukufunda ifolda yonke namafolda angaphakathi kuyo (kuya kumafayela angu-200 ngesikhathi esisodwa). Chofoza ikhadi ukubona okufundiwe: ukubuka kwepulani, igama, umkhiqizi nomodeli, usayizi nezinsiza. Chofoza Beka epulanini noma Beka emodelini ukuyibeka. Ukuze uyisebenzise futhi kwamanye amaphrojekthi, chofoza Londoloza ezintweni zami. Uma kufundwe amafayela amaningi, Londoloza zonke ezintweni zami ayigcina ngesinyathelo esisodwa. Kamuva, chofoza Izinto zami ethebhini le-Umtapo ukuze uzithole. Ziyabekwa, ziyashintshwa futhi ziyavuselelwa njenganoma yisiphi isinto somtapo. Amafayela afundwa kule thebhu. Akukho okulayishelwa kuze kukhethwe Londoloza ezintweni zami. Okufundwa kusuka kuhlobo ngalunye lwefayela Ifayela Okuzothola IFC Uhlobo ngalunye lwento njengento enesimo sayo sangempela se-3D, uhlobo lwe-IFC namasethi wezici glTF, GLB, OBJ Into eyodwa enesimo sayo sangempela se-3D njenge-mesh. Setha iyunithi nokuthi yiliphi icala elikhombe phezulu kuqala. DWG, DXF Ibhulokhi ngayinye njengento enomdwebo wayo wepulani nezici Ifayela lomndeni (.rfa) Igama lomndeni, uhlobo, umkhiqizi, imodeli, amapharamitha nezinhlobo zawo. Hhayi isimo sawo se-3D: ibhokisi lobubanzi, ukujula nobude bomndeni liyamela. CSV Into eyodwa ngomugqa ngayinye: igama, usayizi nedatha, idwetshwe njengebhokisi Amafayela omndeni nesimo sawo se-3D Isimo se-3D esisefayeleni le-.rfa sigcinwa ngefomethi engachazwanga, ngakho i-BimCraft ifunda idatha yomndeni futhi ayiqageli ijiyomethri yawo. Ikhadi liyasho: \"Ijiyomethri ayifundiwe kulo mndeni; ibhokisi liyamela.\" Ukuze uletha umndeni nesimo sawo sangempela, uwukhiphe ohlelweni olwawenza (Revit): Vula umndeni, noma iphrojekthi enomndeni obekwe kuyo. Khetha File \u003E Export \u003E IFC. Bona izilungiselelo zokukhipha ezivulwa kahle lapha. Ku-BimCraft, funda ifayela le-.ifc nge-Amafayela…. Uhlobo ngalunye lomndeni lufika njengento yalo, nesimo nama-property sets alo. Abakhiqizi abaningi banikeza okulandwa nge-IFC noma nge-DWG ngasese kwefayela lomndeni. Lokho kufundeka ngqo. Izinhlobo zomndeni Umndeni onezinhlobo eziningi ufika njengento eyodwa enesinqumo se-Uhlobo, uhlobo olulodwa ngalunye. Uhlobo ngalunye lunamanani ahlukile phakathi kwezinhlobo, nebhokisi lalo uma uhlobo lunobubanzi nokujula. Umndeni onohlobo olulodwa uyinto evamile egcwele amanani alolohlobo. Ezinye izindawo zigcina izinhlobo zazo ohlwini lwezinhlobo: ifayela le-.txt elinegama elifanayo elingaphansi kwefayela lomndeni. Khetha bobabili ndawonye, noma khetha ifolda, bese imigqa yohlu iba uhlobo. Idatha yomndeni esimweni sangempela Uma ifolda inefayela lomndeni nefayela le-IFC, i-glTF noma i-OBJ elinegama elifanayo (Chair.rfa no-Chair.ifc), khetha bobabili ndawonye noma khetha ifolda. I-BimCraft yenza into eyodwa: ifayela lomndeni linikeza igama, umkhiqizi, imodeli, amapharamitha nezinhlobo, nelinye ifayela linikeza isimo sangempela se-3D. Izinothi zisho ukuthi isimo sivela kuphi. Isimo esisodwa sisetshenziswa kuzo zonke izinhlobo. Uma ifayela lomndeni linesithombe elisindisiwe kulo, imininingwane yento ikhombisa leso sithombe ngaphansi komdwebo wepulani. Isithombe sikhonjiswa khona kuphela; asigcinwa nento. Izinto zami Izinto zami uhlu lwakho oluzimele kumtapo. Wena kuphela ubona okukuwo: akusemtapweni womphakathi, akusesakheni, futhi akukhonjiswa ku-ithimba lakho. Ilandela i-akhawunti yakho, ngakho izinto ezifanayo zikhona kwenye ikhompyutha uma usungene kumtapo. Kudingeka ungene kumtapo ukuze ugcine into. Bona ngena kumtapo. Ukugcina into kuthumela into eyodwa ku-akhawunti yakho. Kuze kube yilapho, ihlala ekhompyutheni yakho. Susa ezintweni zami isusa into ohlwini. Izikhopha ezisevele ezithombeni zomdwebo ziyahlala. Ukuze wabelane nento nabo bonke, yilayishe emtapweni womphakathi, ngaphansi kwelayisensi okhetha wena. Izinto zami zisahlolwa futhi kungenzeka zingakavulwa ku-akhawunti yakho. Uma umthombo ungekho, noma kuthi \"Izinto zami azikavulwa ku-akhawunti yale\", ungafunda futhi ubeke amafayela akho nge-Amafayela…; alondolozwa ngaphakathi kumodeli yakho. Amaphutha ajwayelekile Ukulindela isimo sangempela somndeni kwe-.rfa. Idatha yayo kuphela ifundwa. Khipha i-IFC ukuze uthole isimo. Izinto ezimbili lapho ulindele eyodwa. Umndeni nefayela lesimo yahlanganiswa kuphela uma amagama afana ngokuphelele, ngaphandle kokuphela, futhi zisefolda eyodwa. Imesh ifika ingaphindwe ngamakhulu ayinkulungwane noma ilele ngasohlangothini. Setha Amayunithi efayela no-Eksi ephezulu ye-mesh ngaphansi kwe-Amafayela… ngaphambi kokukhetha ifayela. \"Akukho datha yomndeni\" kwifayela. Lena iphrojekthi (.rvt egcinwe ngokuphela okwehlukile) noma ithemplethi yomndeni, hhayi umndeni. Bona Funda ifayela lephrojekthi noma lomndeni. Ukugcina okuqukethwe ongavunyelwe ukukugcina. Amanye amatheku akhokhelwayo awavumeli izikhopha ngaphandle kwesevisi yawo. Hlola imigomo yokuqukethwe ongakudalanga wena.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"georeference-any-projection","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Xhuma imodeli kunoma yiluphi uhlelo lwemephu","summary":"Tshela i-BimCraft ukuthi amakhoordinethi emodeli akuphi uhlelo lwemephu, kusuka ohlwini lwe-EPSG oluphelele, nanoma yiziphi izindawo ze-UTM, noma uhlelo oluchazwe nguwe, bese usebenzisa lowo kwi-Indawo, izendlalelo zemephu namafu amaphoyinti.","section":"tasks","order":62,"keywords":["iphrojekthi","uhlelo lwamakhoordinethi","crs","epsg","utm","izone ye-utm","uhlelo lwezifiso","proj4","umugqa we-proj","prj","wkt","georeference","ukuguqulwa kwemephu","ifc projected crs","amaprojekthi ami","ububanzi","ubude","easting","northing","lambert","gauss-kruger","state plane","national grid"],"headings":[{"id":"khetha-uhlelo-lwemodeli","text":"Khetha uhlelo lwemodeli","level":2},{"id":"amaprojekthi-ami","text":"Amaprojekthi ami","level":2},{"id":"okusebenzisa-kwakho","text":"Okusebenzisa kwakho","level":2},{"id":"imodeli-engakabekwa-emephwini","text":"Imodeli engakabekwa emephwini","level":2},{"id":"imodeli-esevele-emephwini","text":"Imodeli esevele emephwini","level":2},{"id":"amafu-amaphoyinti-nomhlaba-ohlelweni-olwehlukile","text":"Amafu amaphoyinti nomhlaba ohlelweni olwehlukile","level":2},{"id":"lapho-okuthile-kungaphelele","text":"Lapho okuthile kungaphelele","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EAmanye amapulani adwetshwe ohlelweni lwemephu olungafakiwe ohlwini olufushane: izone ye-UTM, igridi kazwelonke, noma iphrojekthi ethile ebhalwe njengencazelo yombhalo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinganisa\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlelo lwezixhumanisi…\u003C/span\u003E ikuvumela ukuthi usho ukuthi imodeli isebenzisa uhlelo oluphi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khetha-uhlelo-lwemodeli\"\u003EKhetha uhlelo lwemodeli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula imodeli, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinganisa\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlelo lwezixhumanisi…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThayipha ebhokisini lokusesha. Noma yiziphi zalezi ziyasebenza:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Einombolo ye-EPSG: \u003Ccode\u003E32633\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003EEPSG:2277\u003C/code\u003E;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eizone ye-UTM: \u003Ccode\u003EUTM 33N\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EUTM 20 S\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003ENAD83 UTM 15N\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EETRS89 UTM 32N\u003C/code\u003E;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eamagama asegameni: \u003Ccode\u003Elambert 93\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Emga zone 56\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Etexas central\u003C/code\u003E;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eincazelo yephrojekthi: \u003Ccode\u003E+proj=tmerc +lat_0=0 +lon_0=9 +k=0.9996 +x_0=500000 +y_0=0 +ellps=WGS84 +units=m\u003C/code\u003E, ngaphambili kwayo kungabekwa igama (\u003Ccode\u003EMy grid = +proj=…\u003C/code\u003E);\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eumbhalo wefayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.prj\u003C/code\u003E, noma sebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayisha ifayela .prj…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha umphumela, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESebenzisa lolu hlelo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkukhetha kugcinwa kwimodeli (isethi yezici ebizwa \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_CRS\u003C/code\u003E kwiphrojekthi), ukuze kuvuleke kanye nemodeli. Gcina imodeli ukuze uyigcine. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYisusa emodelini\u003C/span\u003E ibuyela kokushiwo yifayela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma incazelo yakho inikeza amakhoordinethi afanayo nohlelo olulodwa lwe-EPSG oluhlwini, i-BimCraft iyasho futhi isebenzise leyo khodi; uma uhlelo oluningi oluhlwini lunezibalo ezifanayo, nazo ziyabizwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amaprojekthi-ami\"\u003EAmaprojekthi ami\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIncazelo oyiphastayo noma i-\u003Ccode\u003E.prj\u003C/code\u003E oyilayishayo ingagcinwa nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGcina kuMaprojekta ami\u003C/span\u003E. Uhlu lutholakala kule divayisi (kulesi sibonisi) futhi lunikezwa ngesikhathi esilandelayo ovula isikhethi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okusebenzisa-kwakho\"\u003EOkusebenzisa kwakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinganisa\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo\u003C/span\u003E iguqula iphoyinti elikhethiwe libe ububanzi nobude ngohlelo lwemodeli. Ngaphambili yayima ngesaziso uma ifayela libiza uhlelo lwemephu ngaphandle kwekhodi ye-EPSG; manje, uma ukukhetha kulondolozwe, inikeza impendulo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzendlalelo zemephu ngaphansi kwemodeli zisebenzisa uhlelo olufanayo. Ifu lamaphoyinti noma ifayela lendawo ohlelweni olwehlukile lithola olwemodeli (bheka ngezansi).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBimCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha olunye uhlelo…\u003C/span\u003E isetha okubikwa yi-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo\u003C/span\u003E futhi: ububanzi nobude ohlelweni lwejografi olulodwa oluhlwini, noma i-easting ne-northing kunoma yiluphi uhlelo olukhishwe, ngaphezu kohlelo lwemodeli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imodeli-engakabekwa-emephwini\"\u003EImodeli engakabekwa emephwini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma ifayela lingenayo ukuguqulwa kwemephu, ukukhetha uhlelo kuvula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBeka le modeli kwimephu\u003C/span\u003E. Ungayivula nakusuka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinganisa\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmsuka wemephu…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENika umsuka wemodeli njenge-easting ne-northing ohlelweni, noma uthayipha ububanzi nobude bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuqula ibe ama-easting nama-northing\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENika ukujikeka ku-grid north (amadigri, ngokuphambene nokuzungeza kwamawashi; 0 kusho ukuthi i-Y axis yemodeli ibheka ku-grid north) nokuphakama komsuka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsikali siqala ngomehluko weyunithi phakathi kwemodeli nemephu (0.001 kwemodeli yamamilimitha ku-grid yamamitha). Shintsha kuphela uma kuyisibalo sesisekelo ku-grid esihlanganisiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBeka kwimephu\u003C/span\u003E. Isinyathelo esisodwa se-undo sibhala i-IfcProjectedCRS ne-IfcMapConversion (IFC4). Imodeli ngokwayo ayinyakazi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIfayela le-IFC2X3 alinazo zombili izinhlobo. I-BimCraft ibhala izinombolo ezifanayo ngendlela leso sethulo sivumela ngayo: amasethi ezici e-buildingSMART \u003Ccode\u003EePSet_MapConversion\u003C/code\u003E ne-\u003Ccode\u003EePSet_ProjectedCRS\u003C/code\u003E kwiphrojekthi, ububanzi nobude besayithi, nenyakatho yeqiniso. Ingxoxo iyasho lokho. Gcina imodeli ukuze uyigcine.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imodeli-esevele-emephwini\"\u003EImodeli esevele emephwini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma ifayela selizibeka emephwini uma ukhetha uhlelo olunye, i-BimCraft iyabuza:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShintsha okubikwa yi-Location kuphela\u003C/span\u003E igcina ukuxhumanisa kwemephu kwefayela futhi isebenzise ukukhetha kwakho ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo\u003C/span\u003E, izendlalelo zemephu namafu amaphoyinti (izinombolo zemodeli sezifundwa njengezikhona kuhlelo olusha).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa imodeli kulolu hlelo\u003C/span\u003E ibhala kabusha ukuxhumanisa: umsuka udlula ku-projection (easting, northing, ukuphakama, ukujikeka nesikali) futhi i-IfcProjectedCRS (igama, i-datum, i-projection, izone, iyunithi) iyabhalwa kabusha, ngakho i-IFC egciniwe ithi uhlelo olusha. Indawo emhlabeni ihlala ifanayo: umsuka ugcina ububanzi nobude bawo. Izinto ngaphakathi kwemodeli azishintshi; kushintsha ukuxhumanisa kuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIngxoxo ibonisa umsuka omdala nomusha ngaphambi kokuthi ukhethe. Ukuhamba khona nokubuyela kubuyisela umsuka ngaphakathi kwemilimitha eyodwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amafu-amaphoyinti-nomhlaba-ohlelweni-olwehlukile\"\u003EAmafu amaphoyinti nomhlaba ohlelweni olwehlukile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIfu noma ifayela lokuhlola linohlelo lwalo (LAS, LAZ, E57, GeoTIFF) noma akunalo. Uma lihlukile kohlelo lwemodeli, i-BimCraft inikeza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhrojekthela kabusha kuhlelo lwemodeli\u003C/span\u003E. Amaphoyinti ayahanjiswa ngamaqoqo (kwi-worker uma kukhulu, ukuze ikhasi lisasebenziseka), ifayela kukhompyutha yakho alithintwa, nomugqa wesimo uchaza okwenziwe. Vula ifayela futhi ukuze ubuyele kuhlelo lwalo. Kwifu elisevele livuliwe, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhrojekthela kabusha kumodeli…\u003C/span\u003E ebhareni lefu yenza okufanayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma ifayela lingasho uhlelo, i-BimCraft iyabuza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELe fayela lisohlelweni oluphi lwamakhoordinethi?\u003C/span\u003E: khetha ngo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha uhlelo…\u003C/span\u003E futhi impendulo iyakhunjulwa kulelo fayela kule divayisi. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGcina uhlelo lwefayela lwalo\u003C/span\u003E ushiya amaphoyinti njengoba enjalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lapho-okuthile-kungaphelele\"\u003ELapho okuthile kungaphelele\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinkinga zidwetshwa kwingxoxo nakuhlu lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinkinga\u003C/span\u003E, hhayi ngokuthula:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIndawo engaphandle kwendawo uhlelo olwenzelwe yona: izinombolo zisebenza, kodwa ukuphambuka kuyakhula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkushintshwa kwe-datum okudinga ifayela legridi (i-NADCON, i-NTv2 nezinye) akutholakali. Amahlelo e-datum ahlukile ahanjiswa ngokushintshwa okungelona igridi okudwetshwe ohlwini lwe-EPSG, futhi umphumela ucishe ufane nokunemba okushiwo, umlayezo unikeza kumamitha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIphoyinti elingenakuqanjwa liyashiywa futhi libalwe; ifayela elidlula umkhawulo wosayizi linqatshelwa nomkhawulo ushiwo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmakhoordinethi emephu adinga ukuguqulwa kwemephu. Ifayela elingenaso lihlanganiswa emephwini nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmsuka wemephu…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuhamba phakathi kwama-datum ngaphandle kwefayela legridi kuphelele kumamitha ambalwa; umphumela we-Indawo ushoo kuhle kangakanani uma ikhathalogi iyazi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Amanye amapulani adwetshwe ohlelweni lwemephu olungafakiwe ohlwini olufushane: izone ye-UTM, igridi kazwelonke, noma iphrojekthi ethile ebhalwe njengencazelo yombhalo. Linganisa › Uhlelo lwezixhumanisi… ikuvumela ukuthi usho ukuthi imodeli isebenzisa uhlelo oluphi. Khetha uhlelo lwemodeli Vula imodeli, khetha Linganisa, bese Uhlelo lwezixhumanisi…. Thayipha ebhokisini lokusesha. Noma yiziphi zalezi ziyasebenza: inombolo ye-EPSG: 32633 noma EPSG:2277; izone ye-UTM: UTM 33N, UTM 20 S, NAD83 UTM 15N, ETRS89 UTM 32N; amagama asegameni: lambert 93, mga zone 56, texas central; incazelo yephrojekthi: +proj=tmerc +lat_0=0 +lon_0=9 +k=0.9996 +x_0=500000 +y_0=0 +ellps=WGS84 +units=m, ngaphambili kwayo kungabekwa igama (My grid = +proj=…); umbhalo wefayela le-.prj, noma sebenzisa Layisha ifayela .prj…. Khetha umphumela, bese Sebenzisa lolu hlelo. Ukukhetha kugcinwa kwimodeli (isethi yezici ebizwa CadCraft_CRS kwiphrojekthi), ukuze kuvuleke kanye nemodeli. Gcina imodeli ukuze uyigcine. Yisusa emodelini ibuyela kokushiwo yifayela. Uma incazelo yakho inikeza amakhoordinethi afanayo nohlelo olulodwa lwe-EPSG oluhlwini, i-BimCraft iyasho futhi isebenzise leyo khodi; uma uhlelo oluningi oluhlwini lunezibalo ezifanayo, nazo ziyabizwa. Amaprojekthi ami Incazelo oyiphastayo noma i-.prj oyilayishayo ingagcinwa nge-Gcina kuMaprojekta ami. Uhlu lutholakala kule divayisi (kulesi sibonisi) futhi lunikezwa ngesikhathi esilandelayo ovula isikhethi. Okusebenzisa kwakho Linganisa › Indawo iguqula iphoyinti elikhethiwe libe ububanzi nobude ngohlelo lwemodeli. Ngaphambili yayima ngesaziso uma ifayela libiza uhlelo lwemephu ngaphandle kwekhodi ye-EPSG; manje, uma ukukhetha kulondolozwe, inikeza impendulo. Izendlalelo zemephu ngaphansi kwemodeli zisebenzisa uhlelo olufanayo. Ifu lamaphoyinti noma ifayela lendawo ohlelweni olwehlukile lithola olwemodeli (bheka ngezansi). Izilungiselelo › BimCraft › Indawo › Khetha olunye uhlelo… isetha okubikwa yi-Indawo futhi: ububanzi nobude ohlelweni lwejografi olulodwa oluhlwini, noma i-easting ne-northing kunoma yiluphi uhlelo olukhishwe, ngaphezu kohlelo lwemodeli. Imodeli engakabekwa emephwini Uma ifayela lingenayo ukuguqulwa kwemephu, ukukhetha uhlelo kuvula Beka le modeli kwimephu. Ungayivula nakusuka Linganisa › Umsuka wemephu…. Nika umsuka wemodeli njenge-easting ne-northing ohlelweni, noma uthayipha ububanzi nobude bese ukhetha Guqula ibe ama-easting nama-northing. Nika ukujikeka ku-grid north (amadigri, ngokuphambene nokuzungeza kwamawashi; 0 kusho ukuthi i-Y axis yemodeli ibheka ku-grid north) nokuphakama komsuka. Isikali siqala ngomehluko weyunithi phakathi kwemodeli nemephu (0.001 kwemodeli yamamilimitha ku-grid yamamitha). Shintsha kuphela uma kuyisibalo sesisekelo ku-grid esihlanganisiwe. Khetha Beka kwimephu. Isinyathelo esisodwa se-undo sibhala i-IfcProjectedCRS ne-IfcMapConversion (IFC4). Imodeli ngokwayo ayinyakazi. Ifayela le-IFC2X3 alinazo zombili izinhlobo. I-BimCraft ibhala izinombolo ezifanayo ngendlela leso sethulo sivumela ngayo: amasethi ezici e-buildingSMART ePSet_MapConversion ne-ePSet_ProjectedCRS kwiphrojekthi, ububanzi nobude besayithi, nenyakatho yeqiniso. Ingxoxo iyasho lokho. Gcina imodeli ukuze uyigcine. Imodeli esevele emephwini Uma ifayela selizibeka emephwini uma ukhetha uhlelo olunye, i-BimCraft iyabuza: Shintsha okubikwa yi-Location kuphela igcina ukuxhumanisa kwemephu kwefayela futhi isebenzise ukukhetha kwakho ku-Indawo, izendlalelo zemephu namafu amaphoyinti (izinombolo zemodeli sezifundwa njengezikhona kuhlelo olusha). Hambisa imodeli kulolu hlelo ibhala kabusha ukuxhumanisa: umsuka udlula ku-projection (easting, northing, ukuphakama, ukujikeka nesikali) futhi i-IfcProjectedCRS (igama, i-datum, i-projection, izone, iyunithi) iyabhalwa kabusha, ngakho i-IFC egciniwe ithi uhlelo olusha. Indawo emhlabeni ihlala ifanayo: umsuka ugcina ububanzi nobude bawo. Izinto ngaphakathi kwemodeli azishintshi; kushintsha ukuxhumanisa kuphela. Ingxoxo ibonisa umsuka omdala nomusha ngaphambi kokuthi ukhethe. Ukuhamba khona nokubuyela kubuyisela umsuka ngaphakathi kwemilimitha eyodwa. Amafu amaphoyinti nomhlaba ohlelweni olwehlukile Ifu noma ifayela lokuhlola linohlelo lwalo (LAS, LAZ, E57, GeoTIFF) noma akunalo. Uma lihlukile kohlelo lwemodeli, i-BimCraft inikeza Phrojekthela kabusha kuhlelo lwemodeli. Amaphoyinti ayahanjiswa ngamaqoqo (kwi-worker uma kukhulu, ukuze ikhasi lisasebenziseka), ifayela kukhompyutha yakho alithintwa, nomugqa wesimo uchaza okwenziwe. Vula ifayela futhi ukuze ubuyele kuhlelo lwalo. Kwifu elisevele livuliwe, Phrojekthela kabusha kumodeli… ebhareni lefu yenza okufanayo. Uma ifayela lingasho uhlelo, i-BimCraft iyabuza Le fayela lisohlelweni oluphi lwamakhoordinethi?: khetha ngo-Khetha uhlelo… futhi impendulo iyakhunjulwa kulelo fayela kule divayisi. Gcina uhlelo lwefayela lwalo ushiya amaphoyinti njengoba enjalo. Lapho okuthile kungaphelele Izinkinga zidwetshwa kwingxoxo nakuhlu lwe-Izinkinga, hhayi ngokuthula: Indawo engaphandle kwendawo uhlelo olwenzelwe yona: izinombolo zisebenza, kodwa ukuphambuka kuyakhula. Ukushintshwa kwe-datum okudinga ifayela legridi (i-NADCON, i-NTv2 nezinye) akutholakali. Amahlelo e-datum ahlukile ahanjiswa ngokushintshwa okungelona igridi okudwetshwe ohlwini lwe-EPSG, futhi umphumela ucishe ufane nokunemba okushiwo, umlayezo unikeza kumamitha. Iphoyinti elingenakuqanjwa liyashiywa futhi libalwe; ifayela elidlula umkhawulo wosayizi linqatshelwa nomkhawulo ushiwo. Amakhoordinethi emephu adinga ukuguqulwa kwemephu. Ifayela elingenaso lihlanganiswa emephwini nge-Umsuka wemephu…. Ukuhamba phakathi kwama-datum ngaphandle kwefayela legridi kuphelele kumamitha ambalwa; umphumela we-Indawo ushoo kuhle kangakanani uma ikhathalogi iyazi.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"climate-futures","scope":"bimcraft","title":"\"Izimo zesimo sezulu sesikhathi esizayo: izikhukhula, ukushisa nomlilo wehlathi ngo-2050 no-2080\"","summary":"Phinda uqalise izikhukhula, unyaka wamandla nokuhlola komlilo wehlathi ngesimo sezulu sesikhathi esizayo (izimo SSP2-4.5 ne-SSP5-8.5, iminyaka 2050 no-2080) kusuka kuphakheji yedatha yesimo sezulu, kubonisiwe ngaseceleni: okwamanje nesikhathi esizayo.","section":"tasks","order":63,"keywords":["isimo sezulu","ukushintsha kwesimo sezulu","isikhathi esizayo","2050","2080","ssp","cmip6","isimo","izinga lolwandle","izikhukhula","ukushisa","ifayela lesimo sezulu","epw","morph","energyplus","umlilo wehlathi","bushfire","isimo somlilo"],"headings":[{"id":"khetha-isikhathi-esizayo","text":"Khetha isikhathi esizayo","level":2},{"id":"ukukhukhula-kuseceleni-kwamanje","text":"Ukukhukhula, kuseceleni kwamanje","level":2},{"id":"ukushisa-ifayela-lesimo-sezulu-sesikhathi-esizayo","text":"Ukushisa: ifayela lesimo sezulu sesikhathi esizayo","level":2},{"id":"unyaka-wamandla-kuseceleni-kwamanje","text":"Unyaka wamandla, kuseceleni kwamanje","level":2},{"id":"ukuveza-umlilo-wehlathi-ukuhlola-kuphela","text":"Ukuveza umlilo wehlathi (ukuhlola kuphela)","level":2},{"id":"lapho-izibalo-zivela-khona","text":"Lapho izibalo zivela khona","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIzibalo zesimo sezulu zivela kuphakheji yedatha (\u003Cstrong\u003Edata pack\u003C/strong\u003E), hhayi ku-app. Vula i-add-on ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClimate futures\u003C/span\u003E ku-Izilungiselelo › Okwengeziwe, noma layisha ifayela lephakheji lakho ku-block ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClimate future\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIphakheji elize ne-add-on liyisampula: izindawo ezintathu (Denver, Miami, Johannesburg), imodeli yesimo sezulu eyodwa, kanye neminyaka emihlanu kuzo zonke izikhathi zeminyaka engu-20. Likhona ukuze uzame amathuluzi, \u003Cstrong\u003Ehhayi ukuklama\u003C/strong\u003E. Ipane iyasho lokho ngamagama anesibindi ngenkathi lisasetshenziswa. Iphakheji eliphelele (imodeli eminingi, zonke iminyaka, izindawo eziningi) lakhiwa nge-\u003Ccode\u003Etools/climate/build-pack.mjs\u003C/code\u003E kusuka kudatha ye-NEX-GDDP-CMIP6 kaNASA.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khetha-isikhathi-esizayo\"\u003EKhetha isikhathi esizayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKupaneli yesobunxele ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHazard playback\u003C/span\u003E, khetha \u003Cstrong\u003EIsimo\u003C/strong\u003E (SSP2-4.5, indlela ephakathi, noma SSP5-8.5, ukukhishwa kwamagesi okuphezulu) nonyaka \u003Cstrong\u003EUnyaka\u003C/strong\u003E (2050 usho 2041-2060, 2080 usho 2071-2090; zombili zibhekiswa ku-1995-2014). \u003Cstrong\u003EIndawo\u003C/strong\u003E iyindawo yephakheji eseduze kakhulu nesayithi lemodeli (ubude nobubanzi be-IfcSite), noma eyodwa ozikhethele yona. Uma ikude kakhulu kuzo zonke izindawo, kusetshenziswa izinguquko zomhlaba wonke zephakheji, nepaneli iyakusho lokho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukukhukhula-kuseceleni-kwamanje\"\u003EUkukhukhula, kuseceleni kwamanje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma isimo sikhethiwe, setha i-\u003Cstrong\u003EUhlobo lokukhukhula\u003C/strong\u003E: ogwini (lungeza ukuphakama kolwandle), umfula noma imvula enkulu (ijulile ngokushintsha kwemvula yosuku olumanzi kakhulu), noma kokubili. Cindezela Run: ukukhukhula kudlala njengakuqala, nethebula libonisa ukukhukhula kwamanje nokwesikhathi esizayo ngaseceleni (izinga lamanzi, amakamelo azomanzisa, amanzi ajulile kakhulu). Izinto ezithathelwe ingqalasizinda zibalwe ngaphansi kwalo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eizinga lasogwini likhuphuka ngokuphakama kolwandle kuphela; ukuvuvukala namagagasi akushintshi;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eukugeleza komfula kukhuphuka ngokulingana nemvula yosuku olumanzi kakhulu, nokujula kulandela ukugeleza kuphakanyiswe ku-0.6 (isibalo sikaManning somfula obanzi);\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Elezi zingxenye ezimbili ziyangezwa kanjalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukushisa-ifayela-lesimo-sezulu-sesikhathi-esizayo\"\u003EUkushisa: ifayela lesimo sezulu sesikhathi esizayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha uhlobo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHeat: future weather file\u003C/span\u003E, khetha ifayela lesimo sezulu le-\u003Ccode\u003E.epw\u003C/code\u003E lamanje bese ucindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMake the future weather file\u003C/span\u003E. Ifayela liyi-\u003Cstrong\u003Eishintshiwe\u003C/strong\u003E ngenyanga ngenyanga ngendlela yokushintsha nokwelula eshicilelwe (Belcher, Hacker and Powell 2005): izinga lokushisa elingokwesilinganiso senyanga liyafudumala ngokushintsha kwephakheji, ukushisa kwasemini kuyafudumala ngokushintsha kokushisa okuphezulu kosuku, nobusuku obubandayo bufudumala ngokushintsha kokushisa okuphansi kosuku; umswakama ohlobene uhamba ngokushintsha kwephakheji futhi iphoyinti lomswakama liyabalwa kabusha. Ingcindezi nomoya kuhlala njengoba kwakunjalo. Ithebula liqhathanisa izinga lokushisa eliphakathi nelishisa kakhulu, amazinga okuklama okupholisa ayi-0.4 % nokufudumeza ayi-99.6 %, amahora angu-30 °C no-35 °C kanye ne-degree-days.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave the future weather file\u003C/span\u003E iyalondoloza; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse it in the energy check\u003C/span\u003E iyiyisa kuhlolo lwe-EnergyPlus (ithebhu ethi Energy). Ifayela lesikhathi esizayo liyonyaka ofanayo ojwayelekile, ofudumele: alingezi amaza amasha okushisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"unyaka-wamandla-kuseceleni-kwamanje\"\u003EUnyaka wamandla, kuseceleni kwamanje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuhlolo lwe-EnergyPlus ethebhini le-Energy (i-add-on yalo, nenjini yakho), khetha ifayela lesimo sezulu lamanje, bese isimo nonyaka kwi-block yayo ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClimate future\u003C/span\u003E, bese ucindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESimulate a year: present and future\u003C/span\u003E: unyaka uqhuba kwifayela lamanje nakwelishintshiwe lesikhathi esizayo, nokushisa nokupholisa kwegumbi ngalinye kubhalwa ngaseceleni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuveza-umlilo-wehlathi-ukuhlola-kuphela\"\u003EUkuveza umlilo wehlathi (ukuhlola kuphela)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha uhlobo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWildfire exposure (screening only)\u003C/span\u003E: ukhula oluseduze kakhulu, ukuthambeka okusuka kukhula kuya endlini nedilo lakho. Umphumela ubanga kusuka kokuphansi kakhulu kuya kokuphezulu kakhulu, wamanje nesikhathi esizayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuhlola kuphela.\u003C/strong\u003E Lesi isikali sethu esiqhathaniswayo sokutshela ukuthi isayithi lidinga yini ukuhlolwa okufanele komlilo wehlathi, hhayi isilinganiso sekhodi noma izinga le-bushfire attack. Siphindaphinda isisindo sokhula, isilinganiso sokuthambeka (umlilo uzophuthuma ngamaphindwe amabili ngamadigri ayi-10 ukuthambeka okuphezulu, kubalwa kuze kube ngu-20 degrees), isilinganiso sebanga (10 m ihlukaniswe ngebanga, ikhulu kakhulu ngu-1) nokushintsha kwephakheji ku-Fire Weather Index.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lapho-izibalo-zivela-khona\"\u003ELapho izibalo zivela khona\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinga lokushisa, umswakama, ukukhanya kwelanga, imvula, isimo somlilo:\u003C/strong\u003E NASA NEX-GDDP-CMIP6, okuphuma kwemodeli ye-CMIP6 enqunyiwe ngansuku. Okuphuma kwemodeli ngayinye kungaphansi kwe-CC BY 4.0. Ukushintsha kwe-fire-weather kuyi-Canadian Fire Weather Index ebalwe ngosuku ngosuku kusuka esimweni semodeli (nomswakama wansuku esikhundleni somswakama wemini).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuphakama kolwandle:\u003C/strong\u003E isilinganiso somhlaba wonke se-IPCC AR6 (hhayi sendawo; ukuphakama noma ukwehla komhlaba akufakiwe kuso), uma iphakheji lingathwala izibalo zendawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIphakheji liveza umthombo waso, ilayisensi nosuku; ipaneli iyakubonisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Izibalo zesimo sezulu zivela kuphakheji yedatha (data pack), hhayi ku-app. Vula i-add-on ethi Climate futures ku-Izilungiselelo › Okwengeziwe, noma layisha ifayela lephakheji lakho ku-block ethi Climate future. Iphakheji elize ne-add-on liyisampula: izindawo ezintathu (Denver, Miami, Johannesburg), imodeli yesimo sezulu eyodwa, kanye neminyaka emihlanu kuzo zonke izikhathi zeminyaka engu-20. Likhona ukuze uzame amathuluzi, hhayi ukuklama. Ipane iyasho lokho ngamagama anesibindi ngenkathi lisasetshenziswa. Iphakheji eliphelele (imodeli eminingi, zonke iminyaka, izindawo eziningi) lakhiwa nge-tools/climate/build-pack.mjs kusuka kudatha ye-NEX-GDDP-CMIP6 kaNASA. Khetha isikhathi esizayo Kupaneli yesobunxele ethi Hazard playback, khetha Isimo (SSP2-4.5, indlela ephakathi, noma SSP5-8.5, ukukhishwa kwamagesi okuphezulu) nonyaka Unyaka (2050 usho 2041-2060, 2080 usho 2071-2090; zombili zibhekiswa ku-1995-2014). Indawo iyindawo yephakheji eseduze kakhulu nesayithi lemodeli (ubude nobubanzi be-IfcSite), noma eyodwa ozikhethele yona. Uma ikude kakhulu kuzo zonke izindawo, kusetshenziswa izinguquko zomhlaba wonke zephakheji, nepaneli iyakusho lokho. Ukukhukhula, kuseceleni kwamanje Uma isimo sikhethiwe, setha i-Uhlobo lokukhukhula: ogwini (lungeza ukuphakama kolwandle), umfula noma imvula enkulu (ijulile ngokushintsha kwemvula yosuku olumanzi kakhulu), noma kokubili. Cindezela Run: ukukhukhula kudlala njengakuqala, nethebula libonisa ukukhukhula kwamanje nokwesikhathi esizayo ngaseceleni (izinga lamanzi, amakamelo azomanzisa, amanzi ajulile kakhulu). Izinto ezithathelwe ingqalasizinda zibalwe ngaphansi kwalo: izinga lasogwini likhuphuka ngokuphakama kolwandle kuphela; ukuvuvukala namagagasi akushintshi; ukugeleza komfula kukhuphuka ngokulingana nemvula yosuku olumanzi kakhulu, nokujula kulandela ukugeleza kuphakanyiswe ku-0.6 (isibalo sikaManning somfula obanzi); lezi zingxenye ezimbili ziyangezwa kanjalo. Ukushisa: ifayela lesimo sezulu sesikhathi esizayo Khetha uhlobo Heat: future weather file, khetha ifayela lesimo sezulu le-.epw lamanje bese ucindezela Make the future weather file. Ifayela liyi-ishintshiwe ngenyanga ngenyanga ngendlela yokushintsha nokwelula eshicilelwe (Belcher, Hacker and Powell 2005): izinga lokushisa elingokwesilinganiso senyanga liyafudumala ngokushintsha kwephakheji, ukushisa kwasemini kuyafudumala ngokushintsha kokushisa okuphezulu kosuku, nobusuku obubandayo bufudumala ngokushintsha kokushisa okuphansi kosuku; umswakama ohlobene uhamba ngokushintsha kwephakheji futhi iphoyinti lomswakama liyabalwa kabusha. Ingcindezi nomoya kuhlala njengoba kwakunjalo. Ithebula liqhathanisa izinga lokushisa eliphakathi nelishisa kakhulu, amazinga okuklama okupholisa ayi-0.4 % nokufudumeza ayi-99.6 %, amahora angu-30 °C no-35 °C kanye ne-degree-days. Save the future weather file iyalondoloza; Use it in the energy check iyiyisa kuhlolo lwe-EnergyPlus (ithebhu ethi Energy). Ifayela lesikhathi esizayo liyonyaka ofanayo ojwayelekile, ofudumele: alingezi amaza amasha okushisa. Unyaka wamandla, kuseceleni kwamanje Kuhlolo lwe-EnergyPlus ethebhini le-Energy (i-add-on yalo, nenjini yakho), khetha ifayela lesimo sezulu lamanje, bese isimo nonyaka kwi-block yayo ethi Climate future, bese ucindezela Simulate a year: present and future: unyaka uqhuba kwifayela lamanje nakwelishintshiwe lesikhathi esizayo, nokushisa nokupholisa kwegumbi ngalinye kubhalwa ngaseceleni. Ukuveza umlilo wehlathi (ukuhlola kuphela) Khetha uhlobo Wildfire exposure (screening only): ukhula oluseduze kakhulu, ukuthambeka okusuka kukhula kuya endlini nedilo lakho. Umphumela ubanga kusuka kokuphansi kakhulu kuya kokuphezulu kakhulu, wamanje nesikhathi esizayo. Ukuhlola kuphela. Lesi isikali sethu esiqhathaniswayo sokutshela ukuthi isayithi lidinga yini ukuhlolwa okufanele komlilo wehlathi, hhayi isilinganiso sekhodi noma izinga le-bushfire attack. Siphindaphinda isisindo sokhula, isilinganiso sokuthambeka (umlilo uzophuthuma ngamaphindwe amabili ngamadigri ayi-10 ukuthambeka okuphezulu, kubalwa kuze kube ngu-20 degrees), isilinganiso sebanga (10 m ihlukaniswe ngebanga, ikhulu kakhulu ngu-1) nokushintsha kwephakheji ku-Fire Weather Index. Lapho izibalo zivela khona Izinga lokushisa, umswakama, ukukhanya kwelanga, imvula, isimo somlilo: NASA NEX-GDDP-CMIP6, okuphuma kwemodeli ye-CMIP6 enqunyiwe ngansuku. Okuphuma kwemodeli ngayinye kungaphansi kwe-CC BY 4.0. Ukushintsha kwe-fire-weather kuyi-Canadian Fire Weather Index ebalwe ngosuku ngosuku kusuka esimweni semodeli (nomswakama wansuku esikhundleni somswakama wemini). Ukuphakama kolwandle: isilinganiso somhlaba wonke se-IPCC AR6 (hhayi sendawo; ukuphakama noma ukwehla komhlaba akufakiwe kuso), uma iphakheji lingathwala izibalo zendawo. Iphakheji liveza umthombo waso, ilayisensi nosuku; ipaneli iyakubonisa.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"life-cycle-view","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Bona okuzoguga iminyaka engamashumi amahlanu","summary":"Amawindi, iminyango, izinhlangothi zokuqeda, uphahla nezinto emodelini, izikhathi zazo zokusebenza, iminyaka lapho ngayinye ishintshwa, nezindleko ngonyaka nenani lazo lamanje uma uthayipha indleko ngeyunithi.","section":"tasks","order":63,"keywords":["impilo yonke","impilo","isikhathi sokusebenza","ukushintshwa","ukugcinwa","izindleko","inani lamanje","ukunciphisa","ukwanda kwentengo","iminyaka engama-50","amawindi","upende","uphahla","izinhlangothi zokuqeda","impilo yonke yesakhiwo"],"headings":[{"id":"ukuyifunda","text":"Ukuyifunda","level":2},{"id":"ipayipi-ipayipi-lomoya-ukuwiringa-nemishini","text":"Ipayipi, ipayipi lomoya, ukuwiringa nemishini","level":2},{"id":"ikhabhoni-ngokushintshwa-ngakunye","text":"Ikhabhoni ngokushintshwa ngakunye","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIsigaba \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmbono wempilo yonke\u003C/span\u003E esingakhashana kwesokunxele sidweba okuqukethwe imodeli okuguguka nokuthi kushintshwa nini phakathi nesikhathi sokufunda (iminyaka engama-50 ekuqaleni). Akukho okushintshwa emodelini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuyifunda\"\u003EUkuyifunda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIngxenye ngayinye ibonisa inani layo (elilinganiswe emodelini: indawo yewindi, iminyango yangaphandle nangaphakathi, ukuqeda udonga lwangaphandle, upende wangaphakathi, ukuqeda iphansi nesilingo, indawo yophahla, izitebhisi), \u003Cstrong\u003Eimpilo ngeminyaka\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003Enendleko ngeyunithi\u003C/strong\u003E. Ingxenye ishintshwa ngemva kwempilo yayo, ngemva kwezikhathi ezimbili zempilo njalo njalo uma lokho kusengaphambi kokuphela kwesifundo, ngakho iwindi elinempilo yeminyaka engama-30 kusifundo seminyaka engama-50 lishintshwa kanye, eminyakeni engama-30. Izikhathi zempilo ezisetshenziswa ngokuvamile yizibalo zokuhlela ezijwayelekile: zishintshe ukuze zifanele imikhiqizo yakho nesimo sezulu sakho. Akukho sindleko esithathwa njengesivamile; thayipha esisodwa ukuze ubone imali ngonyaka, isamba nenani layo lamanje. Engeza izinga lokunciphisa nezinga lokwanda kwentengo uma uzifuna.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza uhlelo (CSV)\u003C/span\u003E ibhala izingxenye neminyaka. Amapayipi, amapayipi omoya, ukuwiringa nemishini nakho kufakwa oluhlu (bheka ngezansi).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ipayipi-ipayipi-lomoya-ukuwiringa-nemishini\"\u003EIpayipi, ipayipi lomoya, ukuwiringa nemishini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmapayipi namapayipi omoya\u003C/strong\u003E ayizinmitha zawo wonke umugqa odwetshiwe. \u003Cstrong\u003EImishini\u003C/strong\u003E (iziphampu, amafeni, amavalvu, amatheminali, izinto ezifakiwe, amasokhethi, amaswishi, amabhodi nezinye izinto ethrekisa ithebhu ye-Assets) ibalwa ngohlobo, ngalunye lunempilo yokuhlela. Into esethe \u003Cem\u003Eimpilo yensiza\u003C/em\u003E ethebhuleni le-Assets inomugqa wayo nalowo mpilo, futhi uma inedethi yokufakwa iqala ngeminyaka yayo: iphampu eneminyaka eyi-16 enempilo engu-10 isifanele manje, bese kusho ngayo yonke iminyaka eyi-10.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuwiringa\u003C/strong\u003E kuyisilinganiso: ibanga eliseplanini ukusuka ebhodini liye kumadivayisi ngamadivayisi esekethe ngayinye, eduze kakhulu kuqala,liphindwe nge-1.25 ngenxa yokuhamba kwamakhebuli. Imodeli ayidweshi ikhebuli, ngakho hlola lokhu nohlu lwakho lokubala amanani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzikhathi zempilo ziyizibalo zokuhlela okufanele ziphinde zibhekwe, hhayi umthombo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ikhabhoni-ngokushintshwa-ngakunye\"\u003EIkhabhoni ngokushintshwa ngakunye\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaka ikhabhoni eyakhiwe yokushintshwa ngakunye\u003C/span\u003E. Iwindi elisha, umnyango, isitebhisi, uphahla, ipayipi noma isiqephu semishini ibalwa ngekhabhoni elinalo izinto zemodeli zalolo hlobo (izinsiza zethebhu ye-Carbon, ngeyunithi). Ingxenye engenayo into noma insiza, njengopende, izinto zokuqeda nokuwiringa, ibonisa idashi futhi iyafakwa oluhlu. Impilo yokugcina yengxenye endala nomsebenzi wokuyishintsha akubalwa.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Isigaba Umbono wempilo yonke esingakhashana kwesokunxele sidweba okuqukethwe imodeli okuguguka nokuthi kushintshwa nini phakathi nesikhathi sokufunda (iminyaka engama-50 ekuqaleni). Akukho okushintshwa emodelini. Ukuyifunda Ingxenye ngayinye ibonisa inani layo (elilinganiswe emodelini: indawo yewindi, iminyango yangaphandle nangaphakathi, ukuqeda udonga lwangaphandle, upende wangaphakathi, ukuqeda iphansi nesilingo, indawo yophahla, izitebhisi), impilo ngeminyaka kanye nendleko ngeyunithi. Ingxenye ishintshwa ngemva kwempilo yayo, ngemva kwezikhathi ezimbili zempilo njalo njalo uma lokho kusengaphambi kokuphela kwesifundo, ngakho iwindi elinempilo yeminyaka engama-30 kusifundo seminyaka engama-50 lishintshwa kanye, eminyakeni engama-30. Izikhathi zempilo ezisetshenziswa ngokuvamile yizibalo zokuhlela ezijwayelekile: zishintshe ukuze zifanele imikhiqizo yakho nesimo sezulu sakho. Akukho sindleko esithathwa njengesivamile; thayipha esisodwa ukuze ubone imali ngonyaka, isamba nenani layo lamanje. Engeza izinga lokunciphisa nezinga lokwanda kwentengo uma uzifuna. Londoloza uhlelo (CSV) ibhala izingxenye neminyaka. Amapayipi, amapayipi omoya, ukuwiringa nemishini nakho kufakwa oluhlu (bheka ngezansi). Ipayipi, ipayipi lomoya, ukuwiringa nemishini Amapayipi namapayipi omoya ayizinmitha zawo wonke umugqa odwetshiwe. Imishini (iziphampu, amafeni, amavalvu, amatheminali, izinto ezifakiwe, amasokhethi, amaswishi, amabhodi nezinye izinto ethrekisa ithebhu ye-Assets) ibalwa ngohlobo, ngalunye lunempilo yokuhlela. Into esethe impilo yensiza ethebhuleni le-Assets inomugqa wayo nalowo mpilo, futhi uma inedethi yokufakwa iqala ngeminyaka yayo: iphampu eneminyaka eyi-16 enempilo engu-10 isifanele manje, bese kusho ngayo yonke iminyaka eyi-10. Ukuwiringa kuyisilinganiso: ibanga eliseplanini ukusuka ebhodini liye kumadivayisi ngamadivayisi esekethe ngayinye, eduze kakhulu kuqala,liphindwe nge-1.25 ngenxa yokuhamba kwamakhebuli. Imodeli ayidweshi ikhebuli, ngakho hlola lokhu nohlu lwakho lokubala amanani. Izikhathi zempilo ziyizibalo zokuhlela okufanele ziphinde zibhekwe, hhayi umthombo. Ikhabhoni ngokushintshwa ngakunye Khetha Faka ikhabhoni eyakhiwe yokushintshwa ngakunye. Iwindi elisha, umnyango, isitebhisi, uphahla, ipayipi noma isiqephu semishini ibalwa ngekhabhoni elinalo izinto zemodeli zalolo hlobo (izinsiza zethebhu ye-Carbon, ngeyunithi). Ingxenye engenayo into noma insiza, njengopende, izinto zokuqeda nokuwiringa, ibonisa idashi futhi iyafakwa oluhlu. Impilo yokugcina yengxenye endala nomsebenzi wokuyishintsha akubalwa.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"compare-scan-with-model","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Qhathanisa ukuskena nemodeli nohlelo lwe-4D","summary":"Hlola yonke into yemodeli ngokumelene nebhulu lamaphoyinti elivulekile (yakhiwe, ingxenye, ilahlekile, akufinyelelwe), bona iphesenti elakhiwe, udwebe imodeli ngalo, futhi nohlelo lwe-4D oluloyiwe, ubale okusemuva noma okusemberi kusuku lwe-4D.","section":"tasks","order":63,"keywords":["ukuskena","point cloud","progress","percent complete","built","missing","behind schedule","ahead of schedule","4D","site progress","deviation","as-built","laser scan","drone","qhathanisa"],"headings":[{"id":"okwenzayo","text":"Okwenzayo","level":2},{"id":"ngokumelene-nohlelo-lwe-4d","text":"Ngokumelene nohlelo lwe-4D","level":2},{"id":"ithebula-nemodeli","text":"Ithebula nemodeli","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EVula i-IFC, vula ibhulu lamaphoyinti ngaseceleni (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/point-clouds\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/point-clouds\"\u003EAmabhulu wamaphoyinti\u003C/a\u003E) bese uyibeka emodelini. Isigaba \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQhathanisa ukuskena nemodeli\u003C/span\u003E sivela ngakwesokudla lapho ibhulu livulekile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okwenzayo\"\u003EOkwenzayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQhathanisa\u003C/span\u003E. Isakhi ngasinye semodeli sihlolwa ngobuso baso, ngoba yilokho umskeni akubonayo. Izinhlangothi eziyisithupha zebhokisi lisikiwe zibe amaseli angaba ngu-20 cm; iseli libalwa uma iphoyinti lokuskena lisesikhaleni sakho se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubekezelela\u003C/span\u003E (50 mm ekuqaleni) kusuka ebusweni. Ubuso obukhulu obuhle obubalwayo, ngakho udonga oluskenwe ngohlangothi olulodwa alujezisi ngenxa yolunye uhlangothi lwalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EYakhiwe\u003C/strong\u003E: okungenani ama-40 % ebusweni ayabonakala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIngxenye\u003C/strong\u003E: 10 % kuya kuma-40 %.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIlahlekile\u003C/strong\u003E: ngaphansi kwalokho, kodwa ukuskena kuyifinyelela isakhi (amaphoyinti angaphakathi kwe-1.5 m kuso).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkufinyelelwe\u003C/strong\u003E: ukuskena akuyizanga lapho, ngakho akukho okushiwo ngayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKwezakhiwe nezingxenye zakhiwe, ukuskena kunika nesilinganiso samaphoyinti okuskena kusuka ebusweni bemodeli, futhi kushilo ukuthi isakhi sisendaweni yaso (ngaphakathi kokubekezelela), eduze (ngaphakathi kwezikhathi ezintathu) noma kude (ngaphezulu). Ibona kuphela ukungafani kuze kube yizikhathi ezinhlanu zokubekezelela; isakhi esakhiwe kude nendawo yaso ngaphezu kwalokho sifunda njengesilahlekile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsifinyezo sinika iphesenti elakhiwe phakathi kwezakhi ezifinyelelwe ukuskena, ngenani nangevolumu. Izakhi eziyingxenye ziyabalwa ngokwahlukana futhi azengezwa kwezakhiwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ngokumelene-nohlelo-lwe-4d\"\u003ENgokumelene nohlelo lwe-4D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELapho uhlelo lwe-4D lulayishiwe (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/4d-schedule\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/4d-schedule\"\u003EUhlelo lwe-4D\u003C/a\u003E), umphumela uphinde usebenzise usuku osulisethile ku-slider ye-4D: izakhi ezifanele ngalolo suku ezingabonakali njengezakhiwe yi-scan ziyi-\u003Cstrong\u003Eezemuva kohlelo\u003C/strong\u003E; izakhi ezingakafiki ezakhiwe ziyi-\u003Cstrong\u003Eezisemberi\u003C/strong\u003E. Izakhi ezemuva kohlelo zishiwo ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinkinga\u003C/span\u003E, futhi ithebula lingahlungwa lube lezo kuphela. Ngaphandle kohlelo akukho okushiwo ngokuthi ziemuva noma zisemberi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ithebula-nemodeli\"\u003EIthebula nemodeli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza umugqa ukuze ukhethe into. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDweba imodeli ngemibala\u003C/span\u003E ipenda izakhi zibe luhlaza (zakhiwe), zibe mthubi (ingxenye), zibe bomvu (ziyalahlekile) noma zibe igrey (azifinyelelwe); \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImibala yayo\u003C/span\u003E iyazibuyisela. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza i-CSV\u003C/span\u003E ibhala ithebula. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaka izakhi ezifanayo njengezihlolwe endaweni\u003C/span\u003E imaka zonke izakhi ezibonwe njengezakhiwe futhi zisendaweni yokubekezelela njengezihlolwe endaweni (LOD 500, indlela scan) ngesinyathelo esisodwa, osungasihlehlisa. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/verification\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/verification\"\u003EMaka izakhi njengezihloliwe noma zihlolwe endaweni\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELokhu kuqhathanisa ibhokisi lezakhi ngayinye namaphoyinti okuskena ngaphakathi kokubekezelela. \u003Cstrong\u003EAkuyona invo, akukhishwa kwezinto nezisekelo zokukhokha.\u003C/strong\u003E Into efihliwe ngemuva kwento eskenwe (udonga ngemuva kwesidwaba, isilabhu ngaphansi kokuqeda kwendlela) yabelana ngobuso bayo futhi ingafundeka njengakhiwe; isakhi esigobile noma esithambekile sinebhokisi elikhudlwana kunomzimba waso futhi singafundeka njengengxenye noma njengesilahlekile. Bheka uhlu ngaphambi kokuthatha isinyathelo. Amazwana emvume nezimpawu zenqubekelaphambili azikho lapha: zihlala ezikholomini ozigcina kuzo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmsizi angasebenzisa ukuqhathanisa okufanayo ngethuluzi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQhathanisa ukuskena nemodeli\u003C/span\u003E; ngeke ishintshe lutho emodelini.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Vula i-IFC, vula ibhulu lamaphoyinti ngaseceleni (bona Amabhulu wamaphoyinti) bese uyibeka emodelini. Isigaba Qhathanisa ukuskena nemodeli sivela ngakwesokudla lapho ibhulu livulekile. Okwenzayo Chofoza Qhathanisa. Isakhi ngasinye semodeli sihlolwa ngobuso baso, ngoba yilokho umskeni akubonayo. Izinhlangothi eziyisithupha zebhokisi lisikiwe zibe amaseli angaba ngu-20 cm; iseli libalwa uma iphoyinti lokuskena lisesikhaleni sakho se-Ukubekezelela (50 mm ekuqaleni) kusuka ebusweni. Ubuso obukhulu obuhle obubalwayo, ngakho udonga oluskenwe ngohlangothi olulodwa alujezisi ngenxa yolunye uhlangothi lwalo. Yakhiwe: okungenani ama-40 % ebusweni ayabonakala. Ingxenye: 10 % kuya kuma-40 %. Ilahlekile: ngaphansi kwalokho, kodwa ukuskena kuyifinyelela isakhi (amaphoyinti angaphakathi kwe-1.5 m kuso). Akufinyelelwe: ukuskena akuyizanga lapho, ngakho akukho okushiwo ngayo. Kwezakhiwe nezingxenye zakhiwe, ukuskena kunika nesilinganiso samaphoyinti okuskena kusuka ebusweni bemodeli, futhi kushilo ukuthi isakhi sisendaweni yaso (ngaphakathi kokubekezelela), eduze (ngaphakathi kwezikhathi ezintathu) noma kude (ngaphezulu). Ibona kuphela ukungafani kuze kube yizikhathi ezinhlanu zokubekezelela; isakhi esakhiwe kude nendawo yaso ngaphezu kwalokho sifunda njengesilahlekile. Isifinyezo sinika iphesenti elakhiwe phakathi kwezakhi ezifinyelelwe ukuskena, ngenani nangevolumu. Izakhi eziyingxenye ziyabalwa ngokwahlukana futhi azengezwa kwezakhiwe. Ngokumelene nohlelo lwe-4D Lapho uhlelo lwe-4D lulayishiwe (bona Uhlelo lwe-4D), umphumela uphinde usebenzise usuku osulisethile ku-slider ye-4D: izakhi ezifanele ngalolo suku ezingabonakali njengezakhiwe yi-scan ziyi-ezemuva kohlelo; izakhi ezingakafiki ezakhiwe ziyi-ezisemberi. Izakhi ezemuva kohlelo zishiwo ku-Izinkinga, futhi ithebula lingahlungwa lube lezo kuphela. Ngaphandle kohlelo akukho okushiwo ngokuthi ziemuva noma zisemberi. Ithebula nemodeli Chofoza umugqa ukuze ukhethe into. Dweba imodeli ngemibala ipenda izakhi zibe luhlaza (zakhiwe), zibe mthubi (ingxenye), zibe bomvu (ziyalahlekile) noma zibe igrey (azifinyelelwe); Imibala yayo iyazibuyisela. Londoloza i-CSV ibhala ithebula. Maka izakhi ezifanayo njengezihlolwe endaweni imaka zonke izakhi ezibonwe njengezakhiwe futhi zisendaweni yokubekezelela njengezihlolwe endaweni (LOD 500, indlela scan) ngesinyathelo esisodwa, osungasihlehlisa. Bona Maka izakhi njengezihloliwe noma zihlolwe endaweni. Lokhu kuqhathanisa ibhokisi lezakhi ngayinye namaphoyinti okuskena ngaphakathi kokubekezelela. Akuyona invo, akukhishwa kwezinto nezisekelo zokukhokha. Into efihliwe ngemuva kwento eskenwe (udonga ngemuva kwesidwaba, isilabhu ngaphansi kokuqeda kwendlela) yabelana ngobuso bayo futhi ingafundeka njengakhiwe; isakhi esigobile noma esithambekile sinebhokisi elikhudlwana kunomzimba waso futhi singafundeka njengengxenye noma njengesilahlekile. Bheka uhlu ngaphambi kokuthatha isinyathelo. Amazwana emvume nezimpawu zenqubekelaphambili azikho lapha: zihlala ezikholomini ozigcina kuzo. Umsizi angasebenzisa ukuqhathanisa okufanayo ngethuluzi Qhathanisa ukuskena nemodeli; ngeke ishintshe lutho emodelini.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"rvt-to-ifc","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Kusukela kwifayela leprojekthi kuya ku-BimCraft nge-IFC","summary":"Izilungiselelo zokuthumela ku-IFC ezivula kahle ku-BimCraft (inguqulo, amasethi wezakhiwo, izibalo eziyisisekelo, amagumbi, amafayela axhunyiwe, izixhumanisi), indlela yokuvula umphumela, nokuthi ukuthumela kugcina ini.","section":"tasks","order":70,"keywords":["thumela","ukuthumela kwe-ifc","rvt kuya ku-ifc","guqula","3d","geometry","ifc2x3","ifc4","coordination view","reference view","design transfer view","amasethi wezakhiwo","izibalo eziyisisekelo","amagumbi","izikhala","amafayela axhunyiwe","izixhumanisi ezabelanwayo","ipoyinti yesilinganiso","ipoyinti yesisekelo seprojekthi","izilungiselelo"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenziwa","text":"Okuzokwenziwa","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"izilungiselelo-ezivula-kahle-lapha","text":"Izilungiselelo ezivula kahle lapha","level":2},{"id":"okuzobonwa","text":"Okuzobonwa","level":2},{"id":"okugcinwayo-nokungagcinwa","text":"Okugcinwayo nokungagcinwa","level":2},{"id":"izinkinga-ezivamile","text":"Izinkinga ezivamile","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenziwa\"\u003EOkuzokwenziwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuqula ifayela leprojekthi libe ifayela le-IFC ongalijikeleza, ulihlole futhi ulihlele ku-BimCraft. I-BimCraft ayifundi imodeli ye-3D ngaphakathi kwefayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.rvt\u003C/code\u003E okwamanje, ngakho ukuthumela kwenziwa kuhlelo olwenza ifayela (Revit); i-BimCraft ivula umphumela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula iprojekthi kuhlelo olwayenza. Ikhadi le-BimCraft libiza inguqulo elagcinwa kuyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula ukubuka kwe-3D okubonisa lokho ofuna ukukuthumela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EFile &gt; Export &gt; IFC\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEbhokisini lokuthumela khetha isethi (noma \u003Cstrong\u003EModify setup…\u003C/strong\u003E) nezilungiselelo ezingezansi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha ifolda negama lefayela, bese uthumela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-BimCraft, chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChoose a file\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha ifayela elisha le-\u003Ccode\u003E.ifc\u003C/code\u003E. Amamodeli axhunyiwe athunyelwe njengamafayela awo angokwawo avulelwa endaweni eyodwa nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a model\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izilungiselelo-ezivula-kahle-lapha\"\u003EIzilungiselelo ezivula kahle lapha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsilungiselelo kumthumeli\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKhetha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKungani\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIFC version\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIFC4 Reference View\u003C/strong\u003E ukubukela, ukuhlola nokubala; \u003Cstrong\u003EIFC2X3 Coordination View 2.0\u003C/strong\u003E uma abanye bedinga i-IFC2X3\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZombili ziyavula ngokuphelele. \u003Cstrong\u003EIFC4 Design Transfer View\u003C/strong\u003E nayo iyavula, inezimo ezinembe kakhudlwana, kodwa ifayela linkulu futhi lishubile.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFile type\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIFC\u003C/strong\u003E (esijwayelekile)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-BimCraft ayivuli \u003Ccode\u003E.ifczip\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E.ifcxml\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhase / visible elements\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsigaba ofuna ukusithumela, ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EExport only elements visible in view\u003C/strong\u003E uma usethe ukubuka kwe-3D ngakho\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKushiya lokho owukufihlile ngenhloso.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EProperty sets\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EExport Revit property sets\u003C/strong\u003E ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EExport IFC common property sets\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZibe ngamasethi wezakhiwo i-BimCraft ayibonisa ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E, futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFind\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EColor\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel checks\u003C/span\u003E ayisebenzisa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBase quantities\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EExport base quantities\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantity totals\u003C/span\u003E nohlu basebenzisa lezi (ubude, izindawo, amavolumu) esikhundleni sokuqagela.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERooms and areas\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EExport rooms in 3D views\u003C/strong\u003E (noma inketho ye-Rooms / Spaces)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmagumbi afika njengezikhala: chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpaces\u003C/span\u003E ukuwabona.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinked files\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EExport linked files as separate IFCs\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsixhumanisi ngasinye siba ifayela layo; vula ndawonye nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a model\u003C/span\u003E bahlale benqamula ngokufanele.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECoordinate base\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EShared coordinates\u003C/strong\u003E (noma ipoyinti yesilinganiso)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfayela lithwala isikhundla salo emephini (IfcMapConversion), ngakho i-Linganisa › Indawo, izendlalelo zemephu phansi namapoyinti esikanini ahlelwe ngamakhodinethi emephu asebenza. Ipoyinti yesisekelo seprojekthi igcina imodeli eduze nomsuka kodwa ingenaso isikhundla sayo semephu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESplit walls and columns by level\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVula, uma uthatha izibalo ngesitezi ngasinye\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIngxenye yesitezi ngasinye iyinto yayo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzobonwa\"\u003EOkuzobonwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImodeli ku-3D, nezitezi ezithathwe emazingeni ephrojekthi kanye nolwazi lweprojekthi ephaneli ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E. I-\u003Cstrong\u003EExported from\u003C/strong\u003E ibiza isithumeli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okugcinwayo-nokungagcinwa\"\u003EOkugcinwayo nokungagcinwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKuyagcinwa\u003C/strong\u003E: ijiyomethri, izitezi, izinhlobo zezinto, amagama, izinhlobo, amapharamitha amaningi (njengamasethi wezakhiwo), izibalo eziyisisekelo uma zicelwe, amagumbi njengezikhala, nesikhundla semephu nama-shared coordinates.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkugcinwa\u003C/strong\u003E: izibuko, amashidi, okungeziwe okubhaliwe (annotation), imindeni njengemindeni ehlelekayo, ama-worksets namakhetho wokwakha. Ifayela le-IFC ngumfanekiso wezinto zemodeli, hhayi iprojekthi. Ngamashidi, thumela i-DWG bese uyivula ku-2D view.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinkinga-ezivamile\"\u003EIzinkinga ezivamile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmapharamitha angekho ku-BimCraft.\u003C/strong\u003E Vula izinketho zamasethi wezakhiwo ngenhla bese uthumela futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmagumbi angekho.\u003C/strong\u003E Vula inketho yamagumbi, bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpaces\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkugcina njenge-\u003Ccode\u003E.ifczip\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/strong\u003E Khetha i-IFC esijwayelekile, noma khipha i-\u003Ccode\u003E.ifczip\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkukho sikhundla semephu.\u003C/strong\u003E Thumela nge-shared coordinates; hlola ukuthi ipoyinti yesilinganiso seprojekthi isethiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkulindela ukuthi ushintsho lubuyele.\u003C/strong\u003E Ushintsho olugcinwe ku-BimCraft lungena efayeleni elisha le-IFC, hhayi efayeleni leprojekthi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenziwa Guqula ifayela leprojekthi libe ifayela le-IFC ongalijikeleza, ulihlole futhi ulihlele ku-BimCraft. I-BimCraft ayifundi imodeli ye-3D ngaphakathi kwefayela le-.rvt okwamanje, ngakho ukuthumela kwenziwa kuhlelo olwenza ifayela (Revit); i-BimCraft ivula umphumela. Izinyathelo Vula iprojekthi kuhlelo olwayenza. Ikhadi le-BimCraft libiza inguqulo elagcinwa kuyo. Vula ukubuka kwe-3D okubonisa lokho ofuna ukukuthumela. Khetha File \u003E Export \u003E IFC. Ebhokisini lokuthumela khetha isethi (noma Modify setup…) nezilungiselelo ezingezansi. Khetha ifolda negama lefayela, bese uthumela. Ku-BimCraft, chofoza Choose a file bese ukhetha ifayela elisha le-.ifc. Amamodeli axhunyiwe athunyelwe njengamafayela awo angokwawo avulelwa endaweni eyodwa nge-Add a model. Izilungiselelo ezivula kahle lapha Isilungiselelo kumthumeli Khetha Kungani IFC version IFC4 Reference View ukubukela, ukuhlola nokubala; IFC2X3 Coordination View 2.0 uma abanye bedinga i-IFC2X3 Zombili ziyavula ngokuphelele. IFC4 Design Transfer View nayo iyavula, inezimo ezinembe kakhudlwana, kodwa ifayela linkulu futhi lishubile. File type IFC (esijwayelekile) I-BimCraft ayivuli .ifczip noma .ifcxml. Phase / visible elements Isigaba ofuna ukusithumela, ne-Export only elements visible in view uma usethe ukubuka kwe-3D ngakho Kushiya lokho owukufihlile ngenhloso. Property sets Export Revit property sets ne-Export IFC common property sets Zibe ngamasethi wezakhiwo i-BimCraft ayibonisa ku-Properties, futhi Find, Color ne-Model checks ayisebenzisa. Base quantities Export base quantities Quantity totals nohlu basebenzisa lezi (ubude, izindawo, amavolumu) esikhundleni sokuqagela. Rooms and areas Export rooms in 3D views (noma inketho ye-Rooms / Spaces) Amagumbi afika njengezikhala: chofoza Spaces ukuwabona. Linked files Export linked files as separate IFCs Isixhumanisi ngasinye siba ifayela layo; vula ndawonye nge-Add a model bahlale benqamula ngokufanele. Coordinate base Shared coordinates (noma ipoyinti yesilinganiso) Ifayela lithwala isikhundla salo emephini (IfcMapConversion), ngakho i-Linganisa › Indawo, izendlalelo zemephu phansi namapoyinti esikanini ahlelwe ngamakhodinethi emephu asebenza. Ipoyinti yesisekelo seprojekthi igcina imodeli eduze nomsuka kodwa ingenaso isikhundla sayo semephu. Split walls and columns by level Vula, uma uthatha izibalo ngesitezi ngasinye Ingxenye yesitezi ngasinye iyinto yayo. Okuzobonwa Imodeli ku-3D, nezitezi ezithathwe emazingeni ephrojekthi kanye nolwazi lweprojekthi ephaneli ye-File. I-Exported from ibiza isithumeli. Okugcinwayo nokungagcinwa Kuyagcinwa: ijiyomethri, izitezi, izinhlobo zezinto, amagama, izinhlobo, amapharamitha amaningi (njengamasethi wezakhiwo), izibalo eziyisisekelo uma zicelwe, amagumbi njengezikhala, nesikhundla semephu nama-shared coordinates. Akugcinwa: izibuko, amashidi, okungeziwe okubhaliwe (annotation), imindeni njengemindeni ehlelekayo, ama-worksets namakhetho wokwakha. Ifayela le-IFC ngumfanekiso wezinto zemodeli, hhayi iprojekthi. Ngamashidi, thumela i-DWG bese uyivula ku-2D view. Izinkinga ezivamile Amapharamitha angekho ku-BimCraft. Vula izinketho zamasethi wezakhiwo ngenhla bese uthumela futhi. Amagumbi angekho. Vula inketho yamagumbi, bese uchofoza Spaces. Ukugcina njenge-.ifczip. Khetha i-IFC esijwayelekile, noma khipha i-.ifczip. Akukho sikhundla semephu. Thumela nge-shared coordinates; hlola ukuthi ipoyinti yesilinganiso seprojekthi isethiwe. Ukulindela ukuthi ushintsho lubuyele. Ushintsho olugcinwe ku-BimCraft lungena efayeleni elisha le-IFC, hhayi efayeleni leprojekthi.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"develop-a-mass","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Thuthukisa ubuningi besakhiwo kusuka ocwaningweni lwesayithi","summary":"Thatha ubuningi besakhiwo obucwaningwe embonweni wesayithi we-CivilCraft bese uluthuthukisa lube amazinga, izindonga namafloor, nendawo yesayithi ezindaweni zemephu igcinwe.","section":"tasks","order":71,"keywords":["ubuningi","ubuningi besakhiwo","ukwakha ubuningi","ucwaningo lwesayithi","thuthukisa","CivilCraft","nikeza","amazinga","izindonga","floor","isisekelo","georeference","IFC"],"headings":[{"id":"thuthukisa-ubuningi","text":"Thuthukisa ubuningi","level":2},{"id":"indawo-yesayithi","text":"Indawo yesayithi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EImbono yesayithi ye-CivilCraft ingadweba ubuningi bezakhiwo emhlabeni futhi iwuhlole ngomhlaba, imikhawulo oyibhalayo nelanga. \u003Cstrong\u003EThuthukela ku-BimCraft\u003C/strong\u003E ivula i-BimCraft kwithebhu entsha ngobuningi; \u003Cstrong\u003EUbuningi njenge-IFC\u003C/strong\u003E bulondoloza njengefayela ovula lapha ngendlela ejwayelekile. Kwenzeke kanjani noma kanjani, ubuningi ngabunye bufika njengesayithi, isakhiwo esinesitezi esisodwa ngasinye sendawo, nebhulokhi eyodwa (ubuningi ngokwabo) inezinombolo zalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"thuthukisa-ubuningi\"\u003EThuthukisa ubuningi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha ubuningi ku-3D view. Izimfanelo zibonisa ukusetshenziswa kwabo, izitezi nobude besitezi, isisekelo, indlela okuhlala ngayo esimeni, nephaseli labo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECofa \u003Cstrong\u003EDevelop this mass\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa, lonke izinga lalesi sakhiwo lithola izindonga ezungeza isisekelo (isisekelo siyisiphetho sangaphandle sezindonga; ngayinye yazo iphakama iye esitezini esingenhla, nowaphezulu uphakama isitezi esisodwa) kanye ne-floor ngaphansi kwakhiwo lonke. Ibhulokhi iyashintshwa, futhi isakhiwo sigcina izinombolo zocwaningo esethini lempahla \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_SiteMass\u003C/code\u003E, siphawulwe njengesithuthukisiwe. Akukho uphahla: uphahla lwncike kuklama.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"indawo-yesayithi\"\u003EIndawo yesayithi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIfayela elivela ku-CivilCraft libhalwe ngeyunithi yobude yeprojekthi ngokwayo, futhi uma iprojekthi ye-CivilCraft inohlelo lokuhlela, liyakuthwala njengokuguqulwa kwemephu yeprojekthi. Ukuthuthukisa ubuningi akulushintshi lolo lwazi, ngakho isakhiwo sihlala lapho imephu ithi kunjalo.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Imbono yesayithi ye-CivilCraft ingadweba ubuningi bezakhiwo emhlabeni futhi iwuhlole ngomhlaba, imikhawulo oyibhalayo nelanga. Thuthukela ku-BimCraft ivula i-BimCraft kwithebhu entsha ngobuningi; Ubuningi njenge-IFC bulondoloza njengefayela ovula lapha ngendlela ejwayelekile. Kwenzeke kanjani noma kanjani, ubuningi ngabunye bufika njengesayithi, isakhiwo esinesitezi esisodwa ngasinye sendawo, nebhulokhi eyodwa (ubuningi ngokwabo) inezinombolo zalo. Thuthukisa ubuningi Khetha ubuningi ku-3D view. Izimfanelo zibonisa ukusetshenziswa kwabo, izitezi nobude besitezi, isisekelo, indlela okuhlala ngayo esimeni, nephaseli labo. Cofa Develop this mass. Ngesinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa, lonke izinga lalesi sakhiwo lithola izindonga ezungeza isisekelo (isisekelo siyisiphetho sangaphandle sezindonga; ngayinye yazo iphakama iye esitezini esingenhla, nowaphezulu uphakama isitezi esisodwa) kanye ne-floor ngaphansi kwakhiwo lonke. Ibhulokhi iyashintshwa, futhi isakhiwo sigcina izinombolo zocwaningo esethini lempahla CadCraft_SiteMass, siphawulwe njengesithuthukisiwe. Akukho uphahla: uphahla lwncike kuklama. Indawo yesayithi Ifayela elivela ku-CivilCraft libhalwe ngeyunithi yobude yeprojekthi ngokwayo, futhi uma iprojekthi ye-CivilCraft inohlelo lokuhlela, liyakuthwala njengokuguqulwa kwemephu yeprojekthi. Ukuthuthukisa ubuningi akulushintshi lolo lwazi, ngakho isakhiwo sihlala lapho imephu ithi kunjalo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"pln-project-files","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Vula amafayela ephrojekthi e-.pln ne-.pla","summary":"Okwenziwa yi-BimCraft ngamafayela e-.pln, .pla, .tpl kanye .bpn njengamanje, nokuthi ungayithumela kanjani i-IFC ne-DWG kuwo ukuze imodeli nemidwebo kuvuleke lapha.","section":"tasks","order":72,"keywords":["pln","pla","tpl","bpn","ifayela lephrojekthi","i-archive","ithempulethi","ukusekelwa","ukuthumela i-IFC","ukuthumela i-DWG","umguquli","izindawo","amashidi"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"okuvulwa-njengamanje","text":"Okuvulwa njengamanje","level":2},{"id":"ukuthumela-i-ifc-imodeli","text":"Ukuthumela i-IFC (imodeli)","level":2},{"id":"ukuthumela-i-dwg-imidwebo","text":"Ukuthumela i-DWG (imidwebo)","level":2},{"id":"ukuxazulula-izinkinga","text":"Ukuxazulula izinkinga","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThola iphrojekthi elondolozwe njenge-\u003Ccode\u003E.pln\u003C/code\u003E (iphrojekthi), \u003Ccode\u003E.pla\u003C/code\u003E (i-archive nelayibrari yayo), \u003Ccode\u003E.tpl\u003C/code\u003E (ithempulethi) noma \u003Ccode\u003E.bpn\u003C/code\u003E (ukusekelwa) ukuze ungenise ku-BimCraft. Lawa ngamafayela e-Archicad angokwawo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuvulwa-njengamanje\"\u003EOkuvulwa njengamanje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmafayela ephrojekthi awavuli okwamanje.\u003C/strong\u003E Ifomethi yawo ayikashicilelwa, futhi i-BimCraft ayiwafundi okwamanje. Uma uvula elilodwa, i-BimCraft iyasho lokho futhi ikukhombise lapha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EI-BimCraft ihlola amabhithi okuqala efayela.\u003C/strong\u003E Amaphrojekthi e-Archicad kusukela enguqulweni 17 aqala ngesignature efanayo emfushane, ngakho i-BimCraft ingakutshela ngokuqinisekile ukuthi ifayela liphrojekthi ye-Archicad. Ifayela elinegama le-Archicad elingaqali ngaleyo ndlela mhlawumbe liqanjwe kabusha, lonakele, noma livela enguqulweni endala. Isignature ayihlukanisi iphrojekthi, i-archive nethempulethi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuthunyelwa kwe-IFC kuvula ngokugcwele\u003C/strong\u003E: imodeli ku-3D, izitezi, izindawo njengezikhala, idatha yezinto, amasethi ezakhiwo kanye nokuhlukaniswa, nakuyo yonke amathuluzi e-BimCraft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuthunyelwa kwe-DWG kuvula\u003C/strong\u003E ku-view ye-2D, nezendlela zayo nezakhiwo (layouts), nakwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E. Ukuze uhlele, sebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlela ku-CadCraft\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENoma yisa iphrojekthi yonke njenge-zip eyodwa, ne-views, izakhiwo namaqembu wezakhiwo: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/open-project-bundle\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/open-project-bundle\"\u003EVula ibhandi leprojekthi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuthumela-i-ifc-imodeli\"\u003EUkuthumela i-IFC (imodeli)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula iphrojekthi ku-Archicad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EFile &gt; Save As\u003C/strong\u003E, bese ukhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EIFC\u003C/strong\u003E njengohlobo lwefayela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha isiguquli se-IFC (igama le-Archicad lesethi yezilungiselelo zokuthumela i-IFC). Eyodwa ye-\u003Cstrong\u003EIFC4 Reference View\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003EIFC2X3 Coordination View 2.0\u003C/strong\u003E ifanele i-BimCraft. I-IFC4X3 nayo iyavula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha okuzothunyelwa: iphrojekthi yonke, noma izinto ezibonakala kuphela kumazitezi obukele wona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELondoloza, bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha ifayela\u003C/span\u003E ku-BimCraft bese ukhetha ifayela \u003Ccode\u003E.ifc\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHlola lezi ezilungiselelweni zesiguquli ngaphambi kokuthumela:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzindawo\u003C/strong\u003E: zithumele, ukuze amagumbi afike njengezikhala. Chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzindawo\u003C/span\u003E ku-BimCraft ukuze uzibone.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzici nokuhlukaniswa\u003C/strong\u003E: zithumele, ukuze zibonakale ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzici\u003C/span\u003E futhi zisetshenziswe ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThola\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmbala\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmanani aphelele\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.ifc\u003C/code\u003E evamile\u003C/strong\u003E, hhayi \u003Ccode\u003E.ifczip\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E.ifcxml\u003C/code\u003E. I-BimCraft ivula i-\u003Ccode\u003E.ifc\u003C/code\u003E evamile kuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuthumela-i-dwg-imidwebo\"\u003EUkuthumela i-DWG (imidwebo)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula ipulani, isigaba noma i-layout ofuna.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EFile &gt; Save As\u003C/strong\u003E, bese ukhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EDWG\u003C/strong\u003E njengohlobo lwefayela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha isiguquli se-DXF-DWG, bese uyalondoloza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuze uthole iseti yonke yamashidi, londoloza ama-layout ku-Layout Book, noma uwapapashe njenge-DWG.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula i-\u003Ccode\u003E.dwg\u003C/code\u003E ku-BimCraft. Imidwebo exhunywe ngokuthunyelwa ivulwa nayo uma isefolda efanayo; bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/dwg-linked-files\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/dwg-linked-files\"\u003EImidwebo nezithombe ezixhunyiwe\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuxazulula-izinkinga\"\u003EUkuxazulula izinkinga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;… iyiphrojekthi ye-Archicad: amabhithi ayo okuqala ayasho lokho.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Thumela i-IFC noma i-DWG njengoba kuchaziwe ngenhla, bese uvula leyo fayela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;… iqanjwe njengefayela le-Archicad kodwa ayiqali njalo.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Bheka ukuthi ifike kuphi: mhlawumbe iyolunye uhlobo lwefayela olunegama elisha (zama ukulivula ngesandiso sangempela), ikhophi engakaqedi, noma iphrojekthi evela enguqulweni engaphansi kwe-17. Yivule ku-Archicad uma ukwazi, bese uthumela i-IFC noma i-DWG.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImodeli ivula ngaphandle kwamagumbi.\u003C/strong\u003E Izindawo azithunyelwanga. Zivule kusiguquli se-IFC bese uthumela futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzimbobo azinqunywanga.\u003C/strong\u003E I-BimCraft ikutshela lokho ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EAkukadwetshwa okwamanje\u003C/strong\u003E ephaneli ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E. Thumela futhi; uma kuhlala, vula imodeli ngohlelo olwayenza bese uhlola izimbobo lapho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmbhalo ku-DWG ubukeka ngokwehlukile.\u003C/strong\u003E Ukuthunyelwa kungagcina amafonti e-BimCraft engenawo; i-BimCraft idweba umbhalo ngefonti elula ye-sans-serif.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBheka futhi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/rvt-to-ifc\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/rvt-to-ifc\"\u003EThola ifayela lephrojekthi ku-3D nge-IFC\u003C/a\u003E kanye \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/file-formats\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/file-formats\"\u003EOkufundwa yi-BimCraft kusuka kuyo ifomethi ngayinye\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Thola iphrojekthi elondolozwe njenge-.pln (iphrojekthi), .pla (i-archive nelayibrari yayo), .tpl (ithempulethi) noma .bpn (ukusekelwa) ukuze ungenise ku-BimCraft. Lawa ngamafayela e-Archicad angokwawo. Okuvulwa njengamanje Amafayela ephrojekthi awavuli okwamanje. Ifomethi yawo ayikashicilelwa, futhi i-BimCraft ayiwafundi okwamanje. Uma uvula elilodwa, i-BimCraft iyasho lokho futhi ikukhombise lapha. I-BimCraft ihlola amabhithi okuqala efayela. Amaphrojekthi e-Archicad kusukela enguqulweni 17 aqala ngesignature efanayo emfushane, ngakho i-BimCraft ingakutshela ngokuqinisekile ukuthi ifayela liphrojekthi ye-Archicad. Ifayela elinegama le-Archicad elingaqali ngaleyo ndlela mhlawumbe liqanjwe kabusha, lonakele, noma livela enguqulweni endala. Isignature ayihlukanisi iphrojekthi, i-archive nethempulethi. Ukuthunyelwa kwe-IFC kuvula ngokugcwele: imodeli ku-3D, izitezi, izindawo njengezikhala, idatha yezinto, amasethi ezakhiwo kanye nokuhlukaniswa, nakuyo yonke amathuluzi e-BimCraft. Ukuthunyelwa kwe-DWG kuvula ku-view ye-2D, nezendlela zayo nezakhiwo (layouts), nakwe-3D. Ukuze uhlele, sebenzisa Hlela ku-CadCraft. Noma yisa iphrojekthi yonke njenge-zip eyodwa, ne-views, izakhiwo namaqembu wezakhiwo: bheka Vula ibhandi leprojekthi. Ukuthumela i-IFC (imodeli) Vula iphrojekthi ku-Archicad. Khetha File \u003E Save As, bese ukhetha IFC njengohlobo lwefayela. Khetha isiguquli se-IFC (igama le-Archicad lesethi yezilungiselelo zokuthumela i-IFC). Eyodwa ye-IFC4 Reference View noma IFC2X3 Coordination View 2.0 ifanele i-BimCraft. I-IFC4X3 nayo iyavula. Khetha okuzothunyelwa: iphrojekthi yonke, noma izinto ezibonakala kuphela kumazitezi obukele wona. Londoloza, bese uchofoza Khetha ifayela ku-BimCraft bese ukhetha ifayela .ifc. Hlola lezi ezilungiselelweni zesiguquli ngaphambi kokuthumela: Izindawo: zithumele, ukuze amagumbi afike njengezikhala. Chofoza Izindawo ku-BimCraft ukuze uzibone. Izici nokuhlukaniswa: zithumele, ukuze zibonakale ku-Izici futhi zisetshenziswe ku-Thola, Umbala no-Amanani aphelele. .ifc evamile, hhayi .ifczip noma .ifcxml. I-BimCraft ivula i-.ifc evamile kuphela. Ukuthumela i-DWG (imidwebo) Vula ipulani, isigaba noma i-layout ofuna. Khetha File \u003E Save As, bese ukhetha DWG njengohlobo lwefayela. Khetha isiguquli se-DXF-DWG, bese uyalondoloza. Ukuze uthole iseti yonke yamashidi, londoloza ama-layout ku-Layout Book, noma uwapapashe njenge-DWG. Vula i-.dwg ku-BimCraft. Imidwebo exhunywe ngokuthunyelwa ivulwa nayo uma isefolda efanayo; bheka Imidwebo nezithombe ezixhunyiwe. Ukuxazulula izinkinga \"… iyiphrojekthi ye-Archicad: amabhithi ayo okuqala ayasho lokho.\" Thumela i-IFC noma i-DWG njengoba kuchaziwe ngenhla, bese uvula leyo fayela. \"… iqanjwe njengefayela le-Archicad kodwa ayiqali njalo.\" Bheka ukuthi ifike kuphi: mhlawumbe iyolunye uhlobo lwefayela olunegama elisha (zama ukulivula ngesandiso sangempela), ikhophi engakaqedi, noma iphrojekthi evela enguqulweni engaphansi kwe-17. Yivule ku-Archicad uma ukwazi, bese uthumela i-IFC noma i-DWG. Imodeli ivula ngaphandle kwamagumbi. Izindawo azithunyelwanga. Zivule kusiguquli se-IFC bese uthumela futhi. Izimbobo azinqunywanga. I-BimCraft ikutshela lokho ngaphansi kwe-Akukadwetshwa okwamanje ephaneli ye-File. Thumela futhi; uma kuhlala, vula imodeli ngohlelo olwayenza bese uhlola izimbobo lapho. Umbhalo ku-DWG ubukeka ngokwehlukile. Ukuthunyelwa kungagcina amafonti e-BimCraft engenawo; i-BimCraft idweba umbhalo ngefonti elula ye-sans-serif. Bheka futhi Thola ifayela lephrojekthi ku-3D nge-IFC kanye Okufundwa yi-BimCraft kusuka kuyo ifomethi ngayinye.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"open-project-bundle","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Vula isethi yeprojekthi","summary":"Isethi yeprojekthi iyi-zip eyodwa enemodeli, izibuko zayo, ukwakheka kwayo namaqembu wezakhiwo. Yivule, bonisa umbono ngesitezi nezingqimba zawo, vula ukwakheka, bese ubona izakhiwo emaqenjini eprojekthi yayo.","section":"tasks","order":73,"keywords":["isethi","isethi yeprojekthi","ccbundle","zip","imibono","imephu yombono","ukwakheka","incwadi yokwakheka","inhlanganisela yongqimba","amaqembu wezakhiwo","imigomo","pln","isifanekiso"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"ukwenza-isethi","text":"Ukwenza isethi","level":2},{"id":"vula-isethi","text":"Vula isethi","level":2},{"id":"bonisa-umbono","text":"Bonisa umbono","level":2},{"id":"vula-ukwakheka","text":"Vula ukwakheka","level":2},{"id":"bona-izakhi-emaqenjini-eprojekthi","text":"Bona izakhi emaqenjini eprojekthi","level":2},{"id":"imigomo-namanothi","text":"Imigomo namanothi","level":2},{"id":"ukuxazulula-izinkinga","text":"Ukuxazulula izinkinga","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula \u003Cstrong\u003Eisethi yeprojekthi\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Ccode\u003E.ccbundle.zip\u003C/code\u003E) bese usebenza neprojekthi njengoba yahlelwa: izibuko zayo, ukwakheka kwayo namaqembu wezakhiwo, phezu kwemodeli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsethi iqukethe:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eimodeli njenge-IFC,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eukwakheka njenge-PDF ne-DWG,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Euhlu lwezinto i-IFC engazifaki: izibuko (ngayinye nesitezi, inhlanganisela yongqimba nesikali sayo), ukwakheka nemidwebo ebekwe kuyo, izincazelo zezakhiwo emaqenjini azo, izigaxekiso, nemigomo efana nezingqimba, amasethi amapeni, izinhlobo zemigqa, izigcwalisi, izindawo nezinhlanganisela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmasethi abhalwa yiskripthi esivulekile esisebenza ngaphakathi kwe-Archicad futhi sicela i-Archicad ngokwayo lezi zinhlu. I-BimCraft ayikaze ifunde amafayela \u003Ccode\u003E.pln\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E.tpl\u003C/code\u003E ngqo; bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/pln-project-files\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/pln-project-files\"\u003EVula amafayela eprojekthi .pln ne-.pla\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukwenza-isethi\"\u003EUkwenza isethi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELeli skripthi lisemgqeni wokuhlolwa: alikaze lihlolwe kuzo zonke izinguqulo ze-Archicad. Lithole kule \u003Ca href=\"https://github.com/getcadcraft/bim-project-bundle\" class=\"hx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003Egithub.com/getcadcraft/bim-project-bundle\u003C/a\u003E. Udinga i-Archicad 24 noma eyamuva nePython 3.8 noma eyamuva; akudingeki okunye okufakwayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELondoloza \u003Ccode\u003Earchicad_bundle.py\u003C/code\u003E kufolda, isibonelo \u003Ccode\u003EC:\\cc-bundle\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-Archicad, vula iprojekthi bese wenza isethi yomshicileli ebizwa ngokuqondile \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft bundle\u003C/strong\u003E: umbono we-3D njenge-IFC, wonke ukwakheka njenge-PDF, bese wonke ukwakheka futhi njenge-DWG, kushicilelwe emafayeleni ediskini kufolda eyodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgiprojekthi evulekile, qhuba \u003Ccode\u003Epython archicad_bundle.py --probe --out .\u003C/code\u003E kanye. Ifunda kuphela, ibhale \u003Ccode\u003Eprobe.json\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQhuba \u003Ccode\u003Epython archicad_bundle.py --out . --translator &quot;IFC4 Reference View&quot;\u003C/code\u003E (sebenzisa isiguquli se-IFC okukhethile). I-Archicad ishicilela isethi, bese iskripthi libhala \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;project&gt;.ccbundle.zip\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma ukushicilela ngeskripthi kwehluleka, shicilela isethi ngesandla bese uqhuba \u003Ccode\u003Epython archicad_bundle.py --out . --no-publish --files &lt;folder&gt;\\*.ifc &lt;folder&gt;\\*.pdf &lt;folder&gt;\\*.dwg\u003C/code\u003E. I-README yerepository inazo zonke izinketho. Uma okuthile kungafiki, vula isihloko lapho bese uhlanganisa \u003Ccode\u003Eprobe.json\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vula-isethi\"\u003EVula isethi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha ifayela\u003C/span\u003E, noma wehlise \u003Ccode\u003E.ccbundle.zip\u003C/code\u003E ku-BimCraft. Ku-folda ovule nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula ifolda\u003C/span\u003E, amasethi ahlolwa ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EAmasethi eprojekthi\u003C/strong\u003E; chofoza elinye ngegama lalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImodeli ivulwa njengoba i-IFC ivulwa njalo, futhi isigaba se-\u003Cstrong\u003EIsethi yeprojekthi\u003C/strong\u003E sivela ngakwesobunxele, ngaphansi kwezici zefayela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAkukho okulayishwayo: isethi ifundwa ekhompyutheni yakho, ifayela elilodwa ngesikhathi, ngakho imodeli enkulu ayikopishwa kabili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bonisa-umbono\"\u003EBonisa umbono\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EImibono\u003C/strong\u003E, imibono ihlelwe ngamafolda ebenawo kuprojekthi. Chofoza igama lombono:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmbono wephansi\u003C/strong\u003E ubonisa isitezi sawo kuphela, ubukwe ngaphezulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInhlanganisela yongqimba\u003C/strong\u003E ifihla izakhi ezingqimbeni ezifihlwa yiyo. Umugqa wesimo utshela ukuthi izakhi ezingaki ezifihliwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsikali\u003C/strong\u003E sibonakala ngasecaleni kwegama nasemgqeni wesimo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmbono we-3D\u003C/strong\u003E ubonisa wonke amasitezi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze ubonise konke futhi, sebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa konke\u003C/span\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha wonke amasitezi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-BimCraft ithola izingqimba ngokusebenzisa izabelo zezingqimba zefayela le-IFC. Uma i-IFC ithunyelwe ngaphandle kwazo, inhlanganisela yongqimba ayifihli lutho, futhi umugqa wesimo uthi izakhi ezifihliwe ziyi-0.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vula-ukwakheka\"\u003EVula ukwakheka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EUkwakheka\u003C/strong\u003E, ukwakheka ngakunye kubonisa inombolo yakho, igama, usayizi wephepha nemibono ebekwe kuyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPDF\u003C/strong\u003E igcina i-PDF yokwakheka kusuka kwisethi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDWG\u003C/strong\u003E ivula umdwebo wokwakheka ku-2D view. Chofoza noma yimuphi umbono ukuze ubuyele kumodeli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EVula ku…\u003C/strong\u003E ithumela ifayela lokwakheka ku-app eyilungisayo, ethebhini elisha: i-PDF iya ku-MarkupCraft, i-DWG iya ku-CadCraft. Ivela kuphela lapho leyo app ivulekile eduze ne-BimCraft. Ifayela lifundwa kusuka kwisethi njengoba ithebhu lilayisha, futhi akukho okulayishwayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkwakheka okungenalo okukodwa kwalezi bhala \u003Cstrong\u003EAkukho ifayela kwisethi\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bona-izakhi-emaqenjini-eprojekthi\"\u003EBona izakhi emaqenjini eprojekthi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha into. \u003Cstrong\u003EAmaqembu wezakhi\u003C/strong\u003E ibonisa izakhi zayo ngaphansi kwamaqembu eprojekthi achazile, ehlanganiswe ngesethi yempahla negama elinikezwa inkcazo ye-IFC, noma ngegama layo. Okusele kuhlala ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzici\u003C/span\u003E njengoba kujwayelekile. \u003Cstrong\u003EIzincazelo zezakhi\u003C/strong\u003E zidweba zonke izincazelo ngeqembu layo, uhlobo negama le-IFC.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imigomo-namanothi\"\u003EImigomo namanothi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImigomo\u003C/strong\u003E ibala izingqimba, inhlanganisela yezingqimba, amasethi amapeni, izinhlobo zemigqa, izigcwalisi, izindawo, izinhlanganisela nezinto ezisesethini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmanothi\u003C/strong\u003E adwebe okungakwazanga ukuthathwa yiskripthi kulowo khipha we-Archicad, noma yimuphi ensimu i-BimCraft ingayifunda, nanoma iyiphi ifayela isethi eyibiza kodwa ingayibambi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuxazulula-izinkinga\"\u003EUkuxazulula izinkinga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;… iyi-zip kodwa ayisona isethi yeprojekthi.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E I-zip ayinayo i-\u003Ccode\u003Emanifest.json\u003C/code\u003E. Yikhiphe bese uvula i-\u003Ccode\u003E.ifc\u003C/code\u003E ekuyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;… iyisethi yeprojekthi entsha kunaleli BimCraft elifunda.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Vuselela i-BimCraft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;… alikho imodeli ibhekisa kuyo i-manifest yalo.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E I-zip inqunyiwe noma ihlelwe. Yenza kabusha isethi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmbono ubonisa wonke amasitezi.\u003C/strong\u003E Isitezi salo asiseyo ku-IFC yemodeli (umugqa wesimo uyakusho). Hlola ukuthi ukuthunyelwa kwe-IFC kubandakanye leso sitezi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBheka futhi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/two-bim-programs\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/two-bim-programs\"\u003EUkusebenza phakathi kwezinhlelo ezimbili ze-BIM\u003C/a\u003E kanye \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/file-formats\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/file-formats\"\u003Enokufundwa yi-BimCraft kusuka kwifomethi ngayinye\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Vula isethi yeprojekthi (.ccbundle.zip) bese usebenza neprojekthi njengoba yahlelwa: izibuko zayo, ukwakheka kwayo namaqembu wezakhiwo, phezu kwemodeli. Isethi iqukethe: imodeli njenge-IFC, ukwakheka njenge-PDF ne-DWG, uhlu lwezinto i-IFC engazifaki: izibuko (ngayinye nesitezi, inhlanganisela yongqimba nesikali sayo), ukwakheka nemidwebo ebekwe kuyo, izincazelo zezakhiwo emaqenjini azo, izigaxekiso, nemigomo efana nezingqimba, amasethi amapeni, izinhlobo zemigqa, izigcwalisi, izindawo nezinhlanganisela. Amasethi abhalwa yiskripthi esivulekile esisebenza ngaphakathi kwe-Archicad futhi sicela i-Archicad ngokwayo lezi zinhlu. I-BimCraft ayikaze ifunde amafayela .pln noma .tpl ngqo; bheka Vula amafayela eprojekthi .pln ne-.pla. Ukwenza isethi Leli skripthi lisemgqeni wokuhlolwa: alikaze lihlolwe kuzo zonke izinguqulo ze-Archicad. Lithole kule github.com/getcadcraft/bim-project-bundle. Udinga i-Archicad 24 noma eyamuva nePython 3.8 noma eyamuva; akudingeki okunye okufakwayo. Londoloza archicad_bundle.py kufolda, isibonelo C:\\cc-bundle. Ku-Archicad, vula iprojekthi bese wenza isethi yomshicileli ebizwa ngokuqondile CadCraft bundle: umbono we-3D njenge-IFC, wonke ukwakheka njenge-PDF, bese wonke ukwakheka futhi njenge-DWG, kushicilelwe emafayeleni ediskini kufolda eyodwa. Ngiprojekthi evulekile, qhuba python archicad_bundle.py --probe --out . kanye. Ifunda kuphela, ibhale probe.json. Qhuba python archicad_bundle.py --out . --translator \"IFC4 Reference View\" (sebenzisa isiguquli se-IFC okukhethile). I-Archicad ishicilela isethi, bese iskripthi libhala \u003Cproject\u003E.ccbundle.zip. Uma ukushicilela ngeskripthi kwehluleka, shicilela isethi ngesandla bese uqhuba python archicad_bundle.py --out . --no-publish --files \u003Cfolder\u003E\\*.ifc \u003Cfolder\u003E\\*.pdf \u003Cfolder\u003E\\*.dwg. I-README yerepository inazo zonke izinketho. Uma okuthile kungafiki, vula isihloko lapho bese uhlanganisa probe.json. Vula isethi Chofoza Khetha ifayela, noma wehlise .ccbundle.zip ku-BimCraft. Ku-folda ovule nge-Vula ifolda, amasethi ahlolwa ngaphansi kwe-Amasethi eprojekthi; chofoza elinye ngegama lalo. Imodeli ivulwa njengoba i-IFC ivulwa njalo, futhi isigaba se-Isethi yeprojekthi sivela ngakwesobunxele, ngaphansi kwezici zefayela. Akukho okulayishwayo: isethi ifundwa ekhompyutheni yakho, ifayela elilodwa ngesikhathi, ngakho imodeli enkulu ayikopishwa kabili. Bonisa umbono Ngaphansi kwe-Imibono, imibono ihlelwe ngamafolda ebenawo kuprojekthi. Chofoza igama lombono: Umbono wephansi ubonisa isitezi sawo kuphela, ubukwe ngaphezulu. Inhlanganisela yongqimba ifihla izakhi ezingqimbeni ezifihlwa yiyo. Umugqa wesimo utshela ukuthi izakhi ezingaki ezifihliwe. Isikali sibonakala ngasecaleni kwegama nasemgqeni wesimo. Umbono we-3D ubonisa wonke amasitezi. Ukuze ubonise konke futhi, sebenzisa Bonisa konke ku-Bonisa bese ukhetha wonke amasitezi. I-BimCraft ithola izingqimba ngokusebenzisa izabelo zezingqimba zefayela le-IFC. Uma i-IFC ithunyelwe ngaphandle kwazo, inhlanganisela yongqimba ayifihli lutho, futhi umugqa wesimo uthi izakhi ezifihliwe ziyi-0. Vula ukwakheka Ngaphansi kwe-Ukwakheka, ukwakheka ngakunye kubonisa inombolo yakho, igama, usayizi wephepha nemibono ebekwe kuyo. PDF igcina i-PDF yokwakheka kusuka kwisethi. DWG ivula umdwebo wokwakheka ku-2D view. Chofoza noma yimuphi umbono ukuze ubuyele kumodeli. Vula ku… ithumela ifayela lokwakheka ku-app eyilungisayo, ethebhini elisha: i-PDF iya ku-MarkupCraft, i-DWG iya ku-CadCraft. Ivela kuphela lapho leyo app ivulekile eduze ne-BimCraft. Ifayela lifundwa kusuka kwisethi njengoba ithebhu lilayisha, futhi akukho okulayishwayo. Ukwakheka okungenalo okukodwa kwalezi bhala Akukho ifayela kwisethi. Bona izakhi emaqenjini eprojekthi Khetha into. Amaqembu wezakhi ibonisa izakhi zayo ngaphansi kwamaqembu eprojekthi achazile, ehlanganiswe ngesethi yempahla negama elinikezwa inkcazo ye-IFC, noma ngegama layo. Okusele kuhlala ku-Izici njengoba kujwayelekile. Izincazelo zezakhi zidweba zonke izincazelo ngeqembu layo, uhlobo negama le-IFC. Imigomo namanothi Imigomo ibala izingqimba, inhlanganisela yezingqimba, amasethi amapeni, izinhlobo zemigqa, izigcwalisi, izindawo, izinhlanganisela nezinto ezisesethini. Amanothi adwebe okungakwazanga ukuthathwa yiskripthi kulowo khipha we-Archicad, noma yimuphi ensimu i-BimCraft ingayifunda, nanoma iyiphi ifayela isethi eyibiza kodwa ingayibambi. Ukuxazulula izinkinga \"… iyi-zip kodwa ayisona isethi yeprojekthi.\" I-zip ayinayo i-manifest.json. Yikhiphe bese uvula i-.ifc ekuyo. \"… iyisethi yeprojekthi entsha kunaleli BimCraft elifunda.\" Vuselela i-BimCraft. \"… alikho imodeli ibhekisa kuyo i-manifest yalo.\" I-zip inqunyiwe noma ihlelwe. Yenza kabusha isethi. Umbono ubonisa wonke amasitezi. Isitezi salo asiseyo ku-IFC yemodeli (umugqa wesimo uyakusho). Hlola ukuthi ukuthunyelwa kwe-IFC kubandakanye leso sitezi. Bheka futhi Ukusebenza phakathi kwezinhlelo ezimbili ze-BIM kanye nokufundwa yi-BimCraft kusuka kwifomethi ngayinye.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"merge-models","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Hlanganisa ukuhlelwa kwabantu ababili kumodeli eyodwa","summary":"Vumela i-git, i-Fossil noma i-Mercurial ukuhlanganisa amakhophi amabili ahleliwe emodeli efanayo ye-IFC ngento ngento, ukuze abantu ababili badwebe esakhiweni esisodwa bese bahlanganisa umsebenzi wabo.","section":"tasks","order":76,"keywords":["hlanganisa","git","fossil","mercurial","ukulawula inguqulo","ukungqubuzana","izindlela ntathu","cadcraft merge","gitattributes","ifc","globalid","ithimba","amakhophi amabili","amagatsha"],"headings":[{"id":"okwenza-kusebenze","text":"Okwenza kusebenze","level":2},{"id":"setha","text":"Setha","level":2},{"id":"imithetho","text":"Imithetho","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EAbantu ababili bathatha ikhophi yesakhiwo esifanayo, omunye adwebe ingxenye yempumalanga, omunye eyentshonalanga, bese kamuva amakhophi kudingeka abe okunye. Uma babe bathinte izinto ezahlukene, uhlelo lungakwenza esikhundleni somuntu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okwenza-kusebenze\"\u003EOkwenza kusebenze\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYonke udonga, umnyango, izinga, igumbi kanye nesethi yezici ku-IFC ine-GlobalId engashintshi. Ukuhlanganisa kubheka izinto ngalo id, hhayi ngenombolo efayela iyinika (\u003Ccode\u003E#123\u003C/code\u003E), ngoba izinombolo ziyashintsha uma uhlelo lulondoloza. Izingxenye ezincike ekintu ezingenayo i-id yazo (izindawo, imilo, izinyunithi) ziqhathaniswa ngokuthi ziqukethe ini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmakhophi womabili kumele abe inguqulo efanayo ye-IFC (2x3, 4 noma 4.3). Ukuhlanganisa kugcina ifayela lakho njengoba lilunjalo, ukulandelana kwalo nezinombolo zalo, bese kungeza okusha, ngakho i-git diff yokuhlanganisa ikhombisa okuguqulwe ukuhlanganisa kuphela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"setha\"\u003ESetha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-Git idinga imigqa emibili kanye ngesitoreji ngasinye:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E# .gitattributes\n*.ifc merge=cadcraft\n\n# kanye, kukhompyutha ngayinye\ngit config merge.cadcraft.driver &quot;node /path/to/tools/cli/merge.mjs %O %A %B&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgaphandle kwe-git, qhuba \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft merge &lt;base&gt; &lt;ours&gt; &lt;theirs&gt;\u003C/code\u003E. I-Fossil ne-Mercurial zithatha amafayela amathathu afanayo kusetha yazo yesisetshenziswa sokuhlanganisa. Akukho okulayishwayo; konke kusebenza kukhompyutha yakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imithetho\"\u003EImithetho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsici esishintshe ohlangothini olulodwa kuphela siyathathwa. Ushintsho olufanayo ohlangothini lombili luthathwa kanye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsici esishintshwe ngezindlela ezimbili (izinga elifanayo elilungiswe ngezindlela ezimbili) ngukungqubuzana: uhlangothi lwakho luhlala futhi umbiko ubhala bobabili. Vula umphumela ulungise ngesandla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUhlu lwezinto (udonga ezingeni, izici zesethi) luhlanganiswa njengesethi: okwengezwe nganoma yiluphi uhlangothi kuyagcinwa, nokususwe nganoma yiluphi uhlangothi kuyasuswa. Abantu ababili abengeza amadonga ezingeni elifanayo abaphikisani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInto eyengezwe nganoma yiluphi uhlangothi iyagcinwa, nomumo wayo nezici zayo. Isusiwe ohlangothini olulodwa futhi ingashintshiwe kolunye: iyasuswa. Isusiwe ohlangothini olulodwa futhi ishintshwe kolunye: iyasuswa, futhi iyabikwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsikhathi nomlobi wefayela, kanye nomlando womnikazi wento ngayinye, kuhlala kwakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImilo ihlanganiswa ngokuphelele: umumo wodonga uvela ohlangothini olulodwa, akuxutshwa ngephoyinti ngephoyinti. Amafayela e-IFC nawe-IFCX afakwe ku-zip ayahlanganiswa. Ngemva kokuhlanganisa, vula umphumela ku-BimCraft ubheke iphaneli \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinkinga\u003C/span\u003E ngaphambi kokuthi ulondoloze.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Abantu ababili bathatha ikhophi yesakhiwo esifanayo, omunye adwebe ingxenye yempumalanga, omunye eyentshonalanga, bese kamuva amakhophi kudingeka abe okunye. Uma babe bathinte izinto ezahlukene, uhlelo lungakwenza esikhundleni somuntu. Okwenza kusebenze Yonke udonga, umnyango, izinga, igumbi kanye nesethi yezici ku-IFC ine-GlobalId engashintshi. Ukuhlanganisa kubheka izinto ngalo id, hhayi ngenombolo efayela iyinika (#123), ngoba izinombolo ziyashintsha uma uhlelo lulondoloza. Izingxenye ezincike ekintu ezingenayo i-id yazo (izindawo, imilo, izinyunithi) ziqhathaniswa ngokuthi ziqukethe ini. Amakhophi womabili kumele abe inguqulo efanayo ye-IFC (2x3, 4 noma 4.3). Ukuhlanganisa kugcina ifayela lakho njengoba lilunjalo, ukulandelana kwalo nezinombolo zalo, bese kungeza okusha, ngakho i-git diff yokuhlanganisa ikhombisa okuguqulwe ukuhlanganisa kuphela. Setha I-Git idinga imigqa emibili kanye ngesitoreji ngasinye: # .gitattributes *.ifc merge=cadcraft # kanye, kukhompyutha ngayinye git config merge.cadcraft.driver \"node /path/to/tools/cli/merge.mjs %O %A %B\" Ngaphandle kwe-git, qhuba cadcraft merge \u003Cbase\u003E \u003Cours\u003E \u003Ctheirs\u003E. I-Fossil ne-Mercurial zithatha amafayela amathathu afanayo kusetha yazo yesisetshenziswa sokuhlanganisa. Akukho okulayishwayo; konke kusebenza kukhompyutha yakho. Imithetho Isici esishintshe ohlangothini olulodwa kuphela siyathathwa. Ushintsho olufanayo ohlangothini lombili luthathwa kanye. Isici esishintshwe ngezindlela ezimbili (izinga elifanayo elilungiswe ngezindlela ezimbili) ngukungqubuzana: uhlangothi lwakho luhlala futhi umbiko ubhala bobabili. Vula umphumela ulungise ngesandla. Uhlu lwezinto (udonga ezingeni, izici zesethi) luhlanganiswa njengesethi: okwengezwe nganoma yiluphi uhlangothi kuyagcinwa, nokususwe nganoma yiluphi uhlangothi kuyasuswa. Abantu ababili abengeza amadonga ezingeni elifanayo abaphikisani. Into eyengezwe nganoma yiluphi uhlangothi iyagcinwa, nomumo wayo nezici zayo. Isusiwe ohlangothini olulodwa futhi ingashintshiwe kolunye: iyasuswa. Isusiwe ohlangothini olulodwa futhi ishintshwe kolunye: iyasuswa, futhi iyabikwa. Isikhathi nomlobi wefayela, kanye nomlando womnikazi wento ngayinye, kuhlala kwakho. Imilo ihlanganiswa ngokuphelele: umumo wodonga uvela ohlangothini olulodwa, akuxutshwa ngephoyinti ngephoyinti. Amafayela e-IFC nawe-IFCX afakwe ku-zip ayahlanganiswa. Ngemva kokuhlanganisa, vula umphumela ku-BimCraft ubheke iphaneli Izinkinga ngaphambi kokuthi ulondoloze.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"permit-package","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Isethi yemvume nemibhalo esekelayo yomphathi","summary":"Hlanganisa ukuhlolwa kwemithetho, izimvo ezingaba khona zomhloli, imodeli nohlu lomphathi lwemibhalo esekelayo ibe yi-zip eyodwa, nemibhalo ngayinye ixhunyiwe kweshidi noma kulungiselelo olwanelisayo.","section":"tasks","order":78,"keywords":["inqubo yokuvuma","ifomethi yokuthumela","imidwebo edingekayo","usayizi weshidi","ifomethi yefayela","amakhophi","iphakethe lemithetho","imvume","isethi yemvume","ukuthumela kwesakhiwo","ukuvunyelwa kwemiklamo","ukuthumela okusemthethweni","imibhalo esekelayo","uhlu lokuhlola","umphathi","umasipala","ibhunga","isicelo sokuhlelwa","izimvo zomhloli","imithetho yokwakha","imibhalo elahlekile"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"indlela-umbhalo-oxhunyiwe-ngayo","text":"Indlela umbhalo oxhunyiwe ngayo","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukwazi","text":"Okufanele ukwazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYakha i-zip eyodwa yokuthumela okusemthethweni (uma uhlu lomphathi luvela kuphakethe lemithetho, ikwathi izinyathelo zokuvuma nefomethi yokuthumela): ikhava, izimvo umhloli angazenza (ezibhalwe ngokuhlolwa, hhayi ezicabangwayo), umbiko wemithetho uma i-Building regulations add-on ivuliwe, imodeli, nohlu lomphathi lwemibhalo esekelayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELesi siqondiso sakhiwe ngemodeli. Umhloli obhalisiwe nomphathi banquma okudingekayo nokwamukelekayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgemodeli evuliwe, vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPermit package\u003C/span\u003E ngaphakathi kuphaneli esekhohlo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThayipha igama leprojekthi, ikheli nomcelisi, bese ubhala amashidi nezifomu zakho, eyodwa ngomugqa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESupporting documents\u003C/span\u003E, khetha i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuthority&#039;s list\u003C/span\u003E. Uhlu luvela kumaphakethe emithetho: engeza i-Building regulations add-on bese uthikha iphakethe lendawo yakho ku-Izilungiselelo › Imithetho yokwakha (iphakethe lingabamba imithetho, inqubo yokuvuma, ifomethi yokuthumela, izivumelwano zemidwebo nezinsizakalo ezijwayelekile). Uhlu jikelele usebenza ngaphandle kwalokho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFunda uhlu. Umbhalo ngamunye ungu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinked\u003C/span\u003E (neshidi nesizathu), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESupplied by you\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDoes not apply\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMissing\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgephepha onikeza wena (ifomu, isitifiketi somhlaba, irisidi yemali) khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESupplied by me\u003C/span\u003E. Ngento emakiwe ngokuthi &quot;uma isebenza&quot; engasebenzi, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDoes not apply here\u003C/span\u003E. Ukuxhumanisa umbhalo weshidi ngokwakho, khetha leshidi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EApproval process\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESubmission format\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kohlu ukuze ufunde izinyathelo nokuthi yini okufanele uyinikeze (usayizi wamashidi, amafomethi amafayela, amakhophi). Imali noma isikhathi sivela kuphela uma umthombo wephakethe uyishilo, nekhasi nosuku lapho ifundwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuild the permit package (zip)\u003C/span\u003E. Izinyathelo nefomethi nazo zisekhava.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"indlela-umbhalo-oxhunyiwe-ngayo\"\u003EIndlela umbhalo oxhunyiwe ngayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmbhalo uxhunyiwe kweshidi elibamba uhlobo olufanele lombono (uhlelo lwephansi, ukubukeka kohlangothi, isigaba), kweshidi elibamba uhlobo olufanele lohlu (uhlu lwamasivalo, uhlu lwezinhlobo), noma kweshidi igama layo lithi kanjalo (ishidi elithi &quot;Site plan&quot;). Lapho imodeli inemigqa kodwa akukho shidi elibamba uhlu, noma indawo idwetshiwe kodwa akukho shidi elithi yiphulani yesayithi, into ihlala ingekho futhi ichaze ngani.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukwazi\"\u003EOkufanele ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUhlu lomphathi ngalinye alubhekwa umuntu wendawo.\u003C/strong\u003E Ngalinye lufundwe emthonjeni oshicilelwe alibhekisela kuwo, ngosuku olukhonjisiwe, futhi lubhalwe ngamagama ethu. Izidingo ziyashintsha: hlola uhlu lwamanje lomphathi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOkusele okungekho esethini, noma ishidi elingenalo usayizi, ukuqondisa noma isikali esicelwe iphakethe, kubonakala ohlwini lwezinkinga njengesaziso. Izaziso ziyeluleko: azikaze zimise iphakethe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImibhalo elahlekile ayikaze imise iphakethe. Ibhalwa ekhava nakwi-\u003Ccode\u003E04-supporting-documents.csv\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUhlu ludatha, hhayi ikhodi, ngaphakathi kumaphakethe emithetho: iNingizimu Afrika (Imithetho Yokwakha Yezwe, umthetho A2), Cape Town (neNingizimu Afrika engezwe kusuka ku-Umtapo), England (izidingo zolwazi lwezwe), Portland e-Oregon, iphakethe lokufundisa elenziwe ngamanga, nohlu oluvamile olungelo lomphathi yisiphi na. Noma ubani angabhala iphakethe lendawo yakhe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinqumo zakho zigcinwa emodelini, ngakho zikhona lapho uyivula futhi, futhi ngayinye iyisinyathelo esingahlehliswa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBheka futhi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/sheets\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/sheets\"\u003EAmashidi\u003C/a\u003E kanye \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/site-building-and-levels\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/site-building-and-levels\"\u003Enesayithi, isakhiwo esiphezu kwalo, namazinga\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Yakha i-zip eyodwa yokuthumela okusemthethweni (uma uhlu lomphathi luvela kuphakethe lemithetho, ikwathi izinyathelo zokuvuma nefomethi yokuthumela): ikhava, izimvo umhloli angazenza (ezibhalwe ngokuhlolwa, hhayi ezicabangwayo), umbiko wemithetho uma i-Building regulations add-on ivuliwe, imodeli, nohlu lomphathi lwemibhalo esekelayo. Lesi siqondiso sakhiwe ngemodeli. Umhloli obhalisiwe nomphathi banquma okudingekayo nokwamukelekayo. Izinyathelo Ngemodeli evuliwe, vula Permit package ngaphakathi kuphaneli esekhohlo. Thayipha igama leprojekthi, ikheli nomcelisi, bese ubhala amashidi nezifomu zakho, eyodwa ngomugqa. Ngaphansi kwe-Supporting documents, khetha i-Authority's list. Uhlu luvela kumaphakethe emithetho: engeza i-Building regulations add-on bese uthikha iphakethe lendawo yakho ku-Izilungiselelo › Imithetho yokwakha (iphakethe lingabamba imithetho, inqubo yokuvuma, ifomethi yokuthumela, izivumelwano zemidwebo nezinsizakalo ezijwayelekile). Uhlu jikelele usebenza ngaphandle kwalokho. Funda uhlu. Umbhalo ngamunye ungu-Linked (neshidi nesizathu), Supplied by you, Does not apply noma Missing. Ngephepha onikeza wena (ifomu, isitifiketi somhlaba, irisidi yemali) khetha Supplied by me. Ngento emakiwe ngokuthi \"uma isebenza\" engasebenzi, khetha Does not apply here. Ukuxhumanisa umbhalo weshidi ngokwakho, khetha leshidi. Vula Approval process kanye Submission format ngaphansi kohlu ukuze ufunde izinyathelo nokuthi yini okufanele uyinikeze (usayizi wamashidi, amafomethi amafayela, amakhophi). Imali noma isikhathi sivela kuphela uma umthombo wephakethe uyishilo, nekhasi nosuku lapho ifundwe. Chofoza Build the permit package (zip). Izinyathelo nefomethi nazo zisekhava. Indlela umbhalo oxhunyiwe ngayo Umbhalo uxhunyiwe kweshidi elibamba uhlobo olufanele lombono (uhlelo lwephansi, ukubukeka kohlangothi, isigaba), kweshidi elibamba uhlobo olufanele lohlu (uhlu lwamasivalo, uhlu lwezinhlobo), noma kweshidi igama layo lithi kanjalo (ishidi elithi \"Site plan\"). Lapho imodeli inemigqa kodwa akukho shidi elibamba uhlu, noma indawo idwetshiwe kodwa akukho shidi elithi yiphulani yesayithi, into ihlala ingekho futhi ichaze ngani. Okufanele ukwazi Uhlu lomphathi ngalinye alubhekwa umuntu wendawo. Ngalinye lufundwe emthonjeni oshicilelwe alibhekisela kuwo, ngosuku olukhonjisiwe, futhi lubhalwe ngamagama ethu. Izidingo ziyashintsha: hlola uhlu lwamanje lomphathi. Okusele okungekho esethini, noma ishidi elingenalo usayizi, ukuqondisa noma isikali esicelwe iphakethe, kubonakala ohlwini lwezinkinga njengesaziso. Izaziso ziyeluleko: azikaze zimise iphakethe. Imibhalo elahlekile ayikaze imise iphakethe. Ibhalwa ekhava nakwi-04-supporting-documents.csv. Uhlu ludatha, hhayi ikhodi, ngaphakathi kumaphakethe emithetho: iNingizimu Afrika (Imithetho Yokwakha Yezwe, umthetho A2), Cape Town (neNingizimu Afrika engezwe kusuka ku-Umtapo), England (izidingo zolwazi lwezwe), Portland e-Oregon, iphakethe lokufundisa elenziwe ngamanga, nohlu oluvamile olungelo lomphathi yisiphi na. Noma ubani angabhala iphakethe lendawo yakhe. Izinqumo zakho zigcinwa emodelini, ngakho zikhona lapho uyivula futhi, futhi ngayinye iyisinyathelo esingahlehliswa. Bheka futhi Amashidi kanye nesayithi, isakhiwo esiphezu kwalo, namazinga.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"local-requirements","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Izidingo zendawo njengamaphakheji emithetho","summary":"Iphakheji yemithetho ingabamba okungaphezu kwemithetho: inqubo yokuvunywa, ifomethi yokuthumela, amadwebo okufanele ahlinzekwe, izivumelwano zokudweba namanothi ajwayelekile endawo.","section":"tasks","order":79,"keywords":["iphakheji yemithetho","inqubo yokuvunywa","ifomethi yokuthumela","izivumelwano zokudweba","amanothi ajwayelekile","amanothi ajwayelekile jikelele","ukuphakama kombhalo","ukuhlukaniswa kohlamvu","isikhombi sasenyakatho","izidingo zendawo","umasipala","izwe","ifomethi yephakheji"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okungabanjwa-yiphakheji-yemithetho","text":"Okungabanjwa yiphakheji yemithetho","level":2},{"id":"okwaziwayo-okuhle","text":"Okwaziwayo okuhle","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThola ukuthi indawo yakho idinga ni, bese wenza i-BimCraft ikusebenzisele lokho: izinyathelo zokuthola imvume yokwakha, okufanele unikeze nefomethi yakho, indlela amadwebo okufanele abukeke ngayo, namanothi ajwayelekile okufanele afakwe kuwo. Iphakheji eyodwa ibamba lokho, eduze kwemithetho yokwakha, futhi uyikhetha kanye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIphakheji iyisiqondisi. Umphathi wokuvuma nengcweti ebhalisiwe banquma okudingekayo. Iphakheji ngayinye ichaza ukuthi ingathenjwa kangakanani: \u003Cstrong\u003Eakuhlolwanga\u003C/strong\u003E (akukho muntu owayiqinisekisile), \u003Cstrong\u003Euhlaka\u003C/strong\u003E (ibhalwe kusuka emakhasini ashicilelwe, kodwa ingakabhekwa ngongcweti) noma \u003Cstrong\u003Eibuyekeziwe\u003C/strong\u003E. Iphakheji yokufundisa eyenziwe ngamanga ibhala MADE-UP kukho konke.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEngeza i-add-on ethi Building regulations bese uvula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImithetho yokwakha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThikha iphakheji yendawo yakho. Yivule: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIphinde iqukethe\u003C/span\u003E ohlwini lokukhona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEphakhejini yokuvuma khetha uhlu lwayo: izinyathelo, ifomethi namadwebo okufanele unikeze avela. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/permit-package\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/permit-package\"\u003EIphakheji yokuvuma\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEsheethini, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmanothi ajwayelekile\u003C/span\u003E ifaka amanothi ephakheji. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/sheets\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/sheets\"\u003EAmashidi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinkomba zosayizi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESebenzisa usayizi wephakheji yemithetho\u003C/span\u003E uthatha ukuphakama kombhalo ephakhejini. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/annotation-sizes\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/annotation-sizes\"\u003EDweba ngosayizi ogcwele, uchaze ngesikali\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okungabanjwa-yiphakheji-yemithetho\"\u003EOkungabanjwa yiphakheji yemithetho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInqubo yokuvunywa:\u003C/strong\u003E izinyathelo ngokulandelana, ubani owenza ngayinye, okufakwayo, nemibhalo. Imali noma isikhathi sokuqeda kuvela kuphela nekhasi elafundwa kulo nosuku lokufunda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIfomethi yokuthumela:\u003C/strong\u003E usayizi weshidi, ukuma kwalo, amafomethi amafayela, izikhombisa, amagama amafayela, izinkundla zebhulokhi lesihloko, namadwebo (nezikali) namaphepha okuthunyelwa kudingeka. Into engekho ilokhu ibhalwa ku-Problems, hhayi ukuyima.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzivumelwano zokudweba:\u003C/strong\u003E ukuphakama kombhalo ephepheni, ukuminyana komugqa, ithebhu yamapeni, namarekhodi afana nophawu lwasenyakatho noma ibha yesikali. Ezinye zihlolwa njengemithetho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmanothi ajwayelekile:\u003C/strong\u003E amanothi ngokwezifundo, ngamagama ephakheji uqobo, ngalinye nesigatshana sawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okwaziwayo-okuhle\"\u003EOkwaziwayo okuhle\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIphakheji yedolobha yakha phezu kweyezwe lalo: izinyathelo, amadwebo namanothi ayo azinqoba, kanti eyezwe lihlala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELokho okungafundwanga kwikhasi elisemthethweni kumakwa njengesampula noma okungaqinisekisiwe ephakhejini nasendaweni lapho kubonakala khona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUngabhala iphakheji yendawo yakho bese uyingeza ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayisha ifayela lemithetho\u003C/span\u003E; ihlala ikhonjwa njengeyakho, hhayi njengeyabuyekeziwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Thola ukuthi indawo yakho idinga ni, bese wenza i-BimCraft ikusebenzisele lokho: izinyathelo zokuthola imvume yokwakha, okufanele unikeze nefomethi yakho, indlela amadwebo okufanele abukeke ngayo, namanothi ajwayelekile okufanele afakwe kuwo. Iphakheji eyodwa ibamba lokho, eduze kwemithetho yokwakha, futhi uyikhetha kanye. Iphakheji iyisiqondisi. Umphathi wokuvuma nengcweti ebhalisiwe banquma okudingekayo. Iphakheji ngayinye ichaza ukuthi ingathenjwa kangakanani: akuhlolwanga (akukho muntu owayiqinisekisile), uhlaka (ibhalwe kusuka emakhasini ashicilelwe, kodwa ingakabhekwa ngongcweti) noma ibuyekeziwe. Iphakheji yokufundisa eyenziwe ngamanga ibhala MADE-UP kukho konke. Izinyathelo Engeza i-add-on ethi Building regulations bese uvula Izilungiselelo › Imithetho yokwakha. Thikha iphakheji yendawo yakho. Yivule: Iphinde iqukethe ohlwini lokukhona. Ephakhejini yokuvuma khetha uhlu lwayo: izinyathelo, ifomethi namadwebo okufanele unikeze avela. Bheka Iphakheji yokuvuma. Esheethini, Amanothi ajwayelekile ifaka amanothi ephakheji. Bheka Amashidi. Ku-Izinkomba zosayizi, Sebenzisa usayizi wephakheji yemithetho uthatha ukuphakama kombhalo ephakhejini. Bheka Dweba ngosayizi ogcwele, uchaze ngesikali. Okungabanjwa yiphakheji yemithetho Inqubo yokuvunywa: izinyathelo ngokulandelana, ubani owenza ngayinye, okufakwayo, nemibhalo. Imali noma isikhathi sokuqeda kuvela kuphela nekhasi elafundwa kulo nosuku lokufunda. Ifomethi yokuthumela: usayizi weshidi, ukuma kwalo, amafomethi amafayela, izikhombisa, amagama amafayela, izinkundla zebhulokhi lesihloko, namadwebo (nezikali) namaphepha okuthunyelwa kudingeka. Into engekho ilokhu ibhalwa ku-Problems, hhayi ukuyima. Izivumelwano zokudweba: ukuphakama kombhalo ephepheni, ukuminyana komugqa, ithebhu yamapeni, namarekhodi afana nophawu lwasenyakatho noma ibha yesikali. Ezinye zihlolwa njengemithetho. Amanothi ajwayelekile: amanothi ngokwezifundo, ngamagama ephakheji uqobo, ngalinye nesigatshana sawo. Okwaziwayo okuhle Iphakheji yedolobha yakha phezu kweyezwe lalo: izinyathelo, amadwebo namanothi ayo azinqoba, kanti eyezwe lihlala. Lokho okungafundwanga kwikhasi elisemthethweni kumakwa njengesampula noma okungaqinisekisiwe ephakhejini nasendaweni lapho kubonakala khona. Ungabhala iphakheji yendawo yakho bese uyingeza ku-Layisha ifayela lemithetho; ihlala ikhonjwa njengeyakho, hhayi njengeyabuyekeziwe.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"issues-and-revisions","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Izinkinga, izinguquko nelogi yokushintsha komdwebo","summary":"Rekhoda isethi ngayinye yamashidi oyinikezayo, bona okushintshile kuwo wonke amashidi nezakhi, bese ugcina imiyalelo yesayithi, imidwebo yomkhiqizi nemodeli exhunyiwe ngenkinga okuyiyo.","section":"tasks","order":79,"keywords":["inkinga","isethi ekhishiwe","isethi ethunyelwe","ukuthunyelwa","isiguquko","izinguquko","okushintshile","kusukela enkingeni","logi yokushintsha","logi yokushintsha komdwebo","uhlu lwamarekhodi","ukuthunyelwa kwemibhalo","imiyalelo yesayithi","umdwebo womkhiqizi","imodeli exhunyiwe","ithenda","ukwakha","isithombe","qhathanisa"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okuwusizo-ukukwazi","text":"Okuwusizo ukukwazi","level":2},{"id":"akukakwakhiwa","text":"Akukakwakhiwa","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERekhoda inkinga: yimaphi amashidi aphumile, ngusuku luni, ngenjongo yani, ngesiguquko ngasinye. Kamuva, buza okushintshile kusukela kuleyo nkinga. Gcina imiyalelo yesayithi nemidwebo yomkhiqizi ebuyiswe ngayo ngenkinga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-panel yesobunxele vula \u003Cstrong\u003EIzinkinga nezinguquko\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003ERekhoda inkinga\u003C/strong\u003E. Isiguquko siphakanyiswa (A, bese B; okunombolo efana no-P1 kukhuphuka). Khetha inhloso yokukhishwa, ukuthi ithunyelwa kubani, usuku namashidi. Uma isigaba sephrojekthi sisethiwe, inhloso ilandela sona. Uma iphakheji lemvume linohlu lwemibhalo esekelayo, amashidi axhunyiwe kuleso hlu ayatshekwa ngokuzenzakalelayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShiya \u003Cstrong\u003EFuthi londoloza ikhophi yemodeli njengoba ikhishiwe\u003C/strong\u003E itshekiwe ukuze imodeli ihlale njengoba iphumile. Ikhophi iyalandwa; igama, usayizi kanye ne-SHA-256 yayo kugcinwa nenkinga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003ERekhoda le nkinga\u003C/strong\u003E. Ishidi elishintshile kusukela ekukhishweni kwalo kokugcina lithola isiguquko esisha. Ishidi elingashintshanga ligcina isiguquko lalo. Ibhulokhi yesihloko yeshidi ngalinye iveza isiguquko salo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuze ubone okushintshile, khetha \u003Cstrong\u003EIzinguquko kusukela\u003C/strong\u003E eduze kwenkinga. Ishidi ngalinye lithi Ifanayo noma Ishintshile, kanye nezakhi ezengeziwe, eziguqukile nezisusiwe kulo. Chofoza inani ukuze ukhethe lezo zakhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EEngeza irekhodi\u003C/strong\u003E ngemiyalelo yesayithi, umdwebo womkhiqizi, isethi yokumaka, imodeli exhunyiwe noma inothi. Khetha inkinga okuyo. Ifayela oliKhethayo lirekhodwa ngegama, usayizi kanye ne-SHA-256; ifayela lihlala lapho lisekhona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELogi yokushintsha komdwebo\u003C/strong\u003E ikhombisa umugqa oyedwa ngeshidi ngalinye nekholomu eyodwa ngenkinga ngayinye. \u003Cstrong\u003ELanda logi (CSV)\u003C/strong\u003E iyigcina ngezinkinga namarekhodi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGcina umlando wezinkinga\u003C/strong\u003E ibhala ifayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.issues.json\u003C/code\u003E. I-MarkupCraft, i-TakeoffCraft ne-DetailCraft ziyalifunda nge-\u003Cstrong\u003EFunda umlando wenkinga\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuwusizo-ukukwazi\"\u003EOkuwusizo ukukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmlando ugcinwa ngaphakathi kwefayela le-IFC (ipropathi set \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_Issues\u003C/code\u003E kwiphrojekthi). Ezinye izinhlelo ziyawunaka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIshidi libalwa njengeshintshile uma ukusethwa kwalo kushintshile, noma uma into ebonakala kulo ishintshile: ipulani ibonisa izinga layo, umbono ongaphezulu noma isigaba ibonisa imodeli yonke, ishejuli yomnyango noma yewindi ibonisa iminyango noma amawindi ayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsakhi sibalwa njengeshintshile uma ipropathi, indawo yaso, usayizi noma isimo sashintsha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuze ubone ngqo ipropathi eshintshile, vula ikhophi egciniwe yemodeli ekhishiwe nge-\u003Cstrong\u003EQhathanisa izinguqulo\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkususa inkinga kugcina amarekhodi ayo, kodwa ngaphandle kwenkinga. Isinyathelo ngasinye yi-Undo eyodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImodeli enezakhi ezingaphezu kuka-60,000 ayigcini irekhodi lalo lonke elakhi ngalinye nenkinga. Amashidi asaqhathaniswa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akukakwakhiwa\"\u003EAkukakwakhiwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmashidi awagcinwa njenge-PDF nenkinga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIgu lokushintsha alidwetshwa emashidini e-BimCraft. Rekhoda amagu ku-MarkupCraft ngokumelene nenkinga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Rekhoda inkinga: yimaphi amashidi aphumile, ngusuku luni, ngenjongo yani, ngesiguquko ngasinye. Kamuva, buza okushintshile kusukela kuleyo nkinga. Gcina imiyalelo yesayithi nemidwebo yomkhiqizi ebuyiswe ngayo ngenkinga. Izinyathelo Ku-panel yesobunxele vula Izinkinga nezinguquko. Khetha Rekhoda inkinga. Isiguquko siphakanyiswa (A, bese B; okunombolo efana no-P1 kukhuphuka). Khetha inhloso yokukhishwa, ukuthi ithunyelwa kubani, usuku namashidi. Uma isigaba sephrojekthi sisethiwe, inhloso ilandela sona. Uma iphakheji lemvume linohlu lwemibhalo esekelayo, amashidi axhunyiwe kuleso hlu ayatshekwa ngokuzenzakalelayo. Shiya Futhi londoloza ikhophi yemodeli njengoba ikhishiwe itshekiwe ukuze imodeli ihlale njengoba iphumile. Ikhophi iyalandwa; igama, usayizi kanye ne-SHA-256 yayo kugcinwa nenkinga. Khetha Rekhoda le nkinga. Ishidi elishintshile kusukela ekukhishweni kwalo kokugcina lithola isiguquko esisha. Ishidi elingashintshanga ligcina isiguquko lalo. Ibhulokhi yesihloko yeshidi ngalinye iveza isiguquko salo. Ukuze ubone okushintshile, khetha Izinguquko kusukela eduze kwenkinga. Ishidi ngalinye lithi Ifanayo noma Ishintshile, kanye nezakhi ezengeziwe, eziguqukile nezisusiwe kulo. Chofoza inani ukuze ukhethe lezo zakhi. Khetha Engeza irekhodi ngemiyalelo yesayithi, umdwebo womkhiqizi, isethi yokumaka, imodeli exhunyiwe noma inothi. Khetha inkinga okuyo. Ifayela oliKhethayo lirekhodwa ngegama, usayizi kanye ne-SHA-256; ifayela lihlala lapho lisekhona. Logi yokushintsha komdwebo ikhombisa umugqa oyedwa ngeshidi ngalinye nekholomu eyodwa ngenkinga ngayinye. Landa logi (CSV) iyigcina ngezinkinga namarekhodi. Gcina umlando wezinkinga ibhala ifayela le-.issues.json. I-MarkupCraft, i-TakeoffCraft ne-DetailCraft ziyalifunda nge-Funda umlando wenkinga. Okuwusizo ukukwazi Umlando ugcinwa ngaphakathi kwefayela le-IFC (ipropathi set CadCraft_Issues kwiphrojekthi). Ezinye izinhlelo ziyawunaka. Ishidi libalwa njengeshintshile uma ukusethwa kwalo kushintshile, noma uma into ebonakala kulo ishintshile: ipulani ibonisa izinga layo, umbono ongaphezulu noma isigaba ibonisa imodeli yonke, ishejuli yomnyango noma yewindi ibonisa iminyango noma amawindi ayo. Isakhi sibalwa njengeshintshile uma ipropathi, indawo yaso, usayizi noma isimo sashintsha. Ukuze ubone ngqo ipropathi eshintshile, vula ikhophi egciniwe yemodeli ekhishiwe nge-Qhathanisa izinguqulo. Ukususa inkinga kugcina amarekhodi ayo, kodwa ngaphandle kwenkinga. Isinyathelo ngasinye yi-Undo eyodwa. Imodeli enezakhi ezingaphezu kuka-60,000 ayigcini irekhodi lalo lonke elakhi ngalinye nenkinga. Amashidi asaqhathaniswa. Akukakwakhiwa Amashidi awagcinwa njenge-PDF nenkinga. Igu lokushintsha alidwetshwa emashidini e-BimCraft. Rekhoda amagu ku-MarkupCraft ngokumelene nenkinga.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"client-pack-and-stage-report","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Amaphakheji amakhasimende, imibiko yezigaba nokuqhathanisa izinketho","summary":"Yenza iphakheji lekhasimende noma umbiko wesigaba kusuka kumodeli, nezinketho zevolumu yesakhiwo eziqhathaniswa ngendawo nezindleko, izindawo zamafolo, imidwebo namaguquko ayo, nomlando wokukhishwa. Yonke inani ligcina izinto ngemuva kwalo.","section":"tasks","order":80,"keywords":["iphakheji lekhasimende","ukwethulwa","umbiko wesigaba","umbiko","ukuqhathanisa izinketho","izinketho","qhathanisa izinketho","indawo nezindleko","izindleko ngokukhethwa","akukho izinga","ivolumu","izindawo zamafolo","uhlu lwemidwebo","umlando wokukhishwa","izibalo","izibalo ezixhunyiwe"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"izinkambu","text":"Izinkambu","level":2},{"id":"ukubalwa-kwezinketho","text":"Ukubalwa kwezinketho","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukwazi","text":"Okufanele ukwazi","level":2},{"id":"akwakhiwe-okwamanje","text":"Akwakhiwe okwamanje","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYenza iphakheji lekhasimende noma umbiko wesigaba kusuka kumodeli njengoba ikhona manje, bese uqhathanisa izinketho zevolumu ezigciniwe ngendawo nezindleko, ecaleni komunye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEsidlule sohlangothi lwesobunxele vula \u003Cstrong\u003EIphakheji lekhasimende nombiko wesigaba\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EVula ku-Documents\u003C/strong\u003E eduze kuka-Iphakheji lekhasimende noma Umbiko wesigaba. Idokhumenti iyavela ku-Documents isuka kumodeli, lapho ungashintsha umbhalo wayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-preview, chofoza isibalo ukukhetha izinto ezingemuva kwaso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EYakha iphakheji\u003C/strong\u003E. Kulondolozwa i-zip eyodwa: idokhumenti njenge-PDF, isithombe sombono we-3D, kanye ne-\u003Ccode\u003Efigures.csv\u003C/code\u003E, ebala yonke isibalo namaGlobalId ezinto zaso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinkambu\"\u003EIzinkambu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELezi zingasetshenziswa kunoma iyiphi idokhumenti.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInkambu\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIkhombisa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{{stage}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsigaba sephrojekthi emininingwaneni yomdwebo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{{options}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinketho zevolumu ezigciniwe, ecaleni komunye: amafolo, ukuphakama, isiza, indawo yonke yamafolo, isigqoko nezindleko.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{{areas}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIndawo yamafolo ngezinga, ivela ezigumbini.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{{sheets}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmashidi nokuguqulwa okumi kuwo nokuthi akhishwe nini ngokugcina.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{{issues}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmlando wokukhishwa nencwadi yezinguquko zemidwebo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{{changes}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkushintshe kusukela ekukhishweni kokugcina, ishidi ngalinye.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukubalwa-kwezinketho\"\u003EUkubalwa kwezinketho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzindleko zivela kuphela etafuleni lamanani ephrojekthi yakho (Energy/Cost, izindleko ze-5D). Akukho lokho okulinganiselwa ngokwakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmugqa wamanani uyabala okukhethwayo kuphela uma izigaba zawo zibiza \u003Ccode\u003EIfcBuildingElementProxy\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIndawo yamafolo ibalwa ngumugqa onamagama asho ukusetshenziswa kokukhethwayo, njengo-office. Uma kungekho, kusetshenziswa umugqa onamagama athi gross floor area noma building mass. Umugqa nge-m² usebenzisa indawo yonke yamafolo. Umugqa nge-m³ usebenzisa ivolumu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsigqoko (perimitha iphindwe ngokuphakama) sibalwa ngumugqa onegama elithi envelope noma facade.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOkukhethwayo okungenamugqa ofanayo kubonisa \u003Cstrong\u003EAkukho izinga\u003C/strong\u003E. Inani eliphelele libonakala kuphela uma zonke izingxenye ezicelwe zinezinga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukwazi\"\u003EOkufanele ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGcina izinketho nge-\u003Cstrong\u003EGcina njengokukhetha\u003C/strong\u003E ohlwini lwevolumu lohlelo lwegumbi. Bona Izinketho zevolumu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-PDF ayikwazi ukukhetha izinto. Ngaphandle kwe-BimCraft, \u003Ccode\u003Efigures.csv\u003C/code\u003E ithwele ixhumanisi ngayinye yesibalo kuzinto zaso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akwakhiwe-okwamanje\"\u003EAkwakhiwe okwamanje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmashidi nemibono edwetshiwe ayikabekwa ngaphakathi kwedokhumenti. Iphakheji libamba isithombe sombono we-3D kuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Yenza iphakheji lekhasimende noma umbiko wesigaba kusuka kumodeli njengoba ikhona manje, bese uqhathanisa izinketho zevolumu ezigciniwe ngendawo nezindleko, ecaleni komunye. Izinyathelo Esidlule sohlangothi lwesobunxele vula Iphakheji lekhasimende nombiko wesigaba. Khetha Vula ku-Documents eduze kuka-Iphakheji lekhasimende noma Umbiko wesigaba. Idokhumenti iyavela ku-Documents isuka kumodeli, lapho ungashintsha umbhalo wayo. Ku-preview, chofoza isibalo ukukhetha izinto ezingemuva kwaso. Khetha Yakha iphakheji. Kulondolozwa i-zip eyodwa: idokhumenti njenge-PDF, isithombe sombono we-3D, kanye ne-figures.csv, ebala yonke isibalo namaGlobalId ezinto zaso. Izinkambu Lezi zingasetshenziswa kunoma iyiphi idokhumenti. Inkambu Ikhombisa {{stage}} Isigaba sephrojekthi emininingwaneni yomdwebo. {{options}} Izinketho zevolumu ezigciniwe, ecaleni komunye: amafolo, ukuphakama, isiza, indawo yonke yamafolo, isigqoko nezindleko. {{areas}} Indawo yamafolo ngezinga, ivela ezigumbini. {{sheets}} Amashidi nokuguqulwa okumi kuwo nokuthi akhishwe nini ngokugcina. {{issues}} Umlando wokukhishwa nencwadi yezinguquko zemidwebo. {{changes}} Okushintshe kusukela ekukhishweni kokugcina, ishidi ngalinye. Ukubalwa kwezinketho Izindleko zivela kuphela etafuleni lamanani ephrojekthi yakho (Energy/Cost, izindleko ze-5D). Akukho lokho okulinganiselwa ngokwakho. Umugqa wamanani uyabala okukhethwayo kuphela uma izigaba zawo zibiza IfcBuildingElementProxy. Indawo yamafolo ibalwa ngumugqa onamagama asho ukusetshenziswa kokukhethwayo, njengo-office. Uma kungekho, kusetshenziswa umugqa onamagama athi gross floor area noma building mass. Umugqa nge-m² usebenzisa indawo yonke yamafolo. Umugqa nge-m³ usebenzisa ivolumu. Isigqoko (perimitha iphindwe ngokuphakama) sibalwa ngumugqa onegama elithi envelope noma facade. Okukhethwayo okungenamugqa ofanayo kubonisa Akukho izinga. Inani eliphelele libonakala kuphela uma zonke izingxenye ezicelwe zinezinga. Okufanele ukwazi Gcina izinketho nge-Gcina njengokukhetha ohlwini lwevolumu lohlelo lwegumbi. Bona Izinketho zevolumu. I-PDF ayikwazi ukukhetha izinto. Ngaphandle kwe-BimCraft, figures.csv ithwele ixhumanisi ngayinye yesibalo kuzinto zaso. Akwakhiwe okwamanje Amashidi nemibono edwetshiwe ayikabekwa ngaphakathi kwedokhumenti. Iphakheji libamba isithombe sombono we-3D kuphela.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"project-stages","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Izigaba zephrojekthi, kusukela esidingweni kuze kube imiyalelo yesayithi","summary":"Qala ngesidingo esinezindawo ezihlosiwe bese ubona ukuthi ufinyelelwe noma imfushane njengoba udweba, qhathanisa izinketho zekhonsepthi ngakho, xhumanisa izichazi nemininingwane nezinhlobo, buyekeza amadrowing okukhiqiza bese urekhoda imiyalelo yesayithi ngezakhi.","section":"tasks","order":80,"keywords":["isidingo","ishedyuli yezindawo","indawo ehlosiwe","ifinyelelwe","imfushane","amagumbi","izinketho zekhonsepthi","izinketho","ubukhulu bomumo","isabelomali","isichazi","incazelo","umininingwane","umininingwane wokwakha","uhlobo","idrowing yokukhiqiza","ukubuyekeza","vumela","ngenisa kabusha","imiyalelo yesayithi","inguqulo","imbangela","endaweni","isigaba"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenziwa-nguwe","text":"Okuzokwenziwa nguwe","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okuwusizo-ukwazi","text":"Okuwusizo ukwazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenziwa-nguwe\"\u003EOkuzokwenziwa nguwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHamba ngezigaba zephrojekthi ngephaneli eyodwa: bhala isidingo somkhthi njengamagumbi nezindawo ezihlosiwe, qhathanisa izinketho zekhonsepthi ngakho, gcina isichazi nemininingwane yokwakha ihlobene nezinhlobo ezifanele kuzo, buyekeza amadrowing okukhiqiza njengoba ebuya kubahwebi, bese urekhoda imiyalelo yesayithi ngezakhi ezishintshwa yiyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKwiphaneli ekhohlo vula \u003Cstrong\u003EIzigaba zephrojekthi\u003C/strong\u003E, bese \u003Cstrong\u003EIsidingo\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENamathisela amagumbi, igumbi elilodwa ngomugqa ngamunye: \u003Ccode\u003ELiving; 1; 30\u003C/code\u003E isho igumbi elilodwa elingu-30 m². Inani lingasuswa. Khetha \u003Cstrong\u003EEngeza amagumbi\u003C/strong\u003E. Gcwalisa iklayenti, indawo, isabelomali, ukubekezela nohlelo, bese \u003Cstrong\u003ELondoloza isidingo\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDweba izindonga. Igumbi ngalinye elenziwe yizindonga elinegama legumbi lesidingo liyabalwa (inombolo elandela igama, njengo &quot;Bedroom 2&quot;, iyanganakwa). \u003Cstrong\u003EIshedyuli yezindawo\u003C/strong\u003E ithi \u003Cstrong\u003EIfinyelelwe\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EImfushane\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EIdlule\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003EAyidwetshwanga\u003C/strong\u003E, nomehluko ku-m².\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuqala iphrojekthi entsha ngale ndlela, khetha \u003Cstrong\u003EQala iphrojekthi entsha ngesidingo\u003C/strong\u003E. Ivula imodeli entsha, evela kwesinye sezifanekiso ozigcinile uma ukhetha esisodwa, bese ibeka isidingo njengesinyathelo sayo sokuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cstrong\u003EIzinketho ngokumelene nesidingo\u003C/strong\u003E. Yonke inketho yobukhulu bomumo egcinwe kumodeli idwetshwe ngesikali esisodwa nendawo yayo ephelele, okucelwa yisidingo, kanye nokuthi amagumbi esidingo angaki angena kangakanani. \u003Cstrong\u003EBeka isidingo lapha\u003C/strong\u003E ifaka amagumbi ezitezi zenketho, eyiphansi phezulu, bese ikhomba okungangenwa kukho. Izindleko zivela etafuleni lamanani ephrojekthi kuphela; uma kungekho mugqa ohambisanayo ithi &quot;Akukho izinga&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cstrong\u003EIzinhlobo, izichazi nemininingwane\u003C/strong\u003E. Ngayinye yezindonga, izivalo, amawindi nezinhlobo zophahla nephansi ibonisa ukuthi inombhalo wesichazi yini, imininingwane exhunyiwe kuyo, nokuthi isichazi, amashedyuli namashidi ayahlukana kuphi. \u003Cstrong\u003EXhuma umininingwane\u003C/strong\u003E yengeza ifayela le-DetailCraft noma le-CadCraft, ikheli, noma ishidi lalo modeli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cstrong\u003EAmadrowing okukhiqiza\u003C/strong\u003E. Khetha izakhi idrowing yokukhiqiza eyimbozayo kumodeli, bese \u003Cstrong\u003EYamukela\u003C/strong\u003E. Sebenzisa \u003Cstrong\u003EVumela\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ENjengoba kuphawuliwe\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003EBuyekeza\u003C/strong\u003E negama nenothi yomhloli. \u003Cstrong\u003EIthunyelwe kabusha\u003C/strong\u003E yenza inguqulo elandelayo yalo rekhodi futhi igcine umlando wokubuyekeza. Isimo siphinde sibhalwe kuzakhi ngayinye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cstrong\u003EImiyalelo yesayithi\u003C/strong\u003E. Khetha izakhi, nikeza imbangela nokuthi iyithinta kanjani izindleko nesikhathi ngamazwi akho, bese \u003Cstrong\u003EYirekhoda\u003C/strong\u003E. Ngemva kokurekhoda udaba, \u003Cstrong\u003EChaza izinguquko ezenzeke kusukela kulolu daba\u003C/strong\u003E ithi yiziphi izakhi ezishintshile eziyimbozwa yimiyalelo nezishintshile ngaphandle kokuthi kurekhodwe lutho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuwusizo-ukwazi\"\u003EOkuwusizo ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsinyathelo ngasinye yi-\u003Cstrong\u003EHlehlisa\u003C/strong\u003E eyodwa. Akukho okwenqatshwayo: isidingo esingafinyelelwe, uhlobo olungavumelani nombhalo walo, noma idrowing yokukhiqiza ephuzile kuyisexwayiso noma inothi ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinkinga\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmagumbi esidingo ayizindawo ezingenazo izindonga. Anesilinganiso esihlosiwe, hhayi indawo edwetshiwe, ngakho amashedyuli amagumbi kanye ne-COBie abawabali njengamagumbi adwetshiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsakhiwo sibeka amagumbi ezitezi ngokwendawo kuphela. Asidwebi izindonga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmbhalo wesichazi ubhalwa ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EImibhalo\u003C/strong\u003E kusuka kumodeli. Lapha uqhathaniswa nosayizi wemodeli kuphela: akukho sigaba sesitandade esibhalelwa wena.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmadrowing okukhiqiza nemiyalelo yesayithi ngamarekhodi ngomlando ofanayo nephaneli ethi \u003Cstrong\u003EIzindaba nezinguqulo\u003C/strong\u003E, ngakho zombili iziphaneli ziwabonisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsimo sedrowing yokukhiqiza siyimpahla yakho ngayinye (\u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_ShopDrawing\u003C/code\u003E), kanti imiyalelo yesayithi yi-\u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_SiteInstruction\u003C/code\u003E, ngakho \u003Cstrong\u003EThola\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003EShaya ngempahla\u003C/strong\u003E kungazisebenzisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzimpawu ezihlolwe endaweni (Isigaba 7) zisezici ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuqinisekiswa\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenziwa nguwe Hamba ngezigaba zephrojekthi ngephaneli eyodwa: bhala isidingo somkhthi njengamagumbi nezindawo ezihlosiwe, qhathanisa izinketho zekhonsepthi ngakho, gcina isichazi nemininingwane yokwakha ihlobene nezinhlobo ezifanele kuzo, buyekeza amadrowing okukhiqiza njengoba ebuya kubahwebi, bese urekhoda imiyalelo yesayithi ngezakhi ezishintshwa yiyo. Izinyathelo Kwiphaneli ekhohlo vula Izigaba zephrojekthi, bese Isidingo. Namathisela amagumbi, igumbi elilodwa ngomugqa ngamunye: Living; 1; 30 isho igumbi elilodwa elingu-30 m². Inani lingasuswa. Khetha Engeza amagumbi. Gcwalisa iklayenti, indawo, isabelomali, ukubekezela nohlelo, bese Londoloza isidingo. Dweba izindonga. Igumbi ngalinye elenziwe yizindonga elinegama legumbi lesidingo liyabalwa (inombolo elandela igama, njengo \"Bedroom 2\", iyanganakwa). Ishedyuli yezindawo ithi Ifinyelelwe, Imfushane, Idlule noma Ayidwetshwanga, nomehluko ku-m². Ukuqala iphrojekthi entsha ngale ndlela, khetha Qala iphrojekthi entsha ngesidingo. Ivula imodeli entsha, evela kwesinye sezifanekiso ozigcinile uma ukhetha esisodwa, bese ibeka isidingo njengesinyathelo sayo sokuqala. Vula Izinketho ngokumelene nesidingo. Yonke inketho yobukhulu bomumo egcinwe kumodeli idwetshwe ngesikali esisodwa nendawo yayo ephelele, okucelwa yisidingo, kanye nokuthi amagumbi esidingo angaki angena kangakanani. Beka isidingo lapha ifaka amagumbi ezitezi zenketho, eyiphansi phezulu, bese ikhomba okungangenwa kukho. Izindleko zivela etafuleni lamanani ephrojekthi kuphela; uma kungekho mugqa ohambisanayo ithi \"Akukho izinga\". Vula Izinhlobo, izichazi nemininingwane. Ngayinye yezindonga, izivalo, amawindi nezinhlobo zophahla nephansi ibonisa ukuthi inombhalo wesichazi yini, imininingwane exhunyiwe kuyo, nokuthi isichazi, amashedyuli namashidi ayahlukana kuphi. Xhuma umininingwane yengeza ifayela le-DetailCraft noma le-CadCraft, ikheli, noma ishidi lalo modeli. Vula Amadrowing okukhiqiza. Khetha izakhi idrowing yokukhiqiza eyimbozayo kumodeli, bese Yamukela. Sebenzisa Vumela, Njengoba kuphawuliwe noma Buyekeza negama nenothi yomhloli. Ithunyelwe kabusha yenza inguqulo elandelayo yalo rekhodi futhi igcine umlando wokubuyekeza. Isimo siphinde sibhalwe kuzakhi ngayinye. Vula Imiyalelo yesayithi. Khetha izakhi, nikeza imbangela nokuthi iyithinta kanjani izindleko nesikhathi ngamazwi akho, bese Yirekhoda. Ngemva kokurekhoda udaba, Chaza izinguquko ezenzeke kusukela kulolu daba ithi yiziphi izakhi ezishintshile eziyimbozwa yimiyalelo nezishintshile ngaphandle kokuthi kurekhodwe lutho. Okuwusizo ukwazi Isinyathelo ngasinye yi-Hlehlisa eyodwa. Akukho okwenqatshwayo: isidingo esingafinyelelwe, uhlobo olungavumelani nombhalo walo, noma idrowing yokukhiqiza ephuzile kuyisexwayiso noma inothi ku-Izinkinga. Amagumbi esidingo ayizindawo ezingenazo izindonga. Anesilinganiso esihlosiwe, hhayi indawo edwetshiwe, ngakho amashedyuli amagumbi kanye ne-COBie abawabali njengamagumbi adwetshiwe. Isakhiwo sibeka amagumbi ezitezi ngokwendawo kuphela. Asidwebi izindonga. Umbhalo wesichazi ubhalwa ku-Imibhalo kusuka kumodeli. Lapha uqhathaniswa nosayizi wemodeli kuphela: akukho sigaba sesitandade esibhalelwa wena. Amadrowing okukhiqiza nemiyalelo yesayithi ngamarekhodi ngomlando ofanayo nephaneli ethi Izindaba nezinguqulo, ngakho zombili iziphaneli ziwabonisa. Isimo sedrowing yokukhiqiza siyimpahla yakho ngayinye (CadCraft_ShopDrawing), kanti imiyalelo yesayithi yi-CadCraft_SiteInstruction, ngakho Thola kanye Shaya ngempahla kungazisebenzisa. Izimpawu ezihlolwe endaweni (Isigaba 7) zisezici ngaphansi kwe-Ukuqinisekiswa.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"open-project-folder","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Vula ifolda yonke yeprojekthi","summary":"Khomba i-BimCraft kufolda yeprojekthi ukuze ubone wonke amamodeli, izikhulu zawo nezixhumanisi ngesikhathi esisodwa, futhi uvumele ibhokisi i-Qala lapha lisikisele ukuthi yiphi ifayela okufanele uyisebenzise.","section":"tasks","order":80,"keywords":["ifolda","inkomba","ifolda yeprojekthi","idrayivu yenethiwekhi","iseva","qala lapha","iyiphi ifayela","izikhulu","izixhumanisi","xrefs","amafolda akamuva","hudula ifolda"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okuzobona","text":"Okuzobona","level":2},{"id":"sebenzisa-ibhokisi-le-qala-lapha","text":"Sebenzisa ibhokisi le-Qala lapha","level":2},{"id":"vula-amafayela-kumbiko","text":"Vula amafayela kumbiko","level":2},{"id":"vula-kabusha-ifolda-kamuva","text":"Vula kabusha ifolda kamuva","level":2},{"id":"izinephutha-ezivamile","text":"Izinephutha ezivamile","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula ifolda yonke yeprojekthi, njengaleyo onikezwe yona womsebenzi, bese uvumela i-BimCraft iyihlele: yiziphi izimodeli ezikhona, yiziphi ezikopi ezingezikhulu, yini exhuma kuyini, yiziphi amafayela alimele, nokuthi yiyiphi ifayela okungenzeka ufuna ukulivula.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKufundwa kuphela amakhilobhayithi ambalwa anesidingo ikhadi ngalinye lemodeli, ngakho ifolda kudrayivu yenethiwekhi noma kufolda yefu ehlanganisiwe iyamukeleka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula ifolda\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesobunxele (noma phakathi kwesikrini esingenalutho).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha ifolda yeprojekthi kuwindi elivulayo bese uchofoza \u003Cstrong\u003EKhetha\u003C/strong\u003E (noma \u003Cstrong\u003ELayisha\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003EVula\u003C/strong\u003E, kuye ngesistimu yakho).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cstrong\u003EBona amafayela\u003C/strong\u003E lapho isiphequluli sibuza &quot;Vumela isayithi ukubona amafayela?&quot;. Lokhu kuvumela ithebhu ifunde ifolda kuphela; akukho okulayishwayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELinda umugqa wesimo ubala: &quot;Ukubala ifolda: … amafayela&quot;, bese &quot;Ukuhlola amafayela e-Revit: … kwezingu-…&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:firefox\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EFirefox\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula ifolda\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesobunxele (noma phakathi kwesikrini esingenalutho).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha ifolda yeprojekthi kuwindi elivulayo bese uyaqinisekisa. I-Firefox ingase ikubuze ukuthi uqinisekise ukuthi ikhasi lingafunda amafayela efolda; asahlale ekhompyutheni yakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELinda umugqa wesimo uthi &quot;Ukufunda ifolda: … amafayela&quot;, bese &quot;Ukuhlola amafayela e-Revit: … kwezingu-…&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ESafari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula ifolda\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesobunxele (noma phakathi kwesikrini esingenalutho).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha ifolda yeprojekthi kuwindi elivulayo bese uchofoza \u003Cstrong\u003ELayisha\u003C/strong\u003E. Nakuba igama lithi kanjalo, akukho okuphuma ku-Mac yakho: amafayela anikezwa ithebhu kuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELinda umugqa wesimo uthi &quot;Ukufunda ifolda: … amafayela&quot;, bese &quot;Ukuhlola amafayela e-Revit: … kwezingu-…&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUngaphinda \u003Cstrong\u003Euhudule ifolda\u003C/strong\u003E isuka ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hp\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:mac\" title=\"Mac\"\u003EFinder\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:windows\" title=\"Windows\"\u003EFile Explorer\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:linux\" title=\"Linux\"\u003Eisiphathi-fayela sakho\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E uyibeke ekhasini. Ifolda ehudulwe ivula ngaphandle kwesimemezelo sokuvuma kuwo wonke amasiphequluli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzobona\"\u003EOkuzobona\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmbiko wefolda ugcwalisa maphakathi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIgama lefolda, izinani zamamodeli, imidwebo ye-CAD, amamodeli e-IFC namafayela, nosayizi wonke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmanothi abomvu noma aphuzi uma amafayela ethile engaphelele noma izixhumanisi ezithile zingekho kufolda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIbhokisi le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQala lapha\u003C/span\u003E: ifayela leBimCraft elisikisela ukuthi uvule, nezizathu zalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmamodeli\u003C/strong\u003E: umugqa owodwa ngemodeli, nezikhulu zayo zihlelwe ngaphansi kwayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmafayela axhunyiwe nakhonjiwe\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EAmamodeli e-IFC\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EImidwebo ye-CAD\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003EIbekelwe eceleni\u003C/strong\u003E, uma kukhona kufolda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgakwesobunxele, uphaneli \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfolda\u003C/span\u003E uyifingqa; \u003Cstrong\u003EIzinkinga\u003C/strong\u003E zithi &quot;Akukho&quot; uma yonke ikopi iphilile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sebenzisa-ibhokisi-le-qala-lapha\"\u003ESebenzisa ibhokisi le-Qala lapha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIbhokisi libiza ifayela eyodwa bese lichaza ngani, isibonelo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Umsebenzi osanda ukugcinwa kule folda (Mar 3, 2025).&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;\u003Cem\u003EConsultant.rvt\u003C/em\u003E ixhunyiwe kwamanye amamodeli, ngakho iyingemuva, hhayi ifayela okufanele uyihlele.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;\u003Cem\u003ETower.rvt\u003C/em\u003E ibonakala njengokukhetha okuvelele, kodwa ilimele; ikopi yayo yokugcina esihle isuka ku …&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Lena imodeli emaphakathi: ku-Revit, yivule ngo-&quot;Create New Local&quot; bese usebenza ekopini yasendaweni.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFunda izizathu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula ikhadi layo\u003C/span\u003E ukuze ufunde ikhadi lalelo fayela, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYibonise ohlwini\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uthole umugqa wayo ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EAmamodeli\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHlola nomuntu owasebenza ekugcineni eprojekthini ngaphambi kokuthembela kuyo. Ibhokisi nalo liyasho lokho: kuyisibikezelo esiqagelwe ngamagama, usuku nezixhumanisi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vula-amafayela-kumbiko\"\u003EVula amafayela kumbiko\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza igama lemodeli ukuze uvule ikhadi layo. Ikhadi lihlola ngayinye ixhumanisi ngefolda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuyela ku\u003C/span\u003E negama lefolda phezulu kwekhadi (noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuyela kwifolda\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesobunxele) ukuze ubuyele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza noma iliphi ifayela le-IFC ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EAmamodeli e-IFC\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze liveze ku-3D.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza noma iliphi i-DWG noma i-DXF ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EImidwebo ye-CAD\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze liveze ku-2D. Izixhumanisi zalo nezithombe zitholakala ngokuzenzakalelayo kufolda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vula-kabusha-ifolda-kamuva\"\u003EVula kabusha ifolda kamuva\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmafolda avulwe nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula ifolda\u003C/span\u003E noma ngokuhudula alondolozwa ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmafolda akamuva\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesobunxele. Chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula futhi\u003C/span\u003E negama lefolda ukuze uyivule futhi ngaphandle kokuyikhetha. Ngemuva kokuqalisa kabusha isiphequluli, i-Chrome noma i-Edge ibuza kanye futhi; khetha &quot;Vumela njalo&quot; ukuze unqamule lokho. Uhlu lugcinwa kulesi siphequluli kuphela, akuthunyelwa noyedwa. Chofoza × ukuze ukhohlwe ifolda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:firefox,safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EFirefox or Safari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELesi siphequluli asikwazi ukukhumbula amafolda phakathi kokuvakashelwa. Khetha ifolda futhi nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula ifolda\u003C/span\u003E, noma yihudule ngenhla.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinephutha-ezivamile\"\u003EIzinephutha ezivamile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkukhetha ifolda enkulu kakhulu.\u003C/strong\u003E Ngaphezu kwamafayela angu-20,000: &quot;Le folda inamafayela angaphezu kwezingu-20,000. Khetha ifolda encane, njengeyodwa yeprojekthi.&quot; Khetha ifolda yeprojekthi, hhayi idrayivu yonke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkukhetha umzali wamaprojekthi amaningi.\u003C/strong\u003E Ibhokisi le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQala lapha\u003C/span\u003E lizokhetha phakathi kwamaprojekthi. Khetha eyodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmafolda e-Revit ebukeka ehlukaniswe.\u003C/strong\u003E Amafolda \u003Ccode\u003E*_backup\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E*_log\u003C/code\u003E nelethi \u003Ccode\u003ERevit_temp\u003C/code\u003E ayizinto zokugcina endaweni ehlanzekile futhi ahlelwa ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EIbekelwe eceleni\u003C/strong\u003E, awafundwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkulindela imodeli ukuthi ivule ku-3D ekhadini layo.\u003C/strong\u003E Ifayela leprojekthi liyikhadi kuphela. Vula i-IFC yalo ekhishwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmafoni namathebulethi.\u003C/strong\u003E Amasiphequluli amaningi wefoni awakwazi ukukhetha amafolda. Sebenzisa ikhompyutha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/check-folder-health\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/check-folder-health\"\u003EHlola ifolda ukuthola amakhophi alimele, izixhumanisi ezingekho nezinsalela\u003C/a\u003E kanye \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/folder-roles\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/folder-roles\"\u003Enombiko wefolda: izindima, izimo nezixhumanisi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Vula ifolda yonke yeprojekthi, njengaleyo onikezwe yona womsebenzi, bese uvumela i-BimCraft iyihlele: yiziphi izimodeli ezikhona, yiziphi ezikopi ezingezikhulu, yini exhuma kuyini, yiziphi amafayela alimele, nokuthi yiyiphi ifayela okungenzeka ufuna ukulivula. Kufundwa kuphela amakhilobhayithi ambalwa anesidingo ikhadi ngalinye lemodeli, ngakho ifolda kudrayivu yenethiwekhi noma kufolda yefu ehlanganisiwe iyamukeleka. Izinyathelo Chofoza Vula ifolda ngakwesobunxele (noma phakathi kwesikrini esingenalutho). Khetha ifolda yeprojekthi kuwindi elivulayo bese uchofoza Khetha (noma Layisha noma Vula, kuye ngesistimu yakho). Chofoza Bona amafayela lapho isiphequluli sibuza \"Vumela isayithi ukubona amafayela?\". Lokhu kuvumela ithebhu ifunde ifolda kuphela; akukho okulayishwayo. Linda umugqa wesimo ubala: \"Ukubala ifolda: … amafayela\", bese \"Ukuhlola amafayela e-Revit: … kwezingu-…\". Chofoza Vula ifolda ngakwesobunxele (noma phakathi kwesikrini esingenalutho). Khetha ifolda yeprojekthi kuwindi elivulayo bese uyaqinisekisa. I-Firefox ingase ikubuze ukuthi uqinisekise ukuthi ikhasi lingafunda amafayela efolda; asahlale ekhompyutheni yakho. Linda umugqa wesimo uthi \"Ukufunda ifolda: … amafayela\", bese \"Ukuhlola amafayela e-Revit: … kwezingu-…\". Chofoza Vula ifolda ngakwesobunxele (noma phakathi kwesikrini esingenalutho). Khetha ifolda yeprojekthi kuwindi elivulayo bese uchofoza Layisha. Nakuba igama lithi kanjalo, akukho okuphuma ku-Mac yakho: amafayela anikezwa ithebhu kuphela. Linda umugqa wesimo uthi \"Ukufunda ifolda: … amafayela\", bese \"Ukuhlola amafayela e-Revit: … kwezingu-…\". Ungaphinda uhudule ifolda isuka ku-Finder / File Explorer / isiphathi-fayela sakho uyibeke ekhasini. Ifolda ehudulwe ivula ngaphandle kwesimemezelo sokuvuma kuwo wonke amasiphequluli. Okuzobona Umbiko wefolda ugcwalisa maphakathi: Igama lefolda, izinani zamamodeli, imidwebo ye-CAD, amamodeli e-IFC namafayela, nosayizi wonke. Amanothi abomvu noma aphuzi uma amafayela ethile engaphelele noma izixhumanisi ezithile zingekho kufolda. Ibhokisi le-Qala lapha: ifayela leBimCraft elisikisela ukuthi uvule, nezizathu zalo. Amamodeli: umugqa owodwa ngemodeli, nezikhulu zayo zihlelwe ngaphansi kwayo. Amafayela axhunyiwe nakhonjiwe, Amamodeli e-IFC, Imidwebo ye-CAD kanye Ibekelwe eceleni, uma kukhona kufolda. Ngakwesobunxele, uphaneli Ifolda uyifingqa; Izinkinga zithi \"Akukho\" uma yonke ikopi iphilile. Sebenzisa ibhokisi le-Qala lapha Ibhokisi libiza ifayela eyodwa bese lichaza ngani, isibonelo: \"Umsebenzi osanda ukugcinwa kule folda (Mar 3, 2025).\" \"Consultant.rvt ixhunyiwe kwamanye amamodeli, ngakho iyingemuva, hhayi ifayela okufanele uyihlele.\" \"Tower.rvt ibonakala njengokukhetha okuvelele, kodwa ilimele; ikopi yayo yokugcina esihle isuka ku …\" \"Lena imodeli emaphakathi: ku-Revit, yivule ngo-\"Create New Local\" bese usebenza ekopini yasendaweni.\" Funda izizathu. Chofoza Vula ikhadi layo ukuze ufunde ikhadi lalelo fayela, noma Yibonise ohlwini ukuze uthole umugqa wayo ku-Amamodeli. Hlola nomuntu owasebenza ekugcineni eprojekthini ngaphambi kokuthembela kuyo. Ibhokisi nalo liyasho lokho: kuyisibikezelo esiqagelwe ngamagama, usuku nezixhumanisi. Vula amafayela kumbiko Chofoza igama lemodeli ukuze uvule ikhadi layo. Ikhadi lihlola ngayinye ixhumanisi ngefolda. Chofoza Buyela ku negama lefolda phezulu kwekhadi (noma Buyela kwifolda ngakwesobunxele) ukuze ubuyele. Chofoza noma iliphi ifayela le-IFC ngaphansi kwe-Amamodeli e-IFC ukuze liveze ku-3D. Chofoza noma iliphi i-DWG noma i-DXF ngaphansi kwe-Imidwebo ye-CAD ukuze liveze ku-2D. Izixhumanisi zalo nezithombe zitholakala ngokuzenzakalelayo kufolda. Vula kabusha ifolda kamuva Amafolda avulwe nge-Vula ifolda noma ngokuhudula alondolozwa ngaphansi kwe-Amafolda akamuva ngakwesobunxele. Chofoza Vula futhi negama lefolda ukuze uyivule futhi ngaphandle kokuyikhetha. Ngemuva kokuqalisa kabusha isiphequluli, i-Chrome noma i-Edge ibuza kanye futhi; khetha \"Vumela njalo\" ukuze unqamule lokho. Uhlu lugcinwa kulesi siphequluli kuphela, akuthunyelwa noyedwa. Chofoza × ukuze ukhohlwe ifolda. Lesi siphequluli asikwazi ukukhumbula amafolda phakathi kokuvakashelwa. Khetha ifolda futhi nge-Vula ifolda, noma yihudule ngenhla. Izinephutha ezivamile Ukukhetha ifolda enkulu kakhulu. Ngaphezu kwamafayela angu-20,000: \"Le folda inamafayela angaphezu kwezingu-20,000. Khetha ifolda encane, njengeyodwa yeprojekthi.\" Khetha ifolda yeprojekthi, hhayi idrayivu yonke. Ukukhetha umzali wamaprojekthi amaningi. Ibhokisi le-Qala lapha lizokhetha phakathi kwamaprojekthi. Khetha eyodwa. Amafolda e-Revit ebukeka ehlukaniswe. Amafolda *_backup, *_log nelethi Revit_temp ayizinto zokugcina endaweni ehlanzekile futhi ahlelwa ngaphansi kwe-Ibekelwe eceleni, awafundwa. Ukulindela imodeli ukuthi ivule ku-3D ekhadini layo. Ifayela leprojekthi liyikhadi kuphela. Vula i-IFC yalo ekhishwe. Amafoni namathebulethi. Amasiphequluli amaningi wefoni awakwazi ukukhetha amafolda. Sebenzisa ikhompyutha. Bheka Hlola ifolda ukuthola amakhophi alimele, izixhumanisi ezingekho nezinsalela kanye nombiko wefolda: izindima, izimo nezixhumanisi.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"level-of-development","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Izinga lentuthuko (LOD) nokuhlola kwezigaba","summary":"Nikeza izinto izinga lentuthuko, bona lapho livela khona, hlola imodeli ngokuya ngezinga isigaba esilidingayo, bese ulungisa amathegi aswelayo namagumbi angenamagama. Konke ukuhlola kuyeluleka; akukho okuvinjelwayo.","section":"tasks","order":81,"keywords":["lod","izinga lentuthuko","lod 100","lod 200","lod 300","lod 350","lod 400","lod 500","isigaba","ithebula lezigaba","ukuhlola imodeli","amathegi aswelayo","amagumbi angenamagama","ukuhlala kujwayelekile ekuqaleni","uhlobo lwe-IFC","ukuhlukaniswa"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukubone","text":"Okufanele ukubone","level":2},{"id":"okuwusizo","text":"Okuwusizo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETshela ukuthi yimuphi umkhakha ngamunye usuthuthukile kangakanani, bese uhlola imodeli yonke ngokuya ngalokho isigaba sephrojekthi esikudingayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha into (noma izinto ezimbalwa) bese uvula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E. Thola \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELevel of development\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha izinga kuhlu. Ngalinye lichazwa ngokuthi lisho ini, futhi ngalinye lifaka phakathi ayangaphansi kwalo. Isinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa simboza konke okukhethiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFunda ukuthi izinga livela kuphi: kule nto, kuhlobo lwayo, noma kusimaka okuqinisekiswe ngesayithi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuhlola imodeli, vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel checks\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesobunxele, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELOD milestones\u003C/span\u003E. Khetha isigaba nethebula (ithebula lokuqala, noma ifayela lakho le-CSV noma le-JSON ngo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELoad\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck the model\u003C/span\u003E. Amanani aphelele nomugqa ngamunye wesakhiwo sethebula akhombisa okufinyelele izinga lakho nokungafinyelelanga; okutholakele futhi kuvela ohlwini lwezinkinga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphansi kuka-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMissing tags and unnamed rooms\u003C/span\u003E, chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFind them\u003C/span\u003E, hlela izincomo uma uthanda, bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EApply\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukubone\"\u003EOkufanele ukubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinga oliqokile kule nto, kanye nekilasi layo ye-IFC nezikhodi zokuhlukaniswa eziseduze kwalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmanani aphelele nemigqa yesigaba. Ithebula alishintshi incazelo yezinga: isikali sisethiwe, ithebula lisho kuphela ukuthi yiliphi izinga isigaba esilidingayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Ukuhlala kujwayelekile ekuqaleni&quot;: iseluleko sokugcina izinto zijwayelekile esigabeni sokuqala. Siyiseluleko kuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuwusizo\"\u003EOkuwusizo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkukho okuvimbela lapha. Imodeli engaphansi kwezinga isigaba esilidingayo iyabhalwa ohlwini, ayenqatshwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzingxenye ezintathu zezinga (ijometri, ulwazi, ukubhalwa phansi) ngayinye ingasethwa; uphawu lubonisa ukuthi kufinyelelwe, kungaphansi, noma akushiwo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Tshela ukuthi yimuphi umkhakha ngamunye usuthuthukile kangakanani, bese uhlola imodeli yonke ngokuya ngalokho isigaba sephrojekthi esikudingayo. Izinyathelo Khetha into (noma izinto ezimbalwa) bese uvula Properties. Thola Level of development. Khetha izinga kuhlu. Ngalinye lichazwa ngokuthi lisho ini, futhi ngalinye lifaka phakathi ayangaphansi kwalo. Isinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa simboza konke okukhethiwe. Funda ukuthi izinga livela kuphi: kule nto, kuhlobo lwayo, noma kusimaka okuqinisekiswe ngesayithi. Ukuhlola imodeli, vula Model checks ngakwesobunxele, bese LOD milestones. Khetha isigaba nethebula (ithebula lokuqala, noma ifayela lakho le-CSV noma le-JSON ngo-Load). Chofoza Check the model. Amanani aphelele nomugqa ngamunye wesakhiwo sethebula akhombisa okufinyelele izinga lakho nokungafinyelelanga; okutholakele futhi kuvela ohlwini lwezinkinga. Ngaphansi kuka-Missing tags and unnamed rooms, chofoza Find them, hlela izincomo uma uthanda, bese uchofoza Apply. Okufanele ukubone Izinga oliqokile kule nto, kanye nekilasi layo ye-IFC nezikhodi zokuhlukaniswa eziseduze kwalo. Amanani aphelele nemigqa yesigaba. Ithebula alishintshi incazelo yezinga: isikali sisethiwe, ithebula lisho kuphela ukuthi yiliphi izinga isigaba esilidingayo. \"Ukuhlala kujwayelekile ekuqaleni\": iseluleko sokugcina izinto zijwayelekile esigabeni sokuqala. Siyiseluleko kuphela. Okuwusizo Akukho okuvimbela lapha. Imodeli engaphansi kwezinga isigaba esilidingayo iyabhalwa ohlwini, ayenqatshwa. Izingxenye ezintathu zezinga (ijometri, ulwazi, ukubhalwa phansi) ngayinye ingasethwa; uphawu lubonisa ukuthi kufinyelelwe, kungaphansi, noma akushiwo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"wall-finishes","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Izimpelasi zodonga, ukubekwa kwamathayela nezisekelo","summary":"Faka izimpelasi ezinhlangothini ezimbili zodonga, bekela amathayela kusukela endaweni yokuqala, bese usetha izendlalelo zesisekelo ngemuva kwawo, bese ufunda izinani ezisematheyibhilini wezimpelasi zodonga.","section":"tasks","order":82,"keywords":["impelasi yodonga","izimpelasi","ithayela","amathayela","ukubeka","isimbozo sangemuva","udonga lwesihlambi","ukungenisa amanzi","isisekelo","udaka lokunamathisela","ujoyini","inkunkuma","isimbozo","uhlu","inani"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukubone","text":"Okufanele ukubone","level":2},{"id":"okuwusizo-ukukwazi","text":"Okuwusizo ukukwazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQeda izinhlangothi zodonga (upende, ibhodi, ithayela) bese ufunda ukuthi ibhilding idinga kangakanani kwesinye nesinye isimbozo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalls\u003C/span\u003E › Izimpelasi zodonga…. Iphaneli ivula phezu komdwebo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha udonga. Esigabeni \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFace\u003C/span\u003E khetha uhlangothi lwesobunxele noma lwesokudla, bese wengeza isimbozo: Ubude obugcwele, Isimbozo sangemuva, Udonga lwesihlambi noma Ngamakhona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma kuyithayela, khetha lapho ukubeka kuqala khona (ikhona, isenta, umphetho wesivulo noma iphoyinti), ukuqondiswa kwethayela kanye nephethini eqondile noma eyisakhiwo. Inani lamathayela aphelele nalawo anqunyiwe libonakala ngesikhathi esifanayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEsigabeni \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFinish types\u003C/span\u003E yenza noma shintsha uhlobo: igama, uhlobo, usayizi wethayela nojoyini, inkunkuma, kanye nokwakhiwa kusuka odongeni kuya phandle (isisekelo, ukumelana namanzi, udaka lokunamathisela, ukuqeda).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEsigabeni \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESubstrates\u003C/span\u003E shintsha izendlalelo zesisekelo ngokwazo bese ufunda ukuthi udonga lulinganiswa kanjani uma selugedwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEsigabeni \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESchedules\u003C/span\u003E funda izimpelasi zodonga ngesifunda, ngokuqeda nangegumbi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukubone\"\u003EOkufanele ukubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzimpelasi ezidwetshwe esicwebeni nanjengezimbozo emodelini; ukunyakaza noma ukubhala kabusha udonga kunyakaza nezimpelasi zalo nazo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYonke ushintsho ingusinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinani ngaphandle kwezimbobo. Izinani zamathayela ezimakwe ≈ ziyizilinganiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuwusizo-ukukwazi\"\u003EOkuwusizo ukukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIphaneli ieluleka kuphela futhi ayikaze ivimbele umsebenzi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzimpelasi zodonga zivela futhi esigabeni \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESchedules\u003C/span\u003E njengezimpelasi zodonga ngesifunda, ngokuqeda nangegumbi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Qeda izinhlangothi zodonga (upende, ibhodi, ithayela) bese ufunda ukuthi ibhilding idinga kangakanani kwesinye nesinye isimbozo. Izinyathelo Vula Draw › Walls › Izimpelasi zodonga…. Iphaneli ivula phezu komdwebo. Khetha udonga. Esigabeni Face khetha uhlangothi lwesobunxele noma lwesokudla, bese wengeza isimbozo: Ubude obugcwele, Isimbozo sangemuva, Udonga lwesihlambi noma Ngamakhona. Uma kuyithayela, khetha lapho ukubeka kuqala khona (ikhona, isenta, umphetho wesivulo noma iphoyinti), ukuqondiswa kwethayela kanye nephethini eqondile noma eyisakhiwo. Inani lamathayela aphelele nalawo anqunyiwe libonakala ngesikhathi esifanayo. Esigabeni Finish types yenza noma shintsha uhlobo: igama, uhlobo, usayizi wethayela nojoyini, inkunkuma, kanye nokwakhiwa kusuka odongeni kuya phandle (isisekelo, ukumelana namanzi, udaka lokunamathisela, ukuqeda). Esigabeni Substrates shintsha izendlalelo zesisekelo ngokwazo bese ufunda ukuthi udonga lulinganiswa kanjani uma selugedwe. Esigabeni Schedules funda izimpelasi zodonga ngesifunda, ngokuqeda nangegumbi. Okufanele ukubone Izimpelasi ezidwetshwe esicwebeni nanjengezimbozo emodelini; ukunyakaza noma ukubhala kabusha udonga kunyakaza nezimpelasi zalo nazo. Yonke ushintsho ingusinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Izinani ngaphandle kwezimbobo. Izinani zamathayela ezimakwe ≈ ziyizilinganiso. Okuwusizo ukukwazi Iphaneli ieluleka kuphela futhi ayikaze ivimbele umsebenzi. Izimpelasi zodonga zivela futhi esigabeni Schedules njengezimpelasi zodonga ngesifunda, ngokuqeda nangegumbi.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"part-link","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Thumela isakhi ku-PartCraft bese uyibuyisela","summary":"Khetha isekelo, ibhulaketi, irelingi noma isisetshenziswa, ukwenze njengengxenye ku-PartCraft nesakhiwo esizungezile, bese wamukela isimo esisha sibuyele emodelini.","section":"tasks","order":84,"keywords":["partcraft","ingxenye","thumela","xhuma","isakhi","isekelo","ibhulaketi","ifenisi","irelingi","isisetshenziswa","dizayini","uhambo oluphindwayo","amukela","kushintshiwe","izixhumanisi zengxenye"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukubone","text":"Okufanele ukubone","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-wazi","text":"Okufanele wazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDizayina elinye isakhi sesakhiwo njengengxenye: lithumele ku-PartCraft, ulishintshe khona (sika, engeza, bhoboza, lulame ubukhulu), bese ubuyisela isimo esisha emodelini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha isakhi esisodwa emodelini: isakhi esijwayelekile, isisetshenziswa, ikholomu, ibhimu, irelingi noma impahla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzixhumanisi zengxenye\u003C/span\u003E kwithuluzi bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela ku-PartCraft\u003C/span\u003E. I-PartCraft ivula ithebhu entsha nesakhi njengengxenye. Izakhi ezingaphakathi kwe-3 m zidwetshwe zingwevu eduze kwaso ukuze uzidizayinele ngapha. Azikwazi ukushintshwa lapho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShintsha ingxenye ku-PartCraft. Ku-PartCraft khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfayela\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza ubuyele ku-BimCraft\u003C/span\u003E. Ungalondoloza kabuyela njengoba ufuna.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEmuva ku-BimCraft inkinobho ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzixhumanisi zengxenye\u003C/span\u003E ibonisa inani, nekhadi libhala isakhi njengo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKushintshwe ku-PartCraft\u003C/span\u003E nokushintsha kobukhulu nevolumu ngamazwi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uyibheke, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmukela\u003C/span\u003E ukuze isakhi sithole isimo esisha, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGcina okwami\u003C/span\u003E ukuze sishiye njengoba sasinjalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukubone\"\u003EOkufanele ukubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkwamukela kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Isakhi sigcina indawo yaso, i-GlobalId, uhlobo, izinto nezici. Kushintshwa umzimba waso kuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsakhi sithola isethi yezici \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft_PartLink\u003C/span\u003E enesixhumanisi, isimo sayo nenguqulo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela futhi\u003C/span\u003E ivula lesi sakhi ku-PartCraft futhi, ngalesi sixhumanisi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-wazi\"\u003EOkufanele wazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzindonga, amafloro, uphahla, iminyango, amawindi, izitebhisi, amaramp nezikhala kwakhiwa amathuluzi wesakhiwo kusuka emugqeni nasezindaweni ezizungezile futhi kwakhiwe kabusha ngemuva kwawo wonke ushintsho. Umzimba ovela kwenye i-app ubhalwa phezulu, ngakho lezi zinqatshwa nesizathu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsimo sibuya njenge-mesh (i-IFC tessellation), hhayi njengezici zengxenye. Umlando wengxenye uhlala ku-PartCraft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma isakhi siguquke emodelini emva kokuthi usithumele, ikhadi lisho lokho ngaphambi kokuthi wamukele: ukwamukela kushintsha lezo zinguquko.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkukho okulayishwa. Lezi zinhlelo zimbili ziyimikhasi yesayithi eyodwa futhi zidlulisa isakhi phakathi kwazo kulesi sisiphequluli. Zombili kumele zivulwe esiphequluleni esifanayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsakhi kumele sibe yisimo esiqinile ku-PartCraft. Isakhi esinezikhala ezinkulu ezivulekile siyenqatshwa khona nenombolo yemiphetho evulekile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuze wamukele, yenza imodeli ebamba lesi sakhi ibe ngeyamanje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Dizayina elinye isakhi sesakhiwo njengengxenye: lithumele ku-PartCraft, ulishintshe khona (sika, engeza, bhoboza, lulame ubukhulu), bese ubuyisela isimo esisha emodelini. Izinyathelo Khetha isakhi esisodwa emodelini: isakhi esijwayelekile, isisetshenziswa, ikholomu, ibhimu, irelingi noma impahla. Khetha Izixhumanisi zengxenye kwithuluzi bese Thumela ku-PartCraft. I-PartCraft ivula ithebhu entsha nesakhi njengengxenye. Izakhi ezingaphakathi kwe-3 m zidwetshwe zingwevu eduze kwaso ukuze uzidizayinele ngapha. Azikwazi ukushintshwa lapho. Shintsha ingxenye ku-PartCraft. Ku-PartCraft khetha Ifayela › Thumela › Londoloza ubuyele ku-BimCraft. Ungalondoloza kabuyela njengoba ufuna. Emuva ku-BimCraft inkinobho ye-Izixhumanisi zengxenye ibonisa inani, nekhadi libhala isakhi njengo-Kushintshwe ku-PartCraft nokushintsha kobukhulu nevolumu ngamazwi. Khetha Bonisa ukuze uyibheke, bese Amukela ukuze isakhi sithole isimo esisha, noma Gcina okwami ukuze sishiye njengoba sasinjalo. Okufanele ukubone Ukwamukela kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa. Isakhi sigcina indawo yaso, i-GlobalId, uhlobo, izinto nezici. Kushintshwa umzimba waso kuphela. Isakhi sithola isethi yezici CadCraft_PartLink enesixhumanisi, isimo sayo nenguqulo. Thumela futhi ivula lesi sakhi ku-PartCraft futhi, ngalesi sixhumanisi. Okufanele wazi Izindonga, amafloro, uphahla, iminyango, amawindi, izitebhisi, amaramp nezikhala kwakhiwa amathuluzi wesakhiwo kusuka emugqeni nasezindaweni ezizungezile futhi kwakhiwe kabusha ngemuva kwawo wonke ushintsho. Umzimba ovela kwenye i-app ubhalwa phezulu, ngakho lezi zinqatshwa nesizathu. Isimo sibuya njenge-mesh (i-IFC tessellation), hhayi njengezici zengxenye. Umlando wengxenye uhlala ku-PartCraft. Uma isakhi siguquke emodelini emva kokuthi usithumele, ikhadi lisho lokho ngaphambi kokuthi wamukele: ukwamukela kushintsha lezo zinguquko. Akukho okulayishwa. Lezi zinhlelo zimbili ziyimikhasi yesayithi eyodwa futhi zidlulisa isakhi phakathi kwazo kulesi sisiphequluli. Zombili kumele zivulwe esiphequluleni esifanayo. Isakhi kumele sibe yisimo esiqinile ku-PartCraft. Isakhi esinezikhala ezinkulu ezivulekile siyenqatshwa khona nenombolo yemiphetho evulekile. Ukuze wamukele, yenza imodeli ebamba lesi sakhi ibe ngeyamanje.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"check-folder-health","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Hlola ifolda ukuthola amakhophi alimele, izixhumanisi ezilahlekile nezinsalela","summary":"Sebenzisa umbiko wefolda ukuthola amafayela emodeli aphelelwe, ukukhetha ikhophi yokugcina yokusekela ephelele, ukubona izixhumanisi ezingekho, nokubona amafayela okukhiya nesikhashana.","section":"tasks","order":90,"keywords":["ukuhlola impilo","elonakele","elonakalisiwe","ephelele","ephelelwe","ukusekela","izixhumanisi ezilahlekile","xref ilahlekile","ukuhlola","izinsalela","amafayela okukhiya","dwl","bak","ukudlulisela"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo-amakhophi-alimele","text":"Izinyathelo: amakhophi alimele","level":2},{"id":"ukuhlola-impilo-kwenzani","text":"Ukuhlola impilo kwenzani","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo-izixhumanisi-ezilahlekile","text":"Izinyathelo: izixhumanisi ezilahlekile","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo-izinsalela","text":"Izinyathelo: izinsalela","level":2},{"id":"okungalungile-okuvamile","text":"Okungalungile okuvamile","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHlola ifolda yephrojekthi ngaphambi kokuyidlulisela noma ngaphambi kokuqala ukuyisebenzisa: ingabe yonke imodeli iphelele, iyiphi ikhophi yokusekela yokugcina elungile, futhi zonke izifayela ezixhunyiwe zikhona yini?\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo-amakhophi-alimele\"\u003EIzinyathelo: amakhophi alimele\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula ifolda yephrojekthi. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/open-project-folder\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/open-project-folder\"\u003EVula ifolda yephrojekthi yonke\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFunda amanothi ngaphansi kwegama lefolda. &quot;Amafayela angu-2 aphelele noma awafundeki. Bona amamodeli angezansi.&quot; kusho ukuthi kukhona okufanele ukubheka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-\u003Cstrong\u003EAmamodeli\u003C/strong\u003E, bheka ikholomu \u003Cstrong\u003EIsimo\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EEphelele\u003C/strong\u003E kuyahle. &quot;1 ayiphelele&quot; ephuzi kusho ukuthi ikhophi eyodwa ayilungile kepha enye iyilungile. \u003Cstrong\u003EAyiphelele\u003C/strong\u003E ebomvu kusho ukuthi akutholakalanga ikhophi elungile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cstrong\u003EYonke ... amakhophi\u003C/strong\u003E ngaphansi kwemodeli enenkinga. Ibhala ifayela eyinhloko nokusekela ngakunye okunamba, okusha kakhulu phezulu, ngosayizi, usuku nesimo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFunda inothi ngaphezulu kohlu, isibonelo &quot;Tower.rvt ayiphelele (183.2 MB, kufanele ibe ngaphezu kuka-214.0 MB). Ikhadi likhombisa ikhophi ephelele eyakamuva, Tower.0012.rvt (Mar 3, 2025).&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ikhophi ofuna ukuyivula. Amakhophi aphelele kuphela angachofozwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuhlola-impilo-kwenzani\"\u003EUkuhlola impilo kwenzani\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYonke ikhophi yemodeli ngayinye ithola ukuhlolwa okusheshayo kwekhanda layo, ama-byte angu-512 ngayinye, ngakho ifolda yemodeli ezinkulu ihlolwa ngemizuzwana. Ifayela elikhomba ngaphesheya kwesiphelo salo lapho lisikiwe lapho likopishwa, lilayishwa noma lihlanganiswa. Ifayela lesidwebi sikadrayivu wamafu esisesimweni se-&quot;online only&quot; lingabonakala lifana nalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIkhadi lemodeli ngayinye lifundwa kufayela eyinhloko uma liphilile, futhi kusukela ekusekelweni okusha okuphilile uma kungenjalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo-izixhumanisi-ezilahlekile\"\u003EIzinyathelo: izixhumanisi ezilahlekile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBheka inothi elithi &quot;\u003Cem\u003En\u003C/em\u003E amafayela axhunyiwe awakho kule folda.&quot; ngaphansi kwegama lefolda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESkrola uye ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EAmafayela axhunyiwe nakhonjelwe\u003C/strong\u003E. Izixhumanisi ezilahlekile zibhalwe phezulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFunda ikholomu \u003Cstrong\u003ELapho\u003C/strong\u003E kwesixhumanisi ngasinye:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKule folda\u003C/strong\u003E: itholakale endleleni emodeli eyilondoloze kuyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIgama elifanayo litholakele\u003C/strong\u003E: ifayela linegama elifanayo endaweni enye ngaphakathi kwefolda. Hlola ukuthi ngelolungile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIfayela le-library\u003C/strong\u003E: ithebula lekhodi yezinkomba noma yezakhiwo. Lezi zifika nalolu hlelo kukhompyutha ngayinye, ngakho azilindelwe kule folda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkulona kule folda\u003C/strong\u003E: alitholakalanga noma kuphi kule folda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFunda \u003Cstrong\u003EKusetshenziswa ngu-\u003C/strong\u003E ukubona ukuthi yimaphi amamodeli axhuma ifayela ngalinye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-BimCraft ifuna isixhumanisi ngasinye kuqala ngendlela yaso ehlobene, bese ngokuphela kwendlela esiyilondoloze (ngakho \u003Ccode\u003E\\\\server\\jobs\\Tower\\Cad\\X-Refs\\site.dwg\u003C/code\u003E itholakala ku-\u003Ccode\u003EX-Refs/site.dwg\u003C/code\u003E uma ukhethe ifolda ethi \u003Ccode\u003ECad\u003C/code\u003E), bese ngegama lefayela noma kuphi kule folda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo-izinsalela\"\u003EIzinyathelo: izinsalela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESkrola uye ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EBekelwe eceleni\u003C/strong\u003E ekugcineni komBiko.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFunda imigqa emithathu engavela:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmafolda okugcina (\u003Ccode\u003E*_backup\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E*_log\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003ERevit_temp\u003C/code\u003E): awafundwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinsalela zokukhiya, zamalogi nezokusekela: amafayela afana ne-\u003Ccode\u003E.dwl\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.dwl2\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.bak\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.err\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.log\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.tmp\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.sv$\u003C/code\u003E. Zishiywe yizinhlelo ezahlulekile noma ezazivulekile lapho ifolda ikopishwa. Ngokuvamile ziphephile ukususwa uma kungekho muntu ovule amafayela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmanye amafayela: konke okunye i-BimCraft engakufundi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okungalungile-okuvamile\"\u003EOkungalungile okuvamile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkususa ifayela eyinhloko elimeleyo ngaphambi kokulondoloza ukusekela okuhle.\u003C/strong\u003E Kopisha ukusekela okusha okuphelele kuqala, bese uphatha ifayela elimeleyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkwethemba &quot;Igama elifanayo litholakele&quot; ngokungabheki.\u003C/strong\u003E Imidwebo emibili ingabelana ngegama elifanayo. Vula bobabili uma unokungabaza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkucabanga ukuthi ifayela le-library elilahlekile yinkinga.\u003C/strong\u003E Amathebula ekhodi yezinkomba nezakhiwo ahlala nohlelo kukhompyutha ngayinye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInani lamafayela lehluka phakathi kwamabhrawuza.\u003C/strong\u003E Ku-Firefox ne-Safari, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen a folder\u003C/span\u003E inikeza wonke amafayela, kuhlanganise nalawo angaphakathi kumafolda okugcina, ngakho inani (kanye nomkhawulo wamafayela angu-20,000) liwafaka. Ukudonsa ifolda ngaphakathi kuwadlula, njengoba i-Chrome ne-Edge zenza. Umbiko ngenye indlela ufana nokuthi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Hlola ifolda yephrojekthi ngaphambi kokuyidlulisela noma ngaphambi kokuqala ukuyisebenzisa: ingabe yonke imodeli iphelele, iyiphi ikhophi yokusekela yokugcina elungile, futhi zonke izifayela ezixhunyiwe zikhona yini? Izinyathelo: amakhophi alimele Vula ifolda yephrojekthi. Bona Vula ifolda yephrojekthi yonke. Funda amanothi ngaphansi kwegama lefolda. \"Amafayela angu-2 aphelele noma awafundeki. Bona amamodeli angezansi.\" kusho ukuthi kukhona okufanele ukubheka. Ku-Amamodeli, bheka ikholomu Isimo. Ephelele kuyahle. \"1 ayiphelele\" ephuzi kusho ukuthi ikhophi eyodwa ayilungile kepha enye iyilungile. Ayiphelele ebomvu kusho ukuthi akutholakalanga ikhophi elungile. Vula Yonke ... amakhophi ngaphansi kwemodeli enenkinga. Ibhala ifayela eyinhloko nokusekela ngakunye okunamba, okusha kakhulu phezulu, ngosayizi, usuku nesimo. Funda inothi ngaphezulu kohlu, isibonelo \"Tower.rvt ayiphelele (183.2 MB, kufanele ibe ngaphezu kuka-214.0 MB). Ikhadi likhombisa ikhophi ephelele eyakamuva, Tower.0012.rvt (Mar 3, 2025).\" Chofoza ikhophi ofuna ukuyivula. Amakhophi aphelele kuphela angachofozwa. Ukuhlola impilo kwenzani Yonke ikhophi yemodeli ngayinye ithola ukuhlolwa okusheshayo kwekhanda layo, ama-byte angu-512 ngayinye, ngakho ifolda yemodeli ezinkulu ihlolwa ngemizuzwana. Ifayela elikhomba ngaphesheya kwesiphelo salo lapho lisikiwe lapho likopishwa, lilayishwa noma lihlanganiswa. Ifayela lesidwebi sikadrayivu wamafu esisesimweni se-\"online only\" lingabonakala lifana nalo. Ikhadi lemodeli ngayinye lifundwa kufayela eyinhloko uma liphilile, futhi kusukela ekusekelweni okusha okuphilile uma kungenjalo. Izinyathelo: izixhumanisi ezilahlekile Bheka inothi elithi \"n amafayela axhunyiwe awakho kule folda.\" ngaphansi kwegama lefolda. Skrola uye ku-Amafayela axhunyiwe nakhonjelwe. Izixhumanisi ezilahlekile zibhalwe phezulu. Funda ikholomu Lapho kwesixhumanisi ngasinye: Kule folda: itholakale endleleni emodeli eyilondoloze kuyo. Igama elifanayo litholakele: ifayela linegama elifanayo endaweni enye ngaphakathi kwefolda. Hlola ukuthi ngelolungile. Ifayela le-library: ithebula lekhodi yezinkomba noma yezakhiwo. Lezi zifika nalolu hlelo kukhompyutha ngayinye, ngakho azilindelwe kule folda. Akulona kule folda: alitholakalanga noma kuphi kule folda. Funda Kusetshenziswa ngu- ukubona ukuthi yimaphi amamodeli axhuma ifayela ngalinye. I-BimCraft ifuna isixhumanisi ngasinye kuqala ngendlela yaso ehlobene, bese ngokuphela kwendlela esiyilondoloze (ngakho \\\\server\\jobs\\Tower\\Cad\\X-Refs\\site.dwg itholakala ku-X-Refs/site.dwg uma ukhethe ifolda ethi Cad), bese ngegama lefayela noma kuphi kule folda. Izinyathelo: izinsalela Skrola uye ku-Bekelwe eceleni ekugcineni komBiko. Funda imigqa emithathu engavela: Amafolda okugcina (*_backup, *_log, Revit_temp): awafundwa. Izinsalela zokukhiya, zamalogi nezokusekela: amafayela afana ne-.dwl, .dwl2, .bak, .err, .log, .tmp, .sv$. Zishiywe yizinhlelo ezahlulekile noma ezazivulekile lapho ifolda ikopishwa. Ngokuvamile ziphephile ukususwa uma kungekho muntu ovule amafayela. Amanye amafayela: konke okunye i-BimCraft engakufundi. Okungalungile okuvamile Ukususa ifayela eyinhloko elimeleyo ngaphambi kokulondoloza ukusekela okuhle. Kopisha ukusekela okusha okuphelele kuqala, bese uphatha ifayela elimeleyo. Ukwethemba \"Igama elifanayo litholakele\" ngokungabheki. Imidwebo emibili ingabelana ngegama elifanayo. Vula bobabili uma unokungabaza. Ukucabanga ukuthi ifayela le-library elilahlekile yinkinga. Amathebula ekhodi yezinkomba nezakhiwo ahlala nohlelo kukhompyutha ngayinye. Inani lamafayela lehluka phakathi kwamabhrawuza. Ku-Firefox ne-Safari, Open a folder inikeza wonke amafayela, kuhlanganise nalawo angaphakathi kumafolda okugcina, ngakho inani (kanye nomkhawulo wamafayela angu-20,000) liwafaka. Ukudonsa ifolda ngaphakathi kuwadlula, njengoba i-Chrome ne-Edge zenza. Umbiko ngenye indlela ufana nokuthi.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"view-dwg","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Buka umdwebo we-DWG noma we-DXF","summary":"Vula i-DWG noma i-DXF, uzule endaweni yemodeli namashidi, ufunde amakhoordinethi, ubone okungakadwetshwa.","section":"tasks","order":100,"keywords":["amablokhi wamandla","izimo zokubonakala","dwg","dxf","cad","umdwebo","2d","buka","isibukimodeli","hambisa","sondeza","indawo yemodeli","indawo yephepha","isakhiwo","amakhoordinethi","vula i-dwg"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ubone","text":"Okufanele ubone","level":2},{"id":"ukuhamba","text":"Ukuhamba","level":2},{"id":"amablokhi-wamandla","text":"Amablokhi wamandla","level":2},{"id":"akukadwetshwa","text":"Akukadwetshwa","level":2},{"id":"izinkinga-ezijwayelekile","text":"Izinkinga ezijwayelekile","level":2},{"id":"okulandelayo","text":"Okulandelayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula umdwebo we-CAD, ubone ngo-3D noma ngo-2D, uhambe kuwo, uguqule phakathi kwendawo yemodeli namashidi awo, bese ufunda amakhoordinethi. I-BimCraft ibonisa imidwebo ye-DWG ne-DXF; ayihleli noma ilondoloze. Ukuze ushintshe, chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlela ku-CadCraft\u003C/span\u003E: umdwebo uvulwa ohlelweni lokudweba lwe-CadCraft ethebhini elisha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha ifayela\u003C/span\u003E, noma wehlise umdwebo ekhasini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha ifayela \u003Ccode\u003E.dwg\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E.dxf\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELinda kuze umugqa wesimo uthi &quot;Ifunda umdwebo…&quot;. Imidwebo emikhulu ithatha imizuzwana. Bese uthi kuthathe isikhathi esingakanani ukufunda, &quot;Kuyarenda…&quot; uma kudwetshwa isithombe sokuqala, nokuthi kuthathe isikhathi esingakanani lokho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmdwebo uvula ngo-3D, indlela esheshayo yokubonisa umdwebo omkhulu (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/dwg-in-3d\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/dwg-in-3d\"\u003EBona umdwebo we-DWG noma we-DXF nge-3D\u003C/a\u003E). Chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImodeli\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uthole ukubuka okulinganayo kwe-2D. Ukuze imidwebo ivule njalo nge-2D, setha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBimCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EImidwebo ivulwa ku-\u003C/strong\u003E ibe \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImodeli (2D)\u003C/span\u003E. Umdwebo ongenalutho endaweni yemodeli, noma isiphequluli esingeke sibonise i-3D, uvula nge-2D.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBheka amathebhu aphezulu womdwebo: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImodeli\u003C/span\u003E kuqala, bese ithebhu eyodwa ngeshidi ngalinye, ngokulandelana komdwebo ngokwawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ithebhu leshidi ukuze ubone leshidi: iphepha, nemodeli ebonakala ngamawindi okubuka ayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImodeli\u003C/span\u003E ukuze ubuyele endaweni yemodeli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHambisa ipoyinta phezu komdwebo ufunde ama-X no-Y ekhoneni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ubone\"\u003EOkufanele ubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmdwebo, ulingana newindi. Imibala ilandela umdwebo; imigqa emhlophe (umbala 7) idwetshwa ngombala wombhalo wetimu, nemibala ekhanyayo iyagqokisiswa ethimini elikhanyayo ukuze ihlale ifundeka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIpaneli \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmdwebo\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesobunxele: ifayela, usayizi, ifomethi (isibonelo &quot;AutoCAD 2018 (AC1032)&quot;), izinyunithi, inani lezinto nezingqimba, inombolo yamashidi, nezidwebo ezixhunyiwe nezinsiza uma zikhona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUhlu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzingqimba\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesobunxele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgakwesokunene: indlela yokuhamba, imidwebo nezithombe ezixhunyiwe, no-\u003Cstrong\u003EAkukadwetshwa\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuhamba\"\u003EUkuhamba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:mouse\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMouse\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkuze\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYenza lokhu\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShelelisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHudula ngenkinobho yanoma iyiphi imouse\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESondeza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESkrola iwili; ipoyinta ephansi kwepoyinta ihlala ibekiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELwanela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza kabili, cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, noma chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELwanele\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac;input:mouse\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac, Mouse\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-trackpad, ukuskrola ngeminwe emibili \u003Cstrong\u003Ekusondeza\u003C/strong\u003E, akushelelisi. Ukucindezela nokuhlanganisa nakho kuyasondeza. Ukuze ushelelise, chofoza uhudule.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHudula ngeminwe eyodwa ukuze ushelelise. Ukusondeza ngokucindezela akukakwakhiwa kumidwebo: chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELwanele\u003C/span\u003E ukuze ubone ishidi lonke, bese usebenzisa imouse noma i-trackpad ukuze usondeze.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amablokhi-wamandla\"\u003EAmablokhi wamandla\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIbhlokhi lamandla lidwetshwa njengoba umdwebo uyibonisa: ibhlokhi ngalinye elibekiwe esimweni sokubonakala umdwebo owagcina ngaso (&quot;Plan&quot; noma &quot;Front&quot;, &quot;Single bowl&quot; noma &quot;Double bowl&quot;). Ngakwesokunene, \u003Cstrong\u003EAmablokhi wamandla\u003C/strong\u003E ibala zonke ezibekwe endaweni yemodeli: zingaki ezibekiwe, izimo ezibonisa, nezimo zonke ibhlokhi linazo. Ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E, chofoza ibhlokhi elibekiwe ukuze ubone \u003Cstrong\u003EIbhlokhi lamandla\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EIsimo esibonisiwe\u003C/strong\u003E nezinye izimo kuphaneli \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzici\u003C/span\u003E. I-BimCraft ayishintshi izimo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akukadwetshwa\"\u003EAkukadwetshwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEzinye izinhlobo zezinto azidwetshwa kule nguqulo. Zibalwa ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EAkukadwetshwa\u003C/strong\u003E ngakwesokunene (&quot;Lezi zingxenye zomdwebo zidlulwa okwamanje, azicatshangwa.&quot;), ukuze wazi ukuthi kukhona okushiyiwe. Imigqa, iphola-layini, umnsalo, indilinga, i-ellipse, i-spline, imigqa yokufiphaza nokugcwaliswa okuqinile, umbhalo nombhalo wemigqa eminingi, amablokhi anezici, izilinganiso, imigqa yokuholela nemigqa eminingi yokuholela, amatafula, izithombe namawindi okubuka kuyadwetshwa. Ama-3D faces, ama-polyface mesh ne-polygon mesh adwetshwa njengemiphetho yawo ebonakala ukusuka phezulu; shintsha ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uwabone njengezindwangu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-DXF eyinari ayivuli: i-BimCraft iyasho lokho. Yilondoloze futhi njenge-ASCII DXF, noma njenge-DWG, kusuka ohlelweni olwayenza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinkinga-ezijwayelekile\"\u003EIzinkinga ezijwayelekile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmdwebo ubukeka ungenalutho.\u003C/strong\u003E Ezinye izingqimba zingase zivaliwe noma zikhenyiwe emdwebeni ngokwawo; zifika zingakhethiwe ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzingqimba\u003C/span\u003E. Chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKonke kuvuliwe\u003C/span\u003E. Uma isimo sithi &quot;\u003Cem\u003Eigama\u003C/em\u003E ngumdwebo ongenalutho: awunayo imigqa, umbhalo noma amablokhi.&quot;, kayikho lutho kuwo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIshidi libonisa uhlaka olungenalutho.\u003C/strong\u003E Ishidi lingase lincike emidwebeni exhunyiwe. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/dwg-linked-files\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/dwg-linked-files\"\u003EThola imidwebo nezithombe ezixhunyiwe\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmbhalo ubukeka umehluka kancane.\u003C/strong\u003E I-BimCraft udweba umbhalo ngefonti elincane elingenazo izibambo, hhayi amafonti omdwebo, ngakho umbhalo ungase ube mkhulu noma mncane kancane kunasohlelweni olwawenza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;\u003Cem\u003Eigama\u003C/em\u003E alikwazanga ukufundwa. Lingase lonakale, noma lilondolozwe ngefomethi umfundi ongakasekeli.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Ibhulaketi ekugcineni liqamba ikhodi yefomethi yefayela. Yilondoloze ohlelweni olwayenza njenge-DWG endala noma njenge-DXF, bese uzama futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUlindele ukukala, ukudweba noma ukuhlela.\u003C/strong\u003E I-BimCraft ibukela imidwebo kuphela. Chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlela ku-CadCraft\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uvule ifayela elifanayo ohlelweni lokudweba lwe-CadCraft, olihlela futhi lilondoloze ikhophi njenge-DWG noma i-DXF. Ifayela lakho lokuqala alishintshwa, nemidwebo exhunyiwe ihlala ku-BimCraft. Inkinobho ikhombisa kuphela lapho i-CadCraft ivulekile kuwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulandelayo\"\u003EOkulandelayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/dwg-in-3d\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/dwg-in-3d\"\u003EBona umdwebo we-DWG noma we-DXF nge-3D\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/dwg-layers-sheets\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/dwg-layers-sheets\"\u003ESebenza ngezingqimba namashidi\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/print-view\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/print-view\"\u003EHlola umdwebo kumbukwano wokuphrinta\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Vula umdwebo we-CAD, ubone ngo-3D noma ngo-2D, uhambe kuwo, uguqule phakathi kwendawo yemodeli namashidi awo, bese ufunda amakhoordinethi. I-BimCraft ibonisa imidwebo ye-DWG ne-DXF; ayihleli noma ilondoloze. Ukuze ushintshe, chofoza Hlela ku-CadCraft: umdwebo uvulwa ohlelweni lokudweba lwe-CadCraft ethebhini elisha. Izinyathelo Chofoza Khetha ifayela, noma wehlise umdwebo ekhasini. Khetha ifayela .dwg noma .dxf. Linda kuze umugqa wesimo uthi \"Ifunda umdwebo…\". Imidwebo emikhulu ithatha imizuzwana. Bese uthi kuthathe isikhathi esingakanani ukufunda, \"Kuyarenda…\" uma kudwetshwa isithombe sokuqala, nokuthi kuthathe isikhathi esingakanani lokho. Umdwebo uvula ngo-3D, indlela esheshayo yokubonisa umdwebo omkhulu (bheka Bona umdwebo we-DWG noma we-DXF nge-3D). Chofoza Imodeli ukuze uthole ukubuka okulinganayo kwe-2D. Ukuze imidwebo ivule njalo nge-2D, setha Izilungiselelo › BimCraft › Imidwebo ivulwa ku- ibe Imodeli (2D). Umdwebo ongenalutho endaweni yemodeli, noma isiphequluli esingeke sibonise i-3D, uvula nge-2D. Bheka amathebhu aphezulu womdwebo: Imodeli kuqala, bese ithebhu eyodwa ngeshidi ngalinye, ngokulandelana komdwebo ngokwawo. Chofoza ithebhu leshidi ukuze ubone leshidi: iphepha, nemodeli ebonakala ngamawindi okubuka ayo. Chofoza Imodeli ukuze ubuyele endaweni yemodeli. Hambisa ipoyinta phezu komdwebo ufunde ama-X no-Y ekhoneni. Okufanele ubone Umdwebo, ulingana newindi. Imibala ilandela umdwebo; imigqa emhlophe (umbala 7) idwetshwa ngombala wombhalo wetimu, nemibala ekhanyayo iyagqokisiswa ethimini elikhanyayo ukuze ihlale ifundeka. Ipaneli Umdwebo ngakwesobunxele: ifayela, usayizi, ifomethi (isibonelo \"AutoCAD 2018 (AC1032)\"), izinyunithi, inani lezinto nezingqimba, inombolo yamashidi, nezidwebo ezixhunyiwe nezinsiza uma zikhona. Uhlu Izingqimba ngakwesobunxele. Ngakwesokunene: indlela yokuhamba, imidwebo nezithombe ezixhunyiwe, no-Akukadwetshwa. Ukuhamba Ukuze Yenza lokhu Shelelisa Hudula ngenkinobho yanoma iyiphi imouse Sondeza Skrola iwili; ipoyinta ephansi kwepoyinta ihlala ibekiwe Lwanela Chofoza kabili, cindezela F, noma chofoza Lwanele Ku-trackpad, ukuskrola ngeminwe emibili kusondeza, akushelelisi. Ukucindezela nokuhlanganisa nakho kuyasondeza. Ukuze ushelelise, chofoza uhudule. Hudula ngeminwe eyodwa ukuze ushelelise. Ukusondeza ngokucindezela akukakwakhiwa kumidwebo: chofoza Lwanele ukuze ubone ishidi lonke, bese usebenzisa imouse noma i-trackpad ukuze usondeze. Amablokhi wamandla Ibhlokhi lamandla lidwetshwa njengoba umdwebo uyibonisa: ibhlokhi ngalinye elibekiwe esimweni sokubonakala umdwebo owagcina ngaso (\"Plan\" noma \"Front\", \"Single bowl\" noma \"Double bowl\"). Ngakwesokunene, Amablokhi wamandla ibala zonke ezibekwe endaweni yemodeli: zingaki ezibekiwe, izimo ezibonisa, nezimo zonke ibhlokhi linazo. Ku-3D, chofoza ibhlokhi elibekiwe ukuze ubone Ibhlokhi lamandla, Isimo esibonisiwe nezinye izimo kuphaneli Izici. I-BimCraft ayishintshi izimo. Akukadwetshwa Ezinye izinhlobo zezinto azidwetshwa kule nguqulo. Zibalwa ngaphansi kwe-Akukadwetshwa ngakwesokunene (\"Lezi zingxenye zomdwebo zidlulwa okwamanje, azicatshangwa.\"), ukuze wazi ukuthi kukhona okushiyiwe. Imigqa, iphola-layini, umnsalo, indilinga, i-ellipse, i-spline, imigqa yokufiphaza nokugcwaliswa okuqinile, umbhalo nombhalo wemigqa eminingi, amablokhi anezici, izilinganiso, imigqa yokuholela nemigqa eminingi yokuholela, amatafula, izithombe namawindi okubuka kuyadwetshwa. Ama-3D faces, ama-polyface mesh ne-polygon mesh adwetshwa njengemiphetho yawo ebonakala ukusuka phezulu; shintsha ku-3D ukuze uwabone njengezindwangu. I-DXF eyinari ayivuli: i-BimCraft iyasho lokho. Yilondoloze futhi njenge-ASCII DXF, noma njenge-DWG, kusuka ohlelweni olwayenza. Izinkinga ezijwayelekile Umdwebo ubukeka ungenalutho. Ezinye izingqimba zingase zivaliwe noma zikhenyiwe emdwebeni ngokwawo; zifika zingakhethiwe ku-Izingqimba. Chofoza Konke kuvuliwe. Uma isimo sithi \"igama ngumdwebo ongenalutho: awunayo imigqa, umbhalo noma amablokhi.\", kayikho lutho kuwo. Ishidi libonisa uhlaka olungenalutho. Ishidi lingase lincike emidwebeni exhunyiwe. Bheka Thola imidwebo nezithombe ezixhunyiwe. Umbhalo ubukeka umehluka kancane. I-BimCraft udweba umbhalo ngefonti elincane elingenazo izibambo, hhayi amafonti omdwebo, ngakho umbhalo ungase ube mkhulu noma mncane kancane kunasohlelweni olwawenza. \"igama alikwazanga ukufundwa. Lingase lonakale, noma lilondolozwe ngefomethi umfundi ongakasekeli.\" Ibhulaketi ekugcineni liqamba ikhodi yefomethi yefayela. Yilondoloze ohlelweni olwayenza njenge-DWG endala noma njenge-DXF, bese uzama futhi. Ulindele ukukala, ukudweba noma ukuhlela. I-BimCraft ibukela imidwebo kuphela. Chofoza Hlela ku-CadCraft ukuze uvule ifayela elifanayo ohlelweni lokudweba lwe-CadCraft, olihlela futhi lilondoloze ikhophi njenge-DWG noma i-DXF. Ifayela lakho lokuqala alishintshwa, nemidwebo exhunyiwe ihlala ku-BimCraft. Inkinobho ikhombisa kuphela lapho i-CadCraft ivulekile kuwe. Okulandelayo Bona umdwebo we-DWG noma we-DXF nge-3D Sebenza ngezingqimba namashidi Hlola umdwebo kumbukwano wokuphrinta","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"dwg-in-3d","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Bona umdwebo we-DWG noma we-DXF nge-3D","summary":"Shintsha indawo yemodeli yomdwebo ibe ngu-3D ukuze ubone amaphakamo, ubukhulu, izinkombandlela ze-3D, ama-mesh nama-block, uzungeze, ucwebe into ukuze ubone izici zayo, futhi ubone lokho okungakadwetshwa.","section":"tasks","order":105,"keywords":["3d","dwg","dxf","umdwebo","indawo yemodeli","zungeza","isigaba","sika","ukuvala","khetha","izici","izinkulumo","isibambo","amaphakamo","ubukhulu","ukukhishwa","3dface","polyface","mesh","3d polyline","amablokhi","imibono","umbono","okuhambisanayo","okuphelele","acis","amasolid"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ubone","text":"Okufanele ubone","level":2},{"id":"yisike-ngendiza-yesigaba","text":"Yisike ngendiza yesigaba","level":2},{"id":"bona-izici-zento","text":"Bona izici zento","level":2},{"id":"ukuhamba","text":"Ukuhamba","level":2},{"id":"yini-edwetshwe-ku-3d","text":"Yini edwetshwe ku-3D","level":2},{"id":"kubukwa-kukhona-kuphela-kwi-2d","text":"Kubukwa kukhona kuphela kwi-2D","level":2},{"id":"akukadwetshwa","text":"Akukadwetshwa","level":2},{"id":"amaphutha-ajwayelekile","text":"Amaphutha ajwayelekile","level":2},{"id":"okulandelayo","text":"Okulandelayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBheka indawo yemodeli yomdwebo ngo-3D. Imigqa nama-polyline ahlala ngamaphakamo awo wangempela, izinto ezinobukhulu zimi njengezindonga, futhi ama-3D faces, ama-mesh nama-3D block abonakala njengezindawo ongazungeza kuzo. Amashidi asahlala ngo-2D.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula i-DWG noma i-DXF. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/view-dwg\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/view-dwg\"\u003EBona umdwebo we-DWG noma we-DXF\u003C/a\u003E. Ivulwa ngo-3D ngaphandle uma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBimCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EAmadwebo avula ku\u003C/strong\u003E isho \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel (2D)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKusukela ku-2D, chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E kwibha ephezu komdwebo, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELinda isikhashana okokuqala: umugqa wesimo uthi &quot;Kwakha umdwebo nge-3D…&quot;, bese ubonisa inani lemigqa nezindawo okubonisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EZungeza, hudula futhi usondeze (bona ithebula elingezansi).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza umbono kwibha yesibili: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIso\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETop\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBottom\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFront\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELeft\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERight\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPerspective\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uguqule phakathi komzimba nombono ohambisanayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExtents\u003C/span\u003E noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukubona umdwebo wonke futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E futhi, cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, noma chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel\u003C/span\u003E noma ithebhu yeshidi ukuze ubuyele ku-2D.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ubone\"\u003EOkufanele ubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIndawo yemodeli nge-3D, Z iphezulu, ngemibala yomdwebo ngokwawo. Izindawo zilula kancane kunemiphetho yazo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzingqimba ozivala ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayers\u003C/span\u003E ziyanyamalala nasebukweni be-3D.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgakwesokudla: inani lemigqa nezindawo, ubukhulu bomdwebo ngo-X, Y no-Z, \u003Cstrong\u003EKubukwa kukhona kuphela kwi-2D\u003C/strong\u003E no-\u003Cstrong\u003EAkukadwetshwa\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yisike-ngendiza-yesigaba\"\u003EYisike ngendiza yesigaba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESection\u003C/span\u003E kwibha ye-3D, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Ibha ngaphansi kwayo isebenza njengoba kwenzeka kumamodeli e-IFC (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/section-plane\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/section-plane\"\u003ESika imodeli ye-IFC ngendiza yesigaba\u003C/a\u003E): sika kusuka ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETop\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFront\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESide\u003C/span\u003E, hudula noma uthayipha i-offset — ngeyunithi yomdwebo ngokwawo lapha — futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFlip\u003C/span\u003E ukugcina olunye uhlangothi. Lokho indiza elisikayo alikwazi ukukhethwa. Ukubuyela ku-2D kususa ukusika.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bona-izici-zento\"\u003EBona izici zento\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza into ku-3D. Iyashintsha ibe yimibala yokukhetha futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E ikhombisa okutshiwo yifayela ngayo: uhlobo lwayo, ingqimba, umbala, uhlobo lomugqa nesibambo, bese idatha yayo, njengokuqala, ukuphela nobude komugqa, isikhungo nesiphambano sendilinga, amakhona e-3D face, noma igama leblokhi, iphoyinti lokufaka, isikali, ukujikeka nezinani zezici zeblokhi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIreferensi yeblokhi ikhethwa njengento eyodwa, nezibhokisi ezizikwe ngaphakathi kwayo nazo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuchofoza okuseduze kwemigqa embalwa ngamapikseli kukhetha umugqa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bese uchofoza ukuze ukhethe izinto eziningi, noma ukhiphe eyodwa; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E bese iyazibala ngohlobo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, noma ukuchofoza endaweni engenalutho, kususa ukukhetha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinto ezisezingqimbeni ozivalile azikwazi ukukhethwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuhamba\"\u003EUkuhamba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:mouse\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMouse\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkwenza\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYenza lokhu\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZungeza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHudula ngenkinobho ephakathi, noma ngenkinobho yokunxele\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHudula\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHudula ngenkinobho yesokudla, noma bamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bese uhudula\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESondeza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESkrola ivili; lisondeza kulokho okungaphansi kwesikhombi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBona konke\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExtents\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBheka ngohlangothi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza ubuso, umphetho noma ikhona lekhyubhu lokubuka ekhoneni elingaphansi kwesokudla\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIkhyubhu lokubuka lingashintshwa ngesithonjana se-axis, noma lifihlwe, ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/settings\"\u003EIzilungiselelo ze-BimCraft\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac;input:mouse\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac, Mouse\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-trackpad, swayiphela ngeminwe emibili ukuze uzungeze, bamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uswayiphe ukuze uhudule, futhi ukhuphule ukusondeza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHudula ngomunwe owodwa ukuze uzungeze. Cindezela ngeminwe emibili ukuze usondeze, bese uyihambisa ndawonye ukuze uhudule.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yini-edwetshwe-ku-3d\"\u003EYini edwetshwe ku-3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEmdwebweni\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKu-3D\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImigqa, ama-polyline ka-3D\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENgamaphakamo awo wangempela\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAma-polyline, imijikelezo, amajika, ama-ellipse\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEndizeni yawo, ngokuphakama kwawo, ngokuthambeka uma umdwebo uthambekisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbukhulu emigqeni, kumapolyline, emijikelezweni nasemajikeni\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzindonga zalobo bude; imijikelezo ivaliwe phezulu nasezansi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAma-3D faces, ama-polyface mesh, ama-polygon mesh\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzindawo ezinemthunzi nemiphetho yazo ebonakalayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmablokhi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAbekwe, ajikelwe futhi akhulisiwe nge-3D, namablokhi asehlelwe ngaphakathi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAma-hatch\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImiphetho yawo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImigqa elula ye-2D\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbhalwe, lapho yadwetshwa khona\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kubukwa-kukhona-kuphela-kwi-2d\"\u003EKubukwa kukhona kuphela kwi-2D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmbhalo, umbhalo wemigqa eminingi nezici ezibonakalayo zamablokhi zidwetshwa nge-3D, endizeni yazo, ngamaphakamo azo, futhi ukuchofoza kuzo kuzikhethe. Imigqa ebanzi ye-polyline ibonisa ububanzi bayo njengebhande elilingene. Ama-multileader, izithombe nemifanekiso yama-hatch ibalwa ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EKubukwa kukhona kuphela kwi-2D\u003C/strong\u003E: zibheke ethebhu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel\u003C/span\u003E noma emashidini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akukadwetshwa\"\u003EAkukadwetshwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzindawo nezindawo ezigcinwe njengemizimba ye-ACIS (ama-3D solids, imizimba, izifunda nezindawo) nama-subdivision mesh zidweshwa ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EAkukadwetshwa\u003C/strong\u003E nenani lazo. Ziyadlulwa, azinakucatshangwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amaphutha-ajwayelekile\"\u003EAmaphutha ajwayelekile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKonke kubonakala kulinganile.\u003C/strong\u003E Umdwebo ungowe-2D: imigqa yawo ayinamaphakamo. Chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFront\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uhlole; umdwebo olinganile ubonakala njengomugqa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImodeli eqinile ayibonisi lutho.\u003C/strong\u003E Izinto ezenziwe ngomhlobisi weqoqo ziyizimbiza ze-ACIS, zidweshwa ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EAkukadwetshwa\u003C/strong\u003E. Hambisa imodeli njenge-IFC noma njengama-3D faces esikhundleni salokhu kusuka kuhlelo olwayenza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmdwebo uyiqoqo elincane ngaphakathi.\u003C/strong\u003E Into ekude emoduleni, njengekhophi endala yepulani, yenza okuphelele kube kukhulu. Sondeza ngeskrola lapho ofuna ukubheka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulandelayo\"\u003EOkulandelayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/dwg-layers-sheets\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/dwg-layers-sheets\"\u003ESebenza ngezingqimba namashidi\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/section-plane\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/section-plane\"\u003ESika imodeli ye-IFC ngendiza yesigaba\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Bheka indawo yemodeli yomdwebo ngo-3D. Imigqa nama-polyline ahlala ngamaphakamo awo wangempela, izinto ezinobukhulu zimi njengezindonga, futhi ama-3D faces, ama-mesh nama-3D block abonakala njengezindawo ongazungeza kuzo. Amashidi asahlala ngo-2D. Izinyathelo Vula i-DWG noma i-DXF. Bona Bona umdwebo we-DWG noma we-DXF. Ivulwa ngo-3D ngaphandle uma Settings › BimCraft › Amadwebo avula ku isho Model (2D). Kusukela ku-2D, chofoza 3D kwibha ephezu komdwebo, noma cindezela 3. Linda isikhashana okokuqala: umugqa wesimo uthi \"Kwakha umdwebo nge-3D…\", bese ubonisa inani lemigqa nezindawo okubonisa. Zungeza, hudula futhi usondeze (bona ithebula elingezansi). Chofoza umbono kwibha yesibili: Iso, Top, Bottom, Front, Back, Left noma Right. Chofoza Perspective ukuze uguqule phakathi komzimba nombono ohambisanayo. Chofoza Extents noma cindezela F ukubona umdwebo wonke futhi. Chofoza 3D futhi, cindezela 3, noma chofoza Model noma ithebhu yeshidi ukuze ubuyele ku-2D. Okufanele ubone Indawo yemodeli nge-3D, Z iphezulu, ngemibala yomdwebo ngokwawo. Izindawo zilula kancane kunemiphetho yazo. Izingqimba ozivala ku-Layers ziyanyamalala nasebukweni be-3D. Ngakwesokudla: inani lemigqa nezindawo, ubukhulu bomdwebo ngo-X, Y no-Z, Kubukwa kukhona kuphela kwi-2D no-Akukadwetshwa. Yisike ngendiza yesigaba Chofoza Section kwibha ye-3D, noma cindezela X. Ibha ngaphansi kwayo isebenza njengoba kwenzeka kumamodeli e-IFC (bona Sika imodeli ye-IFC ngendiza yesigaba): sika kusuka ku-Top, Front noma Side, hudula noma uthayipha i-offset — ngeyunithi yomdwebo ngokwawo lapha — futhi Flip ukugcina olunye uhlangothi. Lokho indiza elisikayo alikwazi ukukhethwa. Ukubuyela ku-2D kususa ukusika. Bona izici zento Chofoza into ku-3D. Iyashintsha ibe yimibala yokukhetha futhi Properties ikhombisa okutshiwo yifayela ngayo: uhlobo lwayo, ingqimba, umbala, uhlobo lomugqa nesibambo, bese idatha yayo, njengokuqala, ukuphela nobude komugqa, isikhungo nesiphambano sendilinga, amakhona e-3D face, noma igama leblokhi, iphoyinti lokufaka, isikali, ukujikeka nezinani zezici zeblokhi. Ireferensi yeblokhi ikhethwa njengento eyodwa, nezibhokisi ezizikwe ngaphakathi kwayo nazo. Ukuchofoza okuseduze kwemigqa embalwa ngamapikseli kukhetha umugqa. Bamba Ctrl bese uchofoza ukuze ukhethe izinto eziningi, noma ukhiphe eyodwa; Properties bese iyazibala ngohlobo. Esc, noma ukuchofoza endaweni engenalutho, kususa ukukhetha. Izinto ezisezingqimbeni ozivalile azikwazi ukukhethwa. Ukuhamba Ukwenza Yenza lokhu Zungeza Hudula ngenkinobho ephakathi, noma ngenkinobho yokunxele Hudula Hudula ngenkinobho yesokudla, noma bamba Shift bese uhudula Sondeza Skrola ivili; lisondeza kulokho okungaphansi kwesikhombi Bona konke Extents noma F Bheka ngohlangothi Chofoza ubuso, umphetho noma ikhona lekhyubhu lokubuka ekhoneni elingaphansi kwesokudla Ikhyubhu lokubuka lingashintshwa ngesithonjana se-axis, noma lifihlwe, ku-Settings. Bona Izilungiselelo ze-BimCraft. Ku-trackpad, swayiphela ngeminwe emibili ukuze uzungeze, bamba Shift uswayiphe ukuze uhudule, futhi ukhuphule ukusondeza. Hudula ngomunwe owodwa ukuze uzungeze. Cindezela ngeminwe emibili ukuze usondeze, bese uyihambisa ndawonye ukuze uhudule. Yini edwetshwe ku-3D Emdwebweni Ku-3D Imigqa, ama-polyline ka-3D Ngamaphakamo awo wangempela Ama-polyline, imijikelezo, amajika, ama-ellipse Endizeni yawo, ngokuphakama kwawo, ngokuthambeka uma umdwebo uthambekisa Ubukhulu emigqeni, kumapolyline, emijikelezweni nasemajikeni Izindonga zalobo bude; imijikelezo ivaliwe phezulu nasezansi Ama-3D faces, ama-polyface mesh, ama-polygon mesh Izindawo ezinemthunzi nemiphetho yazo ebonakalayo Amablokhi Abekwe, ajikelwe futhi akhulisiwe nge-3D, namablokhi asehlelwe ngaphakathi Ama-hatch Imiphetho yawo Imigqa elula ye-2D Ibhalwe, lapho yadwetshwa khona Kubukwa kukhona kuphela kwi-2D Umbhalo, umbhalo wemigqa eminingi nezici ezibonakalayo zamablokhi zidwetshwa nge-3D, endizeni yazo, ngamaphakamo azo, futhi ukuchofoza kuzo kuzikhethe. Imigqa ebanzi ye-polyline ibonisa ububanzi bayo njengebhande elilingene. Ama-multileader, izithombe nemifanekiso yama-hatch ibalwa ngaphansi kwe-Kubukwa kukhona kuphela kwi-2D: zibheke ethebhu ye-Model noma emashidini. Akukadwetshwa Izindawo nezindawo ezigcinwe njengemizimba ye-ACIS (ama-3D solids, imizimba, izifunda nezindawo) nama-subdivision mesh zidweshwa ngaphansi kwe-Akukadwetshwa nenani lazo. Ziyadlulwa, azinakucatshangwa. Amaphutha ajwayelekile Konke kubonakala kulinganile. Umdwebo ungowe-2D: imigqa yawo ayinamaphakamo. Chofoza Front ukuze uhlole; umdwebo olinganile ubonakala njengomugqa. Imodeli eqinile ayibonisi lutho. Izinto ezenziwe ngomhlobisi weqoqo ziyizimbiza ze-ACIS, zidweshwa ngaphansi kwe-Akukadwetshwa. Hambisa imodeli njenge-IFC noma njengama-3D faces esikhundleni salokhu kusuka kuhlelo olwayenza. Umdwebo uyiqoqo elincane ngaphakathi. Into ekude emoduleni, njengekhophi endala yepulani, yenza okuphelele kube kukhulu. Sondeza ngeskrola lapho ofuna ukubheka. Okulandelayo Sebenza ngezingqimba namashidi Sika imodeli ye-IFC ngendiza yesigaba","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"dwg-layers-sheets","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Sebenza ngezingqimba namashidi","summary":"Vula nivale izingqimba zomdwebo, shintsha phakathi kwendawo yemodeli namashidi, futhi uqonde ukuthi amashidi akhombisa kanjani imodeli ngamabhodwe awo.","section":"tasks","order":110,"keywords":["izingqimba","ukuvula nokuvala ingqimba","qandisa","ncibilikisa","amashidi","ilayawuti","isikhala sephepha","amathebhu","amabhodwe","umphathi wezingqimba","izingqimba","la"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo-izingqimba","text":"Izinyathelo: izingqimba","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ubone","text":"Okufanele ubone","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo-amashidi","text":"Izinyathelo: amashidi","level":2},{"id":"amashidi-asebenza-kanjani-lapha","text":"Amashidi asebenza kanjani lapha","level":2},{"id":"amaphutha-ajwayelekile","text":"Amaphutha ajwayelekile","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHlanza ukubuka komdwebo onenkathazo ngokuvala izingqimba, bese ubheka amashidi omdwebo owodwa owodwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo-izingqimba\"\u003EIzinyathelo: izingqimba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula umdwebo we-DWG noma we-DXF.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThola uhlu lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayers\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesokunxele. Ingqimba ngayinye inebhokisi lokukhetha, isampula yombala negama layo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESusa ukukhetha ingqimba ukuze ufihle konke okusesingqimbeni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAll off\u003C/span\u003E ukufihla zonke izingqimba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha izingqimba ozifuna kuphela ukuze zibonakale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAll on\u003C/span\u003E ukuze ubonise konke futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ubone\"\u003EOkufanele ubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzingqimba ziyanyamalala futhi ziphinde zivele ngesikhathi esisodwa, ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel\u003C/span\u003E nakunoma iliphi ishidi. Izingqimba ezivaliwe noma eziqandisiwe emdwebeni ngokwawo ziqala zingakhethiwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo-amashidi\"\u003EIzinyathelo: amashidi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBheka umugqa wamathebhu aphezu komdwebo: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel\u003C/span\u003E, bese ishidi ngalinye ngegama lalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ithebhu yeshidi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBheka leshidi: iphepha lihlala etafuleni elimnyama, futhi ibhodwe ngalinye libonisa ingxenye yalo yemodeli ngesikali nangesimo salo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESondeza ibhodwe ukuze ufunde imininingwane. Usondeza ishidi, hhayi ibhodwe, ngakho lonke ishidi lihamba ndawonye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit\u003C/span\u003E noma uchofoze kabili ukuze ubone leshidi lonke futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amashidi-asebenza-kanjani-lapha\"\u003EAmashidi asebenza kanjani lapha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIshidi (ilayawuti, noma isikhala sephepha) libamba ibhulokhi yesihloko namabhodwe abuka emodelini. I-BimCraft idweba ngayinye ibhodwe ihlanjululwe emaphethelweni alo, ngesikali nangokujikeka kwalo, futhi ifihle izingqimba eziqandisiwe kulowo bhodwe. Ibhodwe lokuqala leshidi ngalinye yileshidi ngokwalo futhi aliphindwa kabili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amaphutha-ajwayelekile\"\u003EAmaphutha ajwayelekile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkulindele ukuthi izinguquko zezingqimba zigcinwe.\u003C/strong\u003E Izilungiselelo zezingqimba zithinta ukubuka kuphela, uze uvule enye ifayela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkulindele ukulawula izingqimba ngebhodwe ngalinye.\u003C/strong\u003E Uhlu lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayers\u003C/span\u003E lushintsha ingqimba yonke indawo. Izingqimba eziqandisiwe ebhodweni elilodwa ngomdwebo ziyahlala ziqandisiwe khona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkufuna ukusesha ingqimba noma izimo zezingqimba.\u003C/strong\u003E Akukakwakhiwa. Uhlu lulandela uhlelo lomdwebo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkulindele ukusebenza ngaphakathi kwebhodwe.\u003C/strong\u003E Ayikho into yokusebenza: i-BimCraft ibonisa ishidi kuphela. Sebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel\u003C/span\u003E ukubheka indawo yemodeli ngqo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Hlanza ukubuka komdwebo onenkathazo ngokuvala izingqimba, bese ubheka amashidi omdwebo owodwa owodwa. Izinyathelo: izingqimba Vula umdwebo we-DWG noma we-DXF. Thola uhlu lwe-Layers ngakwesokunxele. Ingqimba ngayinye inebhokisi lokukhetha, isampula yombala negama layo. Susa ukukhetha ingqimba ukuze ufihle konke okusesingqimbeni. Chofoza All off ukufihla zonke izingqimba. Khetha izingqimba ozifuna kuphela ukuze zibonakale. Chofoza All on ukuze ubonise konke futhi. Okufanele ubone Izingqimba ziyanyamalala futhi ziphinde zivele ngesikhathi esisodwa, ku-Model nakunoma iliphi ishidi. Izingqimba ezivaliwe noma eziqandisiwe emdwebeni ngokwawo ziqala zingakhethiwe. Izinyathelo: amashidi Bheka umugqa wamathebhu aphezu komdwebo: Model, bese ishidi ngalinye ngegama lalo. Chofoza ithebhu yeshidi. Bheka leshidi: iphepha lihlala etafuleni elimnyama, futhi ibhodwe ngalinye libonisa ingxenye yalo yemodeli ngesikali nangesimo salo. Sondeza ibhodwe ukuze ufunde imininingwane. Usondeza ishidi, hhayi ibhodwe, ngakho lonke ishidi lihamba ndawonye. Chofoza Fit noma uchofoze kabili ukuze ubone leshidi lonke futhi. Amashidi asebenza kanjani lapha Ishidi (ilayawuti, noma isikhala sephepha) libamba ibhulokhi yesihloko namabhodwe abuka emodelini. I-BimCraft idweba ngayinye ibhodwe ihlanjululwe emaphethelweni alo, ngesikali nangokujikeka kwalo, futhi ifihle izingqimba eziqandisiwe kulowo bhodwe. Ibhodwe lokuqala leshidi ngalinye yileshidi ngokwalo futhi aliphindwa kabili. Amaphutha ajwayelekile Ukulindele ukuthi izinguquko zezingqimba zigcinwe. Izilungiselelo zezingqimba zithinta ukubuka kuphela, uze uvule enye ifayela. Ukulindele ukulawula izingqimba ngebhodwe ngalinye. Uhlu lwe-Layers lushintsha ingqimba yonke indawo. Izingqimba eziqandisiwe ebhodweni elilodwa ngomdwebo ziyahlala ziqandisiwe khona. Ukufuna ukusesha ingqimba noma izimo zezingqimba. Akukakwakhiwa. Uhlu lulandela uhlelo lomdwebo. Ukulindele ukusebenza ngaphakathi kwebhodwe. Ayikho into yokusebenza: i-BimCraft ibonisa ishidi kuphela. Sebenzisa Model ukubheka indawo yemodeli ngqo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"documents-walkthrough","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Amadokhumenti nezinguqulo (i-vault)","summary":"Uhambo oluhlanganisiwe lwalo msebenzi wangempela: beka ifolda yephrojekthi yamamodeli e-IFC ngaphansi kolawulo, phuma imodeli, uyishintshe, ngenisa ngenothi, uthumele ukuze ibukwe, vume futhi ukhiphe, bone umlando nokuthi isetshenziswa kanjani, nokuthi umuntu wesibili ubona ini uma ulibambe ifayela, nokuthi lisebenza kanjani nezikhwama zefu.","section":"tasks","order":119,"keywords":["vault","amadokhumenti","uhambo","isifundo","phuma","ngenisa","inguqulo","khipha","vuma","khiya","umlando","lapho kusetshenziswa","ifc","imodeli","ifolda yefu","ifolda yephrojekthi","abantu ababili","ifolda eyabelwanwa"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"1-setha-ifolda-yephrojekthi","text":"1. Setha ifolda yephrojekthi","level":2},{"id":"2-beka-ifayela-ngaphansi-kolawulo","text":"2. Beka ifayela ngaphansi kolawulo","level":2},{"id":"3-phuma-shintsha-ngenisa","text":"3. Phuma, shintsha, ngenisa","level":2},{"id":"4-ukubuyekeza-nokukhipha","text":"4. Ukubuyekeza nokukhipha","level":2},{"id":"5-inguqulo-entsha","text":"5. Inguqulo entsha","level":2},{"id":"6-bona-okwenzeke","text":"6. Bona okwenzeke","level":2},{"id":"amamodeli-akhomba-kwamanye-amadokhumenti","text":"Amamodeli akhomba kwamanye amadokhumenti","level":2},{"id":"7-okubonwa-ngu-ben-lapho-ubamba-ifayela","text":"7. Okubonwa ngu-Ben lapho ubamba ifayela","level":2},{"id":"8-amafolda-efu","text":"8. Amafolda efu","level":2},{"id":"zama","text":"Zama","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUyi-Ana, usebenza ku-Riverside Clinic nomunye umuntu, u-Ben. Amamodeli e-IFC ephrojekthi ahlala kwifolda eyodwa enifinyelela kuyo nobabili (idrayivu eyabelwanwa, ifolda ehlanganisiwe, noma ifolda yefu). Ekugcineni, ifayela lidlule kusukela ekukopisheni kwalo kokuqala liya ekukhishweni okuvunyiwe njenge-\u003Cstrong\u003EA\u003C/strong\u003E, lase lishintshwa njenge-\u003Cstrong\u003EB.1\u003C/strong\u003E; uyibonile ukuthi ubani wenzani, futhi ubone ukuthi u-Ben ubona ini uma ubambe ifayela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKonke kugcinwa kufolda ecashile ethi \u003Ccode\u003E.ccvault\u003C/code\u003E eceleni kwamafayela akho: akukho iseva, akukho okulayishwa (ifolda yefu iyisiphambeko, bona isinyathelo sokugcina). Ukuze uthole zonke izinkinobho nemithetho endaweni eyodwa, bheka isihloko esithi \u003Cem\u003EAmadokhumenti: phuma, izinguqulo nokukhishwa\u003C/em\u003E lapho i-app yakho inaso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"1-setha-ifolda-yephrojekthi\"\u003E1. Setha ifolda yephrojekthi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImibhalo\u003C/span\u003E eduze kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula ifolda\u003C/span\u003E esikrinini sokuqala, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImibhalo…\u003C/span\u003E kumenyu ye-\u003Cstrong\u003EFile\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha ifolda yephrojekthi\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha ifolda equkethe amamodeli e-IFC ephrojekthi. (Amafolda ephrojekthi asebenza ku-Studio nasezisekhweni zesiphequluli ezivula ifolda, njengeChrome ne-Edge. Kwezinye izisekhwezi ibhodi iyakutshela.)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUshintsho\u003C/span\u003E eduze kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EWena:\u003C/strong\u003E bese uthayipha igama lakho, \u003Ccode\u003EAna\u003C/code\u003E (uma kubuza, negama lalelikhompyutha). Ibhodi manje ithi \u003Cem\u003EWena: Ana ku\u003C/em\u003E nekhompyutha yakho. Igama lakho lihamba nakho konke okwenzayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQala isitoreji kule folda\u003C/span\u003E bese uthayipha igama leprojekthi, \u003Ccode\u003ERiverside clinic\u003C/code\u003E. Ibhodi ithi \u003Cem\u003EI-vault iqalile i-Riverside clinic.\u003C/em\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"2-beka-ifayela-ngaphansi-kolawulo\"\u003E2. Beka ifayela ngaphansi kolawulo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cstrong\u003EAmafayela angekho ku-vault\u003C/strong\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza\u003C/span\u003E eduze kwe-\u003Ccode\u003Emodels/House.ifc\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELivela ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EAmafayela ku-vault\u003C/strong\u003E ngenguqulo \u003Cstrong\u003EA.1\u003C/strong\u003E, isimo \u003Cstrong\u003EIyaqhubeka\u003C/strong\u003E. I-A.1 iyikhophi lokuqala; i-vault igcina ikhophi yenguqulo ngayinye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"3-phuma-shintsha-ngenisa\"\u003E3. Phuma, shintsha, ngenisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula\u003C/span\u003E eduze kwe-\u003Ccode\u003Emodels/House.ifc\u003C/code\u003E. Imodeli ivulwa ku-BimCraft futhi ibhodi iyavaleka ukuze uyibone. Vula ibhodi futhi kusuka ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImibhalo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula ibhodi futhi bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhuma\u003C/span\u003E. Umugqa manje uthi \u003Cstrong\u003EIphume kuwe\u003C/strong\u003E. Ifayela lokukhiya lenziwe ku-\u003Ccode\u003E.ccvault/locks\u003C/code\u003E; akekho ongaphuma kulelifayela aze unengenise.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShintsha imodeli: hambisa udonga, engeza umnyango. Ukugcina kuyenqatshwa uma imodeli ingaphumile kuwe, futhi kukutshela ngani; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGcina njenge\u003C/span\u003E isasebenza njalo ngekhophi yakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula ibhodi, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgenisa\u003C/span\u003E bese uthayipha okushintshile (umzekelo \u003Ccode\u003EHambise umnyango\u003C/code\u003E). Ibhodi ithi \u003Cem\u003Eingeniswe njenge-A.2\u003C/em\u003E. Ifayela kwifolda yephrojekthi manje ngumodeli owawuvulekile, nokukhiya kuyanyamalala. Ukungenisa ngaphandle koshintsho kugcina inguqulo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma ushintsha umqondo wakho, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlehlisa ukuphuma\u003C/span\u003E ibuyisela ifayela ngaphandle kwenguqulo entsha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"4-ukubuyekeza-nokukhipha\"\u003E4. Ukubuyekeza nokukhipha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela ukuze ibukwe\u003C/span\u003E. Isimo sishintsha sibe \u003Cstrong\u003EUkuze ibukwe\u003C/strong\u003E nefayela lifundeka kuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphambi kokuvuma, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo zephrojekthi\u003C/span\u003E bese uhlu lwalabo abangavuma (igama elilodwa ngomugqa ngamunye), umzekelo \u003Ccode\u003EBen\u003C/code\u003E no-\u003Ccode\u003ECarla\u003C/code\u003E, bese ukhomba umthetho wokuthi ovumayo kumele abe omunye kunomlobi. Khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza izilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E. Manje i-vault ngokwayo yenqaba omunye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EU-Ben (noma u-Carla) ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVuma\u003C/span\u003E bese uthayipha igama lomvumayo. Isimo sishintsha sibe \u003Cstrong\u003EIkhishiwe\u003C/strong\u003E nenguqulo ibe \u003Cstrong\u003EA\u003C/strong\u003E, nokuthi \u003Cem\u003Eivunywe ngu-\u003C/em\u003E negama. Ifayela elikhishiwe lifundeka kuphela. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuyisela\u003C/span\u003E bekuyibuyisela ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EIyaqhubeka\u003C/strong\u003E, nesizathu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIgama lomvumayo liwugama olibhalwe ebhodini; liyirekhodi lokuthi ubani usayine, hhayi ubufakazi bokuthi ungubani.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"5-inguqulo-entsha\"\u003E5. Inguqulo entsha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEfayeleni elikhishiwe, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInguqulo entsha\u003C/span\u003E. Uyibamba ngohlamvu olulandelayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYishintshe, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgenisa\u003C/span\u003E. Inguqulo ibe \u003Cstrong\u003EB.1\u003C/strong\u003E, iyaqhubeka. Yikhiphe ngendlela efanayo futhi iba \u003Cstrong\u003EB\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlehlisa ukuphuma\u003C/span\u003E ngaphambi kokungenisa kokuqala kushiya ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EA\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmagama enguqulo alandelana A, B … Z, AA, AB. Uma inqubomgomo yakho ishiya amanye amagama, isethingi yephrojekthi \u003Cem\u003EUse the ASME Y14.35 sequence\u003C/em\u003E iyakhipha I, O, Q, S, X no-Z ezinguqulweni ezilandelayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"6-bona-okwenzeke\"\u003E6. Bona okwenzeke\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha igama lefayela ukuze uvule imininingwane yalo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmlando\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E: yonke imicimbi, eyakamuva kuqala, nokuthi ubani, iyiphi ikhompyutha nesikhathi: \u003Cem\u003EIngeniswe A.2\u003C/em\u003E ngu-Ana, \u003Cem\u003EIkhishiwe\u003C/em\u003E ngu-Ben, njalo njalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinguqulo\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E: ithebula lezinguqulo: zonke izinguqulo ezigciniwe, nosuku lwazo, ubani wazingenisa, inothi, nokuthi ubani wazivuma. I-vault igcina ikhophi yazo ngayinye ku-\u003Ccode\u003E.ccvault/revs\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKusetshenziswa\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E: amadokhumenti imodeli ye-IFC ekhomba kuwo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKusetshenziswa yi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E: ibala yonke imodeli ku-vault ekhomba kulelifayela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amamodeli-akhomba-kwamanye-amadokhumenti\"\u003EAmamodeli akhomba kwamanye amadokhumenti\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImodeli ye-IFC ekhomba kwamanye amadokhumenti esifolda (imidwebo, amahlu) iwabonisa ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EKusetshenziswa\u003C/strong\u003E, futhi ngayinye yawo ibonisa imodeli ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EKusetshenziswa yi\u003C/strong\u003E. Ungenisa idokhumenti ubone ukuthi yiliphi amamodeli elibhekisela kulo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"7-okubonwa-ngu-ben-lapho-ubamba-ifayela\"\u003E7. Okubonwa ngu-Ben lapho ubamba ifayela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EManje phuma ifayela futhi, bese ucela u-Ben ukuthi avule ifolda yephrojekthi efanayo ekhompyutheni yakhe bese evula ibhodi. Esihlanganweni salelifayela ubona \u003Cstrong\u003EIphume nguAna ku\u003C/strong\u003E ikhompyutha yakho \u003Cstrong\u003Ekusukela\u003C/strong\u003E isikhathi, futhi akekho inkinobho ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhuma\u003C/span\u003E. Uma ezama noma kanjalo i-vault iyanqaba: ukukhiya kuyifayela esistimu engeke iyenze kabili, ngakho abantu ababili abakwazi ukubamba ifayela ngasikhathi sinye, ngisho nangomzuzwana owodwa, uma ifolda ikudiski ku-Studio. (Kusiphequluli ifolda ivumela okungenani okungakwazi, futhi ibhodi iyakutshela ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EIfolda\u003C/strong\u003E.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma u-Ana engekho futhi u-Ben edinga ifayela, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhula ukuphuma\u003C/span\u003E liyilikhulula. Kumele athayiphe isizathu; sifakwa kulogi nokuthi ukuphuma kwakubani. Uma iphrojekthi ibala abaphathi, bona kuphela abangakwenza lokho. Ukuphuma okudlule umkhawulo wokuphelelwa isikhathi (izinsuku ezingu-14 ngokuzenzakalelayo) kuphawulwa njengesikhathi eside. Ngemva kokuphula, ukungenisa kuka-Ana okuphuzile kuyenqatshwa, ngakho nina nobabili anikwazi ukubhalelana phezu kwezinto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"8-amafolda-efu\"\u003E8. Amafolda efu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIfolda yefu iyifolda yephrojekthi egcinwa esitoreji sefu lethimu yakho, ngakho ithimba alidingi idrayivu eyabelwanwa. Ku-Studio, ngemva kokungena ku-akhawunti yakho ye-CadCraft, ibhodi ibonisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula ifolda yefu\u003C/span\u003E eduze kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha ifolda yephrojekthi\u003C/span\u003E. Yikhethe bese ukhetha ifolda, ebhalwe njenge-workspace / folder. Umnikazi wesikhala somsebenzi wenza ifolda kuqala, futhi isitoreji sefu sethimu kumele sisebenze. Konke okungenhla kusebenza ngendlela efanayo; iseva yenza ukukhiya, okuqinile phakathi kwabantu. Uma ungangenanga ibhodi iyakutshela ukuthi ungene ngemvume. Kuthebhu evamile yesiphequluli inkinobho yefu ayitholakali; sebenzisa i-Studio.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"zama\"\u003EZama\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYenza izinyathelo eziyisishiyagalolunye ezingenhla ngekhophi yefayela langempela. Izinyathelo zabantu ababili zidinga omunye umuntu, noma amawindi amabili namagama amabili. Uma uzama ngefolda eyabelwanwa langempela, ikhasi lokuhlola komphakathi libhala lokhu ngqo futhi lamukela imiphumela.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Uyi-Ana, usebenza ku-Riverside Clinic nomunye umuntu, u-Ben. Amamodeli e-IFC ephrojekthi ahlala kwifolda eyodwa enifinyelela kuyo nobabili (idrayivu eyabelwanwa, ifolda ehlanganisiwe, noma ifolda yefu). Ekugcineni, ifayela lidlule kusukela ekukopisheni kwalo kokuqala liya ekukhishweni okuvunyiwe njenge-A, lase lishintshwa njenge-B.1; uyibonile ukuthi ubani wenzani, futhi ubone ukuthi u-Ben ubona ini uma ubambe ifayela. Konke kugcinwa kufolda ecashile ethi .ccvault eceleni kwamafayela akho: akukho iseva, akukho okulayishwa (ifolda yefu iyisiphambeko, bona isinyathelo sokugcina). Ukuze uthole zonke izinkinobho nemithetho endaweni eyodwa, bheka isihloko esithi Amadokhumenti: phuma, izinguqulo nokukhishwa lapho i-app yakho inaso. 1. Setha ifolda yephrojekthi Khetha Imibhalo eduze kwe-Vula ifolda esikrinini sokuqala, noma Imibhalo… kumenyu ye-File. Khetha Khetha ifolda yephrojekthi bese ukhetha ifolda equkethe amamodeli e-IFC ephrojekthi. (Amafolda ephrojekthi asebenza ku-Studio nasezisekhweni zesiphequluli ezivula ifolda, njengeChrome ne-Edge. Kwezinye izisekhwezi ibhodi iyakutshela.) Khetha Ushintsho eduze kwe-Wena: bese uthayipha igama lakho, Ana (uma kubuza, negama lalelikhompyutha). Ibhodi manje ithi Wena: Ana ku nekhompyutha yakho. Igama lakho lihamba nakho konke okwenzayo. Khetha Qala isitoreji kule folda bese uthayipha igama leprojekthi, Riverside clinic. Ibhodi ithi I-vault iqalile i-Riverside clinic. 2. Beka ifayela ngaphansi kolawulo Vula Amafayela angekho ku-vault bese ukhetha Engeza eduze kwe-models/House.ifc. Livela ngaphansi kwe-Amafayela ku-vault ngenguqulo A.1, isimo Iyaqhubeka. I-A.1 iyikhophi lokuqala; i-vault igcina ikhophi yenguqulo ngayinye. 3. Phuma, shintsha, ngenisa Khetha Vula eduze kwe-models/House.ifc. Imodeli ivulwa ku-BimCraft futhi ibhodi iyavaleka ukuze uyibone. Vula ibhodi futhi kusuka ku-Imibhalo. Vula ibhodi futhi bese ukhetha Phuma. Umugqa manje uthi Iphume kuwe. Ifayela lokukhiya lenziwe ku-.ccvault/locks; akekho ongaphuma kulelifayela aze unengenise. Shintsha imodeli: hambisa udonga, engeza umnyango. Ukugcina kuyenqatshwa uma imodeli ingaphumile kuwe, futhi kukutshela ngani; Gcina njenge isasebenza njalo ngekhophi yakho. Vula ibhodi, khetha Ngenisa bese uthayipha okushintshile (umzekelo Hambise umnyango). Ibhodi ithi ingeniswe njenge-A.2. Ifayela kwifolda yephrojekthi manje ngumodeli owawuvulekile, nokukhiya kuyanyamalala. Ukungenisa ngaphandle koshintsho kugcina inguqulo. Uma ushintsha umqondo wakho, Hlehlisa ukuphuma ibuyisela ifayela ngaphandle kwenguqulo entsha. 4. Ukubuyekeza nokukhipha Khetha Thumela ukuze ibukwe. Isimo sishintsha sibe Ukuze ibukwe nefayela lifundeka kuphela. Ngaphambi kokuvuma, khetha Izilungiselelo zephrojekthi bese uhlu lwalabo abangavuma (igama elilodwa ngomugqa ngamunye), umzekelo Ben no-Carla, bese ukhomba umthetho wokuthi ovumayo kumele abe omunye kunomlobi. Khetha Londoloza izilungiselelo. Manje i-vault ngokwayo yenqaba omunye. U-Ben (noma u-Carla) ukhetha Vuma bese uthayipha igama lomvumayo. Isimo sishintsha sibe Ikhishiwe nenguqulo ibe A, nokuthi ivunywe ngu- negama. Ifayela elikhishiwe lifundeka kuphela. Buyisela bekuyibuyisela ku-Iyaqhubeka, nesizathu. Igama lomvumayo liwugama olibhalwe ebhodini; liyirekhodi lokuthi ubani usayine, hhayi ubufakazi bokuthi ungubani. 5. Inguqulo entsha Efayeleni elikhishiwe, khetha Inguqulo entsha. Uyibamba ngohlamvu olulandelayo. Yishintshe, bese Ngenisa. Inguqulo ibe B.1, iyaqhubeka. Yikhiphe ngendlela efanayo futhi iba B. Hlehlisa ukuphuma ngaphambi kokungenisa kokuqala kushiya ku-A. Amagama enguqulo alandelana A, B … Z, AA, AB. Uma inqubomgomo yakho ishiya amanye amagama, isethingi yephrojekthi Use the ASME Y14.35 sequence iyakhipha I, O, Q, S, X no-Z ezinguqulweni ezilandelayo. 6. Bona okwenzeke Khetha igama lefayela ukuze uvule imininingwane yalo: Umlando: yonke imicimbi, eyakamuva kuqala, nokuthi ubani, iyiphi ikhompyutha nesikhathi: Ingeniswe A.2 ngu-Ana, Ikhishiwe ngu-Ben, njalo njalo. Izinguqulo: ithebula lezinguqulo: zonke izinguqulo ezigciniwe, nosuku lwazo, ubani wazingenisa, inothi, nokuthi ubani wazivuma. I-vault igcina ikhophi yazo ngayinye ku-.ccvault/revs. Kusetshenziswa: amadokhumenti imodeli ye-IFC ekhomba kuwo. Kusetshenziswa yi: ibala yonke imodeli ku-vault ekhomba kulelifayela. Amamodeli akhomba kwamanye amadokhumenti Imodeli ye-IFC ekhomba kwamanye amadokhumenti esifolda (imidwebo, amahlu) iwabonisa ngaphansi kwe-Kusetshenziswa, futhi ngayinye yawo ibonisa imodeli ngaphansi kwe-Kusetshenziswa yi. Ungenisa idokhumenti ubone ukuthi yiliphi amamodeli elibhekisela kulo. 7. Okubonwa ngu-Ben lapho ubamba ifayela Manje phuma ifayela futhi, bese ucela u-Ben ukuthi avule ifolda yephrojekthi efanayo ekhompyutheni yakhe bese evula ibhodi. Esihlanganweni salelifayela ubona Iphume nguAna ku ikhompyutha yakho kusukela isikhathi, futhi akekho inkinobho ye-Phuma. Uma ezama noma kanjalo i-vault iyanqaba: ukukhiya kuyifayela esistimu engeke iyenze kabili, ngakho abantu ababili abakwazi ukubamba ifayela ngasikhathi sinye, ngisho nangomzuzwana owodwa, uma ifolda ikudiski ku-Studio. (Kusiphequluli ifolda ivumela okungenani okungakwazi, futhi ibhodi iyakutshela ngaphansi kwe-Ifolda.) Uma u-Ana engekho futhi u-Ben edinga ifayela, Phula ukuphuma liyilikhulula. Kumele athayiphe isizathu; sifakwa kulogi nokuthi ukuphuma kwakubani. Uma iphrojekthi ibala abaphathi, bona kuphela abangakwenza lokho. Ukuphuma okudlule umkhawulo wokuphelelwa isikhathi (izinsuku ezingu-14 ngokuzenzakalelayo) kuphawulwa njengesikhathi eside. Ngemva kokuphula, ukungenisa kuka-Ana okuphuzile kuyenqatshwa, ngakho nina nobabili anikwazi ukubhalelana phezu kwezinto. 8. Amafolda efu Ifolda yefu iyifolda yephrojekthi egcinwa esitoreji sefu lethimu yakho, ngakho ithimba alidingi idrayivu eyabelwanwa. Ku-Studio, ngemva kokungena ku-akhawunti yakho ye-CadCraft, ibhodi ibonisa Vula ifolda yefu eduze kwe-Khetha ifolda yephrojekthi. Yikhethe bese ukhetha ifolda, ebhalwe njenge-workspace / folder. Umnikazi wesikhala somsebenzi wenza ifolda kuqala, futhi isitoreji sefu sethimu kumele sisebenze. Konke okungenhla kusebenza ngendlela efanayo; iseva yenza ukukhiya, okuqinile phakathi kwabantu. Uma ungangenanga ibhodi iyakutshela ukuthi ungene ngemvume. Kuthebhu evamile yesiphequluli inkinobho yefu ayitholakali; sebenzisa i-Studio. Zama Yenza izinyathelo eziyisishiyagalolunye ezingenhla ngekhophi yefayela langempela. Izinyathelo zabantu ababili zidinga omunye umuntu, noma amawindi amabili namagama amabili. Uma uzama ngefolda eyabelwanwa langempela, ikhasi lokuhlola komphakathi libhala lokhu ngqo futhi lamukela imiphumela.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"dwg-linked-files","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Thola amadwebo axhunyiwe namaphiksha","summary":"Bonisa amadwebo axhunyiwe komdwebo (xrefs) namaphiksha ebhulokhini yesihloko, ngokuvula ifolda yawo noma ngokungeza amafayela ngesandla.","section":"tasks","order":120,"keywords":["xref","isethenjwa sangaphandle","udwebo oxhunyiwe","hlanganisa","phezulu","isithombe","iphiksha","logo","ibhulokhi yesihloko","i-xref engatholakali","etransmit","umphathi wesethenjwa"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"indlela-elula-vula-ifolda","text":"Indlela elula: vula ifolda","level":2},{"id":"indlela-enye-engeza-amafayela-ngesandla","text":"Indlela enye: engeza amafayela ngesandla","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ubone","text":"Okufanele ubone","level":2},{"id":"amaphutha-ajwayelekile","text":"Amaphutha ajwayelekile","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYenza udwebo ugcwele: bonisa amadwebo awuxhumanisa nawo (ukuthenjwa kwangaphandle, noma i-xrefs) namaphiksha asiwasebenzisayo, njengelogo kwibhulokhi yesihloko.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"indlela-elula-vula-ifolda\"\u003EIndlela elula: vula ifolda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen a folder\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha ifolda equkethe udwebo namaxhumanisi alo, isibonelo ifolda yonke ethi \u003Ccode\u003ECad\u003C/code\u003E yephrojekthi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKumbiko wefolda, skrola uye ku-\u003Cstrong\u003ECAD drawings\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza udwebo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBheka iphaneli ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesokudla, ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003ELinked drawings\u003C/strong\u003E ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EImages\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-BimCraft ifuna ngalinye idwebo elixhunyiwe ngegama lalo (&quot;\u003Cem\u003Eigama\u003C/em\u003E.dwg&quot;), kuqala efolda elifanayo nodwebo, bese noma kuphi kwifolda oyivulile. Izithombe ziyatholakala ngendlela efanayo, futhi nangegama elifanayo: i-eTransmit noma ukuthumela kwe-Revit kuvame ukungeza igama lephrojekthi phambili, ngakho i-\u003Ccode\u003Elogo.png\u003C/code\u003E itholakala njenge-\u003Ccode\u003ETower-logo-5425051.png\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"indlela-enye-engeza-amafayela-ngesandla\"\u003EIndlela enye: engeza amafayela ngesandla\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula udwebo wodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgakwesokudla, ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003ELinked drawings\u003C/strong\u003E, chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd linked drawings…\u003C/span\u003E. Ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EImages\u003C/strong\u003E, inkinobho ithi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd pictures…\u003C/span\u003E; zombili zivula isikhethi esifanayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha amafayela e-\u003Ccode\u003E.dwg\u003C/code\u003E axhunyiwe namafayela ezithombe. Ungakhetha amaningi ngesikhathi esisodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELinda ngenkathi i-BimCraft iphinde ivula udwebo nawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ubone\"\u003EOkufanele ubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIdwebo ngalinye elixhunyiwe nesithombe ngasinye kuhlwiswe ngelebula:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIlebula\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsho ukuthi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKuboniswa\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EItholakele futhi idwetshwe. Indlela ngaphansi kwayo ibonisa lapho ivela khona, noma &quot;engezwe nguwe&quot;.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKuboniswa, igama elifanayo\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsithombe esitholakele ngegama elifanayo. Hlola ukuthi siyilo elifanele.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkutholakali\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkukho efolda noma kumafayela owengezile. Isithombe esingatholakali sibonakala njengefreyimu engenalutho.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EI-TIFF ayikwazi ukuboniswa kusiphequluli\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsithombe iyifayela le-TIFF, amasiphequluli angayidwetshi. Gcina njenge-PNG ngegama elifanayo bese uyengeza.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAyikwazanga ukufundwa\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfayela litholakele kodwa alikwazanga ukuvulwa njengesithombe.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIfulelo le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrawing\u003C/span\u003E kwesokunxele libonisa &quot;\u003Cem\u003En\u003C/em\u003E kwe-\u003Cem\u003Em\u003C/em\u003E kulayishiwe&quot; wamadwebo axhunyiwe. Izingqimba zamadwebo axhunyiwe zivela ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayers\u003C/span\u003E njenge-&quot;\u003Cem\u003Eigama lexhumanisi\u003C/em\u003E|\u003Cem\u003Eingqimba\u003C/em\u003E&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amaphutha-ajwayelekile\"\u003EAmaphutha ajwayelekile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuvula udwebo kuphela.\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Lo mdwebo ubonisa okuqukethwe kwawo kuphela uze ungezwe amadwebo axhunyiwe. Ukuvula wonke ifolda yephrojekthi kuwatholela ngokuzenzakalelayo.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuvula ifolda encane kakhulu.\u003C/strong\u003E Uma amaxhumanisi ahlala kwifolda engxenye, vula ifolda yomzali.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmaxhumanisi aqanjiwe kabusha.\u003C/strong\u003E I-BimCraft ifanisa amadwebo axhunyiwe ngegama. Ixhumanisi eliqanjwe kabusha kudiski alitholakali; yengeze ngesandla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmaxhumanisi amaxhumanisi.\u003C/strong\u003E I-BimCraft ilayisha amadwebo odwebo ovulekile ahlanganiswe nawo. Amadwebo axhunyiwe ngaphakathi kwalawo awafuneki, ngakho ngokuvamile awabonisi kule nguqulo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Yenza udwebo ugcwele: bonisa amadwebo awuxhumanisa nawo (ukuthenjwa kwangaphandle, noma i-xrefs) namaphiksha asiwasebenzisayo, njengelogo kwibhulokhi yesihloko. Indlela elula: vula ifolda Chofoza Open a folder bese ukhetha ifolda equkethe udwebo namaxhumanisi alo, isibonelo ifolda yonke ethi Cad yephrojekthi. Kumbiko wefolda, skrola uye ku-CAD drawings. Chofoza udwebo. Bheka iphaneli ye-Properties ngakwesokudla, ngaphansi kwe-Linked drawings ne-Images. I-BimCraft ifuna ngalinye idwebo elixhunyiwe ngegama lalo (\"igama.dwg\"), kuqala efolda elifanayo nodwebo, bese noma kuphi kwifolda oyivulile. Izithombe ziyatholakala ngendlela efanayo, futhi nangegama elifanayo: i-eTransmit noma ukuthumela kwe-Revit kuvame ukungeza igama lephrojekthi phambili, ngakho i-logo.png itholakala njenge-Tower-logo-5425051.png. Indlela enye: engeza amafayela ngesandla Vula udwebo wodwa. Ngakwesokudla, ngaphansi kwe-Linked drawings, chofoza Add linked drawings…. Ngaphansi kwe-Images, inkinobho ithi Add pictures…; zombili zivula isikhethi esifanayo. Khetha amafayela e-.dwg axhunyiwe namafayela ezithombe. Ungakhetha amaningi ngesikhathi esisodwa. Linda ngenkathi i-BimCraft iphinde ivula udwebo nawo. Okufanele ubone Idwebo ngalinye elixhunyiwe nesithombe ngasinye kuhlwiswe ngelebula: Ilebula Isho ukuthi Kuboniswa Itholakele futhi idwetshwe. Indlela ngaphansi kwayo ibonisa lapho ivela khona, noma \"engezwe nguwe\". Kuboniswa, igama elifanayo Isithombe esitholakele ngegama elifanayo. Hlola ukuthi siyilo elifanele. Akutholakali Akukho efolda noma kumafayela owengezile. Isithombe esingatholakali sibonakala njengefreyimu engenalutho. I-TIFF ayikwazi ukuboniswa kusiphequluli Isithombe iyifayela le-TIFF, amasiphequluli angayidwetshi. Gcina njenge-PNG ngegama elifanayo bese uyengeza. Ayikwazanga ukufundwa Ifayela litholakele kodwa alikwazanga ukuvulwa njengesithombe. Ifulelo le-Drawing kwesokunxele libonisa \"n kwe-m kulayishiwe\" wamadwebo axhunyiwe. Izingqimba zamadwebo axhunyiwe zivela ku-Layers njenge-\"igama lexhumanisi|ingqimba\". Amaphutha ajwayelekile Ukuvula udwebo kuphela. \"Lo mdwebo ubonisa okuqukethwe kwawo kuphela uze ungezwe amadwebo axhunyiwe. Ukuvula wonke ifolda yephrojekthi kuwatholela ngokuzenzakalelayo.\" Ukuvula ifolda encane kakhulu. Uma amaxhumanisi ahlala kwifolda engxenye, vula ifolda yomzali. Amaxhumanisi aqanjiwe kabusha. I-BimCraft ifanisa amadwebo axhunyiwe ngegama. Ixhumanisi eliqanjwe kabusha kudiski alitholakali; yengeze ngesandla. Amaxhumanisi amaxhumanisi. I-BimCraft ilayisha amadwebo odwebo ovulekile ahlanganiswe nawo. Amadwebo axhunyiwe ngaphakathi kwalawo awafuneki, ngakho ngokuvamile awabonisi kule nguqulo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"print-view","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Hlola umdwebo ku-print view","summary":"Shintsha i-DWG noma i-DXF ibe yi-print view ukuze uyibone imnyama phezu komhlaba omhlophe ngobubanzi bemigqa yayo, ngaphandle kwamalayiri angeke aphrintwe.","section":"tasks","order":130,"keywords":["print","plot","preview","plot preview","line weights","lineweight","monochrome","black and white","defpoints","no plot","ukuphrinta","ukubuka kuqala","ukuplotha","ubukhulu bemigqa","kumnyama nokumhlophe","akuplothi"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenziwa","text":"Okuzokwenziwa","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ubone","text":"Okufanele ubone","level":2},{"id":"okuvamise-ukwenziwa-kabi","text":"Okuvamise ukwenziwa kabi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenziwa\"\u003EOkuzokwenziwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBona ukuthi ishidi lizobukeka kanjani ephepheni ngaphambi kokuliphrinta kusofthiwe elalenza: lumnyama phezu komhlaba omhlophe, imigqa ngobubanzi bayo bangempela, nangaphandle kwamalayiri asethelwe ukungaphrintwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula umdwebo we-DWG noma we-DXF.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ithebhu yeshidi ngaphezulu komdwebo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubuka kokuphrinta\u003C/span\u003E ekugcineni kwamathebhu, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESondeza ukuqhathanisa imigqa enzima nelula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubuka kokuphrinta\u003C/span\u003E, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ukubuyela emibaleni ejwayelekile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ubone\"\u003EOkufanele ubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIphepha elimhlophe edeskini elingwevu, yonke imigqa nombhalo kumnyama, nanoma yimuphi itimu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUbukhulu bemigqa: ephepheni ngalinye libonakala ngobubanzi bangempela ephepheni, ngakho umugqa ongu-0.5 mm ushuba kabili kunomugqa ongu-0.25 mm kunoma yisiphi isilinganiso. Umugqa awusoze udwetshwe ulula kunobukhulu bawo besikrini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmalayiri asethelwe ukungaphrintwa, nelayiri le-DEFPOINTS, ayafihlwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInkinobho \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubuka kokuphrinta\u003C/span\u003E ihlala icindezelwe. Ukubuka kokuphrinta kuhlala kuvuliwe uma ushintsha amashidi noma uvula omunye umdwebo, kuze kube yilapho ukuvala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImodeli\u003C/span\u003E, ukubuka kokuphrinta kusebenzisa ubukhulu besikrini kuphela (imigqa emincane ibe yipikseli eyodwa, eminye ibe mikhulu kancane), ngoba isikhala semodeli asinasayizi wephepha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuvamise-ukwenziwa-kabi\"\u003EOkuvamise ukwenziwa kabi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkulindela ukuthi kuphrinte.\u003C/strong\u003E Ukubuka kokuphrinta kuwukubuka kuqala. Ukuphrinta nokuthumela nge-PDF akukakhiwa ku-BimCraft; phrinta kusofthiwe elenza umdwebo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkulindela amapulethi okuphrinta.\u003C/strong\u003E Amathebula amapeni nemibala yokuphrinta awafundwa. Konke kumnyama olula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkucindezela P ngenkathi uthayipha.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E awenzi lutho uma uthayipha enkambweni, noma uma itafula lemishini likhonjiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenziwa Bona ukuthi ishidi lizobukeka kanjani ephepheni ngaphambi kokuliphrinta kusofthiwe elalenza: lumnyama phezu komhlaba omhlophe, imigqa ngobubanzi bayo bangempela, nangaphandle kwamalayiri asethelwe ukungaphrintwa. Izinyathelo Vula umdwebo we-DWG noma we-DXF. Chofoza ithebhu yeshidi ngaphezulu komdwebo. Chofoza Ukubuka kokuphrinta ekugcineni kwamathebhu, noma cindezela P. Sondeza ukuqhathanisa imigqa enzima nelula. Chofoza futhi Ukubuka kokuphrinta, noma cindezela P, ukubuyela emibaleni ejwayelekile. Okufanele ubone Iphepha elimhlophe edeskini elingwevu, yonke imigqa nombhalo kumnyama, nanoma yimuphi itimu. Ubukhulu bemigqa: ephepheni ngalinye libonakala ngobubanzi bangempela ephepheni, ngakho umugqa ongu-0.5 mm ushuba kabili kunomugqa ongu-0.25 mm kunoma yisiphi isilinganiso. Umugqa awusoze udwetshwe ulula kunobukhulu bawo besikrini. Amalayiri asethelwe ukungaphrintwa, nelayiri le-DEFPOINTS, ayafihlwa. Inkinobho Ukubuka kokuphrinta ihlala icindezelwe. Ukubuka kokuphrinta kuhlala kuvuliwe uma ushintsha amashidi noma uvula omunye umdwebo, kuze kube yilapho ukuvala. Ku-Imodeli, ukubuka kokuphrinta kusebenzisa ubukhulu besikrini kuphela (imigqa emincane ibe yipikseli eyodwa, eminye ibe mikhulu kancane), ngoba isikhala semodeli asinasayizi wephepha. Okuvamise ukwenziwa kabi Ukulindela ukuthi kuphrinte. Ukubuka kokuphrinta kuwukubuka kuqala. Ukuphrinta nokuthumela nge-PDF akukakhiwa ku-BimCraft; phrinta kusofthiwe elenza umdwebo. Ukulindela amapulethi okuphrinta. Amathebula amapeni nemibala yokuphrinta awafundwa. Konke kumnyama olula. Ukucindezela P ngenkathi uthayipha. F no-P awenzi lutho uma uthayipha enkambweni, noma uma itafula lemishini likhonjiwe.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"usd","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Hlinzeka imodeli njenge-USD","summary":"Bhala amamodeli e-IFC avulekile njenge-USD ukuze kurenderwe, kuhlanganiswe isimo nezinye izinhlelo ze-3D, kugcinwe ikilasi le-IFC, i-GlobalId nezici zento ngayinye.","section":"tasks","order":140,"keywords":["usd","usda","usdc","usdz","openusd","hlinzeka","ifc","globalid","izici","izitezi","izinkambu","ukuhlanganiswa kwesimo","ukurenda","archviz"],"headings":[{"id":"hlinzeka","text":"Hlinzeka","level":2},{"id":"okusefayelini","text":"Okusefayelini","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EEbhalini lamathuluzi, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUSD\u003C/span\u003E ibhala lokho okuvuliwe (zonke izimodeli, ezihlanganisiwe lapho uzibeke khona) njengefayela elilodwa le-USD.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlinzeka\"\u003EHlinzeka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUSD\u003C/span\u003E ebhalini lamathuluzi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmbhalo (.usda)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EObhayinari (.usdc)\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIphakheji (.usdz)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIfayela liyalandwa. Ibha yesimo ikhombisa izinto eziningi ezingeniwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okusefayelini\"\u003EOkusefayelini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKumodeli ye-IFC\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKufayela le-USD\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIndawo, isakhiwo, izitezi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmaqembu ahlanganisiwe, izitezi ngokulandelana kokuphakama\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInto ngayinye\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIprim eyodwa ngaphansi kwesitezi nenkambu yayo (Ukwakha, Isakhiwo, MEP, Ukuhlobisa, Indawo, Izikhala, Okunye), nejiyomethri yayo njenge-mesh\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkilasi, i-GlobalId, igama, uhlobo, ithegi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzici ezibizwa ngokuthi \u003Ccode\u003Eifc:class\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eifc:globalId\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eifc:name\u003C/code\u003E nokunye\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmasethi wezici nezilinganiso\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsici esisodwa ngasinye; ubude, izindawo nevolumu ngamamitha, amamitha esikwele namamitha ekhyubhu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImibala\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinto zokwakha (nokucaca)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzikhala\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZigcinwa, zimakwe njengezinqondiso ukuze abarenda bazidlule\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIjiyomethri ihlala ezixhumanisweni zefayela le-IFC. Ukwakheka kulandela imigomo ye-USD ebhalwe yi-CadCraft yezakhiwo.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ebhalini lamathuluzi, USD ibhala lokho okuvuliwe (zonke izimodeli, ezihlanganisiwe lapho uzibeke khona) njengefayela elilodwa le-USD. Hlinzeka Khetha USD ebhalini lamathuluzi. Khetha Umbhalo (.usda), Obhayinari (.usdc) noma Iphakheji (.usdz). Ifayela liyalandwa. Ibha yesimo ikhombisa izinto eziningi ezingeniwe. Okusefayelini Kumodeli ye-IFC Kufayela le-USD Indawo, isakhiwo, izitezi Amaqembu ahlanganisiwe, izitezi ngokulandelana kokuphakama Into ngayinye Iprim eyodwa ngaphansi kwesitezi nenkambu yayo (Ukwakha, Isakhiwo, MEP, Ukuhlobisa, Indawo, Izikhala, Okunye), nejiyomethri yayo njenge-mesh Ikilasi, i-GlobalId, igama, uhlobo, ithegi Izici ezibizwa ngokuthi ifc:class, ifc:globalId, ifc:name nokunye Amasethi wezici nezilinganiso Isici esisodwa ngasinye; ubude, izindawo nevolumu ngamamitha, amamitha esikwele namamitha ekhyubhu Imibala Izinto zokwakha (nokucaca) Izikhala Zigcinwa, zimakwe njengezinqondiso ukuze abarenda bazidlule Ijiyomethri ihlala ezixhumanisweni zefayela le-IFC. Ukwakheka kulandela imigomo ye-USD ebhalwe yi-CadCraft yezakhiwo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"equipment-schedule","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Yakha uhlu lwezinsiza uphinde ulande i-CSV","summary":"Guqula amathegi ezinto emdwebeni wokudla ube uhlu lwezinsiza, uhlunge, uye kwesinye ngasinye ishidini lakhe, bese ulanda kube yi-CSV.","section":"tasks","order":140,"keywords":["izinsiza","uhlu","ukudla","ikhishi","amathegi ezinto","kcl","izici","bom","uhlu lwezinto ezidingekayo","csv","ishidi lezibalo","ukuthumela","ukukhipha idatha"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukubone","text":"Okufanele ukubone","level":2},{"id":"ukwakhiwa-kohlu","text":"Ukwakhiwa kohlu","level":2},{"id":"izinkinga-ezivamile","text":"Izinkinga ezivamile","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFunda uhlu lwezinsiza kumdwebo wekhishi noma wokudla, uluhlole, uthole isinto ngasinye kupulani, bese ulanda njengefayela le-spreadsheet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELokhu kusebenza kumidwebo lapho amathegi ezinsiza ephethe idatha yawo njengezici zebhulokhi, njengoba kwenza amalabhulari okuklama amakhishi afana ne-KCL: ithegi ngayinye iphethe inombolo yento (\u003Ccode\u003EKCL-ITEM\u003C/code\u003E), inani, isigaba, umkhiqizi, imodeli, idatha yoge namanzi, nezimvumelo. Eminye imidwebo ayinayo ithebhu ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEquipment\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula umdwebo, ngokuvamile usuka kwifolda yephrojekthi ukuze nemidwebo exhunyiwe ilayishwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ithebhu ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEquipment\u003C/span\u003E ngaphezulu komdwebo. Ilebula yayo ikhombisa ukuthi zingaki izinto ezisemashidini, njengokuthi &quot;Equipment (88)&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFunda uhlu: \u003Cstrong\u003EItem\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EQty\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EEquipment\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EManufacturer\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EModel\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EElectrical\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EPlumbing\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003EWhere\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha okuzohlwanyelwa kwimenyu ngaphezulu kwethebula: \u003Cstrong\u003EZonke izishidi\u003C/strong\u003E, ishidi elilodwa, \u003Cstrong\u003EAkekho ishidi\u003C/strong\u003E, noma \u003Cstrong\u003EKonke okuthegiwe emdwebeni\u003C/strong\u003E. Ngayinye ikhombisa inani layo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBhala kubhokisi lokuhlunga (&quot;Filter: category, maker, model…&quot;) ukuze unciphise uhlu, njengokuthi \u003Ccode\u003Erefrigerator\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E208\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza igama leshidi lesinto ekholomini ethi \u003Cstrong\u003EWhere\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBheka umdwebo: i-BimCraft ishintshela kuleshidi, izoomela kusinto bese idweba indilinga ozungeze yona. Umugqa wesimo uthi &quot;Item \u003Cem\u003En\u003C/em\u003E, \u003Cem\u003Ecategory\u003C/em\u003E is ringed on \u003Cem\u003Esheet\u003C/em\u003E.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEquipment\u003C/span\u003E ukuze ubuyele kuhlu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDownload CSV\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukubone\"\u003EOkufanele ukubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIfayela elithi &quot;\u003Cem\u003Eigama lomdwebo\u003C/em\u003E equipment.csv&quot; (negama leshidi ephakathi kwamabhulaketi uma uhlu lwelishidi elilodwa) kufolda yakho yokulanda. Livulwa ku-Excel, Numbers, LibreOffice noma Google Sheets.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmugqa wesimo: &quot;Ulandiwe \u003Cem\u003Eigama lefayela\u003C/em\u003E (\u003Cem\u003En\u003C/em\u003E izinto).&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-CSV inamakholomu: Item, Qty, Category, Manufacturer, Model, Electrical, Plumbing, Remarks, Electrical remarks, Plumbing remarks, Sheets, Placed (amathegi amangaki). Ilanda kuphela imigqa ethi ethebula, ngemva kwemenyu nokuhlunga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukwakhiwa-kohlu\"\u003EUkwakhiwa kohlu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELufundwa kusuka \u003Cstrong\u003Ekumathegi ngokwawo\u003C/strong\u003E, hhayi kuthebula lohlu elidwetshwe kushidi. Inothi ngaphezulu kwethebula likhomba amathegi angaki afundwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmugqa owodwa ungunombolo eyodwa yento nesethi eyodwa yedatha. Inani lawo yi-\u003Cstrong\u003Esum\u003C/strong\u003E yamathegi awo, njengoba uhlu oluphrintiwe luyibala: amashelufu athegwe &quot;5&quot; endaweni eyodwa nowathi &quot;3&quot; kwenye ayi-8, akhonjiswe njengo &quot;5 + 3&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWhere\u003C/strong\u003E ibala amashidi abonisa ngayinye into, ngokusekelwe kokubonakala ezibonelweni zeshidi, okuphrintwayo. &quot;Model only&quot; kusho ukuthi akukho shidi elibonisa lokho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENumber used twice\u003C/strong\u003E ibhala inombolo yento eyodwa ezinhlobonhlobo ezimbili ezihlukene zezinsiza. Umugqa unophawu lwe-amber.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmathegi angabonakali kunoma iliphi ishidi agcinwa ehlukaniswe ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003ENot on any sheet\u003C/strong\u003E. Ngokuvamile asala emipulanini yangaphambili noma emisebenzini yezinye izinhlelo, futhi awaxutshwa ne-\u003Cstrong\u003EZonke izishidi\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EElectrical\u003C/strong\u003E ikhombisa ama-amp, ama-kW, i-HP, ama-volt, isigaba, ukuxhumeka nephlagi njengoba kuthegiwe. \u003Cstrong\u003EPlumbing\u003C/strong\u003E ikhombisa usayizi wokuxhumeka: CW amanzi abandayo, HW amanzi ashisayo, DD ukukhipha okuqondile, ID ukukhipha okungaqondile, negesi. Ezinye izinkambu zethegi azikakabonakali.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinkinga-ezivamile\"\u003EIzinkinga ezivamile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkukho ithebhu ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEquipment\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/strong\u003E Umdwebo awunawo amathegi e-\u003Ccode\u003EKCL-ITEM\u003C/code\u003E, noma izinsiza zawo zidwetshwe ngaphandle kwedatha. Akukho okufundwayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmanani ahlukile kohlu oluphrintiwe.\u003C/strong\u003E Uhlu oluphrintiwe lungadlula izinombolo ezingasetshenziswa noma lusebenzise amagama amafushane kunamathegi. Themba amathegi ngokuthi yini ebekiwe; hlola umehluko nomklami.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuvula i-CSV kukhombisa izinhlamvu ezingavamile.\u003C/strong\u003E Ifayela lingu-UTF-8. Liyovula ngomyalo wokungenisa wesipredishithi bese ukhetha UTF-8 uma uhlelo lukubuza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIseli iqala ngophawu lwe-apostrophe.\u003C/strong\u003E Amanani aqala nge-\u003Ccode\u003E=\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E+\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E-\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E@\u003C/code\u003E athola i-\u003Ccode\u003E&#039;\u003C/code\u003E ephambili ukuze izipredishithi zingawasebenzisi njengamafomula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E azisebenzi.\u003C/strong\u003E Asebenza emdwebeni, hhayi kuhlu. Chofoza ithebhu yeshidi kuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Funda uhlu lwezinsiza kumdwebo wekhishi noma wokudla, uluhlole, uthole isinto ngasinye kupulani, bese ulanda njengefayela le-spreadsheet. Lokhu kusebenza kumidwebo lapho amathegi ezinsiza ephethe idatha yawo njengezici zebhulokhi, njengoba kwenza amalabhulari okuklama amakhishi afana ne-KCL: ithegi ngayinye iphethe inombolo yento (KCL-ITEM), inani, isigaba, umkhiqizi, imodeli, idatha yoge namanzi, nezimvumelo. Eminye imidwebo ayinayo ithebhu ethi Equipment. Izinyathelo Vula umdwebo, ngokuvamile usuka kwifolda yephrojekthi ukuze nemidwebo exhunyiwe ilayishwe. Chofoza ithebhu ethi Equipment ngaphezulu komdwebo. Ilebula yayo ikhombisa ukuthi zingaki izinto ezisemashidini, njengokuthi \"Equipment (88)\". Funda uhlu: Item, Qty, Equipment, Manufacturer, Model, Electrical, Plumbing kanye Where. Khetha okuzohlwanyelwa kwimenyu ngaphezulu kwethebula: Zonke izishidi, ishidi elilodwa, Akekho ishidi, noma Konke okuthegiwe emdwebeni. Ngayinye ikhombisa inani layo. Bhala kubhokisi lokuhlunga (\"Filter: category, maker, model…\") ukuze unciphise uhlu, njengokuthi refrigerator noma 208. Chofoza igama leshidi lesinto ekholomini ethi Where. Bheka umdwebo: i-BimCraft ishintshela kuleshidi, izoomela kusinto bese idweba indilinga ozungeze yona. Umugqa wesimo uthi \"Item n, category is ringed on sheet.\" Chofoza Equipment ukuze ubuyele kuhlu. Chofoza Download CSV. Okufanele ukubone Ifayela elithi \"igama lomdwebo equipment.csv\" (negama leshidi ephakathi kwamabhulaketi uma uhlu lwelishidi elilodwa) kufolda yakho yokulanda. Livulwa ku-Excel, Numbers, LibreOffice noma Google Sheets. Umugqa wesimo: \"Ulandiwe igama lefayela (n izinto).\" I-CSV inamakholomu: Item, Qty, Category, Manufacturer, Model, Electrical, Plumbing, Remarks, Electrical remarks, Plumbing remarks, Sheets, Placed (amathegi amangaki). Ilanda kuphela imigqa ethi ethebula, ngemva kwemenyu nokuhlunga. Ukwakhiwa kohlu Lufundwa kusuka kumathegi ngokwawo, hhayi kuthebula lohlu elidwetshwe kushidi. Inothi ngaphezulu kwethebula likhomba amathegi angaki afundwe. Umugqa owodwa ungunombolo eyodwa yento nesethi eyodwa yedatha. Inani lawo yi-sum yamathegi awo, njengoba uhlu oluphrintiwe luyibala: amashelufu athegwe \"5\" endaweni eyodwa nowathi \"3\" kwenye ayi-8, akhonjiswe njengo \"5 + 3\". Where ibala amashidi abonisa ngayinye into, ngokusekelwe kokubonakala ezibonelweni zeshidi, okuphrintwayo. \"Model only\" kusho ukuthi akukho shidi elibonisa lokho. Number used twice ibhala inombolo yento eyodwa ezinhlobonhlobo ezimbili ezihlukene zezinsiza. Umugqa unophawu lwe-amber. Amathegi angabonakali kunoma iliphi ishidi agcinwa ehlukaniswe ngaphansi kwe-Not on any sheet. Ngokuvamile asala emipulanini yangaphambili noma emisebenzini yezinye izinhlelo, futhi awaxutshwa ne-Zonke izishidi. Electrical ikhombisa ama-amp, ama-kW, i-HP, ama-volt, isigaba, ukuxhumeka nephlagi njengoba kuthegiwe. Plumbing ikhombisa usayizi wokuxhumeka: CW amanzi abandayo, HW amanzi ashisayo, DD ukukhipha okuqondile, ID ukukhipha okungaqondile, negesi. Ezinye izinkambu zethegi azikakabonakali. Izinkinga ezivamile Akukho ithebhu ethi Equipment. Umdwebo awunawo amathegi e-KCL-ITEM, noma izinsiza zawo zidwetshwe ngaphandle kwedatha. Akukho okufundwayo. Amanani ahlukile kohlu oluphrintiwe. Uhlu oluphrintiwe lungadlula izinombolo ezingasetshenziswa noma lusebenzise amagama amafushane kunamathegi. Themba amathegi ngokuthi yini ebekiwe; hlola umehluko nomklami. Ukuvula i-CSV kukhombisa izinhlamvu ezingavamile. Ifayela lingu-UTF-8. Liyovula ngomyalo wokungenisa wesipredishithi bese ukhetha UTF-8 uma uhlelo lukubuza. Iseli iqala ngophawu lwe-apostrophe. Amanani aqala nge-=, +, - noma @ athola i-' ephambili ukuze izipredishithi zingawasebenzisi njengamafomula. F no-P azisebenzi. Asebenza emdwebeni, hhayi kuhlu. Chofoza ithebhu yeshidi kuqala.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"collada","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Thumela imodeli njenge-Collada noma yephakheji ye-Google Earth","summary":"Bhala amamodeli e-IFC avulekile njengefayela le-Collada (.dae) lebhulauza nezinye izinhlelo ze-3D, noma njengephakheji ye-Google Earth (.kmz) ebekwe lapho imodeli ikhona kumephu.","section":"tasks","order":141,"keywords":["collada","dae","kmz","kml","google earth","blender","thumela","geolocation","georeference","latitude","longitude","indawo","izinhlelo ze-3d"],"headings":[{"id":"thumela","text":"Thumela","level":2},{"id":"okusefayelini","text":"Okusefayelini","level":2},{"id":"lapho-indawo-ivela-khona","text":"Lapho indawo ivela khona","level":2},{"id":"ezinye-izinhlelo","text":"Ezinye izinhlelo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECollada\u003C/span\u003E ethulini lamathuluzi (noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela i-Collada (.dae, .kmz)…\u003C/span\u003E kumenyu Ifayela kumitlolo yemenyu nebha yeribhoni) ibhala okuvuliwe njenge-Collada 1.4.1: yonke imodeli eboniswayo, nemodeli ezixhunyiwe lapho uzibeke khona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"thumela\"\u003EThumela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECollada\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha ifomethi:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfayela le-Collada (.dae), le-Blender nezinye izinhlelo ze-3D\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIphakheji ye-Google Earth (.kmz): imodeli ibekwe lapho ikhona kumephu\u003C/span\u003E. Ikhonjiswa kuphela uma imodeli inendawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha izinketho, bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E. Ifayela liyalandwa, futhi ibha yesimo ikutshela ukuthi izinto ezingaki zingenile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInketho\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYenza ini\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWrite the location into the file\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYengeza i-latitude, i-longitude, ukuphakama nesiqondiso somsuka wefayela le-.dae\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHeight\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOn the ground: the model’s level 0 sits on the terrain\u003C/span\u003E, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe model’s own height above sea level\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInclude rooms and spaces\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzindawo nazo ziyangeniswa (zishiywa ngokuzenzakalelayo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInclude hidden elements\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinto ozifihlile nazo ziyabhalwa (ngokuzenzakalelayo kubhalwa okubonakalayo kuphela)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okusefayelini\"\u003EOkusefayelini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKumodeli\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKufayela le-Collada\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsakhiwo, izitezi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinodi ezigxilile, izitezi ngokulandelana kokuphakama; izinto ezingekho esiteziini esithile zingaphansi kwe-&quot;Akubekiwe&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYonke into\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInodi eyodwa enemeshi yayo, ibizwe njengakumodeli (igama layo, uma lingekho, iklasi nethegi yayo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIklasi, GlobalId, uhlobo olucacisiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEdatheni eyengeziwe yenodi (i-IFC profile), ngegama elifanayo ngokuphelele (i-ModelCraft profile)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImibala\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinto zokwakha, nokukhanya\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIziyunithi nama-eksisi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMitha, Z iphakame. Izinga 0 lemodeli ephambili lisekuphakameni 0\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImodeli ihlala eduze komsuka emhlabeni, ngakho izinhlelo ezisebenza ngokunemba okuncane zibonisa kahle ngaphandle kokunyikinyeka. I-ModelCraft ibhala amafayela ayo e-Collada ngomlobi ofanayo, futhi ivula lawa mafayela ngamagama ezakhi zawo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lapho-indawo-ivela-khona\"\u003ELapho indawo ivela khona\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImodeli ephambili inikeza indawo, ngendlela efanayo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinganisa\u003C/span\u003E ahlola ngayo i-latitude ne-longitude yephoyinti:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuguqulwa kwemephu (i-IFC4 IfcMapConversion, noma amasethi ezici we-IFC2X3) ngohlelo lwamakhoordineyithi lemodeli. Uhlelo owukhethele imodeli luyanqoba olufakwe ngamafayela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKungenjalo, i-latitude ne-longitude yendawo yokwakha (eseduze: kuhle endaweni yonke yokwakha).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsiqondiso siyalinganiswa, asiphoqiwe: sithatha phezu kokujikeleza kwemephu, enyakatho yeqiniso nokuhlangana kwemephu. Ukuze unike imodeli indawo, sebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmsuka wemephu…\u003C/span\u003E kuLinganisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ezinye-izinhlelo\"\u003EEzinye izinhlelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGoogle Earth\u003C/strong\u003E ifunda i-.kmz: imodeli ivela endaweni yayo, ijikelezwe ibheke enyakatho. I-.dae ejwayelekile alinayo indawo ifayela le-Google Earth elifunda kuyo; sebenzisa i-.kmz.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBlender\u003C/strong\u003E (4.x nangaphambili): File, Import, Collada (.dae). Yonke into ingena njengento yayo ene-material yayo. Indawo igcinwa edatheni eyengeziwe yefayela, Blender ayifundi leyo datha. I-Blender 5.0 yakhipha isifaki se-Collada esasakhiwe ngaphakathi; kuyo, sebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUSD\u003C/span\u003E noma ukuthumela kwe-glTF, noma vula i-.dae ku-Blender 4.5 bese ugcina njenge-.blend.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzivivinyo zethu zihlola wonke amafayela ngesikimu se-Collada 1.4.1 futhi ziwafunde ngomfundi ozimele we-Collada. Azikaze zivule kuBlender noma kuGoogle Earth.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Collada ethulini lamathuluzi (noma Thumela i-Collada (.dae, .kmz)… kumenyu Ifayela kumitlolo yemenyu nebha yeribhoni) ibhala okuvuliwe njenge-Collada 1.4.1: yonke imodeli eboniswayo, nemodeli ezixhunyiwe lapho uzibeke khona. Thumela Khetha Collada. Khetha ifomethi: Ifayela le-Collada (.dae), le-Blender nezinye izinhlelo ze-3D. Iphakheji ye-Google Earth (.kmz): imodeli ibekwe lapho ikhona kumephu. Ikhonjiswa kuphela uma imodeli inendawo. Khetha izinketho, bese ukhetha Thumela. Ifayela liyalandwa, futhi ibha yesimo ikutshela ukuthi izinto ezingaki zingenile. Inketho Yenza ini Write the location into the file Yengeza i-latitude, i-longitude, ukuphakama nesiqondiso somsuka wefayela le-.dae Height On the ground: the model’s level 0 sits on the terrain, noma The model’s own height above sea level Include rooms and spaces Izindawo nazo ziyangeniswa (zishiywa ngokuzenzakalelayo) Include hidden elements Izinto ozifihlile nazo ziyabhalwa (ngokuzenzakalelayo kubhalwa okubonakalayo kuphela) Okusefayelini Kumodeli Kufayela le-Collada Isakhiwo, izitezi Izinodi ezigxilile, izitezi ngokulandelana kokuphakama; izinto ezingekho esiteziini esithile zingaphansi kwe-\"Akubekiwe\" Yonke into Inodi eyodwa enemeshi yayo, ibizwe njengakumodeli (igama layo, uma lingekho, iklasi nethegi yayo) Iklasi, GlobalId, uhlobo olucacisiwe Edatheni eyengeziwe yenodi (i-IFC profile), ngegama elifanayo ngokuphelele (i-ModelCraft profile) Imibala Izinto zokwakha, nokukhanya Iziyunithi nama-eksisi Mitha, Z iphakame. Izinga 0 lemodeli ephambili lisekuphakameni 0 Imodeli ihlala eduze komsuka emhlabeni, ngakho izinhlelo ezisebenza ngokunemba okuncane zibonisa kahle ngaphandle kokunyikinyeka. I-ModelCraft ibhala amafayela ayo e-Collada ngomlobi ofanayo, futhi ivula lawa mafayela ngamagama ezakhi zawo. Lapho indawo ivela khona Imodeli ephambili inikeza indawo, ngendlela efanayo Linganisa ahlola ngayo i-latitude ne-longitude yephoyinti: Ukuguqulwa kwemephu (i-IFC4 IfcMapConversion, noma amasethi ezici we-IFC2X3) ngohlelo lwamakhoordineyithi lemodeli. Uhlelo owukhethele imodeli luyanqoba olufakwe ngamafayela. Kungenjalo, i-latitude ne-longitude yendawo yokwakha (eseduze: kuhle endaweni yonke yokwakha). Isiqondiso siyalinganiswa, asiphoqiwe: sithatha phezu kokujikeleza kwemephu, enyakatho yeqiniso nokuhlangana kwemephu. Ukuze unike imodeli indawo, sebenzisa Umsuka wemephu… kuLinganisa. Ezinye izinhlelo Google Earth ifunda i-.kmz: imodeli ivela endaweni yayo, ijikelezwe ibheke enyakatho. I-.dae ejwayelekile alinayo indawo ifayela le-Google Earth elifunda kuyo; sebenzisa i-.kmz. Blender (4.x nangaphambili): File, Import, Collada (.dae). Yonke into ingena njengento yayo ene-material yayo. Indawo igcinwa edatheni eyengeziwe yefayela, Blender ayifundi leyo datha. I-Blender 5.0 yakhipha isifaki se-Collada esasakhiwe ngaphakathi; kuyo, sebenzisa USD noma ukuthumela kwe-glTF, noma vula i-.dae ku-Blender 4.5 bese ugcina njenge-.blend. Izivivinyo zethu zihlola wonke amafayela ngesikimu se-Collada 1.4.1 futhi ziwafunde ngomfundi ozimele we-Collada. Azikaze zivule kuBlender noma kuGoogle Earth.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"ifc5-alpha-ifcx","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Vula futhi uthumele amafayela e-IFC5 alpha (IFCX)","summary":"Inketho yelabhu ye-ifomethi yefayela le-IFC5 alpha (.ifcx): vula ifayela nezendlalelo zalo, bone okungaxhunyiwe ukuhlolwa ngokufunda, futhi uthumele amamodeli avulekile. Ifomethi isashintsha, ngakho funda kuqala.","section":"tasks","order":142,"keywords":["ifc5","ifcx","alpha","buildingsmart","json","izingqimba","isikimu","ilabhu","izilinganiso","qto","thumela","ngenisa"],"headings":[{"id":"yivule","text":"Yivule","level":2},{"id":"vula","text":"Vula","level":2},{"id":"umbiko","text":"Umbiko","level":3},{"id":"okuba-yini","text":"Okuba yini","level":2},{"id":"thumela","text":"Thumela","level":2},{"id":"imingcele","text":"Imingcele","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EI-IFC5 alpha (ifayela elinesifaki \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E.ifcx\u003C/span\u003E) iyifomethi i-buildingSMART isaklama. Ayiphelele: amafayela, nendlela esiwafunda ngayo, angashintsha. Yingakho lokhu kuyinketho yelabhu futhi kudingeka ukufunda kuqala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yivule\"\u003EYivule\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E, bese isigaba se-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIFC5 alpha (IFCX)\u003C/span\u003E sethebhu ye-BimCraft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaka itiki ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIFC5 alpha (IFCX) - the format is still changing; read first\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIcima ngokuzenzakalelayo. Lapho icimile, ifayela le-.ifcx ayamukelwa, kanye nomlayezo osho lapha. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen IFC5 alpha (.ifcx)…\u003C/span\u003E nenkinobho ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIFC5 alpha\u003C/span\u003E yokuthumela ivela uma ivuliwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vula\"\u003EVula\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha ifayela le-.ifcx nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen a file or folder\u003C/span\u003E (ishintsha imodeli evuliwe, ngemva kombuzo ojwayelekile wokuhlela), noma\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ekhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen IFC5 alpha (.ifcx)…\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha amafayela amaningi ndawonye: ifayela, izingqimba zalo, namafayela esikimu alingenisa. Uma imodeli sele ivuliwe, ifayela \u003Cstrong\u003Elengezwa ecaleni kwayo\u003C/strong\u003E; u-x ohlwini lwemodeli uyalisusa futhi, okuyinto ehlehlisayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIfayela le-IFCX libala ama-node (indlela, izingane zawo, lokho alifakwayo, izimpawu zawo). Amafayela amaningi angachaza i-node efanayo: ifayela elilandelayo (ungqimba) lishintsha izimpawu zelangaphambili, nengane ye-null iyasusa ingane. I-BimCraft iyawahlanganisa, bese idweba umphumela njengemodeli encane ye-IFC4: iphrojekthi, indawo, isakhiwo, izitezi nezinto ezinamagama, izigaba, izici, izilinganiso, imibala nemeshi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAkukho okulandwa kunethiwekhi. Amafayela esikimu alingenisa ifayela (isibonelo \u003Ccode\u003Eifc@v5a.ifcx\u003C/code\u003E) asetshenziswa kuphela uma uwakhethe ndawonye nefayela; ngaphandle kwalokho umbiko uyasho lokho futhi izimpawu ziyafundwa ngaphandle kokuhlolwa kohlobo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"umbiko\"\u003EUmbiko\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgemva kokuvula, umbiko ubala okutholwe ukufunda: idatha engahambisani nesikimu sayo, amafayela esikimu angaphansiwe, nezimpawu ezingenayo incazelo ye-IFC lapha. Izimpawu ezingenamephu zihlala \u003Cstrong\u003Ezigcinwe\u003C/strong\u003E emodelini, azilahlwa, futhi zibhalwa kabusha lapho uthumela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuba-yini\"\u003EOkuba yini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKwifayela le-IFCX\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKu-BimCraft\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-node enohlobo lwe-IFC (iphrojekthi, indawo, isakhiwo, isitezi, udonga …)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-elementi ye-IFC4 efanayo; uhlobo lokufunda okungakwazi ukulwazi luba yi-building element proxy\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIgama i-node elinalo ngaphansi komzali wayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIgama lento\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzimpawu ezinohlobo lobukhulu (Length, Area, Volume, Mass …)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsethi yezilinganiso ye-IFC4 ebizwa ngokuthi \u003Ccode\u003EQto_IFCX\u003C/code\u003E (amasethi ezilinganiso ze-IFC4 ahlala njengamasethi \u003Ccode\u003EQto_*\u003C/code\u003E e-IFC4)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEzinye izimpawu zezici\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsethi yezici ebizwa ngokuthi \u003Ccode\u003EPset_IFCX\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzimpawu zemeshi nokuguqula\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOnxantathu bento kanye nendawo yayo; imeshi engabonakali ayidwetshwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmbala, ukungaqinile, impahla, ukuhlelwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsitayela sokuphela, impahla nokuhlelwa kwento\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmayunithi athathwa njengamamitha, nge-Z iphezulu: i-alpha ithi amayunithi azobhalwa kamuva.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"thumela\"\u003EThumela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIFC5 alpha\u003C/span\u003E kumthamo wamathuluzi, funda isaziso, bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport .ifcx\u003C/span\u003E. Ifayela linekhanda lethu (umbhali CadCraft, inguqulo ifcx_alpha) futhi lisho ngokwalo ukuthi yifomethi ye-alpha. Imodeli ngayinye ibhalwa ezixhumanweni zayo zefayela, ngamamitha, namagama, izigaba, amasethi wezici, izilinganiso (njengezimpawu nohlobo lwazo), imibala nonxantathu. Izingqimba nokuthola kubhalwa kuhlanganiswe. Hlola ifayela kuhlelo olulithumela kulo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imingcele\"\u003EImingcele\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIjometri egobile (amajika, izindawo) ayifundwa: onxantathu bemeshi kuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIminyango namawindi akhiwe ngaphakathi kwesidonga ahlelwa esitezini; udonga abavela kulo alixhunyiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmasethi we-IFC4 \u003Ccode\u003EQto_*\u003C/code\u003E agcinwa njengamaqembu ezimpawu ezingezethu (\u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft::qto::…\u003C/code\u003E); isikimu esijwayelekile se-alpha sinamagama ambalwa kuphela ezilinganiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIfomethi ingashintsha phansi kwethu; ifayela elenziwe namuhla lingangafundeki kusasa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"I-IFC5 alpha (ifayela elinesifaki .ifcx) iyifomethi i-buildingSMART isaklama. Ayiphelele: amafayela, nendlela esiwafunda ngayo, angashintsha. Yingakho lokhu kuyinketho yelabhu futhi kudingeka ukufunda kuqala. Yivule Khetha Settings, bese isigaba se-IFC5 alpha (IFCX) sethebhu ye-BimCraft. Faka itiki ku-IFC5 alpha (IFCX) - the format is still changing; read first. Icima ngokuzenzakalelayo. Lapho icimile, ifayela le-.ifcx ayamukelwa, kanye nomlayezo osho lapha. Open IFC5 alpha (.ifcx)… nenkinobho ye-IFC5 alpha yokuthumela ivela uma ivuliwe. Vula Khetha ifayela le-.ifcx nge-Open a file or folder (ishintsha imodeli evuliwe, ngemva kombuzo ojwayelekile wokuhlela), noma khetha Open IFC5 alpha (.ifcx)… bese ukhetha amafayela amaningi ndawonye: ifayela, izingqimba zalo, namafayela esikimu alingenisa. Uma imodeli sele ivuliwe, ifayela lengezwa ecaleni kwayo; u-x ohlwini lwemodeli uyalisusa futhi, okuyinto ehlehlisayo. Ifayela le-IFCX libala ama-node (indlela, izingane zawo, lokho alifakwayo, izimpawu zawo). Amafayela amaningi angachaza i-node efanayo: ifayela elilandelayo (ungqimba) lishintsha izimpawu zelangaphambili, nengane ye-null iyasusa ingane. I-BimCraft iyawahlanganisa, bese idweba umphumela njengemodeli encane ye-IFC4: iphrojekthi, indawo, isakhiwo, izitezi nezinto ezinamagama, izigaba, izici, izilinganiso, imibala nemeshi. Akukho okulandwa kunethiwekhi. Amafayela esikimu alingenisa ifayela (isibonelo ifc@v5a.ifcx) asetshenziswa kuphela uma uwakhethe ndawonye nefayela; ngaphandle kwalokho umbiko uyasho lokho futhi izimpawu ziyafundwa ngaphandle kokuhlolwa kohlobo. Umbiko Ngemva kokuvula, umbiko ubala okutholwe ukufunda: idatha engahambisani nesikimu sayo, amafayela esikimu angaphansiwe, nezimpawu ezingenayo incazelo ye-IFC lapha. Izimpawu ezingenamephu zihlala zigcinwe emodelini, azilahlwa, futhi zibhalwa kabusha lapho uthumela. Okuba yini Kwifayela le-IFCX Ku-BimCraft I-node enohlobo lwe-IFC (iphrojekthi, indawo, isakhiwo, isitezi, udonga …) I-elementi ye-IFC4 efanayo; uhlobo lokufunda okungakwazi ukulwazi luba yi-building element proxy Igama i-node elinalo ngaphansi komzali wayo Igama lento Izimpawu ezinohlobo lobukhulu (Length, Area, Volume, Mass …) Isethi yezilinganiso ye-IFC4 ebizwa ngokuthi Qto_IFCX (amasethi ezilinganiso ze-IFC4 ahlala njengamasethi Qto_* e-IFC4) Ezinye izimpawu zezici Isethi yezici ebizwa ngokuthi Pset_IFCX Izimpawu zemeshi nokuguqula Onxantathu bento kanye nendawo yayo; imeshi engabonakali ayidwetshwa Umbala, ukungaqinile, impahla, ukuhlelwa Isitayela sokuphela, impahla nokuhlelwa kwento Amayunithi athathwa njengamamitha, nge-Z iphezulu: i-alpha ithi amayunithi azobhalwa kamuva. Thumela Khetha IFC5 alpha kumthamo wamathuluzi, funda isaziso, bese ukhetha Export .ifcx. Ifayela linekhanda lethu (umbhali CadCraft, inguqulo ifcx_alpha) futhi lisho ngokwalo ukuthi yifomethi ye-alpha. Imodeli ngayinye ibhalwa ezixhumanweni zayo zefayela, ngamamitha, namagama, izigaba, amasethi wezici, izilinganiso (njengezimpawu nohlobo lwazo), imibala nonxantathu. Izingqimba nokuthola kubhalwa kuhlanganiswe. Hlola ifayela kuhlelo olulithumela kulo. Imingcele Ijometri egobile (amajika, izindawo) ayifundwa: onxantathu bemeshi kuphela. Iminyango namawindi akhiwe ngaphakathi kwesidonga ahlelwa esitezini; udonga abavela kulo alixhunyiwe. Amasethi we-IFC4 Qto_* agcinwa njengamaqembu ezimpawu ezingezethu (cadcraft::qto::…); isikimu esijwayelekile se-alpha sinamagama ambalwa kuphela ezilinganiso. Ifomethi ingashintsha phansi kwethu; ifayela elenziwe namuhla lingangafundeki kusasa.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"place-from-library","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Beka izinsiza nofenisha kusuka ku-Library","summary":"Thola into ku-Library, ifayela noma umdwebo ovulekile, uyibeke esitezini semodeli ye-IFC ngombukiso ongaqinile, uyiphendulele, uyiphathele odongeni bese ulondoloza.","section":"tasks","order":150,"keywords":["hambisa","phendulela","donsa","library","librarycraft","beka","faka","izinsiza","fenisha","ibhulokhi","umndeni","into","ikhathalogu","okuqukethwe","kcl","csv","gltf","obj","rfa","dwg","uhlobo lwe-ifc"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"ipulani-noma-imodeli","text":"Ipulani noma imodeli","level":2},{"id":"hambisa-noma-uphendulele-into-ebekiwe","text":"Hambisa noma uphendulele into ebekiwe","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukubone","text":"Okufanele ukubone","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukwazi","text":"Okufanele ukwazi","level":2},{"id":"izinto-ngolimi-lwakho","text":"Izinto ngolimi lwakho","level":2},{"id":"iziphazamiso-ezivamile","text":"Iziphazamiso ezivamile","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaka into ye-library emodelini ye-IFC: isinki, itafula lokusebenzela, isihlalo. I-BimCraft iyibhala njengento ye-IFC efanele ngohlobo, ngakho zonke izikhobi zento efanayo zabelana ngesethi eyodwa yejiyomethri, nedatha yayo, inombolo yento kanye nelayisensi kuhamba nayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula imodeli ye-IFC.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ithebhu ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmtapo\u003C/span\u003E eduze kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzici\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesokudla, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmtapo\u003C/span\u003E ebhareni lamathuluzi ngaphezu kwemodeli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha umthombo:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzimpawu ezakhelwe ngaphakathi\u003C/strong\u003E: izimpawu zepulani zepulumbing ezijwayelekile ezifakwe ku-BimCraft ngaphansi kwe-Apache-2.0, ezitholakala ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi. Hlola ubukhulu bazo ngaphambi kokwakha. Ngezimpawu zepulani zikagesi kanye nezinsiza zikagesi ze-IFC, sebenzisa \u003Cstrong\u003EUkwakhiwa › Ugesi\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELibrary\u003C/strong\u003E: i-CadCraft library kulesi sayithi. Izinto zomphakathi azidingi ukungena.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELe faela\u003C/strong\u003E: amabhulokhi omdwebo ovulekile we-DWG noma we-DXF. Ibhulokhi elinamamodi okubonakala linikezwa kanye ngayinye imodi, libizwe ngokuthi &quot;Sink: Double bowl&quot;, ngayinye idwetshwe ngezinto zalowo mo kuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmafayela…\u003C/strong\u003E: ifayela le-DWG, DXF, IFC, glTF/GLB, OBJ, RFA noma CSV kwikhompyutha yakho. Lifundwa kule thebhu; akulayishwa noma kumuphi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImithombo yezinye\u003C/strong\u003E: enye library esebenzisa ifomethi efanayo yomthombo. Engeza ikheli layo kanye; ligcinwa kulesi siphequluli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESesha noma khetha isigaba, bese uchofoza ikhadi. Likhombisa ukubukeka kwepulani, igama, umenzi nemodeli, ilayisensi kanye nenguqulo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBeka epulanini\u003C/span\u003E (kuMbono wePulani) noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBeka emodelini\u003C/span\u003E (kuMbono we-3D). Ku-Split, lapho ipulani ne-3D zibonakala ndawonye, inkinobho iyinkinobho ehlukaniswayo: isenzo sayo esiyinhloko yi-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBeka epulanini\u003C/span\u003E, nomcibisholo wayo ongakwesokudla uvula imenyu enayo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBeka emodelini\u003C/span\u003E. Noma hudula ikhadi, noma isithombe kwiminingwane yento, uliyise epulanini noma kumbono we-3D: into iyabekwa lapho uyilahla khona. Ngepeni noma ngomunwe, cindezela ikhadi isikhashana, bese uhudula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha isitezi ebhareni lokubeka. Kumbono we-3D, izitezi eziphezulu kwaso ziyafihlwa ngenkathi ubeka, nombono uphenduka uye phezulu; epulanini, ipulani sekuvele lelo sitezi. Ukukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBeka emodelini\u003C/span\u003E kusuka epulanini wedwa kuletha umbono we-3D ecaleni kwayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHambisa iphoyinti phezu kwemodeli: ibhokisi elisobala likhombisa lapho into iyokwenza khona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze uyiphendulele ngama-90°. Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubopha kodonga\u003C/span\u003E) ukuze ubeke ingemuva layo eduze kodonga oseduze, ibheke igumbi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza ukuze uyibeke. Noma thayipha isikhundla ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EX, Y (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E, njengo \u003Ccode\u003E1200, 3400\u003C/code\u003E, bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkukhanya noma okunye okuphuza kusuka phezulu: setha \u003Cstrong\u003EUkufaka\u003C/strong\u003E ibe \u003Cstrong\u003EEsilingini\u003C/strong\u003E. Phezulu kwento kuhlala ngaphansi kwesiling ngalowo ndawo (noma ngaphansi kwephezulu lesitezi lapho kungekho siling). Uma kukhona ipulani yesiling epulanini lombono, \u003Cstrong\u003EUkufaka\u003C/strong\u003E iqala ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EEsilingini\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPhendula umbuzo owodwa: \u003Cstrong\u003Einombolo yento\u003C/strong\u003E (inombolo elandelayo etholakalayo igcwaliswa), inani kanye nenothi. Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBeka okunye, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuyeka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGcina njenge-IFC\u003C/span\u003E ukulanda ikhophi eshintshiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ipulani-noma-imodeli\"\u003EIpulani noma imodeli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInkinobho yokubeka ye-Library ilandela umbono onawo, futhi iyashintsha uma ushintsha umbono (izinkinobho \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIpulani\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlukanisa\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E, ikhibhodi, ukuvula ifayela). Ipulani likhombisa inkinobho eyodwa, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBeka epulanini\u003C/span\u003E; i-3D ikhombisa eyodwa, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBeka emodelini\u003C/span\u003E; Split ikhombisa inkinobho ehlukaniswayo, ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBeka epulanini\u003C/span\u003E njengesenzo esiyinhloko ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBeka emodelini\u003C/span\u003E emenyuini yayo. Zombili izindlela zisebenzisa ibha efanayo yokubeka futhi zibhala into efanayo ye-IFC: umlobi usebenza kumbono wepulani kwesinye, futhi kumbono we-3D kwesinye. Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma nini ukuyeka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuhudula ikhadi akunakhiye yalo: inkinobho ehlukaniswayo, noma eyodwa, yenza okufanayo ngekhibhodi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hambisa-noma-uphendulele-into-ebekiwe\"\u003EHambisa noma uphendulele into ebekiwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDweba\u003C/span\u003E, khetha into epulanini. Igridi eyisikwele ibonakala endaweni yokubeka, nesiyingi esiseduze kwayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHudula into, noma igridi yayo eyisikwele, ukuze uyihambise. Iyambambelela njengethuluzi lodonga (imiphetho nobuso bodonga); \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyigcina iqondile kwendawo ayeseyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHudula isiyingi ukuze uyiphendulele ngezinyathelo ezingu-15°. Bamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ngezinyathelo ezingu-1°.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze uyiphendulele ngama-90°.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzici\u003C/strong\u003E (futhi ku-3D view), thayipha \u003Cstrong\u003EX\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EY\u003C/strong\u003E kanye \u003Cstrong\u003ERotation (°)\u003C/strong\u003E, noma chofoza \u003Cstrong\u003ETurn 90°\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuhamba ngakunye yinyathelo elilodwa le-undo futhi kuhamba ku-Live TeamWork. Into igcina inombolo yayo, idatha yayo ye-library kanye nokuphakama kwayo ngaphezu kwesitezi. Akukakhiwa okwamanje: ukuhudula kumbono we-3D.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukubone\"\u003EOkufanele ukubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInto emodelini, ikhethiwe, nezici zayo ngakwesokudla: ibhokisi elithi \u003Cstrong\u003ELibrary item\u003C/strong\u003E nelayisensi nokubonga kwayo, kanye nezethi \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_Placement\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_LibraryItem\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_Equipment\u003C/code\u003E kanye, kwizinto ezivela kumadrowing athegiwe, \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_SourceAttributes\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Placed: \u003Cem\u003Eitem\u003C/em\u003E (item \u003Cem\u003En\u003C/em\u003E)&quot; kuhlu lwezinguquko. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyayihlehlisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmugqa wesimo: &quot;Placed \u003Cem\u003Eitem\u003C/em\u003E as item \u003Cem\u003En\u003C/em\u003E.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukwazi\"\u003EOkufanele ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEzinye izinto zifika ngosayizi noma ngokukhetha okuningi: ikhadi lapho linokukhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EVariant\u003C/strong\u003E, futhi eyodwa oyikhethayo ibekwa. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/library-variants\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/library-variants\"\u003EBeka futhi ushintshe into ye-library enokuhlukahluka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInto engenayo umzimba we-3D (isimpawu se-2D) ibekwa ngebhokisi elibambela; unikeza ukuphakama kwayo lapho ibuzwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOkwengeziwe ngokufanayo: khetha into ebekiwe usebenzise \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKopisha\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENamathisela\u003C/span\u003E, noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/copy-paste\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/copy-paste\"\u003EKopisha, namathisela futhi uphinde uthathe izinto ze-library\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkwenza ukubopha kodonga kuvulwe ekubekeni ngakunye, vula \u003Cstrong\u003EStart with wall snap on\u003C/strong\u003E ku-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/settings\"\u003EIzilungiselelo ze-BimCraft\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUbude bungaguqulwa bube ezingeni lemodeli, noma yiziphi ezinye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEntourage\u003C/strong\u003E (izihlahla, izihlahlana, abantu, izimoto) nayo itholakala kwi-library: sesha &quot;tree&quot;, &quot;person&quot; noma &quot;car&quot;. Lezi zidwetshwe yi-CadCraft (CC0) futhi zigcina imibala yazo lapho zibekwa (isiqu sibe nsundu, amaqabunga aluhlaza, amawindi emoto akwazi ukubonakala), kuBimCraft nakwezinye izinhlelo ze-BIM. Zibonakala ku-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render\"\u003Eizithombe ezinikeziwe\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-IFC2X3 umzimba ubhalwa njenge-faceted solid; ku-IFC4 njenge-triangulated face set. Zombili zivulwa ngamanye amathuluzi e-IFC.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmdwebo (DWG noma DXF) awukwazi ukugcinwa lapha, ngakho izinto zibekwa emamodelini e-IFC kuphela. Sebenzisa \u003Cstrong\u003ELe faela\u003C/strong\u003E kumdwebo ukubona ukuthi amabhulokhi awo angaba yini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinto-ngolimi-lwakho\"\u003EIzinto ngolimi lwakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInto ingaba negama, incazelo nohlobo ngezinye izilimi. Uma inakho ngolimi lwe-BimCraft olusethiwe (Izilungiselelo › Okujwayelekile › Ulimi), ikhasi lento libonisa lezo, negama umenzi wayo alinikeze lingaphansi kwazo, futhi \u003Cstrong\u003EBeka\u003C/strong\u003E ibhala igama ngolimi lwakho emodelini, ukuze uhlu lwezinsiza lulibonise ngalo. Into ihlala iyinto efanayo: ukuhlola izibuyekezo kanye nokushintshwa kwenziwa ngento uqobo, hhayi ngegama layo. Izinto ezingenayo ukuhunyushwa zigcina amagama awo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"iziphazamiso-ezivamile\"\u003EIziphazamiso ezivamile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInkinobho yokubeka ayikho.\u003C/strong\u003E Akukho modeli ye-IFC evuliwe. Vula eyodwa kuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsithombe esingaqinile asilandeli iphoyinti.\u003C/strong\u003E Iphoyinti liphume endaweni yemodeli, noma indiza yesitezi ayikho ebonakalayo. Chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhezulu\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubopha kodonga\u003C/span\u003E kuthi akukho zindonga.\u003C/strong\u003E Isitezi asinazo izindonga ku-IFC (ezinye izinhlelo zokuthumela zibeka izindonga esitezini esihlukile). Khetha lelo sitezi, noma thayipha X no-Y.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinto zefayela zinosayizi ongalungile.\u003C/strong\u003E Ifayela alinayo iyunithi, noma lisho eyingalungile. Ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmafayela…\u003C/span\u003E khetha iyunithi bese ulifunda futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkubeka into efanayo kabili kwabelana ngohlobo olulodwa lwe-IFC, ngakho imodeli enezihlalo ezingu-40 igcina isihlalo kanye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Faka into ye-library emodelini ye-IFC: isinki, itafula lokusebenzela, isihlalo. I-BimCraft iyibhala njengento ye-IFC efanele ngohlobo, ngakho zonke izikhobi zento efanayo zabelana ngesethi eyodwa yejiyomethri, nedatha yayo, inombolo yento kanye nelayisensi kuhamba nayo. Izinyathelo Vula imodeli ye-IFC. Chofoza ithebhu ethi Umtapo eduze kwe-Izici ngakwesokudla, noma Umtapo ebhareni lamathuluzi ngaphezu kwemodeli. Khetha umthombo: Izimpawu ezakhelwe ngaphakathi: izimpawu zepulani zepulumbing ezijwayelekile ezifakwe ku-BimCraft ngaphansi kwe-Apache-2.0, ezitholakala ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi. Hlola ubukhulu bazo ngaphambi kokwakha. Ngezimpawu zepulani zikagesi kanye nezinsiza zikagesi ze-IFC, sebenzisa Ukwakhiwa › Ugesi. Library: i-CadCraft library kulesi sayithi. Izinto zomphakathi azidingi ukungena. Le faela: amabhulokhi omdwebo ovulekile we-DWG noma we-DXF. Ibhulokhi elinamamodi okubonakala linikezwa kanye ngayinye imodi, libizwe ngokuthi \"Sink: Double bowl\", ngayinye idwetshwe ngezinto zalowo mo kuphela. Amafayela…: ifayela le-DWG, DXF, IFC, glTF/GLB, OBJ, RFA noma CSV kwikhompyutha yakho. Lifundwa kule thebhu; akulayishwa noma kumuphi. Imithombo yezinye: enye library esebenzisa ifomethi efanayo yomthombo. Engeza ikheli layo kanye; ligcinwa kulesi siphequluli. Sesha noma khetha isigaba, bese uchofoza ikhadi. Likhombisa ukubukeka kwepulani, igama, umenzi nemodeli, ilayisensi kanye nenguqulo. Chofoza Beka epulanini (kuMbono wePulani) noma Beka emodelini (kuMbono we-3D). Ku-Split, lapho ipulani ne-3D zibonakala ndawonye, inkinobho iyinkinobho ehlukaniswayo: isenzo sayo esiyinhloko yi-Beka epulanini, nomcibisholo wayo ongakwesokudla uvula imenyu enayo Beka emodelini. Noma hudula ikhadi, noma isithombe kwiminingwane yento, uliyise epulanini noma kumbono we-3D: into iyabekwa lapho uyilahla khona. Ngepeni noma ngomunwe, cindezela ikhadi isikhashana, bese uhudula. Khetha isitezi ebhareni lokubeka. Kumbono we-3D, izitezi eziphezulu kwaso ziyafihlwa ngenkathi ubeka, nombono uphenduka uye phezulu; epulanini, ipulani sekuvele lelo sitezi. Ukukhetha Beka emodelini kusuka epulanini wedwa kuletha umbono we-3D ecaleni kwayo. Hambisa iphoyinti phezu kwemodeli: ibhokisi elisobala likhombisa lapho into iyokwenza khona. Cindezela R ukuze uyiphendulele ngama-90°. Cindezela Tab (noma Ukubopha kodonga) ukuze ubeke ingemuva layo eduze kodonga oseduze, ibheke igumbi. Chofoza ukuze uyibeke. Noma thayipha isikhundla ku-X, Y (mm), njengo 1200, 3400, bese ucindezela Enter. Ukukhanya noma okunye okuphuza kusuka phezulu: setha Ukufaka ibe Esilingini. Phezulu kwento kuhlala ngaphansi kwesiling ngalowo ndawo (noma ngaphansi kwephezulu lesitezi lapho kungekho siling). Uma kukhona ipulani yesiling epulanini lombono, Ukufaka iqala ku-Esilingini. Phendula umbuzo owodwa: inombolo yento (inombolo elandelayo etholakalayo igcwaliswa), inani kanye nenothi. Cindezela Enter. Beka okunye, noma cindezela Esc ukuyeka. Chofoza Gcina njenge-IFC ukulanda ikhophi eshintshiwe. Ipulani noma imodeli Inkinobho yokubeka ye-Library ilandela umbono onawo, futhi iyashintsha uma ushintsha umbono (izinkinobho Ipulani, Hlukanisa kanye 3D, ikhibhodi, ukuvula ifayela). Ipulani likhombisa inkinobho eyodwa, Beka epulanini; i-3D ikhombisa eyodwa, Beka emodelini; Split ikhombisa inkinobho ehlukaniswayo, ne-Beka epulanini njengesenzo esiyinhloko ne-Beka emodelini emenyuini yayo. Zombili izindlela zisebenzisa ibha efanayo yokubeka futhi zibhala into efanayo ye-IFC: umlobi usebenza kumbono wepulani kwesinye, futhi kumbono we-3D kwesinye. Cindezela Esc noma nini ukuyeka. Ukuhudula ikhadi akunakhiye yalo: inkinobho ehlukaniswayo, noma eyodwa, yenza okufanayo ngekhibhodi. Hambisa noma uphendulele into ebekiwe Ku-Dweba, khetha into epulanini. Igridi eyisikwele ibonakala endaweni yokubeka, nesiyingi esiseduze kwayo. Hudula into, noma igridi yayo eyisikwele, ukuze uyihambise. Iyambambelela njengethuluzi lodonga (imiphetho nobuso bodonga); Shift iyigcina iqondile kwendawo ayeseyo. Hudula isiyingi ukuze uyiphendulele ngezinyathelo ezingu-15°. Bamba Shift ngezinyathelo ezingu-1°. Cindezela R ukuze uyiphendulele ngama-90°. Ku-Izici (futhi ku-3D view), thayipha X, Y kanye Rotation (°), noma chofoza Turn 90°. Ukuhamba ngakunye yinyathelo elilodwa le-undo futhi kuhamba ku-Live TeamWork. Into igcina inombolo yayo, idatha yayo ye-library kanye nokuphakama kwayo ngaphezu kwesitezi. Akukakhiwa okwamanje: ukuhudula kumbono we-3D. Okufanele ukubone Into emodelini, ikhethiwe, nezici zayo ngakwesokudla: ibhokisi elithi Library item nelayisensi nokubonga kwayo, kanye nezethi CadCraft_Placement, CadCraft_LibraryItem, CadCraft_Equipment kanye, kwizinto ezivela kumadrowing athegiwe, CadCraft_SourceAttributes. \"Placed: item (item n)\" kuhlu lwezinguquko. Ctrl+Z iyayihlehlisa. Umugqa wesimo: \"Placed item as item n.\" Okufanele ukwazi Ezinye izinto zifika ngosayizi noma ngokukhetha okuningi: ikhadi lapho linokukhetha Variant, futhi eyodwa oyikhethayo ibekwa. Bona Beka futhi ushintshe into ye-library enokuhlukahluka. Into engenayo umzimba we-3D (isimpawu se-2D) ibekwa ngebhokisi elibambela; unikeza ukuphakama kwayo lapho ibuzwa. Okwengeziwe ngokufanayo: khetha into ebekiwe usebenzise Kopisha no-Namathisela, noma Ctrl+D. Bona Kopisha, namathisela futhi uphinde uthathe izinto ze-library. Ukwenza ukubopha kodonga kuvulwe ekubekeni ngakunye, vula Start with wall snap on ku-Izilungiselelo ze-BimCraft. Ubude bungaguqulwa bube ezingeni lemodeli, noma yiziphi ezinye. Entourage (izihlahla, izihlahlana, abantu, izimoto) nayo itholakala kwi-library: sesha \"tree\", \"person\" noma \"car\". Lezi zidwetshwe yi-CadCraft (CC0) futhi zigcina imibala yazo lapho zibekwa (isiqu sibe nsundu, amaqabunga aluhlaza, amawindi emoto akwazi ukubonakala), kuBimCraft nakwezinye izinhlelo ze-BIM. Zibonakala ku-izithombe ezinikeziwe. Ku-IFC2X3 umzimba ubhalwa njenge-faceted solid; ku-IFC4 njenge-triangulated face set. Zombili zivulwa ngamanye amathuluzi e-IFC. Umdwebo (DWG noma DXF) awukwazi ukugcinwa lapha, ngakho izinto zibekwa emamodelini e-IFC kuphela. Sebenzisa Le faela kumdwebo ukubona ukuthi amabhulokhi awo angaba yini. Izinto ngolimi lwakho Into ingaba negama, incazelo nohlobo ngezinye izilimi. Uma inakho ngolimi lwe-BimCraft olusethiwe (Izilungiselelo › Okujwayelekile › Ulimi), ikhasi lento libonisa lezo, negama umenzi wayo alinikeze lingaphansi kwazo, futhi Beka ibhala igama ngolimi lwakho emodelini, ukuze uhlu lwezinsiza lulibonise ngalo. Into ihlala iyinto efanayo: ukuhlola izibuyekezo kanye nokushintshwa kwenziwa ngento uqobo, hhayi ngegama layo. Izinto ezingenayo ukuhunyushwa zigcina amagama awo. Iziphazamiso ezivamile Inkinobho yokubeka ayikho. Akukho modeli ye-IFC evuliwe. Vula eyodwa kuqala. Isithombe esingaqinile asilandeli iphoyinti. Iphoyinti liphume endaweni yemodeli, noma indiza yesitezi ayikho ebonakalayo. Chofoza Phezulu. Ukubopha kodonga kuthi akukho zindonga. Isitezi asinazo izindonga ku-IFC (ezinye izinhlelo zokuthumela zibeka izindonga esitezini esihlukile). Khetha lelo sitezi, noma thayipha X no-Y. Izinto zefayela zinosayizi ongalungile. Ifayela alinayo iyunithi, noma lisho eyingalungile. Ku-Amafayela… khetha iyunithi bese ulifunda futhi. Ukubeka into efanayo kabili kwabelana ngohlobo olulodwa lwe-IFC, ngakho imodeli enezihlalo ezingu-40 igcina isihlalo kanye.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"add-ons-in-your-file","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Okwengeziwe ifayela lakho lisebenzisa","summary":"Amanothi e-BimCraft ku-ifayela le-IFC atshela ukuthi yiziphi izinto ezengeziwe ezibhale kulo, futhi akunikeze ukungeza ezingekho lapho ulivula.","section":"tasks","order":151,"keywords":["okwengeziwe","addon","lolu fayela lusebenzisa","okwengeziwe okungekho","trusscraft","umtapo","irekhodi","cadcraft_addons"],"headings":[{"id":"lokhu-kwenza-ini","text":"Lokhu kwenza ini","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"izinkinga-ezivamile","text":"Izinkinga ezivamile","level":2},{"id":"okulandelayo","text":"Okulandelayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"lokhu-kwenza-ini\"\u003ELokhu kwenza ini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma okwengeziwe kubhala emodelini (ithrasi, umugqa wepayipi), i-BimCraft iqopha okwengeziwe nenguqulo yakho ku-IFC project, ku-property set ebizwa ngokuthi CadCraft_AddOns. Irekhodi libhalwa ngesinyathelo esifanayo sokuhlehlisa njengoshintsho lwalokho kwengeziwe, ngakho ukuhlehlisa lolo shintsho nalo kususa irekhodi. Ezinye izinhlelo zilinaka i-property set; okwadwetshwa yilokho kwengeziwe kuhlala kufayela noma kunjalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula ifayela le-IFC okwasiza okwengeziwe ukulenza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma okwengeziwe okusisebenzisile kungavuliwe, kukhona inothi phezu kwemodeli elitshela ukuthi yiziphi, nenkinobho yokuzengeza kwi-akhawunti yakho yoMtapo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EZengeza, noma vala inothi. Imodeli iyavuleka kokubili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinkinga-ezivamile\"\u003EIzinkinga ezivamile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkukho nothi elivela.\u003C/strong\u003E Awungeni ku-akhawunti yakho kule thebhu, noma ifayela alinarekhodi (lenziwe ngaphambi kwamarekhodi, noma ngohlelo olunye).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUhlu lwezinguquko lubhala &quot;undefined&quot;.\u003C/strong\u003E Kulungisiwe: amalebula manje akhombisa igama lokwengeziwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulandelayo\"\u003EOkulandelayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/place-from-library\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/place-from-library\"\u003EFaka izinsiza nempahla emtapweni\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Lokhu kwenza ini Uma okwengeziwe kubhala emodelini (ithrasi, umugqa wepayipi), i-BimCraft iqopha okwengeziwe nenguqulo yakho ku-IFC project, ku-property set ebizwa ngokuthi CadCraft_AddOns. Irekhodi libhalwa ngesinyathelo esifanayo sokuhlehlisa njengoshintsho lwalokho kwengeziwe, ngakho ukuhlehlisa lolo shintsho nalo kususa irekhodi. Ezinye izinhlelo zilinaka i-property set; okwadwetshwa yilokho kwengeziwe kuhlala kufayela noma kunjalo. Izinyathelo Vula ifayela le-IFC okwasiza okwengeziwe ukulenza. Uma okwengeziwe okusisebenzisile kungavuliwe, kukhona inothi phezu kwemodeli elitshela ukuthi yiziphi, nenkinobho yokuzengeza kwi-akhawunti yakho yoMtapo. Zengeza, noma vala inothi. Imodeli iyavuleka kokubili. Izinkinga ezivamile Akukho nothi elivela. Awungeni ku-akhawunti yakho kule thebhu, noma ifayela alinarekhodi (lenziwe ngaphambi kwamarekhodi, noma ngohlelo olunye). Uhlu lwezinguquko lubhala \"undefined\". Kulungisiwe: amalebula manje akhombisa igama lokwengeziwe. Okulandelayo Faka izinsiza nempahla emtapweni","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"swap-and-update-library-items","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Shintsha into ebekiwe, ubuyekeze izinto ezivela emtapweni","summary":"Yenza esinye isinto esibekiwe emtapweni sishintshwe ngesinye ngenkathi ugcina indawo yaso nenombolo yaso, bese uhlola iMtapo ukuthola izinguqulo ezintsha zakho konke okusemodeli.","section":"tasks","order":151,"keywords":["shintsha","faka esikhundleni","thatha indawo","buyekeza","inguqulo entsha","hlola izibuyekezo","umtapo","ihoshiwe","ukushintsha kwelayisense","inombolo yento"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"shintsha-into-eyodwa","text":"Shintsha into eyodwa","level":2},{"id":"hlola-izibuyekezo","text":"Hlola izibuyekezo","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukubone","text":"Okufanele ukubone","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-wazi","text":"Okufanele wazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShintsha umqondo wakho ngento ngaphandle kokuyihambisa futhi, bese ugcina izinto zomtapo kumodeli zisesikhathini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shintsha-into-eyodwa\"\u003EShintsha into eyodwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza into yomtapo ebekiwe emodelini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzici\u003C/span\u003E, chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShintsha into…\u003C/span\u003E ebhokisini i-\u003Cstrong\u003ELibrary item\u003C/strong\u003E. Ithebhu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmtapo\u003C/span\u003E iyavuleka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThola into entsha bese uchofoza ikhadi layo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShintsha … ibe lolu\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInto igcina indawo yayo, ukujika kwayo, isitezi, inombolo yento, inani nezinqaku. Uhlobo lwayo, isimo nedatha yayo kushintsha kube yinto entsha. Izinto ezibekwe ngendlela efanayo zabelana ngohlobo olufanayo, njengalapho uzibeka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInto enezinhlobo ezihlukahlukene (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/library-variants\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/library-variants\"\u003EBeka futhi ushintshe into yomtapo enezinhlobo\u003C/a\u003E) ibala ezinye izinhlobo zayo phezulu kwethebhu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmtapo\u003C/span\u003E lapho uyishintsha: ukuchofoza kukodwa kwalowo nalowo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma into entsha iwuhlobo oluhlukile lwento, isibonelo isinki esikhundleni setafula, ikilasi le-IFC lento liyashintsha lifane nalo (lapha lisuka kwisakhiwo sefenisha lisiye kwisiphelo sokuhlanza). Ihlala iyinto efanayo, ne-GlobalId efanayo, ngakho izixhumanisi kuyo ziyasebenza. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ibuyisa ikilasi elidala kanye nento endala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlola-izibuyekezo\"\u003EHlola izibuyekezo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzibuyekezo\u003C/span\u003E kumbhalo wamathuluzi (noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlola izibuyekezo\u003C/span\u003E ebhokisini yento yomtapo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFunda uhlu: yonke into yomtapo emodelini ngenguqulo yayo emodelini, inguqulo entsha kakhulu nesimo: \u003Cstrong\u003EUp to date\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ENewer version\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EWithdrawn\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003ENot found\u003C/strong\u003E. Futhi itshela ukuthi yini eshintshile (ijometri, idatha, ilayisense noma ukulungiswa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuyekeza\u003C/span\u003E esihlanganeni, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuyekeza konke\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukubone\"\u003EOkufanele ukubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Buyekezwe \u003Cem\u003En\u003C/em\u003E izibeka. Izibeka, izinombolo zento, izinani nezinqaku ziyagcinwa.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImigqa ethi &quot;Buyekezwe: \u003Cem\u003Einto\u003C/em\u003E&quot; kuhlu lwezinguquko. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyahlehlisa ngayinye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-wazi\"\u003EOkufanele wazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKuphela izinto ezivela emtapweni ziyahlolwa. Izinto ezivela emafayelini azinayo inombolo yomtapo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma ilayisense ishintsha, ikhophi osuyibekile igcina ilayisense eyayo kuze kube yilapho uyibuyekeza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInto \u003Cstrong\u003EWithdrawn\u003C/strong\u003E ayinikezwa ukubekwa okusha. Eyayo ngenxa yamalungelo okushicilela ayikwazi ukulandwa; yishintshe nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShintsha into…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInhlobo ebekiwe igcina ukuba yinhlobo yayo uma inguqulo entsha yento inayo; uma ingenayo, ithatha inhlobo ezenzakalelayo yento.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuhlola kuthumela izinombolo zezinto nezinguqulo kuphela, akuthumeli imodeli yakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Shintsha umqondo wakho ngento ngaphandle kokuyihambisa futhi, bese ugcina izinto zomtapo kumodeli zisesikhathini. Shintsha into eyodwa Chofoza into yomtapo ebekiwe emodelini. Ku-Izici, chofoza Shintsha into… ebhokisini i-Library item. Ithebhu Umtapo iyavuleka. Thola into entsha bese uchofoza ikhadi layo. Chofoza Shintsha … ibe lolu. Into igcina indawo yayo, ukujika kwayo, isitezi, inombolo yento, inani nezinqaku. Uhlobo lwayo, isimo nedatha yayo kushintsha kube yinto entsha. Izinto ezibekwe ngendlela efanayo zabelana ngohlobo olufanayo, njengalapho uzibeka. Into enezinhlobo ezihlukahlukene (bheka Beka futhi ushintshe into yomtapo enezinhlobo) ibala ezinye izinhlobo zayo phezulu kwethebhu Umtapo lapho uyishintsha: ukuchofoza kukodwa kwalowo nalowo. Uma into entsha iwuhlobo oluhlukile lwento, isibonelo isinki esikhundleni setafula, ikilasi le-IFC lento liyashintsha lifane nalo (lapha lisuka kwisakhiwo sefenisha lisiye kwisiphelo sokuhlanza). Ihlala iyinto efanayo, ne-GlobalId efanayo, ngakho izixhumanisi kuyo ziyasebenza. Ctrl+Z ibuyisa ikilasi elidala kanye nento endala. Hlola izibuyekezo Chofoza Izibuyekezo kumbhalo wamathuluzi (noma Hlola izibuyekezo ebhokisini yento yomtapo). Funda uhlu: yonke into yomtapo emodelini ngenguqulo yayo emodelini, inguqulo entsha kakhulu nesimo: Up to date, Newer version, Withdrawn noma Not found. Futhi itshela ukuthi yini eshintshile (ijometri, idatha, ilayisense noma ukulungiswa). Chofoza Buyekeza esihlanganeni, noma Buyekeza konke. Okufanele ukubone \"Buyekezwe n izibeka. Izibeka, izinombolo zento, izinani nezinqaku ziyagcinwa.\" Imigqa ethi \"Buyekezwe: into\" kuhlu lwezinguquko. Ctrl+Z iyahlehlisa ngayinye. Okufanele wazi Kuphela izinto ezivela emtapweni ziyahlolwa. Izinto ezivela emafayelini azinayo inombolo yomtapo. Uma ilayisense ishintsha, ikhophi osuyibekile igcina ilayisense eyayo kuze kube yilapho uyibuyekeza. Into Withdrawn ayinikezwa ukubekwa okusha. Eyayo ngenxa yamalungelo okushicilela ayikwazi ukulandwa; yishintshe nge-Shintsha into…. Inhlobo ebekiwe igcina ukuba yinhlobo yayo uma inguqulo entsha yento inayo; uma ingenayo, ithatha inhlobo ezenzakalelayo yento. Ukuhlola kuthumela izinombolo zezinto nezinguqulo kuphela, akuthumeli imodeli yakho.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"plant-list","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Faka izitshalo kusuka ku-Library","summary":"Khetha isitshalo kumthombo we-Library ethi Plants, nesimpawu saso sepulani nosayizi ekuvuthweni, bese usibeka emodelini.","section":"tasks","order":152,"keywords":["izitshalo","izihlahla","izihlahlana","ukuhlobiswa kwezindawo","izinhlobo","uhlu lwezitshalo","library","cc0","isimpawu","usayizi ekuvuthweni"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukubone","text":"Okufanele ukubone","level":2},{"id":"okulandelayo","text":"Okulandelayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBeka izitshalo emodelini yesakhiwo. Umthombo we-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzitshalo\u003C/span\u003E we-Library unohlu lwezitshalo ezingaba ngu-400 ezibhalwe yi-CadCraft (CC0), ngayinye inesimpawu sayo sepulani nosayizi wayo ekuvuthweni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmtapo\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesokudla bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzitshalo\u003C/span\u003E njengomthombo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESesha noma khetha isitshalo, bese usibeka njengoba ubeka noma yiyiphi into ye-Library.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukubone\"\u003EOkufanele ukubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUhlu luvela ku-Library uma usuxhunyiwe ku-inthanethi, ngakho izitshalo ezengezwe khona ziyavela. Ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi, noma uma i-Library ingafinyeleleki, i-BimCraft ikhombisa uhlu lwezitshalo elinalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsitshalo ngasinye sigcina igama, usayizi nelayisensi yaso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulandelayo\"\u003EOkulandelayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/place-from-library\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/place-from-library\"\u003EBeka izinsiza nofenisha kusuka ku-library\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Beka izitshalo emodelini yesakhiwo. Umthombo we-Izitshalo we-Library unohlu lwezitshalo ezingaba ngu-400 ezibhalwe yi-CadCraft (CC0), ngayinye inesimpawu sayo sepulani nosayizi wayo ekuvuthweni. Izinyathelo Vula Umtapo ngakwesokudla bese ukhetha Izitshalo njengomthombo. Sesha noma khetha isitshalo, bese usibeka njengoba ubeka noma yiyiphi into ye-Library. Okufanele ukubone Uhlu luvela ku-Library uma usuxhunyiwe ku-inthanethi, ngakho izitshalo ezengezwe khona ziyavela. Ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi, noma uma i-Library ingafinyeleleki, i-BimCraft ikhombisa uhlu lwezitshalo elinalo. Isitshalo ngasinye sigcina igama, usayizi nelayisensi yaso. Okulandelayo Beka izinsiza nofenisha kusuka ku-library","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"library-credits","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Hlola izikweletu zomtapo bese ungena emtapweni","summary":"Bona zonke izinto zomtapo ezisetshenziswe kumodeli ngelayisensi nokubhalwa kwazo, kopisha izikweletu noma uzilande nohlu, bese ungena ukuze ubone izinto zethimba lakho.","section":"tasks","order":152,"keywords":["izikweletu","ukubhalwa","ilayisensi","cc by","cc0","ilungelo lokushicilela","umtapo wethimba","ngena","xhuma","ukhiye","uhlu lwezinsiza","csv"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izikweletu-zomtapo","text":"Izikweletu zomtapo","level":2},{"id":"uhlu-lwezinsiza-zemodeli","text":"Uhlu lwezinsiza zemodeli","level":2},{"id":"ngena-emtapweni","text":"Ngena emtapweni","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukubone","text":"Okufanele ukubone","level":2},{"id":"okuwusizo-ukukwazi","text":"Okuwusizo ukukwazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENika ukubonga lapho ilayisensi iphoqelela, bese ufinyelela izinto zomtapo zethimba lakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izikweletu-zomtapo\"\u003EIzikweletu zomtapo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula imodeli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECredits\u003C/span\u003E kwithuluzi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFunda uhlu: ngayinye into esetshenzisiwe, inguqulo yayo, ilayisensi, ukubhalwa kwayo nezinombolo zezinto ezibekwe njengazo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy credits\u003C/span\u003E ukukopisha imigqa yokubhalwa, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV with the schedule\u003C/span\u003E ukuthola ishidi lamanani lakho lonke ukubekwa nezikweletu zakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIlayisensi nokubhalwa nakho kuboniswa ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E uma ukhetha into ebekiwe, futhi kugcinwa ku-IFC (\u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_LibraryItem\u003C/code\u003E), ngakho zihamba nefayela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uhlu-lwezinsiza-zemodeli\"\u003EUhlu lwezinsiza zemodeli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEquipment\u003C/span\u003E kwithuluzi. Uhlu lwakhiwa kusuka ezintweni zomtapo ezibekiwe: inombolo yento, inani, igama, umkhiqizi, imodeli, idatha kagesi namapayipi, ihlelwe ngezitezi. Lilandwa njenge-CSV efanayo naleyo yeshejuli yomdwebo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ngena-emtapweni\"\u003ENgena emtapweni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-ithebhu ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELibrary\u003C/span\u003E, khetha \u003Cstrong\u003EUmtapo\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESign in to the library\u003C/span\u003E. Iwindi elincane livula kule sayithi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgena uma ucelwa, bese uchofoza \u003Cstrong\u003EXhuma\u003C/strong\u003E. Iwindi linikeza i-BimCraft ukhiye womtapo, futhi ungawuvala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukubone\"\u003EOkufanele ukubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Ungene emtapweni&quot; phezulu kuhlu lomtapo. Izinto zethimba lakho zivela ngasese zomphakathi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinto ozibekayo ziyarekhodwa njengezisetshenzisiwe, ukuze umtapo ukwazise uma zishintsha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuwusizo-ukukwazi\"\u003EOkuwusizo ukukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkhiye ugcinwa kuleli thebhu kuphela futhi uphela uma uvala. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EForget sign-in\u003C/span\u003E uyawukhipha ngaphambi kwesikhathi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIkhasi lokuphepha le-akhawunti yakho lidabula ukhiye njenge-&quot;BimCraft library (browser)&quot;; wuhoxise lapho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkukho okuthunyelwa ngemodeli yakho: kuthunyelwa kuphela ukuthi yeziphi izinto zomtapo ozibekile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Nika ukubonga lapho ilayisensi iphoqelela, bese ufinyelela izinto zomtapo zethimba lakho. Izikweletu zomtapo Vula imodeli. Chofoza Credits kwithuluzi. Funda uhlu: ngayinye into esetshenzisiwe, inguqulo yayo, ilayisensi, ukubhalwa kwayo nezinombolo zezinto ezibekwe njengazo. Chofoza Copy credits ukukopisha imigqa yokubhalwa, noma CSV with the schedule ukuthola ishidi lamanani lakho lonke ukubekwa nezikweletu zakho. Ilayisensi nokubhalwa nakho kuboniswa ku-Properties uma ukhetha into ebekiwe, futhi kugcinwa ku-IFC (CadCraft_LibraryItem), ngakho zihamba nefayela. Uhlu lwezinsiza zemodeli Chofoza Equipment kwithuluzi. Uhlu lwakhiwa kusuka ezintweni zomtapo ezibekiwe: inombolo yento, inani, igama, umkhiqizi, imodeli, idatha kagesi namapayipi, ihlelwe ngezitezi. Lilandwa njenge-CSV efanayo naleyo yeshejuli yomdwebo. Ngena emtapweni Ku-ithebhu ethi Library, khetha Umtapo. Chofoza Sign in to the library. Iwindi elincane livula kule sayithi. Ngena uma ucelwa, bese uchofoza Xhuma. Iwindi linikeza i-BimCraft ukhiye womtapo, futhi ungawuvala. Okufanele ukubone \"Ungene emtapweni\" phezulu kuhlu lomtapo. Izinto zethimba lakho zivela ngasese zomphakathi. Izinto ozibekayo ziyarekhodwa njengezisetshenzisiwe, ukuze umtapo ukwazise uma zishintsha. Okuwusizo ukukwazi Ukhiye ugcinwa kuleli thebhu kuphela futhi uphela uma uvala. Forget sign-in uyawukhipha ngaphambi kwesikhathi. Ikhasi lokuphepha le-akhawunti yakho lidabula ukhiye njenge-\"BimCraft library (browser)\"; wuhoxise lapho. Akukho okuthunyelwa ngemodeli yakho: kuthunyelwa kuphela ukuthi yeziphi izinto zomtapo ozibekile.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"library-variants","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Beka futhi ushintshe into yomtapo enezinhlobo","summary":"Ezinye izinto zomtapo zifika ngosayizi noma izinketho ezahlukene. Khetha uhlobo ngaphambi kokubeka, bona okuthile okubekiwe kuwo, ushintshe ube enye ngokuchofoza kanye, bese uyigcina lapho into ibuyekezwa.","section":"tasks","order":153,"keywords":["uhlobo","izinhlobo","usayizi","izinketho","ukulungiselela","umtapo","librarycraft","beka","shintsha","umndeni","buyekeza","amaport"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"khetha-uhlobo-bese-ubeka","text":"Khetha uhlobo bese ubeka","level":2},{"id":"bona-uhlobo-lwento-ebekiwe","text":"Bona uhlobo lwento ebekiwe","level":2},{"id":"shintsha-ibe-olunye-uhlobo","text":"Shintsha ibe olunye uhlobo","level":2},{"id":"kopisha-namathisela-nokubuyekeza","text":"Kopisha, namathisela nokubuyekeza","level":2},{"id":"okuwusizo-ukukwazi","text":"Okuwusizo ukukwazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBeka into yomtapo ngosayizi noma ngenketho odinga, bese ushintsha umqondo wakho kamuva ngaphandle kokuyibeka futhi. Into enezinhlobo ingento eyodwa emtapweni (igama elilodwa, ilayisensi eyodwa, inguqulo eyodwa) enetafula lezinhlobo ezifika kuzo: isibonelo ipuleyiti yokumisa ngo-Encane, Ephakathi ne-Enkulu, noma ipuleyiti efanayo ngaphandle kwezimbobo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khetha-uhlobo-bese-ubeka\"\u003EKhetha uhlobo bese ubeka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula ithebhu ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELibrary\u003C/span\u003E bese uchofoza ikhadi lento.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphansi kwegama, inketho ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVariant\u003C/span\u003E ibala zonke izinhlobo ngosayizi wazo. Into eyisimo yokuqala ikhethwa kuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha enye. Ipulani, usayizi nomzimba we-3D kulandela ukukhetha kwakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlace in plan\u003C/span\u003E (noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlace in model\u003C/span\u003E kumbono we-3D) ubeke njengakho konke izinto: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/place-from-library\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/place-from-library\"\u003EBeka izinsiza nempahla evela emtapweni\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsakhi esibekiwe sibizwa ngegama lento nohlobo lwayo, isibonelo \u003Cem\u003EIpuleyiti yokumisa — Enkulu\u003C/em\u003E, ukuze uhlu lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEquipment\u003C/span\u003E nesihlahla kuyihlukanise. Uhlobo ngalunye lulolwayo lwe-IFC: ukubeka uhlobo olufanayo kabili kwabelana ngohlobo olulodwa, uhlobo olwahlukile lunohlobo lwalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bona-uhlobo-lwento-ebekiwe\"\u003EBona uhlobo lwento ebekiwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha isakhi. Ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E, ibhokisi le-\u003Cstrong\u003EInto yomtapo\u003C/strong\u003E linomugqa othi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVariant\u003C/span\u003E. I-IFC igcina kona ku-\u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_LibraryItem\u003C/code\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003EVariant\u003C/code\u003E (i-id yohlobo), \u003Ccode\u003EVariantName\u003C/code\u003E no-\u003Ccode\u003EVariantValues\u003C/code\u003E (amanani wenketho, njengombhalo), ukuze ezinye izinhlelo zikwazi ukuyifunda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shintsha-ibe-olunye-uhlobo\"\u003EShintsha ibe olunye uhlobo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha isakhi esibekiwe bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESwap item…\u003C/span\u003E kubhokisi le-\u003Cstrong\u003EInto yomtapo\u003C/strong\u003E. Ithebhu ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELibrary\u003C/span\u003E iyavula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPhezulu, \u003Cstrong\u003EEzinye izinhlobo ze\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cem\u003Einto\u003C/em\u003E ibala zonke izinhlobo ngosayizi wazo. Eyebekiwe iyamakwa futhi ayikwazi ukukhethwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShintsha ibe …\u003C/span\u003E ohlobweni olufunayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsakhi siyagcina indawo yaso, ukuphenduka, isitezi, inombolo yento, inani namanothi; uhlobo lwaso, ukwakheka kwaso nedatha kuyashintsha kuye kolunye uhlobo. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ibuyisela okokuqala. Ungakhetha noma yisiphi esinye isinto kuhlu oluphansi, njengakuqala: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/swap-and-update-library-items\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/swap-and-update-library-items\"\u003EShintsha isakhi esibekiwe, bese ubuyekeza izinto zomtapo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kopisha-namathisela-nokubuyekeza\"\u003EKopisha, namathisela nokubuyekeza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIkhophi yohlobo olubekiwe ingohlobo olufanayo: kule modeli, nakwenye imodeli evulwe kuthebhu yesiphequluli efanayo, ngoKopisha nokuNamathisela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkubuyekeza\u003C/strong\u003E kugcina uhlobo: uma inguqulo entsha yento inalo, ukubekwa kuba lolohlobo lwenguqulo entsha. Uma inguqulo entsha ingasenalo, ukubekwa kuthatha uhlobo oluzenzakalelayo lwento.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuwusizo-ukukwazi\"\u003EOkuwusizo ukukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEzinye izinto zomtapo zinezinhlobo kuphela. Amakhadi awasho lokho; ubona ukhetho \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVariant\u003C/span\u003E uma uvula enye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInto ingaba nama-\u003Cstrong\u003Eamaport\u003C/strong\u003E (amaphoyinti okuxhuma amapayipi namadakhithi) ngohlobo ngalunye. Ithebhu yomtapo ikhombisa ukuthi uhlobo ngalunye lunawangaki. Awabhalwa ku-IFC uma ubeka into ngokusuka ethebhini yomtapo okwamanje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUhlobo olungenalo umzimba we-3D lubekwa ngebhokisi elimelela, njengoba kwenzeka noma yisiphi isimboli ye-2D.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUsayizi osekhethweni ulinganiswa ngamamilimitha, njengoba umtapo uwabhala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Beka into yomtapo ngosayizi noma ngenketho odinga, bese ushintsha umqondo wakho kamuva ngaphandle kokuyibeka futhi. Into enezinhlobo ingento eyodwa emtapweni (igama elilodwa, ilayisensi eyodwa, inguqulo eyodwa) enetafula lezinhlobo ezifika kuzo: isibonelo ipuleyiti yokumisa ngo-Encane, Ephakathi ne-Enkulu, noma ipuleyiti efanayo ngaphandle kwezimbobo. Khetha uhlobo bese ubeka Vula ithebhu ethi Library bese uchofoza ikhadi lento. Ngaphansi kwegama, inketho ethi Variant ibala zonke izinhlobo ngosayizi wazo. Into eyisimo yokuqala ikhethwa kuqala. Khetha enye. Ipulani, usayizi nomzimba we-3D kulandela ukukhetha kwakho. Chofoza Place in plan (noma Place in model kumbono we-3D) ubeke njengakho konke izinto: bona Beka izinsiza nempahla evela emtapweni. Isakhi esibekiwe sibizwa ngegama lento nohlobo lwayo, isibonelo Ipuleyiti yokumisa — Enkulu, ukuze uhlu lwe-Equipment nesihlahla kuyihlukanise. Uhlobo ngalunye lulolwayo lwe-IFC: ukubeka uhlobo olufanayo kabili kwabelana ngohlobo olulodwa, uhlobo olwahlukile lunohlobo lwalo. Bona uhlobo lwento ebekiwe Khetha isakhi. Ku-Properties, ibhokisi le-Into yomtapo linomugqa othi Variant. I-IFC igcina kona ku-CadCraft_LibraryItem: Variant (i-id yohlobo), VariantName no-VariantValues (amanani wenketho, njengombhalo), ukuze ezinye izinhlelo zikwazi ukuyifunda. Shintsha ibe olunye uhlobo Khetha isakhi esibekiwe bese uchofoza Swap item… kubhokisi le-Into yomtapo. Ithebhu ethi Library iyavula. Phezulu, Ezinye izinhlobo ze into ibala zonke izinhlobo ngosayizi wazo. Eyebekiwe iyamakwa futhi ayikwazi ukukhethwa. Chofoza Shintsha ibe … ohlobweni olufunayo. Isakhi siyagcina indawo yaso, ukuphenduka, isitezi, inombolo yento, inani namanothi; uhlobo lwaso, ukwakheka kwaso nedatha kuyashintsha kuye kolunye uhlobo. Ctrl+Z ibuyisela okokuqala. Ungakhetha noma yisiphi esinye isinto kuhlu oluphansi, njengakuqala: bona Shintsha isakhi esibekiwe, bese ubuyekeza izinto zomtapo. Kopisha, namathisela nokubuyekeza Ikhophi yohlobo olubekiwe ingohlobo olufanayo: kule modeli, nakwenye imodeli evulwe kuthebhu yesiphequluli efanayo, ngoKopisha nokuNamathisela. Ukubuyekeza kugcina uhlobo: uma inguqulo entsha yento inalo, ukubekwa kuba lolohlobo lwenguqulo entsha. Uma inguqulo entsha ingasenalo, ukubekwa kuthatha uhlobo oluzenzakalelayo lwento. Okuwusizo ukukwazi Ezinye izinto zomtapo zinezinhlobo kuphela. Amakhadi awasho lokho; ubona ukhetho Variant uma uvula enye. Into ingaba nama-amaport (amaphoyinti okuxhuma amapayipi namadakhithi) ngohlobo ngalunye. Ithebhu yomtapo ikhombisa ukuthi uhlobo ngalunye lunawangaki. Awabhalwa ku-IFC uma ubeka into ngokusuka ethebhini yomtapo okwamanje. Uhlobo olungenalo umzimba we-3D lubekwa ngebhokisi elimelela, njengoba kwenzeka noma yisiphi isimboli ye-2D. Usayizi osekhethweni ulinganiswa ngamamilimitha, njengoba umtapo uwabhala.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"undo-across-apps","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Hlehlisa kuzo izinhlelo ku-CadCraft Studio","summary":"Ngaphakathi kwe-Studio, i-BimCraft itshela i-Studio ngayo yonke isinyathelo esiqediwe, ukuze i-Studio ikwazi ukuhlehlisa isinyathelo sakho sokugcina kunoma iyiphi iwindi osebenze kuyo ekugcineni.","section":"tasks","order":153,"keywords":["hlehlisa","studio","kuzo zonke izinhlelo","hlehlisa iphrojekthi","umlando","ijenali","iwindi"],"headings":[{"id":"lokho-akwenzayo","text":"Lokho akwenzayo","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-wazi","text":"Okufanele wazi","level":2},{"id":"okulandelayo","text":"Okulandelayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"lokho-akwenzayo\"\u003ELokho akwenzayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-CadCraft Studio, iwindi ngalinye lohlelo litshela i-Studio lapho isinyathelo siqediwe (udonga oludwetshiwe, isethi yezindonga ezamukelwe ekuskenweni). I-Studio igcina lezo zinyathelo ngokulandelana owasebenza ngakho futhi ingacela iwindi elenze isinyathelo sakamuva ukuthi lihlehlise, lisebenzisa ukuhlehlisa kwalo okwalo. Ctrl+Z ngaphakathi kwe-BimCraft ihlala iyeyayo ngokwayo futhi nayo iyatshelwa i-Studio.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-wazi\"\u003EOkufanele wazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-Studio icela iwindi ukuthi lihlehlise kuphela uma uhlu lwalo lokuhlehlisa lufana ngqo nendlela isinyathelo sashiya ngayo. Emva kokuthi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza\u003C/span\u003E (lokho kuqala uhlu olusha lwezinguquko) noma emva kokushintsha imodeli oyihlela, i-BimCraft iphendula ukuthi uhlu lushintshile futhi i-Studio iwudlula lo windi. Akukho okuphoqwayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuhlehlisa imiphumela yohlelo olulodwa kwelinye akukakwakhiwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphandle kwe-Studio akukho okushintshayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInto yemenyu ye-Studio ecela ukuhlehlisa iza nesakhiwo se-Studio; kuze kube yilapho, izinyathelo ziyabikwa kodwa akukho nto yemenyu esizisebenzisayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulandelayo\"\u003EOkulandelayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/work-live\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/work-live\"\u003ESebenza ngokuphila nabanye\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Lokho akwenzayo Ku-CadCraft Studio, iwindi ngalinye lohlelo litshela i-Studio lapho isinyathelo siqediwe (udonga oludwetshiwe, isethi yezindonga ezamukelwe ekuskenweni). I-Studio igcina lezo zinyathelo ngokulandelana owasebenza ngakho futhi ingacela iwindi elenze isinyathelo sakamuva ukuthi lihlehlise, lisebenzisa ukuhlehlisa kwalo okwalo. Ctrl+Z ngaphakathi kwe-BimCraft ihlala iyeyayo ngokwayo futhi nayo iyatshelwa i-Studio. Okufanele wazi I-Studio icela iwindi ukuthi lihlehlise kuphela uma uhlu lwalo lokuhlehlisa lufana ngqo nendlela isinyathelo sashiya ngayo. Emva kokuthi Londoloza (lokho kuqala uhlu olusha lwezinguquko) noma emva kokushintsha imodeli oyihlela, i-BimCraft iphendula ukuthi uhlu lushintshile futhi i-Studio iwudlula lo windi. Akukho okuphoqwayo. Ukuhlehlisa imiphumela yohlelo olulodwa kwelinye akukakwakhiwa. Ngaphandle kwe-Studio akukho okushintshayo. Into yemenyu ye-Studio ecela ukuhlehlisa iza nesakhiwo se-Studio; kuze kube yilapho, izinyathelo ziyabikwa kodwa akukho nto yemenyu esizisebenzisayo. Okulandelayo Sebenza ngokuphila nabanye","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"copy-paste","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Kopisha, namathisela futhi phinda izinto zomtapo","summary":"Kopisha into yomtapo ebekiwe bese unamathisela lapho ucofa khona, endaweni eseduze nomthombo, noma kwenye imodeli; kopisha izici zanoma yiziphi ezinye izakhi njengombhalo; hlehlisa nophinde wenze.","section":"tasks","order":155,"keywords":["kopisha","namathisela","phinda","iklipiboodi","namathisela endaweni","sika","susa","khetha konke","hlehlisa","phinda wenze","imenyu yokuhlela","okuningi","into yomtapo","ukubekwa","phindaphinda","uhlu lwezinto"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"namathisela-endaweni","text":"Namathisela endaweni","level":2},{"id":"phinda","text":"Phinda","level":2},{"id":"kwenye-imodeli-noma-kwenye-ithebhu","text":"Kwenye imodeli noma kwenye ithebhu","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukubone","text":"Okufanele ukubone","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukwazi","text":"Okufanele ukwazi","level":2},{"id":"iziphazamiso-ezivamile","text":"Iziphazamiso ezivamile","level":2},{"id":"okuhlobene","text":"Okuhlobene","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYenza amakhophi amaningi ento owe wayibeka kakade: itafula lesibili lokusebenzela, umugqa wamasinki. Lesi sihloko sikhuluma ngezinto zomtapo ezibekiwe, izakhi ezibhalwe yi-BimCraft emodelini: enye yazo ingamanamathiselwa kunoma iyiphi imodeli, ngisho nakwenye ithebhu. Izindonga, iminyango kanye nezinye izakhi zonke zikopishwa, zisikwe, zinamathiselwe futhi zisulwe ngendlela efanayo ngaphakathi kwemodeli yazo: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/edit-elements\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/edit-elements\"\u003ESusa, sika, kopisha namathisele izakhi zesakhiwo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImiyalo itholakala kwibha yamathuluzi ngaphezulu kwemodeli: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlehlisa\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhinda wenze\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKopisha\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENamathisela\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkuningi\u003C/span\u003E, imenyu enezinto ezi-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESika\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKopisha\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENamathisela\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENamathisela endaweni\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhinda\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha konke\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha lutho\u003C/span\u003E. Umyalo ongenakwenza okuthile manje uba mpunga; hambisa iphoyinti phezu kwawo ukuze ufunde ukuthi kungani, noma uwucofe futhi umugqa wesimo uzokutshela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula imodeli ye-IFC enento yomtapo, noma beka enye kuqala. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/place-from-library\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/place-from-library\"\u003EBeka izinto zomtapo nezingxenye zokufakelwa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECofa into ku-3D view. Izimfanelo zayo zibonisa ibhokisi elithi \u003Cstrong\u003EInto yomtapo\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECofa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKopisha\u003C/span\u003E noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECofa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENamathisela\u003C/span\u003E noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Ibha yokubeka iyavula, futhi ibhokisi elibonakalayo lilandela iphoyinti, lijikiswe njengoba kunjalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze uyijikise ngama-90°, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze ihlanganise emuva kwayo kudonga, noma uthayipha X no-Y kwibha yokubeka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECofa lapho ikhophi lihamba khona. Ukucofa ngakunye kubeka ikhophi elilodwa; cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze umise.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECofa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGcina njenge-IFC\u003C/span\u003E ukuze ulande ikhophi elihlelwe lemodeli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"namathisela-endaweni\"\u003ENamathisela endaweni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkuningi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENamathisela endaweni\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command V\"\u003E⇧⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E unamathisela ngaphandle kokucofa, ku-X ne-Y efanayo nangokujikijela okufanayo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEmodelini efanayo, esitezini esifanayo\u003C/strong\u003E: izinto ezimbili endaweni eyodwa azisizi, ngakho ikhophi lihamba eduze nomthombo, ububanzi bento eyodwa kuphezu kwe-100 mm ngobude bayo. Namathisela endaweni futhi kusuka kwikhophi elisha ukuze wenze umugqa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEsitezini esihlukile noma kwenye imodeli\u003C/strong\u003E: i-X, i-Y nokujikijela okufanayo ngokuphelele. I-BimCraft isebenzisa isitezi esinegama elifanayo; uma singekho, kuthathwa eyeduze kakhulu ngobude. Umugqa wesimo uyatshela ukuthi yiyiphi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"phinda\"\u003EPhinda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkuningi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhinda\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ikopisha into ekhethiwe bese iqala ukuyinamathisela ngokushesha: isinyathelo esisodwa esikhundleni sezimbili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kwenye-imodeli-noma-kwenye-ithebhu\"\u003EKwenye imodeli noma kwenye ithebhu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkukopishwe kugcinwa kulesi siphequluli, ngakho ungavula enye imodeli ye-IFC, noma i-BimCraft kwenye ithebhu, bese unamathisela khona. Lowo modeli udinga into yomtapo ngokwayo: i-BimCraft iyayibhekile uma into ibekiwe, ishintshwe noma ibuyekezwe kule thebhu. Into ebekwe enkathini yangaphambili ingenamathiselwa kuphela emodelini yayo; kwenye imodeli, yibeke kusuka kuthebhu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmtapo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukubone\"\u003EOkufanele ukubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIkhophi emodelini, likhethiwe, linento efanayo yomtapo, ilayisense, idatha yezinsimbi, inani kanye nenothi njengomthombo, \u003Cstrong\u003Ekanye nenombolo elandelayo ekhululekile yento\u003C/strong\u003E. Shintsha inombolo kuMaphrophathi, ngaphansi kwe-\u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_Placement\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Kubekiwe: \u003Cem\u003Einto\u003C/em\u003E (into \u003Cem\u003En\u003C/em\u003E)&quot; ohlwini lwezinguquko. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyayihlehlisa; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyibuyisela futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukwazi\"\u003EOkufanele ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmakhophi ahlanganyela uhlobo lomthombo, ngakho onke asebenzisa isethi eyodwa yejometri, njengalapho ubeka into efanayo kabili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlehlisa\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhinda wenze\u003C/span\u003E bamboza zonke izinguquko: izinani ohlelile, ukubekwa, ukunamathisela, ukushintshwa nokubuyekezwa. Phinda wenze ibuyisela ukubekwa endaweni efanayo; inguquko entsha isula lokho okungenziwa ukuphinda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKumbonakalo we-2D wedwebo akukho okungakhethwa, ngakho akukho okungakopishwa. Sebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlela ku-CadCraft\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uguqule idwebo, uma likhona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"iziphazamiso-ezivamile\"\u003EIziphazamiso ezivamile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENamathisela\u003C/span\u003E uthi izakhi zavela kwenye imodeli.\u003C/strong\u003E Okokugcina owakopisha kwakuyisakhi sesakhiwo, noma izakhi eziningi: lezo zinamathiselwa emodelini yazo kuphela. Khetha into eyodwa yomtapo ebekiwe bese uyikopisha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENamathisela\u003C/span\u003E uthi ikhophi lavela kwenye imodeli ngaphandle kwento yomtapo.\u003C/strong\u003E Beka into kusuka kuthebhu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmtapo\u003C/span\u003E kule thebhu kanye, bese uyikopisha futhi uyinamathisele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ikopisha umbhalo wekhasi esikhundleni.\u003C/strong\u003E Umbhalo wawukhethiwe ekhasini. Cofa imodeli kuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuhlobene\"\u003EOkuhlobene\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/keyboard#edit\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/keyboard\" data-hash=\"edit\"\u003EOkhiye nemouse\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/settings\"\u003EIzilungiselelo ze-BimCraft\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Yenza amakhophi amaningi ento owe wayibeka kakade: itafula lesibili lokusebenzela, umugqa wamasinki. Lesi sihloko sikhuluma ngezinto zomtapo ezibekiwe, izakhi ezibhalwe yi-BimCraft emodelini: enye yazo ingamanamathiselwa kunoma iyiphi imodeli, ngisho nakwenye ithebhu. Izindonga, iminyango kanye nezinye izakhi zonke zikopishwa, zisikwe, zinamathiselwe futhi zisulwe ngendlela efanayo ngaphakathi kwemodeli yazo: bona Susa, sika, kopisha namathisele izakhi zesakhiwo. Imiyalo itholakala kwibha yamathuluzi ngaphezulu kwemodeli: Hlehlisa, Phinda wenze, Kopisha, Namathisela kanye Okuningi, imenyu enezinto ezi-Sika, Kopisha, Namathisela, Namathisela endaweni, Phinda, Susa, Khetha konke kanye Khetha lutho. Umyalo ongenakwenza okuthile manje uba mpunga; hambisa iphoyinti phezu kwawo ukuze ufunde ukuthi kungani, noma uwucofe futhi umugqa wesimo uzokutshela. Izinyathelo Vula imodeli ye-IFC enento yomtapo, noma beka enye kuqala. Bona Beka izinto zomtapo nezingxenye zokufakelwa. Cofa into ku-3D view. Izimfanelo zayo zibonisa ibhokisi elithi Into yomtapo. Cofa Kopisha noma cindezela Ctrl+C. Cofa Namathisela noma cindezela Ctrl+V. Ibha yokubeka iyavula, futhi ibhokisi elibonakalayo lilandela iphoyinti, lijikiswe njengoba kunjalo. Cindezela R ukuze uyijikise ngama-90°, Tab ukuze ihlanganise emuva kwayo kudonga, noma uthayipha X no-Y kwibha yokubeka. Cofa lapho ikhophi lihamba khona. Ukucofa ngakunye kubeka ikhophi elilodwa; cindezela Esc ukuze umise. Cofa Gcina njenge-IFC ukuze ulande ikhophi elihlelwe lemodeli. Namathisela endaweni Okuningi, Namathisela endaweni noma Ctrl+Shift+V unamathisela ngaphandle kokucofa, ku-X ne-Y efanayo nangokujikijela okufanayo: Emodelini efanayo, esitezini esifanayo: izinto ezimbili endaweni eyodwa azisizi, ngakho ikhophi lihamba eduze nomthombo, ububanzi bento eyodwa kuphezu kwe-100 mm ngobude bayo. Namathisela endaweni futhi kusuka kwikhophi elisha ukuze wenze umugqa. Esitezini esihlukile noma kwenye imodeli: i-X, i-Y nokujikijela okufanayo ngokuphelele. I-BimCraft isebenzisa isitezi esinegama elifanayo; uma singekho, kuthathwa eyeduze kakhulu ngobude. Umugqa wesimo uyatshela ukuthi yiyiphi. Phinda Okuningi, Phinda noma Ctrl+D ikopisha into ekhethiwe bese iqala ukuyinamathisela ngokushesha: isinyathelo esisodwa esikhundleni sezimbili. Kwenye imodeli noma kwenye ithebhu Okukopishwe kugcinwa kulesi siphequluli, ngakho ungavula enye imodeli ye-IFC, noma i-BimCraft kwenye ithebhu, bese unamathisela khona. Lowo modeli udinga into yomtapo ngokwayo: i-BimCraft iyayibhekile uma into ibekiwe, ishintshwe noma ibuyekezwe kule thebhu. Into ebekwe enkathini yangaphambili ingenamathiselwa kuphela emodelini yayo; kwenye imodeli, yibeke kusuka kuthebhu ye-Umtapo. Okufanele ukubone Ikhophi emodelini, likhethiwe, linento efanayo yomtapo, ilayisense, idatha yezinsimbi, inani kanye nenothi njengomthombo, kanye nenombolo elandelayo ekhululekile yento. Shintsha inombolo kuMaphrophathi, ngaphansi kwe-CadCraft_Placement. \"Kubekiwe: into (into n)\" ohlwini lwezinguquko. Ctrl+Z iyayihlehlisa; Ctrl+Y iyibuyisela futhi. Okufanele ukwazi Amakhophi ahlanganyela uhlobo lomthombo, ngakho onke asebenzisa isethi eyodwa yejometri, njengalapho ubeka into efanayo kabili. Hlehlisa no-Phinda wenze bamboza zonke izinguquko: izinani ohlelile, ukubekwa, ukunamathisela, ukushintshwa nokubuyekezwa. Phinda wenze ibuyisela ukubekwa endaweni efanayo; inguquko entsha isula lokho okungenziwa ukuphinda. Kumbonakalo we-2D wedwebo akukho okungakhethwa, ngakho akukho okungakopishwa. Sebenzisa Hlela ku-CadCraft ukuze uguqule idwebo, uma likhona. Iziphazamiso ezivamile Namathisela uthi izakhi zavela kwenye imodeli. Okokugcina owakopisha kwakuyisakhi sesakhiwo, noma izakhi eziningi: lezo zinamathiselwa emodelini yazo kuphela. Khetha into eyodwa yomtapo ebekiwe bese uyikopisha. Namathisela uthi ikhophi lavela kwenye imodeli ngaphandle kwento yomtapo. Beka into kusuka kuthebhu ye-Umtapo kule thebhu kanye, bese uyikopisha futhi uyinamathisele. Ctrl+C ikopisha umbhalo wekhasi esikhundleni. Umbhalo wawukhethiwe ekhasini. Cofa imodeli kuqala. Okuhlobene Okhiye nemouse Izilungiselelo ze-BimCraft","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"edit-elements","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Susa, sika, kopisha futhi unamathisele izakhi zesakhiwo","summary":"Khetha izindonga, iminyango, impahla noma noma yini enye kumodeli ye-IFC; zisuse, zisike, noma uzikopishe uzinamathisele lapho uchofoza khona, endaweni yazo, noma esitezini esihlukile.","section":"tasks","order":156,"keywords":["susa","cima","sika","kopisha","namathisela","phinda","hambisa","khetha konke","khetha zonke","izakhi zesakhiwo","udonga","umnyango","iwindi","uphahla","izinyathelo","ukuvuleka","hlehlisa"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okuhamba-nesakhi","text":"Okuhamba nesakhi","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukubone","text":"Okufanele ukubone","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-wazi","text":"Okufanele wazi","level":2},{"id":"izinkinga-ezivamile","text":"Izinkinga ezivamile","level":2},{"id":"okuhlobene","text":"Okuhlobene","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShintsha okusemodelini ye-IFC: susa izakhi ongazidingi, kopisha udonga noma isethi yempahla uyithumele endaweni enye, noma uhambise izakhi ngokusika nokunamathisela. Yonke inguquko iyisinyathelo esisodwa osikwazi ukusihlehlisa, nokulondoloza kudala ifayela elisha, ngakho umthombo wakho uhlala njengoba wawunjalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula imodeli ye-IFC. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/open-ifc-model\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/open-ifc-model\"\u003EVula imodeli ye-IFC ubheke ku-3D\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha okufuna ukushintsha: chofoza isakhi, bamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uchofoze ukuze ukhethe okwengeziwe, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkuningi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhetha konke\u003C/span\u003E) ukuze ukhethe zonke izakhi ezibonakalayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBese:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESusa:\u003C/strong\u003E cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkuningi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKopisha:\u003C/strong\u003E cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKopisha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESika:\u003C/strong\u003E cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command X\"\u003E⌘X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkuningi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESika\u003C/span\u003E. Izakhi ziyanyamalala, futhi ungazinamathisela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuze unamathisele, cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENamathisela\u003C/span\u003E. Ibhokisi elibonakala kancane, elifana nobukhulu balokho okukopishile, lilandela isikhombi esitezini elikhethwe kubha yokubeka. Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze uyiphendulele ngama-90°, bese uchofoza lapho okufanele ibe khona. Ukuchofoza ngakunye kubeka ikhophi entsha; cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze uyeke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENoma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command V\"\u003E⇧⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkuningi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENamathisela endaweni\u003C/span\u003E): emva kokusika izakhi zibuyela endaweni ezazikuyo ngqo; emva kokukopisha ikhophi ifika eduze kwezakhi zoqobo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGcina njenge-IFC\u003C/span\u003E ukuze ulande imodeli eshintshiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuhamba-nesakhi\"\u003EOkuhamba nesakhi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzingxenye:\u003C/strong\u003E isitebhisi sithatha izinqwaba zaso, udonga lwekhathini lithatha amaphaneli alo, noma yini eyenziwe ngezingxenye ithatha zonke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuvuleka:\u003C/strong\u003E udonga luthatha ukuvuleka okusikwe kulo. Ukususa umnyango noma iwindi kususa nokuvuleka okwakugcwalisa, ukuze udonga luvale, njengoba kwenzeka kuhlelo lokudweba. Ukususa udonga odwetswe ku-BimCraft kususe nemiyango namawindi alo, bese izindonga ezisele ziyaxhunyiwa. Ukususa udonga kufayela elenziwe kwenye indawo kushiya iminyango namawindi alo lapho ayekhona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIdatha:\u003C/strong\u003E ikhophi inohlobo, izinto, amasethi ezici kanye nezinani njengomthombo, futhi inesihlonzi esisha se-GlobalId. Ukushintsha inani ekhophini kamuva akushintshi umthombo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinto zelabhulari\u003C/strong\u003E zigcina idatha yazo yelabhulari; ikhophi ithola inombolo yesinto elandelayo, nento esikiwe ebuyiselwe ngemuva igcina eyayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukubone\"\u003EOkufanele ukubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Kususiwe: …&quot; noma &quot;Kunamathisiwe: …&quot; ohlwini \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinguquko\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ibuyisela inguquko yokugcina; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyibuyisela futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEmva kokususa, ulayini wesimo utshela ukuthi izingxenye nezivuleko ezingaki nazo zisusiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzakhi ezinamathisiwe zikhethiwe, ngakho ungazinamathisela endaweni yazo futhi ukwenze umugqa, noma uzisuse.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-wazi\"\u003EOkufanele wazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmakhophi asebenzisa ijometri efanayo nomthombo (i-IFC ivumela izakhi ukwabelana ngayo), ngakho ifayela likhula kancane kakhulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzakhi zesakhiwo ezinamathisiwe zingena kumodeli ezikopishwe kuyo, kuthebhu efanayo. Ukusebenzisa izinto zelabhulari ezibekiwe kwenye imodeli, kopisha into eyodwa ngesikhathi: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/copy-paste\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/copy-paste\"\u003EKopisha, namathisela nophinde ukhiphe izinto zelabhulari\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzitezi, izikhala, izakhiwo nendawo yesakhiwo azikwazi ukususwa noma ukukopishwa. Khetha izakhi ezikuzo kunalokho. Igumbi elidwetswe ku-BimCraft livela ezindongeni ezilizungezile: susa udonga ukuze uhlanganise amagumbi amabili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzindonga, iminyango namawindi edwetswe ngamathuluzi wakhe e-BimCraft awakwazi ukukopishwa, ukusikwa noma ukuphindwa okwamanje; ulayini wesimo uyatshela lokho. Zidwebe futhi. Ukususa kuyasebenza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkukopisha kubuye kubeke amagama nezici zento okukopishwe yona ebhodini lakho lokopisha njengombhalo, ukuze unamathisele kuspredshithi noma ku-i-imeyili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinkinga-ezivamile\"\u003EIzinkinga ezivamile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa\u003C/span\u003E ishaywe ngegrey.\u003C/strong\u003E Akukho okukhethiwe, noma kukhethwe izitezi noma izikhala kuphela. Yibheke ukuze ufunde ukuthi kungani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkunamathisela kuthi izakhi zivela kwenye imodeli.\u003C/strong\u003E Uvule enye imodeli kusukela lapho uzikopishe khona. Vula imodeli yokuqala futhi uzikopishe lapho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIkhophi enamathisiwe isesitezini esihlukile.\u003C/strong\u003E Ibha yokubeka ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsitezi\u003C/span\u003E inquma lapho ifika khona; khetha isitezi ngaphambi kokuchofoza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuhlobene\"\u003EOkuhlobene\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\"\u003EFihla, hlukanisa futhi ubone izakhi ngokuthe xaxa\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/keyboard#edit\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/keyboard\" data-hash=\"edit\"\u003EOkokhiye nemouse\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Shintsha okusemodelini ye-IFC: susa izakhi ongazidingi, kopisha udonga noma isethi yempahla uyithumele endaweni enye, noma uhambise izakhi ngokusika nokunamathisela. Yonke inguquko iyisinyathelo esisodwa osikwazi ukusihlehlisa, nokulondoloza kudala ifayela elisha, ngakho umthombo wakho uhlala njengoba wawunjalo. Izinyathelo Vula imodeli ye-IFC. Bona Vula imodeli ye-IFC ubheke ku-3D. Khetha okufuna ukushintsha: chofoza isakhi, bamba Ctrl noma Shift uchofoze ukuze ukhethe okwengeziwe, noma cindezela Ctrl+A (Okuningi, Khetha konke) ukuze ukhethe zonke izakhi ezibonakalayo. Bese: Susa: cindezela Delete, noma Okuningi, Susa. Kopisha: cindezela Ctrl+C noma chofoza Kopisha. Sika: cindezela Ctrl+X, noma Okuningi, Sika. Izakhi ziyanyamalala, futhi ungazinamathisela. Ukuze unamathisele, cindezela Ctrl+V noma chofoza Namathisela. Ibhokisi elibonakala kancane, elifana nobukhulu balokho okukopishile, lilandela isikhombi esitezini elikhethwe kubha yokubeka. Cindezela R ukuze uyiphendulele ngama-90°, bese uchofoza lapho okufanele ibe khona. Ukuchofoza ngakunye kubeka ikhophi entsha; cindezela Esc ukuze uyeke. Noma cindezela Ctrl+Shift+V (Okuningi, Namathisela endaweni): emva kokusika izakhi zibuyela endaweni ezazikuyo ngqo; emva kokukopisha ikhophi ifika eduze kwezakhi zoqobo. Chofoza Gcina njenge-IFC ukuze ulande imodeli eshintshiwe. Okuhamba nesakhi Izingxenye: isitebhisi sithatha izinqwaba zaso, udonga lwekhathini lithatha amaphaneli alo, noma yini eyenziwe ngezingxenye ithatha zonke. Ukuvuleka: udonga luthatha ukuvuleka okusikwe kulo. Ukususa umnyango noma iwindi kususa nokuvuleka okwakugcwalisa, ukuze udonga luvale, njengoba kwenzeka kuhlelo lokudweba. Ukususa udonga odwetswe ku-BimCraft kususe nemiyango namawindi alo, bese izindonga ezisele ziyaxhunyiwa. Ukususa udonga kufayela elenziwe kwenye indawo kushiya iminyango namawindi alo lapho ayekhona. Idatha: ikhophi inohlobo, izinto, amasethi ezici kanye nezinani njengomthombo, futhi inesihlonzi esisha se-GlobalId. Ukushintsha inani ekhophini kamuva akushintshi umthombo. Izinto zelabhulari zigcina idatha yazo yelabhulari; ikhophi ithola inombolo yesinto elandelayo, nento esikiwe ebuyiselwe ngemuva igcina eyayo. Okufanele ukubone \"Kususiwe: …\" noma \"Kunamathisiwe: …\" ohlwini Izinguquko. Ctrl+Z ibuyisela inguquko yokugcina; Ctrl+Y iyibuyisela futhi. Emva kokususa, ulayini wesimo utshela ukuthi izingxenye nezivuleko ezingaki nazo zisusiwe. Izakhi ezinamathisiwe zikhethiwe, ngakho ungazinamathisela endaweni yazo futhi ukwenze umugqa, noma uzisuse. Okufanele wazi Amakhophi asebenzisa ijometri efanayo nomthombo (i-IFC ivumela izakhi ukwabelana ngayo), ngakho ifayela likhula kancane kakhulu. Izakhi zesakhiwo ezinamathisiwe zingena kumodeli ezikopishwe kuyo, kuthebhu efanayo. Ukusebenzisa izinto zelabhulari ezibekiwe kwenye imodeli, kopisha into eyodwa ngesikhathi: bona Kopisha, namathisela nophinde ukhiphe izinto zelabhulari. Izitezi, izikhala, izakhiwo nendawo yesakhiwo azikwazi ukususwa noma ukukopishwa. Khetha izakhi ezikuzo kunalokho. Igumbi elidwetswe ku-BimCraft livela ezindongeni ezilizungezile: susa udonga ukuze uhlanganise amagumbi amabili. Izindonga, iminyango namawindi edwetswe ngamathuluzi wakhe e-BimCraft awakwazi ukukopishwa, ukusikwa noma ukuphindwa okwamanje; ulayini wesimo uyatshela lokho. Zidwebe futhi. Ukususa kuyasebenza. Ukukopisha kubuye kubeke amagama nezici zento okukopishwe yona ebhodini lakho lokopisha njengombhalo, ukuze unamathisele kuspredshithi noma ku-i-imeyili. Izinkinga ezivamile Susa ishaywe ngegrey. Akukho okukhethiwe, noma kukhethwe izitezi noma izikhala kuphela. Yibheke ukuze ufunde ukuthi kungani. Ukunamathisela kuthi izakhi zivela kwenye imodeli. Uvule enye imodeli kusukela lapho uzikopishe khona. Vula imodeli yokuqala futhi uzikopishe lapho. Ikhophi enamathisiwe isesitezini esihlukile. Ibha yokubeka ye-Isitezi inquma lapho ifika khona; khetha isitezi ngaphambi kokuchofoza. Okuhlobene Fihla, hlukanisa futhi ubone izakhi ngokuthe xaxa Okokhiye nemouse","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"move-align-distribute","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Hambisa, kopisha, linganisa futhi sabalalisa izinto zesakhiwo","summary":"Hambisa izindonga, amafulowa, insika nezinto zethala ezibekiwe ngephoyinti lokuqala nephoyinti lesibili noma ibanga oliphrintile, zikopishe njengoba uqhubeka, bese uzilinganisa noma uzibeke zilingane, epulanini noma ngokukhetha ku-3D.","section":"tasks","order":157,"keywords":["hambisa","kopisha","linganisa","sabalalisa","ibanga","ukuthuthwa","iphoyinti lokuqala","ukunyakaza","izindonga","insika","amafulowa","MOVE","ALIGN","DISTRIBUTE","Shift+M"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"amagama-nokhiye","text":"Amagama nokhiye","level":2},{"id":"hambisa","text":"Hambisa","level":2},{"id":"linganisa","text":"Linganisa","level":2},{"id":"sabalalisa","text":"Sabalalisa","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHambisa udonga, ifulowa, insika noma into yethala ebekiwe iye endaweni entsha, yenze amakhophi ayo, noma uhlele izinto eziningi, ungazidwebanga futhi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amagama-nokhiye\"\u003EAmagama nokhiye\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImiyalo ibizwa ngokuthi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinganisa\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESabalalisa\u003C/span\u003E, ungathayipha \u003Ccode\u003EMOVE\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EALIGN\u003C/code\u003E no-\u003Ccode\u003EDISTRIBUTE\u003C/code\u003E komugqa womyalo, njengoba kwenziwa ku-drafting app ye-CadCraft. Umehluko owodwa: ku-BimCraft \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ingu-Linganisa (Measure), ngakho u-Hambisa unokhiye wakhe, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift M\"\u003E⇧M\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+M\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Amathuluzi atholakala kumenyu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkwakhiwa\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hambisa\"\u003EHambisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha okuzohanjiswa, epulanini noma ku-3D view. Izindonga, amafulowa, insika nezinto zethala ezibekiwe zonke zingakhethwa ngokukhethwa okukodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift M\"\u003E⇧M\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+M\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza iphoyinti lesisekelo, bese iphoyinti lesibili. Noma, emva kwephoyinti lesisekelo, thayipha ibanga bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: liyohamba ngendlela ophawula ngayo ukusuka ephoyinteni lesisekelo. Ungathayipha futhi \u003Ccode\u003Edx,dy\u003C/code\u003E (noma \u003Ccode\u003E@dx,dy\u003C/code\u003E), noma \u003Ccode\u003Eubude&lt;i-engeli\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuvula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKopisha\u003C/span\u003E: yonke ukuhamba kuzokwenza amakhophi futhi kulungele okulandelayo. Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuyima.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKokubili amaphoyinti angachofozwa nasku-3D view: nge-Hambisa ivuliwe, isikhombi sihlangana nobude befulowa lezinga, ngakho ukuchofoza lapho kuyiphoyinti lepulani. Bamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uchofoze ukukhetha into enye. Sebenzisa ipulani, phezulu, phambili noma uhlangothi njengoba ufisa: amaphoyinti ahlala esezingeni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUdonga luhamba nemisebe yalo namafasitela. Ifulowa elidwetshwe lihamba namavulo alo. Amagumbi, amafulowa nezilingi ezilandela izindonga ayavuselelwa. Izindonga ezixhumene nodonga oluhanjisiwe zihlala lapho zazikhona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuhanjiswa ngakunye kuyinguquko eyodwa: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E eyodwa iyayihlehlisa, futhi iyafika kubo bonke ku-Live TeamWork session. Into yethala ebekiwe ayikwazi ukukopishwa ngale ndlela; sebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlela\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKopisha\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENamathisela\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"linganisa\"\u003ELinganisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha izinto ezimbili noma ngaphezulu, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinganisa\u003C/span\u003E, bese uhlangothi (kwesobunxele, esiphakathi, kwesokudla, phezulu, phakathi noma ngaphansi) kanye nalokho okuzolinganiswa kukho: isethi ekhethiwe, okokuqala okukhethiwe, okokugcina okukhethiwe, noma iphoyinti oliphephe. Cindezela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinganisa\u003C/span\u003E kwibha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sabalalisa\"\u003ESabalalisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha izinto ezintathu noma ngaphezulu, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESabalalisa\u003C/span\u003E, bese uqondisa (ngokuhambisana noma phansi) kanye nokusabalala: amagebe alinganayo phakathi kwazo noma amaphakathi alinganayo. Izinto ezisemaphethelweni amabili zihlala lapho zazikhona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzindonga ezilinganiswa noma ezisabalaliswa ziyawagcina amajoyini azo, njengoba kwenziwa ku-Hambisa: udonga oluxhunywe nodonga oluhanjisiwe luhamba ngomkhawulo waluhle ngomugqa walo ukuze luhlale luxhunyiwe, izindonga zokuhlukanisa ezigxumela kulo ziyahamba nalo, nezindonga ezimbili ezixhunyiwe ezombili ezihanjisiwe zigcina ikhona lazo lapho imigqa emisha ihlangana khona. Amagumbi ahlala evaliwe. Kuyisinyathelo esisodwa ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinguquko\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Hambisa udonga, ifulowa, insika noma into yethala ebekiwe iye endaweni entsha, yenze amakhophi ayo, noma uhlele izinto eziningi, ungazidwebanga futhi. Amagama nokhiye Imiyalo ibizwa ngokuthi Hambisa, Linganisa no-Sabalalisa, ungathayipha MOVE, ALIGN no-DISTRIBUTE komugqa womyalo, njengoba kwenziwa ku-drafting app ye-CadCraft. Umehluko owodwa: ku-BimCraft M ingu-Linganisa (Measure), ngakho u-Hambisa unokhiye wakhe, Shift+M. Amathuluzi atholakala kumenyu Ukwakhiwa. Hambisa Khetha okuzohanjiswa, epulanini noma ku-3D view. Izindonga, amafulowa, insika nezinto zethala ezibekiwe zonke zingakhethwa ngokukhethwa okukodwa. Cindezela Shift+M noma khetha Hambisa. Chofoza iphoyinti lesisekelo, bese iphoyinti lesibili. Noma, emva kwephoyinti lesisekelo, thayipha ibanga bese ucindezela Enter: liyohamba ngendlela ophawula ngayo ukusuka ephoyinteni lesisekelo. Ungathayipha futhi dx,dy (noma @dx,dy), noma ubude\u003Ci-engeli. Cindezela C ukuvula Kopisha: yonke ukuhamba kuzokwenza amakhophi futhi kulungele okulandelayo. Cindezela Esc ukuyima. Kokubili amaphoyinti angachofozwa nasku-3D view: nge-Hambisa ivuliwe, isikhombi sihlangana nobude befulowa lezinga, ngakho ukuchofoza lapho kuyiphoyinti lepulani. Bamba Shift uchofoze ukukhetha into enye. Sebenzisa ipulani, phezulu, phambili noma uhlangothi njengoba ufisa: amaphoyinti ahlala esezingeni. Udonga luhamba nemisebe yalo namafasitela. Ifulowa elidwetshwe lihamba namavulo alo. Amagumbi, amafulowa nezilingi ezilandela izindonga ayavuselelwa. Izindonga ezixhumene nodonga oluhanjisiwe zihlala lapho zazikhona. Ukuhanjiswa ngakunye kuyinguquko eyodwa: Ctrl+Z eyodwa iyayihlehlisa, futhi iyafika kubo bonke ku-Live TeamWork session. Into yethala ebekiwe ayikwazi ukukopishwa ngale ndlela; sebenzisa Hlela › Kopisha no-Namathisela. Linganisa Khetha izinto ezimbili noma ngaphezulu, khetha Linganisa, bese uhlangothi (kwesobunxele, esiphakathi, kwesokudla, phezulu, phakathi noma ngaphansi) kanye nalokho okuzolinganiswa kukho: isethi ekhethiwe, okokuqala okukhethiwe, okokugcina okukhethiwe, noma iphoyinti oliphephe. Cindezela Linganisa kwibha. Sabalalisa Khetha izinto ezintathu noma ngaphezulu, khetha Sabalalisa, bese uqondisa (ngokuhambisana noma phansi) kanye nokusabalala: amagebe alinganayo phakathi kwazo noma amaphakathi alinganayo. Izinto ezisemaphethelweni amabili zihlala lapho zazikhona. Izindonga ezilinganiswa noma ezisabalaliswa ziyawagcina amajoyini azo, njengoba kwenziwa ku-Hambisa: udonga oluxhunywe nodonga oluhanjisiwe luhamba ngomkhawulo waluhle ngomugqa walo ukuze luhlale luxhunyiwe, izindonga zokuhlukanisa ezigxumela kulo ziyahamba nalo, nezindonga ezimbili ezixhunyiwe ezombili ezihanjisiwe zigcina ikhona lazo lapho imigqa emisha ihlangana khona. Amagumbi ahlala evaliwe. Kuyisinyathelo esisodwa ku-Izinguquko.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"trace-pens-stairs-obj","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Landela izinga, setha amapeni ngombono, dweba isitebhisi, vula i-OBJ","summary":"Bonisa elinye izinga ngaphansi kwephlani ngamachashaza bese uliqondanisa, nikeza izindonga, iminyango namawindi ipeni yayo embonweni owodwa, dweba umugqa wokuhamba ukuze uthole isitebhisi, bese uvula imeshi ye-Wavefront OBJ.","section":"tasks","order":158,"keywords":["isethenjwa","ithunzi","ingaphansi","ipeni","ububanzi bomugqa","uhlobo lomugqa","ukuphoqa","isitebhisi","isketshi","isiteshi sokuphumula","OBJ","imeshi","ukungenisa","Wavefront"],"headings":[{"id":"landela-izinga","text":"Landela izinga","level":2},{"id":"amapeni-ngombono","text":"Amapeni ngombono","level":2},{"id":"isitebhisi-esivela-esketshini","text":"Isitebhisi esivela esketshini","level":2},{"id":"vula-i-obj","text":"Vula i-OBJ","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"landela-izinga\"\u003ELandela izinga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELandela\u003C/span\u003E kumenyu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkwakhiwa\u003C/span\u003E, bese ukhetha ombono kuhlu: ephlanini lelinye izinga, ephlanini lophahla lwangaphakathi lezinga, noma isibizo sesigaba (esisikwe ngomkhawulo waso). Izindonga, izinsika namaphansi alo kubonakala ngamachashaza ngaphansi kwephlani ozwela kulo. Yihambise ngokuchofoza iphoyinti lesisekelo esisethenjwa bese uchofoza lapho leliphoyinti kufanele liye khona, noma uthayiphe X, Y nengeneli (iyajikeleza ngaphakathi kwayo). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESetha kabusha\u003C/span\u003E iyabuyisela, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFihla\u003C/span\u003E iyayisusa. Yisethenjwa kuphela: akukho okuyikhethayo, ayiphrintwa futhi ayigcinwa ku-IFC. I-BimCraft iyakhumbula kusiphequluli lesi ukuthi ulandele kanjani izinga ngalinye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amapeni-ngombono\"\u003EAmapeni ngombono\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmapeni\u003C/span\u003E. Chaza ukuthi ipeni ilani: zonke izindonga, zonke iminyango, zonke amawindi, uhlobo lwento ekhethiwe, noma izinto ezikhethiwe. Khetha ububanzi, umugqa (oqinile, onamachashaza, onamaphoyinti) nombala, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESebenzisa\u003C/span\u003E. Ushintsho lusebenza kuphlani lwalelizinga kuphela. Ukukhetha kunqoba uhlobo, nohlobo lunqoba isigaba sonke. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESula konke\u003C/span\u003E iyakususa. Zigcinwa kulesi siphequluli. Thikha \u003Cstrong\u003EImibala yamapeni ku-3D\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze upeyinte amapeni emibala emodelini kwi-3D view; ububanzi noma ukudashwa kumugqa kuwuhlobo lomugqa, ngakho imibala kuphela ibonakala lapho; susa ithikhi ukuze ubuyele emuva. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhrinta\u003C/span\u003E iwadweba kwi-PDF yephlani: ububanzi buskala kusuka kusikrini (ipeni elizenzakalelayo lodonga elingu-1.75 amapixel ngu-0.5 mm), izindawo zokudasha zihlala zidashi, nombala uphrinta ngenani lawo lesihloko sephepha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isitebhisi-esivela-esketshini\"\u003EIsitebhisi esivela esketshini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDweba isitebhisi\u003C/span\u003E bese uchofoza amakhona womugqa wokuhamba, isinyathelo esiphansi kuqala. Umugqa owodwa uyisitebhisi esiqondile, imigqa emibili ehlangana ngengeneli eqondile iyi-L, nemigqa emithathu (phezulu, phambili, emuva) iyi-U. Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukudweba isiteshi sokuphumula: chofoza amakhona alo bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E; uhlangothi lwalo olufushane luyibeka ububanzi besitebhisi. Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukubeka isitebhisi. Inyathelo ngalinye libalwa ngobude bomugqa wakho nenani lezinyathelo ezidingwa ukuphakama. Ngemva kwalokho kuyisitebhisi esijwayelekile: shintsha kuIzici, bese umgodi wesitebhisi nezibambelelo ziyalandela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThikha \u003Cstrong\u003EYenza ibe umndeni\u003C/strong\u003E kumugqa wethuluzi (noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) ngaphambi kwe-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze ubeke isitebhisi njengomndeni (isitebhisi esiqondile, i-L noma i-U). Ifika njengento eyodwa bese ivula kumhleli womndeni nobubanzi bayo, inyathelo, ukuphakama okuphelele, izinyathelo zendiza ngayinye nebanga le-U njengamapharamitha, ukuze wengeze izilinganiso, uphawu lwephlani noma ama-hotspot. Izinyathelo nokuphakama kwezinyathelo kulandela kuwo. Alinazo izibambelelo noma umgodi wesitebhisi: lezo zingezesitebhisi esijwayelekile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vula-i-obj\"\u003EVula i-OBJ\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula ifayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.obj\u003C/code\u003E njengakunoma iyiphi enye ifayela. I-OBJ alinayo izinyunithi, ngakho i-BimCraft ifunda amamitha nge-Y ephezulu, njengoba izinhlelo eziningi zilibhala. Yonke into noma iqembu iba yinto eyodwa yemeshi ezingeni elilodwa, bese ungayibona, uyilinganise, uyisike, uyibeke emodelini futhi uyigcine njenge-IFC. Imigqa, amajika nezindawo ziyashiywa, futhi umugqa wesimo uyakutshela lokho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInto eyiphrizimu ngokuphelele (imeshi evaliwe enezindawo ezimbili ezilingana ngokuphelele nezinhlangothi ezingqondile kuzo: ifulegi, ipositi, ibhulokhi lodonga, ipuleti ngezimbobo) igcinwa ku-IFC njengevolumu eqinile yakwa-IFC enesakhiwo sayo nobujula, hhayi ohlu lwezinxantathu. Ezinye izinhleloziyifunda njengevolumu eqinile, ayikhulu, futhi ubujula nesakhiwo sayo kungahlelwa kamuva. Umugqa wesimo utshela ukuthi zingaki izinto ezigcinwe ngale ndlela. Okungeyona iphrizimu ngokuqinisekile (isimo esincipha, imeshi lapho ikhona elilodwa lishintshwe, imeshi enegebe) kuhlala kungezinxantathu. Ifayela le-STEP lifundwa ngendlela efanayo.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Landela izinga Khetha Landela kumenyu Ukwakhiwa, bese ukhetha ombono kuhlu: ephlanini lelinye izinga, ephlanini lophahla lwangaphakathi lezinga, noma isibizo sesigaba (esisikwe ngomkhawulo waso). Izindonga, izinsika namaphansi alo kubonakala ngamachashaza ngaphansi kwephlani ozwela kulo. Yihambise ngokuchofoza iphoyinti lesisekelo esisethenjwa bese uchofoza lapho leliphoyinti kufanele liye khona, noma uthayiphe X, Y nengeneli (iyajikeleza ngaphakathi kwayo). Setha kabusha iyabuyisela, Fihla iyayisusa. Yisethenjwa kuphela: akukho okuyikhethayo, ayiphrintwa futhi ayigcinwa ku-IFC. I-BimCraft iyakhumbula kusiphequluli lesi ukuthi ulandele kanjani izinga ngalinye. Amapeni ngombono Khetha Amapeni. Chaza ukuthi ipeni ilani: zonke izindonga, zonke iminyango, zonke amawindi, uhlobo lwento ekhethiwe, noma izinto ezikhethiwe. Khetha ububanzi, umugqa (oqinile, onamachashaza, onamaphoyinti) nombala, bese Sebenzisa. Ushintsho lusebenza kuphlani lwalelizinga kuphela. Ukukhetha kunqoba uhlobo, nohlobo lunqoba isigaba sonke. Sula konke iyakususa. Zigcinwa kulesi siphequluli. Thikha Imibala yamapeni ku-3D ukuze upeyinte amapeni emibala emodelini kwi-3D view; ububanzi noma ukudashwa kumugqa kuwuhlobo lomugqa, ngakho imibala kuphela ibonakala lapho; susa ithikhi ukuze ubuyele emuva. Phrinta iwadweba kwi-PDF yephlani: ububanzi buskala kusuka kusikrini (ipeni elizenzakalelayo lodonga elingu-1.75 amapixel ngu-0.5 mm), izindawo zokudasha zihlala zidashi, nombala uphrinta ngenani lawo lesihloko sephepha. Isitebhisi esivela esketshini Khetha Dweba isitebhisi bese uchofoza amakhona womugqa wokuhamba, isinyathelo esiphansi kuqala. Umugqa owodwa uyisitebhisi esiqondile, imigqa emibili ehlangana ngengeneli eqondile iyi-L, nemigqa emithathu (phezulu, phambili, emuva) iyi-U. Cindezela L ukudweba isiteshi sokuphumula: chofoza amakhona alo bese ucindezela Enter; uhlangothi lwalo olufushane luyibeka ububanzi besitebhisi. Cindezela Enter ukubeka isitebhisi. Inyathelo ngalinye libalwa ngobude bomugqa wakho nenani lezinyathelo ezidingwa ukuphakama. Ngemva kwalokho kuyisitebhisi esijwayelekile: shintsha kuIzici, bese umgodi wesitebhisi nezibambelelo ziyalandela. Thikha Yenza ibe umndeni kumugqa wethuluzi (noma cindezela F) ngaphambi kwe-Enter ukuze ubeke isitebhisi njengomndeni (isitebhisi esiqondile, i-L noma i-U). Ifika njengento eyodwa bese ivula kumhleli womndeni nobubanzi bayo, inyathelo, ukuphakama okuphelele, izinyathelo zendiza ngayinye nebanga le-U njengamapharamitha, ukuze wengeze izilinganiso, uphawu lwephlani noma ama-hotspot. Izinyathelo nokuphakama kwezinyathelo kulandela kuwo. Alinazo izibambelelo noma umgodi wesitebhisi: lezo zingezesitebhisi esijwayelekile. Vula i-OBJ Vula ifayela le-.obj njengakunoma iyiphi enye ifayela. I-OBJ alinayo izinyunithi, ngakho i-BimCraft ifunda amamitha nge-Y ephezulu, njengoba izinhlelo eziningi zilibhala. Yonke into noma iqembu iba yinto eyodwa yemeshi ezingeni elilodwa, bese ungayibona, uyilinganise, uyisike, uyibeke emodelini futhi uyigcine njenge-IFC. Imigqa, amajika nezindawo ziyashiywa, futhi umugqa wesimo uyakutshela lokho. Into eyiphrizimu ngokuphelele (imeshi evaliwe enezindawo ezimbili ezilingana ngokuphelele nezinhlangothi ezingqondile kuzo: ifulegi, ipositi, ibhulokhi lodonga, ipuleti ngezimbobo) igcinwa ku-IFC njengevolumu eqinile yakwa-IFC enesakhiwo sayo nobujula, hhayi ohlu lwezinxantathu. Ezinye izinhleloziyifunda njengevolumu eqinile, ayikhulu, futhi ubujula nesakhiwo sayo kungahlelwa kamuva. Umugqa wesimo utshela ukuthi zingaki izinto ezigcinwe ngale ndlela. Okungeyona iphrizimu ngokuqinisekile (isimo esincipha, imeshi lapho ikhona elilodwa lishintshwe, imeshi enegebe) kuhlala kungezinxantathu. Ifayela le-STEP lifundwa ngendlela efanayo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"pictures-as-backgrounds","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Faka isithombe ngaphansi kwepulani","summary":"Beka isithombe se-PNG, JPEG noma WebP (isikena sepulani, isikisela, isithombe sesayithi, isithombe esivela phezulu) ngaphansi kwepulani lezinga noma endizeni eme, sisikalise ngamaphoyinti amabili, sihambise, sijikeleze, sifiphaze futhi sikhiye, sibone ku-3D nasepulanini ye-PDF, bese usigcina eduze kwemodeli esethini.","section":"tasks","order":159,"keywords":["isithombe","umfanekiso","isisekelo","PNG","JPEG","WebP","iskena","isikisela","isithombe sesayithi","isithombe esivela phezulu","ipulani lesayithi","isikali","ukuqina","ukukhiya","ingaphansi","ukulandela"],"headings":[{"id":"beka-isithombe","text":"Beka isithombe","level":2},{"id":"setha-isikali","text":"Setha isikali","level":2},{"id":"namathisela-indawo-ekopishiwe","text":"Namathisela indawo ekopishiwe","level":2},{"id":"hambisa-jikeleza-fiphaza-khiya","text":"Hambisa, jikeleza, fiphaza, khiya","level":2},{"id":"izithombe-eziningi-amazinga-amaningi","text":"Izithombe eziningi, amazinga amaningi","level":2},{"id":"izithombe-ku-3d-view","text":"Izithombe ku-3D view","level":2},{"id":"isithombe-endizeni-eme","text":"Isithombe endizeni eme","level":2},{"id":"ukushicilela","text":"Ukushicilela","level":2},{"id":"kugcinwe-eduze-kwemodeli","text":"Kugcinwe eduze kwemodeli","level":2},{"id":"ezigatsheni-nasezibonakalweni-zamashidi","text":"Ezigatsheni nasezibonakalweni zamashidi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"beka-isithombe\"\u003EBeka isithombe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw\u003C/span\u003E, uye ezingeni, bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPicture\u003C/span\u003E kumenyu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuild\u003C/span\u003E. Bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInsert picture…\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha ifayela le-PNG, JPEG noma WebP. Lifundwa kusiphequluli sakho futhi aliyi kulayishwa. Livela ngaphansi kwepulani, lilingana nombono, futhi ithuluzi lithi awusasikalisi. Konke oyidwetshayo kuhlala phezulu kwalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"setha-isikali\"\u003ESetha isikali\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale\u003C/span\u003E, bese uchofoza amaphoyinti amabili esithombeni okwaziwayo ibanga langempela phakathi kwawo (imikhawulo yodonga ezindaweni ezisikeniwe epulanini, ubukhulu obubhalwe esikisela), bese uthayipha ibanga bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Isithombe siyakhula noma sincipha sizungeze iphoyinti lokuqala owalichofoze. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyakhansela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"namathisela-indawo-ekopishiwe\"\u003ENamathisela indawo ekopishiwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-MarkupCraft, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy area\u003C/span\u003E ikopisha ingxenye yeshidi le-PDF njengesithombe. Ngemuva ku-BimCraft, lapho ipulani lezinga likhombisa, cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control V\"\u003E⌃V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaste\u003C/span\u003E kumenyu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E): indawo ifika epulanini njengesithombe, ibekwe maphakathi lapho kukhomba khona isikhombi (noma maphakathi nombono). Uma ishidi linesikali sokudweba, ifika ngobukhulu bayo bangempela, ngakho udonga oluselwayo lubude njengodonga lwakho. Uma lingenalo, ifika ngosayizi wephepha futhi i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale\u003C/span\u003E iyaqala, ukuze ukwazi ukuchofoza amaphoyinti amabili bese uthayipha ibanga lawo. Indawo ekopishwe iqala ngokuqina okwakhopishelwa ngakho. Kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa futhi igcinwa njenganoma yisiphi esinye isithombe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaste\u003C/span\u003E uthatha okokugcina okopishile: indawo ekopishiwe noma into okopishe ku-BimCraft. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control V\"\u003E⌃V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iphinda inamathisele noma yisiphi esinye isithombe se-PNG, JPEG noma WebP esikhumbulweni sakho, sibekwe njengaku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInsert picture…\u003C/span\u003E futhi singasikalisiwe. Indawo ekopishiwe ikhunjulwa amahora ayisithupha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hambisa-jikeleza-fiphaza-khiya\"\u003EHambisa, jikeleza, fiphaza, khiya\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove\u003C/span\u003E uthatha iphoyinti lesisekelo esithombeni bese kuthi indawo okufanele iye kuyo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETurn\u003C/span\u003E uthatha i-engeli ngamadigri, ngokuzungeza phakathi kwesithombe. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpacity\u003C/span\u003E kuyisona esifiphaza ukuze imigqa yakho ibonakale. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELock\u003C/span\u003E kuyigcina isingahambi ngenkathi udweba; isithombe esikhiyiwe usakwazi ukushintsha ukuqina kwaso nokusifihla. Ushintsho ngalunye luyisinyathelo sokuhlehlisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izithombe-eziningi-amazinga-amaningi\"\u003EIzithombe eziningi, amazinga amaningi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsithombe siyeyesinqubo esabekwe kuso, futhi sibonakala epulanini yalelo zinga nakwepulani yesiling. Chofoza isithombe ukuze usisebenze, noma ukhethe kuhlu. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHide\u003C/span\u003E siyasivala ngaphandle kokusisusa; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove\u003C/span\u003E (noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) siyasikhipha emodelini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izithombe-ku-3d-view\"\u003EIzithombe ku-3D view\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYonke isithombe futhi simi ku-3D view njengendiza eliyisicaba: isithombe sepulani sihlezi phezu kwezinga layo, isithombe sendiza ephakeme sime phezu komugqa wayo wesigaba. Sidwetshwa phezu kwemodeli ngaphandle kokuyifihla, futhi imodeli ifihla ingxenye yesithombe ebehlala ngemuva kwayo. Izithombe ezigqumekile ziyahlelwa ngobubanzi. Ukuqina, Fihla, Khiya noSusa kusebenza ngendlela efanayo, futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow in 3D\u003C/span\u003E ivala zonke iziphandla ku-3D view kuphela. Izinga elilodwa linamanye ama-8 wezithombe kuphela, ukuze imibono isheshe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isithombe-endizeni-eme\"\u003EIsithombe endizeni eme\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlace on\u003C/span\u003E khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EA vertical plane (section line)\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInsert picture…\u003C/span\u003E. Chofoza amaphethelo amabili womugqa epulanini (ubuso bodonga bunamathela), noma khetha umugqa wesigaba oqanjiwe wezinga ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOver a section line\u003C/span\u003E ngaphandle kokuchofoza. Isithombe sime phezu kwezinga phezu komugqa, sibe bubanzi obufanayo nomugqa. Setha i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWidth\u003C/span\u003E yaso, indawo yaso \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAlong the line\u003C/span\u003E nokuphakama kwaso \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHeight above level\u003C/span\u003E ngokuthayipha; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETurn\u003C/span\u003E siyasijikeleza endizeni yaso. Isithombe esime asidwetshwa ngaphansi kwepulani; ipulani likhombisa umugqa waso lapho usisebenza. I-BimCraft ayinayo iwindi lesigaba se-2D elisebenzisanayo: izigaba nezibonakalo zidwetshwa emashidini, futhi izithombe azishicilelwa kulezo zibonakalo zamashidi okwamanje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukushicilela\"\u003EUkushicilela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrint view\u003C/span\u003E epulanini ibhala izithombe zezinga kwi-PDF ngaphansi komdwebo, ngesikali, ngokuphendulwa nokuqina kwazo, kuvinjelwe ngaphakathi kweshidi; isithombe esifihliwe sihlala ngaphandle. I-JPEG ingena njengoba ikhona; ezinye izithombe zehliswa zibe ngu-200 dpi kuqala ngaphambi kweshidi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kugcinwe-eduze-kwemodeli\"\u003EKugcinwe eduze kwemodeli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmabhithi esithombe awabhalwa embhalweni we-IFC. Imodeli ibhekisa kwesinye ngasinye ngegama (i-IfcDocumentReference efana ne-pictures/&lt;id&gt;.png) futhi amabhithi ahamba esethini yeprojekthi. Sebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave as bundle…\u003C/span\u003E (noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave as IFC\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha lokho): uthola i-.ccbundle eyodwa enemodeli nezithombe zayo; i-IFC ihlale incane futhi ukuhlela kusheshe. Vula i-.ccbundle bese izithombe zibuya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-.ifc elula ayikwazi ukugcina isithombe ngaphandle kokukhula kakhulu. Lapho uyigcina, i-BimCraft ithi izithombe ezingaki zigcinwe ngaphandle kwayo futhi inikeze isethi, noma i-IFC elula efaka izithombe kuze kufike ku-512 KB futhi ishiye ezinye. I-.ifc elula evulwe ngaphandle kwesethi yayo ikhombisa lezo zithombe njengezingekho futhi uhlu lwezinkinga luzibhala; vula i-.ccbundle abagcinwe kuyo. Amafayela agcinwe yinguqulo yokuqala, lapho isithombe sisemngceleni we-IFC, asavulwa, futhi ukugcinwa kwesethi kuhambisa izithombe zawo ngaphandle. Isithombe sigcinwa njengoba sinjalo kuze kube ngu-6 MB; esikhulu sehliswa usayizi kuqala, futhi uyatshelwa. Ezinye izinhlelo ezivula imodeli ziyazinaka izithombe. Isithombe ongakasisikalisi sibhalwa ohlwini lwezinkinga njengesaziso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ezigatsheni-nasezibonakalweni-zamashidi\"\u003EEzigatsheni nasezibonakalweni zamashidi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsithombe endizeni eme (khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVertical\u003C/span\u003E kuphaneli yesithombe bese uchofoza amaphethelo amabili womugqa, noma usibeke phezu komugqa wesigaba oqanjiwe) sishicilelwa kwizibonakalo zamashidi ezibheke kuso ngqo. Isigaba sibonisa isithombe esime emugqeni wasso wesigaba, noma esibekwe phezu kwaloyo mugqa wesigaba ngegama. Ukubukeka kohlangothi kubonisa wonke izithombe ezimile endizeni ezibheke kuso. Isithombe sidwetshwa ngaphansi kwemigqa yombono, ngesikali sombono, sigcinwe ngaphakathi komngcele wombono, futhi sigcina ukuqina kwaso. Vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESheets…\u003C/span\u003E ukuze ubone; i-PDF yeshidi iphethe njengesithombe. Ukubukwa ngasemuva isithombe sibonakala sijikiwe, njengakwi-3D. Izithombe ezifihliwe ziyashiywa.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Beka isithombe Vula Draw, uye ezingeni, bese ukhetha Picture kumenyu Build. Bese Insert picture… bese ukhetha ifayela le-PNG, JPEG noma WebP. Lifundwa kusiphequluli sakho futhi aliyi kulayishwa. Livela ngaphansi kwepulani, lilingana nombono, futhi ithuluzi lithi awusasikalisi. Konke oyidwetshayo kuhlala phezulu kwalo. Setha isikali Khetha Scale, bese uchofoza amaphoyinti amabili esithombeni okwaziwayo ibanga langempela phakathi kwawo (imikhawulo yodonga ezindaweni ezisikeniwe epulanini, ubukhulu obubhalwe esikisela), bese uthayipha ibanga bese ucindezela Enter. Isithombe siyakhula noma sincipha sizungeze iphoyinti lokuqala owalichofoze. Esc iyakhansela. Namathisela indawo ekopishiwe Ku-MarkupCraft, Copy area ikopisha ingxenye yeshidi le-PDF njengesithombe. Ngemuva ku-BimCraft, lapho ipulani lezinga likhombisa, cindezela Ctrl+V (noma Paste kumenyu Edit): indawo ifika epulanini njengesithombe, ibekwe maphakathi lapho kukhomba khona isikhombi (noma maphakathi nombono). Uma ishidi linesikali sokudweba, ifika ngobukhulu bayo bangempela, ngakho udonga oluselwayo lubude njengodonga lwakho. Uma lingenalo, ifika ngosayizi wephepha futhi i-Scale iyaqala, ukuze ukwazi ukuchofoza amaphoyinti amabili bese uthayipha ibanga lawo. Indawo ekopishwe iqala ngokuqina okwakhopishelwa ngakho. Kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuhlehlisa futhi igcinwa njenganoma yisiphi esinye isithombe. Paste uthatha okokugcina okopishile: indawo ekopishiwe noma into okopishe ku-BimCraft. Ctrl+V iphinda inamathisele noma yisiphi esinye isithombe se-PNG, JPEG noma WebP esikhumbulweni sakho, sibekwe njengaku-Insert picture… futhi singasikalisiwe. Indawo ekopishiwe ikhunjulwa amahora ayisithupha. Hambisa, jikeleza, fiphaza, khiya Move uthatha iphoyinti lesisekelo esithombeni bese kuthi indawo okufanele iye kuyo. Turn uthatha i-engeli ngamadigri, ngokuzungeza phakathi kwesithombe. Opacity kuyisona esifiphaza ukuze imigqa yakho ibonakale. Lock kuyigcina isingahambi ngenkathi udweba; isithombe esikhiyiwe usakwazi ukushintsha ukuqina kwaso nokusifihla. Ushintsho ngalunye luyisinyathelo sokuhlehlisa. Izithombe eziningi, amazinga amaningi Isithombe siyeyesinqubo esabekwe kuso, futhi sibonakala epulanini yalelo zinga nakwepulani yesiling. Chofoza isithombe ukuze usisebenze, noma ukhethe kuhlu. Hide siyasivala ngaphandle kokusisusa; Remove (noma Delete) siyasikhipha emodelini. Izithombe ku-3D view Yonke isithombe futhi simi ku-3D view njengendiza eliyisicaba: isithombe sepulani sihlezi phezu kwezinga layo, isithombe sendiza ephakeme sime phezu komugqa wayo wesigaba. Sidwetshwa phezu kwemodeli ngaphandle kokuyifihla, futhi imodeli ifihla ingxenye yesithombe ebehlala ngemuva kwayo. Izithombe ezigqumekile ziyahlelwa ngobubanzi. Ukuqina, Fihla, Khiya noSusa kusebenza ngendlela efanayo, futhi Show in 3D ivala zonke iziphandla ku-3D view kuphela. Izinga elilodwa linamanye ama-8 wezithombe kuphela, ukuze imibono isheshe. Isithombe endizeni eme Ngaphansi kwe-Place on khetha A vertical plane (section line), bese Insert picture…. Chofoza amaphethelo amabili womugqa epulanini (ubuso bodonga bunamathela), noma khetha umugqa wesigaba oqanjiwe wezinga ku-Over a section line ngaphandle kokuchofoza. Isithombe sime phezu kwezinga phezu komugqa, sibe bubanzi obufanayo nomugqa. Setha i-Width yaso, indawo yaso Along the line nokuphakama kwaso Height above level ngokuthayipha; Turn siyasijikeleza endizeni yaso. Isithombe esime asidwetshwa ngaphansi kwepulani; ipulani likhombisa umugqa waso lapho usisebenza. I-BimCraft ayinayo iwindi lesigaba se-2D elisebenzisanayo: izigaba nezibonakalo zidwetshwa emashidini, futhi izithombe azishicilelwa kulezo zibonakalo zamashidi okwamanje. Ukushicilela Print view epulanini ibhala izithombe zezinga kwi-PDF ngaphansi komdwebo, ngesikali, ngokuphendulwa nokuqina kwazo, kuvinjelwe ngaphakathi kweshidi; isithombe esifihliwe sihlala ngaphandle. I-JPEG ingena njengoba ikhona; ezinye izithombe zehliswa zibe ngu-200 dpi kuqala ngaphambi kweshidi. Kugcinwe eduze kwemodeli Amabhithi esithombe awabhalwa embhalweni we-IFC. Imodeli ibhekisa kwesinye ngasinye ngegama (i-IfcDocumentReference efana ne-pictures/\u003Cid\u003E.png) futhi amabhithi ahamba esethini yeprojekthi. Sebenzisa Save as bundle… (noma Save as IFC bese ukhetha lokho): uthola i-.ccbundle eyodwa enemodeli nezithombe zayo; i-IFC ihlale incane futhi ukuhlela kusheshe. Vula i-.ccbundle bese izithombe zibuya. I-.ifc elula ayikwazi ukugcina isithombe ngaphandle kokukhula kakhulu. Lapho uyigcina, i-BimCraft ithi izithombe ezingaki zigcinwe ngaphandle kwayo futhi inikeze isethi, noma i-IFC elula efaka izithombe kuze kufike ku-512 KB futhi ishiye ezinye. I-.ifc elula evulwe ngaphandle kwesethi yayo ikhombisa lezo zithombe njengezingekho futhi uhlu lwezinkinga luzibhala; vula i-.ccbundle abagcinwe kuyo. Amafayela agcinwe yinguqulo yokuqala, lapho isithombe sisemngceleni we-IFC, asavulwa, futhi ukugcinwa kwesethi kuhambisa izithombe zawo ngaphandle. Isithombe sigcinwa njengoba sinjalo kuze kube ngu-6 MB; esikhulu sehliswa usayizi kuqala, futhi uyatshelwa. Ezinye izinhlelo ezivula imodeli ziyazinaka izithombe. Isithombe ongakasisikalisi sibhalwa ohlwini lwezinkinga njengesaziso. Ezigatsheni nasezibonakalweni zamashidi Isithombe endizeni eme (khetha Vertical kuphaneli yesithombe bese uchofoza amaphethelo amabili womugqa, noma usibeke phezu komugqa wesigaba oqanjiwe) sishicilelwa kwizibonakalo zamashidi ezibheke kuso ngqo. Isigaba sibonisa isithombe esime emugqeni wasso wesigaba, noma esibekwe phezu kwaloyo mugqa wesigaba ngegama. Ukubukeka kohlangothi kubonisa wonke izithombe ezimile endizeni ezibheke kuso. Isithombe sidwetshwa ngaphansi kwemigqa yombono, ngesikali sombono, sigcinwe ngaphakathi komngcele wombono, futhi sigcina ukuqina kwaso. Vula Sheets… ukuze ubone; i-PDF yeshidi iphethe njengesithombe. Ukubukwa ngasemuva isithombe sibonakala sijikiwe, njengakwi-3D. Izithombe ezifihliwe ziyashiywa.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"panel-drawings","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Imiklamo yamaphaneli ngehlaza noma insimbi ekhanyayo","summary":"Akha udonga, amaphansi namaphahla emodeli njengamaphaneli ngehlaza noma insimbi ekhanyayo, bone yonke i-stud, i-plate, i-header, i-joist ne-rafter ngesikali, bese ugcina uhlu lokusika njenge-CSV nemiklamo yeshobhu njenge-PDF.","section":"tasks","order":161,"keywords":["iphaneli","ukwakha","umklamo weshobhu","uhlu lokusika","insimbi ekhanyayo","i-stud yensimbi","LGS","ihlaza","joist","rafter","header","isitoko","PDF"],"headings":[{"id":"vula-amaphaneli","text":"Vula amaphaneli","level":2},{"id":"impahla-yokwakha-usayizi-nokuhlukana","text":"Impahla yokwakha, usayizi nokuhlukana","level":2},{"id":"okutholayo","text":"Okutholayo","level":2},{"id":"akwenzi","text":"Akwenzi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"vula-amaphaneli\"\u003EVula amaphaneli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImiklamo yamaphaneli\u003C/span\u003E kumenyu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkwakhiwa\u003C/span\u003E (noma thayipha \u003Ccode class=\"hcmd\"\u003EPANELS\u003C/code\u003E). Uhlu lunawo wonke udonga owudwetshiwe, wonke amaphansi nawo wonke amaphahla emodeli, ngayinye ngethikhi. Udonga uza nezicabha nezikhenkethi njengezimbobo. Iphansi lakhiwa njengesikwele esizungeze umjikelezo waso, nama-joist ahamba ngendlela emfushane. Iphahla lakhiwa njenge-gable phezu komjikelezo wodonga lalo, nge-pitch yophahla; uhlu lukusho lokho, ngoba i-hip noma iphahla eyinkimbinkimbi akuyona i-gable.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"impahla-yokwakha-usayizi-nokuhlukana\"\u003EImpahla yokwakha, usayizi nokuhlukana\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImpahla yokwakha\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cstrong\u003EIhlaza\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003EInsimbi ekhanyayo\u003C/strong\u003E. Izingcezu zensimbi ziyi-C-stud ezibizwa ngokujula kwazo nokuqina kwazo (isibonelo C92-1.2), nethrekhi lama-plate. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUsayizi wengxenye\u003C/span\u003E ukhetha usayizi oyodwa kumaphaneli wonke athikiwe, noma uyishiye ku-Default ukuze uthathe okuzenzakalelayo kwendlela ngayinye yephaneli. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpacing\u003C/span\u003E kuwukuhlukana phakathi kwama-stud, ama-joist noma ama-rafter. Lezi yizinani zokuqala ozokusetha. Azikho ukuhlola kwekhodi: ukuthi i-stud ekuhlukana kwayo ithwele lolo donga, nokuthi i-header inde kangakanani, kuncike kumathebula ekhodi (i-Building regulations add-on inawo we-IRC) nakunjiniyela wakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okutholayo\"\u003EOkutholayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIphaneli lokuqala elithikiwe lidwetshwa ngesikali kuwindi, namabanga. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlu lokusika (CSV)\u003C/span\u003E ligcina zonke izingcezu zephaneli ngamaki, usayizi nobude, nobude bezitoko okufanele uzithenge. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImiklamo yeshobhu (PDF)\u003C/span\u003E igcina ikhasi elilodwa le-A3 ngalinye iphaneli, zonke izingcezu zimakwe nohlu lwazo lokusika. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmdwebo (SVG)\u003C/span\u003E ugcina iphaneli lokuqala njengomdwebo. Noma yiyiphi into ekhodi yokwakha ingayikwazi ukuyakha (ukuvulwa okusondele kakhulu ekugcineni kodonga, i-header engalingani ngaphansi kwama-plate, uchungechunge olude kunesitoko eside kakhulu) iyalulwa ohlwini lwezinkinga njengoba ikhona nakuwindi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akwenzi\"\u003EAkwenzi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmaphaneli ayimidwebo eyenziwa emodelini uma uyicela: akukho okubhalwa emodelini, ngakho ahlala efana nawo. Ukuze ufake ukwakheka emodelini njengezinto ezizimele, sebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlaka lokwakha\u003C/span\u003E wodonga, amaphansi namaphahla ehlaza.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Vula amaphaneli Khetha Imiklamo yamaphaneli kumenyu Ukwakhiwa (noma thayipha PANELS). Uhlu lunawo wonke udonga owudwetshiwe, wonke amaphansi nawo wonke amaphahla emodeli, ngayinye ngethikhi. Udonga uza nezicabha nezikhenkethi njengezimbobo. Iphansi lakhiwa njengesikwele esizungeze umjikelezo waso, nama-joist ahamba ngendlela emfushane. Iphahla lakhiwa njenge-gable phezu komjikelezo wodonga lalo, nge-pitch yophahla; uhlu lukusho lokho, ngoba i-hip noma iphahla eyinkimbinkimbi akuyona i-gable. Impahla yokwakha, usayizi nokuhlukana Khetha Impahla yokwakha: Ihlaza noma Insimbi ekhanyayo. Izingcezu zensimbi ziyi-C-stud ezibizwa ngokujula kwazo nokuqina kwazo (isibonelo C92-1.2), nethrekhi lama-plate. Usayizi wengxenye ukhetha usayizi oyodwa kumaphaneli wonke athikiwe, noma uyishiye ku-Default ukuze uthathe okuzenzakalelayo kwendlela ngayinye yephaneli. Spacing kuwukuhlukana phakathi kwama-stud, ama-joist noma ama-rafter. Lezi yizinani zokuqala ozokusetha. Azikho ukuhlola kwekhodi: ukuthi i-stud ekuhlukana kwayo ithwele lolo donga, nokuthi i-header inde kangakanani, kuncike kumathebula ekhodi (i-Building regulations add-on inawo we-IRC) nakunjiniyela wakho. Okutholayo Iphaneli lokuqala elithikiwe lidwetshwa ngesikali kuwindi, namabanga. Uhlu lokusika (CSV) ligcina zonke izingcezu zephaneli ngamaki, usayizi nobude, nobude bezitoko okufanele uzithenge. Imiklamo yeshobhu (PDF) igcina ikhasi elilodwa le-A3 ngalinye iphaneli, zonke izingcezu zimakwe nohlu lwazo lokusika. Umdwebo (SVG) ugcina iphaneli lokuqala njengomdwebo. Noma yiyiphi into ekhodi yokwakha ingayikwazi ukuyakha (ukuvulwa okusondele kakhulu ekugcineni kodonga, i-header engalingani ngaphansi kwama-plate, uchungechunge olude kunesitoko eside kakhulu) iyalulwa ohlwini lwezinkinga njengoba ikhona nakuwindi. Akwenzi Amaphaneli ayimidwebo eyenziwa emodelini uma uyicela: akukho okubhalwa emodelini, ngakho ahlala efana nawo. Ukuze ufake ukwakheka emodelini njengezinto ezizimele, sebenzisa Uhlaka lokwakha wodonga, amaphansi namaphahla ehlaza.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"curtain-systems","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Uhlelo lwekhethini: izindonga zengilazi ngegridi, nemiqamelo","summary":"Donsa uhlelo lwekhethini njengodonga noma ulibeke ebusweni, bese usetha imigqa yegridi nemiqamelo yalo. Lulondolozwa njenge-IfcCurtainWall namapaneli ayo nemiqamelo.","section":"tasks","order":172,"keywords":["uhlelo lwekhethini","udonga lwekhethini","igridi yekhethini","umqamelo","ukugcwaliswa ngengilazi","ifasiteli lesitolo","udonga lwengilazi","ipaneli","ifasiteli","ngobuso","ubuso","ubuningi","umugqa wegridi","ubude","iprofayili","umphezulu ophansi","IfcCurtainWall","IfcPlate","IfcMember"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"ngobuso","text":"Ngobuso","level":2},{"id":"ukukalwa","text":"Ukukalwa","level":2},{"id":"ku-ifc","text":"Ku-IFC","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukwazi","text":"Okufanele ukwazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYenza udonga lwengilazi lwamafasiteli phakathi kwemiqamelo, shintsha lapho imigqa yegridi yalo ikhona, futhi ukhethe imigqa eyothwala umqamelo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cstrong\u003EDweba\u003C/strong\u003E bese uvula imenyu ye-\u003Cstrong\u003EBuild\u003C/strong\u003E (ku-ribbon: ithebhu ye-Architecture).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003ECurtain System\u003C/strong\u003E. Emgqeni walo setha phezulu (izinga elilandelayo, noma ukuphakama), umugqa njalo ngobude obuthile kuwo, umugqa njalo ngokuphakama okuthile (shiya ukungenalutho uma kungekho), ukuthi uzoba nemiqamelo yini, nephrofayili yomqamelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECofa lapho uqala khona nalapho uphela khona, njengoba udweba udonga. I-Shift igcina kulingene.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuze ushintshe igridi, khetha \u003Cstrong\u003ECurtain Grid\u003C/strong\u003E bese ucofa uhlelo:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEngeza umugqa\u003C/strong\u003E: umugqa oma-ngqo uyavela lapho ucofa khona. Ngomugqa wezinga, bhala ukuphakama kwawo ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EAt\u003C/strong\u003E kuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHambisa umugqa\u003C/strong\u003E: cofa umugqa, bese ucofa lapho uyohamba khona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESusa umugqa\u003C/strong\u003E: cofa umugqa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESetha ngebanga\u003C/strong\u003E: bhala ibanga ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EEvery\u003C/strong\u003E, bese ucofa uhlelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuze ushintshe imiqamelo, khetha \u003Cstrong\u003EMullion\u003C/strong\u003E, khetha okusebenza kuwo (umugqa oma-ngqo ocofa kuwo, umugqa wezinga ngokuphakama, umphetho, noma yonke imigqa), khetha \u003Cstrong\u003EPlace mullions\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003ERemove mullions\u003C/strong\u003E neprofayili, bese ucofa uhlelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha uhlelo ukuze ubone konke ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EProperties\u003C/strong\u003E: wonke umugqa wegridi ngendawo yawo, uphawu lomqamelo wawo nenkinobho yokuwususa; ibanga; umphetho; iprofayili; ubukhulu bepaneli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ngobuso\"\u003ENgobuso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBy Face\u003C/strong\u003E yenza uhlelo lwekhethini ebusweni obusicaba obucofa kuwo ku-3D view. Umugqa wayo unezilungiselelo zegridi nemiqamelo ezifanayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELusebenza kunoma yiluphi ubuso obusicaba bunoma yiliphi element elibonwa yi-3D view: ubuningi, udonga, ifloor, uphahla, insika, into ebekiwe. Ubuso bungaba buma-ngqo, bethambekile noma buyisicaba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUhlelo luthatha umbhalo wobuso. I-gable noma enye imumo engavamile iyasika amapaneli nemiqamelo ukuze ilingane.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELungenza \u003Cstrong\u003Eudonga\u003C/strong\u003E esikhundleni, ngaphansi kwesisekelo sobuso obuma-ngqo, siphakame njengobuso. Udonga lapha lusoze lume ngqo, ngakho ubuso obuthambekile noma obuyisicaba abunakukwazi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAlwenzi uphahla. Uphahla ku-BimCraft lubalwa kusuka ocingweni lwezinga nasekuthambekeni, hhayi kubuso bodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUbuso obugoqekile kuyizindawo eziningi ezincane ezisicaba: ukucofa kukodwa kuthatha olunye lwazo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUbuso olunezimbobo: uhlelo luhlanganisa umbhalo wangaphandle kwebuso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukukalwa\"\u003EUkukalwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGross area\u003C/strong\u003E ingumbhalo wohlelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGlass area\u003C/strong\u003E ingamapaneli njengoba enziwe: ipaneli ngalinye lilahlekelwa uhhafu wobubanzi bomqamelo ohlangothini olunomqamelo wegridi, nobubanzi bonke kumqamelo womphetho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmqamelo oma-ngqo uhamba kusuka komunye umphetho kuya komunye. Umqamelo wezinga uyama kuwo wonke umqamelo oma-ngqo nasemphethweni. Imiqamelo yomphetho ilele ngaphakathi kombhalo; lapho ezimbili zihlangana, eyethe kakhulu iyadlula. Amahlanganiso anqunywa acaleke, awagoqwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESchedules\u003C/strong\u003E inohlu lwe-\u003Cstrong\u003ECurtain systems\u003C/strong\u003E nalezi zinombolo uma imodeli inalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-ifc\"\u003EKu-IFC\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-IfcCurtainWall esitezini sayo, eyakhiwe yi-IfcPlate (ipaneli yekhethini) ngalinye ngepaneli ngalinye, ne-IfcMember (umqamelo) ngayinye ngocezu lomqamelo ngalunye, ngalunye nesimo, impahla kanye nezinani zesisekelo zalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukwazi\"\u003EOkufanele ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENoma yisiphi usayizi senziwa njengoba ucela. Umbhalo ongenayo indawo kuphela uyenqatshwa, ngoba akukho okungakwenziwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUhlelo odwetshwe njengodonga ugcina ukuphakama okwadwetshwa ngakho. Uma uhambisa izinga kamuva, setha ukuphakama kwalo futhi ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EProperties\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIthuluzi le-Move alikahambisi uhlelo lwekhethini. Lisuse bese uyadweba futhi, noma ushintshe igridi yalo endaweni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUndo ibuyisela ngayinye inyathelo: uhlelo lonke, ushintsho olulodwa legridi, noma ushintsho olulodwa lomqamelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Yenza udonga lwengilazi lwamafasiteli phakathi kwemiqamelo, shintsha lapho imigqa yegridi yalo ikhona, futhi ukhethe imigqa eyothwala umqamelo. Izinyathelo Vula Dweba bese uvula imenyu ye-Build (ku-ribbon: ithebhu ye-Architecture). Khetha Curtain System. Emgqeni walo setha phezulu (izinga elilandelayo, noma ukuphakama), umugqa njalo ngobude obuthile kuwo, umugqa njalo ngokuphakama okuthile (shiya ukungenalutho uma kungekho), ukuthi uzoba nemiqamelo yini, nephrofayili yomqamelo. Cofa lapho uqala khona nalapho uphela khona, njengoba udweba udonga. I-Shift igcina kulingene. Ukuze ushintshe igridi, khetha Curtain Grid bese ucofa uhlelo: Engeza umugqa: umugqa oma-ngqo uyavela lapho ucofa khona. Ngomugqa wezinga, bhala ukuphakama kwawo ku-At kuqala. Hambisa umugqa: cofa umugqa, bese ucofa lapho uyohamba khona. Susa umugqa: cofa umugqa. Setha ngebanga: bhala ibanga ku-Every, bese ucofa uhlelo. Ukuze ushintshe imiqamelo, khetha Mullion, khetha okusebenza kuwo (umugqa oma-ngqo ocofa kuwo, umugqa wezinga ngokuphakama, umphetho, noma yonke imigqa), khetha Place mullions noma Remove mullions neprofayili, bese ucofa uhlelo. Khetha uhlelo ukuze ubone konke ku-Properties: wonke umugqa wegridi ngendawo yawo, uphawu lomqamelo wawo nenkinobho yokuwususa; ibanga; umphetho; iprofayili; ubukhulu bepaneli. Ngobuso By Face yenza uhlelo lwekhethini ebusweni obusicaba obucofa kuwo ku-3D view. Umugqa wayo unezilungiselelo zegridi nemiqamelo ezifanayo. Lusebenza kunoma yiluphi ubuso obusicaba bunoma yiliphi element elibonwa yi-3D view: ubuningi, udonga, ifloor, uphahla, insika, into ebekiwe. Ubuso bungaba buma-ngqo, bethambekile noma buyisicaba. Uhlelo luthatha umbhalo wobuso. I-gable noma enye imumo engavamile iyasika amapaneli nemiqamelo ukuze ilingane. Lungenza udonga esikhundleni, ngaphansi kwesisekelo sobuso obuma-ngqo, siphakame njengobuso. Udonga lapha lusoze lume ngqo, ngakho ubuso obuthambekile noma obuyisicaba abunakukwazi. Alwenzi uphahla. Uphahla ku-BimCraft lubalwa kusuka ocingweni lwezinga nasekuthambekeni, hhayi kubuso bodwa. Ubuso obugoqekile kuyizindawo eziningi ezincane ezisicaba: ukucofa kukodwa kuthatha olunye lwazo. Ubuso olunezimbobo: uhlelo luhlanganisa umbhalo wangaphandle kwebuso. Ukukalwa Gross area ingumbhalo wohlelo. Glass area ingamapaneli njengoba enziwe: ipaneli ngalinye lilahlekelwa uhhafu wobubanzi bomqamelo ohlangothini olunomqamelo wegridi, nobubanzi bonke kumqamelo womphetho. Umqamelo oma-ngqo uhamba kusuka komunye umphetho kuya komunye. Umqamelo wezinga uyama kuwo wonke umqamelo oma-ngqo nasemphethweni. Imiqamelo yomphetho ilele ngaphakathi kombhalo; lapho ezimbili zihlangana, eyethe kakhulu iyadlula. Amahlanganiso anqunywa acaleke, awagoqwa. Schedules inohlu lwe-Curtain systems nalezi zinombolo uma imodeli inalo. Ku-IFC I-IfcCurtainWall esitezini sayo, eyakhiwe yi-IfcPlate (ipaneli yekhethini) ngalinye ngepaneli ngalinye, ne-IfcMember (umqamelo) ngayinye ngocezu lomqamelo ngalunye, ngalunye nesimo, impahla kanye nezinani zesisekelo zalo. Okufanele ukwazi Noma yisiphi usayizi senziwa njengoba ucela. Umbhalo ongenayo indawo kuphela uyenqatshwa, ngoba akukho okungakwenziwa. Uhlelo odwetshwe njengodonga ugcina ukuphakama okwadwetshwa ngakho. Uma uhambisa izinga kamuva, setha ukuphakama kwalo futhi ku-Properties. Ithuluzi le-Move alikahambisi uhlelo lwekhethini. Lisuse bese uyadweba futhi, noma ushintshe igridi yalo endaweni. Undo ibuyisela ngayinye inyathelo: uhlelo lonke, ushintsho olulodwa legridi, noma ushintsho olulodwa lomqamelo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"work-plane","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Uhlelo lokusebenza: lusethe, lubonise, lubheke ngqo","summary":"Uhlelo lokusebenza yiphlani esetshenziswa imigqa yemodeli, umbhalo wemodeli kanye ne-Work Plane Viewer. Lusethe ezingeni, ebusweni, kuhlelo lwesethenjwa oluqanjiwe noma kumugqa; lubonise ezibukweni; vula isibuki ukuze udwebe kuhlelo oluma phezulu.","section":"tasks","order":173,"keywords":["uhlelo lokusebenza","setha uhlelo lokusebenza","bonisa uhlelo lokusebenza","uhlelo lwesethenjwa","isibuki sohlelo lokusebenza","uhlelo oluqanjiwe","ubuso","izinga","uhlelo oluma","uhlelo oluthe xaxa","dweba udonga","umdwebo wokubukeka kohlangothi","snap","ukuhlanganiswa","ref plane"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"uhlelo-lwesethenjwa","text":"Uhlelo lwesethenjwa","level":2},{"id":"okuwusizo","text":"Okuwusizo","level":2},{"id":"ku-fayela-le-ifc","text":"Ku-fayela le-IFC","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhetha uhlelo odweba kuwo, ubone lapho lukhona, futhi udwebe kuhlelo oluma phezulu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cstrong\u003EDweba\u003C/strong\u003E bese uvula imenyu \u003Cstrong\u003EAkha\u003C/strong\u003E (kuledi yesitayela se-ribbon: ithebhu ye-Architecture, Uhlelo Lokusebenza).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003ESetha Uhlelo Lokusebenza\u003C/strong\u003E. Bese wenza okulodwa kwalokhu:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ekhetha izinga ku-\u003Cstrong\u003ESetha ku\u003C/strong\u003E;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ekhetha uhlelo lwesethenjwa oluqanjiwe ohlwini oluseduze kwawo;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Echofoza umugqa ku-plan: udonga, umugqa wegridi, uhlelo lwesethenjwa, umugqa wemodeli noma uhlelo lwe-curtain. Uhlelo lokusebenza luba uhlelo oluma phezu kwalowo mugqa;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Echofoza ubuso obuthe ku-3D view. Uhlelo lokusebenza lulala phezu kwaleso busa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EBonisa Uhlelo Lokusebenza\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze ulubone: ishidi elinombala ocwebile negridi yamamitha ku-3D view, umugqa noma umbandela ocwebezelwe ku-plan, nombandela ocwebezelwe ku-ipaneli yokubukeka kohlangothi nesigaba esinqunyiwe. Khetha futhi ukuze uyifihle.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EIsibuki Sohlelo Lokusebenza\u003C/strong\u003E ukuze ubheke ngqo kuhlelo. Imigqa emnyama imodeli eyanqunywa uhlelo. Sebenzisa amathuluzi aso ukudweba umugqa wemodeli, umbhalo wemodeli noma uhlelo lwesethenjwa kuhlelo. \u003Cstrong\u003EBheka kuyo ku-3D\u003C/strong\u003E uphendula ku-3D view ukuze ibhekane nohlelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uhlelo-lwesethenjwa\"\u003EUhlelo lwesethenjwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUhlelo lwesethenjwa uhlelo oluqanjiwe oludwetshwa njengomugqa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EUhlelo Lwesethenjwa\u003C/strong\u003E. Thayipha igama emgqeni wawo uma ufuna elilodwa (kuzoqanjwa ngokuzenzakalelayo uma ungenzi lutho) nobude.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza lapho iqala khona nalapho iphela khona. Ku-plan lokhu kwenza uhlelo oluma. Ku-Isibuki Sohlelo Lokusebenza kwenza uhlelo olumile ngokuqondile kuhlelo lokusebenza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELubonakala njengomugqa ocwebezelwe oluhlaza negama lawo ku-plan, nombandela ocwebezelwe ku-3D view nasepanelini lokubukeka kohlangothi nesigaba esinqunyiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha ukuze uyiqamba kabusha, ushintshe ubude, ukuphakama nesisekelo sawo, noma ucindezele \u003Cstrong\u003ESebenzisa njengohlelo lokusebenza\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUhlelo lwesethenjwa olumbili alukwazi ukuba negama elifanayo, ngoba igama yindlela yokukhetha olulodwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuwusizo\"\u003EOkuwusizo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImodeli engenalo uhlelo lokusebenza isebenza ezingeni laleyo elisezansi kakhulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUhlelo lokusebenza lulondolozwa efayelini. Ukubonisa noma ukufihla kwalo kukhunjulwa kulesi siphequluli, hhayi efayelini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma uhlelo lokusebenza lulandela uhlelo lwesethenjwa futhi ulunyakazisa, uhlelo lokusebenza nalo luyanyakaza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOhlelweni lokusebenza oluma, amathuluzi Womugqa Womodeli nombhalo Womodeli avula isibuki, ngoba iplan ingakwazi ukubhekisa ebudeni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmathuluzi okudweba abamba iziphetho zohlelo lwesethenjwa oludwetshwe ku-plan ngendlela efanayo abamba ngayo iziphetho zemigqa yabanye ku-viewer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-fayela-le-ifc\"\u003EKu-fayela le-IFC\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUhlelo lokusebenza yisethi yezici (CadCraft_WorkPlane) kuphrojekthi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUhlelo lwesethenjwa yi-IfcAnnotation enohlobo lwento ReferencePlane negama layo. Isimo sayo ingqikithi evaliwe yohlelo, ukuze enye inhlelo ibonise lapho lukhona. Isethi yayo CadCraft_ReferencePlane iqukethe umthombo, isiqondiso, i-normal nobubanzi. I-IFC ayinayo ikilasi lohlelo lwesethenjwa; i-annotation ayibalwa njengento yesakhiwo futhi ayibophi amagumbi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Khetha uhlelo odweba kuwo, ubone lapho lukhona, futhi udwebe kuhlelo oluma phezulu. Izinyathelo Vula Dweba bese uvula imenyu Akha (kuledi yesitayela se-ribbon: ithebhu ye-Architecture, Uhlelo Lokusebenza). Khetha Setha Uhlelo Lokusebenza. Bese wenza okulodwa kwalokhu: khetha izinga ku-Setha ku; khetha uhlelo lwesethenjwa oluqanjiwe ohlwini oluseduze kwawo; chofoza umugqa ku-plan: udonga, umugqa wegridi, uhlelo lwesethenjwa, umugqa wemodeli noma uhlelo lwe-curtain. Uhlelo lokusebenza luba uhlelo oluma phezu kwalowo mugqa; chofoza ubuso obuthe ku-3D view. Uhlelo lokusebenza lulala phezu kwaleso busa. Khetha Bonisa Uhlelo Lokusebenza ukuze ulubone: ishidi elinombala ocwebile negridi yamamitha ku-3D view, umugqa noma umbandela ocwebezelwe ku-plan, nombandela ocwebezelwe ku-ipaneli yokubukeka kohlangothi nesigaba esinqunyiwe. Khetha futhi ukuze uyifihle. Khetha Isibuki Sohlelo Lokusebenza ukuze ubheke ngqo kuhlelo. Imigqa emnyama imodeli eyanqunywa uhlelo. Sebenzisa amathuluzi aso ukudweba umugqa wemodeli, umbhalo wemodeli noma uhlelo lwesethenjwa kuhlelo. Bheka kuyo ku-3D uphendula ku-3D view ukuze ibhekane nohlelo. Uhlelo lwesethenjwa Uhlelo lwesethenjwa uhlelo oluqanjiwe oludwetshwa njengomugqa. Khetha Uhlelo Lwesethenjwa. Thayipha igama emgqeni wawo uma ufuna elilodwa (kuzoqanjwa ngokuzenzakalelayo uma ungenzi lutho) nobude. Chofoza lapho iqala khona nalapho iphela khona. Ku-plan lokhu kwenza uhlelo oluma. Ku-Isibuki Sohlelo Lokusebenza kwenza uhlelo olumile ngokuqondile kuhlelo lokusebenza. Lubonakala njengomugqa ocwebezelwe oluhlaza negama lawo ku-plan, nombandela ocwebezelwe ku-3D view nasepanelini lokubukeka kohlangothi nesigaba esinqunyiwe. Khetha ukuze uyiqamba kabusha, ushintshe ubude, ukuphakama nesisekelo sawo, noma ucindezele Sebenzisa njengohlelo lokusebenza. Uhlelo lwesethenjwa olumbili alukwazi ukuba negama elifanayo, ngoba igama yindlela yokukhetha olulodwa. Okuwusizo Imodeli engenalo uhlelo lokusebenza isebenza ezingeni laleyo elisezansi kakhulu. Uhlelo lokusebenza lulondolozwa efayelini. Ukubonisa noma ukufihla kwalo kukhunjulwa kulesi siphequluli, hhayi efayelini. Uma uhlelo lokusebenza lulandela uhlelo lwesethenjwa futhi ulunyakazisa, uhlelo lokusebenza nalo luyanyakaza. Ohlelweni lokusebenza oluma, amathuluzi Womugqa Womodeli nombhalo Womodeli avula isibuki, ngoba iplan ingakwazi ukubhekisa ebudeni. Amathuluzi okudweba abamba iziphetho zohlelo lwesethenjwa oludwetshwe ku-plan ngendlela efanayo abamba ngayo iziphetho zemigqa yabanye ku-viewer. Ku-fayela le-IFC Uhlelo lokusebenza yisethi yezici (CadCraft_WorkPlane) kuphrojekthi. Uhlelo lwesethenjwa yi-IfcAnnotation enohlobo lwento ReferencePlane negama layo. Isimo sayo ingqikithi evaliwe yohlelo, ukuze enye inhlelo ibonise lapho lukhona. Isethi yayo CadCraft_ReferencePlane iqukethe umthombo, isiqondiso, i-normal nobubanzi. I-IFC ayinayo ikilasi lohlelo lwesethenjwa; i-annotation ayibalwa njengento yesakhiwo futhi ayibophi amagumbi.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"model-lines-and-text","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Imigqa yemodeli nombhalo wemodeli: udwetshwe emodelini, endaweni yokusebenza","summary":"Umugqa wemodeli umugqa, iphola-layini noma umnsalo ohlala emodelini ubonakale kuyo yonke imibono eyibonayo. Umbhalo wemodeli ububhalo be-3D onokujula okwangempela. Kokubili kudwetshwa endaweni yokusebenza.","section":"tasks","order":174,"keywords":["umugqa wemodeli","umbhalo wemodeli","umbhalo we-3D","ukubhala","uphawu","umugqa ku-3D","umnsalo","iphola-layini","indawo yokusebenza","umbhalo osikiwe","ifonti","ujuqu","umugqa wemininingwane","umugqa wokudweba","isichasisi","IfcAnnotation"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"lapho-ziboniswa-khona","text":"Lapho ziboniswa khona","level":2},{"id":"ifonti","text":"Ifonti","level":2},{"id":"kwifayela-le-ifc","text":"Kwifayela le-IFC","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukwazi","text":"Okufanele ukwazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDweba imigqa nombhalo okuyingxenye yemodeli, hhayi yombono owodwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESetha indawo yokusebenza kuqala (bheka \u003Cstrong\u003EIndawo yokusebenza\u003C/strong\u003E). Indiza yezinga idwetshwa epulanini; indiza emile idwetshwa ku-Work Plane Viewer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgomugqa khetha \u003Cstrong\u003EUmugqa wemodeli\u003C/strong\u003E kumenyu \u003Cstrong\u003EUkwakhiwa\u003C/strong\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cstrong\u003EUmugqa\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EIphola-layini\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003EUmnsalo (amaphoyinti amathathu)\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eumugqa ngochofo ababili;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eiphola-layini ngochofo lwephoyinti ngalinye, bese \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma uchofoze kabili. Ukuchofoza iphoyinti lokuqala kuyivala;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eumnsalo ngochofo ezintathu: ukuqala kwawo, iphoyinti edlula kulo, nokuphela kwawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOmbhalweni khetha \u003Cstrong\u003EUmbhalo wemodeli\u003C/strong\u003E. Thayipha amagama, setha ukuphakama kwamakhaphithali nokujula, bese uchofoza lapho umbhalo uqala khona (uhlangothi lwesobunxele lwesisekelo sawo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha umugqa noma umbhalo ukuze uwubone ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EIzici\u003C/strong\u003E. Amagama, ukuphakama nokujula kombhalo kungashintshwa lapho. Susa kususa kona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lapho-ziboniswa-khona\"\u003ELapho ziboniswa khona\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmugqa wemodeli ubonakala epulanini yezinga lawo, ku-3D view, ekubukeni kohlangothi nakupanele yesigaba, nakwi-Work Plane Viewer uma uwuthwele endaweni yokusebenza. Umugqa wokudweba (Chaza, Umugqa) ungowombono owodwa kuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmbhalo wemodeli uyijometri eqinile: ubonakala nakuphi lapho imodeli ibonakala khona, epulanini, ku-3D, ezinhlangothini nasezigabeni, nasemashidini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImigqa yemodeli ayikadwetshwa emashidini aphrintiwe. Umbhalo wemodeli uyadwetshwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ifonti\"\u003EIfonti\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmbhalo wemodeli usebenzisa ifonti efanayo namashidi kanye nama-PDF: Liberation Sans, ngaphansi kwe-SIL Open Font License. Uhlamvu ifonti angalunaki lubonakala njengophawu lombuzo futhi uyatshelwa ukuthi yiluphi. Kukhona ifonti eyodwa nobukhulu obubodwa. Izinhlamvu zibekwa ngobubanzi bifonti yazo, ngaphandle kwe-kerning.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kwifayela-le-ifc\"\u003EKwifayela le-IFC\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmugqa wemodeli ungu-IfcAnnotation onohlobo lwento ModelLine. Isimo sawo siyijometri ye-3D: iphola-layini, noma umjikelezo osikiwe womnsalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmbhalo wemodeli ungu-IfcBuildingElementProxy onohlobo lwento ModelText. Isimo sawo siyisisekelo esisodwa esikhishiwe ngakunye kwesiqephu sohlamvu, namaholo ezinhlamvu ezifana no-O no-B. Izinga lawo liyindawo yesiphimbo nevolumu (indawo yesiphimbo ephindwe ngojuqu).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukwazi\"\u003EOkufanele ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENoma yiliphi usayizi lenziwa njengoba ucela. Kuphela umugqa ongenabude, umnsalo onamaphoyinti amathathu emugqeni owodwa, noma umbhalo ongenazinhlamvu ayenqatshelwa, ngoba akukho okokwenza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmugqa ngamunye, nombhalo noma ushintsho kuwo, kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuHlehlisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Dweba imigqa nombhalo okuyingxenye yemodeli, hhayi yombono owodwa. Izinyathelo Setha indawo yokusebenza kuqala (bheka Indawo yokusebenza). Indiza yezinga idwetshwa epulanini; indiza emile idwetshwa ku-Work Plane Viewer. Ngomugqa khetha Umugqa wemodeli kumenyu Ukwakhiwa bese ukhetha Umugqa, Iphola-layini noma Umnsalo (amaphoyinti amathathu): umugqa ngochofo ababili; iphola-layini ngochofo lwephoyinti ngalinye, bese Enter noma uchofoze kabili. Ukuchofoza iphoyinti lokuqala kuyivala; umnsalo ngochofo ezintathu: ukuqala kwawo, iphoyinti edlula kulo, nokuphela kwawo. Ombhalweni khetha Umbhalo wemodeli. Thayipha amagama, setha ukuphakama kwamakhaphithali nokujula, bese uchofoza lapho umbhalo uqala khona (uhlangothi lwesobunxele lwesisekelo sawo). Khetha umugqa noma umbhalo ukuze uwubone ku-Izici. Amagama, ukuphakama nokujula kombhalo kungashintshwa lapho. Susa kususa kona. Lapho ziboniswa khona Umugqa wemodeli ubonakala epulanini yezinga lawo, ku-3D view, ekubukeni kohlangothi nakupanele yesigaba, nakwi-Work Plane Viewer uma uwuthwele endaweni yokusebenza. Umugqa wokudweba (Chaza, Umugqa) ungowombono owodwa kuphela. Umbhalo wemodeli uyijometri eqinile: ubonakala nakuphi lapho imodeli ibonakala khona, epulanini, ku-3D, ezinhlangothini nasezigabeni, nasemashidini. Imigqa yemodeli ayikadwetshwa emashidini aphrintiwe. Umbhalo wemodeli uyadwetshwa. Ifonti Umbhalo wemodeli usebenzisa ifonti efanayo namashidi kanye nama-PDF: Liberation Sans, ngaphansi kwe-SIL Open Font License. Uhlamvu ifonti angalunaki lubonakala njengophawu lombuzo futhi uyatshelwa ukuthi yiluphi. Kukhona ifonti eyodwa nobukhulu obubodwa. Izinhlamvu zibekwa ngobubanzi bifonti yazo, ngaphandle kwe-kerning. Kwifayela le-IFC Umugqa wemodeli ungu-IfcAnnotation onohlobo lwento ModelLine. Isimo sawo siyijometri ye-3D: iphola-layini, noma umjikelezo osikiwe womnsalo. Umbhalo wemodeli ungu-IfcBuildingElementProxy onohlobo lwento ModelText. Isimo sawo siyisisekelo esisodwa esikhishiwe ngakunye kwesiqephu sohlamvu, namaholo ezinhlamvu ezifana no-O no-B. Izinga lawo liyindawo yesiphimbo nevolumu (indawo yesiphimbo ephindwe ngojuqu). Okufanele ukwazi Noma yiliphi usayizi lenziwa njengoba ucela. Kuphela umugqa ongenabude, umnsalo onamaphoyinti amathathu emugqeni owodwa, noma umbhalo ongenazinhlamvu ayenqatshelwa, ngoba akukho okokwenza. Umugqa ngamunye, nombhalo noma ushintsho kuwo, kuyisinyathelo esisodwa sokuHlehlisa.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"audit-the-model","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Hlola imodeli: amagumbi, amathegi, i-LOD, ukungqubuzana nezixhumanisi","summary":"Qalisa izinhlolo ezilungele amagumbi angaqanjwanga, amathegi alahlekile, izinto ezingaphansi kwe-level of development esicelwa yisigaba sephrojekthi, ukungqubuzana phakathi kwezizinda nezixhumanisi ze-LOD 350. Iseluleko kuphela: akukho okuvinjelwayo.","section":"tasks","order":175,"keywords":["ukuhlola","ukuhlola","igumbi elingaqanjwanga","ithegi elilahlekile","mark","lod","level of development","milestone","isigaba","ukungqubuzana","isizinda","ukuxhumana","ixhumano","lod 350","ukuvulwa","ilintel","ikhanda","ukungena","isleeve","ipayipi","umoya","izinkinga","umbiko wokuhlola","iseluleko"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"izinhlu-zemithetho","text":"Izinhlu zemithetho","level":2},{"id":"i-lod-esicelwa-yisigaba-ngasinye","text":"I-LOD esicelwa yisigaba ngasinye","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ukwazi","text":"Okufanele ukwazi","level":2},{"id":"okulandelayo","text":"Okulandelayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBheka imodeli yonke ngesikhathi esisodwa ngaphambi kokuyikhipha. Ukuhlola kugijima izinhlu zemithetho ezilungele bese kubeka okutholakele ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProblems\u003C/span\u003E njengeseluleko. Akukho okuvinjelwayo: ulungisa okutholakele, noma uyakwamukela ngesizathu, njengezinye izinkinga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel checks\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAudit\u003C/span\u003E kwiphaneli yesobunxele, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETools\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAudit the model…\u003C/span\u003E (uthayipha: \u003Ccode\u003EAUDIT\u003C/code\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProject stage\u003C/span\u003E. Yisigaba esifanayo nasemininingwaneni yemidwebo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha izinhlu zemithetho ozozigijima.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERun the audit\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFunda umugqa ngamunye wezinhlu zemithetho, bese uvula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen the Problems list\u003C/span\u003E. Ukuchofoza okutholakele kukhetha into yakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe check report\u003C/span\u003E ilanda umbiko: konke okutholakele, ukuthi ubani wamukela ini nangani, nezinhlu zemithetho ezigijimile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinhlu-zemithetho\"\u003EIzinhlu zemithetho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmagumbi angaqanjwanga\u003C/strong\u003E: igumbi elingenagama, noma elisabizwa ngalokho uhlelo lwalibiza ngakho (&quot;Room 3&quot;).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmathegi alahlekile\u003C/strong\u003E: umnyango noma iwindi elingenaso isibonakaliso, igumbi elingenanombolo, into kagesi engenalo ithegi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinto ngaphansi kwe-LOD yesigaba\u003C/strong\u003E: udonga ngalunye, iphansi, isiling, uphahla, umnyango newindi ngalinye elinge-LOD ingaphansi kwalokho isigaba esikucelayo. Into ifunda ithegi lohlobo lwayo le-LOD; into eqinisekiswe endaweni ingu-LOD 500. Izinto ezingenathegi zibalwa emnweni munye, ngoba azikwazi ukuhlolwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkungqubuzana phakathi kwezizinda\u003C/strong\u003E: izinto zezizinda ezimbili (ukwakheka, isakhiwo, imishini, ipayipi, ugesi, ngeklasi ye-IFC) ezingqubuzanayo. Uphahla olusekela izindonga zalo alubalwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIxhumano le-LOD 350\u003C/strong\u003E: wonke umnyango newindi ahlala endaweni evulekile edongeni lawo, ukuvuleka okulingana ngaphakathi kodonga, izivulo ezimbili azigqumi, ukuvuleka okubanzi kunomkhawulo kunelintel noma ikhanda (into phezu kwalo, noma inothi emnyangweni noma ewindini), nepayipi, umtapo womoya noma i-cable tray edlula udonga noma iphansi kunokuvuleka khona. Okutholakele kubalwa ngamapheya ezizinda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinto ezibonakele ezingahlolwanga yimuntu\u003C/strong\u003E: izindonga, iminyango, amawindi namagumbi afundwe kusuka kwi-PDF, kusikena noma emdwebweni, okusengakaqinisekiswa. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/verification\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/verification\"\u003EMaka izinto njengezihloliwe noma ezi-qinisekiswe endaweni\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"i-lod-esicelwa-yisigaba-ngasinye\"\u003EI-LOD esicelwa yisigaba ngasinye\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe LOD each stage asks for\u003C/span\u003E ukuze ubone noma uguqule ithebula.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthebula nobubanzi belintel kungamanani okuqala e-CadCraft. Awathathwanga esilinganisweni; iphrojekthi isetha i-LOD ngesigaba ngasinye kuhlelo lwayo lokusebenza kwe-BIM. Yisethe ngokwakho. Ihhovisi lingasetha ithebula kubo bonke ku-Izilungiselelo › Default Policies › Audit; ushintsho esigabeni se-Audit ligcinwa kule kompyutha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ukwazi\"\u003EOkufanele ukwazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIlintel lingabhalwa esikhundleni sokuyimodela: khetha umnyango noma iwindi bese ugcwalisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELintel or header note\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwesihloko \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVerification\u003C/span\u003E ku-Izakhiwo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIpayipi elidlula kuvulo langempela alidluli ngaphezulu kwesipha futhi alibikwa. Elimodelwe liqonda udonga lidlule kulo libikwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuhlolwa kokungqubuzana kuyayeka emva kwemizuzwana embalwa emodelini enkulu kakhulu futhi kuyasho lokho. Ukuhlolwa okuphelele kwezinhlu ezimbili ozikhethile sebenzisa \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/clash-check\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/clash-check\"\u003EThola ukungqubuzana phakathi kwezinto\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGijima ukuhlola kabusha uma ushintsha imodeli. Okutholakele okwamukelwe kuhlala kwamukelwe uma izinombolo zabo zingashintshi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIfunda imodeli. Ayithathelwa indawo ukubuyekezwa kokuhlelwa ngabantu abanesibopho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulandelayo\"\u003EOkulandelayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/model-checks\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/model-checks\"\u003EHlola imodeli ngezinkinga ezivamile\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/clash-check\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/clash-check\"\u003EThola ukungqubuzana phakathi kwezinto\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/verification\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/verification\"\u003EMaka izinto njengezihloliwe noma ezi-qinisekiswe endaweni\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Bheka imodeli yonke ngesikhathi esisodwa ngaphambi kokuyikhipha. Ukuhlola kugijima izinhlu zemithetho ezilungele bese kubeka okutholakele ku-Problems njengeseluleko. Akukho okuvinjelwayo: ulungisa okutholakele, noma uyakwamukela ngesizathu, njengezinye izinkinga. Izinyathelo Vula Model checks › Audit kwiphaneli yesobunxele, noma Tools › Audit the model… (uthayipha: AUDIT). Khetha Project stage. Yisigaba esifanayo nasemininingwaneni yemidwebo. Khetha izinhlu zemithetho ozozigijima. Chofoza Run the audit. Funda umugqa ngamunye wezinhlu zemithetho, bese uvula Open the Problems list. Ukuchofoza okutholakele kukhetha into yakho. The check report ilanda umbiko: konke okutholakele, ukuthi ubani wamukela ini nangani, nezinhlu zemithetho ezigijimile. Izinhlu zemithetho Amagumbi angaqanjwanga: igumbi elingenagama, noma elisabizwa ngalokho uhlelo lwalibiza ngakho (\"Room 3\"). Amathegi alahlekile: umnyango noma iwindi elingenaso isibonakaliso, igumbi elingenanombolo, into kagesi engenalo ithegi. Izinto ngaphansi kwe-LOD yesigaba: udonga ngalunye, iphansi, isiling, uphahla, umnyango newindi ngalinye elinge-LOD ingaphansi kwalokho isigaba esikucelayo. Into ifunda ithegi lohlobo lwayo le-LOD; into eqinisekiswe endaweni ingu-LOD 500. Izinto ezingenathegi zibalwa emnweni munye, ngoba azikwazi ukuhlolwa. Ukungqubuzana phakathi kwezizinda: izinto zezizinda ezimbili (ukwakheka, isakhiwo, imishini, ipayipi, ugesi, ngeklasi ye-IFC) ezingqubuzanayo. Uphahla olusekela izindonga zalo alubalwa. Ixhumano le-LOD 350: wonke umnyango newindi ahlala endaweni evulekile edongeni lawo, ukuvuleka okulingana ngaphakathi kodonga, izivulo ezimbili azigqumi, ukuvuleka okubanzi kunomkhawulo kunelintel noma ikhanda (into phezu kwalo, noma inothi emnyangweni noma ewindini), nepayipi, umtapo womoya noma i-cable tray edlula udonga noma iphansi kunokuvuleka khona. Okutholakele kubalwa ngamapheya ezizinda. Izinto ezibonakele ezingahlolwanga yimuntu: izindonga, iminyango, amawindi namagumbi afundwe kusuka kwi-PDF, kusikena noma emdwebweni, okusengakaqinisekiswa. Bona Maka izinto njengezihloliwe noma ezi-qinisekiswe endaweni. I-LOD esicelwa yisigaba ngasinye Vula The LOD each stage asks for ukuze ubone noma uguqule ithebula. Ithebula nobubanzi belintel kungamanani okuqala e-CadCraft. Awathathwanga esilinganisweni; iphrojekthi isetha i-LOD ngesigaba ngasinye kuhlelo lwayo lokusebenza kwe-BIM. Yisethe ngokwakho. Ihhovisi lingasetha ithebula kubo bonke ku-Izilungiselelo › Default Policies › Audit; ushintsho esigabeni se-Audit ligcinwa kule kompyutha. Okufanele ukwazi Ilintel lingabhalwa esikhundleni sokuyimodela: khetha umnyango noma iwindi bese ugcwalisa Lintel or header note ngaphansi kwesihloko Verification ku-Izakhiwo. Ipayipi elidlula kuvulo langempela alidluli ngaphezulu kwesipha futhi alibikwa. Elimodelwe liqonda udonga lidlule kulo libikwa. Ukuhlolwa kokungqubuzana kuyayeka emva kwemizuzwana embalwa emodelini enkulu kakhulu futhi kuyasho lokho. Ukuhlolwa okuphelele kwezinhlu ezimbili ozikhethile sebenzisa Thola ukungqubuzana phakathi kwezinto. Gijima ukuhlola kabusha uma ushintsha imodeli. Okutholakele okwamukelwe kuhlala kwamukelwe uma izinombolo zabo zingashintshi. Ifunda imodeli. Ayithathelwa indawo ukubuyekezwa kokuhlelwa ngabantu abanesibopho. Okulandelayo Hlola imodeli ngezinkinga ezivamile Thola ukungqubuzana phakathi kwezinto Maka izinto njengezihloliwe noma ezi-qinisekiswe endaweni","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"verification","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Maka izinto njengezihloliwe noma eziqinisekiswe endaweni","summary":"Into efundwe kwi-PDF noma eskenwe ayiqinisekisiwe kuze uyihlole. Maka izinto njengezihloliwe, noma njengeziqinisekisiwe endaweni (LOD 500) ngokuthi ubani, nini nangaphi, bese unikeza imodeli ye-as-built esho okuyiyo.","section":"tasks","order":176,"keywords":["akuqinisekisiwe","kuqinisekisiwe","kuhloliwe","eziqinisekiswe endaweni","as built","as-built","lod 500","ukuvala","ukunikezela","kulinganiswe endaweni","ithepi","ilaser","ukuskena","ukuhlola umhlaba","isakhiwo esikhona","ukushintsha","maka njengokuhlolwe","ukuqinisekiswa","isigaba 7"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo","text":"Izinyathelo","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-ubone","text":"Okufanele ubone","level":2},{"id":"ukusuka-kuskena","text":"Ukusuka kuskena","level":2},{"id":"imodeli-ye-as-built-nephakethi-yokunikezela","text":"Imodeli ye-as-built nephakethi yokunikezela","level":2},{"id":"indlela-ekugcinwa-ngayo-ku-ifc","text":"Indlela ekugcinwa ngayo ku-IFC","level":2},{"id":"okulandelayo","text":"Okulandelayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGcina ukulandelela lokho okuthile emodelini ngempela okube sekukhona umuntu okubukile. Into inophawu olulodwa kwezintathu, noma alunalo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkuqinisekisiwe\u003C/strong\u003E: uhlelo lukubonile kusuka kwi-PDF, emdwebeni oskeniwe, emdwebeni olandelwe noma kuskena wamafu wamaphoyinti. Akukakho muntu okuhlolile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKuhloliwe\u003C/strong\u003E: umuntu uyiqhathanise nomdwebo ivela kuwo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKuqinisekisiwe endaweni (LOD 500)\u003C/strong\u003E: umuntu uyilinganisile endaweni. Ubani, nini nangaphi kugcinwa nayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAlunophawu\u003C/strong\u003E: idwetshwe umuntu. Imodeli ayenzi isimangalo ngayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo\"\u003EIzinyathelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha into eyodwa noma eminingi (izindonga, iminyango, amawindi, amakamelo, noma yiyiphi into).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKuphaneli \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzici\u003C/span\u003E, vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuqinisekiswa\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThayipha ubani ohlole noma olinganise. Usuku yilolu lwanamuhla uma ungalushintshi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaka njengokuhlolwe\u003C/span\u003E. Ukulinganisa endaweni, khetha indlela yokulinganisa (ithepi, imitha yebanga le-laser, ukuskena, ukuhlola umhlaba) bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaka njengokuqinisekiswe endaweni (LOD 500)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaka njengongaqinisekisiwe\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa impawu\u003C/span\u003E kubuyisela. Ukuchofoza ngakunye kuyisinyathelo esingahlehliswa, ngakho konke okukhethiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkumaka okukhethiwe ngokushesha: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmathuluzi\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaka njengokuhlolwe\u003C/span\u003E (uthayipha: \u003Ccode\u003EMARKCHECKED\u003C/code\u003E) umaka lokho okukhethiwe njengokuhlolwe nguwe, namhlanje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-ubone\"\u003EOkufanele ubone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKuplani, into engakaqinisekiswa inebhokisi elibhoksiwe nombuzo &quot;?&quot;; into eqinisekisiwe endaweni inetiki. Susa ukukhethwa kokuthi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa izimpawu zokuqinisekisa eplanini\u003C/span\u003E kwisigaba \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuhlola\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uzifihle.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlu\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuqinisekiswa\u003C/span\u003E ibhala zonke izinto ezimakiwe nesigaba sazo, isimo, ubani, nini, indlela nokuvela kwazo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuhlola kuhlu izinto ezingakaqinisekiswa, futhi kubala into eqinisekisiwe endaweni njenge-LOD 500. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/audit-the-model\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/audit-the-model\"\u003EHlola imodeli\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukusuka-kuskena\"\u003EUkusuka kuskena\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma uqhathanisa iskena nemodeli, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaka izinto ezifanayo njengeziqinisekisiwe endaweni\u003C/span\u003E umaka yonke into iskena esiyibonile njengoba yakhiwe ngaphakathi kwesilinganiso sokubekezelela, ngendlela ethi &quot;scan&quot; nokubekezelela esihlokweni. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/compare-scan-with-model\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/compare-scan-with-model\"\u003EQhathanisa iskena nemodeli\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELokhu kuqhathanisa kuhambisa ibhokisi lento ngayinye namaphoyinti eskena. Akuyona ukuhlola komhlaba. Yisebenzise ezintweni nawe ozibukile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imodeli-ye-as-built-nephakethi-yokunikezela\"\u003EImodeli ye-as-built nephakethi yokunikezela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhiwa iphakethi yokunikezela\u003C/span\u003E kuthebhu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzimpahla\u003C/span\u003E ifaka imodeli ye-as-built ku-zip, ine:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eisitatimende kuphrojekthi sokuthi izinto eziningi eziqinisekiswe endaweni, eziholiwe, ezingakaqinisekiswa nezingamakiwe;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eas-built/verified-elements.csv\u003C/code\u003E: yonke into negumbi ngalinye nesimo sayo, ubani, nini nangaphi;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eas-built/as-built-drawings.pdf\u003C/code\u003E: iseti yemidwebo njengoba ikunjalo manje;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eushintsho lomdwebo, uma imodeli inamaseti akhishiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/assets-and-maintenance\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/assets-and-maintenance\"\u003EIzimpahla nokugcinwa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"indlela-ekugcinwa-ngayo-ku-ifc\"\u003EIndlela ekugcinwa ngayo ku-IFC\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsicabha ngasinye esimakiwe sithwala isethi yezici \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_Verification\u003C/code\u003E: State, By, On, Method, Source, Note, and LevelOfDevelopment (\u003Ccode\u003ELOD 500\u003C/code\u003E uma iqinisekiswe endaweni). Ziwumbhalo oqobo, ngakho ezinye izinhlelo ziyazibala, futhi Thola, Umbala ngesici nohlu lwamathegi kungazisebenzisa. Isitatimende se-as-built siyisethi yezici \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_AsBuilt\u003C/code\u003E kuphrojekthi. Isicabha esingenaso isethi asilinganiswanga endaweni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulandelayo\"\u003EOkulandelayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/walls-from-plans\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/walls-from-plans\"\u003EIzindonga kusuka emasethini wamapulani\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/audit-the-model\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/audit-the-model\"\u003EHlola imodeli\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Gcina ukulandelela lokho okuthile emodelini ngempela okube sekukhona umuntu okubukile. Into inophawu olulodwa kwezintathu, noma alunalo: Akuqinisekisiwe: uhlelo lukubonile kusuka kwi-PDF, emdwebeni oskeniwe, emdwebeni olandelwe noma kuskena wamafu wamaphoyinti. Akukakho muntu okuhlolile. Kuhloliwe: umuntu uyiqhathanise nomdwebo ivela kuwo. Kuqinisekisiwe endaweni (LOD 500): umuntu uyilinganisile endaweni. Ubani, nini nangaphi kugcinwa nayo. Alunophawu: idwetshwe umuntu. Imodeli ayenzi isimangalo ngayo. Izinyathelo Khetha into eyodwa noma eminingi (izindonga, iminyango, amawindi, amakamelo, noma yiyiphi into). Kuphaneli Izici, vula Ukuqinisekiswa. Thayipha ubani ohlole noma olinganise. Usuku yilolu lwanamuhla uma ungalushintshi. Chofoza Maka njengokuhlolwe. Ukulinganisa endaweni, khetha indlela yokulinganisa (ithepi, imitha yebanga le-laser, ukuskena, ukuhlola umhlaba) bese uchofoza Maka njengokuqinisekiswe endaweni (LOD 500). Maka njengongaqinisekisiwe no-Susa impawu kubuyisela. Ukuchofoza ngakunye kuyisinyathelo esingahlehliswa, ngakho konke okukhethiwe. Ukumaka okukhethiwe ngokushesha: Amathuluzi › Maka njengokuhlolwe (uthayipha: MARKCHECKED) umaka lokho okukhethiwe njengokuhlolwe nguwe, namhlanje. Okufanele ubone Kuplani, into engakaqinisekiswa inebhokisi elibhoksiwe nombuzo \"?\"; into eqinisekisiwe endaweni inetiki. Susa ukukhethwa kokuthi Bonisa izimpawu zokuqinisekisa eplanini kwisigaba Ukuhlola ukuze uzifihle. Uhlu › Ukuqinisekiswa ibhala zonke izinto ezimakiwe nesigaba sazo, isimo, ubani, nini, indlela nokuvela kwazo. Ukuhlola kuhlu izinto ezingakaqinisekiswa, futhi kubala into eqinisekisiwe endaweni njenge-LOD 500. Bheka Hlola imodeli. Ukusuka kuskena Uma uqhathanisa iskena nemodeli, Maka izinto ezifanayo njengeziqinisekisiwe endaweni umaka yonke into iskena esiyibonile njengoba yakhiwe ngaphakathi kwesilinganiso sokubekezelela, ngendlela ethi \"scan\" nokubekezelela esihlokweni. Bheka Qhathanisa iskena nemodeli. Lokhu kuqhathanisa kuhambisa ibhokisi lento ngayinye namaphoyinti eskena. Akuyona ukuhlola komhlaba. Yisebenzise ezintweni nawe ozibukile. Imodeli ye-as-built nephakethi yokunikezela Khiwa iphakethi yokunikezela kuthebhu Izimpahla ifaka imodeli ye-as-built ku-zip, ine: isitatimende kuphrojekthi sokuthi izinto eziningi eziqinisekiswe endaweni, eziholiwe, ezingakaqinisekiswa nezingamakiwe; as-built/verified-elements.csv: yonke into negumbi ngalinye nesimo sayo, ubani, nini nangaphi; as-built/as-built-drawings.pdf: iseti yemidwebo njengoba ikunjalo manje; ushintsho lomdwebo, uma imodeli inamaseti akhishiwe. Bheka Izimpahla nokugcinwa. Indlela ekugcinwa ngayo ku-IFC Isicabha ngasinye esimakiwe sithwala isethi yezici CadCraft_Verification: State, By, On, Method, Source, Note, and LevelOfDevelopment (LOD 500 uma iqinisekiswe endaweni). Ziwumbhalo oqobo, ngakho ezinye izinhlelo ziyazibala, futhi Thola, Umbala ngesici nohlu lwamathegi kungazisebenzisa. Isitatimende se-as-built siyisethi yezici CadCraft_AsBuilt kuphrojekthi. Isicabha esingenaso isethi asilinganiswanga endaweni. Okulandelayo Izindonga kusuka emasethini wamapulani Hlola imodeli","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"work-live","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Sebenzela emodelini eyodwa ndawonye nge-Live TeamWork","summary":"Yini eshintsha ku-BimCraft uma useseshini ye-Live TeamWork evela ku-CadCraft Studio: ukuhlela kwabo bonke ku-imodeli efanayo ye-IFC, ukuhlehlisa komsebenzi wakho, nokujoyina usebenzisa isiphequluli kunethiwekhi efanayo.","section":"tasks","order":199,"keywords":["live","live teamwork","studio live","ndawonye","sebenzisana","iseshini","yabelana live","joyina","ifc","izici","qamba kabusha","umbala","isikhombi","bonana","amagama","ukukhetha","hlehlisa","umphathi"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzofunda","text":"Okuzofunda","level":2},{"id":"bonke-bahlela-ngesikhathi-esisodwa","text":"Bonke bahlela ngesikhathi esisodwa","level":2},{"id":"babonane","text":"Babonane","level":2},{"id":"ukuhlehlisa-kuhlehlisa-umsebenzi-wakho","text":"Ukuhlehlisa kuhlehlisa umsebenzi wakho","level":2},{"id":"joyina-usebenzisa-isiphequluli","text":"Joyina usebenzisa isiphequluli","level":2},{"id":"lapho-iseshini-iphela","text":"Lapho iseshini iphela","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzofunda\"\u003EOkuzofunda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYini eyenzeka ku-modeli ye-IFC uma abantu abaningi behlela ngesikhathi esifanayo. I-CadCraft Studio iqala futhi ijoyine iseshini ye-Live TeamWork (Yabelana, Joyina); leli khasi likhuluma ngemodeli ngokwayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bonke-bahlela-ngesikhathi-esisodwa\"\u003EBonke bahlela ngesikhathi esisodwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImodeli yomphathi ifika kubo bonke abajoyina. Qamba kabusha izinto, shintsha amanani ezici zazo, faka, shintsha noma susa amathuluzi nezinto njengoba kujwayelekile. Ukuhlela kwakho kubonakala masinyane; ukuhlela kwabanye kuvela kancane ngemva kokuthi bakwenze. Uma ukuhlela kushintsha into oyibonayo (into efakiwe noma esusiwe), i-BimCraft iphinde idwebe imodeli futhi igcine ukubuka kwakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAbantu ababili beshintsha into eyodwa:\u003C/strong\u003E ushintsho olwenziwe kamuva emugqeni ofanayo wemodeli luyanqoba. Isethi yezici eyabelwana ngezinto eziningi ikhopishelwa into oyihlelayo, njengakuqala, ukuze ezinye zigcine amanani azo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInto abanye abantu eyisusile sekuthe:\u003C/strong\u003E ayisakwazi ukuhlelwa. Ukuhlela kwakho kuyahlehliswa, futhi ibha yesimo ichaza ukuthi kungani.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImigqa emisha yomuntu ngamunye kumodeli ithola izinombolo zayo, ukuze abantu ababili bangalibali ngenombolo efanayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"babonane\"\u003EBabonane\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWonke umuntu oseshini unombala wakhe. Ku-ukubuka kwe-3D ubona isikhombi somuntu ngamunye njengomcibisholo ngombala wakhe negama lakhe eduze kwawo, esinqumeni asikhomba kuso, kanye nebhokisi elimile ngombala wakhe elizungeze ngayinye yezinto abayikhethile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzikhombi, amagama nokukhethwa kuseshini kuphela: akusoze kulondolozwe efayelini futhi akusoze kungene ekuhlehliseni komuntu. Ziyashelela zingene lapho kukhona ngayinye yabantu, ngakho zihlala zibushelelezi nakuxhumo oluhamba kancane.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuhlehlisa-kuhlehlisa-umsebenzi-wakho\"\u003EUkuhlehlisa kuhlehlisa umsebenzi wakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlehlisa\u003C/span\u003E uhlehlisa ukuhlela kwakho kokugcina futhi ushiye ukwabanye bonke. Uma othile eshintshe into efanayo kusukela lapho, akukho okuhlehliswayo futhi ibha yesimo itshela ukuthi ngubani.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"joyina-usebenzisa-isiphequluli\"\u003EJoyina usebenzisa isiphequluli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIlungu lethimba elingenayo i-Studio lingaskena isithombe ngaphansi kwekhodi lomphathi ngefoni, ithebhulethi noma ikhompyutha kunethiwekhi efanayo. I-BimCraft ivula esiphequluli futhi ivule imodeli yomphathi uma umphathi evumela ukungena. Isixhumanisi sokumema sivumela umuntu ukuthi ajoyine kwenye inethiwekhi: umphathi udinga isihlalo se-Team Cloud Plan sale-app, abanye bonke bajoyina mahhala, futhi isixhumanisi sisebenza kuphela uma iseshini yomphathi ivulekile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lapho-iseshini-iphela\"\u003ELapho iseshini iphela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmphathi kuphela ulondoloza imodeli. Abanye bonke bagcina ikhophi engalondolozwanga: sebenzisa Londoloza njenge-IFC uma ufuna ukuyigcina.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImodeli yokuqala kuphela esigcemeni ihlanganyelwa. Ukuvula enye ifayela ngesikhathi seshini kushiya iseshini kulowo iwindi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Okuzofunda Yini eyenzeka ku-modeli ye-IFC uma abantu abaningi behlela ngesikhathi esifanayo. I-CadCraft Studio iqala futhi ijoyine iseshini ye-Live TeamWork (Yabelana, Joyina); leli khasi likhuluma ngemodeli ngokwayo. Bonke bahlela ngesikhathi esisodwa Imodeli yomphathi ifika kubo bonke abajoyina. Qamba kabusha izinto, shintsha amanani ezici zazo, faka, shintsha noma susa amathuluzi nezinto njengoba kujwayelekile. Ukuhlela kwakho kubonakala masinyane; ukuhlela kwabanye kuvela kancane ngemva kokuthi bakwenze. Uma ukuhlela kushintsha into oyibonayo (into efakiwe noma esusiwe), i-BimCraft iphinde idwebe imodeli futhi igcine ukubuka kwakho. Abantu ababili beshintsha into eyodwa: ushintsho olwenziwe kamuva emugqeni ofanayo wemodeli luyanqoba. Isethi yezici eyabelwana ngezinto eziningi ikhopishelwa into oyihlelayo, njengakuqala, ukuze ezinye zigcine amanani azo. Into abanye abantu eyisusile sekuthe: ayisakwazi ukuhlelwa. Ukuhlela kwakho kuyahlehliswa, futhi ibha yesimo ichaza ukuthi kungani. Imigqa emisha yomuntu ngamunye kumodeli ithola izinombolo zayo, ukuze abantu ababili bangalibali ngenombolo efanayo. Babonane Wonke umuntu oseshini unombala wakhe. Ku-ukubuka kwe-3D ubona isikhombi somuntu ngamunye njengomcibisholo ngombala wakhe negama lakhe eduze kwawo, esinqumeni asikhomba kuso, kanye nebhokisi elimile ngombala wakhe elizungeze ngayinye yezinto abayikhethile. Izikhombi, amagama nokukhethwa kuseshini kuphela: akusoze kulondolozwe efayelini futhi akusoze kungene ekuhlehliseni komuntu. Ziyashelela zingene lapho kukhona ngayinye yabantu, ngakho zihlala zibushelelezi nakuxhumo oluhamba kancane. Ukuhlehlisa kuhlehlisa umsebenzi wakho Hlehlisa uhlehlisa ukuhlela kwakho kokugcina futhi ushiye ukwabanye bonke. Uma othile eshintshe into efanayo kusukela lapho, akukho okuhlehliswayo futhi ibha yesimo itshela ukuthi ngubani. Joyina usebenzisa isiphequluli Ilungu lethimba elingenayo i-Studio lingaskena isithombe ngaphansi kwekhodi lomphathi ngefoni, ithebhulethi noma ikhompyutha kunethiwekhi efanayo. I-BimCraft ivula esiphequluli futhi ivule imodeli yomphathi uma umphathi evumela ukungena. Isixhumanisi sokumema sivumela umuntu ukuthi ajoyine kwenye inethiwekhi: umphathi udinga isihlalo se-Team Cloud Plan sale-app, abanye bonke bajoyina mahhala, futhi isixhumanisi sisebenza kuphela uma iseshini yomphathi ivulekile. Lapho iseshini iphela Umphathi kuphela ulondoloza imodeli. Abanye bonke bagcina ikhophi engalondolozwanga: sebenzisa Londoloza njenge-IFC uma ufuna ukuyigcina. Imodeli yokuqala kuphela esigcemeni ihlanganyelwa. Ukuvula enye ifayela ngesikhathi seshini kushiya iseshini kulowo iwindi.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"coming-from","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Uvela kwezinye izinhlelo ze-BIM nezokudweba","summary":"Indlela izinkambiso zesofthiwe yokwakha ye-BIM yedeskithophu nokubuka amafayela e-DWG ezihambisana ngayo ne-BimCraft, kanye nemihlukano edida abantu.","section":"switching","order":10,"keywords":["ukushintsha","ukudlulisa","ejwayelekile","desktop bim","umndeni","amapharamitha","isiphequluli sephrojekthi","ipharetha yezici","view cube","xref","isiphathi songqimba","umehluko","qhathanisa"],"headings":[{"id":"izinkambiso-ezihlelelwe","text":"Izinkambiso ezihlelelwe","level":2},{"id":"ukusuka-ekubukeni-amafayela-e-dwg","text":"Ukusuka ekubukeni amafayela e-DWG","level":2},{"id":"umehluko-ohlupha-abantu","text":"Umehluko ohlupha abantu","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EUma wazi i-Revit, iningi le-BimCraft lizokuzwakala lijwayelekile ngamagama, lishaye ngokuphelele ngobubanzi. Umehluko obaluleke kakhulu: lolu hlobo lufunda futhi luhlola amamodeli futhi lulungise idatha ye-IFC. \u003Cstrong\u003EAlukwazi ukudweba njenge-Revit okwamanje.\u003C/strong\u003E Awukwazi ukudweba udonga, ukubeka imindeni, ukwenza izibuko noma amashidi, noma ukulondoloza ifayela leprojekthi. Okungenzeka ukwenza ukuvula cishe noma yisiphi isakhiwo ngalo nakanoma yikuphi, ukubona okukuwo, ukuhlola ifolda yonke yephrojekthi, nokulungisa idatha kumodeli ye-IFC.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinkambiso-ezihlelelwe\"\u003EIzinkambiso ezihlelelwe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUma ujwayele\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKu-BimCraft\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuvula i-\u003Ccode\u003E.rvt\u003C/code\u003E ku-Revit ukuze ubone imodeli\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-BimCraft ivula i-\u003Ccode\u003E.rvt\u003C/code\u003E njengekhadi lefayela: ukukhishwa, ulwazi lwephrojekthi, izixhumanisi, isibonelo. Ngemodeli ye-3D, thumela i-IFC bese uyivula. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/read-rvt-file\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/read-rvt-file\"\u003EFunda ifayela lephrojekthi noma lomndeni\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuhlola ukuthi ifayela lagcinwa ekukhishweni kuphi ngaphambi kokulivula\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkhadi lithi &quot;igcinwe ku-Revit …&quot; phezulu, ngaphandle kokuthuthukisa noma ukuthinta ifayela\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsiphequluli sephrojekthi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkukho siphequluli sezibuko namashidi. Imodeli ye-IFC inezinhlu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzitezi\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinto\u003C/span\u003E; idwebo linamathebhu eshidi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIpharetha yezici\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIphaneli \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzici\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesokudla, yento oyichofozile. Amasethi ezici e-IFC esikhundleni samaqembu wamapharamitha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmapharamitha wesibonelo nohlobo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmasethi ezici wesibonelo, namasethi amakhonjwa ngokuthi &quot;(type)&quot;. Ukushintsha kohlobo kusebenza kuzo zonke izinto zohlobo, njenge-Revit. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/type-vs-instance\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/type-vs-instance\"\u003EShintsha isici sohlobo kuzo zonke izinto zohlobo\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHlela uhlobo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkukho ibhokisi lencazelo: chofoza inani kusethi ethi &quot;(type)&quot; bese uthayipha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkukhetha izinto eziningi, izihlungi, Khetha wonke amasibonelo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInto eyodwa ngesikhathi. Akukakhiwa okwamanje\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkyubu lokubuka nevili lokuzula\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkyubu lokubuka ekhoneni elingezansi kwesokudla, izinkinobho ezine (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELwanele\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhezulu\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhambili\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlangothi\u003C/span\u003E) nokuzungeza okukhululekile. Akukho vili lokuzula\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShift nokudonsa ngenkinobho ephakathi ukuzungeza, ukudonsa ngenkinobho ephakathi ukushelelisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkudonsa ngenkinobho yesokunxele kuzungeza, ukudonsa ngenkinobho yesokudla (noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E nokudonsa) kushelelisa, insudo izondeza. Isitayela semenyu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbha ye-BIM\u003C/span\u003E sishintshela ekushelelisweni ngenkinobho ephakathi nokuzungeza nge-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E nenkinobho ephakathi. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\"\u003EImenyu, okhiye nembewu\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmaplani wamaphansi, izigaba, amabhokisi ezigaba\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIpuleni eyodwa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsigaba\u003C/span\u003E ngesikhathi (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E); akukho bhokisi lesigaba noma amaplani e-2D. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/section-plane\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/section-plane\"\u003ESika imodeli ye-IFC ngendiza yesigaba\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkufihla ekubukeni, ukuhlukanisa, ukubonakala/izinhlobo zokubonakala\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzitezi\u003C/span\u003E ziyavulwa nevaliwe, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzindawo\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImiphetho\u003C/span\u003E. Akukho ukufihla ngokwento okwamanje\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmagumbi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzindawo ze-IFC, zifihliwe ekuqaleni. Chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzindawo\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELondoloza, Londoloza njenge, hlanganisa nesikhungo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGcina njenge-IFC\u003C/span\u003E ilanda ifayela le-IFC elisha. Umthombo awushintshi. Akukho sikhungo, akukho ukwabelana ngomsebenzi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHlehlisa nge-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsebenza ezinguqukweni ze-IFC kuze kube yilapho ulondoloza. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/edit-ifc-properties\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/edit-ifc-properties\"\u003EShintsha izici ze-IFC bese ulondoloza ikhophi eshintshiwe\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhatha izixhumanisi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVula ifolda yephrojekthi: wonke amaxhumanisi ahlolwa futhi amakhonjwa nge-\u003Cstrong\u003EKule folda\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EIgama elifanayo litholakele\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EIfayela lomtapo\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003EAkukho kule folda\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/open-project-folder\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/open-project-folder\"\u003EVula ifolda yephrojekthi yonke\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuhlola, noma ukuvula ifayela ukubona ukuthi lonakele yini\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmbiko wefolda uhlola yonke ikhophi nokhokho ukuthi awaphelelanga, ngemizuzwana. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/check-folder-health\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/check-folder-health\"\u003EHlola ifolda ukuze uthole amakhophi alimele\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkukhetha ifayela elifanele kufolda ehlelekile\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbhokisi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQala lapha\u003C/span\u003E liphakamisa elilodwa, linezizathu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma uvula amamodeli ikakhulu ukuze uwahlole, njengohlelo lokuhlola noma lokubuka i-IFC, khetha isitayela semenyu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsibukeli\u003C/span\u003E: amathuluzi okubuka nokuhlola aza phambili, amathuluzi okwakha asala ngaphakathi kwemenyu eyodwa. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\"\u003EImenyu, okhiye nembewu\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukusuka-ekubukeni-amafayela-e-dwg\"\u003EUkusuka ekubukeni amafayela e-DWG\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma uvula ama-DWG ku-AutoCAD noma isibukeli se-DWG:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUma ujwayele\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKu-BimCraft\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmathebhu emodeli nesakhiwo ngaphansi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmathebhu aphezu komdwebo: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImodeli\u003C/span\u003E kanye nelilodwa ngalinye leshidi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZOOM Extents, chofoza kabili insudo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza kabili, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELwanele\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShelelisa ngenkinobho ephakathi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDonsa ngenkinobho noma iyiphi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsiphathi songqimba\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUhlu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzingqimba\u003C/span\u003E: khonza ukuze ubonise, khipha ukuze ufihle, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKonke kuvuliwe\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKonke kuvaliwe\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsiphathi se-xref\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmadwebo axhunyiwe\u003C/strong\u003E ngakwesokudla, anokuthi \u003Cstrong\u003EIyabonakala\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003EAkutholakalanga\u003C/strong\u003E, kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza amadwebo axhunyiwe…\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkubuka ngaphambi kokuprinta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubuka kokuphrinta\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: okumnyama ephepheni elimhlophe nobubanzi bemigqa. Akuphrintwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkukhishwa kwedatha yezici zebhulokhi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIthebhu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinsiza\u003C/span\u003E yemidwebo yokudla enamathegi, nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELanda i-CSV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinganisa, dweba, hlela, gcina njenge\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkukho ku-BimCraft. Uhlelo lokudweba lwe-CadCraft luyadweba luhlele\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"umehluko-ohlupha-abantu\"\u003EUmehluko ohlupha abantu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsebenza kusiphequluli, futhi isiphequluli sinakekela amafayela akho.\u003C/strong\u003E I-BimCraft ingafunda kuphela amafayela namafolda owanikeza wona, ngokuwakhetha noma ngokuwahudula ngaphakathi. Ayikwazi ukuvula ifayela ngokwayo, futhi ayikwazi ukulondoloza phezu kwalo. Yonke into elondolozwayo ilandwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkulayishwa lutho.\u003C/strong\u003E Amagama ethi &quot;upload&quot; kwezinye izingxoxo zamafolda zesiphequluli ngamagama asesiphequluli. Amafayela ahlala kukhompyutha yakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EI-IFC yifomethi yemodeli.\u003C/strong\u003E Ifayela leprojekthi livula njengekhadi ngoba okuqukethwe kwalo kwe-3D akuchazwanga. Thatha i-IFC njengendlela amamodeli angena ngayo ku-BimCraft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuhlela kwenza ikhophi.\u003C/strong\u003E Ukushintsha inani lesinto kakukaze kushintshe izakhi eziseduze, ngisho noma umthumeli wabelana ngalelo nani phakathi kwazo. Izici zohlobo yikhethelo elihlosiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkukho phrojekthi, akukho mibono.\u003C/strong\u003E I-BimCraft ibonisa ifayela elilodwa ngesikhathi futhi ayikhumbuli lutho ngalo ngemva kokuvala ithebhu, ngaphandle kwamagama wamafolda amuva ku-Chrome ne-Edge.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOkhiye bekaMac.\u003C/strong\u003E Lapho okhiye be-Revit beWindows besebenzisa i-Ctrl, okhiye be-BimCraft basebenzisa \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: i-Command kuMac.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinkinobho zakho zembewu.\u003C/strong\u003E Ukuzungeza kuyinkinobho yesokunxele, hhayi i-Shift nenkinobho ephakathi, ngaphandle uma ukhetha isitayela semenyu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbha ye-BIM\u003C/span\u003E noma usetha izinkinobho ngokwakho ku-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\"\u003EImenyu, okhiye nembewu\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EYini engakakhiwe\u003C/a\u003E ukuze uthole okufanele usebenzise esikhundleni salokho namuhla.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Uma wazi i-Revit, iningi le-BimCraft lizokuzwakala lijwayelekile ngamagama, lishaye ngokuphelele ngobubanzi. Umehluko obaluleke kakhulu: lolu hlobo lufunda futhi luhlola amamodeli futhi lulungise idatha ye-IFC. Alukwazi ukudweba njenge-Revit okwamanje. Awukwazi ukudweba udonga, ukubeka imindeni, ukwenza izibuko noma amashidi, noma ukulondoloza ifayela leprojekthi. Okungenzeka ukwenza ukuvula cishe noma yisiphi isakhiwo ngalo nakanoma yikuphi, ukubona okukuwo, ukuhlola ifolda yonke yephrojekthi, nokulungisa idatha kumodeli ye-IFC. Izinkambiso ezihlelelwe Uma ujwayele Ku-BimCraft Ukuvula i-.rvt ku-Revit ukuze ubone imodeli I-BimCraft ivula i-.rvt njengekhadi lefayela: ukukhishwa, ulwazi lwephrojekthi, izixhumanisi, isibonelo. Ngemodeli ye-3D, thumela i-IFC bese uyivula. Funda ifayela lephrojekthi noma lomndeni Ukuhlola ukuthi ifayela lagcinwa ekukhishweni kuphi ngaphambi kokulivula Ikhadi lithi \"igcinwe ku-Revit …\" phezulu, ngaphandle kokuthuthukisa noma ukuthinta ifayela Isiphequluli sephrojekthi Akukho siphequluli sezibuko namashidi. Imodeli ye-IFC inezinhlu Izitezi kanye Izinto; idwebo linamathebhu eshidi Ipharetha yezici Iphaneli Izici ngakwesokudla, yento oyichofozile. Amasethi ezici e-IFC esikhundleni samaqembu wamapharamitha Amapharamitha wesibonelo nohlobo Amasethi ezici wesibonelo, namasethi amakhonjwa ngokuthi \"(type)\". Ukushintsha kohlobo kusebenza kuzo zonke izinto zohlobo, njenge-Revit. Shintsha isici sohlobo kuzo zonke izinto zohlobo Hlela uhlobo Akukho ibhokisi lencazelo: chofoza inani kusethi ethi \"(type)\" bese uthayipha Ukukhetha izinto eziningi, izihlungi, Khetha wonke amasibonelo Into eyodwa ngesikhathi. Akukakhiwa okwamanje Ikyubu lokubuka nevili lokuzula Ikyubu lokubuka ekhoneni elingezansi kwesokudla, izinkinobho ezine (Lwanele, Phezulu, Phambili, Uhlangothi) nokuzungeza okukhululekile. Akukho vili lokuzula Shift nokudonsa ngenkinobho ephakathi ukuzungeza, ukudonsa ngenkinobho ephakathi ukushelelisa Ukudonsa ngenkinobho yesokunxele kuzungeza, ukudonsa ngenkinobho yesokudla (noma Shift nokudonsa) kushelelisa, insudo izondeza. Isitayela semenyu Ibha ye-BIM sishintshela ekushelelisweni ngenkinobho ephakathi nokuzungeza nge-Shift nenkinobho ephakathi. Imenyu, okhiye nembewu Amaplani wamaphansi, izigaba, amabhokisi ezigaba Ipuleni eyodwa Isigaba ngesikhathi (X); akukho bhokisi lesigaba noma amaplani e-2D. Sika imodeli ye-IFC ngendiza yesigaba Ukufihla ekubukeni, ukuhlukanisa, ukubonakala/izinhlobo zokubonakala Izitezi ziyavulwa nevaliwe, Izindawo ne-Imiphetho. Akukho ukufihla ngokwento okwamanje Amagumbi Izindawo ze-IFC, zifihliwe ekuqaleni. Chofoza Izindawo Londoloza, Londoloza njenge, hlanganisa nesikhungo Gcina njenge-IFC ilanda ifayela le-IFC elisha. Umthombo awushintshi. Akukho sikhungo, akukho ukwabelana ngomsebenzi Hlehlisa nge-Ctrl+Z Isebenza ezinguqukweni ze-IFC kuze kube yilapho ulondoloza. Shintsha izici ze-IFC bese ulondoloza ikhophi eshintshiwe Phatha izixhumanisi Vula ifolda yephrojekthi: wonke amaxhumanisi ahlolwa futhi amakhonjwa nge-Kule folda, Igama elifanayo litholakele, Ifayela lomtapo noma Akukho kule folda. Vula ifolda yephrojekthi yonke Ukuhlola, noma ukuvula ifayela ukubona ukuthi lonakele yini Umbiko wefolda uhlola yonke ikhophi nokhokho ukuthi awaphelelanga, ngemizuzwana. Hlola ifolda ukuze uthole amakhophi alimele Ukukhetha ifayela elifanele kufolda ehlelekile Ibhokisi Qala lapha liphakamisa elilodwa, linezizathu Uma uvula amamodeli ikakhulu ukuze uwahlole, njengohlelo lokuhlola noma lokubuka i-IFC, khetha isitayela semenyu Isibukeli: amathuluzi okubuka nokuhlola aza phambili, amathuluzi okwakha asala ngaphakathi kwemenyu eyodwa. Bona Imenyu, okhiye nembewu. Ukusuka ekubukeni amafayela e-DWG Uma uvula ama-DWG ku-AutoCAD noma isibukeli se-DWG: Uma ujwayele Ku-BimCraft Amathebhu emodeli nesakhiwo ngaphansi Amathebhu aphezu komdwebo: Imodeli kanye nelilodwa ngalinye leshidi ZOOM Extents, chofoza kabili insudo Chofoza kabili, F noma Lwanele Shelelisa ngenkinobho ephakathi Donsa ngenkinobho noma iyiphi Isiphathi songqimba Uhlu Izingqimba: khonza ukuze ubonise, khipha ukuze ufihle, Konke kuvuliwe kanye Konke kuvaliwe Isiphathi se-xref Amadwebo axhunyiwe ngakwesokudla, anokuthi Iyabonakala noma Akutholakalanga, kanye Engeza amadwebo axhunyiwe… Ukubuka ngaphambi kokuprinta Ukubuka kokuphrinta noma P: okumnyama ephepheni elimhlophe nobubanzi bemigqa. Akuphrintwa Ukukhishwa kwedatha yezici zebhulokhi Ithebhu Izinsiza yemidwebo yokudla enamathegi, nge-Landa i-CSV Linganisa, dweba, hlela, gcina njenge Akukho ku-BimCraft. Uhlelo lokudweba lwe-CadCraft luyadweba luhlele Umehluko ohlupha abantu Isebenza kusiphequluli, futhi isiphequluli sinakekela amafayela akho. I-BimCraft ingafunda kuphela amafayela namafolda owanikeza wona, ngokuwakhetha noma ngokuwahudula ngaphakathi. Ayikwazi ukuvula ifayela ngokwayo, futhi ayikwazi ukulondoloza phezu kwalo. Yonke into elondolozwayo ilandwa. Akulayishwa lutho. Amagama ethi \"upload\" kwezinye izingxoxo zamafolda zesiphequluli ngamagama asesiphequluli. Amafayela ahlala kukhompyutha yakho. I-IFC yifomethi yemodeli. Ifayela leprojekthi livula njengekhadi ngoba okuqukethwe kwalo kwe-3D akuchazwanga. Thatha i-IFC njengendlela amamodeli angena ngayo ku-BimCraft. Ukuhlela kwenza ikhophi. Ukushintsha inani lesinto kakukaze kushintshe izakhi eziseduze, ngisho noma umthumeli wabelana ngalelo nani phakathi kwazo. Izici zohlobo yikhethelo elihlosiwe. Akukho phrojekthi, akukho mibono. I-BimCraft ibonisa ifayela elilodwa ngesikhathi futhi ayikhumbuli lutho ngalo ngemva kokuvala ithebhu, ngaphandle kwamagama wamafolda amuva ku-Chrome ne-Edge. Okhiye bekaMac. Lapho okhiye be-Revit beWindows besebenzisa i-Ctrl, okhiye be-BimCraft basebenzisa Ctrl: i-Command kuMac. Izinkinobho zakho zembewu. Ukuzungeza kuyinkinobho yesokunxele, hhayi i-Shift nenkinobho ephakathi, ngaphandle uma ukhetha isitayela semenyu Ibha ye-BIM noma usetha izinkinobho ngokwakho ku-Imenyu, okhiye nembewu. Bona Yini engakakhiwe ukuze uthole okufanele usebenzise esikhundleni salokho namuhla.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"two-bim-programs","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Ukusebenza phakathi kwezinhlelo ezimbili ze-BIM","summary":"Thumela imodeli isuka kuhlelo olulodwa lwe-BIM iye kwelinye nge-IFC ne-BimCraft ephakathi, gcina ama-GlobalId, amasethi ezakhiwo nokuhlukaniswa, setha zombili izinhlelo ngezakhiwo ezifanayo, bese ubona okubuyile.","section":"switching","order":40,"keywords":["ifc","uhambo oluphindwayo","ukusebenziseka ndawonye","globalid","guid","amasethi ezakhiwo","psets","ukuhlukaniswa","izipharamitha ezabiwe","ukumaphayo kwezakhiwo","umhumushi","bcf","ukuhlelwa","ukudluliswa"],"headings":[{"id":"okuzokwenza","text":"Okuzokwenza","level":2},{"id":"okugcinwa-yi-bimcraft","text":"Okugcinwa yi-BimCraft","level":2},{"id":"setha-zombili-izinhlelo-ngezakhiwo-ezifanayo","text":"Setha zombili izinhlelo ngezakhiwo ezifanayo","level":2},{"id":"thumela-imodeli-ubuye-nayo","text":"Thumela imodeli ubuye nayo","level":2},{"id":"funda-umbiko","text":"Funda umbiko","level":2},{"id":"izinkinga-zihamba-njenge-bcf","text":"Izinkinga zihamba njenge-BCF","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuzokwenza\"\u003EOkuzokwenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHambisa imodeli phakathi kwezinhlelo ezimbili ze-BIM, isibonelo kusuka ku-Revit kuya ku-Archicad nakubuyele, ngokudlula ku-IFC, ne-BimCraft phakathi ukuze ihlole, yengeze kuyo futhi ibike okusinde. Akukho ifomethi yefayela yalolo hlelo elifundwa: konke kuhamba njenge-IFC.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okugcinwa-yi-bimcraft\"\u003EOkugcinwa yi-BimCraft\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma ushintsha imodeli ku-BimCraft bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGcina njenge-IFC\u003C/span\u003E, yonke into ongayishintshanga ibhalwa kabusha njengoba yayinjalo. Ngakho:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAma-GlobalId\u003C/strong\u003E ahlala efanayo, ukuze enye inhlelo ihlanganise ngayinye yento eyayithumele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmasethi ezakhiwo\u003C/strong\u003E namanani awo ahlala, ngaphandle kwamanani owashintshile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuhlukaniswa\u003C/strong\u003E kuhlala kuxhunyelwe ezintweni zakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"setha-zombili-izinhlelo-ngezakhiwo-ezifanayo\"\u003ESetha zombili izinhlelo ngezakhiwo ezifanayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula imodeli ku-BimCraft (nephakheji lephrojekthi, uma unalo: amaqembu alo ezakhiwo ayengezwa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgakwesokunxele, vula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhakathi kwezinhlelo ezimbili ze-BIM\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EUkumaphayo kwezakhiwo\u003C/strong\u003E, landa okudingwa yiyo yonke inhlelo:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzipharamitha ezabiwe\u003C/span\u003E: ifayela lepharamitha elabiwe. Ku-Revit, lilayishe nge-Manage › Shared Parameters bese wengeza izipharamitha ezigabeni eziyidingayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmasethi ezakhiwo wokuthumela i-IFC\u003C/span\u003E: ifayela lesethi yezakhiwo echazwe umsebenzisi. Ezilungiselelweni zokuthumela i-IFC ye-Revit, khetha lo ngaphansi kwamasethi ezakhiwo achazwe umsebenzisi, ukuze i-IFC ethunyelwe ithwale isethi namagama ezakhiwo afanayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIthebula lokumaphayo (CSV)\u003C/span\u003E: yonke into enesethi yayo ye-IFC negama, uhlobo lwayo, namagama afanayo kuyo yonke inhlelo. Amafayela okumaphayo e-Archicad awasiyo ifomethi eshicilelwe, ngakho hlela umhumushi wawo we-IFC nomphathi wezakhiwo ngesandla usebenzisa leli thebula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfayela lokumaphayo\u003C/span\u003E: konke ukumaphayo njengefayela elilodwa, ukuze ligcinwe nephrojekthi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmasethi ajwayelekile (Pset_ no-Qto_) ashiywa ngaphandle kwefayela lepharamitha elabiwe: zombili izinhlelo zizibhala kudatha yazo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"thumela-imodeli-ubuye-nayo\"\u003EThumela imodeli ubuye nayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhipha i-IFC kusuka kuhlelo lokuqala ngama-GlobalId agciniwe (Revit: &quot;Store the IFC GUID in an element parameter after export&quot; ivuliwe).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula kwi-BimCraft, uhlole (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuhlola imodeli\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuhlola ukungqubuzana\u003C/span\u003E), wengeze izinkinga (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinkinga\u003C/span\u003E, BCF), shintsha amanani uma udinga, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGcina njenge-IFC\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula i-IFC egciniwe kwinhlelo yesibili, usebenze kuyo, bese uthumela i-IFC kusuka kuleyo nhlelo ngama-GlobalId agciniwe (umhumushi we-Archicad: &quot;Global Unique Identifiers: Keep existing&quot;).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEbuyela ku-BimCraft, vula imodeli ephumile, bese wengeza leyo ebuyile (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza imodeli\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwe-Amamodeli).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhakathi kwezinhlelo ezimbili ze-BIM\u003C/span\u003E, khetha \u003Cstrong\u003EKuphume\u003C/strong\u003E no \u003Cstrong\u003EKubuyile\u003C/strong\u003E, bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYenza umbiko\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"funda-umbiko\"\u003EFunda umbiko\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzinto\u003C/strong\u003E: zingaki ezibuyile nge-GlobalId efanayo, zingaki ezingekho, nezingaki ezintsha. Izinto ngeGlobalId entsha zibonakala njengezingekho nezintsha: enye inhlelo ayizigcinanga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUhlobo lwe-IFC lushintshile\u003C/strong\u003E: izinto ezibuyile njengohlobo lwento oluhlukile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmanani ezici agcinwe\u003C/strong\u003E: ingxenye yamanani abuyela ngaphandle kokushintshwa. Uhlu oluphansi lubonisa izici ezinamanani ashintshe kakhulu noma ashoweyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuhlukaniswa\u003C/strong\u003E: kugcinwe, kushintshiwe (uhlelo olufanayo, ikhodi ehlukile) noma kushoweyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELanda umbiko (CSV)\u003C/span\u003E inikeza yonke into nenombolo yayo. Ukuze ubone izinto ezihambe noma eshintshe ukwakheka, sebenzisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQhathanisa izinguqulo\u003C/span\u003E kumamodeli amabili afanayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-BimCraft ayisebenzisi nakuphi kwalezi zinhlelo ezimbili. Ukuthi yiziphi izilungiselelo ezidlulisa inani zincike ezilungiselelweni ze-IFC zohlelo ngalunye: umbiko ubonisa okubuyile ngempela, ngakho zama isilungiselelo, khipha futhi uqhathanise.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinkinga-zihamba-njenge-bcf\"\u003EIzinkinga zihamba njenge-BCF\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinkinga ozikhulisa ku-BimCraft zikhishwa njenge-BCF (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinkinga\u003C/span\u003E), okufundeka ngamathuluzi awo e-BCF ngazo zombili izinhlelo, ngakho umbuzo mayelana nento ufika kumuntu osebenza kwenye inhlelo ngombono wayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBona futhi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/open-project-bundle\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/open-project-bundle\"\u003EVula iphakheji lephrojekthi\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/rvt-to-ifc\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/rvt-to-ifc\"\u003EKusuka kufayela lephrojekthi kuya ku-BimCraft nge-IFC\u003C/a\u003E kanye \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/compare-versions\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/compare-versions\"\u003EQhathanisa izinguqulo ezimbili zemodeli\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Okuzokwenza Hambisa imodeli phakathi kwezinhlelo ezimbili ze-BIM, isibonelo kusuka ku-Revit kuya ku-Archicad nakubuyele, ngokudlula ku-IFC, ne-BimCraft phakathi ukuze ihlole, yengeze kuyo futhi ibike okusinde. Akukho ifomethi yefayela yalolo hlelo elifundwa: konke kuhamba njenge-IFC. Okugcinwa yi-BimCraft Uma ushintsha imodeli ku-BimCraft bese uchofoza Gcina njenge-IFC, yonke into ongayishintshanga ibhalwa kabusha njengoba yayinjalo. Ngakho: Ama-GlobalId ahlala efanayo, ukuze enye inhlelo ihlanganise ngayinye yento eyayithumele. Amasethi ezakhiwo namanani awo ahlala, ngaphandle kwamanani owashintshile. Ukuhlukaniswa kuhlala kuxhunyelwe ezintweni zakho. Setha zombili izinhlelo ngezakhiwo ezifanayo Vula imodeli ku-BimCraft (nephakheji lephrojekthi, uma unalo: amaqembu alo ezakhiwo ayengezwa). Ngakwesokunxele, vula Phakathi kwezinhlelo ezimbili ze-BIM. Ngaphansi kwe-Ukumaphayo kwezakhiwo, landa okudingwa yiyo yonke inhlelo: Izipharamitha ezabiwe: ifayela lepharamitha elabiwe. Ku-Revit, lilayishe nge-Manage › Shared Parameters bese wengeza izipharamitha ezigabeni eziyidingayo. Amasethi ezakhiwo wokuthumela i-IFC: ifayela lesethi yezakhiwo echazwe umsebenzisi. Ezilungiselelweni zokuthumela i-IFC ye-Revit, khetha lo ngaphansi kwamasethi ezakhiwo achazwe umsebenzisi, ukuze i-IFC ethunyelwe ithwale isethi namagama ezakhiwo afanayo. Ithebula lokumaphayo (CSV): yonke into enesethi yayo ye-IFC negama, uhlobo lwayo, namagama afanayo kuyo yonke inhlelo. Amafayela okumaphayo e-Archicad awasiyo ifomethi eshicilelwe, ngakho hlela umhumushi wawo we-IFC nomphathi wezakhiwo ngesandla usebenzisa leli thebula. Ifayela lokumaphayo: konke ukumaphayo njengefayela elilodwa, ukuze ligcinwe nephrojekthi. Amasethi ajwayelekile (Pset_ no-Qto_) ashiywa ngaphandle kwefayela lepharamitha elabiwe: zombili izinhlelo zizibhala kudatha yazo. Thumela imodeli ubuye nayo Khipha i-IFC kusuka kuhlelo lokuqala ngama-GlobalId agciniwe (Revit: \"Store the IFC GUID in an element parameter after export\" ivuliwe). Vula kwi-BimCraft, uhlole (Ukuhlola imodeli, Ukuhlola ukungqubuzana), wengeze izinkinga (Izinkinga, BCF), shintsha amanani uma udinga, bese Gcina njenge-IFC. Vula i-IFC egciniwe kwinhlelo yesibili, usebenze kuyo, bese uthumela i-IFC kusuka kuleyo nhlelo ngama-GlobalId agciniwe (umhumushi we-Archicad: \"Global Unique Identifiers: Keep existing\"). Ebuyela ku-BimCraft, vula imodeli ephumile, bese wengeza leyo ebuyile (Engeza imodeli ngaphansi kwe-Amamodeli). Ku-Phakathi kwezinhlelo ezimbili ze-BIM, khetha Kuphume no Kubuyile, bese uchofoza Yenza umbiko. Funda umbiko Izinto: zingaki ezibuyile nge-GlobalId efanayo, zingaki ezingekho, nezingaki ezintsha. Izinto ngeGlobalId entsha zibonakala njengezingekho nezintsha: enye inhlelo ayizigcinanga. Uhlobo lwe-IFC lushintshile: izinto ezibuyile njengohlobo lwento oluhlukile. Amanani ezici agcinwe: ingxenye yamanani abuyela ngaphandle kokushintshwa. Uhlu oluphansi lubonisa izici ezinamanani ashintshe kakhulu noma ashoweyo. Ukuhlukaniswa: kugcinwe, kushintshiwe (uhlelo olufanayo, ikhodi ehlukile) noma kushoweyo. Landa umbiko (CSV) inikeza yonke into nenombolo yayo. Ukuze ubone izinto ezihambe noma eshintshe ukwakheka, sebenzisa Qhathanisa izinguqulo kumamodeli amabili afanayo. I-BimCraft ayisebenzisi nakuphi kwalezi zinhlelo ezimbili. Ukuthi yiziphi izilungiselelo ezidlulisa inani zincike ezilungiselelweni ze-IFC zohlelo ngalunye: umbiko ubonisa okubuyile ngempela, ngakho zama isilungiselelo, khipha futhi uqhathanise. Izinkinga zihamba njenge-BCF Izinkinga ozikhulisa ku-BimCraft zikhishwa njenge-BCF (Izinkinga), okufundeka ngamathuluzi awo e-BCF ngazo zombili izinhlelo, ngakho umbuzo mayelana nento ufika kumuntu osebenza kwenye inhlelo ngombono wayo. Bona futhi Vula iphakheji lephrojekthi, Kusuka kufayela lephrojekthi kuya ku-BimCraft nge-IFC kanye Qhathanisa izinguqulo ezimbili zemodeli.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"settings","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Izilungiselelo ze-BimCraft","summary":"Khetha ukuthi amakamelo nezindawo zibonakale yini, ukuthi imiphetho idwetshwe yini nokuthi imodeli ivulwa kuluphi ukubuka, futhi uqale ukubeka ngokubopha kodonga kuvuliwe.","section":"reference","order":5,"keywords":["izilungiselelo","izintandokazo","okukhethwayo","izindawo","amakamelo","ifcspace","imiphetho","imigqa","ukusebenza","imodeli enkulu","ukubuka ekuvulweni","ikhamera","ukubuka phezulu","ukubopha kodonga","ukubamba"],"headings":[{"id":"imenyu-okhiye-nemouse","text":"Imenyu, okhiye nemouse","level":2},{"id":"lapho-imodeli-ivulwa","text":"Lapho imodeli ivulwa","level":2},{"id":"imidwebo-ivulwa-ku","text":"Imidwebo ivulwa ku-","level":2},{"id":"ukubuka-ekuvulweni","text":"Ukubuka ekuvulweni","level":2},{"id":"ukubeka-izinto-zemitapo","text":"Ukubeka izinto zemitapo","level":2},{"id":"ibhokisi-lesigaba","text":"Ibhokisi lesigaba","level":2},{"id":"indawo","text":"Indawo","level":2},{"id":"isikhombisi-sekhona","text":"Isikhombisi sekhona","level":2},{"id":"igama-lakho-kuzihloko","text":"Igama lakho kuzihloko","level":2},{"id":"abasizi","text":"Abasizi","level":2},{"id":"okuhlobene","text":"Okuhlobene","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E ngegiya elisebhalini lohlelo noma nge-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Ithebhu yokuqala, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBimCraft\u003C/span\u003E, ibamba izilungiselelo ezibhekelela lolu hlelo; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikelele\u003C/span\u003E ibamba ezabelwa zonke izinhlelo ze-CadCraft (itimu, ithuluzi, amapaneli). Izilungiselelo ze-BimCraft zikhona kuphela kulolu hlelo: uzishintsha lapha, futhi leli shiphini liyazikhumbula. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESetha kabusha izilungiselelo ze-BimCraft\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwengxoxo iyazibuyisela ekuqaleni, kanye nezabelwanayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imenyu-okhiye-nemouse\"\u003EImenyu, okhiye nemouse\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsitayela semenyu (ithuluzi lakwa-BimCraft, imenyu yokuklama ikhaya, ribhoni ye-BIM noma umugqa womyalo womdwebo), okhiye nemenyu yakho, nokuthi ivili nezinkinobho zemouse zenzani. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\"\u003EImenyu, okhiye nemouse\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lapho-imodeli-ivulwa\"\u003ELapho imodeli ivulwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBonisa amakamelo nezindawo\u003C/strong\u003E (kuvaliwe ekuqaleni): amakamelo nezindawo ziyizibhokisi ezibonakalayo ezingavimba izindonga ezisemuva kwazo, ngakho ziqala zifihliwe. Inkinobho ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzindawo\u003C/span\u003E phezu kwemodeli isavula futhi icime kumodeli evuliwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImiphetho\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImiphetho ivulekile\u003C/span\u003E (ukuqala) idweba imigqa yemiphetho enikeza ukubukeka kokudweba. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmamodeli amancane kuphela\u003C/span\u003E idweba kuphela emamodelini angaphansi kwezinxantathu ezingu-300 000, okugcina amamodeli amakhulu eshesha ukuguqulwa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImiphetho ivaliwe\u003C/span\u003E iqala yonke imodeli ingenayo. Inkinobho ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImiphetho\u003C/span\u003E isashintsha kumodeli evuliwe. Ngaphezu kwezinxantathu eziyizigidi ezingu-1.5 imiphetho ivalwa njalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imidwebo-ivulwa-ku\"\u003EImidwebo ivulwa ku-\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuthi umdwebo we-DWG noma we-DXF uqala ukubonakala kanjani: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D (eshesha kakhulu)\u003C/span\u003E (ukuqala) udweba nomdwebo omkhulu ngokushesha, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImodeli (2D)\u003C/span\u003E ivula umbono wesikhala semodeli obalele. Amathebhu ngaphezulu komdwebo ashintsha phakathi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImodeli\u003C/span\u003E, amashidi kanye ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E noma nini. Umdwebo ongenalutho esikhaleni semodeli, noma isiphequluli esingakwazi ukubonisa i-3D, uvula njalo ku-2D.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukubuka-ekuvulweni\"\u003EUkubuka ekuvulweni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIkhamera imodeli evulwa ngayo: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELwanele\u003C/span\u003E (ukuqala, imodeli yonke isuka ekhoneni), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhezulu\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhambili\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlangothi\u003C/span\u003E. Izinkinobho ezingaphezulu kwemodeli zishintsha ukubuka noma nini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsakhiwo esiphendukile endaweni yaso\u003C/strong\u003E: amamodeli amaningi afika nesakhiwo ngokuthambeka ezinhlelweni zefayela (ekuhloleni noma kuzixhumanisi ezabelanwayo). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESisesikwele nesakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E (ukuqala) ikhombisa isakhiwo esinjalo siqondile: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELwanele\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhezulu\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhambili\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUhlangothi\u003C/span\u003E, izinhlangothi zekhyubhu lokubuka nazo zonke izigaba ezintsha zilandela izindonga zakhe, futhi ikhampasi lekhyubhu lokubuka lisaqondisa enyakatho yemodeli. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENjengoba sibekwe esizeni\u003C/span\u003E igcina ama-axis efayela. Isakhiwo esinezindonga ezigijima ngama-axis sibukeka ngendlela efanayo kunoma iyiphi indlela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukubeka-izinto-zemitapo\"\u003EUkubeka izinto zemitapo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQala ngokubopha kodonga kuvuliwe\u003C/strong\u003E (kuvaliwe ekuqaleni): lapho kuqala ukubeka noma ukunamathisela into yemitapo, ingemuva layo libophela edongeni eliseduze, libheke ikamelo. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubopha kodonga\u003C/span\u003E ebhalini yokubeka iyalicima okwamanje. Isitezi esingenazo izindonga siqala ngaphandle kwalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ibhokisi-lesigaba\"\u003EIbhokisi lesigaba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo ezungeze okukhethiwe\u003C/span\u003E yisikhala esishiywa yi-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbhokisi lesigaba elizungeze okukhethiwe\u003C/span\u003E ezinhlangothini zonke zezinto ozikhethile, ngamamilimitha: 300 ukuqala, kuze kube ngu-5000. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/section-plane\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/section-plane\"\u003ESika imodeli ye-IFC ngendiza yesigaba\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"indawo\"\u003EIndawo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUbubanzi nobude kusetshenziswa\u003C/span\u003E ukhetha uhlelo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinganisa\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo\u003C/span\u003E anika ububanzi nobude kulo: WGS 84 (EPSG:4326, ukuqala, njengoba i-GPS namamephu awebhu esebenzisa), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIdatha yefayela ngokwalo\u003C/span\u003E, noma enye yalezi: ETRS89, NAD83, GDA94, GDA2020, NZGD2000, JGD2011 neCGCS2000. Uhlelo lwamamephu nedatha yefayela lwalo nokho luyabonakala njalo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/measure\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/measure\"\u003ELinganisa amabanga, izindawo zobuso nezindawo nge-3D\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isikhombisi-sekhona\"\u003EIsikhombisi sekhona\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkuhlezi ekhoneni elingezansi kwesokudla lwemibono ye-3D (imodeli ye-IFC, nomdwebo oshintshelwe ku-3D): \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIkhyubhu lokubuka\u003C/span\u003E (ukuqala), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsithonjana se-axis\u003C/span\u003E (i-X, Y no-Z ezincane) noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAkukho\u003C/span\u003E. Kushintsha kanye. Umbono womdwebo we-2D awukaze ubonise lutho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEkhyubhini lokubuka chofoza ubuso, umphetho noma ikhona ukuze ubuke kuleyo ndlela, donsa ikhyubhu ukuze uligibe, donsa indandatho ukuze uyiphendule, bese uchofoza indlu ukuze uthole umbono wokuqala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"igama-lakho-kuzihloko\"\u003EIgama lakho kuzihloko\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma ungene ngemvume, izihloko zithwala igama le-akhawunti yakho futhi i-BimCraft ayicelani lutho: lesi sigaba sikhombisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkusuka ku-akhawunti yakho (&lt;name&gt;)\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESebenzisa elinye igama\u003C/span\u003E ivula ibhokisi lelinye igama, elinqoba kuze kube yilapho ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESebenzisa igama le-akhawunti yami\u003C/span\u003E. Uma ungene ngaphandle, ifomu lesihloko licela igama njengakuqala. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/issues-bcf\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/issues-bcf\"\u003EIzihloko namafayela e-BCF\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"abasizi\"\u003EAbasizi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EVumela abasizi be-AI nezikripthi ukusebenzisa i-BimCraft\u003C/strong\u003E (kuvaliwe ekuqaleni) livumela umsizi okukhompyutha yakho ukufinyelela imodeli evuliwe nge-CadCraft Studio: \u003Cstrong\u003EFunda\u003C/strong\u003E ithola izinto ifunde izakhiwo zazo, \u003Cstrong\u003EShintsha ukubuka\u003C/strong\u003E iyazihlukanisa, iyazifihla futhi iyazibonisa. \u003Cstrong\u003EUmsebenzi\u003C/strong\u003E uhlu lwezinkomba zawo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/assistants\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/assistants\"\u003EVumela umsizi we-AI asebenze nemodeli yakho\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEzinye izilungiselelo zisebenza lapho imodeli ivulwa noma ukubeka kuqala. Imodeli evele ivuliwe igcina ukubukeka kwayo kuze usebenzise izinkinobho zethuluzi noma uyivule futhi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuhlobene\"\u003EOkuhlobene\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/copy-paste\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/copy-paste\"\u003EKopisha, namathisela futhi phinda izinto zemitapo\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/place-from-library\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/place-from-library\"\u003EBeka izinsiza nezitulo kusuka emitapweni\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/workspace\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/workspace\"\u003EIsikrini se-BimCraft\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/assistants\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/assistants\"\u003EVumela umsizi we-AI asebenze nemodeli yakho\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Vula Izilungiselelo ngegiya elisebhalini lohlelo noma nge-Ctrl+,. Ithebhu yokuqala, BimCraft, ibamba izilungiselelo ezibhekelela lolu hlelo; Jikelele ibamba ezabelwa zonke izinhlelo ze-CadCraft (itimu, ithuluzi, amapaneli). Izilungiselelo ze-BimCraft zikhona kuphela kulolu hlelo: uzishintsha lapha, futhi leli shiphini liyazikhumbula. Setha kabusha izilungiselelo ze-BimCraft ngaphansi kwengxoxo iyazibuyisela ekuqaleni, kanye nezabelwanayo. Imenyu, okhiye nemouse Isitayela semenyu (ithuluzi lakwa-BimCraft, imenyu yokuklama ikhaya, ribhoni ye-BIM noma umugqa womyalo womdwebo), okhiye nemenyu yakho, nokuthi ivili nezinkinobho zemouse zenzani. Bona Imenyu, okhiye nemouse. Lapho imodeli ivulwa Bonisa amakamelo nezindawo (kuvaliwe ekuqaleni): amakamelo nezindawo ziyizibhokisi ezibonakalayo ezingavimba izindonga ezisemuva kwazo, ngakho ziqala zifihliwe. Inkinobho ethi Izindawo phezu kwemodeli isavula futhi icime kumodeli evuliwe. Imiphetho: Imiphetho ivulekile (ukuqala) idweba imigqa yemiphetho enikeza ukubukeka kokudweba. Amamodeli amancane kuphela idweba kuphela emamodelini angaphansi kwezinxantathu ezingu-300 000, okugcina amamodeli amakhulu eshesha ukuguqulwa. Imiphetho ivaliwe iqala yonke imodeli ingenayo. Inkinobho ethi Imiphetho isashintsha kumodeli evuliwe. Ngaphezu kwezinxantathu eziyizigidi ezingu-1.5 imiphetho ivalwa njalo. Imidwebo ivulwa ku- Ukuthi umdwebo we-DWG noma we-DXF uqala ukubonakala kanjani: 3D (eshesha kakhulu) (ukuqala) udweba nomdwebo omkhulu ngokushesha, noma Imodeli (2D) ivula umbono wesikhala semodeli obalele. Amathebhu ngaphezulu komdwebo ashintsha phakathi kwe-Imodeli, amashidi kanye ne-3D noma nini. Umdwebo ongenalutho esikhaleni semodeli, noma isiphequluli esingakwazi ukubonisa i-3D, uvula njalo ku-2D. Ukubuka ekuvulweni Ikhamera imodeli evulwa ngayo: Lwanele (ukuqala, imodeli yonke isuka ekhoneni), Phezulu, Phambili noma Uhlangothi. Izinkinobho ezingaphezulu kwemodeli zishintsha ukubuka noma nini. Isakhiwo esiphendukile endaweni yaso: amamodeli amaningi afika nesakhiwo ngokuthambeka ezinhlelweni zefayela (ekuhloleni noma kuzixhumanisi ezabelanwayo). Sisesikwele nesakhiwo (ukuqala) ikhombisa isakhiwo esinjalo siqondile: Lwanele, Phezulu, Phambili, Uhlangothi, izinhlangothi zekhyubhu lokubuka nazo zonke izigaba ezintsha zilandela izindonga zakhe, futhi ikhampasi lekhyubhu lokubuka lisaqondisa enyakatho yemodeli. Njengoba sibekwe esizeni igcina ama-axis efayela. Isakhiwo esinezindonga ezigijima ngama-axis sibukeka ngendlela efanayo kunoma iyiphi indlela. Ukubeka izinto zemitapo Qala ngokubopha kodonga kuvuliwe (kuvaliwe ekuqaleni): lapho kuqala ukubeka noma ukunamathisela into yemitapo, ingemuva layo libophela edongeni eliseduze, libheke ikamelo. Tab noma Ukubopha kodonga ebhalini yokubeka iyalicima okwamanje. Isitezi esingenazo izindonga siqala ngaphandle kwalo. Ibhokisi lesigaba Indawo ezungeze okukhethiwe yisikhala esishiywa yi-Ibhokisi lesigaba elizungeze okukhethiwe ezinhlangothini zonke zezinto ozikhethile, ngamamilimitha: 300 ukuqala, kuze kube ngu-5000. Bona Sika imodeli ye-IFC ngendiza yesigaba. Indawo Ububanzi nobude kusetshenziswa ukhetha uhlelo Linganisa › Indawo anika ububanzi nobude kulo: WGS 84 (EPSG:4326, ukuqala, njengoba i-GPS namamephu awebhu esebenzisa), Idatha yefayela ngokwalo, noma enye yalezi: ETRS89, NAD83, GDA94, GDA2020, NZGD2000, JGD2011 neCGCS2000. Uhlelo lwamamephu nedatha yefayela lwalo nokho luyabonakala njalo. Bona Linganisa amabanga, izindawo zobuso nezindawo nge-3D. Isikhombisi sekhona Okuhlezi ekhoneni elingezansi kwesokudla lwemibono ye-3D (imodeli ye-IFC, nomdwebo oshintshelwe ku-3D): Ikhyubhu lokubuka (ukuqala), Isithonjana se-axis (i-X, Y no-Z ezincane) noma Akukho. Kushintsha kanye. Umbono womdwebo we-2D awukaze ubonise lutho. Ekhyubhini lokubuka chofoza ubuso, umphetho noma ikhona ukuze ubuke kuleyo ndlela, donsa ikhyubhu ukuze uligibe, donsa indandatho ukuze uyiphendule, bese uchofoza indlu ukuze uthole umbono wokuqala. Igama lakho kuzihloko Uma ungene ngemvume, izihloko zithwala igama le-akhawunti yakho futhi i-BimCraft ayicelani lutho: lesi sigaba sikhombisa Ukusuka ku-akhawunti yakho (\u003Cname\u003E). Sebenzisa elinye igama ivula ibhokisi lelinye igama, elinqoba kuze kube yilapho ukhetha Sebenzisa igama le-akhawunti yami. Uma ungene ngaphandle, ifomu lesihloko licela igama njengakuqala. Bona Izihloko namafayela e-BCF. Abasizi Vumela abasizi be-AI nezikripthi ukusebenzisa i-BimCraft (kuvaliwe ekuqaleni) livumela umsizi okukhompyutha yakho ukufinyelela imodeli evuliwe nge-CadCraft Studio: Funda ithola izinto ifunde izakhiwo zazo, Shintsha ukubuka iyazihlukanisa, iyazifihla futhi iyazibonisa. Umsebenzi uhlu lwezinkomba zawo. Bona Vumela umsizi we-AI asebenze nemodeli yakho. Ezinye izilungiselelo zisebenza lapho imodeli ivulwa noma ukubeka kuqala. Imodeli evele ivuliwe igcina ukubukeka kwayo kuze usebenzise izinkinobho zethuluzi noma uyivule futhi. Okuhlobene Kopisha, namathisela futhi phinda izinto zemitapo Beka izinsiza nezitulo kusuka emitapweni Isikrini se-BimCraft Vumela umsizi we-AI asebenze nemodeli yakho","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"menus-keys-and-mouse","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Imenyu, okhiye nemouse","summary":"Khetha isitayela semenyu esihambisana nendlela osuvele usebenza ngayo, nikeza noma yimuphi umyalo ukhiye wakho, hambisa imiyalo phakathi kwemenyu, bese usetha ukuthi isondo nenkinobho ngayinye ziyenza ini.","section":"reference","order":6,"keywords":["isitayela semenyu","imenyu","ibha yemenyu","ribhoni","umugqa womyalo","izinkinobho zekhibhodi","okhiye abashisekayo","okhiye","lungisa","hlanganisa","hambisa","mouse","isondo","phenduluka","isiqondiso sokusondeza","inkinobho ephakathi","shelelisa","zungeza","okhiye bezinhlamvu ezimbili","thumela","ngenisa","ukushintsha","okujwayelekile"],"headings":[{"id":"izitayela-ezinhlanu","text":"Izitayela ezinhlanu","level":2},{"id":"yenze-eyakho","text":"Yenze eyakho","level":2},{"id":"imouse","text":"Imouse","level":2},{"id":"yithathe-nawe","text":"Yithathe nawe","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EImiyalo ye-BimCraft ifana noma ngabe uyifinyelela ngayiphi indlela. \u003Cstrong\u003EIsitayela semenyu\u003C/strong\u003E sinquma kuphela lapho zikhona esikrinini, ukuthi zibizwa ngani lapho, nokuthi ziqalwa yiziphi izinkinobho, ngakho ungagcina izinkambiso ozijwayele. Khetha esinye ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBimCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImenyu, okhiye nemouse\u003C/span\u003E; ushintsho luyasebenza ngokushesha, futhi lesi sisekhi siyakukhumbula.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izitayela-ezinhlanu\"\u003EIzitayela ezinhlanu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsitayela\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkuzothola\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIthuluzi lika-BimCraft nokhiye bayo (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E udonga, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E umnyango, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"N\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iwindi, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E isigaba, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E lingana). Okokuqala.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIdizayini yekhaya\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbha yemenyu (Ifayela, Hlela, Ukwakhiwa, Umtapo, 3D, CAD, Amathuluzi, Ukubuka) phezu komugqa wamathuluzi okwakha, njengoba izinhlelo zokuklama amakhaya zizihlela ngayo. Okhiye abafanayo abayodwa, kanye \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command L\"\u003E⌘L\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+L\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ye-library, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F9\"\u003EF9\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF9\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E yombono we-3D, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F10\"\u003EF10\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF10\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E yeplani kanye \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F11\"\u003EF11\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF11\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kokubili.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBIM ribbon\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmathebhu ezinkinobho ezinkulu (Ukwakha, Faka, Chaza, Guqula, Ukubuka, Okuphumayo) nemenyu ye-Ifayela namankinobho asheshayo ngakwesokudla. Okhiye ababili: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bese \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kudonga, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E umnyango, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"N\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iwindi, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E isigaba, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Z\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E lingana. Inkinobho ephakathi iyashelelisa; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kanye nenkinobho ephakathi kuyazungeza.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkudweba kwakudala\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERibhoni encane kanye nomugqa womyalo, zabantu abathayipha imiyalo: WALL, DOOR, WINDOW, ROOF, U (hlehlisa), ZOOM, SECTION, PLOT, INSERT, HELP. Qala ukuthayipha noma yikuphi lapho, bese izinhlamvu zingena emugqeni womyalo; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyaqalisa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ngaphandle kwalutho iphinda umyalo wokugcina, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iwusula.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsibukeli\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuvula nokuhlola amamodeli hhayi ukuwadweba: imenyu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfayela\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubuka\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlola\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlela\u003C/span\u003E phezu komugqa wamathuluzi okubuka (lingana, phezulu, phambili, eceleni, isigaba, linganisa, fihla, hlukanisa, okubonakalayo, bonisa konke, hamba). Amathuluzi okwakha alindele kumenyu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImodeli\u003C/span\u003E ekugcineni. Okhiye afanayo nalawo esitayela sika-BimCraft.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImenyu namabhoni kuvela uma imodeli ivuliwe noma uqala isakhiwo esisha; ngaphambi kwalokho, iphaneli echibini lesokunxele ivula amafayela iqale izakhiwo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkhiye ongowe-BimCraft ngokwayo kodwa hhayi wesitayela osikhethile awusebenzi, futhi umugqa wesimo utshela ukuthi umyalo wawo waya kuphi (&quot;Ku-BIM ribbon, Section ingu-SC&quot;). \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kanye nezitshalo zihlala zinencazelo yazo, nethuluzi elisebenzayo ligcina okhiye balo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kanye \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E lapho ubeka, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E lapho uhamba, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"H\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ngamathuluzi omnyango newindi, izinombolo lapho uthayipha ubude.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yenze-eyakho\"\u003EYenze eyakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha isitayela esiseduze kakhulu nalokho ofuna, bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELungisa…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkhiye nemenyu\u003C/span\u003E, thola umyalo (ibhokisi lokusesha liyasiza). Chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza ukhiye\u003C/span\u003E bese ucindezela ukhiye, noma okhiye ababili ngokulandelana ukuze uthole ukhiye wezinhlamvu ezimbili. Chofoza ukhiye ukuze uwususe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENgomugqa wemenyu noma ribhoni, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELapho ihlala khona\u003C/span\u003E ihambisa umyalo kwenye imenyu noma iphaneli, noma ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkhiye kuphela\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImouse\u003C/span\u003E, setha isondo, izinkinobho ezishelelisa iplani, nokuthi yiliphi umsebenzi nganoma iyiphi inkinobho ezibonweni ze-3D.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENikeza igama bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkulondoloza isitayela esakhelwe ngaphakathi kwenza ikhophi yakho (&quot;Idizayini yekhaya yami&quot;); esakhelwe ngaphakathi asikaze siguquke. Ukhiye onikezwe imiyalo emibili, noma olandelana nokhiye ababili ngaphambi kokuthayipha ukhiye wezinhlamvu ezimbili, ubonakala ngombala obomvu futhi kudingeka ulungiswe ngaphambi kokuthi ulondoloze.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imouse\"\u003EImouse\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsondo lemouse\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuskrola phezulu kusondeza ngaphakathi\u003C/span\u003E (okokuqala) noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuskrola phezulu kusondeza ngaphandle\u003C/span\u003E, nokuthi kushesha kangakanani. Ukuhlanganisa iminwe ku-trackpad kusondeza njalo ngendlela iminwe yakho enyakaza ngayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHambisa iplani nemidwebo ngo\u003C/strong\u003E: noma yiziphi izinkinobho zesobunxele, eziphakathi nezesokudla. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E nokuhudula nakho kuyashelelisa; ukuhudula ngesobunxele kushelelisa kuphela lapho ukuchofoza kungeke kukhethe noma kudwebe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHudula emibonweni ye-3D\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEyombono ngamunye\u003C/span\u003E igcina izinkinobho ze-BimCraft (isobunxele sizungeza, isokudla sishelelisa). Noma setha inkinobho ngayinye ukuthi izungeze, ishelelise, isondeze noma ingenzi lutho; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E nenkinobho yenza ukuguqula phakathi kokuzungeza nokushelelisa. Ukuchofoza ngaphandle kokuhudula kusakhetha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yithathe-nawe\"\u003EYithathe nawe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E ilondoloza isitayela esisetshenziswayo njengefayela elincane le-\u003Ccode\u003E.ccinput.json\u003C/code\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgenisa…\u003C/span\u003E lingeza elinye, kusuka kwenye ikhompyutha noma kumngane wakho. Ifayela elingeniswe lingabhekisela kumiyalo ka-BimCraft kuphela: noma yini engeyona kuwo (umyalo lolu weqiniso alunawo, noma ukhiye ongasebenzi lapha) iyasuswa futhi ibalwe kumugqa wesimo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa lesi sitayela\u003C/span\u003E isusa eyakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELezi zilungiselelo zihlala kulesi sisekhi. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESebenzisa leli sitayela kuzo zonke izinhlelo\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwamakhadi esitayela yenza zonke izinhlelo zivule esitayelweni esihambisanayo (ithuluzi layo elingokwayo, ibha yemenyu, ribhoni noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkudweba kwakudala\u003C/span\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsibukeli\u003C/span\u003E ingeyesi-BimCraft kuphela futhi ayinaso esihambisanayo kwezinye), ngoshintsho owenze kwiyo ngayinye; uhlelo olungenaso isitayela esihambisanayo lugcina owalo. Ukukhetha esinye isitayela kwesinye isisetshenziswa kushintsha lowo kuphela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkuhlobene: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/keyboard\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/keyboard\"\u003EIkhibhodi nemouse\u003C/a\u003E · \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/settings\"\u003EIzilungiselelo ze-BimCraft\u003C/a\u003E · \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/coming-from\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/coming-from\"\u003EUkusuka kwezinye izinhlelo ze-BIM nokudweba\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Imiyalo ye-BimCraft ifana noma ngabe uyifinyelela ngayiphi indlela. Isitayela semenyu sinquma kuphela lapho zikhona esikrinini, ukuthi zibizwa ngani lapho, nokuthi ziqalwa yiziphi izinkinobho, ngakho ungagcina izinkambiso ozijwayele. Khetha esinye ku-Izilungiselelo (Ctrl+,) › BimCraft › Imenyu, okhiye nemouse; ushintsho luyasebenza ngokushesha, futhi lesi sisekhi siyakukhumbula. Izitayela ezinhlanu Isitayela Okuzothola CadCraft Ithuluzi lika-BimCraft nokhiye bayo (W udonga, D umnyango, N iwindi, X isigaba, F lingana). Okokuqala. Idizayini yekhaya Ibha yemenyu (Ifayela, Hlela, Ukwakhiwa, Umtapo, 3D, CAD, Amathuluzi, Ukubuka) phezu komugqa wamathuluzi okwakha, njengoba izinhlelo zokuklama amakhaya zizihlela ngayo. Okhiye abafanayo abayodwa, kanye Ctrl+L ye-library, F9 yombono we-3D, F10 yeplani kanye F11 kokubili. BIM ribbon Amathebhu ezinkinobho ezinkulu (Ukwakha, Faka, Chaza, Guqula, Ukubuka, Okuphumayo) nemenyu ye-Ifayela namankinobho asheshayo ngakwesokudla. Okhiye ababili: W bese A kudonga, D R umnyango, W N iwindi, S C isigaba, Z F lingana. Inkinobho ephakathi iyashelelisa; Shift kanye nenkinobho ephakathi kuyazungeza. Ukudweba kwakudala Ribhoni encane kanye nomugqa womyalo, zabantu abathayipha imiyalo: WALL, DOOR, WINDOW, ROOF, U (hlehlisa), ZOOM, SECTION, PLOT, INSERT, HELP. Qala ukuthayipha noma yikuphi lapho, bese izinhlamvu zingena emugqeni womyalo; Enter iyaqalisa, Enter ngaphandle kwalutho iphinda umyalo wokugcina, Esc iwusula. Isibukeli Ukuvula nokuhlola amamodeli hhayi ukuwadweba: imenyu Ifayela, Ukubuka, Bonisa, Hlola kanye Hlela phezu komugqa wamathuluzi okubuka (lingana, phezulu, phambili, eceleni, isigaba, linganisa, fihla, hlukanisa, okubonakalayo, bonisa konke, hamba). Amathuluzi okwakha alindele kumenyu ye-Imodeli ekugcineni. Okhiye afanayo nalawo esitayela sika-BimCraft. Imenyu namabhoni kuvela uma imodeli ivuliwe noma uqala isakhiwo esisha; ngaphambi kwalokho, iphaneli echibini lesokunxele ivula amafayela iqale izakhiwo. Ukhiye ongowe-BimCraft ngokwayo kodwa hhayi wesitayela osikhethile awusebenzi, futhi umugqa wesimo utshela ukuthi umyalo wawo waya kuphi (\"Ku-BIM ribbon, Section ingu-SC\"). Delete, Esc, Enter, Tab, Space kanye nezitshalo zihlala zinencazelo yazo, nethuluzi elisebenzayo ligcina okhiye balo: R kanye Tab lapho ubeka, W A S D lapho uhamba, H ngamathuluzi omnyango newindi, izinombolo lapho uthayipha ubude. Yenze eyakho Khetha isitayela esiseduze kakhulu nalokho ofuna, bese uchofoza Lungisa…. Ku-Okhiye nemenyu, thola umyalo (ibhokisi lokusesha liyasiza). Chofoza Engeza ukhiye bese ucindezela ukhiye, noma okhiye ababili ngokulandelana ukuze uthole ukhiye wezinhlamvu ezimbili. Chofoza ukhiye ukuze uwususe. Ngomugqa wemenyu noma ribhoni, Lapho ihlala khona ihambisa umyalo kwenye imenyu noma iphaneli, noma ku-Okhiye kuphela. Ku-Imouse, setha isondo, izinkinobho ezishelelisa iplani, nokuthi yiliphi umsebenzi nganoma iyiphi inkinobho ezibonweni ze-3D. Nikeza igama bese uchofoza Londoloza. Ukulondoloza isitayela esakhelwe ngaphakathi kwenza ikhophi yakho (\"Idizayini yekhaya yami\"); esakhelwe ngaphakathi asikaze siguquke. Ukhiye onikezwe imiyalo emibili, noma olandelana nokhiye ababili ngaphambi kokuthayipha ukhiye wezinhlamvu ezimbili, ubonakala ngombala obomvu futhi kudingeka ulungiswe ngaphambi kokuthi ulondoloze. Imouse Isondo lemouse: Ukuskrola phezulu kusondeza ngaphakathi (okokuqala) noma Ukuskrola phezulu kusondeza ngaphandle, nokuthi kushesha kangakanani. Ukuhlanganisa iminwe ku-trackpad kusondeza njalo ngendlela iminwe yakho enyakaza ngayo. Hambisa iplani nemidwebo ngo: noma yiziphi izinkinobho zesobunxele, eziphakathi nezesokudla. Space nokuhudula nakho kuyashelelisa; ukuhudula ngesobunxele kushelelisa kuphela lapho ukuchofoza kungeke kukhethe noma kudwebe. Hudula emibonweni ye-3D: Eyombono ngamunye igcina izinkinobho ze-BimCraft (isobunxele sizungeza, isokudla sishelelisa). Noma setha inkinobho ngayinye ukuthi izungeze, ishelelise, isondeze noma ingenzi lutho; Shift nenkinobho yenza ukuguqula phakathi kokuzungeza nokushelelisa. Ukuchofoza ngaphandle kokuhudula kusakhetha. Yithathe nawe Thumela ilondoloza isitayela esisetshenziswayo njengefayela elincane le-.ccinput.json; Ngenisa… lingeza elinye, kusuka kwenye ikhompyutha noma kumngane wakho. Ifayela elingeniswe lingabhekisela kumiyalo ka-BimCraft kuphela: noma yini engeyona kuwo (umyalo lolu weqiniso alunawo, noma ukhiye ongasebenzi lapha) iyasuswa futhi ibalwe kumugqa wesimo. Susa lesi sitayela isusa eyakho. Lezi zilungiselelo zihlala kulesi sisekhi. Sebenzisa leli sitayela kuzo zonke izinhlelo ngaphansi kwamakhadi esitayela yenza zonke izinhlelo zivule esitayelweni esihambisanayo (ithuluzi layo elingokwayo, ibha yemenyu, ribhoni noma Ukudweba kwakudala; Isibukeli ingeyesi-BimCraft kuphela futhi ayinaso esihambisanayo kwezinye), ngoshintsho owenze kwiyo ngayinye; uhlelo olungenaso isitayela esihambisanayo lugcina owalo. Ukukhetha esinye isitayela kwesinye isisetshenziswa kushintsha lowo kuphela. Okuhlobene: Ikhibhodi nemouse · Izilungiselelo ze-BimCraft · Ukusuka kwezinye izinhlelo ze-BIM nokudweba","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"keyboard","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Okhiye nembewu","summary":"Wonke okhiye, izenzo zembewu, zepedi lokuthinta nezithinta ku-BimCraft, aqoqwe ngokuthi ubheka yini.","section":"reference","order":10,"keywords":["ikhibhodi","izinqamuleli","okhiye","imbewu","ipedi lokuthinta","ukuthinta","zungeza","shelelisa","sondeza","fihla","khipha bodwa","ukubona ngakho","hlehlisa","phinda wenze","kopisha","namathisela","phinda","londoloza","lwanele","ukubuka kokuphrinta","escape","izilungiselelo","dweba","udonga","umnyango","iwindi","ipulani"],"headings":[{"id":"yonke-indawo","text":"Yonke indawo","level":2},{"id":"umbono-we-3d-amamodeli-e-ifc","text":"Umbono we-3D (amamodeli e-IFC)","level":2},{"id":"hlela","text":"Hlela","level":2},{"id":"umbono-wepulani-dweba","text":"Umbono wepulani (Dweba)","level":2},{"id":"ukubeka-nokunamathisela-izinto-zomtapo","text":"Ukubeka nokunamathisela izinto zomtapo","level":2},{"id":"ukuhlela-amanani-e-ifc","text":"Ukuhlela amanani e-IFC","level":2},{"id":"imidwebo-ye-2d-dwg-ne-dxf","text":"Imidwebo ye-2D (DWG ne-DXF)","level":2},{"id":"imidwebo-nge-3d","text":"Imidwebo nge-3D","level":2},{"id":"amafayela","text":"Amafayela","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EBimCraft inezinqamuleli ezimbalwa. Iningi lomsebenzi lenziwa ngembewu namapanele. Izinqamuleli ezibhalwe nge-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E zisebenzisa i-Command ku-Mac ne-Ctrl kwezinye. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/keys\" data-topic=\"basics/keys\"\u003EOkhiye, imbewu namapedi okuthinta\u003C/a\u003E ukuthi okhiye babhalwa kanjani kule usizo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yonke-indawo\"\u003EYonke indawo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkhiye\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkwenzayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGingqa phakathi kwezimo zesikrini: ejwayelekile, isikrini esigcwele, isikrini esigcwele nezimpaphe zifihliwe. Ctrl kuyo yonke imishini, kufaka ne-Mac\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhuma esikrinini esigcwele\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/settings\"\u003EIzilungiselelo ze-BimCraft\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHambisa phakathi kwezinkinobho, amabhokisi okuhlola nezinani. Yonke ilawulo ingafinyelelwa ngekhibhodi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"umbono-we-3d-amamodeli-e-ifc\"\u003EUmbono we-3D (amamodeli e-IFC)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkhiye noma isenzo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkwenzayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELwanisa imodeli yonke, umbono wamakona amathathu (njengo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit\u003C/span\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESusa ukukhethwa, noma yeka ukubeka noma ukunamathisela\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhetha isakhi esingaphansi kwesikhombi; chofoza ingemuva elingenalutho ukuze ususe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+chofoza noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+chofoza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEngeza isakhi ekukhetheni, noma usikhiphe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"H\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFihla izakhi ezikhethiwe. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\"\u003EFihla, khipha bodwa nobone ngokudlulisa izakhi\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"I\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBonisa izakhi ezikhethiwe kuphela (khipha bodwa)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"T\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBonisa izakhi ezikhethiwe, konke okunye kubonakale ngokudlulisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift H\"\u003E⇧H\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+H\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBonisa zonke izakhi futhi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalk\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBese \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma imitshingo ihamba, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E igijima, ukudonsa kubheka ngokuzungeza, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyima. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/walk\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/walk\"\u003EHamba emodelini\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinganisa izibalo nezindawo zobuso. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/measure\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/measure\"\u003ELinganisa izibalo, izindawo zobuso nezindawo nge-3D\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDonsa ngenkinobho yesobunxele\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZungeza\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDonsa ngenkinobho yesokudla\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShelelisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bese udonsa ngenkinobho yesobunxele\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShelelisa (kulula epedini lokuthinta)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESkrola iwhili, noma donsa ngenkinobho ephakathi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESondeza\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESkrola ngeminwe emibili noma ucindezele ipedi lokuthinta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESondeza\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmunwe owodwa (ukuthinta)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZungeza; ukuthepha kukhetha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIminwe emibili (ukuthinta)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECindezela ukuze usondeze, hambisa ndawonye ukuze ushelelise\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E| \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E | Vula nevala indiza yesigaba. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/section-plane\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/section-plane\"\u003ESika imodeli ye-IFC ngendiza yesigaba\u003C/a\u003E | | \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift X\"\u003E⇧X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E | Ibhokisi lesigaba elizungeze izakhi ezikhethiwe, negumbi elisethwe ku-Izilungiselelo |\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAwekho okhiye be-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETop\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFront\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESide\u003C/span\u003E; sebenzisa izinkinobho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlela\"\u003EHlela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImiyalo efanayo itholakala kwithuluzi: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaste\u003C/span\u003E nemenyu ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E, ebonisa ukhiye ngamunye. Zisebenza embonweni we-3D wemodeli ye-IFC, hhayi lapho uthayipha kusimo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/copy-paste\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/copy-paste\"\u003EKopisha, namathisela futhi uphinde izinto zomtapo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkhiye\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkwenzayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHlehlisa ushintsho lwamuva\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command Z\"\u003E⇧⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhinda wenze lokho okuthathwe yi-Undo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKopisha izakhi ezikhethiwe (amagama nezimfanelo zazo nazo ziyathunyelwa ebhodini lokopisha njengombhalo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command X\"\u003E⌘X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESika izakhi ezikhethiwe: zikopishe, bese uzisusa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENamathisela okukopishile: kulandela ipoyinta, chofoza lapho kufanele khona\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command V\"\u003E⇧⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENamathisela endaweni efanayo: lapho okusikiwe kwavela khona, noma eceleni kwemvelaphi ngemuva kokukopisha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhinda: kopisha izakhi ezikhethiwe bese uqala ukuzinamathisela\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESusa izakhi ezikhethiwe, kanye nezingxenye zazo nokuvulwa kwazo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/edit-elements\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/edit-elements\"\u003ESusa, sika, kopisha namathisela izakhi zokwakha\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhetha zonke izakhi ezibonisiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhetha lutho\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma umbhalo ukhethiwe ekhasini, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ikopisha lowo mbhalo njengoba ijwayelekile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"umbono-wepulani-dweba\"\u003EUmbono wepulani (Dweba)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELokhu kusebenza ngenkathi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw\u003C/span\u003E ivuliwe futhi ungathayiphi kusimo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/draw-walls\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/draw-walls\"\u003EDweba udonga\u003C/a\u003E kanye \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/doors-and-windows\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/doors-and-windows\"\u003EIminyango namawindi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkhiye noma isenzo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkwenzayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWall\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDoor\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"N\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWindow\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"H\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENgo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDoor\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWindow\u003C/span\u003E: izigxobo ekugcineni okunye\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ngesikhathi udweba udonga\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELiyigcine ku-0°, 90°, 180° noma 270°\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmadijithi nezimpawu zamafiti nezinhlamvu (\u003Ccode\u003E&#039;\u003C/code\u003E ne-\u003Ccode\u003E&quot;\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQala ukuthayipha ubude ebhokisini le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELength\u003C/span\u003E; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyasebenzisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, chofoza ngesokudla noma chofoza kabili\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQeda udonga odudayo; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E futhi ibuyela ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESusa udonga, iminyango namawindi okukhethiwe; izindonga ezisele zihlanganiswa futhi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E nepoyinta phezu kwepulani\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELwanisa ipulani\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESkrola iwhili\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESondeza ngakwepoyinta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDonsa ngenkinobho ephakathi noma yesokudla, noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bese udonsa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShelelisa; ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E ivuliwe, ukudonsa okujwayelekile nakho kuyashelelisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDonsa umnyango noma iwindi ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHambisa ngodonga lwalo, noma uye kwelinye udonga\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIminwe emibili (ukuthinta)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECindezela ukuze usondeze, hambisa ndawonye ukuze ushelelise\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukubeka-nokunamathisela-izinto-zomtapo\"\u003EUkubeka nokunamathisela izinto zomtapo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkhiye\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkwenzayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhendula into ngama-90°\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkubamba udonga kuvulwe nakuvaliwe: ingemuva lento libamba udonga oseduze\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EX, Y (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBeka endaweni ethayipheke\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYeka ukubeka noma ukunamathisela\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuhlela-amanani-e-ifc\"\u003EUkuhlela amanani e-IFC\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkhiye\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkwenzayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGcina inani othayiphile\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhansela ubuyisele inani elidala\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza kwenye indawo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGcina inani othayiphile\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHlehlisa ushintsho lwamuva. Kuphela uma unoshintsho olungalondolozwanga futhi awuthayiphi ensimini\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhinda wenze lokho okuthathwe yi-Undo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELondoloza njenge-IFC. Kuphela uma unoshintsho olungalondolozwanga; ngaphandle kwalokho kuvulwa umyalo wokulondoloza wesiphequluli\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuhlela ngekhibhodi kuphela: cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kuze kugqanyiswe inani, bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuqala ukuthayipha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imidwebo-ye-2d-dwg-ne-dxf\"\u003EImidwebo ye-2D (DWG ne-DXF)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkhiye noma isenzo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkwenzayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELwanisa umdwebo noma ishidi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmbono wokuphrinta uvuliwe nuvaliwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza kabili\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELwanisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDonsa ngayo yonke inkinobho\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShelelisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESkrola iwhili\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESondeza ngakwepoyinta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESkrola ngeminwe emibili noma ucindezele ipedi lokuthinta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESondeza ngakwepoyinta. Ukuskrola ngeminwe emibili akushelelisi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmunwe owodwa (ukuthinta)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShelelisa. Ukusondeza ngokucindezela akukakwakhiwa imidwebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imidwebo-nge-3d\"\u003EImidwebo nge-3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkhiye noma isenzo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkwenzayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E3D ivuliwe nivaliwe (futhi nakumbono we-2D)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImikhawulo: umdwebo wonke\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDonsa ngenkinobho ephakathi noma yesobunxele\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZungeza\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDonsa ngenkinobho yesokudla, noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bese udonsa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShelelisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESkrola iwhili\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESondeza ngasebezweni elingaphansi kwepoyinta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkushayela ngeminwe emibili epedini lokuthinta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZungeza; ne-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, shelelisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkucindezela ngeminwe epedini lokuthinta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESondeza\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIminwe emibili (ukuthinta)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECindezela ukuze usondeze, hambisa ndawonye ukuze ushelelise\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kanye \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E azenzi lutho lapho uthayipha ensimini, lapho uhlu lwezinsiza luvuliwe, noma uma ubamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amafayela\"\u003EAmafayela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsenzo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkwenzayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDonsa ifayela uliphonsele ekhasini\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELivule\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDonsa ifolda uliphonsele ekhasini\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELiyivule njengefolda yephrojekthi, ngaphandle komyalo wokuvuma\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E","text":"BimCraft inezinqamuleli ezimbalwa. Iningi lomsebenzi lenziwa ngembewu namapanele. Izinqamuleli ezibhalwe nge-Ctrl zisebenzisa i-Command ku-Mac ne-Ctrl kwezinye. Bona Okhiye, imbewu namapedi okuthinta ukuthi okhiye babhalwa kanjani kule usizo. Yonke indawo Ukhiye Okwenzayo Ctrl+Shift+F Gingqa phakathi kwezimo zesikrini: ejwayelekile, isikrini esigcwele, isikrini esigcwele nezimpaphe zifihliwe. Ctrl kuyo yonke imishini, kufaka ne-Mac Esc Phuma esikrinini esigcwele Ctrl+, Vula Settings. Bona Izilungiselelo ze-BimCraft Tab Hambisa phakathi kwezinkinobho, amabhokisi okuhlola nezinani. Yonke ilawulo ingafinyelelwa ngekhibhodi Umbono we-3D (amamodeli e-IFC) Ukhiye noma isenzo Okwenzayo F Lwanisa imodeli yonke, umbono wamakona amathathu (njengo-Fit) Esc Susa ukukhethwa, noma yeka ukubeka noma ukunamathisela Chofoza Khetha isakhi esingaphansi kwesikhombi; chofoza ingemuva elingenalutho ukuze ususe Ctrl+chofoza noma Shift+chofoza Engeza isakhi ekukhetheni, noma usikhiphe H Fihla izakhi ezikhethiwe. Bona Fihla, khipha bodwa nobone ngokudlulisa izakhi I Bonisa izakhi ezikhethiwe kuphela (khipha bodwa) T Bonisa izakhi ezikhethiwe, konke okunye kubonakale ngokudlulisa Shift+H Bonisa zonke izakhi futhi Walk Bese W A S D noma imitshingo ihamba, Shift igijima, ukudonsa kubheka ngokuzungeza, Esc iyima. Bona Hamba emodelini M Linganisa izibalo nezindawo zobuso. Bona Linganisa izibalo, izindawo zobuso nezindawo nge-3D Donsa ngenkinobho yesobunxele Zungeza Donsa ngenkinobho yesokudla Shelelisa Shift noma Ctrl bese udonsa ngenkinobho yesobunxele Shelelisa (kulula epedini lokuthinta) Skrola iwhili, noma donsa ngenkinobho ephakathi Sondeza Skrola ngeminwe emibili noma ucindezele ipedi lokuthinta Sondeza Umunwe owodwa (ukuthinta) Zungeza; ukuthepha kukhetha Iminwe emibili (ukuthinta) Cindezela ukuze usondeze, hambisa ndawonye ukuze ushelelise | X | Vula nevala indiza yesigaba. Bona Sika imodeli ye-IFC ngendiza yesigaba | | Shift+X | Ibhokisi lesigaba elizungeze izakhi ezikhethiwe, negumbi elisethwe ku-Izilungiselelo | Awekho okhiye be-Top, Front ne-Side; sebenzisa izinkinobho. Hlela Imiyalo efanayo itholakala kwithuluzi: Undo, Redo, Copy, Paste nemenyu ethi More, ebonisa ukhiye ngamunye. Zisebenza embonweni we-3D wemodeli ye-IFC, hhayi lapho uthayipha kusimo. Bona Kopisha, namathisela futhi uphinde izinto zomtapo. Ukhiye Okwenzayo Ctrl+Z Hlehlisa ushintsho lwamuva Ctrl+Y noma Ctrl+Shift+Z Phinda wenze lokho okuthathwe yi-Undo Ctrl+C Kopisha izakhi ezikhethiwe (amagama nezimfanelo zazo nazo ziyathunyelwa ebhodini lokopisha njengombhalo) Ctrl+X Sika izakhi ezikhethiwe: zikopishe, bese uzisusa Ctrl+V Namathisela okukopishile: kulandela ipoyinta, chofoza lapho kufanele khona Ctrl+Shift+V Namathisela endaweni efanayo: lapho okusikiwe kwavela khona, noma eceleni kwemvelaphi ngemuva kokukopisha Ctrl+D Phinda: kopisha izakhi ezikhethiwe bese uqala ukuzinamathisela Delete Susa izakhi ezikhethiwe, kanye nezingxenye zazo nokuvulwa kwazo. Bona Susa, sika, kopisha namathisela izakhi zokwakha Ctrl+A Khetha zonke izakhi ezibonisiwe Esc Khetha lutho Uma umbhalo ukhethiwe ekhasini, Ctrl+C ikopisha lowo mbhalo njengoba ijwayelekile. Umbono wepulani (Dweba) Lokhu kusebenza ngenkathi Draw ivuliwe futhi ungathayiphi kusimo. Bona Dweba udonga kanye Iminyango namawindi. Ukhiye noma isenzo Okwenzayo V Select W Wall D Door N Window H Ngo-Door noma Window: izigxobo ekugcineni okunye Shift ngesikhathi udweba udonga Liyigcine ku-0°, 90°, 180° noma 270° Amadijithi nezimpawu zamafiti nezinhlamvu (' ne-\") Qala ukuthayipha ubude ebhokisini le-Length; Enter iyasebenzisa Enter, Esc, chofoza ngesokudla noma chofoza kabili Qeda udonga odudayo; Esc futhi ibuyela ku-Select Delete Susa udonga, iminyango namawindi okukhethiwe; izindonga ezisele zihlanganiswa futhi F nepoyinta phezu kwepulani Lwanisa ipulani Skrola iwhili Sondeza ngakwepoyinta Donsa ngenkinobho ephakathi noma yesokudla, noma Space bese udonsa Shelelisa; ne-Select ivuliwe, ukudonsa okujwayelekile nakho kuyashelelisa Donsa umnyango noma iwindi ne-Select Hambisa ngodonga lwalo, noma uye kwelinye udonga Iminwe emibili (ukuthinta) Cindezela ukuze usondeze, hambisa ndawonye ukuze ushelelise Ukubeka nokunamathisela izinto zomtapo Ukhiye Okwenzayo R Phendula into ngama-90° Tab Ukubamba udonga kuvulwe nakuvaliwe: ingemuva lento libamba udonga oseduze Enter ku-X, Y (mm) Beka endaweni ethayipheke Esc Yeka ukubeka noma ukunamathisela Ukuhlela amanani e-IFC Ukhiye Okwenzayo Enter Gcina inani othayiphile Esc Khansela ubuyisele inani elidala Chofoza kwenye indawo Gcina inani othayiphile Ctrl+Z Hlehlisa ushintsho lwamuva. Kuphela uma unoshintsho olungalondolozwanga futhi awuthayiphi ensimini Ctrl+Y Phinda wenze lokho okuthathwe yi-Undo Ctrl+S Londoloza njenge-IFC. Kuphela uma unoshintsho olungalondolozwanga; ngaphandle kwalokho kuvulwa umyalo wokulondoloza wesiphequluli Ukuhlela ngekhibhodi kuphela: cindezela Tab kuze kugqanyiswe inani, bese ucindezela Enter ukuqala ukuthayipha. Imidwebo ye-2D (DWG ne-DXF) Ukhiye noma isenzo Okwenzayo F Lwanisa umdwebo noma ishidi P Umbono wokuphrinta uvuliwe nuvaliwe Chofoza kabili Lwanisa Donsa ngayo yonke inkinobho Shelelisa Skrola iwhili Sondeza ngakwepoyinta Skrola ngeminwe emibili noma ucindezele ipedi lokuthinta Sondeza ngakwepoyinta. Ukuskrola ngeminwe emibili akushelelisi Umunwe owodwa (ukuthinta) Shelelisa. Ukusondeza ngokucindezela akukakwakhiwa imidwebo Imidwebo nge-3D Ukhiye noma isenzo Okwenzayo 3 3D ivuliwe nivaliwe (futhi nakumbono we-2D) F Imikhawulo: umdwebo wonke Donsa ngenkinobho ephakathi noma yesobunxele Zungeza Donsa ngenkinobho yesokudla, noma Shift bese udonsa Shelelisa Skrola iwhili Sondeza ngasebezweni elingaphansi kwepoyinta Ukushayela ngeminwe emibili epedini lokuthinta Zungeza; ne-Shift, shelelisa Ukucindezela ngeminwe epedini lokuthinta Sondeza Iminwe emibili (ukuthinta) Cindezela ukuze usondeze, hambisa ndawonye ukuze ushelelise F, P kanye 3 azenzi lutho lapho uthayipha ensimini, lapho uhlu lwezinsiza luvuliwe, noma uma ubamba Ctrl noma Alt. Amafayela Isenzo Okwenzayo Donsa ifayela uliphonsele ekhasini Livule Donsa ifolda uliphonsele ekhasini Liyivule njengefolda yephrojekthi, ngaphandle komyalo wokuvuma","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"file-formats","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Okufundwa yi-BimCraft kusuka kuzo ifomethi ngayinye","summary":"Okufundwa ngempela yi-BimCraft kumafayela e-IFC, amaphrojekthi nemindeni, i-DWG ne-DXF, nokungakuthinti.","section":"reference","order":20,"keywords":["ifomethi","ifc","ifc2x3","ifc4","rvt","rfa","rte","rft","dwg","dxf","dgn","ifczip","izinguqulo","ukuhambisana","okufundwayo"],"headings":[{"id":"ifc","text":"IFC","level":2},{"id":"amaphrojekthi-nemindeni","text":"Amaphrojekthi nemindeni","level":2},{"id":"amafayela-pln-pla-tpl-kanye-bpn","text":"Amafayela .pln, .pla, .tpl kanye .bpn","level":2},{"id":"dwg-ne-dxf","text":"DWG ne-DXF","level":2},{"id":"ngaphakathi-kwefolda","text":"Ngaphakathi kwefolda","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"ifc\"\u003EIFC\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKufundwa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EImininingwane\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIjiyomethri\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYonke into enesimo, inombala njengoba ifayela lisho. Amagumbi nezikhala zidwetshwa zingabonakali futhi zifihliwe ekuqaleni\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzitezi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzitezi zakhiwo ngokulandelana kokuphakama, nokuthi yiziphi izinto ezisemagatsheni ngamunye. Izinto ezingasesitezini azilungiselelwe ngaphansi kwe-&quot;Not on a storey&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInani lezinto\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinto zangaphezu kohlobo ngalunye (izindonga, iminyango, izilingo…), ezibonakala ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EElements\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUlwazi lwephrojekthi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIgama leprojekthi, igama elide, nesigaba; isikimu, uhlelo oluthumela, umbhali nosuku lokuthumela kusuka ekhanda lefayela\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIdatha yento\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIgama, uhlobo, uhlobo lwento, ithegi, incazelo, GlobalId; yonke isethi yezici nesethi yezinani esemayinteni nasohlobeni lwayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkuhlelekayo: igama, uhlobo lwento, ithegi, incazelo, nezinani zesici ezisodwa. Igcinwa njengefayela elisha le-IFC. Izikimu i-IFC2X3, i-IFC4 kanye ne-IFC4X3 ziyavuleka, zifundwa yi-injini ye-IFC yangaphakathi ye-BimCraft; yonke into engakayikwazi ukudweba ibhalwa ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003ENot drawn yet\u003C/strong\u003E ephaneli ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E. Imodeli ihanjiswa ukuya kumsuka lapho ivulwa, ngakho imodeli ebekwe kude nawo isavela phakathi kwesikrini. Ama-\u003Ccode\u003E.ifczip\u003C/code\u003E no-\u003Ccode\u003E.ifcxml\u003C/code\u003E akavuleki.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amaphrojekthi-nemindeni\"\u003EAmaphrojekthi nemindeni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmaphrojekthi e-\u003Ccode\u003E.rvt\u003C/code\u003E, amathempleti amaphrojekthi e-\u003Ccode\u003E.rte\u003C/code\u003E, imindeni e-\u003Ccode\u003E.rfa\u003C/code\u003E kanye namathempleti emindeni e-\u003Ccode\u003E.rft\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKufundwa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EImininingwane\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUlwazi lwefayela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkukhishwa nokwakhiwa, ukusebenza ngokuhlanganyela, indlela yemodeli ephakathi, indlela yokugcinwa kokugcina, igama lomsebenzisi, ulimi, i-GUID yedokhumenti\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUlwazi lweprojekthi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinkambu zephrojekthi ngokwayo (igama, inombolo, ikhasimende, ikheli, isimo…), ngaphandle kwezinkomba zokuzenzakalela zephrojekthi emisha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUlwazi lomndeni\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIgama lomndeni, isigaba, ukukhishwa, isibuyekezo sokugcina, namapharamitha ayo ngamaqembu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzixhumanisi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUhlu lwemodeli exhunyiwe, izixhumanisi ze-CAD, izithombe namathebhulu ezinkomba okutholwe kufayela\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsithombe sokubuka kuqala\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsithonjana esigcinwe kufayela\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAkufundwa: imodeli ye-3D, izinto, imibono, amashidi nohlu. Zigcinwa ngefomethi engakachazwa. I-BimCraft ifunda amakhilobhayithi ambalwa nje kusuka kwifayela ngalinye, ngakho usayizi wefayela ngokuvamile awubalulekile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amafayela-pln-pla-tpl-kanye-bpn\"\u003EAmafayela .pln, .pla, .tpl kanye .bpn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAkufundwa okwamanje: i-BimCraft iyasho lokho lapho uyivula. Yisa ngaphandle i-IFC yemodeli kanye ne-DWG yemidwebo; bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/pln-project-files\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/pln-project-files\"\u003EVula amafayela ephrojekthi e-.pln nawe-.pla\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dwg-ne-dxf\"\u003EDWG ne-DXF\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKufundwa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EImininingwane\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzikhala\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsikhala semodeli nalo lonke ishidi (ukwakheka), ngokulandelana kwamathebhu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkubuka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkubuka kwalo shidi ngalinye, ngesikali sakho, ukuphendulwa nezendlela ezifriziwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmaleya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIgama, umbala, ukuvuleka/ukuvalwa, ukufriza, isibonakaliso sokuphrinta nobukhulu bomugqa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinto\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImigqa, ama-polyline, ama-arc, izindilinga, ama-ellipse, ama-spline, ukugcwaliswa, umbhalo nombhalo wemigqa eminingi, amabhulokhi namakhoyi, izilinganiso, ama-leader namamulti-leader, amathebhu, amaphoyinti, izithombe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImidwebo exhunyiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIdwetshwa lapho ifakwe khona, uma amafayela ayo etholakala\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzithombe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZidwetshwa kusuka kumafayela ezithombe uma etholakele (PNG, JPEG, GIF, BMP, WebP; hhayi TIFF)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmathegi ezinsiza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmathegi ezinsiza zokudla (izici ze-\u003Ccode\u003EKCL-ITEM\u003C/code\u003E), ohlwini lwezinsiza\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOkunye konke kubalwa ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003ENot drawn yet\u003C/strong\u003E, kungaqagelwa. Ifomethi ye-DWG ukusuka ku-AutoCAD 2000 kuya ku-2018 yiyona ehloliwe (amafayela e-R13 ne-R14 nawo ayamukelwa, kodwa ayikho esethini yokuhlola; ama-DWG amadala akavuleki); iphaneli ethi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrawing\u003C/span\u003E ibonisa ikhodi yefomethi (njengo-AC1032). Amafayela e-DXF weziguqulo zonke ayavuleka, e-R12 nawo. Kokubili kufundwa ngabafundi bangaphakathi be-BimCraft kule thebhu. Akukho okulondolozwa kubuyele ku-DWG noma i-DXF.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ngaphakathi-kwefolda\"\u003ENgaphakathi kwefolda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUhlobo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkwelulekiwe\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKumbiko\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmamodeli\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.rvt\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.rfa\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.rte\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.rft\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAhlelwe nezikhadi zokusekela ezinenombolo, ahlolwa impilo, ikhadi lifundwe, nezixhumanisi ziyahlolwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIFC\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.ifc\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbhalwe ohlwini; ivula ku-3D\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECAD\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.dwg\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.dxf\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.dgn\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbhalwe ohlwini ngamamodeli awaxhumanisayo; i-DWG ne-DXF zivula ku-2D, i-DGN ayivuleki\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinsalela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.dwl\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.dwl2\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.bak\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.err\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.log\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.tmp\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.sv$\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.ac$\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.lck\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.slog\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZibalwa ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003ESet aside\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmafolda okugcina\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E*_backup\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E*_log\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003ERevit_temp\u003C/code\u003E, amafolda afihliwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAbalwa ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003ESet aside\u003C/strong\u003E, akufundwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/folder-roles\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/folder-roles\"\u003EUmbiko wefolda: izindima, izimo nezixhumanisi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"IFC Kufundwa Imininingwane Ijiyomethri Yonke into enesimo, inombala njengoba ifayela lisho. Amagumbi nezikhala zidwetshwa zingabonakali futhi zifihliwe ekuqaleni Izitezi Izitezi zakhiwo ngokulandelana kokuphakama, nokuthi yiziphi izinto ezisemagatsheni ngamunye. Izinto ezingasesitezini azilungiselelwe ngaphansi kwe-\"Not on a storey\" Inani lezinto Izinto zangaphezu kohlobo ngalunye (izindonga, iminyango, izilingo…), ezibonakala ku-Elements Ulwazi lwephrojekthi Igama leprojekthi, igama elide, nesigaba; isikimu, uhlelo oluthumela, umbhali nosuku lokuthumela kusuka ekhanda lefayela Idatha yento Igama, uhlobo, uhlobo lwento, ithegi, incazelo, GlobalId; yonke isethi yezici nesethi yezinani esemayinteni nasohlobeni lwayo Okuhlelekayo: igama, uhlobo lwento, ithegi, incazelo, nezinani zesici ezisodwa. Igcinwa njengefayela elisha le-IFC. Izikimu i-IFC2X3, i-IFC4 kanye ne-IFC4X3 ziyavuleka, zifundwa yi-injini ye-IFC yangaphakathi ye-BimCraft; yonke into engakayikwazi ukudweba ibhalwa ngaphansi kwe-Not drawn yet ephaneli ethi File. Imodeli ihanjiswa ukuya kumsuka lapho ivulwa, ngakho imodeli ebekwe kude nawo isavela phakathi kwesikrini. Ama-.ifczip no-.ifcxml akavuleki. Amaphrojekthi nemindeni Amaphrojekthi e-.rvt, amathempleti amaphrojekthi e-.rte, imindeni e-.rfa kanye namathempleti emindeni e-.rft. Kufundwa Imininingwane Ulwazi lwefayela Ukukhishwa nokwakhiwa, ukusebenza ngokuhlanganyela, indlela yemodeli ephakathi, indlela yokugcinwa kokugcina, igama lomsebenzisi, ulimi, i-GUID yedokhumenti Ulwazi lweprojekthi Izinkambu zephrojekthi ngokwayo (igama, inombolo, ikhasimende, ikheli, isimo…), ngaphandle kwezinkomba zokuzenzakalela zephrojekthi emisha Ulwazi lomndeni Igama lomndeni, isigaba, ukukhishwa, isibuyekezo sokugcina, namapharamitha ayo ngamaqembu Izixhumanisi Uhlu lwemodeli exhunyiwe, izixhumanisi ze-CAD, izithombe namathebhulu ezinkomba okutholwe kufayela Isithombe sokubuka kuqala Isithonjana esigcinwe kufayela Akufundwa: imodeli ye-3D, izinto, imibono, amashidi nohlu. Zigcinwa ngefomethi engakachazwa. I-BimCraft ifunda amakhilobhayithi ambalwa nje kusuka kwifayela ngalinye, ngakho usayizi wefayela ngokuvamile awubalulekile. Amafayela .pln, .pla, .tpl kanye .bpn Akufundwa okwamanje: i-BimCraft iyasho lokho lapho uyivula. Yisa ngaphandle i-IFC yemodeli kanye ne-DWG yemidwebo; bona Vula amafayela ephrojekthi e-.pln nawe-.pla. DWG ne-DXF Kufundwa Imininingwane Izikhala Isikhala semodeli nalo lonke ishidi (ukwakheka), ngokulandelana kwamathebhu Ukubuka Ukubuka kwalo shidi ngalinye, ngesikali sakho, ukuphendulwa nezendlela ezifriziwe Amaleya Igama, umbala, ukuvuleka/ukuvalwa, ukufriza, isibonakaliso sokuphrinta nobukhulu bomugqa Izinto Imigqa, ama-polyline, ama-arc, izindilinga, ama-ellipse, ama-spline, ukugcwaliswa, umbhalo nombhalo wemigqa eminingi, amabhulokhi namakhoyi, izilinganiso, ama-leader namamulti-leader, amathebhu, amaphoyinti, izithombe Imidwebo exhunyiwe Idwetshwa lapho ifakwe khona, uma amafayela ayo etholakala Izithombe Zidwetshwa kusuka kumafayela ezithombe uma etholakele (PNG, JPEG, GIF, BMP, WebP; hhayi TIFF) Amathegi ezinsiza Amathegi ezinsiza zokudla (izici ze-KCL-ITEM), ohlwini lwezinsiza Okunye konke kubalwa ngaphansi kwe-Not drawn yet, kungaqagelwa. Ifomethi ye-DWG ukusuka ku-AutoCAD 2000 kuya ku-2018 yiyona ehloliwe (amafayela e-R13 ne-R14 nawo ayamukelwa, kodwa ayikho esethini yokuhlola; ama-DWG amadala akavuleki); iphaneli ethi Drawing ibonisa ikhodi yefomethi (njengo-AC1032). Amafayela e-DXF weziguqulo zonke ayavuleka, e-R12 nawo. Kokubili kufundwa ngabafundi bangaphakathi be-BimCraft kule thebhu. Akukho okulondolozwa kubuyele ku-DWG noma i-DXF. Ngaphakathi kwefolda Uhlobo Okwelulekiwe Kumbiko Amamodeli .rvt .rfa .rte .rft Ahlelwe nezikhadi zokusekela ezinenombolo, ahlolwa impilo, ikhadi lifundwe, nezixhumanisi ziyahlolwa IFC .ifc Ibhalwe ohlwini; ivula ku-3D CAD .dwg .dxf .dgn Ibhalwe ohlwini ngamamodeli awaxhumanisayo; i-DWG ne-DXF zivula ku-2D, i-DGN ayivuleki Izinsalela .dwl .dwl2 .bak .err .log .tmp .sv$ .ac$ .lck .slog Zibalwa ngaphansi kwe-Set aside Amafolda okugcina *_backup, *_log, Revit_temp, amafolda afihliwe Abalwa ngaphansi kwe-Set aside, akufundwa Bheka Umbiko wefolda: izindima, izimo nezixhumanisi.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"point-cloud-formats","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Ifomethi zamafu amaphoyinti: okuvulayo nokuthumelayo","summary":"Yiphi mafayela okuskena ngelaser avula kuvubo le-3D, yiphi ayiyo ifomethi yomkhiqizi womshini wokuskena, nokuthi yini okufanele uyithumele kusofthiwe womshini wokuskena ukuze lokhu kuskena kuvule lapha.","section":"reference","order":28,"keywords":["ifu lamaphoyinti","ukuskena ngelaser","ukuskena","amafomethi","e57","las","laz","ply","pcd","ptx","pts","xyz","rcp","rcs","fls","lgs","tzf","zfs","ukuthumela","akuvuli","akufundeki"],"headings":[{"id":"okuvulayo-lapha","text":"Okuvulayo lapha","level":2},{"id":"amafayela-asetshenziswa-yisofthiwe-yomskena-kuphela","text":"Amafayela asetshenziswa yisofthiwe yomskena kuphela","level":2},{"id":"kungani-lawa-mafayela-angafundwa","text":"Kungani lawa mafayela angafundwa","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"okuvulayo-lapha\"\u003EOkuvulayo lapha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula lezi nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIvulekile\u003C/span\u003E noma ngokuzikhipha ekhasini (bheka isihloko sokubonisa ifu lamaphoyinti ecaleni kwemodeli):\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIfomethi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsandiso\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkufundwayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELAS, LAZ\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.las\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.laz\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELAS 1.0–1.4: amaphoyinti, imibala, amandla okukhanya, amakilasi e-LiDAR, uhlelo lokugonya. LAZ kuya ku-1 GB.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EE57\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.e57\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKonke ukuskena kuleli fayela, ngakunye kubekwe ngendawo yakho; imibala, noma amandla okukhanya uma ifayela lingenayo imibala. Izithombe kulo fayela ziyashiywa (kuyashiwo). Kuya kumaphoyinti ayizigidi ezi-6 nama-512 MB njengamanje: thumela ukuskena okukhulu njenge-LAS noma i-LAZ.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPLY\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.ply\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkubhaliwe nokunamabhithi (zombili izindlela zama-byte): i-x y z yama-vertex, imibala namandla okukhanya. Izinhlangothi ziyashiywa (kuyashiwo).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPCD\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.pcd\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkubhaliwe nokunamabhithi: x y z, imibala ehlanganisiwe noma ehlukene, amandla okukhanya. Amafayela e-PCD acindezelwe awafundwa okwamanje: gcina njengabhithi noma njengombhalo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPTX\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.ptx\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuskena okukodwa noma okuningi, ngakunye kubekwe ngoshintsho lwakho; amaphoyinti umskena ongawalinganisanga ayashiywa. Ngamamitha.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPTS, XYZ\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.pts\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.xyz\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkubhaliwe: x y z, namandla okukhanya nemibala uma amakholomu enawo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amafayela-asetshenziswa-yisofthiwe-yomskena-kuphela\"\u003EAmafayela asetshenziswa yisofthiwe yomskena kuphela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmanye amafayela okuskena ayifomethi yomkhiqizi womshini wokuskena, angenayo incazelo eshicilelwe nomfundi ovulekile. I-BimCraft ayikwazi ukuwafunda, futhi ukuvula elilodwa kubonisa ikhadi elisho ukuthi yini nokuthi yenzeni. Thumela ukuskena kusofthiwe womkhiqizi njenge-E57 noma i-LAS (noma i-PTX, i-PTS), bese uvula leyo fayela ethunyelwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIfayela\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsandiso\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EThumela kusuka ku\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EReCap project\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.rcp\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EReCap: vula iphrojekthi bese uyithumela. Iphrojekthi ikhomba kuskena kuphela, ngakho ukukopisha i-\u003Ccode\u003E.rcp\u003C/code\u003E yodwa akunike amaphoyinti.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EReCap scan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.rcs\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EReCap: vula iphrojekthi uskeni olungene kuyo bese uyithumela.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFARO scan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.fls\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFARO SCENE.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELeica scan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.lgs\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELeica Cyclone REGISTER 360.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETrimble scan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.tzf\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETrimble RealWorks noma Trimble Business Center.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZ+F scan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.zfs\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZ+F LaserControl.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELapho ukuthumela kubuza ifomethi, i-LAS noma i-LAZ igcina konke i-BimCraft ekhombisayo (imibala, amandla okukhanya, amakilasi nohlelo lokugonya) efayeleni elincane kakhulu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kungani-lawa-mafayela-angafundwa\"\u003EKungani lawa mafayela angafundwa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELezi zifomethi azishicilelwe, futhi indlela kuphela yokuzifunda iyilayibrari yesofthiwe yomkhiqizi ngamunye, ngaphansi kwemigomo yayo. I-BimCraft ifunda kuphela ifomethi engayifunda ngekhodi yayo kukhompyutha yakho, ngakho ukuskena akudingi ukuthunyelwa noma kuphi ukuze kuvule.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Okuvulayo lapha Vula lezi nge-Ivulekile noma ngokuzikhipha ekhasini (bheka isihloko sokubonisa ifu lamaphoyinti ecaleni kwemodeli): Ifomethi Isandiso Okufundwayo LAS, LAZ .las, .laz LAS 1.0–1.4: amaphoyinti, imibala, amandla okukhanya, amakilasi e-LiDAR, uhlelo lokugonya. LAZ kuya ku-1 GB. E57 .e57 Konke ukuskena kuleli fayela, ngakunye kubekwe ngendawo yakho; imibala, noma amandla okukhanya uma ifayela lingenayo imibala. Izithombe kulo fayela ziyashiywa (kuyashiwo). Kuya kumaphoyinti ayizigidi ezi-6 nama-512 MB njengamanje: thumela ukuskena okukhulu njenge-LAS noma i-LAZ. PLY .ply Okubhaliwe nokunamabhithi (zombili izindlela zama-byte): i-x y z yama-vertex, imibala namandla okukhanya. Izinhlangothi ziyashiywa (kuyashiwo). PCD .pcd Okubhaliwe nokunamabhithi: x y z, imibala ehlanganisiwe noma ehlukene, amandla okukhanya. Amafayela e-PCD acindezelwe awafundwa okwamanje: gcina njengabhithi noma njengombhalo. PTX .ptx Ukuskena okukodwa noma okuningi, ngakunye kubekwe ngoshintsho lwakho; amaphoyinti umskena ongawalinganisanga ayashiywa. Ngamamitha. PTS, XYZ .pts, .xyz Okubhaliwe: x y z, namandla okukhanya nemibala uma amakholomu enawo. Amafayela asetshenziswa yisofthiwe yomskena kuphela Amanye amafayela okuskena ayifomethi yomkhiqizi womshini wokuskena, angenayo incazelo eshicilelwe nomfundi ovulekile. I-BimCraft ayikwazi ukuwafunda, futhi ukuvula elilodwa kubonisa ikhadi elisho ukuthi yini nokuthi yenzeni. Thumela ukuskena kusofthiwe womkhiqizi njenge-E57 noma i-LAS (noma i-PTX, i-PTS), bese uvula leyo fayela ethunyelwe. Ifayela Isandiso Thumela kusuka ku ReCap project .rcp ReCap: vula iphrojekthi bese uyithumela. Iphrojekthi ikhomba kuskena kuphela, ngakho ukukopisha i-.rcp yodwa akunike amaphoyinti. ReCap scan .rcs ReCap: vula iphrojekthi uskeni olungene kuyo bese uyithumela. FARO scan .fls FARO SCENE. Leica scan .lgs Leica Cyclone REGISTER 360. Trimble scan .tzf Trimble RealWorks noma Trimble Business Center. Z+F scan .zfs Z+F LaserControl. Lapho ukuthumela kubuza ifomethi, i-LAS noma i-LAZ igcina konke i-BimCraft ekhombisayo (imibala, amandla okukhanya, amakilasi nohlelo lokugonya) efayeleni elincane kakhulu. Kungani lawa mafayela angafundwa Lezi zifomethi azishicilelwe, futhi indlela kuphela yokuzifunda iyilayibrari yesofthiwe yomkhiqizi ngamunye, ngaphansi kwemigomo yayo. I-BimCraft ifunda kuphela ifomethi engayifunda ngekhodi yayo kukhompyutha yakho, ngakho ukuskena akudingi ukuthunyelwa noma kuphi ukuze kuvule.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"properties-panel","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Izinkambu zephaneli yezici","summary":"Okusho ngayinkambu ngayinye ephaneli ye-Properties kanye nephaneli ye-File, Drawing ne-Folder, nokuthi yiziphi ongazishintsha.","section":"reference","order":30,"keywords":["izici","izinkambu","izici (attributes)","globalid","guid","kopisha","kopisha inani","kopisha konke","csv","clipboard","inombolo yenkonzo","ithegi","uhlobo lwento","umugqa","express id","isethi yezici","pset","izinombolo","ischema","ephaneli yefayela"],"headings":[{"id":"into-ye-ifc","text":"Into ye-IFC","level":2},{"id":"kopisha-inani","text":"Kopisha inani","level":2},{"id":"ephaneli-ye-file-ifc","text":"Ephaneli ye-File (IFC)","level":2},{"id":"ephaneli-ye-file-amafayela-ephrojekthi-nomndeni","text":"Ephaneli ye-File (amafayela ephrojekthi nomndeni)","level":2},{"id":"ephaneli-ye-drawing-dwg-ne-dxf","text":"Ephaneli ye-Drawing (DWG ne-DXF)","level":2},{"id":"ephaneli-yefolda","text":"Ephaneli yefolda","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"into-ye-ifc\"\u003EInto ye-IFC\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPhezulu kwephaneli ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzici\u003C/span\u003E kukhonjwa uhlobo lwento ngaphandle kwesiqalo &quot;Ifc&quot; (isibonelo &quot;Door&quot;, &quot;WallStandardCase&quot;, &quot;FurnishingElement&quot;) negama layo, noma &quot;Akuqanjiwe&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInkambu\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIncazelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIyashintsheka\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIgama\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIgama lento, ngokuvamile igama lomndeni nohlobo oluvela kumthumeli\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUhlobo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIgama lohlobo lwento, uma inalo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUhlobo lwento\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIncazelo yohlobo ngombhalo ovulekile ezinye izithumeli ezizigcwalisayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIthegi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIthegi noma uphawu lwento; izithumeli eziningi zibhala i-ID yento lapha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIncazelo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmbhalo ovulekile\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGlobalId\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkhodi ye-IFC yento engu-22 izinhlamvu, engaguquki, efanayo kuwo wonke ukuthunyelwa kwalento efanayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmugqa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInombolo yomugqa (\u003Ccode\u003E#1234\u003C/code\u003E) yento kulelo fayela le-IFC. Iyashintsha phakathi kokuthunyelwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgaphansi kuvela \u003Cstrong\u003Eamasethi ezici\u003C/strong\u003E, ahlelwe ngegama:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIseti ngayinye ivulwa futhi ivalwe lapho uchofoza igama layo. Ezintathu zokuqala zivulekile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIseti emaka ngo &quot;(type)&quot; yohlobo lwento: &quot;Inani lohlobo: ukushintsha lapha kusebenza kuzo zonke izinto zalolohlobo.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmasethi wezibalo (ubude, izindawo, amavolumu, izibalo, izisindo) afundeka kuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinhlu nezinani ezibalwayo zikhonjiswa, zifundeka kuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmanani Yebo/Cha abonisa \u003Cstrong\u003EYebo\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003ECha\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinombolo ziyazungezwa zibe izinkamba ezine ukuze zikhonjiswe. Ubude (inkambu yobude noma ubude bewuthi) bubonisa ngo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmayunithi\u003C/span\u003E akhethwe kuthuluzi, nomkhiqizo wabo ecaleni kwawo, futhi ungathayipha inani elisha kuleyo yunithi noma ngophawu olunye lweyunithi (2.4 m, 8&#039;-0&quot;): i-BimCraft ibhala inombolo yefayela yona ibuyele kuyo. Ezinye izinombolo zibonisa njengoba ifayela linazo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInani elingenalutho libonisa \u003Cem\u003Eempty\u003C/em\u003E. Inani eliguqulwe libe bold futhi linebha eluhlaza ecaleni kwalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kopisha-inani\"\u003EKopisha inani\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInani ngalinye ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzici\u003C/span\u003E linenkinobho encane yokukopisha ecaleni kwalo: chofoza ukuze ufake lelo nani ku-clipboard njengoba likhonjiwe, isibonelo i-GlobalId, inombolo yesisebenzi noma nanoma yiliphi inani leseti yezici. Ukukopisha akuqali ukuhlela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPhezulu, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKopisha konke\u003C/span\u003E ikopisha wonke amanani wento njengombhalo, iseti ngeseti, kanti \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKopisha njenge-CSV\u003C/span\u003E ikopisha njengemigqa yeqembu, izici nenani ukuze unamathisele kusipredishithi; amanani angenalutho ayagcinwa ukuze inkambu ngayinye ibe nomugqa. Lokhu kusebenza ngendlela efanayo kusinto yemodeli evulekile evela kwenye; uma kuvulekile amamodeli amaningi, i-CSV iqala ngekholomu ye-Model ebiza igama lefayela lawo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ephaneli-ye-file-ifc\"\u003EEphaneli ye-File (IFC)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInkambu\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIncazelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFile, Size\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfayela olivulile nosayizi walo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESchema\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInguqulo ye-IFC, njengo-IFC2X3 noma IFC4\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EProject\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIgama lephrojekthi nelide\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhase\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsigaba sephrojekthi, uma umthumeli esibhalile\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EExported from\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUhlelo olwathumela, kusuka ekhanda lefayela\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAuthor\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmbhali ekhanda lefayela\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EExported\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUsuku nesikhathi ekhanda lefayela\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EElements\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInani lezinto ezinesimo esidwetshiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETriangles\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInani lama-triangle akhiwa yizimo zazo; ikhalidi lokuthi imodeli inzima kangakanani\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ephaneli-ye-file-amafayela-ephrojekthi-nomndeni\"\u003EEphaneli ye-File (amafayela ephrojekthi nomndeni)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInkambu\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIncazelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKind\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIphrojekthi, Ithempulethi yephrojekthi, Umndeni noma Ithempulethi yomndeni\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESaved in\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkukhishwa okulondoloze ifayela okokugcina\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBuild\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbhildi elinembile lalokho kukhishwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERead\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYingakanani ingxenye yefayela i-BimCraft eyifundile, kusuka kubukhulu balo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ephaneli-ye-drawing-dwg-ne-dxf\"\u003EEphaneli ye-Drawing (DWG ne-DXF)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInkambu\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIncazelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormat\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkukhishwa umdwebo olondolozwe ngakho, nekhodi yefomethi, njengo-AC1032\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUnits\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmayunithi okungenisa womdwebo, uma esethiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEntities\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInani lezinto ezifundiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELayers\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInani lamalayiri\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESheets\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInani lamashidi (ama-layout), noma None\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinked drawings\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImidwebo exhunyiwe etholakele futhi elayishiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEquipment\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInani lemishini ethegiwe esemashidini\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ephaneli-yefolda\"\u003EEphaneli yefolda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInkambu\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIncazelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFolder, Files, Size\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfolda evulekile, inani lamafayela alo nosayizi wawo wonke\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EModels\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmafayela ephrojekthi nomndeni, ngayinye nezikhulumi zayo zibalwa kanye\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECAD drawings, IFC models\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInani ngalinye\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EProblems\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInani lamakhophi emodeli angaphelele noma angafundeki, noma None\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E","text":"Into ye-IFC Phezulu kwephaneli ye-Izici kukhonjwa uhlobo lwento ngaphandle kwesiqalo \"Ifc\" (isibonelo \"Door\", \"WallStandardCase\", \"FurnishingElement\") negama layo, noma \"Akuqanjiwe\". Inkambu Incazelo Iyashintsheka Igama Igama lento, ngokuvamile igama lomndeni nohlobo oluvela kumthumeli Yebo Uhlobo Igama lohlobo lwento, uma inalo Cha Uhlobo lwento Incazelo yohlobo ngombhalo ovulekile ezinye izithumeli ezizigcwalisayo Yebo Ithegi Ithegi noma uphawu lwento; izithumeli eziningi zibhala i-ID yento lapha Yebo Incazelo Umbhalo ovulekile Yebo GlobalId Ikhodi ye-IFC yento engu-22 izinhlamvu, engaguquki, efanayo kuwo wonke ukuthunyelwa kwalento efanayo Cha Umugqa Inombolo yomugqa (#1234) yento kulelo fayela le-IFC. Iyashintsha phakathi kokuthunyelwa Cha Ngaphansi kuvela amasethi ezici, ahlelwe ngegama: Iseti ngayinye ivulwa futhi ivalwe lapho uchofoza igama layo. Ezintathu zokuqala zivulekile. Iseti emaka ngo \"(type)\" yohlobo lwento: \"Inani lohlobo: ukushintsha lapha kusebenza kuzo zonke izinto zalolohlobo.\" Amasethi wezibalo (ubude, izindawo, amavolumu, izibalo, izisindo) afundeka kuphela. Izinhlu nezinani ezibalwayo zikhonjiswa, zifundeka kuphela. Amanani Yebo/Cha abonisa Yebo noma Cha. Izinombolo ziyazungezwa zibe izinkamba ezine ukuze zikhonjiswe. Ubude (inkambu yobude noma ubude bewuthi) bubonisa ngo-Amayunithi akhethwe kuthuluzi, nomkhiqizo wabo ecaleni kwawo, futhi ungathayipha inani elisha kuleyo yunithi noma ngophawu olunye lweyunithi (2.4 m, 8'-0\"): i-BimCraft ibhala inombolo yefayela yona ibuyele kuyo. Ezinye izinombolo zibonisa njengoba ifayela linazo. Inani elingenalutho libonisa empty. Inani eliguqulwe libe bold futhi linebha eluhlaza ecaleni kwalo. Kopisha inani Inani ngalinye ku-Izici linenkinobho encane yokukopisha ecaleni kwalo: chofoza ukuze ufake lelo nani ku-clipboard njengoba likhonjiwe, isibonelo i-GlobalId, inombolo yesisebenzi noma nanoma yiliphi inani leseti yezici. Ukukopisha akuqali ukuhlela. Phezulu, Kopisha konke ikopisha wonke amanani wento njengombhalo, iseti ngeseti, kanti Kopisha njenge-CSV ikopisha njengemigqa yeqembu, izici nenani ukuze unamathisele kusipredishithi; amanani angenalutho ayagcinwa ukuze inkambu ngayinye ibe nomugqa. Lokhu kusebenza ngendlela efanayo kusinto yemodeli evulekile evela kwenye; uma kuvulekile amamodeli amaningi, i-CSV iqala ngekholomu ye-Model ebiza igama lefayela lawo. Ephaneli ye-File (IFC) Inkambu Incazelo File, Size Ifayela olivulile nosayizi walo Schema Inguqulo ye-IFC, njengo-IFC2X3 noma IFC4 Project Igama lephrojekthi nelide Phase Isigaba sephrojekthi, uma umthumeli esibhalile Exported from Uhlelo olwathumela, kusuka ekhanda lefayela Author Umbhali ekhanda lefayela Exported Usuku nesikhathi ekhanda lefayela Elements Inani lezinto ezinesimo esidwetshiwe Triangles Inani lama-triangle akhiwa yizimo zazo; ikhalidi lokuthi imodeli inzima kangakanani Ephaneli ye-File (amafayela ephrojekthi nomndeni) Inkambu Incazelo Kind Iphrojekthi, Ithempulethi yephrojekthi, Umndeni noma Ithempulethi yomndeni Saved in Ukukhishwa okulondoloze ifayela okokugcina Build Ibhildi elinembile lalokho kukhishwa Read Yingakanani ingxenye yefayela i-BimCraft eyifundile, kusuka kubukhulu balo Ephaneli ye-Drawing (DWG ne-DXF) Inkambu Incazelo Format Ukukhishwa umdwebo olondolozwe ngakho, nekhodi yefomethi, njengo-AC1032 Units Amayunithi okungenisa womdwebo, uma esethiwe Entities Inani lezinto ezifundiwe Layers Inani lamalayiri Sheets Inani lamashidi (ama-layout), noma None Linked drawings Imidwebo exhunyiwe etholakele futhi elayishiwe Equipment Inani lemishini ethegiwe esemashidini Ephaneli yefolda Inkambu Incazelo Folder, Files, Size Ifolda evulekile, inani lamafayela alo nosayizi wawo wonke Models Amafayela ephrojekthi nomndeni, ngayinye nezikhulumi zayo zibalwa kanye CAD drawings, IFC models Inani ngalinye Problems Inani lamakhophi emodeli angaphelele noma angafundeki, noma None","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"render-engine-addons","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Engeza injini yokurenda nge-add-on","summary":"Okungezwa yi-add-on kuhlu lwe-Injini engxoxweni yokurenda, imvume edingekayo ukuze uhlelo lusebenze, nokuthi i-Studio ihlola futhi icela ini.","section":"reference","order":37,"keywords":["okwengeziwe","add-on","addon","injini","injini yokurenda","umthuthukisi","engine.run","imvume","uhlelo","iskripthi","sayiniwe","studio","api"],"headings":[],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EI-add-on (Izilungiselelo › Okwengeziwe) ingangeza injini kuhlu lwe-Injini engxoxweni \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERenda\u003C/span\u003E. Umbhalo ogcwele wababhali be-add-on useceleni 16 wesipesifikheshini se-add-on; ngokufushane:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-add-on ibhalisa injini enesamba esiqala ngesayo, igama, izilungiselelo ezingaphoqelekile, \u003Cstrong\u003Enoma\u003C/strong\u003E uhlelo lokuqhuba \u003Cstrong\u003Enoma\u003C/strong\u003E umsebenzi we-JavaScript odweba isithombe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInjini eqhuba uhlelo idinga imvume \u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eengine.run\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E, ebonakala ngaphambi kokufaka nakuZilungiselelo. Isebenza kuStudio kuphela; kuwebhu ibonakala njengefayela okufanele silondolozwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-add-on iqamba uhlelo (igama lefayela elilula kuphela: hhayi i-shell), iskripthi \u003Cstrong\u003Eesingaphakathi kwe-add-on esayiniwe\u003C/strong\u003E, nezimpikiswano ezakhiwe ngokubamba izindawo nemigqa elula. I-Studio iyathola uhlelo noma icele ukuthi uyibhekisele kanye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOkokuqala lapho i-add-on iqhuba uhlelo, \u003Cstrong\u003Ei-Studio ikubuza engxoxweni yayo\u003C/strong\u003E: yiyiphi i-add-on, yiluphi uhlelo, nokuthi iskripthi singenza noma yini uhlelo olungayenza. Yivumele kuphela i-add-on oyithembayo. Impendulo yakho iyakhunjulwa ngale add-on nalolu hlelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIpakethe (isimo njenge-USD nefayela lezilungiselelo, kanye nefayela le-glTF uma i-add-on iyicela) neskripthi le-add-on kungena kufolda yesikhashana emisha; uhlelo luqhuba lapho, isithombe sibuya sibhalwe ngegama leinjini ye-add-on.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAma-add-on angangeza injini zokurenda kuphela kusukela ku-API ye-add-on 1.4. Isibonelo esisebenzayo sesikhali somyalo esivulekile sitholakala endaweni yaso yokugcina; asikaqhutshwa kuleyo renda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"I-add-on (Izilungiselelo › Okwengeziwe) ingangeza injini kuhlu lwe-Injini engxoxweni Renda. Umbhalo ogcwele wababhali be-add-on useceleni 16 wesipesifikheshini se-add-on; ngokufushane: I-add-on ibhalisa injini enesamba esiqala ngesayo, igama, izilungiselelo ezingaphoqelekile, noma uhlelo lokuqhuba noma umsebenzi we-JavaScript odweba isithombe. Injini eqhuba uhlelo idinga imvume engine.run, ebonakala ngaphambi kokufaka nakuZilungiselelo. Isebenza kuStudio kuphela; kuwebhu ibonakala njengefayela okufanele silondolozwe. I-add-on iqamba uhlelo (igama lefayela elilula kuphela: hhayi i-shell), iskripthi esingaphakathi kwe-add-on esayiniwe, nezimpikiswano ezakhiwe ngokubamba izindawo nemigqa elula. I-Studio iyathola uhlelo noma icele ukuthi uyibhekisele kanye. Okokuqala lapho i-add-on iqhuba uhlelo, i-Studio ikubuza engxoxweni yayo: yiyiphi i-add-on, yiluphi uhlelo, nokuthi iskripthi singenza noma yini uhlelo olungayenza. Yivumele kuphela i-add-on oyithembayo. Impendulo yakho iyakhunjulwa ngale add-on nalolu hlelo. Ipakethe (isimo njenge-USD nefayela lezilungiselelo, kanye nefayela le-glTF uma i-add-on iyicela) neskripthi le-add-on kungena kufolda yesikhashana emisha; uhlelo luqhuba lapho, isithombe sibuya sibhalwe ngegama leinjini ye-add-on. Ama-add-on angangeza injini zokurenda kuphela kusukela ku-API ye-add-on 1.4. Isibonelo esisebenzayo sesikhali somyalo esivulekile sitholakala endaweni yaso yokugcina; asikaqhutshwa kuleyo renda.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"folder-roles","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Umbiko wefolda: izindima, izimo namaxhumanisi","summary":"Yonke incwadi emBikweni wefolda, okusho kwayo, nokuthi isiphakamiso se-Qala lapha sikhethwa kanjani.","section":"reference","order":40,"keywords":["umbiko wefolda","izindima","isimo","eqediwe","akuqediwe","akufundeki","oxhunyiwe","ngemuva","isisekelo","esiphakathi","umndeni","izikhwama kuphela","qala lapha","isimo sokuxhuma"],"headings":[{"id":"isimo-sekhophi","text":"Isimo sekhophi","level":2},{"id":"amakhophi-okusekela","text":"Amakhophi okusekela","level":2},{"id":"izindima","text":"Izindima","level":2},{"id":"ukuthi-qala-lapha-ikhethwa-kanjani","text":"Ukuthi \"Qala lapha\" ikhethwa kanjani","level":2},{"id":"isimo-sokuxhuma","text":"Isimo sokuxhuma","level":2},{"id":"okubekwe-eceleni","text":"Okubekwe eceleni","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"isimo-sekhophi\"\u003EIsimo sekhophi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYonke ikhophi yemodeli, ifayela elikhulu namakhophi okusekela anamanani, konke kuthola ukuhlolwa kwekhanda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIncwadi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkusho kwayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEqediwe\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkhanda lefayela nendondo yalo kulingana ngaphakathi kwefayela\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkuqediwe\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfayela lifushane kunenkomba yalo: lanqunyiwe lapho likopishelwa, lilayishelwa noma lilungiswa, noma kuyifayela lefu elisemakhasini &quot;online only&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkufundeki\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfayela alisiyo i-compound file esemthethweni, noma alikwazanga ukufundwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKwikholomu \u003Cstrong\u003EIsimo\u003C/strong\u003E imodeli ibonisa \u003Cstrong\u003EEqediwe\u003C/strong\u003E, i-\u003Cem\u003En\u003C/em\u003E akuqediwe ngombala we-amber uma okungenani ikhophi eyodwa imbi kodwa enye ilungile, noma \u003Cstrong\u003EAkuqediwe\u003C/strong\u003E obomvu uma zingekho ikhophi elungile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amakhophi-okusekela\"\u003EAmakhophi okusekela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmafayela anegama elinamanani njengo \u003Ccode\u003EName.0001.rvt\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EName.0002.rvt\u003C/code\u003E njalo njalo ayizikhophi zokusekela ezinamanani ka \u003Ccode\u003EName.rvt\u003C/code\u003E. Ahlelwa ngaphansi kwemodeli yawo, amasha kuqala, ku-\u003Cstrong\u003EZonke … amakhophi\u003C/strong\u003E. Ikhadi lifundwa kusuka kufayela elikhulu uma liphelele, noma kusuka kokusekela okusha okuphelele (&quot;newest complete&quot;).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izindima\"\u003EIzindima\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZikhonjiswa ngamagama aphansi egama lemodeli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIndima\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkusho kwayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOxhunywe \u003Cem\u003Eyenye imodeli\u003C/em\u003E: ingemuva\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEnye imodeli kule folda iyixhumanisa, ngakho kungenzeka kakhulu ukuthi ingemuva labanye, njengemodeli yomeluleki\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfayela lesisekelo noma elingenagama\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIgama njengo-Blank, Template, Default, Untitled noma Project1: indawo yokuqala, noma ifayela elingazange lithiywe ngokufanele\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImodeli emaphakathi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImodeli emaphakathi esetshenziswa ngabaningi. Umsebenzi wenziwa kwikhophi yasendaweni, hhayi lapha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmndeni (ingxenye)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfayela \u003Ccode\u003E.rfa\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E.rft\u003C/code\u003E: ingxenye, hhayi iphrojekthi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzikhwama kuphela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfayela elikhulu seliphelile, kusele izikhwama zokusekela ezinamanani kuphela\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuthi-qala-lapha-ikhethwa-kanjani\"\u003EUkuthi &quot;Qala lapha&quot; ikhethwa kanjani\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBimCraft isebenzisa ukucabanga okungenziwa umsebenzisi onolwazi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAbaviwe bayiphrojekthi abafundekayo amafayela (\u003Ccode\u003E.rvt\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.rte\u003C/code\u003E) angaxhunywanga yimodeli enye futhi angesona isisekelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmaphakathi namamodeli okusekela kuphela kubalwa uma kungekho okungcono.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPhakathi kwabaviwe, eyolongwe kamuva kakhulu iyanqoba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIbhokisi lidweba izizathu zalo, futhi lixwayisa uma ifayela elibonakala njengokukhetha okuvelele lonakele, uma ezinye izimodeli ziyingemuva, nalapho ukukhethwa kuyimodeli emaphakathi. Kuyisiqagelo; buza lowo owenza umsebenzi wokugcina wephrojekthi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isimo-sokuxhuma\"\u003EIsimo sokuxhuma\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIncwadi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkusho kwayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKule folda\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EItholakale endleleni ehlobene egciniwe, noma ekugcineni kwendlela egcwele egciniwe ngaphakathi kwefolda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIgama elifanayo litholakele\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkusendleleni yalo, kodwa ifayela elinegama elifanayo lisefolda. Hlola ukuthi liyilelo elifanele\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIfayela le-Library\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIthebula lezinkomba noma lekhodi lomhlangano. Lezi zifika nalolu hlelo kwikhompyutha ngayinye\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkulona kule folda\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAlitholakali noma kuphi kule folda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIkholomu \u003Cstrong\u003EAmaxhumanisi atholakele\u003C/strong\u003E kwi-\u003Cstrong\u003EAmamodeli\u003C/strong\u003E ibonisa ukuthi kwatholakala amaxhumanisi emodeli angaki, phakathi kwalawo alindelwe kule folda (amafayela e-library akabalwa).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okubekwe-eceleni\"\u003EOkubekwe eceleni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUmugqa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkusho kwayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmafolda okugcina i-Revit (awafundwa)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmafolda \u003Ccode\u003E*_backup\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E*_log\u003C/code\u003E ne-\u003Ccode\u003ERevit_temp\u003C/code\u003E, kanye namafolda afihliwe ne-\u003Ccode\u003E__MACOSX\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkusalayo kokukhiya, ilogi nokusekela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmafayela \u003Ccode\u003E.dwl\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.dwl2\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.bak\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.err\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.log\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.tmp\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.sv$\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.ac$\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.lck\u003C/code\u003E ne-\u003Ccode\u003E.slog\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmanye amafayela\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKonke okunye (okokuqala angu-40 kuqanjwe amagama)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E","text":"Isimo sekhophi Yonke ikhophi yemodeli, ifayela elikhulu namakhophi okusekela anamanani, konke kuthola ukuhlolwa kwekhanda. Incwadi Okusho kwayo Eqediwe Ikhanda lefayela nendondo yalo kulingana ngaphakathi kwefayela Akuqediwe Ifayela lifushane kunenkomba yalo: lanqunyiwe lapho likopishelwa, lilayishelwa noma lilungiswa, noma kuyifayela lefu elisemakhasini \"online only\" Akufundeki Ifayela alisiyo i-compound file esemthethweni, noma alikwazanga ukufundwa Kwikholomu Isimo imodeli ibonisa Eqediwe, i-n akuqediwe ngombala we-amber uma okungenani ikhophi eyodwa imbi kodwa enye ilungile, noma Akuqediwe obomvu uma zingekho ikhophi elungile. Amakhophi okusekela Amafayela anegama elinamanani njengo Name.0001.rvt, Name.0002.rvt njalo njalo ayizikhophi zokusekela ezinamanani ka Name.rvt. Ahlelwa ngaphansi kwemodeli yawo, amasha kuqala, ku-Zonke … amakhophi. Ikhadi lifundwa kusuka kufayela elikhulu uma liphelele, noma kusuka kokusekela okusha okuphelele (\"newest complete\"). Izindima Zikhonjiswa ngamagama aphansi egama lemodeli. Indima Okusho kwayo Oxhunywe yenye imodeli: ingemuva Enye imodeli kule folda iyixhumanisa, ngakho kungenzeka kakhulu ukuthi ingemuva labanye, njengemodeli yomeluleki Ifayela lesisekelo noma elingenagama Igama njengo-Blank, Template, Default, Untitled noma Project1: indawo yokuqala, noma ifayela elingazange lithiywe ngokufanele Imodeli emaphakathi Imodeli emaphakathi esetshenziswa ngabaningi. Umsebenzi wenziwa kwikhophi yasendaweni, hhayi lapha Umndeni (ingxenye) Ifayela .rfa noma .rft: ingxenye, hhayi iphrojekthi Izikhwama kuphela Ifayela elikhulu seliphelile, kusele izikhwama zokusekela ezinamanani kuphela Ukuthi \"Qala lapha\" ikhethwa kanjani BimCraft isebenzisa ukucabanga okungenziwa umsebenzisi onolwazi: Abaviwe bayiphrojekthi abafundekayo amafayela (.rvt, .rte) angaxhunywanga yimodeli enye futhi angesona isisekelo. Amaphakathi namamodeli okusekela kuphela kubalwa uma kungekho okungcono. Phakathi kwabaviwe, eyolongwe kamuva kakhulu iyanqoba. Ibhokisi lidweba izizathu zalo, futhi lixwayisa uma ifayela elibonakala njengokukhetha okuvelele lonakele, uma ezinye izimodeli ziyingemuva, nalapho ukukhethwa kuyimodeli emaphakathi. Kuyisiqagelo; buza lowo owenza umsebenzi wokugcina wephrojekthi. Isimo sokuxhuma Incwadi Okusho kwayo Kule folda Itholakale endleleni ehlobene egciniwe, noma ekugcineni kwendlela egcwele egciniwe ngaphakathi kwefolda Igama elifanayo litholakele Akusendleleni yalo, kodwa ifayela elinegama elifanayo lisefolda. Hlola ukuthi liyilelo elifanele Ifayela le-Library Ithebula lezinkomba noma lekhodi lomhlangano. Lezi zifika nalolu hlelo kwikhompyutha ngayinye Akulona kule folda Alitholakali noma kuphi kule folda Ikholomu Amaxhumanisi atholakele kwi-Amamodeli ibonisa ukuthi kwatholakala amaxhumanisi emodeli angaki, phakathi kwalawo alindelwe kule folda (amafayela e-library akabalwa). Okubekwe eceleni Umugqa Okusho kwayo Amafolda okugcina i-Revit (awafundwa) Amafolda *_backup, *_log ne-Revit_temp, kanye namafolda afihliwe ne-__MACOSX Okusalayo kokukhiya, ilogi nokusekela Amafayela .dwl, .dwl2, .bak, .err, .log, .tmp, .sv$, .ac$, .lck ne-.slog Amanye amafayela Konke okunye (okokuqala angu-40 kuqanjwe amagama)","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"platforms","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Izingxhasi, amadivayisi nenkumbulo","summary":"Okwehluka ku-BimCraft phakathi kwe-Chrome, i-Edge, i-Firefox ne-Safari, ku-Mac, Windows nasekuLinux, nge-mouse, i-trackpad noma ukuthinta, nokuthi ifayela elikhulu kangakanani elingalilayisha.","section":"reference","order":50,"keywords":["isiphequluli","chrome","edge","firefox","safari","brave","mac","windows","linux","ipad","ithebhulethi","ifoni","ukuthinta","trackpad","inkumbulo","amafayela amakhulu","webgl","ukusebenza"],"headings":[{"id":"ukuvula-ifolda","text":"Ukuvula ifolda","level":2},{"id":"mac-windows-nasekulinux","text":"Mac, Windows nasekuLinux","level":2},{"id":"imouse-i-trackpad-nokuthinta","text":"Imouse, i-trackpad nokuthinta","level":2},{"id":"amafayela-amakhulu-nenkumbulo","text":"Amafayela amakhulu nenkumbulo","level":2},{"id":"okuhlobene","text":"Okuhlobene","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EI-BimCraft isebenza kumaguqulo amanje e-Chrome, i-Edge, i-Firefox ne-Safari, ku-Mac, Windows nasekuLinux. Ukubuka kwe-3D kudinga i-WebGL, okuyinto esekelwa yisiphequluli ngasinye samanje. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/browsers\" data-topic=\"basics/browsers\"\u003EIzinsiphequluli nezikhompyutha\u003C/a\u003E ukuze uthole okudingwa yi-apps ngokuvamile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuvula-ifolda\"\u003EUkuvula ifolda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsiphequluli\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula ifolda\u003C/span\u003E yenza lokhu\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkuhudula ifolda ngaphakathi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmafolda akamuva\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChrome, Edge\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsikhethi sefolda sesiphequluli, bese &quot;Vumela isayithi ukubona amafayela?&quot;: chofoza \u003Cstrong\u003EView files\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIvuleka ngaphandle kokubuza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYebo, kwamafolda akhethiwe noma adonselwe ngaphakathi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFirefox\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsikhethi sefolda sesistimu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIvuleka ngaphandle kokubuza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESafari\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsikhethi sefolda sesistimu, nenkinobho \u003Cstrong\u003EUpload\u003C/strong\u003E (akukho okulayishwayo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIvuleka ngaphandle kokubuza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgemuva kwesigameko: i-Chrome ne-Edge zisebenzisa isikhethi se-File System Access futhi zingakhumbula ifolda. I-Firefox ne-Safari zisebenzisa isikhethi sefolda sakudala, esinikeza wonke amafayela efolda ngesikhathi esisodwa futhi asikwazi ukukhunjulwa. Ifolda edonselwe ngaphakathi ifundwa ngesinengiso ngasinye kuwo wonke amasiphequluli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-Brave kanye nezinye izisiphequluli ze-Chromium ezithile zivala isikhethi sefolda. I-BimCraft-ke isebenzisa isikhethi sefolda sesistimu, futhi isiphequluli singabuza ukuthi &quot;Layisha amafayela \u003Cem\u003En\u003C/em\u003E kule sayithi?&quot;. Akukho okulayishwayo; amafayela aya kuphela ethebhini. Ukuhudula ifolda ngaphakathi kugwema lombuzo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mac-windows-nasekulinux\"\u003EMac, Windows nasekuLinux\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinqamuleli ezibhalwe \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kanye \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ziyi-Command ku-Mac futhi ziyi-Ctrl ku-Windows nasekuLinux.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (izindlela zesikrini) iyi-Control kuwo wonke amapulatifomu, kuhlanganise ne-Mac.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzingxoxo zamafayela kanye nefolda yokulanda zeqembu lesistimu yakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imouse-i-trackpad-nokuthinta\"\u003EImouse, i-trackpad nokuthinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkokufaka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkubuka kwe-3D\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUmdwebo we-2D\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMouse\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkudonsa kwesokunxele kuzungeza, ukudonsa kwesokudla kushelelisa, insimbi yevili isondeza, ukuchofoza kukhetha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENoma iyiphi indonga ishelelisa, insimbi yevili isondeza, ukuchofoza kabili kulinganisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETrackpad\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuchofoza-nokudonsa kuzungeza; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kanye nokudonsa kushelelisa; ukuskrola ngeminwe emibili noma ukucindezela kusondeza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuchofoza-nokudonsa kushelelisa; ukuskrola ngeminwe emibili noma ukucindezela kusondeza\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuthinta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmunwe owodwa uzungeza, iminwe emibili icindezela futhi ishelelise, ukuthinta kukhetha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmunwe owodwa ushelelisa; asikho ukucindezela kokusondeza okwamanje; thinta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELwanele\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-trackpad ye-Mac, ukuchofoza ngokwesokudla kuyinkinobho yeminwe emibili (noma ukuchofoza nge-Control). Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/keys\" data-topic=\"basics/keys\"\u003EIzinkinobho, ama-mouse nama-trackpad\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmathebhulethi namafoni angavula amafayela awodwa abuke kuwo, kodwa isikrini sincane, izisiphequluli eziningi zeselula azikwazi ukukhetha amafolda, futhi amamodeli amakhulu angangeneki enkumbulweni yawo. Ikhompyutha isebenza kangcono kakhulu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amafayela-amakhulu-nenkumbulo\"\u003EAmafayela amakhulu nenkumbulo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKonke i-BimCraft eyakufunda kuhlala enkumbulweni yethebhu yesiphequluli. Ithebhu ingasebenzisa kangakanani incike kakhulu esiphequluleni nasekhompyutheni yakho, kunokuba incike ku-BimCraft.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIfayela\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkufundwa kangakanani\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkulindeleke\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIFC\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfayela lonke, kanye ne-geometry ye-3D eyakhiwe kulo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUbukhulu bungancika ekhompyutheni nesiphequluli; imodeli enamamegabhithi ayamakhulu ingaba ngcono kakhulu kulaptop. Ngaphezu kwezigidi ezingu-1.5 zama-triangle, imiphetho iyacishwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmafayela ephrojekthi nomndeni\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECishe i-40 KB kuya ku-100 KB, noma ubukhulu bungaba yini\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENgisho namamodeli amakhulu amaphrojekthi avula ngokushesha, nasedrayivu yenethiwekhi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDWG kanye DXF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfayela lonke\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImidwebo emikhulu kakhulu ibonisa &quot;This drawing is very large; only part of it is shown.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmafolda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUhlu lwamafayela, kanye nama-kilobytes ambalwa ngemodeli ngayinye\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKufika kumafayela angu-20,000\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma ithebhu iphelelwa yinkumbulo, isiphequluli sibonisa ikhasi laso lephutha (&quot;Aw, Snap!&quot; ku-Chrome, njengesibonelo). Vala amanye amathebhu, layisha kabusha i-BimCraft bese uzama futhi, noma sebenzisa ikhompyutha enenkumbulo eningi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okuhlobene\"\u003EOkuhlobene\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/online-offline\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/online-offline\"\u003EKu-inthanethi nangaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/troubleshooting\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/troubleshooting\"\u003EUkuxazulula izinkinga\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"I-BimCraft isebenza kumaguqulo amanje e-Chrome, i-Edge, i-Firefox ne-Safari, ku-Mac, Windows nasekuLinux. Ukubuka kwe-3D kudinga i-WebGL, okuyinto esekelwa yisiphequluli ngasinye samanje. Bheka Izinsiphequluli nezikhompyutha ukuze uthole okudingwa yi-apps ngokuvamile. Ukuvula ifolda Isiphequluli Vula ifolda yenza lokhu Ukuhudula ifolda ngaphakathi Amafolda akamuva Chrome, Edge Isikhethi sefolda sesiphequluli, bese \"Vumela isayithi ukubona amafayela?\": chofoza View files Ivuleka ngaphandle kokubuza Yebo, kwamafolda akhethiwe noma adonselwe ngaphakathi Firefox Isikhethi sefolda sesistimu Ivuleka ngaphandle kokubuza Cha Safari Isikhethi sefolda sesistimu, nenkinobho Upload (akukho okulayishwayo) Ivuleka ngaphandle kokubuza Cha Ngemuva kwesigameko: i-Chrome ne-Edge zisebenzisa isikhethi se-File System Access futhi zingakhumbula ifolda. I-Firefox ne-Safari zisebenzisa isikhethi sefolda sakudala, esinikeza wonke amafayela efolda ngesikhathi esisodwa futhi asikwazi ukukhunjulwa. Ifolda edonselwe ngaphakathi ifundwa ngesinengiso ngasinye kuwo wonke amasiphequluli. I-Brave kanye nezinye izisiphequluli ze-Chromium ezithile zivala isikhethi sefolda. I-BimCraft-ke isebenzisa isikhethi sefolda sesistimu, futhi isiphequluli singabuza ukuthi \"Layisha amafayela n kule sayithi?\". Akukho okulayishwayo; amafayela aya kuphela ethebhini. Ukuhudula ifolda ngaphakathi kugwema lombuzo. Mac, Windows nasekuLinux Izinqamuleli ezibhalwe Ctrl+S kanye Ctrl+Z ziyi-Command ku-Mac futhi ziyi-Ctrl ku-Windows nasekuLinux. Ctrl+Shift+F (izindlela zesikrini) iyi-Control kuwo wonke amapulatifomu, kuhlanganise ne-Mac. Izingxoxo zamafayela kanye nefolda yokulanda zeqembu lesistimu yakho. Imouse, i-trackpad nokuthinta Okokufaka Ukubuka kwe-3D Umdwebo we-2D Mouse Ukudonsa kwesokunxele kuzungeza, ukudonsa kwesokudla kushelelisa, insimbi yevili isondeza, ukuchofoza kukhetha Noma iyiphi indonga ishelelisa, insimbi yevili isondeza, ukuchofoza kabili kulinganisa Trackpad Ukuchofoza-nokudonsa kuzungeza; Shift noma Ctrl kanye nokudonsa kushelelisa; ukuskrola ngeminwe emibili noma ukucindezela kusondeza Ukuchofoza-nokudonsa kushelelisa; ukuskrola ngeminwe emibili noma ukucindezela kusondeza Ukuthinta Umunwe owodwa uzungeza, iminwe emibili icindezela futhi ishelelise, ukuthinta kukhetha Umunwe owodwa ushelelisa; asikho ukucindezela kokusondeza okwamanje; thinta Lwanele Ku-trackpad ye-Mac, ukuchofoza ngokwesokudla kuyinkinobho yeminwe emibili (noma ukuchofoza nge-Control). Bheka Izinkinobho, ama-mouse nama-trackpad. Amathebhulethi namafoni angavula amafayela awodwa abuke kuwo, kodwa isikrini sincane, izisiphequluli eziningi zeselula azikwazi ukukhetha amafolda, futhi amamodeli amakhulu angangeneki enkumbulweni yawo. Ikhompyutha isebenza kangcono kakhulu. Amafayela amakhulu nenkumbulo Konke i-BimCraft eyakufunda kuhlala enkumbulweni yethebhu yesiphequluli. Ithebhu ingasebenzisa kangakanani incike kakhulu esiphequluleni nasekhompyutheni yakho, kunokuba incike ku-BimCraft. Ifayela Okufundwa kangakanani Okulindeleke IFC Ifayela lonke, kanye ne-geometry ye-3D eyakhiwe kulo Ubukhulu bungancika ekhompyutheni nesiphequluli; imodeli enamamegabhithi ayamakhulu ingaba ngcono kakhulu kulaptop. Ngaphezu kwezigidi ezingu-1.5 zama-triangle, imiphetho iyacishwa Amafayela ephrojekthi nomndeni Cishe i-40 KB kuya ku-100 KB, noma ubukhulu bungaba yini Ngisho namamodeli amakhulu amaphrojekthi avula ngokushesha, nasedrayivu yenethiwekhi DWG kanye DXF Ifayela lonke Imidwebo emikhulu kakhulu ibonisa \"This drawing is very large; only part of it is shown.\" Amafolda Uhlu lwamafayela, kanye nama-kilobytes ambalwa ngemodeli ngayinye Kufika kumafayela angu-20,000 Uma ithebhu iphelelwa yinkumbulo, isiphequluli sibonisa ikhasi laso lephutha (\"Aw, Snap!\" ku-Chrome, njengesibonelo). Vala amanye amathebhu, layisha kabusha i-BimCraft bese uzama futhi, noma sebenzisa ikhompyutha enenkumbulo eningi. Okuhlobene Ku-inthanethi nangaphandle kwe-inthanethi Ukuxazulula izinkinga","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"touch-screens","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Sebenzisa i-BimCraft kusikrini sokuthinta noma ku-ithebhulethi","summary":"Zungeza, sondeza nokhethe emodelini ka-3D, shelelisa nehlanganise idwebo ngeminwe, khetha izinto eziningana, hamba, nobeke izinto ngeminwe yakho.","section":"reference","order":52,"keywords":["ukuthinta","ithebhulethi","ipad","android","umunwe","ukuhlanganisa","ukucindezela isikhathi eside","ukuthinta kancane","zungeza","hamba","izenzo zomzwelo","isitayilasi","ipeni"],"headings":[{"id":"imodeli-ye-3d","text":"Imodeli ye-3D","level":2},{"id":"amadwebo-dwg-ne-dxf","text":"Amadwebo (DWG ne-DXF)","level":2},{"id":"hamba","text":"Hamba","level":2},{"id":"ukubeka-izinto-zomtapo","text":"Ukubeka izinto zomtapo","level":2},{"id":"linganisa","text":"Linganisa","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EI-BimCraft isebenza ngeminwe njengakho ngemouse. Ukuthinta kokuqala kwesikrini, izinkinobho, amathebhu nemigqa yohlu kukhula kube ngosayizi womunwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imodeli-ye-3d\"\u003EImodeli ye-3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkwenza\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYenza lokhu\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZungeza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHudula umunwe owodwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESondeza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHlanganisa iminwe emibili noma uyihlukanise\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShelelisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHudula iminwe emibili ndawonye\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhetha into\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThinta kuyo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEngeza into ekukhetheni, noma uyisuse\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECindezela uphinde ubambe kuyo isigamu sesekhondi (njengo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+click)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhetha lutho\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThinta isikhala esingenalutho\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuhlanganisa noma ukudonsa ngeminwe emibili akukaze kukhethe lutho, nanoma umunwe uphakama phezu kwento.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amadwebo-dwg-ne-dxf\"\u003EAmadwebo (DWG ne-DXF)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkwenza\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYenza lokhu\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShelelisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHudula umunwe owodwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESondeza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHlanganisa; indawo phakathi kweminwe yakho ihlala ivele\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBonisa ishidi lonke\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThinta kabili, noma uthinte \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELwanele\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E view yedwebo, izenzo zemodeli ziyasebenza: umunwe owodwa uzungeza, iminwe emibili ihlanganise futhi ishelelise, ukuthinta kukhetha, ukucindezela isikhathi eside kungeza ekukhetheni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hamba\"\u003EHamba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThinta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHamba\u003C/span\u003E, bese uthinta iflowa lapho ufuna ukuma khona. Umugqa wamanikinobho womcibisholo uvela embarini yokuhamba:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBamba umcibisholo ukuhamba phambili, emuva, noma uye ohlangothini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkudonsela phansi\u003C/span\u003E evaliwe, imicibisholo emibili iyaphakama iphinde yehle.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHudula umunwe owodwa emodelini ukuze ubheke ngakho konke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThinta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKuqediwe\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uyeke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukubeka-izinto-zomtapo\"\u003EUkubeka izinto zomtapo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThinta lapho into ibekwa khona. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhendula 90°\u003C/span\u003E embarini yokubeka iyayiphendula (ukhiye \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ekhibhodini), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubopha kodonga\u003C/span\u003E iyayibopha ngemuva kodonga oluseduze, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYeka ukubeka\u003C/span\u003E iyaphela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"linganisa\"\u003ELinganisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThinta iphoyinti lokuqala, bese iphoyinti lesibili. Amaphoyinti abopha emakhoneni nasemiphethweni eseduze nokuthinta kwakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma ikhibhodi ixhunywe ku-ithebhulethi, zonke izinqamuleli zisebenza njengakukhompyutha. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/keyboard\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/keyboard\"\u003EIzinqamuleli zekhibhodi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"I-BimCraft isebenza ngeminwe njengakho ngemouse. Ukuthinta kokuqala kwesikrini, izinkinobho, amathebhu nemigqa yohlu kukhula kube ngosayizi womunwe. Imodeli ye-3D Ukwenza Yenza lokhu Zungeza Hudula umunwe owodwa Sondeza Hlanganisa iminwe emibili noma uyihlukanise Shelelisa Hudula iminwe emibili ndawonye Khetha into Thinta kuyo Engeza into ekukhetheni, noma uyisuse Cindezela uphinde ubambe kuyo isigamu sesekhondi (njengo Ctrl+click) Khetha lutho Thinta isikhala esingenalutho Ukuhlanganisa noma ukudonsa ngeminwe emibili akukaze kukhethe lutho, nanoma umunwe uphakama phezu kwento. Amadwebo (DWG ne-DXF) Ukwenza Yenza lokhu Shelelisa Hudula umunwe owodwa Sondeza Hlanganisa; indawo phakathi kweminwe yakho ihlala ivele Bonisa ishidi lonke Thinta kabili, noma uthinte Lwanele Ku-3D view yedwebo, izenzo zemodeli ziyasebenza: umunwe owodwa uzungeza, iminwe emibili ihlanganise futhi ishelelise, ukuthinta kukhetha, ukucindezela isikhathi eside kungeza ekukhetheni. Hamba Thinta Hamba, bese uthinta iflowa lapho ufuna ukuma khona. Umugqa wamanikinobho womcibisholo uvela embarini yokuhamba: Bamba umcibisholo ukuhamba phambili, emuva, noma uye ohlangothini. Uma Ukudonsela phansi evaliwe, imicibisholo emibili iyaphakama iphinde yehle. Hudula umunwe owodwa emodelini ukuze ubheke ngakho konke. Thinta Kuqediwe ukuze uyeke. Ukubeka izinto zomtapo Thinta lapho into ibekwa khona. Phendula 90° embarini yokubeka iyayiphendula (ukhiye R ekhibhodini), Ukubopha kodonga iyayibopha ngemuva kodonga oluseduze, bese Yeka ukubeka iyaphela. Linganisa Thinta iphoyinti lokuqala, bese iphoyinti lesibili. Amaphoyinti abopha emakhoneni nasemiphethweni eseduze nokuthinta kwakho. Uma ikhibhodi ixhunywe ku-ithebhulethi, zonke izinqamuleli zisebenza njengakukhompyutha. Bona Izinqamuleli zekhibhodi.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"online-offline","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Ku-inthanethi nangaphandle kwe-inthanethi","summary":"Okulayishwa yi-BimCraft esiza kuyo, indlela i-Londoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi eyenza ngayo amamodeli e-IFC namadrowings e-DWG avulwe ngaphandle koxhumo, nokuthi kungani okuvulwayo akukaze kulayishwe.","section":"reference","order":60,"keywords":["ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi","ku-inthanethi","i-inthanethi","uxhumo","akukho inethiwekhi","indiza","ukuvakashela isayithi","londoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi","ilungele ngaphandle","ukulayisha","ubumfihlo","wasm","webassembly","injini ye-IFC","dwg","ifu"],"headings":[{"id":"okulayishwa-yi-bimcraft-esiza-kuyo","text":"Okulayishwa yi-BimCraft esiza kuyo","level":2},{"id":"gcina-i-bimcraft-ukuze-isetshenziswe-ngaphandle-kwe-inthanethi","text":"Gcina i-BimCraft ukuze isetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi","level":2},{"id":"okutsho-inkinobho","text":"Okutsho inkinobho","level":2},{"id":"okungadingi-xhumo","text":"Okungadingi xhumo","level":2},{"id":"okungakatholakali-okwamanje","text":"Okungakatholakali okwamanje","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EBimCraft ifunda amafayela akho ngaphakathi kwethebhu yesiphequluli. Ukuvula, ukuhlola, ukuhlela nokugcina akukaze kuthumele amafayela akho noma kuphi, ku-inthanethi noma ngaphandle kwayo. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EUkusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/a\u003E kuchaza indlela amakhophi angaphandle asebenza ngayo kuzo zonke izinhlelo; leli khasi limayelana nalokho okukhethekile ku-BimCraft.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okulayishwa-yi-bimcraft-esiza-kuyo\"\u003EOkulayishwa yi-BimCraft esiza kuyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIngxenye\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ELapho ilayisha ngaphandle kwekhophi yangaphandle\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUsayizi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUhlelo ngokwalo, nomlaleli wakho we-3D nekhodi yenjini ye-IFC\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELapho uvula i-BimCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENgemegabhayithi ezimbalwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIngxenye ye-WebAssembly yenjini ye-IFC\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfayela le-IFC lokuqala elivulwa kuthebhu: &quot;Iqalisa injini ye-IFC…&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECishe i-1.6 MB\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EImidwebo ye-DWG ne-DXF, amafayela wephrojekthi nemindeni namafolda akudingi okwengeziwe: abafundi bawo bengxenye yohlelo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gcina-i-bimcraft-ukuze-isetshenziswe-ngaphandle-kwe-inthanethi\"\u003EGcina i-BimCraft ukuze isetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula i-BimCraft ngesikhathi uxhumekile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E kwibha yohlelo phezulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBheka inkinobho ikhuphuka ibale: &quot;Ilondoloza 40 kwezingu-212&quot;, njengesibonelo. Ikhophi ye-BimCraft cishe ingu-11 MB, ngoba ibandakanya injini ye-IFC.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELinda ukuthi kuvele \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIlungele ukusetshenziswa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELapho sekuthi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIlungele ukusetshenziswa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E, amamodeli e-IFC, imidwebo ye-DWG ne-DXF, amafayela wephrojekthi, amafolda nalo lusizo konke kuvuleka ngaphandle koxhumo. Akudingeki uvule i-IFC noma i-DWG kuqala ukuze &quot;ufudumeze&quot; abafundi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze uvuselele noma ususe ikhophi, chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIlungele ukusetshenziswa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza futhi (thola inguqulo entsha kakhulu)\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa ikopi engaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okutsho-inkinobho\"\u003EOkutsho inkinobho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInkinobho\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsho\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAlikho ikhophi yangaphandle kulesi siphequluli okwamanje. Chofoza ukuze ulonge eyodwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Ilondoloza \u003Cem\u003En\u003C/em\u003E kwezi-\u003Cem\u003Em\u003C/em\u003E&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIyalondoloza; gcina ithebhu ivulekile kuze kuphele\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIlungele ukusetshenziswa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIgciniwe. Hambisa ngaphezulu ukuze ubone nini; chofoza ukuze uthole imenyu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAkukwazanga ukulondoloza\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmanye amafayela awazange alandwe. Hlola uxhumo bese uchofoza ukuzama futhi. Ikhophi yokugcina esilungile, uma ikhona, iyagcinwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAyikho ingaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELesi windi asikwazi ukugcina ikhophi yangaphandle (iwindi elizimele nomaikhompyutha elilawulwayo). Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EUkusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"net:offline\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EOffline\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAwuxhunyiwe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma inkinobho ithi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIlungele ukusetshenziswa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E, zonke izinhlobo zamafayela ziyavuleka njengokujwayelekile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma kungatsho lokho, kuphela okuke kwalayishwa yithebhu yamanje kuyasebenza: umfundi ongakaze alayishwe kuleyo thebhu akakwazi ukuqala, futhi ukuvula uhlobo lwefayela olunjalo kuboniswa iphutha lesiphequluli emugqeni wesimo. Ungabuyekezi ithebhu uze uxhumeke futhi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okungadingi-xhumo\"\u003EOkungadingi xhumo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgemva kokuvula i-BimCraft ethebhini, lezi zisebenza ngaphandle koxhumo ngisho nangaphandle kwekhophi egciniwe:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkufunda amafayela ephrojekthi nemindeni nokuhlola amafolda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkukhetha izinto, ukufunda izici nokuhlela amanani e-IFC emodelini esevulwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGcina njenge-IFC\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELanda i-CSV\u003C/span\u003E: zombili ziyokulanda okwenziwa ethebhini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okungakatholakali-okwamanje\"\u003EOkungakatholakali okwamanje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkugcinwa efwini.\u003C/strong\u003E Amafayela agcinwa kukhompyutha yakho kuphela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/your-files\" data-topic=\"basics/your-files\"\u003ELapho amafayela akho ayakhona\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"BimCraft ifunda amafayela akho ngaphakathi kwethebhu yesiphequluli. Ukuvula, ukuhlola, ukuhlela nokugcina akukaze kuthumele amafayela akho noma kuphi, ku-inthanethi noma ngaphandle kwayo. Ukusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi kuchaza indlela amakhophi angaphandle asebenza ngayo kuzo zonke izinhlelo; leli khasi limayelana nalokho okukhethekile ku-BimCraft. Okulayishwa yi-BimCraft esiza kuyo Ingxenye Lapho ilayisha ngaphandle kwekhophi yangaphandle Usayizi Uhlelo ngokwalo, nomlaleli wakho we-3D nekhodi yenjini ye-IFC Lapho uvula i-BimCraft Ngemegabhayithi ezimbalwa Ingxenye ye-WebAssembly yenjini ye-IFC Ifayela le-IFC lokuqala elivulwa kuthebhu: \"Iqalisa injini ye-IFC…\" Cishe i-1.6 MB Imidwebo ye-DWG ne-DXF, amafayela wephrojekthi nemindeni namafolda akudingi okwengeziwe: abafundi bawo bengxenye yohlelo. Gcina i-BimCraft ukuze isetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi Vula i-BimCraft ngesikhathi uxhumekile. Chofoza Londoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi kwibha yohlelo phezulu. Bheka inkinobho ikhuphuka ibale: \"Ilondoloza 40 kwezingu-212\", njengesibonelo. Ikhophi ye-BimCraft cishe ingu-11 MB, ngoba ibandakanya injini ye-IFC. Linda ukuthi kuvele Ilungele ukusetshenziswa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi. Lapho sekuthi Ilungele ukusetshenziswa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi, amamodeli e-IFC, imidwebo ye-DWG ne-DXF, amafayela wephrojekthi, amafolda nalo lusizo konke kuvuleka ngaphandle koxhumo. Akudingeki uvule i-IFC noma i-DWG kuqala ukuze \"ufudumeze\" abafundi. Ukuze uvuselele noma ususe ikhophi, chofoza Ilungele ukusetshenziswa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi bese ukhetha Londoloza futhi (thola inguqulo entsha kakhulu) noma Susa ikopi engaphandle kwe-inthanethi. Okutsho inkinobho Inkinobho Isho Londoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi Alikho ikhophi yangaphandle kulesi siphequluli okwamanje. Chofoza ukuze ulonge eyodwa \"Ilondoloza n kwezi-m\" Iyalondoloza; gcina ithebhu ivulekile kuze kuphele Ilungele ukusetshenziswa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi Igciniwe. Hambisa ngaphezulu ukuze ubone nini; chofoza ukuze uthole imenyu Akukwazanga ukulondoloza Amanye amafayela awazange alandwe. Hlola uxhumo bese uchofoza ukuzama futhi. Ikhophi yokugcina esilungile, uma ikhona, iyagcinwa Ayikho ingaphandle kwe-inthanethi Lesi windi asikwazi ukugcina ikhophi yangaphandle (iwindi elizimele nomaikhompyutha elilawulwayo). Bheka Ukusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi Awuxhunyiwe. Uma inkinobho ithi Ilungele ukusetshenziswa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi, zonke izinhlobo zamafayela ziyavuleka njengokujwayelekile. Uma kungatsho lokho, kuphela okuke kwalayishwa yithebhu yamanje kuyasebenza: umfundi ongakaze alayishwe kuleyo thebhu akakwazi ukuqala, futhi ukuvula uhlobo lwefayela olunjalo kuboniswa iphutha lesiphequluli emugqeni wesimo. Ungabuyekezi ithebhu uze uxhumeke futhi. Okungadingi xhumo Ngemva kokuvula i-BimCraft ethebhini, lezi zisebenza ngaphandle koxhumo ngisho nangaphandle kwekhophi egciniwe: Ukufunda amafayela ephrojekthi nemindeni nokuhlola amafolda. Ukukhetha izinto, ukufunda izici nokuhlela amanani e-IFC emodelini esevulwe. Gcina njenge-IFC no-Landa i-CSV: zombili ziyokulanda okwenziwa ethebhini. Okungakatholakali okwamanje Ukugcinwa efwini. Amafayela agcinwa kukhompyutha yakho kuphela. Bheka Lapho amafayela akho ayakhona.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"your-machine","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Umshini wakho urenda ngani","summary":"Izilungiselelo › Ukurenda ibonisa izithombe, amakhore eprosesa nenkumbulo isiphequluli esivumela i-app ukuthi isebenzise, nezinga elisetha lapho ukurenda kuqala khona.","section":"reference","order":60,"keywords":["umshini wakho","ikhadi lezithombe","gpu","webgpu","webgl","iprosesa","cpu","amakhore","imicu","inkumbulo","ram","inkumbulo yokwabelana","ukuhlukaniswa","izinga","izinga lokurenda","isivinini","kancane","ilaptophu"],"headings":[{"id":"izinga","text":"Izinga","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), uhlale ethebhini le-app yalo bese uskrolela ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkurenda\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmshini wakho\u003C/span\u003E ulanda lokho isiphequluli esivumela i-app ukuthi isisebenzise ekurendeni. Akukho okuphuma kulokhu kukhompyutha yakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUmugqa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOkusho\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImifanekiso\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkhadi lezithombe isiphequluli esilibika. &quot;WebGPU&quot; kusho ukuthi lingakwenza umsebenzi wokurenda; &quot;WebGL 2 only&quot; kusho ukuthi akukho WebGPU: ukubuka okuphilayo nezithombe ezinekhwalithi ephezulu zisebenzisa ikhadi lezithombe nge-WebGL 2 (izithombe nomsebenzi wakudala we-WebGL path tracer, ngaphandle kwezengeziwe ezidinga i-WebGPU); isiboneli sesofthiwe kusho ukuthi konke kusebenza ngeprosesa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIprosesa\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmakhore eprosesa esiphequluli esiwabika\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInkumbulo\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECishe inkumbulo ikhompyutha enayo, uma isiphequluli sikutshela. Ezinye iziphequluli azikutshelii\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInkumbulo yokwabelana\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuthi ikhasi lingabelana yini ngenkumbulo phakathi kwabasebenzi balo. Uma kuvuliwe, wonke amakhore angasebenza ekhophini eyodwa yesimo; uma kuvaliwe, ngayinye idinga ikhophi yayo, ngakho isimo esikhulu singalingana namakhore amancane ngesikhathi esisodwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIkhodi yeprosesa esheshayo\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuthi isiphequluli sisebenzisa yini ikhodi ye-WebAssembly esheshayo. Ngaphandle kwayo kusetshenziswa okuhlehlayo okungasheshi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinga\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIkhadi lezithombe, eliphezulu\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIkhadi lezithombe, elisisekelo\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIprosesa kuphela\u003C/span\u003E, nesizathu esingaphansi kwalo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinga\"\u003EIzinga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinga yilapho ukurenda kuqala khona, ukuze ilaptophu enetshipisi yezithombe eyakhelwe ngaphakathi noma engenayo ikhadi lezithombe iqhubeke isabela. Itshipisi yezithombe eyakhelwe ngaphakathi noma eyesifoni, noma inkumbulo engu-4 GB noma ngaphansi, akusoze ithole \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIkhadi lezithombe, eliphezulu\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzisiphequluli ziyehluka. Ikhompyutha efanayo ingakhombisa i-WebGPU kwesinye isiphequluli kanti ikhombise &quot;WebGL 2 only&quot; kwesinye. Ku-Linux iningi lezisiphequluli alinayo i-WebGPU okwamanje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Vula Izilungiselelo (Ctrl+,), uhlale ethebhini le-app yalo bese uskrolela ku-Ukurenda. Umshini wakho ulanda lokho isiphequluli esivumela i-app ukuthi isisebenzise ekurendeni. Akukho okuphuma kulokhu kukhompyutha yakho. Umugqa Okusho Imifanekiso Ikhadi lezithombe isiphequluli esilibika. \"WebGPU\" kusho ukuthi lingakwenza umsebenzi wokurenda; \"WebGL 2 only\" kusho ukuthi akukho WebGPU: ukubuka okuphilayo nezithombe ezinekhwalithi ephezulu zisebenzisa ikhadi lezithombe nge-WebGL 2 (izithombe nomsebenzi wakudala we-WebGL path tracer, ngaphandle kwezengeziwe ezidinga i-WebGPU); isiboneli sesofthiwe kusho ukuthi konke kusebenza ngeprosesa Iprosesa Amakhore eprosesa esiphequluli esiwabika Inkumbulo Cishe inkumbulo ikhompyutha enayo, uma isiphequluli sikutshela. Ezinye iziphequluli azikutshelii Inkumbulo yokwabelana Ukuthi ikhasi lingabelana yini ngenkumbulo phakathi kwabasebenzi balo. Uma kuvuliwe, wonke amakhore angasebenza ekhophini eyodwa yesimo; uma kuvaliwe, ngayinye idinga ikhophi yayo, ngakho isimo esikhulu singalingana namakhore amancane ngesikhathi esisodwa Ikhodi yeprosesa esheshayo Ukuthi isiphequluli sisebenzisa yini ikhodi ye-WebAssembly esheshayo. Ngaphandle kwayo kusetshenziswa okuhlehlayo okungasheshi Izinga Ikhadi lezithombe, eliphezulu, Ikhadi lezithombe, elisisekelo noma Iprosesa kuphela, nesizathu esingaphansi kwalo Izinga Izinga yilapho ukurenda kuqala khona, ukuze ilaptophu enetshipisi yezithombe eyakhelwe ngaphakathi noma engenayo ikhadi lezithombe iqhubeke isabela. Itshipisi yezithombe eyakhelwe ngaphakathi noma eyesifoni, noma inkumbulo engu-4 GB noma ngaphansi, akusoze ithole Ikhadi lezithombe, eliphezulu. Izisiphequluli ziyehluka. Ikhompyutha efanayo ingakhombisa i-WebGPU kwesinye isiphequluli kanti ikhombise \"WebGL 2 only\" kwesinye. Ku-Linux iningi lezisiphequluli alinayo i-WebGPU okwamanje.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"troubleshooting","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Ukuxazulula izinkinga","summary":"Imilayezo i-BimCraft eyibonisayo, okubangela kuwo, nokufanele wenze, ngokuvula amafayela, amafolda, amamodeli e-3D, imidwebo nokuhlelwa.","section":"trouble","order":10,"keywords":["inkinga","iphutha","akusebenzi","akukwazi ukuvula","yehlulekile","ayiphelele","yonakele","ihamba kancane","ukuwa","ingasebenzi","ayikho","umlayezo","usizo"],"headings":[{"id":"ukuvula-amafayela","text":"Ukuvula amafayela","level":2},{"id":"ukuvula-amafolda","text":"Ukuvula amafolda","level":2},{"id":"ingxenye-yokuqala-yenjini-ye-ifc","text":"Ingxenye yokuqala yenjini ye-IFC","level":2},{"id":"ukulondoloza-ukusetshenziswa-ngaphandle-kwe-inthanethi","text":"Ukulondoloza ukusetshenziswa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi","level":2},{"id":"ukubuka-kwe-3d","text":"Ukubuka kwe-3D","level":2},{"id":"ukuhlela-i-ifc","text":"Ukuhlela i-IFC","level":2},{"id":"amadwebo","text":"Amadwebo","level":2},{"id":"sekusakhathaza","text":"Sekusakhathaza","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EImilayezo ivela emugqeni wesimo ongaphansi kwesiteji, ibe mibomvu lapho okuthile kuhlulekile. Thola umlayezo ongezansi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuvula-amafayela\"\u003EUkuvula amafayela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;\u003Cem\u003Ename\u003C/em\u003E akuyona ifayela le-IFC, RVT, RFA, DWG noma DXF.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E I-BimCraft ayilibonanga ifayela. Hlola isandiso nokuthi ifayela alilingene. Ama-PDF, izithombe namafayela ehhovisi awavuleki.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;.ifczip ayisasekeli okwamanje. Gcina noma ukhiphe imodeli njenge-.ifc elula.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E (futhi ku-\u003Ccode\u003E.ifcxml\u003C/code\u003E) Khipha i-\u003Ccode\u003E.ifczip\u003C/code\u003E (ingumzipho ojwayelekile oqukethe i-\u003Ccode\u003E.ifc\u003C/code\u003E) noma khipha i-IFC elula.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;… yifayela lephrojekthi i-BimCraft engakafundi.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Ifayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.pln\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.pla\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.tpl\u003C/code\u003E noma \u003Ccode\u003E.bpn\u003C/code\u003E. Khipha i-IFC noma i-DWG kuwo bese uvula lokho: bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/pln-project-files\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/pln-project-files\"\u003EVula amafayela ephrojekthi .pln nama-.pla\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Le fayela le-IFC alikwazanga ukufundwa.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Ifayela le-IFC lonakele noma akuyona i-IFC eqinile. Liyivule kuhleli wombhalo: ifayela le-IFC langempela liqala nge-\u003Ccode\u003EISO-10303-21;\u003C/code\u003E. Liphinde likhiphe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Leli fayela alipheli: liyi… MB, kodwa uhlu lwalo lwalo lukhomba idatha okungenani… MB ngaphakathi. …&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Iphrojekthi noma ifayela lomndeni lusikiwe lapho lukopishwa, lulayishwa noma lusatshalaliswa. Ifayela le-cloud-drive elithi &quot;ku-inthanethi kuphela&quot; libukeka kanjalo. Ifayela elivulwa lodwa liyavuleka, lingaphezulu kwalo lo mlayezo ngaphezulu kwekhadi nokuthi &quot;Ikhombisa okutholakele; kopisha okuyisisekelo futhi ukuze uthole imodeli egcwele&quot;: ikhadi likhombisa kuphela izingxenye ezinayo zonke izinhlamvu zazo kuleli fayela futhi zidwebe ezisele ngaphansi kwethi \u003Cstrong\u003EAkusekho kwifayela\u003C/strong\u003E. Yenza ifayela litholakale ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi kwidrayivu yakho yefu, noma kopisha okuyisisekelo futhi, bese uyavula kabusha. Efolda, i-BimCraft ikhombisa isipele esisha esiphelele.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;… Nohlu lwezinto zefayela nalo lusemgodini ongekho, ngakho akukho okungavulwa kuwo.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Ifayela lasikwa ngakusenesikhathi kangangokuthi nohlu lwalo lwezinto alukho, ngakho akukho okungabuyiselwa kule kopi. Kopisha okuyisisekelo futhi uyivule kabusha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Lo fayela le-compound alinayo i-BasicFileInfo stream, ngakho alisiyo ifayela le-Revit.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Ifayela liwuhlobo lwe-compound lolunye uhlobo (amadokhumenti amadala ehhovisi asebenzisa isitsha esifanayo). Hlola ukuthi ukhethe ifayela elifanele.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Sisasebenza kowedlule…&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E I-BimCraft isasebenza ngefayela noma ngefolda yangaphambilini. Linda umugqa wesimo uqede, bese uzama futhi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsikhethi sefayela sifiphaza ifayela lami.\u003C/strong\u003E Isikhethi sinikeza kuphela \u003Ccode\u003E.ifc\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.rvt\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.rfa\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.rte\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.rft\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.dwg\u003C/code\u003E nama-\u003Ccode\u003E.dxf\u003C/code\u003E. Hudula amanye amafayela ekhasini, bese i-BimCraft iyakutshela ukuthi ingawafunda yini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuvula-amafolda\"\u003EUkuvula amafolda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Lo folda unamafayela angaphezu kuka-20,000. Khetha ifolda encane, njengephrojekthi eyodwa.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Ukhethe ifolda ephezulu kakhulu, njengedrayivu yonke. Khetha ifolda yephrojekthi eyodwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Isiphequluli asinikezanga \u003Cem\u003Ename\u003C/em\u003E ukufinyelela. Yikhethe futhi ngothi Vula ifolda.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Uchofoze \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula futhi\u003C/span\u003E kwifolda yakamuva futhi imvume yesiphequluli yenqatshwe noma iphelelwe yisikhathi. Khetha ifolda futhi, noma hudula uyingenise.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsiphequluli sithi izo &quot;upload&quot; amafayela.\u003C/strong\u003E Lokho yisichazo sesiphequluli sokudlulisela amafayela ekhasini. I-BimCraft ayiwathumeli noma kuphi. Hudula ifolda uyingenise ukuze uphephe lombuzo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkukho okwenzekayo kwifoni noma ku-ithebhulethi.\u003C/strong\u003E Izinsiphequluli eziningi zeselula azikwazi ukukhetha amafolda. Vula amafayela ngamanye, noma sebenzisa ikhompyutha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ingxenye-yokuqala-yenjini-ye-ifc\"\u003EIngxenye yokuqala yenjini ye-IFC\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmugqa wesimo uhlala ku-&quot;Kuqalisa injini ye-IFC…&quot;, noma ukhombisa iphutha elifana no-&quot;Failed to fetch&quot;.\u003C/strong\u003E Injini ye-IFC ayikwazanga ukulandwa. Ungase ungabi ku-inthanethi, noma i-firewall noma isivimbi somkhiqizo siyivimbela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"net:offline\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EOffline\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAwuku-inthanethi. Uma inkinobho yebha yohlelo ingathi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIlungele ukusetshenziswa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E, injini ye-IFC ayikaze igcinwe kulesi siphequluli. Xhuma futhi, vule ifayela kabusha, bese uchofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E ukuze isebenze ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi ngesikhathi esilandelayo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/online-offline\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/online-offline\"\u003EKu-inthanethi nangaphandle\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"net:online\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EOnline\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELayisha kabusha ikhasi bese uzama futhi. Kunethiwekhi yomsebenzi, cela ithimba lakho le-IT ukuthi livume amafayela \u003Ccode\u003E.wasm\u003C/code\u003E wesayithi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukulondoloza-ukusetshenziswa-ngaphandle-kwe-inthanethi\"\u003EUkulondoloza ukusetshenziswa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInkinobho ithi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAkukwazanga ukulondoloza\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/strong\u003E Amanye amafayela awazange alandwe, ngokuvamile ngoba ukuxhumana kuphuke. Hlola ukuxhumana bese uchofoza inkinobho futhi. Ikhophi yangaphambilini engaphandle kwe-inthanethi iyagcinwa kuze kube yikhophi entsha iphelele.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInkinobho ithi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAyikho ingaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/strong\u003E Leli windi alikwazi ukugcina ikhophi engaphandle kwe-inthanethi, isibonelo iwindi lokuzimela noma ikhompyutha yomsebenzi elawulwayo. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EUkusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInkinobho ihlala ku-&quot;Ilondoloza \u003Cem\u003En\u003C/em\u003E kwe-\u003Cem\u003Em\u003C/em\u003E&quot; isikhathi eside.\u003C/strong\u003E Ikhophi ye-BimCraft icishe ibe ngu-11 MB, ingxenye enkulu iyinjini ye-IFC. Gcina ithebhu livulekile kuze kuthi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIlungele ukusetshenziswa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EI-BimCraft ivulwe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi kodwa ibukeka idlule isikhathi.\u003C/strong\u003E Ikhophi yakho elondoloziwe ivela kuvakashelo lwangaphambilini. Uma uku-inthanethi, chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIlungele ukusetshenziswa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza futhi (thola inguqulo entsha kakhulu)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukubuka-kwe-3d\"\u003EUkubuka kwe-3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImodeli ayisendaweni engilindele, noma imincane kakhulu.\u003C/strong\u003E Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELwanele\u003C/span\u003E. Lwanele ihlala ifaka konke okusemodelini, okuhlanganisa nezitezi ongazisusanga nezinto ezizulazulayo ezikude nesakhiwo, ngakho isakhiwo singabonakala sincane. Sondeza kusuka lapho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuchofoza akukhethi lutho.\u003C/strong\u003E Bamba imbewu inganyakazi lapho uchofoza: ukuhudula okuncane kuzungeza. Izinto ezitezini ezingasasiwe azikwazi ukukhethwa. Uma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzindawo\u003C/span\u003E zivuliwe, izindawo ezibonakalayo zikhethwa ngaphambi kwalokho okungaphakathi kwazo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInkinobho \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImiphetho\u003C/span\u003E ibonakala imnyama: &quot;Imiphetho ivaliwe kumamodeli amakhulu kakhulu&quot;.\u003C/strong\u003E Imodeli inezinxantathu ezingaphezu kwezigidi ezingu-1.5. Imiphetho ishiyelwe ukuze kulondolozwe inkumbulo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIthebhu liba lihamba kancane, lishone, noma likhombise ikhasi lokuwa lesiphequluli.\u003C/strong\u003E Imodeli inkulu kakhulu enkumbulweni esiphequluli sinikeza ithebhu. Vala amanye amathebhu bese ulayisha kabusha. Khipha i-IFC encane: isakhiwo esisodwa, umkhakha owodwa noma izitezi ezimbalwa. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/platforms\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/platforms\"\u003EIzinsiphequluli, amadivayisi nenkumbulo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkubuka kwe-3D kuhlala kungenalutho.\u003C/strong\u003E I-WebGL ingase ivalwe noma ivinjelwe. Ezilungiselelweni zesiphequluli, vula ukusheshisa kwe-hardware (noma ukusheshisa kwegrafikhi) bese uqala kabusha isiphequluli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukuhlela-i-ifc\"\u003EUkuhlela i-IFC\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Sebenzisa inombolo.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Inani linani elilula. Thayipha inombolo elula ngaphandle kwamayunithi, njengo \u003Ccode\u003E2.4\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Sebenzisa inombolo ephelele.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Inani liyisibalo noma inombolo ephelele. Susa izinhlamvu zedesimali.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Izici zenani elilodwa kuphela ezingahlelwa.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Uhlu, izinhlobo nezilinganiso ziyafundeka kuphela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ivula iwindi &quot;Londoloza ikhasi&quot; lesiphequluli.\u003C/strong\u003E Akukho okungagcinwanga, ngakho i-BimCraft ishiye ukhiye kwisiphequluli. Vala leli windi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E akwenzi lutho.\u003C/strong\u003E Lisebenza kuphela uma unezinguquko ezingagcinwanga futhi awubhali ensimini. Ngemva kokulondoloza, akukho okusalwe okungahlehliswa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUhlu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinguquko\u003C/span\u003E lusabonisa ukuhlelwa okulahliwe lapho uvula idwebo noma ifolda.\u003C/strong\u003E Uma uphendula umbuzo othi &quot;Ubalahle?&quot; nge-OK bese uvula okungewona imodeli ye-IFC, ukuhlelwa okudala kugcinwa enkumbulweni futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza njenge-IFC\u003C/span\u003E ingazigcina. Ukuqala kabusha ngempela, vula i-IFC yokuqala futhi, noma layisha ikhasi kabusha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuhlela kwami kushintshe izinto eziningi kunalezo engizikhethile.\u003C/strong\u003E Ushintshe isici esethini emaka &quot;(uhlobo)&quot;. Izici zohlobo zisebenza kuzo zonke izinto zalolo hlobo. Chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlehlisa\u003C/span\u003E. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/type-vs-instance\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/type-vs-instance\"\u003EShintsha isici sohlobo kuzo zonke izinto zohlobo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amadwebo\"\u003EAmadwebo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;\u003Cem\u003Ename\u003C/em\u003E akukwazanga ukufundwa. Mhlawumbe yonakele, noma igcinwe ngefomethi umfundi angakayisekeli (…).&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Gcina idwebo kusuka kuhlelo olwenza ngalo njenge-DWG endala (2018 noma ngaphambili) noma njenge-DXF, bese uzama futhi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Leli dwebo alinalutho olubonisayo.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E noma \u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;\u003Cem\u003Ename\u003C/em\u003E ngudwebo olungenalutho: alinayo imigqa, umbhalo noma amabhulokhi.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Idwebo lingenalutho, noma linalokho i-BimCraft engakadwebi (bona \u003Cstrong\u003EAkusadwetshwa\u003C/strong\u003E ngakwesokudla).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Leli dwebo likhulu kakhulu; kubonakala ingxenye yalo kuphela.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E I-BimCraft iyeka ukudweba ukuze isasabeleke. Vala izingqimba ongazidingi, noma vula amashidi odingayo kusuka kwidwebo elincane.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzingxenye zeshidi zingasekho.\u003C/strong\u003E Imidwebo exhunyiwe ingase ingasekho: bheka ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EImidwebo exhunyiwe\u003C/strong\u003E ngakwesokudla. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/dwg-linked-files\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/dwg-linked-files\"\u003EThola imidwebo nezithombe exhunyiwe\u003C/a\u003E. Izingqimba nazo zingase zivalwe: chofoza \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKonke kuvuliwe\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsithombe sibonakala njengohlaka olungenalutho.\u003C/strong\u003E Ifayela lakhe alitholakalanga, noma kuyi-TIFF (&quot;TIFF ayikwazi ukuboniswa kusiphequluli&quot;). Engeza ikhophi ye-PNG noma ye-JPEG ngo-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza izithombe…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuskrola kwe-trackpad yami kusondeza kunokunyakazisa idwebo.\u003C/strong\u003E Yindlela imidwebo esebenza ngayo ku-BimCraft. Chofoza udonse ukuze ushelelise.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sekusakhathaza\"\u003ESekusakhathaza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFunda \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EOkungakakwakhiwa\u003C/a\u003E: into oyifunayo ingase ingabi khona kulesi sakhiwo.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Imilayezo ivela emugqeni wesimo ongaphansi kwesiteji, ibe mibomvu lapho okuthile kuhlulekile. Thola umlayezo ongezansi. Ukuvula amafayela \"name akuyona ifayela le-IFC, RVT, RFA, DWG noma DXF.\" I-BimCraft ayilibonanga ifayela. Hlola isandiso nokuthi ifayela alilingene. Ama-PDF, izithombe namafayela ehhovisi awavuleki. \".ifczip ayisasekeli okwamanje. Gcina noma ukhiphe imodeli njenge-.ifc elula.\" (futhi ku-.ifcxml) Khipha i-.ifczip (ingumzipho ojwayelekile oqukethe i-.ifc) noma khipha i-IFC elula. \"… yifayela lephrojekthi i-BimCraft engakafundi.\" Ifayela le-.pln, .pla, .tpl noma .bpn. Khipha i-IFC noma i-DWG kuwo bese uvula lokho: bona Vula amafayela ephrojekthi .pln nama-.pla. \"Le fayela le-IFC alikwazanga ukufundwa.\" Ifayela le-IFC lonakele noma akuyona i-IFC eqinile. Liyivule kuhleli wombhalo: ifayela le-IFC langempela liqala nge-ISO-10303-21;. Liphinde likhiphe. \"Leli fayela alipheli: liyi… MB, kodwa uhlu lwalo lwalo lukhomba idatha okungenani… MB ngaphakathi. …\" Iphrojekthi noma ifayela lomndeni lusikiwe lapho lukopishwa, lulayishwa noma lusatshalaliswa. Ifayela le-cloud-drive elithi \"ku-inthanethi kuphela\" libukeka kanjalo. Ifayela elivulwa lodwa liyavuleka, lingaphezulu kwalo lo mlayezo ngaphezulu kwekhadi nokuthi \"Ikhombisa okutholakele; kopisha okuyisisekelo futhi ukuze uthole imodeli egcwele\": ikhadi likhombisa kuphela izingxenye ezinayo zonke izinhlamvu zazo kuleli fayela futhi zidwebe ezisele ngaphansi kwethi Akusekho kwifayela. Yenza ifayela litholakale ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi kwidrayivu yakho yefu, noma kopisha okuyisisekelo futhi, bese uyavula kabusha. Efolda, i-BimCraft ikhombisa isipele esisha esiphelele. \"… Nohlu lwezinto zefayela nalo lusemgodini ongekho, ngakho akukho okungavulwa kuwo.\" Ifayela lasikwa ngakusenesikhathi kangangokuthi nohlu lwalo lwezinto alukho, ngakho akukho okungabuyiselwa kule kopi. Kopisha okuyisisekelo futhi uyivule kabusha. \"Lo fayela le-compound alinayo i-BasicFileInfo stream, ngakho alisiyo ifayela le-Revit.\" Ifayela liwuhlobo lwe-compound lolunye uhlobo (amadokhumenti amadala ehhovisi asebenzisa isitsha esifanayo). Hlola ukuthi ukhethe ifayela elifanele. \"Sisasebenza kowedlule…\" I-BimCraft isasebenza ngefayela noma ngefolda yangaphambilini. Linda umugqa wesimo uqede, bese uzama futhi. Isikhethi sefayela sifiphaza ifayela lami. Isikhethi sinikeza kuphela .ifc, .rvt, .rfa, .rte, .rft, .dwg nama-.dxf. Hudula amanye amafayela ekhasini, bese i-BimCraft iyakutshela ukuthi ingawafunda yini. Ukuvula amafolda \"Lo folda unamafayela angaphezu kuka-20,000. Khetha ifolda encane, njengephrojekthi eyodwa.\" Ukhethe ifolda ephezulu kakhulu, njengedrayivu yonke. Khetha ifolda yephrojekthi eyodwa. \"Isiphequluli asinikezanga name ukufinyelela. Yikhethe futhi ngothi Vula ifolda.\" Uchofoze Vula futhi kwifolda yakamuva futhi imvume yesiphequluli yenqatshwe noma iphelelwe yisikhathi. Khetha ifolda futhi, noma hudula uyingenise. Isiphequluli sithi izo \"upload\" amafayela. Lokho yisichazo sesiphequluli sokudlulisela amafayela ekhasini. I-BimCraft ayiwathumeli noma kuphi. Hudula ifolda uyingenise ukuze uphephe lombuzo. Akukho okwenzekayo kwifoni noma ku-ithebhulethi. Izinsiphequluli eziningi zeselula azikwazi ukukhetha amafolda. Vula amafayela ngamanye, noma sebenzisa ikhompyutha. Ingxenye yokuqala yenjini ye-IFC Umugqa wesimo uhlala ku-\"Kuqalisa injini ye-IFC…\", noma ukhombisa iphutha elifana no-\"Failed to fetch\". Injini ye-IFC ayikwazanga ukulandwa. Ungase ungabi ku-inthanethi, noma i-firewall noma isivimbi somkhiqizo siyivimbela. Awuku-inthanethi. Uma inkinobho yebha yohlelo ingathi Ilungele ukusetshenziswa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi, injini ye-IFC ayikaze igcinwe kulesi siphequluli. Xhuma futhi, vule ifayela kabusha, bese uchofoza Londoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi ukuze isebenze ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi ngesikhathi esilandelayo. Bona Ku-inthanethi nangaphandle. Layisha kabusha ikhasi bese uzama futhi. Kunethiwekhi yomsebenzi, cela ithimba lakho le-IT ukuthi livume amafayela .wasm wesayithi. Ukulondoloza ukusetshenziswa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi Inkinobho ithi Akukwazanga ukulondoloza. Amanye amafayela awazange alandwe, ngokuvamile ngoba ukuxhumana kuphuke. Hlola ukuxhumana bese uchofoza inkinobho futhi. Ikhophi yangaphambilini engaphandle kwe-inthanethi iyagcinwa kuze kube yikhophi entsha iphelele. Inkinobho ithi Ayikho ingaphandle kwe-inthanethi. Leli windi alikwazi ukugcina ikhophi engaphandle kwe-inthanethi, isibonelo iwindi lokuzimela noma ikhompyutha yomsebenzi elawulwayo. Bona Ukusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi. Inkinobho ihlala ku-\"Ilondoloza n kwe-m\" isikhathi eside. Ikhophi ye-BimCraft icishe ibe ngu-11 MB, ingxenye enkulu iyinjini ye-IFC. Gcina ithebhu livulekile kuze kuthi Ilungele ukusetshenziswa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi. I-BimCraft ivulwe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi kodwa ibukeka idlule isikhathi. Ikhophi yakho elondoloziwe ivela kuvakashelo lwangaphambilini. Uma uku-inthanethi, chofoza Ilungele ukusetshenziswa ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi bese ukhetha Londoloza futhi (thola inguqulo entsha kakhulu). Ukubuka kwe-3D Imodeli ayisendaweni engilindele, noma imincane kakhulu. Cindezela F noma chofoza Lwanele. Lwanele ihlala ifaka konke okusemodelini, okuhlanganisa nezitezi ongazisusanga nezinto ezizulazulayo ezikude nesakhiwo, ngakho isakhiwo singabonakala sincane. Sondeza kusuka lapho. Ukuchofoza akukhethi lutho. Bamba imbewu inganyakazi lapho uchofoza: ukuhudula okuncane kuzungeza. Izinto ezitezini ezingasasiwe azikwazi ukukhethwa. Uma Izindawo zivuliwe, izindawo ezibonakalayo zikhethwa ngaphambi kwalokho okungaphakathi kwazo. Inkinobho Imiphetho ibonakala imnyama: \"Imiphetho ivaliwe kumamodeli amakhulu kakhulu\". Imodeli inezinxantathu ezingaphezu kwezigidi ezingu-1.5. Imiphetho ishiyelwe ukuze kulondolozwe inkumbulo. Ithebhu liba lihamba kancane, lishone, noma likhombise ikhasi lokuwa lesiphequluli. Imodeli inkulu kakhulu enkumbulweni esiphequluli sinikeza ithebhu. Vala amanye amathebhu bese ulayisha kabusha. Khipha i-IFC encane: isakhiwo esisodwa, umkhakha owodwa noma izitezi ezimbalwa. Bona Izinsiphequluli, amadivayisi nenkumbulo. Ukubuka kwe-3D kuhlala kungenalutho. I-WebGL ingase ivalwe noma ivinjelwe. Ezilungiselelweni zesiphequluli, vula ukusheshisa kwe-hardware (noma ukusheshisa kwegrafikhi) bese uqala kabusha isiphequluli. Ukuhlela i-IFC \"Sebenzisa inombolo.\" Inani linani elilula. Thayipha inombolo elula ngaphandle kwamayunithi, njengo 2.4. \"Sebenzisa inombolo ephelele.\" Inani liyisibalo noma inombolo ephelele. Susa izinhlamvu zedesimali. \"Izici zenani elilodwa kuphela ezingahlelwa.\" Uhlu, izinhlobo nezilinganiso ziyafundeka kuphela. Ctrl+S ivula iwindi \"Londoloza ikhasi\" lesiphequluli. Akukho okungagcinwanga, ngakho i-BimCraft ishiye ukhiye kwisiphequluli. Vala leli windi. Ctrl+Z akwenzi lutho. Lisebenza kuphela uma unezinguquko ezingagcinwanga futhi awubhali ensimini. Ngemva kokulondoloza, akukho okusalwe okungahlehliswa. Uhlu Izinguquko lusabonisa ukuhlelwa okulahliwe lapho uvula idwebo noma ifolda. Uma uphendula umbuzo othi \"Ubalahle?\" nge-OK bese uvula okungewona imodeli ye-IFC, ukuhlelwa okudala kugcinwa enkumbulweni futhi Londoloza njenge-IFC ingazigcina. Ukuqala kabusha ngempela, vula i-IFC yokuqala futhi, noma layisha ikhasi kabusha. Ukuhlela kwami kushintshe izinto eziningi kunalezo engizikhethile. Ushintshe isici esethini emaka \"(uhlobo)\". Izici zohlobo zisebenza kuzo zonke izinto zalolo hlobo. Chofoza Hlehlisa. Bona Shintsha isici sohlobo kuzo zonke izinto zohlobo. Amadwebo \"name akukwazanga ukufundwa. Mhlawumbe yonakele, noma igcinwe ngefomethi umfundi angakayisekeli (…).\" Gcina idwebo kusuka kuhlelo olwenza ngalo njenge-DWG endala (2018 noma ngaphambili) noma njenge-DXF, bese uzama futhi. \"Leli dwebo alinalutho olubonisayo.\" noma \"name ngudwebo olungenalutho: alinayo imigqa, umbhalo noma amabhulokhi.\" Idwebo lingenalutho, noma linalokho i-BimCraft engakadwebi (bona Akusadwetshwa ngakwesokudla). \"Leli dwebo likhulu kakhulu; kubonakala ingxenye yalo kuphela.\" I-BimCraft iyeka ukudweba ukuze isasabeleke. Vala izingqimba ongazidingi, noma vula amashidi odingayo kusuka kwidwebo elincane. Izingxenye zeshidi zingasekho. Imidwebo exhunyiwe ingase ingasekho: bheka ngaphansi kwe-Imidwebo exhunyiwe ngakwesokudla. Bona Thola imidwebo nezithombe exhunyiwe. Izingqimba nazo zingase zivalwe: chofoza Konke kuvuliwe. Isithombe sibonakala njengohlaka olungenalutho. Ifayela lakhe alitholakalanga, noma kuyi-TIFF (\"TIFF ayikwazi ukuboniswa kusiphequluli\"). Engeza ikhophi ye-PNG noma ye-JPEG ngo-Engeza izithombe…. Ukuskrola kwe-trackpad yami kusondeza kunokunyakazisa idwebo. Yindlela imidwebo esebenza ngayo ku-BimCraft. Chofoza udonse ukuze ushelelise. Sekusakhathaza Funda Okungakakwakhiwa: into oyifunayo ingase ingabi khona kulesi sakhiwo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"not-built-yet","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Okungakakwakhiwa","summary":"Okungenziwa yile-build ye-BimCraft okwamanje, nokufanele usebenzise esikhundleni salo namuhla.","section":"trouble","order":20,"keywords":["okuntulekayo","imikhawulo","akusekelwe","uhlelo lwesikhathi esizayo","ukumodela","ukubhala","izigaba","ukukala","ukungqubuzana","bcf","ifu","ideskithophu","ukuthumela"],"headings":[{"id":"ukumodela-nokubhala","text":"Ukumodela nokubhala","level":2},{"id":"ukubuka-amamodeli","text":"Ukubuka amamodeli","level":2},{"id":"imidwebo","text":"Imidwebo","level":2},{"id":"amafayela-namapulatifomu","text":"Amafayela namapulatifomu","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EI-BimCraft namuhla iyisifundi, isihloli nomhleli wedatha ye-IFC esesiqalile ukudweba izakhiwo: izindonga, iminyango namafasitela, amagumbi, amafulowa, izilingi nophahla (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/draw-walls\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/draw-walls\"\u003EDweba izindonga\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/doors-and-windows\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/doors-and-windows\"\u003EIminyango namafasitela\u003C/a\u003E kanye \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/floors-and-roofs\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/floors-and-roofs\"\u003EAmagumbi, amafulowa, izilingi nophahla\u003C/a\u003E). Lolu uhlu oluqotho lokungakwenzi okwamanje, nokufanele kwenziwe esikhundleni salo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukumodela-nokubhala\"\u003EUkumodela nokubhala\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAkusakwenziwa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEsikhundleni salokho, namuhla\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkudweba amabhimu; insika zensimbi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESebenzisa uhlelo lwakho lokubhala, bese uvula i-export yalo ye-IFC lapha. Insika ezingqo namasekhono zifakwa lapha (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/grids-and-columns\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/grids-and-columns\"\u003EGridi nensika\u003C/a\u003E); izitebhisi ezingqo, ezinesimo se-L, U, winder ne-spiral nezinhlaka zokuphephela kudwetshwa lapha (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/stairs-and-railings\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/stairs-and-railings\"\u003EIzitebhisi nezinhlaka zokuphephela\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfasitela ebusweni be-dormer; ama-dormer ezindizeni zophahla adwetshwe ngesandla; uphahla oluthambile; ukumbozwa kophahla okunesakhiwo esiboniswe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzindiza zophahla ezidwetshwe ngamakhoni awo, nokuthambeka kodonga ngalunye: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/roofs\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/roofs\"\u003EUphahla: ukuthambeka kodonga ngalunye, amagable, izindlu nezindiza zophahla\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkushintsha izindonga, iminyango noma amafasitela okwenziwe yenye inhlelo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUhlelo lwakho lokubhala; amathuluzi okudweba ashintsha kuphela lokho akudwetshile\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIphrofayili yodonga enemiphetho noma izimbobo; izimbobo zodonga ezingesona amakhonapha; ukwengeza noma ukususa amaphoyinti ephrofayili yodonga ku-3D view\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIphrofayili, ukunamathela, ukuthambeka nezimbobo kusebenza ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzici\u003C/span\u003E, ezinhlangothini nasezigabeni, ebusweni bodonga nangamabanga ku-3D, kwezindonga ezigoqekile nezigobile: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/wall-shape\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/wall-shape\"\u003EYenza udonga: ukunamathela, iphrofayili, ukuthambeka nezimbobo\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEzindongeni ezigoqekile: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESika / eleza\u003C/span\u003E no-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIkhona\u003C/span\u003E, ukwakha ngezakhiwo, izilinganiso zepulani ezizenzakalelayo, ukubamba ngokuhambisana nomsedwa (ibamba emaphethelweni alo nasemaphakathi womsedwa wawo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDweba udonga oluqondile kulokho, noma sebenzisa izigaba ezingqo. Izindonga ezigoqekile zitholakala kuthi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/draw-walls\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/draw-walls\"\u003EDweba izindonga\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuhudula into yethala ebekiwe ku-3D view\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHudula kwipulani, noma thayipha X, Y no-Rotation ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzici\u003C/span\u003E: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/place-from-library\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/place-from-library\"\u003EMisa izinto nezinto zasendlini kusuka ethaleni\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkubeka izitshalo kusuka ethaleni lezitshalo le-Landscape workspace ye-CivilCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZitshale ku-CivilCraft, noma beka imithi nezihlahla ezincane kusuka ethaleni lokuhlobisa: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/place-from-library\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/place-from-library\"\u003EMisa izinto nezinto zasendlini kusuka ethaleni\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu-add-on ye-Plant (icishwe kuze kuvulwe): ukudweba umugqa ohanjiswayo ungene emodelini, izinombolo zamaspool kwama-isometric awo, ukuhlola kokwakheka kwezinto ezibekwe ethaleni\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDweba umugqa nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIpayipi\u003C/span\u003E (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/pipes-and-ducts\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/pipes-and-ducts\"\u003EAmapayipi namapayipi omoya\u003C/a\u003E); ukuhlola kokwakheka kufunda ithebula lezinto le-add-on ngokwalo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkujikeleza, ukubonakalisa noma ukuhlela izindonga, iminyango namafasitela adwetshwe ngokwahlukana (izindonga ziyahanjiswa, zikopishwe nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa\u003C/span\u003E, Offset noma box stretch: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/wall-tools\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/wall-tools\"\u003EIzimo zodonga, ukuhlukanisa, ukubeka kude, ukweluleka nokukhiya\u003C/a\u003E); isitayela sokuxhumana (butt, square off) emakhoneni nodonga oluthambile noma izindonga ezintathu noma ngaphezulu (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/wall-tools\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/wall-tools\"\u003EIzimo zodonga, ukuhlukanisa, ukubeka kude, ukweluleka nokukhiya\u003C/a\u003E); ithuluzi lombhalo; izindonga zesikhwama\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKopisha konke okusezingeni nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKopisha leli zinga…\u003C/span\u003E (bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/draw-walls#levels\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/draw-walls\" data-hash=\"levels\"\u003EDweba izindonga\u003C/a\u003E); noma uzidwebe futhi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzendlalelo zokwakheka kodonga ezidwetshwe epulanini nasesigabeni; izilinganiso ezigabeni nasezinhlangothini; izilinganiso zezinto zokubhekisela ezindaweni zamafasitela, iminyango nezinye izingxenye; ukwakheka nezinzwa ezikushaywa ku-schedules nokuthola inani; ilabhulali yezinto ezabiwa phakathi kwamaphrojekthi; ukubaluleka kwezendlalelo ezigabeni, ezinhlangothini nasku-3D nasezixhumanweni zezindonga ezintathu noma ngaphezulu (epulanini, amakhona, izixhumanisi ze-T nokuwelana kwezindonga ezimbili kuhlanzwa ngokubaluleka kwezendlalelo: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/wall-tools\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/wall-tools\"\u003EIzimo zodonga, ukuhlukanisa, ukubeka kude, ukweluleka nokukhiya\u003C/a\u003E); izendlalelo ezifakiwe noma ezihlukahlukene; ukuhlela ukwakheka kodonga olwenziwe yenye inhlelo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzendlalelo zisohlotsheni lodonga nasembonweni walo (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzakhiwo zodonga…\u003C/span\u003E); izindonga zilinganiswa njengenvelopu eyodwa: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/wall-assemblies\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/wall-assemblies\"\u003EIzakhiwo zodonga nezinkomba zezilinganiso\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkushintsha ukwakheka noma usayizi wento (ngaphandle kwezindonga, iminyango namafasitela adwetshwe lapha, nezinto ezibekwe emndenini)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUhlelo lwakho lokubhala. Ukususa, ukusika, ukukopisha namathisela kusebenza lapha: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/edit-elements\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/edit-elements\"\u003ESusa, sika, kopisha namathisela izinto zesakhiwo\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkususa izitezi, izindawo, izakhiwo noma isayithi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESusa izinto ezikuzo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkunamathelisa izinto zesakhiwo kwenye imodeli\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKopisha futhi unamathisele ngaphakathi kwemodeli eyodwa; izinto zethala ezibekiwe zinamathela kunoma iyiphi imodeli\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkwengeza izici ezintsha noma amasethi ezici\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGcwalisa amanani akhona lapha, noma engeza iparamitha kuhlelo lwakho lokubhala bese uyithumela futhi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuhlela izinani, izinhlu, izinhlobo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUhlelo lwakho lokubhala\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkugcina amafayela wephrojekthi wezinye izinhlelo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-BimCraft igcina i-IFC (nemindeni yayo: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/families\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/families\"\u003EImindeni nosayizi bayo\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImindeni: ithala lemindeni elibekwa kusuka epulanini nelabelwana phakathi kwamaphrojekthi (Library), i-hotspot ehudulwa ku-3D view yento ebekiwe (ihudulwa kwi-preview yomhleli womndeni nasepulanini), amazinga emininingwane akhethwa ngombono (izinga elilodwa lephrojekthi; amashidi akhetha ngesikali), i-revolve endizeni eme ngaphakathi komndeni owodwa ejikelezwe ngekota, izimpawu zepulani zezigxobo nezamafasitela zazo (zidweba izimpawu zesisekelo sazo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImindeni enezici ezibhalwe ngohlobo, izifomula, isimpawu sepulani sayo, ama-hotspot, okuphindayo, amazinga emininingwane, imindeni ngaphakathi kwemindeni, usayizi ngethebula nezici ngento ngayinye zenziwa lapha: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/family-editor\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/family-editor\"\u003EHlela umndeni\u003C/a\u003E no-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/families\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/families\"\u003EImindeni nosayizi bayo\u003C/a\u003E. Phinda umndeni ukuze uqale kuwo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuhlela izinhlobo zezinye izinhlelo njengemindeni; ukuguqula into yethala ibe umndeni\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinhlobo zezinye izinhlelo ziyadwetshwa, ziqoqwe ngokuqagela, nezinto zazo ziyakhethwa. Izinto zethala ziyabekwa njengoba zinjalo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinto zabakhiqizi, amavalvu nemishini (amandla, isisindo, usayizi wokuxhuma wabakhiqizi); izindlela ze-ASME B16.9 zamathee nezinciphisi kumaspool ensimbi; ukulahleka kwengcindezi ngokuhamba kwezinto, imigeleko nokulinganisa; ama-sprinkler; amathreyi wezingcingo; ukulinganisa izitaki nokuphefumula ngamayunithi wezinto; ukudonsa amakhoni womugqa; ukusika izimbobo ezindongeni nasemafulowa; ukuvumela ukuphela komugqa okubanjwe kuport (ngaphandle kokususa imishini); amaport ezinto zethala ezibekwe ephaneli yethala; isisindo sezinto; izimpande, amaghequ nezixhumanisi zomoya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinhlelo zomugqa wepayipi nomoya nezinhlobo ezijwayelekile, izinhlelo, amapulani, amathebula nethakhi kwenziwa lapha: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/pipes-and-ducts\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/pipes-and-ducts\"\u003EAmapayipi namapayipi omoya\u003C/a\u003E. Imishini enamaport, imigqa exhunyiwe nokuhlola kokuxhuma: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/mep-equipment\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/mep-equipment\"\u003EImishini ye-MEP enamaport\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/mep-connections\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/mep-connections\"\u003EXhuma amapayipi namapayipi omoya emishini\u003C/a\u003E. Amasethi okungqubuzana, izindawo zokusondela nohlu lwemingxunyeni: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/mep-against-structure\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/mep-against-structure\"\u003EHlola amapayipi namapayipi omoya nesakhiwo\u003C/a\u003E. Amaspool ensimbi namashidi, uhlu lokusika lwamapayipi omoya: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/pipe-spools\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/pipe-spools\"\u003EAmaspool epayipi lensimbi namashidi amaspool\u003C/a\u003E. Lethe izinto zabakhiqizi kusuka ohlelweni lwakho lwe-MEP njenge-IFC\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuhlolwa kwamakhodi okwakha ama-I-shape aweldiwe, ama-I-shape angabizwa ngegama lephrofayili ye-IFC njengosayizi we-W, S, IPE, HEA noma HEB, namatyubhu, ama-angle namachannel (ayabuyela engahlolwanga); ukugoba noma impendulo esebenzayo (ukuqhubeka kwemvelo kusebhlokini lwe-Finite elements) (ukwesibili kuyi-P-Delta kuphela: elastic, flexural, akukho ukunciphisa ukuqina); izindonga namafulowa ekuhlaziyweni; izilayishi ezenziwe ngezindawo (ngaphandle kwengcindezi eyodwa kuwo wonke amafulowa we-concrete)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIthebhu le-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuhlaziya\u003C/span\u003E linikeza izimpoqo, ukusekela nokuguquka kwamabhimu, insika namabhureji ngokuhlaziywa kokuqala futhi lihlola ama-I-shape akhiqizwe ngomshini, njengosizo kuze kube unjiniyela ekubuyekeze: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/frame-analysis#design-checks\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/frame-analysis\" data-hash=\"design-checks\"\u003EHlaziya uhlaka lokwakha\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukubuka-amamodeli\"\u003EUkubuka amamodeli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAkusakwenziwa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEsikhundleni salokho, namuhla\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-3D kusuka emafayeleni wephrojekthi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHlela i-IFC bese uyavula. Bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/rvt-to-ifc\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/rvt-to-ifc\"\u003EThola ifayela lephrojekthi libe ku-3D nge-IFC\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinhlangothi zangaphakathi esethini lemidwebo eyenziwe (kusuka ku-Properties yegumbi nakumashidi akho zenziwa); izilinganiso zakho ezinhlangothini nasezigabeni (izimpawu zezinga, ukuphakama, ububanzi nezithegi zomnyango / zefasitela ziyadwetshwa; izinhlobo zibhalwa ekubukeni: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/edit-in-elevations\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/edit-in-elevations\"\u003EHlela ezinhlangothini nasezigabeni\u003C/a\u003E); izindonga emdwebeni wohlangothi (zidwetshwa endizeni yesigaba); amathempulethi eqembu ngeStudio\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsethi yemidwebo eyenziwe emodelini: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/sheets\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/sheets\"\u003EIzinhlangothi, izigaba nemashidi\u003C/a\u003E. Kunoma imuphi imodeli ye-IFC: indiza eyodwa ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsigaba\u003C/span\u003E, noma ibhokisi lesigaba; bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/section-plane\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/section-plane\"\u003ESika imodeli ye-IFC ngendiza yesigaba\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinkomba zokubuka, izinkomba zemininingwane, izibuko zokudweba nezincazelo; ukudweba izinkomba noma izigaba ekubukeni; ukusika ukubukeka kohlangothi noma isigaba; amathempulethi okubuka kwezinhlangothi, izigaba, izilingi nombono we-3D; izilingi zepulani ezisezinhlobonhlobo emidwebeni eyenziwe; ukubhala izilingi ngaphakathi kwesethi yemidwebo; isethi eyodwa yamashidi akho ePDF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmapulani nepulani yezilingi anemikhawulo yokubuka, indawo yokusika, isikali nengaphansi (amapulani nawo anamathempulethi), namashidi akho angathatha amapulani, izilingi, izinhlangothi, izigaba nezinkomba, ngalinye ligcinwe njenge-PDF: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/views-and-sheets\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/views-and-sheets\"\u003EUkubuka, imikhawulo yokubuka namashidi akho\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkubeka kabusha ilambu ngemva kokulibeka esilingini; izilingi ezithambekile noma ezinezinyathelo; amaphethini wesilingi ngaphandle kwemigqa emihlanu; isimpawu selambu sayo epulanini yesilingi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYibeke nge-\u003Cstrong\u003EMount: Esilingini\u003C/strong\u003E. Ipulani yesilingi idwetsha isimo selambu ngokwesakhiwo sayo: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/place-from-library\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/place-from-library\"\u003EMisa izinto nezinto zasendlini kusuka ethaleni\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkwabelana ngamasethi okusesha nabanye, amasethi angaphakathi kwefayela le-IFC\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmasethi ahlala kulesi siphequluli; bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/find\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/find\"\u003EThola izinto ngohlobo, igama noma isici\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkulinganisa izinkomba noma ngendlela enamaphoyinti amaningi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinganisa ingxenye ngayinye nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinganisa\u003C/span\u003E: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/measure\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/measure\"\u003ELinganisa amabanga, izindawo zobuso nezindawo ku-3D\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuthungwa ku-3D view ephilayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinto ezipendwe zikhombisa umbala wazo ekubukeni nokuthungwa kwazo emifanekisweni eboniswayo: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render\"\u003EBoniswa umfanekiso wemodeli\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuhlolwa okuthile (soft) phakathi kwanoma yimaphi amasethi, amaqembu okungqubuzana, ukulondoloza imiphumela yokungqubuzana\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQalisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkuhlola ukungqubuzana\u003C/span\u003E bese wenza izindaba zalezo ezibalulekile: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/clash-check\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/clash-check\"\u003EHlola ukungqubuzana\u003C/a\u003E. Amapayipi namapayipi omoya nesakhiwo banokuthi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlola amabanga\u003C/span\u003E: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/mep-against-structure\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/mep-against-structure\"\u003EHlola amapayipi namapayipi omoya nesakhiwo\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkulondoloza amamodeli amaningi njengesethi eyodwa, noma ukuhlela amamodeli amabili ngesikhathi esisodwa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHlela imodeli eyodwa ngesikhathi; ngayinye igcina ifayela layo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkunikeza izindaba, izinsuku ezifanele, amalebula, izimbono eziningi ngendaba, ukuhlela indaba\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkubuka okukodwa ngendaba; bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/issues-bcf\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/issues-bcf\"\u003EIzindaba nemafayela e-BCF\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.ifczip\u003C/code\u003E no-\u003Ccode\u003E.ifcxml\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHlobosha noma khipha \u003Ccode\u003E.ifc\u003C/code\u003E ngokuvamile\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmamephu ezendawo emodelini engenayo imephu yokuguqula, noma emibonweni yomdwebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhipha imodeli ngokuhlelwa kwayo: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/map-layers\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/map-layers\"\u003EImephu emhlabeni ngaphansi kwemodeli\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmaskena e-E57 angaphezu kwamaphoyinti ayizigidi eziyisithupha noma angaphezu kwe-512 MB; amafayela womkhiqizi wamaskena (RCP, RCS, FLS, LGS, TZF, ZFS); amafu amaphoyinti kumbono we-3D womdwebo; ukulondoloza indawo yefu nemodeli\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhipha iskena njenge-LAS noma i-LAZ bese uyivula ecaleni kwemodeli ye-IFC: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/point-cloud-formats\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/point-cloud-formats\"\u003EAmafomethi amafu amaphoyinti\u003C/a\u003E no-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/point-clouds\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/point-clouds\"\u003EBonisa ifu lamaphoyinti eduze kwemodeli\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkubhalisa amaskena: ukuthola izinhloso (amabhola, amabhodi echeck) kuskena ngokwayo, ukuxazulula onkana bonke amaskena ndawonye (bundle adjustment), isikali, ukubhalisa ngokuhlanganyela nemodeli\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhetha amaphoyinti ahambisanayo noma uthayiphe izixhumanisi zezinhloso, bese ulungisa iskena elilodwa ngesikhathi nge-ICP: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/register-scans\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/register-scans\"\u003EHlanganisa amaskena amaningi abe munye\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuvula amafayela wephrojekthi \u003Ccode\u003E.pln\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.pla\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.tpl\u003C/code\u003E no-\u003Ccode\u003E.bpn\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhipha i-IFC ne-DWG kuwo, noma i-project bundle: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/pln-project-files\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/pln-project-files\"\u003EVula amafayela wephrojekthi .pln no-.pla\u003C/a\u003E no-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/open-project-bundle\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/open-project-bundle\"\u003EVula i-project bundle\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuvula uhlu lwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzinto\u003C/span\u003E ukukhetha ngohlobo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChofoza iqembu lohlobo ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmuthi wemodeli\u003C/span\u003E: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/model-tree\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/model-tree\"\u003EThola indlela yakho ngomuthi wemodeli\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuthayipha isihloko noma amazwana endabeni ku-VR, amanothi ezwi, ukuhambisa ipulani lesigaba ngesandla ku-VR, ibhokisi lesigaba ku-VR\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBeka indaba ku-VR, bese ungeza amagama ayo ethebhini yezindaba; setha ipulani noma ibhokisi lesigaba ku-3D view ngaphambi kokungena: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/vr-review\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/vr-review\"\u003EHlola imodeli nge-VR headset\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkubona abantu bahlezi edeskini ku-VR, ukurekhoda uhambo lwe-VR\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECela ukuthi bajoyine ku-VR, noma balandele ku-3D view\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkulingisa kwemini (ukukhanya okuncike esimweni sezulu, ukukhanya kwemini, amahora elanga), amafasitela ophahla ekukhanyeni kwemini, nokuhlolwa kwe-BS EN 17037 noma izikimu zokwakha eziluhlaza; indlela yamandla ye-ISO 52016-1, ukulingisa kwamandla ngamahora, ukugcina ukushisa nezibopho, amafayela wezulu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinsiza zokuklama: inani eliphakathi lokukhanya kwemini, i-vertical sky component yefasitela ngalinye, ilanga elingena emafasiteleni ngosuku oluthile, nokukhanya kwemini ngegridi (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/daylight-factor\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/daylight-factor\"\u003ELinganisa ukukhanya kwemini ngegumbi ngalinye\u003C/a\u003E); ukulahlekelwa kokushisa, unyaka wezinsuku zedigri nokuphakama kokupholisa ngegumbi ngalinye (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/heating-and-cooling-loads\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/heating-and-cooling-loads\"\u003ELinganisa imithwalo yokushisa nokupholisa\u003C/a\u003E). Sebenzisa uhlelo lokulingisa ukuze uthole ukuhambisana\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsakhiwo sedijithali esiphilayo esigcinwa ngesikhathi i-BimCraft ivaliwe, izexwayiso zi-imeyili, izikhumbuzo zokugcinwa nge-imeyili; i-MQTT 5; ukubuyisa imisebenzi ye-COBie\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzilinganiso ezivela ku-CSV noma ngqo kubroker wakho noma kwikheli lakho ngesikhathi imodeli ivuliwe, imikhawulo ebonisa izinto, amadokhumenti, i-COBie ephumayo nengenayo: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/assets-and-maintenance\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/assets-and-maintenance\"\u003EGcina idatha yezinto nerekhodi lokugcinwa emodelini\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIpulaginini noma i-live link ye-Enscape, Twinmotion noma ezinye izinhlelo zokubonisa; amafayela e-FBX noma e-Datasmith; into eyodwa ngayinye ngayinye; imibono egciniwe nokuhamba ku-.glb\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGcina i-.glb yezinhlelo zokunikeza ezifunda i-glTF, ifayela le-USD (into eyodwa ngayinye, ngedatha yayo ye-IFC: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/usd\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/usd\"\u003EKhipha imodeli njenge-USD\u003C/a\u003E), noma i-IFC yezinhlelo ezisebenza ngaphakathi kolunye uhlelo lokuklama: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/model-for-rendering\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/model-for-rendering\"\u003EThumela imodeli kuhlelo lokunikeza\u003C/a\u003E no-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render-open-in\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render-open-in\"\u003EVula isimo kolunye uhlelo\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEnye inhlelo idweba isithombe se-Render ngaphandle kwe-add-on yenjini yokunikeza (i-CadCraft ayikaze isebenzise uhlelo ngaphansi kwelayisense ye-GNU GPL); amapanorama noma amakhamera e-stereo nesithombe sesibhakabhaka ngenye inhlelo; i-plug-in ye-Unreal Engine (amafayela ayabhalwa, i-plug-in evula wona ayikakhishwa)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInjini yethu ye-Fast ne-Path tracer; injini ye-add-on (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render-other-program\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render-other-program\"\u003Edweba isithombe ngenye inhlelo\u003C/a\u003E); ifayela lefolda le-USD, le-glTF noma le-Unreal kusukaohlwini lwe-Engine ukuze uyise kunoma iyiphi inhlelo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu-live view: ukuhlwanyela izitshalo namadwala, ukwabelana ngamapanorama, uhambo, isibuki esingaxhumekile noma ividiyo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-live view ye-ModelCraft inakho; lapha, kudwetshwa izithombe nezinkundla ze-360°: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/live-view\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/live-view\"\u003EI-live view\u003C/a\u003E no-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render\"\u003EDweba isithombe semodeli\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"imidwebo\"\u003EImidwebo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAkusakwenziwa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEsikhundleni salokho, namuhla\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuhlela, ukulinganisa noma ukugcina i-DWG ne-DXF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI-drafting app ye-CadCraft (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlela ku-CadCraft\u003C/span\u003E ku-2D view)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuphrinta noma ukukhipha i-PDF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhrinta kuhlelo olwenze umdwebo; hlola kuqala nge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubuka kokuphrinta\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmapulethi okuphrinta netafula lamapeni\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkubuka kokuphrinta\u003C/span\u003E ikhombisa umbala omnyama onobubanzi bomugqa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmafayela e-DWG adala kunokuthi R13, nama-DXF abhinary (i-BimCraft iyakutshela lapho uvula enye)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGcina umdwebo futhi njenge-DWG entsha, noma njenge-ASCII DXF\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImidwebo exhunyiwe ngaphakathi kwemidwebo exhunyiwe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVula ngqo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzithombe ze-TIFF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGcina ikhophi ye-PNG noma ye-JPEG ngegama elifanayo bese uyengeza\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImidwebo ye-DGN\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIbhalwe ezimbikweni zemibiko yamafolda kuphela\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinto ezibhalwe ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cstrong\u003EAkukadwetshwa\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBona umdwebo kuhlelo olwawudweba\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinqe ze-ACIS, amabhodi, izindawo nezindawo ezingaphezulu, namaphethini wokuhlukanisa ku-3D\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhipha i-IFC noma ubuso be-3D kuhlelo olwenza umdwebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzithombe, ama-multileader nezinkundla ku-3D view yomdwebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBona kuthebhu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImodeli\u003C/span\u003E nasemashidini\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkukhetha izinto ku-2D view yomdwebo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShintshela ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E bese uchofoza into lapho: bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/dwg-in-3d\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/dwg-in-3d\"\u003EBona umdwebo we-DWG noma we-DXF nge-3D\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUhlu lwemishini kusuka kumidwebo engenamathegi e-\u003Ccode\u003EKCL-ITEM\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkutholakali\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUhlu lwemishini njenge-XLSX noma i-PDF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELanda i-CSV\u003C/span\u003E bese uyivula kuhlelo lwamaspredishithi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amafayela-namapulatifomu\"\u003EAmafayela namapulatifomu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAkusakwenziwa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEsikhundleni salokho, namuhla\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkugcinwa efwini\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGcina amakhophi ekhompyutheni yakho noma kuseva yehhovisi. Ukugcinwa efwini akukatholakali okwamanje\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkukhumbula amafolda ku-Firefox ne-Safari\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhetha ifolda futhi, noma yihudule\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuhlehlisa ngemva kokulondoloza\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVula ifayela lokuqala ukuze uqale kabusha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkugcwalisa ingxenye eyelashwe yefayela lephrojekthi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKopisha okokuqala futhi; kufolda, i-BimCraft ifunda ikhophi yokugcina esiphelele kakhulu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkuvula kabusha amafayela owayevulekile\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzinguquko ezingalondolozwanga ziyabuyiswa njengo &quot;Vuselela umsebenzi wakho?&quot; uma ubuyela; vula amafayela futhi kusuka kuhlu lwamanje\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E","text":"I-BimCraft namuhla iyisifundi, isihloli nomhleli wedatha ye-IFC esesiqalile ukudweba izakhiwo: izindonga, iminyango namafasitela, amagumbi, amafulowa, izilingi nophahla (bheka Dweba izindonga, Iminyango namafasitela kanye Amagumbi, amafulowa, izilingi nophahla). Lolu uhlu oluqotho lokungakwenzi okwamanje, nokufanele kwenziwe esikhundleni salo. Ukumodela nokubhala Akusakwenziwa Esikhundleni salokho, namuhla Ukudweba amabhimu; insika zensimbi Sebenzisa uhlelo lwakho lokubhala, bese uvula i-export yalo ye-IFC lapha. Insika ezingqo namasekhono zifakwa lapha (bheka Gridi nensika); izitebhisi ezingqo, ezinesimo se-L, U, winder ne-spiral nezinhlaka zokuphephela kudwetshwa lapha (bheka Izitebhisi nezinhlaka zokuphephela) Ifasitela ebusweni be-dormer; ama-dormer ezindizeni zophahla adwetshwe ngesandla; uphahla oluthambile; ukumbozwa kophahla okunesakhiwo esiboniswe Izindiza zophahla ezidwetshwe ngamakhoni awo, nokuthambeka kodonga ngalunye: bheka Uphahla: ukuthambeka kodonga ngalunye, amagable, izindlu nezindiza zophahla Ukushintsha izindonga, iminyango noma amafasitela okwenziwe yenye inhlelo Uhlelo lwakho lokubhala; amathuluzi okudweba ashintsha kuphela lokho akudwetshile Iphrofayili yodonga enemiphetho noma izimbobo; izimbobo zodonga ezingesona amakhonapha; ukwengeza noma ukususa amaphoyinti ephrofayili yodonga ku-3D view Iphrofayili, ukunamathela, ukuthambeka nezimbobo kusebenza ku-Izici, ezinhlangothini nasezigabeni, ebusweni bodonga nangamabanga ku-3D, kwezindonga ezigoqekile nezigobile: bheka Yenza udonga: ukunamathela, iphrofayili, ukuthambeka nezimbobo Ezindongeni ezigoqekile: Sika / eleza no-Ikhona, ukwakha ngezakhiwo, izilinganiso zepulani ezizenzakalelayo, ukubamba ngokuhambisana nomsedwa (ibamba emaphethelweni alo nasemaphakathi womsedwa wawo) Dweba udonga oluqondile kulokho, noma sebenzisa izigaba ezingqo. Izindonga ezigoqekile zitholakala kuthi Dweba izindonga Ukuhudula into yethala ebekiwe ku-3D view Hudula kwipulani, noma thayipha X, Y no-Rotation ku-Izici: bheka Misa izinto nezinto zasendlini kusuka ethaleni Ukubeka izitshalo kusuka ethaleni lezitshalo le-Landscape workspace ye-CivilCraft Zitshale ku-CivilCraft, noma beka imithi nezihlahla ezincane kusuka ethaleni lokuhlobisa: bheka Misa izinto nezinto zasendlini kusuka ethaleni Ku-add-on ye-Plant (icishwe kuze kuvulwe): ukudweba umugqa ohanjiswayo ungene emodelini, izinombolo zamaspool kwama-isometric awo, ukuhlola kokwakheka kwezinto ezibekwe ethaleni Dweba umugqa nge-Ipayipi (bheka Amapayipi namapayipi omoya); ukuhlola kokwakheka kufunda ithebula lezinto le-add-on ngokwalo Ukujikeleza, ukubonakalisa noma ukuhlela izindonga, iminyango namafasitela adwetshwe ngokwahlukana (izindonga ziyahanjiswa, zikopishwe nge-Hambisa, Offset noma box stretch: bheka Izimo zodonga, ukuhlukanisa, ukubeka kude, ukweluleka nokukhiya); isitayela sokuxhumana (butt, square off) emakhoneni nodonga oluthambile noma izindonga ezintathu noma ngaphezulu (bheka Izimo zodonga, ukuhlukanisa, ukubeka kude, ukweluleka nokukhiya); ithuluzi lombhalo; izindonga zesikhwama Kopisha konke okusezingeni nge-Kopisha leli zinga… (bheka Dweba izindonga); noma uzidwebe futhi Izendlalelo zokwakheka kodonga ezidwetshwe epulanini nasesigabeni; izilinganiso ezigabeni nasezinhlangothini; izilinganiso zezinto zokubhekisela ezindaweni zamafasitela, iminyango nezinye izingxenye; ukwakheka nezinzwa ezikushaywa ku-schedules nokuthola inani; ilabhulali yezinto ezabiwa phakathi kwamaphrojekthi; ukubaluleka kwezendlalelo ezigabeni, ezinhlangothini nasku-3D nasezixhumanweni zezindonga ezintathu noma ngaphezulu (epulanini, amakhona, izixhumanisi ze-T nokuwelana kwezindonga ezimbili kuhlanzwa ngokubaluleka kwezendlalelo: bheka Izimo zodonga, ukuhlukanisa, ukubeka kude, ukweluleka nokukhiya); izendlalelo ezifakiwe noma ezihlukahlukene; ukuhlela ukwakheka kodonga olwenziwe yenye inhlelo Izendlalelo zisohlotsheni lodonga nasembonweni walo (Izakhiwo zodonga…); izindonga zilinganiswa njengenvelopu eyodwa: bheka Izakhiwo zodonga nezinkomba zezilinganiso Ukushintsha ukwakheka noma usayizi wento (ngaphandle kwezindonga, iminyango namafasitela adwetshwe lapha, nezinto ezibekwe emndenini) Uhlelo lwakho lokubhala. Ukususa, ukusika, ukukopisha namathisela kusebenza lapha: bheka Susa, sika, kopisha namathisela izinto zesakhiwo Ukususa izitezi, izindawo, izakhiwo noma isayithi Susa izinto ezikuzo Ukunamathelisa izinto zesakhiwo kwenye imodeli Kopisha futhi unamathisele ngaphakathi kwemodeli eyodwa; izinto zethala ezibekiwe zinamathela kunoma iyiphi imodeli Ukwengeza izici ezintsha noma amasethi ezici Gcwalisa amanani akhona lapha, noma engeza iparamitha kuhlelo lwakho lokubhala bese uyithumela futhi Ukuhlela izinani, izinhlu, izinhlobo Uhlelo lwakho lokubhala Ukugcina amafayela wephrojekthi wezinye izinhlelo I-BimCraft igcina i-IFC (nemindeni yayo: bheka Imindeni nosayizi bayo) Imindeni: ithala lemindeni elibekwa kusuka epulanini nelabelwana phakathi kwamaphrojekthi (Library), i-hotspot ehudulwa ku-3D view yento ebekiwe (ihudulwa kwi-preview yomhleli womndeni nasepulanini), amazinga emininingwane akhethwa ngombono (izinga elilodwa lephrojekthi; amashidi akhetha ngesikali), i-revolve endizeni eme ngaphakathi komndeni owodwa ejikelezwe ngekota, izimpawu zepulani zezigxobo nezamafasitela zazo (zidweba izimpawu zesisekelo sazo) Imindeni enezici ezibhalwe ngohlobo, izifomula, isimpawu sepulani sayo, ama-hotspot, okuphindayo, amazinga emininingwane, imindeni ngaphakathi kwemindeni, usayizi ngethebula nezici ngento ngayinye zenziwa lapha: bheka Hlela umndeni no-Imindeni nosayizi bayo. Phinda umndeni ukuze uqale kuwo Ukuhlela izinhlobo zezinye izinhlelo njengemindeni; ukuguqula into yethala ibe umndeni Izinhlobo zezinye izinhlelo ziyadwetshwa, ziqoqwe ngokuqagela, nezinto zazo ziyakhethwa. Izinto zethala ziyabekwa njengoba zinjalo Izinto zabakhiqizi, amavalvu nemishini (amandla, isisindo, usayizi wokuxhuma wabakhiqizi); izindlela ze-ASME B16.9 zamathee nezinciphisi kumaspool ensimbi; ukulahleka kwengcindezi ngokuhamba kwezinto, imigeleko nokulinganisa; ama-sprinkler; amathreyi wezingcingo; ukulinganisa izitaki nokuphefumula ngamayunithi wezinto; ukudonsa amakhoni womugqa; ukusika izimbobo ezindongeni nasemafulowa; ukuvumela ukuphela komugqa okubanjwe kuport (ngaphandle kokususa imishini); amaport ezinto zethala ezibekwe ephaneli yethala; isisindo sezinto; izimpande, amaghequ nezixhumanisi zomoya Izinhlelo zomugqa wepayipi nomoya nezinhlobo ezijwayelekile, izinhlelo, amapulani, amathebula nethakhi kwenziwa lapha: bheka Amapayipi namapayipi omoya. Imishini enamaport, imigqa exhunyiwe nokuhlola kokuxhuma: Imishini ye-MEP enamaport, Xhuma amapayipi namapayipi omoya emishini. Amasethi okungqubuzana, izindawo zokusondela nohlu lwemingxunyeni: Hlola amapayipi namapayipi omoya nesakhiwo. Amaspool ensimbi namashidi, uhlu lokusika lwamapayipi omoya: Amaspool epayipi lensimbi namashidi amaspool. Lethe izinto zabakhiqizi kusuka ohlelweni lwakho lwe-MEP njenge-IFC Ukuhlolwa kwamakhodi okwakha ama-I-shape aweldiwe, ama-I-shape angabizwa ngegama lephrofayili ye-IFC njengosayizi we-W, S, IPE, HEA noma HEB, namatyubhu, ama-angle namachannel (ayabuyela engahlolwanga); ukugoba noma impendulo esebenzayo (ukuqhubeka kwemvelo kusebhlokini lwe-Finite elements) (ukwesibili kuyi-P-Delta kuphela: elastic, flexural, akukho ukunciphisa ukuqina); izindonga namafulowa ekuhlaziyweni; izilayishi ezenziwe ngezindawo (ngaphandle kwengcindezi eyodwa kuwo wonke amafulowa we-concrete) Ithebhu le-Ukuhlaziya linikeza izimpoqo, ukusekela nokuguquka kwamabhimu, insika namabhureji ngokuhlaziywa kokuqala futhi lihlola ama-I-shape akhiqizwe ngomshini, njengosizo kuze kube unjiniyela ekubuyekeze: bheka Hlaziya uhlaka lokwakha Ukubuka amamodeli Akusakwenziwa Esikhundleni salokho, namuhla I-3D kusuka emafayeleni wephrojekthi Hlela i-IFC bese uyavula. Bheka Thola ifayela lephrojekthi libe ku-3D nge-IFC Izinhlangothi zangaphakathi esethini lemidwebo eyenziwe (kusuka ku-Properties yegumbi nakumashidi akho zenziwa); izilinganiso zakho ezinhlangothini nasezigabeni (izimpawu zezinga, ukuphakama, ububanzi nezithegi zomnyango / zefasitela ziyadwetshwa; izinhlobo zibhalwa ekubukeni: bheka Hlela ezinhlangothini nasezigabeni); izindonga emdwebeni wohlangothi (zidwetshwa endizeni yesigaba); amathempulethi eqembu ngeStudio Isethi yemidwebo eyenziwe emodelini: bheka Izinhlangothi, izigaba nemashidi. Kunoma imuphi imodeli ye-IFC: indiza eyodwa ye-Isigaba, noma ibhokisi lesigaba; bheka Sika imodeli ye-IFC ngendiza yesigaba Izinkomba zokubuka, izinkomba zemininingwane, izibuko zokudweba nezincazelo; ukudweba izinkomba noma izigaba ekubukeni; ukusika ukubukeka kohlangothi noma isigaba; amathempulethi okubuka kwezinhlangothi, izigaba, izilingi nombono we-3D; izilingi zepulani ezisezinhlobonhlobo emidwebeni eyenziwe; ukubhala izilingi ngaphakathi kwesethi yemidwebo; isethi eyodwa yamashidi akho ePDF Amapulani nepulani yezilingi anemikhawulo yokubuka, indawo yokusika, isikali nengaphansi (amapulani nawo anamathempulethi), namashidi akho angathatha amapulani, izilingi, izinhlangothi, izigaba nezinkomba, ngalinye ligcinwe njenge-PDF: bheka Ukubuka, imikhawulo yokubuka namashidi akho Ukubeka kabusha ilambu ngemva kokulibeka esilingini; izilingi ezithambekile noma ezinezinyathelo; amaphethini wesilingi ngaphandle kwemigqa emihlanu; isimpawu selambu sayo epulanini yesilingi Yibeke nge-Mount: Esilingini. Ipulani yesilingi idwetsha isimo selambu ngokwesakhiwo sayo: bheka Misa izinto nezinto zasendlini kusuka ethaleni Ukwabelana ngamasethi okusesha nabanye, amasethi angaphakathi kwefayela le-IFC Amasethi ahlala kulesi siphequluli; bheka Thola izinto ngohlobo, igama noma isici Ukulinganisa izinkomba noma ngendlela enamaphoyinti amaningi Linganisa ingxenye ngayinye nge-Linganisa: bheka Linganisa amabanga, izindawo zobuso nezindawo ku-3D Ukuthungwa ku-3D view ephilayo Izinto ezipendwe zikhombisa umbala wazo ekubukeni nokuthungwa kwazo emifanekisweni eboniswayo: bheka Boniswa umfanekiso wemodeli Ukuhlolwa okuthile (soft) phakathi kwanoma yimaphi amasethi, amaqembu okungqubuzana, ukulondoloza imiphumela yokungqubuzana Qalisa Ukuhlola ukungqubuzana bese wenza izindaba zalezo ezibalulekile: bheka Hlola ukungqubuzana. Amapayipi namapayipi omoya nesakhiwo banokuthi Hlola amabanga: bheka Hlola amapayipi namapayipi omoya nesakhiwo Ukulondoloza amamodeli amaningi njengesethi eyodwa, noma ukuhlela amamodeli amabili ngesikhathi esisodwa Hlela imodeli eyodwa ngesikhathi; ngayinye igcina ifayela layo Ukunikeza izindaba, izinsuku ezifanele, amalebula, izimbono eziningi ngendaba, ukuhlela indaba Ukubuka okukodwa ngendaba; bheka Izindaba nemafayela e-BCF .ifczip no-.ifcxml Hlobosha noma khipha .ifc ngokuvamile Amamephu ezendawo emodelini engenayo imephu yokuguqula, noma emibonweni yomdwebo Khipha imodeli ngokuhlelwa kwayo: bheka Imephu emhlabeni ngaphansi kwemodeli Amaskena e-E57 angaphezu kwamaphoyinti ayizigidi eziyisithupha noma angaphezu kwe-512 MB; amafayela womkhiqizi wamaskena (RCP, RCS, FLS, LGS, TZF, ZFS); amafu amaphoyinti kumbono we-3D womdwebo; ukulondoloza indawo yefu nemodeli Khipha iskena njenge-LAS noma i-LAZ bese uyivula ecaleni kwemodeli ye-IFC: bheka Amafomethi amafu amaphoyinti no-Bonisa ifu lamaphoyinti eduze kwemodeli Ukubhalisa amaskena: ukuthola izinhloso (amabhola, amabhodi echeck) kuskena ngokwayo, ukuxazulula onkana bonke amaskena ndawonye (bundle adjustment), isikali, ukubhalisa ngokuhlanganyela nemodeli Khetha amaphoyinti ahambisanayo noma uthayiphe izixhumanisi zezinhloso, bese ulungisa iskena elilodwa ngesikhathi nge-ICP: bheka Hlanganisa amaskena amaningi abe munye Ukuvula amafayela wephrojekthi .pln, .pla, .tpl no-.bpn Khipha i-IFC ne-DWG kuwo, noma i-project bundle: bheka Vula amafayela wephrojekthi .pln no-.pla no-Vula i-project bundle Ukuvula uhlu lwe-Izinto ukukhetha ngohlobo Chofoza iqembu lohlobo ku-Umuthi wemodeli: bheka Thola indlela yakho ngomuthi wemodeli Ukuthayipha isihloko noma amazwana endabeni ku-VR, amanothi ezwi, ukuhambisa ipulani lesigaba ngesandla ku-VR, ibhokisi lesigaba ku-VR Beka indaba ku-VR, bese ungeza amagama ayo ethebhini yezindaba; setha ipulani noma ibhokisi lesigaba ku-3D view ngaphambi kokungena: bheka Hlola imodeli nge-VR headset Ukubona abantu bahlezi edeskini ku-VR, ukurekhoda uhambo lwe-VR Cela ukuthi bajoyine ku-VR, noma balandele ku-3D view Ukulingisa kwemini (ukukhanya okuncike esimweni sezulu, ukukhanya kwemini, amahora elanga), amafasitela ophahla ekukhanyeni kwemini, nokuhlolwa kwe-BS EN 17037 noma izikimu zokwakha eziluhlaza; indlela yamandla ye-ISO 52016-1, ukulingisa kwamandla ngamahora, ukugcina ukushisa nezibopho, amafayela wezulu Izinsiza zokuklama: inani eliphakathi lokukhanya kwemini, i-vertical sky component yefasitela ngalinye, ilanga elingena emafasiteleni ngosuku oluthile, nokukhanya kwemini ngegridi (Linganisa ukukhanya kwemini ngegumbi ngalinye); ukulahlekelwa kokushisa, unyaka wezinsuku zedigri nokuphakama kokupholisa ngegumbi ngalinye (Linganisa imithwalo yokushisa nokupholisa). Sebenzisa uhlelo lokulingisa ukuze uthole ukuhambisana Isakhiwo sedijithali esiphilayo esigcinwa ngesikhathi i-BimCraft ivaliwe, izexwayiso zi-imeyili, izikhumbuzo zokugcinwa nge-imeyili; i-MQTT 5; ukubuyisa imisebenzi ye-COBie Izilinganiso ezivela ku-CSV noma ngqo kubroker wakho noma kwikheli lakho ngesikhathi imodeli ivuliwe, imikhawulo ebonisa izinto, amadokhumenti, i-COBie ephumayo nengenayo: bheka Gcina idatha yezinto nerekhodi lokugcinwa emodelini Ipulaginini noma i-live link ye-Enscape, Twinmotion noma ezinye izinhlelo zokubonisa; amafayela e-FBX noma e-Datasmith; into eyodwa ngayinye ngayinye; imibono egciniwe nokuhamba ku-.glb Gcina i-.glb yezinhlelo zokunikeza ezifunda i-glTF, ifayela le-USD (into eyodwa ngayinye, ngedatha yayo ye-IFC: bheka Khipha imodeli njenge-USD), noma i-IFC yezinhlelo ezisebenza ngaphakathi kolunye uhlelo lokuklama: bheka Thumela imodeli kuhlelo lokunikeza no-Vula isimo kolunye uhlelo Enye inhlelo idweba isithombe se-Render ngaphandle kwe-add-on yenjini yokunikeza (i-CadCraft ayikaze isebenzise uhlelo ngaphansi kwelayisense ye-GNU GPL); amapanorama noma amakhamera e-stereo nesithombe sesibhakabhaka ngenye inhlelo; i-plug-in ye-Unreal Engine (amafayela ayabhalwa, i-plug-in evula wona ayikakhishwa) Injini yethu ye-Fast ne-Path tracer; injini ye-add-on (dweba isithombe ngenye inhlelo); ifayela lefolda le-USD, le-glTF noma le-Unreal kusukaohlwini lwe-Engine ukuze uyise kunoma iyiphi inhlelo Ku-live view: ukuhlwanyela izitshalo namadwala, ukwabelana ngamapanorama, uhambo, isibuki esingaxhumekile noma ividiyo I-live view ye-ModelCraft inakho; lapha, kudwetshwa izithombe nezinkundla ze-360°: bheka I-live view no-Dweba isithombe semodeli Imidwebo Akusakwenziwa Esikhundleni salokho, namuhla Ukuhlela, ukulinganisa noma ukugcina i-DWG ne-DXF I-drafting app ye-CadCraft (Hlela ku-CadCraft ku-2D view) Ukuphrinta noma ukukhipha i-PDF Phrinta kuhlelo olwenze umdwebo; hlola kuqala nge-Ukubuka kokuphrinta Amapulethi okuphrinta netafula lamapeni Ukubuka kokuphrinta ikhombisa umbala omnyama onobubanzi bomugqa Amafayela e-DWG adala kunokuthi R13, nama-DXF abhinary (i-BimCraft iyakutshela lapho uvula enye) Gcina umdwebo futhi njenge-DWG entsha, noma njenge-ASCII DXF Imidwebo exhunyiwe ngaphakathi kwemidwebo exhunyiwe Vula ngqo Izithombe ze-TIFF Gcina ikhophi ye-PNG noma ye-JPEG ngegama elifanayo bese uyengeza Imidwebo ye-DGN Ibhalwe ezimbikweni zemibiko yamafolda kuphela Izinto ezibhalwe ngaphansi kwe-Akukadwetshwa Bona umdwebo kuhlelo olwawudweba Izinqe ze-ACIS, amabhodi, izindawo nezindawo ezingaphezulu, namaphethini wokuhlukanisa ku-3D Khipha i-IFC noma ubuso be-3D kuhlelo olwenza umdwebo Izithombe, ama-multileader nezinkundla ku-3D view yomdwebo Bona kuthebhu ye-Imodeli nasemashidini Ukukhetha izinto ku-2D view yomdwebo Shintshela ku-3D bese uchofoza into lapho: bheka Bona umdwebo we-DWG noma we-DXF nge-3D Uhlu lwemishini kusuka kumidwebo engenamathegi e-KCL-ITEM Akutholakali Uhlu lwemishini njenge-XLSX noma i-PDF Landa i-CSV bese uyivula kuhlelo lwamaspredishithi Amafayela namapulatifomu Akusakwenziwa Esikhundleni salokho, namuhla Ukugcinwa efwini Gcina amakhophi ekhompyutheni yakho noma kuseva yehhovisi. Ukugcinwa efwini akukatholakali okwamanje Ukukhumbula amafolda ku-Firefox ne-Safari Khetha ifolda futhi, noma yihudule Ukuhlehlisa ngemva kokulondoloza Vula ifayela lokuqala ukuze uqale kabusha Ukugcwalisa ingxenye eyelashwe yefayela lephrojekthi Kopisha okokuqala futhi; kufolda, i-BimCraft ifunda ikhophi yokugcina esiphelele kakhulu Ukuvula kabusha amafayela owayevulekile Izinguquko ezingalondolozwanga ziyabuyiswa njengo \"Vuselela umsebenzi wakho?\" uma ubuyela; vula amafayela futhi kusuka kuhlu lwamanje","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"help","scope":"basics","title":"Ukusebenzisa lolu sizo","summary":"Vula usizo, lusesha, bese ubona izinyathelo zekhompyutha yakho.","section":"start","order":10,"keywords":["usizo","f1","sesha","amathuto","incwadi"],"headings":[{"id":"vula-usizo","text":"Vula usizo","level":2},{"id":"thola-isihloko","text":"Thola isihloko","level":2},{"id":"izinyathelo-zekhompyutha-yakho","text":"Izinyathelo zekhompyutha yakho","level":2},{"id":"lolu-sizo-olufanayo-kuwebhusayithi","text":"Lolu sizo olufanayo kuwebhusayithi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EUhlelo ngalunye lunosizo lwalo. Lingxenye yohlelo, ngakho livula ngaphandle kokuxhumeka futhi lichaza inguqulo oyisebenzisayo njalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vula-usizo\"\u003EVula usizo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, noma khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUsizo\u003C/span\u003E ebhareni ephezulu lohlelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVala\u003C/span\u003E ukuze uyifihle. Umdwebo wakho uhlala njengoba ubunjalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEzikhibhodini eziningi ze-Mac umugqa ophezulu uletha ukukhanya nomsindo. Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kanye nokhiye \u003Cstrong\u003Efn\u003C/strong\u003E (noma ukhiye we-globe), noma sebenzisa inkinobho \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUsizo\u003C/span\u003E. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/keys#function-keys-on-a-mac\" data-topic=\"basics/keys\" data-hash=\"function-keys-on-a-mac\"\u003EOkhiye ku-Mac\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"thola-isihloko\"\u003EThola isihloko\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBhala ebhokisini lokusesha phezulu koSizo. Imiphumela ivuselelwa njengoba ubhala futhi ihlanganisa amagama emiyalo yezinye izinhlelo, ngakho ukubhala lokho ongabe ukubhale kwenye indawo kuvamise ukuthola ikhasi elifanele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzihloko zihlelwa ngendlela efanayo kuzo zonke izinhlelo: ukuqala, izinyathelo ngezinyathelo, ukuza kusuka kwezinye izinhlelo, ireferensi, nokubhekana nezinkinga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzixhumanisi ngaphakathi kwesihloko zivula isihloko esilandelayo kuphaneli elifanayo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack\u003C/span\u003E ibuyisela lapho wawukhona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinyathelo-zekhompyutha-yakho\"\u003EIzinyathelo zekhompyutha yakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEzinye izinyathelo ziyehluka phakathi kwe-Mac, i-Windows ne-Linux, phakathi kwezisebenzi, nasekuxhumekeni nasekungaxhumeki. Usizo luthola okusebenza kuwe bese lubonisa lezo zinyathelo. Umugqa ophezulu wesihloko uthi iyiphi olukhethile, njengesibonelo &quot;Kubonisa izinyathelo ze-Mac, i-Chrome noma i-Edge, ku-inthanethi&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShintsha\u003C/span\u003E kuleso mugqa ukuze ukhethe ikhompyutha noma isiphequluli esihlukile, njengokusiza umngani wakho wasemsebenzini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa konke\u003C/span\u003E ukuze ubone yonke inguqulo yazo zonke izinyathelo, ngayinye inegama layo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinqamulelo zekhibhodi zibhalwa ngendlela ikhibhodi yakho eyibiza ngayo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ifundeka njengo-⌘S ku-Mac ne-Ctrl+S ku-Windows ne-Linux.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lolu-sizo-olufanayo-kuwebhusayithi\"\u003ELolu sizo olufanayo kuwebhusayithi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIwebhusayithi ibonisa izihloko ezifanayo ku-getcadcraft.com/tutorials, nezinyathelo zayo zonke izinhlelo. Ohlelweni, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula kuwebhusayithi\u003C/span\u003E ngaphansi kwesihloko ivula leyo khasi uma uxhunyiwe ku-inthanethi.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Uhlelo ngalunye lunosizo lwalo. Lingxenye yohlelo, ngakho livula ngaphandle kokuxhumeka futhi lichaza inguqulo oyisebenzisayo njalo. Vula usizo Cindezela F1, noma khetha Usizo ebhareni ephezulu lohlelo. Cindezela Esc noma khetha Vala ukuze uyifihle. Umdwebo wakho uhlala njengoba ubunjalo. Ezikhibhodini eziningi ze-Mac umugqa ophezulu uletha ukukhanya nomsindo. Cindezela F1 kanye nokhiye fn (noma ukhiye we-globe), noma sebenzisa inkinobho Usizo. Bona Okhiye ku-Mac. Thola isihloko Bhala ebhokisini lokusesha phezulu koSizo. Imiphumela ivuselelwa njengoba ubhala futhi ihlanganisa amagama emiyalo yezinye izinhlelo, ngakho ukubhala lokho ongabe ukubhale kwenye indawo kuvamise ukuthola ikhasi elifanele. Izihloko zihlelwa ngendlela efanayo kuzo zonke izinhlelo: ukuqala, izinyathelo ngezinyathelo, ukuza kusuka kwezinye izinhlelo, ireferensi, nokubhekana nezinkinga. Izixhumanisi ngaphakathi kwesihloko zivula isihloko esilandelayo kuphaneli elifanayo. Back ibuyisela lapho wawukhona. Izinyathelo zekhompyutha yakho Ezinye izinyathelo ziyehluka phakathi kwe-Mac, i-Windows ne-Linux, phakathi kwezisebenzi, nasekuxhumekeni nasekungaxhumeki. Usizo luthola okusebenza kuwe bese lubonisa lezo zinyathelo. Umugqa ophezulu wesihloko uthi iyiphi olukhethile, njengesibonelo \"Kubonisa izinyathelo ze-Mac, i-Chrome noma i-Edge, ku-inthanethi\". Khetha Shintsha kuleso mugqa ukuze ukhethe ikhompyutha noma isiphequluli esihlukile, njengokusiza umngani wakho wasemsebenzini. Khetha Bonisa konke ukuze ubone yonke inguqulo yazo zonke izinyathelo, ngayinye inegama layo. Izinqamulelo zekhibhodi zibhalwa ngendlela ikhibhodi yakho eyibiza ngayo: Ctrl+S ifundeka njengo-⌘S ku-Mac ne-Ctrl+S ku-Windows ne-Linux. Lolu sizo olufanayo kuwebhusayithi Iwebhusayithi ibonisa izihloko ezifanayo ku-getcadcraft.com/tutorials, nezinyathelo zayo zonke izinhlelo. Ohlelweni, Vula kuwebhusayithi ngaphansi kwesihloko ivula leyo khasi uma uxhunyiwe ku-inthanethi.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"browsers","scope":"basics","title":"Izisebenzi nekhompyutha","summary":"Izisebenzi izinhlelo ezisebenza kuzo, okwehlukile phakathi kwazo, nokuthi ikhompyutha yakho idinga ini.","section":"start","order":20,"keywords":["chrome","edge","firefox","safari","brave","isiphequluli","mac","windows","linux","ipad","ithebulethi","webgl","izidingo","inkumbulo"],"headings":[{"id":"isiphequluli-esingasetshenziswa","text":"Isiphequluli esingasetshenziswa","level":2},{"id":"okwehlukile-phakathi-kwezisebenzi","text":"Okwehlukile phakathi kwezisebenzi","level":2},{"id":"mac-windows-ne-linux","text":"Mac, Windows ne-Linux","level":2},{"id":"amathebulethi-nezikrini-zokuthinta","text":"Amathebulethi nezikrini zokuthinta","level":2},{"id":"isiphequluli-nesistimu-zakudala-kakhulu","text":"Isiphequluli nesistimu zakudala kakhulu","level":2},{"id":"okudingwa-ikhompyutha-yakho","text":"Okudingwa ikhompyutha yakho","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIzinhlelo zisebenza ngaphakathi kwesiphequluli sewebhu. Zenza umsebenzi kukhompyutha yakho: amafayela akho avulwa lapho futhi awathunyelwa kithi (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/your-files\" data-topic=\"basics/your-files\"\u003ELapho amafayela akho aya khona\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isiphequluli-esingasetshenziswa\"\u003EIsiphequluli esingasetshenziswa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESebenzisa inguqulo esisha yesinye salezi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsiphequluli\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInjini\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAmanothi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChromium\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEyiphelele kakhulu: ukukhetha ifolda, ukulondoloza ukuze usebenze ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi, ukuphatha amafayela.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFirefox\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGecko\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIyasebenza. Ukuvula ifolda yonke kusebenzisa isikhethi esilula. Ukulondoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi kungenzeka kungasebenzi emawindini angasese.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESafari\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWebKit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIyasebenza kuMac naseiPad. Ukuvula ifolda yonke kusebenzisa isikhethi esilula. I-Safari ingasusa ikhophi yangaphandle kwe-inthanethi ongayisebenzisanga amasonto ambalwa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZombili izinjini ezintathu ziyanele emsebenzini wansuku zonke. Lapho uhlelo lwenza into ngendlela ehlukile kwenye yazo, usizo lwalo lubonisa izinyathelo zesiphequluli sakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okwehlukile-phakathi-kwezisebenzi\"\u003EOkwehlukile phakathi kwezisebenzi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuvula ifolda.\u003C/strong\u003E Izisebenzi ze-Chromium zibonisa isikhethi sefolda langempela futhi zingafunda ifolda ngqo. I-Firefox ne-Safari zikucela ukuthi ukhethe ifolda bese zifunda wonke amafayela kuyo, okuthatha isikhathi eside kumafolda amakhulu ephrojekthi; ukuhudula ifolda kuhlelo kuyasebenza kuzo zonke ezintathu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkulondoloza.\u003C/strong\u003E Izinhlelo zilondoloza ngokulanda ifayela. Isiphequluli sakho sinquma lapho okulandwayo kuya khona nokuthi sibuza ngaphambili yini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-Chrome noma ku-Edge, vula &quot;Ask where to save each file before downloading&quot; (ku-Settings, ngaphansi kwe-Downloads) ukuze ukhethe ifolda njalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:firefox\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EFirefox\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-Firefox, vula Settings, bese General, bese Downloads, bese khetha &quot;Always ask you where to save files&quot; ukuze ukhethe ifolda njalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ESafari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-Safari, vula Settings, bese General, bese usetha &quot;File download location&quot; ibe &quot;Ask for each download&quot; ukuze ukhethe ifolda njalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mac-windows-ne-linux\"\u003EMac, Windows ne-Linux\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinhlelo zifana kukhompyutha yonke. Okushintshayo ikhibhodi: izinqamulelo zibhalwa ngokuzenzakalelayo ukuze zifaneleke kukhompyutha yakho. Bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/keys\" data-topic=\"basics/keys\"\u003EOkhiye, ama-mouse nama-trackpad\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amathebulethi-nezikrini-zokuthinta\"\u003EAmathebulethi nezikrini zokuthinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEzinye izinhlelo zamukela ukuthinta (umunwe owodwa udweba noma ukhethe, iminwe emibili icindezela ukuze usondeze futhi ushelelise). Usizo lohlelo ngalunye luyasho ukuthi uyakwenza yini. Ku-iPad, sebenzisa Safari noma Chrome. Ikhibhodi isiza ngezinhlelo ezisebenzisa imiyalo ebhalwayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isiphequluli-nesistimu-zakudala-kakhulu\"\u003EIsiphequluli nesistimu zakudala kakhulu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESizifunde kukhodi yezinhlelo ze-0.7, hhayi ngokuqagela: wonke amafayela ahlaziywa futhi isici ngasinye solimi esisisebenzisayo sabhekwa kudatha yokuhambisana eshicilelwe yezisebenzi. Ngaphansi kwalezi zinguqulo, izinhlelo azikwazi nokuqala, ngoba isiphequluli asiqondi ikhodi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInguqulo yakudala kakhulu esingaqala ngayo izinhlelo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChromium 94\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFirefox\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E93\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESafari (Mac, iPad, iPhone)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E16.4 (macOS 13.3, iPadOS and iOS 16.4)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-CadCraft Studio ithwala injini yayo yewebhu ku-Windows, ngakho idinga i-Windows 10 noma 11; ku-Mac isebenzisa eyesistimu, ngakho idinga i-macOS 13.3 noma ephakeme. Izilungiselelo › Izibuyekezo ku-Studio ibonisa okuqhuba ikhophi yakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELena inguqulo yakudala kakhulu \u003Cem\u003Eeqala\u003C/em\u003E, efundwe kukhodi. Akuyona uhlu lwezisebenzi zakudala esizisebenzise izinhlelo kuzo, ngakho owendala oqalayo kungenzeka ungabi nesici.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okudingwa-ikhompyutha-yakho\"\u003EOkudingwa ikhompyutha yakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELezi yizinga ezincane ezihleliwe zezinhlelo, hhayi izidingo ezilinganisiwe:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-8 GB yenkumbulo (i-16 GB iyanconywa emamodeli amakhulu ahlanganisiwe).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIchip yezithombe enesekela le-WebGL 2 ezinhlelweni ze-3D. Uma ukubuka kwe-3D kuhlala kungenalutho, hlola ukuthi ukusheshisa kwe-hardware kuvuliwe kuzilungiselelo zesiphequluli sakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsikrini esingenani-1280 pixels ububanzi ukuze kuboniswe ibha yamathuluzi ephelele; izikrini ezincane ziyayiphindisela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmafayela amakhulu kakhulu (amasethi amapulani amakhulu, amamodeli amakhulu) asebenzisa inkumbulo eningi ethebhini lesiphequluli. Vala amanye amathebhu anzima uma uhlelo lunciphisa isivinini.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Izinhlelo zisebenza ngaphakathi kwesiphequluli sewebhu. Zenza umsebenzi kukhompyutha yakho: amafayela akho avulwa lapho futhi awathunyelwa kithi (bona Lapho amafayela akho aya khona). Isiphequluli esingasetshenziswa Sebenzisa inguqulo esisha yesinye salezi: Isiphequluli Injini Amanothi Chrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi Chromium Eyiphelele kakhulu: ukukhetha ifolda, ukulondoloza ukuze usebenze ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi, ukuphatha amafayela. Firefox Gecko Iyasebenza. Ukuvula ifolda yonke kusebenzisa isikhethi esilula. Ukulondoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi kungenzeka kungasebenzi emawindini angasese. Safari WebKit Iyasebenza kuMac naseiPad. Ukuvula ifolda yonke kusebenzisa isikhethi esilula. I-Safari ingasusa ikhophi yangaphandle kwe-inthanethi ongayisebenzisanga amasonto ambalwa. Zombili izinjini ezintathu ziyanele emsebenzini wansuku zonke. Lapho uhlelo lwenza into ngendlela ehlukile kwenye yazo, usizo lwalo lubonisa izinyathelo zesiphequluli sakho. Okwehlukile phakathi kwezisebenzi Ukuvula ifolda. Izisebenzi ze-Chromium zibonisa isikhethi sefolda langempela futhi zingafunda ifolda ngqo. I-Firefox ne-Safari zikucela ukuthi ukhethe ifolda bese zifunda wonke amafayela kuyo, okuthatha isikhathi eside kumafolda amakhulu ephrojekthi; ukuhudula ifolda kuhlelo kuyasebenza kuzo zonke ezintathu. Ukulondoloza. Izinhlelo zilondoloza ngokulanda ifayela. Isiphequluli sakho sinquma lapho okulandwayo kuya khona nokuthi sibuza ngaphambili yini. Ku-Chrome noma ku-Edge, vula \"Ask where to save each file before downloading\" (ku-Settings, ngaphansi kwe-Downloads) ukuze ukhethe ifolda njalo. Ku-Firefox, vula Settings, bese General, bese Downloads, bese khetha \"Always ask you where to save files\" ukuze ukhethe ifolda njalo. Ku-Safari, vula Settings, bese General, bese usetha \"File download location\" ibe \"Ask for each download\" ukuze ukhethe ifolda njalo. Mac, Windows ne-Linux Izinhlelo zifana kukhompyutha yonke. Okushintshayo ikhibhodi: izinqamulelo zibhalwa ngokuzenzakalelayo ukuze zifaneleke kukhompyutha yakho. Bona Okhiye, ama-mouse nama-trackpad. Amathebulethi nezikrini zokuthinta Ezinye izinhlelo zamukela ukuthinta (umunwe owodwa udweba noma ukhethe, iminwe emibili icindezela ukuze usondeze futhi ushelelise). Usizo lohlelo ngalunye luyasho ukuthi uyakwenza yini. Ku-iPad, sebenzisa Safari noma Chrome. Ikhibhodi isiza ngezinhlelo ezisebenzisa imiyalo ebhalwayo. Isiphequluli nesistimu zakudala kakhulu Sizifunde kukhodi yezinhlelo ze-0.7, hhayi ngokuqagela: wonke amafayela ahlaziywa futhi isici ngasinye solimi esisisebenzisayo sabhekwa kudatha yokuhambisana eshicilelwe yezisebenzi. Ngaphansi kwalezi zinguqulo, izinhlelo azikwazi nokuqala, ngoba isiphequluli asiqondi ikhodi. Inguqulo yakudala kakhulu esingaqala ngayo izinhlelo Chrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi Chromium 94 Firefox 93 Safari (Mac, iPad, iPhone) 16.4 (macOS 13.3, iPadOS and iOS 16.4) I-CadCraft Studio ithwala injini yayo yewebhu ku-Windows, ngakho idinga i-Windows 10 noma 11; ku-Mac isebenzisa eyesistimu, ngakho idinga i-macOS 13.3 noma ephakeme. Izilungiselelo › Izibuyekezo ku-Studio ibonisa okuqhuba ikhophi yakho. Lena inguqulo yakudala kakhulu eqala, efundwe kukhodi. Akuyona uhlu lwezisebenzi zakudala esizisebenzise izinhlelo kuzo, ngakho owendala oqalayo kungenzeka ungabi nesici. Okudingwa ikhompyutha yakho Lezi yizinga ezincane ezihleliwe zezinhlelo, hhayi izidingo ezilinganisiwe: I-8 GB yenkumbulo (i-16 GB iyanconywa emamodeli amakhulu ahlanganisiwe). Ichip yezithombe enesekela le-WebGL 2 ezinhlelweni ze-3D. Uma ukubuka kwe-3D kuhlala kungenalutho, hlola ukuthi ukusheshisa kwe-hardware kuvuliwe kuzilungiselelo zesiphequluli sakho. Isikrini esingenani-1280 pixels ububanzi ukuze kuboniswe ibha yamathuluzi ephelele; izikrini ezincane ziyayiphindisela. Amafayela amakhulu kakhulu (amasethi amapulani amakhulu, amamodeli amakhulu) asebenzisa inkumbulo eningi ethebhini lesiphequluli. Vala amanye amathebhu anzima uma uhlelo lunciphisa isivinini.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"keys","scope":"basics","title":"Okhiye, ama-mouse nama-trackpad","summary":"Indlela izinqamulelo ezibhalwa ngayo, okhiye bomsebenzi ku-Mac, ukuchofoza ngesokudla nokuhambisa ngaphandle kwe-mouse.","section":"start","order":30,"keywords":["ikhibhodi","inqamulelo","ctrl","command","cmd","option","fn","okhiye bomsebenzi","trackpad","chofoza ngesokudla","inkinobho ephakathi","magic mouse"],"headings":[{"id":"indlela-izinqamulelo-ezibhalwa-ngayo","text":"Indlela izinqamulelo ezibhalwa ngayo","level":2},{"id":"okhiye-bomsebenzi-ku-mac","text":"Okhiye bomsebenzi ku-Mac","level":2},{"id":"izinqamulelo-isiphequluli-esizigcinayo","text":"Izinqamulelo isiphequluli esizigcinayo","level":2},{"id":"izinkinobho-ze-mouse-ku-trackpad","text":"Izinkinobho ze-mouse ku-trackpad","level":2},{"id":"ukubhala-ebhokisini-lombhalo","text":"Ukubhala ebhokisini lombhalo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"indlela-izinqamulelo-ezibhalwa-ngayo\"\u003EIndlela izinqamulelo ezibhalwa ngayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUsizo lubhala inqamulelo ngayinye ngendlela ikhibhodi yakho eyibiza ngayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUkubhalwa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKu-Mac\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKu-Windows ne-Linux\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECommand (⌘) kanye S\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECtrl kanye S\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EControl (⌃), Shift (⇧) kanye F\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECtrl, Shift kanye F\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option ←\"\u003E⌥←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOption (⌥) kanye ←\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAlt kanye ←\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInkinobho ye-Delete\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBackspace\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efn kanye Delete (ukususa phambili)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDelete\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EReturn\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEnter\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUphawu lwe-plus kusho ukubamba okhiye ndawonye. &quot;Bese&quot; kusho ukucindezela elandelanayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinqamulelo eziningi zohlelo zamukela i-Command noma i-Control ku-Mac, ngakho \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E isebenza ngazo zombili izindlela. Ezimbalwa, njengesikrini esigcwele (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), zisebenzisa ukhiye we-Control kukhompyutha yonke; usizo luyasho lapho lokho kusebenza khona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okhiye-bomsebenzi-ku-mac\"\u003EOkhiye bomsebenzi ku-Mac\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEzikhibhodini eziningi ze-Mac umugqa ophezulu ushintsha ukukhanya, ivolumu nemidiya. Ukuze uthumele u-F1 kuya ku-F12:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ebamba \u003Cstrong\u003Efn\u003C/strong\u003E (noma ukhiye we-globe) ngenkathi ucindezela okhiye, noma\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Evula \u003Cstrong\u003ESystem Settings\u003C/strong\u003E, bese \u003Cstrong\u003EKeyboard\u003C/strong\u003E, bese \u003Cstrong\u003EKeyboard Shortcuts\u003C/strong\u003E, bese \u003Cstrong\u003EFunction Keys\u003C/strong\u003E, bese uvula &quot;Use F1, F2, etc. keys as standard function keys&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEzinye izinkinobho ze-F zibanjwa ye-macOS ngokwayo (njengesibonelo Mission Control). Uma ukhiye ungenzi lutho ohlelweni, zama ngo-fn, noma sebenzisa inkinobho yebha yamathuluzi esikhundleni salokho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinqamulelo-isiphequluli-esizigcinayo\"\u003EIzinqamulelo isiphequluli esizigcinayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIkhasi lewebhu alikwazi ukuthatha ezinye izinqamulelo kusiphequluli, noma yini eyenzayo. Kuzo zonke izinhlelo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command N\"\u003E⌘N\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+N\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command T\"\u003E⌘T\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+T\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kanye \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command W\"\u003E⌘W\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+W\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E njalo ziyavula noma zivale amawindi namathebhu esiphequluli. Izinhlelo zisebenzisa izinkinobho zokuthi Okusha kanye Vala esikhundleni salokho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Q\"\u003E⌘Q\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Q\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ku-Mac kanye \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option F4\"\u003E⌥ F4\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+F4\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ku-Windows ziphuma kusiphequluli. Uma unomsebenzi ongalondolozwanga, isiphequluli sibuza kuqala (&quot;Leave site?&quot;); khetha ukuhlala, bese ulondoloza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsikrini esigcwele sesiphequluli (\u003Cspan class=\"hp\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:mac\" title=\"Mac\"\u003EControl-Command-F, noma inkinobho eluhlaza ewindini\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:windows,linux\" title=\"Windows or Linux\"\u003EF11\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E) sisasebenza. Izinhlelo zinemodi zazo zesikrini ku-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ezingafihla namabha ohlelo nazo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izinkinobho-ze-mouse-ku-trackpad\"\u003EIzinkinobho ze-mouse ku-trackpad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinhlelo zisebenzisa inkinobho yesokudla nenkinobho ephakathi. Uma ungenayo i-mouse enezinkinobho ezintathu:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuchofoza ngesokudla:\u003C/strong\u003E chofoza ngeminwe emibili. Vula &quot;Secondary click&quot; ku-\u003Cstrong\u003ESystem Settings\u003C/strong\u003E, bese \u003Cstrong\u003ETrackpad\u003C/strong\u003E, uma ukuchofoza ngeminwe emibili kungenzi lutho. Ukubamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ngenkathi uchofoza kuvula imenyu yesiphequluli, kodwa ngaphakathi komdwebo ezinye izinhlelo zilifunda njengokuchofoza okujwayelekile (kuba ukhiye we-Control ubanjiwe), ngakho kungcono ukuchofoza ngeminwe emibili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuhudula ngenkinobho ephakathi (ukushelelisa):\u003C/strong\u003E inhlelo ngayinye inikeza enye indlela yokushelelisa, njengokubamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ngenkathi uhudula noma ukuhudula ngenkinobho yesokudla. Ikhasi lekhibhodi lohlelo luyasho ukuthi yiyiphi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkusondeza ngevili:\u003C/strong\u003E ukuskrola ngeminwe emibili ku-trackpad kusondeza ezinhlelweni eziningi. Ukucindezela nakho kuyasondeza lapho uhlelo lukwamukela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:windows,linux\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EWindows or Linux\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuchofoza ngesokudla:\u003C/strong\u003E chofoza ngeminwe emibili, noma chofoza ikhona eliphansi ngakwesokudla se-touchpad. Lokhu kuncike ezilungiselelweni zakho ze-touchpad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuhudula ngenkinobho ephakathi (ukushelelisa):\u003C/strong\u003E inhlelo ngayinye inikeza enye indlela yokushelelisa, njengokubamba \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ngenkathi uhudula noma ukuhudula ngenkinobho yesokudla. Ikhasi lekhibhodi lohlelo luyasho ukuthi yiyiphi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkusondeza ngevili:\u003C/strong\u003E ukuskrola ngeminwe emibili ku-touchpad kusondeza ezinhlelweni eziningi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukubhala-ebhokisini-lombhalo\"\u003EUkubhala ebhokisini lombhalo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELapho ubhala ebhokisini (igama, inothi, ukusesha), izinqamulelo zohlelo zenhlamvu eyodwa zivalwa, ngakho ukubhala &quot;L&quot; kubhala u-L. Cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E noma chofoza emdwebweni ukuze ubuyisele okhiye kuhlelo.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Indlela izinqamulelo ezibhalwa ngayo Usizo lubhala inqamulelo ngayinye ngendlela ikhibhodi yakho eyibiza ngayo. Ukubhalwa Ku-Mac Ku-Windows ne-Linux Ctrl+S Command (⌘) kanye S Ctrl kanye S Ctrl+Shift+F Control (⌃), Shift (⇧) kanye F Ctrl, Shift kanye F Alt+← Option (⌥) kanye ← Alt kanye ← Backspace Inkinobho ye-Delete Backspace Delete fn kanye Delete (ukususa phambili) Delete Enter Return Enter Uphawu lwe-plus kusho ukubamba okhiye ndawonye. \"Bese\" kusho ukucindezela elandelanayo. Izinqamulelo eziningi zohlelo zamukela i-Command noma i-Control ku-Mac, ngakho Ctrl+Z isebenza ngazo zombili izindlela. Ezimbalwa, njengesikrini esigcwele (Ctrl+Shift+F), zisebenzisa ukhiye we-Control kukhompyutha yonke; usizo luyasho lapho lokho kusebenza khona. Okhiye bomsebenzi ku-Mac Ezikhibhodini eziningi ze-Mac umugqa ophezulu ushintsha ukukhanya, ivolumu nemidiya. Ukuze uthumele u-F1 kuya ku-F12: bamba fn (noma ukhiye we-globe) ngenkathi ucindezela okhiye, noma vula System Settings, bese Keyboard, bese Keyboard Shortcuts, bese Function Keys, bese uvula \"Use F1, F2, etc. keys as standard function keys\". Ezinye izinkinobho ze-F zibanjwa ye-macOS ngokwayo (njengesibonelo Mission Control). Uma ukhiye ungenzi lutho ohlelweni, zama ngo-fn, noma sebenzisa inkinobho yebha yamathuluzi esikhundleni salokho. Izinqamulelo isiphequluli esizigcinayo Ikhasi lewebhu alikwazi ukuthatha ezinye izinqamulelo kusiphequluli, noma yini eyenzayo. Kuzo zonke izinhlelo: Ctrl+N, Ctrl+T kanye Ctrl+W njalo ziyavula noma zivale amawindi namathebhu esiphequluli. Izinhlelo zisebenzisa izinkinobho zokuthi Okusha kanye Vala esikhundleni salokho. Ctrl+Q ku-Mac kanye Alt+F4 ku-Windows ziphuma kusiphequluli. Uma unomsebenzi ongalondolozwanga, isiphequluli sibuza kuqala (\"Leave site?\"); khetha ukuhlala, bese ulondoloza. Isikrini esigcwele sesiphequluli (Control-Command-F, noma inkinobho eluhlaza ewindini / F11) sisasebenza. Izinhlelo zinemodi zazo zesikrini ku-Ctrl+Shift+F, ezingafihla namabha ohlelo nazo. Izinkinobho ze-mouse ku-trackpad Izinhlelo zisebenzisa inkinobho yesokudla nenkinobho ephakathi. Uma ungenayo i-mouse enezinkinobho ezintathu: Ukuchofoza ngesokudla: chofoza ngeminwe emibili. Vula \"Secondary click\" ku-System Settings, bese Trackpad, uma ukuchofoza ngeminwe emibili kungenzi lutho. Ukubamba Ctrl ngenkathi uchofoza kuvula imenyu yesiphequluli, kodwa ngaphakathi komdwebo ezinye izinhlelo zilifunda njengokuchofoza okujwayelekile (kuba ukhiye we-Control ubanjiwe), ngakho kungcono ukuchofoza ngeminwe emibili. Ukuhudula ngenkinobho ephakathi (ukushelelisa): inhlelo ngayinye inikeza enye indlela yokushelelisa, njengokubamba Space ngenkathi uhudula noma ukuhudula ngenkinobho yesokudla. Ikhasi lekhibhodi lohlelo luyasho ukuthi yiyiphi. Ukusondeza ngevili: ukuskrola ngeminwe emibili ku-trackpad kusondeza ezinhlelweni eziningi. Ukucindezela nakho kuyasondeza lapho uhlelo lukwamukela. Ukuchofoza ngesokudla: chofoza ngeminwe emibili, noma chofoza ikhona eliphansi ngakwesokudla se-touchpad. Lokhu kuncike ezilungiselelweni zakho ze-touchpad. Ukuhudula ngenkinobho ephakathi (ukushelelisa): inhlelo ngayinye inikeza enye indlela yokushelelisa, njengokubamba Space ngenkathi uhudula noma ukuhudula ngenkinobho yesokudla. Ikhasi lekhibhodi lohlelo luyasho ukuthi yiyiphi. Ukusondeza ngevili: ukuskrola ngeminwe emibili ku-touchpad kusondeza ezinhlelweni eziningi. Ukubhala ebhokisini lombhalo Lapho ubhala ebhokisini (igama, inothi, ukusesha), izinqamulelo zohlelo zenhlamvu eyodwa zivalwa, ngakho ukubhala \"L\" kubhala u-L. Cindezela Esc noma chofoza emdwebweni ukuze ubuyisele okhiye kuhlelo.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"find-tools","scope":"basics","title":"Thola ithuluzi noma isilungiselelo","summary":"Cindezela Ctrl+K bese uthayipha izinhlamvu ezimbalwa ukuze usebenzise noma yiliphi ithuluzi, ushintshe noma yisiphi isilungiselelo noma uvule isihloko sosizo.","section":"start","order":32,"keywords":["thola","sesha","ipaleti yomyalo","vula ngokushesha","sebenzisa umyalo","ctrl k","cmd k","ithuluzi","isilungiselelo","inqamulelo"],"headings":[{"id":"thola-bese-usebenzisa","text":"Thola bese usebenzisa","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-wazi","text":"Okufanele wazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EUhlelo ngalunye linebhokisi lokusesha lamathuluzi alo, izilungiselelo zalo kanye nalolu sizo. Akudingeki wazi ukuthi ithuluzi likuphi ebhareni yamathuluzi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"thola-bese-usebenzisa\"\u003EThola bese usebenzisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, noma khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThola\u003C/span\u003E ebhareni ephezulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBhala izinhlamvu ezimbalwa ozifunayo: &quot;fillet&quot;, &quot;panel text&quot;, &quot;units&quot;. Wonke amagama obhalayo kumele afane, ngakho engeza igama lesibili ukuze unciphise uhlu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze usebenzise okokuqala okufanele, noma uhambe ngezinkinobho zomcibisholo kuqala. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ivala ibhokisi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthuluzi lisebenza sengathi ulichofoze ebhareni yamathuluzi. Isilungiselelo sivula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E kulelo silungiselelo. Isihloko sosizo sivula lapha, ephaneli losizo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-wazi\"\u003EOkufanele wazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOkusetshenziswe ekugcineni kuvela kuqala ngesikhathi esilandelayo, ngakho ithuluzi osebenzisa kaningi lilele ukucindezela okukodwa kukhiye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmathuluzi angasebenzi manje, njengasemva kokuvulwa kwefayela, ayalwa kodwa abonakala emnyama.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmathuluzi ezengeziwe nawo akuhlu, uma sekuvuliwe okwengeziwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Uhlelo ngalunye linebhokisi lokusesha lamathuluzi alo, izilungiselelo zalo kanye nalolu sizo. Akudingeki wazi ukuthi ithuluzi likuphi ebhareni yamathuluzi. Thola bese usebenzisa Cindezela Ctrl+K, noma khetha Thola ebhareni ephezulu. Bhala izinhlamvu ezimbalwa ozifunayo: \"fillet\", \"panel text\", \"units\". Wonke amagama obhalayo kumele afane, ngakho engeza igama lesibili ukuze unciphise uhlu. Cindezela Enter ukuze usebenzise okokuqala okufanele, noma uhambe ngezinkinobho zomcibisholo kuqala. Esc ivala ibhokisi. Ithuluzi lisebenza sengathi ulichofoze ebhareni yamathuluzi. Isilungiselelo sivula Izilungiselelo kulelo silungiselelo. Isihloko sosizo sivula lapha, ephaneli losizo. Okufanele wazi Okusetshenziswe ekugcineni kuvela kuqala ngesikhathi esilandelayo, ngakho ithuluzi osebenzisa kaningi lilele ukucindezela okukodwa kukhiye. Amathuluzi angasebenzi manje, njengasemva kokuvulwa kwefayela, ayalwa kodwa abonakala emnyama. Amathuluzi ezengeziwe nawo akuhlu, uma sekuvuliwe okwengeziwe.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"arrange-panels","scope":"basics","title":"Hlela amaphaneli bese usebenzisa isikrini sesibili","summary":"Faka amaphaneli ohlangothini lwesobunxele, lwesokudla noma ngaphansi, uwabeke phezu kwawanye, uwahlanganise njengamathebhu, uwabambe noma uwafihle, uwantante phezu komdwebo, wenze isakhiwo sihlangane kakhulu, khetha imigqa yethuluzi osebenzisa, noma uwahambise ewindini lawo esikrinini esinye.","section":"start","order":35,"keywords":["amaphaneli","faka","ntanta","hambisa iphaneli","donsa","isakhiwo","amathebhu","eqenjini lethebhu","beka phezulu","bopha","fihla ngokuzenzakalela","fihla iphaneli","vala iphaneli","okuhlangene","ubukhulu besakhiwo","okuhlangene kakhulu","imigqa yebha yamathuluzi","phindisela","umugqa owodwa","imigqa emi-2","imigqa yethuluzi","isikrini sesibili","izikrini ezimbili","isikrini esingaphezulu","iwindi","i-pop-up","setha kabusha isakhiwo"],"headings":[{"id":"hambisa-iphaneli-ewindini","text":"Hambisa iphaneli ewindini","level":2},{"id":"hlanganisa-amaphaneli-njengamathebhu","text":"Hlanganisa amaphaneli njengamathebhu","level":2},{"id":"bopha-fihla-futhi-uyibuyisele","text":"Bopha, fihla futhi uyibuyisele","level":2},{"id":"yenza-isakhiwo-sihlangane-kakhulu","text":"Yenza isakhiwo sihlangane kakhulu","level":2},{"id":"khetha-imigqa-ethuluzi-lisebenzisa","text":"Khetha imigqa ethuluzi lisebenzisa","level":2},{"id":"sebenzisa-ikhibhodi","text":"Sebenzisa ikhibhodi","level":2},{"id":"beka-amaphaneli-esikrinini-sesibili","text":"Beka amaphaneli esikrinini sesibili","level":2},{"id":"amawindi-amaningi-amaphaneli","text":"Amawindi amaningi amaphaneli","level":2},{"id":"ngendlela-efanayo-kuzo-zonke-izingxenye-zesakhiwo","text":"Ngendlela efanayo kuzo zonke izingxenye zesakhiwo","level":2},{"id":"hambisa-ingxoxo","text":"Hambisa ingxoxo","level":2},{"id":"buyisela-amaphaneli","text":"Buyisela amaphaneli","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EAmaphaneli aseceleni komdwebo angahanjiswa. Wabeke lapho akulungele khona, noma uwanike iwindi lawo esikrinini sesibili ukuze umdwebo uthole sonke isikrini sokuqala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIphaneli ngalinye linebha yesihloko: ibha emincane enegama lephaneli, imenyu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E, isikhonkwane nenkinobho yokuvala phezulu kwephaneli. Izinguqulo ezingaphambi kuka-0.7 zinegama nemenyu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E kuphela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hambisa-iphaneli-ewindini\"\u003EHambisa iphaneli ewindini\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDonsa iphaneli ngegama lalo phezulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELapho udonsa, izindawo ezinemigqa zivela ngakwesobunxele, ngakwesokudla nangaphansi komdwebo. Liyeke kwenye yazo ukuze ulifake lapho. Indawo oyiphezu kwayo iyafiphala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELiyeke noma yiphi enye indawo phezu komdwebo ukuze libe ntanta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmaphaneli angabelana ngohlangothi olulodwa: ayabekwa phezulu komunye, futhi umugqa ophakathi kwawo ngamunye ungadonswa ukuze wabelane ngendawo (uma umugqa ugxilile, izinkinobho zomcibisholo ziwuhambisa, nokuchofoza kabili kuwo kwabelana ngendawo ngokulinganayo). Donsa umphetho wangaphakathi wohlangothi olufakiwe ukuze wenze lube banzi noma libe mncane; chofoza kabili umphetho ukuze ubuyisele.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIphaneli elintantayo lihlala phezu komdwebo. Liyihambise ngegama lalo, bese ulungisa usayizi walo ngokudonsa ikhona lalo eliphansi nangakwesokudla (noma ubhodle uye ekhoneni usebenzise izinkinobho zomcibisholo). Chofoza kabili igama lalo ukuze ulifake futhi endaweni yalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDonsa ngomunwe owodwa egameni lephaneli. Donsa ikhona eliphansi nangakwesokudla lephaneli entantayo ngomunwe owodwa ukuze uliguqule usayizi, namaphethelo phakathi kwamaphaneli afakiwe ngendlela efanayo. Ukuze ntanta noma ufake ngaphandle kokudonsa, sebenzisa imenyu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlanganisa-amaphaneli-njengamathebhu\"\u003EHlanganisa amaphaneli njengamathebhu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmaphaneli amabili angabelana ngerempe eyodwa futhi abonise eyodwa ngesikhathi. Donsa iphaneli ngegama lalo uliyise phezu kwebha yesihloko yephaneli elinye (ibha inemigqa lapho useduze kwayo) bese uyeka: manje irempe linethebhu yephaneli ngalinye, ebhalweni yesihloko. Chofoza ithebhu ukuze ubonise leyo phaneli. Uma ithebhu igxilile, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ashintsha amathebhu, futhi \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ←\"\u003Efn ←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EHome\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn →\"\u003Efn →\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnd\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E aya kowokuqala nowokugcina.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze uphume iphaneli eqenjini, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhuma eqenjini lethebhu\u003C/span\u003E kumenyu yalo ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E, noma uyidonse iye kwenye indawo. Khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlanganisa ngethebhu ne\u003C/span\u003E negama lephaneli ukuze uwahlanganise ngaphandle kokudonsa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bopha-fihla-futhi-uyibuyisele\"\u003EBopha, fihla futhi uyibuyisele\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsikhonkwane esebhalweni yesihloko yephaneli simenza libe \u003Cstrong\u003Elifihla ngokuzenzakalela\u003C/strong\u003E: iphaneli liphuma endaweni yalo ifakwe, libe ithebhu encane kuleyo mphetho. Yelekelela ithebhu, uyigxilisele noma uyichofoze, bese iphaneli liphuma liye phezu komdwebo; hambela eceleni (noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) bese libuyela ngasemuva. Cindezela isikhonkwane futhi, noma khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhipha isikhonkwane\u003C/span\u003E, ukuze ulifake ngokuphelele.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInkinobho yokuvala, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFihla lo phaneli\u003C/span\u003E emenyuwini, ifihla iphaneli ibuye ivale indawo yalo efakiwe. Ithebhu enemigqa ephukile ngaleyo mphetho iyibuyisa: chofoza kuyo, noma ugxilise bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yenza-isakhiwo-sihlangane-kakhulu\"\u003EYenza isakhiwo sihlangane kakhulu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkujwayelekile\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUbukhulu besakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E unezinketho ezimbili. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkulula\u003C/span\u003E yisimo esizenzakalelayo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkuhlangene\u003C/span\u003E unciphisa ukuphakama kwemigqa, ukuhlanganiswa kwephaneli, izinkinobho zethuluzi nombhalo wephaneli walolo hlelo ukuze kufake okwengeziwe esikrinini. Igcinwa ngohlelo ngalunye. Isikrini sokuthinta sigcina izinkinobho zaso ezinkulu kokubili, nefoni igcina isakhiwo sayo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESetha kabusha isakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E ishiya ubukhulu obuwukhethile.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khetha-imigqa-ethuluzi-lisebenzisa\"\u003EKhetha imigqa ethuluzi lisebenzisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkujwayelekile\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImigqa yebha yamathuluzi\u003C/span\u003E unezinketho ezintathu. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhindisela emugqeni olandelayo\u003C/span\u003E yisimo esizenzakalelayo: wonke amaqembu ethuluzi ayabonakala, emigqeni eminingi njengoba kudingeka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImigqa emi-2\u003C/span\u003E igcina ithuluzi ngemigqa emibili, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmugqa owodwa\u003C/span\u003E ibe umugqa owodwa, ukuze umdwebo uthole ubude; amaqembu angafaneli ahamba ecaleni ngaphakathi kwethuluzi (sebenzisa ivili le-mouse, ukuswayiphela ngeminwe emibili, noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ufike kwethuluzi). Ithuluzi elisevele lifaneleka ezigabeni ezimbili lihlala njengoba linjalo ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImigqa emi-2\u003C/span\u003E, ngoba igridi izonenza ilule kakhulu kuphela. Ukukhetha kugcinwa ngohlelo ngalunye. Isikrini sokuthinta nefoni zigcina isakhiwo sazo. I-CadCraft inezilungiselelo zayo zethuluzi layo, ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sebenzisa-ikhibhodi\"\u003ESebenzisa ikhibhodi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInkinobho ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E yalo lonke iphaneli ivula imenyu: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaka ngakwesobunxele\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaka ngakwesokudla\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaka ngaphansi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENtanta phezu komdwebo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBopha emphethweni\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFihla lo phaneli\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlanganisa ngethebhu ne\u003C/span\u003E elinye iphaneli, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa uye kwewindi elisha\u003C/span\u003E nakwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYibuyisele\u003C/span\u003E. Gxilisela kwinkinobho, cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, hambisa ngezinkinobho zomcibisholo bese ucindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E futhi. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ivala imenyu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beka-amaphaneli-esikrinini-sesibili\"\u003EBeka amaphaneli esikrinini sesibili\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E kwiphaneli, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa wonke amaphaneli kuwindi elisha\u003C/span\u003E. Ungakhetha futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa amaphaneli ewindini elisha\u003C/span\u003E ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIwindi elincane livula linamaphaneli kuwo. Lidonse esikrinini sakho sesibili bese ulenza likhule njengoba ufisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQhubeka usebenza: amaphaneli asebenza komdwebo njengakuqala, nomdwebo ugcwalisa iwindi elikhulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzinqamuleli zisasebenza uma iwindi lamaphaneli liphambili: izinkinobho ocindezela zona lapho, ngaphandle kokubhala kubhokisi, ziya komdwebo. Imibuzo nezingxoxo ohlelo oluzibuzayo zisavula ewindini elikhulu, ngakho bheka khona lapho okuvela khona. Itimu nobukhulu bombhalo wephaneli kulandela iwindi elikhulu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-Chrome ne-Edge zingabeka iwindi esikrinini esinye ngawe. Uma kuxhunyiwe isikrini sesibili, khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYibeke esikrinini sami sesibili\u003C/span\u003E kwiwindi lamaphaneli (noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBeka amaphaneli esikrinini sami sesibili\u003C/span\u003E kumenyu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E yephaneli). Isiphequluli sibuza kanye ukuthi lesi sayithi singabona yini izikrini zakho; uma uvumela, iwindi lamaphaneli livula kuleso sikrini njalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:firefox,safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EFirefox or Safari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDonsa iwindi lamaphaneli kwesinye isikrini ngokwakho. Livula endaweni efanayo nangosayizi ofanayo ngesikhathi esilandelayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amawindi-amaningi-amaphaneli\"\u003EAmawindi amaningi amaphaneli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIphaneli ngalinye lingaba neliwindi lalo: kuya kumawindi amane amaphaneli, isibonelo elilodwa ngesikrini ngasinye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKumenyu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E yephaneli, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa uye kwewindi elisha\u003C/span\u003E livula iwindi elihlukile lalelo phaneli, futhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa kwiwindi lamaphaneli 2\u003C/span\u003E (njalo) iyihambisela kwelivuliwe. Iwindi lesibili libizwa ngokuthi &quot;panels 2&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDonsa iphaneli ngegama lalo kusuka kwelinye iwindi uye kwelinye: liyeke phezu kwewindi elikhulu ukuze liyifake lapho (izindawo ezinemigqa zivela lapho useduze kwazo) noma ukuze libe ntanta, nephezu kwelinye iwindi lamaphaneli ukuze lihanjiswe kulo. Liyeke noma yiphi enye indawo bese lihlala lapho lalikhona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIwindi lamaphaneli elingasekho namaphaneli livala lodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENgemva kokulayisha kabusha, uhlelo luphinda luhlinze amawindi akho amaphaneli. Iziphequluli zivula iwindi elilodwa ngokuchofoza ngakunye, ngakho khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula okulandelayo\u003C/span\u003E kanye ngalowo wewindi ngalinye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ngendlela-efanayo-kuzo-zonke-izingxenye-zesakhiwo\"\u003ENgendlela efanayo kuzo zonke izingxenye zesakhiwo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIribhoni, ibhokisi lamathuluzi, imigqa yamathuluzi nebha yesimo ziphuma ziye kwiwindi lazo ngendlela efanayo nephaneli: vula imenyu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E kwingxenye bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa uye kwewindi elisha\u003C/span\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYibuyisele\u003C/span\u003E (noma ukuvala iwindi) iyibuyisela ekhaya. Izinkinobho ocindezela zona kulelo windi ziyafinyelela kuhlelo, njengakwiwindi lamaphaneli. Ingxenye ngayinye inemenyu enjalo eyodwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hambisa-ingxoxo\"\u003EHambisa ingxoxo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYonke ingxoxo ingahanjiswa ukuze ingavimbi komdwebo: cindezela bese udonsa ibha yesihloko sayo. Ingxoxo ikhumbula lapho uyishiye khona, ingxoxo ngayinye ngokwayo, futhi ibuyela kuleyo ndawo ngesikhathi esilandelayo evulwa ngalo. Chofoza kabili ibha yesihloko ukuze uyibuyisele maphakathi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkusuka ekhibhodini, cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+inkinobho yomcibisholo ugxile ngaphakathi kwengxoxo ukuze uyihambise ngamapheseli ayi-16 ngesikhathi; engeza \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ukuze uthole ayi-64. Ingxoxo esuka esikrinini (ngemva kwewindi noma isikrini esincane) iyabuyiswa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEfonini, izingxoxo zihlala zingamashidi agcwele ububanzi futhi azihanjiswa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu-CadCraft Studio, ingxoxo ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhrinta ku-PDF\u003C/span\u003E ye-CadCraft, oyingenela ukuthi uyigcine ivulekile ngesikhathi usebenza, inenkinobho ebhalweni yayo yesihloko, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula ngewindi layo\u003C/span\u003E. Ingxoxo ihamba ibe iwindi layo elihlukile elingabekwa kwesinye isikrini. Ukuvala ingxoxo kuvala iwindi, nokuvala iwindi kuvala ingxoxo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"buyisela-amaphaneli\"\u003EBuyisela amaphaneli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuyisela amaphaneli\u003C/span\u003E kwiwindi lamaphaneli, noma uvale kuphela. Amaphaneli abuyela lapho ayekhona khona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuvala noma ukulayisha kabusha iwindi elikhulu nakho kuvala iwindi lamaphaneli. Uma uhlelo lusivulwa futhi lithi amaphaneli akho ayewindini layo; khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula\u003C/span\u003E ukuze ubuyisele iwindi, noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGcina lapha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkujwayelekile\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESetha kabusha isakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E ibuyisela wonke amaphaneli endaweni ayeqale kuyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma akukho okuvulayo lapho uhambisa amaphaneli kuwindi elisha, isiphequluli sivimbe i-pop-up. Uhlelo luyasho lokho futhi ligcine amaphaneli lapho ayekhona khona. Vumela ama-pop-up ye-getcadcraft.com, bese uzama futhi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsakhiwo sigcinwa ngohlelo ngalunye kulo isiphequluli, kanye nezinye izilungiselelo zakho.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Amaphaneli aseceleni komdwebo angahanjiswa. Wabeke lapho akulungele khona, noma uwanike iwindi lawo esikrinini sesibili ukuze umdwebo uthole sonke isikrini sokuqala. Iphaneli ngalinye linebha yesihloko: ibha emincane enegama lephaneli, imenyu ye-⋯, isikhonkwane nenkinobho yokuvala phezulu kwephaneli. Izinguqulo ezingaphambi kuka-0.7 zinegama nemenyu ye-⋯ kuphela. Hambisa iphaneli ewindini Donsa iphaneli ngegama lalo phezulu. Lapho udonsa, izindawo ezinemigqa zivela ngakwesobunxele, ngakwesokudla nangaphansi komdwebo. Liyeke kwenye yazo ukuze ulifake lapho. Indawo oyiphezu kwayo iyafiphala. Liyeke noma yiphi enye indawo phezu komdwebo ukuze libe ntanta. Amaphaneli angabelana ngohlangothi olulodwa: ayabekwa phezulu komunye, futhi umugqa ophakathi kwawo ngamunye ungadonswa ukuze wabelane ngendawo (uma umugqa ugxilile, izinkinobho zomcibisholo ziwuhambisa, nokuchofoza kabili kuwo kwabelana ngendawo ngokulinganayo). Donsa umphetho wangaphakathi wohlangothi olufakiwe ukuze wenze lube banzi noma libe mncane; chofoza kabili umphetho ukuze ubuyisele. Iphaneli elintantayo lihlala phezu komdwebo. Liyihambise ngegama lalo, bese ulungisa usayizi walo ngokudonsa ikhona lalo eliphansi nangakwesokudla (noma ubhodle uye ekhoneni usebenzise izinkinobho zomcibisholo). Chofoza kabili igama lalo ukuze ulifake futhi endaweni yalo. Donsa ngomunwe owodwa egameni lephaneli. Donsa ikhona eliphansi nangakwesokudla lephaneli entantayo ngomunwe owodwa ukuze uliguqule usayizi, namaphethelo phakathi kwamaphaneli afakiwe ngendlela efanayo. Ukuze ntanta noma ufake ngaphandle kokudonsa, sebenzisa imenyu ye-⋯. Hlanganisa amaphaneli njengamathebhu Amaphaneli amabili angabelana ngerempe eyodwa futhi abonise eyodwa ngesikhathi. Donsa iphaneli ngegama lalo uliyise phezu kwebha yesihloko yephaneli elinye (ibha inemigqa lapho useduze kwayo) bese uyeka: manje irempe linethebhu yephaneli ngalinye, ebhalweni yesihloko. Chofoza ithebhu ukuze ubonise leyo phaneli. Uma ithebhu igxilile, ← no-→ ashintsha amathebhu, futhi Home no-End aya kowokuqala nowokugcina. Ukuze uphume iphaneli eqenjini, khetha Phuma eqenjini lethebhu kumenyu yalo ye-⋯, noma uyidonse iye kwenye indawo. Khetha Hlanganisa ngethebhu ne negama lephaneli ukuze uwahlanganise ngaphandle kokudonsa. Bopha, fihla futhi uyibuyisele Isikhonkwane esebhalweni yesihloko yephaneli simenza libe lifihla ngokuzenzakalela: iphaneli liphuma endaweni yalo ifakwe, libe ithebhu encane kuleyo mphetho. Yelekelela ithebhu, uyigxilisele noma uyichofoze, bese iphaneli liphuma liye phezu komdwebo; hambela eceleni (noma cindezela Esc) bese libuyela ngasemuva. Cindezela isikhonkwane futhi, noma khetha Khipha isikhonkwane, ukuze ulifake ngokuphelele. Inkinobho yokuvala, noma Fihla lo phaneli emenyuwini, ifihla iphaneli ibuye ivale indawo yalo efakiwe. Ithebhu enemigqa ephukile ngaleyo mphetho iyibuyisa: chofoza kuyo, noma ugxilise bese ucindezela Enter. Yenza isakhiwo sihlangane kakhulu Izilungiselelo › Okujwayelekile › Ubukhulu besakhiwo unezinketho ezimbili. Okulula yisimo esizenzakalelayo. Okuhlangene unciphisa ukuphakama kwemigqa, ukuhlanganiswa kwephaneli, izinkinobho zethuluzi nombhalo wephaneli walolo hlelo ukuze kufake okwengeziwe esikrinini. Igcinwa ngohlelo ngalunye. Isikrini sokuthinta sigcina izinkinobho zaso ezinkulu kokubili, nefoni igcina isakhiwo sayo. Setha kabusha isakhiwo ishiya ubukhulu obuwukhethile. Khetha imigqa ethuluzi lisebenzisa Izilungiselelo › Okujwayelekile › Imigqa yebha yamathuluzi unezinketho ezintathu. Phindisela emugqeni olandelayo yisimo esizenzakalelayo: wonke amaqembu ethuluzi ayabonakala, emigqeni eminingi njengoba kudingeka. Imigqa emi-2 igcina ithuluzi ngemigqa emibili, Umugqa owodwa ibe umugqa owodwa, ukuze umdwebo uthole ubude; amaqembu angafaneli ahamba ecaleni ngaphakathi kwethuluzi (sebenzisa ivili le-mouse, ukuswayiphela ngeminwe emibili, noma Tab ufike kwethuluzi). Ithuluzi elisevele lifaneleka ezigabeni ezimbili lihlala njengoba linjalo ngaphansi kwe-Imigqa emi-2, ngoba igridi izonenza ilule kakhulu kuphela. Ukukhetha kugcinwa ngohlelo ngalunye. Isikrini sokuthinta nefoni zigcina isakhiwo sazo. I-CadCraft inezilungiselelo zayo zethuluzi layo, ngaphansi kwe-Izilungiselelo › CadCraft. Sebenzisa ikhibhodi Inkinobho ye-⋯ yalo lonke iphaneli ivula imenyu: Faka ngakwesobunxele, Faka ngakwesokudla, Faka ngaphansi, Ntanta phezu komdwebo, Bopha emphethweni, Fihla lo phaneli, Hlanganisa ngethebhu ne elinye iphaneli, Hambisa uye kwewindi elisha nakwe-Yibuyisele. Gxilisela kwinkinobho, cindezela Enter, hambisa ngezinkinobho zomcibisholo bese ucindezela Enter futhi. Esc ivala imenyu. Beka amaphaneli esikrinini sesibili Khetha ⋯ kwiphaneli, bese Hambisa wonke amaphaneli kuwindi elisha. Ungakhetha futhi Hambisa amaphaneli ewindini elisha ku-Izilungiselelo. Iwindi elincane livula linamaphaneli kuwo. Lidonse esikrinini sakho sesibili bese ulenza likhule njengoba ufisa. Qhubeka usebenza: amaphaneli asebenza komdwebo njengakuqala, nomdwebo ugcwalisa iwindi elikhulu. Izinqamuleli zisasebenza uma iwindi lamaphaneli liphambili: izinkinobho ocindezela zona lapho, ngaphandle kokubhala kubhokisi, ziya komdwebo. Imibuzo nezingxoxo ohlelo oluzibuzayo zisavula ewindini elikhulu, ngakho bheka khona lapho okuvela khona. Itimu nobukhulu bombhalo wephaneli kulandela iwindi elikhulu. I-Chrome ne-Edge zingabeka iwindi esikrinini esinye ngawe. Uma kuxhunyiwe isikrini sesibili, khetha Yibeke esikrinini sami sesibili kwiwindi lamaphaneli (noma Beka amaphaneli esikrinini sami sesibili kumenyu ye-⋯ yephaneli). Isiphequluli sibuza kanye ukuthi lesi sayithi singabona yini izikrini zakho; uma uvumela, iwindi lamaphaneli livula kuleso sikrini njalo. Donsa iwindi lamaphaneli kwesinye isikrini ngokwakho. Livula endaweni efanayo nangosayizi ofanayo ngesikhathi esilandelayo. Amawindi amaningi amaphaneli Iphaneli ngalinye lingaba neliwindi lalo: kuya kumawindi amane amaphaneli, isibonelo elilodwa ngesikrini ngasinye. Kumenyu ye-⋯ yephaneli, Hambisa uye kwewindi elisha livula iwindi elihlukile lalelo phaneli, futhi Hambisa kwiwindi lamaphaneli 2 (njalo) iyihambisela kwelivuliwe. Iwindi lesibili libizwa ngokuthi \"panels 2\". Donsa iphaneli ngegama lalo kusuka kwelinye iwindi uye kwelinye: liyeke phezu kwewindi elikhulu ukuze liyifake lapho (izindawo ezinemigqa zivela lapho useduze kwazo) noma ukuze libe ntanta, nephezu kwelinye iwindi lamaphaneli ukuze lihanjiswe kulo. Liyeke noma yiphi enye indawo bese lihlala lapho lalikhona. Iwindi lamaphaneli elingasekho namaphaneli livala lodwa. Ngemva kokulayisha kabusha, uhlelo luphinda luhlinze amawindi akho amaphaneli. Iziphequluli zivula iwindi elilodwa ngokuchofoza ngakunye, ngakho khetha Vula okulandelayo kanye ngalowo wewindi ngalinye. Ngendlela efanayo kuzo zonke izingxenye zesakhiwo Iribhoni, ibhokisi lamathuluzi, imigqa yamathuluzi nebha yesimo ziphuma ziye kwiwindi lazo ngendlela efanayo nephaneli: vula imenyu ye-⋯ kwingxenye bese ukhetha Hambisa uye kwewindi elisha; Yibuyisele (noma ukuvala iwindi) iyibuyisela ekhaya. Izinkinobho ocindezela zona kulelo windi ziyafinyelela kuhlelo, njengakwiwindi lamaphaneli. Ingxenye ngayinye inemenyu enjalo eyodwa. Hambisa ingxoxo Yonke ingxoxo ingahanjiswa ukuze ingavimbi komdwebo: cindezela bese udonsa ibha yesihloko sayo. Ingxoxo ikhumbula lapho uyishiye khona, ingxoxo ngayinye ngokwayo, futhi ibuyela kuleyo ndawo ngesikhathi esilandelayo evulwa ngalo. Chofoza kabili ibha yesihloko ukuze uyibuyisele maphakathi. Ukusuka ekhibhodini, cindezela Alt+Shift+inkinobho yomcibisholo ugxile ngaphakathi kwengxoxo ukuze uyihambise ngamapheseli ayi-16 ngesikhathi; engeza Ctrl ukuze uthole ayi-64. Ingxoxo esuka esikrinini (ngemva kwewindi noma isikrini esincane) iyabuyiswa. Efonini, izingxoxo zihlala zingamashidi agcwele ububanzi futhi azihanjiswa. Ku-CadCraft Studio, ingxoxo ye-Phrinta ku-PDF ye-CadCraft, oyingenela ukuthi uyigcine ivulekile ngesikhathi usebenza, inenkinobho ebhalweni yayo yesihloko, Vula ngewindi layo. Ingxoxo ihamba ibe iwindi layo elihlukile elingabekwa kwesinye isikrini. Ukuvala ingxoxo kuvala iwindi, nokuvala iwindi kuvala ingxoxo. Buyisela amaphaneli Khetha Buyisela amaphaneli kwiwindi lamaphaneli, noma uvale kuphela. Amaphaneli abuyela lapho ayekhona khona. Ukuvala noma ukulayisha kabusha iwindi elikhulu nakho kuvala iwindi lamaphaneli. Uma uhlelo lusivulwa futhi lithi amaphaneli akho ayewindini layo; khetha Vula ukuze ubuyisele iwindi, noma Gcina lapha. Izilungiselelo › Okujwayelekile › Setha kabusha isakhiwo ibuyisela wonke amaphaneli endaweni ayeqale kuyo. Uma akukho okuvulayo lapho uhambisa amaphaneli kuwindi elisha, isiphequluli sivimbe i-pop-up. Uhlelo luyasho lokho futhi ligcine amaphaneli lapho ayekhona khona. Vumela ama-pop-up ye-getcadcraft.com, bese uzama futhi. Isakhiwo sigcinwa ngohlelo ngalunye kulo isiphequluli, kanye nezinye izilungiselelo zakho.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"dock-tool-groups","scope":"basics","title":"Dock a group of tools beside the drawing, and bring your windows back","summary":"Turn a ribbon group, a tool-row group or a toolbox group into a palette in a side panel or a column of the drawing, with tabs and collapse, and put it back; every bar has the same grip and close; the windows you tore off come back in one click.","section":"start","order":36,"keywords":["dock","palette","ribbon group","tool group","toolbox group","tool rows","side panel","tabs","collapse","grip","handle","drag","close","open in a window","restore my windows","second monitor","two screens","remembered windows"],"headings":[{"id":"the-grip-and-the-close-button","text":"The grip and the close button","level":2},{"id":"dock-a-group-as-a-palette","text":"Dock a group as a palette","level":2},{"id":"put-it-back","text":"Put it back","level":2},{"id":"arrange-mode","text":"Arrange mode","level":2},{"id":"float-a-group-over-the-drawing","text":"Float a group over the drawing","level":2},{"id":"pin","text":"Pin","level":2},{"id":"close-a-group","text":"Close a group","level":2},{"id":"your-windows-next-time","text":"Your windows, next time","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E&lt;!-- SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 --&gt; &lt;!-- DRAFT (session ui-dock2-10, 2026-11-15). Not in assets/help/: what it describes shows only with the owner&#039;s switch (html[data-cc-ws-edit=&quot;1&quot;]). Move it to assets/help/common/ and run php bin/build-help.php &lt;app&gt; for the eight apps in the same step that turns the switch on; other languages are lang-10&#039;s. --&gt;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn a layout with a ribbon, tool rows or a toolbox, any group of tools can leave its bar and become a palette at the side, as a column of tools.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-grip-and-the-close-button\"\u003EThe grip and the close button\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEvery bar that can move has the same head: a grip \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⠿\u003C/span\u003E at the far left and a close button \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E×\u003C/span\u003E at the far right. Click the grip for its menu: \u003Cstrong\u003EOpen in a window\u003C/strong\u003E, the bar&#039;s own choices (such as \u003Cstrong\u003ECollapse the ribbon\u003C/strong\u003E) and \u003Cstrong\u003EHide\u003C/strong\u003E. You can also right-click the head.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach group of tools has a small grip at the left of its name.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dock-a-group-as-a-palette\"\u003EDock a group as a palette\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDrag the group&#039;s grip. Outlined areas appear: the left panel, the right panel, and the drawing&#039;s left and right columns.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDrop the group on one of them. Its tools now stand in a column there, under a head with the group&#039;s name.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOr click the grip and pick \u003Cstrong\u003EDock to\u003C/strong\u003E and a place.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETwo groups in the same place become tabs. The \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E button folds the palette to its head and opens it again.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"put-it-back\"\u003EPut it back\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EClick the palette&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E×\u003C/span\u003E, pick \u003Cstrong\u003EPut it back\u003C/strong\u003E in its grip menu, or drag its grip onto the bar it came from. The group goes back to its place in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhere you docked each group is remembered for this app and this layout.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"arrange-mode\"\u003EArrange mode\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhile you arrange the layout (Settings › Layout › Arrange), the places where a group can dock are outlined. Drag a group&#039;s grip onto one: it becomes a palette there, and a second group dropped on the same place joins it as a tab.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"float-a-group-over-the-drawing\"\u003EFloat a group over the drawing\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPick \u003Cstrong\u003EFloat on the drawing\u003C/strong\u003E in a group&#039;s grip menu, or drag the grip onto the drawing where no place is outlined. The palette floats there; drag its grip to move it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pin\"\u003EPin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPin\u003C/strong\u003E in a grip menu keeps that bar or palette where it is: it cannot be dragged, closed or hidden, and a pinned ribbon stays unfolded. \u003Cstrong\u003EUnpin\u003C/strong\u003E gives it all back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"close-a-group\"\u003EClose a group\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach ribbon group has a \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E×\u003C/span\u003E at the right of its name, and every group&#039;s grip menu has \u003Cstrong\u003EClose\u003C/strong\u003E. The group leaves its bar; the bar&#039;s own grip menu lists it as \u003Cstrong\u003EShow … again\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-windows-next-time\"\u003EYour windows, next time\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA bar you moved to its own window remembers where that window was, and on which screen, for this app and layout. When you open the app again, a note offers \u003Cstrong\u003ERestore my windows\u003C/strong\u003E: one click opens them where they were. A browser may open only one window per click; if one stays closed, click \u003Cstrong\u003ERestore my windows\u003C/strong\u003E again. \u003Cstrong\u003EKeep them here\u003C/strong\u003E forgets them.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"\u003C!-- SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 --\u003E \u003C!-- DRAFT (session ui-dock2-10, 2026-11-15). Not in assets/help/: what it describes shows only with the owner's switch (html[data-cc-ws-edit=\"1\"]). Move it to assets/help/common/ and run php bin/build-help.php \u003Capp\u003E for the eight apps in the same step that turns the switch on; other languages are lang-10's. --\u003E In a layout with a ribbon, tool rows or a toolbox, any group of tools can leave its bar and become a palette at the side, as a column of tools. The grip and the close button Every bar that can move has the same head: a grip ⠿ at the far left and a close button × at the far right. Click the grip for its menu: Open in a window, the bar's own choices (such as Collapse the ribbon) and Hide. You can also right-click the head. Each group of tools has a small grip at the left of its name. Dock a group as a palette Drag the group's grip. Outlined areas appear: the left panel, the right panel, and the drawing's left and right columns. Drop the group on one of them. Its tools now stand in a column there, under a head with the group's name. Or click the grip and pick Dock to and a place. Two groups in the same place become tabs. The ⌃ button folds the palette to its head and opens it again. Put it back Click the palette's ×, pick Put it back in its grip menu, or drag its grip onto the bar it came from. The group goes back to its place in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox. Where you docked each group is remembered for this app and this layout. Arrange mode While you arrange the layout (Settings › Layout › Arrange), the places where a group can dock are outlined. Drag a group's grip onto one: it becomes a palette there, and a second group dropped on the same place joins it as a tab. Float a group over the drawing Pick Float on the drawing in a group's grip menu, or drag the grip onto the drawing where no place is outlined. The palette floats there; drag its grip to move it. Pin Pin in a grip menu keeps that bar or palette where it is: it cannot be dragged, closed or hidden, and a pinned ribbon stays unfolded. Unpin gives it all back. Close a group Each ribbon group has a × at the right of its name, and every group's grip menu has Close. The group leaves its bar; the bar's own grip menu lists it as Show … again. Your windows, next time A bar you moved to its own window remembers where that window was, and on which screen, for this app and layout. When you open the app again, a note offers Restore my windows: one click opens them where they were. A browser may open only one window per click; if one stays closed, click Restore my windows again. Keep them here forgets them.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"interface-styles","scope":"basics","title":"Pick an interface style","summary":"Choose how the toolbar, panels and tabs are arranged, see what a style leaves out in your app, keep one style for every app or one for a single app, and export or import a style file.","section":"start","order":36,"keywords":["interface style","style","layout","workspace","ribbon","toolbox","drafting","multi-view","sketch","vector","duncan","classic","per app","import","export","ccworkspace","arrange","my tools","settings"],"headings":[{"id":"pick-a-style","text":"Pick a style","level":2},{"id":"see-what-a-style-leaves-out","text":"See what a style leaves out","level":2},{"id":"one-style-for-every-app-or-one-for-this-app","text":"One style for every app, or one for this app","level":2},{"id":"arrange-your-own","text":"Arrange your own","level":2},{"id":"export-and-import-a-style","text":"Export and import a style","level":2},{"id":"if-a-style-does-not-work","text":"If a style does not work","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EAn interface style is one arrangement of the toolbar, the panels, the tabs and the command line. Pick the one you are used to and the app opens in it. Your tools, menus and keys do not change; only where they sit does.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pick-a-style\"\u003EPick a style\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) and choose the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E tab.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInterface style\u003C/span\u003E choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPick a style\u003C/span\u003E. The list shows each style with a line that says how it is arranged.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose one. The window changes at once. The first choice, the app&#039;s classic style, is the arrangement the app started with.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe styles are \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrafting\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMulti-view\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESketch\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVector\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDuncan\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERibbon and project browser\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbox and info box\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAutoRev\u003C/span\u003E and the four \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPRO-cad1 Ribbon\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPRO-cad2 Workbench\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPRO-cad3 Review\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPRO-cad4 Studio\u003C/span\u003E styles. Styles that come from an add-on or from a file you imported are listed under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom add-ons and files\u003C/span\u003E. Which of these you see depends on the app and on the build: a style the app cannot use is not offered.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis page describes the picker as it stands in the lab build. Some of the styles are still being finished; a style that looks incomplete in your build is one of those.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"see-what-a-style-leaves-out\"\u003ESee what a style leaves out\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn app is not the same as every other app. A style may ask for a ribbon, a tool column, view tabs, several views side by side or a 3D view cube, and your app may have none of those. Under the picker \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E says what the chosen style leaves out in this app, for example: &quot;In this app this style leaves out: the ribbon (this app has none).&quot; It also counts tools and commands the style names that the app does not have. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMulti-view\u003C/span\u003E splits the drawing area into Top, Front, Right and Perspective views, which needs an app with a 3D model; in an app with one view at a time it keeps that one view.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"one-style-for-every-app-or-one-for-this-app\"\u003EOne style for every app, or one for this app\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe style you pick is used in every app that has it; an app that does not have it keeps its own layout. To give just this app a different style, tick \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse a different interface style for\u003C/span\u003E this app. Unticked, the app follows your choice for all apps.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn the lab (the version for testing) the choice under the picker reads \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThis app\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEvery app\u003C/span\u003E, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThis app\u003C/span\u003E is the start: the style you pick is kept for the app you are in, and the other apps keep theirs. Choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEvery app\u003C/span\u003E to make this app follow the style you pick for every app; choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThis app\u003C/span\u003E again and the style in use becomes this app&#039;s own. Each app opens in its own style straight away, before the page draws.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"arrange-your-own\"\u003EArrange your own\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArrange your own interface style…\u003C/span\u003E opens a list of choices for where each part goes: the commands as a ribbon or the app&#039;s toolbar, what is on the left and the right, the tabs, a status bar, an info box or quick bar, the edit palette by the pointer and the look of tabs and button outlines. Only parts the app has are offered. The result is saved as \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMy layout\u003C/span\u003E (or the name you type), works in every app that has layouts, and its panels still dock, float and move to their own window (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EArrange the panels\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn a style that has the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMy tools\u003C/span\u003E slots, right-click a tool and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd to My tools\u003C/span\u003E, or drag it to an empty slot. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEmpty this slot\u003C/span\u003E clears one.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"export-and-import-a-style\"\u003EExport and import a style\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport this interface style\u003C/span\u003E saves the style as a \u003Ccode\u003E.ccworkspace.json\u003C/code\u003E file. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport an interface style…\u003C/span\u003E reads one, or drop the file on the box. The file holds layout data only and is read as untrusted: it can arrange the app&#039;s own blocks and cannot run anything. A file that is larger than 64 kB, made for a newer version, or has no name or blocks is refused, and the message says why. Up to eight imported styles are kept; remove one before adding a ninth. An imported style appears under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom add-ons and files\u003C/span\u003E; pick it there.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-a-style-does-not-work\"\u003EIf a style does not work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIf a style cannot be used in this app, the app shows its classic layout and says so.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFinish or cancel the running command first: a style cannot change while a tool is running.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETo go back at any time, choose the classic style again in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"An interface style is one arrangement of the toolbar, the panels, the tabs and the command line. Pick the one you are used to and the app opens in it. Your tools, menus and keys do not change; only where they sit does. Pick a style Open Settings (the gear, or Ctrl+,) and choose the Global tab. Under Interface style choose Pick a style. The list shows each style with a line that says how it is arranged. Choose one. The window changes at once. The first choice, the app's classic style, is the arrangement the app started with. The styles are Drafting, Multi-view, Sketch, Vector, Duncan, Ribbon and project browser, Toolbox and info box, AutoRev and the four PRO-cad1 Ribbon, PRO-cad2 Workbench, PRO-cad3 Review and PRO-cad4 Studio styles. Styles that come from an add-on or from a file you imported are listed under From add-ons and files. Which of these you see depends on the app and on the build: a style the app cannot use is not offered. This page describes the picker as it stands in the lab build. Some of the styles are still being finished; a style that looks incomplete in your build is one of those. See what a style leaves out An app is not the same as every other app. A style may ask for a ribbon, a tool column, view tabs, several views side by side or a 3D view cube, and your app may have none of those. Under the picker Settings says what the chosen style leaves out in this app, for example: \"In this app this style leaves out: the ribbon (this app has none).\" It also counts tools and commands the style names that the app does not have. Multi-view splits the drawing area into Top, Front, Right and Perspective views, which needs an app with a 3D model; in an app with one view at a time it keeps that one view. One style for every app, or one for this app The style you pick is used in every app that has it; an app that does not have it keeps its own layout. To give just this app a different style, tick Use a different interface style for this app. Unticked, the app follows your choice for all apps. In the lab (the version for testing) the choice under the picker reads This app or Every app, and This app is the start: the style you pick is kept for the app you are in, and the other apps keep theirs. Choose Every app to make this app follow the style you pick for every app; choose This app again and the style in use becomes this app's own. Each app opens in its own style straight away, before the page draws. Arrange your own Arrange your own interface style… opens a list of choices for where each part goes: the commands as a ribbon or the app's toolbar, what is on the left and the right, the tabs, a status bar, an info box or quick bar, the edit palette by the pointer and the look of tabs and button outlines. Only parts the app has are offered. The result is saved as My layout (or the name you type), works in every app that has layouts, and its panels still dock, float and move to their own window (Arrange the panels). In a style that has the My tools slots, right-click a tool and choose Add to My tools, or drag it to an empty slot. Empty this slot clears one. Export and import a style Export this interface style saves the style as a .ccworkspace.json file. Import an interface style… reads one, or drop the file on the box. The file holds layout data only and is read as untrusted: it can arrange the app's own blocks and cannot run anything. A file that is larger than 64 kB, made for a newer version, or has no name or blocks is refused, and the message says why. Up to eight imported styles are kept; remove one before adding a ninth. An imported style appears under From add-ons and files; pick it there. If a style does not work If a style cannot be used in this app, the app shows its classic layout and says so. Finish or cancel the running command first: a style cannot change while a tool is running. To go back at any time, choose the classic style again in Settings.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"layout-ribbon","scope":"basics","title":"Sebenza ngesakhiwo seribhoni nesiphequluli sephrojekthi","summary":"Shintsha uhlelo lube seribhoni yamathebhu phezu komdwebo, ne-Properties nesiphequluli sephrojekthi ngakwesobunxele kanye nethebhu ngayinye yokubuka evuliwe, bese ubuyela esakhiweni sasendulo noma nini lapho ufisa.","section":"start","order":36,"keywords":["isakhiwo","indawo yokusebenza","iribhoni","amathebhu eribhoni","isiphequluli sephrojekthi","isiphequluli","amaphalethi","iphaneli le-properties","amathebhu okubuka","ibha yesimo","ukufinyelela ngokushesha","goqa iribhoni","iwindi leribhoni","isakhiwo sakudala","shintsha isakhiwo","efakiwe"],"headings":[{"id":"yikhethe","text":"Yikhethe","level":2},{"id":"okukuphi","text":"Okukuphi","level":2},{"id":"sebenzisa-iribhoni-ngekhibhodi","text":"Sebenzisa iribhoni ngekhibhodi","level":2},{"id":"goqa-iribhoni-noma-uyinike-iwindi-layo","text":"Goqa iribhoni noma uyinike iwindi layo","level":2},{"id":"amaphaneli-akho-asahlala-ngokwakho","text":"Amaphaneli akho asahlala ngokwakho","level":2},{"id":"buyela-esakhiweni-sakudala","text":"Buyela esakhiweni sakudala","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIribhoni nesiphequluli sephrojekthi\u003C/strong\u003E ngomunye wezakhiwo ezintathu zendawo yokusebenza yohlelo. Iribhoni yamathebhu igijima phezulu, i-Properties nesiphequluli sephrojekthi zabelana ngephaneli lesobunxele, yonke ivibha evulwayo ithola ithebhu phezu komdwebo, futhi ibha yesimo ihlala ngaphansi. Amathuluzi ngawohlelo lwawo: konke ongakwenza esakhiweni sakudala kusebenza nalapha, futhi umdwebo wakho, isitayela semenyu nezinkinobho zakho ziyahlala njengoba zinjalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yikhethe\"\u003EYikhethe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E (igiya, noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha ithebhu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikelele\u003C/span\u003E, bese uya ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo yokusebenza\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIribhoni nesiphequluli sephrojekthi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsakhiwo sishintsha ngokushesha. Ukukhetha kuyodwa kuzo zonke izinhlelo kulo isiphequluli: ngayinye ivula kuso kusukela lapho, futhi sisendaweni ngaphambi kokuthi ikhasi lidwebe, ngakho awuwaboni ngaso isakhiwo sakudala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okukuphi\"\u003EOkukuphi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbha yesihloko:\u003C/strong\u003E igama lohlelo, izinkinobho zokufinyelela ngokushesha (vula, londoloza, hlehlisa, phinda wenze), igama lefayela elivuliwe, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOkwenziwa yithuluzi ngalapha\u003C/span\u003E (uhlu lwawo wonke amathuluzi nebhokisi lokusesha, lukhombisa ukuthi yiliphi elilungele manje nokuthi kungani amanye engalungile), isikrini esigcwele, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUsizo\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E. Kuleli sakhiwo ibha yesihloko ithatha indawo yebha yohlelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIribhoni:\u003C/strong\u003E amathuluzi ohlelo emathebhwini, ngamaqembu ngaphakathi kwawo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIfayela\u003C/span\u003E ngakwesobunxele livula, lilondoloze, njalo njalo. Amanye amahlelo engeza ithebhu yawo lapho usebenza kuthi ethile imodi noma indawo yokusebenza; ikhanya lapho isebenza, bese iyanyamalala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbha yezinketho:\u003C/strong\u003E ngaphansi kweribhoni, into ethuluzi elisebenzayo elidinga kuwe, noma okukhethiwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIphaneli lesobunxele:\u003C/strong\u003E i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E phezulu, nangaphansi kwayo amaphaleti (isiphequluli sephrojekthi nokuqukethwe kwephaneli ngalinye) njengamathebhu. Donsa umugqa ophakathi kwawo ukuze wabelane ngendawo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmathebhu okubuka:\u003C/strong\u003E ithebhu eyodwa ngombono ngamunye ovuliwe (ishidi, ipulani, indawo ebonakalayo…). Vala eyodwa ngenkinobho yayo yokuvala; ifayela lihlala livulekile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbha yokubuka nebha yesimo:\u003C/strong\u003E ngaphansi komdwebo, izilawuli zombono wawo (isikali, isilinganiso sokuzoom); ngaphansi kakhulu, imilayezo yohlelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthuluzi elingasebenzi manje liyabonakala limnyama, nethiphu yalo ichaza ukuthi kungani (isibonelo &quot;Vula ifayela kuqala&quot;, noma ukuthi uhlelo alikwazi okwamanje ukuthola leyo thuluzi). Chofoza kulo, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kulo, ukuze ufunde isizathu ebhokisini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sebenzisa-iribhoni-ngekhibhodi\"\u003ESebenzisa iribhoni ngekhibhodi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma ithebhu yeribhoni igxilile, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bahambisa phakathi kwamathebhu, no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ←\"\u003Efn ←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EHome\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn →\"\u003Efn →\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnd\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bafike owokuqala nowokugcina. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iqeda ithuluzi elisebenzayo kuqala, njengakusakhiwo sakudala, futhi zonke izinqamuleli kanye no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (izimodi zesikrini) zisebenza njengakuqala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"goqa-iribhoni-noma-uyinike-iwindi-layo\"\u003EGoqa iribhoni noma uyinike iwindi layo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChofoza kabili ithebhu yeribhoni ukuze uyigoqe ibe amathebhu awo; ukuchofoza ithebhu bese kubonisa amathuluzi ayo kuze kube yilapho uhamba. Chofoza kabili futhi ukuze uyigcine ivulekile. Inkinobho ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa iribhoni\u003C/span\u003E ekugcineni kwesokudla kweribhoni nayo inezinketho ze-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoqa iribhoni\u003C/span\u003E ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGcina iribhoni ivulekile\u003C/span\u003E. Uhlelo ngalunye luyikhumbula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa iribhoni\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa uye kwewindi elisha\u003C/span\u003E ibeka iribhoni eWindini layo, isibonelo esikrinini sesibili. Izinkinobho ocindezela zona kuleyo ndawo ziyafinyelela kuhlelo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYibuyisele iribhoni\u003C/span\u003E, noma ukuvala leyo windi, iyibuyisela ekhaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzilungiselelo zebha yamathuluzi zisebenza eribhoneni: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikelele\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbha yamathuluzi\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzithonjana namagama\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzithonjana kuphela\u003C/span\u003E (iribhoni bese ibonisa imigqa emibili yezithonjana ezincane ngeqembu ngalinye) noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmagama kuphela\u003C/span\u003E, kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa amagama amaqembu (Ifayela, Dweba, …)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amaphaneli-akho-asahlala-ngokwakho\"\u003EAmaphaneli akho asahlala ngokwakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmaphaneli esobunxele nesokudla agcina konke okuchaziwe kuthi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EHlela amaphaneli\u003C/a\u003E: ukufaka, ukuntanta, ukubopha, ukufihla, amathebhu, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa uye kwewindi elisha\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESetha kabusha isakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"buyela-esakhiweni-sakudala\"\u003EBuyela esakhiweni sakudala\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikelele\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo yokusebenza\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft yasendulo\u003C/span\u003E. Yonke ibha yamathuluzi, ithebhu nephaneli kubuyela lapho kwakukhona khona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEfonini, noma ewindini elingu-760 pixels noma elincane kunalokho, uhlelo lusebenzisa isakhiwo sefoni nxa kungakhethwa lutho. Iwindi elibanzi libuyisa isakhiwo sakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze uzame enye indlela yokuhlela, bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-toolbox\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-toolbox\"\u003Eisakhiwo sebhokisi lamathuluzi nebhokisi lolwazi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze ushintshe lokho esakhiwo esikubonisayo, bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EShintsha isakhiwo esikrinini\u003C/a\u003E; ukuze uthole ukuhlelwa okumnyama, okunebha yemenyu neribhoni, bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-drafting\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-drafting\"\u003Eisakhiwo sakwa-Uhlaka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Iribhoni nesiphequluli sephrojekthi ngomunye wezakhiwo ezintathu zendawo yokusebenza yohlelo. Iribhoni yamathebhu igijima phezulu, i-Properties nesiphequluli sephrojekthi zabelana ngephaneli lesobunxele, yonke ivibha evulwayo ithola ithebhu phezu komdwebo, futhi ibha yesimo ihlala ngaphansi. Amathuluzi ngawohlelo lwawo: konke ongakwenza esakhiweni sakudala kusebenza nalapha, futhi umdwebo wakho, isitayela semenyu nezinkinobho zakho ziyahlala njengoba zinjalo. Yikhethe Vula Izilungiselelo (igiya, noma Ctrl+,). Khetha ithebhu ye-Jikelele, bese uya ku-Isakhiwo › Indawo yokusebenza. Khetha Iribhoni nesiphequluli sephrojekthi. Isakhiwo sishintsha ngokushesha. Ukukhetha kuyodwa kuzo zonke izinhlelo kulo isiphequluli: ngayinye ivula kuso kusukela lapho, futhi sisendaweni ngaphambi kokuthi ikhasi lidwebe, ngakho awuwaboni ngaso isakhiwo sakudala. Okukuphi Ibha yesihloko: igama lohlelo, izinkinobho zokufinyelela ngokushesha (vula, londoloza, hlehlisa, phinda wenze), igama lefayela elivuliwe, Okwenziwa yithuluzi ngalapha (uhlu lwawo wonke amathuluzi nebhokisi lokusesha, lukhombisa ukuthi yiliphi elilungele manje nokuthi kungani amanye engalungile), isikrini esigcwele, Usizo kanye Izilungiselelo. Kuleli sakhiwo ibha yesihloko ithatha indawo yebha yohlelo. Iribhoni: amathuluzi ohlelo emathebhwini, ngamaqembu ngaphakathi kwawo. Ifayela ngakwesobunxele livula, lilondoloze, njalo njalo. Amanye amahlelo engeza ithebhu yawo lapho usebenza kuthi ethile imodi noma indawo yokusebenza; ikhanya lapho isebenza, bese iyanyamalala. Ibha yezinketho: ngaphansi kweribhoni, into ethuluzi elisebenzayo elidinga kuwe, noma okukhethiwe. Iphaneli lesobunxele: i-Properties phezulu, nangaphansi kwayo amaphaleti (isiphequluli sephrojekthi nokuqukethwe kwephaneli ngalinye) njengamathebhu. Donsa umugqa ophakathi kwawo ukuze wabelane ngendawo. Amathebhu okubuka: ithebhu eyodwa ngombono ngamunye ovuliwe (ishidi, ipulani, indawo ebonakalayo…). Vala eyodwa ngenkinobho yayo yokuvala; ifayela lihlala livulekile. Ibha yokubuka nebha yesimo: ngaphansi komdwebo, izilawuli zombono wawo (isikali, isilinganiso sokuzoom); ngaphansi kakhulu, imilayezo yohlelo. Ithuluzi elingasebenzi manje liyabonakala limnyama, nethiphu yalo ichaza ukuthi kungani (isibonelo \"Vula ifayela kuqala\", noma ukuthi uhlelo alikwazi okwamanje ukuthola leyo thuluzi). Chofoza kulo, noma cindezela Enter kulo, ukuze ufunde isizathu ebhokisini. Sebenzisa iribhoni ngekhibhodi Uma ithebhu yeribhoni igxilile, ← no-→ bahambisa phakathi kwamathebhu, no-Home no-End bafike owokuqala nowokugcina. Esc iqeda ithuluzi elisebenzayo kuqala, njengakusakhiwo sakudala, futhi zonke izinqamuleli kanye no-Ctrl+Shift+F (izimodi zesikrini) zisebenza njengakuqala. Goqa iribhoni noma uyinike iwindi layo Chofoza kabili ithebhu yeribhoni ukuze uyigoqe ibe amathebhu awo; ukuchofoza ithebhu bese kubonisa amathuluzi ayo kuze kube yilapho uhamba. Chofoza kabili futhi ukuze uyigcine ivulekile. Inkinobho ye-Hambisa iribhoni ekugcineni kwesokudla kweribhoni nayo inezinketho ze-Goqa iribhoni ne-Gcina iribhoni ivulekile. Uhlelo ngalunye luyikhumbula. Hambisa iribhoni › Hambisa uye kwewindi elisha ibeka iribhoni eWindini layo, isibonelo esikrinini sesibili. Izinkinobho ocindezela zona kuleyo ndawo ziyafinyelela kuhlelo. Yibuyisele iribhoni, noma ukuvala leyo windi, iyibuyisela ekhaya. Izilungiselelo zebha yamathuluzi zisebenza eribhoneni: Izilungiselelo › Jikelele › Ibha yamathuluzi › Izithonjana namagama, Izithonjana kuphela (iribhoni bese ibonisa imigqa emibili yezithonjana ezincane ngeqembu ngalinye) noma Amagama kuphela, kanye Bonisa amagama amaqembu (Ifayela, Dweba, …). Amaphaneli akho asahlala ngokwakho Amaphaneli esobunxele nesokudla agcina konke okuchaziwe kuthi Hlela amaphaneli: ukufaka, ukuntanta, ukubopha, ukufihla, amathebhu, Hambisa uye kwewindi elisha kanye Setha kabusha isakhiwo. Buyela esakhiweni sakudala Vula Izilungiselelo › Jikelele › Isakhiwo › Indawo yokusebenza bese ukhetha CadCraft yasendulo. Yonke ibha yamathuluzi, ithebhu nephaneli kubuyela lapho kwakukhona khona. Efonini, noma ewindini elingu-760 pixels noma elincane kunalokho, uhlelo lusebenzisa isakhiwo sefoni nxa kungakhethwa lutho. Iwindi elibanzi libuyisa isakhiwo sakho. Ukuze uzame enye indlela yokuhlela, bheka isakhiwo sebhokisi lamathuluzi nebhokisi lolwazi. Ukuze ushintshe lokho esakhiwo esikubonisayo, bheka Shintsha isakhiwo esikrinini; ukuze uthole ukuhlelwa okumnyama, okunebha yemenyu neribhoni, bheka isakhiwo sakwa-Uhlaka.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"icons-one-set","scope":"basics","title":"One set of icons in every layout","summary":"Every tool in the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox, the menus and the palettes is drawn from one icon set, in the same style in every layout; choose full colour, an outline in your own colour, or the app's own drawings under Settings.","section":"start","order":37,"keywords":["icons","icon set","icon style","full colour","outline","colorized","each app's own drawings","ribbon icons","toolbar icons","toolbox icons","menu icons","palette icons","consistent icons","layout icons","tool pictures","icon colour"],"headings":[{"id":"choose-how-the-icons-look","text":"Choose how the icons look","level":2},{"id":"what-stays-the-same","text":"What stays the same","level":2},{"id":"if-a-picture-is-wrong","text":"If a picture is wrong","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EEvery tool has one picture, and the picture is the same wherever you meet the tool: in the ribbon, in a row of tool buttons, in the toolbox, in the File menu, in a menu opened from a panel&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E button, and in the palettes of the Vector and Sketch layouts. Switch the layout and the picture stays put, so you learn each tool once.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis is in the lab builds first. A tool the set has no drawing for yet shows its old picture until the drawing is added, and the lab keeps a list of those so none is forgotten.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"choose-how-the-icons-look\"\u003EChoose how the icons look\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (Ctrl+,) and find \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIcons\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPick one:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFull colour\u003C/span\u003E: two-tone drawings with colour fills.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutline\u003C/span\u003E: line drawings in one colour. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutline colour\u003C/span\u003E sets the colour; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse the theme colour\u003C/span\u003E puts it back.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEach app&#039;s own drawings\u003C/span\u003E: the pictures the app drew for itself, as before. Every layout then shows those instead of the set.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe drawings are vectors, so they stay sharp at any size and follow \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInterface size\u003C/span\u003E. They follow the light and dark theme too.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-stays-the-same\"\u003EWhat stays the same\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe tool&#039;s name, tooltip, keys and position do not change; only its picture.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EArrows that open or close a list (the small carets) are not tool pictures and keep their own shape.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe pictures inside a drawing or a model (symbols, hatches, textures) are yours or the library&#039;s and are not touched.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-a-picture-is-wrong\"\u003EIf a picture is wrong\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHover the tool to read its name, then use \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReport a problem\u003C/span\u003E from the Help menu and name the tool; the name tells us which drawing to change.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Every tool has one picture, and the picture is the same wherever you meet the tool: in the ribbon, in a row of tool buttons, in the toolbox, in the File menu, in a menu opened from a panel's ⋯ button, and in the palettes of the Vector and Sketch layouts. Switch the layout and the picture stays put, so you learn each tool once. This is in the lab builds first. A tool the set has no drawing for yet shows its old picture until the drawing is added, and the lab keeps a list of those so none is forgotten. Choose how the icons look Open Settings (Ctrl+,) and find Icons. Pick one: Full colour: two-tone drawings with colour fills. Outline: line drawings in one colour. Outline colour sets the colour; Use the theme colour puts it back. Each app's own drawings: the pictures the app drew for itself, as before. Every layout then shows those instead of the set. The drawings are vectors, so they stay sharp at any size and follow Interface size. They follow the light and dark theme too. What stays the same The tool's name, tooltip, keys and position do not change; only its picture. Arrows that open or close a list (the small carets) are not tool pictures and keep their own shape. The pictures inside a drawing or a model (symbols, hatches, textures) are yours or the library's and are not touched. If a picture is wrong Hover the tool to read its name, then use Report a problem from the Help menu and name the tool; the name tells us which drawing to change.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"layout-toolbox","scope":"basics","title":"Sebenza ngesakhiwo sebhokisi lamathuluzi nebhokisi lolwazi","summary":"Shintsha uhlelo lube yikholomu yamathuluzi ngakwesobunxele ezindaweni zakho, ibhokisi lolwazi phezu kwesikrini elilandela ithuluzi elisebenzayo noma okukhethiwe kuwe, inavigeyitha ngakwesokudla, ithebhu ngayinye yokubuka, izinketho ezisheshayo nephaleti lokuhlela, bese ubuyela esakhiweni sakudala noma nini lapho ufisa.","section":"start","order":37,"keywords":["isakhiwo","indawo yokusebenza","ibhokisi lamathuluzi","ikholomu yamathuluzi","ibhokisi lolwazi","ibha yolwazi","inavigeyitha","ishadi lephrojekthi","ibha esheshayo","izinketho ezisheshayo","iphaleti lokuhlela","iphaleti lepeti","amathuluzi ami","amathuluzi angikhethile","amathebhu okubuka","iwindi lebhokisi lamathuluzi","isakhiwo sakudala","shintsha isakhiwo"],"headings":[{"id":"yikhethe","text":"Yikhethe","level":2},{"id":"okukuphi","text":"Okukuphi","level":2},{"id":"nika-ibhokisi-lamathuluzi-iwindi-lalo","text":"Nika ibhokisi lamathuluzi iwindi lalo","level":2},{"id":"amaphaneli-akho-asahlala-ngokwakho","text":"Amaphaneli akho asahlala ngokwakho","level":2},{"id":"buyela-esakhiweni-sakudala","text":"Buyela esakhiweni sakudala","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbhokisi lamathuluzi nebhokisi lolwazi\u003C/strong\u003E ngomunye wezakhiwo ezintathu zendawo yokusebenza yohlelo. Amathuluzi omdwebo ami ngekholomu ngakwesobunxele, ibhokisi lolwazi libonisa phezu kwesikrini into ethuluzi elisebenzayo elidinga yona noma eyikhethile, kube nethebhu ngombono ngamunye, futhi ibha esheshayo ngaphansi komdwebo ibamba izinketho ezimbalwa zansuku zonke. Amathuluzi ngawohlelo lwawo: konke ongakwenza esakhiweni sakudala kusebenza nalapha, futhi umdwebo wakho, isitayela semenyu nezinkinobho zakho ziyahlala njengoba zinjalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yikhethe\"\u003EYikhethe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E (igiya, noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha ithebhu ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikelele\u003C/span\u003E, bese uya ku-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo yokusebenza\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbhokisi lamathuluzi nebhokisi lolwazi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsakhiwo sishintsha ngokushesha. Ukukhetha kuyodwa kuzo zonke izinhlelo kulo isiphequluli: ngayinye ivula kuso kusukela lapho, futhi sisendaweni ngaphambi kokuthi ikhasi lidwebe, ngakho awuwaboni ngaso isakhiwo sakudala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okukuphi\"\u003EOkukuphi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbha yamathuluzi:\u003C/strong\u003E ibha yohlelo yayo ihlala phezulu kwendawo yomdwebo, nemenyu yayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbhokisi lolwazi:\u003C/strong\u003E ngaphansi kwebha yamathuluzi. Ithuluzi lisasebenza, libonisa ithuluzi nalokho olukudingayo. Lapho ukhetha into, libonisa izilungiselelo zayo eziyinhloko (ngodonga: uhlobo lwalo, ukuthi lujulile kangakanani, ubude, umugqa wendawo nobude), futhi ungazishintsha lapho: ukushintsha lapho kufana nalokho okukuphrophathi, bese \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kukubuyisela. Uma ungakukhethi lutho litshela ukuthi &quot;Akukhethiwe lutho&quot;. Uhlelo ngalunye lwengeza amabhokisi awo lapha, njengesendlalelo noma inheli esebenzayo, noma incwadi evuliwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbhokisi lamathuluzi:\u003C/strong\u003E ikholomu ngakwesobunxele, amathuluzi ohlelo emaqenjini. Chofoza igama lweqembu ukuze uligoqe noma uliphinde uliveze. Ithuluzi elisebenzayo liyakhanya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmathuluzi ami:\u003C/strong\u003E iqembu lokuqala lebhokisi lamathuluzi, amasilothi amathathu ayishumi nesishiyagalombili azingile ngamathuluzi osebenzisa kakhulu. Chofoza isilothi esingenalutho ukuze ukhethe noma yiliphi ithuluzi noma umyalo wohlelo; noma chofoza ngakwesokudla ithuluzi ebhokisini lamathuluzi bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngeza kumathuluzi ami\u003C/span\u003E; noma donsa ithuluzi uliyise esilothini. Chofoza ngakwesokudla isilothi ukuze ulishintshe noma ulikhiphe. Amasilothi akho agcinwa ngohlelo ngalunye kulo isiphequluli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInavigeyitha:\u003C/strong\u003E iphaneli ngakwesokudla. Ishadi lephrojekthi lohlelo lisezansi (amapulani, amasigaba, izinkanyezi, imibono ye-3D, amashadi okuhlela, amashidi, njengoba uhlelo lunawo): chofoza olunye ukuze uvule. Ngaphansi kwalo, i-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E nethebhu nokuqukethwe okunye kwephaneli lesokudla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmathebhu okubuka:\u003C/strong\u003E ithebhu yombono ngamunye wefayela elivuliwe (ishidi, ipulani, isimo…), phezu komdwebo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIbha esheshayo:\u003C/strong\u003E ngaphansi komdwebo, izilungiselelo zombono nezinketho zansuku zonke ohlelo olinazo, njengesikali, izinga lemininingwane, uhla lombono, fit, plan, split noma 3D, izinamathela nezinyunithi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIphaleti lokuhlela:\u003C/strong\u003E chofoza into emdwebweni bese kuvela iphaleti elincane ngasesikhombisi nemiyalo yokuhlela yohlelo yayo, njengokuhambisa, ukukopisha, ukujikisa, ukufaka isibonakalo esigxilile, ukuphinda, noma ukususa, kanye ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, inkinobho yevili le-mouse, ukuchofoza okunye noma inkinobho yokuvala kuyishiya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIthuluzi elingasebenzi manje liyabonakala limnyama, nethiphu yalo ichaza ukuthi kungani. Chofoza kulo, noma cindezela \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kulo, ukuze ufunde isizathu ebhokisini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iqeda ithuluzi elisebenzayo kuqala, njengakusakhiwo sakudala, futhi zonke izinqamuleli kanye no-\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (izimodi zesikrini) zisebenza njengakuqala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nika-ibhokisi-lamathuluzi-iwindi-lalo\"\u003ENika ibhokisi lamathuluzi iwindi lalo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInkinobho ye-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa ibhokisi lamathuluzi\u003C/span\u003E phezulu kwebhokisi lamathuluzi inezinketho ze-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa uye kwewindi elisha\u003C/span\u003E: ibhokisi lamathuluzi livula kwiwindi elincane lalo, lingabekwa eceleni kohlelo noma esikrinini sesibili. Izinkinobho ocindezela zona kulowo windi ziyafinyelela kuhlelo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYibuyisele ibhokisi lamathuluzi\u003C/span\u003E, noma ukuvala leyo windi, iyibuyisela ekhaya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzilungiselelo zebha yamathuluzi zisebenza nakubhokisi lamathuluzi: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikelele\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIbha yamathuluzi\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzithonjana namagama\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzithonjana kuphela\u003C/span\u003E noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmagama kuphela\u003C/span\u003E, kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBonisa amagama amaqembu (Ifayela, Dweba, …)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"amaphaneli-akho-asahlala-ngokwakho\"\u003EAmaphaneli akho asahlala ngokwakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmaphaneli esobunxele nesokudla agcina konke okuchaziwe kuthi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EHlela amaphaneli\u003C/a\u003E: ukufaka, ukuntanta, ukubopha, ukufihla, amathebhu, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHambisa uye kwewindi elisha\u003C/span\u003E kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESetha kabusha isakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"buyela-esakhiweni-sakudala\"\u003EBuyela esakhiweni sakudala\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikelele\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo yokusebenza\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft yasendulo\u003C/span\u003E. Yonke ibha yamathuluzi, ithebhu nephaneli kubuyela lapho kwakukhona khona.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEfonini, noma ewindini elingu-760 pixels noma elincane kunalokho, uhlelo lusebenzisa isakhiwo sefoni nxa kungakhethwa lutho. Iwindi elibanzi libuyisa isakhiwo sakho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze uzame enye indlela yokuhlela, bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-ribbon\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-ribbon\"\u003Eisakhiwo seribhoni nesiphequluli sephrojekthi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze ushintshe lokho esakhiweni esikubonisayo, bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EShintsha isakhiwo esikrinini\u003C/a\u003E; ukuze uthole ukuhlelwa okumnyama, okunebha yemenyu neribhoni, bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-drafting\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-drafting\"\u003Eisakhiwo sakwa-Uhlaka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ibhokisi lamathuluzi nebhokisi lolwazi ngomunye wezakhiwo ezintathu zendawo yokusebenza yohlelo. Amathuluzi omdwebo ami ngekholomu ngakwesobunxele, ibhokisi lolwazi libonisa phezu kwesikrini into ethuluzi elisebenzayo elidinga yona noma eyikhethile, kube nethebhu ngombono ngamunye, futhi ibha esheshayo ngaphansi komdwebo ibamba izinketho ezimbalwa zansuku zonke. Amathuluzi ngawohlelo lwawo: konke ongakwenza esakhiweni sakudala kusebenza nalapha, futhi umdwebo wakho, isitayela semenyu nezinkinobho zakho ziyahlala njengoba zinjalo. Yikhethe Vula Izilungiselelo (igiya, noma Ctrl+,). Khetha ithebhu ye-Jikelele, bese uya ku-Isakhiwo › Indawo yokusebenza. Khetha Ibhokisi lamathuluzi nebhokisi lolwazi. Isakhiwo sishintsha ngokushesha. Ukukhetha kuyodwa kuzo zonke izinhlelo kulo isiphequluli: ngayinye ivula kuso kusukela lapho, futhi sisendaweni ngaphambi kokuthi ikhasi lidwebe, ngakho awuwaboni ngaso isakhiwo sakudala. Okukuphi Ibha yamathuluzi: ibha yohlelo yayo ihlala phezulu kwendawo yomdwebo, nemenyu yayo. Ibhokisi lolwazi: ngaphansi kwebha yamathuluzi. Ithuluzi lisasebenza, libonisa ithuluzi nalokho olukudingayo. Lapho ukhetha into, libonisa izilungiselelo zayo eziyinhloko (ngodonga: uhlobo lwalo, ukuthi lujulile kangakanani, ubude, umugqa wendawo nobude), futhi ungazishintsha lapho: ukushintsha lapho kufana nalokho okukuphrophathi, bese Ctrl+Z kukubuyisela. Uma ungakukhethi lutho litshela ukuthi \"Akukhethiwe lutho\". Uhlelo ngalunye lwengeza amabhokisi awo lapha, njengesendlalelo noma inheli esebenzayo, noma incwadi evuliwe. Ibhokisi lamathuluzi: ikholomu ngakwesobunxele, amathuluzi ohlelo emaqenjini. Chofoza igama lweqembu ukuze uligoqe noma uliphinde uliveze. Ithuluzi elisebenzayo liyakhanya. Amathuluzi ami: iqembu lokuqala lebhokisi lamathuluzi, amasilothi amathathu ayishumi nesishiyagalombili azingile ngamathuluzi osebenzisa kakhulu. Chofoza isilothi esingenalutho ukuze ukhethe noma yiliphi ithuluzi noma umyalo wohlelo; noma chofoza ngakwesokudla ithuluzi ebhokisini lamathuluzi bese ukhetha Engeza kumathuluzi ami; noma donsa ithuluzi uliyise esilothini. Chofoza ngakwesokudla isilothi ukuze ulishintshe noma ulikhiphe. Amasilothi akho agcinwa ngohlelo ngalunye kulo isiphequluli. Inavigeyitha: iphaneli ngakwesokudla. Ishadi lephrojekthi lohlelo lisezansi (amapulani, amasigaba, izinkanyezi, imibono ye-3D, amashadi okuhlela, amashidi, njengoba uhlelo lunawo): chofoza olunye ukuze uvule. Ngaphansi kwalo, i-Properties nethebhu nokuqukethwe okunye kwephaneli lesokudla. Amathebhu okubuka: ithebhu yombono ngamunye wefayela elivuliwe (ishidi, ipulani, isimo…), phezu komdwebo. Ibha esheshayo: ngaphansi komdwebo, izilungiselelo zombono nezinketho zansuku zonke ohlelo olinazo, njengesikali, izinga lemininingwane, uhla lombono, fit, plan, split noma 3D, izinamathela nezinyunithi. Iphaleti lokuhlela: chofoza into emdwebweni bese kuvela iphaleti elincane ngasesikhombisi nemiyalo yokuhlela yohlelo yayo, njengokuhambisa, ukukopisha, ukujikisa, ukufaka isibonakalo esigxilile, ukuphinda, noma ukususa, kanye ne-Properties. Esc, inkinobho yevili le-mouse, ukuchofoza okunye noma inkinobho yokuvala kuyishiya. Ithuluzi elingasebenzi manje liyabonakala limnyama, nethiphu yalo ichaza ukuthi kungani. Chofoza kulo, noma cindezela Enter kulo, ukuze ufunde isizathu ebhokisini. Esc iqeda ithuluzi elisebenzayo kuqala, njengakusakhiwo sakudala, futhi zonke izinqamuleli kanye no-Ctrl+Shift+F (izimodi zesikrini) zisebenza njengakuqala. Nika ibhokisi lamathuluzi iwindi lalo Inkinobho ye-Hambisa ibhokisi lamathuluzi phezulu kwebhokisi lamathuluzi inezinketho ze-Hambisa uye kwewindi elisha: ibhokisi lamathuluzi livula kwiwindi elincane lalo, lingabekwa eceleni kohlelo noma esikrinini sesibili. Izinkinobho ocindezela zona kulowo windi ziyafinyelela kuhlelo. Yibuyisele ibhokisi lamathuluzi, noma ukuvala leyo windi, iyibuyisela ekhaya. Izilungiselelo zebha yamathuluzi zisebenza nakubhokisi lamathuluzi: Izilungiselelo › Jikelele › Ibha yamathuluzi › Izithonjana namagama, Izithonjana kuphela noma Amagama kuphela, kanye Bonisa amagama amaqembu (Ifayela, Dweba, …). Amaphaneli akho asahlala ngokwakho Amaphaneli esobunxele nesokudla agcina konke okuchaziwe kuthi Hlela amaphaneli: ukufaka, ukuntanta, ukubopha, ukufihla, amathebhu, Hambisa uye kwewindi elisha kanye Setha kabusha isakhiwo. Buyela esakhiweni sakudala Vula Izilungiselelo › Jikelele › Isakhiwo › Indawo yokusebenza bese ukhetha CadCraft yasendulo. Yonke ibha yamathuluzi, ithebhu nephaneli kubuyela lapho kwakukhona khona. Efonini, noma ewindini elingu-760 pixels noma elincane kunalokho, uhlelo lusebenzisa isakhiwo sefoni nxa kungakhethwa lutho. Iwindi elibanzi libuyisa isakhiwo sakho. Ukuze uzame enye indlela yokuhlela, bheka isakhiwo seribhoni nesiphequluli sephrojekthi. Ukuze ushintshe lokho esakhiweni esikubonisayo, bheka Shintsha isakhiwo esikrinini; ukuze uthole ukuhlelwa okumnyama, okunebha yemenyu neribhoni, bheka isakhiwo sakwa-Uhlaka.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"layout-own","scope":"basics","title":"Hlela isakhiwo sakho bese ulondoloza amasethi akho","summary":"Khetha iphaneli elibonisa isiphequluli sephrojekthi, i-Properties noma okuqukethwe yiphaneli ngalinye, lapho ibhokisi lamathuluzi lihlala khona nokuthi amabha aqukethe ini, ulondoloze njengesakhiwo sakho, futhi ugcine wonke amasethi ngegama ukuze ushintshe phakathi kwawo.","section":"start","order":39,"keywords":["isakhiwo","indawo yokusebenza","hlela","yenza ngokwakho","isakhiwo sami","isakhiwo sakho","amaphaneli","abahleli","isiphequluli sephrojekthi","properties","ibhokisi lamathuluzi","ibha esheshayo","ibhokisi lolwazi","indawo yokusebenza","isethi","iphrofayili","londoloza isethi","shintsha isethi","thumela isethi","ngenisa isethi","ccenv"],"headings":[{"id":"hlela-isakhiwo-sakho","text":"Hlela isakhiwo sakho","level":2},{"id":"londoloza-isethi-yakho-njengendawo-yokusebenza","text":"Londoloza isethi yakho njengendawo yokusebenza","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ENgaphandle kwezakhiwo ezintathu ezakhelwe ngaphakathi, ungahlela esakho, futhi ulondoloze wonke amasethi akho ngegama ukuze ubuyele kuwo ngesinyathelo esisodwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hlela-isakhiwo-sakho\"\u003EHlela isakhiwo sakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzilungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E (igiya, noma \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), khetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJikelele\u003C/span\u003E, bese \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsakhiwo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHlela ukulungiswa kwakho…\u003C/span\u003E. Ingxoxo iqala ngesakhiwo osisebenzisa manje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENikeza igama, bese ukhetha:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPhezu komdwebo:\u003C/strong\u003E ithuluzi lohlelo, iribhoni noma akukho lutho; ibha yesihloko; ibhokisi lolwazi nezilawuli okuzibambayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENgasohlangothini lomdwebo:\u003C/strong\u003E ibhokisi lamathuluzi ngakwesobunxele, ngakwesokudla noma ngeke libe khona, nangaphandle kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmathuluzi ami\u003C/span\u003E; iphaneli elibamba amaphaleti, elisezansi kwayo yonke (isiphequluli sephrojekthi noma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E, isibonelo), nalawo angamathebhu ngaphansi kwalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIndawo yomdwebo:\u003C/strong\u003E amathebhu okubuka, ibha esheshayo nebha yokubuka enezilawuli oziklikile, iphaleti lokuhlela, ibha yesimo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkubukeka:\u003C/strong\u003E usayizi, imiphetho yezinkinobho nesitayela sethebhu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESebenzisa lolu lungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E. Uhlelo lushintshela kulo ngokushesha, futhi wonke amahlelo anezakhiwo nawo ayasisebenzisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKunikezwa kuphela lokho uhlelo olunakho. Isakhiwo sakho sidweshulwa ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKusuka kuzengezo nasemafayelini\u003C/span\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela lolu lungiselelo\u003C/span\u003E silondoloza njengefayela onganikeza ngalo umngane wakho wokusebenza, futhi inkinobho yokususa iyasisusa. Amaphaneli alo agcwalisayo asafakwa, ayantanta futhi ahambe awale ewindini awo, njengakuthi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EHlela amaphaneli\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"londoloza-isethi-yakho-njengendawo-yokusebenza\"\u003ELondoloza isethi yakho njengendawo yokusebenza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIndawo yokusebenza iyisethi yakho yonke yazo zonke izinhlelo kulo isiphequluli: isakhiwo, isitayela semenyu nezinkinobho zakho, isitayela sebha yamathuluzi, amaphaneli nosayizi wawo, kanye ne-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAmathuluzi ami\u003C/span\u003E. Itimu nolimi akuyona ingxenye yayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELondoloza:\u003C/strong\u003E bhala igama ngaphansi kwe-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIndawo yokusebenza\u003C/span\u003E bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza isethi yami\u003C/span\u003E. Ukulondoloza ngegama elikhona kushintsha leso sethi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EShintsha:\u003C/strong\u003E khetha isethi ohlwini bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShintshela kuyo\u003C/span\u003E. Uhlelo luyalayisha kabusha kuleyo sethi; uma unomsebenzi ongalondolozwanga, uhlelo luyababuza kuqala, njengakunoma yiliphi ilayisha kabusha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EYabelana:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThumela\u003C/span\u003E ilondoloza isethi okhethiwe njengefayela le-\u003Ccode\u003E.ccenv.json\u003C/code\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENgenisa isethi…\u003C/span\u003E yengeza enye esuka efayelini. Ifayela libeka lezi zinketho kuphela, akukho okunye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESusa:\u003C/strong\u003E khetha isethi bese ukhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESusa\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUngagcina kuze kube amasethi ayishumi nambili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkuze ushintshe isakhiwo ngaphandle kokuvula ingxoxo (donsa ibhulokhi, uchofoze ngakwesokudla ethulusi), bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EShintsha isakhiwo esikrinini\u003C/a\u003E. Ukuze uzame okuhlelwe ngaphambili kuqala, bheka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-toolbox\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-toolbox\"\u003Eisakhiwo sebhokisi lamathuluzi nebhokisi lolwazi\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-ribbon\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-ribbon\"\u003Eisakhiwo seribhoni nesiphequluli sephrojekthi\u003C/a\u003E kanye no-\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-drafting\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-drafting\"\u003Eisakhiwo sakwa-Uhlaka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ngaphandle kwezakhiwo ezintathu ezakhelwe ngaphakathi, ungahlela esakho, futhi ulondoloze wonke amasethi akho ngegama ukuze ubuyele kuwo ngesinyathelo esisodwa. Hlela isakhiwo sakho Vula Izilungiselelo (igiya, noma Ctrl+,), khetha Jikelele, bese Isakhiwo. Khetha Hlela ukulungiswa kwakho…. Ingxoxo iqala ngesakhiwo osisebenzisa manje. Nikeza igama, bese ukhetha: Phezu komdwebo: ithuluzi lohlelo, iribhoni noma akukho lutho; ibha yesihloko; ibhokisi lolwazi nezilawuli okuzibambayo. Ngasohlangothini lomdwebo: ibhokisi lamathuluzi ngakwesobunxele, ngakwesokudla noma ngeke libe khona, nangaphandle kwe-Amathuluzi ami; iphaneli elibamba amaphaleti, elisezansi kwayo yonke (isiphequluli sephrojekthi noma Properties, isibonelo), nalawo angamathebhu ngaphansi kwalo. Indawo yomdwebo: amathebhu okubuka, ibha esheshayo nebha yokubuka enezilawuli oziklikile, iphaleti lokuhlela, ibha yesimo. Ukubukeka: usayizi, imiphetho yezinkinobho nesitayela sethebhu. Khetha Sebenzisa lolu lungiselelo. Uhlelo lushintshela kulo ngokushesha, futhi wonke amahlelo anezakhiwo nawo ayasisebenzisa. Kunikezwa kuphela lokho uhlelo olunakho. Isakhiwo sakho sidweshulwa ngaphansi kwe-Kusuka kuzengezo nasemafayelini; Thumela lolu lungiselelo silondoloza njengefayela onganikeza ngalo umngane wakho wokusebenza, futhi inkinobho yokususa iyasisusa. Amaphaneli alo agcwalisayo asafakwa, ayantanta futhi ahambe awale ewindini awo, njengakuthi Hlela amaphaneli. Londoloza isethi yakho njengendawo yokusebenza Indawo yokusebenza iyisethi yakho yonke yazo zonke izinhlelo kulo isiphequluli: isakhiwo, isitayela semenyu nezinkinobho zakho, isitayela sebha yamathuluzi, amaphaneli nosayizi wawo, kanye ne-Amathuluzi ami. Itimu nolimi akuyona ingxenye yayo. Londoloza: bhala igama ngaphansi kwe-Indawo yokusebenza bese ukhetha Londoloza isethi yami. Ukulondoloza ngegama elikhona kushintsha leso sethi. Shintsha: khetha isethi ohlwini bese ukhetha Shintshela kuyo. Uhlelo luyalayisha kabusha kuleyo sethi; uma unomsebenzi ongalondolozwanga, uhlelo luyababuza kuqala, njengakunoma yiliphi ilayisha kabusha. Yabelana: Thumela ilondoloza isethi okhethiwe njengefayela le-.ccenv.json; Ngenisa isethi… yengeza enye esuka efayelini. Ifayela libeka lezi zinketho kuphela, akukho okunye. Susa: khetha isethi bese ukhetha Susa. Ungagcina kuze kube amasethi ayishumi nambili. Ukuze ushintshe isakhiwo ngaphandle kokuvula ingxoxo (donsa ibhulokhi, uchofoze ngakwesokudla ethulusi), bheka Shintsha isakhiwo esikrinini. Ukuze uzame okuhlelwe ngaphambili kuqala, bheka isakhiwo sebhokisi lamathuluzi nebhokisi lolwazi, isakhiwo seribhoni nesiphequluli sephrojekthi kanye no-isakhiwo sakwa-Uhlaka.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"addons-basics","scope":"basics","title":"Add-ons and your account list","summary":"How add-ons work in every app and edition. Add one once in the Library and it follows your account, loads the first time an app needs it, and updates inside its major version. Sign in on a computer, pin a version, add a package from a file, or keep working offline.","section":"start","order":40,"keywords":["add-ons","library","add","remove","update","pin","lab channel","your add-ons","sign in","offline","offline on this device","use offline","add from a file","download as a file","drag and drop","ccaddon","package","paid","licence","entitlement","this file uses","engine","needs","orphan","team add-ons"],"headings":[{"id":"what-an-add-on-is","text":"What an add-on is","level":2},{"id":"your-list","text":"Your list","level":2},{"id":"needs","text":"Needs","level":2},{"id":"files-that-use-add-ons","text":"Files that use add-ons","level":2},{"id":"skill-packs-and-agents","text":"Skill packs and agents","level":2},{"id":"offline","text":"Offline","level":2},{"id":"add-from-a-file","text":"Add from a file","level":2},{"id":"paid-add-ons-offline","text":"Paid add-ons offline","level":2},{"id":"ipad-and-iphone","text":"iPad and iPhone","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-an-add-on-is\"\u003EWhat an add-on is\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn add-on adds features (a new tool or panel) or data (regulation packs, materials, trade packs) to an app. You add it once in the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELibrary\u003C/span\u003E and it is on your account list, so it follows you to every edition: the browser, Studio, the portable build and the apps on a tablet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-list\"\u003EYour list\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd-ons\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYour add-ons\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESign in\u003C/strong\u003E connects this app to your account. Signed out, the app keeps a list for this device only, and offers to merge it into your account when you sign in. In Studio the sign-in shows a short code to approve in your browser.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERemove\u003C/strong\u003E takes an add-on off the list. It is refused while another add-on you keep needs it, and the screen names that add-on. When you remove something, anything that was brought in only for it is taken off too, and the screen says which.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECheck for updates\u003C/strong\u003E lists every change together. Updates inside the same major version arrive by themselves. A new major version, a changed permission, a pinned version or a lab version always asks you first, and an update is all or nothing: if one file fails its check, nothing changes.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKeep a version\u003C/strong\u003E pins it. \u003Cstrong\u003EFollow newest\u003C/strong\u003E unpins it. \u003Cstrong\u003ETry lab versions\u003C/strong\u003E moves one add-on to the lab channel.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERoll back\u003C/strong\u003E returns to the version you had.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"needs\"\u003ENeeds\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn add-on can need other add-ons or a shared engine. Add brings them along and tells you what it also adds, how big it is and which permissions it asks for. Engines are shared: one copy serves everything that needs it, and a copy nothing needs is freed after 30 days.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"files-that-use-add-ons\"\u003EFiles that use add-ons\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA drawing remembers the add-ons whose data it holds. Open it on a computer that does not have them and the app says &quot;This file uses ...&quot; and offers to add them. Until you do, the data stays in the file untouched.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"skill-packs-and-agents\"\u003ESkill packs and agents\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe add-on directory at \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd-ons\u003C/span\u003E on getcadcraft.com also lists skill packs and agents for your own AI assistant. They are text only: a skill pack is instructions your assistant reads, an agent is a listing that describes a program someone wrote that uses the apps&#039; tools. We host, run and vouch for none of an outside maker&#039;s code, and they have no price here. Open them with the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESkill packs\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAgents\u003C/span\u003E filters.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETo offer one, a verified member or lab tester uses \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend a skill pack\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend an agent listing\u003C/span\u003E in the directory once submissions are open. A person on our team reads every submission before it is listed, and the same review decides it as for any add-on.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"offline\"\u003EOffline\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDownload everything for offline\u003C/span\u003E fetches every add-on on your list. Once fetched, Studio and the portable build work with no connection. Each download is checked against its checksum and its signature before it is used.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn a browser, the website does the same for your whole list in one go: open \u003Cstrong\u003EYour add-ons\u003C/strong\u003E on getcadcraft.com and choose \u003Cstrong\u003EMake my add-ons available offline\u003C/strong\u003E under \u003Cstrong\u003EOffline on this device\u003C/strong\u003E, in the browser you will take with you. The check below it says how many are ready, how much is stored and when, and names anything missing or out of date. Add-ons that come inside an app are ready once that app is saved for offline (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E in the app bar). Browsers can clear stored files when space runs low, so look at that check before you go.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith no account, the Library keeps a list for this browser (&quot;Your add-ons in this browser&quot;) with the same button; \u003Cstrong\u003EUse offline\u003C/strong\u003E on an add-on&#039;s page adds it there and fetches it at once. Free add-ons only. Sign up and the list moves onto your account.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"add-from-a-file\"\u003EAdd from a file\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn an add-on&#039;s page, \u003Cstrong\u003EDownload as a file\u003C/strong\u003E saves its signed package (a \u003Ccode\u003E.ccaddon.json\u003C/code\u003E file). In the app, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd from a file\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYour add-ons\u003C/span\u003E takes that file with no connection needed, or drop the file onto the app&#039;s window. The app checks the signature first and refuses a file that was changed, is not signed by getcadcraft.com, or is made for another app. Reload the app to use it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"paid-add-ons-offline\"\u003EPaid add-ons offline\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA paid add-on keeps working offline through its licence on the device: a signed entitlement that lasts up to 30 days from the last time the app (or the Your add-ons page) was online, and never past the end of what you bought. Going online again renews it. A paid package file only installs on a device that holds a licence for it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ipad-and-iphone\"\u003EiPad and iPhone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAdd-ons that are only data download as usual. Code add-ons made by CadCraft are already inside the app and are switched on from your list. Code add-ons from outside makers are not offered on the iPad and iPhone apps; the browser app (Add to Home Screen) has them.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What an add-on is An add-on adds features (a new tool or panel) or data (regulation packs, materials, trade packs) to an app. You add it once in the Library and it is on your account list, so it follows you to every edition: the browser, Studio, the portable build and the apps on a tablet. Your list Open Settings › Add-ons › Your add-ons. Sign in connects this app to your account. Signed out, the app keeps a list for this device only, and offers to merge it into your account when you sign in. In Studio the sign-in shows a short code to approve in your browser. Remove takes an add-on off the list. It is refused while another add-on you keep needs it, and the screen names that add-on. When you remove something, anything that was brought in only for it is taken off too, and the screen says which. Check for updates lists every change together. Updates inside the same major version arrive by themselves. A new major version, a changed permission, a pinned version or a lab version always asks you first, and an update is all or nothing: if one file fails its check, nothing changes. Keep a version pins it. Follow newest unpins it. Try lab versions moves one add-on to the lab channel. Roll back returns to the version you had. Needs An add-on can need other add-ons or a shared engine. Add brings them along and tells you what it also adds, how big it is and which permissions it asks for. Engines are shared: one copy serves everything that needs it, and a copy nothing needs is freed after 30 days. Files that use add-ons A drawing remembers the add-ons whose data it holds. Open it on a computer that does not have them and the app says \"This file uses ...\" and offers to add them. Until you do, the data stays in the file untouched. Skill packs and agents The add-on directory at Add-ons on getcadcraft.com also lists skill packs and agents for your own AI assistant. They are text only: a skill pack is instructions your assistant reads, an agent is a listing that describes a program someone wrote that uses the apps' tools. We host, run and vouch for none of an outside maker's code, and they have no price here. Open them with the Skill packs and Agents filters. To offer one, a verified member or lab tester uses Send a skill pack or Send an agent listing in the directory once submissions are open. A person on our team reads every submission before it is listed, and the same review decides it as for any add-on. Offline Download everything for offline fetches every add-on on your list. Once fetched, Studio and the portable build work with no connection. Each download is checked against its checksum and its signature before it is used. In a browser, the website does the same for your whole list in one go: open Your add-ons on getcadcraft.com and choose Make my add-ons available offline under Offline on this device, in the browser you will take with you. The check below it says how many are ready, how much is stored and when, and names anything missing or out of date. Add-ons that come inside an app are ready once that app is saved for offline (Save for offline in the app bar). Browsers can clear stored files when space runs low, so look at that check before you go. With no account, the Library keeps a list for this browser (\"Your add-ons in this browser\") with the same button; Use offline on an add-on's page adds it there and fetches it at once. Free add-ons only. Sign up and the list moves onto your account. Add from a file On an add-on's page, Download as a file saves its signed package (a .ccaddon.json file). In the app, Add from a file under Your add-ons takes that file with no connection needed, or drop the file onto the app's window. The app checks the signature first and refuses a file that was changed, is not signed by getcadcraft.com, or is made for another app. Reload the app to use it. Paid add-ons offline A paid add-on keeps working offline through its licence on the device: a signed entitlement that lasts up to 30 days from the last time the app (or the Your add-ons page) was online, and never past the end of what you bought. Going online again renews it. A paid package file only installs on a device that holds a licence for it. iPad and iPhone Add-ons that are only data download as usual. Code add-ons made by CadCraft are already inside the app and are switched on from your list. Code add-ons from outside makers are not offered on the iPad and iPhone apps; the browser app (Add to Home Screen) has them.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"layout-edit","scope":"basics","title":"Change a layout on the screen","summary":"Drag a block to another place, right-click a tool to remove, move or add one, and keep the result as a layout of your own that you can export.","section":"start","order":40,"keywords":["layout","arrange","drag","handle","move block","right-click","tool","remove tool","add tool","new group","rename group","my layout","reset","undo","workspace","customize ribbon","customize toolbox","window","palette stack","large tools","small tools","more tools"],"headings":[{"id":"move-a-block","text":"Move a block","level":2},{"id":"change-what-a-block-holds","text":"Change what a block holds","level":2},{"id":"a-block-in-a-window-of-its-own","text":"A block in a window of its own","level":2},{"id":"palettes-in-two-stacks","text":"Palettes in two stacks","level":2},{"id":"switch-layouts","text":"Switch layouts","level":2},{"id":"keep-it","text":"Keep it","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EYou can change a layout without leaving the drawing. The built-in layout is never changed: your first change makes a copy named \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMy\u003C/span\u003E and the layout&#039;s name, and every later change edits that copy.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"move-a-block\"\u003EMove a block\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E, then \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E, and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArrange your own layout…\u003C/span\u003E. With a layout on, the screen goes into Arrange mode and the dialog closes.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEvery block (the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox, the palettes, the status bar and the others) has a small handle at its corner. Drag a handle: a map of the places appears. The places the block can go to are outlined; the others are dimmed and say why.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDrop the block on a place. The layout changes at once.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe bar at the bottom has \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E for each move, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset\u003C/span\u003E to bring the built-in layout back, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDone\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWithout a mouse: put the focus on a handle and press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. A list of the places that block may go to opens; choose one.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"change-what-a-block-holds\"\u003EChange what a block holds\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERight-click a tool in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove from here\u003C/span\u003E takes the tool out of its group (the tool is still in the app; it is only not shown here).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove earlier\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove later\u003C/span\u003E change its place in the group.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a tool\u003C/span\u003E lists the app&#039;s tools and then every command the app has; the one you pick goes after the tool you clicked.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew group\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERename the group\u003C/span\u003E make a group and name it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset this block\u003C/span\u003E gives the block back the tools the app offers.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow the first … tools\u003C/span\u003E keeps that many tools of the group in view; the rest wait under the group&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E▾\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow all its tools\u003C/span\u003E undoes it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the ribbon, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELarge tools\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESmall tools\u003C/span\u003E draw every tool of the group one size; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESizes as the app draws them\u003C/span\u003E goes back.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"a-block-in-a-window-of-its-own\"\u003EA block in a window of its own\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn Arrange mode the map of places also has \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIn a window\u003C/span\u003E for the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox and the status bar. The block stays in its place until you click \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen in windows\u003C/span\u003E in the note at the bottom: a browser opens a window only when you click. A layout file can ask for the same with the place \u003Ccode\u003Ewindow\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"palettes-in-two-stacks\"\u003EPalettes in two stacks\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe panel&#039;s palettes can stand in two stacks, one over the other, each with its own tabs. Drag a palette by its tab (or use the grip at the left of its stack&#039;s tabs) to the other stack, to a stack of its own, or to the other panel. Each move is one step of \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E. The panel&#039;s own content always stays in its panel.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"switch-layouts\"\u003ESwitch layouts\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELayouts are chosen in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E: your own layouts first, then the built-in ones and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClassic\u003C/span\u003E. Choosing one does not reload the app.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"keep-it\"\u003EKeep it\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYour layout is listed in Settings under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom add-ons and files\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport this layout\u003C/span\u003E saves it as a file you can give a colleague or check on the developers&#039; layouts page. The file only says where blocks go and which tools they hold: no code.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESee also \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-own\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-own\"\u003EArrange your own layout and save your setups\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"You can change a layout without leaving the drawing. The built-in layout is never changed: your first change makes a copy named My and the layout's name, and every later change edits that copy. Move a block Open Settings (the gear, or Ctrl+,), choose Global, then Layout, and choose Arrange your own layout…. With a layout on, the screen goes into Arrange mode and the dialog closes. Every block (the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox, the palettes, the status bar and the others) has a small handle at its corner. Drag a handle: a map of the places appears. The places the block can go to are outlined; the others are dimmed and say why. Drop the block on a place. The layout changes at once. The bar at the bottom has Undo and Redo for each move, Reset to bring the built-in layout back, and Done. Without a mouse: put the focus on a handle and press Enter. A list of the places that block may go to opens; choose one. Change what a block holds Right-click a tool in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox: Remove from here takes the tool out of its group (the tool is still in the app; it is only not shown here). Move earlier and Move later change its place in the group. Add a tool lists the app's tools and then every command the app has; the one you pick goes after the tool you clicked. New group and Rename the group make a group and name it. Reset this block gives the block back the tools the app offers. Show the first … tools keeps that many tools of the group in view; the rest wait under the group's ▾. Show all its tools undoes it. In the ribbon, Large tools and Small tools draw every tool of the group one size; Sizes as the app draws them goes back. A block in a window of its own In Arrange mode the map of places also has In a window for the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox and the status bar. The block stays in its place until you click Open in windows in the note at the bottom: a browser opens a window only when you click. A layout file can ask for the same with the place window. Palettes in two stacks The panel's palettes can stand in two stacks, one over the other, each with its own tabs. Drag a palette by its tab (or use the grip at the left of its stack's tabs) to the other stack, to a stack of its own, or to the other panel. Each move is one step of Undo. The panel's own content always stays in its panel. Switch layouts Layouts are chosen in Settings › Global › Layout: your own layouts first, then the built-in ones and Classic. Choosing one does not reload the app. Keep it Your layout is listed in Settings under From add-ons and files. Export this layout saves it as a file you can give a colleague or check on the developers' layouts page. The file only says where blocks go and which tools they hold: no code. See also Arrange your own layout and save your setups.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"offline","scope":"basics","title":"Ukusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi","summary":"Londoloza uhlelo ukuze lisetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi, okusebenza ngaphandle kokuxhumeka, nokudinga okuxhumeka.","section":"start","order":40,"keywords":["ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi","ayikho i-inthanethi","indiza","ukuvakasha endaweni","ikhashe","service worker","faka","landa","ukuxhumeka"],"headings":[{"id":"londoloza-uhlelo-ukuze-lisetshenziswe-ngaphandle-kwe-inthanethi","text":"Londoloza uhlelo ukuze lisetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi","level":2},{"id":"okusebenza-ngaphandle-kwe-inthanethi","text":"Okusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi","level":2},{"id":"okudinga-ukuxhumeka","text":"Okudinga ukuxhumeka","level":2},{"id":"okufanele-wazi","text":"Okufanele wazi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIzinhlelo zenza umsebenzi wazo kukhompyutha yakho, ngakho ingxenye enkulu yazo isebenza ngaphandle kokuxhumeka. Isiphequluli kuphela kudingeka sibe sesilondoloze amafayela ohlelo kuqala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"londoloza-uhlelo-ukuze-lisetshenziswe-ngaphandle-kwe-inthanethi\"\u003ELondoloza uhlelo ukuze lisetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVula uhlelo uma uxhunyiwe ku-inthanethi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhetha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E ebhareni ephezulu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELinda &quot;Ilungele ukusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi&quot;. Amafayela ohlelo, abafundi bawo namafayela nosizo lwalo manje alondoloziwe esiphequluleni sakho. Izinhlelo ezifunda amafayela e-DWG noma e-PDF nazo ziyalondoloza abafundi bazo, ngakho lokhu kungathatha umzuzu ngokuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYenza lokhu kanye ngohlelo ngalunye, kuzo zonke izisebenzi ozisebenzisayo. Ukuze ubuyele kuhlelo ngakamuva ngaphandle kokuxhumeka, vula ikheli ofuna ukulisebenzisa ngaphambili, noma ibhukimaki yalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"net:offline\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EOffline\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUsuphandle manje. Uma lolu hlelo lulondolozwe ukuze lusetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi, konke okungaphansi kuyasebenza. Uma kungalondolozwanga, usakwazi ukusebenzisa lokho okuse kulayishiwe kuleli thebhu, kodwa ungayilayishi kabusha uze uxhunyiwe futhi ku-inthanethi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okusebenza-ngaphandle-kwe-inthanethi\"\u003EOkusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuvula amafayela esuka kukhompyutha yakho, ukudweba, ukuhlela, ukulinganisa nokuhlola.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkulondoloza nokuthumela: ukulondoloza ngakunye kuwukulanda kukhompyutha yakho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELolu sizo, kufaka phakathi ukusesha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okudinga-ukuxhumeka\"\u003EOkudinga ukuxhumeka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuvula uhlelo okokuqala, nokulondoloza ukuze lisetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuthola inguqulo entsha yohlelo. Uma uxhunyiwe ku-inthanethi, uhlelo luthatha inguqulo entsha ngesikhathi esilandelayo livula, kanye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELondoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\u003C/span\u003E ivuselela ikhophi elondoloziwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzixhumanisi zewebhusayithi, njenge-\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVula kuwebhusayithi\u003C/span\u003E nezixhumanisi zamanye amakhasi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkulondoloza kuleyo nkomba (cloud) nokuvumelanisa phakathi kwezikhompyutha, okungakatholakali okwamanje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okufanele-wazi\"\u003EOkufanele wazi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIkhophi elilondoloziwe lingeleyo isiphequluli kukhompyutha eyodwa. Ukusula idatha yewebhusayithi yesiphequluli sakho kuyisusa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmawindi asengasese kwezinye izisebenzi, nezinye ikhompyutha zomsebenzi ezivalekile, azivumeli ukulondoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi. Inkinobho iyakutshela lapho ingakwazi ukulondoloza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ESafari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI-Safari isusa idatha elondoloziwe yewebhusayithi ongavakashelanga kuyo amasonto ambalwa. Vula uhlelo njalo ngezikhathi ezithile uma uxhunyiwe ku-inthanethi, noma ulondoloze kabusha ngaphambi kohambo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-CadCraft Studio, uhlelo lwedeskithophu olunazo zonke izinhlelo eziyisishiyagalombili ekufakweni kunye, lutholakala ku-getcadcraft.com/download.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Izinhlelo zenza umsebenzi wazo kukhompyutha yakho, ngakho ingxenye enkulu yazo isebenza ngaphandle kokuxhumeka. Isiphequluli kuphela kudingeka sibe sesilondoloze amafayela ohlelo kuqala. Londoloza uhlelo ukuze lisetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi Vula uhlelo uma uxhunyiwe ku-inthanethi. Khetha Londoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi ebhareni ephezulu. Linda \"Ilungele ukusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi\". Amafayela ohlelo, abafundi bawo namafayela nosizo lwalo manje alondoloziwe esiphequluleni sakho. Izinhlelo ezifunda amafayela e-DWG noma e-PDF nazo ziyalondoloza abafundi bazo, ngakho lokhu kungathatha umzuzu ngokuqala. Yenza lokhu kanye ngohlelo ngalunye, kuzo zonke izisebenzi ozisebenzisayo. Ukuze ubuyele kuhlelo ngakamuva ngaphandle kokuxhumeka, vula ikheli ofuna ukulisebenzisa ngaphambili, noma ibhukimaki yalo. Usuphandle manje. Uma lolu hlelo lulondolozwe ukuze lusetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi, konke okungaphansi kuyasebenza. Uma kungalondolozwanga, usakwazi ukusebenzisa lokho okuse kulayishiwe kuleli thebhu, kodwa ungayilayishi kabusha uze uxhunyiwe futhi ku-inthanethi. Okusebenza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi Ukuvula amafayela esuka kukhompyutha yakho, ukudweba, ukuhlela, ukulinganisa nokuhlola. Ukulondoloza nokuthumela: ukulondoloza ngakunye kuwukulanda kukhompyutha yakho. Lolu sizo, kufaka phakathi ukusesha. Okudinga ukuxhumeka Ukuvula uhlelo okokuqala, nokulondoloza ukuze lisetshenziswe ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi. Ukuthola inguqulo entsha yohlelo. Uma uxhunyiwe ku-inthanethi, uhlelo luthatha inguqulo entsha ngesikhathi esilandelayo livula, kanye Londoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi ivuselela ikhophi elondoloziwe. Izixhumanisi zewebhusayithi, njenge-Vula kuwebhusayithi nezixhumanisi zamanye amakhasi. Ukulondoloza kuleyo nkomba (cloud) nokuvumelanisa phakathi kwezikhompyutha, okungakatholakali okwamanje. Okufanele wazi Ikhophi elilondoloziwe lingeleyo isiphequluli kukhompyutha eyodwa. Ukusula idatha yewebhusayithi yesiphequluli sakho kuyisusa. Amawindi asengasese kwezinye izisebenzi, nezinye ikhompyutha zomsebenzi ezivalekile, azivumeli ukulondoloza ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi. Inkinobho iyakutshela lapho ingakwazi ukulondoloza. I-Safari isusa idatha elondoloziwe yewebhusayithi ongavakashelanga kuyo amasonto ambalwa. Vula uhlelo njalo ngezikhathi ezithile uma uxhunyiwe ku-inthanethi, noma ulondoloze kabusha ngaphambi kohambo. I-CadCraft Studio, uhlelo lwedeskithophu olunazo zonke izinhlelo eziyisishiyagalombili ekufakweni kunye, lutholakala ku-getcadcraft.com/download.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"layout-drafting","scope":"basics","title":"The Drafting layout: a 2D drafting workspace","summary":"A workspace with a menu bar, a ribbon, file tabs, a viewport label, navigation bar and axes over the drawing, Model and sheet tabs and a row of drawing-mode toggles, in dark chrome.","section":"start","order":42,"keywords":["drafting","layout","workspace","menu bar","ribbon","quick access","navigation bar","axes","viewport label","command line","model tab","sheet tab","status bar","toggles","grid","snap","ortho","polar","dark","2D"],"headings":[{"id":"what-is-where","text":"What is where","level":2},{"id":"choose-it","text":"Choose it","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EDrafting is a layout for people who draw in 2D all day: the whole chrome is dark, and the controls sit where drafting programs have taught people to look for them. It is built from the same blocks as every other layout, so it works in every app that has the parts it asks for and leaves out, with a note, the parts an app does not have (a view cube in an app with no 3D view, for example).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-is-where\"\u003EWhat is where\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETop row:\u003C/strong\u003E the app mark and name, your quick-access tools (the ones this app has), the document name and the window buttons. The document name shows a dot while there are unsaved changes.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMenu bar\u003C/strong\u003E under it, with the menus drafting programs use: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModify\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETools\u003C/span\u003E and the rest the app has.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERibbon\u003C/strong\u003E under the menu bar. A tab that appears when something is selected lights up in the app&#039;s colour. The ribbon never wraps: what does not fit goes behind a \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E button.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOver the drawing:\u003C/strong\u003E the view label at the top left, the navigation bar at the right edge and the axes at the bottom left. An app with a 3D view also gets a view cube at the top right. Between them the drawing keeps the pointer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECommand line:\u003C/strong\u003E in an app that has one (CadCraft), the app&#039;s own command bar stays where it was: Drafting does not add a second one.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBottom:\u003C/strong\u003E the Model and sheet tabs, and a row of mode toggles (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGrid\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESnap\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOrtho\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPolar\u003C/span\u003E and the others the app has) with the app&#039;s messages beside them. A toggle the app does not have is simply not there.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe app&#039;s name and logo show once, in the top row, whatever the width of the window.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"choose-it\"\u003EChoose it\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrafting\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClassic\u003C/span\u003E always brings back the layout you had. To move a block or change what a block holds, see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EChange a layout on the screen\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOn a phone, or in a window 760 pixels wide or narrower, the app uses its phone layout whatever you picked. A wider window brings Drafting back.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis layout is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Drafting is a layout for people who draw in 2D all day: the whole chrome is dark, and the controls sit where drafting programs have taught people to look for them. It is built from the same blocks as every other layout, so it works in every app that has the parts it asks for and leaves out, with a note, the parts an app does not have (a view cube in an app with no 3D view, for example). What is where Top row: the app mark and name, your quick-access tools (the ones this app has), the document name and the window buttons. The document name shows a dot while there are unsaved changes. Menu bar under it, with the menus drafting programs use: File, Edit, View, Modify, Tools and the rest the app has. Ribbon under the menu bar. A tab that appears when something is selected lights up in the app's colour. The ribbon never wraps: what does not fit goes behind a ⋯ button. Over the drawing: the view label at the top left, the navigation bar at the right edge and the axes at the bottom left. An app with a 3D view also gets a view cube at the top right. Between them the drawing keeps the pointer. Command line: in an app that has one (CadCraft), the app's own command bar stays where it was: Drafting does not add a second one. Bottom: the Model and sheet tabs, and a row of mode toggles (Grid, Snap, Ortho, Polar and the others the app has) with the app's messages beside them. A toggle the app does not have is simply not there. The app's name and logo show once, in the top row, whatever the width of the window. Choose it Settings › Global › Layout › Drafting. Classic always brings back the layout you had. To move a block or change what a block holds, see Change a layout on the screen. Good to know On a phone, or in a window 760 pixels wide or narrower, the app uses its phone layout whatever you picked. A wider window brings Drafting back. This layout is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"interface-sizes","scope":"basics","title":"The interface on a small laptop and on a very large screen","summary":"The interface picks a compact, normal or comfortable step for your window by itself, keeps side panels at a width that suits it, and folds extra tools into a menu instead of wrapping.","section":"start","order":43,"keywords":["density","compact","comfortable","small screen","laptop","13 inch","large screen","ultrawide","4k","panel width","toolbar wrap","scale","window size","responsive"],"headings":[{"id":"three-steps","text":"Three steps","level":2},{"id":"panels-and-bars","text":"Panels and bars","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThe interface follows the size of your window. You do not have to set anything.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"three-steps\"\u003EThree steps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECompact\u003C/strong\u003E on a small laptop screen (a window under 1600 pixels wide or 900 high), so the drawing gets the room.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENormal\u003C/strong\u003E on a regular monitor.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EComfortable\u003C/strong\u003E on a very wide, large screen (3000 pixels wide and 1200 high or more), where targets and type grow a little.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe step is chosen again when you resize the window or move it to another screen. It is separate from the Comfortable / Compact choice in the panels (see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EArrange the panels\u003C/a\u003E). A touch screen is never made compact.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panels-and-bars\"\u003EPanels and bars\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESide panels keep a width that fits the step and the window, so a panel is never a third of a small screen and never a sliver on an ultrawide. A bar of tools never wraps onto a second line: the tools that do not fit fold into a \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E menu at its end, and come back when the window is wider.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet. There is no setting to pick a step yourself yet. To hide the interface and show only the drawing, see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/present\" data-topic=\"basics/present\"\u003EPresent a drawing\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"The interface follows the size of your window. You do not have to set anything. Three steps Compact on a small laptop screen (a window under 1600 pixels wide or 900 high), so the drawing gets the room. Normal on a regular monitor. Comfortable on a very wide, large screen (3000 pixels wide and 1200 high or more), where targets and type grow a little. The step is chosen again when you resize the window or move it to another screen. It is separate from the Comfortable / Compact choice in the panels (see Arrange the panels). A touch screen is never made compact. Panels and bars Side panels keep a width that fits the step and the window, so a panel is never a third of a small screen and never a sliver on an ultrawide. A bar of tools never wraps onto a second line: the tools that do not fit fold into a ⋯ menu at its end, and come back when the window is wider. Good to know This is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet. There is no setting to pick a step yourself yet. To hide the interface and show only the drawing, see Present a drawing.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"theme-light-dark","scope":"basics","title":"Light and dark: the sun and the moon","summary":"Switch every app and the site between the light and the dark theme with the sun and the moon in the top bar, or pick one in Settings, or let your system decide.","section":"start","order":44,"keywords":["theme","light","dark","sun","moon","dark mode","light mode","night","paper","model","colours","contrast","match the system","appearance"],"headings":[{"id":"switch-it-in-the-top-bar","text":"Switch it in the top bar","level":2},{"id":"choose-it-in-settings","text":"Choose it in Settings","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EEvery CadCraft app and the website share one theme: light or dark. Change it in one app and the others and the site follow.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"switch-it-in-the-top-bar\"\u003ESwitch it in the top bar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAt the right of the top bar there are two small buttons:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ethe \u003Cstrong\u003Esun\u003C/strong\u003E is the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELight theme\u003C/span\u003E: a light page with dark lines;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ethe \u003Cstrong\u003Emoon\u003C/strong\u003E is the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDark theme\u003C/span\u003E: a dark page with light lines.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe one in use is lit. Hover over a button to see its name. On a phone the two buttons are in the top bar&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E menu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhere the sun and the moon are not there yet, the same two buttons carry the words \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaper\u003C/span\u003E (light) and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel\u003C/span\u003E (dark). They do the same thing.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"choose-it-in-settings\"\u003EChoose it in Settings\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETheme\u003C/span\u003E offers the light theme (the sun), the dark theme (the moon) and a third choice that matches your system. With that one the apps follow your computer&#039;s light or dark setting and change when it changes.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe theme is kept in this browser. It is not part of a \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-own\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-own\"\u003Ework environment\u003C/a\u003E and it does not change your drawing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe drawing&#039;s own spaces are a different thing: in CadCraft, model space and paper space (the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel\u003C/span\u003E tab and the sheet tabs) are where you draw and where you lay out sheets. The theme only changes the colours of the interface.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELogos and icons follow the theme by themselves.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Every CadCraft app and the website share one theme: light or dark. Change it in one app and the others and the site follow. Switch it in the top bar At the right of the top bar there are two small buttons: the sun is the Light theme: a light page with dark lines; the moon is the Dark theme: a dark page with light lines. The one in use is lit. Hover over a button to see its name. On a phone the two buttons are in the top bar's More menu. Where the sun and the moon are not there yet, the same two buttons carry the words Paper (light) and Model (dark). They do the same thing. Choose it in Settings Settings › Global › Theme offers the light theme (the sun), the dark theme (the moon) and a third choice that matches your system. With that one the apps follow your computer's light or dark setting and change when it changes. Good to know The theme is kept in this browser. It is not part of a work environment and it does not change your drawing. The drawing's own spaces are a different thing: in CadCraft, model space and paper space (the Model tab and the sheet tabs) are where you draw and where you lay out sheets. The theme only changes the colours of the interface. Logos and icons follow the theme by themselves.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"craft-menu","scope":"basics","title":"The CadCraft menu: settings, help, presenting and your account in one place","summary":"In the Drafting layout, the app mark and name at the top left open one menu with Settings, Full screen, Help, About, Save for offline, Present, the theme switch and your account. Pin what you use often to the top row.","section":"start","order":44,"keywords":["craft menu","cadcraft menu","app menu","settings","full screen","help","about","offline","present","presentation","account","sign in","sign out","theme","light","dark","sun","moon","pin","add-ons","alt+o","find"],"headings":[{"id":"what-the-menu-holds","text":"What the menu holds","level":2},{"id":"pin-what-you-use-often","text":"Pin what you use often","level":2},{"id":"add-ons-and-find","text":"Add-ons and Find","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThe buttons that belong to the site rather than to your drawing sit in one menu. Click the app mark and name at the very top left, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option O\"\u003E⌥O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-the-menu-holds\"\u003EWhat the menu holds\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFull screen\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHelp\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAbout\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E, when the app can be kept on this computer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPresent\u003C/span\u003E: hides the interface so only the drawing shows. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/present\" data-topic=\"basics/present\"\u003EPresent a drawing\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVisit GetCadCraft.com\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA row of two icons for the theme: the sun is the light theme, the moon is the dark theme.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAccount\u003C/span\u003E with \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESign out\u003C/span\u003E under it, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESign in\u003C/span\u003E when you are not signed in.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pin-what-you-use-often\"\u003EPin what you use often\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach option has a small dot at its right. Click the dot to pin that option as a button in the top row, and click it again to unpin it. Up to six options can be pinned. A number on a pinned button, or on the app mark, is something waiting for you.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"add-ons-and-find\"\u003EAdd-ons and Find\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd-ons\u003C/span\u003E in the top row lists the add-ons and panels; a tick means one is open, and picking it opens or closes it. At the right of the top row, the search box finds commands and help topics.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe menu is part of the Drafting layout (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrafting\u003C/span\u003E). The other layouts keep these buttons in the app bar. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-drafting\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-drafting\"\u003EThe Drafting layout\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"The buttons that belong to the site rather than to your drawing sit in one menu. Click the app mark and name at the very top left, or press Alt+O. What the menu holds Settings (Ctrl+,), Full screen, Help (F1) and About. Save for offline, when the app can be kept on this computer. Present: hides the interface so only the drawing shows. See Present a drawing. Visit GetCadCraft.com. A row of two icons for the theme: the sun is the light theme, the moon is the dark theme. Account with Sign out under it, or Sign in when you are not signed in. Pin what you use often Each option has a small dot at its right. Click the dot to pin that option as a button in the top row, and click it again to unpin it. Up to six options can be pinned. A number on a pinned button, or on the app mark, is something waiting for you. Add-ons and Find Add-ons in the top row lists the add-ons and panels; a tick means one is open, and picking it opens or closes it. At the right of the top row, the search box finds commands and help topics. Good to know The menu is part of the Drafting layout (Settings › Global › Layout › Drafting). The other layouts keep these buttons in the app bar. See The Drafting layout. This is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"present","scope":"basics","title":"Present a drawing: hide the interface","summary":"Present hides the bars, ribbon and palettes so a client sees only the drawing. Nothing closes; Esc or Exit presentation brings everything back.","section":"start","order":45,"keywords":["present","presentation","presentation mode","show client","hide interface","clean view","hide toolbars","hide panels","meeting","exit presentation","escape"],"headings":[{"id":"start-presenting","text":"Start presenting","level":2},{"id":"stop-presenting","text":"Stop presenting","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EWhen you show a drawing to someone across a table or on a shared screen, the interface gets in the way. Present hides it and leaves the drawing.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"start-presenting\"\u003EStart presenting\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen the CadCraft menu (click the app mark and name at the top left, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option O\"\u003E⌥O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) and pick \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPresent\u003C/span\u003E. To have it one click away, pin it to the top row with the dot beside it (see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/craft-menu\" data-topic=\"basics/craft-menu\"\u003EThe CadCraft menu\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe title bar, menu bar, ribbon, palettes, status bar and the marks over the drawing are hidden. The view cube stays, so you can still turn a 3D view.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"stop-presenting\"\u003EStop presenting\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPress \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, or click \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExit presentation\u003C/span\u003E at the top right corner. Everything comes back where it was: nothing was closed and nothing in the drawing changed.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPresent is in the Drafting layout, where the CadCraft menu is.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"When you show a drawing to someone across a table or on a shared screen, the interface gets in the way. Present hides it and leaves the drawing. Start presenting Open the CadCraft menu (click the app mark and name at the top left, or press Alt+O) and pick Present. To have it one click away, pin it to the top row with the dot beside it (see The CadCraft menu). The title bar, menu bar, ribbon, palettes, status bar and the marks over the drawing are hidden. The view cube stays, so you can still turn a 3D view. Stop presenting Press Esc, or click Exit presentation at the top right corner. Everything comes back where it was: nothing was closed and nothing in the drawing changed. Good to know Present is in the Drafting layout, where the CadCraft menu is. This is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"your-files","scope":"basics","title":"Lapho amafayela akho aya khona","summary":"Amafayela ahlala kukhompyutha yakho, indlela ukulondoloza ngayo, nokuthi isiphequluli sikhumbula ini.","section":"start","order":50,"keywords":["ubumfihlo","ukulayisha phezulu","ifu","londoloza","landa","isitoreji","endaweni","ukuphepha","imfihlo"],"headings":[{"id":"amafayela-akho-ahlala-kukhompyutha-yakho","text":"Amafayela akho ahlala kukhompyutha yakho","level":2},{"id":"indlela-ukulondoloza-ngayo","text":"Indlela ukulondoloza ngayo","level":2},{"id":"okukhunjulwa-yisiphequluli","text":"Okukhunjulwa yisiphequluli","level":2},{"id":"ukulondoloza-ngefu","text":"Ukulondoloza ngefu","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"amafayela-akho-ahlala-kukhompyutha-yakho\"\u003EAmafayela akho ahlala kukhompyutha yakho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUma uvula umdwebo, imodeli noma i-PDF, uhlelo luyifunda ngaphakathi kwesiphequluli sakho. \u003Cstrong\u003EIfayela alilayishwa phezulu.\u003C/strong\u003E Thina asikaze siyibone, futhi isebenza ngendlela efanayo ngaphandle kokuxhumeka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"indlela-ukulondoloza-ngayo\"\u003EIndlela ukulondoloza ngayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIkhasi lesiphequluli alikwazi ukubhala phezu kwamafayela kukhompyutha yakho ngokwalo, ngakho izinhlelo zilondoloza ngokulanda ifayela elisha \u003Cstrong\u003E(ngokulanda)\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkulanda kuya lapho isiphequluli sakho sibeka khona okulandwayo, ngokuvamile kufolda yakho ye-Downloads, ngaphandle uma usethe isiphequluli ukuthi sibuze njalo (bona \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/browsers#what-differs-between-browsers\" data-topic=\"basics/browsers\" data-hash=\"what-differs-between-browsers\"\u003EIzisebenzi nekhompyutha\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinhlelo ezishintsha ifayela zilondoloza ikhophi ngegama elisha, njengo &quot;(edited)&quot; noma &quot;(marked up)&quot;, ukuze umsuka wakho uhlale ungathintwanga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUma uvala ithebhu enomsebenzi ongalondolozwanga, isiphequluli sibuza kuqala (&quot;Leave site?&quot;).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"okukhunjulwa-yisiphequluli\"\u003EOkukhunjulwa yisiphequluli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEzinye izinhlelo zikhumbula izilungiselelo ezincane esiphequluleni sakho, njengegama lomlobi noma izitayela zamathuluzi. Zihlala kuleso siphequluli kukhompyutha leyo, nokusula idatha yewebhusayithi kuzisusa. Usizo lwalo ngalunye luyasho okulondolozayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ukulondoloza-ngefu\"\u003EUkulondoloza ngefu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkulondoloza ngefu nokuvumelanisa phakathi kwezikhompyutha kungxenye yelayisensi yezentengiselwano. Azikatholakali okwamanje. Kuze kube yilapho, gcina amafayela akho lapho ugcina amanye amafayela ephrojekthi, uwasekele ngendlela ejwayelekile.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Amafayela akho ahlala kukhompyutha yakho Uma uvula umdwebo, imodeli noma i-PDF, uhlelo luyifunda ngaphakathi kwesiphequluli sakho. Ifayela alilayishwa phezulu. Thina asikaze siyibone, futhi isebenza ngendlela efanayo ngaphandle kokuxhumeka. Indlela ukulondoloza ngayo Ikhasi lesiphequluli alikwazi ukubhala phezu kwamafayela kukhompyutha yakho ngokwalo, ngakho izinhlelo zilondoloza ngokulanda ifayela elisha (ngokulanda): Ukulanda kuya lapho isiphequluli sakho sibeka khona okulandwayo, ngokuvamile kufolda yakho ye-Downloads, ngaphandle uma usethe isiphequluli ukuthi sibuze njalo (bona Izisebenzi nekhompyutha). Izinhlelo ezishintsha ifayela zilondoloza ikhophi ngegama elisha, njengo \"(edited)\" noma \"(marked up)\", ukuze umsuka wakho uhlale ungathintwanga. Uma uvala ithebhu enomsebenzi ongalondolozwanga, isiphequluli sibuza kuqala (\"Leave site?\"). Okukhunjulwa yisiphequluli Ezinye izinhlelo zikhumbula izilungiselelo ezincane esiphequluleni sakho, njengegama lomlobi noma izitayela zamathuluzi. Zihlala kuleso siphequluli kukhompyutha leyo, nokusula idatha yewebhusayithi kuzisusa. Usizo lwalo ngalunye luyasho okulondolozayo. Ukulondoloza ngefu Ukulondoloza ngefu nokuvumelanisa phakathi kwezikhompyutha kungxenye yelayisensi yezentengiselwano. Azikatholakali okwamanje. Kuze kube yilapho, gcina amafayela akho lapho ugcina amanye amafayela ephrojekthi, uwasekele ngendlela ejwayelekile.","lang":"zu"},{"slug":"connect-ai-windows","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on Windows","summary":"Let your own AI app work with the CadCraft apps: one click in CadCraft Studio, or a short paste for each AI app. Includes the one-line test that proves it works.","section":"start","order":63,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","mcp","claude","cursor","vs code","windsurf","codex","gemini","set up","test","windows"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"the-easy-way","text":"The easy way","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"or-paste-it-yourself","text":"Or paste it yourself","level":2},{"id":"claude-desktop","text":"Claude Desktop","level":3},{"id":"claude-code","text":"Claude Code","level":3},{"id":"cursor","text":"Cursor","level":3},{"id":"windsurf","text":"Windsurf","level":3},{"id":"visual-studio-code","text":"Visual Studio Code","level":3},{"id":"codex-cli","text":"Codex CLI","level":3},{"id":"google-antigravity","text":"Google Antigravity","level":3},{"id":"gemini-cli","text":"Gemini CLI","level":3},{"id":"browser-ai-and-phones","text":"Browser AI and phones","level":2},{"id":"if-it-does-not-work","text":"If it does not work","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, &quot;MCP&quot;.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-easy-way\"\u003EThe easy way\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one&#039;s settings, and writes it only after you press \u003Cstrong\u003EYes\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EDisconnect\u003C/strong\u003E takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app&#039;s settings.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIt should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the \u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E that is on to begin with. In Studio, \u003Cstrong\u003ECheck the connection\u003C/strong\u003E tests each step without the AI and says which one failed.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"or-paste-it-yourself\"\u003EOr paste it yourself\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOne card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E and nothing else.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-desktop\"\u003EClaude Desktop\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERestart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-code\"\u003EClaude Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen a terminal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERun the command below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Claude Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eclaude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cursor\"\u003ECursor\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Cursor and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"windsurf\"\u003EWindsurf\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Windsurf and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"visual-studio-code\"\u003EVisual Studio Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;servers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;stdio&quot;,\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"codex-cli\"\u003ECodex CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcp_servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E[mcp_servers.cadcraft]\ncommand = &quot;npx&quot;\nargs = [&quot;-y&quot;,&quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,&quot;connect&quot;]\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"google-antigravity\"\u003EGoogle Antigravity\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"gemini-cli\"\u003EGemini CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browser-ai-and-phones\"\u003EBrowser AI and phones\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-it-does-not-work\"\u003EIf it does not work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe AI app does not list CadCraft:\u003C/strong\u003E restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Could not reach CadCraft Studio&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIt can look but not change:\u003C/strong\u003E Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, \"MCP\".) The easy way Open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one's settings, and writes it only after you press Yes. Disconnect takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app's settings. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. It should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the Read that is on to begin with. In Studio, Check the connection tests each step without the AI and says which one failed. Or paste it yourself One card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named cadcraft and nothing else. Claude Desktop Open %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Restart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json. Claude Code Open a terminal. Run the command below. Start Claude Code and ask it the test prompt. claude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect Undo: claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user Cursor Open %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Cursor and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Windsurf Open %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Windsurf and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Visual Studio Code Open %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"servers\" if the file has one). Start Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt. { \"servers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"type\": \"stdio\", \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Codex CLI Open %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcp_servers\" if the file has one). Start Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt. [mcp_servers.cadcraft] command = \"npx\" args = [\"-y\",\"@getcadcraft/mcp\",\"connect\"] Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Google Antigravity Open %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Gemini CLI Open %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Browser AI and phones AI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the hosted connector instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link. If it does not work The AI app does not list CadCraft: restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings. \"Could not reach CadCraft Studio\": open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on. It can look but not change: Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"connect-ai-macos","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on a Mac","summary":"Let your own AI app work with the CadCraft apps: one click in CadCraft Studio, or a short paste for each AI app. Includes the one-line test that proves it works.","section":"start","order":64,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","mcp","claude","cursor","vs code","windsurf","codex","gemini","set up","test","macos"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"the-easy-way","text":"The easy way","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"or-paste-it-yourself","text":"Or paste it yourself","level":2},{"id":"claude-desktop","text":"Claude Desktop","level":3},{"id":"claude-code","text":"Claude Code","level":3},{"id":"cursor","text":"Cursor","level":3},{"id":"windsurf","text":"Windsurf","level":3},{"id":"visual-studio-code","text":"Visual Studio Code","level":3},{"id":"codex-cli","text":"Codex CLI","level":3},{"id":"google-antigravity","text":"Google Antigravity","level":3},{"id":"gemini-cli","text":"Gemini CLI","level":3},{"id":"browser-ai-and-phones","text":"Browser AI and phones","level":2},{"id":"if-it-does-not-work","text":"If it does not work","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, &quot;MCP&quot;.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-easy-way\"\u003EThe easy way\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one&#039;s settings, and writes it only after you press \u003Cstrong\u003EYes\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EDisconnect\u003C/strong\u003E takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app&#039;s settings.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIt should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the \u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E that is on to begin with. In Studio, \u003Cstrong\u003ECheck the connection\u003C/strong\u003E tests each step without the AI and says which one failed.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"or-paste-it-yourself\"\u003EOr paste it yourself\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOne card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E and nothing else.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-desktop\"\u003EClaude Desktop\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERestart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-code\"\u003EClaude Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen a terminal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERun the command below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Claude Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eclaude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cursor\"\u003ECursor\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Cursor and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"windsurf\"\u003EWindsurf\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Windsurf and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"visual-studio-code\"\u003EVisual Studio Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;servers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;stdio&quot;,\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"codex-cli\"\u003ECodex CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcp_servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E[mcp_servers.cadcraft]\ncommand = &quot;npx&quot;\nargs = [&quot;-y&quot;,&quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,&quot;connect&quot;]\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codex/config.toml.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"google-antigravity\"\u003EGoogle Antigravity\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"gemini-cli\"\u003EGemini CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browser-ai-and-phones\"\u003EBrowser AI and phones\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-it-does-not-work\"\u003EIf it does not work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe AI app does not list CadCraft:\u003C/strong\u003E restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Could not reach CadCraft Studio&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIt can look but not change:\u003C/strong\u003E Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, \"MCP\".) The easy way Open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one's settings, and writes it only after you press Yes. Disconnect takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app's settings. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. It should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the Read that is on to begin with. In Studio, Check the connection tests each step without the AI and says which one failed. Or paste it yourself One card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named cadcraft and nothing else. Claude Desktop Open ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Restart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json. Claude Code Open a terminal. Run the command below. Start Claude Code and ask it the test prompt. claude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect Undo: claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user Cursor Open ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Cursor and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Windsurf Open ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Windsurf and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Visual Studio Code Open ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"servers\" if the file has one). Start Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt. { \"servers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"type\": \"stdio\", \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Codex CLI Open ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcp_servers\" if the file has one). Start Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt. [mcp_servers.cadcraft] command = \"npx\" args = [\"-y\",\"@getcadcraft/mcp\",\"connect\"] Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codex/config.toml. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Google Antigravity Open ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Gemini CLI Open ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Browser AI and phones AI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the hosted connector instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link. If it does not work The AI app does not list CadCraft: restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings. \"Could not reach CadCraft Studio\": open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on. It can look but not change: Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"connect-ai-linux","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on Linux","summary":"Let your own AI app work with the CadCraft apps: one click in CadCraft Studio, or a short paste for each AI app. Includes the one-line test that proves it works.","section":"start","order":65,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","mcp","claude","cursor","vs code","windsurf","codex","gemini","set up","test","linux"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"the-easy-way","text":"The easy way","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"or-paste-it-yourself","text":"Or paste it yourself","level":2},{"id":"claude-desktop","text":"Claude Desktop","level":3},{"id":"claude-code","text":"Claude Code","level":3},{"id":"cursor","text":"Cursor","level":3},{"id":"windsurf","text":"Windsurf","level":3},{"id":"visual-studio-code","text":"Visual Studio Code","level":3},{"id":"codex-cli","text":"Codex CLI","level":3},{"id":"google-antigravity","text":"Google Antigravity","level":3},{"id":"gemini-cli","text":"Gemini CLI","level":3},{"id":"browser-ai-and-phones","text":"Browser AI and phones","level":2},{"id":"if-it-does-not-work","text":"If it does not work","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, &quot;MCP&quot;.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-easy-way\"\u003EThe easy way\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one&#039;s settings, and writes it only after you press \u003Cstrong\u003EYes\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EDisconnect\u003C/strong\u003E takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app&#039;s settings.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIt should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the \u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E that is on to begin with. In Studio, \u003Cstrong\u003ECheck the connection\u003C/strong\u003E tests each step without the AI and says which one failed.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"or-paste-it-yourself\"\u003EOr paste it yourself\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOne card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E and nothing else.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-desktop\"\u003EClaude Desktop\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERestart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-code\"\u003EClaude Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen a terminal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERun the command below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Claude Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eclaude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cursor\"\u003ECursor\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Cursor and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"windsurf\"\u003EWindsurf\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Windsurf and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"visual-studio-code\"\u003EVisual Studio Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;servers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;stdio&quot;,\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"codex-cli\"\u003ECodex CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcp_servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E[mcp_servers.cadcraft]\ncommand = &quot;npx&quot;\nargs = [&quot;-y&quot;,&quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,&quot;connect&quot;]\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codex/config.toml.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"google-antigravity\"\u003EGoogle Antigravity\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"gemini-cli\"\u003EGemini CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browser-ai-and-phones\"\u003EBrowser AI and phones\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-it-does-not-work\"\u003EIf it does not work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe AI app does not list CadCraft:\u003C/strong\u003E restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Could not reach CadCraft Studio&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIt can look but not change:\u003C/strong\u003E Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, \"MCP\".) The easy way Open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one's settings, and writes it only after you press Yes. Disconnect takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app's settings. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. It should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the Read that is on to begin with. In Studio, Check the connection tests each step without the AI and says which one failed. Or paste it yourself One card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named cadcraft and nothing else. Claude Desktop Open ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Restart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json. Claude Code Open a terminal. Run the command below. Start Claude Code and ask it the test prompt. claude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect Undo: claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user Cursor Open ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Cursor and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Windsurf Open ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Windsurf and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Visual Studio Code Open ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"servers\" if the file has one). Start Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt. { \"servers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"type\": \"stdio\", \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Codex CLI Open ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcp_servers\" if the file has one). Start Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt. [mcp_servers.cadcraft] command = \"npx\" args = [\"-y\",\"@getcadcraft/mcp\",\"connect\"] Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codex/config.toml. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Google Antigravity Open ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Gemini CLI Open ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Browser AI and phones AI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the hosted connector instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link. If it does not work The AI app does not list CadCraft: restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings. \"Could not reach CadCraft Studio\": open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on. It can look but not change: Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"connect-ai-mobile","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on a phone or tablet","summary":"How your own AI app reaches the CadCraft apps from a phone or tablet: through the hosted connector, with CadCraft Studio open on a computer. Includes the one-line test.","section":"start","order":66,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","android","ipad","phone","tablet","hosted connector","test"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"how","text":"How","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"what-it-can-and-cannot-do","text":"What it can and cannot do","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn AI app on a phone or tablet cannot read a settings file on your computer, so it does not use the paste cards. It connects to a \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead, and CadCraft Studio must be open on a computer you own to answer.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"how\"\u003EHow\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOn the computer, open \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E and choose \u003Cstrong\u003EHosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio shows the address to add and asks you to sign in.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn your AI app, add a connector (a &quot;remote&quot; or &quot;custom&quot; connector) with that address and sign in when asked.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKeep Studio open. When it is closed the AI app says CadCraft is not reachable.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-can-and-cannot-do\"\u003EWhat it can and cannot do\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe hosted connector carries only the tool calls and their answers for the apps and permissions you allowed. It never holds your files, and the answers are marked as data from your files, not as instructions. You can disconnect it in Studio at any time.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn An AI app on a phone or tablet cannot read a settings file on your computer, so it does not use the paste cards. It connects to a hosted connector instead, and CadCraft Studio must be open on a computer you own to answer. How On the computer, open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI and choose Hosted connector. Studio shows the address to add and asks you to sign in. In your AI app, add a connector (a \"remote\" or \"custom\" connector) with that address and sign in when asked. Keep Studio open. When it is closed the AI app says CadCraft is not reachable. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. What it can and cannot do The hosted connector carries only the tool calls and their answers for the apps and permissions you allowed. It never holds your files, and the answers are marked as data from your files, not as instructions. You can disconnect it in Studio at any time.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"local-models","scope":"basics","title":"Use an AI that runs on your own computer","summary":"Work with a local AI model and no network: through an AI app that can use tools, .","section":"start","order":66,"keywords":["ai","assistant","local","offline","ollama","lm studio","llama.cpp","jan","air-gapped","private","model","ask box"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"how","text":"How","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to use an AI model that runs on your own computer, so nothing you ask leaves it. This suits firms that cannot send drawings to an outside service. The apps contain no AI; the model asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"how\"\u003EHow\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUse an AI app on this computer that can use tools. LM Studio, Jan and llama.cpp&#039;s server can each use tools through the Model Context Protocol (&quot;MCP&quot;). Add the single \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E entry shown in \u003Cstrong\u003EConnect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E, open CadCraft Studio, then ask your question in that app.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EProgram\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ECan use tools through MCP\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELM Studio\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYes\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ellama.cpp (llama-server)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYes, start it with \u003Ccode\u003E--jinja\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYes, turn on tool calling for the model\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOllama\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENot on its own: use it as the model, with Jan or an editor in front\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis list is taken from each program&#039;s own documentation. It has not yet been tried with every program on every system.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERaise the model&#039;s context length before you start; the default in some programs is small and tool descriptions will not fit.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESmall models call tools less reliably than large hosted ones. If the answer says what it would do but nothing changes, try a larger model or a model marked as able to use tools.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEverything else stays the same: the permission levels, \u003Cstrong\u003ESuggest\u003C/strong\u003E mode, the folders you allowed and the activity list. A model on this computer sends nothing out.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to use an AI model that runs on your own computer, so nothing you ask leaves it. This suits firms that cannot send drawings to an outside service. The apps contain no AI; the model asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. How Use an AI app on this computer that can use tools. LM Studio, Jan and llama.cpp's server can each use tools through the Model Context Protocol (\"MCP\"). Add the single cadcraft entry shown in Connect your AI, open CadCraft Studio, then ask your question in that app. Program Can use tools through MCP LM Studio Yes llama.cpp (llama-server) Yes, start it with --jinja Jan Yes, turn on tool calling for the model Ollama Not on its own: use it as the model, with Jan or an editor in front This list is taken from each program's own documentation. It has not yet been tried with every program on every system. Good to know Raise the model's context length before you start; the default in some programs is small and tool descriptions will not fit. Small models call tools less reliably than large hosted ones. If the answer says what it would do but nothing changes, try a larger model or a model marked as able to use tools. Everything else stays the same: the permission levels, Suggest mode, the folders you allowed and the activity list. A model on this computer sends nothing out.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"engines","scope":"basics","title":"Run an engine on a model","summary":"The Engines panel runs the shared calculation engines (schematics, pipe and power networks, motion, queues, schedule and cost, requirements, risk, live data, circuits, boards, systems, PLC) on a model you paste.","section":"tasks","order":40,"keywords":["engines","schematic","network","power","load flow","robot","kinematics","queue","simulation","schedule","critical path","requirements","risk","fault tree","modbus","circuit","spice","board","pcb","modelica","plc"],"headings":[{"id":"run-one","text":"Run one","level":2},{"id":"controls-on-a-model-or-on-the-3d-scene","text":"Controls on a model, or on the 3D scene","level":2},{"id":"things-to-know","text":"Things to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESome calculations are the same in every app, so they live in one panel instead of eight. Open \u003Cstrong\u003EEngines\u003C/strong\u003E from the button in the bar at the top, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E and type &quot;engines&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"run-one\"\u003ERun one\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose an engine from the list: schematics, pipe networks and power systems, motion and robots, queues, schedule and cost, requirements, risk, live data, circuits, boards, systems or controls.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose a worked example, or replace the text with your own model. Most engines read JSON; circuits, systems and controls read their own text (a circuit deck, Modelica, structured text).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPress \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERun\u003C/span\u003E. The results come back as tables, with the engine&#039;s own problems above them and the limits of its method below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset\u003C/span\u003E puts the example text back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"controls-on-a-model-or-on-the-3d-scene\"\u003EControls on a model, or on the 3D scene\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe controls engine also takes a JSON input that ties a structured-text program to something it can sense and command. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe program bound to a flow model\u003C/span\u003E is the queues engine&#039;s model. In ModelCraft, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe program bound to the 3D scene\u003C/span\u003E ties it to the placements (groups and components) of the open model: a sensor reads \u003Ccode\u003EName.x\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EName.y\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EName.z\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EName.rotZ\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003EName.hidden\u003C/code\u003E, a command writes one of them, and the program decides. Position sensors are whole numbers, so give each a \u003Ccode\u003Escale\u003C/code\u003E (1000 turns metres into millimetres); a command is on or off, and \u003Ccode\u003Evalues\u003C/code\u003E says what off and on mean (\u003Ccode\u003E[0, 2]\u003C/code\u003E puts the placement at 0 or 2 m). A run changes nothing in the model: the results table shows where each placement would end up. Add \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;keep&quot;: true\u003C/code\u003E to write the final state into the model as one undo step. A placement that is not in the model is reported by name.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"things-to-know\"\u003EThings to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEverything runs in this page. Nothing is uploaded, and nothing is saved in your file.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EProblems the engine finds also appear in the Problems panel, under their own source.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe examples are small on purpose, with answers you can check by hand. They are a way to see what an engine does, not a design.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe results are calculation aids. A person who is responsible for the design checks them.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Some calculations are the same in every app, so they live in one panel instead of eight. Open Engines from the button in the bar at the top, or press Ctrl+K and type \"engines\". Run one Choose an engine from the list: schematics, pipe networks and power systems, motion and robots, queues, schedule and cost, requirements, risk, live data, circuits, boards, systems or controls. Choose a worked example, or replace the text with your own model. Most engines read JSON; circuits, systems and controls read their own text (a circuit deck, Modelica, structured text). Press Run. The results come back as tables, with the engine's own problems above them and the limits of its method below. Reset puts the example text back. Controls on a model, or on the 3D scene The controls engine also takes a JSON input that ties a structured-text program to something it can sense and command. The program bound to a flow model is the queues engine's model. In ModelCraft, The program bound to the 3D scene ties it to the placements (groups and components) of the open model: a sensor reads Name.x, Name.y, Name.z, Name.rotZ or Name.hidden, a command writes one of them, and the program decides. Position sensors are whole numbers, so give each a scale (1000 turns metres into millimetres); a command is on or off, and values says what off and on mean ([0, 2] puts the placement at 0 or 2 m). A run changes nothing in the model: the results table shows where each placement would end up. Add \"keep\": true to write the final state into the model as one undo step. A placement that is not in the model is reported by name. Things to know Everything runs in this page. Nothing is uploaded, and nothing is saved in your file. Problems the engine finds also appear in the Problems panel, under their own source. The examples are small on purpose, with answers you can check by hand. They are a way to see what an engine does, not a design. The results are calculation aids. A person who is responsible for the design checks them.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"assistant-in-the-app","scope":"basics","title":"Ask for help inside the app","summary":"Open the Ask box from Help, see why something happened from the steps you took, report a problem with those steps, and see exactly what an assistant was sent.","section":"tasks","order":62,"keywords":["show me how","teacher","walk me through","how do i","sign off","signed off","unsigned","unverified","figures","rules","ask","assistant","ai","help button","why did this happen","history","steps","undo","report a problem","bug report","model excerpt","model data only","personal data","sent back","held back","project stage","brief","concept","tender","step by step","teacher","knowledge pack"],"headings":[{"id":"open-it-from-help","text":"Open it from Help","level":2},{"id":"why-did-this-happen","text":"Why did this happen?","level":2},{"id":"report-a-problem-with-the-steps","text":"Report a problem with the steps","level":2},{"id":"what-an-assistant-is-sent","text":"What an assistant is sent","level":2},{"id":"project-stage","text":"Project stage","level":2},{"id":"show-me-how-with-no-assistant","text":"Show me how, with no assistant","level":2},{"id":"rules-every-assistant-follows","text":"Rules every assistant follows","level":2},{"id":"sign-off-an-estimate-or-an-audit","text":"Sign off an estimate or an audit","level":2},{"id":"step-by-step-on-your-screen","text":"Step by step on your screen","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThe apps contain no AI. The Ask box sends a question to the assistant you connected, which answers by using the app&#039;s own tools. This page covers what is around that box. It is in the lab builds.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"open-it-from-help\"\u003EOpen it from Help\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPress \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E or choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHelp\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsk the assistant\u003C/span\u003E at the top of the Help panel. The Ask box opens.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EType your question and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsk\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith a question goes a short note of where you are: the file&#039;s name, how much is selected, the screen layout, the tool in use and the project stage. It never holds text from the file.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"why-did-this-happen\"\u003EWhy did this happen?\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the Ask box choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhy did this happen?\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERead the list. It is the last steps in this window, oldest first: the commands you started, each change to the model by its name in the undo list, steps you took back or put back, and what an assistant did or was refused.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWith an assistant connected, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsk the assistant to explain\u003C/span\u003E and it explains from those same steps.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe list works with no assistant connected. It is a record of steps, not a judgement.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"report-a-problem-with-the-steps\"\u003EReport a problem with the steps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the Ask box, type what went wrong and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReport a problem\u003C/span\u003E. The app&#039;s own About box opens with your words in it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELeave \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd the steps I took before it happened\u003C/span\u003E ticked. Open \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESee the steps\u003C/span\u003E to read them first.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOnly if you want to, tick the model excerpt. It holds what the app counts and how much is selected: no names, no emails, no folders and never the file itself. Open \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESee the excerpt\u003C/span\u003E to read it first.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd your name and email and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend report\u003C/span\u003E. The report goes to our Submit a problem page, and the box gives you the link to follow it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant can write the draft for you. It can only put the draft in this box: sending is always yours.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-an-assistant-is-sent\"\u003EWhat an assistant is sent\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAssistants get model data only. People&#039;s names (author, drawn by, last saved by), contact details, account and licence details and your user name in a folder path are held back before anything leaves the app.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EActivity\u003C/span\u003E in the bar at the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESet the list to \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEverything\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder each line read \u003Cstrong\u003ESent back\u003C/strong\u003E: the size of the answer and the names of its fields. \u003Cstrong\u003EHeld back\u003C/strong\u003E lists each value that was kept, with the reason.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe log never keeps the answer itself.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"project-stage\"\u003EProject stage\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrawing details\u003C/span\u003E in the bar at the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPick the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProject stage\u003C/span\u003E: Brief, Concept, Design development, Submission, Working drawings, Tender or Close-out.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave details\u003C/span\u003E. The stage is kept in the file with the other details.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant reads the stage so its help fits where the project is.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"show-me-how-with-no-assistant\"\u003EShow me how, with no assistant\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe teacher works from the app&#039;s own Help. It needs no assistant and sends nothing anywhere.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the Ask box type what you want to do, for example &quot;how do I draw a wall&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow me how\u003C/span\u003E. The Help topics that answer it are listed. The tool you are using and the project stage move the best fit to the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose a topic. A step card opens with the topic&#039;s first step, and a ring marks the real button when the layout you use has one.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDo the step, then choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENext\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack\u003C/span\u003E goes to the step before. Nothing is pressed for you.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA topic with no numbered steps says so: open it in Help instead.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"rules-every-assistant-follows\"\u003ERules every assistant follows\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOptional.\u003C/strong\u003E Everything works without an assistant and offline.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe app calculates.\u003C/strong\u003E An assistant explains, arranges and checks, and never writes a figure. Under each answer the box says whether every figure in it is in a result the app returned, and lists the ones it cannot find. A figure on that list is not to be trusted until the app has calculated it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETrust but verify.\u003C/strong\u003E What an assistant makes is marked unverified until you check it. Estimates and audits an assistant hands back say &quot;Not signed off by a person&quot; until you sign them off. Open the list under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERules every assistant follows\u003C/span\u003E in the Ask box.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EModel data only.\u003C/strong\u003E Your personal and account details are never sent.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sign-off-an-estimate-or-an-audit\"\u003ESign off an estimate or an audit\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrawing details\u003C/span\u003E in the bar at the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESign-off\u003C/span\u003E, check your name, add a note if you like and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESign off\u003C/span\u003E beside \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEstimate\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAudit\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWho signed and when are kept in the file with the other details. If the drawing is saved after you sign, the panel says so: sign off again.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOnly you can sign off. No assistant can do it, or take your sign-off back. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETake my sign-off back\u003C/span\u003E removes it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"step-by-step-on-your-screen\"\u003EStep by step on your screen\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant, or a lesson, can show a task one step at a time. A small card says what to do, and a ring marks the real button on your screen. Nothing is pressed for you. Close the card with its \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClose the step\u003C/span\u003E button.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant answers better when it knows this version of the app. The knowledge pack holds the manuals, the step-by-step help, every command and the skills as plain text, with a version that matches the app. The Ask box says so when a connected pack is for another version.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"The apps contain no AI. The Ask box sends a question to the assistant you connected, which answers by using the app's own tools. This page covers what is around that box. It is in the lab builds. Open it from Help Press F1 or choose Help. Choose Ask the assistant at the top of the Help panel. The Ask box opens. Type your question and choose Ask. With a question goes a short note of where you are: the file's name, how much is selected, the screen layout, the tool in use and the project stage. It never holds text from the file. Why did this happen? In the Ask box choose Why did this happen?. Read the list. It is the last steps in this window, oldest first: the commands you started, each change to the model by its name in the undo list, steps you took back or put back, and what an assistant did or was refused. With an assistant connected, choose Ask the assistant to explain and it explains from those same steps. The list works with no assistant connected. It is a record of steps, not a judgement. Report a problem with the steps In the Ask box, type what went wrong and choose Report a problem. The app's own About box opens with your words in it. Leave Add the steps I took before it happened ticked. Open See the steps to read them first. Only if you want to, tick the model excerpt. It holds what the app counts and how much is selected: no names, no emails, no folders and never the file itself. Open See the excerpt to read it first. Add your name and email and choose Send report. The report goes to our Submit a problem page, and the box gives you the link to follow it. An assistant can write the draft for you. It can only put the draft in this box: sending is always yours. What an assistant is sent Assistants get model data only. People's names (author, drawn by, last saved by), contact details, account and licence details and your user name in a folder path are held back before anything leaves the app. Choose Activity in the bar at the top. Set the list to Everything. Under each line read Sent back: the size of the answer and the names of its fields. Held back lists each value that was kept, with the reason. The log never keeps the answer itself. Project stage Choose Drawing details in the bar at the top. Pick the Project stage: Brief, Concept, Design development, Submission, Working drawings, Tender or Close-out. Choose Save details. The stage is kept in the file with the other details. An assistant reads the stage so its help fits where the project is. Show me how, with no assistant The teacher works from the app's own Help. It needs no assistant and sends nothing anywhere. In the Ask box type what you want to do, for example \"how do I draw a wall\". Choose Show me how. The Help topics that answer it are listed. The tool you are using and the project stage move the best fit to the top. Choose a topic. A step card opens with the topic's first step, and a ring marks the real button when the layout you use has one. Do the step, then choose Next. Back goes to the step before. Nothing is pressed for you. A topic with no numbered steps says so: open it in Help instead. Rules every assistant follows Optional. Everything works without an assistant and offline. The app calculates. An assistant explains, arranges and checks, and never writes a figure. Under each answer the box says whether every figure in it is in a result the app returned, and lists the ones it cannot find. A figure on that list is not to be trusted until the app has calculated it. Trust but verify. What an assistant makes is marked unverified until you check it. Estimates and audits an assistant hands back say \"Not signed off by a person\" until you sign them off. Open the list under Rules every assistant follows in the Ask box. Model data only. Your personal and account details are never sent. Sign off an estimate or an audit Choose Drawing details in the bar at the top. Under Sign-off, check your name, add a note if you like and choose Sign off beside Estimate or Audit. Who signed and when are kept in the file with the other details. If the drawing is saved after you sign, the panel says so: sign off again. Only you can sign off. No assistant can do it, or take your sign-off back. Take my sign-off back removes it. Step by step on your screen An assistant, or a lesson, can show a task one step at a time. A small card says what to do, and a ring marks the real button on your screen. Nothing is pressed for you. Close the card with its Close the step button. An assistant answers better when it knows this version of the app. The knowledge pack holds the manuals, the step-by-step help, every command and the skills as plain text, with a version that matches the app. The Ask box says so when a connected pack is for another version.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"assistants-recipes","scope":"basics","title":"Recipes for AI assistants","summary":"Worked examples for using your own AI assistant with the CadCraft apps: what to ask, the tools it calls, and the permissions each needs. Every recipe here is run by our tests with the same calls.","section":"tasks","order":62,"keywords":["ai","assistant","mcp","recipes","examples","prompts","automation","batch","convert","plot","check","takeoff","cut","fill","parameters","script"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"recipes","text":"Recipes","level":2},{"id":"tidy-a-drawing","text":"Tidy a drawing","level":3},{"id":"plot-a-set-of-sheets","text":"Plot a set of sheets","level":3},{"id":"convert-drawings-for-a-consultant","text":"Convert drawings for a consultant","level":3},{"id":"check-drawings-before-sending-them","text":"Check drawings before sending them","level":3},{"id":"ask-a-building-model-questions","text":"Ask a building model questions","level":3},{"id":"draw-a-room-in-bimcraft","text":"Draw a room in BimCraft","level":3},{"id":"total-a-takeoff","text":"Total a takeoff","level":3},{"id":"site-numbers","text":"Site numbers","level":3},{"id":"try-a-part-variant","text":"Try a part variant","level":3},{"id":"fill-in-a-title-block","text":"Fill in a title block","level":3},{"id":"recipes-you-can-run","text":"Recipes you can run","level":2},{"id":"your-files-and-your-assistant","text":"Your files and your assistant","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EReady-made requests for your own AI assistant, and what it does with them. The apps contain no AI: your assistant reads the files and calls the apps&#039; tools, and you decide which permissions it has. Each recipe names the tools it calls, so you can check its work in the activity log, and each one is run by our tests with exactly these calls, so they keep working.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThere are two ways in. In \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio\u003C/strong\u003E, an assistant works with the apps you have open (Settings › Assistants in each app). \u003Cstrong\u003EWithout a window\u003C/strong\u003E, the CadCraft file server for assistants (\u003Ccode\u003Enpx @getcadcraft/mcp --root &lt;folder&gt;\u003C/code\u003E) works on files in folders you name; the \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E command line does the same jobs for your own scripts. The recipes say which way they use; most work both ways.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStart read-only. Ask the assistant to describe a file before it changes anything; its answers are better when it has looked first, and Read is the only permission that is on to begin with.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"recipes\"\u003ERecipes\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"tidy-a-drawing\"\u003ETidy a drawing\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;List the layers with nothing on them and the blocks nobody uses, then purge the unused blocks.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe assistant opens the drawing and reads it, then runs PURGE:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Edrawing_open {path: &quot;Kitchen/kitchen-equipment.dwg&quot;}            → d1\ndrawing_describe {doc: &quot;d1&quot;}                                    layers with 0 objects, blocks with 0 uses\ncommand_run {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, input: &quot;PURGE&quot;}                         one undo step: &quot;Assistant: PURGE&quot;\ndrawing_save {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, path: &quot;Kitchen/kitchen-tidy.dwg&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Edit, and Save to write the result. Dimension arrowheads count as used, so they stay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"plot-a-set-of-sheets\"\u003EPlot a set of sheets\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Plot every sheet of every drawing in the Kitchen folder to PDF.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efiles_list {folder: &quot;Kitchen&quot;, extensions: [&quot;dwg&quot;, &quot;dxf&quot;]}\ndrawing_open {path: …}  ·  drawing_describe {doc}                the sheets of each drawing\ndrawing_plot {doc, layout: &quot;&lt;sheet&gt;&quot;, out: &quot;Plots/&lt;drawing&gt; &lt;sheet&gt;.pdf&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Export. From the command line, one PDF per drawing with all its sheets: \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft plot Kitchen/*.dwg Plots --all\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"convert-drawings-for-a-consultant\"\u003EConvert drawings for a consultant\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Save copies of the drawings in Kitchen as AutoCAD 2013 DWG in the Out folder.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efiles_list {folder: &quot;Kitchen&quot;, extensions: [&quot;dwg&quot;, &quot;dxf&quot;]}\ndrawing_convert {path: &quot;Kitchen/&lt;file&gt;&quot;, out: &quot;Out/&lt;file&gt;.dwg&quot;, version: &quot;2013&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Export; the originals are not changed. From the command line: \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft convert Kitchen/*.dwg Kitchen/*.dxf Out --to dwg --version 2013\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"check-drawings-before-sending-them\"\u003ECheck drawings before sending them\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Check the drawings in Kitchen: nothing on layer 0, colours by layer, no unused blocks. Give me a table of what fails.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Edrawing_check {doc, rules: {layers: {noObjectsOn: [&quot;0&quot;]}, objects: {colorByLayer: true}, blocks: {noUnused: true}}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read. Keep your office&#039;s rules in a file and the command line checks a whole folder: \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft check Kitchen/*.dwg --rules office-standards.json\u003C/code\u003E (exit code 1 when something fails, so it fits in a script).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ask-a-building-model-questions\"\u003EAsk a building model questions\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;How many doors does the house have on each level, and which are external?&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eifc_open {path: &quot;house.ifc&quot;}                                    → d1\nifc_query {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, class: &quot;IfcDoor&quot;}                         each door with its level\nifc_properties {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, id: &lt;door&gt;}                          Pset_DoorCommon.IsExternal\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read. In Studio, BimCraft&#039;s own tools answer the same about the model you have open.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"draw-a-room-in-bimcraft\"\u003EDraw a room in BimCraft\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Draw a 6 by 4 metre room on Level 1 with a single door in the south wall.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ewalls_add {points: [[0, 0], [6000, 0], [6000, 4000], [0, 4000]], closed: true}     one undo step\nopening_add {wall: &quot;&lt;the first wall&#039;s GlobalId&gt;&quot;, kind: &quot;door&quot;}                    one undo step\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Edit. Walls join and the room follows, as with the Draw tools. Without a window, \u003Ccode\u003Eifc_new\u003C/code\u003E starts a building first and \u003Ccode\u003Eifc_save\u003C/code\u003E writes it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"total-a-takeoff\"\u003ETotal a takeoff\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Give me the estimate by item and export it to XLSX.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_open {path: &quot;job.takeoff.json&quot;}  ·  takeoff_estimate {doc}  ·  takeoff_export {doc, out: &quot;job.xlsx&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read, and Export for the file. Marks on sheets with no scale are listed and never counted as zero, so an incomplete estimate says so.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"site-numbers\"\u003ESite numbers\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;How much cut and fill does the pad need?&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Esite_open {path: &quot;site.civilcraft.json&quot;}  ·  surface_volume {doc}       cut, fill and net, per pad\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read. With a level instead of a design: \u003Ccode\u003Esurface_volume {doc, datum: 100}\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"try-a-part-variant\"\u003ETry a part variant\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Set the length to 40 mm, rebuild, and give me the mass.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Epart_open {path: &quot;screw.partcraft.json&quot;}  ·  params_list {doc}\nparam_set {doc, name: &quot;l&quot;, value: 40}                           one undo step, the part rebuilt\nmass_properties {doc}                                            volume, mass from the material, centre, inertia\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Edit; Save (\u003Ccode\u003Epart_save\u003C/code\u003E) to keep it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"fill-in-a-title-block\"\u003EFill in a title block\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Insert the title block at 0,0 with sheet number A-101 and the title Kitchen plan.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eblock_insert {doc, block: &quot;TITLEBLOCK-ARCHD&quot;, at: [0, 0], attributes: {&quot;SHEET-NO&quot;: &quot;A-101&quot;, &quot;SHEET-TITLE&quot;: &quot;Kitchen plan&quot;}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Edit. One undo step; the attributes it does not name keep their defaults.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"recipes-you-can-run\"\u003ERecipes you can run\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\"https://github.com/getcadcraft/examples\" class=\"hx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003Egithub.com/getcadcraft/examples\u003C/a\u003E has recipes as files you can run yourself: \u003Ccode\u003Emcp-tidy-a-drawing\u003C/code\u003E makes an assistant&#039;s calls step by step (check a drawing against office standards, fix it with a LISP routine, save and plot), and \u003Ccode\u003Ecli-check-standards\u003C/code\u003E and \u003Ccode\u003Ecli-convert-and-plot\u003C/code\u003E do the same jobs with the \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E command line.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-files-and-your-assistant\"\u003EYour files and your assistant\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe apps never send your files anywhere. \u003Cstrong\u003EBut what your assistant reads goes to whoever runs that assistant:\u003C/strong\u003E a cloud assistant&#039;s maker sees the parts of the drawing it is shown. If that matters for a job, use an assistant that runs on your own computer, or keep that job&#039;s folders out of the ones you allow.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn Ready-made requests for your own AI assistant, and what it does with them. The apps contain no AI: your assistant reads the files and calls the apps' tools, and you decide which permissions it has. Each recipe names the tools it calls, so you can check its work in the activity log, and each one is run by our tests with exactly these calls, so they keep working. There are two ways in. In CadCraft Studio, an assistant works with the apps you have open (Settings › Assistants in each app). Without a window, the CadCraft file server for assistants (npx @getcadcraft/mcp --root \u003Cfolder\u003E) works on files in folders you name; the cadcraft command line does the same jobs for your own scripts. The recipes say which way they use; most work both ways. Start read-only. Ask the assistant to describe a file before it changes anything; its answers are better when it has looked first, and Read is the only permission that is on to begin with. Recipes Tidy a drawing Ask: \"List the layers with nothing on them and the blocks nobody uses, then purge the unused blocks.\" The assistant opens the drawing and reads it, then runs PURGE: drawing_open {path: \"Kitchen/kitchen-equipment.dwg\"} → d1 drawing_describe {doc: \"d1\"} layers with 0 objects, blocks with 0 uses command_run {doc: \"d1\", input: \"PURGE\"} one undo step: \"Assistant: PURGE\" drawing_save {doc: \"d1\", path: \"Kitchen/kitchen-tidy.dwg\"} Needs Read and Edit, and Save to write the result. Dimension arrowheads count as used, so they stay. Plot a set of sheets Ask: \"Plot every sheet of every drawing in the Kitchen folder to PDF.\" files_list {folder: \"Kitchen\", extensions: [\"dwg\", \"dxf\"]} drawing_open {path: …} · drawing_describe {doc} the sheets of each drawing drawing_plot {doc, layout: \"\u003Csheet\u003E\", out: \"Plots/\u003Cdrawing\u003E \u003Csheet\u003E.pdf\"} Needs Read and Export. From the command line, one PDF per drawing with all its sheets: cadcraft plot Kitchen/*.dwg Plots --all. Convert drawings for a consultant Ask: \"Save copies of the drawings in Kitchen as AutoCAD 2013 DWG in the Out folder.\" files_list {folder: \"Kitchen\", extensions: [\"dwg\", \"dxf\"]} drawing_convert {path: \"Kitchen/\u003Cfile\u003E\", out: \"Out/\u003Cfile\u003E.dwg\", version: \"2013\"} Needs Read and Export; the originals are not changed. From the command line: cadcraft convert Kitchen/*.dwg Kitchen/*.dxf Out --to dwg --version 2013. Check drawings before sending them Ask: \"Check the drawings in Kitchen: nothing on layer 0, colours by layer, no unused blocks. Give me a table of what fails.\" drawing_check {doc, rules: {layers: {noObjectsOn: [\"0\"]}, objects: {colorByLayer: true}, blocks: {noUnused: true}}} Needs Read. Keep your office's rules in a file and the command line checks a whole folder: cadcraft check Kitchen/*.dwg --rules office-standards.json (exit code 1 when something fails, so it fits in a script). Ask a building model questions Ask: \"How many doors does the house have on each level, and which are external?\" ifc_open {path: \"house.ifc\"} → d1 ifc_query {doc: \"d1\", class: \"IfcDoor\"} each door with its level ifc_properties {doc: \"d1\", id: \u003Cdoor\u003E} Pset_DoorCommon.IsExternal Needs Read. In Studio, BimCraft's own tools answer the same about the model you have open. Draw a room in BimCraft Ask: \"Draw a 6 by 4 metre room on Level 1 with a single door in the south wall.\" walls_add {points: [[0, 0], [6000, 0], [6000, 4000], [0, 4000]], closed: true} one undo step opening_add {wall: \"\u003Cthe first wall's GlobalId\u003E\", kind: \"door\"} one undo step Needs Edit. Walls join and the room follows, as with the Draw tools. Without a window, ifc_new starts a building first and ifc_save writes it. Total a takeoff Ask: \"Give me the estimate by item and export it to XLSX.\" takeoff_open {path: \"job.takeoff.json\"} · takeoff_estimate {doc} · takeoff_export {doc, out: \"job.xlsx\"} Needs Read, and Export for the file. Marks on sheets with no scale are listed and never counted as zero, so an incomplete estimate says so. Site numbers Ask: \"How much cut and fill does the pad need?\" site_open {path: \"site.civilcraft.json\"} · surface_volume {doc} cut, fill and net, per pad Needs Read. With a level instead of a design: surface_volume {doc, datum: 100}. Try a part variant Ask: \"Set the length to 40 mm, rebuild, and give me the mass.\" part_open {path: \"screw.partcraft.json\"} · params_list {doc} param_set {doc, name: \"l\", value: 40} one undo step, the part rebuilt mass_properties {doc} volume, mass from the material, centre, inertia Needs Read and Edit; Save (part_save) to keep it. Fill in a title block Ask: \"Insert the title block at 0,0 with sheet number A-101 and the title Kitchen plan.\" block_insert {doc, block: \"TITLEBLOCK-ARCHD\", at: [0, 0], attributes: {\"SHEET-NO\": \"A-101\", \"SHEET-TITLE\": \"Kitchen plan\"}} Needs Edit. One undo step; the attributes it does not name keep their defaults. Recipes you can run github.com/getcadcraft/examples has recipes as files you can run yourself: mcp-tidy-a-drawing makes an assistant's calls step by step (check a drawing against office standards, fix it with a LISP routine, save and plot), and cli-check-standards and cli-convert-and-plot do the same jobs with the cadcraft command line. Your files and your assistant The apps never send your files anywhere. But what your assistant reads goes to whoever runs that assistant: a cloud assistant's maker sees the parts of the drawing it is shown. If that matters for a job, use an assistant that runs on your own computer, or keep that job's folders out of the ones you allow.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"community-testing","scope":"basics","title":"Community testing","summary":"How to try a test on the Community testing page and send your result.","section":"tasks","order":90,"keywords":["community","testing","test","results","report","feedback","files","passed","failing"],"headings":[{"id":"send-a-result","text":"Send a result","level":2},{"id":"sending-files","text":"Sending files","level":2},{"id":"your-privacy","text":"Your privacy","level":2},{"id":"what-counts-as-known-not-to-work","text":"What counts as \"known not to work\"","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESome checks need a real computer, a real file or a real device. The Community testing page lists them so anyone can help.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"send-a-result\"\u003ESend a result\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the \u003Cstrong\u003ECommunity testing\u003C/strong\u003E page on the website and choose a test.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUse the public build named in \u003Cstrong\u003EBefore you start\u003C/strong\u003E, never a lab build.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFollow the \u003Cstrong\u003ESteps\u003C/strong\u003E and compare with the \u003Cstrong\u003EExpected result\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFill in \u003Cstrong\u003ESend a result\u003C/strong\u003E: passed, still failing, partly works, or could not run it. Say which system you used and what happened.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYou do not need an account to send a result. A signed-in account is needed only to send files.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sending-files\"\u003ESending files\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen a test asks for files, drag them into the framed area (or click it, or press Enter or Space on it to choose them). You can send several at once; each shows its name and size and a Remove button. The form says which file types and sizes we take. We never take programs, scripts or web pages.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-privacy\"\u003EYour privacy\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA result sent while you are signed in carries your account so we can write back. It is never shown on the page.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYour first name is shown next to a result only if you tick \u003Cstrong\u003EShow my first name\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENotes are shown to others only if you tick \u003Cstrong\u003EAnyone may read my notes\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFiles are seen only by the CadCraft team, kept privately and deleted automatically after the number of days the form states. Remove anything private from a file first.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-counts-as-known-not-to-work\"\u003EWhat counts as &quot;known not to work&quot;\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach test lists what is not built yet. Please do not report those as bugs.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Some checks need a real computer, a real file or a real device. The Community testing page lists them so anyone can help. Send a result Open the Community testing page on the website and choose a test. Use the public build named in Before you start, never a lab build. Follow the Steps and compare with the Expected result. Fill in Send a result: passed, still failing, partly works, or could not run it. Say which system you used and what happened. You do not need an account to send a result. A signed-in account is needed only to send files. Sending files When a test asks for files, drag them into the framed area (or click it, or press Enter or Space on it to choose them). You can send several at once; each shows its name and size and a Remove button. The form says which file types and sizes we take. We never take programs, scripts or web pages. Your privacy A result sent while you are signed in carries your account so we can write back. It is never shown on the page. Your first name is shown next to a result only if you tick Show my first name. Notes are shown to others only if you tick Anyone may read my notes. Files are seen only by the CadCraft team, kept privately and deleted automatically after the number of days the form states. Remove anything private from a file first. What counts as \"known not to work\" Each test lists what is not built yet. Please do not report those as bugs.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"work-together-live","scope":"basics","title":"Work together live","summary":"Share the file open in an app so teammates edit it with you on your own network with a short code, and join someone else's session. Invite links over the internet are not open yet.","section":"tasks","order":90,"keywords":["live","studio live","work together","collaborate","share live","join","code","qr","invite link","link","host","approve","guest","network","relay","license","many people","limit","allow anyway","slow","recent edits","edit log","who changed","history"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"share-the-file-you-have-open","text":"Share the file you have open","level":2},{"id":"let-people-in","text":"Let people in","level":2},{"id":"when-many-people-join","text":"When many people join","level":2},{"id":"codes-on-your-own-network","text":"Codes on your own network","level":2},{"id":"invite-links-over-the-internet-not-open-yet","text":"Invite links over the internet: not open yet","level":2},{"id":"join-someone-else-s-session","text":"Join someone else's session","level":2},{"id":"who-changed-what-recent-edits","text":"Who changed what: Recent edits","level":2},{"id":"assistants-in-a-session","text":"Assistants in a session","level":2},{"id":"when-the-session-ends","text":"When the session ends","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to share a file live from CadCraft Studio, let people in, and join a session someone else shares. What you see in the drawing itself while you work together is on the app&#039;s own page about live sessions.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"share-the-file-you-have-open\"\u003EShare the file you have open\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the file in its app inside CadCraft Studio on a computer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive\u003C/span\u003E in the app&#039;s bar, type the name others should see, then choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShare live\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStudio shows a code like \u003Ccode\u003EK7-Q4M2X\u003C/code\u003E with a picture to scan and the computer&#039;s address. Give the code to the people you want to invite.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYour file stays on your computer. Only you save it, and everyone sees your saves.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"let-people-in\"\u003ELet people in\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENobody gets in without you. When someone knocks, a card shows their name and device and whether they came on this network or through the internet:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E lets them change the file with you.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView only\u003C/span\u003E lets them watch; anything they try to change is taken back.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeny\u003C/span\u003E turns them away.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe list under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIn the session\u003C/span\u003E shows everyone. Change a person&#039;s role there, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove\u003C/span\u003E them: they keep a copy of what they had, and they can&#039;t come back without a new invitation.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"when-many-people-join\"\u003EWhen many people join\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA session&#039;s usual size is up to 20 people besides you. It is not a hard limit: how many people can work well together depends on their computers, the file and the network, so Studio asks you before a session grows past it instead of deciding for you.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen someone knocks and would make more than 20, their card says so, and Studio explains what to expect: every change goes to everyone, so with many people each change takes longer to reach each person, and slower laptops and connections fall behind first. Then you choose:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAllow anyway\u003C/span\u003E lets more people in for this session. Each person still waits for your \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView only\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeny\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKeep it at 20\u003C/span\u003E turns away the people waiting over the limit; they are told you are keeping the session small.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETo allow more before anyone knocks, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAllow more people…\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIn the session\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack to 20\u003C/span\u003E puts the usual size back. Your choice lasts for this session only; the next one starts at 20 again.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf things slow down, fewer people, a quieter file (fewer people changing it at the same moment) or a better connection (a cable instead of Wi-Fi) helps.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"codes-on-your-own-network\"\u003ECodes on your own network\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA code works for 10 minutes. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew code\u003C/span\u003E makes another; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStop inviting\u003C/span\u003E closes it. People already in stay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOne-time code\u003C/span\u003E lets one person in per code.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAfter 3 wrong codes in a row, Studio closes the code and makes a new one, and tells you.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESessions on your own network are free, for everyone.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"invite-links-over-the-internet-not-open-yet\"\u003EInvite links over the internet: not open yet\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInvite links aren&#039;t open yet. Sessions on your own network are free. Today the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOver the internet\u003C/span\u003E part of the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive\u003C/span\u003E panel says so in a plain sentence instead of offering a link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen invite links open, this is how they will work:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOver the internet\u003C/span\u003E, choose how long the link works (1 hour, 8 hours, or until you end the session), then \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInvite by link\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECopy the link and send it like a meeting link.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe link&#039;s secret part (after \u003Ccode\u003E#\u003C/code\u003E) never reaches getcadcraft.com: the site only passes on encrypted messages it can&#039;t read, and you still approve each person. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew link\u003C/span\u003E makes the old one stop working at once; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStop the link\u003C/span\u003E ends it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMaking an invite link will need you signed in, with a commercial license in force for the app. Guests will need nothing: no account, no license.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"join-someone-else-s-session\"\u003EJoin someone else&#039;s session\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CadCraft Studio&#039;s home screen, find \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin a live session\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EType the code the host gave you, or type the address shown under their code followed by the code. (Once invite links open, you will paste the host&#039;s link here too.)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EType your name and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin\u003C/span\u003E. Studio opens the right app; it fills with the host&#039;s file once the host lets you in.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWithout Studio, scan the picture under the host&#039;s code with a device on the same network: the app opens in the browser.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn CadCraft, if you already have the same file open in a Studio window, you can join from that window instead: choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive\u003C/span\u003E, then under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin with the drawing open here\u003C/span\u003E type the code or the address and code, and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin here\u003C/span\u003E. Only the changes made since the file was opened travel. If the host&#039;s drawing is a different one, it replaces the one in that window; your file on disk stays as it is.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuest, hotel and school Wi-Fi often keep devices apart, so a code can&#039;t find the host there. Use a network that lets devices see each other, such as the office network. Invite links, for when you are not on the same network, are not open yet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"who-changed-what-recent-edits\"\u003EWho changed what: Recent edits\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe Live panel lists \u003Cstrong\u003ERecent edits\u003C/strong\u003E: who made each change and what it was (the step&#039;s name, such as Line or Move), newest first, with how long ago. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow more\u003C/span\u003E lists more of them. With something selected in CadCraft or MarkupCraft, the panel also says who changed it last, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly what is selected\u003C/span\u003E keeps just the edits that touched it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe list is made in your own window from the session&#039;s edits while the session runs. It is gone when the session ends: it is never saved in the file or sent anywhere. Everyone in the session can see who made each change. If you joined after people had started, or were away for a while, the edits from before are not in your list, and the panel says so.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"assistants-in-a-session\"\u003EAssistants in a session\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf someone turned on assistants in their app&#039;s settings, their AI assistant can ask to work in the session too. The host&#039;s own assistant joins at once; anyone else&#039;s waits for the host, with a card saying whose assistant it is: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAllow\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeny\u003C/span\u003E. An assistant edits like its person, with its own undo, and leaves the session when its person leaves.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"when-the-session-ends\"\u003EWhen the session ends\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe host chooses \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEnd the session\u003C/span\u003E, or closes the file. Everyone else keeps an unsaved copy of the file as it was: save it if you want to keep it. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELeave\u003C/span\u003E does the same for you alone.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to share a file live from CadCraft Studio, let people in, and join a session someone else shares. What you see in the drawing itself while you work together is on the app's own page about live sessions. Share the file you have open Open the file in its app inside CadCraft Studio on a computer. Choose Live in the app's bar, type the name others should see, then choose Share live. Studio shows a code like K7-Q4M2X with a picture to scan and the computer's address. Give the code to the people you want to invite. Your file stays on your computer. Only you save it, and everyone sees your saves. Let people in Nobody gets in without you. When someone knocks, a card shows their name and device and whether they came on this network or through the internet: Edit lets them change the file with you. View only lets them watch; anything they try to change is taken back. Deny turns them away. The list under In the session shows everyone. Change a person's role there, or Remove them: they keep a copy of what they had, and they can't come back without a new invitation. When many people join A session's usual size is up to 20 people besides you. It is not a hard limit: how many people can work well together depends on their computers, the file and the network, so Studio asks you before a session grows past it instead of deciding for you. When someone knocks and would make more than 20, their card says so, and Studio explains what to expect: every change goes to everyone, so with many people each change takes longer to reach each person, and slower laptops and connections fall behind first. Then you choose: Allow anyway lets more people in for this session. Each person still waits for your Edit, View only or Deny. Keep it at 20 turns away the people waiting over the limit; they are told you are keeping the session small. To allow more before anyone knocks, choose Allow more people… under In the session. Back to 20 puts the usual size back. Your choice lasts for this session only; the next one starts at 20 again. If things slow down, fewer people, a quieter file (fewer people changing it at the same moment) or a better connection (a cable instead of Wi-Fi) helps. Codes on your own network A code works for 10 minutes. New code makes another; Stop inviting closes it. People already in stay. One-time code lets one person in per code. After 3 wrong codes in a row, Studio closes the code and makes a new one, and tells you. Sessions on your own network are free, for everyone. Invite links over the internet: not open yet Invite links aren't open yet. Sessions on your own network are free. Today the Over the internet part of the Live panel says so in a plain sentence instead of offering a link. When invite links open, this is how they will work: Under Over the internet, choose how long the link works (1 hour, 8 hours, or until you end the session), then Invite by link. Copy the link and send it like a meeting link. The link's secret part (after #) never reaches getcadcraft.com: the site only passes on encrypted messages it can't read, and you still approve each person. New link makes the old one stop working at once; Stop the link ends it. Making an invite link will need you signed in, with a commercial license in force for the app. Guests will need nothing: no account, no license. Join someone else's session In CadCraft Studio's home screen, find Join a live session. Type the code the host gave you, or type the address shown under their code followed by the code. (Once invite links open, you will paste the host's link here too.) Type your name and choose Join. Studio opens the right app; it fills with the host's file once the host lets you in. Without Studio, scan the picture under the host's code with a device on the same network: the app opens in the browser. In CadCraft, if you already have the same file open in a Studio window, you can join from that window instead: choose Live, then under Join with the drawing open here type the code or the address and code, and choose Join here. Only the changes made since the file was opened travel. If the host's drawing is a different one, it replaces the one in that window; your file on disk stays as it is. Guest, hotel and school Wi-Fi often keep devices apart, so a code can't find the host there. Use a network that lets devices see each other, such as the office network. Invite links, for when you are not on the same network, are not open yet. Who changed what: Recent edits The Live panel lists Recent edits: who made each change and what it was (the step's name, such as Line or Move), newest first, with how long ago. Show more lists more of them. With something selected in CadCraft or MarkupCraft, the panel also says who changed it last, and Only what is selected keeps just the edits that touched it. The list is made in your own window from the session's edits while the session runs. It is gone when the session ends: it is never saved in the file or sent anywhere. Everyone in the session can see who made each change. If you joined after people had started, or were away for a while, the edits from before are not in your list, and the panel says so. Assistants in a session If someone turned on assistants in their app's settings, their AI assistant can ask to work in the session too. The host's own assistant joins at once; anyone else's waits for the host, with a card saying whose assistant it is: Allow or Deny. An assistant edits like its person, with its own undo, and leaves the session when its person leaves. When the session ends The host chooses End the session, or closes the file. Everyone else keeps an unsaved copy of the file as it was: save it if you want to keep it. Leave does the same for you alone.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"pen-and-touch","scope":"basics","title":"Draw with a pen on a tablet","summary":"What the app does when you draw with a pen on a touch screen: it ignores your palm, can leave the drawing to the pen while your fingers move the view, and lets the pen's buttons and a two-finger tap undo.","section":"tasks","order":94,"keywords":["pen","stylus","tablet","touch","palm","palm rejection","finger","fingers","two fingers","tap","undo","redo","side button","barrel button","eraser","pressure","hover","phone"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"a-pen-is-noticed-the-first-time","text":"A pen is noticed the first time","level":2},{"id":"your-palm-is-ignored","text":"Your palm is ignored","level":2},{"id":"let-the-pen-draw-and-your-fingers-move-the-view","text":"Let the pen draw and your fingers move the view","level":2},{"id":"undo-with-a-tap","text":"Undo with a tap","level":2},{"id":"the-pen-s-buttons","text":"The pen's buttons","level":2},{"id":"these-are-the-device-s-settings","text":"These are the device's settings","level":2},{"id":"not-built-yet","text":"Not built yet","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow the app works with a pen on a tablet or a touch-screen laptop, and the settings that change it. They are in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen and touch\u003C/span\u003E, which shows on a touch screen, or once you have used a pen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"a-pen-is-noticed-the-first-time\"\u003EA pen is noticed the first time\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENothing changes until you touch the drawing with a pen. From then on the app remembers, on this device, that you draw with one, and the choices below start to apply. Before that, your fingers draw and select as usual.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-palm-is-ignored\"\u003EYour palm is ignored\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIgnore my palm while I use a pen\u003C/span\u003E on (it starts on), a touch on the drawing is ignored while the pen touches the screen, for a moment after you lift it or while it hovers just above the screen, and whenever the contact is as big as a palm. Rest your hand on the screen and draw.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf a quick finger right after the pen does nothing, wait a moment: that moment is the palm rule at work.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"let-the-pen-draw-and-your-fingers-move-the-view\"\u003ELet the pen draw and your fingers move the view\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFingers on the drawing, once you use a pen here\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw and select\u003C/span\u003E (the start): a finger does what the pen does.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly move the view\u003C/span\u003E: one finger on the drawing does nothing, so a stray touch never draws or picks. Two fingers still move and zoom the view as usual.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe toolbars, panels and dialogs work with your fingers either way.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"undo-with-a-tap\"\u003EUndo with a tap\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETap with two fingers to undo, three to redo\u003C/span\u003E on (it starts on), tap the drawing with two fingers together to undo your last step, and with three to redo it. It works with or without a pen. Moving the fingers is a pan or a zoom, never a tap.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-pen-s-buttons\"\u003EThe pen&#039;s buttons\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen side button\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat the app does (a right click)\u003C/span\u003E at the start, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen eraser end\u003C/span\u003E (on pens that have one): \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat the app does\u003C/span\u003E at the start, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E. In ModelCraft, what the app does is to erase while the eraser end touches.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"these-are-the-device-s-settings\"\u003EThese are the device&#039;s settings\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe pen and touch choices are kept for this device and apply in every app on it, so you set them once. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the layout\u003C/span\u003E and resetting an app&#039;s settings leave them as they are.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"not-built-yet\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhere the pen is turned on for the apps (Settings › Global › Input devices › Pen), CadCraft&#039;s sketch tools take a stroke&#039;s pressure as its lineweight and BimCraft&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESketch stair\u003C/span\u003E takes one pen stroke as the walking line; the other apps don&#039;t use pressure yet. No app uses the pen&#039;s tilt yet, and no app has a handwriting tool.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How the app works with a pen on a tablet or a touch-screen laptop, and the settings that change it. They are in Settings › General › Pen and touch, which shows on a touch screen, or once you have used a pen. A pen is noticed the first time Nothing changes until you touch the drawing with a pen. From then on the app remembers, on this device, that you draw with one, and the choices below start to apply. Before that, your fingers draw and select as usual. Your palm is ignored With Ignore my palm while I use a pen on (it starts on), a touch on the drawing is ignored while the pen touches the screen, for a moment after you lift it or while it hovers just above the screen, and whenever the contact is as big as a palm. Rest your hand on the screen and draw. If a quick finger right after the pen does nothing, wait a moment: that moment is the palm rule at work. Let the pen draw and your fingers move the view Under Fingers on the drawing, once you use a pen here: Draw and select (the start): a finger does what the pen does. Only move the view: one finger on the drawing does nothing, so a stray touch never draws or picks. Two fingers still move and zoom the view as usual. The toolbars, panels and dialogs work with your fingers either way. Undo with a tap With Tap with two fingers to undo, three to redo on (it starts on), tap the drawing with two fingers together to undo your last step, and with three to redo it. It works with or without a pen. Moving the fingers is a pan or a zoom, never a tap. The pen's buttons Pen side button: What the app does (a right click) at the start, or Undo or Redo. Pen eraser end (on pens that have one): What the app does at the start, or Undo or Redo. In ModelCraft, what the app does is to erase while the eraser end touches. These are the device's settings The pen and touch choices are kept for this device and apply in every app on it, so you set them once. Reset the layout and resetting an app's settings leave them as they are. Not built yet Where the pen is turned on for the apps (Settings › Global › Input devices › Pen), CadCraft's sketch tools take a stroke's pressure as its lineweight and BimCraft's Sketch stair takes one pen stroke as the walking line; the other apps don't use pressure yet. No app uses the pen's tilt yet, and no app has a handwriting tool.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"input-devices","scope":"basics","title":"Use a trackpad, 3D mouse or controller","summary":"Set what a trackpad, your mouse's side buttons, a pen, finger taps, a 3D mouse, a game controller or a MIDI controller does, for every app or for one app.","section":"tasks","order":95,"keywords":["trackpad","touchpad","two fingers","pinch","scroll","mouse","side button","back button","forward button","tilt wheel","pen","stylus","eraser","tap","3D mouse","space mouse","6 axis","game controller","gamepad","joystick","MIDI","knob","fader","pad","input device","customize","assign"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"every-app-or-only-this-app","text":"Every app, or only this app","level":2},{"id":"trackpad","text":"Trackpad","level":2},{"id":"mouse-buttons","text":"Mouse buttons","level":2},{"id":"pen-and-finger-taps","text":"Pen and finger taps","level":2},{"id":"3d-mouse","text":"3D mouse","level":2},{"id":"game-controller","text":"Game controller","level":2},{"id":"midi-controller","text":"MIDI controller","level":2},{"id":"share-your-settings","text":"Share your settings","level":2},{"id":"not-built-yet","text":"Not built yet","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to choose what each of your input devices does in the app. The settings are in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInput devices\u003C/span\u003E, one card per device. Until you change something, every device works as it did before.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"every-app-or-only-this-app\"\u003EEvery app, or only this app\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAt the top, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThese settings are for\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEvery app\u003C/span\u003E (the start): what you set applies in every app that has no settings of its own.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly\u003C/span\u003E this app: the app takes a copy of the shared settings and keeps its own from then on. Change them here without touching the other apps.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEvery app\u003C/span\u003E again to drop this app&#039;s own settings and go back to the shared ones. The settings are kept on this device, in every app window and in the desktop app&#039;s apps.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"trackpad\"\u003ETrackpad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETwo-finger scroll\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat the app does\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPan the view\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZoom\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOrbit (3D views)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPinch\u003C/span\u003E: zoom, as the app does, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENothing\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpeed\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse the direction\u003C/span\u003E apply when you have chosen pan, zoom or orbit.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe app tells a trackpad from a mouse wheel by the way it scrolls, so a mouse wheel keeps doing what it does.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mouse-buttons\"\u003EMouse buttons\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack side button\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EForward side button\u003C/span\u003E: run any command, such as Undo and Redo, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit everything in view\u003C/span\u003E. A side button set to a command no longer takes the browser back a page.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWheel tilted sideways\u003C/span\u003E: what the app does, pan the view, or nothing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe wheel&#039;s zoom direction and which buttons pan or orbit are in the app&#039;s own tab, under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pen-and-finger-taps\"\u003EPen and finger taps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESide button\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEraser end\u003C/span\u003E: what the app does, or any command.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETwo-finger tap\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThree-finger tap\u003C/span\u003E (they start as Undo and Redo): any command, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENothing\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPalm rejection and what your fingers do once you use a pen stay under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen and touch\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"3d-mouse\"\u003E3D mouse\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EConnect a 3D mouse\u003C/span\u003E and pick it in the browser&#039;s list; the browser remembers it for this site. Then push, lift, tilt and twist the cap to move the view under the pointer:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEach movement (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPush left and right\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPush forward and back\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELift and press\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETilt forward and back\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETilt left and right\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETwist\u003C/span\u003E) can pan, zoom, orbit or do nothing, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse\u003C/span\u003E turns it round.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpeed\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDead zone\u003C/span\u003E (how far the cap moves before anything happens) and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly the strongest movement at a time\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEach button runs a command or fits the view.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA 3D mouse needs Chrome or Edge in the browser.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"game-controller\"\u003EGame controller\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPlug in a controller and press any button so the browser shows it to the app. The sticks pan, orbit or zoom; the triggers zoom in and out; every button can run a command. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpeed\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDead zone\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse up and down on the sticks\u003C/span\u003E are there too.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"midi-controller\"\u003EMIDI controller\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EConnect MIDI\u003C/span\u003E. Then, for each control: pick what it should do under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a control for\u003C/span\u003E (a knob or fader pans, zooms or orbits; a pad or key runs a command), choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELearn it\u003C/span\u003E, and turn the knob or press the pad. Each learned control is listed, with a button to remove it. MIDI needs Chrome or Edge in the browser.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"share-your-settings\"\u003EShare your settings\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E saves the settings shown as a file; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport\u003C/span\u003E reads one back (settings this version doesn&#039;t know are left out, and you&#039;re told how many). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack to the defaults\u003C/span\u003E undoes every change for the settings shown.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"not-built-yet\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA wheel dial (such as the ones on Windows) and the desktop app&#039;s own drivers for 3D mice are not supported yet. A 3D mouse, controller or knob moves the view only in apps that have handed their views over; their buttons work everywhere.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to choose what each of your input devices does in the app. The settings are in Settings › Global › Input devices, one card per device. Until you change something, every device works as it did before. Every app, or only this app At the top, These settings are for: Every app (the start): what you set applies in every app that has no settings of its own. Only this app: the app takes a copy of the shared settings and keeps its own from then on. Change them here without touching the other apps. Choose Every app again to drop this app's own settings and go back to the shared ones. The settings are kept on this device, in every app window and in the desktop app's apps. Trackpad Two-finger scroll: What the app does, Pan the view, Zoom or Orbit (3D views). Pinch: zoom, as the app does, or Nothing. Speed and Reverse the direction apply when you have chosen pan, zoom or orbit. The app tells a trackpad from a mouse wheel by the way it scrolls, so a mouse wheel keeps doing what it does. Mouse buttons Back side button and Forward side button: run any command, such as Undo and Redo, or Fit everything in view. A side button set to a command no longer takes the browser back a page. Wheel tilted sideways: what the app does, pan the view, or nothing. The wheel's zoom direction and which buttons pan or orbit are in the app's own tab, under Menus, keys and mouse. Pen and finger taps Side button and Eraser end: what the app does, or any command. Two-finger tap and Three-finger tap (they start as Undo and Redo): any command, or Nothing. Palm rejection and what your fingers do once you use a pen stay under Pen and touch. 3D mouse Choose Connect a 3D mouse and pick it in the browser's list; the browser remembers it for this site. Then push, lift, tilt and twist the cap to move the view under the pointer: Each movement (Push left and right, Push forward and back, Lift and press, Tilt forward and back, Tilt left and right, Twist) can pan, zoom, orbit or do nothing, and Reverse turns it round. Speed, Dead zone (how far the cap moves before anything happens) and Only the strongest movement at a time. Each button runs a command or fits the view. A 3D mouse needs Chrome or Edge in the browser. Game controller Plug in a controller and press any button so the browser shows it to the app. The sticks pan, orbit or zoom; the triggers zoom in and out; every button can run a command. Speed, Dead zone and Reverse up and down on the sticks are there too. MIDI controller Choose Connect MIDI. Then, for each control: pick what it should do under Add a control for (a knob or fader pans, zooms or orbits; a pad or key runs a command), choose Learn it, and turn the knob or press the pad. Each learned control is listed, with a button to remove it. MIDI needs Chrome or Edge in the browser. Share your settings Export saves the settings shown as a file; Import reads one back (settings this version doesn't know are left out, and you're told how many). Back to the defaults undoes every change for the settings shown. Not built yet A wheel dial (such as the ones on Windows) and the desktop app's own drivers for 3D mice are not supported yet. A 3D mouse, controller or knob moves the view only in apps that have handed their views over; their buttons work everywhere.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"undo-across-windows","scope":"basics","title":"Undo the last step across windows","summary":"In CadCraft Studio, take back the last thing you did in any app window from the Studio window, in the order you worked, without changing windows first.","section":"tasks","order":140,"keywords":["undo","undo across apps","undo last step","last step","project undo","studio undo","order I worked","undo in another app","windows","journal"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-do","text":"What you will do","level":2},{"id":"how-it-works","text":"How it works","level":2},{"id":"what-it-will-not-do","text":"What it will not do","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-do\"\u003EWhat you will do\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYou drew a wall in BimCraft, then moved a mark in TakeoffCraft, and you want the last one back without hunting for the right window. In the Studio window, under \u003Cstrong\u003EOpen windows\u003C/strong\u003E, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo last step\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"how-it-works\"\u003EHow it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach app window tells Studio when it finishes a step, with the name you see in its own Undo. Studio keeps the newest step of every window and the order between them. The line beside the button names the newest one, for example &quot;Rename the takeoff in TakeoffCraft&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo last step\u003C/span\u003E in the Studio window. Studio asks &quot;Undo this step in that app?&quot;; nothing happens until you say \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo it\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStudio asks that window for its own next undo and the window runs it, exactly as if you had pressed Undo there. Choose the button again for the step before.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-will-not-do\"\u003EWhat it will not do\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIt takes back \u003Cstrong\u003Eone window&#039;s own last step\u003C/strong\u003E only. It does not undo the effects of that step in another app: a change in BimCraft that fed a takeoff is not undone in TakeoffCraft by this.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIf you have changed that window since (typed in it, opened another file, or undone by hand there), Studio does not force anything. It skips that window and says nothing was undone; use Undo inside the app.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA closed window&#039;s steps are gone. Steps older than half an hour are not offered.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIt does not undo a save, and it is not offered in a browser tab on its own: it needs the apps open as windows of one Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach app&#039;s own Undo (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Z\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) works as before, and is told to Studio too, so the two never disagree.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will do You drew a wall in BimCraft, then moved a mark in TakeoffCraft, and you want the last one back without hunting for the right window. In the Studio window, under Open windows, choose Undo last step. How it works Each app window tells Studio when it finishes a step, with the name you see in its own Undo. Studio keeps the newest step of every window and the order between them. The line beside the button names the newest one, for example \"Rename the takeoff in TakeoffCraft\". Choose Undo last step in the Studio window. Studio asks \"Undo this step in that app?\"; nothing happens until you say Undo it. Studio asks that window for its own next undo and the window runs it, exactly as if you had pressed Undo there. Choose the button again for the step before. What it will not do It takes back one window's own last step only. It does not undo the effects of that step in another app: a change in BimCraft that fed a takeoff is not undone in TakeoffCraft by this. If you have changed that window since (typed in it, opened another file, or undone by hand there), Studio does not force anything. It skips that window and says nothing was undone; use Undo inside the app. A closed window's steps are gone. Steps older than half an hour are not offered. It does not undo a save, and it is not offered in a browser tab on its own: it needs the apps open as windows of one Studio. Each app's own Undo (Ctrl+Z) works as before, and is told to Studio too, so the two never disagree.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"full-screen-crosshair","scope":"basics","title":"Full-screen crosshair","summary":"Two thin lines through the pointer, edge to edge across the drawing or view, to check by eye that things line up. One switch turns it on in every app.","section":"reference","order":30,"keywords":["full screen crosshair","full-screen cursor","crosshair","cursor","cursorsize","cursorsize 100","edge to edge","line up","alignment","align","guide lines","cross hairs"],"headings":[{"id":"turn-it-on","text":"Turn it on","level":2},{"id":"what-it-does","text":"What it does","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThe full-screen crosshair draws two thin lines through the pointer: one across the whole width of the drawing or view under it, one down its whole height. Move the pointer to an edge or a corner and you can see at once whether other things sit on the same line. It is the same as AutoCAD&#039;s \u003Ccode class=\"hcmd\"\u003ECURSORSIZE\u003C/code\u003E 100.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"turn-it-on\"\u003ETurn it on\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear in the app bar, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), go to \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E and tick \u003Cstrong\u003ECrosshair from edge to edge in every app\u003C/strong\u003E under \u003Cstrong\u003EFull-screen crosshair\u003C/strong\u003E. It is one switch for all eight apps on this computer: turn it on in one app and the others have it too, also in tabs that are already open.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-does\"\u003EWhat it does\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe lines show while the pointer is over a drawing or a view, also when no tool is running.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EToolbars, cards and hints that sit over the view stay on top of the lines; a dialog never gets them.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWith a finger nothing changes: the lines follow a mouse, a trackpad or a pen.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CadCraft the crosshair is drawn by the drawing itself: it turns with the coordinate system (UCS), and with the view split it stays in the pane you are working in. CadCraft also has it as a cursor size of its own: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003ECursor\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EFull screen\u003C/strong\u003E, or type \u003Ccode class=\"hcmd\"\u003ECURSORSIZE\u003C/code\u003E and 100.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"The full-screen crosshair draws two thin lines through the pointer: one across the whole width of the drawing or view under it, one down its whole height. Move the pointer to an edge or a corner and you can see at once whether other things sit on the same line. It is the same as AutoCAD's CURSORSIZE 100. Turn it on Open Settings (the gear in the app bar, or Ctrl+,), go to General and tick Crosshair from edge to edge in every app under Full-screen crosshair. It is one switch for all eight apps on this computer: turn it on in one app and the others have it too, also in tabs that are already open. What it does The lines show while the pointer is over a drawing or a view, also when no tool is running. Toolbars, cards and hints that sit over the view stay on top of the lines; a dialog never gets them. With a finger nothing changes: the lines follow a mouse, a trackpad or a pen. In CadCraft the crosshair is drawn by the drawing itself: it turns with the coordinate system (UCS), and with the view split it stays in the pane you are working in. CadCraft also has it as a cursor size of its own: Settings › CadCraft › Cursor › Full screen, or type CURSORSIZE and 100.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"unit-lists","scope":"basics","title":"Units, typed values and the unit lists","summary":"Type a length in any unit with its mark, choose which units the unit lists show, and star the unit new work starts in. A file always keeps its own unit.","section":"reference","order":60,"keywords":["units","unit list","metric","imperial","feet","inches","feet and inches","meters","millimeters","US survey foot","survey feet","international foot","yards","miles","nautical mile","chain","rod","link","furlong","fathom","point","pica","acre","hectare","square","roofing square","acre-foot","board foot","gallon","gon","grad","radian","degrees minutes seconds","slope","percent","H:V","rise run","default unit","star","INSUNITS"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"type-a-length-in-any-unit","text":"Type a length in any unit","level":2},{"id":"choose-the-units-the-lists-show","text":"Choose the units the lists show","level":2},{"id":"where-the-lists-and-the-star-are-used","text":"Where the lists and the star are used","level":2},{"id":"a-file-keeps-its-own-unit","text":"A file keeps its own unit","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to type a value in any unit, and how to choose which units the unit lists in the apps show and which one new work starts in. Every app shares one table of units, with the exact sizes their legal definitions give.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"type-a-length-in-any-unit\"\u003EType a length in any unit\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn a box that takes a length, type the number and the unit&#039;s mark after it. The app turns it into the unit the box is in.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EType\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMeans\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039; 6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;-6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3 ft 6 in\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efeet and inches\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E450 mm\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3.2 m\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1.5 km\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2 dm\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E400 nm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emetric lengths (\u003Ccode\u003Enm\u003C/code\u003E is the nanometer)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3 yd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2.5 mi\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E250 mil\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eyards, miles, thousandths of an inch\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E10 US ft\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1 US mi\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ethe US survey foot and mile\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E2 rd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E100 li\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3 ch\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1 fur\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Erods, links, chains, furlongs\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1 nmi\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003E1 NM\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E6 ftm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Enautical miles, fathoms\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12 pt\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3 pc\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Epoints and picas (1/72 and 1/6 of an inch)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Enm\u003C/code\u003E is always the nanometer. For the nautical mile type \u003Ccode\u003Enmi\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003ENM\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Ccode\u003ENm\u003C/code\u003E is refused, because it could be either.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eft\u003C/code\u003E is the international foot (0.3048 m). The US survey foot (1200/3937 m) is a different unit: type \u003Ccode\u003EUS ft\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eusft\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003Esurvey ft\u003C/code\u003E. Rods, links, chains, furlongs and acres are the international-foot ones.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESums work as before where the app takes them, with any of these marks: \u003Ccode\u003E2*3 yd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot; + 3 ch\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CadCraft a mark is read when the drawing has units (its $INSUNITS). A drawing with no units reads one only when its length format is Engineering or Architectural, where one drawing unit is an inch.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CivilCraft a project in feet is in US survey feet, as it always was, so \u003Ccode\u003E10 US ft\u003C/code\u003E is 10 and \u003Ccode\u003E10 ft\u003C/code\u003E is 10 project feet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"choose-the-units-the-lists-show\"\u003EChoose the units the lists show\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear on the app bar, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E, and find \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnits\u003C/span\u003E. There is one list for each kind: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELength\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVolume\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAngle\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESlope\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEach unit has a switch. A unit that is off is left out of the unit lists in the apps.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClick the star beside a unit to make it the default for new work. Click it again to take the star away. With no star, each app keeps its own default (the file&#039;s unit, or the one for your region).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the unit lists\u003C/span\u003E puts the starting lists back, with no stars.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe choices are the same in every app in this browser, and they are saved as you make them.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"where-the-lists-and-the-star-are-used\"\u003EWhere the lists and the star are used\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EApp\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat follows the switches\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat the star sets\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECadCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe units ($INSUNITS) of a new drawing, when it is a unit a drawing can carry\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECivilCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe project&#039;s units list\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELength: a new project in meters (a metric star) or feet. Area and volume: the unit areas and volumes are reported in\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EModelCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe units list beside the value box\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe unit of a new model\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBimCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe units list on the plan toolbar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe display units, until you pick them on the toolbar (your earlier pick is kept)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarkupCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe measuring and position units in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E, and the unit in the calibrate dialog\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe measuring unit, until MarkupCraft&#039;s own settings have been saved\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETakeoffCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe unit lists of an item\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELength and area: the unit of a new item\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe angle and slope lists are saved, but no app&#039;s box follows them yet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"a-file-keeps-its-own-unit\"\u003EA file keeps its own unit\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe settings never change a file. A drawing keeps its units, a CivilCraft project its feet or meters, a model its unit. The unit a file uses is always in its list, even when it is turned off in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to type a value in any unit, and how to choose which units the unit lists in the apps show and which one new work starts in. Every app shares one table of units, with the exact sizes their legal definitions give. Type a length in any unit In a box that takes a length, type the number and the unit's mark after it. The app turns it into the unit the box is in. Type Means 12'6\", 12' 6 1/2\", 12'-6\", 3 ft 6 in feet and inches 450 mm, 3.2 m, 1.5 km, 2 dm, 400 nm metric lengths (nm is the nanometer) 3 yd, 2.5 mi, 250 mil yards, miles, thousandths of an inch 10 US ft, 1 US mi the US survey foot and mile 2 rd, 100 li, 3 ch, 1 fur rods, links, chains, furlongs 1 nmi or 1 NM, 6 ftm nautical miles, fathoms 12 pt, 3 pc points and picas (1/72 and 1/6 of an inch) nm is always the nanometer. For the nautical mile type nmi or NM. Nm is refused, because it could be either. ft is the international foot (0.3048 m). The US survey foot (1200/3937 m) is a different unit: type US ft, usft or survey ft. Rods, links, chains, furlongs and acres are the international-foot ones. Sums work as before where the app takes them, with any of these marks: 2*3 yd, 12'6\" + 3 ch. In CadCraft a mark is read when the drawing has units (its $INSUNITS). A drawing with no units reads one only when its length format is Engineering or Architectural, where one drawing unit is an inch. In CivilCraft a project in feet is in US survey feet, as it always was, so 10 US ft is 10 and 10 ft is 10 project feet. Choose the units the lists show Open Settings (the gear on the app bar, or Ctrl+,), choose General, and find Units. There is one list for each kind: Length, Area, Volume, Angle and Slope. Each unit has a switch. A unit that is off is left out of the unit lists in the apps. Click the star beside a unit to make it the default for new work. Click it again to take the star away. With no star, each app keeps its own default (the file's unit, or the one for your region). Reset the unit lists puts the starting lists back, with no stars. The choices are the same in every app in this browser, and they are saved as you make them. Where the lists and the star are used App What follows the switches What the star sets CadCraft The units ($INSUNITS) of a new drawing, when it is a unit a drawing can carry CivilCraft The project's units list Length: a new project in meters (a metric star) or feet. Area and volume: the unit areas and volumes are reported in ModelCraft The units list beside the value box The unit of a new model BimCraft The units list on the plan toolbar The display units, until you pick them on the toolbar (your earlier pick is kept) MarkupCraft The measuring and position units in Settings, and the unit in the calibrate dialog The measuring unit, until MarkupCraft's own settings have been saved TakeoffCraft The unit lists of an item Length and area: the unit of a new item The angle and slope lists are saved, but no app's box follows them yet. A file keeps its own unit The settings never change a file. A drawing keeps its units, a CivilCraft project its feet or meters, a model its unit. The unit a file uses is always in its list, even when it is turned off in Settings.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"lost-toolbar","scope":"basics","title":"Where did my toolbar go?","summary":"The bars, menus or panels went missing. Here is what hides them on purpose, the keys that bring them back, and one button that puts the whole layout back.","section":"trouble","order":5,"keywords":["toolbar gone","toolbar missing","lost toolbar","lost menu","menu disappeared","ribbon disappeared","bars hidden","show bars","full screen","panels gone","reset layout","layout","ribbon","collapsed","locked toolbar"],"headings":[{"id":"the-quickest-fix-reset-the-layout","text":"The quickest fix: reset the layout","level":2},{"id":"the-bars-are-hidden-full-screen","text":"The bars are hidden (full screen)","level":2},{"id":"the-toolbar-looks-different","text":"The toolbar looks different","level":2},{"id":"the-toolbar-s-own-menu","text":"The toolbar's own menu","level":2},{"id":"everything-is-too-big-or-too-small","text":"Everything is too big or too small","level":2},{"id":"the-panels-are-gone","text":"The panels are gone","level":2},{"id":"on-a-phone","text":"On a phone","level":2},{"id":"still-missing","text":"Still missing?","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ENothing is deleted when a bar or a panel goes away: the app only hides or moves it. Each of these ways is on purpose, and each has a way back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-quickest-fix-reset-the-layout\"\u003EThe quickest fix: reset the layout\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E with the gear button in the app bar, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E tab.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the layout\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe toolbar goes back to its first order and buttons, the panels go back to their sides, the screen mode goes back to the normal view and the menu style goes back to the one the app starts with. Your theme, language, sizes and the app&#039;s own settings stay as they are, and so do any menu styles you made yourself (choose them again under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn CadCraft Studio, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E in Studio&#039;s own window also has \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the layout in every app\u003C/span\u003E. Each app&#039;s windows follow at once, and an app you open later starts from its first layout.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-bars-are-hidden-full-screen\"\u003EThe bars are hidden (full screen)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe screen-mode button in the app bar, and \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, go from the normal view to full screen, then to full screen with the bars hidden, then back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhile the bars are hidden, a small \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow bars\u003C/span\u003E tab stays at the top middle of the window. Choose it, or point at the top edge of the window, and the bars slide down; they hide again a moment after you move away. Press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E to leave this mode, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E to leave full screen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf the app opens with its bars hidden every time, look at \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScreen\u003C/span\u003E: the app does what is chosen there when it opens.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETap the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow bars\u003C/span\u003E tab, or tap the top edge of the screen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-toolbar-looks-different\"\u003EThe toolbar looks different\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETools in another order, or tools you can&#039;t find:\u003C/strong\u003E someone arranged the toolbar. Choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOriginal order\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOnly icons, or only words:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar buttons\u003C/span\u003E in the same place picks icons and labels, icons only or labels only. Hold the pointer over an icon to see its name.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETools won&#039;t move:\u003C/strong\u003E the toolbar is locked. Right-click the toolbar (or press and hold it) and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnlock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E, or clear \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EA ribbon that shows only its tab names:\u003C/strong\u003E it is collapsed. Choose a tab name to open its tools for one command, or double-click a tab name (or choose the pin at the end of the tab row) to keep the ribbon open.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMenus or a ribbon instead of the toolbar:\u003C/strong\u003E a menu style is on. Pick the app&#039;s own style under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › the app&#039;s tab › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E. Every command is in every style; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E finds any of them by name.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-toolbar-s-own-menu\"\u003EThe toolbar&#039;s own menu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERight-click the toolbar, or press and hold it on a touch screen, for a short menu:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArrange the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E: drag tools within their group and groups by their name, or move the focused one with the arrow keys. Choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDone arranging\u003C/span\u003E in the same menu, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, when it looks right.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnlock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E: a locked toolbar can&#039;t be arranged or reset by accident.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E: tools back in their first order.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWith a ribbon menu style: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECollapse the ribbon\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPin the ribbon open\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn a keyboard, the menu key (or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift F10\"\u003E⇧ F10\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+F10\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) opens it for the tool that has the focus.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"everything-is-too-big-or-too-small\"\u003EEverything is too big or too small\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInterface size\u003C/span\u003E makes the bars, toolbars, panels and dialogs of this app bigger or smaller, from 80 % to 140 %. The drawing keeps its own zoom, so a smaller interface leaves more room for it, for example with two apps side by side on one monitor. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPanel text size\u003C/span\u003E beside it changes only the text in the side panels, on top of the interface size. Each app keeps its own size; CadCraft Studio&#039;s own window has one in its \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E too.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-panels-are-gone\"\u003EThe panels are gone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanels can float over the drawing, dock on another side, or move to a window of their own (often on a second monitor, or behind this window).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELook for a second window called after the app with &quot;panels&quot;, and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut the panels back\u003C/span\u003E in it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOr choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset layout\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPanels\u003C/span\u003E, which brings every panel home.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"on-a-phone\"\u003EOn a phone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn a phone the panels are sheets: open one from the bar at the bottom of the screen. The \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETools\u003C/span\u003E button in that bar hides and shows the toolbar, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove\u003C/span\u003E puts it at the top or the bottom of the screen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"still-missing\"\u003EStill missing?\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFind any tool by name with \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, even while its bar is hidden. If something is still not where it should be after resetting the layout, tell us on the support page with the app&#039;s name and what you were doing.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Nothing is deleted when a bar or a panel goes away: the app only hides or moves it. Each of these ways is on purpose, and each has a way back. The quickest fix: reset the layout Open Settings with the gear button in the app bar, or press Ctrl+,. Choose the General tab. Under Layout, choose Reset the layout. The toolbar goes back to its first order and buttons, the panels go back to their sides, the screen mode goes back to the normal view and the menu style goes back to the one the app starts with. Your theme, language, sizes and the app's own settings stay as they are, and so do any menu styles you made yourself (choose them again under Menus, keys and mouse). In CadCraft Studio, Settings in Studio's own window also has Reset the layout in every app. Each app's windows follow at once, and an app you open later starts from its first layout. The bars are hidden (full screen) The screen-mode button in the app bar, and Ctrl+Shift+F, go from the normal view to full screen, then to full screen with the bars hidden, then back. While the bars are hidden, a small Show bars tab stays at the top middle of the window. Choose it, or point at the top edge of the window, and the bars slide down; they hide again a moment after you move away. Press Ctrl+Shift+F to leave this mode, or Esc to leave full screen. If the app opens with its bars hidden every time, look at Settings › General › Screen: the app does what is chosen there when it opens. Tap the Show bars tab, or tap the top edge of the screen. The toolbar looks different Tools in another order, or tools you can't find: someone arranged the toolbar. Choose Original order under Settings › General › Toolbar. Only icons, or only words: Toolbar buttons in the same place picks icons and labels, icons only or labels only. Hold the pointer over an icon to see its name. Tools won't move: the toolbar is locked. Right-click the toolbar (or press and hold it) and choose Unlock the toolbar, or clear Lock the toolbar under Settings › General › Toolbar. A ribbon that shows only its tab names: it is collapsed. Choose a tab name to open its tools for one command, or double-click a tab name (or choose the pin at the end of the tab row) to keep the ribbon open. Menus or a ribbon instead of the toolbar: a menu style is on. Pick the app's own style under Settings › the app's tab › Menus, keys and mouse. Every command is in every style; Ctrl+K finds any of them by name. The toolbar's own menu Right-click the toolbar, or press and hold it on a touch screen, for a short menu: Arrange the toolbar: drag tools within their group and groups by their name, or move the focused one with the arrow keys. Choose Done arranging in the same menu, or press Esc, when it looks right. Lock the toolbar / Unlock the toolbar: a locked toolbar can't be arranged or reset by accident. Reset the toolbar: tools back in their first order. With a ribbon menu style: Collapse the ribbon or Pin the ribbon open. On a keyboard, the menu key (or Shift+F10) opens it for the tool that has the focus. Everything is too big or too small Settings › General › Interface size makes the bars, toolbars, panels and dialogs of this app bigger or smaller, from 80 % to 140 %. The drawing keeps its own zoom, so a smaller interface leaves more room for it, for example with two apps side by side on one monitor. Panel text size beside it changes only the text in the side panels, on top of the interface size. Each app keeps its own size; CadCraft Studio's own window has one in its Settings too. The panels are gone Panels can float over the drawing, dock on another side, or move to a window of their own (often on a second monitor, or behind this window). Look for a second window called after the app with \"panels\", and choose Put the panels back in it. Or choose Reset layout under Settings › General › Panels, which brings every panel home. On a phone On a phone the panels are sheets: open one from the bar at the bottom of the screen. The Tools button in that bar hides and shows the toolbar, and Move puts it at the top or the bottom of the screen. Still missing? Find any tool by name with Ctrl+K, even while its bar is hidden. If something is still not where it should be after resetting the layout, tell us on the support page with the app's name and what you were doing.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"recover","scope":"basics","title":"Recover unsaved work","summary":"How the apps keep a recovery copy while you work, and how to get your work back after a crash or a closed tab.","section":"trouble","order":55,"keywords":["autosave","recover","recovery","crash","lost work","closed tab","unsaved","restore","backup"],"headings":[{"id":"when-the-copy-is-kept","text":"When the copy is kept","level":2},{"id":"get-your-work-back","text":"Get your work back","level":2},{"id":"things-to-know","text":"Things to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EWhile you work, each app keeps a recovery copy of what you have not saved yet. It is not a save: your file on your computer only changes when you save it. The copy is there so a crash, a closed tab or a computer that turns off does not cost you your work.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"when-the-copy-is-kept\"\u003EWhen the copy is kept\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA few seconds after you stop editing, and at least every 30 seconds while you keep going.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWhen you switch to another tab or window.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe copy stays in this browser, on this computer. Nothing is uploaded.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"get-your-work-back\"\u003EGet your work back\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the same app again, in the same browser.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIf it closed before your work was saved, it asks \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERecover your work?\u003C/span\u003E and lists what it kept, with the time of the last copy.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERecover\u003C/span\u003E to open it, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDiscard\u003C/span\u003E to throw it away.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESave it to a file as soon as it opens.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENot now\u003C/span\u003E keeps the copies for 30 days, and the app asks again the next time it opens. A reload counts too: reload a tab with unsaved work and the app offers it back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"things-to-know\"\u003EThings to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWhen you save, or close a file on purpose, its recovery copy is removed.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAnother tab of the same app that is still open never offers your copies. It only offers work from a tab that has gone.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPrivate windows in some browsers, and a browser with no space left, cannot keep a copy. The app tells you when that happens, so save to a file more often.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClearing your browser&#039;s site data removes the copies.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENot every app keeps a recovery copy yet. Each app&#039;s own help says whether it does.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"While you work, each app keeps a recovery copy of what you have not saved yet. It is not a save: your file on your computer only changes when you save it. The copy is there so a crash, a closed tab or a computer that turns off does not cost you your work. When the copy is kept A few seconds after you stop editing, and at least every 30 seconds while you keep going. When you switch to another tab or window. The copy stays in this browser, on this computer. Nothing is uploaded. Get your work back Open the same app again, in the same browser. If it closed before your work was saved, it asks Recover your work? and lists what it kept, with the time of the last copy. Choose Recover to open it, or Discard to throw it away. Save it to a file as soon as it opens. Not now keeps the copies for 30 days, and the app asks again the next time it opens. A reload counts too: reload a tab with unsaved work and the app offers it back. Things to know When you save, or close a file on purpose, its recovery copy is removed. Another tab of the same app that is still open never offers your copies. It only offers work from a tab that has gone. Private windows in some browsers, and a browser with no space left, cannot keep a copy. The app tells you when that happens, so save to a file more often. Clearing your browser's site data removes the copies. Not every app keeps a recovery copy yet. Each app's own help says whether it does.","lang":"en"}],"locale":"zu","chain":["zu","en"]};
